":"Unavailable is a pure beginning that did not already contain the transition into its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the separation of identity and difference: their abstraction from one another destroys the determinate unity of Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility is an enclosed Being or Nothing; precisely their impossibility generates the form of movement of Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS1","text":"Immediate opposites are posited as an inseparable unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS2","text":"The inseparable unity sublates the self-subsistent validity of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS3","text":"The sublated determinations remain preserved as distinct moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS4","text":"Each moment is determined as unity with its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS5","text":"The differing immediacy of the moments generates two directions: Nothing → Being and Being → Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS6","text":"The directions are distinguished as coming-to-be and ceasing-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS7","text":"Each direction reverses into the counter-direction through its own self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:FGS8","text":"The opposed directions are thereby closed as the identical total movement of Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:AF1","text":"Abstract conception of unity → determinate unity of Being and Nothing → sublation of their self-subsistence → preservation as moments → asymmetric double determination → coming-to-be and ceasing-to-be → inner reversal of each direction → identical Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ME1","text":"Being and Nothing are remapped from isolated determinations of being into relational moments of a movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ME2","text":"The opposition of coming-to-be and ceasing-to-be is classified as a difference of direction within an identical movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ME3","text":"External sublation is replaced by inner self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ME4","text":"Identity and difference no longer appear as opposites, but as co-constitutive determinations of Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ME5","text":"Beginning and end lose their absolute separability because every beginning already contains the transition into its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Becoming is determined as the unity of Being and Nothing, as well as coming-to-be and ceasing-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Through the sublation of their self-subsistence, the determinations become moments of a relational structure of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The opposition is resolved not by deciding for one side, but by reconstructing its inner reversibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality appears as an event of transition in which Being and Nothing subsist only in their reciprocal sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from determinate unity through the sublated moments to coming-to-be and ceasing-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the asymmetric weighting of Being and Nothing in the two unities is formally fixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sublation means negation and preservation at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of the counter-direction from the inner determination of each direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT5","text":"Its weakest point lies in the not further grounded positing that every determination is, in itself, its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2MDW:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as Becoming is treated as a self-sublating unity and not as a mere connection of two states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2MDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_2MDW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_2MDW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 15","title":"2. Moments of Becoming.","context":"Chapter 15","original_title":"2. Momente des Werdens."},"original_title":"2. Momente des Werdens.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW","layer":"CH","title":"3. Sublation of Becoming.","order":16,"parents":["RAW_GB18_3ADW"],"revision":"CH_GB18_3ADW@R001","sha256":"adcf6064466fd4a27e88ca2089f7fce7c1fe7c9ccb6cdd61166f1177c1f123a3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Bestimmung des Werdens aus dem Verhältnis von Sein und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS2","text":"Das Werden wird als Einheit entgegengesetzter und zugleich verschwindender Bestimmungen neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS3","text":"Die Bestimmungen Sein und Nichts bestehen im Werden nur durch ihre Unterschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS4","text":"Weil das Werden sowohl die Verschwindensbewegung als auch deren Aufhebung enthält, widerspricht es sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS5","text":"Die Selbstaufhebung des Werdens erzeugt ein ruhiges Resultat, das weder bloßes Nichts noch bloßes Sein ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS6","text":"Das Resultat ist die einfache Einheit von Sein und Nichts als seiende Bestimmung des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS7","text":"Diese seiende Einheit erhält die Gestalt des Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A1","text":"Sein und Nichts sind die entgegengesetzten Bestimmungen des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","text":"Sein und Nichts sind im Werden nur als verschwindende Bestimmungen vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A3","text":"Das Werden setzt die Unterschiedenheit von Sein und Nichts voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","text":"Das Werden ist die wechselseitige Bewegung des Verschwindens von Sein in Nichts und von Nichts in Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","text":"Das Werden enthält zugleich das Verschwinden von Sein und Nichts überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A6","text":"Die Vereinigung entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen widerspricht sich in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","text":"Eine in sich widersprüchliche Vereinigung hebt sich selbst auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","text":"Das Resultat der Aufhebung des Werdens ist nicht das Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","text":"Das Resultat der Aufhebung ist die ruhige Einheit von Sein und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A10","text":"Die ruhige Einfachheit dieser Einheit ist Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A11","text":"Dieses Sein ist nicht selbständig, sondern Bestimmung des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A12","text":"Die seiende Einheit von Sein und Nichts bildet die Gestalt des Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX1","text":"Das Werden ist nicht eine ruhende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX2","text":"Sein und Nichts sind im Werden nicht selbständig bestehende Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX3","text":"Das Resultat des Werdens ist nicht das bloße Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX4","text":"Das Resultat ist kein Rückfall in eine der aufgehobenen Einzelbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX5","text":"Das im Resultat enthaltene Sein ist nicht Sein für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX6","text":"Das Werden ist keine stabile Vereinigung widersprüchlicher Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D1","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Werdens hängt von der Differenz zwischen Sein und Nichts ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","CH_GB18_3ADW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D2","text":"Das Werden ist eine haltungslose Unruhe, weil seine Bestimmungen fortwährend ineinander übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D3","text":"Das Werden hebt sich auf, weil es die Bewegung seiner eigenen Aufhebung bereits enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D4","text":"Das Verschwinden des Werdens ist zugleich das Verschwinden des Verschwindens.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D5","text":"Das Resultat ist ein Verschwundensein, das die Einheit von Sein und Nichts bewahrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D6","text":"Das Resultat ist eine ruhige Einfachheit, weil die bewegte Einheit des Werdens in eine seiende Einheit übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D7","text":"Das Sein des Resultats ist nur als Bestimmung der aufgehobenen Totalität vorhanden.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10","CH_GB18_3ADW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D8","text":"Die Aufhebung des Werdens führt nicht aus Sein und Nichts hinaus, sondern in ihre seiende Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD1","text":"Der Übergang vom Werden zum Dasein entsteht dadurch, dass eine selbstwidersprüchliche Bewegung in eine seiende Einheit ihrer Momente übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A3","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A6","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD2","text":"Das Resultat bewahrt die aufgehobenen Gegensätze nicht als getrennte Substanzen, sondern als Bestimmungen eines Ganzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD3","text":"Die Stabilität des Daseins ist die resultative Form einer Instabilität, die sich selbst aufgehoben hat.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD4","text":"Unmittelbares Sein erscheint erst als Resultat einer Vermittlung durch Nichts und Werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A1","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD5","text":"Das Dasein ist eine positive Bestimmung, deren Einheit die aufgehobene Negativität von Sein und Nichts voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX1","text":"Eine ursprüngliche, für sich bestehende Identität von Sein und Nichts ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX2","text":"Ein Werden ohne innere Differenz ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX3","text":"Eine Bewegung, die ihre eigene Aufhebung nicht hervorbringt, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX4","text":"Ein Resultat, das lediglich eine der Ausgangsbestimmungen wiederherstellt, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX5","text":"Eine seiende Einheit ohne aufgehobene Gegensätzlichkeit ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX6","text":"Ein selbständiges Sein jenseits der resultierenden Totalität ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie, in der Sein oder Nichts unabhängig von ihrer Vermittlung durch das Werden als letzte Bestimmung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, den Widerspruch des Werdens als dauerhaftes Gleichgewicht zu stabilisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Übergang, der das Werden einfach hinter sich lässt, ohne dessen Momente im Resultat zu bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein reines Resultat außerhalb der Beziehung von Sein, Nichts und ihrer Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines selbständigen Anfangs oder Endpunkts strukturiert die gesamte Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS1","text":"Sein + Nichts → entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen → Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS2","text":"Werden → wechselseitiges Verschwinden von Sein und Nichts + Verschwinden beider überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS3","text":"Wechselseitiges Verschwinden + fortbestehende Differenz → innere Selbstwidersprüchlichkeit des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS4","text":"Selbstwidersprüchlichkeit → Selbstaufhebung der bewegten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS5","text":"Selbstaufhebung → Verschwundensein als ruhige Einheit von Sein und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS6","text":"Ruhige Einheit → seiendes Sein, das nicht für sich, sondern Bestimmung des Ganzen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS7","text":"Seiende Einheit der aufgehobenen Momente → Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AF1","text":"Sein und Nichts als Gegensätze → Werden als ihre wechselseitige Bewegung → gleichzeitiges Verschwinden beider → Selbstwiderspruch des Werdens → Selbstaufhebung → ruhige Einheit → Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME1","text":"Sein und Nichts werden von selbständigen Ausgangsbestimmungen zu verschwindenden Momenten einer Vermittlungsbewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME2","text":"Das Werden wird von einer bloßen Übergangsform zu einer sich selbst aufhebenden Einheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME3","text":"Das Resultat wird nicht als Rückkehr zu Sein oder Nichts, sondern als bewahrte Einheit beider klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME4","text":"Ruhe und Bewegung werden nicht als äußerlich getrennte Zustände, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Formen derselben Bestimmungslogik kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME5","text":"Dasein wird als resultative, vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME6","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Entstehen und Vergehen wird in einer gemeinsamen Struktur des Werdens zusammengeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Das Werden geht aus dem wechselnden Verschwinden von Sein und Nichts in eine ruhige Einheit über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die innere Differenz der gegensätzlichen Momente erzeugt die Instabilität und anschließend die Aufhebung des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Widerspruch wird nicht beseitigt, indem eine Seite bevorzugt wird, sondern durch die Erzeugung einer Resultatform neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein wird als Resultat einer zeitlich-bewegten Vermittlung gesetzt und erscheint im Dasein als seiende, aber nicht selbständige Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome A1 bis A12 reichen aus, um den Übergang vom Werden zum Dasein zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Unterschiedenheit von Sein und Nichts ihrerseits begründet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Bewegung insofern, als der Selbstwiderspruch des Werdens seine eigene Aufhebung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Bestimmung des Resultats als weder bloßes Nichts noch bloßes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der fortbestehenden Differenz von Sein und Nichts und ihrer ruhigen Einheit im Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Resultat als Sein bestimmt wird, obwohl es nicht Sein für sich sein darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern Selbstwiderspruch nicht als Abbruch, sondern als Übergangsoperator behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110523042164Z_68bc8395","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3. Sublation of Becoming.","source_sha256":"adcf6064466fd4a27e88ca2089f7fce7c1fe7c9ccb6cdd61166f1177c1f123a3","sha256":"6f45ecb273794dac8a45e0541a7b4095e9a050eac0ebb677a31d79a1961e2aef","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:05:23.043905+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS1","text":"The central problem is the determination of becoming from the relation of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS2","text":"Becoming is newly determined as the unity of opposed and at the same time vanishing determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS3","text":"The determinations being and nothing subsist in becoming only through their difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS4","text":"Because becoming contains both the movement of vanishing and its sublation, it contradicts itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS5","text":"The self-sublation of becoming produces a tranquil result that is neither mere nothing nor mere being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS6","text":"The result is the simple unity of being and nothing as the being determination of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AS7","text":"This being unity assumes the form of determinate being (Dasein).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A1","text":"Being and nothing are the opposed determinations of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","text":"Being and nothing are present in becoming only as vanishing determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A3","text":"Becoming presupposes the difference of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","text":"Becoming is the reciprocal movement of the vanishing of being into nothing and of nothing into being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","text":"Becoming at the same time contains the vanishing of being and nothing altogether.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A6","text":"The union of opposed determinations contradicts itself within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","text":"A union contradictory within itself sublates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","text":"The result of the sublation of becoming is not nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","text":"The result of the sublation is the tranquil unity of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A10","text":"The tranquil simplicity of this unity is being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A11","text":"This being is not self-subsistent, but rather a determination of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:A12","text":"The being unity of being and nothing constitutes the form of determinate being (Dasein).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX1","text":"Becoming is not a resting unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX2","text":"Being and nothing are not self-subsisting determinations in becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX3","text":"The result of becoming is not mere nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX4","text":"The result is not a relapse into one of the sublated individual determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX5","text":"The being contained in the result is not being-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:NX6","text":"Becoming is not a stable union of contradictory determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D1","text":"The determinacy of becoming depends on the difference between being and nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","CH_GB18_3ADW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D2","text":"Becoming is an unrest without stability because its determinations continually pass over into one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A2","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D3","text":"Becoming sublates itself because it already contains the movement of its own sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D4","text":"The vanishing of becoming is at the same time the vanishing of vanishing.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D5","text":"The result is a having-vanished that preserves the unity of being and nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D6","text":"The result is a tranquil simplicity because the moving unity of becoming passes over into a being unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D7","text":"The being of the result is present only as a determination of the sublated totality.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10","CH_GB18_3ADW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:D8","text":"The sublation of becoming does not lead beyond being and nothing, but into their being unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD1","text":"The transition from becoming to determinate being (Dasein) arises in that a self-contradictory movement passes over into a being unity of its moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A3","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A6","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD2","text":"The result preserves the sublated opposites not as separate substances, but as determinations of a whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A8","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD3","text":"The stability of determinate being (Dasein) is the resultant form of an instability that has sublated itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A7","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD4","text":"Immediate being first appears as the result of a mediation through nothing and becoming.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A1","CH_GB18_3ADW:A4","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SD5","text":"Determinate being (Dasein) is a positive determination whose unity presupposes the sublated negativity of being and nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_3ADW:A5","CH_GB18_3ADW:A9","CH_GB18_3ADW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX1","text":"An original identity of being and nothing subsisting for itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX2","text":"A becoming without inner difference is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX3","text":"A movement that does not bring forth its own sublation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX4","text":"A result that merely restores one of the initial determinations is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX5","text":"A being unity without sublated opposition is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:DNX6","text":"A self-subsistent being beyond the resulting totality is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology in which being or nothing subsist as final determinations independently of their mediation through becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of stabilizing the contradiction of becoming as a lasting equilibrium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a transition that simply leaves becoming behind without preserving its moments in the result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a pure result outside the relation of being, nothing, and their sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:SNX5","text":"The absence of a self-subsistent beginning or end point structures the entire movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS1","text":"Being + nothing → opposed determinations → becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS2","text":"Becoming → reciprocal vanishing of being and nothing + vanishing of both altogether.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS3","text":"Reciprocal vanishing + persisting difference → inner self-contradictoriness of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS4","text":"Self-contradictoriness → self-sublation of the moving unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS5","text":"Self-sublation → having-vanished as tranquil unity of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS6","text":"Tranquil unity → being being, which is not for itself but is a determination of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:FGS7","text":"Being unity of the sublated moments → determinate being (Dasein).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:AF1","text":"Being and nothing as opposites → becoming as their reciprocal movement → simultaneous vanishing of both → self-contradiction of becoming → self-sublation → tranquil unity → determinate being (Dasein).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME1","text":"Being and nothing are remapped from self-subsistent initial determinations into vanishing moments of a movement of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME2","text":"Becoming is determined from a mere transitional form into a unity that sublates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME3","text":"The result is classified not as a return to being or nothing, but as the preserved unity of both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME4","text":"Rest and movement are mapped not as externally separate states, but as successive forms of the same logic of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME5","text":"Determinate being (Dasein) becomes visible as resultant, mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ME6","text":"The opposition between arising and passing away is brought together in a common structure of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Becoming passes from the alternating vanishing of being and nothing into a tranquil unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The inner difference of the opposed moments produces the instability and subsequently the sublation of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The contradiction is not eliminated by privileging one side, but is newly determined through the production of a resultant form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is posited as the result of a temporally moving mediation and appears in determinate being (Dasein) as a being, yet not self-subsistent, unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT1","text":"Axioms A1 through A12 suffice to reconstruct the transition from becoming to determinate being (Dasein).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the difference of being and nothing is itself grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT3","text":"The movement is internally coherent insofar as the self-contradiction of becoming produces its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the determination of the result as neither mere nothing nor mere being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between the persisting difference of being and nothing and their tranquil unity in the result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the result is determined as being, although it may not be being-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3ADW:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as self-contradiction is treated not as a break-off, but as an operator of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3ADW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_3ADW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_3ADW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 16","title":"3. Sublation of Becoming.","context":"Chapter 16","original_title":"3. Aufheben des Werdens."},"original_title":"3. Aufheben des Werdens.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":17,"parents":["RAW_GB18_ANME"],"revision":"CH_GB18_ANME@R001","sha256":"dc24e5174d91c6c70c2ce4c8cdd4690e5276d9065254d730397be714579f6c05","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, Aufheben als vermittelte Bestimmung vom unmittelbaren Nichts zu unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS2","text":"Die Neubestimmung des Aufgehobenen verbindet Erhaltung und Negation in einer einzigen Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS3","text":"Die begriffliche Grundlage bildet die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts als vermittelte, reflektierte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS4","text":"Der Beweisgang zeigt, dass das Aufgehobene nicht vernichtet, sondern seiner Unmittelbarkeit entnommen und als Resultat bewahrt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der sprachlichen Doppelbedeutung des Aufhebens zur ontologischen Bestimmung von Moment, Werden und Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A1","text":"Das Unmittelbare ist Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A2","text":"Das Aufgehobene ist ein aus Seyn hervorgegangenes Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A3","text":"Das Aufgehobene ist nicht Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A4","text":"Das Aufheben bedeutet zugleich Aufbewahren und Aufhörenlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A5","text":"Aufbewahrung negiert die Unmittelbarkeit und erhält die Bestimmtheit des Aufbewahrten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A6","text":"Etwas ist nur aufgehoben, wenn es in die Einheit mit seinem Entgegengesetzten eingetreten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A7","text":"Eine reflektierte Bestimmung ist ein Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A8","text":"Seyn und Nichts sind nur in ihrer Unterschiedenheit voneinander abstrakt Seyn und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A9","text":"In ihrer Wahrheit als Einheit verschwinden Seyn und Nichts als abstrakte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A10","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts bleibt die Grundlage ihrer weiteren Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A11","text":"Werden und Daseyn bestimmen Seyn und Nichts jeweils als anders bestimmte Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX1","text":"Aufheben ist nicht bloße Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX2","text":"Das Aufgehobene ist nicht das unmittelbare Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX3","text":"Aufbewahrung ist nicht unveränderte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX4","text":"Die Bestimmung des Aufgehobenen ist nicht auf eine der beiden lexikalischen Bedeutungen des Aufhebens reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX5","text":"Seyn und Nichts sind in ihrer Einheit nicht mehr abstrakt das, was sie isoliert bedeuten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX6","text":"Das Aufgehobene tritt nicht aus der Einheit seiner Bestimmungen in eine abstrakte Einzelbedeutung zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D1","text":"Das Aufgehobene bewahrt die Bestimmtheit seines Ursprungs, obwohl es dessen unmittelbare Seinsweise verloren hat.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A2","CH_GB18_ANME:A3","CH_GB18_ANME:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D2","text":"Die Negation der Unmittelbarkeit ist eine Bedingung der Erhaltung und nicht deren Gegenteil.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D3","text":"Die doppelte Bedeutung des Aufhebens bezeichnet eine spekulative Einheit entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D4","text":"Seyn und Nichts werden als Momente nur durch eine Einheit bestimmt, in der ihre abstrakte Selbständigkeit aufgehoben ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A6","CH_GB18_ANME:A7","CH_GB18_ANME:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D5","text":"Werden bestimmt Seyn und Nichts als Entstehen und Vergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D6","text":"Daseyn bestimmt Seyn und Nichts als anders bestimmte Momente einer bereits vermittelten Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD1","text":"Negation erzeugt hier keine Leere, sondern eine höhere Bestimmtheit, sofern sie die unmittelbare Form beseitigt und den Inhalt erhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A3","CH_GB18_ANME:A5","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD2","text":"Identität und Unterschied werden nicht als Gegensätze außerhalb einer Einheit behandelt, sondern als Momente ihrer vermittelten Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A6","CH_GB18_ANME:A8","CH_GB18_ANME:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD3","text":"Die ontologische Bewegung besteht in der Umwandlung abstrakter Bestimmungen in relationale Momente einer fortgesetzten Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A9","CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD4","text":"Das Aufheben fungiert als generatives Schema, durch das eine Bestimmung zugleich negiert, bewahrt und in eine neue Einheit überführt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A5","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Negation mit absoluter Auslöschung identisch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass eine Bestimmung außerhalb der Beziehungen zu ihrem Entgegengesetzten begrifflich vollständig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Einheit durch Rückkehr zu unmittelbarer Identität entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass sprachliche Gegensätze ohne spekulative Vermittlung bloß nebeneinanderstehende Bedeutungen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass das Resultat einer Bewegung von seiner Herkunft vollständig getrennt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Begriff des Nichts, der keine vorausgehende Bestimmung und keine Vermittlung voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, die erhalten werden könnte, ohne ihre Unmittelbarkeit zu verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist ein Modell, in dem Einheit entweder bloße Identität oder bloße Auflösung der Unterschiede bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine statische Ontologie, in der Seyn und Nichts außerhalb ihrer Übergänge und Einheitsformen bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS1","text":"Eine ursprüngliche Bestimmung tritt in Gegensatz zu ihrem Entgegengesetzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS2","text":"Die Einheit der Gegensätze negiert ihre Unmittelbarkeit, ohne ihre Bestimmtheit auszulöschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS3","text":"Die erhaltene, aber vermittelte Bestimmung wird als Moment einer neuen Einheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS4","text":"Die neue Einheit erzeugt weiterbestimmte Formen wie Entstehen und Vergehen im Werden sowie Seyn und Nichts im Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS5","text":"Die Einheit bleibt als Grundlage wirksam und verhindert die Rückkehr der Momente zu abstrakten Einzelbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AF1","text":"Sprachliche Doppelbedeutung des Aufhebens → Einheit von Erhaltung und Negation → Unterscheidung von Aufgehobenem und Nichts → Einheit von Seyn und Nichts → Bestimmung als Moment → Werden und Daseyn als weiterführende Einheitsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME1","text":"Negation wird von der Karte der Vernichtung auf die Karte der vermittelten Erhaltung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME2","text":"Erhaltung und Aufhörenlassen werden nicht länger als ausschließende Alternativen, sondern als Funktionen eines einzigen Prozesses kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME3","text":"Seyn und Nichts werden von selbständigen Grundbestimmungen zu relationalen Momenten einer Einheit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME4","text":"Das Resultat wird als zugleich abhängige und eigenbestimmte Form seiner Herkunft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME5","text":"Werden und Daseyn erscheinen als unterschiedliche Kartierungen derselben grundlegenden Vermittlungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Text bestimmt die Bedeutung von Aufheben und grenzt das Aufgehobene vom Nichts ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Operation des Aufhebens organisiert die Einheit von Negation, Erhaltung, Vermittlung und Neubestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ersetzt die Entscheidung zwischen gegensätzlichen Bedeutungen durch eine spekulative Rekonstruktion ihrer gemeinsamen Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Seyn und Nichts werden als sich verändernde Momente einer bleibenden Einheit bestimmt, deren Formen sich im Werden und Daseyn differenzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um Aufheben als gleichzeitige Negation und Erhaltung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen unmittelbarem Nichts und vermitteltem Aufgehobenem bleibt nur durch die Herkunftsrelation vollständig bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern „Verschwinden“ als Verlust der abstrakten Form und nicht als Vernichtung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die systematische Verbindung von sprachlicher Doppelbedeutung und ontologischer Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass Seyn und Nichts als dasselbe gelten, gerade weil sie nicht mehr Seyn und Nichts sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Einheit ihre Momente erhält, während sie ihnen zugleich ihre ursprüngliche Bestimmtheit entzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom Aufheben über das Moment zur Bestimmung von Werden und Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111115183772Z_48bea670","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"dc24e5174d91c6c70c2ce4c8cdd4690e5276d9065254d730397be714579f6c05","sha256":"9fba69d2769e288ea240abd1f0eb719521b5b37c8297b5c23ea498793e1b0017","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:11:15.184981+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in distinguishing sublation as a mediated determination from immediate Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS2","text":"The redetermination of the sublated unites preservation and negation in a single operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS3","text":"The conceptual foundation is formed by the unity of Being and Nothing as a mediated, reflected determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS4","text":"The course of proof shows that the sublated is not annihilated, but removed from its immediacy and preserved as a result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AS5","text":"The movement leads from the linguistic double meaning of sublation to the ontological determination of moment, becoming, and determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A1","text":"The immediate is Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A2","text":"The sublated is a result that has emerged from Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A3","text":"The sublated is not Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A4","text":"Sublation means at once preserving and causing to cease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A5","text":"Preservation negates immediacy and retains the determinacy of what is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A6","text":"Something is sublated only when it has entered into unity with its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A7","text":"A reflected determination is a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A8","text":"Being and Nothing are abstract Being and Nothing only in their difference from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A9","text":"In their truth as unity, Being and Nothing vanish as abstract determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A10","text":"The unity of Being and Nothing remains the foundation of their further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:A11","text":"Becoming and determinate being each determine Being and Nothing as differently determined moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX1","text":"Sublation is not mere annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX2","text":"The sublated is not immediate Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX3","text":"Preservation is not unaltered immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX4","text":"The determination of the sublated cannot be reduced to either of the two lexical meanings of sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX5","text":"In their unity, Being and Nothing are no longer abstractly what they mean in isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:NX6","text":"The sublated does not recede from the unity of its determinations into an abstract individual meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D1","text":"The sublated preserves the determinacy of its origin, although it has lost the latter's immediate mode of being.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A2","CH_GB18_ANME:A3","CH_GB18_ANME:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D2","text":"The negation of immediacy is a condition of preservation and not its opposite.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D3","text":"The double meaning of sublation designates a speculative unity of opposed determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D4","text":"Being and Nothing are determined as moments only through a unity in which their abstract self-subsistence is sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A6","CH_GB18_ANME:A7","CH_GB18_ANME:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D5","text":"Becoming determines Being and Nothing as coming-to-be and passing-away.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:D6","text":"Determinate being determines Being and Nothing as differently determined moments of an already mediated unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD1","text":"Here negation produces no emptiness, but rather a higher determinacy, insofar as it removes the immediate form and preserves the content.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A3","CH_GB18_ANME:A5","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD2","text":"Identity and difference are not treated as opposites outside a unity, but as moments of its mediated determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A6","CH_GB18_ANME:A8","CH_GB18_ANME:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD3","text":"The ontological movement consists in the transformation of abstract determinations into relational moments of a continuing unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A9","CH_GB18_ANME:A10","CH_GB18_ANME:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SD4","text":"Sublation functions as a generative schema through which a determination is at once negated, preserved, and transferred into a new unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ANME:A4","CH_GB18_ANME:A5","CH_GB18_ANME:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX1","text":"The system excludes that negation is identical with absolute extinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX2","text":"The system excludes that a determination is conceptually complete outside its relations to its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX3","text":"The system excludes that unity arises through return to immediate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX4","text":"The system excludes that linguistic opposites remain merely juxtaposed meanings without speculative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:DNX5","text":"The system excludes that the result of a movement can be completely separated from its origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX1","text":"Inadmissible is a concept of Nothing that presupposes neither a preceding determination nor mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a pure immediacy that could be preserved without losing its immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is a model in which unity means either mere identity or mere dissolution of differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a static ontology in which Being and Nothing are determined outside their transitions and forms of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS1","text":"An original determination enters into opposition with its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS2","text":"The unity of opposites negates their immediacy without extinguishing their determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS3","text":"The preserved but mediated determination is posited as a moment of a new unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS4","text":"The new unity generates further determined forms such as coming-to-be and passing-away in becoming, as well as Being and Nothing in determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:FGS5","text":"The unity remains effective as foundation and prevents the moments' return to abstract individual determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:AF1","text":"Linguistic double meaning of sublation → unity of preservation and negation → distinction between the sublated and Nothing → unity of Being and Nothing → determination as moment → becoming and determinate being as further forms of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME1","text":"Negation is shifted from the map of annihilation to the map of mediated preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME2","text":"Preservation and causing to cease are no longer mapped as mutually exclusive alternatives, but as functions of a single process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME3","text":"Being and Nothing are reclassified from self-subsistent basic determinations into relational moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME4","text":"The result becomes visible as a form of its origin that is at once dependent and self-determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ME5","text":"Becoming and determinate being appear as different mappings of the same fundamental structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT1","text":"Surface: The text determines the meaning of sublation and distinguishes the sublated from Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT2","text":"Structural: The operation of sublation organizes the unity of negation, preservation, mediation, and redetermination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text replaces the decision between opposed meanings with a speculative reconstruction of their common operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being and Nothing are determined as changing moments of an abiding unity, whose forms differentiate themselves in becoming and determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct sublation as simultaneous negation and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT2","text":"The distinction between immediate Nothing and mediated sublatedness remains fully determined only through the relation of origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as “vanishing” is understood as loss of abstract form and not as annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the systematic connection of linguistic double meaning and ontological mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that Being and Nothing count as the same precisely because they are no longer Being and Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that unity preserves its moments while at the same time depriving them of their original determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ANME:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from sublation through the moment to the determination of becoming and determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ANME:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_ANME@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_ANME:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 17","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 17","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0","layer":"CH","title":"A. Determinate Being as Such.","order":18,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DAS0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DAS0@R001","sha256":"44b4713a68c119174ef122a4d9f3459410164c257173f57d0c864041ebb971ed","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, unbestimmtes Seyn als Daseyn in eine bestimmte begriffliche Form zu überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS2","text":"Daseyn wird durch Bestimmtheit als Qualität neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS3","text":"Qualität erzeugt Relation, Veränderlichkeit und Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS4","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit ist zugleich Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS5","text":"Die Negation des Endlichen eröffnet den Gegensatz des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS6","text":"Der Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem soll sich in gegensatzloser Unendlichkeit beziehungsweise Fürsichseyn auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS7","text":"Die Rückwendung der Bestimmtheit in sich selbst setzt Daseyn als Etwas, als Daseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A1","text":"Daseyn ist bestimmtes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns ist seyende Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A3","text":"Seyende Bestimmtheit ist Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A4","text":"Qualität bestimmt Etwas gegenüber einem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A5","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit macht Etwas veränderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A6","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit macht Etwas endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A7","text":"Das endliche Etwas ist nicht nur gegenüber einem Anderen, sondern an ihm schlechthin negativ bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A8","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit ist sowohl Realität als auch Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A9","text":"Daseyn ist in seinen Bestimmtheiten in sich reflektiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A10","text":"Das in sich reflektierte Daseyn ist als Etwas, als Daseyendes, gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A11","text":"Die Negation des endlichen Etwas steht zunächst als das Unendliche gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A12","text":"Der abstrakte Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem löst sich in gegensatzlose Unendlichkeit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A13","text":"Gegenzatzlose Unendlichkeit bestimmt sich als Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX1","text":"Daseyn ist nicht unbestimmtes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX2","text":"Qualität ist nicht bloße positive Realität, sondern schließt Negation ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX3","text":"Etwas ist nicht isoliert, sondern nur gegenüber einem Anderen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX4","text":"Endlichkeit ist nicht bloß begrenzte Ausdehnung, sondern schlechthin negative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX5","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht als bloß äußerer Gegenstand des Endlichen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX6","text":"Die Unendlichkeit bleibt nicht im abstrakten Gegensatz zum Endlichen stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX7","text":"Daseyn ist nicht bloß äußerlich bestimmt, sondern in seiner Bestimmtheit in sich reflektiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D1","text":"Aus der Einheit von Daseyn und Bestimmtheit folgt, dass Daseyn nur als qualitativ bestimmtes Seyn begrifflich zugänglich ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A1","CH_GB18_DAS0:A2","CH_GB18_DAS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D2","text":"Aus der Qualität als seyender Bestimmtheit folgt die relationale Gegenüberstellung von Etwas und Anderem.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A3","CH_GB18_DAS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D3","text":"Aus der qualitativen Gegenüberstellung folgt, dass Bestimmtheit Veränderung und Endlichkeit einschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A4","CH_GB18_DAS0:A5","CH_GB18_DAS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D4","text":"Aus der Endlichkeit als schlechthin negativer Bestimmtheit folgt die Eröffnung des Unendlichen als Gegenbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A7","CH_GB18_DAS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D5","text":"Aus der Bestimmung der Qualität als Realität und Negation folgt, dass jede qualitative Positivität eine negative Grenze mitführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D6","text":"Aus der inneren Reflexion der Bestimmtheit folgt die Selbständigkeit des Daseyns als Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A9","CH_GB18_DAS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D7","text":"Aus dem abstrakten Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem folgt dessen Aufhebung in eine gegensatzlose Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A11","CH_GB18_DAS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D8","text":"Die gegensatzlose Unendlichkeit wird als Fürsichseyn bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A12","CH_GB18_DAS0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD1","text":"Bestimmtheit erzeugt ihren eigenen Gegenbegriff, weil Qualität zugleich seiende Realität und Negation ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD2","text":"Das endliche Etwas ist strukturell auf ein Anderes und auf die Negation seiner eigenen Endlichkeit verwiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD3","text":"Die Bewegung vom Daseyn zum Etwas verläuft nicht von äußerer Zuschreibung zu Substanz, sondern von Bestimmtheit über Reflexion zu selbstgesetzter Einzelheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist kein stabiler Endpunkt, sondern eine Übergangsform zur gegensatzlosen Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD5","text":"Die Grundstruktur des Daseyns ist eine Einheit von positiver Setzung, relationaler Abgrenzung, Negation und Selbstbezug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Daseyn aus, dessen Bestimmtheit ohne seiende Qualität bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt eine Qualität aus, die ausschließlich positive Realität und nicht zugleich Negation wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt ein isoliertes Etwas aus, das nicht durch ein Anderes mitbestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine Endlichkeit aus, die keine innere Negativität enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt einen endgültigen Dualismus von Endlichem und Unendlichem aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt eine bloß äußerliche Reflexion aus; die Bestimmtheit muss in das Daseyn selbst zurückkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie reiner Unmittelbarkeit, in der Seyn ohne Bestimmtheit und Negation bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußerliche Ordnung von Positivem und Negativem, in der beide Bestimmungen unabhängig voneinander wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, Endlichkeit als selbstgenügsame Bestimmung zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Unendlichkeit, die nur als Gegenpol des Endlichen verfügbar wäre und nicht dessen Gegensatzlosigkeit hervorbrächte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Daseyn ohne Übergang von qualitativer Bestimmtheit zu selbstbezogener Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS1","text":"Unbestimmtes Seyn → Bestimmtes Seyn → Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS2","text":"Daseyn → seyende Bestimmtheit → Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS3","text":"Qualität → Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS4","text":"Qualität → Gegenüberstellung von Etwas und Anderem → Veränderlichkeit und Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS5","text":"Endliches Etwas → schlechthin negative Bestimmtheit → Unendliches als Gegenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS6","text":"Endliches und Unendliches als abstrakter Gegensatz → Auflösung des Gegensatzes → gegensatzlose Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS7","text":"Gegenzatzlose Unendlichkeit → Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS8","text":"Bestimmtheit als Realität und Negation → innere Reflexion → Etwas als Daseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AF1","text":"Bestimmungsproblem → Daseyn als bestimmtes Seyn → Qualität als seyende Bestimmtheit → Realität und Negation → relationale Endlichkeit → Unendlichkeit als Negation des Endlichen → Aufhebung des abstrakten Gegensatzes → Fürsichseyn und Etwas als in sich reflektiertes Daseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME1","text":"Daseyn wird von einer bloßen Seinsgegebenheit in eine durch Qualität organisierte Bestimmungsstruktur überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME2","text":"Qualität wird neu kartiert als Einheit von Realität und Negation statt als ausschließlich positive Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME3","text":"Etwas und Anderes erscheinen als korrelative Bestimmungen und nicht als selbständige, zunächst getrennte Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME4","text":"Endlichkeit wird als innere Negativität klassifiziert und nicht als bloße äußere Begrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME5","text":"Das Unendliche wird vom äußerlichen Gegenpol zur Endlichkeit in eine Aufhebung des Gegensatzes überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME6","text":"Das Daseyn erhält durch Reflexion-in-sich die Form des Etwas beziehungsweise des Daseyenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Daseyn ist bestimmtes Seyn; seine Bestimmtheit erscheint als Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Qualität organisiert die Relation von Etwas und Anderem und erzeugt dadurch Veränderlichkeit, Endlichkeit und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der abstrakte Gegensatz wird nicht als letzte Ordnung akzeptiert, sondern als Übergangsstruktur zur gegensatzlosen Unendlichkeit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität ist als Einheit von seiender Bestimmtheit, Negation und Reflexion-in-sich verfasst; Veränderlichkeit gehört zur qualitativen Bestimmtheit des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome A1 bis A10 reichen aus, um die interne Konstruktion von Daseyn über Qualität zu Etwas zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT2","text":"Für die Bewegung zur Unendlichkeit und zum Fürsichseyn sind A11 bis A13 zusätzlich erforderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, durch welchen begrifflichen Vollzug sich die Auflösung des Gegensatzes im Einzelnen vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Qualität gleichzeitig als Realität und Negation fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Endlichkeit aus qualitativer Negation statt aus äußerer Begrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT6","text":"Die Konstruktion bleibt an der Schwelle zwischen Daseyn als solchem und der weiterführenden Bestimmung des Endlichen beziehungsweise Unendlichen komprimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: Bestimmtheit → Qualität → Negation → Endlichkeit → Unendlichkeit → Fürsichseyn beziehungsweise Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115027644565Z_2f27847a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Determinate Being as such.","source_sha256":"44b4713a68c119174ef122a4d9f3459410164c257173f57d0c864041ebb971ed","sha256":"4900c99fc6bd4e80c6a661fbd0970d3d65228eabc922b4038e20aae8dea6063f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:50:27.652697+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in bringing indeterminate Being into a determinate conceptual form as determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS2","text":"Determinate being is redetermined through determinateness as quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS3","text":"Quality generates relation, mutability, and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS4","text":"Qualitative determinateness is at once reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS5","text":"The negation of the finite opens up the opposition of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS6","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite is to dissolve into oppositionless infinity, or being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AS7","text":"The return of determinateness into itself posits determinate being as something, as an existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A1","text":"Determinate being is determinate Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A2","text":"The determinateness of determinate being is being determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A3","text":"Being determinateness is quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A4","text":"Quality determines something over against an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A5","text":"Qualitative determinateness makes something mutable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A6","text":"Qualitative determinateness makes something finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A7","text":"The finite something is determined not only over against an other, but is in it absolutely negatively determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A8","text":"Qualitative determinateness is both reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A9","text":"Determinate being is reflected into itself in its determinatenesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A10","text":"Determinate being reflected into itself is posited as something, as an existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A11","text":"The negation of the finite something initially stands over against it as the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A12","text":"The abstract opposition of finite and infinite dissolves into oppositionless infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:A13","text":"Oppositionless infinity determines itself as being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX1","text":"Determinate being is not indeterminate Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX2","text":"Quality is not mere positive reality, but includes negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX3","text":"Something is not isolated, but determined only over against an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX4","text":"Finitude is not merely limited extension, but absolutely negative determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX5","text":"The infinite is not determined as a merely external object of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX6","text":"Infinity does not remain fixed in abstract opposition to the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:NX7","text":"Determinate being is not merely externally determined, but reflected into itself in its determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D1","text":"From the unity of determinate being and determinateness it follows that determinate being is conceptually accessible only as qualitatively determinate Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A1","CH_GB18_DAS0:A2","CH_GB18_DAS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D2","text":"From quality as being determinateness follows the relational juxtaposition of something and other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A3","CH_GB18_DAS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D3","text":"From qualitative juxtaposition it follows that determinateness includes change and finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A4","CH_GB18_DAS0:A5","CH_GB18_DAS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D4","text":"From finitude as absolutely negative determinateness follows the opening up of the infinite as counter-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A7","CH_GB18_DAS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D5","text":"From the determination of quality as reality and negation it follows that every qualitative positivity carries along a negative limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D6","text":"From the inner reflection of determinateness follows the self-subsistence of determinate being as something.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A9","CH_GB18_DAS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D7","text":"From the abstract opposition of finite and infinite follows its sublation into an oppositionless infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A11","CH_GB18_DAS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:D8","text":"Oppositionless infinity is determined as being-for-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAS0:A12","CH_GB18_DAS0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD1","text":"Determinateness generates its own counter-concept, because quality is at once being reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD2","text":"The finite something is structurally referred to an other and to the negation of its own finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD3","text":"The movement from determinate being to something proceeds not from external ascription to substance, but from determinateness through reflection to self-posited singularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD4","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite is not a stable endpoint, but a transitional form toward oppositionless infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SD5","text":"The basic structure of determinate being is a unity of positive positing, relational delimitation, negation, and self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a determinate being whose determinateness could exist without being quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a quality that would be exclusively positive reality and not at once negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX3","text":"The system excludes an isolated something that would not be co-determined by an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a finitude that contained no inner negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a final dualism of finite and infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:DNX6","text":"The system excludes a merely external reflection; determinateness must return into determinate being itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of pure immediacy in which Being could exist without determinateness and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an external ordering of the positive and the negative in which both determinations would be independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating finitude as a self-sufficient determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an infinity that would be available only as the opposite pole of the finite and would not bring forth its oppositionlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a determinate being without transition from qualitative determinateness to self-related existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate Being → Determinate Being → determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS2","text":"Determinate being → being determinateness → quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS3","text":"Quality → reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS4","text":"Quality → juxtaposition of something and other → mutability and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS5","text":"Finite something → absolutely negative determinateness → infinite as counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS6","text":"Finite and infinite as abstract opposition → dissolution of the opposition → oppositionless infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS7","text":"Oppositionless infinity → being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:FGS8","text":"Determinateness as reality and negation → inner reflection → something as existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:AF1","text":"Problem of determination → determinate being as determinate Being → quality as being determinateness → reality and negation → relational finitude → infinity as negation of the finite → sublation of the abstract opposition → being-for-self and something as an existent reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME1","text":"Determinate being is transferred from a mere givenness of being into a structure of determination organized through quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME2","text":"Quality is remapped as a unity of reality and negation rather than as an exclusively positive property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME3","text":"Something and other appear as correlative determinations and not as self-subsistent, initially separate units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME4","text":"Finitude is classified as inner negativity and not as mere external limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME5","text":"The infinite is transferred from an external opposite pole to finitude into a sublation of the opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ME6","text":"Through reflection-into-itself, determinate being acquires the form of something, or of the existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Determinate being is determinate Being; its determinateness appears as quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Quality organizes the relation of something and other and thereby generates mutability, finitude, and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The abstract opposition is not accepted as the final order, but treated as a transitional structure toward oppositionless infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is constituted as a unity of being determinateness, negation, and reflection-into-itself; mutability belongs to the qualitative determinateness of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT1","text":"Axioms A1 through A10 suffice to reconstruct the internal construction from determinate being through quality to something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT2","text":"For the movement to infinity and to being-for-self, A11 through A13 are additionally required.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined through what conceptual operation the dissolution of the opposition is carried out in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where quality functions simultaneously as reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of finitude from qualitative negation rather than from external limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT6","text":"The construction remains compressed at the threshold between determinate being as such and the further determination of the finite or infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAS0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement: determinateness → quality → negation → finitude → infinity → being-for-self or something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DAS0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DAS0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 18","title":"A. Determinate Being as Such.","context":"Chapter 18","original_title":"A. Daseyn als solches."},"original_title":"A. Daseyn als solches.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB","layer":"CH","title":"a. Determinate Being in General.","order":19,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DASB"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DASB@R001","sha256":"7456272adab631b1c99098e0cc3c2b5fb9c21b49058eff1127ccef32f592b9ac","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Daseyn aus dem Werden zu bestimmen, ohne die aufgehobene Vermittlung mit einer noch geltenden Unmittelbarkeit zu verwechseln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS2","text":"Das Daseyn wird als einfache Einheit von Seyn und Nichts neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS3","text":"Die Vermittlung dieser Einheit liegt im Werden, ist aber im Daseyn aufgehoben und daher als unmittelbare Form gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns ist nicht bloß äußerlich reflektiert, sondern am Begriff selbst gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS5","text":"Die Entwicklung darf nur das aufnehmen, was im Begriff selbst gesetzt ist, nicht bloße Vorbemerkungen der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS6","text":"Weil das Daseyn bestimmtes und konkretes Seyn ist, erzeugt seine Bestimmtheit weitere unterschiedene Verhältnisse seiner Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A1","text":"Das Daseyn geht aus dem Werden hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A2","text":"Das Werden ist die Vermittlung von Seyn und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A3","text":"Im Daseyn ist die Vermittlung des Werdens aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A4","text":"Das Daseyn ist die einfache Einheit von Seyn und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A5","text":"Die aufgehobene Vermittlung erscheint im Daseyn als Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A6","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht bloßes Seyn, sondern Seyn mit einem aufgenommenen Nichtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A7","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichtseyn bildet die Bestimmtheit als solche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A8","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns ist am Begriff selbst gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A9","text":"Nur eine am Begriff gesetzte Bestimmtheit gehört zu seinem entwickelnden Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A10","text":"Äußerliche Reflexion kann den Entwicklungsgang erläutern, aber nicht als inneres Moment des Begriffs gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A11","text":"Das Seyn der vorigen Sphäre ist unbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A12","text":"Das Daseyn ist bestimmtes und konkretes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A13","text":"Bestimmtes Seyn enthält unterschiedene Verhältnisse seiner Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX1","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht bloßes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX2","text":"Die etymologische Ortsbedeutung von „Daseyn“ bestimmt nicht den Begriff räumlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX3","text":"Das Nichtseyn ist im Daseyn nicht äußerlich neben das Seyn gestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX4","text":"Die Vermittlung des Werdens ist im Daseyn nicht als selbständige Vermittlung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX5","text":"Eine äußerlich reflektierte Bestimmtheit ist noch keine am Begriff gesetzte Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX6","text":"Reflexive Vorausdeutungen sind keine selbständigen Gründe oder Grundlagen der weiteren Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX7","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht mit dem unbestimmten Seyn der vorigen Sphäre gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D1","text":"Die Aufhebung des Werdens lässt das Daseyn als erstes erscheinen, von dem die weitere Entwicklung ausgehen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A1","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D2","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichtseyn erhält im Daseyn die Form eines konkreten Ganzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A4","CH_GB18_DASB:A6","CH_GB18_DASB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D3","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Daseyns ist nicht voraussetzungslos, sondern das Resultat aufgehobener Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A2","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D4","text":"Die einseitige Form des Seyns bildet zunächst die Erscheinungsweise der im Daseyn enthaltenen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A4","CH_GB18_DASB:A5","CH_GB18_DASB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D5","text":"Erst die weitere Negation lässt die im Daseyn enthaltene Bestimmtheit als gesetzte Bestimmtheit hervortreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A7","CH_GB18_DASB:A8","CH_GB18_DASB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D6","text":"Die konkrete Bestimmtheit des Daseyns eröffnet eine Mehrzahl von Bestimmungen und Verhältnissen seiner Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A12","CH_GB18_DASB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD1","text":"Das Daseyn ist eine resultative Unmittelbarkeit: Es erscheint unmittelbar, weil seine Vermittlung aufgehoben wurde.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A1","CH_GB18_DASB:A2","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD2","text":"Bestimmtheit entsteht nicht durch eine äußerliche Hinzufügung zum Seyn, sondern durch die im Seyn aufgenommene Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A6","CH_GB18_DASB:A7","CH_GB18_DASB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD3","text":"Die begriffliche Entwicklung ist durch die Differenz zwischen reflexiv vorausgesetzter und am Begriff gesetzter Bestimmtheit methodisch begrenzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A8","CH_GB18_DASB:A9","CH_GB18_DASB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD4","text":"Der Übergang vom unbestimmten Seyn zum Daseyn transformiert einfache Unmittelbarkeit in konkrete, intern differenzierbare Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A11","CH_GB18_DASB:A12","CH_GB18_DASB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einem von seiner Vermittlung losgelösten, vorausliegenden Daseyn beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX2","text":"Bestimmtheit darf nicht als äußerliche Prädikation eines zunächst vollständigen Seyns verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX3","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts darf nicht als bloße Addition zweier fertiger Momente gefasst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX4","text":"Die Entwicklung darf nicht aus bloßen Reflexionsurteilen konstruiert werden, die im Begriff noch nicht gesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX5","text":"Konkretheit darf nicht mit räumlicher Lokalisation identifiziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie reiner Unmittelbarkeit, in der Vermittlung nicht als aufgehobene Herkunft fortwirkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein äußerliches Differenzmodell, in dem Seyn und Nichts getrennt bestehen und erst nachträglich vereinigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Entwicklung, deren Notwendigkeit aus vorwegnehmender Reflexion statt aus der Selbstbestimmung des Begriffs stammt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Verständnis des Daseyns, das seine Konkretheit auf eine außertheoretische Raumvorstellung reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Seyn und Nichtseyn gehen in das Werden ein; das Werden vermittelt ihre Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS2","text":"Die Vermittlung hebt sich auf; ihre aufgehobene Einheit tritt als unmittelbares Daseyn hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS3","text":"Im Daseyn wird das Nichtseyn in das Seyn aufgenommen; dadurch entsteht bestimmtes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit erscheint zunächst in der Form des Seyns, ohne damit auf bloßes Seyn zurückzufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS5","text":"Die Reflexion unterscheidet äußerlich Vorgedeutetes von dem, was am Begriff selbst gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS6","text":"Die weitere Negation setzt die zuvor nur enthaltene Einheit als bestimmte Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS7","text":"Das bestimmte Seyn erweist sich als konkretes Seyn und erzeugt unterschiedene Verhältnisse seiner Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AF1","text":"Werden als Vermittlung → Aufhebung der Vermittlung → Daseyn als resultative Unmittelbarkeit → Einheit von Seyn und Nichtseyn → gesetzte Bestimmtheit → konkretes Seyn → weitere Differenzierung der Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird als Resultat einer aufgehobenen Vermittlung kartiert, nicht als deren Abwesenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME2","text":"Nichtseyn wird von einem äußeren Gegenpol zu einer im Seyn wirksamen Bestimmtheitsfunktion umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME3","text":"Die Grenze zwischen begrifflicher Entwicklung und äußerlicher Reflexion wird als methodische Ordnungslinie sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME4","text":"Der Übergang vom Seyn zum Daseyn wird als Übergang von Unbestimmtheit zu konkreter interner Differenzierbarkeit neu gezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME5","text":"Konkretheit wird von räumlicher Bestimmung gelöst und als Einheit von Seyn und aufgenommenem Nichtseyn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Daseyn erscheint als einfaches, unmittelbares bestimmtes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Form des Daseyns entsteht aus der aufgehobenen Vermittlung des Werdens und der Aufnahme des Nichtseyns in das Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Entwicklung wird gegen äußerliche Reflexion abgesichert, indem nur gesetzte Bestimmungen als argumentative Schritte gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Daseyn ist eine nachträgliche Unmittelbarkeit: Es ist erstes Resultat, dessen Herkunft im aufgehobenen Werden fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Werden zum Daseyn und dessen Grundbestimmung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen gesetzter Bestimmtheit und äußerlicher Reflexion ist notwendig, damit die Entwicklung nicht durch Vorwegnahmen ersetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Unmittelbarkeit als aufgehobene Vermittlung und nicht als vermittlungslose Gegebenheit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, durch welche konkrete Negation die im Daseyn enthaltenen Momente später auseinandergelegt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Bestimmtheit aus der Einheit von Seyn und Nichtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass das Daseyn als erstes erscheint, obwohl es nur als Resultat des Werdens verständlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die reflexiven Erläuterungen nicht als eigenständige Entwicklungsgründe behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115048569740Z_5534f878","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Determinate Being in General.","source_sha256":"7456272adab631b1c99098e0cc3c2b5fb9c21b49058eff1127ccef32f592b9ac","sha256":"102878b9aeefd5ddb69cdf8307829d82026bfe43550d29b327936dfa4073c827","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:50:48.571309+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining determinate being from becoming without confusing sublated mediation with an immediacy that still holds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS2","text":"Determinate being is newly determined as the simple unity of Being and Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS3","text":"The mediation of this unity lies in becoming, but is sublated in determinate being and is therefore posited as immediate form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS4","text":"The determinacy of determinate being is not merely externally reflected, but is posited in the Concept itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS5","text":"The development may take up only what is posited in the Concept itself, not mere preliminary remarks of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AS6","text":"Because determinate being is determinate and concrete Being, its determinacy generates further differentiated relations of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A1","text":"Determinate being emerges from becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A2","text":"Becoming is the mediation of Being and Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A3","text":"In determinate being, the mediation of becoming is sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A4","text":"Determinate being is the simple unity of Being and Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A5","text":"The sublated mediation appears in determinate being as immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A6","text":"Determinate being is not mere Being, but Being with an incorporated non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A7","text":"The unity of Being and non-being constitutes determinacy as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A8","text":"The determinacy of determinate being is posited in the Concept itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A9","text":"Only a determinacy posited in the Concept belongs to its developing content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A10","text":"External reflection can elucidate the course of development, but cannot count as an internal moment of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A11","text":"The Being of the preceding sphere is indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A12","text":"Determinate being is determinate and concrete Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:A13","text":"Determinate Being contains differentiated relations of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX1","text":"Determinate being is not mere Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX2","text":"The etymological locational meaning of “Daseyn” does not determine the Concept spatially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX3","text":"In determinate being, non-being is not externally placed alongside Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX4","text":"The mediation of becoming is not preserved in determinate being as an independent mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX5","text":"An externally reflected determinacy is not yet a determinacy posited in the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX6","text":"Reflective anticipations are not independent grounds or foundations of further development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:NX7","text":"Determinate being is not to be equated with the indeterminate Being of the preceding sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D1","text":"The sublation of becoming makes determinate being appear as the first from which further development can proceed.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A1","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D2","text":"In determinate being, the unity of Being and non-being receives the form of a concrete whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A4","CH_GB18_DASB:A6","CH_GB18_DASB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D3","text":"The immediacy of determinate being is not presuppositionless, but the result of sublated mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A2","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D4","text":"The one-sided form of Being initially constitutes the mode of appearance of the unity contained in determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A4","CH_GB18_DASB:A5","CH_GB18_DASB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D5","text":"Only further negation causes the determinacy contained in determinate being to emerge as posited determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A7","CH_GB18_DASB:A8","CH_GB18_DASB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:D6","text":"The concrete determinacy of determinate being opens up a multiplicity of determinations and relations of its moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A12","CH_GB18_DASB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD1","text":"Determinate being is a resultant immediacy: it appears immediate because its mediation has been sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A1","CH_GB18_DASB:A2","CH_GB18_DASB:A3","CH_GB18_DASB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD2","text":"Determinacy does not arise through an external addition to Being, but through negation incorporated into Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A6","CH_GB18_DASB:A7","CH_GB18_DASB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD3","text":"Conceptual development is methodically bounded by the difference between reflectively presupposed determinacy and determinacy posited in the Concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A8","CH_GB18_DASB:A9","CH_GB18_DASB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SD4","text":"The transition from indeterminate Being to determinate being transforms simple immediacy into concrete, internally differentiable immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DASB:A11","CH_GB18_DASB:A12","CH_GB18_DASB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on a determinate being antecedent to and detached from its mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX2","text":"Determinacy must not be understood as an external predication of an initially complete Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX3","text":"The unity of Being and Nothing must not be conceived as the mere addition of two finished moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX4","text":"Development must not be constructed from mere judgments of reflection that are not yet posited in the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:DNX5","text":"Concreteness must not be identified with spatial localization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of pure immediacy in which mediation does not persist as sublated provenance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an external model of difference in which Being and Nothing subsist separately and are only subsequently united.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a development whose necessity derives from anticipatory reflection rather than from the self-determination of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible is an understanding of determinate being that reduces its concreteness to an extra-theoretical conception of space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS1","text":"Immediate Being and non-being enter into becoming; becoming mediates their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS2","text":"The mediation sublates itself; its sublated unity emerges as immediate determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS3","text":"In determinate being, non-being is incorporated into Being; thereby determinate Being arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS4","text":"Determinacy initially appears in the form of Being, without thereby falling back into mere Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS5","text":"Reflection externally distinguishes what has been prefigured from what is posited in the Concept itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS6","text":"Further negation posits the previously merely contained unity as determinate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:FGS7","text":"Determinate Being proves to be concrete Being and generates differentiated relations of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:AF1","text":"Becoming as mediation → sublation of mediation → determinate being as resultant immediacy → unity of Being and non-being → posited determinacy → concrete Being → further differentiation of the moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME1","text":"Immediacy is mapped as the result of a sublated mediation, not as its absence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME2","text":"Non-being is reclassified from an external opposite pole into a function of determinacy active in Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME3","text":"The boundary between conceptual development and external reflection becomes visible as a methodological line of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME4","text":"The transition from Being to determinate being is redrawn as a transition from indeterminacy to concrete internal differentiability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ME5","text":"Concreteness is detached from spatial determination and determined as the unity of Being and incorporated non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Determinate being appears as simple, immediate determinate Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT2","text":"Structural — The form of determinate being arises from the sublated mediation of becoming and the incorporation of non-being into Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Development is secured against external reflection by counting only posited determinations as argumentative steps.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinate being is a subsequent immediacy: it is the first result, whose provenance persists in sublated becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from becoming to determinate being and its fundamental determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT2","text":"The distinction between posited determinacy and external reflection is necessary so that development is not replaced by anticipations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as immediacy is understood as sublated mediation and not as a given devoid of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined through which concrete negation the moments contained in determinate being are later separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of determinacy from the unity of Being and non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that determinate being appears as the first, although it is intelligible only as the result of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DASB:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the reflective elucidations are not treated as independent grounds of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DASB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DASB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DASB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 19","title":"a. Determinate Being in General.","context":"Chapter 19","original_title":"a. Daseyn überhaupt."},"original_title":"a. Daseyn überhaupt.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0","layer":"CH","title":"b. Quality.","order":20,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BQT0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BQT0@R001","sha256":"6964fe3597eb28557cea33f59c4409164c39d816a4e4057433b977bee9419c9c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS1","text":"Unmittelbares Daseyn setzt Seyn und Nichts in einer ungeschiedenen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS2","text":"Bestimmtheit ist zunächst weder vom Seyn abgelöst noch als selbständige Besonderheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS3","text":"Die isolierte seyende Bestimmtheit erzeugt den Begriff der Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS4","text":"Die in der Qualität verborgene Negation macht ihre bloße Unmittelbarkeit einseitig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung von seyender und verneinter Bestimmtheit erzeugt Realität, Negation, Grenze, Schranke und Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS6","text":"Realität und Negation bleiben beide Formen des Daseyns, obwohl die Realität ihre eigene Negativität verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","text":"Im unmittelbaren Daseyn sind Seyn und Nichts eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","text":"Bestimmtheit ist zunächst unmittelbar mit dem Seyn verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","text":"Das Daseyn ist die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A4","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts bildet den Grund aller ferneren Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","text":"Als isolierte seyende Bestimmtheit ist Bestimmtheit Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A6","text":"Bestimmtheit ist ein allgemeinerer Begriff als Qualität und kann auch Quantität oder weiter Bestimmtes sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","text":"Jede unmittelbare seyende Bestimmtheit enthält eine Bestimmung des Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A8","text":"Eine Bestimmung des Nichts ist eine reflektierte Verneinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","text":"Qualität als unterschiedene seyende Bestimmtheit heißt Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","text":"Qualität als mit Verneinung behaftete Bestimmtheit ist Negation und bestimmt sich weiter als Grenze, Schranke oder Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A11","text":"Realität und Negation sind beide Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A12","text":"Die Realität gilt unmittelbar als Positives, indem sie ihre enthaltene Negation ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX1","text":"Seyn wird nicht als vom Nichts getrennte Unmittelbarkeit zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX2","text":"Bestimmtheit wird nicht als bereits vom Seyn abgelöste Besonderheit zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX3","text":"Qualität wird nicht mit dem gesamten Umfang der Bestimmtheit gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX4","text":"Die Realität schließt, sofern sie bloß positiv gilt, Verneinung, Beschränktheit und Mangel aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX5","text":"Negation wird nicht auf reines Nichts reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX6","text":"Das unmittelbare Daseyn wird nicht als unterschiedslose Positivität festgehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX7","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts wird nicht als bereits gesetzte Unterscheidung beider Bestimmungen verstanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D1","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts macht das Daseyn zur Grundlage weiterer Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D2","text":"Die unmittelbare Einheit von Seyn und Bestimmtheit verhindert zunächst ihre begriffliche Unterscheidung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D3","text":"Die Isolierung der seyenden Bestimmtheit erzeugt Qualität als einfache, unmittelbare Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","CH_GB18_BQT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D4","text":"Die Allgemeinheit der Bestimmtheit ermöglicht ihre weitere Ausprägung als Qualität, Quantität oder weiter Bestimmtes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","CH_GB18_BQT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D5","text":"Weil jede seyende Bestimmtheit eine Bestimmung des Nichts enthält, ist Qualität nicht ausschließlich positive Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D6","text":"Die reflektierte Verneinung verwandelt die bloße seyende Qualität in eine unterschiedene Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D7","text":"Die unterschiedene seyende Qualität erscheint als Realität, während die mit Verneinung bestimmte Qualität als Negation erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D8","text":"Die Negation erhält als Qualität die Bestimmungen von Grenze, Schranke und Mangel.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D9","text":"Negation als bloßer Mangel wäre Nichts, bleibt aber als bestimmte Qualität ein Daseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","CH_GB18_BQT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD1","text":"Daseyn ist nicht die erste positive Gegebenheit, sondern eine durch die Einheit von Seyn und Nichts erzeugte Bestimmungsstruktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD2","text":"Jede Qualität ist doppelt codiert: als seyende Bestimmtheit und als in ihr enthaltene Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Realität und Negation ist keine Trennung zweier äußerer Bereiche, sondern eine interne Differenzierung des Daseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","CH_GB18_BQT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD4","text":"Die positive Bestimmtheit kann nur dadurch als Positives gelten, dass sie ihre eigene negative Struktur verdeckt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD5","text":"Grenze, Schranke und Mangel sind keine nachträglichen Zusätze zur Qualität, sondern Formen der in ihr wirksamen Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A8","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Bestimmung aus, die ohne Bezug auf Negation unmittelbar positiv bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Negation aus, die außerhalb des Daseyns als reines Nichts verbliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine äußerliche Gegenüberstellung von Realität und Negation aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Qualität bereits die vollständige Form der Bestimmtheit darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Unterscheidung aus, die Seyn und Nichts voneinander trennt, bevor ihre unmittelbare Einheit bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Daseyn, dessen Bestimmtheit nicht zugleich Negativität wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Positivität, die ihre eigene Begrenztheit als äußerlich oder zufällig behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Realität und Mangel ontologisch verschiedenen Grundtypen zuzuordnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein reines Nichts, das nicht als bestimmte Negation in einer Qualität gegenwärtig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS1","text":"Seyn + Nichts → unmittelbare Einheit → Daseyn als Grund weiterer Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS2","text":"Daseyn → unmittelbare seyende Bestimmtheit → isolierte Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS3","text":"Qualität → enthaltende Bestimmung des Nichts → reflektierte Verneinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS4","text":"Verneinung der Qualität → Unterscheidung von Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS5","text":"Negation als Qualität → Grenze → Schranke → Mangel; Negation als bloßer Mangel → drohende Reduktion auf Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS6","text":"Realität als bloß Positives → Ausschluss der sichtbaren Negativität → verdeckte Rückkehr der Bestimmtheit und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Einheit von Seyn und Nichts → Daseyn als Grund → seyende Bestimmtheit → Qualität → innere Bestimmung des Nichts → reflektierte Verneinung → Realität und Negation → Grenze, Schranke und Mangel → Aufhebung der bloßen Positivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME1","text":"Das Begriffsfeld verschiebt sich von einer Opposition zwischen Seyn und Nichts zu einer Einheit, aus der erst Unterscheidungen hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME2","text":"Qualität wird von einer bloß positiven Eigenschaft in eine intern negative Bestimmungsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME3","text":"Realität und Negation werden als gleichrangige Formen des Daseyns klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME4","text":"Grenze, Schranke und Mangel werden von äußerlichen Einschränkungen zu Erzeugnissen der bestimmten Negation umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME5","text":"Die scheinbare Alternative von Positivität und Nichts wird durch die Kategorie der bestimmten Negation reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Daseyn enthält Seyn und Nichts; Qualität ist seyende Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Bestimmtheit erzeugt durch ihre verborgene Negation die Differenz von Realität, Negation, Grenze, Schranke und Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse ersetzt die äußerliche Gegenüberstellung von Positivem und Negativem durch eine interne Ableitungsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Daseyn ist eine unmittelbare Einheit, in der die Unterscheidung von Seyn und Nichts noch nicht gesetzt, aber als Grund späterer Bestimmungen wirksam ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Einheit von Seyn und Nichts zur Qualität und weiter zur bestimmten Negation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT2","text":"Die Ableitung von Grenze, Schranke und Mangel bleibt an die Bestimmung der Negation als Qualität gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die angekündigten weiteren Bestimmungen über Qualität und Quantität hinaus systematisch entwickelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Negation weder als reines Nichts noch als äußerliche Gegeninstanz behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Rückführung der positiven Realität auf eine in ihr enthaltene Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der unmittelbaren Einheit von Seyn und Nichts und der späteren Unterscheidung von Realität und Negation bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht dadurch, dass Realität die Negation ausschließt, obwohl sie als Bestimmtheit notwendig von ihr durchdrungen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern Realität nicht als Endpunkt, sondern als verdeckte Negativität gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113624031749Z_cba39a3a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Quality.","source_sha256":"6964fe3597eb28557cea33f59c4409164c39d816a4e4057433b977bee9419c9c","sha256":"a3e1ff9433ab869de641b5d45fc9525b51071922dae9a63a6a8ce616a0607b46","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:36:24.032836+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS1","text":"Immediate determinate being posits Being and Nothing in an undivided unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS2","text":"Determinacy is initially neither detached from Being nor posited as an independent particularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS3","text":"Isolated being determinacy produces the concept of quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS4","text":"The negation concealed in quality makes its mere immediacy one-sided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS5","text":"The distinction between being and negated determinacy produces reality, negation, limit, limitation, and defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AS6","text":"Reality and negation both remain forms of determinate being, although reality conceals its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","text":"In immediate determinate being, Being and Nothing are one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","text":"Determinacy is initially immediately connected with Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","text":"Determinate being is the unity of Being and Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A4","text":"The unity of Being and Nothing forms the ground of all further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","text":"As isolated being determinacy, determinacy is quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A6","text":"Determinacy is a more universal concept than quality and can also be quantity or something further determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","text":"Every immediate being determinacy contains a determination of Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A8","text":"A determination of Nothing is a reflected negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","text":"Quality as distinguished being determinacy is called reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","text":"Quality as determinacy afflicted with negation is negation and determines itself further as limit, limitation, or defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A11","text":"Reality and negation are both determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:A12","text":"Reality immediately counts as the positive insofar as it excludes the negation contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX1","text":"Being is not admitted as immediacy separated from Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX2","text":"Determinacy is not admitted as a particularity already detached from Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX3","text":"Quality is not equated with the entire scope of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX4","text":"Reality, insofar as it counts as merely positive, excludes negation, limitation, and defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX5","text":"Negation is not reduced to pure Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX6","text":"Immediate determinate being is not maintained as undifferentiated positivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:NX7","text":"The unity of Being and Nothing is not understood as an already posited distinction between the two determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D1","text":"The unity of Being and Nothing makes determinate being the foundation of further determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D2","text":"The immediate unity of Being and determinacy initially prevents their conceptual distinction.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D3","text":"The isolation of being determinacy produces quality as a simple, immediate determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A2","CH_GB18_BQT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D4","text":"The universality of determinacy enables its further formation as quality, quantity, or something further determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","CH_GB18_BQT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D5","text":"Because every being determinacy contains a determination of Nothing, quality is not exclusively positive immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D6","text":"Reflected negation transforms mere being quality into a distinguished quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D7","text":"Distinguished being quality appears as reality, whereas quality determined with negation appears as negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D8","text":"As quality, negation receives the determinations of limit, limitation, and defect.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:D9","text":"Negation as mere defect would be Nothing, but as determinate quality it remains a determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","CH_GB18_BQT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD1","text":"Determinate being is not the first positive givenness, but a structure of determination produced through the unity of Being and Nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A1","CH_GB18_BQT0:A3","CH_GB18_BQT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD2","text":"Every quality is doubly coded: as being determinacy and as negation contained within it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A5","CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD3","text":"The distinction between reality and negation is not a separation of two external domains, but an internal differentiation of determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A9","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10","CH_GB18_BQT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD4","text":"Positive determinacy can count as positive only by concealing its own negative structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A7","CH_GB18_BQT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SD5","text":"Limit, limitation, and defect are not subsequent additions to quality, but forms of the negation effective within it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BQT0:A8","CH_GB18_BQT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a determination that could subsist immediately positively without relation to negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a negation that would remain outside determinate being as pure Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX3","text":"It excludes an external juxtaposition of reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX4","text":"It excludes quality already constituting the complete form of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:DNX5","text":"It excludes a distinction that separates Being and Nothing from one another before their immediate unity is determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a determinate being whose determinacy would not at the same time be negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a positivity that treats its own limitedness as external or accidental.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX3","text":"Barred is the possibility of assigning reality and defect to ontologically different basic types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a pure Nothing that would not be present as determinate negation in a quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS1","text":"Being + Nothing → immediate unity → determinate being as the ground of further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS2","text":"Determinate being → immediate being determinacy → isolated quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS3","text":"Quality → containing determination of Nothing → reflected negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS4","text":"Negation of quality → distinction between reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS5","text":"Negation as quality → limit → limitation → defect; negation as mere defect → impending reduction to Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:FGS6","text":"Reality as merely positive → exclusion of visible negativity → concealed return of determinacy and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:AF1","text":"Immediate unity of Being and Nothing → determinate being as ground → being determinacy → quality → internal determination of Nothing → reflected negation → reality and negation → limit, limitation, and defect → sublation of mere positivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME1","text":"The conceptual field shifts from an opposition between Being and Nothing to a unity from which distinctions first emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME2","text":"Quality is remapped from a merely positive property into an internally negative form of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME3","text":"Reality and negation are classified as coequal forms of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME4","text":"Limit, limitation, and defect are redefined from external restrictions into products of determinate negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ME5","text":"The apparent alternative of positivity and Nothing is reorganized through the category of determinate negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Determinate being contains Being and Nothing; quality is being determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Through its concealed negation, determinacy produces the difference of reality, negation, limit, limitation, and defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis replaces the external juxtaposition of the positive and the negative with an internal movement of derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinate being is an immediate unity in which the distinction of Being and Nothing is not yet posited, but is effective as the ground of later determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the unity of Being and Nothing to quality and further to determinate negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT2","text":"The derivation of limit, limitation, and defect remains bound to the determination of negation as quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the announced further determinations beyond quality and quantity are systematically developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where negation is treated neither as pure Nothing nor as an external counter-instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the reduction of positive reality to a negation contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the immediate unity of Being and Nothing and the later distinction of reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT7","text":"A further tension arises from reality excluding negation, although as determinacy it is necessarily permeated by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BQT0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as reality is read not as an endpoint, but as concealed negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BQT0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BQT0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BQT0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 20","title":"b. Quality.","context":"Chapter 20","original_title":"b. Qualität."},"original_title":"b. Qualität.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":21,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_2"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_2@R001","sha256":"685326f7d736139a9b76fd8c2c92393f891b63ab6d8cdadc280ebf9f8ef45ad5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS1","text":"Der mehrdeutige Gebrauch von Realität erzeugt die falsche Alternative zwischen äußerlichem Dasein als alleinigem Wahrheitsmaßstab und der gegen Dasein gleichgültigen Idee.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS2","text":"Der ontologische Begriff Gottes als Inbegriff aller Realitäten setzt Realität als widerspruchslose affirmative Vollkommenheit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS3","text":"Realität ist nur als bestimmte Qualität und Dasein Realität; Bestimmtheit enthält notwendig Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS4","text":"Die Ausdehnung der Realität über alle Bestimmtheit hinaus erzeugt entweder leeres Sein oder, als Totalität bestimmter Realitäten, die Totalität der Negationen und Widersprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS5","text":"Die Negativität der Bestimmtheit erzwingt den Übergang von statischer Substanz und isoliertem Individuum zu Relation, Bewegung und Selbsterhaltung im Widerstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A1","text":"Weder äußerliches Dasein noch abstrakte Idee besitzt isoliert das Recht, Wahrheit abschließend zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A2","text":"Realität ist Qualität und Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","text":"Qualität ist nur als Bestimmtheit, und Bestimmtheit enthält Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","text":"Die Abstraktion von aller Negation hebt zugleich alle bestimmte Realität auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","text":"Eine zur Bestimmungslosigkeit erweiterte Realität wird abstraktes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","text":"Abstraktes Sein und abstraktes Nichts sind dasselbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A7","text":"Die Totalität bestimmter Realitäten enthält zugleich die Totalität ihrer Negationen und damit Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","text":"Schranken begründen die Selbstbeziehung des Endlichen nur als Beziehung auf Anderes und verhindern sein selbständiges Sein in der Sphäre des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A9","text":"Negation ist als bloße Abstraktion ebenso wenig das Letzte wie Realität als bloße Affirmation das Wahre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","text":"Qualität wird als Eigenschaft wirksam, wenn sie sich in äußerer Beziehung als immanente Bestimmung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A11","text":"Qualität erhält sich in ihrer negativen Natur nur durch innere Unruhe, Gegenwirkung und Kampf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX1","text":"Realität ist nicht bloß empirisches Dasein und nicht bloß wertlose Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX2","text":"Idee ist nicht um so wahrer, je gleichgültiger sie gegen Realität und Dasein bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX3","text":"Realität ist nicht reine, negationsfreie Affirmation oder Vollkommenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX4","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht gegenseitiges Temperieren, Beschränken oder Vermischen bestimmter Prädikate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX5","text":"Gott ist nicht sinnvoll als Inbegriff aller Realitäten bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX6","text":"Die Einheit der Substanz ist nicht die substanzielle Eigenständigkeit ihrer Attribute, Modi oder endlichen Individuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX7","text":"Negation oder Nichts ist nicht der letzte Inhalt spekulativer Philosophie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX8","text":"Eigenschaft ist nicht bloß ruhende, vom Sein ablösbare Gestaltbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D1","text":"Der ontologische Gottesbegriff zerfällt in Bestimmungslosigkeit, wenn Realität ohne Negation gedacht wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A2","CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D2","text":"Der ontologische Gottesbegriff zerfällt in Widerspruch und schließlich in abstraktes Nichts, wenn Realität als Totalität bestimmter Qualitäten gedacht wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D3","text":"Die Einheit der spinozistischen Substanz folgt als Konsequenz daraus, daß bestimmte Realitäten nur als Negationen und nicht als selbständige Seiende gefaßt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D4","text":"Attribute und Modi verlieren innerhalb der abstrakten Substanzeinheit den Status eigenständiger Bestimmungen und erscheinen als äußerlich gesetzte Unterschiede.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D5","text":"Das endliche Individuum kann innerhalb der Metaphysik des Seins nicht als an-und-für-sich substantiell bestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D6","text":"Das Positive ist nicht einfache Affirmation, sondern die auf Negation reflektierte Realität.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D7","text":"Eigenschaft bezeichnet die aktive Behauptung immanenter Bestimmung gegen fremde Einwirkungen, nicht eine bloß ruhende Beschaffenheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD1","text":"Jede Metaphysik eines rein affirmativen Absoluten vernichtet entweder die Bestimmtheit ihrer Prädikate oder produziert die Widersprüche, die sie ausschließen wollte.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD2","text":"Totalisierung fungiert als Selbstaufhebung: Sie verwandelt bestimmte Inhalte entweder in leere Einheit oder in die Aufhebung aller endlichen Unterschiede.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD3","text":"Realität wird nur als negative Selbstbeziehung denkbar, weil ihre Bestimmtheit, ihre Beziehung auf Anderes und ihre Selbsterhaltung dieselbe Bewegungsstruktur bilden.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD4","text":"Die Kritik der Substanzmetaphysik erzwingt keine Rückkehr zum isolierten Individuum, sondern verlegt Individualität in eine Sphäre jenseits der bloßen Metaphysik des Seins.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","CH_GB18_AN_2:A9","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, ein bestimmter Inhalt könne bestehen, ohne durch Negation von anderem unterschieden zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, die Beseitigung aller Grenzen erhalte oder steigere den Gehalt des Bestimmten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, Nichtwiderspruch könne durch die bloße Akkumulation affirmativer Prädikate gesichert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, endliche Selbständigkeit sei innerhalb bloßer Seinskategorien begründbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX5","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, Negation sei entweder ein eliminierbarer Mangel oder ein abschließendes metaphysisches Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein positives Absolutes, das als Summe oder Steigerung bestimmter Realitäten unmittelbar dargestellt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Standpunkt, von dem Wahrheit vor aller Differenz, Negation und Vermittlung gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Vorstellung einer konfliktlosen Selbstidentität von Qualität, Macht, Weisheit, Güte oder Gerechtigkeit als bestimmten Prädikaten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine endliche Individualität, die zugleich schrankenlos, beziehungslos und an-und-für-sich sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS1","text":"Äußerlichkeit als Wahrheitsmaßstab und Innerlichkeit als realitätsfreie Wahrheit werden als symmetrische Einseitigkeiten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS2","text":"Realität wird als bestimmte Qualität rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS3","text":"Bestimmtheit wird als affirmative Negation gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS4","text":"Die Entfernung der Negation erzeugt Bestimmungslosigkeit und den Umschlag von abstraktem Sein in Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS5","text":"Die Beibehaltung aller Bestimmtheiten in einer Totalität erzeugt die Totalität der Negationen und Widersprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS6","text":"Substanz, Attribute und endliche Individuen werden unter diesem Resultat ihrer behaupteten selbständigen Seinsform entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS7","text":"Qualität wird als relationale Selbsterhaltung durch negative Bewegung und Kampf weiterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF1","text":"Mehrdeutigkeit der Realität → Ausschluß der einseitigen Vorrangstellung von Dasein oder Idee → Kritik des rein affirmativen Realitätsbegriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF2","text":"Realität als Qualität → Bestimmtheit als Negation → Unmöglichkeit einer negationsfreien Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF3","text":"Negationsfreie Totalität → leeres Sein → abstraktes Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF4","text":"Totalität bestimmter Realitäten → Totalität der Negationen → Widerspruch, Absorption und Aufhebung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF5","text":"Kritik der abstrakten Substanz → Entzug endlicher Selbständigkeit → Übergang zu reflektierter Realität, Eigenschaft und qualifizierender Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME1","text":"Realität wird von einer Skala des Mehr-oder-Weniger-Seins in eine Struktur bestimmter Negativität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen empirischer Realität und Idee verliert seine Form als exklusiver Wahrheitsgegensatz; beide Pole werden als isolierte Einseitigkeiten sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME3","text":"Der Gottesbegriff als Inbegriff aller Realitäten wird von einer höchsten Vollkommenheit in einen Mechanismus der Entleerung oder Selbstwidersprüchlichkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME4","text":"Spinozistische Einheit erscheint nicht als gelöste Einheit des Vielen, sondern als Abstraktion, in der Bestimmungen ihren eigenen Seinsstatus verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME5","text":"Individualität wird von atomarer Selbständigkeit zu begrenzter, auf Anderes bezogener Selbsterhaltung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME6","text":"Qualität wird von ruhender Beschaffenheit zu einer dynamischen Form des Sichbehauptens gegen äußere Einwirkung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text prüft die Bedeutungen von Realität, die Definition Gottes als Inbegriff aller Realitäten, die Einheit der spinozistischen Substanz und den Begriff der Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Bestimmtheit wird durch Negation erzeugt; jede Totalisierung bestimmter Realität produziert entweder Abstraktion oder Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument neutralisiert gegnerische Positionen nicht durch Wahl eines Pols, sondern durch den Nachweis, daß beide aus der Trennung von Affirmation und Negation hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein, Qualität und Individualität besitzen keine ruhende Selbstidentität, sondern bestehen nur als negative Relation, Bewegung und konflikthafte Selbsterhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Zusammenbruch des ontologischen Realitätsbegriffs in Bestimmungslosigkeit oder Widerspruch zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die zentrale Bewegung von der Kritik einseitiger Realität über bestimmte Negation zur Bewegungsform der Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der positive Begriff des wahren Unendlichen und der absoluten Einheit, weil er nur angekündigt und gegen falsches Temperieren abgegrenzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste interne Verbindung liegt in der Kette Qualität → Bestimmtheit → Negation → Kritik der affirmativen Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT5","text":"Die Differenz zwischen formlosem Nichts und affirmativ gesetzter Negation wird benötigt, aber innerhalb der Einheit nicht vollständig ausgearbeitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT6","text":"Die Ableitung von der Negativität der Bestimmtheit zur spinozistischen Substanzeinheit hängt von Voraussetzungen über Unendlichkeit und Attribute ab, die nur teilweise expliziert sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT7","text":"Die Endfigur der Qualirung erweitert die statische Logik zu Kampf und Selbsterhaltung, ohne deren Übergang aus der Kritik der Substanz vollständig zu vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111137003902Z_cd8dd708","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"685326f7d736139a9b76fd8c2c92393f891b63ab6d8cdadc280ebf9f8ef45ad5","sha256":"189ce51c29fd19300ad04d068c11465f50e83d4555661a5003332928e33bbccc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:11:37.006661+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS1","text":"The ambiguous use of reality produces the false alternative between external existence as the sole measure of truth and the idea indifferent to existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS2","text":"The ontological concept of God as the sum total of all realities presupposes reality as non-contradictory affirmative perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS3","text":"Reality is reality only as determinate quality and existence; determinacy necessarily contains negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS4","text":"The extension of reality beyond all determinacy produces either empty being or, as the totality of determinate realities, the totality of negations and contradictions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AS5","text":"The negativity of determinacy compels the transition from static substance and isolated individual to relation, movement, and self-preservation in resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A1","text":"Neither external existence nor abstract idea has, in isolation, the right conclusively to determine truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A2","text":"Reality is quality and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","text":"Quality is only as determinacy, and determinacy contains negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","text":"The abstraction from all negation simultaneously sublates all determinate reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","text":"Reality expanded into indeterminacy becomes abstract being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","text":"Abstract being and abstract nothing are the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A7","text":"The totality of determinate realities simultaneously contains the totality of their negations and thus contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","text":"Limits ground the self-relation of the finite only as relation to an other and prevent its independent being in the sphere of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A9","text":"Negation as mere abstraction is no more the ultimate than reality as mere affirmation is the true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","text":"Quality becomes effective as property when it maintains itself in external relation as immanent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:A11","text":"Quality maintains itself in its negative nature only through inner unrest, counteraction, and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX1","text":"Reality is not merely empirical existence and not merely valueless externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX2","text":"The idea is not truer the more indifferent it remains toward reality and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX3","text":"Reality is not pure affirmation or perfection free of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX4","text":"The infinite is not the mutual tempering, limiting, or mixing of determinate predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX5","text":"God cannot meaningfully be determined as the sum total of all realities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX6","text":"The unity of substance is not the substantial independence of its attributes, modes, or finite individuals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX7","text":"Negation or nothing is not the final content of speculative philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:NX8","text":"Property is not merely a static determination of form detachable from being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D1","text":"The ontological concept of God collapses into indeterminacy when reality is thought without negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A2","CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D2","text":"The ontological concept of God collapses into contradiction and finally into abstract nothing when reality is thought as the totality of determinate qualities.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D3","text":"The unity of Spinozistic substance follows as a consequence from the fact that determinate realities are conceived only as negations and not as independently existing beings.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D4","text":"Within the abstract unity of substance, attributes and modes lose the status of independent determinations and appear as externally posited differences.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D5","text":"Within the metaphysics of being, the finite individual cannot subsist as substantial in-and-for-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D6","text":"The positive is not simple affirmation, but reality reflected upon negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:D7","text":"Property denotes the active assertion of immanent determination against external influences, not a merely static constitution.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD1","text":"Every metaphysics of a purely affirmative absolute either annihilates the determinacy of its predicates or produces the contradictions it sought to exclude.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A6","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD2","text":"Totalization functions as self-sublation: it transforms determinate contents either into empty unity or into the sublation of all finite differences.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A4","CH_GB18_AN_2:A5","CH_GB18_AN_2:A7","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD3","text":"Reality becomes thinkable only as negative self-relation, because its determinacy, its relation to an other, and its self-preservation form the same structure of movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A3","CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","CH_GB18_AN_2:A10","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SD4","text":"The critique of substance metaphysics does not compel a return to the isolated individual, but relocates individuality into a sphere beyond the mere metaphysics of being.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_2:A8","CH_GB18_AN_2:A9","CH_GB18_AN_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX1","text":"The assumption must be false that a determinate content can subsist without being distinguished through negation from another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX2","text":"The assumption must be false that the removal of all limits preserves or increases the content of the determinate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX3","text":"The assumption must be false that non-contradiction can be secured through the mere accumulation of affirmative predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX4","text":"The assumption must be false that finite independence can be grounded within mere categories of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:DNX5","text":"The assumption must be false that negation is either a removable deficiency or a conclusive metaphysical result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a positive absolute that could be immediately represented as the sum or intensification of determinate realities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a standpoint from which truth would be given prior to all difference, negation, and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the notion of a conflict-free self-identity of quality, power, wisdom, goodness, or justice as determinate predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a finite individuality that would at once be without limits, without relation, and in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS1","text":"Externality as the measure of truth and inwardness as truth free of reality are determined as symmetrical one-sidednesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS2","text":"Reality is reconstructed as determinate quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS3","text":"Determinacy is posited as affirmative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS4","text":"The removal of negation produces indeterminacy and the transition of abstract being into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS5","text":"The retention of all determinacies in a totality produces the totality of negations and contradictions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS6","text":"Substance, attributes, and finite individuals are deprived, under this result, of their asserted independent form of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:FGS7","text":"Quality is further determined as relational self-preservation through negative movement and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF1","text":"Ambiguity of reality → exclusion of the one-sided priority of existence or idea → critique of the purely affirmative concept of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF2","text":"Reality as quality → determinacy as negation → impossibility of a reality free of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF3","text":"Totality free of negation → empty being → abstract nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF4","text":"Totality of determinate realities → totality of negations → contradiction, absorption, and sublation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:AF5","text":"Critique of abstract substance → deprivation of finite independence → transition to reflected reality, property, and qualifying movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME1","text":"Reality is transferred from a scale of more-or-less being into a structure of determinate negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME2","text":"The opposition between empirical reality and idea loses its form as an exclusive opposition of truth; both poles become visible as isolated one-sidednesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME3","text":"The concept of God as the sum total of all realities is reclassified from a highest perfection into a mechanism of emptying or self-contradictoriness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME4","text":"Spinozistic unity appears not as a resolved unity of the many, but as an abstraction in which determinations lose their own ontological status.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME5","text":"Individuality is shifted from atomic independence to limited self-preservation related to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ME6","text":"Quality is shifted from static constitution to a dynamic form of self-assertion against external influence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines the meanings of reality, the definition of God as the sum total of all realities, the unity of Spinozistic substance, and the concept of quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Determinacy is generated through negation; every totalization of determinate reality produces either abstraction or contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument neutralizes opposing positions not by choosing one pole, but by demonstrating that both arise from the separation of affirmation and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being, quality, and individuality possess no static self-identity, but subsist only as negative relation, movement, and conflictual self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the collapse of the ontological concept of reality into indeterminacy or contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central movement from the critique of one-sided reality through determinate negation to the form of movement of quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT3","text":"The positive concept of the true infinite and absolute unity remains underdetermined because it is only announced and demarcated against false tempering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest internal connection lies in the chain quality → determinacy → negation → critique of affirmative totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT5","text":"The difference between formless nothing and affirmatively posited negation is required, but not fully elaborated within the unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT6","text":"The derivation from the negativity of determinacy to Spinozistic substantial unity depends on presuppositions concerning infinity and attributes that are only partially explicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_2:MRT7","text":"The final figure of Qualirung (Qualirung) extends static logic into struggle and self-preservation without fully mediating its transition from the critique of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 21","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 21","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW","layer":"CH","title":"c. Something.","order":22,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CETW"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CETW@R001","sha256":"ca58b7df0b6ee413888b923b7835e4f5796515438a4402c260bb443410ea8a5f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS1","text":"Das Daseyn ist als qualitative Bestimmtheit bestimmt und enthält darin die Unterscheidung von Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS2","text":"Realität und Negation sind im Daseyn zugleich vorhanden und aufgehoben, ohne auf abstraktes Seyn oder abstraktes Nichts zurückzufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS3","text":"Die Aufhebung tilgt den Unterschied nicht, sondern vermittelt durch ihn die Rückkehr des Daseyns zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS4","text":"Diese vermittelte Einfachheit bestimmt das Daseyn als Insichseyn und als Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS5","text":"Etwas ist die erste Negation der Negation und damit der noch unbestimmte Anfang des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS6","text":"Die Negation der Negation enthält zugleich Selbstbeziehung und Vermittlung mit sich selbst, wodurch die bloße Unmittelbarkeit ausgeschlossen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS7","text":"Im Werden bestimmt sich Etwas durch Daseyendes und Anderes zu Veränderung, bleibt aber zunächst nur begrifflich vermittelt und noch nicht als konkrete Vermittlung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A1","text":"Daseyn ist bestimmtes, qualitatives Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A2","text":"Die Qualität des Daseyns unterscheidet Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A3","text":"Die Realität enthält die Negation, und die Negation ist selbst ein dem Daseyn angehöriges Daseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A4","text":"Der Unterschied von Realität und Negation ist im Daseyn zugleich vorhanden und aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A5","text":"Die Aufhebung des Unterschieds ist weder bloße Weglassung noch Rückkehr zu einem unterschiedslosen Anfang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A6","text":"Der Unterschied kann nicht entfernt werden, weil er ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A7","text":"Das Daseyn wird durch die Aufhebung des Unterschieds wieder sich selbst gleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A8","text":"Die vermittelte Einfachheit des Daseyns ist seine eigene Bestimmtheit als Insichseyn und Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A9","text":"Etwas ist als Negation der Negation eine einfache seyende Beziehung auf sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A10","text":"Allgemeine Bestimmungen wie Daseyn, Leben und Denken müssen sich zu Daseyendem, Lebendigem und Denkendem bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A11","text":"Etwas ist als erste Subjektbestimmung noch unbestimmt und oberflächlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A12","text":"Der negativen Einheit mit sich liegen die weiteren Bestimmungen vom Fürsichseyn bis zum Begriff zugrunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A13","text":"Die erste Negation ist abstrakte Negativität, die Negation der Negation konkrete und absolute Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A14","text":"Die Negation der Negation stellt die einfache Beziehung auf sich wieder her und vermittelt Etwas mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A15","text":"Vermittlung mit sich ist in jedem Begriff enthalten und daher nicht auf eine einzelne begriffliche Stufe beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A16","text":"Das Werden des Etwas hat Daseyendes und Anderes als seine selbst daseyenden Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A17","text":"Dieses Werden ist Veränderung, bleibt zunächst jedoch nur im Begriff des Etwas gesetzt und noch nicht als gesetzte Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX1","text":"Realität ist nicht von der Negation getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX2","text":"Negation ist nicht das abstrakte Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX3","text":"Daseyn ist nicht unbestimmtes, abstraktes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX4","text":"Aufhebung ist nicht äußeres Zurücknehmen oder bloßes Weglassen des Unterschieds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX5","text":"Aufhebung ist nicht die einfache Rückkehr zum unterschiedslosen Anfang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX6","text":"Etwas ist nicht bereits die konkrete Intensität des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX7","text":"Die erste Negation ist nicht mit der Negation der Negation identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX8","text":"Philosophische Bestimmung darf nicht bei abstrakten Allgemeinheiten wie Daseyn, Leben, Denken oder Gottheit stehenbleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX9","text":"Erkenntnis beruht nicht auf einer bloßen Unmittelbarkeit, aus der jede Vermittlung ausgeschlossen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX10","text":"Das Werden des Etwas ist nicht mehr bloß ein Verhältnis von Seyn und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX11","text":"Die Veränderung des Etwas ist zunächst noch keine vollständig gesetzte Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D1","text":"Realität und Negation bilden keine äußerlich getrennten Bestimmungen, sondern Momente desselben qualitativen Daseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A1","CH_GB18_CETW:A2","CH_GB18_CETW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D2","text":"Die Identität des Daseyns mit sich selbst entsteht erst durch die Aufhebung seines Unterschieds.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A5","CH_GB18_CETW:A6","CH_GB18_CETW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D3","text":"Das Daseyn wird als Etwas bestimmt, weil seine vermittelte Einfachheit ein Insichseyn erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A7","CH_GB18_CETW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D4","text":"Etwas ist zugleich seyend und als Negation der Negation bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D5","text":"Die Bestimmung des Etwas eröffnet die Subjektentwicklung, ohne deren konkrete Gestalten bereits zu enthalten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A11","CH_GB18_CETW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D6","text":"Die Negation der Negation ist nicht nur Wiederherstellung, sondern Selbstvermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A13","CH_GB18_CETW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D7","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer reinen Unmittelbarkeit wird durch die immanente Vermittlung jedes Begriffs aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D8","text":"Das Werden des Etwas wird zu Veränderung, weil seine Momente selbst als Etwas und Anderes bestimmt sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D9","text":"Die Veränderung bleibt zunächst eine begriffliche Selbstveränderung, weil die Vermittlung noch nicht vollständig gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD1","text":"Bestimmtes Seyn ist keine statische Unmittelbarkeit, sondern eine durch aufgehobenen Unterschied erzeugte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A1","CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A7","CH_GB18_CETW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD2","text":"Subjektivität entsteht als gestufte Entwicklung negativer Selbstbeziehung und ist nicht als ursprüngliche konkrete Einheit vorausgesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A11","CH_GB18_CETW:A12","CH_GB18_CETW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD3","text":"Die Kritik der Unmittelbarkeit ist ontologisch begründet, weil Vermittlung nicht nachträglich hinzukommt, sondern jeden Begriff konstituiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD4","text":"Der Unterschied wird vom äußeren Gegensatz zum immanenten Bewegungsmoment des Daseyns und seiner Veränderung umgebildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A2","CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD5","text":"Das System muss Vermittlung als konstitutiv behaupten und sie zugleich auf einer frühen Stufe noch ohne konkrete Seiten bestimmen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keine selbständige Realität außerhalb der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX2","text":"Es gibt keinen voraussetzungslosen Anfang, dessen Einfachheit ohne vermittelte Differenz bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX3","text":"Es gibt kein Subjekt vor der negativen Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX4","text":"Es gibt keine begrifflich hinreichende Allgemeinheit ohne Bestimmung zum Daseyenden, Lebendigen oder Denkenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX5","text":"Vermittlung ist keine nachträgliche Beziehung zwischen unabhängig gegebenen Termen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX6","text":"Veränderung ist nicht auf die bloße Abfolge von Seyn und Nichts reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX7","text":"Die einfache Einheit des Etwas ist keine bereits konkrete Subjektivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine absolute Trennung von Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Identität, die durch Entfernung des Unterschieds und nicht durch dessen Aufhebung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Ontologie reiner, unvermittelter Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Subjektbegriff, der seine eigene negative Hervorbringung überspringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist eine Bestimmung des Werdens, in der die Momente nicht selbst als bestimmte Etwas auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX6","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer vollständig konkreten Vermittlung ist auf der Stufe des Etwas noch nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS1","text":"Qualitatives Daseyn → Unterscheidung von Realität und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS2","text":"Vorhandener Unterschied + immanente Nichtigkeit → Aufhebung ohne Tilgung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS3","text":"Aufgehobener Unterschied → vermittelte Einfachheit → Insichseyn → Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS4","text":"Etwas → Negation der Negation → einfache Selbstbeziehung und Anfang des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS5","text":"Selbstbeziehung → Vermittlung mit sich selbst → Immanenz der Vermittlung in jedem Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS6","text":"Etwas als Werden → Daseyendes + Anderes → Übergang zwischen bestimmten Seienden → Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS7","text":"Noch nicht gesetzte konkrete Vermittlung → begriffliche Selbstveränderung ohne voll entwickelte Subjektivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AF1","text":"Qualitatives Daseyn → Realität/Negation → aufgehobener Unterschied → vermittelte Einfachheit → Insichseyn/Etwas → Negation der Negation → Selbstvermittlung → Werden mit Daseyendem und Anderem → Veränderung → noch nicht gesetzte konkrete Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME1","text":"Realität und Negation werden von getrennten Gegensätzen zu immanenten Momenten des Daseyns umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME2","text":"Einfachheit wird nicht mehr als Abwesenheit von Unterschied, sondern als durch Aufhebung erzeugte Identität sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME3","text":"Etwas wird als Übergangsstufe zum Subjekt klassifiziert, nicht als bereits voll bestimmte Subjektivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME4","text":"Vermittlung wird von einer besonderen Operation zu einer allgemeinen Struktur jedes Begriffs erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME5","text":"Werden wird von der abstrakten Opposition Seyn/Nichts auf die Veränderung bestimmter Seiender und ihres Anderen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME6","text":"Der Gegensatz von Unmittelbarkeit und Vermittlung verliert seine äußere Form und wird als innere Bewegung des Begriffs reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Daseyn, Realität, Negation, Etwas, Werden und Veränderung werden als aufeinanderfolgende Bestimmungen entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Aufhebung des Unterschieds erzeugt Insichseyn; die Negation der Negation erzeugt Selbstvermittlung; Daseyendes und Anderes bilden die Momente der Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die begriffliche Analyse wird von abstrakten Allgemeinheiten und unmittelbarem Wissen auf konkrete Bestimmung und immanente Vermittlung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Seyn erscheint als negative, sich vermittelnde Bewegung, in der das Etwas aus aufgehobenem Unterschied hervorgeht und sich zur Veränderung fortbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom qualitativen Daseyn über Insichseyn und Etwas bis zur Veränderung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete Ausgestaltung des Übergangs vom Etwas zum Fürsichseyn und weiter zum Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aufhebung zugleich Erhaltung und Negation des Unterschieds bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Erzeugung der Identität aus vermittelter Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT5","text":"Die Argumentation hängt von den komprimierten Setzungen ab, dass Negation dem Daseyn immanent und Vermittlung in jedem Begriff enthalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass Etwas bereits Vermittlung mit sich selbst ist, diese Vermittlung aber noch ohne konkrete Seiten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT7","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass Veränderung als konkret gewordenes Werden gilt, zugleich aber nur als begrifflich gesetzte und noch nicht vollständig vermittelte Bestimmung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, erreicht jedoch nicht die später angekündigte konkrete Bestimmung des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114541795078Z_443ac4b8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Something.","source_sha256":"ca58b7df0b6ee413888b923b7835e4f5796515438a4402c260bb443410ea8a5f","sha256":"6b5c62fd01ca0563ae8ff852c47a5e338085d35811b5e8f5cd4a9c577cbd619a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:45:41.796585+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS1","text":"Determinate being is determined as qualitative determinacy and therein contains the distinction between reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS2","text":"Reality and negation are at once present and sublated in determinate being, without relapsing into abstract being or abstract nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS3","text":"Sublation does not efface the distinction, but mediates through it determinate being's return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS4","text":"This mediated simplicity determines determinate being as being-in-itself and as something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS5","text":"Something is the first negation of negation and thus the still indeterminate beginning of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS6","text":"The negation of negation contains at once self-relation and mediation with itself, whereby mere immediacy is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AS7","text":"In becoming, something determines itself through determinate being and other as alteration, but initially remains only conceptually mediated and not yet posited as concrete mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A1","text":"Determinate being is determinate, qualitative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A2","text":"The quality of determinate being distinguishes reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A3","text":"Reality contains negation, and negation is itself a determinate being belonging to determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A4","text":"The distinction between reality and negation is at once present and sublated in determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A5","text":"The sublation of the distinction is neither mere omission nor a return to an undifferentiated beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A6","text":"The distinction cannot be removed, because it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A7","text":"Through the sublation of the distinction, determinate being again becomes equal to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A8","text":"The mediated simplicity of determinate being is its own determinacy as being-in-itself and something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A9","text":"As negation of negation, something is a simple existent relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A10","text":"Universal determinations such as determinate being, life, and thought must determine themselves into determinate being, the living, and the thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A11","text":"As the first determination of the subject, something is still indeterminate and superficial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A12","text":"The further determinations from being-for-itself up to the concept are grounded in negative unity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A13","text":"The first negation is abstract negativity; the negation of negation is concrete and absolute negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A14","text":"The negation of negation restores the simple relation to itself and mediates something with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A15","text":"Mediation with itself is contained in every concept and is therefore not restricted to a single conceptual stage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A16","text":"The becoming of something has determinate being and other as its self-existent moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:A17","text":"This becoming is alteration, but initially remains posited only in the concept of something and not yet as posited mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX1","text":"Reality is not separated from negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX2","text":"Negation is not abstract nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX3","text":"Determinate being is not indeterminate, abstract being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX4","text":"Sublation is not an external withdrawal or mere omission of the distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX5","text":"Sublation is not the simple return to the undifferentiated beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX6","text":"Something is not yet the concrete intensity of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX7","text":"The first negation is not identical with the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX8","text":"Philosophical determination must not remain at abstract universalities such as determinate being, life, thought, or divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX9","text":"Cognition does not rest on a mere immediacy from which every mediation would be excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX10","text":"The becoming of something is no longer merely a relation of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:NX11","text":"The alteration of something is initially not yet fully posited mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D1","text":"Reality and negation do not constitute externally separated determinations, but moments of the same qualitative determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A1","CH_GB18_CETW:A2","CH_GB18_CETW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D2","text":"The identity of determinate being with itself arises only through the sublation of its distinction.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A5","CH_GB18_CETW:A6","CH_GB18_CETW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D3","text":"Determinate being is determined as something because its mediated simplicity produces a being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A7","CH_GB18_CETW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D4","text":"Something is at once existent and determined as negation of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D5","text":"The determination of something opens the development of the subject without already containing its concrete shapes.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A11","CH_GB18_CETW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D6","text":"The negation of negation is not only restoration, but self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A13","CH_GB18_CETW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D7","text":"The possibility of a pure immediacy is sublated by the immanent mediation of every concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D8","text":"The becoming of something becomes alteration because its moments are themselves determined as something and other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:D9","text":"Initially, alteration remains a conceptual self-alteration because mediation has not yet been fully posited.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD1","text":"Determinate being is not a static immediacy, but a self-relation produced through sublated distinction.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A1","CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A7","CH_GB18_CETW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD2","text":"Subjectivity arises as a graduated development of negative self-relation and is not presupposed as an original concrete unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A11","CH_GB18_CETW:A12","CH_GB18_CETW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD3","text":"The critique of immediacy is ontologically grounded, because mediation is not subsequently added but constitutes every concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD4","text":"The distinction is transformed from external opposition into the immanent moment of movement of determinate being and its alteration.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A2","CH_GB18_CETW:A4","CH_GB18_CETW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SD5","text":"The system must assert mediation as constitutive and at the same time determine it at an early stage still without concrete sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_CETW:A9","CH_GB18_CETW:A14","CH_GB18_CETW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX1","text":"There is no independent reality outside negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX2","text":"There is no presuppositionless beginning whose simplicity could subsist without mediated difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX3","text":"There is no subject prior to negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX4","text":"There is no conceptually sufficient universality without determination into determinate being, the living, or the thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX5","text":"Mediation is not a subsequently added relation between independently given terms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX6","text":"Alteration cannot be reduced to the mere succession of being and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:DNX7","text":"The simple unity of something is not already concrete subjectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX1","text":"An absolute separation of reality and negation is impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an identity that arises through the removal of distinction rather than through its sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX3","text":"An ontology of pure, unmediated immediacy is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX4","text":"A concept of the subject that skips over its own negative production is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX5","text":"Barred is a determination of becoming in which the moments do not themselves appear as determinate somethings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:SNX6","text":"The possibility of fully concrete mediation is not yet available at the stage of something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS1","text":"Qualitative determinate being → distinction between reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS2","text":"Present distinction + immanent nullity → sublation without effacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS3","text":"Sublated distinction → mediated simplicity → being-in-itself → something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS4","text":"Something → negation of negation → simple self-relation and beginning of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS5","text":"Self-relation → mediation with itself → immanence of mediation in every concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS6","text":"Something as becoming → determinate being + other → transition between determinate beings → alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:FGS7","text":"Concrete mediation not yet posited → conceptual self-alteration without fully developed subjectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:AF1","text":"Qualitative determinate being → reality/negation → sublated distinction → mediated simplicity → being-in-itself/something → negation of negation → self-mediation → becoming with determinate being and other → alteration → concrete mediation not yet posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME1","text":"Reality and negation are remapped from separate opposites into immanent moments of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME2","text":"Simplicity is no longer visible as the absence of distinction, but as identity produced through sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME3","text":"Something is classified as a transitional stage toward the subject, not as already fully determined subjectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME4","text":"Mediation is extended from a special operation into a universal structure of every concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME5","text":"Becoming is shifted from the abstract opposition of being/nothing to the alteration of determinate beings and their other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ME6","text":"The opposition between immediacy and mediation loses its external form and is reorganized as the inner movement of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT1","text":"Surface — determinate being, reality, negation, something, becoming, and alteration are developed as successive determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT2","text":"Structural — The sublation of distinction produces being-in-itself; the negation of negation produces self-mediation; determinate being and other constitute the moments of alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Conceptual analysis is shifted from abstract universalities and immediate knowledge to concrete determination and immanent mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as a negative, self-mediating movement in which something proceeds from sublated distinction and further determines itself into alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from qualitative determinate being through being-in-itself and something to alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT2","text":"The concrete elaboration of the transition from something to being-for-itself and further to the concept remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sublation signifies at once preservation and negation of distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the production of identity from mediated difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT5","text":"The argument depends on the compressed positings that negation is immanent to determinate being and mediation is contained in every concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that something is already mediation with itself, while this mediation still remains without concrete sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT7","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that alteration counts as becoming made concrete, yet at the same time appears only as a conceptually posited and not yet fully mediated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CETW:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text, but does not attain the later-announced concrete determination of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CETW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CETW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 22","title":"c. Something.","context":"Chapter 22","original_title":"c. Etwas."},"original_title":"c. Etwas.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0","layer":"CH","title":"B. Finitude.","order":23,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDE0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDE0@R001","sha256":"e35f7bbdd0b3fa0e1c6e51244cfbd86dca513254ee61527a5b2753c26f3741b4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Etwas und Anderem wird zunächst als äußerliche Gleichgültigkeit mit außerhalb beider liegender Negation bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS2","text":"Das Andere wird als selbst unmittelbar Daseyendes und damit ebenfalls als Etwas bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS3","text":"Die zunächst äußerliche Negation wird in die Bestimmtheit des Etwas zurückgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Etwas geht als Beschaffenheit in eine Grenze über, die zugleich immanentes und negiertes Seyn-für-Anderes ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS5","text":"Weil die Grenze immanente Bestimmung des Etwas ist, wird das Etwas als das Endliche bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS6","text":"Die Entwicklung bewegt sich von affirmativer Bestimmung über erste Negation zur Negation der Negation im In-sichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A1","text":"Etwas und Anderes sind zunächst gleichgültig gegeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A2","text":"Das Andere ist selbst ein unmittelbar Daseyendes und damit ein Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A3","text":"Die anfängliche Negation fällt außerhalb von Etwas und Anderem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A4","text":"Das Etwas steht seinem Seyn-für-Anderes als Ansichseyn gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A5","text":"Die Bestimmtheit gehört dem Ansichseyn des Etwas an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A6","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Etwas geht in Beschaffenheit über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A7","text":"Die Beschaffenheit ist mit dem immanenten und zugleich negierten Seyn-für-Anderes identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A8","text":"Das immanente und negierte Seyn-für-Anderes bildet die Grenze des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A9","text":"Die Grenze ist immanente Bestimmung des Etwas selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A10","text":"Das durch seine immanente Grenze bestimmte Etwas ist das Endliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A11","text":"In der vorausgehenden Bestimmung des Daseyns waren Qualität und Etwas affirmative Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A12","text":"Die negative Bestimmung des Daseyns entwickelt sich von der ersten Negation zur Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A13","text":"Die Negation der Negation bestimmt das In-sichseyn des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX1","text":"Etwas und Anderes werden nicht durch eine anfängliche innere Differenz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX2","text":"Die Negation ist zunächst keine immanente Bestimmung des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX3","text":"Das Andere ist nicht ein dem Etwas äußerlich gegenüberstehendes Nicht-Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX4","text":"Die Grenze ist keine bloß äußerlich gesetzte Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX5","text":"Die Endlichkeit ist nicht lediglich affirmative Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX6","text":"Die negative Bestimmung bleibt nicht bei der bloßen ersten Negation stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D1","text":"Das Andere verdoppelt die Form des Etwas, weil es selbst als unmittelbar Daseyendes erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A1","CH_GB18_BDE0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D2","text":"Die anfänglich äußerliche Negation wird zur Bestimmung des Etwas, sobald dessen Bestimmtheit dem Ansichseyn angehört.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A3","CH_GB18_BDE0:A4","CH_GB18_BDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D3","text":"Die Beschaffenheit bezeichnet die Einheit von Ansichseyn und Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A5","CH_GB18_BDE0:A6","CH_GB18_BDE0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D4","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht nur Trennung, sondern die im Etwas wirksame Form seines negierten Bezogenseins auf Anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A7","CH_GB18_BDE0:A8","CH_GB18_BDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D5","text":"Das Etwas ist endlich, weil seine eigene Bestimmtheit als Grenze in ihm enthalten ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A9","CH_GB18_BDE0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D6","text":"Die Entwicklung des Daseyns verschiebt sich von unmittelbarer Positivität zu einer in sich zurückgenommenen Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A11","CH_GB18_BDE0:A12","CH_GB18_BDE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD1","text":"Endlichkeit entsteht als Selbstbeziehung der Negation und nicht als äußerliche Begrenzung eines zunächst unbegrenzten Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD2","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Etwas und Anderem wird in eine immanente Struktur des Etwas umgebildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD3","text":"Das Ansichseyn des Etwas ist nicht negationsfrei, sondern enthält die Bestimmung seines Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD4","text":"Die Bewegung vom Daseyn zur Endlichkeit ist eine Umkehrung der Negation: Aus äußerer Negation wird immanente Grenze und daraus bestimmtes In-sichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD5","text":"Affirmative Bestimmung und negative Bestimmung bilden keine getrennten Schichten, sondern zwei Entwicklungsstufen desselben Daseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Ansichseyn aus, das vollständig unabhängig von jeder Beziehung auf Anderes wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Bestimmtheit aus, die bloß äußerlich hinzugefügt oder ablösbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Grenze aus, die nur zwischen bereits fertigen, voneinander unabhängigen Entitäten läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Negation aus, die auf der Ebene bloßer äußerer Verneinung stehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine affirmative Qualität aus, die nicht zugleich negative Beziehung und Begrenzung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird ein völlig unbestimmtes Daseyn, dessen Bestimmung nicht aus einer immanenten Negation hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird ein absolut äußerliches Anderes, das nicht selbst unter die Bestimmung des Etwas fällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX3","text":"Versperrt wird die Möglichkeit, Endlichkeit als zufällige Einschränkung eines an sich unendlichen Etwas zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit einer außerhalb des Etwas verbleibenden Negation strukturiert die gesamte Hervorbringung der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Daseyn → affirmative Bestimmung von Qualität und Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS2","text":"Etwas / Anderes → anfängliche Gleichgültigkeit und äußerliche Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS3","text":"Anderes als Etwas → Aufhebung der absoluten Äußerlichkeit des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS4","text":"Ansichseyn + Bestimmtheit → Beschaffenheit als bestimmtes Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS5","text":"Immanentes und negiertes Seyn-für-Anderes → Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS6","text":"Immanente Grenze → Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS7","text":"Erste Negation → In-sichseyn → Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF1","text":"Gleichgültigkeit von Etwas und Anderem → äußerliche Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF2","text":"Äußerliche Negation → Einbeziehung des Anderen in die Form des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF3","text":"Ansichseyn mit Bestimmtheit → Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF4","text":"Beschaffenheit als negiertes Seyn-für-Anderes → immanente Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF5","text":"Immanente Grenze → Endlichkeit des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF6","text":"Endlichkeit → Übergang von erster Negation zu Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME1","text":"Das Andere wird von einer äußerlichen Gegenposition zu einer Wiederholung der Bestimmungsform des Etwas umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME2","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer äußeren Trennlinie zu einer immanenten Struktur des Begrenzten umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME3","text":"Endlichkeit wird von einem bloßen Mangel an Unbegrenztheit zu einer positiven Bestimmung durch Negation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME4","text":"Das Ansichseyn wird als relationale, nicht als beziehungslose Kategorie sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von affirmativer Qualität und negativer Bestimmung wird als Entwicklungszusammenhang reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Etwas, Anderes, Bestimmtheit, Beschaffenheit und Grenze werden als Bestimmungen des Daseyns entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Beziehung auf Anderes wird in die innere Bestimmung des Etwas integriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die Argumentation ersetzt die äußere Gegenüberstellung durch eine Bewegung der immanenten Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Realität wird als Entwicklung von unmittelbarer Positivität über Negation zur Negation der Negation bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von Etwas und Anderem zur immanenten Grenze zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT2","text":"Die Bestimmung der Endlichkeit bleibt von der expliziten Gleichsetzung von Grenze und immanenter Bestimmung abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT3","text":"Die interne Struktur ist kohärent, sofern die anfängliche äußerliche Negation als aufhebbare Ausgangsbestimmung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Endlichkeit aus der eigenen Bestimmtheit des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der anfänglichen Gleichgültigkeit von Etwas und Anderem und ihrer späteren immanenten Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von affirmativer Bestimmung über erste Negation zur Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112831016362Z_7fafcbcc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Finitude.","source_sha256":"e35f7bbdd0b3fa0e1c6e51244cfbd86dca513254ee61527a5b2753c26f3741b4","sha256":"5d74f65023b31b730eab4100308f797c889fc96a845273aa9ee1dd6d5f5d5d34","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:28:31.017813+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS1","text":"The relation of Something and Other is initially determined as external indifference, with negation lying outside both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS2","text":"The Other is determined as itself an immediately existing determinate being and thus likewise as a Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS3","text":"The initially external negation is taken back into the determinacy of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS4","text":"The determinacy of Something passes, as constitution, into a limit that is at once immanent and negated being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS5","text":"Because the limit is an immanent determination of Something, Something is determined as the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AS6","text":"The development moves from affirmative determination through first negation to the negation of negation in being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A1","text":"Something and Other are initially indifferent to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A2","text":"The Other is itself an immediately existing determinate being and thus a Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A3","text":"The initial negation falls outside Something and Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A4","text":"Something stands opposed to its being-for-other as being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A5","text":"The determinacy belongs to the being-in-itself of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A6","text":"The determinacy of Something passes over into constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A7","text":"Constitution is identical with immanent and at the same time negated being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A8","text":"Immanent and negated being-for-other constitutes the limit of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A9","text":"The limit is the immanent determination of Something itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A10","text":"Something determined through its immanent limit is the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A11","text":"In the preceding determination of determinate being, quality and Something were affirmative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A12","text":"The negative determination of determinate being develops from the first negation to the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:A13","text":"The negation of negation determines the being-in-itself of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX1","text":"Something and Other are not determined through an initial inner difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX2","text":"Negation is initially not an immanent determination of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX3","text":"The Other is not a non-Something externally opposed to Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX4","text":"The limit is not a merely externally posited barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX5","text":"Finitude is not merely affirmative quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:NX6","text":"Negative determination does not remain at mere first negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D1","text":"The Other duplicates the form of Something because it itself appears as an immediately existing determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A1","CH_GB18_BDE0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D2","text":"The initially external negation becomes the determination of Something as soon as its determinacy belongs to being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A3","CH_GB18_BDE0:A4","CH_GB18_BDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D3","text":"Constitution denotes the unity of being-in-itself and being-for-other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A5","CH_GB18_BDE0:A6","CH_GB18_BDE0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D4","text":"The limit is not merely separation, but the form of its negated relation to Other operative in Something.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A7","CH_GB18_BDE0:A8","CH_GB18_BDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D5","text":"Something is finite because its own determinacy is contained in it as limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A9","CH_GB18_BDE0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:D6","text":"The development of determinate being shifts from immediate positivity to a negativity taken back into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDE0:A11","CH_GB18_BDE0:A12","CH_GB18_BDE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD1","text":"Finitude arises as the self-relation of negation and not as the external limitation of a Something initially unlimited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD2","text":"The distinction between Something and Other is transformed into an immanent structure of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD3","text":"The being-in-itself of Something is not free of negation, but contains the determination of its being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD4","text":"The movement from determinate being to finitude is a reversal of negation: external negation becomes immanent limit, and from this determinate being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SD5","text":"Affirmative determination and negative determination do not form separate layers, but two developmental stages of the same determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a being-in-itself that would be completely independent of every relation to Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a determinacy that would be merely externally added or detachable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX3","text":"It excludes a limit that would lie only between already completed, mutually independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX4","text":"It excludes a negation that remains at the level of mere external negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:DNX5","text":"It excludes an affirmative quality that would not at the same time be negative relation and limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a wholly indeterminate determinate being whose determination does not proceed from an immanent negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is an absolutely external Other that does not itself fall under the determination of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of treating finitude as an accidental restriction of a Something infinite in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:SNX4","text":"The absence of a negation remaining outside Something structures the entire production of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS1","text":"Immediate determinate being → affirmative determination of quality and Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS2","text":"Something / Other → initial indifference and external negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS3","text":"Other as Something → sublation of the absolute externality of the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS4","text":"Being-in-itself + determinacy → constitution as determinate being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS5","text":"Immanent and negated being-for-other → limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS6","text":"Immanent limit → finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:FGS7","text":"First negation → being-in-itself → negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF1","text":"Indifference of Something and Other → external negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF2","text":"External negation → incorporation of the Other into the form of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF3","text":"Being-in-itself with determinacy → constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF4","text":"Constitution as negated being-for-other → immanent limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF5","text":"Immanent limit → finitude of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:AF6","text":"Finitude → transition from first negation to negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME1","text":"The Other is remapped from an external counter-position into a repetition of the determinative form of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME2","text":"The limit is reclassified from an external dividing line into an immanent structure of the limited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME3","text":"Finitude is remapped from a mere lack of unboundedness into a positive determination through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME4","text":"Being-in-itself becomes visible as a relational, rather than relationless, category.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ME5","text":"The opposition of affirmative quality and negative determination is reorganized as a developmental connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Something, Other, determinacy, constitution, and limit are developed as determinations of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The relation to Other is integrated into the inner determination of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The argument replaces external opposition with a movement of immanent negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality is determined as a development from immediate positivity through negation to the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from Something and Other to the immanent limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT2","text":"The determination of finitude remains dependent on the explicit equation of limit and immanent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT3","text":"The internal structure is coherent, provided that the initial external negation is understood as a sublatable initial determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of finitude from the own determinacy of Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT5","text":"The central fault line lies between the initial indifference of Something and Other and their later immanent mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDE0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from affirmative determination through first negation to the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDE0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDE0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 23","title":"B. Finitude.","context":"Chapter 23","original_title":"B. Die Endlichkeit."},"original_title":"B. Die Endlichkeit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA","layer":"CH","title":"a. Something and an Other.","order":24,"parents":["RAW_GB18_EUEA"],"revision":"CH_GB18_EUEA@R001","sha256":"0aeefef2c3386e5fc422f7a046ef3b76af22e29ea27ec60881028d402330d5fd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS1","text":"Der Text löst das Problem, wie Etwas bestimmt sein kann, ohne seine Bestimmtheit als bloß äußerlich zugeschriebene Differenz zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS2","text":"Etwas und Anderes werden als wechselseitige Bestimmungen rekonstruiert, deren Unterschied weder einseitig noch durch äußerliches Zeigen begründet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS3","text":"Das Argument operiert als immanente dialektische Rekonstruktion, indem es das isolierte Andere zur Selbstnegation und dadurch zur Selbstbeziehung zwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS4","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung des Etwas wird als Einheit seines Ansichseyns und seines Seyns-für-Anderes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung endet in einer Bestimmung, in der reflektierte Andersheit als immanente Qualität des Etwas erscheint und das abstrakte Ding-an-sich ausgeschlossen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","text":"Etwas und Anderes sind beide Daseyende und daher zunächst gleichrangige Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","text":"Jedes Etwas ist für das andere Etwas ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A3","text":"Das demonstrative Dieses erzeugt keinen immanenten Unterschied, sondern bezeichnet äußerlich und subjektiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","text":"Das isolierte Andere ist das Andere seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","text":"Das Andere seiner selbst ist selbstnegierend und veränderlich, bleibt aber in seiner Veränderung mit sich identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","text":"Etwas erhält sich in seinem Nichtdaseyn und ist daher zugleich mit ihm eins und nicht eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","text":"Seyn-für-Anderes und Ansichseyn sind untrennbare Momente eines und desselben Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A8","text":"Das Ansichseyn ist negative Beziehung auf das Andersseyn und enthält dieses Andersseyn zugleich als sein eigenes Nichtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","text":"Was Etwas ansich ist, hat es auch an ihm, und was es als Seyn-für-Anderes ist, ist es auch ansich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","text":"Ein Ding-an-sich, von dem alle Bestimmung abstrahiert wird, ist eine leere und wahrheitslose Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A11","text":"Das wahre Ansich ist die konkrete begriffliche Bestimmtheit eines Etwas und ist als Zusammenhang seiner Bestimmungen erkennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","text":"In der Sphäre des Seyns ist Bestimmung nur an sich und erscheint als Übergehen, nicht als reflektierendes Setzen oder Hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A13","text":"Die in sich reflektierte Bestimmtheit des Etwas kehrt als einfache seyende Qualität zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX1","text":"Der Unterschied von Etwas und Anderem ist nicht durch die äußere Auswahl eines zuerst gemeinten Diesen begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX2","text":"Das Andere ist nicht bloß eine fremde, von außen an ein Daseyn herangetragene Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX3","text":"Ansichseyn ist nicht die Abwesenheit aller Beziehung auf Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX4","text":"Seyn-für-Anderes ist nicht reines Nichtdaseyn, sondern verweist auf ein in sich reflektiertes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX5","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist nicht als unbestimmter Gegenstand möglicher Erkenntnis haltbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX6","text":"Das Setzen ist nicht die Bestimmungsform des Seyns, sondern gehört der Sphäre der objektiven Reflexion an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D1","text":"Die wechselseitige Andersheit vernichtet jede ontologische Priorität eines der beiden Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","CH_GB18_EUEA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D2","text":"Das Andere erzeugt durch seine Selbstnegation eine Selbstbeziehung, in der Andersseyn aufgehoben, aber nicht schlechthin vernichtet ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D3","text":"Das Daseyn des Etwas ist nicht beziehungslos unmittelbar, sondern besteht als Einheit von Selbstgleichheit und Beziehung auf Nichtdaseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D4","text":"Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit können am Etwas nicht als getrennte Seinsbereiche behandelt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D5","text":"Erkenntnis des Ansich ist nur möglich, sofern Ansich nicht als bestimmungsleere Abstraktion, sondern als konkreter Begriff gefasst wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D6","text":"Qualität ist das Resultat der Rückkehr der Andersheit in die Selbstidentität des Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD1","text":"Bestimmtheit entsteht weder aus reiner Identität noch aus äußerem Vergleich, sondern aus der immanenten Vermittlung von Selbstbeziehung und Andersheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A3","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD2","text":"Das wahrhafte Innere eines Etwas ist kein gegen äußere Erscheinung abgeschlossener Kern, sondern die immanente Einheit seiner bestimmenden Beziehungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD3","text":"Der Übergang von Seyn zu Wesen wird als Differenz zweier Operationsweisen vorbereitet: qualitatives Übergehen einerseits, reflektierendes Setzen andererseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD4","text":"Die Kritik des abstrakten Ding-an-sich transformiert epistemische Unzugänglichkeit in einen Fehler der Begriffsbildung.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein ursprünglich relationsloses Etwas, das erst nachträglich mit Andersheit in Verbindung träte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Selbstidentität, die Andersheit nur als äußerlichen Verlust oder bloße Störung erleidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erkenntnistheorie, in der die Unkenntnis des Ding-an-sich als positive Weisheit gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Metaphysik, die ihre Unterscheidungen als unmittelbar ansichseyende Tatsachen setzt, ohne ihre dialektische Entwicklung auszuweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absolut inneres Ansich, das weder an ihm noch für Anderes bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absolut äußeres Anderes, das nicht zugleich die Negation seiner eigenen Absonderung vollzöge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die endgültige Trennung von Begriff und Bestimmtheit, weil jede Frage nach einem Etwas bereits Bestimmungen verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS1","text":"Äußerliches Dieses → Gleichrangigkeit von Etwas und Anderem → Aufhebung der einseitigen Unterscheidung.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","CH_GB18_EUEA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS2","text":"Isoliertes Anderes → Anderssein seiner selbst → Selbstnegation → Veränderung → Rückkehr zur Selbstidentität.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS3","text":"Erhaltung im Nichtdaseyn → Seyn-für-Anderes und Ansichseyn → Einheit beider Momente → Identität von Ansich und An-ihm-seyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS4","text":"Abstraktes Ding-an-sich → Ausschluss der Bestimmungslosigkeit → konkreter Begriff → erkennbare immanente Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS5","text":"Reflektierte Bestimmtheit → Rückkehr in einfaches Seyn → Qualität → Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AF1","text":"Äußerlich bezeichnetes Dieses → reziproke Andersheit → isoliertes Anderes → Selbstnegation und Selbstidentität → Einheit von Ansichseyn und Seyn-für-Anderes → Widerlegung des abstrakten Ding-an-sich → Qualität als reflektierte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME1","text":"Differenz wird von einer Relation zwischen zwei feststehenden Gegenständen zu einer wechselseitigen Bestimmung jedes einzelnen Etwas umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Innen und Außen zerfällt, weil das an einem Etwas Befindliche zu seinem Ansichseyn gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich wird von einem transzendenten Erkenntnisgegenstand zu einer selbstwidersprüchlichen Abstraktionsoperation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME4","text":"Die Begriffslandschaft wird zeitlich gestuft, indem Übergehen, Setzen, Reflexion und Hervorbringen verschiedenen logischen Sphären zugeordnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist das Verhältnis von Etwas, Anderem, Ansichseyn und Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Bestimmtheit wird als Einheit von Negation, Beziehung, Selbstbeziehung und reflektierter Qualität organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt äußerliche Vergleichs- und Benennungsoperationen durch immanente Entwicklung als gültige Form begrifflicher Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Seyn erscheint als unmittelbare qualitative Sphäre des Übergehens, während Setzung und vermittelte Hervorbringung einer späteren Reflexionssphäre angehören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von äußerlicher Unterscheidung über reziproke Andersheit zur Einheit von Ansichseyn und Seyn-für-Anderes zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich des Status von Natur und Geist unterbestimmt, weil deren Verhältnis als Anwendung der Struktur erscheint, nicht aus ihr abgeleitet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT3","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist intern kohärent, sofern Andersheit weder als bloß äußerliche Differenz noch als aufhebbare Nichtigkeit behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umwandlung des Anderen aus einer äußerlichen Gegenbestimmung in die Selbstnegation, durch welche das Etwas sich auf sich bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass die Selbstidentität des sich negierenden Anderen behauptet wird, obwohl die Notwendigkeit seines Übergangs von Veränderung zu Identität nicht weiter begründet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Zurückweisung des abstrakten Ansich und der positiven Behauptung eines wahren Ansich als Begriff, dessen konkrete Erkenntnisform vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, wenn sie die Unterscheidung von Übergehen und Setzen als systematische Grenze der gegenwärtigen Sphäre beibehält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115924827015Z_a45f187b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Something and an Other.","source_sha256":"0aeefef2c3386e5fc422f7a046ef3b76af22e29ea27ec60881028d402330d5fd","sha256":"d16e2e48284a9ec1ae7e5f1b4f85f5bebcc83ca0f60cc2eddb633896c9d1e5a4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:59:24.828850+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS1","text":"The text resolves the problem of how Something can be determinate without treating its determinacy as a merely externally ascribed difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS2","text":"Something and Other are reconstructed as reciprocal determinations, whose difference is grounded neither one-sidedly nor through external pointing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS3","text":"The argument operates as an immanent dialectical reconstruction by compelling the isolated Other into self-negation and thereby into self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS4","text":"The self-relation of Something is determined as the unity of its Being-in-itself and its Being-for-Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AS5","text":"The movement ends in a determination in which reflected otherness appears as an immanent quality of Something and the abstract thing-in-itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","text":"Something and Other are both determinate beings and are therefore initially Something of equal rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","text":"Every Something is an Other for the other Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A3","text":"The demonstrative This generates no immanent difference, but designates externally and subjectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","text":"The isolated Other is the Other of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","text":"The Other of itself is self-negating and mutable, but remains identical with itself in its alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","text":"Something maintains itself in its non-being and is therefore at once one with it and not one with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","text":"Being-for-Other and Being-in-itself are inseparable moments of one and the same Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A8","text":"Being-in-itself is a negative relation to otherness and at the same time contains this otherness as its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","text":"What Something is in itself, it also has in it, and what it is as Being-for-Other, it is also in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","text":"A thing-in-itself from which every determination is abstracted is an empty and untruthful abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A11","text":"The true in-itself is the concrete conceptual determinacy of a Something and is cognizable as the interconnection of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","text":"In the sphere of Being, determination is only in itself and appears as transition, not as reflective positing or production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:A13","text":"The determinacy of Something reflected into itself returns as simple being quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX1","text":"The difference between Something and Other is not grounded in the external selection of a This intended first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX2","text":"The Other is not merely an alien determination brought to a determinate being from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX3","text":"Being-in-itself is not the absence of every relation to Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX4","text":"Being-for-Other is not pure non-being, but refers to a Being reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX5","text":"The thing-in-itself is not tenable as an indeterminate object of possible cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:NX6","text":"Positing is not the form of determination of Being, but belongs to the sphere of objective reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D1","text":"Reciprocal otherness annihilates every ontological priority of either of the two Somethings.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","CH_GB18_EUEA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D2","text":"Through its self-negation, the Other generates a self-relation in which otherness is sublated, but not simply annihilated.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D3","text":"The determinate being of Something is not relationlessly immediate, but consists as the unity of self-sameness and relation to non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D4","text":"Inwardness and externality cannot be treated in Something as separate domains of Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D5","text":"Cognition of the in-itself is possible only insofar as the in-itself is grasped not as an abstraction empty of determination, but as a concrete concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:D6","text":"Quality is the result of the return of otherness into the self-identity of Something.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD1","text":"Determinacy arises neither from pure identity nor from external comparison, but from the immanent mediation of self-relation and otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A3","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD2","text":"The true inner of a Something is not a core closed off against external appearance, but the immanent unity of its determining relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD3","text":"The transition from Being to Essence is prepared as the difference between two modes of operation: qualitative transition on the one hand, reflective positing on the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SD4","text":"The critique of the abstract thing-in-itself transforms epistemic inaccessibility into an error of concept-formation.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an originally relationless Something that would enter into connection with otherness only subsequently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a pure self-identity that suffers otherness only as an external loss or mere disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an epistemology in which ignorance of the thing-in-itself can count as positive wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a metaphysics that posits its distinctions as immediately facts existing in themselves, without demonstrating their dialectical development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely inner in-itself that would be determined neither in it nor for Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely external Other that would not at the same time enact the negation of its own separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is the final separation of concept and determinacy, because every question concerning a Something already requires determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS1","text":"External This → equal rank of Something and Other → sublation of one-sided distinction.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A1","CH_GB18_EUEA:A2","CH_GB18_EUEA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS2","text":"Isolated Other → otherness of itself → self-negation → alteration → return to self-identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A4","CH_GB18_EUEA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS3","text":"Maintenance in non-being → Being-for-Other and Being-in-itself → unity of both moments → identity of in-itself and being-in-it.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A6","CH_GB18_EUEA:A7","CH_GB18_EUEA:A8","CH_GB18_EUEA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS4","text":"Abstract thing-in-itself → exclusion of indeterminacy → concrete concept → cognizable immanent determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A10","CH_GB18_EUEA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:FGS5","text":"Reflected determinacy → return into simple Being → quality → determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_EUEA:A12","CH_GB18_EUEA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:AF1","text":"Externally designated This → reciprocal otherness → isolated Other → self-negation and self-identity → unity of Being-in-itself and Being-for-Other → refutation of the abstract thing-in-itself → quality as reflected determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME1","text":"Difference is remapped from a relation between two fixed objects to a reciprocal determination of each individual Something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME2","text":"The opposition of inner and outer disintegrates, because what is present in a Something belongs to its Being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME3","text":"The thing-in-itself is reclassified from a transcendent object of cognition into a self-contradictory operation of abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ME4","text":"The conceptual landscape is temporally stratified by assigning transition, positing, reflection, and production to different logical spheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the relation of Something, Other, Being-in-itself, and Being-for-Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Determinacy is organized as the unity of negation, relation, self-relation, and reflected quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces external operations of comparison and naming with immanent development as the valid form of conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as the immediate qualitative sphere of transition, whereas positing and mediated production belong to a later sphere of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from external distinction through reciprocal otherness to the unity of Being-in-itself and Being-for-Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with regard to the status of nature and spirit, because their relation appears as an application of the structure, not as derived from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction is internally coherent insofar as otherness is treated neither as merely external difference nor as sublatable nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in transforming the Other from an external counter-determination into the self-negation through which Something relates to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT5","text":"The central fault line lies in the fact that the self-identity of the self-negating Other is asserted, although the necessity of its transition from alteration to identity is not further grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT6","text":"A further tension consists between the rejection of the abstract in-itself and the positive assertion of a true in-itself as concept, whose concrete form of cognition is presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EUEA:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text if it retains the distinction between transition and positing as the systematic limit of the present sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EUEA:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_EUEA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_EUEA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 24","title":"a. Something and an Other.","context":"Chapter 24","original_title":"a. Etwas und ein Anderes."},"original_title":"a. Etwas und ein Anderes.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU","layer":"CH","title":"b. Determination, Constitution, and Limit.","order":25,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BBBU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BBBU@R001","sha256":"ed5bb636919daa99edb6eb04006fc353f120d952a9e9efe867f53eb176ad8747","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Ansichsein eines Etwas als bestimmte Realität zu denken, ohne es entweder in abstrakte Selbstidentität oder in bloßes Bestimmtwerden durch Anderes aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS2","text":"Das Ansichsein wird als vermittelte Negation des Seyns-für-Anderes bestimmt und enthält dieses Andere daher als eigenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS3","text":"Die affirmative, dem Ansich entsprechende Bestimmtheit wird als Bestimmung, die äußerlich erscheinende Bestimmtheit als Beschaffenheit unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS4","text":"Die anfängliche Trennung von Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit schlägt um, weil jede Bestimmtheit zugleich Ansichsein und Beziehung auf Anderes enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS5","text":"Die Einheit von Selbstbeziehung und Anderssein setzt die Grenze als immanente Negation, welche Etwas und Anderes zugleich verbindet und scheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS6","text":"Die Grenze enthüllt sich als Widerspruch: Etwas ist nur in ihr, aber sie ist zugleich sein Nichtsein und treibt es über sich hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS7","text":"Das Endliche ist Etwas, insofern seine immanente Grenze es als Selbstwiderspruch in den Übergang über sich selbst zwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","text":"Ansichsein ist keine abstrakte Unmittelbarkeit, sondern die durch Aufhebung des Seyns-für-Anderes vermittelte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","text":"Was ein Etwas an sich ist, muss auch an ihm sein, wenn seine Bestimmtheit als reale Bestimmung gelten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A3","text":"Bestimmung ist affirmative Bestimmtheit, durch welche ein Etwas in seinen Beziehungen auf Anderes seiner Gleichheit mit sich gemäß bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","text":"Beschaffenheit ist die Bestimmtheit eines Etwas, insofern sie als von äußerem Verhältnis und äußerem Einfluß abhängig erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","text":"Die Preisgabe eines Etwas an äußere Bestimmungen ist selbst eine Qualität dieses Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A6","text":"Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit sind unterschieden, gehen aber notwendig ineinander über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A7","text":"Äußeres Bestimmtwerden ist durch die immanente Bestimmung des Etwas mitbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A8","text":"Die Veränderung der Beschaffenheit verändert zugleich das Etwas, weil Beschaffenheit zu dem gehört, was es an ihm ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","text":"Das im Etwas gesetzte Anderssein ist immanente Negation und bildet sein entwickeltes Insichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","text":"Die Grenze ist eine Bestimmtheit, die zugleich die Negation des Anderen, die Negation des Etwas und die Vermittlung beider ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","text":"Etwas besitzt sein bestimmtes Dasein nur in seiner Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","text":"Die Grenze ist zugleich das Nichtsein des Etwas; deshalb enthält das bestimmte Etwas den Übergang in sein Anderes in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A13","text":"Grenzen sind nicht bloße Abschlüsse, sondern Prinzipien und Elemente dessen, was sie begrenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A14","text":"Das Endliche ist das Etwas, dessen immanente Grenze als Widerspruch seine Selbstüberschreitung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX1","text":"Ansichsein ist nicht bloße unmittelbare Identität eines Etwas mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX2","text":"Bestimmung ist nicht jede beliebige Bestimmtheit und nicht mit bloßer Beschaffenheit identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX3","text":"Beschaffenheit ist nicht schlechthin äußerlich, obwohl sie als äußerlich abhängig erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX4","text":"Veränderung der Beschaffenheit ist nicht bloß oberflächlich, sobald Beschaffenheit zum An-ihm-Sein des Etwas gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX5","text":"Das Andere ist nicht lediglich ein äußerer Vergleichsgegenstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX6","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht bloß das Nichtsein des Anderen und nicht ein einseitiger Abschluß des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX7","text":"Räumliche Grenze ist nicht bloß ein äußerlich vorfindlicher Punkt, eine Linie oder eine Fläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX8","text":"Der Übergang von Punkt, Linie und Fläche ist nicht zufällig und nicht bloß subjektive Vorstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX9","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht ein ruhender Bestand mit äußerlich hinzugefügter Begrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D1","text":"Eine Bestimmung ist nur erfüllt, wenn die im Verhältnis zu Anderem hervortretenden Bestimmtheiten die immanente Selbstgleichheit des Etwas realisieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","CH_GB18_BBBU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D2","text":"Die Bestimmung des Menschen als denkende Vernunft erscheint zunächst als Sollen, weil ihr Ansichsein dem noch nicht einverleibten natürlichen und sinnlichen Dasein gegenübersteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","CH_GB18_BBBU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D3","text":"Die Beschaffenheit bleibt gegenüber der Bestimmung nicht schlechthin zufällig, weil das scheinbar fremde Bestimmen durch die eigene Bestimmung vermittelt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","CH_GB18_BBBU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D4","text":"Die Trennung von Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit ist instabil, weil die in sich genommene Bestimmung sich dem Anderen öffnet und die isolierte Beschaffenheit sich als selbstbezügliche Bestimmtheit erweist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A6","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D5","text":"Zwei Etwas stehen einander nicht nur äußerlich gegenüber, sondern sind durch eine ihnen immanente Negation zugleich verbunden und voneinander getrennt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D6","text":"Die Grenze vermittelt das Sein und Nichtsein sowohl des Etwas als auch seines Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D7","text":"Punkt, Linie und Fläche besitzen ihre bestimmte Realität nicht unabhängig von ihren Grenzen, sondern durch diese als immanente Prinzipien.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D8","text":"Das Übergehen eines Bestimmten in ein Weiteres ist die explizite Wirklichkeit seines immanenten Widerspruchs.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD1","text":"Identität ist innerhalb dieses Systems nur als vermittelte Identität möglich, weil sie das aufgehobene Anderssein als ihr eigenes Moment voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD2","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird von einer unabhängigen Ursache des Etwas zu einer immanenten Dimension seiner eigenen Bestimmtheit umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","CH_GB18_BBBU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD3","text":"Die Grenze fungiert zugleich als Konstitutionsbedingung, Differenzoperator und Auflösungsoperator des bestimmten Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD4","text":"Endlichkeit bezeichnet keine bloße Begrenztheit, sondern die notwendige Selbstüberschreitung dessen, was nur durch seine Grenze bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD5","text":"Die behauptete Stabilität eines Etwas ist stets nur die affirmative Seite eines Prozesses, dessen negative Seite seine Veränderung und sein Übergang erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A8","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Selbstidentität, die keiner Vermittlung durch Negation und Anderssein bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Exteriorität, in welcher äußere Einflüsse die Sache bestimmen könnten, ohne von deren eigener Bestimmung mitbedingt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine feste ontologische Scheidung von Innerem und Äußerem, weil das Äußere als Beschaffenheit zum An-ihm-Sein gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Grenze, die ausschließlich einseitig begrenzt und selbst nicht beide Seiten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines bestimmten Seienden, das seine Negation nicht als immanentes Moment enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter, unbewegter Anfang, weil jedes Prinzip zugleich Grenze und damit Trieb seines Übergangs ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein absolut selbstgenügsames Endliches, das in seiner Begrenzung verharren könnte, ohne über sich hinauszugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein neutraler Außenstandpunkt, von dem Etwas und Anderes als bereits fertige, voneinander unabhängige Einheiten bestimmt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine widerspruchsfreie Bestimmtheit, weil Bestimmtheit nur als Einheit von affirmativer Selbstbeziehung und Negation besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein bloß räumliches Modell der Grenze, das deren begriffliche Produktivität auf äußere Gestalt reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS1","text":"Abstraktes Ansichsein → Negation des Seyns-für-Anderes → vermitteltes Ansichsein mit immanentem Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS2","text":"Vermitteltes Ansichsein → affirmative Selbstbestimmtheit → Bestimmung als an-ihm-seiende Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS3","text":"Verhältnis zu Anderem → äußerlich erscheinende Bestimmtheit → Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS4","text":"Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit → wechselseitiger Übergang → immanente Negation des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS5","text":"Immanente Negation → Grenze als gemeinschaftliche Bestimmtheit von Etwas und Anderem → Vermittlung von Sein und Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS6","text":"Grenze als Sein und Nichtsein des Etwas → Selbstwiderspruch → Übergang über die bestimmte Gestalt hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS7","text":"Selbstüberschreitendes Etwas → Endlichkeit als prozessuale Form der immanenten Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF1","text":"Das abstrakte Ansichsein wird als unzureichend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF2","text":"Das Ansichsein wird als durch Seyn-für-Anderes vermittelte Selbstbeziehung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF3","text":"Die vermittelte Bestimmtheit wird in Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF4","text":"Die Differenz von Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit wird durch ihren notwendigen Übergang aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF5","text":"Das aufgehobene Anderssein wird als immanente Grenze von Etwas und Anderem bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF6","text":"Die Grenze wird als Einheit von konstitutiver Qualität und negativem Aufhören entfaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF7","text":"Der Widerspruch der Grenze wird als immanenter Trieb des Endlichen zu seinem Übergang bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung von innerer Bestimmung und äußerer Beschaffenheit wird von einer starren Dualität in ein Verhältnis wechselseitiger Vermittlung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME2","text":"Zufälligkeit äußerer Verhältnisse wird nicht beseitigt, aber als Qualität und damit als strukturelle Exponiertheit des Etwas neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME3","text":"Grenze erscheint nicht mehr als Rand eines bereits fertigen Gegenstandes, sondern als Bedingung seiner bestimmten Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME4","text":"Das Andere erscheint nicht mehr als bloß äußerer Gegenpol, sondern als immanentes Moment der Selbstbestimmung des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME5","text":"Geometrische Elemente werden von statischen Gegenständen zu widersprüchlichen Prinzipien ihres jeweiligen Hervorgangs umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME6","text":"Endlichkeit wird von einem bloßen Defekt oder Mangel zu einer bestimmten Form selbstbewegter Negativität umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text unterscheidet Bestimmung, Beschaffenheit und Grenze als Formen der Bestimmtheit eines Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmtheit eines Etwas entsteht durch die Vermittlung von Ansichsein, Seyn-für-Anderes, Negation und äußerem Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Jede scheinbar feste Opposition wird als vorläufige Abstraktion behandelt, deren Wahrheit im Übergang ihrer Seiten liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein ist nur als bestimmtes Sein möglich, bestimmte Existenz nur als immanente Negation, und Endlichkeit nur als prozessuales Übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT5","text":"Formal-Genetic — Grenze fungiert als Prinzip, durch das das Begrenzte zugleich konstituiert, differenziert und in seine weitere Gestalt überführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von vermitteltem Ansichsein über Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit zur Grenze und Endlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genauere Notwendigkeit, mit der die kategoriale Bewegung von der Grenze zu den folgenden Bestimmungen fortschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Negation nicht als äußerer Mangel, sondern als konstitutives Moment bestimmter Existenz vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Operation besteht in der Umwandlung äußerlicher Begrenzung in immanente Vermittlung und produktiven Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT5","text":"Die Differenz von Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit bleibt spannungsvoll, weil ihre anfängliche Unterscheidung zugleich durch ihren notwendigen Übergang relativiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT6","text":"Die Grenze bleibt strukturell doppeldeutig, weil sie das Etwas zugleich erhält, bestimmt, negiert und über sich hinaustreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT7","text":"Die geometrische Anwendung beansprucht begriffliche Notwendigkeit, verweist ihre vollständige Ausarbeitung jedoch an eine spätere Betrachtung des Raums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes nur dann, wenn Bestimmung, Beschaffenheit, Grenze und Endlichkeit als aufeinander erzeugende Stufen und nicht als feste Klassen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112644665891Z_493c7315","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Determination, Constitution, and Limit.","source_sha256":"ed5bb636919daa99edb6eb04006fc353f120d952a9e9efe867f53eb176ad8747","sha256":"4504d02fbca73713849b77e776adbd0552d303303af6d69f9b0726b8b3970a82","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:26:44.667660+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS1","text":"The problem consists in thinking the being-in-itself of a something as determinate reality without dissolving it either into abstract self-identity or into mere determination by another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS2","text":"Being-in-itself is determined as mediated negation of being-for-another and therefore contains this other as its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS3","text":"The affirmative determinacy corresponding to the in-itself is distinguished as determination, and the determinacy appearing as external as constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS4","text":"The initial separation of determination and constitution overturns itself, because every determinacy contains at once being-in-itself and relation to another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS5","text":"The unity of self-relation and otherness posits the limit as immanent negation, which at once connects and separates something and other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS6","text":"The limit reveals itself as contradiction: something is only in it, yet it is at once its non-being and drives it beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AS7","text":"The finite is something insofar as its immanent limit compels it, as self-contradiction, into transition beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","text":"Being-in-itself is not abstract immediacy, but the self-relation mediated through the sublation of being-for-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","text":"What a something is in itself must also be in it if its determinacy is to count as real determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A3","text":"Determination is affirmative determinacy through which a something, in its relations to another, remains in conformity with its equality with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","text":"Constitution is the determinacy of a something insofar as it appears dependent on external relation and external influence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","text":"The surrender of a something to external determinations is itself a quality of this something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A6","text":"Determination and constitution are distinct, but necessarily pass over into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A7","text":"External determination is co-determined by the immanent determination of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A8","text":"The alteration of constitution at the same time alters the something, because constitution belongs to what it is in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","text":"The otherness posited in the something is immanent negation and constitutes its developed being-within-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","text":"The limit is a determinacy that is at once the negation of the other, the negation of the something, and the mediation of both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","text":"Something possesses its determinate being only in its limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","text":"The limit is at once the non-being of the something; therefore the determinate something contains within itself the transition into its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A13","text":"Limits are not mere terminations, but principles and elements of that which they limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:A14","text":"The finite is the something whose immanent limit, as contradiction, produces its self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX1","text":"Being-in-itself is not the mere immediate identity of a something with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX2","text":"Determination is not every arbitrary determinacy and is not identical with mere constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX3","text":"Constitution is not simply external, although it appears externally dependent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX4","text":"Alteration of constitution is not merely superficial once constitution belongs to the being-in-it of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX5","text":"The other is not merely an external object of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX6","text":"The limit is not merely the non-being of the other and not a one-sided termination of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX7","text":"Spatial limit is not merely an externally found point, line, or surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX8","text":"The transition of point, line, and surface is not contingent and not merely subjective representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:NX9","text":"The finite is not a resting subsistence with an externally appended limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D1","text":"A determination is fulfilled only when the determinacies emerging in relation to another realize the immanent self-equality of the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","CH_GB18_BBBU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D2","text":"The determination of the human being as thinking reason initially appears as an ought, because its being-in-itself stands opposed to natural and sensuous determinate being not yet incorporated.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A2","CH_GB18_BBBU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D3","text":"Constitution does not remain simply contingent in relation to determination, because the apparently alien determining is mediated through its own determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","CH_GB18_BBBU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D4","text":"The separation of determination and constitution is unstable, because determination taken into itself opens itself to the other and isolated constitution proves to be self-relating determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A6","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D5","text":"Two somethings do not stand opposed to one another merely externally, but are at once connected and separated from one another through a negation immanent to them.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D6","text":"The limit mediates the being and non-being both of the something and of its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D7","text":"Point, line, and surface possess their determinate reality not independently of their limits, but through these as immanent principles.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:D8","text":"The passing over of a determinate into a further is the explicit actuality of its immanent contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD1","text":"Within this system, identity is possible only as mediated identity, because it presupposes sublated otherness as its own moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A1","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD2","text":"Externality is reclassified from an independent cause of the something into an immanent dimension of its own determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A4","CH_GB18_BBBU:A5","CH_GB18_BBBU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD3","text":"The limit functions at once as condition of constitution, differential operator, and dissolution operator of the determinate something.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A10","CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD4","text":"Finitude designates not mere limitedness, but the necessary self-transcendence of that which is determined only through its limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A11","CH_GB18_BBBU:A12","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SD5","text":"The asserted stability of a something is always only the affirmative side of a process whose negative side produces its alteration and transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_BBBU:A8","CH_GB18_BBBU:A9","CH_GB18_BBBU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a self-identity that requires no mediation through negation and otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an absolute exteriority in which external influences could determine the thing without being co-conditioned by its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a fixed ontological separation of inner and outer, because the outer, as constitution, belongs to being-in-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a limit that limits exclusively one-sidedly and does not itself determine both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a determinate being that does not contain its negation as an immanent moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an ultimate, unmoved beginning, because every principle is at once limit and thus the impulse of its transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely self-sufficient finite that could remain in its limitation without going beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a neutral external standpoint from which something and other could be determined as already finished, mutually independent unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a contradiction-free determinacy, because determinacy exists only as the unity of affirmative self-relation and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a merely spatial model of the limit that reduces its conceptual productivity to external shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS1","text":"Abstract being-in-itself → negation of being-for-another → mediated being-in-itself with immanent otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS2","text":"Mediated being-in-itself → affirmative self-determinacy → determination as quality existing-in-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS3","text":"Relation to another → externally appearing determinacy → constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS4","text":"Determination and constitution → reciprocal transition → immanent negation of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS5","text":"Immanent negation → limit as common determinacy of something and other → mediation of being and non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS6","text":"Limit as being and non-being of the something → self-contradiction → transition beyond the determinate shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:FGS7","text":"Self-transcending something → finitude as the processual form of the immanent limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF1","text":"Abstract being-in-itself is determined as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF2","text":"Being-in-itself is newly determined as self-relation mediated through being-for-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF3","text":"Mediated determinacy is differentiated into determination and constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF4","text":"The difference of determination and constitution is sublated through their necessary transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF5","text":"Sublated otherness is determined as the immanent limit of something and other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF6","text":"The limit is developed as the unity of constitutive quality and negative cessation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:AF7","text":"The contradiction of the limit is determined as the immanent impulse of the finite toward its transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME1","text":"The distinction between inner determination and external constitution is transferred from a rigid duality into a relation of reciprocal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME2","text":"The contingency of external relations is not eliminated, but reclassified as quality and hence as the structural exposure of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME3","text":"The limit no longer appears as the edge of an already finished object, but as the condition of its determinate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME4","text":"The other no longer appears as a merely external counterpole, but as an immanent moment of the self-determination of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME5","text":"Geometrical elements are reordered from static objects into contradictory principles of their respective emergence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ME6","text":"Finitude is reordered from a mere defect or lack into a determinate form of self-moving negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text distinguishes determination, constitution, and limit as forms of the determinacy of a something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinacy of a something arises through the mediation of being-in-itself, being-for-another, negation, and external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Every seemingly fixed opposition is treated as a provisional abstraction whose truth lies in the transition of its sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is possible only as determinate being, determinate existence only as immanent negation, and finitude only as processual passing-over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:ALT5","text":"Formal-Genetic — Limit functions as the principle through which the limited is at once constituted, differentiated, and transferred into its further shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from mediated being-in-itself through determination and constitution to limit and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the more precise necessity with which the categorial movement proceeds from the limit to the following determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as negation is presupposed not as an external lack, but as a constitutive moment of determinate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation consists in transforming external limitation into immanent mediation and productive contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT5","text":"The difference between determination and constitution remains tension-filled, because their initial distinction is at once relativized through their necessary transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT6","text":"The limit remains structurally ambiguous, because it at once preserves, determines, negates, and drives the something beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT7","text":"The geometrical application claims conceptual necessity, yet refers its complete elaboration to a later consideration of space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BBBU:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text only if determination, constitution, limit, and finitude are treated as stages generating one another rather than as fixed classes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BBBU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BBBU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BBBU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 25","title":"b. Determination, Constitution, and Limit.","context":"Chapter 25","original_title":"b. Bestimmung, Beschaffenheit und Grenze."},"original_title":"b. Bestimmung, Beschaffenheit und Grenze.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0","layer":"CH","title":"c. Finitude.","order":26,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDE0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDE0@R001","sha256":"42bd7e03fca294107571096009f53f8ab2e4e98b0dba6ebc6cc1965dccf4d0c2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, bestimmte Existenz nicht als bloße positive Bestimmtheit, sondern als innerlich begrenzte Existenz zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS2","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer äußerlichen Markierung zu einer immanenten Negation des bestimmten Seienden neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS3","text":"Die immanente Negation erzeugt im bestimmten Seienden einen Gegensatz, durch den dessen Insichsein als Werden bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS4","text":"Endlichkeit bezeichnet daher eine Existenz, deren eigenes Wesen das Nichtsein und deren Wahrheit ihr Ende ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von bestimmtem Sein über immanente Grenze und negatives Selbstverhältnis zum notwendigen Vergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A1","text":"Bestimmtes Dasein ist durch eine Qualität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A2","text":"Die Qualität eines Etwas ist zugleich dessen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A3","text":"Die Grenze ist zunächst eine affirmative Bestimmung des ruhenden Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A4","text":"Die Grenze enthält als Negation einen Gegensatz zum Dasein, dem sie angehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","text":"Die Negation der Grenze ist dem Etwas immanent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A6","text":"Die immanente Grenze bestimmt das Insichsein des Etwas als Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A7","text":"Im Endlichen macht das Nichtsein die Natur und das Sein des Seienden aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A8","text":"Das Endliche bezieht sich in seinem Selbstverhältnis negativ auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A9","text":"Das negative Selbstverhältnis überschreitet das eigene Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A10","text":"Die Wahrheit des endlichen Seins ist sein Ende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A11","text":"Endliche Dinge vergehen nicht nur möglicherweise, sondern ihrem Sein nach notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A12","text":"Das Insichsein des Endlichen enthält den Keim seines Vergehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A13","text":"Geburt und Tod gehören im Endlichen derselben zeitlichen Bestimmung an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX1","text":"Endlichkeit ist nicht bloß das Vorliegen einer Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX2","text":"Endlichkeit ist nicht bloß eine äußerliche Begrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX3","text":"Endliche Dinge haben ihr Dasein nicht unabhängig von ihrer Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX4","text":"Das Vergehen ist nicht nur eine äußerlich mögliche Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX5","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht ein Sein, das ohne Vergehen bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX6","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht ausschließlich eine ruhende, affirmative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D1","text":"Die Qualität eines Etwas fungiert zugleich als Bestimmung seines Nichtseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A1","CH_GB18_CDE0:A2","CH_GB18_CDE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D2","text":"Das bestimmte Dasein wird durch seine eigene Grenze in eine innere Bewegung überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A4","CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","CH_GB18_CDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D3","text":"Das Insichsein des Endlichen ist kein statischer Bestand, sondern ein Werden an ihm selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","CH_GB18_CDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D4","text":"Das Nichtsein ist beim Endlichen keine äußerliche Aufhebung, sondern eine Bestimmung seines eigenen Seins.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A7","CH_GB18_CDE0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D5","text":"Das Endliche überschreitet sich durch die Weise, in der es auf sich selbst bezogen ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A8","CH_GB18_CDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D6","text":"Das Vergehen ist die Verwirklichung der im endlichen Sein enthaltenen Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A10","CH_GB18_CDE0:A11","CH_GB18_CDE0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD1","text":"Endlichkeit ist eine ontologische Struktur, in der Bestimmung, Grenze, Negation, Werden und Ende nicht äußerlich verbunden, sondern als Momente eines einzigen Seinsprozesses erzeugt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD2","text":"Das Endliche besitzt keine positive Selbstidentität, die seiner Negativität vorausliegt; seine Identität entsteht als negatives Verhältnis zu seiner eigenen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD3","text":"Die Möglichkeit des Vergehens wird in die Notwendigkeit des Vergehens überführt, weil das endliche Sein selbst den Grund seiner Aufhebung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD4","text":"Zeitliche Entstehung und zeitliche Vernichtung erscheinen als zwei Grenzen desselben immanenten Prozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD5","text":"Die Kategorie des Endlichen totalisiert Negation: Alles, was endlich ist, trägt sein Ende nicht als Ereignis, sondern als Struktur seines Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem Qualität und Grenze vollständig voneinander getrennt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem die Grenze nur von außen an ein ansonsten unberührtes Sein herantritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem das Insichsein des Etwas reine Selbstständigkeit ohne innere Negation bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem das Nichtsein erst nachträglich zum endlichen Sein hinzukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem Vergehen kontingent bleibt, während das endliche Sein unverändert fortbestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX6","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem Geburt und Tod voneinander unabhängige Ereignisse sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Sein, dessen Grenze nicht zu seiner eigenen Bestimmung gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Endliches, dessen Sein sich nicht in Richtung seines Nichtseins überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußerliche Kausalität des Endes, die den inneren Grund des Vergehens ersetzen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine endgültige Selbstidentität des Endlichen jenseits seiner negativen Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS1","text":"Bestimmtes Dasein → qualitative Bestimmung → Grenze als affirmative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS2","text":"Grenze → immanente Negation → Gegensatz von Dasein und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS3","text":"Gegensatz innerhalb des Etwas → bestimmtes Insichsein → Werden an ihm selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS4","text":"Werden an ihm selbst → negatives Selbstverhältnis → Überschreitung des eigenen Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS5","text":"Negatives Selbstverhältnis → Nichtsein als eigene Natur → Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS6","text":"Endlichkeit → immanenter Keim des Vergehens → notwendiges Ende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS7","text":"Geburt als Eintritt in das endliche Sein → immanente Todesbestimmung → Einheit von Geburt und Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AF1","text":"Bestimmtes Dasein → qualitative Grenze → immanente Negation → negatives Insichsein → Werden → Endlichkeit → notwendiges Vergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AF2","text":"Äußerlich mögliche Veränderung → Unterscheidung des Endlichen → Verwerfung bloßer Kontingenz → Bestimmung des Endes als Wahrheit des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME1","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer äußeren Trennlinie zu einer produktiven inneren Struktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME2","text":"Das Nichtsein wird vom Gegenbegriff des Seins zur konstitutiven Bestimmung des endlichen Seins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME3","text":"Vergehen wird von einem möglichen Ereignis zu einer ontologischen Notwendigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME4","text":"Geburt und Tod werden nicht als getrennte Vorgänge, sondern als zeitliche Explikationen eines gemeinsamen endlichen Grundes sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME5","text":"Ruhe und Bewegung werden nicht als Gegensätze äußerer Zustände, sondern als Übergang von affirmativer Bestimmtheit zu immanenter Negativität geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Etwas besitzt eine Qualität, ist durch sie begrenzt und vergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Grenze negiert das Dasein von innen und erzeugt das Werden des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung des Endlichen verschiebt sich von äußerer Veränderung zu immanenter Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein des Endlichen enthält sein Nichtsein; seine Geburt fällt strukturell mit dem Beginn seines Todes zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von bestimmtem Dasein zu immanenter Grenze, Endlichkeit und notwendigem Vergehen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Negation im Einzelnen „entwickelt“ wird und welche Vermittlung zwischen Grenze, Werden und Ende formal erforderlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Endlichkeit durch immanente Negativität und nicht durch äußere Begrenzung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung der Notwendigkeit des Vergehens aus dem Selbstverhältnis des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass das Endliche zunächst als affirmatives, ruhendes Dasein erscheint, zugleich aber von Anfang an den Keim seines Vergehens enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange „Nichtsein“, „Grenze“ und „Ende“ nicht als getrennte äußerliche Momente behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114034519307Z_e9871dac","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Finitude.","source_sha256":"42bd7e03fca294107571096009f53f8ab2e4e98b0dba6ebc6cc1965dccf4d0c2","sha256":"9dc629e1a8622c5554902fc8473c29aaefa8c0ab3d9d7c4fbecf5d0fb371c85c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:40:34.520626+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining determinate existence not as mere positive determinacy, but as intrinsically bounded existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS2","text":"The limit is redetermined from an external marking into an immanent negation of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS3","text":"The immanent negation produces in determinate being an opposition through which its being-within-self is determined as becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS4","text":"Finitude therefore denotes an existence whose own essence is non-being and whose truth is its end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from determinate being through immanent limit and negative self-relation to necessary perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A1","text":"Determinate existence is determined by a quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A2","text":"The quality of a something is at the same time its limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A3","text":"The limit is initially an affirmative determination of quiescent determinate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A4","text":"As negation, the limit contains an opposition to the determinate existence to which it belongs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","text":"The negation of the limit is immanent to the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A6","text":"The immanent limit determines the being-within-self of the something as becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A7","text":"In the finite, non-being constitutes the nature and being of what is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A8","text":"In its self-relation, the finite relates negatively to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A9","text":"Negative self-relation surpasses its own being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A10","text":"The truth of finite being is its end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A11","text":"Finite things perish not merely possibly, but necessarily according to their being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A12","text":"The being-within-self of the finite contains the germ of its perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:A13","text":"Birth and death belong, in the finite, to the same temporal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX1","text":"Finitude is not merely the presence of a quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX2","text":"Finitude is not merely an external limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX3","text":"Finite things do not have their determinate existence independently of their limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX4","text":"Perishing is not merely an externally possible change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX5","text":"The finite is not a being that could subsist without perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:NX6","text":"The limit is not exclusively a quiescent, affirmative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D1","text":"The quality of a something functions at the same time as a determination of its non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A1","CH_GB18_CDE0:A2","CH_GB18_CDE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D2","text":"Determinate existence is transferred into an inner movement through its own limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A4","CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","CH_GB18_CDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D3","text":"The being-within-self of the finite is not a static subsistence, but a becoming in it itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A5","CH_GB18_CDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D4","text":"For the finite, non-being is not an external sublation, but a determination of its own being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A7","CH_GB18_CDE0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D5","text":"The finite surpasses itself through the manner in which it is related to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A8","CH_GB18_CDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:D6","text":"Perishing is the actualization of the negativity contained in finite being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDE0:A10","CH_GB18_CDE0:A11","CH_GB18_CDE0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD1","text":"Finitude is an ontological structure in which determination, limit, negation, becoming, and end are not externally connected, but are generated as moments of a single process of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD2","text":"The finite possesses no positive self-identity that precedes its negativity; its identity arises as a negative relation to its own limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD3","text":"The possibility of perishing is transferred into the necessity of perishing because finite being itself contains the ground of its sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD4","text":"Temporal emergence and temporal annihilation appear as two limits of the same immanent process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SD5","text":"The category of the finite totalizes negation: everything that is finite bears its end not as an event, but as the structure of its being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX1","text":"A model in which quality and limit can be completely separated from one another is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX2","text":"A model in which the limit approaches an otherwise untouched being only from without is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX3","text":"A model in which the being-within-self of the something signifies pure self-subsistence without inner negation is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX4","text":"A model in which non-being is added to finite being only subsequently is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX5","text":"A model in which perishing remains contingent while finite being could persist unchanged is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:DNX6","text":"A model in which birth and death are events independent of one another is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a being whose limit does not belong to its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a finite being whose being does not surpass itself in the direction of its non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an external causality of the end that could replace the inner ground of perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a definitive self-identity of the finite beyond its negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS1","text":"Determinate existence → qualitative determination → limit as affirmative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS2","text":"Limit → immanent negation → opposition of determinate existence and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS3","text":"Opposition within the something → determinate being-within-self → becoming in it itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS4","text":"Becoming in it itself → negative self-relation → surpassing of its own being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS5","text":"Negative self-relation → non-being as its own nature → finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS6","text":"Finitude → immanent germ of perishing → necessary end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:FGS7","text":"Birth as entry into finite being → immanent determination of death → unity of birth and death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AF1","text":"Determinate existence → qualitative limit → immanent negation → negative being-within-self → becoming → finitude → necessary perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:AF2","text":"Externally possible change → distinction of the finite → rejection of mere contingency → determination of the end as the truth of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME1","text":"The limit is remapped from an external dividing line into a productive inner structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME2","text":"Non-being is reclassified from the counter-concept of being into the constitutive determination of finite being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME3","text":"Perishing is remapped from a possible event into an ontological necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME4","text":"Birth and death become visible not as separate processes, but as temporal explications of a shared finite ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ME5","text":"Rest and movement are ordered not as opposites of external states, but as the transition from affirmative determinacy to immanent negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — A something possesses a quality, is limited by it, and perishes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The limit negates determinate existence from within and generates the becoming of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation of the finite shifts from external change to immanent self-surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of the finite contains its non-being; its birth structurally coincides with the beginning of its death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from determinate existence to immanent limit, finitude, and necessary perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how negation is “developed” in detail and what mediation between limit, becoming, and end is formally required.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as finitude is determined by immanent negativity and not by external limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of the necessity of perishing from the self-relation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that the finite initially appears as affirmative, quiescent determinate existence, yet at the same time contains from the outset the germ of its perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDE0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument so long as “non-being,” “limit,” and “end” are not treated as separate external moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDE0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDE0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 26","title":"c. Finitude.","context":"Chapter 26","original_title":"c. Die Endlichkeit."},"original_title":"c. Die Endlichkeit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD","layer":"CH","title":"1. The Immediacy of Finitude.","order":27,"parents":["RAW_GB18_1DUD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DUD@R001","sha256":"a5dd5ed73e1507aa7a06dbf8682139f7cddddbd4e9530e1597f8bf55aa62098d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS1","text":"Das Argument bearbeitet den Widerspruch, dass Endlichkeit als Vergänglichkeit bestimmt und zugleich als unveränderliche letzte Bestimmung festgehalten wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS2","text":"Endlichkeit wird als qualitativ und an sich fixierte Negation bestimmt, die ihrem affirmativen Anderen schroff gegenübersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS3","text":"Die mögliche Aufhebung der Endlichkeit wird auf zwei Wege zugespitzt: affirmative Vereinigung mit dem Unendlichen oder Rückfall in das Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS4","text":"Die Vereinigung mit dem Unendlichen wird als unmöglich gesetzt, während das abstrakte Nichts den Widerspruch von Nichts und Bestehen wiederholt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS5","text":"Die Entwicklung des Endlichen lässt den Widerspruch nicht äußerlich bestehen, sondern im Endlichen selbst zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS6","text":"Die dialektische Bewegung endet nicht im bloßen Vergehen des Endlichen, sondern im Vergehen des Vergehens selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS7","text":"Die Argumentationsform ist immanent-diagnostisch: Fixierung → Gegensatz → Selbstwiderspruch → Selbstauflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A1","text":"Endlichkeit ist qualitative Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A2","text":"Endlichkeit ist als Negation an sich fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","text":"Endlichkeit geht nicht in ihr affirmatives Anderes über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","text":"Das Endliche ist zu seinem Ende bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A5","text":"Das Endliche ist untrennbar mit seinem Nichts gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A6","text":"Das Unendliche wird als Sein beziehungsweise absolutes Sein bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A7","text":"Das Endliche wird als Negatives des Unendlichen festgehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A8","text":"Eine affirmative Bestimmung des Endlichen könnte nur aus dem Affirmativen hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A9","text":"Die Vereinigung des Endlichen mit dem Unendlichen wird als unmöglich gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","text":"Wird das Ende des Endlichen als Nichts gefasst, kehrt die Bestimmung zum abstrakten Nichts zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A11","text":"Dem als bloßes Nichts gesetzten Nichts wird zugleich Existenz im Denken, Vorstellen oder Sprechen zugestanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A12","text":"Der Widerspruch zwischen Nichtigkeit und Bestehen ist in der Endlichkeit ausdrücklich enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX1","text":"Endlichkeit ist nicht ein affirmatives Sein neben ihrer negativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX2","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht ein Seiendes, dessen Endlichkeit sich von ihm ablösen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX3","text":"Endlichkeit ist nicht mit dem Unendlichen vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX4","text":"Das Endliche wird nicht durch affirmative Vereinigung mit dem Unendlichen erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX5","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht das Unvergängliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX6","text":"Das Ende des Endlichen ist nicht als endgültiges Nichts haltbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX7","text":"Das Vergehen ist nicht die letzte Bestimmung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX8","text":"Das abstrakte Nichts ist nicht widerspruchslos als existierend zu setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D1","text":"Die an sich fixierte Negation macht die Endlichkeit zur hartnäckigsten Kategorie des Verstandes.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A1","CH_GB18_1DUD:A2","CH_GB18_1DUD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D2","text":"Die Bestimmung des Endlichen als bloß zu seinem Ende bestimmt hält es in einer vom Affirmativen abgeschnittenen Negativität fest.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D3","text":"Die Behauptung der Unvereinbarkeit mit dem Unendlichen setzt das Endliche als dessen schlechthin entgegengesetzte Seite absolut fest.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A6","CH_GB18_1DUD:A7","CH_GB18_1DUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D4","text":"Die affirmative Aufhebung der Endlichkeit wird innerhalb der gesetzten Perspektive ausgeschlossen, weil sie deren Aufgehen im Unendlichen voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","CH_GB18_1DUD:A8","CH_GB18_1DUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D5","text":"Die Bestimmung des Endes als Nichts reproduziert den Widerspruch eines Nichts, dem zugleich Bestehen zugeschrieben wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","CH_GB18_1DUD:A11","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D6","text":"Die Endlichkeit fällt nicht lediglich durch Vergänglichkeit weg, sondern dadurch, dass ihre eigene letzte Negation widersprüchlich wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A5","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D7","text":"Die Auflösung des Endlichen muss als Auflösung der Letztgültigkeit des Vergehens bestimmt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD1","text":"Die Fixierung des Endlichen als schlechthin Negatives erzeugt gerade die Absolutheit, die sie dem Endlichen ausdrücklich verweigert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD2","text":"Die Behauptung, das Endliche sei nur vergänglich, verwandelt die Vergänglichkeit in eine unveränderliche und damit perennierende Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD3","text":"Die Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem macht das Endliche relational zum absoluten Gegenpol und verleiht ihm dadurch eine negative Absolutheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD4","text":"Die immanente Auflösung verschiebt den Gegenstand der Negation: Nicht nur das endliche Ding, sondern die Endgültigkeit seines Vergehens wird aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD5","text":"Das System benötigt das Affirmative als notwendiges Anderes der Endlichkeit, ohne dessen positive Bestimmung vollständig auszuarbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD6","text":"Die eigentliche dialektische Einheit entsteht nicht durch äußere Versöhnung von Endlichem und Unendlichem, sondern durch den Selbstverlust der fixierten Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Endlichkeit, deren Negation zugleich offen für den Übergang in ihr affirmatives Anderes bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Endliches, dessen Vergänglichkeit als vollständige und letzte Auflösung des Widerspruchs gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine stabile Koexistenz von Endlichem und Unendlichem als äußerlich getrennten Absolutheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Nichts, das als ontologisch letzter Zustand bestehen und zugleich gedacht oder ausgesprochen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine von außen kommende Versöhnung, die den im Endlichen enthaltenen Widerspruch unangetastet lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine positive Endbestimmung, die weder bloßes Nichts noch Übergang in das Affirmative wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX1","text":"Das System organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer vermittelnden positiven Bestimmung zwischen Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein Zustand, in dem das Endliche endlich bleibt und dennoch mit seinem affirmativen Anderen versöhnt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist ein letztes Nichts, dessen Negativität nicht selbst wieder negiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX4","text":"Die terminale Abwesenheit des Systems ist eine positive Bestimmung des Resultats; formal verfügbar bleibt nur die Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS1","text":"Die Maschine setzt Endlichkeit als qualitative, an sich fixierte Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS2","text":"Sie stellt diese fixierte Negation dem als absolutes Sein bestimmten Unendlichen gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS3","text":"Sie erzeugt daraus zwei mögliche Endpunkte: affirmative Vereinigung mit dem Unendlichen oder Ende im Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS4","text":"Sie verwirft die affirmative Vereinigung, weil die gesetzte Endlichkeit nicht in ihr Anderes übergehen darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS5","text":"Sie verwirft das abstrakte Nichts, weil ihm im Denken, Vorstellen oder Sprechen zugleich Bestehen zukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS6","text":"Sie verlagert den Widerspruch aus einer äußeren Gegenüberstellung in die innere Struktur des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS7","text":"Sie erzeugt die Auflösung, indem nicht nur das Endliche, sondern die Letztgültigkeit seines Vergehens vergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AF1","text":"Vergängliches Endliches → an sich fixierte Negation → absolute Gegenüberstellung zum Unendlichen → Ausschluss affirmativer Vereinigung → Rückfall in das widersprüchliche Nichts → immanenter Zusammenfall des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AF2","text":"Endlichkeit als letzte Bestimmung → Vergehen als vermeintliches Letztes → Vergehen des Vergehens → Aufhebung der bloßen Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME1","text":"Endlichkeit wird von einer bloßen Grenze zu einer fixierten Form der Negation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem erscheint nicht mehr als stabile Zweiheit, sondern als Erzeugnis derselben Fixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME3","text":"Vergänglichkeit wird von einem zeitlichen Vorgang zu einer ontologischen Behauptung über die Letztgültigkeit des Negativen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME4","text":"Das Nichts wird vom scheinbaren Endpunkt zu einer widersprüchlichen Wiederholung des Bestehens umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME5","text":"Auflösung wird nicht als Verschwinden eines Gegenstands, sondern als Aufhebung der letzten Negationsform bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME6","text":"Die Alternative „affirmative Vereinigung oder Nichts“ wird als unzureichendes Modell der Endlichkeit sichtbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT1","text":"Surface: Die Endlichkeit der Dinge wird als Vergänglichkeit und Bestimmung zum Untergang behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Endlichkeit wird durch die Fixierung der Negation vom affirmativen Sein getrennt und dadurch als absolute Gegenposition stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ersetzt die äußere Frage nach der Versöhnung durch die immanente Prüfung, ob die negative Bestimmung in sich bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Das zeitliche Vergehen wird selbst zum Gegenstand des Vergehens; kein negatives Resultat darf als letztes Sein bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der fixierten Endlichkeit zum Vergehen des Vergehens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der positive Gehalt des Affirmativen beziehungsweise des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo sie zeigt, dass die behauptete absolute Endlichkeit ihre eigene Bestimmung widerspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Unterscheidung zwischen dem bloßen Vergehen des Endlichen und dem Vergehen des Vergehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt davon ab, dass die Behauptung des Endlichen als Letztem als implizite Absolutsetzung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der notwendigen Bezugnahme auf das Affirmative und dessen fehlender positiver Ausarbeitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Auflösung als immanente Negation der letzten Negation und nicht als äußere Versöhnung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110314336858Z_92d1a29b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1. The Immediacy of Finitude.","source_sha256":"a5dd5ed73e1507aa7a06dbf8682139f7cddddbd4e9530e1597f8bf55aa62098d","sha256":"9ab5cb5af31c7bd7ed92a3cad97974bf0095dfbbac3d2db35cb6b837e3503fda","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:03:14.345883+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS1","text":"The argument addresses the contradiction that finitude is determined as perishability and at the same time maintained as an unchangeable final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS2","text":"Finitude is determined as qualitative negation fixed in itself, standing starkly opposed to its affirmative other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS3","text":"The possible sublation of finitude is sharpened into two paths: affirmative union with the infinite or relapse into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS4","text":"Union with the infinite is posited as impossible, while abstract nothing repeats the contradiction of nothing and subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS5","text":"The development of the finite does not leave the contradiction externally subsisting, but lets it collapse within the finite itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS6","text":"The dialectical movement ends not in the mere perishing of the finite, but in the perishing of perishing itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AS7","text":"The form of argumentation is immanent-diagnostic: fixation → opposition → self-contradiction → self-dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A1","text":"Finitude is qualitative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A2","text":"Finitude is fixed in itself as negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","text":"Finitude does not pass over into its affirmative other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","text":"The finite is determined for its end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A5","text":"The finite is posited as inseparable from its nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A6","text":"The infinite is determined as being, or absolute being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A7","text":"The finite is maintained as the negative of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A8","text":"An affirmative determination of the finite could arise only from the affirmative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A9","text":"The union of the finite with the infinite is posited as impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","text":"If the end of the finite is grasped as nothing, the determination returns to abstract nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A11","text":"Nothing, posited as mere nothing, is at the same time conceded existence in thinking, representing, or speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:A12","text":"The contradiction between nullity and subsistence is explicitly contained in finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX1","text":"Finitude is not an affirmative being alongside its negative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX2","text":"The finite is not a being whose finitude can be detached from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX3","text":"Finitude is not compatible with the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX4","text":"The finite is not preserved through affirmative union with the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX5","text":"The finite is not the imperishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX6","text":"The end of the finite cannot be maintained as definitive nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX7","text":"Perishing is not the final determination of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:NX8","text":"Abstract nothing cannot be posited without contradiction as existing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D1","text":"Negation fixed in itself makes finitude the most stubborn category of the understanding.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A1","CH_GB18_1DUD:A2","CH_GB18_1DUD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D2","text":"The determination of the finite as merely determined for its end holds it fast in a negativity cut off from the affirmative.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D3","text":"The assertion of incompatibility with the infinite fixes the finite absolutely as its utterly opposed side.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A6","CH_GB18_1DUD:A7","CH_GB18_1DUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D4","text":"The affirmative sublation of finitude is excluded within the posited perspective because it presupposes its absorption into the infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A3","CH_GB18_1DUD:A8","CH_GB18_1DUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D5","text":"The determination of the end as nothing reproduces the contradiction of a nothing to which subsistence is at the same time ascribed.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","CH_GB18_1DUD:A11","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D6","text":"Finitude does not fall away merely through perishability, but because its own ultimate negation becomes contradictory.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A5","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:D7","text":"The dissolution of the finite must be determined as the dissolution of the final validity of perishing.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DUD:A4","CH_GB18_1DUD:A10","CH_GB18_1DUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD1","text":"The fixation of the finite as absolutely negative produces precisely the absoluteness that it explicitly denies to the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD2","text":"The assertion that the finite is only perishable transforms perishability into an unchangeable and thus perduring determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD3","text":"The separation of finite and infinite makes the finite relative to the absolute counterpole and thereby confers upon it a negative absoluteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD4","text":"Immanent dissolution shifts the object of negation: not only the finite thing, but the finality of its perishing is sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD5","text":"The system requires the affirmative as the necessary other of finitude without fully elaborating its positive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SD6","text":"The proper dialectical unity arises not through an external reconciliation of finite and infinite, but through the self-loss of fixed negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a finitude whose negation at the same time remains open to transition into its affirmative other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a finite whose perishability can count as a complete and final dissolution of the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a stable coexistence of finite and infinite as externally separated absolutenesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a nothing that can subsist as an ontologically final state and at the same time be thought or uttered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a reconciliation coming from without that leaves untouched the contradiction contained in the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a positive final determination that would be neither mere nothing nor transition into the affirmative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX1","text":"The system organizes itself around the absence of a mediating positive determination between finitude and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a state in which the finite remains finite and is nevertheless reconciled with its affirmative other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a final nothing whose negativity is not itself once again negated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:SNX4","text":"The terminal absence of the system is a positive determination of the result; formally, only the negation of negation remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS1","text":"The machine posits finitude as qualitative negation fixed in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS2","text":"It opposes this fixed negation to the infinite determined as absolute being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS3","text":"From this it generates two possible endpoints: affirmative union with the infinite or an end in nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS4","text":"It rejects affirmative union because the posited finitude may not pass over into its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS5","text":"It rejects abstract nothing because subsistence at the same time belongs to it in thinking, representing, or speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS6","text":"It relocates the contradiction from an external opposition into the inner structure of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:FGS7","text":"It generates dissolution by having not only the finite, but the final validity of its perishing, perish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AF1","text":"Perishable finite → negation fixed in itself → absolute opposition to the infinite → exclusion of affirmative union → relapse into contradictory nothing → immanent collapse of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:AF2","text":"Finitude as final determination → perishing as supposedly final → perishing of perishing → sublation of mere finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME1","text":"Finitude is remapped from a mere limit into a fixed form of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME2","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite no longer appears as a stable duality, but as a product of the same fixation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME3","text":"Perishability is reclassified from a temporal process into an ontological assertion concerning the final validity of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME4","text":"Nothing is remapped from an apparent endpoint into a contradictory repetition of subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME5","text":"Dissolution is determined not as the disappearance of an object, but as the sublation of the final form of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ME6","text":"The alternative “affirmative union or nothing” is made visible as an inadequate model of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT1","text":"Surface: The finitude of things is treated as perishability and determination for ruin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT2","text":"Structural: Through the fixation of negation, finitude is separated from affirmative being and thereby stabilized as an absolute counterposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text replaces the external question of reconciliation with the immanent examination of whether the negative determination can subsist within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Temporal perishing itself becomes the object of perishing; no negative result may remain as final being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from fixed finitude to the perishing of perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT2","text":"The positive content of the affirmative or of the infinite remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent where it shows that the asserted absolute finitude contradicts its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the distinction between the mere perishing of the finite and the perishing of perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on reading the assertion of the finite as final as an implicit absolutization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT6","text":"Unresolved remains the tension between the necessary reference to the affirmative and its absent positive elaboration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DUD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement insofar as dissolution is understood as the immanent negation of the final negation and not as external reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DUD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_1DUD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 27","title":"1. The Immediacy of Finitude.","context":"Chapter 27","original_title":"1. Die Unmittelbarkeit der Endlichkeit."},"original_title":"1. Die Unmittelbarkeit der Endlichkeit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU","layer":"CH","title":"2. The Limit and the Ought.","order":28,"parents":["RAW_GB18_2DSU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DSU@R001","sha256":"d9734d52ebc8025dfbc14fe2bf17e40ed93f8d96968ecce1840d5c340b5fde76","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS1","text":"Der abstrakte Widerspruch des Endlichen wird als innere Struktur des reflektierten Etwas rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS2","text":"Das Etwas besitzt als Insichseyn eine Bestimmung, eine Beschaffenheit und eine ihm immanente Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS3","text":"Das Andersseyn gehört zugleich zum Ansichseyn des Etwas und bleibt als Äußerlichkeit von ihm unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS4","text":"Die immanente Grenze wird als Negation der Negation zur Schranke und als negative Beziehung auf diese Schranke zum Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS5","text":"Das Endliche bestimmt sich als Beziehung seiner Bestimmung auf seine Grenze, wobei die Bestimmung Sollen und die Grenze Schranke ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS6","text":"Das Sollen geht über die Schranke hinaus, besitzt die Schranke aber nur durch dieses Hinausgehen; beide Momente bleiben untrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","text":"Das endliche Etwas ist nicht abstraktes Seyn, sondern in sich reflektiertes Insichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A2","text":"Das Insichseyn des Etwas enthält eine Bestimmung und eine Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A3","text":"Das Insichseyn des Etwas enthält eine ihm immanente Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A4","text":"Die Grenze ist die Qualität des Insichseyns und konstituiert die Endlichkeit des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","text":"Die Bestimmung enthält das Andersseyn als dem Ansichseyn des Etwas zugehörig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A6","text":"Das Andersseyn ist zugleich innere Bestimmtheit des Etwas und von ihm unterschiedene Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","text":"Die Grenze ist als Negation der Negation die Beziehung zwischen dem Etwas und dem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A8","text":"Das mit sich identische Insichseyn bezieht sich auf sein eigenes Nichtseyn und erhält darin das Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","text":"Die als wesentliches Negatives gesetzte immanente Grenze ist Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A10","text":"Die Schranke ist das Gemeinschaftliche des Etwas und des Anderen sowie die Bestimmtheit des Ansichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","text":"Das Ansichseyn als negative Beziehung auf die eigene Schranke ist Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A12","text":"Das Sollen enthält die Bestimmung sowohl als Ansichseyn gegen die Negation als auch als Nichtseyn in Gestalt der Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","text":"Das Endliche ist die Beziehung seiner Bestimmung auf seine Grenze, wobei die Bestimmung Sollen und die Grenze Schranke ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A14","text":"Sollen und Schranke sind beide endlich, wobei nur die Schranke als endlich gesetzt und das Sollen nur an sich beschränkt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A15","text":"Was seyn soll, ist zugleich und ist nicht; deshalb enthält das Sollen wesentlich eine Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A16","text":"Die Schranke ist keine fremde Bestimmung, sondern die eigene Bestimmung des Etwas in ihrer gesetzten Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","text":"Das Sollen geht über die Schranke hinaus, indem es ihre Aufhebung als sein Ansichseyn setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A18","text":"Das Etwas hat nur als Sollen eine Schranke, und das Sollen ist nur durch seine Schranke Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX1","text":"Die Grenze des Endlichen ist kein äußerliches oder fremdes Hindernis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX2","text":"Das Andersseyn ist nicht bloß äußerliche Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX3","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht bloß Grenze, sondern als wesentliches Negatives Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX4","text":"Die Negation der Grenze tilgt die Grenze nicht einseitig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX5","text":"Das Sollen ist kein schrankenloses Ansichseyn außerhalb der Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX6","text":"Die Schranke ist keine von der Bestimmung unabhängige Setzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX7","text":"Das Hinausgehen über die Schranke ist keine Trennung von der Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX8","text":"Das Sollen und die Schranke sind keine voneinander isolierbaren Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D1","text":"Die Endlichkeit wird durch die immanente Grenze als Qualität des Insichseyns bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","CH_GB18_2DSU:A3","CH_GB18_2DSU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D2","text":"Das Andersseyn wird aus einer äußerlichen Gegenüberstellung in eine innere Bestimmung des Etwas überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","CH_GB18_2DSU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","text":"Die Selbstidentität des Etwas besteht in der Beziehung auf sein eigenes Nichtseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","CH_GB18_2DSU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D4","text":"Die Grenze wird zur Schranke, sobald sie als negative und zugleich wesentliche Bestimmung des Etwas gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A8","CH_GB18_2DSU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D5","text":"Die Schranke verbindet das Etwas mit dem Anderen, weil sie gemeinsamer Bezugspunkt beider ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","CH_GB18_2DSU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D6","text":"Das Sollen entsteht aus der negativen Beziehung des Ansichseyns auf die eigene Schranke.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A10","CH_GB18_2DSU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D7","text":"Die Bestimmung des Sollen ist doppelt bestimmt: als gegen die Negation behauptetes Ansichseyn und als von ihm unterschiedenes Nichtseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","CH_GB18_2DSU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","text":"Die Bestimmung und die Grenze werden als zwei Momente derselben Relation des Endlichen identifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A12","CH_GB18_2DSU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D9","text":"Die Beschränkung des Sollens ist vorhanden, bleibt aber in seinem Ansichseyn eingehüllt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","CH_GB18_2DSU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D10","text":"Das Sollen ist nur deshalb ein Sollen, weil sein Inhalt zugleich als seiend und als nichtseiend bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A14","CH_GB18_2DSU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D11","text":"Die eigene Bestimmung des Etwas erweist sich als Schranke, weil sie zugleich nur Bestimmtheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A15","CH_GB18_2DSU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","text":"Das Hinausgehen über die Schranke ist die Aufhebung derselben Bestimmtheit, die als Negation die Schranke bildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A16","CH_GB18_2DSU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D13","text":"Das Sollen ist über seine Schranke erhaben, ohne außerhalb der Schranke zu stehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","CH_GB18_2DSU:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD1","text":"Die Endlichkeit ist keine äußerlich auferlegte Begrenzung, sondern eine Selbstbeziehung, in der die Bestimmung ihre eigene Negation hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D1","CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","CH_GB18_2DSU:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD2","text":"Das Sollen ist keine externe Norm, sondern die immanente Form, in der das Endliche seine eigene Schranke negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D6","CH_GB18_2DSU:D7","CH_GB18_2DSU:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD3","text":"Das Hinausgehen über die Schranke erzeugt keine endgültige Befreiung von ihr, sondern reproduziert die Beziehung, durch die sie besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","CH_GB18_2DSU:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD4","text":"Identität und Andersseyn bleiben innerhalb einer einzigen negativen Vermittlungsstruktur miteinander verbunden.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D2","CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","CH_GB18_2DSU:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD5","text":"Die Aufhebung der Schranke ist nur als Bestimmung des Sollens möglich und setzt dadurch die Schranke als aufgehobene Schranke voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","CH_GB18_2DSU:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD6","text":"Die Dialektik des Endlichen erzeugt eine asymmetrische Ebenenordnung, in der die Schranke gesetzt endlich und das Sollen nur an sich beschränkt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","CH_GB18_2DSU:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Endliches aus, dessen Schranke ausschließlich von außen an es herantritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt ein reines Ansichseyn aus, das nicht zugleich Beziehung auf sein eigenes Nichtseyn wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine Bestimmung aus, die nur positive Identität und nicht zugleich Negation wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt ein Sollen aus, das unabhängig von einer bestimmten Schranke bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine Negation aus, die ihr Negiertes vollständig verschwinden ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt eine Aufhebung aus, die keine fortbestehende Beziehung zur aufgehobenen Schranke enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX7","text":"Das System schließt eine endgültige Trennung von Bestimmung und Beschränkung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines in sich vollendeten, schrankenlosen Endlichen bleibt ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX2","text":"Ein äußerer Standpunkt jenseits der Schranke, von dem aus das Endliche sie verlassen könnte, steht nicht zur Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX3","text":"Eine reine Gegenwart des Seienden und eine reine Abwesenheit des Seienden werden gleichermaßen ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX4","text":"Eine Auflösung des Widerspruchs durch Entfernung eines seiner Momente bleibt unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines Sollens ohne immanente Negation bildet die versperrte Gegenfolie der gesamten Konstruktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX6","text":"Die Möglichkeit, über die Schranke hinauszugehen, ohne durch sie bestimmt zu bleiben, wird nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS1","text":"Reflektiertes Etwas → Insichseyn → Bestimmung und Beschaffenheit → immanente Grenze.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","CH_GB18_2DSU:A2","CH_GB18_2DSU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS2","text":"Immanente Grenze → Andersseyn als innere und äußere Bestimmung → Beziehung zwischen Etwas und Anderem.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","CH_GB18_2DSU:A6","CH_GB18_2DSU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS3","text":"Beziehung auf eigenes Nichtseyn → Negation der Negation → erhaltenes Daseyn innerhalb der Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","CH_GB18_2DSU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS4","text":"Wesentlich negatives Andersseyn → Grenze als Schranke → gemeinsame Bestimmtheit von Etwas und Anderem.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","CH_GB18_2DSU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS5","text":"Negative Beziehung des Ansichseyns auf die Schranke → Sollen → doppelte Bestimmung von Ansichseyn und Nichtseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","CH_GB18_2DSU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS6","text":"Bestimmung zur Grenze → Endlichkeit als Relation → Bestimmung als Sollen und Grenze als Schranke.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","CH_GB18_2DSU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS7","text":"Sollen → Aufhebung der Schranke → Hinausgehen über die Schranke → erneute Bestimmung des Sollens durch die Schranke.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","CH_GB18_2DSU:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AF1","text":"Abstrakter Widerspruch des Endlichen → reflektiertes Insichseyn → immanente Grenze → Andersseyn als Negation der Negation → Grenze als Schranke → negative Beziehung als Sollen → Hinausgehen über die Schranke → untrennbare Einheit von Sollen und Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AF2","text":"Bestimmung → eigene Negation → Schranke → Aufhebung der Schranke → Bestimmung als Sollen → Schranke als notwendige Bedingung des Hinausgehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME1","text":"Das Endliche wird von einem begrenzten Ding in eine Relation von Bestimmung, Grenze und Negation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME2","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer äußerlichen Markierung in eine immanente Schranke transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Innerem und Äußerem wird als gleichzeitige innere Zugehörigkeit und äußere Unterscheidung reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME4","text":"Das Sollen wird nicht mehr als äußerer Anspruch, sondern als negative Selbstbeziehung des Endlichen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME5","text":"Hinausgehen und Begrenzung werden nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als wechselseitig konstituierende Momente kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME6","text":"Die Kategorie der Aufhebung wird als Erhaltung einer negierten Bestimmung und nicht als bloße Entfernung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Etwas besitzt eine Grenze; diese Grenze wird als Schranke und Sollen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Grenze vermittelt Bestimmung, Andersseyn, Negation und die Beziehung des Etwas auf sein eigenes Nichtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Hinausgehen über eine Schranke wird als immanente Aufhebung und nicht als äußerer Ausbruch organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Endliche ist zugleich seiend und nichtseiend; seine Bestimmung bleibt als aufgehobene Schranke wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Erzeugung von Grenze, Schranke und Sollen aus dem reflektierten Etwas zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die eigenständige Funktion der Beschaffenheit gegenüber der Bestimmung, da beide für die weitere Ableitung zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Negation der Negation als Erhaltung und Umformung des Negierten verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung des Sollens aus der immanenten Grenze statt aus einer äußeren Vorschrift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass das Sollen über die Schranke hinausgeht und nur durch diese Schranke Sollen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung liegt darin, dass die Grenze zugleich Bestimmung, Nichtseyn, Schranke und aufgehobene Schranke bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom abstrakten Widerspruch zur wechselseitigen Konstitution von Sollen und Schranke, sofern die widersprüchlichen Identitätssetzungen nicht geglättet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110358379883Z_0144bf36","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2. The Barrier and the Ought.","source_sha256":"d9734d52ebc8025dfbc14fe2bf17e40ed93f8d96968ecce1840d5c340b5fde76","sha256":"20378a074d0c32a7365dcb852834dad0b8be2324a7ca1e18c1321f8c1dc097e6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:03:58.382788+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS1","text":"The abstract contradiction of the finite is reconstructed as the inner structure of the reflected something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS2","text":"As being-in-itself, the something possesses a determination, a constitution, and a limit immanent to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS3","text":"Otherness belongs at the same time to the in-itself of the something and remains distinguished from it as externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS4","text":"The immanent limit becomes, as negation of negation, the barrier, and as negative relation to this barrier, the ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS5","text":"The finite determines itself as the relation of its determination to its limit, whereby the determination is ought and the limit is barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AS6","text":"The ought goes beyond the barrier, but possesses the barrier only through this going-beyond; both moments remain inseparable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","text":"The finite something is not abstract being, but being-in-itself reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A2","text":"The being-in-itself of the something contains a determination and a constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A3","text":"The being-in-itself of the something contains a limit immanent to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A4","text":"The limit is the quality of being-in-itself and constitutes the finitude of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","text":"The determination contains otherness as belonging to the in-itself of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A6","text":"Otherness is at once the inner determinateness of the something and an externality distinguished from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","text":"As negation of negation, the limit is the relation between the something and the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A8","text":"Being-in-itself identical with itself relates to its own non-being and thereby preserves determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","text":"The immanent limit posited as essential negative is barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A10","text":"The barrier is what is common to the something and the other, as well as the determinateness of being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","text":"The in-itself as negative relation to its own barrier is ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A12","text":"The ought contains determination both as in-itself against negation and as non-being in the form of the barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","text":"The finite is the relation of its determination to its limit, whereby the determination is ought and the limit is barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A14","text":"Ought and barrier are both finite, whereby only the barrier is posited as finite and the ought is limited only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A15","text":"What ought to be is at once is and is not; therefore the ought essentially contains a barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A16","text":"The barrier is not an alien determination, but the proper determination of the something in its posited finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","text":"The ought goes beyond the barrier by positing its sublation as its in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:A18","text":"The something has a barrier only as ought, and the ought is ought only through its barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX1","text":"The limit of the finite is not an external or alien impediment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX2","text":"Otherness is not merely external externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX3","text":"The limit is not merely limit, but, as essential negative, barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX4","text":"The negation of the limit does not unilaterally annul the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX5","text":"The ought is not a barrierless in-itself outside determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX6","text":"The barrier is not a positing independent of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX7","text":"Going beyond the barrier is not a separation from the barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:NX8","text":"The ought and the barrier are not determinations isolable from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D1","text":"Finitude is determined through the immanent limit as the quality of being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","CH_GB18_2DSU:A3","CH_GB18_2DSU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D2","text":"Otherness is transferred from an external opposition into an inner determination of the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","CH_GB18_2DSU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","text":"The self-identity of the something consists in the relation to its own non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","CH_GB18_2DSU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D4","text":"The limit becomes barrier as soon as it is posited as a negative and at the same time essential determination of the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A8","CH_GB18_2DSU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D5","text":"The barrier connects the something with the other because it is the common point of reference of both.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","CH_GB18_2DSU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D6","text":"The ought arises from the negative relation of the in-itself to its own barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A10","CH_GB18_2DSU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D7","text":"The determination of the ought is doubly determined: as in-itself asserted against negation and as non-being distinguished from it.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","CH_GB18_2DSU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","text":"Determination and limit are identified as two moments of the same relation of the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A12","CH_GB18_2DSU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D9","text":"The limitation of the ought is present, but remains enveloped in its in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","CH_GB18_2DSU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D10","text":"The ought is an ought only because its content is determined at once as being and as non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A14","CH_GB18_2DSU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D11","text":"The proper determination of the something proves to be barrier because it is at the same time only determinateness.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A15","CH_GB18_2DSU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","text":"Going beyond the barrier is the sublation of that same determinateness which, as negation, constitutes the barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A16","CH_GB18_2DSU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:D13","text":"The ought is above its barrier without standing outside the barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","CH_GB18_2DSU:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD1","text":"Finitude is not an externally imposed limitation, but a self-relation in which determination brings forth its own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D1","CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","CH_GB18_2DSU:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD2","text":"The ought is not an external norm, but the immanent form in which the finite negates its own barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D6","CH_GB18_2DSU:D7","CH_GB18_2DSU:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD3","text":"Going beyond the barrier produces no final liberation from it, but reproduces the relation through which it subsists.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","CH_GB18_2DSU:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD4","text":"Identity and otherness remain connected with one another within a single structure of negative mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D2","CH_GB18_2DSU:D3","CH_GB18_2DSU:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD5","text":"The sublation of the barrier is possible only as a determination of the ought and thereby presupposes the barrier as sublated barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","CH_GB18_2DSU:D12","CH_GB18_2DSU:D13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SD6","text":"The dialectic of the finite produces an asymmetric ordering of levels, in which the barrier is posited as finite and the ought is limited only in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:D8","CH_GB18_2DSU:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a finite whose barrier approaches it exclusively from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a pure in-itself that would not at the same time be relation to its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX3","text":"The system excludes a determination that would be only positive identity and not at the same time negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX4","text":"The system excludes an ought that could subsist independently of a determinate barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a negation that would cause what it negates to disappear completely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX6","text":"The system excludes a sublation that contained no continuing relation to the sublated barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:DNX7","text":"The system excludes a final separation of determination and limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a finite complete in itself and without barriers remains excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX2","text":"An external standpoint beyond the barrier, from which the finite could leave it, is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX3","text":"A pure presence of being and a pure absence of being are equally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX4","text":"A resolution of contradiction through the removal of one of its moments remains inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX5","text":"The possibility of an ought without immanent negation forms the blocked counterfoil of the entire construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:SNX6","text":"The possibility of going beyond the barrier without remaining determined by it is not admitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS1","text":"Reflected something → being-in-itself → determination and constitution → immanent limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A1","CH_GB18_2DSU:A2","CH_GB18_2DSU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS2","text":"Immanent limit → otherness as inner and external determination → relation between something and other.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A5","CH_GB18_2DSU:A6","CH_GB18_2DSU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS3","text":"Relation to its own non-being → negation of negation → preserved determinate being within self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A7","CH_GB18_2DSU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS4","text":"Essentially negative otherness → limit as barrier → common determinateness of something and other.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A9","CH_GB18_2DSU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS5","text":"Negative relation of the in-itself to the barrier → ought → double determination of in-itself and non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A11","CH_GB18_2DSU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS6","text":"Determination to limit → finitude as relation → determination as ought and limit as barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A13","CH_GB18_2DSU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:FGS7","text":"Ought → sublation of the barrier → going beyond the barrier → renewed determination of the ought through the barrier.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DSU:A17","CH_GB18_2DSU:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AF1","text":"Abstract contradiction of the finite → reflected being-in-itself → immanent limit → otherness as negation of negation → limit as barrier → negative relation as ought → going beyond the barrier → inseparable unity of ought and barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:AF2","text":"Determination → own negation → barrier → sublation of the barrier → determination as ought → barrier as necessary condition of going-beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME1","text":"The finite is remapped from a limited thing into a relation of determination, limit, and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME2","text":"The limit is transformed from an external marking into an immanent barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME3","text":"The opposition of inner and outer is reorganized as simultaneous inner belonging and external distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME4","text":"The ought becomes visible no longer as an external demand, but as the negative self-relation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME5","text":"Going-beyond and limitation are mapped not as opposites, but as mutually constituting moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ME6","text":"The category of sublation is reclassified as preservation of a negated determination and not as mere removal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT1","text":"Surface — The something possesses a limit; this limit is determined as barrier and ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT2","text":"Structural — The limit mediates determination, otherness, negation, and the relation of the something to its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Going beyond a barrier is organized as immanent sublation and not as external escape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The finite is at once being and non-being; its determination remains effective as sublated barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the generation of limit, barrier, and ought from the reflected something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT2","text":"The independent function of constitution in relation to determination remains underdetermined, since both coincide for the further derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the negation of negation is understood as preservation and transformation of what is negated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of the ought from the immanent limit rather than from an external prescription.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT5","text":"The central unresolved tension consists in the fact that the ought goes beyond the barrier and is ought only through this barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT6","text":"A second tension lies in the fact that the limit remains at once determination, non-being, barrier, and sublated barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DSU:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from abstract contradiction to the reciprocal constitution of ought and barrier, provided that the contradictory positings of identity are not smoothed over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DSU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DSU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_2DSU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 28","title":"2. The Limit and the Ought.","context":"Chapter 28","original_title":"2. Die Schranke und das Sollen."},"original_title":"2. Die Schranke und das Sollen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":29,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_3"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_3@R001","sha256":"fc1658725e665ae34b59e0b3e7a8297ed1f37977caa41ba21c71dfaf6bbd0787","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS1","text":"Das Sollen beansprucht, die Identität von Ansichsein und Bestimmtheit zu vermitteln, erzeugt aber zugleich den Widerspruch von Können und Nichtkönnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS2","text":"Die Bestimmung von etwas als Schranke setzt bereits dessen Verhältnis zu einem Unbeschränkten und damit ein Hinausgehen über die Schranke voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS3","text":"Konkrete Existenzformen vollziehen das Hinausgehen über ihre Schranken als immanente Entwicklung, Trieb, Schmerz, Denken oder Selbstveränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS4","text":"Das bloße Hinausgehen bleibt als Sollen endlich und unvollkommen; es ist keine wahrhafte Befreiung und keine affirmative Aufhebung der Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS5","text":"Das Sollen besitzt endliche Geltung als Norm gegen besonderen Willen und Interesse, kann aber nicht als letzter wahrer Standpunkt gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS6","text":"Die Erhebung des Sollens zum höchsten Auflösungspunkt konserviert Endlichkeit und Widerspruch, statt sie aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","text":"Das Sollen ist Hinaussein über die Schranke und enthält deren Aufgehobensein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","text":"Das Ansichsein des Sollens ist abstrakte Selbstbeziehung und daher Abstraktion des Könnens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","text":"Das Sollen enthält die Schranke als qualitative Andersheit gegen die formale Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A4","text":"Die Beziehung von formaler Möglichkeit und qualitativer Schranke ist widersprüchlich und erzeugt Unmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","text":"Eine Schranke ist nur als Gegensatz zu ihrem Anderen, dem Unbeschränkten, bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","text":"Was einen Begriff als für sich seiende Totalität enthält, vollzieht seine Überschreitung der Schranke aus sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A7","text":"Schmerz setzt voraus, dass eine Negation innerhalb eines Selbst als dessen Schranke empfunden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A8","text":"Denken und Vernunft sind als Allgemeines ihrem Begriff nach über jede Besonderheit und damit über jede Schranke hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A9","text":"Nicht jedes Hinausgehen über eine Schranke ist wahre Befreiung oder wahre Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","text":"Das Sollen ist ein endliches Hinausgehen und hat deshalb seinen Ort nur innerhalb der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","text":"Die Pflicht erhält ihre Bestimmtheit als Sollen im Gegensatz zu besonderem Willen, selbstsüchtiger Begierde und willkürlichem Interesse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","text":"Ein perennierendes Sollen wäre die Absolutsetzung der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A13","text":"Die Bestimmung des Sollens als höchster Vernunftauflösung ist ein Beharren im Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX1","text":"Das Sollen ist nicht einseitig die Garantie des Könnens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX2","text":"Eine Schranke ist nicht eine schlechthin unüberschreitbare Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX3","text":"Denken ist nicht innerhalb einer ihm äußerlich gesetzten Schranke eingeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX4","text":"Das abstrakte Allgemeine ist nicht schon konkrete Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX5","text":"Moralität ist nicht dadurch zerstört, dass das Sollen nicht als letztes Wahres anerkannt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX6","text":"Das Sollen ist nicht als absoluter und dauerhafter Zustand der Vernunft zulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX7","text":"Die kantisch-fichtesche Auflösung des Vernunftwiderspruchs ist keine wirkliche Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D1","text":"Die Erkenntnis einer Schranke vollzieht bereits den Begriff ihres Überschreitens.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D2","text":"Das Sollen erzeugt zugleich eine abstrakte Möglichkeit und deren qualitative Unmöglichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D3","text":"Endliche Existenz ist nur dort als Schranke wirksam, wo die Negation als Negation für ein Selbst erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","CH_GB18_AN_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D4","text":"Die Behauptung einer unüberschreitbaren Denkgrenze widerspricht dem Begriff des Denkens als Allgemeinem.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D5","text":"Das moralische Sollen ist innerhalb der Endlichkeit normativ gültig, aber als absolute Wahrheit unzureichend.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D6","text":"Die Erhebung des Sollens zur endgültigen Versöhnung hält gerade die Trennung von Ansichsein und Dasein fest.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD1","text":"Die Formel des moralischen Imperativs ist strukturell reversibel: Aus dem Sollen folgt sowohl Können als auch Nichtkönnen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD2","text":"Jede als Schranke begriffene Bestimmtheit wird zu einem Verhältnis von Endlichkeit und über sie hinausweisendem Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD3","text":"Die Negation ist in lebendiger und denkender Existenz nicht bloß äußerer Widerstand, sondern immanenter Motor ihrer Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","CH_GB18_AN_3:A7","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD4","text":"Die moralische Norm kann nur als endliche Vermittlungsform bestehen; ihre Verabsolutierung verwandelt Vermittlung in dauerhaften Widerspruch.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist das Modell einer Schranke, die ohne Bezug auf ein Anderes und Unbeschränktes als Schranke bestehen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein autonomer Möglichkeitsbegriff, der von qualitativer Andersheit und realer Schranke unabhängig wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Denken, das sich als über der Wirklichkeit stehend auffasst, ohne zugleich begrifflich und wirklichkeitsgemäß zu sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine letzte Wahrheit, die als bloßes Ansichsein von ihrer wirklichen Ausführung getrennt bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX1","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit eines endgültigen Standpunkts, in dem das Sollen selbst dauerhaft die Form der Wahrheit wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX2","text":"Verwehrt ist die Gleichsetzung von Freiheit mit der subjektiven Aneignung einer vorgegebenen Richtung innerhalb eines nicht begriffenen Feldes von Möglichkeiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX3","text":"Verwehrt ist die Gleichsetzung des abstrakten Unendlichen mit der vollzogenen Aufhebung der Endlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A9","CH_GB18_AN_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS1","text":"Schranke setzen → Anderes und Unbeschränktes implizieren → Überschreitung bereits im Schrankenbegriff erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS2","text":"Sollen bestimmen → abstraktes Können erzeugen → reale Schranke einsetzen → Widerspruch und Unmöglichkeit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS3","text":"Immanente Negation empfinden oder begreifen → Schranke als eigene Negation erfahren → Selbstüberschreitung vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS4","text":"Abstraktes Hinausgehen prüfen → dessen Endlichkeit feststellen → wahre Befreiung vom bloßen Sollen unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS5","text":"Sollen in der Endlichkeit lokalisieren → moralische Geltung bewahren → absolute Geltung entziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS6","text":"Sollen als höchste Auflösung behaupten → Endlichkeit verewigen → Auflösung als Beharren im Widerspruch ausweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF1","text":"Absolutes Sollen → Doppelstruktur von Können und Unmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF2","text":"Schrankenbehauptung → implizites Unbeschränktes → Widerlegung der Unüberschreitbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF3","text":"Immanente Negation → Trieb, Schmerz oder Denken → konkrete Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF4","text":"Konkrete Überschreitung → Unterscheidung von abstraktem und wahrhaftem Hinausgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF5","text":"Endliche Normgeltung → Entzug absoluter Letztgeltung → Kritik des perennierenden Sollens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF6","text":"Kantisch-fichtesches Sollen → behauptete Vernunftauflösung → Fortbestand des Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME1","text":"Grenzen werden von bloßen Verboten zu relationalen Bestimmungen umklassifiziert, deren Begriff ihr Jenseits mitenthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME2","text":"Möglichkeit wird nicht mehr als reine formale Ressource behandelt, sondern als durch reale Schranke widersprüchlich begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME3","text":"Schmerz, Trieb, organische Entwicklung und Denken erscheinen als abgestufte Formen immanenter Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME4","text":"Moralische Pflicht wird von einer absoluten Ontologie der Vernunft zu einer gültigen, aber endlichen Gegeninstanz gegen partikulären Willen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME5","text":"Freiheit wird als Verhältnis zu einem allgemeinen Feld möglicher Richtungen bestimmt, nicht als bloßes Bewusstsein einer faktischen Richtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Sollen wird als Verhältnis von Pflicht, Möglichkeit, Grenze und moralischem Anspruch untersucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Schranke, Andersheit, Ansichsein, Dasein und Unendlichkeit bilden eine immanente Widerspruchsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der Verteidigung des Sollens auf die Unterscheidung seiner endlichen Geltung von seiner unzulässigen Verabsolutierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Endlichkeit ist nicht statische Begrenzung, sondern eine sich aufhebende Form, deren Verharren als Sollen den Widerspruch perpetuiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die doppelte Bestimmung des Sollens als Überschreitung und Schranke sowie dessen endliche Normgeltung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich der positiven Gestalt wahrhafter Befreiung unterbestimmt, weil der Text das unvollkommene Hinausgehen bestimmt, seine vollendete Affirmation jedoch nicht ausführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT3","text":"Die innere Kohärenz hängt an der Unterscheidung zwischen einer Schranke als bloßer Endlichkeit und einer Schranke als für ein Selbst bestimmten Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die immanente Widerlegung der Behauptung unüberschreitbarer Grenzen durch den Begriff der Schranke selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Bruchlinie besteht zwischen der Anerkennung des Sollens als notwendiger endlicher Normform und seiner Bestimmung als Widerspruchsform, deren positive Aufhebung nicht entwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT6","text":"Die Kritik der kantisch-fichteschen Position beruht auf ihrer Reduktion auf einen höchsten Standpunkt des Sollens; eine interne Differenzierung dieser Positionen wird nicht geliefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT7","text":"Die rekonstruierte Maschine bewahrt die Bewegung von der Grenzdiagnose über die immanente Überschreitung zur Begrenzung des Sollens als letztgültiger Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111157030414Z_ad355436","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"fc1658725e665ae34b59e0b3e7a8297ed1f37977caa41ba21c71dfaf6bbd0787","sha256":"14ad4ce5e2a437ba4eab3ad4bf4db87e44058c0ececb443f8044c0129b1c7ece","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:11:57.031417+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS1","text":"The ought claims to mediate the identity of being-in-itself and determinacy, but at the same time produces the contradiction of can and cannot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS2","text":"The determination of something as a limit already presupposes its relation to an unlimited and thus a going-beyond the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS3","text":"Concrete forms of existence enact the going-beyond their limits as immanent development, drive, pain, thinking, or self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS4","text":"Mere going-beyond remains finite and imperfect as ought; it is no true liberation and no affirmative sublation of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS5","text":"The ought possesses finite validity as a norm against particular will and interest, but cannot count as the final true standpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AS6","text":"The elevation of the ought to the highest point of resolution preserves finitude and contradiction instead of sublating them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","text":"The ought is a going-beyond the limit and contains its sublatedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","text":"The being-in-itself of the ought is abstract self-relation and therefore abstraction from can.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","text":"The ought contains the limit as qualitative otherness over against formal possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A4","text":"The relation of formal possibility and qualitative limit is contradictory and produces impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","text":"A limit is determined only as an opposition to its other, the unlimited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","text":"That which contains a concept as a totality existing for itself enacts its transgression of the limit from out of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A7","text":"Pain presupposes that a negation within a self is felt as its limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A8","text":"Thinking and reason, as the universal, are according to their concept beyond every particularity and thus beyond every limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A9","text":"Not every going-beyond a limit is true liberation or true affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","text":"The ought is a finite going-beyond and therefore has its place only within finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","text":"Duty receives its determinacy as ought in opposition to particular will, selfish desire, and arbitrary interest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","text":"A perennial ought would be the absolutization of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:A13","text":"The determination of the ought as the highest resolution of reason is a persistence in contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX1","text":"The ought is not one-sidedly the guarantee of can.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX2","text":"A limit is not an absolutely insurmountable boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX3","text":"Thinking is not enclosed within a limit externally imposed upon it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX4","text":"The abstract universal is not already concrete liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX5","text":"Morality is not destroyed by the fact that the ought is not recognized as the final true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX6","text":"The ought is not admissible as an absolute and enduring state of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:NX7","text":"The Kantian-Fichtean resolution of the contradiction of reason is no actual resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D1","text":"The cognition of a limit already enacts the concept of its transgression.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D2","text":"The ought simultaneously produces an abstract possibility and its qualitative impossibility.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D3","text":"Finite existence is effective as a limit only where negation appears as negation for a self.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","CH_GB18_AN_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D4","text":"The assertion of an insurmountable limit of thinking contradicts the concept of thinking as universal.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D5","text":"The moral ought is normatively valid within finitude, but inadequate as absolute truth.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:D6","text":"The elevation of the ought to final reconciliation holds fast precisely to the separation of being-in-itself and existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD1","text":"The formula of the moral imperative is structurally reversible: from the ought follows both can and cannot.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A2","CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD2","text":"Every determinacy conceived as a limit becomes a relation of finitude and an other pointing beyond it.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD3","text":"In living and thinking existence, negation is not merely external resistance, but the immanent motor of its self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A6","CH_GB18_AN_3:A7","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SD4","text":"The moral norm can exist only as a finite form of mediation; its absolutization transforms mediation into enduring contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A11","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the model of a limit that could exist as a limit without relation to an other and to the unlimited.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an autonomous concept of possibility that would be independent of qualitative otherness and real limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A3","CH_GB18_AN_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a thinking that conceives itself as standing above actuality without at the same time being conceptual and adequate to actuality.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a final truth that, as mere being-in-itself, remains separated from its actual execution.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A1","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX1","text":"Denied is the possibility of a final standpoint in which the ought itself would enduringly be the form of truth.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A10","CH_GB18_AN_3:A12","CH_GB18_AN_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX2","text":"Denied is the identification of freedom with the subjective appropriation of a given direction within an uncomprehended field of possibilities.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A5","CH_GB18_AN_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:SNX3","text":"Denied is the identification of the abstract infinite with the accomplished sublation of finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_3:A9","CH_GB18_AN_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS1","text":"Posit a limit → imply other and unlimited → generate transgression already in the concept of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS2","text":"Determine ought → generate abstract can → introduce real limit → generate contradiction and impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS3","text":"Feel or comprehend immanent negation → experience the limit as one's own negation → enact self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS4","text":"Examine abstract going-beyond → establish its finitude → distinguish true liberation from mere ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS5","text":"Locate ought in finitude → preserve moral validity → withdraw absolute validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:FGS6","text":"Assert ought as the highest resolution → eternalize finitude → exhibit resolution as persistence in contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF1","text":"Absolute ought → double structure of can and impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF2","text":"Assertion of a limit → implicit unlimited → refutation of insurmountability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF3","text":"Immanent negation → drive, pain, or thinking → concrete transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF4","text":"Concrete transgression → distinction between abstract and true going-beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF5","text":"Finite normative validity → withdrawal of absolute final validity → critique of the perennial ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:AF6","text":"Kantian-Fichtean ought → asserted resolution of reason → persistence of contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME1","text":"Limits are reclassified from mere prohibitions into relational determinations whose concept contains their beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME2","text":"Possibility is no longer treated as a pure formal resource, but as contradictorily limited by real limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME3","text":"Pain, drive, organic development, and thinking appear as graduated forms of immanent self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME4","text":"Moral duty is shifted from an absolute ontology of reason to a valid but finite counter-instance against particular will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ME5","text":"Freedom is determined as a relation to a universal field of possible directions, not as mere consciousness of a factual direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — The ought is examined as a relation of duty, possibility, limit, and moral claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Limit, otherness, being-in-itself, existence, and infinity form an immanent structure of contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the question from the defense of the ought to the distinction between its finite validity and its inadmissible absolutization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Finitude is not static limitation, but a self-sublating form whose persistence as ought perpetuates contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the double determination of the ought as transgression and limit, as well as its finite normative validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the positive shape of true liberation, because the text determines imperfect going-beyond but does not elaborate its completed affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT3","text":"The inner coherence depends on the distinction between a limit as mere finitude and a limit as negation determined for a self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation is the immanent refutation of the assertion of insurmountable limits through the concept of the limit itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT5","text":"A structural fault line exists between the recognition of the ought as a necessary finite normative form and its determination as a form of contradiction whose positive sublation is not developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT6","text":"The critique of the Kantian-Fichtean position rests on its reduction to a highest standpoint of ought; an internal differentiation of these positions is not provided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstructed machine preserves the movement from the diagnosis of limits through immanent transgression to the limitation of the ought as a finally valid form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_3:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 29","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 29","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE","layer":"CH","title":"3. Transition of the Finite into the Infinite.","order":30,"parents":["RAW_GB18_3BDE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_3BDE@R001","sha256":"babb9ca9dae2ea4655189b4362b7f9dbf747ed350c5d2b4dfad7d16bf51da11a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Sollen und Schranke bildet die innere Bestimmung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS2","text":"Sollen und Schranke sind qualitativ entgegengesetzte, wechselseitig negative Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS3","text":"Dadurch enthält das Endliche seinen eigenen Widerspruch und hebt sich in seinem Vergehen auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS4","text":"Die Negation des Endlichen erzeugt zunächst ein anderes Endliches und damit die Bewegung des Übergehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS5","text":"In dieser Negation seiner selbst erreicht das Endliche sein Ansichsein und geht mit sich selbst zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS6","text":"Die Negation der Negation bestimmt das affirmative Sein des Unendlichen als das Andere des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A1","text":"Das Sollen enthält die Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A2","text":"Die Schranke enthält das Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A3","text":"Die Beziehung von Sollen und Schranke ist das Endliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A4","text":"Sollen und Schranke sind qualitativ entgegengesetzte Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","text":"Die Schranke ist das Negative des Sollens, und das Sollen ist das Negative der Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","text":"Das Endliche ist der in sich enthaltene Widerspruch seiner eigenen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","text":"Das Resultat des Vergehens des Endlichen ist die Negation des Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","text":"Die Negation des Negativen ist die Bestimmung des Endlichen selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A9","text":"Das Vergehen des Endlichen erzeugt zunächst ein anderes Endliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A10","text":"Das Übergehen in ein anderes Endliches setzt sich als fortlaufende Bewegung fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","text":"Im Vergehen seiner selbst erreicht das Endliche sein Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A12","text":"Das Ansichsein des Endlichen besteht darin, mit sich selbst zusammenzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","text":"Jedes Moment des Endlichen enthält die Bewegung über sich hinaus zu seinem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A14","text":"Das Andere jedes Moments ist zugleich dasselbe Moment in seiner Entzweiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","text":"Die Identität mit sich als Negation der Negation ist affirmatives Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A16","text":"Das Unendliche ist das Andere des Endlichen, dessen Bestimmung die erste Negation ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX1","text":"Das Sollen ist nicht ohne Schranke bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX2","text":"Die Schranke ist nicht ein dem Sollen äußerlich gegenüberstehendes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX3","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht einfache, widerspruchslose Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX4","text":"Das Vergehen des Endlichen ist nicht sein unmittelbares Verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX5","text":"Das Andere des Endlichen ist nicht schlicht ein von ihm unabhängiges Außen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX6","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht als bloße erste Negation des Endlichen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX7","text":"Das Über-sich-Hinausgehen eines Moments führt nicht zu einem schlechthin fremden Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D1","text":"Das Endliche enthält seine eigene Aufhebung, weil seine konstitutiven Momente sich wechselseitig negieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A3","CH_GB18_3BDE:A4","CH_GB18_3BDE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D2","text":"Das Vergehen des Endlichen ist zunächst eine Umwandlung in ein anderes Endliches und keine unmittelbare Aufhebung der Endlichkeit überhaupt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D3","text":"Die Folge anderer Endlicher bildet die operative Form des Übergehens ins Unendliche.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A9","CH_GB18_3BDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D4","text":"Das Sollen überschreitet die Schranke nur, indem es auf die Schranke als sein eigenes Anderes bezogen bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D5","text":"Die Schranke überschreitet sich nur, indem sie mit dem Sollen als ihrem Anderen zusammengeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D6","text":"Die Negation seiner selbst führt das Endliche zu einer Identität mit sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","CH_GB18_3BDE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D7","text":"Das Unendliche entsteht als affirmatives Sein aus der Selbstbeziehung der negativen Bestimmungen des Endlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","CH_GB18_3BDE:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD1","text":"Das Endliche ist kein abgeschlossener Zustand, sondern eine selbstüberschreitende Struktur, deren Grenze den Übergang hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD2","text":"Die Bewegung zum Unendlichen ist keine Flucht aus dem Endlichen, sondern die im Endlichen selbst erzeugte Negation der Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","CH_GB18_3BDE:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD3","text":"Das Andere wird als identische Selbstbeziehung der entzweiten Bestimmungen erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14","CH_GB18_3BDE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD4","text":"Die Endlichkeit erhält ihre Bestimmung nicht trotz ihres Vergehens, sondern durch dessen innere Vollendung.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","CH_GB18_3BDE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Endliches, dessen Grenze lediglich äußerlich hinzugefügt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Sollen, das von seiner eigenen Begrenzung unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Übergang, der durch ein völlig fremdes Anderes vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Negation, die nur vernichtet und keine neue Bestimmung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Unendliches, das nur als unbestimmte Abwesenheit des Endlichen bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nicht durch die Durcharbeitung des Widerspruchs hindurchgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX1","text":"Der Text lässt die Möglichkeit eines statischen Endlichen ohne innere Überschreitung nicht zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX2","text":"Der Text lässt die Möglichkeit eines äußerlichen, vom Endlichen getrennten Unendlichen nicht zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX3","text":"Der Text lässt die Möglichkeit einer endgültigen Trennung von Ansichsein und Dasein nicht zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX4","text":"Der Text lässt die Möglichkeit eines Anderen nicht zu, das außerhalb der Selbstbeziehung der Bestimmungen läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX5","text":"Der Text lässt die Möglichkeit einer bloß negativen Aufhebung ohne affirmatives Resultat nicht zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS1","text":"Sollen ⊃ Schranke ∧ Schranke ⊃ Sollen → relationale Einheit = Endliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS2","text":"Endliches = Sollen ∧ Schranke ∧ wechselseitige Negation → Widerspruch in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS3","text":"Widerspruch in sich → Negation des Endlichen → Vergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS4","text":"Vergehen → anderes Endliches → wiederholtes Übergehen in anderes Endliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS5","text":"Negation des Endlichen = Negation des Negativen → Bestimmung des Endlichen selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS6","text":"Selbstnegation → Erreichen des Ansichseins → Zusammengehen mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS7","text":"Jedes Moment überschreitet sich → sein Anderes ist dasselbe Moment in Entzweiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS8","text":"Identität mit sich durch Negation der Negation → affirmatives Sein → Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AF1","text":"Sollen und Schranke → wechselseitige Negation → Endlichkeit als innerer Widerspruch → Vergehen → anderes Endliches → Negation der Negation → Selbstidentität → Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AF2","text":"Innere Bestimmung → qualitative Entgegensetzung → Selbstaufhebung → Vermittlung durch das Andere → Rückkehr in sich → affirmatives Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME1","text":"Die Schranke wird von einer bloßen Grenze zu einem produktiven Moment des Übergangs umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME2","text":"Das Vergehen wird von einer bloßen Vernichtung zu einer Bestimmung der Selbstbeziehung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME3","text":"Das Andere wird nicht mehr als äußerer Gegensatz, sondern als die eigene Bestimmung in entzweiter Form sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME4","text":"Das Unendliche wird als Resultat einer im Endlichen vollzogenen Negationsbewegung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Endlichem und Unendlichem wird in eine genetische Relation überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Sollen und Schranke stehen in wechselseitiger Beziehung und erzeugen die Bestimmung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Der Widerspruch der Momente treibt das Endliche in die Bewegung des Vergehens und Übergehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Übergang wird nicht als äußerer Schritt, sondern als im Ausgangsbegriff selbst erzeugte Selbstüberschreitung rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein bestimmt sich als Negation der Negation; zeitliche Bewegung und ontologische Bestimmung fallen in der Selbstaufhebung zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Verhältnis von Sollen und Schranke zur Bestimmung des Unendlichen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, in welchem Sinn die Folge anderer Endlicher über eine bloße unendliche Reihe hinaus abgeschlossen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Negation der Negation als affirmative Selbstbeziehung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Ableitung des Anderen aus der inneren Entzweiung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem zunächst als anderes Endliches erscheinenden Resultat und dem abschließenden Unendlichen als affirmativem Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern sie das Unendliche als Resultat und nicht als äußerlich vorausgesetzte Gegeninstanz behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110544054596Z_d7e11750","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3. Transition of the Finite into the Infinite.","source_sha256":"babb9ca9dae2ea4655189b4362b7f9dbf747ed350c5d2b4dfad7d16bf51da11a","sha256":"2d9d1bb0ccf1a76458105d7100cab437c284a2677dd032d2e76defd7446ad2a4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:05:44.060782+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS1","text":"The relation of ought and limit constitutes the inner determination of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS2","text":"Ought and limit are qualitatively opposed, mutually negative moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS3","text":"Thereby, the finite contains its own contradiction and sublates itself in its perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS4","text":"The negation of the finite initially produces another finite and thereby the movement of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS5","text":"In this negation of itself, the finite attains its being-in-itself and comes together with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AS6","text":"The negation of negation determines the affirmative being of the infinite as the other of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A1","text":"The ought contains the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A2","text":"The limit contains the ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A3","text":"The relation of ought and limit is the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A4","text":"Ought and limit are qualitatively opposed moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","text":"The limit is the negative of the ought, and the ought is the negative of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","text":"The finite is the contradiction of its own determinations contained within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","text":"The result of the perishing of the finite is the negation of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","text":"The negation of the negative is the determination of the finite itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A9","text":"The perishing of the finite initially produces another finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A10","text":"The transition into another finite continues as an ongoing movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","text":"In the perishing of itself, the finite attains its being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A12","text":"The being-in-itself of the finite consists in coming together with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","text":"Every moment of the finite contains the movement beyond itself toward its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A14","text":"The other of every moment is at the same time the same moment in its division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","text":"Identity with itself as negation of negation is affirmative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:A16","text":"The infinite is the other of the finite, whose determination is the first negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX1","text":"The ought is not determined without limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX2","text":"The limit is not a moment standing externally opposed to the ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX3","text":"The finite is not simple, contradiction-free identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX4","text":"The perishing of the finite is not its immediate disappearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX5","text":"The other of the finite is not merely an exterior independent of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX6","text":"The infinite is not determined as the mere first negation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:NX7","text":"The going-beyond-itself of a moment does not lead to an absolutely alien content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D1","text":"The finite contains its own sublation because its constitutive moments mutually negate one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A3","CH_GB18_3BDE:A4","CH_GB18_3BDE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D2","text":"The perishing of the finite is initially a transformation into another finite and not an immediate sublation of finitude altogether.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D3","text":"The sequence of other finites constitutes the operative form of the transition into the infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A9","CH_GB18_3BDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D4","text":"The ought transcends the limit only by remaining related to the limit as its own other.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D5","text":"The limit transcends itself only by coming together with the ought as its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D6","text":"The negation of itself leads the finite to an identity with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","CH_GB18_3BDE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:D7","text":"The infinite arises as affirmative being from the self-relation of the negative determinations of the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","CH_GB18_3BDE:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD1","text":"The finite is not a closed state, but a self-transcending structure whose limit brings forth the transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A5","CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD2","text":"The movement toward the infinite is not a flight from the finite, but the negation of negation generated within the finite itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A7","CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","CH_GB18_3BDE:A15","CH_GB18_3BDE:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD3","text":"The other is generated as the identical self-relation of the divided determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A13","CH_GB18_3BDE:A14","CH_GB18_3BDE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SD4","text":"Finitude receives its determination not despite its perishing, but through the latter's inner consummation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BDE:A6","CH_GB18_3BDE:A8","CH_GB18_3BDE:A11","CH_GB18_3BDE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a finite whose limit is merely added externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an ought that would be independent of its own limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a transition mediated by a wholly alien other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a negation that merely annihilates and produces no new determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an infinite that would consist only as the indeterminate absence of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an identity that does not pass through the working-through of contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX1","text":"The text does not permit the possibility of a static finite without inner transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX2","text":"The text does not permit the possibility of an external infinite separated from the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX3","text":"The text does not permit the possibility of a final separation of being-in-itself and determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX4","text":"The text does not permit the possibility of an other that would lie outside the self-relation of determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:SNX5","text":"The text does not permit the possibility of a merely negative sublation without an affirmative result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS1","text":"Ought ⊃ limit ∧ limit ⊃ ought → relational unity = finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS2","text":"Finite = ought ∧ limit ∧ mutual negation → contradiction within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS3","text":"Contradiction within itself → negation of the finite → perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS4","text":"Perishing → other finite → repeated transition into another finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS5","text":"Negation of the finite = negation of the negative → determination of the finite itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS6","text":"Self-negation → attainment of being-in-itself → coming together with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS7","text":"Every moment transcends itself → its other is the same moment in division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:FGS8","text":"Identity with itself through negation of negation → affirmative being → infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AF1","text":"Ought and limit → mutual negation → finitude as inner contradiction → perishing → other finite → negation of negation → self-identity → infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:AF2","text":"Inner determination → qualitative opposition → self-sublation → mediation through the other → return into itself → affirmative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME1","text":"The limit is remapped from a mere boundary into a productive moment of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME2","text":"Perishing is remapped from mere annihilation into a determination of self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME3","text":"The other is no longer visible as external opposition, but as its own determination in divided form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME4","text":"The infinite is classified as the result of a movement of negation carried out within the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ME5","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite is transformed into a genetic relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ought and limit stand in mutual relation and generate the determination of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The contradiction of the moments drives the finite into the movement of perishing and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The transition is reconstructed not as an external step, but as self-transcendence generated within the initial concept itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being determines itself as negation of negation; temporal movement and ontological determination coincide in self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the relation of ought and limit to the determination of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined in what sense the sequence of other finites is completed beyond a mere infinite series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the negation of negation is understood as affirmative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point lies in the derivation of the other from the inner division of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the result initially appearing as another finite and the concluding infinite as affirmative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BDE:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as it treats the infinite as a result and not as an externally presupposed counter-instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_3BDE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_3BDE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 30","title":"3. Transition of the Finite into the Infinite.","context":"Chapter 30","original_title":"3. Übergang des Endlichen in das Unendliche."},"original_title":"3. Übergang des Endlichen in das Unendliche.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0","layer":"CH","title":"C. Infinity.","order":31,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDU0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDU0@R001","sha256":"0c6a060ee8dbb830f17edd9a45fb0efacaa841323545866c4add6c70fd0b1bda","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS1","text":"Das Unendliche wird als neue Bestimmung des Absoluten aus der bestimmungslosen Beziehung auf sich als Seyn und Werden gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS2","text":"Endliche Daseinsformen scheiden als unmittelbare Bestimmtheiten aus den möglichen Definitionen des Absoluten aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS3","text":"Die Bestimmung des Unendlichen als Negation des Endlichen erzeugt zunächst den Anspruch absoluter Unbeschränktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS4","text":"Die bloße Entfernung des Unendlichen vom Endlichen reproduziert jedoch die Endlichkeit innerhalb des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS5","text":"Die Argumentation unterscheidet deshalb das wahrhafte Unendliche der Vernunft vom verendlichten Unendlichen des Verstandes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS6","text":"Das abstrakte Unendliche entsteht als einseitig affirmatives Negieren des Endlichen und bleibt dadurch in Wechselbestimmung mit ihm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS7","text":"Das wahrhafte Unendliche entsteht erst durch das Sichaufheben des abstrakten Unendlichen und des Endlichen in einem gemeinsamen Prozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A1","text":"Das Absolute ist zunächst als bestimmungslose Beziehung auf sich zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A2","text":"Seyn und Werden bilden die anfängliche Gestalt dieser bestimmungslosen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A3","text":"Unmittelbare Daseinsformen sind als Bestimmtheiten endliche Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A4","text":"Das Unendliche wird zunächst als Negation des Endlichen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A5","text":"Eine bloße Negation des Endlichen hebt die Beziehung zum Endlichen nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A6","text":"Was vom Endlichen rein getrennt gehalten wird, wird dadurch als verendlichtes Unendliches fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","text":"Das abstrakte Unendliche steht in Wechselbestimmung mit dem Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A8","text":"Das wahrhafte Unendliche ist ein Prozess des Sichaufhebens des Unendlichen und des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A9","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Vernunft und Verstand bestimmt zwei strukturell verschiedene Formen des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX1","text":"Das Absolute ist nicht mit einer unmittelbaren endlichen Daseinsform identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX2","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht bloß eine endliche Bestimmtheit unter anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX3","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht durch bloße Abwesenheit jeder Beziehung zum Endlichen wahrhaft unendlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX4","text":"Das abstrakte Unendliche ist nicht das wahrhafte Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX5","text":"Das Unendliche des Verstandes ist nicht das Unendliche der Vernunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX6","text":"Die reine Trennung des Unendlichen vom Endlichen entnimmt das Unendliche der Endlichkeit nicht tatsächlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX7","text":"Die Negation des Endlichen darf nicht als abgeschlossene, einseitige Setzung bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D1","text":"Die unmittelbaren Formen des Daseins können keine zureichenden Definitionen des Absoluten liefern.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A1","CH_GB18_CDU0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D2","text":"Die erste Bestimmung des Unendlichen besitzt absoluten Anspruch, weil sie das Endliche ausdrücklich negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D3","text":"Die Negation des Endlichen setzt das Endliche als notwendiges Bezugsglied des Unendlichen voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A4","CH_GB18_CDU0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D4","text":"Das als selbständig gesetzte Unendliche wird zu einer einseitigen und abstrakten Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A5","CH_GB18_CDU0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D5","text":"Die Absonderung vom Endlichen verendlicht gerade das Unendliche, das dadurch unendlich bleiben soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D6","text":"Das abstrakte Unendliche und das Endliche bilden gemeinsam einen Prozess gegenseitiger Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","CH_GB18_CDU0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D7","text":"Die begriffliche Unterscheidung von schlechter und wahrhafter Unendlichkeit ist eine Unterscheidung von statischer Trennung und prozessualer Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","CH_GB18_CDU0:A8","CH_GB18_CDU0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD1","text":"Der Versuch, Absolutheit durch Ausschluss jeder Endlichkeit zu sichern, erzeugt eine Abhängigkeit von genau dem Ausgeschlossenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD2","text":"Unendlichkeit ist nicht als gegenständlich fixierbare Eigenschaft, sondern als Bewegung der Selbstaufhebung endlicher und unendlicher Bestimmungen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD3","text":"Die Trennung von Unendlichem und Endlichem erweist sich als Form der Endlichkeit, weil sie beide als äußerlich begrenzte Bestimmungen stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD4","text":"Der Übergang vom Verstand zur Vernunft besteht in der Umwandlung einer ausschließenden Negation in einen sich selbst bewegenden Prozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD5","text":"Das Absolute wird nicht durch eine letzte isolierte Bestimmung gewonnen, sondern durch die Aufhebung der Fixierung auf eine solche Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass Absolutheit durch die vollständige Entfernung aller Bestimmtheit erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, dass die Negation des Endlichen eine einfache, widerspruchsfreie Unendlichkeit hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein statisches Zweiweltenmodell aus, in dem Endliches und Unendliches unabhängig voneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Identifikation des wahrhaften Unendlichen mit einer bloß unbeschränkten Ausdehnung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Vorstellung aus, dass ein Begriff durch die Abstraktion von allen Gegenbestimmungen vollendet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Unendlichkeit, die ohne Verhältnis zum Endlichen bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Absolutheit, die sich als fertige, selbstidentische Bestimmung außerhalb jeder Bewegung stabilisieren ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Verfügbarkeit eines letzten positiven Grundes, der nicht durch die Aufhebung seiner eigenen Einseitigkeit hindurchgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit als dauerhaft getrennte ontologische Regionen zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS1","text":"Bestimmungslose Selbstbeziehung → anfängliche Setzung als Seyn und Werden → Ausschluss unmittelbarer Daseinsformen als endlicher Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS2","text":"Negation des Endlichen → Anspruch auf Absolutheit → Fortbestehen des Endlichen als notwendige Gegenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS3","text":"Isolierung des Unendlichen vom Endlichen → abstraktes Unendliches → Verendlichung durch einseitige Fixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS4","text":"Wechselbestimmung von Unendlichem und Endlichem → Instabilität beider isolierter Bestimmungen → Prozess ihres Sichaufhebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS5","text":"Sichaufheben des abstrakten Unendlichen und des Endlichen → wahrhaftes Unendliches als prozessuale Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS6","text":"Verstandesmodell der Trennung → Nachweis seiner immanenten Endlichkeit → Vernunftmodell der prozessualen Selbstaufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AF1","text":"Bestimmungslose Selbstbeziehung → Negation des Endlichen → abstrakte Absolutheit → Rückkehr des Endlichen als Gegenbestimmung → Verendlichung des isolierten Unendlichen → Sichaufhebung beider Bestimmungen → wahrhaftes Unendliches als Prozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME1","text":"Das Unendliche wird von einer isolierten Gegenbestimmung des Endlichen zu einer Bewegung der Bestimmungsaufhebung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Endlichem und Unendlichem wird als interne Wechselbestimmung statt als äußerliche Trennung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME3","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Verstand und Vernunft wird als Differenz zweier Operationsweisen der Negation klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME4","text":"Das Absolute wird nicht mehr durch unmittelbare Daseinsformen, sondern durch die Transformation ihrer Einseitigkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME5","text":"Die scheinbare Unbeschränktheit des isolierten Unendlichen wird als strukturelle Form erneuter Beschränkung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Unendliche wird als Negation des Endlichen und anschließend als Prozess seines Sichaufhebens bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmungen des Unendlichen und Endlichen erzeugen sich gegenseitig durch Ausschluss und Gegenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument ersetzt die Strategie äußerlicher Absonderung durch die Strategie immanenter Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit erscheint nicht als starre Verteilung von Endlichem und Unendlichem, sondern als Werden ihrer begrifflichen Selbstaufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der ersten Unendlichkeitsbestimmung zum wahrhaften Unendlichen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie der Prozess des Sichaufhebens im Einzelnen vollzogen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Negation des Endlichen als relationale und nicht als äußerliche Negation verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist der Nachweis, dass die isolierende Abstraktion vom Endlichen dieses als notwendige Gegenbestimmung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT5","text":"Ihre zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass das Unendliche zunächst durch Negation bestimmt wird, aber erst durch die Aufhebung dieser einseitigen Negation wahrhaft unendlich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von unmittelbarer Absolutheit über abstrakte Wechselbestimmung zur prozessualen Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114234744490Z_f5d4836c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Infinity.","source_sha256":"0c6a060ee8dbb830f17edd9a45fb0efacaa841323545866c4add6c70fd0b1bda","sha256":"f1917b9695222ddb6698bbdb60d5ef0b335f02012160ca54582509af15ccaf31","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:42:34.747528+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS1","text":"Infinity is obtained as a new determination of the Absolute from the indeterminate relation to itself as Being (Seyn) and Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS2","text":"Finite forms of determinate being are excluded as immediate determinacies from the possible definitions of the Absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS3","text":"The determination of infinity as the negation of finitude initially produces the claim of absolute unrestrictedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS4","text":"The mere removal of infinity from finitude, however, reproduces finitude within infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS5","text":"The argument therefore distinguishes the true infinity of Reason from the finitized infinity of Understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS6","text":"Abstract infinity arises as a one-sided affirmative negation of finitude and thereby remains in reciprocal determination with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AS7","text":"True infinity arises only through the self-sublation of abstract infinity and finitude in a common process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A1","text":"The Absolute is initially to be thought as an indeterminate relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A2","text":"Being (Seyn) and Becoming constitute the initial form of this indeterminate self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A3","text":"Immediate forms of determinate being are, as determinacies, finite forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A4","text":"Infinity is initially determined as the negation of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A5","text":"A mere negation of finitude does not sublate the relation to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A6","text":"What is held purely separate from finitude is thereby fixed as finitized infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","text":"Abstract infinity stands in reciprocal determination with finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A8","text":"True infinity is a process of the self-sublation of infinity and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:A9","text":"The distinction between Reason and Understanding determines two structurally different forms of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX1","text":"The Absolute is not identical with an immediate finite form of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX2","text":"Infinity is not merely one finite determinacy among others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX3","text":"Infinity is not truly infinite through the mere absence of every relation to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX4","text":"Abstract infinity is not true infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX5","text":"The infinity of Understanding is not the infinity of Reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX6","text":"The pure separation of infinity from finitude does not actually remove infinity from finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:NX7","text":"The negation of finitude must not remain as a completed, one-sided positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D1","text":"The immediate forms of determinate being cannot provide sufficient definitions of the Absolute.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A1","CH_GB18_CDU0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D2","text":"The first determination of infinity bears an absolute claim because it explicitly negates finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D3","text":"The negation of finitude presupposes finitude as a necessary term of relation of infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A4","CH_GB18_CDU0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D4","text":"Infinity posited as self-subsistent becomes a one-sided and abstract determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A5","CH_GB18_CDU0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D5","text":"Separation from finitude finitizes precisely the infinity that is thereby supposed to remain infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D6","text":"Abstract infinity and finitude jointly constitute a process of reciprocal determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","CH_GB18_CDU0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:D7","text":"The conceptual distinction between bad and true infinity is a distinction between static separation and processual sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDU0:A7","CH_GB18_CDU0:A8","CH_GB18_CDU0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD1","text":"The attempt to secure absoluteness through the exclusion of all finitude produces a dependence upon precisely what is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD2","text":"Infinity is determined not as an objectively fixable property, but as the movement of the self-sublation of finite and infinite determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD3","text":"The separation of infinite and finite proves to be a form of finitude, because it stabilizes both as externally bounded determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD4","text":"The transition from Understanding to Reason consists in the transformation of an exclusive negation into a self-moving process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SD5","text":"The Absolute is obtained not through a final isolated determination, but through the sublation of fixation upon such a determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that absoluteness is attained through the complete removal of all determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX2","text":"It excludes the assumption that the negation of finitude produces a simple, contradiction-free infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX3","text":"It excludes a static two-world model in which finitude and infinity exist independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX4","text":"It excludes the identification of true infinity with a merely unrestricted extension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:DNX5","text":"It excludes the notion that a concept is completed through abstraction from all counter-determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an infinity that could exist without relation to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an absoluteness that could stabilize itself as a finished, self-identical determination outside every movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the availability of a final positive ground that does not pass through the sublation of its own one-sidedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating finitude and infinity as permanently separate ontological regions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate self-relation → initial positing as Being (Seyn) and Becoming → exclusion of immediate forms of determinate being as finite determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS2","text":"Negation of finitude → claim to absoluteness → persistence of finitude as necessary counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS3","text":"Isolation of infinity from finitude → abstract infinity → finitization through one-sided fixation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS4","text":"Reciprocal determination of infinite and finite → instability of both isolated determinations → process of their self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS5","text":"Self-sublation of abstract infinity and finitude → true infinity as processual unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:FGS6","text":"Understanding-model of separation → demonstration of its immanent finitude → Reason-model of processual self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:AF1","text":"Indeterminate self-relation → negation of finitude → abstract absoluteness → return of finitude as counter-determination → finitization of isolated infinity → self-sublation of both determinations → true infinity as process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME1","text":"Infinity is remapped from an isolated counter-determination of finitude into a movement of the sublation of determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME2","text":"The opposition between finite and infinite becomes visible as internal reciprocal determination rather than as external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME3","text":"The difference between Understanding and Reason is classified as the difference between two modes of operation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME4","text":"The Absolute is no longer determined through immediate forms of determinate being, but through the transformation of their one-sidedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ME5","text":"The apparent unrestrictedness of isolated infinity becomes visible as a structural form of renewed restriction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Infinity is determined as the negation of finitude and subsequently as the process of its self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinations of infinite and finite mutually generate one another through exclusion and counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces the strategy of external separation with the strategy of immanent sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears not as a rigid distribution of finite and infinite, but as the becoming of their conceptual self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the first determination of infinity to true infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the process of self-sublation is carried out in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that the negation of finitude is understood as relational and not as external negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the demonstration that isolating abstraction from finitude preserves the latter as a necessary counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT5","text":"Its central tension lies in the fact that infinity is initially determined through negation, but becomes truly infinite only through the sublation of this one-sided negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDU0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from immediate absoluteness through abstract reciprocal determination to processual infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDU0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDU0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 31","title":"C. Infinity.","context":"Chapter 31","original_title":"C. Die Unendlichkeit."},"original_title":"C. Die Unendlichkeit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0","layer":"CH","title":"a. The Infinite in General.","order":32,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DUB0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DUB0@R001","sha256":"03c11343de096badd1ee58e7f8dfeaeb721a377d921d8cde10c460999199ae31","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist, das Verhältnis von Endlichem und Unendlichem ohne äußerliche Trennung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS2","text":"Das Endliche wird als in sich beschränkt und zugleich über seine Beschränktheit hinausgehend neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS3","text":"Das Unendliche entsteht als Negation der Negation und damit als affirmative Wiederherstellung des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS4","text":"Die Erhebung ins Unendliche ist keine subjektive oder fremde Bewegung, sondern die eigene Natur des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS5","text":"Das Unendliche ist die wahrhafte Bestimmung dessen, was das Endliche an sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Aussage, dass im Unendlichen das Endliche verschwunden ist und nur das Unendliche ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","text":"Das Unendliche ist die Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A2","text":"Das Unendliche ist affirmatives, wiederhergestelltes und wahrhaftes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A3","text":"Das Endliche bestimmt sich durch seine Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","text":"Die Natur des Endlichen besteht darin, über seine Schranke hinauszugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A5","text":"Die Schranke ist eine Beziehung des Endlichen auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A6","text":"Das Endliche negiert seine Schranke nicht durch eine fremde Gewalt, sondern durch seine eigene Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A7","text":"Das Unendliche steht nicht als selbständiges Fertiges äußerlich über dem Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A8","text":"Die subjektive Vernunft bildet nicht den zureichenden Grund der Erhebung ins Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A9","text":"Die Erhebung des Endlichen ins Unendliche hebt nicht die Endlichkeit überhaupt äußerlich auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","text":"Die Unendlichkeit ist die affirmative Bestimmung des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A11","text":"Das Endliche ist wahrhaft an sich, indem es unendlich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A12","text":"Im Unendlichen verschwindet das Endliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A13","text":"Was nach dem Verschwinden des Endlichen ist, ist nur das Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX1","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht ein für sich fertiges Jenseits des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX2","text":"Das Endliche behält kein unabhängiges Sein außerhalb oder unterhalb des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX3","text":"Die Unendlichkeit ist nicht bloß ein subjektiver Vernunftbegriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX4","text":"Die Erhebung über das Endliche ist keine äußerliche Bewegung des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX5","text":"Eine fremde Gewalt hebt das Endliche nicht ins Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX6","text":"Die Unendlichkeit entsteht nicht durch eine abstrakte Aufhebung der Endlichkeit überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX7","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht als selbständig bleibendes Gegenüber des Unendlichen zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D1","text":"Das Dasein bestimmt sich in seinem Ansichsein als Endliches.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D2","text":"Die Schranke wird zur Vermittlung des Übergangs ins Unendliche, weil das Endliche sich auf sie als eigene Bestimmung bezieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D3","text":"Das Überschreiten der Schranke ist zugleich deren Negation und die Negation der ersten Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D4","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht außerhalb des Endlichen, sondern das Resultat seiner eigenen Selbstbewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6","CH_GB18_DUB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D5","text":"Die affirmative Bestimmung des Endlichen liegt nicht in seinem Verbleib als Endliches, sondern in seinem Werden zum Unendlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","CH_GB18_DUB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D6","text":"Die Negation der Endlichkeit erzeugt nicht ein leeres Nichts, sondern wahrhaftes Sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","CH_GB18_DUB0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D7","text":"Die subjektive Vernunft kann die Erhebung begrifflich nachvollziehen, ist aber nicht deren erzeugendes Prinzip.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A8","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D8","text":"Die Endlichkeit geht im Unendlichen unter, weil sie ihre eigene affirmative Wahrheit nur als Unendlichkeit besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","CH_GB18_DUB0:A11","CH_GB18_DUB0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD1","text":"Endliches und Unendliches bilden keine äußerliche Zweiheit, sondern eine genetische Einheit, in der das Endliche die Bedingung seines eigenen Übergangs liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD2","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht die Entfernung von der Beschränktheit, sondern die in sich zurückgeführte Negation der Beschränktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD3","text":"Die Wahrheit des Endlichen besteht in einer Selbstaufhebung, die zugleich seine affirmative Wiederherstellung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD4","text":"Die Bewegung des Begriffs ersetzt die transzendente Ordnung von unten und oben durch eine immanente Bewegung von Schranke, Negation und Wiederherstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD5","text":"Die abschließende Totalisierung des Unendlichen lässt die Vermittlungsfunktion des Endlichen bestehen, während sie dessen selbständiges Resultatsein ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme, dass das Unendliche unabhängig vom Endlichen fertig vorhanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Endliches, das seine Schranke bloß besitzt, ohne durch sie über sich hinausgetrieben zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vernunft, die das Unendliche ausschließlich als subjektive Erhebung hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußerliche Kausalität, durch die das Endliche in das Unendliche überführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein affirmatives Sein, das nach der Negation der Endlichkeit als bloßes Nichts verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Koexistenz eines selbständigen Endlichen neben einem selbständigen Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Unendliches, dessen Unabhängigkeit gerade durch die dauerhafte Selbständigkeit des Endlichen bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein äußerer Standpunkt, von dem aus die Erhebung über die Endlichkeit vollzogen werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Ontologie, in der die Grenze endgültige Identität statt Übergang und Selbstnegation bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines bleibenden endlichen Gegenpols strukturiert die Behauptung, dass nur das Unendliche ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines Unendlichen jenseits seiner Vermittlung durch das Endliche wird vollständig verschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Sein → Bestimmung als Dasein → Setzung der Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS2","text":"Schranke → Selbstbeziehung des Endlichen → immanentes Überschreiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS3","text":"Negation der Schranke → Negation der Negation → affirmative Wiederherstellung des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS4","text":"Immanente Bewegung → Ausschluss äußerer Gewalt und bloßer subjektiver Vernunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS5","text":"Affirmative Bestimmung → Wahrheit des Endlichen als Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS6","text":"Werden zum Unendlichen → Verschwinden des Endlichen → Sein nur des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS7","text":"Die Maschine erzeugt das Unendliche als Resultat einer Selbstaufhebung, nicht als vorausgesetztes Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AF1","text":"Beschränktes Dasein → Selbstbeziehung auf die Schranke → Überschreitung der Schranke → Negation der Negation → affirmative Unendlichkeit → Verschwinden des Endlichen → nur das Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AF2","text":"Äußerliches Jenseits und subjektive Erhebung → Zurückweisung → immanente Selbstbewegung des Endlichen → ontologische Totalisierung des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME1","text":"Das Unendliche wird vom transzendenten Gegenstand zum immanenten Resultat der Selbstbewegung des Endlichen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Endlichem und Unendlichem wird als falscher äußerlicher Gegensatz aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME3","text":"Die Schranke wird von einer bloßen Grenze zu einer produktiven Vermittlungsform des Übergangs bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME4","text":"Die Vernunft wird vom erzeugenden Ursprung zur begrifflichen Erscheinungsform einer objektiven Bewegung herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME5","text":"Das Endliche wird zugleich als notwendiger Vermittler und als nicht-selbständiges Resultat klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME6","text":"Wahrheit wird als affirmative Selbstaufhebung und nicht als dauerhafte Identität des Ausgangszustands kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Unendliche wird als Negation der Negation, affirmatives Sein und Erhebung aus der Schranke bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Schranke organisiert eine immanente Bewegung, in der das Endliche durch Selbstbeziehung über sich hinausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Erklärung des Übergangs vom subjektiven Akt und äußerlichen Jenseits auf die innere Notwendigkeit des Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein wird als Resultat eines Prozesses der Selbstnegation gedacht; das Endliche ist nur in seiner Überführung ins Unendliche wahrhaft an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von Schranke über Negation zur affirmativen Unendlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, in welchem Sinn das Endliche nach seinem Verschwinden noch als Vermittlung erhalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange das Verschwinden des Endlichen als Aufhebung seiner Selbständigkeit und nicht als völlige Wirkungslosigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die immanente Ableitung des Unendlichen aus der Natur des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT5","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt zwischen der notwendigen Funktion des Endlichen im Erzeugungsprozess und der abschließenden Aussage, dass nur das Unendliche ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, sofern sie das Unendliche als Resultat und zugleich als alleinige Wahrheit des Prozesses fasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115639539131Z_e4c2ac7b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The Infinite in General.","source_sha256":"03c11343de096badd1ee58e7f8dfeaeb721a377d921d8cde10c460999199ae31","sha256":"66ede34fb62c656de4860a078b06f43e1adfa1b75db8d2c044f5d3423d7f7b1b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:56:39.540638+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS1","text":"The problem is to determine the relation of the finite and the infinite without external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS2","text":"The finite is newly determined as limited within itself and at the same time as going beyond its limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS3","text":"The infinite arises as the negation of negation and thereby as the affirmative restoration of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS4","text":"The elevation into the infinite is not a subjective or alien movement, but the finite's own nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS5","text":"The infinite is the true determination of what the finite is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the statement that in the infinite the finite has disappeared and only the infinite is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","text":"The infinite is the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A2","text":"The infinite is affirmative, restored, and true being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A3","text":"The finite determines itself through its limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","text":"The nature of the finite consists in going beyond its limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A5","text":"The limit is a relation of the finite to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A6","text":"The finite negates its limit not through an alien force, but through its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A7","text":"The infinite does not stand externally above the finite as an independent finished entity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A8","text":"Subjective reason does not constitute the sufficient ground of the elevation into the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A9","text":"The elevation of the finite into the infinite does not externally sublate finitude as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","text":"Infinity is the affirmative determination of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A11","text":"The finite is truly in itself by becoming infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A12","text":"In the infinite, the finite disappears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:A13","text":"What is after the disappearance of the finite is only the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX1","text":"The infinite is not a finished beyond of the finite existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX2","text":"The finite retains no independent being outside or beneath the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX3","text":"Infinity is not merely a subjective concept of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX4","text":"The elevation above the finite is not an external movement of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX5","text":"An alien force does not elevate the finite into the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX6","text":"Infinity does not arise through an abstract sublation of finitude as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:NX7","text":"The finite is not to be understood as an independently persisting counterpart to the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D1","text":"Existence determines itself in its being-in-itself as finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D2","text":"The limit becomes the mediation of the transition into the infinite because the finite relates to it as its own determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D3","text":"The transgression of the limit is at the same time its negation and the negation of the first negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D4","text":"The infinite is not outside the finite, but the result of its own self-movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A4","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6","CH_GB18_DUB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D5","text":"The affirmative determination of the finite lies not in its remaining finite, but in its becoming infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","CH_GB18_DUB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D6","text":"The negation of finitude does not produce an empty nothing, but true being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A1","CH_GB18_DUB0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D7","text":"Subjective reason can conceptually retrace the elevation, but is not its generative principle.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A8","CH_GB18_DUB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:D8","text":"Finitude perishes in the infinite because it possesses its own affirmative truth only as infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUB0:A10","CH_GB18_DUB0:A11","CH_GB18_DUB0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD1","text":"Finite and infinite do not form an external duality, but a genetic unity in which the finite supplies the condition of its own transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD2","text":"The infinite is not the removal from limitation, but the negation of limitation brought back into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD3","text":"The truth of the finite consists in a self-sublation that at the same time produces its affirmative restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD4","text":"The movement of the concept replaces the transcendent order of below and above with an immanent movement of limit, negation, and restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SD5","text":"The concluding totalization of the infinite preserves the mediating function of the finite while excluding its independent being as result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX1","text":"The assumption that the infinite is independently present as a finished entity apart from the finite must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a finite that merely possesses its limit without being driven by it beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a reason that produces the infinite exclusively as a subjective elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an external causality through which the finite is transferred into the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an affirmative being that remains as mere nothing after the negation of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the coexistence of an independent finite alongside an independent infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an infinite whose independence would be determined precisely by the enduring independence of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an external standpoint from which the elevation above finitude could be carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is an ontology in which the boundary signifies definitive identity rather than transition and self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX4","text":"The absence of an enduring finite counterpole structures the assertion that only the infinite is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:SNX5","text":"The possibility of an infinite beyond its mediation through the finite is completely closed off.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS1","text":"Immediate being → determination as existence → positing of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS2","text":"Limit → self-relation of the finite → immanent transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS3","text":"Negation of the limit → negation of negation → affirmative restoration of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS4","text":"Immanent movement → exclusion of external force and merely subjective reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS5","text":"Affirmative determination → truth of the finite as infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS6","text":"Becoming infinite → disappearance of the finite → being only of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:FGS7","text":"The machine generates the infinite as the result of a self-sublation, not as a presupposed beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AF1","text":"Limited existence → self-relation to the limit → transgression of the limit → negation of negation → affirmative infinity → disappearance of the finite → only the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:AF2","text":"External beyond and subjective elevation → rejection → immanent self-movement of the finite → ontological totalization of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME1","text":"The infinite is remapped from a transcendent object to the immanent result of the self-movement of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME2","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite is dissolved as a false external opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME3","text":"The limit is determined from a mere boundary into a productive mediating form of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME4","text":"Reason is demoted from generative origin to the conceptual form of appearance of an objective movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME5","text":"The finite is classified simultaneously as a necessary mediator and as a non-independent result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ME6","text":"Truth is mapped as affirmative self-sublation and not as the enduring identity of the initial state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The infinite is determined as negation of negation, affirmative being, and elevation from the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The limit organizes an immanent movement in which the finite goes beyond itself through self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the explanation of transition from the subjective act and external beyond to the inner necessity of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is conceived as the result of a process of self-negation; the finite is truly in itself only in its transition into the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from limit through negation to affirmative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined in what sense the finite is still preserved as mediation after its disappearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as the disappearance of the finite is understood as the sublation of its independence and not as complete ineffectuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the immanent derivation of the infinite from the nature of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension lies between the necessary function of the finite in the generative process and the concluding statement that only the infinite is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUB0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement insofar as it grasps the infinite as result and at the same time as the sole truth of the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DUB0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DUB0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 32","title":"a. The Infinite in General.","context":"Chapter 32","original_title":"a. Das Unendliche überhaupt."},"original_title":"a. Das Unendliche überhaupt.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE","layer":"CH","title":"b. Reciprocal Determination of the Finite and the Infinite.","order":33,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BWDE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BWDE@R001","sha256":"a2aa9818015087927a8683f0d1732cb8196778e48bb1583c52c44cba08aff388","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare Unendliche soll das Endliche negieren, reproduziert es aber als sein ihm gegenüberstehendes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS2","text":"Die qualitative Entgegensetzung von Endlichem und Unendlichem macht beide zu getrennten Bestimmtheiten und begrenzt dadurch das Unendliche selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS3","text":"Jedes der beiden Momente setzt aus seiner eigenen Bestimmtheit notwendig das andere und ist daher von ihm untrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS4","text":"Die notwendige Einheit der entgegengesetzten Momente erscheint im Dasein nicht als Einheit, sondern als äußerliches Übergehen des einen in das andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS5","text":"Das wechselnde Übergehen erzeugt den unendlichen Progress als Wiederkehr derselben Grenze unter stets neuer Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS6","text":"Der unendliche Progress ist kein Vollzug wahrer Unendlichkeit, sondern die unaufgelöste Wiederholung des Widerspruchs von Endlichem und Unendlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A1","text":"Das Unendliche ist zunächst als Negation des Endlichen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","text":"Eine Negation, die einem Anderen äußerlich gegenübertritt, ist selbst bestimmte Negation und damit begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A3","text":"Das Endliche ist als Schranke bestimmt und enthält deshalb den Übergang über seine Schranke in seinem eigenen Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A4","text":"Das Unendliche ist als Negation der Negation affirmativ, fällt aber als unmittelbar affirmatives Sein in qualitative Bestimmtheit zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A5","text":"Endliches und Unendliches sind nur in Beziehung aufeinander das, was sie sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A6","text":"Was nur in Beziehung auf ein Anderes bestimmt ist, trägt dieses Andere in seiner eigenen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A7","text":"Die Grenze jedes Moments ist zugleich seine eigene Negation und das Prinzip seines Übergangs in sein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A8","text":"Die gegenseitige Abhängigkeit der Momente bildet eine Einheit, die in ihrer qualitativen Entgegensetzung zunächst verborgen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A9","text":"Eine Einheit, die nicht als Einheit begriffen wird, erscheint als äußerlicher Wechsel ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A10","text":"Die Wiederherstellung einer Grenze nach jedem Überschreiten erzeugt keine Befreiung von der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A11","text":"Das perennierende Sollen ist die Form einer Negation des Endlichen, die das Endliche nicht wirklich aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX1","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht ein vom Endlichen räumlich oder ontologisch getrenntes Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX2","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht wahrhaft unendlich, sofern es das Endliche als selbständiges Gegenüber voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX3","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht ein in sich ruhendes, von seinem Übergang unabhängiges Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX4","text":"Der Übergang über eine Grenze ist nicht schon deren begriffliche Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX5","text":"Der unendliche Progress ist nicht die erreichte Wahrheit der Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX6","text":"Das Sollen ist nicht die Vollendung dessen, was es fordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX7","text":"Die Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht eine äußerliche Verbindung zweier zuvor selbständiger Entitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D1","text":"Das dem Endlichen entgegengesetzte Unendliche wird selbst zu einem bestimmten Etwas mit Grenze.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A1","CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D2","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung einer endlichen und einer unendlichen Welt erzeugt zwei begrenzte Seiten statt einer absoluten Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D3","text":"Das Endliche geht notwendig in das Unendliche über, weil seine Schranke seine eigene innere Negativität ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A3","CH_GB18_BWDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D4","text":"Das Unendliche geht notwendig in das Endliche über, weil seine unmittelbare Affirmation die verdrängte Negation erneut als Grenze setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A4","CH_GB18_BWDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D5","text":"Das äußerliche Übergehen der Momente ist die Erscheinungsform ihrer nicht reflektierten Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A8","CH_GB18_BWDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D6","text":"Der unendliche Progress reproduziert mit jeder neuen Grenze dieselbe Struktur von Diesseits und Jenseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A7","CH_GB18_BWDE:A9","CH_GB18_BWDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D7","text":"Das Sollen bleibt perennierend, weil es das Endliche negiert, ohne die eigene Beziehung auf das Endliche zu negieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A5","CH_GB18_BWDE:A10","CH_GB18_BWDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD1","text":"Die schlechte Unendlichkeit ist die Selbstreproduktion der Endlichkeit unter der Form ihres Überschreitens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD2","text":"Die absolute Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem zerstört gerade die Absolutheit, die dem Unendlichen zugeschrieben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD3","text":"Der unendliche Progress ist eine zeitliche Projektion einer begrifflich unverarbeiteten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD4","text":"Das Jenseits bleibt unerreichbar nicht wegen äußerer Entfernung, sondern weil seine Bestimmung als Jenseits seine Nichterreichtheit konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD5","text":"Die Bewegung des Fortschreitens enthält ihre Triebfeder nicht in einem äußeren Subjekt, sondern in der immanenten Einheit der gegensätzlichen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX1","text":"Es darf keine schlechthin selbständige Endlichkeit geben, denn das Endliche enthält seine eigene Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX2","text":"Es darf keine schlechthin selbständige Unendlichkeit geben, denn ein dem Endlichen entgegengesetztes Unendliches wäre selbst endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX3","text":"Es darf keinen endgültigen Standpunkt jenseits des Übergangs geben, solange der Übergang nur als Wechsel getrennter Seiten bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX4","text":"Es darf keine Wahrheit des bloßen Weitergehens geben, weil jede neue Grenze die vorausgesetzte Struktur erneut installiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX5","text":"Es darf keine Auflösung des Widerspruchs durch bloße räumliche Verteilung auf Diesseits und Jenseits geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer Unendlichkeit, die nur als Abwesenheit des Endlichen gedacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem als bloß verborgenes Fundament stehen zu lassen, ohne sie begrifflich zu vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Ende des Denkens im „Und so fort ins Unendliche“, weil diese Formel den Widerspruch lediglich perpetuiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Unendliches → Negation des Endlichen → qualitative Gegenüberstellung zweier Bestimmtheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS2","text":"Qualitative Gegenüberstellung → Grenze des Unendlichen → endliches Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS3","text":"Schranke des Endlichen → immanenter Übergang zum Unendlichen → Wiederkehr des Endlichen als neue Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS4","text":"Grenze beider Seiten → gegenseitiges Setzen des Anderen → untrennbare, aber verborgene Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS5","text":"Verborgene Einheit + behauptete Selbständigkeit der Seiten → äußerliches Umschlagen von Endlichem und Unendlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS6","text":"Äußerliches Umschlagen + Wiederkehr der Grenze → unendlicher Progress → schlechte Unendlichkeit und perennierendes Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AF1","text":"Unmittelbares Unendliches → Gegenüberstellung des Endlichen → Begrenzung des Unendlichen → wechselseitiges Setzen der Anderen → verborgene Einheit → äußerlicher Übergang → Wiederkehr der Grenze → unendlicher Progress → unaufgelöster Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Endlichem und Unendlichem wird von einer räumlichen Gegenüberstellung in eine immanente Wechselbestimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME2","text":"Grenze erscheint nicht mehr als bloßes Hindernis eines Seienden, sondern als Produktivkraft des Übergangs und der Reproduktion des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME3","text":"Das Jenseits wird als Effekt einer bestimmten Negationsform klassifiziert, nicht als selbständiger Bereich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME4","text":"Fortschritt ins Unendliche wird von einem positiven Überschreiten in eine zyklische Wiederholung derselben Bestimmungsstruktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME5","text":"Das Sollen wird von einer normativen Erhebung in die Form eines unvollendeten und sich selbst erneuernden Widerspruchs verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT1","text":"Surface — Endliches und Unendliches erscheinen als einander entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen, zwischen denen fortwährend übergegangen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die gegenseitige Grenze bewirkt, dass jedes Moment sein Anderes aus sich selbst setzt und dadurch dessen Abhängigkeit reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text entzieht dem bloßen Überschreiten, dem Sollen und dem Fortschreiten den Status letzter Lösungen, weil sie die vorausgesetzte Trennung konservieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die zeitliche Unendlichkeit des endlosen Weitergehens wird als Erscheinung einer begrifflichen Einheit bestimmt, die im Wechsel selbst wirksam, aber nicht reflektiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Ableitung des schlechten Unendlichen aus der äußerlichen Negation des Endlichen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den unendlichen Progress als Wiederkehr der Grenze und nicht als wahre Unendlichkeit zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Gestalt der Einheit, welche die Wechselbestimmung trägt, weil sie hier als zugrunde liegend, aber nicht ausgeführt bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern jede getrennte Seite durch ihre eigene Bestimmung in ihr Anderes übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt darin, dass die Einheit zugleich als notwendige Triebfeder behauptet und als im Fortgang unverwirklicht beziehungsweise unreflektiert belassen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT6","text":"Eine Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn sie die Differenz zwischen immanenter Einheit und erscheinender Äußerlichkeit nicht in eine unmittelbare Versöhnung auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113740203488Z_a6b40ba5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Reciprocal Determination of the Finite and the Infinite.","source_sha256":"a2aa9818015087927a8683f0d1732cb8196778e48bb1583c52c44cba08aff388","sha256":"8ec58c16c0667d52b64f2ba88e53bfb35bae56dffc122d6f1f15ada0128f10c1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:37:40.204500+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS1","text":"The immediate infinite is supposed to negate the finite, but reproduces it as its other standing over against it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS2","text":"The qualitative opposition of finite and infinite makes both into separate determinacies and thereby limits the infinite itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS3","text":"Each of the two moments necessarily posits the other out of its own determinacy and is therefore inseparable from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS4","text":"The necessary unity of the opposed moments appears in determinate being not as unity, but as the external passing-over of one into the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS5","text":"The alternating passing-over produces the infinite progress as the return of the same boundary in ever new form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AS6","text":"The infinite progress is not the realization of true infinity, but the unresolved repetition of the contradiction of finite and infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A1","text":"The infinite is initially determined as the negation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","text":"A negation that confronts an other externally is itself determinate negation and is thereby limited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A3","text":"The finite is determined as a limit and therefore contains the transition beyond its limit in its own concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A4","text":"The infinite is affirmative as negation of negation, but as immediately affirmative being falls back into qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A5","text":"Finite and infinite are what they are only in relation to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A6","text":"What is determined only in relation to an other bears this other in its own determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A7","text":"The boundary of each moment is at once its own negation and the principle of its transition into its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A8","text":"The mutual dependence of the moments constitutes a unity that initially remains concealed in their qualitative opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A9","text":"A unity that is not comprehended as unity appears as the external alternation of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A10","text":"The restoration of a boundary after every transgression does not produce liberation from finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:A11","text":"The perennating ought is the form of a negation of the finite that does not truly sublate the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX1","text":"The infinite is not an beyond spatially or ontologically separated from the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX2","text":"The infinite is not truly infinite insofar as it presupposes the finite as an independent counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX3","text":"The finite is not a determinate being resting in itself and independent of its transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX4","text":"The transition beyond a boundary is not already its conceptual sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX5","text":"The infinite progress is not the attained truth of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX6","text":"The ought is not the completion of what it demands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:NX7","text":"The unity of finite and infinite is not an external connection of two previously independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D1","text":"The infinite opposed to the finite itself becomes a determinate something with a boundary.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A1","CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D2","text":"The juxtaposition of a finite and an infinite world produces two limited sides instead of an absolute infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D3","text":"The finite necessarily passes over into the infinite because its limit is its own inner negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A3","CH_GB18_BWDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D4","text":"The infinite necessarily passes over into the finite because its immediate affirmation posits the repressed negation again as boundary.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A2","CH_GB18_BWDE:A4","CH_GB18_BWDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D5","text":"The external passing-over of the moments is the form of appearance of their unreflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A8","CH_GB18_BWDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D6","text":"With every new boundary, the infinite progress reproduces the same structure of this side and beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A7","CH_GB18_BWDE:A9","CH_GB18_BWDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:D7","text":"The ought remains perennating because it negates the finite without negating its own relation to the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_BWDE:A5","CH_GB18_BWDE:A10","CH_GB18_BWDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD1","text":"Bad infinity is the self-reproduction of finitude under the form of its transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD2","text":"The absolute separation of finite and infinite destroys precisely the absoluteness attributed to the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD3","text":"The infinite progress is a temporal projection of a conceptually unprocessed unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD4","text":"The beyond remains unattainable not because of external distance, but because its determination as beyond constitutes its unattainability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SD5","text":"The movement of progression contains its driving force not in an external subject, but in the immanent unity of the opposed determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX1","text":"There must be no absolutely independent finitude, for the finite contains its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX2","text":"There must be no absolutely independent infinity, for an infinite opposed to the finite would itself be finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX3","text":"There must be no final standpoint beyond transition so long as transition is determined only as the alternation of separate sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX4","text":"There must be no truth of mere going-on, because every new boundary installs the presupposed structure anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:DNX5","text":"There must be no resolution of the contradiction through mere spatial distribution into this side and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an infinity thought only as the absence of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of leaving the unity of finite and infinite as a merely concealed foundation without conceptually enacting it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an end of thought in “And so on to infinity,” because this formula merely perpetuates the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS1","text":"Immediate infinite → negation of the finite → qualitative juxtaposition of two determinacies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS2","text":"Qualitative juxtaposition → boundary of the infinite → finite infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS3","text":"Limit of the finite → immanent transition to the infinite → return of the finite as new boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS4","text":"Boundary of both sides → mutual positing of the other → inseparable but concealed unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS5","text":"Concealed unity + asserted independence of the sides → external overturning of finite and infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:FGS6","text":"External overturning + return of the boundary → infinite progress → bad infinity and perennating ought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:AF1","text":"Immediate infinite → juxtaposition of the finite → limitation of the infinite → mutual positing of the others → concealed unity → external transition → return of the boundary → infinite progress → unresolved contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME1","text":"The relation of finite and infinite is transferred from a spatial juxtaposition into an immanent reciprocal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME2","text":"Boundary no longer appears as the mere obstacle of a being, but as the productive force of transition and of the reproduction of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME3","text":"The beyond is classified as the effect of a determinate form of negation, not as an independent domain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME4","text":"Progress into infinity is remapped from a positive transcendence into a cyclical repetition of the same structure of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ME5","text":"The ought is shifted from a normative elevation into the form of an uncompleted and self-renewing contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT1","text":"Surface — Finite and infinite appear as determinations opposed to one another, between which there is continual transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT2","text":"Structural — The mutual boundary causes each moment to posit its other out of itself and thereby reproduce its dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text deprives mere transcendence, the ought, and progression of the status of ultimate solutions because they preserve the presupposed separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The temporal infinity of endless going-on is determined as the appearance of a conceptual unity that is effective in the alternation itself but is not reflected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the derivation of bad infinity from the external negation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to generate the infinite progress as return of the boundary and not as true infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT3","text":"The positive shape of the unity that bears the reciprocal determination remains underdetermined, because here it is determined as underlying but not elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as each separate side passes over into its other through its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT5","text":"The strongest tension lies in the fact that unity is asserted at once as the necessary driving force and left unrealized or unreflected in the progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BWDE:MRT6","text":"A reconstruction preserves the movement of the text only if it does not dissolve the difference between immanent unity and appearing externality into an immediate reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BWDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BWDE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BWDE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 33","title":"b. Reciprocal Determination of the Finite and the Infinite.","context":"Chapter 33","original_title":"b. Wechselbestimmung des Endlichen und Unendlichen."},"original_title":"b. Wechselbestimmung des Endlichen und Unendlichen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU","layer":"CH","title":"c. Affirmative Infinity.","order":34,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDAU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDAU@R001","sha256":"681dd12b086e038f511188f706f63255aec9d2e32735c4a3da550fbce6ce8a02","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS1","text":"Der unendliche Progress soll die Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem ausdrücken, enthält aber faktisch ihre wechselseitige Vermittlung und Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS2","text":"Das Unendliche wird neu bestimmt, indem seine anfängliche Gestalt als bloßes Hinausgehen über das Endliche als endliche und widersprüchliche Abstraktion ausgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS3","text":"Die Analyse operiert immanent-rekonstruktiv, indem sie aus den Bestimmungen des Endlichen und Unendlichen deren jeweils enthaltenes Anderes ableitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS4","text":"Die Fixierung der Momente als qualitativ getrennte Selbstständigkeiten erzeugt das Schlecht-Unendliche und verdeckt die im Progress wirksame Negation beider.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS5","text":"Die Negation der Negation erzeugt eine vermittelte Selbstbeziehung, in der Endliches und Unendliches nur noch Momente eines sich schließenden Prozesses sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS6","text":"Das wahrhaft Unendliche ist kein jenseitiges Gegenüber, sondern ein gegenwärtiges Werden, das seine endliche Entäußerung in seine affirmative Selbstbeziehung zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS7","text":"Das Endliche wird innerhalb des wahrhaft Unendlichen als ideelles, nicht selbstständiges Moment bestimmt, während Realität dem affirmativen Ganzen zukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A1","text":"Das unmittelbare Unendliche ist die Negation des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","text":"Das Endliche ist durch seine eigene Nichtigkeit auf Unendlichkeit bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","text":"Endliches und Unendliches können nicht bestimmt werden, ohne jeweils das Andere in ihrer Bestimmung zu enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","text":"Ein als vom Endlichen getrennt gesetztes Unendliches ist selbst endlich, weil es durch sein Gegenüber begrenzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A5","text":"Ein als vom Unendlichen getrennt gesetztes Endliches erhält diejenige Selbstständigkeit, die dem Unendlichen zugeschrieben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","text":"Das Aufheben des Endlichen ist keine äußere Einwirkung, sondern die im Endlichen selbst wirksame Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","text":"Die Negation der Negation ist vermittelte Beziehung auf sich selbst und daher Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","text":"Der unendliche Progress enthält die Negation des Endlichen und des Unendlichen, setzt diese Negation jedoch zunächst als äußeren Wechsel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A9","text":"Die Wiederkehr durch die Negation hebt die isolierte Selbstständigkeit des Endlichen und Unendlichen auf und macht sie zu Momenten eines Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A10","text":"Das wahrhaft Unendliche ist wesentlich Werden und nicht bewegungslose Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A11","text":"Das wahrhaft Unendliche ist als affirmativ in sich zurückgekehrte Negation bestimmtes Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A12","text":"Das Endliche ist im wahrhaft Unendlichen ideell, weil es unterschieden, aber nicht selbstständig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX1","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht ein bloßes Jenseits des Endlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX2","text":"Die Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht äußerliches Zusammenbringen zweier zuvor selbstständiger Entitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX3","text":"Das Aufheben des Endlichen ist nicht Veränderung überhaupt und nicht die Vernichtung eines äußerlich vorliegenden Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX4","text":"Die wahre Unendlichkeit ist nicht die endlose Fortsetzung eines Fortschreitens über immer neue Grenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX5","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht als unerreichbar zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX6","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht das affirmativ Reale gegenüber einem bloß ideellen Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX7","text":"Die Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht abstrakte, bewegungslose Sichselbstgleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D1","text":"Die abstrakte Entgegensetzung von Endlichem und Unendlichem reproduziert zwei Endlichkeiten statt eines wahrhaft Unendlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D2","text":"Der unendliche Progress vollzieht eine Selbstschließung, obwohl er sich als unendliche Flucht darstellt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D3","text":"Das Endliche kehrt durch sein Überschreiten zu sich zurück, weil sein Jenseits seine eigene Unendlichkeit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D4","text":"Das Unendliche kehrt durch die Grenze zu sich zurück, weil die Grenze nicht ein äußeres Hindernis, sondern sein eigenes Moment ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D5","text":"Die qualitative Differenz von Endlichem und Unendlichem verliert in ihrer Wahrheit den Status selbstständiger Naturen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D6","text":"Affirmation ist nicht vornegativ gegeben, sondern entsteht allein als Rückkehr der Negation aus ihrer eigenen Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D7","text":"Die Realität des wahrhaft Unendlichen schließt die Endlichkeit nicht aus, sondern enthält sie als ideelles Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A11","CH_GB18_CDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD1","text":"Die Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht ein stabiler ontologischer Befund, sondern die selbstaufhebende Erscheinungsform ihrer Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A5","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD2","text":"Das wahrhaft Unendliche ist nur als immanente Selbstvermittlung denkbar; jede Transzendenz ohne Rückkehr bleibt abstrakte Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A10","CH_GB18_CDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD3","text":"Der unendliche Progress ist zugleich falsche Darstellung und notwendige Erscheinungsform der Wahrheit, weil er die Vermittlung ausführt, ohne sie als Einheit zu begreifen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9","CH_GB18_CDAU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD4","text":"Die Wahrheit des Endlichen besteht nicht in seiner Aufrechterhaltung als Seiendes, sondern in seiner funktionalen Stellung innerhalb eines affirmativen Ganzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Bestimmungen durch eine feste äußere Grenze ihre Identität erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Negation bloß Mangel, Verlust oder Auslöschung ohne affirmative Rückkehr bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem das Unendliche durch Entfernung vom Endlichen an Wahrheit gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem das Endliche als selbstständige Realität und das Unendliche als bloß gedachte Idealität verteilt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Anfangspunkt, der dem Endlichen oder dem Unendlichen einen ontologischen Vorrang innerhalb des Prozesses zuschreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar wird ein absolut äußeres Jenseits, das vom Endlichen unberührt bleibt und dennoch als dessen Wahrheit gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird eine endgültige qualitative Identität, die sich gegen Vermittlung, Selbstnegation und prozessuale Rückkehr abschirmen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich wird ein Unendliches, das seine Affirmation nicht durch die Aufnahme und Aufhebung seiner Endlichkeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbare Negation des Endlichen → abstraktes Unendliches als Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS2","text":"Abstraktes Jenseits + Gegenüber des Endlichen → Begrenztheit des angeblich Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS3","text":"Wechselseitige Bestimmung der Gegensätze → jedes enthält sein Anderes als eigenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS4","text":"Äußerer Progress über Grenze und Jenseits → faktische Wiederkehr jedes Moments zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS5","text":"Wiederkehr durch Negation → Negation der Negation → vermittelte Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS6","text":"Vermittelte Affirmation → wahrhaft Unendliches als sich selbst erzeugendes Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS7","text":"Wahrhaft Unendliches als Dasein → Endliches als ideelles Moment → Realität des affirmativen Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF1","text":"Schlecht-Unendliches als bloßes Hinausgehen **→** wechselseitige Implikation von Endlichem und Unendlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF2","text":"Wechselseitige Implikation **→** Widerlegung ihrer absoluten qualitativen Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF3","text":"Widerlegung der Trennung **→** Analyse des Progresses als äußerlich gesetzte Negation beider Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF4","text":"Äußerlich gesetzte Negation **→** Rekonstruktion der Wiederkehr als Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF5","text":"Selbstvermittlung **→** Negation der Negation als Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF6","text":"Affirmation **→** wahrhaft Unendliches als gegenwärtiges Dasein und Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF7","text":"Gegenwärtiges Unendliches **→** Idealisierung des Endlichen und höhere Bestimmung der Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME1","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit werden von zwei gegenüberstehenden Seinsregionen zu korrelativen Momenten eines einzigen Vermittlungsprozesses umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME2","text":"Der unendliche Progress erscheint nicht mehr als Beweis unbegrenzter Transzendenz, sondern als unvollständige Erscheinung eines sich schließenden Kreislaufs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME3","text":"Negation wird von einer bloß destruktiven Operation zu der produktiven Vermittlung verschoben, durch die Affirmation entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME4","text":"Das Jenseits verliert den Rang höherer Realität und wird als Mangel einer abstrakten, noch nicht zu sich zurückgekehrten Negation sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME5","text":"Das Endliche verliert den Status selbstständiger Realität und wird als ideeller Inhalt des wahrhaft Unendlichen lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME6","text":"Die Kreisfigur ersetzt die Gerade als Modell der Wahrheit, weil nur die Rückkehr die Präsenz des Unendlichen ausdrückt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das Verhältnis von Endlichem, Unendlichem, Progress, Grenze, Realität und Idealität neu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Identität jeder Bestimmung entsteht durch ihre immanente Negation, ihre Vermittlung mit dem Anderen und ihre Rückkehr zu sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Verstand wird als Operationsweise bestimmt, die prozessuale Momente isoliert, qualitative Selbstständigkeit fixiert und dadurch die Wahrheit der Bewegung verfälscht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit besitzt die Form gegenwärtiger Selbstvermittlung; sie liegt weder in einem vergangenen Ausgangspunkt noch in einem unerreichbaren zukünftigen Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der abstrakten Gegenüberstellung zur affirmativen Unendlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die im Progress beobachtete Wiederkehr notwendig als immanente Einheit und nicht lediglich als Wiederholung beschrieben werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Negation nicht als äußerer Verlust, sondern als Selbstvermittlung begriffen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Operation besteht in der Umkehrung des Jenseitsmodells: Das Unerreichbare wird als Defekt, die Rückkehr als Wahrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung verbleibt zwischen der Kritik an äußerlicher Vergleichung und der eigenen Rekonstruktion der Einheit durch vergleichendes Herausheben der Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung verbleibt zwischen der Bestimmung des wahrhaft Unendlichen als Werden und seiner Bestimmung als gegenwärtiges affirmatives Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung nur dann, wenn die Einheit nicht als Endzustand, sondern als sich vollziehende Aufhebung der Trennung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113953411570Z_298fec17","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The affirmative infinity.","source_sha256":"681dd12b086e038f511188f706f63255aec9d2e32735c4a3da550fbce6ce8a02","sha256":"2d774a434cba5de732677d2767e697b863df6f05cade6feb33a074df76b39702","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:39:53.412704+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS1","text":"Infinite progress is supposed to express the separation of finite and infinite, but in fact contains their reciprocal mediation and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS2","text":"The infinite is newly determined insofar as its initial form, as a mere going-beyond the finite, is shown to be a finite and contradictory abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS3","text":"The analysis operates immanently and reconstructively, deriving from the determinations of the finite and the infinite the other respectively contained within them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS4","text":"The fixation of the moments as qualitatively separate self-subsistences produces the bad infinite and conceals the negation of both operative in progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS5","text":"The negation of negation produces a mediated self-relation in which finite and infinite are only moments of a process closing itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS6","text":"The true infinite is not a beyond confronting it, but a present becoming that takes its finite externalization back into its affirmative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AS7","text":"Within the true infinite, the finite is determined as an ideal, non-self-subsistent moment, while reality belongs to the affirmative whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A1","text":"The immediate infinite is the negation of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","text":"Through its own nullity, the finite is related to infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","text":"Finite and infinite cannot be determined without each containing the other in its determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","text":"An infinite posited as separate from the finite is itself finite, because it is bounded by its counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A5","text":"A finite posited as separate from the infinite acquires that self-subsistence which is ascribed to the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","text":"The sublation of the finite is not an external effect, but the infinity operative within the finite itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","text":"The negation of negation is mediated relation to itself and is therefore affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","text":"Infinite progress contains the negation of the finite and the infinite, but initially posits this negation as an external alternation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A9","text":"Return through negation sublates the isolated self-subsistence of finite and infinite and makes them moments of a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A10","text":"The true infinite is essentially becoming and not motionless unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A11","text":"The true infinite is determinate being determined as negation affirmatively returned into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:A12","text":"The finite is ideal in the true infinite because it is distinguished but not self-subsistent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX1","text":"The infinite is not a mere beyond of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX2","text":"The unity of finite and infinite is not an external bringing together of two previously self-subsistent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX3","text":"The sublation of the finite is not change in general and not the annihilation of a something externally at hand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX4","text":"True infinity is not the endless continuation of a progression beyond ever-new limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX5","text":"The infinite is not to be determined as unattainable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX6","text":"The finite is not the affirmatively real as against a merely ideal infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:NX7","text":"The unity of finite and infinite is not abstract, motionless self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D1","text":"The abstract opposition of finite and infinite reproduces two finitudes instead of one true infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D2","text":"Infinite progress accomplishes a self-closing, although it presents itself as an infinite flight.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D3","text":"The finite returns to itself through its surpassing, because its beyond is its own infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D4","text":"The infinite returns to itself through the limit, because the limit is not an external obstacle but its own moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D5","text":"In its truth, the qualitative difference of finite and infinite loses the status of self-subsistent natures.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D6","text":"Affirmation is not given prior to negation, but arises only as the return of negation from its own negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:D7","text":"The reality of the true infinite does not exclude finitude, but contains it as an ideal moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A11","CH_GB18_CDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD1","text":"The separation of finite and infinite is not a stable ontological finding, but the self-sublating form of appearance of their unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A3","CH_GB18_CDAU:A4","CH_GB18_CDAU:A5","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD2","text":"The true infinite is conceivable only as immanent self-mediation; every transcendence without return remains abstract negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A6","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A10","CH_GB18_CDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD3","text":"Infinite progress is at once a false presentation and a necessary form of appearance of truth, because it carries out mediation without comprehending it as unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A8","CH_GB18_CDAU:A9","CH_GB18_CDAU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SD4","text":"The truth of the finite consists not in its preservation as being, but in its functional position within an affirmative whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAU:A2","CH_GB18_CDAU:A7","CH_GB18_CDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which determinations receive their identity through a fixed external limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which negation signifies merely lack, loss, or extinction without affirmative return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which the infinite gains truth through distance from the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model in which the finite can be distributed as self-subsistent reality and the infinite as merely thought ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a point of departure that ascribes ontological priority within the process to the finite or the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely external beyond that remains untouched by the finite and yet could count as its truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a final qualitative identity that could shield itself against mediation, self-negation, and processual return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:SNX3","text":"Impossible is an infinite that does not produce its affirmation through the incorporation and sublation of its finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS1","text":"Immediate negation of the finite → abstract infinite as beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS2","text":"Abstract beyond + counterpart of the finite → boundedness of the purportedly infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS3","text":"Reciprocal determination of the opposites → each contains its other as its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS4","text":"External progress over limit and beyond → actual return of each moment to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS5","text":"Return through negation → negation of negation → mediated affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS6","text":"Mediated affirmation → true infinite as self-generating becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:FGS7","text":"True infinite as determinate being → finite as ideal moment → reality of the affirmative whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF1","text":"Bad infinite as mere going-beyond **→** reciprocal implication of finite and infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF2","text":"Reciprocal implication **→** refutation of their absolute qualitative separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF3","text":"Refutation of separation **→** analysis of progress as externally posited negation of both moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF4","text":"Externally posited negation **→** reconstruction of return as self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF5","text":"Self-mediation **→** negation of negation as affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF6","text":"Affirmation **→** true infinite as present determinate being and becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:AF7","text":"Present infinite **→** idealization of the finite and higher determination of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME1","text":"Finitude and infinity are reclassified from two opposed regions of being into correlative moments of a single process of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME2","text":"Infinite progress no longer appears as proof of unbounded transcendence, but as the incomplete appearance of a self-closing circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME3","text":"Negation is shifted from a merely destructive operation to the productive mediation through which affirmation arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME4","text":"The beyond loses the rank of higher reality and becomes visible as the deficiency of an abstract negation not yet returned to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME5","text":"The finite loses the status of self-subsistent reality and becomes legible as the ideal content of the true infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ME6","text":"The figure of the circle replaces the straight line as the model of truth, because only return expresses the presence of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text newly determines the relation of finite, infinite, progress, limit, reality, and ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — The identity of every determination arises through its immanent negation, its mediation with the other, and its return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The understanding is determined as a mode of operation that isolates processual moments, fixes qualitative self-subsistence, and thereby falsifies the truth of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth has the form of present self-mediation; it lies neither in a past point of departure nor in an unattainable future beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from abstract opposition to affirmative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why the return observed in progress must necessarily be described as immanent unity and not merely as repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as negation is understood not as external loss, but as self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation consists in the reversal of the model of the beyond: the unattainable is determined as defect, return as truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the critique of external comparison and its own reconstruction of unity through comparative elevation of the moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT6","text":"A further tension remains between the determination of the true infinite as becoming and its determination as present affirmative determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAU:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument only if unity is understood not as an end-state, but as the self-enacting sublation of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAU:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDAU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDAU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 34","title":"c. Affirmative Infinity.","context":"Chapter 34","original_title":"c. Die affirmative Unendlichkeit."},"original_title":"c. Die affirmative Unendlichkeit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB","layer":"CH","title":"The Transition.","order":35,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DERB"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DERB@R001","sha256":"f2be50efcb9962415b7ba7f4c0379e09db9ea4b78f6d8633633bfbecc0d525f5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS1","text":"Die Bestimmung der Idealität verlangt die Vermittlung von Unendlichkeit und Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS2","text":"Das Werden der Idealität bestimmt sich als Übergang in das Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS3","text":"Dieser Übergang erfolgt durch das Aufheben der Endlichkeit und der ihr bloß gegenüberstehenden negativen Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS4","text":"Die Aufhebung erzeugt eine Rückkehr in sich, in der Beziehung auf sich selbst als Seyn bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS5","text":"Weil dieses Seyn Negation enthält, ist es Daseyn; weil diese Negation Negation der Negation ist, wird das Daseyn als Fürsichseyn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A1","text":"Die Idealität kann als Qualität der Unendlichkeit bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A2","text":"Die Idealität ist wesentlich Proceß des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A3","text":"Werden ist wesentlich Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A4","text":"Der maßgebliche Übergang ist der Übergang des Werdens in Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A5","text":"Die Endlichkeit wird als solche aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A6","text":"Die der Endlichkeit bloß gegenüberstehende negative Unendlichkeit wird ebenfalls aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A7","text":"Die Aufhebung der Endlichkeit und der negativen Unendlichkeit ist Rückkehr in sich und Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A8","text":"Seyn, in dem Negation enthalten ist, ist Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A9","text":"Die im Daseyn wirksame Negation ist wesentlich Negation der Negation und sich auf sich beziehende Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A10","text":"Das durch Negation der Negation bestimmte Daseyn heißt Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX1","text":"Die Endlichkeit gilt nicht als selbständige letzte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX2","text":"Die Unendlichkeit gilt nicht als bloß negative Gegenposition zur Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX3","text":"Das Werden wird nicht als äußerer Vorgang neben der Idealität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX4","text":"Das Seyn bleibt nicht bei einer einfachen, negationslosen Unmittelbarkeit stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX5","text":"Die Negation bleibt nicht eine einmalige Negation, sondern wird als Negation der Negation überschritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D1","text":"Die Idealität ist nicht bloß ein Zustand der Unendlichkeit, sondern deren prozessuale Selbstvermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A1","CH_GB18_DERB:A2","CH_GB18_DERB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D2","text":"Der Übergang in das Daseyn ist die konkrete Form, in der die Idealität sich verwirklicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A2","CH_GB18_DERB:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D3","text":"Die Aufhebung der Endlichkeit beseitigt nicht jede Bestimmtheit, sondern führt in eine auf sich bezogene Bestimmung zurück.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A5","CH_GB18_DERB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D4","text":"Die negative Unendlichkeit verliert ihre Selbständigkeit, weil sie als bloße Gegenüberstellung zur Endlichkeit mit aufgehoben wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A6","CH_GB18_DERB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D5","text":"Daseyn ist kein bloßes Seyn, sondern Seyn als bestimmte Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D6","text":"Fürsichseyn entsteht, sobald die Negation des Daseyns sich auf sich selbst bezieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A9","CH_GB18_DERB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD1","text":"Die dialektische Bestimmung der Idealität erzeugt Daseyn nicht durch Addition einer neuen Eigenschaft, sondern durch die Selbstvermittlung aufgehobener Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD2","text":"Endlichkeit und negative Unendlichkeit bilden keine letzten Pole, sondern werden in einer Bewegung aufgehoben, deren Resultat eine selbstbezogene Bestimmtheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD3","text":"Die ontologische Stufenfolge Seyn → Daseyn → Fürsichseyn wird durch zunehmende Selbstbezüglichkeit der Negation erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD4","text":"Das Resultat des Übergangs ist weder unmittelbare Unendlichkeit noch bloße Endlichkeit, sondern eine durch Negation vermittelte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX1","text":"Eine statische Idealität ohne Werden muss falsch sein, damit Idealität als Übergang bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX2","text":"Eine Endlichkeit, die unabhängig von ihrer Aufhebung bestehen bleibt, ist für die Argumentbewegung unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX3","text":"Eine Unendlichkeit, die lediglich außerhalb oder gegenüber der Endlichkeit steht, ist keine tragfähige Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX4","text":"Ein Seyn ohne innere Negation kann nicht als bestimmtes Daseyn gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX5","text":"Eine Negation ohne Rückbezug auf sich selbst reicht nicht zur Bestimmung des Fürsichseyns aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie letzter, voneinander unabhängiger Bestimmungen; jede Bestimmung muss in einen Übergang der Selbstvermittlung eintreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Unendlichkeit als fertige, der Endlichkeit äußerlich entgegengesetzte Totalität zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein unmittelbares Sein, das nicht durch Negation und deren Selbstbeziehung vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines äußerlichen Übergangsmechanismus strukturiert das System: Der Übergang muss aus der inneren Negativität der Bestimmungen hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS1","text":"Idealität als Qualität der Unendlichkeit → Idealität als Werden → Werden als Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS2","text":"Werden als Übergang → Aufhebung der Endlichkeit und der bloß entgegengesetzten negativen Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung der Gegensätze → Rückkehr in sich → Beziehung auf sich selbst → Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS4","text":"Seyn + Negation → Daseyn; Daseyn + Negation der Negation → Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AF1","text":"Idealität als Unendlichkeit → prozessuale Bestimmung als Werden → Übergang in Daseyn → Aufhebung von Endlichkeit und negativer Gegenunendlichkeit → Rückkehr in sich → Seyn → Daseyn → Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME1","text":"Die Karte verschiebt die Unterscheidung von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit von einer äußeren Opposition in eine gemeinsame dialektische Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME2","text":"Seyn, Daseyn und Fürsichseyn werden als aufeinanderfolgende Grade der Negationsbeziehung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME3","text":"Idealität wird von einer abstrakten Eigenschaft in einen selbstvermittelnden Übergangsprozess umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME4","text":"Das Resultat des Aufhebens erscheint nicht als Auflösung von Bestimmtheit, sondern als deren Rückkehr in selbstbezogene Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Text bestimmt den Übergang der Idealität aus dem Werden in das Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Der Übergang wird durch die Aufhebung einer doppelten Opposition und durch die Rückkehr in sich erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text ersetzt äußerliche Gegenüberstellung durch eine Sequenz innerer Vermittlung und bestimmt jede folgende Kategorie aus der vorausgehenden Negationsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Realität erscheint als Werden, Übergang und Negation der Negation; Daseyn und Fürsichseyn sind zeitlich-logische Entwicklungsbestimmungen und keine isolierten Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Idealität über Werden und Übergang zu Daseyn und Fürsichseyn zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch der Übergang formal notwendig wird, da seine Notwendigkeit hauptsächlich durch die dialektische Terminologie gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT3","text":"Die interne Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Negation, Aufhebung und Selbstbeziehung als zusammenhängende Operationen gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der gestuften Ableitung von Seyn, Daseyn und Fürsichseyn aus der Negationsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Stelle liegt in der nicht weiter ausgewiesenen Vermittlung zwischen der Qualität der Unendlichkeit und dem Prozess des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange der Übergang nicht als empirischer Vorgang, sondern als immanente Selbstbestimmung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115231429614Z_7c528f7e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Transition.","source_sha256":"f2be50efcb9962415b7ba7f4c0379e09db9ea4b78f6d8633633bfbecc0d525f5","sha256":"ab43e5cae663663c3462266a70b5f82516fc1905819aad926ae00f1db71addd4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:52:31.430759+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS1","text":"The determination of ideality requires the mediation of infinity and becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS2","text":"The becoming of ideality determines itself as transition into determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS3","text":"This transition takes place through the sublation of finitude and of the negative infinity merely opposed to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS4","text":"Sublation produces a return into itself, in which relation to itself is determined as Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AS5","text":"Because this Being contains negation, it is determinate being; because this negation is negation of negation, determinate being is determined as being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A1","text":"Ideality can be determined as the quality of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A2","text":"Ideality is essentially the process of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A3","text":"Becoming is essentially transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A4","text":"The decisive transition is the transition of becoming into determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A5","text":"Finitude is sublated as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A6","text":"The negative infinity merely opposed to finitude is likewise sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A7","text":"The sublation of finitude and negative infinity is return into itself and relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A8","text":"Being in which negation is contained is determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A9","text":"The negation active in determinate being is essentially negation of negation and self-relating negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:A10","text":"Determinate being determined through negation of negation is called being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX1","text":"Finitude does not count as an independent final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX2","text":"Infinity does not count as a merely negative counterposition to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX3","text":"Becoming is not determined as an external process alongside ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX4","text":"Being does not remain at a simple immediacy devoid of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:NX5","text":"Negation does not remain a one-time negation, but is surpassed as negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D1","text":"Ideality is not merely a state of infinity, but its processual self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A1","CH_GB18_DERB:A2","CH_GB18_DERB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D2","text":"The transition into determinate being is the concrete form in which ideality realizes itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A2","CH_GB18_DERB:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D3","text":"The sublation of finitude does not eliminate every determinacy, but leads back into a self-related determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A5","CH_GB18_DERB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D4","text":"Negative infinity loses its independence because it is sublated along with its mere opposition to finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A6","CH_GB18_DERB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D5","text":"Determinate being is not mere Being, but Being as determinate negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:D6","text":"Being-for-self arises as soon as the negation of determinate being relates to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DERB:A9","CH_GB18_DERB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD1","text":"The dialectical determination of ideality produces determinate being not by the addition of a new property, but through the self-mediation of sublated opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD2","text":"Finitude and negative infinity form no final poles, but are sublated in a movement whose result is a self-related determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD3","text":"The ontological sequence Being → determinate being → being-for-self is produced through increasing self-relatedness of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SD4","text":"The result of the transition is neither immediate infinity nor mere finitude, but a self-relation mediated through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX1","text":"A static ideality without becoming must be false if ideality is to be determined as transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX2","text":"A finitude that persists independently of its sublation is inadmissible for the movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX3","text":"An infinity that merely stands outside or opposed to finitude is no sustainable infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX4","text":"A Being without internal negation cannot count as determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:DNX5","text":"A negation without self-reference does not suffice for the determination of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of final determinations independent of one another; every determination must enter into a transition of self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of treating infinity as a finished totality externally opposed to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is an immediate Being that would not be mediated through negation and its self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:SNX4","text":"The absence of an external mechanism of transition structures the system: the transition must arise from the inner negativity of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS1","text":"Ideality as quality of infinity → ideality as becoming → becoming as transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS2","text":"Becoming as transition → sublation of finitude and of the merely opposed negative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS3","text":"Sublation of the opposites → return into itself → relation to itself → Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:FGS4","text":"Being + negation → determinate being; determinate being + negation of negation → being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:AF1","text":"Ideality as infinity → processual determination as becoming → transition into determinate being → sublation of finitude and negative counter-infinity → return into itself → Being → determinate being → being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME1","text":"The map shifts the distinction between finitude and infinity from an external opposition into a shared dialectical movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME2","text":"Being, determinate being, and being-for-self are classified as successive degrees of the relation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME3","text":"Ideality is remapped from an abstract property into a self-mediating process of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ME4","text":"The result of sublation appears not as the dissolution of determinacy, but as its return into self-related determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The text determines the transition of ideality from becoming into determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The transition is produced through the sublation of a double opposition and through return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text replaces external opposition with a sequence of internal mediation and determines each subsequent category from the preceding movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality appears as becoming, transition, and negation of negation; determinate being and being-for-self are temporal-logical determinations of development and not isolated states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from ideality through becoming and transition to determinate being and being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what makes the transition formally necessary, since its necessity is posited chiefly through dialectical terminology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT3","text":"The internal structure is coherent insofar as negation, sublation, and self-relation count as interconnected operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the graded derivation of Being, determinate being, and being-for-self from the structure of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT5","text":"The weakest point lies in the mediation, not further demonstrated, between the quality of infinity and the process of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DERB:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as transition is understood not as an empirical process, but as immanent self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DERB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DERB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 35","title":"The Transition.","context":"Chapter 35","original_title":"Der Übergang."},"original_title":"Der Übergang.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":36,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_4"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_4@R001","sha256":"2ab90468030d5b36001e692a2982cc0099bf6e452074784f4ba59dfb29034832","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, dass das gewöhnliche Unendliche seinen eigenen Widerspruch als letzte Lösung ausgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS2","text":"Der unendliche Progreß entsteht, weil Einheit und Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem zugleich gesetzt, aber nicht begrifflich vereinigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS3","text":"Die Bewegung des Arguments führt von der schlechten Unendlichkeit über die Diagnose des alternierenden Widerspruchs zur Idealität der Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS4","text":"Spekulatives Denken wird als Erfassen entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen in einer Einheit bestimmt, in der jede ihr Gegenteil an sich selbst hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS5","text":"Die Frage, wie das Unendliche zur Endlichkeit komme, wird nicht beantwortet, sondern wegen ihrer Voraussetzung getrennter Selbstständigkeiten negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS6","text":"Die Endposition bestimmt Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit als ideell unterschiedene, aber untrennbare Momente derselben Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","text":"Das abstrakt dem Endlichen entgegengesetzte Unendliche ist selbst begrenzt und daher endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","text":"Das Endliche enthält seine eigene Negation, die Unendlichkeit, in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","text":"Jede einseitig gesetzte Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem erzeugt ihre Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","text":"Jede einseitig gesetzte Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem erzeugt ihre Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist die abstrakte Abwechslung von Einheit und Trennung, nicht ihre begriffene Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A6","text":"Ursache und Wirkung sind nur als untrennbare Bestimmungen eines Verhältnisses das, was sie sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","text":"Gegensätzliche Bestimmungen besitzen Wahrheit nur als ideelle Momente ihrer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","text":"Die Negation der Negation resultiert in Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","text":"Begreifen besteht darin, die Untrennbarkeit der einander negierenden Bestimmungen einzusehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A10","text":"Eine Frage mit unwahren Voraussetzungen ist durch Negation ihrer Voraussetzungen aufzulösen, nicht innerhalb ihrer Form zu beantworten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A11","text":"Die bestimmte Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem enthält ihre Unterscheidung bereits als ideelle Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX1","text":"Das wahre Unendliche ist nicht der bloße Progreß über eine Grenze hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX2","text":"Die Auflösung des Widerspruchs ist nicht die symmetrische Anerkennung gleicher Richtigkeit und Unrichtigkeit beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX3","text":"Die Einheit von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht eine abstrakte Identität ohne Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX4","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist nicht ihre Loslösung zu selbstständigen Realitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX5","text":"Ursache ist nicht ohne Wirkung, und Wirkung ist nicht ohne Ursache bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX6","text":"Spekulatives Denken ist nicht das Verharren bei abwechselnden Behauptungen von Einheit und Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX7","text":"Die Frage nach dem Herausgehen des Unendlichen ist nicht neutral, sondern setzt das zu Prüfende bereits als wahr voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX8","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht zuerst rein unendlich und erst nachträglich endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D1","text":"Der unendliche Progreß reproduziert notwendig seinen Ausgangswiderspruch, weil jede Grenze des Unendlichen ein neues Endliches und jede Endlichkeit eine Beziehung auf Unendlichkeit erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","CH_GB18_AN_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D2","text":"Die Kausalreihe ist keine Reihe unabhängiger Ursachen, sondern die wiederholte Trennung einer bereits bestehenden Einheit von Ursache und Wirkung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","CH_GB18_AN_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D3","text":"Die schlechte Unendlichkeit ist endlich, weil ihr Sein in der Gegenüberstellung zum Endlichen besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D4","text":"Das Endliche und das abstrakte Unendliche besitzen isoliert keine Wahrheit, weil jede Bestimmung ihr Anderes an sich trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D5","text":"Die Auflösung des Widerspruchs besteht in seiner Versöhnung innerhalb der Idealität der unterschiedenen Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D6","text":"Die Frage nach dem Übergang vom Unendlichen zum Endlichen verfällt, weil sie eine zeitlich oder ontologisch vorgängige Selbstständigkeit beider Seiten voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A10","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D7","text":"Das Unendliche ist ewig zur Endlichkeit herausgegangen, weil es ohne sein Anderes keine bestehende abstrakte Einheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD1","text":"Der unendliche Progreß erscheint als Unendlichkeit, ist aber die formale Selbstreproduktion eines nicht begriffenen Verhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD2","text":"Die affirmative Wahrheit entsteht nicht neben der Negation, sondern als Resultat einer Negation, die ihre eigene Einseitigkeit negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD3","text":"Wahrheit wird von der Selbstständigkeit einzelner Bestimmungen auf die Selbstbeziehung ihrer bewegten Einheit verlagert.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD4","text":"Philosophische Kritik operiert nicht primär durch Antwortbildung, sondern durch Prüfung und Aufhebung der Voraussetzungen, die eine Frage erst erzeugen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","CH_GB18_AN_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Endlichem und Unendlichem hat keine lineare Herkunftsordnung, weil beide nur in ihrer gegenseitigen ideellen Vermittlung bestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Gegensätze zunächst vollständig getrennt bestehen und erst nachträglich vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Unendlichkeit durch bloße Verlängerung endlicher Reihen erreichbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Widerspruch durch Ausgleich zweier gleichberechtigter Einseitigkeiten verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem sprachliche Bilder des Herausgehens ontologische oder zeitliche Prozesse unmittelbar abbilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Fragen unabhängig von den Wahrheitsbedingungen ihrer Voraussetzungen beurteilt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist die Vorstellung eines letzten Standpunkts außerhalb der Bewegung von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit, von dem beide als fertige Entitäten verglichen werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein reines Unendliches, das keine Negativität, Grenze oder Beziehung auf Endlichkeit in sich enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Philosophie, die ihre Grundfrage übernimmt, ohne zuvor die Wahrheit der durch diese Frage gesetzten Bestimmungen zu prüfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte Gegenüberstellung von Endlichem und Unendlichem → jede Seite enthält ihr Gegenteil als Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS2","text":"Enthaltenes Gegenteil → Einheit der Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS3","text":"Einseitige Setzung der Einheit → erneute Trennung der Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS4","text":"Wiederholte Setzung von Einheit und Trennung → unendlicher Progreß als abstrakte Alternation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS5","text":"Einsicht in die Alternation als Selbstnegation beider Einseitigkeiten → Idealität der Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS6","text":"Idealität der Gegensätze → Negation der Negation → affirmative, sich auf sich beziehende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS7","text":"Prüfung der Voraussetzungen einer Übergangsfrage → Negation der vorausgesetzten selbstständigen Entitäten → Auflösung der Frageform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF1","text":"Schlechtes Unendliches → Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF2","text":"Gegensatz → wechselnde Behauptung von Einheit und Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF3","text":"Wechsel → unendlicher Progreß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF4","text":"Diagnose des Progresses → Einsicht in die Untrennbarkeit von Einheit und Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF5","text":"Untrennbarkeit → Idealität der unterschiedenen Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF6","text":"Idealität → Negation der Negation → affirmative Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF7","text":"Übergangsfrage → Entlarvung ihrer Voraussetzungen → Negation der Frage → bestimmte Einheit von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME1","text":"Unendlichkeit wird von quantitativer oder serieller Fortsetzung in eine immanente Selbstbeziehung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Einheit und Trennung wird nicht als Alternative, sondern als selbst untrennbares Gegensatzverhältnis lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME3","text":"Kausalität wird von einer linearen Folge selbstständiger Glieder in die Einheit wechselseitig konstituierender Bestimmungen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME4","text":"Philosophische Fragen werden als Träger ontologischer Voraussetzungen sichtbar und damit selbst zu Gegenständen der Kritik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Endlichem und Unendlichem wird von einer Herkunftserzählung in eine logische Struktur wechselseitiger Immanenz transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das explizite Objekt ist die Bestimmung des Unendlichen, des unendlichen Progresses und des Übergangs zur Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die notwendige Selbstauflösung isolierter Gegensätze in ihre ideelle Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument ersetzt die Beantwortung einer voraussetzungsbeladenen Frage durch die Kritik ihrer begrifflichen Konstruktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit besitzen keine zeitlich geordnete Selbstständigkeit, sondern bestehen nur als Momente einer sich bewegenden Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Erzeugung des unendlichen Progresses aus der Trennung von Einheit und Unterschied zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Auflösung des Progresses durch Idealität und Negation der Negation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die behauptete Affirmation aus der Negation der Negation methodisch gegen eine bloße Umbenennung des Resultats abgesichert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur bleibt kohärent, sofern Unterschied nicht als selbstständige Trennung, sondern als ideelles Moment der Einheit gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation des Systems ist die Rückführung des unendlichen Progresses auf die nicht begriffene Abwechslung von Einheit und Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT6","text":"Die schärfste Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass die Frage nach dem Übergang als unwahr negiert wird, während ihr Inhalt zugleich als notwendige Selbstbewegung des Unendlichen bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Arguments nur, wenn Fragen, Gegensätze und Übergänge nicht als gegebene Gegenstände, sondern als zu prüfende Setzungen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111220003953Z_31a6d887","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1.","source_sha256":"2ab90468030d5b36001e692a2982cc0099bf6e452074784f4ba59dfb29034832","sha256":"f017ae4a07a38987a59356968a3e75eb573bd5a436fe328d4a0f6fae7124a5e9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:12:20.012439+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS1","text":"The problem consists in the fact that ordinary infinity presents its own contradiction as the final solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS2","text":"Infinite progress arises because unity and separation of the finite and the infinite are posited simultaneously, but are not conceptually united.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS3","text":"The movement of the argument leads from bad infinity, through the diagnosis of alternating contradiction, to the ideality of the opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS4","text":"Speculative thinking is determined as the grasping of opposed determinations in a unity in which each has its opposite within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS5","text":"The question of how the infinite comes to finitude is not answered, but negated on account of its presupposition of separate self-subsistences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AS6","text":"The final position determines finitude and infinity as ideally distinct, yet inseparable moments of the same unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","text":"The infinite abstractly opposed to the finite is itself bounded and therefore finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","text":"The finite contains its own negation, infinity, within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","text":"Every one-sidedly posited unity of the finite and the infinite produces their separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","text":"Every one-sidedly posited separation of the finite and the infinite produces their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","text":"Infinite progress is the abstract alternation of unity and separation, not their comprehended truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A6","text":"Cause and effect are what they are only as inseparable determinations of a relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","text":"Opposed determinations possess truth only as ideal moments of their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","text":"The negation of negation results in affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","text":"Comprehending consists in discerning the inseparability of mutually negating determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A10","text":"A question with untrue presuppositions is to be dissolved through negation of its presuppositions, not answered within its form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:A11","text":"The determinate unity of the finite and the infinite already contains their distinction as an ideal distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX1","text":"True infinity is not mere progress beyond a boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX2","text":"The dissolution of contradiction is not the symmetrical recognition of equal correctness and incorrectness on both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX3","text":"The unity of the finite and the infinite is not an abstract identity without distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX4","text":"The distinction between the finite and the infinite is not their detachment into self-subsistent realities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX5","text":"Cause cannot be determined without effect, nor effect without cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX6","text":"Speculative thinking is not persistence in alternating assertions of unity and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX7","text":"The question of the infinite's going-out is not neutral, but already presupposes as true that which is to be examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:NX8","text":"The infinite is not first purely infinite and only subsequently finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D1","text":"Infinite progress necessarily reproduces its initial contradiction, because every boundary of the infinite produces a new finite, and every finitude a relation to infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","CH_GB18_AN_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D2","text":"The causal series is not a series of independent causes, but the repeated separation of an already existing unity of cause and effect.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","CH_GB18_AN_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D3","text":"Bad infinity is finite because its being consists in opposition to the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D4","text":"The finite and abstract infinity possess no truth in isolation, because every determination bears its other within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D5","text":"The dissolution of contradiction consists in its reconciliation within the ideality of the distinct moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D6","text":"The question of the transition from the infinite to the finite collapses, because it presupposes a temporally or ontologically prior self-subsistence of both sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A10","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:D7","text":"The infinite has eternally gone out into finitude, because without its other it is no subsisting abstract unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A1","CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD1","text":"Infinite progress appears as infinity, but is the formal self-reproduction of an uncomprehended relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A3","CH_GB18_AN_4:A4","CH_GB18_AN_4:A5","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD2","text":"Affirmative truth does not arise alongside negation, but as the result of a negation that negates its own one-sidedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD3","text":"Truth is shifted from the self-subsistence of individual determinations to the self-relation of their moving unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A8","CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD4","text":"Philosophical critique operates not primarily through the formation of answers, but through the examination and sublation of the presuppositions that first generate a question.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A9","CH_GB18_AN_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SD5","text":"The relation of the finite and the infinite has no linear order of origin, because both subsist only in their reciprocal ideal mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_4:A2","CH_GB18_AN_4:A7","CH_GB18_AN_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which opposites initially subsist as completely separate and are only subsequently mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which infinity would be attainable through the mere extension of finite series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which contradiction disappears through the balancing of two equally entitled one-sidednesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model in which linguistic images of going-out directly depict ontological or temporal processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a model in which questions can be assessed independently of the truth-conditions of their presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX1","text":"Inadmissible is the notion of a final standpoint outside the movement of finitude and infinity, from which both could be compared as finished entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a pure infinite that contains within itself no negativity, boundary, or relation to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a philosophy that adopts its fundamental question without first examining the truth of the determinations posited by this question.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS1","text":"Abstract opposition of the finite and the infinite → each side contains its opposite as a determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS2","text":"Contained opposite → unity of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS3","text":"One-sided positing of unity → renewed separation of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS4","text":"Repeated positing of unity and separation → infinite progress as abstract alternation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS5","text":"Insight into alternation as the self-negation of both one-sidednesses → ideality of the opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS6","text":"Ideality of the opposites → negation of negation → affirmative, self-relating unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:FGS7","text":"Examination of the presuppositions of a question of transition → negation of the presupposed self-subsistent entities → dissolution of the question-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF1","text":"Bad infinity → opposition of the finite and the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF2","text":"Opposition → alternating assertion of unity and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF3","text":"Alternation → infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF4","text":"Diagnosis of progress → insight into the inseparability of unity and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF5","text":"Inseparability → ideality of the distinct moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF6","text":"Ideality → negation of negation → affirmative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:AF7","text":"Question of transition → exposure of its presuppositions → negation of the question → determinate unity of finitude and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME1","text":"Infinity is reclassified from quantitative or serial continuation into an immanent self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME2","text":"The opposition of unity and separation becomes legible not as an alternative, but as itself an inseparable relation of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME3","text":"Causality is transferred from a linear sequence of self-subsistent members into the unity of mutually constituting determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME4","text":"Philosophical questions become visible as bearers of ontological presuppositions and thereby themselves become objects of critique.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ME5","text":"The relation of the finite and the infinite is transformed from a narrative of origin into a logical structure of reciprocal immanence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit object is the determination of infinity, infinite progress, and the transition to finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is the necessary self-dissolution of isolated opposites into their ideal unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces the answering of a presupposition-laden question with critique of its conceptual construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Finitude and infinity possess no temporally ordered self-subsistence, but subsist only as moments of a moving unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the generation of infinite progress from the separation of unity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the dissolution of progress through ideality and negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the asserted affirmation resulting from the negation of negation is methodically secured against a mere renaming of the result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT4","text":"The structure remains coherent insofar as difference is read not as self-subsistent separation, but as an ideal moment of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT5","text":"The system's strongest operation is the reduction of infinite progress to the uncomprehended alternation of unity and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT6","text":"The sharpest fault line lies in the fact that the question of transition is negated as untrue, while its content is simultaneously determined as the necessary self-movement of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument only if questions, opposites, and transitions are treated not as given objects, but as positings to be examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_4:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_4:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 36","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 36","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":37,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_5"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_5@R001","sha256":"1b9e62c5f434dd3f543a885a5ddeb61437d482d7205e9af00f816fdd4316a791","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS1","text":"Das Argument bestimmt den Idealismus als Nichtanerkennung des Endlichen als wahrhaftes, letztes und absolutes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS2","text":"Es universalisiert diese Bestimmung zum gemeinsamen Prinzip von Philosophie und Religion und entkräftet dadurch den Gegensatz von Idealismus und Realismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS3","text":"Es deutet philosophische Prinzipien und einzelne Dinge als ideell, weil sie nicht unmittelbar und selbständig, sondern allgemein oder aus Anderem gesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS4","text":"Es bestimmt das Ideelle doppelseitig als konkretes wahrhaftes Ganzes und als dessen in ihm aufgehobene Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS5","text":"Es grenzt den subjektiven Idealismus als bloße Formbestimmung ab, die den endlichen Inhalt unangetastet lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS6","text":"Es schließt, dass der Wechsel von objektiver zu subjektiver Form die Endlichkeit des Inhalts nicht beseitigt und daher keine substanzielle Aufhebung leistet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","text":"Das Endliche ist kein wahrhaftes, letztes und absolutes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","text":"Idealismus besteht in der Nichtanerkennung des Endlichen als wahrhaft Seiendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","text":"Jede Philosophie hat den Idealismus wenigstens zu ihrem Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A4","text":"Religion erkennt die Endlichkeit nicht als Letztes, Absolutes, Unerschaffenes oder Ewiges an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","text":"Philosophische Prinzipien sind Allgemeine und Ideelle, nicht unmittelbar vorfindliche sinnliche Einzeldinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A6","text":"Das durch ein anderes gesetzte Seiende ist nicht selbständig und nicht in sich gegründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","text":"Das Ideelle ist zugleich das konkrete wahrhaft Seiende und die Gesamtheit seiner in ihm aufgehobenen Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A8","text":"Im gewöhnlichen Gebrauch bezeichnet das Ideelle vornehmlich die Form der Vorstellung und kann auch ein nicht reelles Vorstellen bedeuten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A9","text":"Der Geist ist der eigentliche Idealist, weil äußerliches Sein in der Einfachheit des Ich aufgehoben und für mich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","text":"Der subjektive Idealismus behauptet die Form der Subjektivität als ausschließende Wahrheit gegenüber der Form der Objektivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A11","text":"Der formelle Idealismus kann den Inhalt des Vorstellens und Denkens vollständig in seiner Endlichkeit belassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","text":"Der Ausschluss einer Form von Endlichkeit beseitigt die übrigen Endlichkeiten des Inhalts nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A13","text":"Der Gegensatz von Subjektivität und Objektivität ist selbst eine bestimmte Form der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX1","text":"Das Endliche darf nicht als absolutes oder letztes Sein gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX2","text":"Eine Lehre, die dem endlichen Dasein als solchem absolutes Sein zuschreibt, ist keine Philosophie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX3","text":"Philosophische Prinzipien dürfen nicht mit unmittelbar sinnlich vorfindlichen Einzeldingen gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX4","text":"Einzelne Dinge sind nicht als selbständige, in sich gegründete Wesen anzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX5","text":"Das Ideelle darf nicht auf bloße Einbildung oder nicht reelles Vorstellen reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX6","text":"Idealität bedeutet nicht die Tilgung des inhaltlichen Endlichseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX7","text":"Die subjektive Form darf nicht als hinreichende Überwindung der Objektivität und der Endlichkeit gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX8","text":"Idealistische und realistische Philosophie bilden keinen grundlegenden Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D1","text":"Die Nichtanerkennung des Endlichen als Absolutes ist die minimale Bestimmung des Idealismus; die Differenz der Philosophien betrifft den Grad ihrer Durchführung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D2","text":"Philosophie und Religion teilen die Zurückweisung der Endlichkeit als absoluten Seins.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D3","text":"Auch ein scheinbar realistisches philosophisches Prinzip ist ideell, sobald es als Allgemeines und als Wesen anderer Dinge bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D4","text":"Das Ideelle darf weder mit bloßer Vorstellung noch mit einer von ihren Momenten abgetrennten Allgemeinheit identifiziert werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D5","text":"Im Geist wird äußerliches Sein nicht schlechthin ausgelöscht, sondern als für das Ich bestehendes Sein aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D6","text":"Der subjektive Idealismus ist formell, weil er die Form des Meinigen verändert, ohne den endlichen Inhalt zu verändern.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A9","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D7","text":"Der subjektive Idealismus gewinnt nichts Substanzielles, weil die Endlichkeit des Inhalts im Ich erhalten bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11","CH_GB18_AN_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D8","text":"Der Gegensatz von Subjektivität und Objektivität ist selbst eine endliche Bestimmung und daher keine Aufhebung der Endlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","CH_GB18_AN_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD1","text":"Die Universalität des Idealismus verlagert die philosophische Grundfrage von der Schulzugehörigkeit auf die Weise, in der Endlichkeit aufgehoben wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD2","text":"Idealität bezeichnet keine zweite, von der Realität getrennte Sphäre, sondern die konkrete Einheit eines Ganzen mit seinen aufgehobenen Momenten.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A6","CH_GB18_AN_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD3","text":"Die Kritik des subjektiven Idealismus richtet sich nicht gegen Idealität überhaupt, sondern gegen ihre Reduktion auf eine ausschließende Form der Vorstellung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A8","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD4","text":"Eine wirksame Aufhebung der Endlichkeit muss den Inhalt in einer konkreten Totalität aufnehmen, statt nur seine subjektive oder objektive Form auszuschließen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","CH_GB18_AN_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD5","text":"Das System umfasst den Realismus als unzureichend durchgeführte Form derselben Grundfrage, ohne subjektiven Formalismus als deren Lösung anzuerkennen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein endliches Seiendes, das unabhängig von jeder Setzung in sich selbst gründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußerliche Objektivität, die der ideellen Vermittlung vollständig entzogen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Idealität, die nur privates Vorstellen oder bloße Nichtrealität wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass der Wechsel zur subjektiven Form die Endlichkeit des Inhalts beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Allgemeines, das unabhängig von seinen aufgehobenen Momenten bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Philosophie, die als neutraler Realismus ein ungesetztes, unerschaffenes und ewiges Endliches behauptet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar wird eine Überwindung der Endlichkeit durch bloße Rückführung des Inhalts auf das Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit zweier voneinander unabhängiger Bereiche von Idealität und Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Standpunkt, von dem aus die Endlichkeit durch den Ausschluss nur einer ihrer Formen verschwände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX5","text":"Die Argumentation hängt von der Abwesenheit einer unmittelbaren, nicht vermittelten Realität ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS1","text":"Behauptung eines absoluten Endlichen → Negation seines letzten Seins → Definition des Ideellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS2","text":"Definition des Ideellen → Universalisierung auf Philosophie und Religion → Entkräftung des Gegensatzes von Idealismus und Realismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS3","text":"Prüfung philosophischer Prinzipien → Rückführung auf Allgemeinheit und Setzung durch ein anderes → Ideellsetzung von Prinzip und Einzelnem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS4","text":"Ideellsetzung → Doppelseitigkeit des Ideellen → Einheit von konkretem Ganzen und aufgehobenen Momenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS5","text":"Aufhebung äußerlichen Seins im Ich → Bestimmung des Für-mich-Seins → subjektiver Idealismus als Formtheorie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS6","text":"Ausschluss der objektiven Form → Erhaltung des endlichen Inhalts → formeller Idealismus ohne substantielle Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS7","text":"Nachweis der fortbestehenden Endlichkeiten → Zurückweisung bloßer Formoppositionen → Vorrang konkreter Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AF1","text":"Endliches als vermeintlich Absolutes → Negation des letzten Seins → Ideellsetzung von Prinzip und Einzelnem → Doppelseitigkeit von konkretem Ganzen und aufgehobenen Momenten → Reduktion des subjektiven Idealismus auf Form → Fortbestand der Endlichkeit des Inhalts → Vorrang konkreter Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME1","text":"Idealismus wird von einer philosophischen Schulbezeichnung zu einem Kriterium für den Umgang mit Endlichkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Idealismus und Realismus wird als nachgeordnete Differenz innerhalb einer gemeinsamen idealistischen Grundstruktur klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME3","text":"Prinzipien und Dinge erscheinen nicht mehr als unmittelbare Selbstheiten, sondern als allgemeine, gesetzte und vermittelte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME4","text":"Das Ideelle wird in konkrete Totalität und bloße Vorstellungsform auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME5","text":"Die Subjekt-Objekt-Differenz wird als endliche Formbestimmung und nicht als abschließende ontologische Alternative sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME6","text":"Die strategische Frage verschiebt sich von der Beseitigung des Realen zur Bestimmung seines Aufgehobenseins im konkreten Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der unmittelbar behandelte Gegenstand ist die Bedeutung des Satzes, dass das Endliche ideell ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Argumentation rekonstruiert Ideellheit als Verhältnis von Setzung, Abhängigkeit, Aufhebung und Ganzheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ersetzt die Auseinandersetzung zwischen philosophischen Lagern durch eine Prüfung des Grades, in dem Endlichkeit tatsächlich aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirklichkeit ist als nicht-selbständiges, gesetztes und im konkreten Ganzen aufgehobenes Sein bestimmt; eine eigenständige Zeitstruktur wird nicht entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Negation des absoluten Endlichen über die Ideellsetzung bis zur Kritik des formellen Idealismus zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt das genaue Verhältnis von Begriff, Idee und Geist sowie die systematische Stufung ihrer jeweiligen Formen der Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist nur kohärent, wenn das Ideelle zugleich als nicht unmittelbares Sein und als konkretes wahrhaftes Ganzes verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion dort, wo sie zeigt, dass der subjektive Formwechsel den endlichen Inhalt nicht beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT5","text":"Die Argumentation hängt von der komprimierten Universalbehauptung ab, dass jede Philosophie idealistisch ist, und von der nicht vollständig ausgeführten Überleitung zur konkreten Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT6","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern formelle Idealität, konkrete Idealität und bloße Vorstellungsform nicht ineinanderfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111301321654Z_5d45d5c9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 2.","source_sha256":"1b9e62c5f434dd3f543a885a5ddeb61437d482d7205e9af00f816fdd4316a791","sha256":"c357d19594e902fd8cb51b0ad5d2df81a81557f7201ecd757885f72b243d39e4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:13:01.323281+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS1","text":"The argument determines idealism as the non-recognition of the finite as true, ultimate, and absolute being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS2","text":"It universalizes this determination into the common principle of philosophy and religion and thereby invalidates the opposition between idealism and realism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS3","text":"It interprets philosophical principles and individual things as ideal because they are not immediate and self-subsistent, but universal or posited by something else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS4","text":"It determines the ideal in a twofold manner, as the concrete true whole and as its moments sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS5","text":"It delimits subjective idealism as a mere determination of form that leaves finite content untouched.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AS6","text":"It concludes that the transition from objective to subjective form does not abolish the finitude of content and therefore accomplishes no substantial sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","text":"The finite is not true, ultimate, and absolute being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","text":"Idealism consists in the non-recognition of the finite as true being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","text":"Every philosophy has idealism at least as its principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A4","text":"Religion does not recognize finitude as ultimate, absolute, uncreated, or eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","text":"Philosophical principles are universals and ideals, not immediately given sensuous individual things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A6","text":"That which is posited by another is not self-subsistent and is not grounded in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","text":"The ideal is at once the concrete true being and the totality of its moments sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A8","text":"In ordinary usage, the ideal primarily denotes the form of representation and can also mean non-real representing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A9","text":"Spirit is the proper idealist, because external being is sublated in the simplicity of the I and is for me.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","text":"Subjective idealism asserts the form of subjectivity as exclusive truth in contrast to the form of objectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A11","text":"Formal idealism can leave the content of representing and thinking entirely in its finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","text":"The exclusion of one form of finitude does not abolish the remaining finitudes of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:A13","text":"The opposition between subjectivity and objectivity is itself a determinate form of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX1","text":"The finite must not count as absolute or ultimate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX2","text":"A doctrine that ascribes absolute being to finite existence as such is not philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX3","text":"Philosophical principles must not be equated with immediately sensuously given individual things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX4","text":"Individual things must not be posited as self-subsistent beings grounded in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX5","text":"The ideal must not be reduced to mere imagination or non-real representing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX6","text":"Ideality does not mean the erasure of the finitude of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX7","text":"The subjective form must not count as a sufficient overcoming of objectivity and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:NX8","text":"Idealist and realist philosophy do not constitute a fundamental opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D1","text":"The non-recognition of the finite as absolute is the minimal determination of idealism; the difference among philosophies concerns the degree of its execution.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D2","text":"Philosophy and religion share the rejection of finitude as absolute being.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D3","text":"Even an apparently realist philosophical principle is ideal as soon as it is determined as a universal and as the essence of other things.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D4","text":"The ideal must be identified neither with mere representation nor with universality separated from its moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D5","text":"In spirit, external being is not simply extinguished, but sublated as being existing for the I.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D6","text":"Subjective idealism is formal because it changes the form of what is mine without changing finite content.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A9","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D7","text":"Subjective idealism gains nothing substantial, because the finitude of content is preserved in the I.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11","CH_GB18_AN_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:D8","text":"The opposition between subjectivity and objectivity is itself a finite determination and therefore not a sublation of finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","CH_GB18_AN_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD1","text":"The universality of idealism shifts the fundamental philosophical question from school affiliation to the manner in which finitude is sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A1","CH_GB18_AN_5:A2","CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD2","text":"Ideality denotes not a second sphere separate from reality, but the concrete unity of a whole with its sublated moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A6","CH_GB18_AN_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD3","text":"The critique of subjective idealism is directed not against ideality as such, but against its reduction to an exclusive form of representation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A8","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD4","text":"An effective sublation of finitude must take up the content into a concrete totality, rather than merely excluding its subjective or objective form.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A7","CH_GB18_AN_5:A12","CH_GB18_AN_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SD5","text":"The system encompasses realism as an insufficiently executed form of the same fundamental question, without recognizing subjective formalism as its solution.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_5:A3","CH_GB18_AN_5:A5","CH_GB18_AN_5:A10","CH_GB18_AN_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a finite being that is grounded in itself independently of every positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an external objectivity that remains entirely withdrawn from ideal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an ideality that would be only private representing or mere non-reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the transition to subjective form abolishes the finitude of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a universal that could exist independently of its sublated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX1","text":"Impossible becomes a philosophy that, as neutral realism, asserts an unposited, uncreated, and eternal finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX2","text":"Unavailable becomes an overcoming of finitude through the mere reduction of content to the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of two mutually independent realms of ideality and reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX4","text":"Not available is a standpoint from which finitude would disappear through the exclusion of only one of its forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:SNX5","text":"The argumentation depends on the absence of an immediate, unmediated reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS1","text":"Assertion of an absolute finite → negation of its ultimate being → definition of the ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS2","text":"Definition of the ideal → universalization to philosophy and religion → invalidation of the opposition between idealism and realism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS3","text":"Examination of philosophical principles → reduction to universality and positing by another → ideal positing of principle and individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS4","text":"Ideal positing → twofold character of the ideal → unity of concrete whole and sublated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS5","text":"Sublation of external being in the I → determination of being-for-me → subjective idealism as theory of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS6","text":"Exclusion of objective form → preservation of finite content → formal idealism without substantial sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:FGS7","text":"Demonstration of persisting finitudes → rejection of mere oppositions of form → primacy of concrete ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:AF1","text":"Finite as supposedly absolute → negation of ultimate being → ideal positing of principle and individual → twofold character of concrete whole and sublated moments → reduction of subjective idealism to form → persistence of the finitude of content → primacy of concrete ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME1","text":"Idealism is remapped from a designation of a philosophical school into a criterion for dealing with finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME2","text":"The opposition between idealism and realism is classified as a subordinate difference within a common idealist basic structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME3","text":"Principles and things no longer appear as immediate selfhoods, but as universal, posited, and mediated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME4","text":"The ideal is divided into concrete totality and mere form of representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME5","text":"The subject-object difference becomes visible as a finite determination of form and not as a conclusive ontological alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ME6","text":"The strategic question shifts from the removal of the real to the determination of its being-sublated in the concrete whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: The immediately treated subject is the meaning of the proposition that the finite is ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: The argument reconstructs ideality as a relation of positing, dependence, sublation, and wholeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text replaces the contention among philosophical camps with an examination of the degree to which finitude is actually sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is determined as non-self-subsistent, posited being sublated in the concrete whole; an autonomous temporal structure is not developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the negation of the absolute finite through ideal positing to the critique of formal idealism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the exact relation of Concept, Idea, and Spirit, as well as the systematic gradation of their respective forms of sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent only if the ideal is understood at once as non-immediate being and as concrete true whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction is strongest where it shows that the subjective change of form does not abolish finite content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT5","text":"The argumentation depends on the compressed universal assertion that every philosophy is idealist, and on the transition to concrete totality that is not fully carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_5:MRT6","text":"The actual movement is preserved provided that formal ideality, concrete ideality, and mere form of representation do not collapse into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_5:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 37","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 37","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA","layer":"CH","title":"A. Being-for-Self as Such.","order":38,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DFRA"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DFRA@R001","sha256":"e3fc182f4d20b617c614d503292cd25eb05a6cef387715a8d55452a5e58231ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt, wie aus dem unbestimmten Seyn über unmittelbare Negation und endliche Differenz das Fürsichseyn als absolute Bestimmtheit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS2","text":"Die Endlichkeit wird dadurch überschritten, dass die Negation als gesetzte Negation der Negation in die einfache Beziehung auf sich übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS3","text":"Das Fürsichseyn erscheint zunächst als Eins, dessen Selbstbeziehung die Vielheit der Einsen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion bestimmen sich wechselseitig und bilden ein Gleichgewicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS5","text":"In diesem Gleichgewicht geht die qualitative Bestimmtheit in Quantität über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS6","text":"Der Begriff des Fürsichseyns wird an der Vorstellung von der Aufhebung des Andersseyns und der Rückkehr in sich geprüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS7","text":"Bewußtseyn und Selbstbewußtseyn fungieren als gestufte Veranschaulichungen: erst erhalten sie die äußere Realität des Gegenstands, dann wird die äußere Beziehungsseite entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist vollendetes qualitatives Seyn und unendliches Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A2","text":"Das Seyn des Anfangs ist bestimmungslos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A3","text":"Das Daseyn ist nur unmittelbar aufgehobenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A4","text":"Im Daseyn sind Seyn und Negation in einfacher Einheit verbunden, aber noch ungleich und nicht gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","text":"Das Daseyn ist die Sphäre der Differenz, des Dualismus und der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A6","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns ist relativ und nicht absolut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","text":"Im Fürsichseyn ist der Unterschied zwischen Seyn und Bestimmtheit oder Negation gesetzt und ausgeglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","text":"Qualität, Andersseyn, Grenze, Realität, Ansichseyn und Sollen sind unvollkommene Einbildungen der Negation in das Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","text":"In der Endlichkeit geht die Negation in die Unendlichkeit als gesetzte Negation der Negation über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","text":"Die Negation der Negation ist einfache Beziehung auf sich und Ausgleichung mit dem Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist als unmittelbares Fürsichseyendes das Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","text":"Das Eins geht durch Repulsion in die Vielheit der Einsen über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","text":"Das Andersseyn des Eins hebt sich in seiner Idealität durch Attraktion auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion bestimmen sich wechselseitig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A15","text":"Das Gleichgewicht von Repulsion und Attraktion bildet den Übergang von Qualität in Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","text":"Das Fürsichseyn besteht in der Negation des begrenzenden Anderen und in der unendlichen Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","text":"Das Bewußtseyn hat den Inhalt des Anderen ideell in sich und ist dadurch in seiner Beziehung auf das Andere bei sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A18","text":"Das Bewußtseyn erhält zugleich die Realität des Gegenstands als äußerliches Daseyn, während das Selbstbewußtseyn die äußere Beziehungsseite entfernt und das Fürsichseyn als vollbracht setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX1","text":"Das anfängliche Seyn ist nicht bereits bestimmte oder unendliche Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX2","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht vollständig aufgehobenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX3","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Negation im Daseyn ist nicht als ausgeglichene Einheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns ist nicht absolute Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX5","text":"Die endlichen Formen der Negation sind keine vollendete Einheit von Seyn und Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX6","text":"Das Andersseyn ist im Fürsichseyn kein selbständiges Äußerliches, sondern ein aufgehobenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX7","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist keine bloß positive Identität, sondern ein polemisch-negatives Verhalten gegen das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX8","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion sind keine isolierten oder endgültigen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX9","text":"Das Bewußtseyn ist nicht bereits vollbrachtes Selbstbewußtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX10","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des allgemeinen Fürsichseyns ist noch keine konkrete Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D1","text":"Das Daseyn bildet als Verbindung von erhaltenem Seyn und unmittelbarer Negation das Feld der Endlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A2","CH_GB18_DFRA:A3","CH_GB18_DFRA:A4","CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","CH_GB18_DFRA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D2","text":"Das Fürsichseyn entsteht, indem die im Daseyn ungesetzte Differenz als Negation der Negation gesetzt und ausgeglichen wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D3","text":"Die einfache Selbstbeziehung der ausgeglichenen Negation bestimmt das Fürsichseyn als absolute Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D4","text":"Die absolute Bestimmtheit nimmt zunächst die Form des Eins an.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D5","text":"Das Eins erzeugt durch Repulsion die Vielheit und überführt deren Andersseyn durch Attraktion in Idealität.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D6","text":"Die wechselseitige Bestimmung von Repulsion und Attraktion führt vom Gegensatz in das Gleichgewicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D7","text":"Das Gleichgewicht von Repulsion und Attraktion lässt die qualitative Bestimmtheit in Quantität übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D8","text":"Das Bewußtseyn ist ein erscheinendes Fürsichseyn, weil es im ideellen Besitz des Gegenstands zugleich auf dessen äußerliche Realität bezogen bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D9","text":"Das Selbstbewußtseyn setzt das Fürsichseyn als vollbracht und macht die Unendlichkeit in einer abstrakten, aber konkreteren Bestimmung präsent.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD1","text":"Die Endlichkeit wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als unvollkommene und schließlich aufgehobene Form der Negation in die Struktur des Fürsichseyns integriert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD2","text":"Die Negation erhält eine doppelte Funktion: Sie entfernt das Andere als selbständige Grenze und bewahrt es zugleich als Moment der Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD3","text":"Die Kategorien Eins, Vielheit, Repulsion und Attraktion bilden keine statische Ordnung, sondern eine interne Erzeugungsbewegung, in der eine Bestimmung ihre Gegenbestimmung hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD4","text":"Der Übergang von Qualität in Quantität erscheint als systemische Folge der Selbstbewegung des Fürsichseyns und nicht als äußerlich hinzugefügte Kategorie.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD5","text":"Die Vollendung des qualitativen Seyns ist keine abschließende Ruhe, sondern der Ausgangspunkt einer weiteren Bestimmungsbewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A1","CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD6","text":"Bewußtseyn und Selbstbewußtseyn übertragen die logische Struktur des Fürsichseyns in die Form der Beziehung zwischen ideellem Inhalt, äußerem Gegenstand und Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie, in der das anfängliche Seyn als selbstgenügsame Bestimmtheit bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit von Seyn und Negation, die bloß unmittelbar und ungesetzt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Differenz, in der Bestimmtheit und Negation äußerlich neben dem Seyn stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein selbständiges Andersseyn außerhalb der Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Verständnis der Negation als bloßer Vernichtung ohne Erhaltung des negierten Moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine statische Alternative von Eins und Vielheit; beide müssen aus derselben Selbstbeziehung hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist das Bewußtseyn als endgültige Gestalt der Unendlichkeit, solange die äußere Realität des Gegenstands erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX8","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Identifikation des allgemeinen Fürsichseyns mit der konkreteren Bestimmung des Selbstbewußtseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX1","text":"Es gibt keinen letzten ontologischen Stand der bloßen Unmittelbarkeit; jede unmittelbare Bestimmung ist Übergangsmoment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX2","text":"Es gibt keine endgültige Äußerlichkeit des Anderen, die nicht in eine Selbstbeziehung aufgenommen werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX3","text":"Es gibt keine absolute Identität, die ohne die Durcharbeitung von Differenz, Repulsion und Attraktion bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX4","text":"Es gibt keine abgeschlossene qualitative Unendlichkeit; die Vollendung des Qualitativen erzeugt den Übergang zur Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX5","text":"Es gibt auf der Ebene des bloßen Bewußtseyns keine vollständig konkrete Präsenz der Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX6","text":"Die selbständige Begründung dafür, dass der logische Begriff des Fürsichseyns der Vorstellung entspricht, bleibt als eigene Vermittlung unausgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS1","text":"Unbestimmtes Seyn → unmittelbare Aufhebung → Daseyn als Differenz-, Dualismus- und Endlichkeitssphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS2","text":"Ungesetzte Differenz → gesetzte und ausgeglichene Negation → Negation der Negation → einfache Selbstbeziehung → absolute Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS3","text":"Absolute Bestimmtheit → Eins → Repulsion → Vielheit der Einsen → Attraktion als Idealisierung des Andersseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion → Wechselbestimmung → Gleichgewicht → Übergang von Qualität in Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS5","text":"Fürsichseyn als Negation des begrenzenden Anderen + erhaltene äußere Realität → Bewußtseyn als dualistisches Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS6","text":"Entfernung der äußeren Beziehungsseite → Selbstbewußtseyn als gesetztes Fürsichseyn → abstrakte, aber konkretere Präsenz der Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF1","text":"Unbestimmtes Seyn → unmittelbare Negation → Daseyn als endlicher Dualismus → gesetzte und ausgeglichene Negation → Fürsichseyn als absolute Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF2","text":"Absolute Bestimmtheit → Eins → Repulsion → Vielheit → Attraktion → Gleichgewicht → Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF3","text":"Begriff des Fürsichseyns → Aufhebung des Andersseyns → ideelles Haben des Gegenstands → Bewußtseyn als erscheinendes Fürsichseyn → Entfernung der äußeren Beziehung → Selbstbewußtseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME1","text":"Das Daseyn wird von einer bloßen Seinsbestimmung zur Sphäre der unaufgelösten Differenz und relativen Bestimmtheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME2","text":"Die Negation wird von einer Grenze des Seyns zu einer Bewegung der Rückkehr in sich und der Versöhnung mit dem Seyn umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME3","text":"Das Andere wird nicht mehr als äußerer Gegenpol, sondern als aufgehobenes Moment der Selbstbeziehung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME4","text":"Eins und Vielheit werden nicht als starre Gegensätze, sondern als durch Repulsion und Attraktion erzeugte Bestimmungen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME5","text":"Der Übergang von Qualität zu Quantität erscheint als innere Folge der Bestimmungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME6","text":"Bewußtseyn und Selbstbewußtseyn werden als verschiedene Grade derselben Fürsichseyn-Struktur und nicht als bloß psychologische Zustände klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das Fürsichseyn wird als vollendetes qualitatives und unendliches Seyn mit den Momenten Eins, Repulsion und Attraktion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die tragende Struktur ist die Überführung unmittelbarer Negation in gesetzte Negation der Negation und einfache Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Endliche Kategorien werden als unvollkommene Momente neu gelesen, deren scheinbare Selbständigkeit durch ihre innere Negationsbewegung aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Seyn erscheint als gestufter Hervorgang, in dem Unmittelbarkeit, Differenz, Selbstbeziehung, Vielheit und Quantität zeitlich-logisch aufeinander folgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom unbestimmten Seyn über Daseyn und Negation der Negation zum Fürsichseyn zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT2","text":"Sie reichen ferner aus, um die Sequenz Eins → Vielheit → Repulsion → Attraktion → Gleichgewicht → Quantität zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue Vermittlung zwischen dem logischen Begriff des Fürsichseyns und seiner Entsprechung in der Vorstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist das System nur unter der Voraussetzung, dass Aufhebung zugleich Negation, Erhaltung und Rückführung in eine höhere Einheit bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Bestimmung der Negation als selbstbezügliche Bewegung, die das Andere nicht einfach vernichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass das Fürsichseyn als vollendet gilt, sich aber unmittelbar weiter in Eins, Vielheit und Quantität entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT7","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt zwischen dem Bewußtseyn, das äußere Realität erhält, und dem Selbstbewußtseyn, in dem die äußere Beziehungsseite entfernt wird, ohne dass diese Vermittlung vollständig entwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die logische Genesis und ihre Anwendung auf Bewußtseyn und Selbstbewußtseyn als verbundene, aber nicht identische Ebenen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115339338365Z_b93432c4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Being-for-self as such.","source_sha256":"e3fc182f4d20b617c614d503292cd25eb05a6cef387715a8d55452a5e58231ff","sha256":"aa92a9bf9a57cb0348c878665855b72a47782871dbdf9b00490b3366224888fd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:53:39.339415+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS1","text":"The text determines how being-for-self emerges from indeterminate Being through immediate negation and finite difference as absolute determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS2","text":"Finitude is surpassed in that negation, as posited negation of negation, passes over into simple relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS3","text":"Being-for-self initially appears as the One, whose self-relation generates the plurality of Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS4","text":"Repulsion and attraction determine one another reciprocally and form an equilibrium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS5","text":"In this equilibrium, qualitative determinacy passes over into quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS6","text":"The concept of being-for-self is examined through the representation of the sublation of otherness and the return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AS7","text":"Consciousness and self-consciousness function as graduated illustrations: first they retain the external reality of the object, then the external relational side is removed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A1","text":"Being-for-self is completed qualitative Being and infinite Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A2","text":"The Being of the beginning is devoid of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A3","text":"Dasein is only immediately sublated Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A4","text":"In Dasein, Being and negation are combined in simple unity, but are still unequal and not posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","text":"Dasein is the sphere of difference, dualism, and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A6","text":"The determinacy of Dasein is relative and not absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","text":"In being-for-self, the difference between Being and determinacy or negation is posited and equalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","text":"Quality, otherness, limit, reality, being-in-itself, and ought are imperfect immanences of negation in Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","text":"In finitude, negation passes over into infinity as posited negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","text":"The negation of negation is simple relation to itself and equalization with Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","text":"Being-for-self, as immediate being-for-self, is the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","text":"Through repulsion, the One passes over into the plurality of Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","text":"The otherness of the One sublates itself in its ideality through attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","text":"Repulsion and attraction determine one another reciprocally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A15","text":"The equilibrium of repulsion and attraction constitutes the transition from quality into quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","text":"Being-for-self consists in the negation of the limiting other and in the infinite return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","text":"Consciousness has the content of the other ideally within itself and thereby is, in its relation to the other, with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:A18","text":"Consciousness simultaneously retains the reality of the object as external Dasein, whereas self-consciousness removes the external relational side and posits being-for-self as accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX1","text":"Initial Being is not already determinate or infinite reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX2","text":"Dasein is not completely sublated Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX3","text":"The unity of Being and negation in Dasein is not posited as equalized unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX4","text":"The determinacy of Dasein is not absolute determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX5","text":"The finite forms of negation are not a completed unity of Being and determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX6","text":"In being-for-self, otherness is not an independent externality, but a sublated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX7","text":"Being-for-self is not a merely positive identity, but a polemically negative comportment toward the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX8","text":"Repulsion and attraction are not isolated or final determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX9","text":"Consciousness is not yet accomplished self-consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:NX10","text":"The infinity of universal being-for-self is not yet concrete infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D1","text":"As the connection of retained Being and immediate negation, Dasein forms the field of finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A2","CH_GB18_DFRA:A3","CH_GB18_DFRA:A4","CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","CH_GB18_DFRA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D2","text":"Being-for-self arises when the unposited difference in Dasein is posited and equalized as negation of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D3","text":"The simple self-relation of equalized negation determines being-for-self as absolute determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D4","text":"Absolute determinacy initially assumes the form of the One.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D5","text":"Through repulsion, the One generates plurality and, through attraction, transfers its otherness into ideality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D6","text":"The reciprocal determination of repulsion and attraction leads from opposition into equilibrium.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D7","text":"The equilibrium of repulsion and attraction lets qualitative determinacy pass over into quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D8","text":"Consciousness is an appearing being-for-self because, in its ideal possession of the object, it simultaneously remains related to its external reality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:D9","text":"Self-consciousness posits being-for-self as accomplished and renders infinity present in an abstract but more concrete determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD1","text":"Finitude is not eliminated, but integrated into the structure of being-for-self as an imperfect and finally sublated form of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A5","CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A8","CH_GB18_DFRA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD2","text":"Negation receives a double function: it removes the other as an independent limit and simultaneously preserves it as a moment of self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A7","CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD3","text":"The categories One, plurality, repulsion, and attraction form not a static order, but an internal generative movement in which one determination brings forth its counter-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A12","CH_GB18_DFRA:A13","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD4","text":"The transition from quality into quantity appears as a systemic consequence of the self-movement of being-for-self and not as an externally added category.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A10","CH_GB18_DFRA:A14","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD5","text":"The completion of qualitative Being is not a final repose, but the point of departure of a further movement of determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A1","CH_GB18_DFRA:A11","CH_GB18_DFRA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SD6","text":"Consciousness and self-consciousness transpose the logical structure of being-for-self into the form of the relation between ideal content, external object, and self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFRA:A16","CH_GB18_DFRA:A17","CH_GB18_DFRA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology in which initial Being could subsist as self-sufficient determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a unity of Being and negation that remains merely immediate and unposited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an absolute difference in which determinacy and negation stand externally alongside Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an independent otherness outside the return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an understanding of negation as mere annihilation without preservation of the negated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a static alternative of One and plurality; both must arise from the same self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX7","text":"Excluded is consciousness as the final shape of infinity so long as the external reality of the object is retained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:DNX8","text":"Excluded is the identification of universal being-for-self with the more concrete determination of self-consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX1","text":"There is no final ontological state of mere immediacy; every immediate determination is a moment of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX2","text":"There is no final externality of the other that could not be taken up into a self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX3","text":"There is no absolute identity that could subsist without the working-through of difference, repulsion, and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX4","text":"There is no completed qualitative infinity; the completion of the qualitative generates the transition to quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX5","text":"At the level of mere consciousness, there is no fully concrete presence of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:SNX6","text":"The independent grounding of why the logical concept of being-for-self corresponds to the representation remains undeveloped as a distinct mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate Being → immediate sublation → Dasein as sphere of difference, dualism, and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS2","text":"Unposited difference → posited and equalized negation → negation of negation → simple self-relation → absolute determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS3","text":"Absolute determinacy → One → repulsion → plurality of Ones → attraction as idealization of otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS4","text":"Repulsion and attraction → reciprocal determination → equilibrium → transition from quality into quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS5","text":"Being-for-self as negation of the limiting other + retained external reality → consciousness as dualistic being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:FGS6","text":"Removal of the external relational side → self-consciousness as posited being-for-self → abstract but more concrete presence of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF1","text":"Indeterminate Being → immediate negation → Dasein as finite dualism → posited and equalized negation → being-for-self as absolute determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF2","text":"Absolute determinacy → One → repulsion → plurality → attraction → equilibrium → quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:AF3","text":"Concept of being-for-self → sublation of otherness → ideal possession of the object → consciousness as appearing being-for-self → removal of the external relation → self-consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME1","text":"Dasein is remapped from a mere determination of Being into the sphere of unresolved difference and relative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME2","text":"Negation is reclassified from a limit of Being into a movement of return into itself and reconciliation with Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME3","text":"The other no longer becomes visible as an external counterpole, but as a sublated moment of self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME4","text":"One and plurality are mapped not as rigid opposites, but as determinations generated through repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME5","text":"The transition from quality to quantity appears as an internal consequence of the structure of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ME6","text":"Consciousness and self-consciousness are classified as different degrees of the same structure of being-for-self and not as merely psychological states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT1","text":"Surface: Being-for-self is determined as completed qualitative and infinite Being, with the moments of One, repulsion, and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT2","text":"Structural: The supporting structure is the transformation of immediate negation into posited negation of negation and simple self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Finite categories are reread as imperfect moments whose apparent independence is dissolved through their inner movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being appears as a graduated emergence in which immediacy, difference, self-relation, plurality, and quantity follow one another temporally-logically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from indeterminate Being through Dasein and negation of negation to being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT2","text":"They further suffice to generate the sequence One → plurality → repulsion → attraction → equilibrium → quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise mediation between the logical concept of being-for-self and its correspondence in representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT4","text":"The system is internally coherent only on the presupposition that sublation simultaneously means negation, preservation, and return into a higher unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT5","text":"The strongest point lies in the determination of negation as a self-relating movement that does not simply annihilate the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT6","text":"The central tension consists in being-for-self being regarded as completed, yet immediately developing further into One, plurality, and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT7","text":"A second line of fracture lies between consciousness, which retains external reality, and self-consciousness, in which the external relational side is removed, without this mediation being fully developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFRA:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument insofar as logical genesis and its application to consciousness and self-consciousness are treated as connected but not identical levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFRA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DFRA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DFRA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 38","title":"A. Being-for-Self as Such.","context":"Chapter 38","original_title":"A. Das Fürsichseyn als solches."},"original_title":"A. Das Fürsichseyn als solches.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR","layer":"CH","title":"a. Determinate Being and Being-for-Self.","order":39,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DUFR"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DUFR@R001","sha256":"ef945687195f34f15ef58b2a6e413965ee851c1cb59573c7d629d6f478e874a2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Daseyn und Fürsichseyn wird als Bestimmung der einfachen Unmittelbarkeit durch die Unendlichkeit problematisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS2","text":"Das Fürsichseyn wird als in das einfache Seyn zusammengesunkene Unendlichkeit neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS3","text":"Die negative Natur der Unendlichkeit erscheint in der Unmittelbarkeit des Seyns als einfache qualitative Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS4","text":"Daraus entsteht das Daseyn, das vom Fürsichseyn unterschieden und zugleich in ihm enthalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS5","text":"Die dem Daseyn eigene Andersheit wird in die unendliche Einheit des Fürsichseyns zurückgebogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung des Daseyns als Seyn-für-Eines innerhalb des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist die in das einfache Seyn zusammengesunkene Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A2","text":"Die Unendlichkeit ist negative Natur und Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A3","text":"In der Unmittelbarkeit des Seyns erscheint die Negation der Negation nur als einfache Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A4","text":"Seyn mit der Bestimmtheit einfacher qualitativer Negation ist Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A5","text":"Das Daseyn ist vom Fürsichseyn unterschieden, weil seine Bestimmtheit nicht selbst die unendliche Bestimmtheit des Fürsichseyns ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A6","text":"Das Daseyn ist zugleich ein Moment des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A7","text":"Das Fürsichseyn enthält Seyn, insofern dieses mit Negation behaftet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A8","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Daseyns als Anderes und Seyn-für-Anderes wird in die unendliche Einheit des Fürsichseyns zurückgebogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A9","text":"Im Fürsichseyn ist das Moment des Daseyns als Seyn-für-Eines vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX1","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht mit dem Fürsichseyn identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX2","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist nicht bloß unmittelbares einfaches Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX3","text":"Die Negation der Negation tritt nicht unmittelbar als vollständige unendliche Bestimmtheit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX4","text":"Das Daseyn ist nicht ausschließlich selbständige Andersheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX5","text":"Das Seyn-für-Anderes bleibt nicht als äußerliche Beziehung außerhalb des Fürsichseyns bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D1","text":"Die Reduktion der Unendlichkeit auf einfache Unmittelbarkeit erzeugt das Daseyn als qualitative Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A1","CH_GB18_DUFR:A2","CH_GB18_DUFR:A3","CH_GB18_DUFR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D2","text":"Das Daseyn besitzt eine relative Selbständigkeit, weil es vom Fürsichseyn unterschieden ist, bleibt aber von dessen unendlicher Bestimmtheit abhängig.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A4","CH_GB18_DUFR:A5","CH_GB18_DUFR:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D3","text":"Das Fürsichseyn enthält Daseyn nicht als fremdes Zusatzmoment, sondern als negiertes Seyn innerhalb seiner eigenen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A6","CH_GB18_DUFR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D4","text":"Anderseyn und Seyn-für-Anderes werden aus äußerlicher Beziehung in eine interne Bestimmung des Fürsichseyns überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D5","text":"Das Daseyn erhält innerhalb des Fürsichseyns die Form des Seyn-für-Eines.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A8","CH_GB18_DUFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist keine von der Unmittelbarkeit abgelöste Unendlichkeit, sondern die in unmittelbarem Seyn wirksame Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD2","text":"Das Verhältnis von Daseyn und Fürsichseyn ist eine integrierte Differenz: Das Daseyn wird gesetzt, unterschieden und zugleich als Moment des Fürsichseyns aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD3","text":"Die äußere Relation des Seyn-für-Anderes wird zur inneren Struktur des Seyn-für-Eines transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD4","text":"Die Einheit des Fürsichseyns entsteht nicht durch Ausschluss des Daseyns, sondern durch Rücknahme seiner negativen Bestimmtheit in die unendliche Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX1","text":"Die Unendlichkeit darf nicht als von der Unmittelbarkeit getrennte positive Sphäre verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX2","text":"Das Daseyn darf nicht als vorgegebene, unaufhebbare Substanz neben dem Fürsichseyn gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX3","text":"Die Negation der Negation darf nicht als einfache Wiederherstellung affirmativen Seyns bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX4","text":"Die Andersheit darf nicht als äußerlich verbleibender Gegensatz zur Einheit des Fürsichseyns fixiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX5","text":"Das Fürsichseyn darf nicht als reine Identität ohne enthaltenes, negiertes Seyn bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie getrennter Ebenen, in der Daseyn und Fürsichseyn unabhängig voneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Unendlichkeit, deren Wahrheit außerhalb der Form unmittelbaren Seyns läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Andersheit, die nicht in eine Bestimmung der Einheit zurückgeführt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Selbstbeziehung ohne ein in ihr enthaltenes Verhältnis zu anderem zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS1","text":"Unendlichkeit als Negation der Negation → Zusammensinken in einfaches Seyn → Erscheinung der Negation als qualitative Bestimmtheit → Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS2","text":"Daseyn als einfache qualitative Negation → Abhebung vom Fürsichseyn → begrenzte Differenz innerhalb der unendlichen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS3","text":"Daseyn als mit Negation behaftetes Seyn → Aufnahme in das Fürsichseyn → Daseyn als dessen Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS4","text":"Anderes und Seyn-für-Anderes → Rückbiegung in die unendliche Einheit → Seyn-für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AF1","text":"Zusammengesunkene Unendlichkeit → unmittelbare qualitative Negation → Daseyn → Differenz zum Fürsichseyn → Rücknahme der Andersheit → Seyn-für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME1","text":"Daseyn wird von einer isolierten Seinsform zu einer vermittelten Bestimmung innerhalb des Fürsichseyns umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Daseyn und Fürsichseyn wird als interne Differenz statt als äußerliche Trennung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME3","text":"Seyn-für-Anderes wird in Seyn-für-Eines überführt; Relation wird dadurch als Moment der Selbstbeziehung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME4","text":"Die Negation der Negation wird nicht als abstrakte Verdopplung der Negation, sondern als in unmittelbarem Seyn gesetzte Bestimmtheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Daseyn wird als einfache qualitative Negation im unmittelbaren Seyn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Daseyn bildet ein unterschiedenes, aber eingeschlossenes Moment der unendlichen Einheit des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Argumentation ersetzt die Alternative von Trennung und Identität durch eine Rückbiegung der Andersheit in die Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird als Prozess der Setzung, Unterscheidung und Rücknahme von Bestimmtheit konstruiert; Einheit ist nur als vermittelte Einheit mit negiertem Seyn gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Ableitung des Daseyns aus der in unmittelbarem Seyn gesetzten Unendlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome erfassen die notwendige Doppelstellung des Daseyns als Unterschied und Moment des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die Rückbiegung der Andersheit formal vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT4","text":"Die interne Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Negation als konstitutives Moment der Einheit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der systematischen Überführung von Seyn-für-Anderes in Seyn-für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass das Daseyn zugleich als einfache qualitative Bestimmtheit und als in der unendlichen Einheit aufgehobenes Moment erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: unmittelbare Negation → Daseyn → Differenz → immanente Rücknahme in das Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115656601059Z_993c07ba","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Determinate Being and Being-for-Self.","source_sha256":"ef945687195f34f15ef58b2a6e413965ee851c1cb59573c7d629d6f478e874a2","sha256":"6ea5ecbdd0eef76c36b9edd1ff276447796870623c51d3738fb511a688151df9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:56:56.602277+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS1","text":"The relation of determinate being and being-for-self is problematized as the determination of simple immediacy by infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS2","text":"Being-for-self is redetermined as infinity collapsed into simple being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS3","text":"The negative nature of infinity appears in the immediacy of being as simple qualitative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS4","text":"From this arises determinate being, which is distinguished from being-for-self and yet contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS5","text":"The otherness proper to determinate being is bent back into the infinite unity of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the determination of determinate being as being-for-one within being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A1","text":"Being-for-self is infinity collapsed into simple being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A2","text":"Infinity is negative nature and negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A3","text":"In the immediacy of being, the negation of negation appears only as simple negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A4","text":"Being with the determinacy of simple qualitative negation is determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A5","text":"Determinate being is distinguished from being-for-self because its determinacy is not itself the infinite determinacy of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A6","text":"Determinate being is at the same time a moment of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A7","text":"Being-for-self contains being insofar as the latter is affected with negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A8","text":"The determinacy of determinate being as other and being-for-other is bent back into the infinite unity of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:A9","text":"In being-for-self, the moment of determinate being is present as being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX1","text":"Determinate being is not identical with being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX2","text":"Being-for-self is not merely immediate simple being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX3","text":"The negation of negation does not appear immediately as complete infinite determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX4","text":"Determinate being is not exclusively self-subsistent otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:NX5","text":"Being-for-other does not remain as an external relation outside being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D1","text":"The reduction of infinity to simple immediacy produces determinate being as qualitative negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A1","CH_GB18_DUFR:A2","CH_GB18_DUFR:A3","CH_GB18_DUFR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D2","text":"Determinate being possesses a relative self-subsistence because it is distinguished from being-for-self, but remains dependent on its infinite determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A4","CH_GB18_DUFR:A5","CH_GB18_DUFR:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D3","text":"Being-for-self contains determinate being not as an alien additional moment, but as negated being within its own unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A6","CH_GB18_DUFR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D4","text":"Other-being and being-for-other are transferred from external relation into an internal determination of being-for-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:D5","text":"Within being-for-self, determinate being receives the form of being-for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_DUFR:A8","CH_GB18_DUFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD1","text":"Being-for-self is not an infinity detached from immediacy, but the negation active in immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD2","text":"The relation of determinate being and being-for-self is an integrated difference: determinate being is posited, distinguished, and at the same time sublated as a moment of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD3","text":"The external relation of being-for-other is transformed into the inner structure of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SD4","text":"The unity of being-for-self arises not through the exclusion of determinate being, but through the withdrawal of its negative determinacy into infinite unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX1","text":"Infinity must not be understood as a positive sphere separated from immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX2","text":"Determinate being must not count as a given, insuperable substance alongside being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX3","text":"The negation of negation must not be determined as the simple restoration of affirmative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX4","text":"Otherness must not be fixed as an externally remaining opposition to the unity of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:DNX5","text":"Being-for-self must not be determined as pure identity without contained, negated being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of separate levels in which determinate being and being-for-self exist independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an infinity whose truth would lie outside the form of immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX3","text":"Impossible is an otherness that cannot be led back into a determination of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:SNX4","text":"Blocked is the possibility of thinking self-relation without a relation to other contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS1","text":"Infinity as negation of negation → collapse into simple being → appearance of negation as qualitative determinacy → determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS2","text":"Determinate being as simple qualitative negation → differentiation from being-for-self → limited difference within infinite determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS3","text":"Determinate being as being affected with negation → incorporation into being-for-self → determinate being as its moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:FGS4","text":"Other and being-for-other → bending back into infinite unity → being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:AF1","text":"Collapsed infinity → immediate qualitative negation → determinate being → difference from being-for-self → withdrawal of otherness → being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME1","text":"Determinate being is remapped from an isolated form of being into a mediated determination within being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME2","text":"The opposition between determinate being and being-for-self becomes visible as internal difference rather than as external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME3","text":"Being-for-other is transferred into being-for-one; relation is thereby classified as a moment of self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ME4","text":"The negation of negation is mapped not as an abstract doubling of negation, but as determinacy posited in immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Determinate being is determined as simple qualitative negation in immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Determinate being forms a distinct but enclosed moment of the infinite unity of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces the alternative of separation and identity with a bending back of otherness into self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is constructed as a process of positing, distinguishing, and withdrawing determinacy; unity is given only as mediated unity with negated being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the derivation of determinate being from infinity posited in immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT2","text":"The axioms capture the necessary double status of determinate being as difference and moment of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the bending back of otherness is formally mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT4","text":"The internal structure is coherent insofar as negation counts as a constitutive moment of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT5","text":"The strongest point lies in the systematic transfer of being-for-other into being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that determinate being appears at once as simple qualitative determinacy and as a moment sublated in infinite unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DUFR:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement: immediate negation → determinate being → difference → immanent withdrawal into being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DUFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DUFR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DUFR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 39","title":"a. Determinate Being and Being-for-Self.","context":"Chapter 39","original_title":"a. Daseyn und Fürsichseyn."},"original_title":"a. Daseyn und Fürsichseyn.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR","layer":"CH","title":"b. Being-for-One.","order":40,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BSFR"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BSFR@R001","sha256":"18436e12621f8a977ede017270e984fed03a9612678430a21e560e2b4c075f65","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS1","text":"Das Moment des Seyn-für-Eines bestimmt die Einheit des Endlichen mit dem Unendlichen als Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS2","text":"Die Negation des Fürsichseyns ist keine äußerliche Grenze und verweist daher nicht auf ein anderes Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS3","text":"Die Bezeichnung Seyn-für-Eines setzt zunächst weder ein vorhandenes Eines noch ein bereits bestimmtes Gegenüber voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS4","text":"Die scheinbar unterschiedenen Seiten erweisen sich als Momente einer einzigen Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS5","text":"Das Fürsichseyn bezieht sich in seinem aufgehobenen Anderen nur auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS6","text":"Die Idealität wird als untrennbare Einheit von Fürsichseyn und Seyn-für-Eines rekonstruiert, deren Für-Eines-Sein kein Für-ein-Anderes-Sein ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A1","text":"Das Endliche ist in seiner Einheit mit dem Unendlichen als Ideelles bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","text":"Das Fürsichseyn enthält die Negation nicht als Bestimmtheit oder Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A3","text":"Das Fürsichseyn enthält dadurch keine Beziehung auf ein von ihm anderes Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","text":"Im anfänglichen Seyn-für-Eines ist weder das Eine noch ein anderes bestimmtes Für-welches vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","text":"Die beiden scheinbaren Seiten des Seyn-für-Eines sind selbst nur Momente desselben Seyn-für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist als Aufgehobenseyn des Andersseyns eine Beziehung auf sich im aufgehobenen Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","text":"Das Ideelle ist notwendig für-Eines, aber nicht für ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A8","text":"Das Eine, für welches das Ideelle ist, ist nur das Ideelle selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","text":"Ich, Geist überhaupt und Gott sind insofern ideell, als sie unendlich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A10","text":"Gott ist für sich, insofern er selbst das ist, was für ihn ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A11","text":"Fürsichseyn und Für-Eines-Sein sind wesentliche und untrennbare Momente derselben Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist nicht durch eine an ihm haftende Grenze bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX2","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist nicht auf ein von ihm verschiedenes Daseyn bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX3","text":"Das anfängliche Seyn-für-Eines ist noch nicht das Eine, dessen Moment es wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX4","text":"Das Für-welches ist zunächst kein selbständig fixiertes Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX5","text":"Das Ideelle ist nicht für ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX6","text":"Fürsichseyn und Für-Eines-Sein sind keine voneinander getrennten Bedeutungen der Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX7","text":"Gott und Geist sind nicht als unmittelbares Daseyn von dem getrennt, was für sie ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D1","text":"Die Negation des Andersseyns wird zur Selbstbeziehung des Fürsichseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","CH_GB18_BSFR:A3","CH_GB18_BSFR:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D2","text":"Die anfängliche Ununterschiedenheit verhindert, dass das Seyn-für-Eines als Beziehung zwischen zwei selbständigen Seienden bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D3","text":"Das Für-Eines-Sein bezeichnet eine Idealität, in der Bestimmung und das Bestimmte nur als Momente einer Einheit auftreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D4","text":"Das Für-Eines-Sein des Ideellen impliziert keine Relationalität zu einem äußeren Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D5","text":"Die Bestimmung Gottes als Fürsichseyn setzt voraus, dass Gott selbst die Instanz seines Für-Einen-Seins ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","CH_GB18_BSFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D6","text":"Die Idealität kann nur als Einheit von Selbstbeziehung und Für-Eines-Sein vollständig bestimmt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD1","text":"Die Aufhebung des Andersseyns erzeugt keine isolierte Identität, sondern eine Selbstbeziehung, die ihr eigenes Für-Eines-Sein einschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD2","text":"Die Idealität wird als selbstgenügsame Relationalität konstituiert: Sie ist wesentlich auf ein Für-Eines bezogen, ohne ein äußeres Gegenüber zu benötigen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD3","text":"Das Eine entsteht nicht als vorausgesetzte Einheit zweier Seiten, sondern als die Selbstidentität des Moments, für welches es zunächst nur scheinbar ein Anderes gibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD4","text":"Die Unendlichkeit von Ich, Geist und Gott ist nur dann Idealität, wenn sie nicht in eine Differenz zwischen einem Fürsichseyn und einem äußeren Für-Eines zerfällt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","CH_GB18_BSFR:A10","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX1","text":"Die Idealität darf nicht auf einer ursprünglichen Zweiheit von Subjekt und äußerem Gegenstand beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX2","text":"Das Eine darf nicht als selbständiges Seiendes vorausgesetzt werden, bevor seine Beziehung auf das Ideelle bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX3","text":"Das Fürsichseyn darf nicht als unmittelbare, von seiner Idealität abtrennbare Existenz verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX4","text":"Negation darf nicht als äußerliche Ausschließung eines anderen Daseyns funktionieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX5","text":"Das Für-Eines-Sein darf nicht in eine bloße Zweck- oder Bezugsrelation zu einem fremden Träger umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Idealität, deren Einheit erst durch die Verbindung bereits unabhängiger Seiten hergestellt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Anderes, das als notwendiger äußerer Grund der Selbstbeziehung fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, Fürsichseyn und Für-Eines-Sein als getrennte ontologische Schichten zu stabilisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Bestimmung des Unendlichen, in der das, was für es ist, nicht es selbst wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS1","text":"Einheit des Endlichen mit dem Unendlichen → Bestimmung als Idealität → Negation ohne äußerliche Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS2","text":"Negation ohne äußeres Anderes → Aufhebung des Andersseyns → Selbstbeziehung des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS3","text":"Seyn-für-Eines ohne vorausgesetztes Eines → Ununterschiedenheit der Seiten → eine einzige Idealität statt zweier Relata.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS4","text":"Selbstbeziehung im aufgehobenen Anderen → Für-Eines-Sein ohne Für-ein-Anderes-Sein → Identität des Ideellen mit dem, für welches es ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS5","text":"Identität von Ideellem und Für-welchem → Einheit von Fürsichseyn und Seyn-für-Eines → vollständige Bestimmung der Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AF1","text":"Endliches in Einheit mit dem Unendlichen → Negation ohne Grenze → kein äußeres Anderes → anfängliche Ununterschiedenheit von Für-Eines und Fürsichseyn → Selbstbeziehung im aufgehobenen Andersseyn → Für-Eines-Sein als Selbstbeziehung → untrennbare Einheit beider Momente der Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME1","text":"Die Karte der Idealität verschiebt sich von einer Relation zwischen getrennten Seienden zu einer Selbstbeziehung im aufgehobenen Andersseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Fürsichseyn und Seyn-für-Eines wird als interne Momentdifferenz statt als Trennung zweier Bedeutungen lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME3","text":"Das Eine wird vom vorausgesetzten Gegenstand zum Resultat beziehungsweise zur Selbstidentität des Für-Einen-Seins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME4","text":"Die Bestimmung des Unendlichen wird von äußerer Bezogenheit auf immanente Selbstbeziehung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME5","text":"Die Alternative zwischen isolierter Identität und äußerer Relation wird durch eine Idealität ersetzt, die Relation als Selbstbeziehung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Seyn-für-Eines bezeichnet die Einheit des Endlichen mit dem Unendlichen als Ideelles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Negation hebt Andersseyn auf, ohne ein äußeres Daseyn als Gegenpol zu setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die scheinbare Zweiheit von Fürsichseyn und Für-Eines-Sein wird in eine interne Momentstruktur der Idealität umgeformt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Eine ist nicht ursprünglich vorhanden, sondern wird innerhalb der Bewegung vom bloßen Moment zur Selbstidentität des Ideellen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Idealität zur Einheit von Fürsichseyn und Seyn-für-Eines zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT2","text":"Die entscheidende tragende Struktur besteht aus Negation ohne äußere Grenze, aufgehobenem Andersseyn und Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie das zunächst nicht vorhandene Eine innerhalb der weiteren Kategorienentwicklung ausdrücklich hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT4","text":"Die interne Spannung liegt darin, dass das Seyn-für-Eines bezeichnet wird, bevor das Eine als sein Bezugspunkt fixiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht zwischen angenommener Unterscheidung und behaupteter Untrennbarkeit der beiden Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur ist insofern kohärent, als jede Differenz als aufgehobene und selbstbezügliche Differenz zurückgeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern das Für-Eines-Sein nicht als äußere Relation, sondern als immanente Selbstbeziehung gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113704805191Z_9383fb4a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Being-for-one.","source_sha256":"18436e12621f8a977ede017270e984fed03a9612678430a21e560e2b4c075f65","sha256":"61b62292d70f4197dbca9dcd738dc167bb8569a5b6a2bd6c27f5478b6ef732c2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:37:04.806761+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS1","text":"The moment of Being-for-one determines the unity of the finite with the infinite as ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS2","text":"The negation of being-for-self is not an external limit and therefore does not refer to another existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS3","text":"The designation Being-for-one initially presupposes neither an existent One nor an already determinate counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS4","text":"The seemingly distinct sides prove to be moments of a single ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS5","text":"Being-for-self relates, in its sublated other, only to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AS6","text":"Ideality is reconstructed as the inseparable unity of being-for-self and Being-for-one, whose being-for-one is not being-for-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A1","text":"The finite is determined in its unity with the infinite as ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","text":"Being-for-self does not contain negation as determinacy or limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A3","text":"Thereby, being-for-self contains no relation to an existence other than itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","text":"In the initial Being-for-one, neither the One nor another determinate for-which is present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","text":"The two apparent sides of Being-for-one are themselves only moments of the same Being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","text":"Being-for-self, as the sublated being of otherness, is a relation to itself in the sublated other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","text":"The ideal is necessarily for-one, but not for-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A8","text":"The One for which the ideal is, is only the ideal itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","text":"I, spirit in general, and God are ideal insofar as they are infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A10","text":"God is for himself insofar as he himself is that which is for him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:A11","text":"Being-for-self and being-for-one are essential and inseparable moments of the same ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX1","text":"Being-for-self is not determined by a limit adhering to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX2","text":"Being-for-self is not related to an existence distinct from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX3","text":"The initial Being-for-one is not yet the One of which it would be a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX4","text":"The for-which is initially no independently fixed something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX5","text":"The ideal is not for-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX6","text":"Being-for-self and being-for-one are not meanings of ideality separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:NX7","text":"God and spirit are not, as immediate existence, separated from that which is for them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D1","text":"The negation of otherness becomes the self-relation of being-for-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","CH_GB18_BSFR:A3","CH_GB18_BSFR:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D2","text":"The initial indistinguishability prevents Being-for-one from being determined as a relation between two independent beings.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D3","text":"Being-for-one designates an ideality in which determinacy and the determined occur only as moments of a unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D4","text":"The being-for-one of the ideal implies no relationality to an external other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D5","text":"The determination of God as being-for-self presupposes that God himself is the instance of his being-for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","CH_GB18_BSFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:D6","text":"Ideality can be completely determined only as the unity of self-relation and being-for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD1","text":"The sublation of otherness produces not an isolated identity, but a self-relation that includes its own being-for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A2","CH_GB18_BSFR:A6","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD2","text":"Ideality is constituted as self-sufficient relationality: it is essentially related to a for-one without requiring an external counterpart.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A7","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD3","text":"The One does not arise as the presupposed unity of two sides, but as the self-identity of the moment for which there is initially only seemingly an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A4","CH_GB18_BSFR:A5","CH_GB18_BSFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SD4","text":"The infinity of I, spirit, and God is ideality only if it does not disintegrate into a difference between a being-for-self and an external for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSFR:A9","CH_GB18_BSFR:A10","CH_GB18_BSFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX1","text":"Ideality must not rest upon an original duality of subject and external object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX2","text":"The One must not be presupposed as an independent being before its relation to the ideal is determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX3","text":"Being-for-self must not be understood as immediate existence separable from its ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX4","text":"Negation must not function as the external exclusion of another existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:DNX5","text":"Being-for-one must not turn into a mere purposive or referential relation to an alien bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ideality whose unity would first be produced by the connection of already independent sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an other that functions as the necessary external ground of self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of stabilizing being-for-self and being-for-one as separate ontological layers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:SNX4","text":"Impermissible is a determination of the infinite in which that which is for it would not be itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS1","text":"Unity of the finite with the infinite → determination as ideality → negation without external limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS2","text":"Negation without external other → sublation of otherness → self-relation of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS3","text":"Being-for-one without a presupposed One → indistinguishability of the sides → one single ideality instead of two relata.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS4","text":"Self-relation in the sublated other → being-for-one without being-for-another → identity of the ideal with that for which it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:FGS5","text":"Identity of the ideal and the for-which → unity of being-for-self and Being-for-one → complete determination of ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:AF1","text":"Finite in unity with the infinite → negation without limit → no external other → initial indistinguishability of for-one and being-for-self → self-relation in sublated otherness → being-for-one as self-relation → inseparable unity of both moments of ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME1","text":"The map of ideality shifts from a relation between separate beings to a self-relation in sublated otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME2","text":"The distinction between being-for-self and Being-for-one becomes legible as an internal difference of moments rather than as a separation of two meanings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME3","text":"The One is reclassified from a presupposed object into the result, respectively the self-identity, of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME4","text":"The determination of the infinite is shifted from external relatedness to immanent self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ME5","text":"The alternative between isolated identity and external relation is replaced by an ideality that contains relation as self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Being-for-one designates the unity of the finite with the infinite as ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Negation sublates otherness without positing an external existence as counterpole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The apparent duality of being-for-self and being-for-one is transformed into an internal moment-structure of ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The One is not originally present, but is determined within the movement from the mere moment to the self-identity of the ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from ideality to the unity of being-for-self and Being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT2","text":"The decisive load-bearing structure consists of negation without external limit, sublated otherness, and self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the initially absent One expressly emerges within the further development of the categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT4","text":"The internal tension lies in the fact that Being-for-one is designated before the One is fixed as its reference point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT5","text":"A second tension arises between the assumed distinction and the asserted inseparability of the two moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT6","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as every difference is traced back as a sublated and self-relating difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSFR:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement provided that being-for-one is grasped not as an external relation, but as immanent self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSFR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BSFR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BSFR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 40","title":"b. Being-for-One.","context":"Chapter 40","original_title":"b. Seyn-für-eines."},"original_title":"b. Seyn-für-eines.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":41,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_6"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_6@R001","sha256":"6d956202399f5e11f251d52819f71e1b8c1ca8dc426a787026ac098a0522fcbe","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS1","text":"Die Frage nach der Qualität legt eine Reflexion frei, in der das Seiende und dasjenige, für welches es ist, in einer Selbstidentität zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS2","text":"Idealisierung besteht nicht in der einseitigen Herabsetzung des Realen, sondern darin, dass aufgehobene Bestimmungen und ihr Reelles gleicherweise nur für Eines gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS3","text":"Der Vollzug des Idealismus wird daran gemessen, ob endliches Dasein als selbständig fortbesteht und ob das Unendliche seine Selbstbeziehung als Idealität enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS4","text":"Abstrakte Einheit ohne immanente Idealität, äußerlich gesetzte Vielheit und fortbestehendes Jenseits sind je Formen eines unvollendeten Idealismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS5","text":"Die untersuchten Systeme scheitern jeweils daran, dass die Bewegung der Aufhebung des Andersseins nicht dem Gegenstand selbst immanent wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS6","text":"Die gerichtete Bewegung führt von der Selbstidentität des Für-Eines über Kriterien der Durchführung zu einer Diagnose der Restbestände von Anderssein, Vielheit und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A1","text":"Qualität ist Reflexion-in-sich, sofern das Seiende und dasjenige, für welches es ist, dasselbe sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","text":"Ideelle Bestimmungen sind als aufgehobene Bestimmungen von dem unterschieden, worin sie aufgehoben sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","text":"Idealisierung ist die Einheit, in der Ideelles und Reelles gleicherweise nur für Eines sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","text":"Selbstbewusstsein, Geist und Gott sind als unendliche Selbstbeziehung nur für sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A5","text":"Bewusstsein enthält einen Unterschied zwischen seiner Idealität und einem bestimmten Inhalt, der als unaufgehobenes Negatives erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A6","text":"Die Bestimmung des Ideellen als bloß einseitig setzt voraus, dass endliches Dasein als das eigentlich Reelle gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","text":"Die Durchführung des Idealismus verlangt die Aufhebung der Selbständigkeit des endlichen Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","text":"Die Durchführung des Idealismus verlangt, dass das Unendliche das Verhältnis des Ideellen zu sich selbst enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","text":"Eine Einheit, die alle Bestimmtheit nur abstrakt negiert, setzt Idealität nicht in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A10","text":"Vielheit, die nur durch ein äußerliches Drittes aufgehoben wird, bleibt der Idealität äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A11","text":"Ein Jenseitiges, das im Ich nur für dieses wird, aber als negatives Ansichsein fortdauert, erhält den Dualismus von Dasein und Fürsichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX1","text":"Idealisierung ist nicht die Gegenüberstellung eines einseitig Ideellen gegen ein selbständig Reelles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX2","text":"Unendlichkeit ist nicht bloße affirmative, unbewegte Einheit ohne Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX3","text":"Aufgehobenes Anderssein ist nicht die bloße Abwesenheit empirischer Wechselwirkung zwischen Vielheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX4","text":"Eine prästabilierte Harmonie ist keine immanente Idealität der vielfältigen Monaden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX5","text":"Der Übergang von absoluter Einheit zu abstrakter Vielheit ist nicht durch die bloße Vorstellung des Erschaffens begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX6","text":"Das Für-Eines ist nicht vollendet, solange ein Jenseits oder unendlicher Anstoß als bleibendes Anderes fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D1","text":"Die Bezeichnung von Geist oder Gott als „bloß ideell“ verfehlt ihre Bestimmung, wenn sie das Endliche vorab als eigenständig reales Gegenprinzip voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","CH_GB18_AN_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D2","text":"Das Selbstbewusstsein ist nicht reine vollendete Idealität, sofern sein vorstellender Inhalt noch als unaufgehobenes Dasein gewusst wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","CH_GB18_AN_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D3","text":"Das eleatische Sein und die spinozistische Substanz bleiben unterhalb des Fürsichseins, weil ihre Negation der Bestimmtheit keine innere Idealität erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D4","text":"Malebranches Bestimmung der Dinge als in Gott ideell enthält konkrete absolute Idealität, bleibt aber logisch unbegründet, sofern die Unendlichkeit nicht für sich bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D5","text":"Leibniz’ Monadenlehre hebt reale Wechselbeziehung auf, ohne die Vielheit selbst als immanent idealisiert auszuweisen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D6","text":"Kantischer und fichte’scher Idealismus bleiben im unendlichen Progress, weil das negative Ansichsein des Anderen nicht verschwindet.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD1","text":"Vollendeter Idealismus ist keine Lehre von der Irrealität der Welt, sondern die immanente Selbstrücknahme jedes als selbständig gesetzten Andersseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A1","CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD2","text":"Der systematische Maßstab verschiebt sich von der Behauptung absoluter Einheit auf die Frage, ob Einheit ihre eigene Differenz, Vielheit und Negativität aus sich vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A5","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD3","text":"Jede Philosophie, die Anderssein entweder nur ausschließt, äußerlich koordiniert oder in ein Jenseits verlegt, reproduziert gerade die Dualität, deren Aufhebung sie beansprucht.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10","CH_GB18_AN_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD4","text":"Die Wahrheit der Idealität verlangt eine Bewegung, in der Realität nicht negiertes Gegenstück, sondern ununterschiedene Dimension desselben Für-Eines ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass ein schlechthin selbständiges endliches Dasein mit absoluter Idealität vereinbar sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass Vermittlung durch ein außerhalb der vielen Bestimmungen stehendes Drittes ihre Immanenz bewahren könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX3","text":"Das System disqualifiziert eine Unendlichkeit, die nur über der Differenz steht, statt die Differenz als ihre eigene Selbstbewegung zu enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine Erkenntnisform aus, in der Bewusstsein gegenüber Inhalt und Bestimmung bloß formell oder gleichgültig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist ein endgültiges Außen der Einheit: kein Ding-an-sich, keine Vielheit und kein Dasein darf als bleibend unassimilierbares Gegenprinzip bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine absolute Einheit, deren Übergang in Differenz nur faktisch, vorgestellt oder schöpferisch behauptet, aber nicht begrifflich erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Trennung von ontologischer Realität und idealer Geltung, weil Realität selbst nur innerhalb der einen Idealität bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS1","text":"Selbstidentität des Seins-für-Eines → Bestimmung der Idealität als Aufgehobensein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS2","text":"Aufgehobensein + Gleichgeltung von Ideellem und Reellem → ununterschiedene Realität der einen Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS3","text":"Unendliche Selbstbeziehung → Prüfmaßstab der Durchführung des Idealismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS4","text":"Selbständiges endliches Dasein oder äußerliche Vielheit oder persistierendes Jenseits → unvollendete Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS5","text":"Unvollendete Idealität → Diagnose abstrakter Einheit, formeller Vorstellung, äußerer Harmonie oder unendlichen Progresses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS6","text":"Immanente Aufhebung des Andersseins → Begriff einer vollendeten Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF1","text":"Die Frage nach der Qualität → bestimmt Sein als Selbstbeziehung des Für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF2","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung → bestimmt Idealität als Einheit von Ideellem und Reellem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF3","text":"Die Einheit von Ideellem und Reellem → erzeugt Kriterien für die Durchführung des Idealismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF4","text":"Die Durchführungskriterien → prüfen abstrakte Substanz, göttliche Ideenlehre, Monadenlehre und transzendentalen Dualismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF5","text":"Die Prüfung → lokalisiert fortbestehende Reste von Anderssein, Vielheit, äußerer Vermittlung und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF6","text":"Der Restbestand des Anderen → markiert die Grenze zwischen behaupteter und vollendeter Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME1","text":"„Real“ und „ideell“ werden von Gegensätzen zu Momenten derselben Geltung für Eines umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME2","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen starken und unvollendeten Idealismen wird nicht nach ihrem Einheitsanspruch, sondern nach der Immanenz ihrer Vermittlung gezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME3","text":"Vielheit erscheint nicht mehr primär als Anzahl von Seienden, sondern als Prüfstein dafür, ob Anderssein innerhalb der Einheit hervorgebracht und aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME4","text":"Das Ding-an-sich, die prästabilierte Harmonie und die abstrakte Substanz erscheinen als verschiedene Gestalten desselben Strukturfehlers: äußerlich bleibender Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Anmerkung bestimmt Qualität, Idealität, Realität, Selbstbewusstsein, Geist, Gott und Fürsichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Philosophische Systeme werden danach geordnet, wie sie Selbständigkeit des Endlichen, Vielheit, Vermittlung und Negativität organisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Gegenüberstellung idealistisch-realistisch durch einen Vollständigkeitstest der immanenten Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unendlichkeit ist nur wahrhaft, wenn sie nicht als unbewegte Einheit oder unendliche Annäherung, sondern als gegenwärtige Selbstvermittlung der Differenz bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundbestimmung der Idealität als Selbstbeziehung und als Einheit von Ideellem und Reellem zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kriterien der Unvollständigkeit in abstrakter Einheit, äußerlicher Vielheit und persistentem Jenseits herzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der positive begriffliche Vollzug, durch den die Vielheit aus der absoluten Idealität notwendig erzeugt und in ihr aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Selbständigkeit des Anderen als Negation der vollendeten Selbstbeziehung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt darin, dass die geforderte immanente Vermittlung als Norm der Kritik fungiert, während ihr eigener vollständiger Vollzug hier nicht ausgeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, wenn sie die philosophiehistorischen Fälle als Prüfkonfigurationen und nicht als bloße Lehrmeinungen behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111323786661Z_aa23341f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"6d956202399f5e11f251d52819f71e1b8c1ca8dc426a787026ac098a0522fcbe","sha256":"e6f899ef66598e3c05590ce49fbb2c03f0baa862e79f1bcdd3ac8dd9b2685f13","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:13:23.788435+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS1","text":"The question of quality discloses a reflection in which what is and that for which it is coincide in a self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS2","text":"Idealization does not consist in the one-sided depreciation of the real, but in the fact that sublated determinations and their real equally hold only for one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS3","text":"The accomplishment of idealism is measured by whether finite determinate being persists as self-subsistent and whether the infinite contains its self-relation as ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS4","text":"Abstract unity without immanent ideality, externally posited multiplicity, and a persisting beyond are each forms of an uncompleted idealism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS5","text":"The systems examined each fail because the movement of the sublation of otherness does not become immanent to the object itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AS6","text":"The directed movement leads from the self-identity of being-for-one through criteria of accomplishment to a diagnosis of the remnants of otherness, multiplicity, and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A1","text":"Quality is reflection-into-itself, insofar as what is and that for which it is are the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","text":"Ideal determinations, as sublated determinations, are distinguished from that in which they are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","text":"Idealization is the unity in which the ideal and the real equally are only for one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","text":"Self-consciousness, spirit, and God, as infinite self-relation, are only for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A5","text":"Consciousness contains a difference between its ideality and a determinate content that appears as unsublated negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A6","text":"The determination of the ideal as merely one-sided presupposes that finite determinate being counts as what is properly real.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","text":"The accomplishment of idealism requires the sublation of the self-subsistence of finite determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","text":"The accomplishment of idealism requires that the infinite contain the relation of the ideal to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","text":"A unity that merely abstractly negates all determinacy does not posit ideality within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A10","text":"Multiplicity that is sublated only through an external third remains external to ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:A11","text":"A beyond that becomes only for this in the I, but endures as negative being-in-itself, preserves the dualism of determinate being and being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX1","text":"Idealization is not the opposition of a one-sided ideal to a self-subsistent real.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX2","text":"Infinity is not mere affirmative, unmoved unity without self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX3","text":"Sublated otherness is not the mere absence of empirical interaction among multiplicities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX4","text":"A pre-established harmony is not an immanent ideality of the multiple monads.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX5","text":"The transition from absolute unity to abstract multiplicity is not grounded by the mere representation of creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:NX6","text":"Being-for-one is not completed so long as a beyond or infinite impetus persists as enduring other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D1","text":"The designation of spirit or God as “merely ideal” misses their determination if it presupposes finite being in advance as an independently real counter-principle.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","CH_GB18_AN_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D2","text":"Self-consciousness is not pure completed ideality insofar as its representational content is still known as unsublated determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A4","CH_GB18_AN_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D3","text":"Eleatic being and Spinozistic substance remain below being-for-self because their negation of determinacy produces no inner ideality.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D4","text":"Malebranche's determination of things as ideal in God contains concrete absolute ideality, but remains logically ungrounded insofar as infinity is not determined for itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D5","text":"Leibniz's doctrine of monads sublates real interaction without showing multiplicity itself to be immanently idealized.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:D6","text":"Kantian and Fichtean idealism remain in infinite progress because the negative being-in-itself of the other does not disappear.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD1","text":"Completed idealism is not a doctrine of the unreality of the world, but the immanent self-retraction of every otherness posited as self-subsistent.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A1","CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD2","text":"The systematic standard shifts from the assertion of absolute unity to the question whether unity mediates its own difference, multiplicity, and negativity out of itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A5","CH_GB18_AN_6:A8","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD3","text":"Every philosophy that either merely excludes otherness, externally coordinates it, or displaces it into a beyond reproduces precisely the duality whose sublation it claims.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A7","CH_GB18_AN_6:A9","CH_GB18_AN_6:A10","CH_GB18_AN_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SD4","text":"The truth of ideality requires a movement in which reality is not a negated counterpart, but an undifferentiated dimension of the same being-for-one.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_6:A2","CH_GB18_AN_6:A3","CH_GB18_AN_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that an absolutely self-subsistent finite determinate being might be compatible with absolute ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the possibility that mediation through a third standing outside the many determinations could preserve their immanence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX3","text":"The system disqualifies an infinity that stands merely above difference instead of containing difference as its own self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a form of cognition in which consciousness remains merely formal or indifferent toward content and determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX1","text":"An ultimate outside of unity is inadmissible: no thing-in-itself, no multiplicity, and no determinate being may persist as an enduringly unassimilable counter-principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX2","text":"An absolute unity whose transition into difference is merely factually, representationally, or creatively asserted, but not conceptually generated, is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:SNX3","text":"The separation of ontological reality and ideal validity is barred, because reality itself can be determined only within the one ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS1","text":"Self-identity of being-for-one → determination of ideality as sublatedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS2","text":"Sublatedness + equal validity of the ideal and the real → undifferentiated reality of the one ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS3","text":"Infinite self-relation → criterion for testing the accomplishment of idealism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS4","text":"Self-subsistent finite determinate being or external multiplicity or persistent beyond → uncompleted ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS5","text":"Uncompleted ideality → diagnosis of abstract unity, formal representation, external harmony, or infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:FGS6","text":"Immanent sublation of otherness → concept of a completed ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF1","text":"The question of quality → determines being as the self-relation of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF2","text":"Self-relation → determines ideality as the unity of the ideal and the real.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF3","text":"The unity of the ideal and the real → generates criteria for the accomplishment of idealism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF4","text":"The criteria of accomplishment → test abstract substance, the doctrine of divine ideas, the doctrine of monads, and transcendental dualism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF5","text":"The test → locates persisting remnants of otherness, multiplicity, external mediation, and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:AF6","text":"The remnant of the other → marks the boundary between asserted and completed ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME1","text":"“Real” and “ideal” are reclassified from opposites into moments of the same validity for one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME2","text":"The distinction between strong and uncompleted idealisms is drawn not according to their claim to unity, but according to the immanence of their mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME3","text":"Multiplicity no longer appears primarily as a number of beings, but as a touchstone of whether otherness is produced and sublated within unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ME4","text":"The thing-in-itself, pre-established harmony, and abstract substance appear as different shapes of the same structural error: externally persisting negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — The note determines quality, ideality, reality, self-consciousness, spirit, God, and being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Philosophical systems are ordered according to how they organize the self-subsistence of the finite, multiplicity, mediation, and negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the idealist-realist opposition with a completeness test of immanent sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Infinity is genuine only if it is determined not as unmoved unity or infinite approximation, but as the present self-mediation of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the fundamental determination of ideality as self-relation and as unity of the ideal and the real.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to derive the criteria of incompleteness in abstract unity, external multiplicity, and persistent beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive conceptual accomplishment through which multiplicity is necessarily generated out of absolute ideality and sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the self-subsistence of the other is treated as the negation of completed self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT5","text":"The strongest tension lies in the fact that the required immanent mediation functions as a norm of critique, while its own complete accomplishment is not carried out here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_6:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text if it treats the cases from the history of philosophy as test configurations and not as mere doctrinal opinions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_6:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 41","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 41","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN","layer":"CH","title":"c. One.","order":42,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CEIN"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CEIN@R001","sha256":"e2f1089bfaa4c3024eb2f572719956db1a4081dd2fb1dc8e1056630ebbe25bd9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn wird als einfache Einheit seiner selbst und des Seyns für-Eines bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS2","text":"Diese Einheit beruht nicht auf positiver Unmittelbarkeit, sondern auf der Beziehung-auf-sich-selbst des Aufhebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS3","text":"Die durch Negation erzeugten Momente sinken in eine unmittelbare, als Seyn erscheinende Unterschiedslosigkeit zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS4","text":"In dieser Unmittelbarkeit verschwindet die innere Bedeutung des Fürsichseyns und wird zur abstrakten Grenze des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS5","text":"Die Momente des Eins treten in der Darstellung auseinander, weil die Form des Seyns jedes Moment als eigene seyende Bestimmung setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS6","text":"Die Darstellung erzeugt dadurch einen Widerspruch zwischen der Selbständigkeit der Momente und ihrer begrifflichen Untrennbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS7","text":"Die Schwierigkeit der Entwicklung des Eins entsteht aus der Notwendigkeit, von jeder abstrakt gesetzten Bestimmung zugleich ihr Gegentheil auszusagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist die einfache Einheit seiner selbst und des Seyns für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","text":"Die einzige Bestimmung des Fürsichseyns ist die Beziehung-auf-sich-selbst des Aufhebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A3","text":"Die Momente des Fürsichseyns sind in Unterschiedslosigkeit zusammengesunken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A4","text":"Diese Unterschiedslosigkeit ist Unmittelbarkeit oder Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A5","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Fürsichseyns gründet sich auf Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A6","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist als diese unmittelbare Einheit Fürsichseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A7","text":"In der Unmittelbarkeit des Fürsichseyenden verschwindet dessen innere Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A8","text":"Das Eins ist die ganz abstrakte Grenze des Fürsichseyenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A9","text":"Der Begriff des Eins enthält Negation überhaupt, zwei Negationen und den daraus bestimmten Zweier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A10","text":"Die beiden Negationen sind identisch und schlechthin entgegengesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A11","text":"Der Begriff des Eins enthält Beziehung-auf-sich als Identität und negative Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A12","text":"Die Form der Unmittelbarkeit tritt am Fürsichseyn als Fürsichseyendem hinzu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit setzt jedes begriffliche Moment als eigene seyende Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A14","text":"Die gesetzten Momente bleiben zugleich untrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A15","text":"Wegen ihrer abstrakten Bestimmtheit muß von jeder Bestimmung ebenso ihr Gegentheil gesagt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist nicht eine positive Einheit unabhängig von Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Fürsichseyns ist nicht voraussetzungslos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX3","text":"Das Eins ist nicht die unvermittelte innere Bedeutung des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX4","text":"Die Momente des Eins sind nicht schlechthin voneinander getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX5","text":"Die Identität des Eins ist nicht frei von negativer Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX6","text":"Die einzelnen Bestimmungen sind nicht ausschließlich das, als was sie in der Form des Seyns erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX7","text":"Die Entwicklung des Eins ist nicht durch widerspruchsfreie Absonderung seiner Momente gewährleistet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D1","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Fürsichseyns ist eine durch Negation vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","CH_GB18_CEIN:A4","CH_GB18_CEIN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D2","text":"Das Fürsichseyende stellt die negative Selbstbeziehung als seiende, unmittelbare Einheit dar.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A5","CH_GB18_CEIN:A6","CH_GB18_CEIN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D3","text":"Das Eins entsteht, indem die innere Bedeutung des Fürsichseyns in die abstrakte Grenze seiner Unmittelbarkeit übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A7","CH_GB18_CEIN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D4","text":"Der Zweier ist aus der Verdopplung der Negation als zwei zugleich identische und entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A9","CH_GB18_CEIN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D5","text":"Die Identität des Eins enthält eine negative Beziehung, weil die Beziehung-auf-sich nur als Beziehung des Aufhebens besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","CH_GB18_CEIN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D6","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit verwandelt begrifflich untrennbare Momente in scheinbar selbständige seyende Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A12","CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","CH_GB18_CEIN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D7","text":"Aus der abstrakten Isolierung eines Moments folgt die Notwendigkeit, ihm zugleich sein Gegentheil zuzuschreiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","CH_GB18_CEIN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD1","text":"Das Eins ist die Form, in der eine negative Selbstbeziehung als unmittelbare Einheit erscheint und dadurch ihren eigenen begrifflichen Gehalt verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD2","text":"Die Entwicklung des Eins erzeugt ihre Schwierigkeit selbst, indem sie untrennbare Momente als getrennte seyende Bestimmungen setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD3","text":"Identität und Gegensatz sind im Eins keine nachträglichen Gegensätze, sondern ko-erzeugte Funktionen derselben negativen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD4","text":"Die abstrakte Unmittelbarkeit macht jede Bestimmung zugleich notwendig und unzureichend: notwendig als gesetztes Moment, unzureichend als isolierte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD5","text":"Der Widerspruch ist hier kein äußerer Einwand gegen die Darstellung, sondern die strukturelle Wirkung ihrer eigenen Darstellungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, die Unmittelbarkeit könne ohne die sie begründende Negation bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Fürsichseyn, dessen Momente als voneinander unabhängige positive Inhalte existieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nicht zugleich negative Beziehung auf sich selbst wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist die Reduktion des Eins auf eine einfache Einheit ohne die Momente von Negation, Zweier, Gegensatz und Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX5","text":"Unhaltbar ist eine Darstellung, die die durch Unmittelbarkeit gesetzte Selbständigkeit der Momente für ihre wirkliche Trennbarkeit nimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, die vor oder außerhalb der Negation läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine stabile Einseitigkeit, in der eine Bestimmung ohne ihr Gegentheil bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, die Einheit des Eins entweder als bloße Identität oder als bloße Vielheit zu fixieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich ist eine begriffliche Entwicklung, die die Momente auseinanderlegt, ohne durch diese Auseinanderlegung ihren inneren Zusammenhang wieder hervorzutreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS1","text":"Negative Selbstbeziehung → einfache Einheit des Fürsichseyns → Zusammensinken der Momente in Unterschiedslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS2","text":"Unterschiedslosigkeit → durch Negation gegründete Unmittelbarkeit → Fürsichseyendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS3","text":"Fürsichseyendes → Verschwinden der inneren Bedeutung → abstrakte Grenze → Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS4","text":"Begriff des Eins → Auseinandertreten von Negation, Negationen, Zweier, Identität und Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS5","text":"Auseinandertreten → Form des Seyns als selbständige Setzung jedes Moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS6","text":"Selbständige Setzung + begriffliche Untrennbarkeit → notwendige Zuschreibung des Gegentheils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS7","text":"Gegensätzliche Doppelbestimmung → Widerspruch → Schwierigkeit der Entwicklung des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF1","text":"Einfache Einheit → negative Selbstbeziehung → negationsbegründete Unmittelbarkeit → abstrakte Grenze → Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF2","text":"Eins → Auseinandertreten seiner Momente → selbständige Setzung durch Seyn → Fortbestehen ihrer Untrennbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF3","text":"Selbständigkeit und Untrennbarkeit → gegenseitige Zuschreibung von Bestimmung und Gegentheil → Widerspruch als Entwicklungsproblem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird von einem Ausgangspunkt zu einem Resultat der Negation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME2","text":"Das Eins wird von einer einfachen Identität zu einer Konfiguration aus Negation, Identität und Gegensatz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME3","text":"Der Zweier erscheint nicht als äußerliche Vielheit, sondern als innere Folge der verdoppelten Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME4","text":"Der Widerspruch wird von einer Störung der Darstellung zu einem Effekt der Form des Seyns umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME5","text":"Getrennte Bestimmungen werden als Darstellungsprodukte sichtbar, deren begriffliche Untrennbarkeit erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Eins wird als abstrakte Grenze des Fürsichseyenden bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Form der Unmittelbarkeit setzt die Momente eines negativen Begriffs als eigene seyende Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Schwierigkeit der Darstellung wird als notwendige Folge der gewählten begrifflichen Setzung rekonstruiert, nicht als bloßes Darstellungsdefizit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Seyn erscheint als unmittelbare Form einer durch Negation erzeugten Einheit; Entwicklung bedeutet die Entfaltung eines bereits widersprüchlich bestimmten Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Fürsichseyn zum Eins und die negative Grundlage der Unmittelbarkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die sechs Momente des Eins und ihre gegenseitige Verschränkung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die weitere Entwicklung des Eins über die festgestellte Schwierigkeit hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die scheinbare Selbständigkeit der Momente als Wirkung der Unmittelbarkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung des Widerspruchs aus der Differenz zwischen begrifflicher Untrennbarkeit und seyender Vereinzelung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Unterscheidung zwischen begrifflicher Bestimmung und ihrer unmittelbaren Darstellungsform ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes bleibt erhalten: negative Einheit → Unmittelbarkeit → Eins → Auseinandertreten → Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114516280960Z_6fcd1c7c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The One.","source_sha256":"e2f1089bfaa4c3024eb2f572719956db1a4081dd2fb1dc8e1056630ebbe25bd9","sha256":"34eba8cdcd8edfde1e68943cd13d9e86665757665db64c21d5c043f792e033cc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:45:16.283348+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS1","text":"Being-for-self is determined as the simple unity of itself and of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS2","text":"This unity rests not on positive immediacy, but on the self-relation of sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS3","text":"The moments generated through negation collapse into an immediate indifference appearing as Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS4","text":"In this immediacy, the inner significance of being-for-self disappears and becomes the abstract limit of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS5","text":"The moments of the One come apart in the exposition, because the form of Being posits each moment as its own existent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS6","text":"The exposition thereby produces a contradiction between the self-subsistence of the moments and their conceptual inseparability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AS7","text":"The difficulty of the development of the One arises from the necessity of asserting, of every abstractly posited determination, at the same time its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A1","text":"Being-for-self is the simple unity of itself and of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","text":"The sole determination of being-for-self is the self-relation of sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A3","text":"The moments of being-for-self have collapsed into indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A4","text":"This indifference is immediacy or Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A5","text":"The immediacy of being-for-self is grounded in negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A6","text":"Being-for-self, as this immediate unity, is being-for-self existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A7","text":"In the immediacy of being-for-self existent, its inner significance disappears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A8","text":"The One is the wholly abstract limit of being-for-self existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A9","text":"The concept of the One contains negation in general, two negations, and the Two determined therefrom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A10","text":"The two negations are identical and absolutely opposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A11","text":"The concept of the One contains self-relation as identity and negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A12","text":"The form of immediacy is added to being-for-self as being-for-self existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","text":"Immediacy posits each conceptual moment as its own existent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A14","text":"The posited moments remain at the same time inseparable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:A15","text":"On account of their abstract determinacy, of every determination its opposite must likewise be said.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX1","text":"Being-for-self is not a positive unity independent of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX2","text":"The immediacy of being-for-self is not presuppositionless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX3","text":"The One is not the unmediated inner significance of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX4","text":"The moments of the One are not absolutely separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX5","text":"The identity of the One is not free of negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX6","text":"The individual determinations are not exclusively that which they appear to be in the form of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:NX7","text":"The development of the One is not secured through the contradiction-free separation of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D1","text":"The immediacy of being-for-self is an immediacy mediated through negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","CH_GB18_CEIN:A4","CH_GB18_CEIN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D2","text":"Being-for-self existent represents negative self-relation as existent, immediate unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A5","CH_GB18_CEIN:A6","CH_GB18_CEIN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D3","text":"The One arises as the inner significance of being-for-self passes over into the abstract limit of its immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A7","CH_GB18_CEIN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D4","text":"The Two is determined from the doubling of negation as two determinations that are at once identical and opposed.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A9","CH_GB18_CEIN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D5","text":"The identity of the One contains a negative relation because self-relation exists only as the relation of sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A2","CH_GB18_CEIN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D6","text":"Immediacy transforms conceptually inseparable moments into apparently self-subsistent existent determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A12","CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","CH_GB18_CEIN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:D7","text":"From the abstract isolation of a moment follows the necessity of ascribing to it, at the same time, its opposite.","refs":["CH_GB18_CEIN:A13","CH_GB18_CEIN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD1","text":"The One is the form in which a negative self-relation appears as immediate unity and thereby conceals its own conceptual content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD2","text":"The development of the One generates its own difficulty by positing inseparable moments as separated existent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD3","text":"Identity and opposition in the One are not subsequent opposites, but co-generated functions of the same negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD4","text":"Abstract immediacy makes every determination at once necessary and insufficient: necessary as a posited moment, insufficient as an isolated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SD5","text":"Contradiction here is not an external objection to the exposition, but the structural effect of its own form of exposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX1","text":"The assumption that immediacy could exist without the negation grounding it is false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a being-for-self whose moments exist as positive contents independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity that would not at the same time be a negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX4","text":"Impermissible is the reduction of the One to a simple unity without the moments of negation, the Two, opposition, and self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:DNX5","text":"Untenable is an exposition that takes the self-subsistence of the moments posited through immediacy for their actual separability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a pure immediacy that would lie before or outside negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a stable one-sidedness in which a determination could subsist without its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of fixing the unity of the One either as mere identity or as mere multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:SNX4","text":"Impossible is a conceptual development that lays the moments apart without, through this laying-apart, driving their inner connection forth again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS1","text":"Negative self-relation → simple unity of being-for-self → collapse of the moments into indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS2","text":"Indifference → immediacy grounded through negation → being-for-self existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS3","text":"Being-for-self existent → disappearance of inner significance → abstract limit → One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS4","text":"Concept of the One → coming-apart of negation, negations, the Two, identity, and opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS5","text":"Coming-apart → form of Being as the self-subsistent positing of each moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS6","text":"Self-subsistent positing + conceptual inseparability → necessary ascription of the opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:FGS7","text":"Opposed double determination → contradiction → difficulty of the development of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF1","text":"Simple unity → negative self-relation → immediacy grounded in negation → abstract limit → One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF2","text":"One → coming-apart of its moments → self-subsistent positing through Being → persistence of their inseparability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:AF3","text":"Self-subsistence and inseparability → reciprocal ascription of determination and opposite → contradiction as a problem of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME1","text":"Immediacy is remapped from a point of departure into a result of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME2","text":"The One is reclassified from a simple identity into a configuration of negation, identity, and opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME3","text":"The Two appears not as external multiplicity, but as an inner consequence of doubled negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME4","text":"Contradiction is remapped from a disruption of exposition into an effect of the form of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ME5","text":"Separated determinations become visible as products of exposition whose conceptual inseparability remains preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT1","text":"Surface — The One is determined as the abstract limit of being-for-self existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT2","text":"Structural — The form of immediacy posits the moments of a negative concept as their own existent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The difficulty of exposition is reconstructed as a necessary consequence of the chosen conceptual positing, not as a mere deficiency of exposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as the immediate form of a unity generated through negation; development signifies the unfolding of a concept already determined contradictorily.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from being-for-self to the One and the negative basis of immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT2","text":"The axioms are sufficient to determine the six moments of the One and their mutual interweaving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT3","text":"The further development of the One beyond the established difficulty remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the apparent self-subsistence of the moments is understood as an effect of immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT5","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of contradiction from the difference between conceptual inseparability and existent isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the distinction between conceptual determination and its immediate form of exposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CEIN:MRT7","text":"The actual movement of the text remains preserved: negative unity → immediacy → One → coming-apart → contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CEIN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CEIN@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CEIN:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 42","title":"c. One.","context":"Chapter 42","original_title":"c. Eins."},"original_title":"c. Eins.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV","layer":"CH","title":"B. One and Many.","order":43,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BEUV"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BEUV@R001","sha256":"ea424a9085e14e0911609f5e8e62b55600ea96339c04dd3304182e085658acf7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS1","text":"Das Eins entsteht als einfache Selbstbeziehung, in der die Momente des Fürsichseyns zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS2","text":"Durch diesen Zusammenfall erhält das Fürsichseyn die Form der Unmittelbarkeit, wodurch seine Momente als daseiende Bestimmungen gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS3","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung des Eins ist Bestimmen und zugleich unendliches Selbstbestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS4","text":"Die als unmittelbar gesetzte Selbstbestimmung schlägt von der Idealität des Fürsichseyns in die abstrakteste Realität des Eins um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS5","text":"Die gesetzte Einheit von Seyn und Daseyn enthält zugleich die Differenz zwischen der Bestimmung des Seyns und der unendlichen Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS6","text":"Das eigene Selbstbestimmen erscheint dadurch als ein vom Eins unterschiedenes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS7","text":"Die Einheit mit sich wird als negative Einheit zur Beziehung auf ein Anderes und zum Ausschließen dieses Anderen aus dem Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","text":"Das Eins ist einfache Beziehung des Fürsichseyns auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A2","text":"Im Eins sind die Momente des Fürsichseyns in sich zusammengefallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","text":"Der Zusammenfall der Momente setzt das Eins als Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A4","text":"Die in der Unmittelbarkeit gesetzten Momente erscheinen als daseiende Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","text":"Die Beziehung des Negativen auf sich ist Bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","text":"Die Beziehung auf sich ist unendliches Selbstbestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit setzt die Unterschiede der Selbstbestimmung zugleich als selbständige Seiende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","text":"Die Idealität des Fürsichseyns als Totalität schlägt in Realität um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A9","text":"Das Eins ist die festeste und abstrakteste Form dieser Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","text":"Im Eins ist Seyn und Daseyn als Einheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","text":"Diese Einheit vereinigt die Beziehung auf Anderes und die Beziehung auf sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A12","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Seyns tritt der Bestimmung der unendlichen Negation gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A13","text":"Was das Eins an sich ist, ist im gesetzten Zustand nur an ihm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","text":"Das Negative wird als vom Eins unterschiedenes Anderes gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A15","text":"Das unterschiedene Andere ist das eigene Selbstbestimmen des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A16","text":"Die Einheit des Selbstbestimmens mit sich wird als Beziehung auf ein Anderes herabgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","text":"Negative Einheit ist Negation seiner selbst als eines Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A18","text":"Das Eins bestimmt sich durch Ausschließen des Anderen aus sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX1","text":"Das Eins ist nicht bloß die abstrakte Identität eines unvermittelten Einen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX2","text":"Seine Momente sind nicht mehr ausschließlich ideelle Momente derselben Selbstbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX3","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit hebt die Unterschiede nicht auf, sondern setzt sie als Seiende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX4","text":"Das Eins ist nicht von jeder Beziehung auf Anderes getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX5","text":"Das Andere ist kein äußerlich hinzutretendes Seiendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX6","text":"Die negative Einheit ist keine ungeteilte Selbstidentität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX7","text":"Das Eins ist nicht ohne Ausschließen bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D1","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung des Eins erzeugt durch ihre Unmittelbarkeit eine Verdoppelung in gesetzte Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","CH_GB18_BEUV:A2","CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","CH_GB18_BEUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D2","text":"Das Eins erscheint als Realität, weil seine ideelle Totalität in eine unmittelbare, abstrakte Existenz umschlägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D3","text":"Die Einheit des Eins enthält eine innere Spannung zwischen der Bestimmtheit des Seyns und der unendlichen Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","CH_GB18_BEUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D4","text":"Das eigene Selbstbestimmen des Eins wird als Anderes gesetzt, sobald die Unterschiede der Selbstbeziehung daseiend werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D5","text":"Die Beziehung auf das Andere ist eine herabgesetzte Form der ursprünglichen Einheit des Eins mit sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A13","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15","CH_GB18_BEUV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D6","text":"Das Eins erhält seine negative Einheit durch die Negation des Anderen und dessen Ausschluss aus sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A16","CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD1","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Eins produziert die Differenz, die seine reine Selbstbeziehung scheinbar ausschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","CH_GB18_BEUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD2","text":"Das Andere ist strukturell im Eins erzeugt, weil es die daseiend gewordene Form seines eigenen Selbstbestimmens ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD3","text":"Die Totalität des Eins bewährt sich nicht als Abwesenheit von Differenz, sondern als Einheit von Selbstbeziehung, Beziehung auf Anderes und Ausschluss.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD4","text":"Das Eins schlägt durch seine eigene Setzung als Realität in eine Struktur um, in der es sich nur durch die Abstoßung eines Anderen erhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A9","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine reine Selbstidentität aus, die ihre Momente nicht als unterschiedene Seiende setzen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Unmittelbarkeit aus, die ohne Hervorbringung von Differenz bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein äußerliches Anderes aus, das nicht aus der Selbstbestimmung des Eins hervorgegangen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Totalität aus, deren Einheit nicht durch negative Beziehung vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine positive Bestimmung des Eins aus, die von Negation und Ausschluss unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Eins, das seine Einheit bewahren könnte, ohne sich in ein von sich unterschiedenes Anderes zu setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Differenz, die dem Eins äußerlich bliebe; jede wirksame Andersheit muss als eigenes Selbstbestimmen des Eins erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit einer Totalität, deren Selbstbezug nicht zugleich Selbstunterscheidung und Ausschluss wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX4","text":"Der Text behandelt die Abwesenheit von Ausschluss als unzureichende Form von Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS1","text":"Selbstbeziehung → Zusammenfall der Momente → Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS2","text":"Unmittelbarkeit → Setzung der Momente als Daseiende → Realität des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS3","text":"Negative Selbstbeziehung → Bestimmen → unendliches Selbstbestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS4","text":"Selbstbestimmung in unmittelbarer Form → zugleich gesetzte Unterschiede → Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS5","text":"Eigenes Selbstbestimmen → Erscheinung als unterschiedenes Anderes → Herabsetzung der Einheit zur Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS6","text":"Beziehung auf Anderes → Negation des Anderen → Ausschluss → negative Einheit des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF1","text":"Einfache Selbstbeziehung → Zusammenfall der Momente → Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF2","text":"Unmittelbarkeit → Dasein der Momente → Umschlag der Idealität in abstrakte Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF3","text":"Realität des Eins → Gegenüber von Seynsbestimmtheit und unendlicher Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF4","text":"Innere Differenz der Selbstbestimmung → Setzung des eigenen Bestimmens als Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF5","text":"Anderes als eigenes Selbstbestimmen → Beziehung statt unmittelbarer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF6","text":"Beziehung auf das Andere → Negation und Ausschluss → negative Einheit des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME1","text":"Das Eins wird von einer isolierten Einheit zu einer Struktur aus Selbstbeziehung, gesetzter Differenz und Ausschluss umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME2","text":"Das Andere wird von einem äußerlichen Gegenüber zu einer erzeugten Gestalt des eigenen Selbstbestimmens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME3","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit wird nicht als Abwesenheit von Vermittlung, sondern als Setzung der Vermittlungsmomente in daseiender Form sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME4","text":"Die Einheit von Seyn und Daseyn wird als konflikthafte Einheit von Realität und Negation lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME5","text":"Ausschluss wird von einer nachträglichen Operation zur konstitutiven Form der Einheit des Eins umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Eins erscheint als unmittelbare Einheit, deren Momente als Daseiende gesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Selbstbeziehung erzeugt durch ihre Setzung eine Differenz zwischen dem Eins und seinem eigenen Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz von Eins und Anderem wird als interne Bewegung statt als äußerer Gegensatz rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität entsteht als Umschlag der idealen Totalität in unmittelbares Daseyn; Differenz ist eine gesetzte Form des Selbstbezugs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der einfachen Selbstbeziehung zur negativen Einheit des Eins zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie genau der Umschlag von Idealität in Realität begrifflich vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern das Andere als Resultat des eigenen Selbstbestimmens verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Rekonstruktion des Anderen als immanente Differenz des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Einheit des Eins und seiner notwendigen Setzung als von sich unterschiedenem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Selbstbeziehung über Realität und Differenz zu Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113411779820Z_ad83cba4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. One and Many.","source_sha256":"ea424a9085e14e0911609f5e8e62b55600ea96339c04dd3304182e085658acf7","sha256":"394497459750c0aa3a559e5f0bfc46d2aa14c3c04f781781ce2d7d8d63c57830","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:34:11.788367+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS1","text":"The One arises as simple self-relation, in which the moments of being-for-self coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS2","text":"Through this coincidence, being-for-self receives the form of immediacy, whereby its moments are posited as existent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS3","text":"The negative self-relation of the One is determining and, at the same time, infinite self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS4","text":"Self-determination posited as immediate turns from the ideality of being-for-self into the most abstract reality of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS5","text":"The posited unity of Being and determinate being contains at the same time the difference between the determination of Being and infinite negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS6","text":"Its own self-determining thereby appears as an Other distinct from the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AS7","text":"Unity with itself becomes, as negative unity, relation to an Other and the exclusion of this Other from the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","text":"The One is the simple relation of being-for-self to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A2","text":"In the One, the moments of being-for-self have coincided within themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","text":"The coincidence of the moments posits the One as immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A4","text":"The moments posited in immediacy appear as existent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","text":"The relation of the negative to itself is determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","text":"Relation to itself is infinite self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","text":"Immediacy at the same time posits the differences of self-determination as self-subsistent beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","text":"The ideality of being-for-self as totality turns into reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A9","text":"The One is the most fixed and most abstract form of this reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","text":"In the One, Being and determinate being are posited as unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","text":"This unity unites relation to an Other and relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A12","text":"The determinacy of Being confronts the determination of infinite negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A13","text":"What the One is in itself is, in the posited state, only in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","text":"The negative is posited as an Other distinct from the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A15","text":"The distinct Other is the One's own self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A16","text":"The unity of self-determining with itself is reduced to relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","text":"Negative unity is negation of itself as an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:A18","text":"The One determines itself by excluding the Other from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX1","text":"The One is not merely the abstract identity of an unmediated One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX2","text":"Its moments are no longer exclusively ideal moments of the same self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX3","text":"Immediacy does not sublate the differences, but posits them as beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX4","text":"The One is not separated from every relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX5","text":"The Other is not a being that accedes externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX6","text":"Negative unity is not an undivided self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:NX7","text":"The One cannot be determined without exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D1","text":"Through its immediacy, the self-relation of the One generates a duplication into posited moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","CH_GB18_BEUV:A2","CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","CH_GB18_BEUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D2","text":"The One appears as reality because its ideal totality turns into an immediate, abstract existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D3","text":"The unity of the One contains an inner tension between the determinacy of Being and infinite negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","CH_GB18_BEUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D4","text":"The One's own self-determining is posited as an Other as soon as the differences of self-relation become existent.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","CH_GB18_BEUV:A7","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D5","text":"Relation to the Other is a reduced form of the original unity of the One with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A13","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15","CH_GB18_BEUV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:D6","text":"The One acquires its negative unity through the negation of the Other and its exclusion from itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A16","CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD1","text":"The immediacy of the One produces the difference that its pure self-relation seemingly excludes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A1","CH_GB18_BEUV:A3","CH_GB18_BEUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD2","text":"The Other is structurally generated in the One because it is the form of its own self-determining that has become existent.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A5","CH_GB18_BEUV:A6","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD3","text":"The totality of the One proves itself not as the absence of difference, but as the unity of self-relation, relation to an Other, and exclusion.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A10","CH_GB18_BEUV:A11","CH_GB18_BEUV:A17","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SD4","text":"Through its own positing as reality, the One turns into a structure in which it maintains itself only through the repulsion of an Other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEUV:A8","CH_GB18_BEUV:A9","CH_GB18_BEUV:A14","CH_GB18_BEUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a pure self-identity that would not have to posit its moments as distinct beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX2","text":"It excludes an immediacy that could subsist without the production of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX3","text":"It excludes an external Other that would not have proceeded from the self-determination of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX4","text":"It excludes a totality whose unity would not be mediated through negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:DNX5","text":"It excludes a positive determination of the One that would be independent of negation and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a One that could preserve its unity without positing itself into an Other distinct from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a difference that would remain external to the One; every effective otherness must appear as the One's own self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX3","text":"Barred is the possibility of a totality whose self-relation would not at the same time be self-distinction and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:SNX4","text":"The text treats the absence of exclusion as an insufficient form of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS1","text":"Self-relation → coincidence of the moments → immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS2","text":"Immediacy → positing of the moments as existents → reality of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS3","text":"Negative self-relation → determining → infinite self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS4","text":"Self-determination in immediate form → differences posited at the same time → Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS5","text":"Own self-determining → appearance as distinct Other → reduction of unity to relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:FGS6","text":"Relation to an Other → negation of the Other → exclusion → negative unity of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF1","text":"Simple self-relation → coincidence of the moments → immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF2","text":"Immediacy → determinate being of the moments → transition of ideality into abstract reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF3","text":"Reality of the One → confrontation of the determinacy of Being and infinite negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF4","text":"Inner difference of self-determination → positing of its own determining as Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF5","text":"Other as its own self-determining → relation instead of immediate unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:AF6","text":"Relation to the Other → negation and exclusion → negative unity of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME1","text":"The One is remapped from an isolated unity into a structure of self-relation, posited difference, and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME2","text":"The Other is reclassified from an external counterpart into a generated shape of its own self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME3","text":"Immediacy becomes visible not as the absence of mediation, but as the positing of the moments of mediation in existent form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME4","text":"The unity of Being and determinate being becomes readable as a conflictual unity of reality and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ME5","text":"Exclusion is redefined from a subsequent operation into the constitutive form of the unity of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — The One appears as immediate unity, whose moments are posited as existents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Through its positing, self-relation generates a difference between the One and its own Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition of One and Other is reconstructed as an internal movement rather than as an external opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality arises as the transition of ideal totality into immediate determinate being; difference is a posited form of self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from simple self-relation to the negative unity of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined precisely how the transition from ideality into reality is conceptually mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the Other is understood as the result of its own self-determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the reconstruction of the Other as immanent difference of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the unity of the One and its necessary positing as an Other distinct from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEUV:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from self-relation through reality and difference to exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BEUV@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BEUV:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 43","title":"B. One and Many.","context":"Chapter 43","original_title":"B. Eins und Vieles."},"original_title":"B. Eins und Vieles.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS","layer":"CH","title":"a. The One in Its Own Self.","order":44,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DEIS"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DEIS@R001","sha256":"928388a427330eab46733449ee7d13f758746d8f4b8014e8e587c957bfd17051","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS1","text":"Das Eins wird als reines Insichsein bestimmt, das keine Beziehung auf ein Anderes enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS2","text":"Diese Bestimmung entsteht durch die Negation von Dasein, äußerer Bestimmtheit und Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS3","text":"Die Negation äußerer Beziehung schließt Anderswerden aus und setzt Unveränderlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS4","text":"Die Unbestimmtheit des Eins ist keine bloße Leere, sondern absolute, auf sich selbst bezogene Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS5","text":"Als sich auf sich beziehende Negation enthält das Eins einen Unterschied, dessen Richtung auf Anderes mangels eines Anderen in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS6","text":"In dieser Rückkehr vermittelt das Eins Dasein und Idealität, wodurch Verschiedenheit und Mannigfaltigkeit aufgehoben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS7","text":"Das im Eins gesetzte Nichts unterscheidet sich vom Insichsein und erscheint als Leeres, das die Qualität des Eins in seiner Unmittelbarkeit bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A1","text":"Das Eins ist an ihm selbst reines Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A2","text":"Das Sein des Eins ist kein Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A3","text":"Das Eins ist keine Bestimmung durch Beziehung auf ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A4","text":"Das Eins ist keine Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A5","text":"Das Eins ist die Negation des Kreises äußerer Kategorien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A6","text":"Die Unbestimmtheit des Eins ist als Beziehung auf sich selbst absolute Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A7","text":"Das Eins ist gesetztes Insichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","text":"Die sich auf sich beziehende Negation enthält einen Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A9","text":"Die auf Anderes gerichtete Negation kehrt mangels eines Anderen in sich zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A10","text":"Die einfache Unmittelbarkeit des Eins vermittelt Dasein und Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A11","text":"In dieser Vermittlung verschwinden Verschiedenheit und Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A12","text":"Das im Eins gesetzte Nichts ist vom Insichsein des Eins unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A13","text":"Das Nichts des Eins ist als Leeres die Qualität des Eins in seiner Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX1","text":"Das Eins ist nicht Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX2","text":"Das Eins ist nicht Beziehung auf ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX3","text":"Das Eins ist nicht Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX4","text":"Das Eins ist nicht dem Anderswerden unterworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX5","text":"Im Eins ist keine äußere Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX6","text":"Im Eins ist keine Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX7","text":"Das Eins enthält nicht ein innerlich vorhandenes Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX8","text":"Das im Eins gesetzte Nichts ist nicht mit dessen Insichsein identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D1","text":"Das Eins ist unveränderlich, weil es keine Beziehung auf ein Anderes besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A2","CH_GB18_DEIS:A3","CH_GB18_DEIS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D2","text":"Die Unbestimmtheit des Eins fungiert als seine höchste Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A6","CH_GB18_DEIS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D3","text":"Der im Eins enthaltene Unterschied erzeugt keine reale Zweiheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","CH_GB18_DEIS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D4","text":"Die Negation des Eins ist zugleich nach außen gerichtet und in sich zurückgenommen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","CH_GB18_DEIS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D5","text":"Das Eins ist nicht bloß unmittelbar, sondern eine durch Rückkehr vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A9","CH_GB18_DEIS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D6","text":"Das Leere bezeichnet das gesetzte Nichts innerhalb der unmittelbaren Bestimmung des Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A12","CH_GB18_DEIS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD1","text":"Das Eins stabilisiert seine Identität, indem es jede mögliche Andersheit als nicht vorhanden in sich zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Eins entsteht nicht durch positiven Inhalt, sondern durch die Selbstbeziehung seiner Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD3","text":"Das System erzeugt eine innere Differenz, deren Funktion gerade in der Verhinderung äußerer Differenz besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD4","text":"Das Eins ist die Einheit von unmittelbarer Einfachheit und vermittelter Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD5","text":"Das Leere ist kein äußerer Mangel, sondern die innerhalb des Eins gesetzte Form seines inhaltslosen Insichseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX1","text":"Das Eins darf nicht als einzelnes Etwas unter anderen Etwasen bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX2","text":"Das Eins darf nicht durch einen positiven inneren Inhalt individualisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX3","text":"Der Unterschied im Eins darf nicht als selbständige Zweiheit bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX4","text":"Vermittlung darf nicht als Übergang zwischen äußerlich getrennten Bestimmungen verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX5","text":"Unbestimmtheit darf nicht als bloße Unkenntnis oder als noch fehlende qualitative Bestimmung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX6","text":"Das Nichts darf nicht außerhalb des Eins als selbständiges Gegenstück angesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie, in der Bestimmtheit nur durch äußere Relation und qualitative Differenz möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Differenz, die sich der Rücknahme in die Selbstbeziehung entzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Unmittelbarkeit, die völlig ohne innere Vermittlung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Nichts, das dem Eins äußerlich gegenübersteht oder von ihm unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS1","text":"Negation äußerer Kategorien → reines Insichsein → Ausschluss von Dasein, Relation und Beschaffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS2","text":"Ausschluss des Anderen → Unveränderlichkeit → Bestimmung des Eins als nicht anderswerdend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS3","text":"Selbstbezügliche Negation → interne Richtungsdifferenz → unmittelbare Rückkehr mangels eines Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS4","text":"Rückkehr der Negation → vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → Einheit von Dasein und Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS5","text":"Vermittlung von Dasein und Idealität → Aufhebung von Verschiedenheit und Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS6","text":"Aufhebung äußerer Differenz → Setzung des Nichts im Eins → Unterscheidung von Insichsein und Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS7","text":"Gesetztes Nichts in unmittelbarer Einheit → Leeres → qualitative Bestimmung des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AF1","text":"Reines Sein → Negation von Dasein und äußerer Beziehung → absolute Selbstbestimmtheit → rückläufige Differenz → vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → aufgehobene Mannigfaltigkeit → gesetztes Nichts → Leeres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME1","text":"Bestimmtheit wird von äußerer Relation auf Selbstbeziehung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME2","text":"Differenz wird nicht mehr als bleibende Zweiheit, sondern als in sich zurückkehrende Negationsbewegung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME3","text":"Unmittelbarkeit erscheint als Resultat einer Vermittlung und nicht als deren Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME4","text":"Das Leere wird vom bloßen Mangel zum strukturellen Qualitätsmoment des Eins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME5","text":"Das Nichts wird aus der Position eines Gegenpols in die Position eines im Eins gesetzten Moments verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Eins ist reines Sein, unveränderlich, unbestimmt und leer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Selbstbezügliche Negation erzeugt einen Unterschied, der mangels äußerer Relation in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz von Unmittelbarkeit und Vermittlung wird durch die Bestimmung einer vermittelten Unmittelbarkeit neu gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird als selbstbezügliche, nicht anderswerdende Bestimmung ohne äußere Zeitfolge und ohne unabhängige Andersheit konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung vom reinen Eins zum Leeren zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt wesentlich an der Identität von Unbestimmtheit und absoluter Selbstbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT3","text":"Die innere Differenz bleibt unterbestimmt, sofern ihre Funktion als Negationsrichtung und Rückkehr nicht zugleich festgehalten wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil jede Differenz an den Ausschluss eines selbständigen Anderen gebunden bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Umkehrung von Unmittelbarkeit in vermittelte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt in der Einheit von „nichts in ihm“ und dem Unterschied zwischen Insichsein und gesetztem Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern das Leere als Resultat der internen Setzung des Nichts und nicht als äußerer Mangel bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115213555672Z_8d61b965","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The One in its own self.","source_sha256":"928388a427330eab46733449ee7d13f758746d8f4b8014e8e587c957bfd17051","sha256":"4f074a49d941f4691c369f06e64fc8571a2defb85d2d1b7c9d2091cac5799fcf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:52:13.557505+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS1","text":"The One is determined as pure being-within-self, which contains no relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS2","text":"This determination arises through the negation of determinate being, external determinacy, and constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS3","text":"The negation of external relation excludes becoming-other and posits immutability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS4","text":"The indeterminacy of the One is not mere emptiness, but absolute determinacy relating to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS5","text":"As self-relating negation, the One contains a difference whose direction toward an Other returns into itself for lack of an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS6","text":"In this return, the One mediates determinate being and ideality, whereby difference and multiplicity are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AS7","text":"The nothing posited in the One distinguishes itself from being-within-self and appears as the void, which constitutes the quality of the One in its immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A1","text":"The One is in its own self pure being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A2","text":"The being of the One is not determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A3","text":"The One is not a determination through relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A4","text":"The One is not a constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A5","text":"The One is the negation of the circle of external categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A6","text":"The indeterminacy of the One, as relation to itself, is absolute determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A7","text":"The One is posited being-within-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","text":"Self-relating negation contains a difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A9","text":"Negation directed toward an Other returns into itself for lack of an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A10","text":"The simple immediacy of the One mediates determinate being and ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A11","text":"In this mediation, difference and multiplicity vanish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A12","text":"The nothing posited in the One is distinguished from the being-within-self of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:A13","text":"The nothing of the One, as the void, is the quality of the One in its immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX1","text":"The One is not determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX2","text":"The One is not relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX3","text":"The One is not constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX4","text":"The One is not subject to becoming-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX5","text":"In the One there is no external difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX6","text":"In the One there is no multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX7","text":"The One does not contain a something inwardly present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:NX8","text":"The nothing posited in the One is not identical with its being-within-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D1","text":"The One is immutable because it possesses no relation to an Other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A2","CH_GB18_DEIS:A3","CH_GB18_DEIS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D2","text":"The indeterminacy of the One functions as its highest determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A6","CH_GB18_DEIS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D3","text":"The difference contained in the One generates no real duality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","CH_GB18_DEIS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D4","text":"The negation of the One is at once directed outward and withdrawn into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A8","CH_GB18_DEIS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D5","text":"The One is not merely immediate, but an immediacy mediated through return.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A9","CH_GB18_DEIS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:D6","text":"The void designates the posited nothing within the immediate determination of the One.","refs":["CH_GB18_DEIS:A12","CH_GB18_DEIS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD1","text":"The One stabilizes its identity by withdrawing into itself every possible otherness as not present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD2","text":"The determinacy of the One arises not through positive content, but through the self-relation of its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD3","text":"The system generates an internal difference whose function consists precisely in preventing external difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD4","text":"The One is the unity of immediate simplicity and mediated self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SD5","text":"The void is not an external lack, but the form, posited within the One, of its contentless being-within-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX1","text":"The One must not be determined as an individual something among other somethings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX2","text":"The One must not be individualized through a positive inner content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX3","text":"The difference in the One must not remain as an independent duality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX4","text":"Mediation must not be understood as a transition between externally separated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX5","text":"Indeterminacy must not count as mere ignorance or as a qualitative determination still lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:DNX6","text":"Nothing must not be posited outside the One as an independent counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology in which determinacy is possible only through external relation and qualitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a difference that eludes withdrawal into self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an immediacy that would be entirely without internal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a nothing that stands externally opposed to the One or would be independent of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS1","text":"Negation of external categories → pure being-within-self → exclusion of determinate being, relation, and constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS2","text":"Exclusion of the Other → immutability → determination of the One as not becoming-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS3","text":"Self-relating negation → internal directional difference → immediate return for lack of an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS4","text":"Return of negation → mediated immediacy → unity of determinate being and ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS5","text":"Mediation of determinate being and ideality → sublation of difference and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS6","text":"Sublation of external difference → positing of nothing in the One → distinction between being-within-self and nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:FGS7","text":"Posited nothing in immediate unity → void → qualitative determination of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:AF1","text":"Pure being → negation of determinate being and external relation → absolute self-determinacy → retrogressive difference → mediated immediacy → sublated multiplicity → posited nothing → void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME1","text":"Determinacy is remapped from external relation onto self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME2","text":"Difference is no longer classified as enduring duality, but as a movement of negation returning into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME3","text":"Immediacy appears as the result of a mediation and not as its exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME4","text":"The void is reclassified from mere lack into the structural moment of quality of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ME5","text":"Nothing is shifted from the position of a counterpole into the position of a moment posited in the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT1","text":"Surface — The One is pure being, immutable, indeterminate, and void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Self-relating negation generates a difference that, for lack of external relation, returns into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition of immediacy and mediation is reconceived through the determination of a mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is constituted as a self-relating, non-becoming-other determination without external temporal succession and without independent otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the pure One to the void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction depends essentially on the identity of indeterminacy and absolute self-determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT3","text":"The internal difference remains underdetermined unless its function as direction of negation and return is simultaneously maintained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent because every difference remains bound to the exclusion of an independent Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the reversal of immediacy into mediated self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the unity of „nothing in it“ and the distinction between being-within-self and posited nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DEIS:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the void is determined as the result of the internal positing of nothing and not as external lack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DEIS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DEIS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DEIS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 44","title":"a. The One in Its Own Self.","context":"Chapter 44","original_title":"a. Das Eins an ihm selbst."},"original_title":"a. Das Eins an ihm selbst.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU","layer":"CH","title":"b. The One and the Void.","order":45,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDEU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDEU@R001","sha256":"de82c76c64d2d4cade3e86ce70d8faeddc0c1a939a4b47ebdec59214b5bdc8f7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn wird durch die Bestimmungen des Eins und des Leeren bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS2","text":"Das Eins wird als auf sich selbst bezogene Negation, das Leere als Nichts schlechthin gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS3","text":"Die Beziehung des Eins auf sich erzeugt die gesetzte Verschiedenheit zwischen affirmativem Seyn und leerem Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS4","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung bildet den gemeinsamen einfachen Boden beider Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS5","text":"Die Einheit ihrer Momente schlägt in Äußerlichkeit und Dasein um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS6","text":"Das Eins und das Leere erscheinen dadurch als einander gegenüberstehende Daseinsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn bestimmt sich als Eins und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A2","text":"Das Eins ist die abstrakte Beziehung der Negation auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A3","text":"Das Eins besitzt neben seiner negativen Bestimmung auch die einfache Unmittelbarkeit des affirmativen Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A4","text":"Das Leere ist als Nichts schlechthin vom affirmativen Seyn des Eins verschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","text":"Die Beziehung des Eins auf sich setzt die Verschiedenheit von Eins und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A6","text":"Das Nichts ist als Leeres außerhalb des seyenden Eins bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A7","text":"Die negative Beziehung auf sich ist der gemeinsame einfache Boden von Eins und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A8","text":"Die Einheit der Momente setzt die Bestimmung des Seyns und damit Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A9","text":"Die Momente des Fürsichseyns werden aus ihrer Einheit heraus äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A10","text":"Die Negation überhaupt erscheint als Dasein des Nichts gegenüber dem Dasein des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX1","text":"Das Leere ist nicht das affirmative Seyn des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX2","text":"Das Nichts ist nicht mit der einfachen Unmittelbarkeit des Eins identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX3","text":"Die Verschiedenheit von Eins und Leere ist nicht eine Beziehungslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX4","text":"Das Leere ist nicht bloß eine positive Bestimmung neben dem Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX5","text":"Die Momente des Fürsichseyns bleiben nicht in ungetrennter Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX6","text":"Die Negation bleibt nicht ohne Daseinsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D1","text":"Die Bestimmung des Eins enthält zugleich affirmative Unmittelbarkeit und negative Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A2","CH_GB18_BDEU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D2","text":"Das Leere erhält seine Bestimmung nur innerhalb der Beziehung zum Eins, obwohl es als dessen Außen erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","CH_GB18_BDEU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D3","text":"Die Verschiedenheit von Eins und Leere ist eine gesetzte Verschiedenheit innerhalb einer gemeinsamen Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","CH_GB18_BDEU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D4","text":"Die Rückkehr des Fürsichseyns zu Eins und Leere ist zugleich die Wiedergewinnung eines Daseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A1","CH_GB18_BDEU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D5","text":"Die Einheit der negativen Selbstbeziehung erzeugt durch ihre eigene Bestimmung die Äußerlichkeit ihrer Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A7","CH_GB18_BDEU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D6","text":"Das Dasein des Nichts ist die gegenständliche Erscheinung der Negation gegenüber dem Dasein des Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A8","CH_GB18_BDEU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD1","text":"Die scheinbare Zweiheit von Eins und Leere ist die aus einer negativen Einheit hervorgegangene Selbstäußerung des Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD2","text":"Das Eins kann nur als Eins bestimmt werden, indem es das Leere als sein negatives Außen mitsetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD3","text":"Die Bestimmung des Daseins entsteht nicht vor der Negation, sondern aus der Differenzierung der negativen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD4","text":"Die Einheit fungiert nicht als aufgehobene Trennung, sondern als Produktionsgrund der Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD5","text":"Das Leere ist zugleich selbständige Gegenüberstellung und abhängige Bestimmung des seyenden Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Eins, dessen affirmative Unmittelbarkeit ohne negative Selbstbeziehung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Leeres, das unabhängig von der Beziehung zum Eins bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine ursprüngliche Zweiheit, deren Momente nicht aus einer gemeinsamen Einheit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit, die ihre Momente in bloßer Ununterschiedenheit festhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Dasein, das nicht aus der Setzung der Bestimmungen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist die reine Positivität des Eins ohne konstitutives Außen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein schlechthin leeres Nichts außerhalb jeder relationalen Setzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Einheit, die nicht in Differenz und Äußerlichkeit umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist die Trennung von ontologischer Bestimmung und negativer Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS1","text":"Fürsichseyn → negative Selbstbeziehung → Bestimmung als Eins und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS2","text":"Eins → affirmative Unmittelbarkeit plus Negation auf sich → gesetzte Verschiedenheit vom Leeren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS3","text":"Negative Einheit → Bestimmung des Seyns → Herabsetzung in Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS4","text":"Einheit der Momente → Äußerlichwerden → Gegenüberstellung von seyendem Eins und leerem Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS5","text":"Gegenüberstellung → relationale Differenz → erneute Bestimmung des Fürsichseyns als Daseinsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AF1","text":"Fürsichseyn → Bestimmung als Eins und Leere → gemeinsame negative Selbstbeziehung → gesetzte Verschiedenheit → Einführung des Seyns → Dasein → äußerliche Gegenüberstellung von Eins und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME1","text":"Das Eins wird von einer isolierten Einheit zu einer relationalen Negationsstruktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME2","text":"Das Leere wird von bloßer Abwesenheit zu einer gegenübergesetzten Daseinsbestimmung des Nichts umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME3","text":"Einheit und Differenz erscheinen nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Momente derselben negativen Struktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME4","text":"Dasein wird als Effekt der Differenzierung einer ursprünglichen negativen Einheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME5","text":"Das Außen des Eins wird als von diesem gesetztes, nicht als äußerlich vorgefundenes Außen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Eins und das Leere stehen als unterschiedliche Bestimmungen des Fürsichseyns gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine negative Selbstbeziehung erzeugt durch die Bestimmung des Seyns die Äußerlichkeit ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Gegenüberstellung von Eins und Leere wird als Resultat einer inneren Setzungsbewegung und nicht als unmittelbare Gegebenheit lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Seyn und Dasein erscheinen als hervorgebrachte Stufen der Selbstbestimmung der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der negativen Selbstbeziehung zur Gegenüberstellung von Eins und Leere zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Bestimmung des Seyns formal aus der negativen Einheit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern das affirmative Seyn des Eins und das Leere als verschiedene Momente derselben Beziehung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Ableitung der Differenz aus einer gemeinsamen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass das Eins zugleich unmittelbares Seyn und Resultat negativer Selbstbeziehung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Leere als außerhalb des Eins und zugleich als durch dessen Beziehung bestimmtes Moment erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn Dasein als Folge der Äußerlichwerdung und nicht als vorausgesetzte Grundlage behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112907859985Z_13b65e0b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The One and the Void.","source_sha256":"de82c76c64d2d4cade3e86ce70d8faeddc0c1a939a4b47ebdec59214b5bdc8f7","sha256":"f99bd1631e3fe860c124edb23f6ef1a4f15f2afbe5a0c0d05d3ade6d8c6a6669","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:29:07.860969+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS1","text":"Being-for-self is determined through the determinations of the One and the Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS2","text":"The One is conceived as negation relating to itself, the Void as Nothing pure and simple.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS3","text":"The relation of the One to itself produces the posited difference between affirmative Being and empty Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS4","text":"Negative self-relation forms the common simple ground of both moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS5","text":"The unity of their moments turns into externality and Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AS6","text":"The One and the Void thereby appear as determinations of Dasein standing opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A1","text":"Being-for-self determines itself as One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A2","text":"The One is the abstract relation of negation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A3","text":"Alongside its negative determination, the One also possesses the simple immediacy of affirmative Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A4","text":"The Void, as Nothing pure and simple, is distinct from the affirmative Being of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","text":"The relation of the One to itself posits the difference of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A6","text":"Nothing is determined as Void outside the being One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A7","text":"Negative relation to itself is the common simple ground of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A8","text":"The unity of the moments posits the determination of Being and thereby Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A9","text":"The moments of being-for-self become external from out of their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:A10","text":"Negation in general appears as the Dasein of Nothing in opposition to the Dasein of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX1","text":"The Void is not the affirmative Being of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX2","text":"Nothing is not identical with the simple immediacy of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX3","text":"The difference of One and Void is not a relationlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX4","text":"The Void is not merely a positive determination alongside the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX5","text":"The moments of being-for-self do not remain in undivided unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:NX6","text":"Negation does not remain without a determination of Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D1","text":"The determination of the One contains at once affirmative immediacy and negative self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A2","CH_GB18_BDEU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D2","text":"The Void receives its determination only within the relation to the One, although it appears as the latter's outside.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","CH_GB18_BDEU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D3","text":"The difference of One and Void is a posited difference within a common relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A5","CH_GB18_BDEU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D4","text":"The return of being-for-self to One and Void is at the same time the recovery of a Dasein.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A1","CH_GB18_BDEU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D5","text":"Through its own determination, the unity of negative self-relation produces the externality of its moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A7","CH_GB18_BDEU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:D6","text":"The Dasein of Nothing is the objective appearance of negation in opposition to the Dasein of the One.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEU:A8","CH_GB18_BDEU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD1","text":"The apparent duality of One and Void is the self-externalization of being-for-self arising from a negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD2","text":"The One can be determined as One only by co-positing the Void as its negative outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD3","text":"The determination of Dasein arises not prior to negation, but out of the differentiation of negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD4","text":"Unity functions not as a sublated separation, but as the productive ground of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SD5","text":"The Void is at once an independent opposition and a dependent determination of the being One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a One whose affirmative immediacy could subsist without negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a Void that would be determined independently of the relation to the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an original duality whose moments do not arise from a common unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a unity that holds its moments fast in mere undifferentiatedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a Dasein that does not arise from the positing of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is the pure positivity of the One without a constitutive outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a Nothing absolutely void outside every relational positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a unity that does not turn into difference and externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:SNX4","text":"Impermissible is the separation of ontological determination and negative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS1","text":"Being-for-self → negative self-relation → determination as One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS2","text":"One → affirmative immediacy plus negation directed toward itself → posited difference from the Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS3","text":"Negative unity → determination of Being → reduction into Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS4","text":"Unity of the moments → becoming-external → opposition of being One and empty Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:FGS5","text":"Opposition → relational difference → renewed determination of being-for-self as a structure of Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:AF1","text":"Being-for-self → determination as One and Void → common negative self-relation → posited difference → introduction of Being → Dasein → external opposition of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME1","text":"The One is remapped from an isolated unity into a relational structure of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME2","text":"The Void is reclassified from mere absence into an opposed determination of Dasein of Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME3","text":"Unity and difference no longer appear as opposites, but as successive moments of the same negative structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME4","text":"Dasein becomes visible as the effect of the differentiation of an original negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ME5","text":"The outside of the One is determined as posited by it, not as an externally encountered outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT1","text":"Surface — The One and the Void stand opposed as distinct determinations of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT2","text":"Structural — A negative self-relation produces, through the determination of Being, the externality of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition of One and Void becomes legible as the result of an inner movement of positing and not as immediate givenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being and Dasein appear as produced stages of the self-determination of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from negative self-relation to the opposition of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the determination of Being formally arises from negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the affirmative Being of the One and the Void count as distinct moments of the same relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the derivation of difference from a common unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that the One is at once immediate Being and the result of negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the Void appears as outside the One and at the same time as a moment determined through its relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEU:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if Dasein is treated as a consequence of becoming-external and not as a presupposed foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDEU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDEU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 45","title":"b. The One and the Void.","context":"Chapter 45","original_title":"b. Das Eins und das Leere."},"original_title":"b. Das Eins und das Leere.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":46,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_7"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_7@R001","sha256":"f8a0bfa2df52d9b528b13beff1bcbf42456a7fc85673b79a89c76a5ab006b80b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS1","text":"Das atomistische Prinzip setzt das Eins und das Leere als einfache Grundbestimmungen des Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS2","text":"Es gewinnt gegenüber bloßem Sein und Werden Bestimmtheit, indem es die Mannigfaltigkeit auf den Gegensatz von Eins und Leere zurückführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS3","text":"Als bloß vorgestelltes Nebeneinander bleiben Eins und Leere äußerlich, abstrakt und gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS4","text":"Die spekulative Bestimmung des Prinzips entsteht erst, wenn das Leere als negative Beziehung und als Quelle der Bewegung gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung gründet nicht in einem räumlichen Platzmangel, sondern in der Negativität, durch die das Eins sich auf sein eigenes Anderssein bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS6","text":"Wo die atomistische Abstraktion als äußerliche Zusammensetzung fortgesetzt wird, erzeugt sie willkürliche Bestimmungen und wiederholt sich in Physik und Staatswissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","text":"Das Eins und das Leere bilden die Grundbestimmungen des atomistischen Prinzips.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","text":"Die Mannigfaltigkeit der Welt soll aus dem einfachen Gegensatz von Eins und Leere erkannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A3","text":"Das Eins ist die Negation alles Andersseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A4","text":"Das Eins ist als unmittelbares Fürsichsein nicht mehr bestimmbar und nicht veränderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","text":"Bestimmung, Mannigfaltigkeit und Verknüpfung verhalten sich zum atomaren Eins äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","text":"Das Leere ist nicht bloß Voraussetzung oder Bedingung, sondern Grund der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","text":"Der Grund des Werdens und der Selbstbewegung liegt im Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A8","text":"Das Negative ist als wahrhafte Negativität des Unendlichen zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A9","text":"Das Leere ist die negative Beziehung des Eins auf sein eigenes Negatives, das als Eins gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","text":"Äußerliche Bestimmungen von Gestalt, Stellung und Bewegungsrichtung der Atome widersprechen der Grundbestimmung des Atoms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A11","text":"Atomistische Begrifflosigkeit reproduziert sich in Molekülen, Partikeln und in einer Staatswissenschaft des einzelnen Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX1","text":"Das atomistische Prinzip ist nicht bloß ein gleichgültiges Nebeneinander von Atomen und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX2","text":"Das Leere ist nicht lediglich ein Raum, in den sich ein bereits Bewegtes hineinbewegen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX3","text":"Das Leere ist nicht nur Voraussetzung oder Bedingung der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX4","text":"Die Bewegung darf nicht als schon vorhanden vorausgesetzt werden, während ihr Grund unbestimmt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX5","text":"Die weiteren Bestimmungen der Atome sind nicht aus ihrer Grundbestimmung notwendig entwickelt, wenn sie willkürlich und äußerlich gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX6","text":"Die Welt ist nicht als innerlich vermittelte Einheit atomarer Einzelheiten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX7","text":"Staatswissenschaft darf nicht beim isolierten Einzelwillen als letztem Prinzip stehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D1","text":"Die Rückführung der Welt auf Eins und Leere erzeugt zunächst nur eine abstrakte und äußerliche Erklärung der Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D2","text":"Die Unveränderlichkeit des Eins macht jede qualitative oder relationale Bestimmung zu einem äußerlichen Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A3","CH_GB18_AN_7:A4","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D3","text":"Das Leere erhält seinen spekulativen Sinn erst durch seine Beziehung zum Eins und nicht durch seine räumliche Leere.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D4","text":"Bewegung ist als Selbstbewegung des Negativen und nicht als bloße Ortsveränderung zu begreifen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A8","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D5","text":"Die atomistische Theorie enthält einen spekulativen Kern, sobald sie das Leere als negative Bewegungsbeziehung fasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D6","text":"Äußerliche Zusatzbestimmungen der Atome verkehren das spekulative Prinzip in eine widersprüchliche Konstruktion.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A9","CH_GB18_AN_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D7","text":"Die atomistische Struktur bildet eine gemeinsame Form naturwissenschaftlicher und politischer Begrifflosigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","CH_GB18_AN_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD1","text":"Das Prinzip der höchsten Abstraktion trägt eine innere Doppelstruktur: Es setzt äußerliche Vereinzelung und enthält zugleich die negative Quelle ihrer Bewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD2","text":"Die Erklärungskraft des atomistischen Prinzips hängt davon ab, ob es beim äußerlichen Nebeneinander stehen bleibt oder zur negativen Selbstbeziehung fortbestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD3","text":"Die äußerliche Zusammensetzung kann keine konkrete Mannigfaltigkeit begründen, weil sie die Vermittlung zwischen den Einzelheiten nicht aus dem Prinzip selbst erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD4","text":"Die Übertragung des atomistischen Modells auf Moleküle, Partikel und Individuen macht die Begrifflosigkeit zu einer bereichsübergreifenden Struktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","CH_GB18_AN_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Vermittlung aus, in der die Mannigfaltigkeit aus inneren Beziehungen und nicht aus äußerer Zusammensetzung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Bestimmung des Eins aus, die Veränderung, Anderssein und qualitative Differenz in sich aufnehmen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Bewegung aus, deren Grund nicht in der negativen Selbstbeziehung des Eins läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine notwendige Ableitung der konkreten Atomformen aus dem atomistischen Grundprinzip aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine politische Totalität aus, die nicht aus voneinander unabhängigen Einzelwillen zusammengesetzt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine konkrete Einheit, in der Eins und Mannigfaltigkeit nicht als äußerliche Gegensätze auseinanderfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine Kausalität, in der Bewegung aus innerer Negativität hervorgeht, ohne in bloße räumliche Bedingtheit zurückzufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX3","text":"Der Text organisiert sich gegen die Möglichkeit, Einzelheit als selbstgenügsamen Grund von Natur und Staat anzuerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Begriffsform, in der Zusammenhang nicht nachträglich zusammengesetzt, sondern ursprünglich vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS1","text":"Eins + Leeres → atomistisches Grundprinzip → Reduktion der Mannigfaltigkeit auf einen einfachen Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS2","text":"Eins als Negation des Andersseins → Fürsichsein → Unveränderlichkeit und äußerliche Beziehung aller weiteren Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS3","text":"Leeres als bloßer Raum → Bedingung der Ortsbewegung → Verfehlung des Bewegungsgrundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS4","text":"Leeres als negative Beziehung des Eins auf sich selbst → Negativität → Grund von Werden und Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS5","text":"Äußerliche Atomdeterminationen → fehlende Notwendigkeit → Widerspruch zur atomistischen Grundbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS6","text":"Wiederholung der Atomform in Molekül, Partikel und Individuum → bereichsübergreifende Begrifflosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF1","text":"Atomistisches Eins-und-Leeres-Prinzip → Reduktion der Weltmannigfaltigkeit → äußerliche Zusammensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF2","text":"Äußerliche Zusammensetzung → Unfähigkeit zur inneren Bestimmung → Kritik der atomistischen Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF3","text":"Kritik der räumlichen Leere → Leeres als negative Beziehung → Bewegung als Selbstbewegung des Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF4","text":"Negative Bewegungsbegründung → spekulative Bestimmung des Atomismus → Abgrenzung gegen bloße Vorstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF5","text":"Willkürliche Atomdeterminationen → Widerspruch zur Grundbestimmung → Übertragung der Begrifflosigkeit auf Physik und Staatswissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME1","text":"Das Leere wird von einer räumlichen Abwesenheit zu einer produktiven negativen Beziehung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME2","text":"Bewegung wird von äußerlicher Ortsveränderung zu einer durch Negativität erzeugten Selbstbewegung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME3","text":"Die atomistische Erklärung wird in eine äußerliche und eine spekulative Schicht aufgeteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME4","text":"Die Trennung von Physik und Staatswissenschaft wird durch die gemeinsame Form atomistischer Begrifflosigkeit relativiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME5","text":"Einzelheit wird nicht mehr als selbständiger Grund, sondern als abstrakte Form äußerlicher Beziehungen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT1","text":"Surface: Atome, Leeres, Zusammensetzung und Bewegung werden als unmittelbare Bestimmungen des atomistischen Prinzips untersucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT2","text":"Structural: Das Verhältnis von Eins und Leere entscheidet darüber, ob Zusammenhang äußerlich oder negativ vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Kritik verschiebt die Erklärung von der vorgestellten Zusammensetzung auf die Bestimmung des Bewegungsgrundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Werden und Selbstbewegung gründen in der Negativität des Unendlichen, nicht in einem bereits vorausgesetzten Bewegungsprozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom atomistischen Grundsatz zur Kritik äußerlicher Zusammensetzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT2","text":"Die Bestimmung des Leeren als negative Beziehung ist erforderlich, damit die Passage von räumlicher Bedingung zu Bewegungsgrund nachvollziehbar bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT3","text":"Die Übertragung auf Physik und Staatswissenschaft bleibt unterbestimmt, sofern die gemeinsame institutionelle oder begriffliche Vermittlung nicht weiter ausgeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT4","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, solange zwischen dem äußerlichen und dem spekulativen Sinn des atomistischen Prinzips unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung entsteht zwischen Negativität, Selbstbewegung und der Kritik des bloßen Nebeneinanders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, verliert jedoch die historische Differenzierung der antiken Positionen durch die notwendige Kompression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111344389633Z_b22809f6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"f8a0bfa2df52d9b528b13beff1bcbf42456a7fc85673b79a89c76a5ab006b80b","sha256":"7d8ceae1637b44eb4877b81989aa2f6a2230e76073fd6396f38bbe42438ab325","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:13:44.392177+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS1","text":"The atomistic principle posits the One and the Void as simple fundamental determinations of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS2","text":"It gains determinacy over against mere being and becoming by reducing multiplicity to the opposition of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS3","text":"As merely represented juxtaposition, One and Void remain external, abstract, and indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS4","text":"The speculative determination of the principle arises only when the Void is grasped as negative relation and as the source of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS5","text":"Movement is grounded not in a spatial lack of room, but in the negativity through which the One relates to its own otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AS6","text":"Where atomistic abstraction is continued as external composition, it produces arbitrary determinations and repeats itself in physics and political science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","text":"The One and the Void constitute the fundamental determinations of the atomistic principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","text":"The multiplicity of the world is to be cognized from the simple opposition of One and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A3","text":"The One is the negation of all otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A4","text":"As immediate being-for-self, the One can no longer be determined and is not mutable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","text":"Determination, multiplicity, and connection relate externally to the atomic One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","text":"The Void is not merely presupposition or condition, but the ground of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","text":"The ground of becoming and self-movement lies in the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A8","text":"The negative is to be determined as the true negativity of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A9","text":"The Void is the negative relation of the One to its own negative, which is posited as One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","text":"External determinations of the shape, position, and direction of movement of atoms contradict the fundamental determination of the atom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:A11","text":"Atomistic conceptlessness reproduces itself in molecules, particles, and in a political science of the individual will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX1","text":"The atomistic principle is not merely an indifferent juxtaposition of atoms and Void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX2","text":"The Void is not merely a space into which something already in motion can move.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX3","text":"The Void is not merely the presupposition or condition of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX4","text":"Movement must not be presupposed as already present while its ground remains indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX5","text":"The further determinations of atoms are not necessarily developed from their fundamental determination when they are posited arbitrarily and externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX6","text":"The world is not determined as an internally mediated unity of atomic singularities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:NX7","text":"Political science must not remain at the isolated individual will as ultimate principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D1","text":"The reduction of the world to One and Void initially produces only an abstract and external explanation of multiplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D2","text":"The immutability of the One makes every qualitative or relational determination an external relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A3","CH_GB18_AN_7:A4","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D3","text":"The Void receives its speculative meaning only through its relation to the One and not through its spatial emptiness.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D4","text":"Movement is to be conceived as the self-movement of the negative and not as mere change of place.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A8","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D5","text":"Atomistic theory contains a speculative core as soon as it grasps the Void as a negative relation of movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D6","text":"External supplementary determinations of atoms transform the speculative principle into a contradictory construction.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A9","CH_GB18_AN_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:D7","text":"The atomistic structure constitutes a common form of scientific and political conceptlessness.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","CH_GB18_AN_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD1","text":"The principle of the highest abstraction bears an inner double structure: it posits external isolation and at the same time contains the negative source of its movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A1","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A7","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD2","text":"The explanatory power of the atomistic principle depends on whether it remains at external juxtaposition or is further determined into negative self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A6","CH_GB18_AN_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD3","text":"External composition cannot ground any concrete multiplicity because it does not generate mediation between singularities from the principle itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A2","CH_GB18_AN_7:A5","CH_GB18_AN_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SD4","text":"The transfer of the atomistic model to molecules, particles, and individuals makes conceptlessness into a cross-domain structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_7:A10","CH_GB18_AN_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a mediation in which multiplicity proceeds from internal relations and not from external composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX2","text":"It excludes a determination of the One that could take change, otherness, and qualitative difference into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX3","text":"It excludes a movement whose ground would not lie in the negative self-relation of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX4","text":"It excludes a necessary derivation of concrete atomic forms from the atomistic fundamental principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:DNX5","text":"It excludes a political totality that would not be composed of mutually independent individual wills.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX1","text":"Unavailable remains a concrete unity in which One and multiplicity do not fall apart as external opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX2","text":"Barred remains a causality in which movement proceeds from inner negativity without falling back into mere spatial conditionedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX3","text":"The text organizes itself against the possibility of recognizing singularity as the self-sufficient ground of nature and state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a form of concept in which connection is not subsequently composed but is originally mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS1","text":"One + Void → atomistic fundamental principle → reduction of multiplicity to a simple opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS2","text":"One as negation of otherness → being-for-self → immutability and external relation of all further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS3","text":"Void as mere space → condition of local movement → failure to grasp the ground of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS4","text":"Void as negative relation of the One to itself → negativity → ground of becoming and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS5","text":"External atomic determinations → lack of necessity → contradiction with the atomistic fundamental determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:FGS6","text":"Repetition of the atomic form in molecule, particle, and individual → cross-domain conceptlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF1","text":"Atomistic One-and-Void principle → reduction of worldly multiplicity → external composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF2","text":"External composition → incapacity for internal determination → critique of atomistic explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF3","text":"Critique of spatial Void → Void as negative relation → movement as self-movement of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF4","text":"Negative grounding of movement → speculative determination of atomism → delimitation against mere representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:AF5","text":"Arbitrary atomic determinations → contradiction with the fundamental determination → transfer of conceptlessness to physics and political science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME1","text":"The Void is remapped from a spatial absence into a productive negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME2","text":"Movement is reclassified from external change of place into a self-movement generated through negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME3","text":"The atomistic explanation is divided into an external and a speculative layer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME4","text":"The separation of physics and political science is relativized through the common form of atomistic conceptlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ME5","text":"Singularity is no longer visible as an independent ground, but as an abstract form of external relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT1","text":"Surface: Atoms, Void, composition, and movement are investigated as immediate determinations of the atomistic principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT2","text":"Structural: The relation of One and Void decides whether connection is external or negatively mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The critique shifts explanation from represented composition to the determination of the ground of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Becoming and self-movement are grounded in the negativity of the infinite, not in a movement process already presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the atomistic fundamental proposition to the critique of external composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT2","text":"The determination of the Void as negative relation is required in order that the passage from spatial condition to ground of movement remain comprehensible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT3","text":"The transfer to physics and political science remains underdetermined insofar as the common institutional or conceptual mediation is not further elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT4","text":"The system is internally coherent so long as a distinction is made between the external and the speculative sense of the atomistic principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection arises between negativity, self-movement, and the critique of mere juxtaposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_7:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but loses the historical differentiation of the ancient positions through the necessary compression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_7:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 46","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 46","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER","layer":"CH","title":"c. Many Ones. Repulsion.","order":47,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CVER"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVER@R001","sha256":"a9b32c9e450601b55a2db2611020da345f584558fbe847515e7a51a804b7f54d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare Fürsichsein bestimmt sich durch Eins und Leeres als Negationen in affirmativem Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS2","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung des Eins wird, sobald das Eins als unmittelbares Seiendes fixiert ist, zur Beziehung auf ein seiendes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS3","text":"Dieses Andere ist nicht das Leere, sondern wiederum ein Eins; dadurch entsteht Vielheit ohne Übergang des Eins in ein anderes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS4","text":"Die immanente negative Selbstbeziehung des Eins bestimmt sich als Repulsion und setzt viele Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS5","text":"Die gesetzten Eins werden als selbständige, nur auf sich bezogene und äußerlich gegeneinander stehende Eins bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS6","text":"Die Vielheit erscheint dadurch als außer dem Eins liegende Grenze und als außer sich gekommene Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS7","text":"Die Vielheit der Eins erweist sich als vom Eins selbst gesetzte, zugleich äußerliche und widersprüchlich sich hervorbringende Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A1","text":"Das Fürsichsein hat in seinem nächsten Dasein die Bestimmungen Eins und Leeres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A2","text":"Das Eins und das Leere sind jeweils Negation und gesetztes Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A3","text":"Das Eins ist Negation in der Bestimmung des Seins, das Leere Negation in der Bestimmung des Nichtseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A4","text":"Das Eins ist wesentlich Beziehung auf sich als beziehende Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A5","text":"Als fixiertes unmittelbares Dasein bezieht sich das Eins durch seine negative Selbstbeziehung zugleich auf ein seiendes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A6","text":"Das seiende Andere der negativen Selbstbeziehung des Eins ist wiederum ein Eins und nicht das unbestimmte Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A7","text":"Das Eins enthält das Negative als Beziehung in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A8","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung des Eins ist Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A9","text":"Die Repulsion des Eins setzt durch das Eins selbst viele Eins außer ihm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A10","text":"Die gesetzten Eins beziehen sich nicht auf ein Anderes, sondern unendlich auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A11","text":"Repellieren und Repelliertwerden kommen den Eins in gleicher Weise zu und begründen keinen Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A12","text":"Das Werden zu Vielen verschwindet als Werden und bestimmt sich als Gesetztwerden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A13","text":"Das Gesetztsein der vielen Eins ist aufgehoben, sodass sie als nur auf sich bezogene Seiende gegeneinander vorausgesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A14","text":"Die Vielheit ist dem Eins äußerlich und keine affirmative Beziehung der Eins aufeinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A15","text":"Eine affirmative Beziehung der Eins aufeinander würde sie begrenzen und ihnen ein Sein-für-Anderes geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A16","text":"Die äußerliche Grenze der Eins ist das Leere als reines Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX1","text":"Die Entstehung der Vielheit ist kein Werden als Übergang von Sein in Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX2","text":"Die erste Repulsion ist nicht das bloße gegenseitige Abhalten bereits vorhandener Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX3","text":"Das Andere der Selbstbeziehung des Eins ist nicht die unbestimmte Negation des Leeren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX4","text":"Die Vielheit ist kein Anderssein des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX5","text":"Die Eins haben keine affirmative Beziehung aufeinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX6","text":"Zwischen repellierendem und repelliertem Eins besteht kein qualitativer Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX7","text":"Die Grenze der Eins ist keine positive Bestimmung ihrer gegenseitigen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX8","text":"Das Fürsichsein des Eins ist nicht Beziehung auf ein äußerliches Anderes, sondern Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D1","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung des fixierten Eins erzeugt eine Beziehung auf ein seiendes Anderes, dessen Bestimmung wiederum Eins ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A5","CH_GB18_CVER:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D2","text":"Die Vielheit entsteht als eigenes Gesetztwerden des Eins und nicht als Übergang des Eins in ein anderes Sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A7","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D3","text":"Die produzierten Eins sind bereits seiende Eins, weil ihre Produktion als Gesetztwerden unmittelbar verschwindet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A10","CH_GB18_CVER:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D4","text":"Die Gleichheit von Repellieren und Repelliertwerden hebt eine einseitige Ursprungsrelation zwischen den Eins auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D5","text":"Die vielen Eins sind zugleich durch Repulsion gesetzt und als gegeneinander vorausgesetzt, weil ihr Gesetztsein aufgehoben ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A12","CH_GB18_CVER:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D6","text":"Die Vielheit bleibt äußerlich, weil eine innere Beziehung der Eins aufeinander sie zu begrenzten Seienden-für-Andere machen würde.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D7","text":"Die Beziehungslosigkeit der Eins bestimmt ihre äußerliche Grenze als Leeres und reines Nichtsein.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D8","text":"Die Repulsion expliziert die immanente Bestimmung des Eins als Beziehung auf viele Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A7","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD1","text":"Die Vielheit ist gleichzeitig eigene Setzung des Eins und äußerliche Bestimmung, weil die Selbstbeziehung des Eins die Andersheit setzt und zugleich aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A13","CH_GB18_CVER:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD2","text":"Die immanente Repulsion des Eins erzeugt die Grundlage für die äußerliche Repulsion, ohne dass die äußerliche Repulsion den ursprünglichen Erzeugungsakt ersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A11","CH_GB18_CVER:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD3","text":"Die Vielheit ist Unendlichkeit, insofern die einfache Selbstbeziehung des Eins außer sich als Vielheit erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD4","text":"Die Vielheit bildet einen unbefangenen Widerspruch, weil sie aus dem Eins hervorgeht, ohne eine innere Beziehung der vielen Eins zu werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A13","CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Erzeugung der Vielheit durch einen ontologischen Übergang des Eins in Nichtsein aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine unabhängig vorgegebene Vielheit aus, die der immanenten Selbstbeziehung des Eins vorausginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine positive relationale Einheit der vielen Eins aus, in der jedes Eins durch die anderen bestimmt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine asymmetrische Ursprungsordnung aus, in der ein Eins ausschließlich aktiv und ein anderes ausschließlich passiv repelliert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX5","text":"Es schließt ein Sein-für-Anderes als konstitutive Grundlage der Vielheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Grenze aus, die als positive Bestimmung zwischen den Eins fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX1","text":"Die affirmative Vermittlung zwischen Eins und Vielheit bleibt als Möglichkeit versperrt; die Vielheit kann nur als äußerliche Setzung des Eins bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX2","text":"Eine bestimmte Beziehung der vielen Eins aufeinander muss fehlen, damit sie als selbständige Eins erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX3","text":"Eine Auflösung des Widerspruchs zwischen eigener Erzeugung und äußerlicher Vielheit wird nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX4","text":"Das System organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines positiven gemeinsamen Daseins der vielen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS1","text":"Eins als negative Selbstbeziehung und Leeres als Negation des Nichtseins → Eins und Leeres als affirmative Daseinsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS2","text":"Fixierung des Eins als unmittelbares Dasein → negative Selbstbeziehung als Beziehung auf ein seiendes Anderes → Anderes als Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS3","text":"Negativität im Eins selbst → keine Vermittlung durch Werden → immanente Selbstrepulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS4","text":"Selbstrepulsion → Setzung vieler Eins außer dem Eins → produziertes Eins als bereits seiendes Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS5","text":"Aufhebung des Gesetztseins → viele Eins als vorausgesetzte, nur auf sich bezogene Seiende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS6","text":"Ausschluss affirmativer Wechselbeziehung → Vielheit als äußere Bestimmung → Leeres als Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS7","text":"Äußerlich gewordene Selbstbeziehung → Unendlichkeit außer sich → Vielheit als selbsthervorbringender Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AF1","text":"Eins und Leeres als unmittelbare Negationsbestimmungen → negative Selbstbeziehung des Eins → seiendes Anderes als weiteres Eins → Repulsion statt Werden → Setzung vieler selbstbezogener Eins → aufgehobenes Gesetztsein und äußerliche Vielheit → Leeres als Grenze → außer sich gekommene Unendlichkeit als Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME1","text":"Die Entstehung der Vielheit wird von einem Übergangsgeschehen auf eine immanente Operation der Selbstrepulsion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME2","text":"Das Andere wird vom unbestimmten Leeren zum weiteren Eins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME3","text":"Die Vielheit wird nicht mehr als Anderssein, sondern als äußerliche Bestimmung des Eins sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen erzeugendem und erzeugtem Eins wird durch die Gleichheit von Repellieren und Repelliertwerden aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME5","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer positiven gegenseitigen Begrenzung zur reinen Negativität des Leeren umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME6","text":"Die Unendlichkeit wird als außer sich gekommene Selbstbeziehung und nicht als bloße quantitative Vielheit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das unmittelbare Fürsichsein zerfällt in Eins und Leeres und bestimmt sich anschließend als Vielheit von Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die negative Selbstbeziehung erzeugt Vielheit, während der Ausschluss affirmativer Wechselbeziehung ihre Äußerlichkeit sichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung der Vielheit wird von der Vorstellung bereits vorhandener, einander abhaltender Eins auf die immanente Erzeugung durch das Eins umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Genese ist kein Werden im Sinne eines Übergangs; sie ist eine unmittelbare Selbstentäußerung des Eins, deren Resultat zugleich gesetzt und vorausgesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der negativen Selbstbeziehung des Eins zur Setzung vieler Eins zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT2","text":"Die Bestimmung des Anderen als Eins und die Ablösung des Werdens durch Repulsion sind für die Rekonstruktion notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent als dialektische Bestimmungskette, sofern Setzung und Aufhebung des Gesetztseins zusammengehören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Vermittlung von immanenter Selbstrepulsion, äußerlicher Vielheit und dem Leeren als Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT5","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die vermittelnde Bestimmung, durch die die erste Repulsion genau in die äußerliche Repulsion übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung bleibt bestehen: Die vielen Eins sind vom Eins erzeugt, gelten aber zugleich als bereits seiend und gegeneinander vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT7","text":"Eine Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn sie die Vielheit zugleich als eigene Setzung des Eins, als äußerliche Bestimmung und als unaufgelösten Widerspruch fasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114707921415Z_e3c63008","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Many Ones. Repulsion.","source_sha256":"a9b32c9e450601b55a2db2611020da345f584558fbe847515e7a51a804b7f54d","sha256":"b5c3773d718fdfed10077d73660638bbeeb5321ba7fb3fa692b829fc92287610","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:47:07.925169+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS1","text":"Immediate being-for-self determines itself through the One and the void as negations in affirmative determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS2","text":"The negative self-relation of the One, as soon as the One is fixed as immediate being, becomes a relation to a being Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS3","text":"This Other is not the void, but again a One; thereby multiplicity arises without a transition of the One into another being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS4","text":"The immanent negative self-relation of the One determines itself as repulsion and posits many Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS5","text":"The posited Ones are determined as self-subsistent Ones related only to themselves and standing externally against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS6","text":"Multiplicity thereby appears as a limit lying outside the One and as infinity having gone outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AS7","text":"The multiplicity of the Ones proves to be an infinity posited by the One itself, at once external and contradictorily self-producing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A1","text":"Being-for-self has, in its immediate determinate being, the determinations of the One and the void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A2","text":"The One and the void are each negation and posited determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A3","text":"The One is negation in the determination of being, the void negation in the determination of non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A4","text":"The One is essentially relation to itself as relating negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A5","text":"As fixed immediate determinate being, the One relates through its negative self-relation at the same time to a being Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A6","text":"The being Other of the negative self-relation of the One is again a One and not the indeterminate void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A7","text":"The One contains the negative as relation within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A8","text":"The negative self-relation of the One is repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A9","text":"The repulsion of the One posits through the One itself many Ones outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A10","text":"The posited Ones relate not to an Other, but infinitely to themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A11","text":"Repelling and being repelled belong to the Ones in the same manner and establish no difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A12","text":"Becoming-many vanishes as becoming and determines itself as being-posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A13","text":"The positedness of the many Ones is sublated, so that they are presupposed against one another as beings related only to themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A14","text":"Multiplicity is external to the One and is no affirmative relation of the Ones to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A15","text":"An affirmative relation of the Ones to one another would limit them and give them a being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:A16","text":"The external limit of the Ones is the void as pure non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX1","text":"The emergence of multiplicity is not a becoming as transition from being into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX2","text":"The first repulsion is not the mere mutual holding apart of already existing Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX3","text":"The Other of the self-relation of the One is not the indeterminate negation of the void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX4","text":"Multiplicity is not other-being of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX5","text":"The Ones have no affirmative relation to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX6","text":"There is no qualitative difference between repelling and repelled One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX7","text":"The limit of the Ones is no positive determination of their mutual relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:NX8","text":"The being-for-self of the One is not relation to an external Other, but relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D1","text":"The negative self-relation of the fixed One produces a relation to a being Other whose determination is again One.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A5","CH_GB18_CVER:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D2","text":"Multiplicity arises as the One's own being-posited and not as a transition of the One into another being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A7","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D3","text":"The produced Ones are already being Ones, because their production immediately vanishes as being-posited.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A10","CH_GB18_CVER:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D4","text":"The equality of repelling and being repelled sublates a one-sided relation of origin between the Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D5","text":"The many Ones are at once posited through repulsion and presupposed against one another, because their positedness is sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A12","CH_GB18_CVER:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D6","text":"Multiplicity remains external, because an inner relation of the Ones to one another would make them limited beings-for-other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D7","text":"The relationlessness of the Ones determines their external limit as void and pure non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:D8","text":"Repulsion explicates the immanent determination of the One as relation to many Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A7","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD1","text":"Multiplicity is simultaneously the One's own positing and an external determination, because the self-relation of the One posits otherness and at the same time sublates it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A13","CH_GB18_CVER:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD2","text":"The immanent repulsion of the One produces the ground for external repulsion, without external repulsion replacing the original act of production.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A11","CH_GB18_CVER:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD3","text":"Multiplicity is infinity insofar as the simple self-relation of the One appears outside itself as multiplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A4","CH_GB18_CVER:A8","CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SD4","text":"Multiplicity forms an unprejudiced contradiction, because it proceeds from the One without becoming an inner relation of the many Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVER:A9","CH_GB18_CVER:A13","CH_GB18_CVER:A14","CH_GB18_CVER:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a production of multiplicity through an ontological transition of the One into non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX2","text":"It excludes an independently given multiplicity that would precede the immanent self-relation of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX3","text":"It excludes a positive relational unity of the many Ones in which each One would be determined by the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX4","text":"It excludes an asymmetrical order of origin in which one One would repel exclusively actively and another exclusively passively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX5","text":"It excludes being-for-other as a constitutive ground of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:DNX6","text":"It excludes a limit that functions as a positive determination between the Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX1","text":"Affirmative mediation between One and multiplicity remains barred as a possibility; multiplicity can exist only as an external positing of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX2","text":"A determinate relation of the many Ones to one another must be absent if they are to remain self-subsistent Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX3","text":"A resolution of the contradiction between own production and external multiplicity is not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:SNX4","text":"The system organizes itself around the absence of a positive common determinate being of the many Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS1","text":"One as negative self-relation and void as negation of non-being → One and void as affirmative determinations of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS2","text":"Fixation of the One as immediate determinate being → negative self-relation as relation to a being Other → Other as One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS3","text":"Negativity in the One itself → no mediation through becoming → immanent self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS4","text":"Self-repulsion → positing of many Ones outside the One → produced One as already being One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS5","text":"Sublation of positedness → many Ones as presupposed beings related only to themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS6","text":"Exclusion of affirmative reciprocal relation → multiplicity as external determination → void as limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:FGS7","text":"Self-relation become external → infinity outside itself → multiplicity as self-producing contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:AF1","text":"One and void as immediate determinations of negation → negative self-relation of the One → being Other as a further One → repulsion instead of becoming → positing of many self-related Ones → sublated positedness and external multiplicity → void as limit → infinity having gone outside itself as contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME1","text":"The emergence of multiplicity is remapped from an event of transition to an immanent operation of self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME2","text":"The Other is reclassified from the indeterminate void to a further One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME3","text":"Multiplicity becomes visible no longer as other-being, but as an external determination of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME4","text":"The distinction between producing and produced One is sublated through the equality of repelling and being repelled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME5","text":"The limit is remapped from a positive mutual limitation to the pure negativity of the void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ME6","text":"Infinity is classified as self-relation having gone outside itself and not as mere quantitative multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT1","text":"Surface — Immediate being-for-self disintegrates into One and void and subsequently determines itself as a multiplicity of Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT2","text":"Structural — Negative self-relation produces multiplicity, while the exclusion of affirmative reciprocal relation secures its externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation of multiplicity is shifted from the notion of already existing Ones holding one another apart to immanent production through the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The genesis is not becoming in the sense of a transition; it is an immediate self-externalization of the One, whose result is at once posited and presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the negative self-relation of the One to the positing of many Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT2","text":"The determination of the Other as One and the replacement of becoming by repulsion are necessary for reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent as a dialectical chain of determinations, provided that positing and the sublation of positedness belong together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the mediation of immanent self-repulsion, external multiplicity, and the void as limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT5","text":"What remains underdetermined is the mediating determination through which the first repulsion passes precisely into external repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT6","text":"The central tension remains: the many Ones are produced by the One, but at the same time count as already being and presupposed against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVER:MRT7","text":"A reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if it grasps multiplicity at once as the One's own positing, as an external determination, and as an unresolved contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVER:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVER@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CVER:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 47","title":"c. Many Ones. Repulsion.","context":"Chapter 47","original_title":"c. Viele Eins. Repulsion."},"original_title":"c. Viele Eins. Repulsion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":48,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_8"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_8@R001","sha256":"b850bf9207b0905dc3af79bb741d9d45febf9e4e8c5af46d9741121f54fde26b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist die Bestimmung des Verhältnisses von Fürsichsein, Eins und Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS2","text":"Der Leibnizianismus setzt die Vielheit als unmittelbare Gegebenheit, ohne sie aus der Monade zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS3","text":"Der Atomismus überschreitet zwar die bloß gleichgültige Vielheit, verfehlt jedoch den Begriff der Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS4","text":"Die entscheidende Unterscheidung lautet, ob das Eins nur für sich besteht oder in sich zugleich Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS5","text":"Die Argumentation führt von der abgeschlossenen Einheit über die Repulsion zur Bestimmung der Vielheit und ihrer Beziehungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS6","text":"Wo die Vielheit nicht als immanente Repulsion begriffen wird, bleibt ihre Beziehung entweder äußerlich oder wird in eine übergeordnete Monade beziehungsweise in den betrachtenden Philosophen verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A1","text":"Die vorstellende Monade ist als Fürsichseiendes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","text":"Die für sich seiende Monade ist eine in sich abgeschlossene ganze Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","text":"Die innere Mannigfaltigkeit der Monade verändert ihre Bestimmung als Fürsichseiendes nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","text":"Die Vielheit kann als Repulsion aus der Einheit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","text":"Leibniz nimmt die Vielheit unmittelbar als gegeben und nicht als Repulsion der Monade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A6","text":"Der Leibnizianismus bestimmt die Vielheit daher nur unter dem Gesichtspunkt abstrakter Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","text":"Das Eins der Idealität enthält in sich sowohl Fürsichsein als auch Für-es-sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","text":"Die Atomistik bestimmt das Eins nicht als ideelles, sondern als einfaches und trockenes Fürsichseiendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","text":"Die Atomistik geht über die bloß gleichgültige Vielheit hinaus, indem sie Beziehungen zwischen den Atomen zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A10","text":"Die atomistische Bestimmung dieser Beziehungen bleibt inkonsequent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A11","text":"In der gleichgültigen Unabhängigkeit der Monaden bleibt die Vielheit eine starre Grundbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A12","text":"Eine nicht aus der Monade entwickelte Beziehung fällt in die Monade der Monaden oder in den betrachtenden Philosophen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX1","text":"Die Vielheit ist nicht als selbstverständliche unmittelbare Gegebenheit hinreichend begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX2","text":"Die innere Mannigfaltigkeit der Monade ist nicht bereits eine Veränderung ihres Fürsichseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX3","text":"Leibnizianischer Idealismus begreift die Vielheit nicht als Repulsion der Monade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX4","text":"Leibnizianischer Idealismus erreicht nicht die immanente Beziehung der Einsheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX5","text":"Die Atomistik besitzt keinen Begriff der Idealität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX6","text":"Das atomistische Eins ist nicht das ideelle Eins, das Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX7","text":"Die monadische Vielheit ist keine bloß äußerlich vermittelte Beziehung aus eigener immanenter Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX8","text":"Die Beziehung der Monaden darf nicht lediglich auf eine Monade der Monaden oder einen äußeren Beobachter übertragen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D1","text":"Die monadische Vielheit bleibt äußerlich, weil die Monade trotz innerer Mannigfaltigkeit als abgeschlossene Einheit unverändert bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D2","text":"Der Leibnizianismus kann die Vielheit nicht aus der Tätigkeit oder Selbstbestimmung der Einheit erklären.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D3","text":"Der atomistische Begriff des Eins verfehlt die Vermittlung von Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D4","text":"Der Atomismus besitzt gegenüber dem Leibnizianismus eine weitergehende Bestimmung, weil er Beziehungen zwischen den Einsheiten zulässt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D5","text":"Die atomistischen Beziehungen können die ursprüngliche Einfachheit der Atome nicht konsequent mit ihrer Beziehungshaftigkeit vermitteln.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","CH_GB18_AN_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D6","text":"Die gleichgültige Unabhängigkeit der Monaden macht die Vielheit zu einer starren, nicht weiter abgeleiteten Grundlage.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D7","text":"Wo die Beziehung nicht im Begriff der Eins erzeugt wird, erscheint sie als äußerliche Setzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD1","text":"Die Alternative zwischen Leibnizianismus und Atomismus ist eine Differenz der Vermittlungsformen: unmittelbare äußere Vielheit gegen inkonsequent vermittelte Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","CH_GB18_AN_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD2","text":"Eine Vielheit ist nur dann begrifflich bestimmt, wenn sie aus der inneren Selbstbeziehung der Einheit als Repulsion hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD3","text":"Die Abgeschlossenheit der Einzelnen erzeugt entweder eine äußerliche Vielheit oder erzwingt eine nachträgliche Instanz, welche ihre Beziehung repräsentiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11","CH_GB18_AN_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD4","text":"Der Begriff der Idealität fungiert als Kriterium, durch das sowohl die bloße monadische Äußerlichkeit als auch der trockene atomistische Individualismus begrenzt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A6","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht voraussetzen, dass Vielheit als ursprüngliche Tatsache bereits begrifflich erklärt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX2","text":"Es kann nicht gelten, dass innere Repräsentation oder Mannigfaltigkeit die abgeschlossene Einheit ohne Weiteres relational macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX3","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen werden, dass ein einfaches Fürsichsein bereits Idealität enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX4","text":"Eine bloß nachträglich hinzugefügte Beziehung kann die Einheit nicht begrifflich aus ihrer Isolation herausführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX5","text":"Die Erklärung der Beziehung darf nicht auf eine externe Beobachtungsinstanz angewiesen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX6","text":"Eine Theorie der Vielheit, die ihre eigene Erzeugung aus der Einheit nicht ausweist, bleibt auf der Ebene abstrakter Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie isolierter Einheiten, in der Beziehung weder aus der Einheit hervorgeht noch deren Bestimmung verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, die nur durch eine übergeordnete Einheit oder durch das Wissen eines Betrachters nachträglich hergestellt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Einheit, die ihre Vielheit und Beziehung aus sich selbst erzeugt, ohne in bloße Abgeschlossenheit zurückzufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit ist eine immanente Bestimmung des Für-es-seins innerhalb des Fürsichseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS1","text":"Fürsichseiendes Eins → abgeschlossene Monade → innere Mannigfaltigkeit ohne Veränderung der Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS2","text":"Abgeschlossene Einheiten → unmittelbar gesetzte Vielheit → abstrakte Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS3","text":"Fehlende Repulsion aus der Einheit → fehlende immanente Erzeugung der Vielheit → äußerliche Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS4","text":"Einfaches atomistisches Fürsichsein → Ausschluss der Idealität → Unfähigkeit, Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein zu vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS5","text":"Atomistische Überschreitung der Gleichgültigkeit → Beziehung der Atome → inkonsequente Verbindung von Einfachheit und Relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS6","text":"Starre monadische Vielheit → Verlagerung der Beziehung → Monade der Monaden oder betrachtender Philosoph.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS7","text":"Begriff der Idealität → Einheit von Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein → Repulsion als immanente Erzeugung der Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF1","text":"Abgeschlossene Monade → unmittelbare Vielheit → abstrakte Äußerlichkeit → atomistische Gegenposition → inkonsequente Beziehung → Verlagerung der Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF2","text":"Leibnizianische Gleichgültigkeit → atomistische Überschreitung → Nachweis des gemeinsamen Mangels im fehlenden Begriff der Idealität → Erfordernis immanenter Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF3","text":"Fürsichsein → Prüfung des Für-es-seins → Unterscheidung zwischen äußerlicher Vielheit und ideeller Vermittlung → begriffliche Schließung durch Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME1","text":"Vielheit wird von einer gegebenen Anzahl isolierter Einheiten in eine aus der Einheit hervorgehende Bewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Leibnizianismus und Atomismus wird als Differenz unzureichender Vermittlungsweisen neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME3","text":"Das Eins wird nicht mehr als bloße Einfachheit, sondern als Einheit von Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME4","text":"Beziehung wird von einer äußeren Verbindung zu einer inneren Bestimmung der Einheit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME5","text":"Der betrachtende Philosoph wird als Symptom einer nicht immanenten Erklärung der Vielheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt Monaden, Atome, Vielheit, Repulsion und ihre gegenseitigen Beziehungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Argumentation analysiert, ob Vielheit und Beziehung aus der Einheit selbst hervorgehen oder äußerlich hinzutreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die konkurrierenden Modelle werden nicht nach ihren Gegenständen, sondern nach dem Grad ihrer begrifflichen Vermittlung geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird als Bewegung vom Fürsichsein zur relationalen Bestimmung gefasst; unmittelbare Vielheit gilt als unzureichende ontologische Grundlegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Kritik am Leibnizianismus und am Atomismus sowie die Vorrangigkeit immanenter Repulsion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive begriffliche Ausarbeitung dessen, wie die Repulsion selbst als konkrete Bewegung zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Idealität als Vermittlung von Fürsichsein und Für-es-sein vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Trennung von bloßer Vielheit, äußerer Beziehung und immanenter relationaler Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT5","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle liegt in der nur angedeuteten Herleitung der Repulsion aus dem ideellen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von abgeschlossener Einheit über äußerliche Vielheit und inkonsequente Beziehung zur Forderung begrifflicher Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111405298226Z_b4ce1b4e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"b850bf9207b0905dc3af79bb741d9d45febf9e4e8c5af46d9741121f54fde26b","sha256":"2da6ce9909577d30171ee79c164f507c8b1c6ee13793d8b133713de9128d0a3e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:14:05.300285+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS1","text":"The problem is the determination of the relation of being-for-self, the One, and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS2","text":"Leibnizianism posits multiplicity as an immediate given, without generating it from the monad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS3","text":"Although atomism surpasses merely indifferent multiplicity, it nevertheless fails to attain the concept of ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS4","text":"The decisive distinction is whether the One exists merely for itself or contains within itself both being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS5","text":"The argument proceeds from closed unity, through repulsion, to the determination of multiplicity and its relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AS6","text":"Where multiplicity is not comprehended as immanent repulsion, its relation remains either external or is displaced into a superordinate monad or into the contemplating philosopher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A1","text":"The representing monad is determined as being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","text":"The monad existing for itself is an entire world closed within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","text":"The inner multiplicity of the monad does not alter its determination as being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","text":"Multiplicity can emerge as repulsion from unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","text":"Leibniz takes multiplicity immediately as given and not as the repulsion of the monad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A6","text":"Leibnizianism therefore determines multiplicity only from the standpoint of abstract externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","text":"The One of ideality contains within itself both being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","text":"Atomism determines the One not as ideal, but as simple and dry being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","text":"Atomism goes beyond merely indifferent multiplicity by admitting relations between atoms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A10","text":"The atomistic determination of these relations remains inconsistent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A11","text":"In the indifferent independence of monads, multiplicity remains a rigid basic determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:A12","text":"A relation not developed from the monad falls into the monad of monads or into the contemplating philosopher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX1","text":"Multiplicity is not sufficiently comprehended as a self-evident immediate given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX2","text":"The inner multiplicity of the monad is not already an alteration of its being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX3","text":"Leibnizian idealism does not comprehend multiplicity as the repulsion of the monad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX4","text":"Leibnizian idealism does not attain the immanent relation of the Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX5","text":"Atomism possesses no concept of ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX6","text":"The atomistic One is not the ideal One that mediates being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX7","text":"Monadic multiplicity is not a merely externally mediated relation arising from its own immanent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:NX8","text":"The relation of monads must not be transferred merely to a monad of monads or to an external observer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D1","text":"Monadic multiplicity remains external because, despite its inner multiplicity, the monad remains unchanged as a closed unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D2","text":"Leibnizianism cannot explain multiplicity from the activity or self-determination of unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D3","text":"The atomistic concept of the One fails to attain the mediation of being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D4","text":"Compared with Leibnizianism, atomism has a more extensive determination because it admits relations between the Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D5","text":"Atomistic relations cannot consistently mediate the original simplicity of atoms with their relationality.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","CH_GB18_AN_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D6","text":"The indifferent independence of monads makes multiplicity into a rigid foundation not further derived.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A3","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:D7","text":"Where relation is not generated in the concept of the One, it appears as an external positing.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD1","text":"The alternative between Leibnizianism and atomism is a difference of forms of mediation: immediate external multiplicity versus inconsistently mediated relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8","CH_GB18_AN_8:A9","CH_GB18_AN_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD2","text":"A multiplicity is conceptually determined only when it emerges as repulsion from the inner self-relation of unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A4","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD3","text":"The closedness of individuals produces either an external multiplicity or compels a subsequent instance that represents their relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A2","CH_GB18_AN_8:A5","CH_GB18_AN_8:A11","CH_GB18_AN_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SD4","text":"The concept of ideality functions as a criterion by which both merely monadic externality and dry atomistic individualism are delimited.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_8:A6","CH_GB18_AN_8:A7","CH_GB18_AN_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX1","text":"The system cannot presuppose that multiplicity, as an original fact, is already conceptually explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX2","text":"It cannot hold that inner representation or multiplicity straightforwardly makes closed unity relational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX3","text":"It must be excluded that simple being-for-self already contains ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX4","text":"A relation merely added subsequently cannot conceptually lead unity out of its isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX5","text":"The explanation of relation must not depend on an external instance of observation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:DNX6","text":"A theory of multiplicity that does not demonstrate its own generation from unity remains at the level of abstract externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of isolated unities in which relation neither emerges from unity nor alters its determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a mediation that is subsequently established only through a superordinate unity or through the knowledge of an observer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility is a unity that generates its multiplicity and relation from itself without falling back into mere closedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:SNX4","text":"The deepest absence is an immanent determination of being-for-it within being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS1","text":"One that is being-for-self → closed monad → inner multiplicity without alteration of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS2","text":"Closed unities → immediately posited multiplicity → abstract externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS3","text":"Absence of repulsion from unity → absence of immanent generation of multiplicity → external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS4","text":"Simple atomistic being-for-self → exclusion of ideality → incapacity to mediate being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS5","text":"Atomistic surpassing of indifference → relation of atoms → inconsistent connection of simplicity and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS6","text":"Rigid monadic multiplicity → displacement of relation → monad of monads or contemplating philosopher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:FGS7","text":"Concept of ideality → unity of being-for-self and being-for-it → repulsion as immanent generation of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF1","text":"Closed monad → immediate multiplicity → abstract externality → atomistic counterposition → inconsistent relation → displacement of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF2","text":"Leibnizian indifference → atomistic surpassing → demonstration of the shared deficiency in the missing concept of ideality → requirement of immanent repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:AF3","text":"Being-for-self → examination of being-for-it → distinction between external multiplicity and ideal mediation → conceptual closure through repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME1","text":"Multiplicity is remapped from a given number of isolated unities into a movement emerging from unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME2","text":"The opposition between Leibnizianism and atomism is reclassified as a difference of inadequate modes of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME3","text":"The One is mapped no longer as mere simplicity, but as the unity of being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME4","text":"Relation is shifted from an external connection to an inner determination of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ME5","text":"The contemplating philosopher becomes visible as a symptom of a non-immanent explanation of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines monads, atoms, multiplicity, repulsion, and their reciprocal relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — The argument analyzes whether multiplicity and relation emerge from unity itself or are externally added.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The competing models are ordered not according to their objects, but according to the degree of their conceptual mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is conceived as a movement from being-for-self to relational determination; immediate multiplicity counts as an insufficient ontological foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the critique of Leibnizianism and atomism, as well as the priority of immanent repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive conceptual elaboration of how repulsion itself is to be understood as concrete movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as ideality is presupposed as the mediation of being-for-self and being-for-it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the separation of mere multiplicity, external relation, and immanent relational determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT5","text":"Its weakest point lies in the merely indicated derivation of repulsion from the ideal One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_8:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from closed unity through external multiplicity and inconsistent relation to the demand for conceptual mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_8:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 48","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 48","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0","layer":"CH","title":"a. Exclusion of the One.","order":49,"parents":["RAW_GB18_ADE0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_ADE0@R001","sha256":"bd4d93f8c6e98075f21c3ed842e1f162050963ae21bad66e671cb20b71b111f8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist, wie viele Eins zugleich als selbständige Seyende und in einer Beziehung der Nicht-Beziehung bestimmt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS2","text":"Das Argument verfährt immanent-dialektisch, indem es die Repulsion aus der Bestimmung des Eins und der Vielheit entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS3","text":"Die Repulsion trifft auf bereits seyende, nichtgesetzte Eins und wird dadurch zum Ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS4","text":"Das gegenseitige Ausschließen erhält die Verschiedenheit nur, indem es jedes Eins auf ein Anderes bezieht und diese Verschiedenheit zugleich aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS5","text":"Die anfängliche Vergleichung wird durch die Untersuchung dessen ersetzt, was in der Beziehung selbst gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS6","text":"Weil Sein und gegenseitiges Setzen bei allen Eins dieselbe Bestimmung haben, erweist sich die Vielheit als affirmative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS7","text":"Die Repulsion geht als Mit-sich-Zusammengehen in Attraktion über, worin die vielen Eins sich in Ein-Eines setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A1","text":"Die vielen Eins sind seyende Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A2","text":"Die Beziehung der Eins aufeinander ist zunächst äußerliche Nicht-Beziehung und abstraktes Leeres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A3","text":"Das Eins ist negative Beziehung auf sich selbst, insofern es sich auf ein seyendes Anderes bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A4","text":"Die Repulsion findet bereits vor, was von ihr repelliert wird, und schließt nur unerzeugte, nichtgesetzte Eins aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A5","text":"Die Vielheit ist zunächst nicht gesetztes Anderssein, während ihre Grenze als Leeres bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","text":"Die gegenseitige Repulsion ist das gesetzte Dasein der vielen Eins und ihre eigene erhaltende Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","text":"Jedes Eins negiert die anderen als bloß für-Eines und negiert zugleich diese Bestimmung des Für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","text":"Das Fürsichseyn der vielen Eins besteht in ihrer Selbsterhaltung durch die Vermittlung gegenseitiger Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A9","text":"Das gegenseitige Ausschließen setzt die anderen zugleich als bloßes Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","text":"Das Ansichseyn der Eins besteht darin, Eins zu sein, und diese Bestimmung kommt allen Eins gleichermaßen zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A11","text":"Das Verhalten der Eins zueinander besteht im gegenseitigen Negieren, und auch diese Bestimmung ist allen gemeinsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","text":"Die Eins sind nur durch die Negation der Anderen und durch die Negation dieser Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A13","text":"Die Rückkehr in sich und Selbsterhaltung erfordern eine wirksame Negation, an der das Seyn Widerstand leistet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","text":"Die Repulsion ist selbst Beziehen, weil das ausschließende Eins sich auf die Eins und damit auf sich selbst bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A15","text":"Attraktion ist das Sich-in-Ein-Eines-Setzen der vielen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX1","text":"Die Beziehung der Eins ist keine unmittelbar innere Einheit, sondern zunächst äußerliche Nicht-Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX2","text":"Die Vielheit ist zunächst kein gesetztes Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX3","text":"Die gegenseitige Repulsion ist nicht das Fürsichseyn der vielen Eins in einem Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX4","text":"Das einzelne Eins ist nicht nur für sich beziehungsweise nur für-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX5","text":"Selbsterhaltung durch gegenseitiges Ausschließen ist keine endgültige Erhaltung, sondern Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX6","text":"Das Ansichseyn liefert keinen festen Punkt der Verschiedenheit, weil es allen Eins gemeinsam ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX7","text":"Das gegenseitige Negieren liefert keine differenzierende Bestimmung, weil es alle Eins identisch setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX8","text":"Die Repulsion ist keine bloß äußerliche Beziehung zwischen bereits getrennten Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX9","text":"Die Verschiedenheit und Äußerlichkeit, die die Eins gegeneinander behaupten, bleiben nicht erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D1","text":"Die Repulsion ist relativ und allseitig beschränkt, weil sie auf bereits seyende Eins trifft.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A1","CH_GB18_ADE0:A2","CH_GB18_ADE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D2","text":"Die gegenseitige Repulsion erzeugt die Vielheit nicht aus einem Dritten, sondern setzt ihr Dasein als eigene gemeinsame Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A5","CH_GB18_ADE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D3","text":"Das Seyn-für-Eines wird durch die Repulsion zum Seyn-für-Anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","CH_GB18_ADE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D4","text":"Die Selbsterhaltung der Eins beruht auf einer Vermittlung, in der die anderen zugleich aufgehoben und als für-Andere gesetzt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D5","text":"Die beiden vermeintlichen Grundlagen der Verschiedenheit, Ansichseyn und gegenseitiges Setzen, erweisen sich als dieselbe Bestimmung bei allen Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D6","text":"Die vielen Eins bilden daher nur Eine affirmative Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D7","text":"Ohne wirksame Negation und Widerstand gibt es keine Rückkehr in sich, keine Selbsterhaltung und kein Seyn der Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D8","text":"Die Repulsion geht in Identität über, weil ihr Ausschließen ein Beziehen auf sich selbst ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D9","text":"Aus der Identität, in welche die Repulsion übergeht, entsteht die Attraktion als Setzen der vielen Eins in Ein-Eines.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD1","text":"Die Vielheit kann ihren Bestand nur durch eine Operation erhalten, die ihre selbständige Verschiedenheit zugleich abbaut.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD2","text":"Die negative Beziehung erzeugt keine bleibende Äußerlichkeit, sondern verinnerlicht die Beziehung als Rückkehr zu sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD3","text":"Die Einheit ist nicht der aufgehobene Gegensatz zur Vielheit, sondern das Resultat ihrer eigenen relationalen Selbsterhaltung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD4","text":"Die Attraktion wird nicht äußerlich eingeführt, sondern als immanente Konsequenz der Repulsion erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A4","CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Vielheit aus, deren Verschiedenheit durch ein unabhängiges Ansichseyn jedes einzelnen Eins begründet wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt eine Beziehung aus, die äußerlich bleiben könnte, nachdem sie das Dasein der Bezogenen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine Selbsterhaltung aus, die ohne Negation, Widerstand und vermittelte Rückkehr in sich bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine bleibende Trennung von Sein, Beziehung und Idealität als selbständige Grundbestimmungen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine Differenz aus, deren beide Seiten nicht durch dieselbe Bestimmung konstituiert wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX1","text":"Eine absolut selbständige Vielheit ist als abschließende Bestimmung unmöglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX2","text":"Eine reine Nicht-Beziehung und eine bloß leere Grenze können nicht als letzte Bestimmung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX3","text":"Ein Fürsichseyn ohne Seyn-für-Anderes ist innerhalb der entwickelten Struktur nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX4","text":"Eine reine Repulsion ohne Übergang in Selbstbeziehung und Attraktion ist unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS1","text":"Viele unmittelbar seyende Eins + äußerliche Nicht-Beziehung → Repulsion trifft auf bereits vorhandene Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS2","text":"Negative Beziehung auf sich → Ausschließen nichtgesetzter Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS3","text":"Ausschließen + leere Grenze → gegenseitige Repulsion als gemeinsames Dasein der Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS4","text":"Gegenseitige Repulsion → Seyn-für-Anderes und gleichzeitige Zurückweisung dieses Für-Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS5","text":"Vermittelte Zurückweisung → Selbsterhaltung durch gegenseitige Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS6","text":"Gleichheit des Ansichseyns und Gleichheit des Negierens → Aufhebung der Verschiedenheit in affirmative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS7","text":"Repulsion als Selbstbeziehung → Identität → Sich-in-Ein-Eines-Setzen → Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Vielheit seyender Eins → äußerliche Nicht-Beziehung → Ausschließen bereits vorhandener Anderer → gegenseitige Repulsion als gemeinsames Dasein → Für-Eines wird Für-Anderes → Selbsterhaltung wird Auflösung → Ansichseyn und Negation setzen alle identisch → Repulsion wird Mit-sich-Zusammengehen → Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME1","text":"Die Vielheit wird von einer Ansammlung äußerlich getrennter Einheiten zu einer durch gegenseitige Beziehung konstituierten Struktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Selbsterhaltung und Auflösung wird als ein einziger Vermittlungsprozess lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME3","text":"Die Differenz der Eins wird nicht mehr als substantieller Unterschied, sondern als identische relationale Bestimmung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion erscheinen nicht als getrennte Kräfte, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Bestimmungen derselben negativen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME5","text":"Vielheit und Einheit werden von ausschließenden Gegenbegriffen zu aufeinanderfolgenden Momenten einer kategorialen Bewegung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Viele Eins repellieren einander, erhalten sich dadurch und setzen sich schließlich in Ein-Eines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die gegenseitige Negation konstituiert zugleich Dasein, Für-Anderes, Selbsterhaltung und Aufhebung der Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Das Argument ersetzt die äußere Vergleichung der Eins durch die immanente Analyse dessen, was ihre Beziehung selbst setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Sein, Beziehung und Rückkehr in sich bilden eine gestufte ontologische Bewegung von unmittelbarer Vielheit über vermittelte Repulsion zur Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der unmittelbaren Vielheit über die Repulsion zur Attraktion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die hier vorausgesetzten Bestimmungen von Seyn, Dasein, Idealität und Unendlichkeit aus dem vorausgehenden System gewonnen wurden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern gegenseitige Negation zugleich als Bedingung der Erhaltung und als Grund der Auflösung fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion dort, wo die behauptete Verschiedenheit aus der Gleichheit ihrer konstitutiven Bestimmungen widerlegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die Eins als bereits seyend vorausgesetzt werden, während ihr Dasein zugleich durch Beziehung gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass die Negation äußerlich an der Oberfläche abprallen, aber für die Rückkehr in sich wirksam sein muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT7","text":"Die komprimierte Struktur bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, verliert jedoch die ausführliche Vermittlung zwischen Vergleichung, Selbsterhaltung, Auflösung und Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110840955657Z_c9856de6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Exclusion of the One.","source_sha256":"bd4d93f8c6e98075f21c3ed842e1f162050963ae21bad66e671cb20b71b111f8","sha256":"01eab41db2254ee7eda4ba874ba79dfd88a1a2b984978aa902a01b92ad40ae28","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:08:40.960156+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS1","text":"The problem is how many Ones can at once be determined as self-subsistent beings and in a relation of non-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS2","text":"The argument proceeds immanently-dialectically by developing repulsion from the determination of the One and the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS3","text":"Repulsion encounters already existing, unposited Ones and thereby becomes exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS4","text":"Mutual exclusion preserves difference only by relating each One to an Other and simultaneously sublating this difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS5","text":"The initial comparison is replaced by the examination of what is posited in the relation itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS6","text":"Because being and mutual positing have the same determination in all Ones, the many prove to be affirmative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AS7","text":"Repulsion passes over, as coming-together-with-itself, into attraction, wherein the many Ones posit themselves into one One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A1","text":"The many Ones are existing unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A2","text":"The relation of the Ones to one another is initially external non-relation and abstract void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A3","text":"The One is negative relation to itself insofar as it relates itself to an existing Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A4","text":"Repulsion already finds what is repelled by it and excludes only unproduced, unposited Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A5","text":"The many are initially unposited otherness, while their limit is determined as void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","text":"Mutual repulsion is the posited existence of the many Ones and their own self-preserving distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","text":"Each One negates the others as merely being-for-one and simultaneously negates this determination of being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","text":"The being-for-self of the many Ones consists in their self-preservation through the mediation of mutual repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A9","text":"Mutual exclusion simultaneously posits the others as mere being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","text":"The being-in-itself of the Ones consists in being One, and this determination pertains equally to all Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A11","text":"The comportment of the Ones toward one another consists in mutual negation, and this determination too is common to all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","text":"The Ones are only through the negation of the Others and through the negation of this negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A13","text":"Return into itself and self-preservation require an effective negation against which being offers resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","text":"Repulsion is itself relating, because the excluding One relates itself to the Ones and thereby to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:A15","text":"Attraction is the self-positing of the many Ones into one One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX1","text":"The relation of the Ones is not immediately inner unity, but initially external non-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX2","text":"The many are initially not posited otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX3","text":"Mutual repulsion is not the being-for-self of the many Ones in a third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX4","text":"The individual One is not merely for itself, or respectively merely being-for-one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX5","text":"Self-preservation through mutual exclusion is no final preservation, but dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX6","text":"Being-in-itself provides no fixed point of difference, because it is common to all Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX7","text":"Mutual negation provides no differentiating determination, because it posits all Ones identically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX8","text":"Repulsion is not a merely external relation between already separated Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:NX9","text":"The difference and externality that the Ones assert against one another are not preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D1","text":"Repulsion is relative and limited on all sides because it encounters already existing Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A1","CH_GB18_ADE0:A2","CH_GB18_ADE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D2","text":"Mutual repulsion does not produce the many from a third, but posits their existence as their own common relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A5","CH_GB18_ADE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D3","text":"Being-for-one becomes being-for-other through repulsion.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","CH_GB18_ADE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D4","text":"The self-preservation of the Ones rests on a mediation in which the others are simultaneously sublated and posited as for-others.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D5","text":"The two alleged foundations of difference, being-in-itself and mutual positing, prove to be the same determination in all Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D6","text":"The many Ones therefore form only one affirmative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D7","text":"Without effective negation and resistance, there is no return into itself, no self-preservation, and no being of the Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D8","text":"Repulsion passes over into identity because its exclusion is a relating to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:D9","text":"From the identity into which repulsion passes over arises attraction as the positing of the many Ones into one One.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD1","text":"The many can maintain their subsistence only through an operation that simultaneously dismantles their self-subsistent difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A10","CH_GB18_ADE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD2","text":"The negative relation produces no enduring externality, but internalizes the relation as return to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A7","CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD3","text":"Unity is not the sublated opposite of multiplicity, but the result of its own relational self-preservation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A6","CH_GB18_ADE0:A8","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SD4","text":"Attraction is not externally introduced, but produced as an immanent consequence of repulsion.","refs":["CH_GB18_ADE0:A4","CH_GB18_ADE0:A12","CH_GB18_ADE0:A14","CH_GB18_ADE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a multiplicity whose difference would be grounded in an independent being-in-itself of each individual One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a relation that could remain external after determining the existence of those related.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX3","text":"The system excludes a self-preservation that could subsist without negation, resistance, and mediated return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX4","text":"The system excludes an enduring separation of being, relation, and ideality as self-subsistent fundamental determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a difference whose two sides would not be constituted by the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX1","text":"An absolutely self-subsistent multiplicity is impossible as a concluding determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX2","text":"A pure non-relation and a merely empty limit cannot subsist as the final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX3","text":"A being-for-self without being-for-other is unavailable within the developed structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:SNX4","text":"A pure repulsion without transition into self-relation and attraction is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS1","text":"Many immediately existing Ones + external non-relation → repulsion encounters already present Others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS2","text":"Negative relation to itself → exclusion of unposited Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS3","text":"Exclusion + empty limit → mutual repulsion as the common existence of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS4","text":"Mutual repulsion → being-for-other and simultaneous rejection of this being-for-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS5","text":"Mediated rejection → self-preservation through mutual sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS6","text":"Equality of being-in-itself and equality of negating → sublation of difference into affirmative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:FGS7","text":"Repulsion as self-relation → identity → self-positing into one One → attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:AF1","text":"Immediate multiplicity of existing Ones → external non-relation → exclusion of already present Others → mutual repulsion as common existence → being-for-one becomes being-for-other → self-preservation becomes dissolution → being-in-itself and negation posit all identically → repulsion becomes coming-together-with-itself → attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME1","text":"Multiplicity is remapped from an assemblage of externally separated unities into a structure constituted through mutual relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME2","text":"The opposition between self-preservation and dissolution becomes legible as a single process of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME3","text":"The difference of the Ones is no longer classified as a substantial distinction, but as an identical relational determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME4","text":"Repulsion and attraction appear not as separate forces, but as successive determinations of the same negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ME5","text":"Multiplicity and unity are reordered from exclusive counter-concepts into successive moments of a categorial movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Many Ones repel one another, thereby preserve themselves, and finally posit themselves into one One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Mutual negation simultaneously constitutes existence, being-for-other, self-preservation, and the sublation of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The argument replaces the external comparison of the Ones with the immanent analysis of what their relation itself posits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being, relation, and return into itself form a graduated ontological movement from immediate multiplicity through mediated repulsion to attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from immediate multiplicity through repulsion to attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the determinations of being, existence, ideality, and infinity presupposed here were obtained from the preceding system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as mutual negation functions simultaneously as the condition of preservation and as the ground of dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction is strongest where the asserted difference is refuted from the equality of its constitutive determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the Ones being presupposed as already existing while their existence is simultaneously posited through relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT6","text":"A second tension consists in negation having to rebound externally from the surface while being effective for return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ADE0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ADE0:MRT7","text":"The compressed structure preserves the actual movement, but loses the detailed mediation between comparison, self-preservation, dissolution, and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_ADE0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_ADE0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 49","title":"a. Exclusion of the One.","context":"Chapter 49","original_title":"a. Ausschließen des Eins."},"original_title":"a. Ausschließen des Eins.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":50,"parents":["RAW_GB18_AN_9"],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_9@R001","sha256":"2a05a7647ec48d1036f83bce7e71ff04d3104df5c086ea9e36ebfafcaa085787","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist die Selbstsetzung des Fürsichseyns als abstrakte, formelle Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS2","text":"Diese Selbstständigkeit wird als Irrtum bestimmt, weil sie das eigene Wesen als Negatives behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS3","text":"Ihr Versuch, das eigene Seyn durch Negation zu gewinnen, erzeugt dessen Zerstörung und offenbart die Nichtigkeit ihres Tuns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS4","text":"Versöhnung entsteht durch die Anerkennung dessen, gegen das sich die Negativität richtet, als des eigenen Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS5","text":"Die Einheit von Eins und Vielen ist nicht als ruhendes Sein, sondern als Werden von Repulsion und Attraktion zu fassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS6","text":"Die Vielen sind unterschieden, aber jedes ist nur in derselben Bestimmung wie die anderen Eins; Einheit und Unterschied bestehen daher zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","text":"Abstrakte Selbstständigkeit setzt das Fürsichseyn als schlechthin selbstgenügsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","text":"Das eigene Wesen der abstrakten Selbstständigkeit ist das, was sie als negativ behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A3","text":"Negatives Verhalten gegen das eigene Wesen zerstört das Seyn, das es gewinnen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A4","text":"Die Tätigkeit der abstrakten Selbstständigkeit manifestiert die Nichtigkeit ihres eigenen Anspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A5","text":"Versöhnung besteht in der Anerkennung des negierten Anderen als eigenen Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A6","text":"Die Wahrheit von Eins und Vielen ist prozessual und nicht in der Form eines ruhenden Satzes angemessen ausgedrückt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A7","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion vermitteln das Werden von Einheit und Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A8","text":"Die Vielen sind äußerlich aufeinander bezogen und können deshalb miteinander verglichen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A9","text":"Jedes Einzelne der Vielen ist Eins und zugleich Eins der Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A10","text":"Jedes Eins bestimmt sich ausschließend gegen die anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A11","text":"Die ausschließende Verschiedenheit der Vielen lässt sie in der Bestimmung des Eins schlechthin dasselbe sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A12","text":"Unterschied und Einheit bestehen trotz ihrer Spannung gleichzeitig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX1","text":"Abstrakte Selbstständigkeit ist nicht höchste Wahrheit, sondern der höchste Irrtum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX2","text":"Freiheit ist nicht die Setzung des eigenen Wesens in einer bloßen Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX3","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist nicht durch Festhalten an seiner Negativität zu retten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX4","text":"Das eigene Wesen ist nicht als äußerlich negatives Gegenüber zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX5","text":"Die Wahrheit von Eins und Vielen ist nicht als ruhendes Sein eines isolierten Satzes zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX6","text":"Der Unterschied der Vielen hebt ihre gemeinsame Bestimmung als Eins nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX7","text":"Die Einheit der Vielen ist nicht durch die Auslöschung ihres Unterschieds gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D1","text":"Die abstrakte Freiheit schlägt in Selbstzerstörung um, weil sie ihr Wesen als bloßes Fürsichseyn isoliert.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","CH_GB18_AN_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D2","text":"Das Böse erscheint als konkrete Form einer Freiheit, die sich in der abstrakten Negation ihres Wesens festsetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","CH_GB18_AN_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D3","text":"Die Aufhebung der Selbstzerstörung verlangt keine äußerliche Ergänzung, sondern die Umkehrung des negativen Verhältnisses zum eigenen Wesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A3","CH_GB18_AN_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D4","text":"Der Satz „das Viele ist Eines“ bleibt unangemessen, wenn er die Vermittlung von Einheit und Vielheit nicht als Prozess ausdrückt.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A6","CH_GB18_AN_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D5","text":"Die Vergleichbarkeit der Vielen zeigt, dass jedes Einzelne zugleich identisch bestimmt und ausschließend unterschieden ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A8","CH_GB18_AN_9:A9","CH_GB18_AN_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D6","text":"Das Faktum der Einheit besteht nicht trotz des Unterschieds, sondern in einer Bestimmung, die den Unterschied mitenthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A11","CH_GB18_AN_9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD1","text":"Eine auf reine Identität reduzierte Selbstständigkeit erzeugt durch ihre eigene Negativität die Notwendigkeit der Anerkennung relationaler Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD2","text":"Versöhnung und dialektische Einheit folgen derselben Struktur: Eine isolierte Bestimmung wird durch die Anerkennung ihres negierten Bezugs aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD3","text":"Das Einzelne ist weder selbstgenügsame Einheit noch bloßer Teil eines äußeren Ganzen, sondern eine prozessual vermittelte Einheit von Identität und Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD4","text":"Die Form des ruhenden Satzes verdeckt die Bewegungsstruktur, durch die Einheit und Unterschied überhaupt erst bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX1","text":"Unwahr ist die Annahme, dass Selbstständigkeit durch vollständige Unabhängigkeit von jeder negierten Bestimmung gewonnen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX2","text":"Unwahr ist die Annahme, dass Negation ein positives eigenes Seyn unmittelbar hervorbringen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Versöhnung als äußerliche Vermittlung zweier bereits fertiger Seiten erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Logik, in der Einheit und Unterschied sich gegenseitig vollständig beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX5","text":"Unzureichend ist jede Erkenntnisform, die den Unterschied nur gegen die Einheit oder die Einheit nur gegen den Unterschied behauptet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX1","text":"Der Text schließt die Möglichkeit eines absolut isolierten Fürsichseyns aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX2","text":"Der Text behandelt ein ruhendes, unvermitteltes Sein als unzureichende Form der Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Freiheit, die ihr Wesen besitzen könnte, ohne sich zu einem negierten Anderen zu verhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit ist eine Einheit, die nicht durch Beziehung, Bewegung und innere Differenz vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS1","text":"Fürsichseyn → Setzung abstrakter Selbstständigkeit → Behandlung des eigenen Wesens als Negatives → negative Selbstbeziehung → Zerstörung des gesetzten Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS2","text":"Selbstzerstörung → Offenbarung der Nichtigkeit → Anerkennung des negierten Wesens → Ablassen von der Negativität → Versöhnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS3","text":"Eins/Vieles als ruhender Satz → Aufdeckung der unangemessenen Form → Prozess von Repulsion und Attraktion → vermittelte Einheit von Eins und Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS4","text":"Äußerlichkeit der Vielen → Vergleichbarkeit → gleiche Bestimmung jedes Einzelnen als Eins → ausschließende Unterscheidung → Einheit in der Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS5","text":"Einheit und Unterschied → gegenseitige Nichtaufhebung → dialektische Bestimmung als prozessuale Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AF1","text":"Abstrakte Selbstständigkeit → Selbstnegation → Selbstzerstörung → Anerkennung des eigenen Wesens im Negierten → Versöhnung → Eins und Vieles als Prozess → Einheit durch ausschließende Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME1","text":"Freiheit wird von einer isolierten Selbstsetzung in eine durch Anerkennung vermittelte Selbstbeziehung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME2","text":"Das Böse wird als operative Form abstrakter Selbstständigkeit und nicht als äußerliche Gegenmacht klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME3","text":"Versöhnung wird als Aufhebung einer negativen Haltung und nicht als Addition fremder Bestimmungen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME4","text":"Eins und Vieles werden aus dem Gegensatzschema in eine Prozessstruktur von Repulsion, Attraktion, Identität und Ausschluss überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME5","text":"Der Unterschied der Vielen erscheint nicht länger als Widerlegung ihrer Einheit, sondern als deren notwendige Bestimmungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT1","text":"Surface — Abstrakte Selbstständigkeit, Freiheit, das Böse sowie das Verhältnis von Eins und Vielen werden als unmittelbare Gegenstände bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die negative Selbstbeziehung beziehungsweise die Vermittlung von Einheit und Unterschied durch Ausschluss und Vergleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt isolierende Verstandesbestimmungen durch eine dialektische Auffassung, die Widersprüche als Bewegungsformen rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Seyn wird nicht als ruhende Identität, sondern als Werden und prozessuale Vermittlung von Repulsion und Attraktion gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von abstrakter Selbstständigkeit zu Selbstzerstörung und Versöhnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT2","text":"Sie sind ebenfalls hinreichend, um die Einheit von Eins und Vielen als prozessuale Identität in der Differenz abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die konkrete Vermittlung von Repulsion und Attraktion im Einzelnen verläuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Selbstnegation und dialektische Vermittlung nach demselben Muster gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Bestimmung der Einheit als nicht gegen, sondern durch den Unterschied hindurch bestehend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der Voraussetzung, dass Prozess und Vermittlung gegenüber ruhender Satzform den höheren Wahrheitsmodus bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT7","text":"Die argumentative Bewegung des Textes bleibt durch die Sequenz Abstraktion → Negation → Selbstaufhebung → Anerkennung → vermittelte Einheit erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111425156025Z_50d705e7","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"2a05a7647ec48d1036f83bce7e71ff04d3104df5c086ea9e36ebfafcaa085787","sha256":"20406a0bebc9283553ddf94e44ab458ee53ec17a3c7a124e68b2cf30ef9e4adc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:14:25.158270+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS1","text":"The problem is the self-positing of being-for-self as abstract, formal self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS2","text":"This self-subsistence is determined as error because it treats its own essence as negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS3","text":"Its attempt to attain its own Being through negation produces its destruction and reveals the nullity of its doing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS4","text":"Reconciliation arises through the recognition of that against which negativity is directed as one's own essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS5","text":"The unity of One and Many is to be grasped not as quiescent being, but as the becoming of repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AS6","text":"The Many are distinct, but each is only in the same determination as the other Ones; unity and difference therefore subsist simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","text":"Abstract self-subsistence posits being-for-self as absolutely self-sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","text":"The own essence of abstract self-subsistence is that which it treats as negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A3","text":"Negative conduct toward one's own essence destroys the Being that it seeks to attain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A4","text":"The activity of abstract self-subsistence manifests the nullity of its own claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A5","text":"Reconciliation consists in the recognition of the negated other as one's own essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A6","text":"The truth of One and Many is processual and is not adequately expressed in the form of a quiescent proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A7","text":"Repulsion and attraction mediate the becoming of unity and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A8","text":"The Many are externally related to one another and can therefore be compared with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A9","text":"Each individual among the Many is One and at the same time one of the Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A10","text":"Each One determines itself exclusively in relation to the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A11","text":"The exclusive diversity of the Many makes them absolutely the same in the determination of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:A12","text":"Difference and unity subsist simultaneously despite their tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX1","text":"Abstract self-subsistence is not the highest truth, but the highest error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX2","text":"Freedom is not the positing of one's own essence in a mere abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX3","text":"Being-for-self cannot be saved by clinging to its negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX4","text":"One's own essence is not to be treated as an externally negative counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX5","text":"The truth of One and Many is not to be determined as the quiescent being of an isolated proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX6","text":"The difference of the Many does not cancel their common determination as One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:NX7","text":"The unity of the Many is not given through the effacement of their difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D1","text":"Abstract freedom turns into self-destruction because it isolates its essence as mere being-for-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","CH_GB18_AN_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D2","text":"Evil appears as the concrete form of a freedom that fixes itself in the abstract negation of its essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A1","CH_GB18_AN_9:A2","CH_GB18_AN_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D3","text":"The sublation of self-destruction requires no external supplement, but rather the reversal of the negative relation to one's own essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A3","CH_GB18_AN_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D4","text":"The proposition “the Many are One” remains inadequate if it does not express the mediation of unity and multiplicity as a process.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A6","CH_GB18_AN_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D5","text":"The comparability of the Many shows that each individual is at once determined identically and distinguished exclusively.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A8","CH_GB18_AN_9:A9","CH_GB18_AN_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:D6","text":"The fact of unity subsists not despite difference, but in a determination that contains difference within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_AN_9:A11","CH_GB18_AN_9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD1","text":"A self-subsistence reduced to pure identity generates, through its own negativity, the necessity of recognizing relational determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD2","text":"Reconciliation and dialectical unity follow the same structure: an isolated determination is sublated through the recognition of its negated relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD3","text":"The individual is neither self-sufficient unity nor a mere part of an external whole, but a processually mediated unity of identity and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SD4","text":"The form of the quiescent proposition conceals the structure of movement through which unity and difference are determined in the first place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX1","text":"Untrue is the assumption that self-subsistence is attained through complete independence from every negated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX2","text":"Untrue is the assumption that negation can immediately bring forth a positive Being of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which reconciliation appears as the external mediation of two sides already complete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a logic in which unity and difference completely eliminate one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:DNX5","text":"Inadequate is every form of cognition that asserts difference only against unity, or unity only against difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX1","text":"The text excludes the possibility of an absolutely isolated being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX2","text":"The text treats a quiescent, unmediated being as an inadequate form of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX3","text":"The barred possibility is a freedom that could possess its essence without relating itself to a negated other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:SNX4","text":"The deepest absence is a unity not mediated through relation, movement, and inner difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS1","text":"Being-for-self → positing of abstract self-subsistence → treatment of one's own essence as negative → negative self-relation → destruction of posited Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS2","text":"Self-destruction → revelation of nullity → recognition of the negated essence → relinquishment of negativity → reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS3","text":"One/Many as a quiescent proposition → disclosure of the inadequate form → process of repulsion and attraction → mediated unity of One and Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS4","text":"Externality of the Many → comparability → same determination of each individual as One → exclusive distinction → unity in difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:FGS5","text":"Unity and difference → reciprocal non-sublation → dialectical determination as processual identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:AF1","text":"Abstract self-subsistence → self-negation → self-destruction → recognition of one's own essence in the negated → reconciliation → One and Many as process → unity through exclusive difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME1","text":"Freedom is remapped from an isolated self-positing into a self-relation mediated through recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME2","text":"Evil is classified as the operative form of abstract self-subsistence and not as an external counterforce.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME3","text":"Reconciliation becomes visible as the sublation of a negative attitude and not as the addition of alien determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME4","text":"One and Many are transferred from the schema of opposition into a process-structure of repulsion, attraction, identity, and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ME5","text":"The difference of the Many no longer appears as a refutation of their unity, but as its necessary form of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT1","text":"Surface — Abstract self-subsistence, freedom, evil, and the relation of One and Many are determined as immediate objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is negative self-relation, respectively the mediation of unity and difference through exclusion and comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces isolating determinations of the understanding with a dialectical conception that reconstructs contradictions as forms of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is grasped not as quiescent identity, but as becoming and the processual mediation of repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from abstract self-subsistence to self-destruction and reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT2","text":"They are likewise sufficient to derive the unity of One and Many as processual identity in difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the concrete mediation of repulsion and attraction proceeds in the individual case.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where self-negation and dialectical mediation are read according to the same pattern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT5","text":"The strongest point is the determination of unity as subsisting not against, but through difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the presupposition that process and mediation constitute the higher mode of truth in comparison with quiescent propositional form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_AN_9:MRT7","text":"The argumentative movement of the text is preserved through the sequence abstraction → negation → self-sublation → recognition → mediated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_AN_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_AN_9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_AN_9:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 50","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 50","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE","layer":"CH","title":"b. The One One of Attraction.","order":51,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDEE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDEE@R001","sha256":"c3716baf295f3a59313549cc1883ea01881789dc5cf4f41320e2146b3dbb8534","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS1","text":"Die Repulsion erzeugt die Vielheit der Eins, deren gegenseitige Vorausgesetztheit ihr negatives Verhalten unmächtig macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS2","text":"Die Attraktion wird als Realisierung der zunächst nur gesollten Idealität der Eins bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS3","text":"Die Attraktion setzt die Repulsion voraus und erhält in ihr die Materie ihrer eigenen Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS4","text":"Die Attraktion erzeugt das Eine Eins nicht durch abstrakte Vernichtung der Vielen, sondern durch deren vermittelte Erhaltung in einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der unmittelbaren Vielheit über ihre gesetzte Negation zur Einheit von Repulsion und Attraktion im vermittelten Einen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","text":"Die Eins zerfällt durch Repulsion zunächst in Viele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A2","text":"Die vielen Eins setzen einander als Seiende voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A3","text":"Die Repulsion ist die Realität der Eins, während die Attraktion ihre gesetzte Idealität ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","text":"Die Attraktion setzt die Repulsion als ihre Voraussetzung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","text":"Die Repulsion liefert die Vielen als Materie der Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","text":"Fortdauernde Attraktion setzt die fortdauernde Erzeugung der attrahierbaren Eins voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A7","text":"Eine vollendete Attraktion, die alle Vielen in ein einziges träges Eins überführt, wäre keine Attraktion mehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A8","text":"Die Attraktion enthält als Idealität die Negation ihrer selbst, nämlich die Vielen, auf die sie sich bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","text":"Die Attraktion setzt zunächst die unterschiedslose Gleichheit der vielen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","text":"Das Eine Eins entsteht erst durch die von der Attraktion gesetzte Negation der unmittelbaren Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A11","text":"Das Eine Eins ist als vermitteltes, als Eins gesetztes Eins bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","text":"Das Eine Eins enthält die Vermittlung der Repulsion als eigene Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A13","text":"Die attrahierten Eins werden im Einen Eins nicht abstrakt aufgehoben, sondern als Viele erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A14","text":"Das Eine Eins ist die Einheit von Repulsion und Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX1","text":"Die Repulsion ist nicht selbstgenügsame Vielheit, weil die vielen Eins einander voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX2","text":"Die Idealität der Repulsion ist nicht bereits realisiert, sondern zunächst nur Sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX3","text":"Die Attraktion ist nicht unabhängig von der Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX4","text":"Attraktion ist nicht möglich, wenn keine Vielen als attrahierbare Eins vorhanden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX5","text":"Die Attraktion ist nicht bloße Gleichgewichtslage zwischen gleichmäßig wirkenden Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX6","text":"Das Eine Eins ist nicht ein unmittelbares Eins, das den anderen äußerlich vorgeordnet wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX7","text":"Die Einheit der Attraktion ist nicht abstrakte Konsumtion oder punktförmige Vernichtung der Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D1","text":"Die Repulsion kann nur als unvollständige Idealität gelten, weil ihre Vielheit die Bedingung ihrer eigenen Überführung in Attraktion bildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","CH_GB18_BDEE:A3","CH_GB18_BDEE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D2","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion sind trotz ihrer anfänglichen Unterscheidung untrennbar aufeinander bezogen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D3","text":"Ein Gleichgewicht unmittelbarer Attraktion wäre eine träge Ruhe, weil darin kein gesetztes ideales Eins hervorginge.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D4","text":"Das attrahierende Eins ist nicht eines der unmittelbaren Vielen, sondern das durch deren Negation vermittelte Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","CH_GB18_BDEE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D5","text":"Die Fortdauer der Attraktion verlangt eine fortdauernde Reproduktion der Vielheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","CH_GB18_BDEE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D6","text":"Die Einheit des Einen Eins bewahrt die Vielheit als innere Erfüllung und nicht als äußerlich aufgehobenes Material.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","CH_GB18_BDEE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD1","text":"Einheit ist hier nur als fortgesetzte Vermittlung von Vielheit und Negation stabil.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A8","CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","CH_GB18_BDEE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD2","text":"Die Attraktion erzeugt ihr Resultat nur, indem sie die Bedingung ihrer Tätigkeit reproduziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","CH_GB18_BDEE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD3","text":"Das Eine Eins ist keine vorausliegende Substanz, sondern das Resultat einer Bewegung, die ihre eigenen Voraussetzungen in sich aufnimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","CH_GB18_BDEE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Einen Eins besteht in einer nichtabschließbaren Einheit, deren Vollendung als träge Ruhe den Begriff der Attraktion aufheben würde.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A7","CH_GB18_BDEE:A13","CH_GB18_BDEE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Vielheit ohne gegenseitige Vorausgesetztheit besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Attraktion eine von Repulsion unabhängige ursprüngliche Kraft wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit, deren Herstellung die Bedingungen ihrer eigenen Tätigkeit endgültig vernichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein substanzielles Eine Eins, das vor seiner Vermittlung durch die Vielen bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine abgeschlossene Totalität, in der die Attraktion ihre eigene Voraussetzung vollständig beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist die Trennung von Einheit und Vielheit als voneinander unabhängigen Seinsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Einheit ohne innere Negativität, Erfüllung und fortdauernde Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS1","text":"Eins → Repulsion → Viele; die ursprüngliche Einheit wird als Vielheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS2","text":"Viele → gegenseitige Vorausgesetztheit → unmächtige Negativität; die Vielheit bleibt aufeinander verwiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS3","text":"Repulsion → gesollte Idealität → Attraktion; die negative Realität wird in gesetzte Idealität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS4","text":"Attraktion → gesetzte Negation der Vielen → vermitteltes Eine Eins; die Einheit entsteht durch die Negation der unmittelbaren Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS5","text":"Vermitteltes Eine Eins → Erhaltung der Vielen in sich → Einheit von Repulsion und Attraktion; das Resultat bleibt durch seine Voraussetzung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AF1","text":"Selbstzersplitterung des Eins → vorausgesetzte Vielheit → Attraktion als realisierte Idealität → drohende träge Ruhe bei vollständiger Konsumtion → fortdauernde Reproduktion der Vielen → vermitteltes Eine Eins → Einheit von Repulsion und Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME1","text":"Vielheit wird nicht mehr als bloße Zerstreuung, sondern als notwendige Materie der Einheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME2","text":"Einheit und Vielheit werden nicht als ausschließende Gegensätze, sondern als vermittelte Bestimmungen desselben Prozesses klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME3","text":"Attraktion wird von einer unmittelbaren Kraft zu einer Tätigkeit umkartiert, die ihre eigene Voraussetzung reproduzieren muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME4","text":"Das Eine Eins wird vom ursprünglichen Ausgangspunkt zum Resultat gesetzter Negation und innerer Erhaltung umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Repulsion zerstreut die Eins; Attraktion führt die Vielen in das Eine Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Attraktion ist strukturell von der Repulsion abhängig und kann ohne fortbestehende Vielheit nicht tätig sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Gegensatz von Vielheit und Einheit wird als Vermittlungsbewegung statt als statische Alternative organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Das Sein des Einen Eins ist ein werdendes, selbstvermitteltes Sein, dessen Tätigkeit die Reproduktion seiner Voraussetzungen einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Repulsion zur Attraktion und zum vermittelten Einen Eins zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die fortdauernde Erzeugung der Vielen konkret zu verstehen ist; der Text hält hierfür eine sinnliche und eine begriffliche Bestimmung nebeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Attraktion nicht als Endzustand, sondern als fortgesetzte Vermittlung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Einheit aus der Erhaltung ihrer negierten Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Rede von der Überführung der Vielen in das Eine Eins und ihrer gleichzeitigen Erhaltung als Viele im Einen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der Vorstellung vollständiger Attraktion als möglicher Vollendung und ihrer Bestimmung als Aufhebung der Attraktion selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern das Resultat nicht als ruhendes Endprodukt, sondern als Einheit einer fortbestehenden Vermittlung gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112849166440Z_e88ff5d8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The One One of Attraction.","source_sha256":"c3716baf295f3a59313549cc1883ea01881789dc5cf4f41320e2146b3dbb8534","sha256":"eb41fc364126ddcff338257e327b266dca4a59f172253f135381c646911d63a0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:28:49.167590+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS1","text":"Repulsion produces the multiplicity of ones, whose mutual presupposition renders their negative comportment impotent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS2","text":"Attraction is determined as the realization of the initially merely ought-to-be ideality of the ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS3","text":"Attraction presupposes repulsion and finds in it the matter of its own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS4","text":"Attraction produces the One One not through the abstract annihilation of the many, but through their mediated preservation in a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from immediate multiplicity through its posited negation to the unity of repulsion and attraction in the mediated One One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","text":"Through repulsion, the ones initially disintegrate into many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A2","text":"The many ones presuppose one another as beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A3","text":"Repulsion is the reality of the ones, whereas attraction is their posited ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","text":"Attraction presupposes repulsion as its presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","text":"Repulsion supplies the many as the matter of attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","text":"Continuing attraction presupposes the continuing production of the attractable ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A7","text":"A completed attraction that transfers all the many into a single inert one would no longer be attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A8","text":"As ideality, attraction contains the negation of itself, namely the many to which it relates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","text":"Attraction initially posits the undifferentiated equality of the many ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","text":"The One One arises only through the negation of the immediate many posited by attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A11","text":"The One One is determined as a mediated one, as a posited one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","text":"The One One contains the mediation of repulsion as its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A13","text":"The attracted ones are not abstractly sublated in the One One, but preserved as many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:A14","text":"The One One is the unity of repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX1","text":"Repulsion is not self-sufficient multiplicity, because the many ones presuppose one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX2","text":"The ideality of repulsion is not already realized, but initially only an ought-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX3","text":"Attraction is not independent of repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX4","text":"Attraction is not possible if no many are present as attractable ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX5","text":"Attraction is not a mere state of equilibrium between uniformly acting ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX6","text":"The One One is not an immediate one that would be externally subordinated before the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:NX7","text":"The unity of attraction is not abstract consumption or point-like annihilation of the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D1","text":"Repulsion can count only as incomplete ideality, because its multiplicity constitutes the condition of its own transition into attraction.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","CH_GB18_BDEE:A3","CH_GB18_BDEE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D2","text":"Despite their initial distinction, attraction and repulsion are inseparably related to one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D3","text":"An equilibrium of immediate attraction would be an inert repose, because no posited ideal one would emerge therein.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D4","text":"The attracting one is not one of the immediate many, but the one mediated through their negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A9","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","CH_GB18_BDEE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D5","text":"The continuation of attraction requires a continuing reproduction of multiplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","CH_GB18_BDEE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:D6","text":"The unity of the One One preserves multiplicity as inner fulfillment and not as externally sublated material.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","CH_GB18_BDEE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD1","text":"Here unity is stable only as the continued mediation of multiplicity and negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A8","CH_GB18_BDEE:A12","CH_GB18_BDEE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD2","text":"Attraction produces its result only by reproducing the condition of its activity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A5","CH_GB18_BDEE:A6","CH_GB18_BDEE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD3","text":"The One One is not a pre-existing substance, but the result of a movement that takes its own presuppositions into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A1","CH_GB18_BDEE:A4","CH_GB18_BDEE:A10","CH_GB18_BDEE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SD4","text":"The determinacy of the One One consists in a non-terminable unity whose completion as inert repose would sublate the concept of attraction.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDEE:A7","CH_GB18_BDEE:A13","CH_GB18_BDEE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which multiplicity exists without mutual presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which attraction would be an original force independent of repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a unity whose production definitively annihilates the conditions of its own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a substantial One One that would be determined prior to its mediation through the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a closed totality in which attraction completely removes its own presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is the separation of unity and multiplicity as forms of being independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a unity without inner negativity, fulfillment, and continuing mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS1","text":"One → Repulsion → Many; original unity is posited as multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS2","text":"Many → mutual presupposition → impotent negativity; multiplicity remains referred to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS3","text":"Repulsion → ought-to-be ideality → Attraction; negative reality is transferred into posited ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS4","text":"Attraction → posited negation of the many → mediated One One; unity arises through the negation of immediate multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:FGS5","text":"Mediated One One → preservation of the many within itself → unity of repulsion and attraction; the result remains determined by its presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:AF1","text":"Self-fragmentation of the one → presupposed multiplicity → attraction as realized ideality → threatening inert repose in the case of complete consumption → continuing reproduction of the many → mediated One One → unity of repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME1","text":"Multiplicity is mapped no longer as mere dispersion, but as the necessary matter of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME2","text":"Unity and multiplicity are classified not as excluding opposites, but as mediated determinations of the same process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME3","text":"Attraction is remapped from an immediate force into an activity that must reproduce its own presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ME4","text":"The One One is redefined from the original point of departure into the result of posited negation and inner preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Repulsion disperses the ones; attraction brings the many into the One One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Attraction is structurally dependent on repulsion and cannot be active without persisting multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The opposition of multiplicity and unity is organized as a movement of mediation rather than as a static alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The being of the One One is a becoming, self-mediating being whose activity includes the reproduction of its presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from repulsion to attraction and to the mediated One One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the continuing production of the many is to be understood concretely; the text holds a sensible and a conceptual determination side by side for this purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as attraction is understood not as an end-state, but as continuing mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of unity from the preservation of its negated presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between speaking of the transfer of the many into the One One and their simultaneous preservation as many in the One One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies between the conception of complete attraction as a possible completion and its determination as the sublation of attraction itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDEE:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the result is conceived not as a resting end-product, but as the unity of a persisting mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDEE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDEE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDEE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 51","title":"b. The One One of Attraction.","context":"Chapter 51","original_title":"b. Das Eine Eins der Attraktion."},"original_title":"b. Das Eine Eins der Attraktion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Relation of Repulsion and Attraction.","order":52,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDBD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDBD@R001","sha256":"2072898b30740742b1e20452ec11fb316e8a8ad8120dd88fe65f1ee6e6d3f457","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS1","text":"Der Unterschied von Einem und Vielen muß als Verhältnis zweier scheinbar selbständiger Bestimmungen, Repulsion und Attraktion, begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS2","text":"Die anfängliche Trennung von Repulsion und Attraktion zerfällt, weil jede Bestimmung das voraussetzt, was sie als ihr Anderes ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS3","text":"Repulsion erweist sich als negative Beziehung, die das Ausgeschlossene gerade als bezogenes Moment erhält und daher Attraktion in sich enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS4","text":"Attraktion erweist sich als Setzen des Einen, das die Vielen idealisiert und dadurch selbst Repulsion als Negation und Hervorbringen des Einen enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS5","text":"Das Selbstvoraussetzen beider Bestimmungen ist ihre Selbstvermittlung: Jede geht aus sich in ihr Anderes über und kontinuiert sich darin mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS6","text":"Das Eine ist nicht ein vorausliegendes Substrat, sondern der Prozeß seiner Selbstentzweiung in Viele und seiner Rückkehr aus den Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS7","text":"Die aufgehobene Differenz von Repulsion und Attraktion erzeugt eine affirmative, vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit, deren neue Seinsbestimmung Quantität ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A1","text":"Das Eine und die Vielen sind nur durch ihre Beziehung aufeinander bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","text":"Repulsion ist das Setzen der Vielen als wechselseitig ausschließender Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","text":"Attraktion ist das Setzen des Einen als Negation oder Idealität der Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A4","text":"Repulsion ist nicht beziehungslose Zerstreuung, sondern negative Beziehung auf das Ausgeschlossene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A5","text":"Attraktion setzt die Idealität der Vielen voraus, die sie zugleich hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","text":"Jede Bestimmung setzt sich selbst voraus, indem sie ihr eigenes Negatives als anderes Moment setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","text":"Das Sich-selbst-Voraussetzen ist Vermittlung einer Bestimmung mit sich selbst durch ihr Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A8","text":"Repulsion ist nur durch Attraktion Repulsion, und Attraktion ist nur durch Repulsion Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","text":"Das Eine ist die Negation der Negation, die sich durch ihr abstraktes Anderssein auf sich bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A10","text":"Das Eine besteht nur als Werden von Einem und Vielen; weder sein Anfang noch sein Resultat ist ein bleibendes Unmittelbares.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A11","text":"Aufgehobene qualitative Bestimmtheit ist nicht vernichtet, sondern als Moment einer durch Negation vermittelten Einheit erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A12","text":"Die vermittelte Einheit, in der Grenze und Bestimmtheit dem Sein äußerlich und gleichgültig werden, ist Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX1","text":"Repulsion ist nicht bloßes Leeres, bloße Vereinzelung oder Befreiung von jeder Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX2","text":"Die repellierenden Eins sind nicht vor der Repulsion als fertige und unmittelbare Existenzen gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX3","text":"Attraktion ist nicht eine von außen zur Repulsion hinzutretende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion sind nicht zwei dauerhaft getrennte, selbständige Ursachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX5","text":"Das Eine ist nicht unabhängig von den Vielen und nicht ein unverändertes Substrat ihres Prozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX6","text":"Das Ansich des Einen ist nicht beziehungslose Innerlichkeit, weil seine Bestimmung selbst das Werden zu Vielen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX7","text":"Quantität ist nicht bloße unmittelbare Gleichgültigkeit, sondern die Resultatform aufgehobener qualitativer Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D1","text":"Die Zerstreuung der Vielen kann Repulsion nicht erklären, weil Zerstreuung ohne fortbestehende Beziehung kein Ausschließen wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D2","text":"Die durch Repulsion gesetzten Eins besitzen kein von der Repulsion verschiedenes Sein, weil ihr Bestehen nur ihr gegenseitiges Abhalten ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D3","text":"Attraktion negiert die Selbständigkeit der Vielen nicht nachträglich, sondern setzt diese Selbständigkeit von Anfang an als ideell.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D4","text":"Die Selbständigkeit von Repulsion und Attraktion besteht nur als wechselseitiges Bestimmtsein durch das jeweils andere Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D5","text":"Die Repulsion daseiender Eins enthält Attraktion, weil die Negation anderer Eins deren Idealität für das ausschließende Eine setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D6","text":"Die Attraktion daseiender Eins enthält Repulsion, weil das Setzen des Einen die Negation ihrer Vielheit und damit deren Hervorbringen vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D7","text":"Die Aufhebung der äußeren Beziehung zwischen Unmittelbaren verwandelt die Beziehung von Repulsion und Attraktion in immanente Selbstvermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD1","text":"Die Vielheit ist keine ontologisch selbständige Sphäre neben dem Einen, sondern die Weise, in der das Eine sein eigenes Anderssein setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A1","CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD2","text":"Die Einheit von Repulsion und Attraktion ist keine Versöhnung zweier vorgegebenen Gegensätze, sondern der Nachweis, daß ihre anfängliche Getrenntheit selbst ein Moment ihrer Einheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD3","text":"Das Fürsichsein vollendet sich nur durch den Verlust seiner unmittelbaren Selbstidentität und gewinnt sich gerade als aufgehobenes Moment zurück.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10","CH_GB18_CDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD4","text":"Quantität erscheint als die Form, in welcher qualitative Grenze nicht verschwindet, sondern zur gleichgültigen und äußerlichen Bestimmbarkeit einer affirmativen Einheit herabgesetzt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A11","CH_GB18_CDBD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Relata ihrer Beziehung logisch oder ontologisch vorausliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine negative Bestimmung, die nicht zugleich das von ihr Negierte als notwendiges Moment enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine positive Einheit, die ohne Selbstentzweiung und Rückkehr zu sich selbst bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Übergang von Qualität zu Quantität als äußerliche Hinzufügung einer neuen Kategorie zu einem unveränderten Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein schlechthin erstes, unmittelbares Eines, das dem Prozeß seiner Setzung vorausginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine endgültige Vielheit, deren Zerstreuung nicht zugleich die Rückkehr zur Einheit enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Grenze, die absolute Trennung stiftet, ohne selbst als aufgehobenes Moment einer umfassenderen Einheit zu fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS1","text":"Ein/Viele → äußerlich getrennte Repulsion und Attraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS2","text":"Repulsion → Ausschließen der Vielen → notwendige negative Beziehung auf das Ausgeschlossene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS3","text":"Negative Beziehung → immanente Attraktion als Idealität der ausgeschlossenen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS4","text":"Attraktion → Setzen des Einen → Negation und Hervorbringen der Vielen → immanente Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS5","text":"Wechselseitiges Selbstvoraussetzen → Negation der äußeren Vermittlung → Selbstvermittlung jedes Moments im Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS6","text":"Selbstvermittlung des Einen → Werden von Einem und Vielen → aufgehobene qualitative Grenze → Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF1","text":"Unterschied von Einem und Vielen → Spaltung in Repulsion und Attraktion → Widerlegung ihrer äußeren Selbständigkeit → wechselseitiges Voraussetzen → Selbstvermittlung des Einen → Übergang von Qualität zu Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF2","text":"Repulsion als Zerstreuung → Unmöglichkeit beziehungslosen Ausschließens → Attraktion im Inneren der Repulsion → Einheit der entgegengesetzten Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF3","text":"Attraktion als Setzen des Einen → Idealität der Vielen → Repulsion im Inneren der Attraktion → Aufhebung des festen Einen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF4","text":"Unmittelbares Eine → Negation der Negation → Werden → vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Einheit und Vielheit wird von einer numerischen Gegenüberstellung in eine Selbstbewegung des Einen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME2","text":"Ausschluß wird nicht mehr als Abwesenheit von Beziehung, sondern als intensive Form negativer Beziehung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME3","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion verlieren den Status getrennter Kräfte und werden als wechselseitige Momente eines einzigen Vermittlungsprozesses bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME4","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird als Resultat von Aufhebung statt als vorausgesetzter Anfang sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME5","text":"Quantität wird als Konsequenz der Selbstaufhebung qualitativer Grenze und nicht als äußerliches Feld bloßer Vielheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Repulsion bezeichnet das Auseinanderhalten vieler Eins; Attraktion bezeichnet ihr Zusammengehen im Einen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Jede Bestimmung produziert die Voraussetzungen ihrer eigenen Wirksamkeit und enthält ihr Gegenteil als internes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse ersetzt die Erklärung durch äußere Ursachen durch eine Rekonstruktion immanenter Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein ist nicht substanzielle Beharrung, sondern ein Werden, dessen Anfang und Resultat nur aufgehobene Gestalten desselben Prozesses sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT5","text":"Categorical — Der Übergang zur Quantität entsteht, wenn qualitative Bestimmtheit als vermittelte und dem affirmativen Sein äußerliche Grenze gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Auflösung der äußeren Gegenüberstellung von Repulsion und Attraktion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion erfordert insbesondere, daß Ausschluß als Beziehung und Selbstvoraussetzen als Selbstvermittlung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die idealisierende Attraktion genau dieselbe logische Notwendigkeit besitzt wie die repellierende Selbsterhaltung, sofern ihre Symmetrie nicht aus dem Gesamtgang vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Strukturstelle ist die Umkehrung, nach der jede scheinbar äußere Voraussetzung als eigenes Setzen der jeweiligen Bestimmung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der anfänglichen Darstellung von Repulsion und Attraktion als getrennten Bestimmungen und ihrer nachträglichen Behauptung, immer schon untrennbar gewesen zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT6","text":"Die Ableitung der Quantität bleibt auf die These angewiesen, daß aufgehobene qualitative Grenze notwendig in gleichgültige Bestimmbarkeit übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Arguments, sofern das Eine nicht als Objekt, sondern als Vollzug seiner Selbstnegation und Selbstwiederherstellung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114014916190Z_f0af7eed","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Relation of Repulsion and Attraction.","source_sha256":"2072898b30740742b1e20452ec11fb316e8a8ad8120dd88fe65f1ee6e6d3f457","sha256":"a45b7fdd171146bf119974bd50c75ef225a1352bd060f0c6696380786283f37e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:40:14.918076+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS1","text":"The difference of One and Many must be grasped as the relation of two seemingly self-subsistent determinations, repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS2","text":"The initial separation of repulsion and attraction collapses, because each determination presupposes what it excludes as its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS3","text":"Repulsion proves to be a negative relation that preserves precisely what is excluded as a related moment and therefore contains attraction within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS4","text":"Attraction proves to be the positing of the One, which idealizes the Many and thereby itself contains repulsion as negation and production of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS5","text":"The self-presupposition of both determinations is their self-mediation: each passes out of itself into its other and continues itself therein with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS6","text":"The One is not a pre-existing substrate, but the process of its self-division into Many and of its return from the Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AS7","text":"The sublated difference of repulsion and attraction produces an affirmative, mediated immediacy, whose new determination of being is quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A1","text":"The One and the Many are determined only through their relation to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","text":"Repulsion is the positing of the Many as mutually excluding Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","text":"Attraction is the positing of the One as negation or ideality of the Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A4","text":"Repulsion is not relationless dispersion, but negative relation to what is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A5","text":"Attraction presupposes the ideality of the Many, which it simultaneously produces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","text":"Each determination presupposes itself by positing its own negative as another moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","text":"Self-presupposition is the mediation of a determination with itself through its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A8","text":"Repulsion is repulsion only through attraction, and attraction is attraction only through repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","text":"The One is the negation of negation, which relates itself to itself through its abstract otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A10","text":"The One subsists only as the becoming of One and Many; neither its beginning nor its result is an abiding immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A11","text":"Sublated qualitative determinacy is not annihilated, but preserved as a moment of a unity mediated through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:A12","text":"The mediated unity in which limit and determinacy become external and indifferent to being is quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX1","text":"Repulsion is not mere emptiness, mere isolation, or liberation from every relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX2","text":"The repelling Ones are not given prior to repulsion as finished and immediate existences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX3","text":"Attraction is not a force externally added to repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX4","text":"Repulsion and attraction are not two permanently separate, self-subsistent causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX5","text":"The One is not independent of the Many and is not an unchanged substrate of their process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX6","text":"The in-itself of the One is not relationless inwardness, because its determination itself is the becoming into Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:NX7","text":"Quantity is not mere immediate indifference, but the resultant form of sublated qualitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D1","text":"The dispersion of the Many cannot explain repulsion, because dispersion without continuing relation would not be exclusion.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D2","text":"The Ones posited through repulsion possess no being distinct from repulsion, because their subsistence is only their mutual holding apart.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D3","text":"Attraction does not subsequently negate the self-subsistence of the Many, but from the outset posits this self-subsistence as ideal.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D4","text":"The self-subsistence of repulsion and attraction consists only in reciprocal determinateness through the respectively other moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D5","text":"The repulsion of existent Ones contains attraction, because the negation of other Ones posits their ideality for the excluding One.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D6","text":"The attraction of existent Ones contains repulsion, because the positing of the One carries out the negation of their plurality and thus its production.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A2","CH_GB18_CDBD:A3","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:D7","text":"The sublation of the external relation between immediates transforms the relation of repulsion and attraction into immanent self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD1","text":"Plurality is not an ontologically self-subsistent sphere alongside the One, but the manner in which the One posits its own otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A1","CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD2","text":"The unity of repulsion and attraction is not a reconciliation of two given opposites, but the demonstration that their initial separateness is itself a moment of their unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A6","CH_GB18_CDBD:A7","CH_GB18_CDBD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD3","text":"Being-for-self completes itself only through the loss of its immediate self-identity and recovers itself precisely as a sublated moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A9","CH_GB18_CDBD:A10","CH_GB18_CDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SD4","text":"Quantity appears as the form in which qualitative limit does not disappear, but is reduced to the indifferent and external determinability of an affirmative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDBD:A11","CH_GB18_CDBD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which relata logically or ontologically precede their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a negative determination that does not simultaneously contain what it negates as a necessary moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a positive unity that could subsist without self-division and return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a transition from quality to quantity as the external addition of a new category to an unchanged being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely first, immediate One that would precede the process of its positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a final plurality whose dispersion would not simultaneously contain the return to unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a limit that establishes absolute separation without itself functioning as a sublated moment of a more comprehensive unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS1","text":"One/Many → externally separated repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS2","text":"Repulsion → exclusion of the Many → necessary negative relation to what is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS3","text":"Negative relation → immanent attraction as ideality of the excluded Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS4","text":"Attraction → positing of the One → negation and production of the Many → immanent repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS5","text":"Reciprocal self-presupposition → negation of external mediation → self-mediation of each moment in the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:FGS6","text":"Self-mediation of the One → becoming of One and Many → sublated qualitative limit → quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF1","text":"Difference of One and Many → division into repulsion and attraction → refutation of their external self-subsistence → reciprocal presupposition → self-mediation of the One → transition from quality to quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF2","text":"Repulsion as dispersion → impossibility of relationless exclusion → attraction within repulsion → unity of the opposing determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF3","text":"Attraction as positing of the One → ideality of the Many → repulsion within attraction → sublation of the fixed One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:AF4","text":"Immediate One → negation of negation → becoming → mediated immediacy → quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME1","text":"The relation of unity and plurality is reclassified from a numerical opposition into a self-movement of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME2","text":"Exclusion becomes legible no longer as absence of relation, but as an intensive form of negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME3","text":"Attraction and repulsion lose the status of separate forces and are determined as reciprocal moments of a single process of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME4","text":"Immediacy becomes visible as the result of sublation rather than as a presupposed beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ME5","text":"Quantity is determined as the consequence of the self-sublation of qualitative limit and not as an external field of mere plurality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Repulsion designates the holding apart of many Ones; attraction designates their coming together in the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Each determination produces the presuppositions of its own efficacy and contains its opposite as an internal moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis replaces explanation through external causes with a reconstruction of immanent self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is not substantial persistence, but a becoming whose beginning and result are only sublated shapes of the same process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:ALT5","text":"Categorical — The transition to quantity arises when qualitative determinacy is posited as a mediated limit external to affirmative being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the dissolution of the external opposition between repulsion and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction requires in particular that exclusion be determined as relation and self-presupposition as self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is why idealizing attraction possesses exactly the same logical necessity as repelling self-preservation, provided that its symmetry is not presupposed from the overall course.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural point is the reversal according to which every seemingly external presupposition appears as the positing proper to the respective determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT5","text":"The strongest fault line lies between the initial presentation of repulsion and attraction as separate determinations and their subsequent assertion that they have always already been inseparable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT6","text":"The derivation of quantity remains dependent on the thesis that sublated qualitative limit necessarily passes over into indifferent determinability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDBD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument insofar as the One is treated not as an object, but as the enactment of its self-negation and self-restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDBD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDBD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDBD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 52","title":"c. The Relation of Repulsion and Attraction.","context":"Chapter 52","original_title":"c. Die Beziehung der Repulsion und Attraktion."},"original_title":"c. Die Beziehung der Repulsion und Attraktion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":53,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_10"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_10@R001","sha256":"bf5f8a30c5b8de18a244147ac7cbcd8609568481a8c0a0b25858d4037a9d9145","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS1","text":"Die Bestimmung von Attraktion und Repulsion soll von der Vorstellung zweier selbstständiger materieller Kräfte auf ihre logische Wahrheit als ineinander übergehende Momente zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS2","text":"Kants angebliche Konstruktion der Materie wird als analytische Reflexion bestimmt, weil sie die empirische Vorstellung fertiger Materie voraussetzt und nachträglich passende Kräfte ableitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS3","text":"Die asymmetrische Behandlung von Repulsion als unmittelbar gegeben und Attraktion als bloß erschlossen zerfällt, weil beide Bestimmungen gleichermaßen aus der vorausgesetzten Wahrnehmung von Materie stammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS4","text":"Die funktionale Trennung einer durchdringenden Attraktion von einer bloßen Flächenrepulsion setzt bereits die materielle Kontinuität voraus, die durch die Kräfte erst erklärt werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS5","text":"Die Kantische Festlegung der Kräfte führt dazu, dass Attraktion und Repulsion die jeweils entgegengesetzte Funktion übernehmen und dadurch ihre behauptete feste Differenz aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS6","text":"Die Ausdehnung des Gegensatzes zu Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkraft reproduziert die Unbestimmtheit, weil quantitative Kraftverhältnisse die zu erklärende Bewegung bereits voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A1","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion beruhen begrifflich auf den reinen Bestimmungen des Eins und Vielen und deren wechselseitiger Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A2","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion sind in ihrer Wahrheit keine selbstständigen Kräfte, sondern Momente, die ineinander übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A3","text":"Die gewöhnliche Kraftvorstellung setzt Attraktion und Repulsion als feste Gegensätze voraus, die in einer ihnen äußerlichen Materie zusammentreffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A4","text":"Eine Konstruktion der Materie ist nicht gegeben, wenn die Vorstellung fertiger Materie vorausgesetzt und ihre Bestimmungen analytisch auf Kräfte zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A5","text":"Die Bestimmung der Undurchdringlichkeit privilegiert Repulsion einseitig, obwohl Attraktion ebenso in der wahrgenommenen räumlichen Ausdehnung und im Zusammenhalt der Materie enthalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A6","text":"Die Anerkennung von Attraktion als innerer Kraft der Materie hebt die äußere Mechanik nur unvollständig auf, solange Attraktion und Repulsion selbst als äußerliche Selbstständigkeiten bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A7","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Flächenkraft und durchdringender Kraft setzt bereits räumlich bestimmte, kontinuierliche und berührende Materie voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A8","text":"Die Zuordnung von leerem Raum zur Attraktion und Raumerfüllung zur Repulsion verkehrt die ursprünglichen Kraftbestimmungen in ihr jeweiliges Gegenteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A9","text":"Kräfte, durch welche Materie erst entstehen soll, dürfen nicht mit Kräften verwechselt werden, durch welche bereits konstituierte Materien einander bewegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A10","text":"Ein quantitatives Gegeneinander von Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkraft erklärt Bewegung nicht, wenn die Zu- und Abnahme der Kräfte nur aus der bereits vorausgesetzten Bewegungserscheinung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX1","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion sind nicht zwei unabhängig bestehende Erstprinzipien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX2","text":"Materie ist nicht ein neutrales Drittes, in dem voneinander freie Kräfte bloß verbunden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX3","text":"Kants Verfahren ist nicht konstruktiv, sofern Konstruktion eine begriffliche Hervorbringung des Gegenstands verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX4","text":"Attraktion ist nicht eine dem Materiebegriff äußerlich hinzugefügte Bestimmung, wenn sie zu dessen Möglichkeit gehören soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX5","text":"Repulsion ist nicht auf die Oberfläche fertiger Materie beschränkt, wenn Berührung selbst noch Außereinanderhalten voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX6","text":"Bewegung ist nicht eine der Materie äußerlich zukommende Wirkung von Druck und Stoß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX7","text":"Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkraft sind nicht durch ein festes quantitatives Verhältnis eindeutig voneinander isolierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D1","text":"Die Deduktion der Materie aus Grundkräften bleibt analytisch, weil sie materielle Undurchdringlichkeit, Räumlichkeit und Kontinuität voraussetzt, bevor sie deren Kräfte bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D2","text":"Die Differenz zwischen unmittelbar gegebener Repulsion und nachträglich erschlossener Attraktion ist nicht haltbar, weil beide Kraftbestimmungen aus Eigenschaften der bereits wahrgenommenen Materie gewonnen werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D3","text":"Die These einer bloßen Flächenrepulsion ist tautologisch, weil sie Berührung als Zustand voraussetzt, in dem Repulsion bereits aufgehoben ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D4","text":"Sobald Berührung als fortbestehendes Außereinanderhalten verstanden wird, operiert Repulsion innerhalb jener Sphäre, die ausschließlich Attraktion zugeschrieben werden sollte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D5","text":"Die räumlichen Funktionen der Kräfte destabilisieren ihre begriffliche Differenz, weil Attraktion den leeren Raum erhält und Repulsion durch seine Aufhebung ihre eigene negative Beziehung aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D6","text":"Der Begriff innerer materieller Bewegung bleibt unvollendet, wenn die Bewegung zwar nicht mehr äußerem Stoß zugeschrieben wird, aber weiterhin aus selbstständigen, gegeneinander äußeren Kräften erklärt werden soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A6","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D7","text":"Die quantitative Erklärung planetarischer Ungleichheit bleibt zirkulär, weil dieselbe Erscheinung die gegenläufige Zunahme oder Abnahme der Kräfte rechtfertigen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD1","text":"Jede Erklärung, die Attraktion und Repulsion feste Inhalte und getrennte Wirkungsbereiche zuweist, produziert notwendig Funktionsüberschneidungen, Rollentausch und Selbstaufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD2","text":"Die Kantische Materiekonstruktion scheitert nicht bloß an einzelnen Kraftdefinitionen, sondern an der kategorialen Verwechslung von Bedingungen der Konstitution und Bedingungen der Bewegung eines bereits konstituierten Gegenstands.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD3","text":"Die Kritik verwandelt den Kraftdualismus in eine Logik immanenter Negativität, in der jede Kraft nur durch ihren Übergang in die Gegenkraft bestimmbar ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD4","text":"Die Absicht, Mechanik zu überwinden, bleibt innerhalb der kritisierten Mechanik gefangen, solange die Erklärung an äußerlich gegeneinander gesetzten Kraftgrößen festhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A3","CH_GB18_A_10:A6","CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX1","text":"Ein aus empirisch gegebenen Materialeigenschaften abgeleiteter Begriff kann nicht als begriffliche Hervorbringung der Materie gelten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX2","text":"Die Beziehung der Materie auf sich kann nicht als nachträgliche äußere Verbindung selbstständiger Einheiten verstanden werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX3","text":"Eine Kraftbestimmung kann nicht festgelegt werden, bevor die Bedingungen ihrer räumlichen Anwendung als bereits konstituierte Materie vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX4","text":"Eine Erklärung ist nicht gültig, wenn sie die zu erklärende Bewegungsdifferenz in die variabel angesetzten Erklärungskräfte zurückverlegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine ursprüngliche Materie, die zugleich Resultat ihrer Kräfte und deren bereits fertiger Träger sein könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein stabiler Gegensatz, dessen Pole ihre Bestimmtheit ohne Übergang, Vermittlung oder Selbstnegation bewahren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein neutraler Raum, in dem Attraktion, Repulsion, Berührung und Leere feste, widerspruchsfreie Funktionen erhalten könnten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS1","text":"Reine Bestimmungen des Eins und Vielen → Attraktion und Repulsion als relationale Momente → Unmöglichkeit ihrer festen Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS2","text":"Vorausgesetzte sinnliche Materie → Auswahl empirischer Eigenschaften → Zuordnung erklärender Kräfte → analytische Reflexion statt Konstruktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS3","text":"Festsetzung getrennter Kraftfunktionen → Voraussetzung fertiger Räumlichkeit, Berührung oder Kontinuität → Zirkularität der Kraftdefinition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS4","text":"Räumliche Funktionszuweisung → Übergang jeder Kraft in die Funktion ihres Gegenteils → Auflösung der behaupteten Inhaltsdifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS5","text":"Erklärung von Bewegung durch quantitative Gegenkräfte → Rückprojektion der Erscheinung in die Kraftgrößen → Unbestimmtheit der Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF1","text":"Selbstständige Kräfte **→** Kritik der materiellen Vermittlungsinstanz **→** Rückführung auf Eins und Vieles **→** Übergang der Momente ineinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF2","text":"Kantische Materiekonstruktion **→** Aufdeckung der vorausgesetzten Materie **→** Kollaps der Differenz von unmittelbarer Repulsion und erschlossener Attraktion **→** Bestimmung des Verfahrens als Analyse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF3","text":"Flächenkraft und Durchdringungskraft **→** Voraussetzung von Berührung und Kontinuität **→** Umkehrung der Kraftfunktionen **→** Aufhebung des festen Kraftdualismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF4","text":"Äußere Mechanik **→** partielle Verinnerlichung der Bewegung **→** Fortbestand äußerlicher Grundkräfte **→** unvollendete immanente Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF5","text":"Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkraft **→** quantitatives Gegenverhältnis **→** zirkuläre Zurechnung von Zu- und Abnahme **→** Unbestimmtheit der dynamischen Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME1","text":"Attraktion und Repulsion werden von physikalischen Grundkräften zu logischen Bewegungsmomenten des Eins und Vielen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME2","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Konstruktion und Analyse wird daran neu gezogen, ob der Gegenstand aus seinen Bestimmungen hervorgebracht oder als fertige Erfahrungsvorstellung vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME3","text":"Berührung, Kontinuität, Leere und Raumerfüllung erscheinen nicht mehr als neutrale Voraussetzungen, sondern als begrifflich belastete Einsätze in der Krafttheorie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME4","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von innerer und äußerer Bewegung wird von einer physikalischen Lokalitätsfrage zu einer Frage der immanenten oder äußerlichen Bestimmung der Materie verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME5","text":"Quantitative Kraftmodelle werden nicht als neutraler Zugang zu Bewegung behandelt, sondern als mögliche Verschleierung der bereits vorausgesetzten Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text prüft Kants Bestimmungen von Attraktions-, Repulsions-, Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text isoliert die Zirkularität, dass fertige Materie, räumliche Kontinuität und Bewegung vorausgesetzt werden, um Kräfte als deren Gründe auszugeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Frage nach passenden Erklärungskräften durch die Prüfung, ob ein Verfahren seinen Gegenstand wirklich begrifflich erzeugt oder nur empirisch analysiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Materie ist nur angemessen zu denken, wenn ihre Bestimmungen keine festen äußeren Zutaten bleiben, sondern als immanente Übergänge begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Kritik zu rekonstruieren: Die Kräfte können weder selbstständig noch aus fertiger Materie konstruktiv abgeleitet sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Bestimmung, durch welche Materie aus dem Übergang von Attraktion und Repulsion vollständig hervorgehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern die Priorität der logischen Momente gegenüber der empirischen Kraftvorstellung anerkannt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Aufdeckung von Voraussetzungen, die innerhalb der Definitionen von Flächenkraft, Durchdringungskraft, leerem Raum und Raumerfüllung verborgen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT5","text":"Die Hauptbruchlinie besteht zwischen der Anerkennung des Kantischen Grundgedankens und der Behauptung, dass dessen konkrete Durchführung notwendigerweise analytisch und widersprüchlich bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT6","text":"Die Kritik der Zentripetal- und Zentrifugalkräfte bleibt komprimiert, weil die behauptete Unmöglichkeit ihrer quantitativen Scheidung auf eine spätere Ausführung verwiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung, sofern sie von der Kritik fester Kräfte über die Diagnose analytischer Voraussetzungen zur Forderung immanenter Bewegung fortschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111449123682Z_528b0d92","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"bf5f8a30c5b8de18a244147ac7cbcd8609568481a8c0a0b25858d4037a9d9145","sha256":"0c1f8d03745c37f055d1f1d0685848b6cabcdd71753665e1dfdb7b583fe50292","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:14:49.125417+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS1","text":"The determination of attraction and repulsion is to be reduced from the representation of two independent material forces to its logical truth as moments passing over into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS2","text":"Kant's alleged construction of matter is determined as analytical reflection, because it presupposes the empirical representation of ready-made matter and subsequently derives fitting forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS3","text":"The asymmetrical treatment of repulsion as immediately given and attraction as merely inferred disintegrates, because both determinations equally stem from the presupposed perception of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS4","text":"The functional separation of a penetrating attraction from a merely surface repulsion already presupposes the material continuity that is only to be explained by the forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS5","text":"The Kantian fixation of the forces leads to attraction and repulsion assuming the respectively opposite function and thereby sublating their asserted fixed difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AS6","text":"The extension of the opposition to centripetal and centrifugal force reproduces the indeterminacy, because quantitative force-relations already presuppose the motion to be explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A1","text":"Attraction and repulsion are conceptually grounded in the pure determinations of the One and the Many and their reciprocal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A2","text":"In their truth, attraction and repulsion are not independent forces, but moments that pass over into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A3","text":"The ordinary representation of force presupposes attraction and repulsion as fixed opposites that encounter one another in a matter external to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A4","text":"A construction of matter is not given when the representation of ready-made matter is presupposed and its determinations are analytically reduced to forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A5","text":"The determination of impenetrability privileges repulsion one-sidedly, although attraction is equally contained in the perceived spatial extension and cohesion of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A6","text":"The recognition of attraction as an inner force of matter only incompletely sublates external mechanics so long as attraction and repulsion themselves remain as external independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A7","text":"The distinction between surface force and penetrating force already presupposes spatially determined, continuous, and contacting matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A8","text":"The assignment of empty space to attraction and space-filling to repulsion reverses the original determinations of force into their respective opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A9","text":"Forces through which matter is first supposed to arise must not be confused with forces through which already constituted matters move one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:A10","text":"A quantitative opposition between centripetal and centrifugal force does not explain motion if the increase and decrease of the forces is determined only from the already presupposed appearance of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX1","text":"Attraction and repulsion are not two independently existing first principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX2","text":"Matter is not a neutral third in which forces independent of one another are merely combined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX3","text":"Kant's procedure is not constructive insofar as construction requires a conceptual production of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX4","text":"Attraction is not a determination externally added to the concept of matter if it is to belong to its possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX5","text":"Repulsion is not restricted to the surface of ready-made matter if contact itself still presupposes being-held-apart (Außereinanderhalten).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX6","text":"Motion is not an effect of pressure and impact accruing externally to matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:NX7","text":"Centripetal and centrifugal force cannot be unambiguously isolated from one another by a fixed quantitative ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D1","text":"The deduction of matter from fundamental forces remains analytical because it presupposes material impenetrability, spatiality, and continuity before determining their forces.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D2","text":"The difference between immediately given repulsion and subsequently inferred attraction is untenable because both determinations of force are obtained from properties of already perceived matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D3","text":"The thesis of a merely surface repulsion is tautological because it presupposes contact as a state in which repulsion is already sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D4","text":"As soon as contact is understood as a persisting being-held-apart (Außereinanderhalten), repulsion operates within that sphere which was supposed to be ascribed exclusively to attraction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D5","text":"The spatial functions of the forces destabilize their conceptual difference because attraction maintains empty space and repulsion, through its sublation, sublates its own negative relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D6","text":"The concept of inner material motion remains unfinished when motion is no longer ascribed to external impact, yet is still supposed to be explained from independent forces external to one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A6","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:D7","text":"The quantitative explanation of planetary inequality remains circular because the same appearance can justify the contrary increase or decrease of the forces.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD1","text":"Every explanation that assigns attraction and repulsion fixed contents and separate spheres of efficacy necessarily produces functional overlaps, exchanges of roles, and self-sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD2","text":"The Kantian construction of matter fails not merely because of individual definitions of force, but because of the categorical confusion of conditions of constitution with conditions of the motion of an already constituted object.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD3","text":"The critique transforms force dualism into a logic of immanent negativity, in which each force is determinable only through its transition into the counterforce.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SD4","text":"The intention of overcoming mechanics remains trapped within the mechanics criticized so long as the explanation adheres to magnitudes of force externally posited against one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A3","CH_GB18_A_10:A6","CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX1","text":"A concept derived from empirically given material properties cannot count as a conceptual production of matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX2","text":"The relation of matter to itself cannot be understood as a subsequent external connection of independent units.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2","CH_GB18_A_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX3","text":"A determination of force cannot be fixed before the conditions of its spatial application are presupposed as already constituted matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:DNX4","text":"An explanation is not valid if it projects back into the variably posited explanatory forces the difference of motion that is to be explained.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an original matter that could at once be the result of its forces and their already finished bearer.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A4","CH_GB18_A_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a stable opposition whose poles preserve their determinacy without transition, mediation, or self-negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A1","CH_GB18_A_10:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a neutral space in which attraction, repulsion, contact, and emptiness could receive fixed, contradiction-free functions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_10:A7","CH_GB18_A_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS1","text":"Pure determinations of the One and the Many → attraction and repulsion as relational moments → impossibility of their fixed independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS2","text":"Presupposed sensible matter → selection of empirical properties → assignment of explanatory forces → analytical reflection instead of construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS3","text":"Fixation of separate force-functions → presupposition of ready-made spatiality, contact, or continuity → circularity of the definition of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS4","text":"Spatial assignment of functions → transition of each force into the function of its opposite → dissolution of the asserted difference of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:FGS5","text":"Explanation of motion through quantitative counterforces → projection back of the appearance into the magnitudes of force → indeterminacy of the explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF1","text":"Independent forces **→** critique of the material mediating instance **→** reduction to the One and the Many **→** transition of the moments into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF2","text":"Kantian construction of matter **→** disclosure of presupposed matter **→** collapse of the difference between immediate repulsion and inferred attraction **→** determination of the procedure as analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF3","text":"Surface force and penetrating force **→** presupposition of contact and continuity **→** reversal of force-functions **→** sublation of fixed force dualism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF4","text":"External mechanics **→** partial internalization of motion **→** persistence of external fundamental forces **→** unfinished immanent motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:AF5","text":"Centripetal and centrifugal force **→** quantitative counterrelation **→** circular attribution of increase and decrease **→** indeterminacy of the dynamic explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME1","text":"Attraction and repulsion are reclassified from physical fundamental forces into logical moments of motion of the One and the Many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME2","text":"The difference between construction and analysis is redrawn according to whether the object is produced from its determinations or presupposed as a ready-made representation of experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME3","text":"Contact, continuity, emptiness, and space-filling no longer appear as neutral presuppositions, but as conceptually charged stakes in the theory of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME4","text":"The opposition between inner and outer motion is shifted from a question of physical locality to a question of the immanent or external determination of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ME5","text":"Quantitative force-models are treated not as a neutral approach to motion, but as a possible obscuring of the already presupposed appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines Kant's determinations of attractive, repulsive, centripetal, and centrifugal force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text isolates the circularity whereby ready-made matter, spatial continuity, and motion are presupposed in order to present forces as their grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the question of suitable explanatory forces with the examination of whether a procedure truly conceptually produces its object or merely empirically analyzes it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Matter can be thought adequately only if its determinations do not remain fixed external additions, but are comprehended as immanent transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central critique: the forces can neither be independent nor constructively derived from ready-made matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive determination through which matter is supposed to arise completely from the transition of attraction and repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the priority of logical moments over the empirical representation of force is acknowledged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in exposing presuppositions concealed within the definitions of surface force, penetrating force, empty space, and space-filling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT5","text":"The principal fault line consists between the recognition of the Kantian basic thought and the assertion that its concrete execution necessarily remains analytical and contradictory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT6","text":"The critique of centripetal and centrifugal forces remains compressed because the asserted impossibility of their quantitative separation is referred to a later exposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_10:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument insofar as it proceeds from the critique of fixed forces through the diagnosis of analytical presuppositions to the demand for immanent motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_10:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 53","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 53","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":54,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_11"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_11@R001","sha256":"68e142e32dffd2a15b1e1debe8c783d4f8c782cb4708daa10cdebf4a43192e14","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS1","text":"Das Argument bestimmt, wie Quantität sich von Qualität unterscheidet, ohne als bloße äußerliche Eigenschaft stehenzubleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS2","text":"Es setzt Quantität als eine dem Sein gleichgültig gewordene Grenze und erklärt diese Grenze aus dem nicht-ausschließenden Fürsichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS3","text":"Aus Kontinuität, äußerer Bestimmtheit und Selbstüberschreitung entwickelt es die Stufen reine Quantität, Quantum, unendliches Quantum und quantitatives Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS4","text":"Die Selbstnegation des Quantums führt über den unendlichen Progreß zur Wiederherstellung der Qualität und weiter zum Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS5","text":"An der quantitativen Veränderung des bleibenden Etwas trennt es veränderliche Größe von qualitativer Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS6","text":"Die mathematische Definition der Größe wird als zirkulär diagnostiziert und in äußerliches Hinzufügen und Wegnehmen rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung ist dialektisch-rekonstruktiv: unmittelbare Bestimmtheit wird zur äußerlichen Gleichgültigkeit, diese zur vermittelten Einheit von Qualität und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A1","text":"Qualität ist die erste unmittelbare Bestimmtheit des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A2","text":"Quantität ist eine dem Sein gegenüber gleichgültig gewordene Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A3","text":"Das Fürsichseiende setzt sich affirmativ in sein Anderes fort, statt es auszuschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A4","text":"Die Repulsion der vielen Eins ist unmittelbar Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A5","text":"Die quantitative Grenze ist gegen sich selbst und gegen das Etwas gleichgültig und äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A6","text":"Reine Quantität ist in sich zurückgekehrtes, noch unbestimmtes Fürsichsein und kontinuierliche unendliche Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A7","text":"Eine an der reinen Quantität äußerlich gesetzte Bestimmtheit macht sie zum Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A8","text":"Das Quantum ist eine gleichgültige Bestimmtheit, die über sich hinausgeht und sich selbst negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A9","text":"Das Über-sich-Hinausgehen des Quantums vollzieht sich als unendlicher Progreß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A10","text":"Das unendliche Quantum hebt die gleichgültige Bestimmtheit auf und stellt die Qualität wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A11","text":"Im quantitativen Verhältnis hat ein Quantum seine Bestimmung in einem anderen Quantum und seine Selbstbeziehung in diesem Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A12","text":"Die dem Verhältnis zugrunde liegende Äußerlichkeit macht es zunächst zur formellen Einheit von Qualität und Quantität und treibt es zum Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A13","text":"Die qualitative Grenze bestimmt, was ein Etwas ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A14","text":"Die quantitative Grenze kann sich verändern, ohne die qualitative Bestimmtheit des Etwas aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A15","text":"Die mathematische Definition der Größe verwendet in der Erklärung des Vermehrens und Verminderns bereits die Größe selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A16","text":"Veränderung am Quantum vollzieht sich als äußerliches Hinzufügen und Wegnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX1","text":"Quantität ist nicht die unmittelbare qualitative Bestimmtheit des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX2","text":"Die quantitative Grenze ist nicht die wesentliche Grenze, durch die ein Etwas das ist, was es ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX3","text":"Reine Quantität ist nicht bereits ein bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX4","text":"Das Quantum ist keine in sich ruhende, unveränderliche Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX5","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist kein endgültiger Abschluß quantitativer Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX6","text":"Das quantitative Verhältnis ist noch nicht die absolute Einheit von Qualität und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX7","text":"Quantitative Veränderung ist nicht notwendig qualitative Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX8","text":"Die quantitative Größenbestimmung ist keine nicht-zirkuläre Definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX9","text":"Die Repulsion der vielen Eins ist keine dauerhafte Ausschließung voneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D1","text":"Die quantitative Grenze wird als vom Etwas und von sich selbst gleichgültige äußerliche Bestimmtheit gefaßt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A2","CH_GB18_A_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D2","text":"Die nicht-ausschließende Bewegung des Fürsichseins verwandelt die Repulsion der vielen Eins in Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A3","CH_GB18_A_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D3","text":"Die in sich zurückgekehrte Kontinuität ohne besondere Bestimmtheit bildet die reine Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A4","CH_GB18_A_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D4","text":"Durch die Setzung einer äußerlichen Bestimmtheit geht reine Quantität in Quantum über.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A6","CH_GB18_A_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D5","text":"Weil das Quantum über sich hinausgeht und sich negiert, erscheint sein Anderssein als unendlicher Progreß.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D6","text":"Das unendliche Quantum hebt die gleichgültige Bestimmtheit auf und führt zur Wiederherstellung der Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A9","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D7","text":"Im Verhältnis erscheint die Selbstbeziehung des Quantums als Bestimmung durch ein anderes Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D8","text":"Die fortbestehende Äußerlichkeit macht das Verhältnis zur formellen Einheit von Qualität und Quantität und läßt es in das Maß übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D9","text":"Ein Etwas kann seine quantitative Grenze verändern und qualitativ dasselbe bleiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D10","text":"Die Veränderung der qualitativen Grenze hebt dagegen die Bestimmtheit des Etwas auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D11","text":"Die mathematische Definition der Größe ist zirkulär, weil sie Vermehrung und Verminderung durch die Größe selbst erklärt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D12","text":"Die Veränderung des Quantums erhält deshalb die Form äußerlichen Hinzufügens und Wegnehmens.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD1","text":"Quantität ist kein zweites Merkmal neben der Qualität, sondern die in äußerliche Gleichgültigkeit übergegangene Bestimmtheit, die durch ihre eigene Dialektik wieder auf Qualität verweist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A1","CH_GB18_A_11:A2","CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD2","text":"Die Folge reine Quantität, Quantum, Verhältnis und Maß ist eine Reihe von Selbstaufhebungen, in der jede Form ihre vorausgesetzte Einseitigkeit überschreitet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A6","CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A11","CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD3","text":"Das Etwas wird als bleibender Träger einer veränderlichen quantitativen Grenze bestimmt, dessen qualitative Identität erst durch den Umschlag der qualitativen Grenze aufgehoben wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit der Quantität ist zugleich Bedingung ihrer Bestimmbarkeit und Grund ihrer Unzulänglichkeit als abschließende Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A11","CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD5","text":"Die mathematische Vorstellung der Größe wiederholt auf begrifflicher Ebene die äußerliche Struktur des Quantums.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A7","CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die Bestimmtheit des Seins sei ausschließlich unmittelbare Selbstbeziehung und niemals äußerlich vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Gleichsetzung qualitativer Identität mit jeder einzelnen quantitativen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Quantum, dessen Bestimmtheit vollständig in sich selbst begründet und nicht auf ein anderes Quantum bezogen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Auffassung der quantitativen Unendlichkeit als selbständige, endgültige Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Definition der Größe, die Vermehrung und Verminderung ohne vorausgesetzten Größenbegriff erklären könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Veränderung, deren Form nicht durch äußerliche Negation und äußerliche Affirmation bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX1","text":"Eine ursprüngliche absolute Trennung von Qualität und Quantität ist unzulässig; das System setzt ihre Übergängigkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX2","text":"Ein Etwas mit vollständig innerer, gegen jede äußere Bestimmung abgeschlossener Grenze ist im System nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX3","text":"Eine quantitativ endlose Progression ohne Rückkehr in qualitative Bestimmung kann keine abschließende Erklärung liefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX4","text":"Eine unmittelbar verfügbare absolute Einheit von Qualität und Quantität fehlt zunächst und erscheint erst als Resultat der Dialektik des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX5","text":"Eine von ihren Operationen des Hinzufügens und Wegnehmens unabhängige, neutrale Größe ist nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbare Bestimmtheit → qualitative Bestimmtheit; gleichgültig gewordene Bestimmtheit → Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A1","CH_GB18_A_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS2","text":"Nicht-Ausschluß des Anderen → Repulsion der vielen Eins → Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A3","CH_GB18_A_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS3","text":"Kontinuierliches In-sich-Zurückgekehrtsein ohne besondere Bestimmtheit → reine Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A4","CH_GB18_A_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS4","text":"Äußerlich gesetzte Bestimmtheit → Quantum → Selbstüberschreitung → unendlicher Progreß.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A7","CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS5","text":"Aufhebung der gleichgültigen Bestimmtheit → unendliches Quantum → Wiederherstellung der Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A9","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS6","text":"Bestimmung in einem anderen Quantum → quantitatives Verhältnis → Selbstbeziehung im Anderssein.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS7","text":"Fortbestehende Äußerlichkeit → formelle Einheit von Qualität und Quantität → Maß.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS8","text":"Veränderliche quantitative Grenze + bleibende qualitative Grenze → quantitative Variation ohne qualitative Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS9","text":"Zirkuläre Größenbestimmung → Zerlegung der Veränderung in äußerliches Hinzufügen und Wegnehmen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Bestimmtheit → qualitative Grenze → gleichgültig gewordene Grenze → reine Quantität → Quantum → unendlicher Progreß → unendliches Quantum → quantitatives Verhältnis → Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AF2","text":"Bleibendes Etwas → quantitative Variation ohne qualitative Änderung → Veränderung der qualitativen Grenze → Aufhebung der Bestimmtheit → Kritik der Größenbestimmung → äußerliche Veränderungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME1","text":"Die Kategorie der Grenze wird in wesentliche qualitative Grenze und äußerliche quantitative Grenze aufgeteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME2","text":"Vielheit wird nicht mehr als bloße Ausschließung, sondern als kontinuierliche Einheit der vielen Eins kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME3","text":"Der unendliche Progreß wird vom möglichen Endpunkt zur Übergangsform der Wiederherstellung von Qualität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME4","text":"Das quantitative Verhältnis wird als Vermittlungsstufe zwischen Quantität und Maß sichtbar, nicht als bloße Vergleichsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME5","text":"Das Etwas wird als bleibende Identität unter quantitativer Veränderung und als veränderte Identität unter qualitativer Grenzüberschreitung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME6","text":"Die mathematische Größe wird von einer scheinbar selbständigen Definition auf die Operationen äußerlicher Addition und Subtraktion zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die Unterscheidung von Qualität, Quantität, Quantum, Verhältnis und Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die tragende Struktur ist die Externalisierung der Grenze bei gleichzeitiger Erhaltung eines bleibenden Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Das Argument ersetzt die isolierte Definition der Größe durch eine genetische Folge von Setzung, Äußerlichkeit, Selbstnegation und Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Sein wird als bleibender Träger veränderlicher äußerer Bestimmungen und als Bewegung ihrer Rückkehr in qualitative Bestimmtheit gefaßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Hauptfolge reine Quantität → Quantum → Verhältnis → Maß zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT2","text":"Sie reichen aus, um quantitative Variation von qualitativer Aufhebung der Bestimmtheit zu unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie genau aus der formellen Einheit des Verhältnisses die absolute Einheit des Maßes erzeugt wird; der Übergang wird nur dialektisch angezeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT4","text":"Eine zentrale Spannung besteht zwischen der Äußerlichkeit der Quantität und ihrer Fähigkeit, durch ihre eigene Dialektik Qualität wiederherzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der reinen Quantität als unbestimmter unendlicher Einheit und dem Quantum als selbstnegierender Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur ist dialektisch kohärent, aber nicht formal geschlossen; mehrere Übergänge werden durch begriffliche Bewegung statt durch explizite Vermittlung getragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT7","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion bei der Trennung von qualitativer und quantitativer Grenze sowie bei der Kritik der zirkulären Größenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur dann, wenn die negativen Ausschlüsse und nicht bloß die positive Stufenfolge erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111513236602Z_31dd6c71","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"68e142e32dffd2a15b1e1debe8c783d4f8c782cb4708daa10cdebf4a43192e14","sha256":"3f544394749892921c96daa14eaa6192aa204da6d8415b928298e2f5dad72f48","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:15:13.237692+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS1","text":"The argument determines how quantity differs from quality without remaining a merely external property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS2","text":"It posits quantity as a limit that has become indifferent to being and explains this limit from non-excluding being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS3","text":"From continuity, external determinacy, and self-transcendence, it develops the stages of pure quantity, quantum, infinite quantum, and quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS4","text":"The self-negation of quantum leads through infinite progress to the restoration of quality and onward to measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS5","text":"In the quantitative alteration of the enduring something, it separates variable magnitude from qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS6","text":"The mathematical definition of magnitude is diagnosed as circular and reconstructed in external adding and taking away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AS7","text":"The movement is dialectical-reconstructive: immediate determinacy becomes external indifference, and this becomes the mediated unity of quality and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A1","text":"Quality is the first immediate determinacy of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A2","text":"Quantity is a determinacy that has become indifferent toward being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A3","text":"That which is for itself continues itself affirmatively into its other, instead of excluding it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A4","text":"The repulsion of the many ones is immediately continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A5","text":"The quantitative limit is indifferent and external toward itself and toward the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A6","text":"Pure quantity is being-for-self returned into itself, still indeterminate, and continuous infinite unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A7","text":"A determinacy externally posited in pure quantity makes it into quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A8","text":"Quantum is an indifferent determinacy that goes beyond itself and negates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A9","text":"The going-beyond-itself of quantum takes place as infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A10","text":"The infinite quantum sublates the indifferent determinacy and restores quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A11","text":"In quantitative relation, a quantum has its determination in another quantum and its self-relation in this otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A12","text":"The externality underlying the relation initially makes it the formal unity of quality and quantity and drives it toward measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A13","text":"The qualitative limit determines what a something is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A14","text":"The quantitative limit can change without sublating the qualitative determinacy of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A15","text":"The mathematical definition of magnitude already employs magnitude itself in the explanation of increase and diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:A16","text":"Alteration in quantum takes place as external adding and taking away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX1","text":"Quantity is not the immediate qualitative determinacy of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX2","text":"The quantitative limit is not the essential limit through which a something is what it is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX3","text":"Pure quantity is not already a determinate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX4","text":"Quantum is not a determinacy resting within itself and unchangeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX5","text":"Infinite progress is not a final completion of quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX6","text":"Quantitative relation is not yet the absolute unity of quality and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX7","text":"Quantitative alteration is not necessarily qualitative alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX8","text":"Quantitative determination of magnitude is not a non-circular definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:NX9","text":"The repulsion of the many ones is not a lasting mutual exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D1","text":"The quantitative limit is grasped as an external determinacy indifferent to the something and to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A2","CH_GB18_A_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D2","text":"The non-excluding movement of being-for-self transforms the repulsion of the many ones into continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A3","CH_GB18_A_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D3","text":"Continuity returned into itself without particular determinacy constitutes pure quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A4","CH_GB18_A_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D4","text":"Through the positing of an external determinacy, pure quantity passes over into quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A6","CH_GB18_A_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D5","text":"Because quantum goes beyond itself and negates itself, its otherness appears as infinite progress.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D6","text":"The infinite quantum sublates the indifferent determinacy and leads to the restoration of quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A9","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D7","text":"In relation, the self-relation of quantum appears as determination through another quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D8","text":"The persisting externality makes relation the formal unity of quality and quantity and lets it pass over into measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D9","text":"A something can alter its quantitative limit and remain qualitatively the same.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D10","text":"The alteration of the qualitative limit, by contrast, sublates the determinacy of the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D11","text":"The mathematical definition of magnitude is circular because it explains increase and diminution through magnitude itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:D12","text":"The alteration of quantum therefore assumes the form of external adding and taking away.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD1","text":"Quantity is not a second characteristic alongside quality, but determinacy that has passed over into external indifference and that, through its own dialectic, points back to quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A1","CH_GB18_A_11:A2","CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD2","text":"The sequence pure quantity, quantum, relation, and measure is a series of self-sublations in which each form transcends its presupposed one-sidedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A6","CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A11","CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD3","text":"The something is determined as the enduring bearer of a variable quantitative limit, whose qualitative identity is sublated only through the transition of the qualitative limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD4","text":"The externality of quantity is at once the condition of its determinability and the ground of its inadequacy as a conclusive form.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A5","CH_GB18_A_11:A11","CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SD5","text":"The mathematical conception of magnitude repeats, at the conceptual level, the external structure of quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A7","CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the determinacy of being is exclusively immediate self-relation and never externally mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the equation of qualitative identity with every individual quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a quantum whose determinacy would be grounded entirely within itself and not related to another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the conception of quantitative infinity as an independent, final totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a definition of magnitude that could explain increase and diminution without a presupposed concept of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an alteration whose form would not be determined by external negation and external affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX1","text":"An original absolute separation of quality and quantity is inadmissible; the system presupposes their transitionability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX2","text":"A something with a wholly inner limit closed off against every external determination is not available within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX3","text":"A quantitatively endless progression without return into qualitative determination cannot provide a conclusive explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX4","text":"An immediately available absolute unity of quality and quantity is initially absent and appears only as the result of the dialectic of relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:SNX5","text":"A neutral magnitude independent of its operations of adding and taking away is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS1","text":"Immediate determinacy → qualitative determinacy; determinacy become indifferent → quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A1","CH_GB18_A_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS2","text":"Non-exclusion of the other → repulsion of the many ones → continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A3","CH_GB18_A_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS3","text":"Continuous return-into-itself without particular determinacy → pure quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A4","CH_GB18_A_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS4","text":"Externally posited determinacy → quantum → self-transcendence → infinite progress.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A7","CH_GB18_A_11:A8","CH_GB18_A_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS5","text":"Sublation of indifferent determinacy → infinite quantum → restoration of quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A9","CH_GB18_A_11:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS6","text":"Determination in another quantum → quantitative relation → self-relation in otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS7","text":"Persisting externality → formal unity of quality and quantity → measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS8","text":"Variable quantitative limit + enduring qualitative limit → quantitative variation without qualitative sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A13","CH_GB18_A_11:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:FGS9","text":"Circular determination of magnitude → decomposition of alteration into external adding and taking away.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_11:A15","CH_GB18_A_11:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AF1","text":"Immediate determinacy → qualitative limit → limit become indifferent → pure quantity → quantum → infinite progress → infinite quantum → quantitative relation → measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:AF2","text":"Enduring something → quantitative variation without qualitative alteration → alteration of the qualitative limit → sublation of determinacy → critique of the determination of magnitude → external form of alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME1","text":"The category of limit is divided into essential qualitative limit and external quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME2","text":"Multiplicity is mapped no longer as mere exclusion, but as the continuous unity of the many ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME3","text":"Infinite progress is reclassified from a possible endpoint to a transitional form of the restoration of quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME4","text":"Quantitative relation becomes visible as a mediating stage between quantity and measure, not as a mere form of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME5","text":"The something is classified as an enduring identity under quantitative alteration and as an altered identity under transgression of the qualitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ME6","text":"Mathematical magnitude is reduced from an apparently independent definition to the operations of external addition and subtraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The immediate subject is the distinction among quality, quantity, quantum, relation, and measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The supporting structure is the externalization of the limit while preserving an enduring something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The argument replaces the isolated definition of magnitude with a genetic sequence of positing, externality, self-negation, and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being is grasped as the enduring bearer of variable external determinations and as the movement of their return into qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the main sequence pure quantity → quantum → relation → measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT2","text":"They suffice to distinguish quantitative variation from the qualitative sublation of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined exactly how the absolute unity of measure is generated from the formal unity of relation; the transition is only dialectically indicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT4","text":"A central tension exists between the externality of quantity and its capacity to restore quality through its own dialectic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT5","text":"A further tension lies between pure quantity as indeterminate infinite unity and quantum as self-negating determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT6","text":"The structure is dialectically coherent, but not formally closed; several transitions are sustained by conceptual movement rather than explicit mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the separation of qualitative and quantitative limit and in the critique of circular determination of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_11:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the negative exclusions, and not merely the positive sequence of stages, are retained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_11:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_11:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 54","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 54","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT","layer":"CH","title":"A. Pure Quantity.","order":55,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DRQT"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DRQT@R001","sha256":"17ef10c21528b59c580797bac0645b5b8d353f04de78499a1f31b25b5712ffa8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS1","text":"Das isolierte Fürsichseyn erweist sich als eine sich aufhebende negative Beziehung zum ausgeschlossenen Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS2","text":"Die Aufhebung der ausschließenden Repulsion erzeugt Attraktion als Beziehung identischer Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS3","text":"Attraktion bestimmt die Quantität zunächst als Kontinuität: als selbstgleiche Beziehung ohne unterbrechende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS4","text":"Die ausgeschlossene Vielheit bleibt innerhalb dieser Kontinuität als unterschiedsloses Außereinander erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS5","text":"Kontinuität und Diskretion bilden eine Einheit, obwohl die Quantität diese Einheit zunächst nur in der Form der Kontinuität setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS6","text":"Die Repulsion erzeugt als Fortfließen ihrer selbst eine Kontinuität, die zugleich ununterbrochene Vielheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist ein sich auf sich beziehendes, sich zugleich von anderem abstoßendes Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","text":"Die ausschließende Repulsion verhält sich zunächst nur negativ zum ausgeschlossenen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A3","text":"Die negative Beziehung der Einsen geht in eine identische Beziehung zum Anderen über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A4","text":"Der Übergang der Repulsion in Attraktion erzeugt Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","text":"Kontinuität ist einfache, sich selbst gleiche Beziehung auf sich ohne Grenze und Ausschließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","text":"Kontinuität ist keine unmittelbare Einheit, sondern die Einheit der fürsichseienden Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","text":"Die Vielheit bleibt in der Kontinuität als Außereinander der Vielen erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A8","text":"Die Vielen sind einander gleich, sodass Vielheit als unterschiedslose Gleichheit bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","text":"Die Diskretion ist ein notwendiges Moment der Größe innerhalb der Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A10","text":"Die Diskretion der Quantität ist zusammenfließende Diskretion, deren Einsen sich nicht durch das Leere oder Negative aufeinander beziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","text":"Quantität ist die Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","text":"Die Quantität setzt diese Einheit zunächst nur in der Form der Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A13","text":"Die zunächst gesetzte Quantität enthält ihre Momente, ohne sie bereits entwickelt und ausdrücklich an ihr gesetzt zu haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","text":"Das Fürsichseyn ist seinem Begriff nach ein sich aufhebendes Beziehen auf sich und ein fortdauerndes Außersichkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","text":"Das Abgestoßene bleibt mit dem Abstoßenden identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","text":"Die Repulsion ist deshalb das erzeugende Fortfließen ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX1","text":"Quantität ist nicht die absolute Sprödigkeit eines isolierten Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX2","text":"Kontinuität ist nicht unmittelbare, voraussetzungslose Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX3","text":"Kontinuität ist nicht durch Grenze oder Ausschließung unterbrochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX4","text":"Die Vielheit ist nicht als voneinander isolierte oder ausschließende Vielheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX5","text":"Die diskreten Einsen beziehen sich nicht auf das Leere oder das Negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX6","text":"Die Quantität ist nicht bereits die vollständig entwickelte Einheit ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX7","text":"Repulsion ist in der Quantität nicht mehr ausschließendes Prinzip, sondern nur noch Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D1","text":"Das Fürsichseyn wird zur Quantität, sobald seine ausschließende Selbstbeziehung in eine identische Beziehung der Einsen übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A1","CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","CH_GB18_DRQT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D2","text":"Attraktion ist die quantitative Form der aufgehobenen Repulsion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","CH_GB18_DRQT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D3","text":"Kontinuität bewahrt die Vielheit, indem sie die vielen Einsen als unterschiedsloses Außereinander fortbestehen lässt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D4","text":"Die Kontinuität enthält Diskretion, weil ihre Selbstgleichheit die Vielen nicht aufhebt, sondern zusammenfließen lässt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D5","text":"Die Diskretion der Quantität ist keine Unterbrechung der Kontinuität, sondern deren innere Bestimmung als Vielheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D6","text":"Die anfängliche Bestimmung der Quantität als Kontinuität ist ein Resultat der Dialektik des Fürsichseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A4","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D7","text":"Die Quantität enthält ihre begrifflichen Momente zunächst implizit, weil sie als einfache Unmittelbarkeit gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","CH_GB18_DRQT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D8","text":"Die Identität des Abgestoßenen mit sich selbst verwandelt Repulsion in ununterbrochenes Fortfließen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD1","text":"Die quantitative Einheit ist weder einfache Einheit noch bloße Vielheit, sondern eine Einheit, die ihre Vielheit als kontinuierliche Selbstgleichheit in sich trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD2","text":"Die quantitative Kontinuität ist ein dynamisch erzeugtes Außersichsein, kein ruhender homogener Bestand.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","CH_GB18_DRQT:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD3","text":"Die Abstoßung erzeugt gerade dadurch Zusammenhang, dass das Abgestoßene nicht aus der Identität mit sich herausfällt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","CH_GB18_DRQT:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD4","text":"Die Quantität ist strukturell spannungsvoll, weil sie ihre Einheit als Kontinuität setzt, diese Kontinuität aber nur durch das nicht ausgeschlossene Moment der Diskretion bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","CH_GB18_DRQT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD5","text":"Das quantitative Viele ist keine Summe äußerlich verbundener Einheiten, sondern die in sich gleiche Fortsetzung der Einsen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A8","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit eines absolut selbstständigen und undurchlässigen Eins ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Vielheit aus, deren Einheiten nur durch äußere Trennung oder leeren Zwischenraum bestimmt wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert ein Modell, in dem Kontinuität ohne innere Vielheit oder Diskretion bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine unmittelbare Einheit aus, die nicht aus der Vermittlung der fürsichseienden Einsen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX5","text":"Es verwirft eine Repulsion, deren Resultat bloße Zerstreuung und nicht die Erzeugung eines Fortfließens wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX6","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Außersichkommen nicht den Verlust der Identität, sondern deren quantitative Realisierung bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine Trennung, in der die Einsen ohne gemeinsame Kontinuität bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist ebenso eine reine Kontinuität, in der die Vielheit als diskretes Moment verschwunden wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Alternative zwischen isolierter Einheit und äußerlich aggregierter Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Begriff der Quantität, der entweder nur leere Gleichförmigkeit oder nur diskrete Abzählbarkeit zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX5","text":"Die fundamentale Abwesenheit ist ein außerhalb der Beziehung stehendes Eins, von dem die quantitative Einheit ihren Ausgang nehmen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS1","text":"Selbstbeziehung des Eins → negative Abstoßung des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS2","text":"Negative Abstoßung → Übergang zur identischen Beziehung der Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS3","text":"Identische Beziehung → Attraktion als aufgehobene Repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS4","text":"Attraktion → Kontinuität als selbstgleiche Beziehung ohne Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS5","text":"Kontinuität → Erhaltung des Außereinanders der Vielen in unterschiedsloser Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS6","text":"Erhaltene Vielheit → Diskretion als inneres, nicht ausschließendes Moment der Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS7","text":"Kontinuität plus Diskretion → Quantität als deren Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS8","text":"Noch nicht entwickelte Einheit → anfängliche Setzung der Quantität in der Form der Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS9","text":"Identität des Abgestoßenen mit sich → Repulsion als erzeugendes Fortfließen ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS10","text":"Fortfließende Repulsion → Kontinuität, die ohne Unterbrechung Vielheit bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AF1","text":"Isoliertes Fürsichseyn → negative Repulsion → aufgehobene Ausschließung → Attraktion → Kontinuität → in ihr erhaltene unterschiedslose Vielheit → zusammenfließende Diskretion → Quantität als zunächst unentwickelte Einheit beider Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME1","text":"Das Eins wird von einer isolierten Einheit zu einem relationalen Moment der Quantität umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME2","text":"Kontinuität wird nicht mehr als Gegensatz zur Vielheit, sondern als deren selbstgleiche Organisationsform sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME3","text":"Diskretion wird von einer äußeren Unterbrechung zu einem inneren Moment der Kontinuität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion erscheinen nicht als alternative Kräfte, sondern als aufeinander bezogene Momente der quantitativen Erzeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Einheit und Vielheit bricht zugunsten einer Einheit zusammen, die Vielheit als Außersichsein in sich enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME6","text":"Quantität wird als Resultat einer Bewegung und nicht als vorausgesetzte homogene Gegebenheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Die Quantität wird als Kontinuität und als Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Einheiten bleiben unterschieden, werden aber durch identische Beziehung, Attraktion und selbstgleiche Fortsetzung zusammengehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Gegensatz von ausschließender Repulsion und verbindender Einheit wird in eine generative Abfolge von Repulsion, Attraktion und Kontinuität umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein ist als sich aufhebendes Fürsichseyn und fortdauerndes Außersichkommen bestimmt; Kontinuität bezeichnet die zeitlos-strukturelle Fortsetzung dieser Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Fürsichseyn zur Kontinuität und zur Quantität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT2","text":"Die Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion ist erfasst, obwohl die Diskretion gegenüber der anfänglichen Setzung der Kontinuität nachgeordnet bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die zunächst nur enthaltenen Momente später ausdrücklich entwickelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der Identität des Abgestoßenen mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Struktur ist die Ableitung der Kontinuität aus einer Repulsion, die nicht in bloße Trennung zerfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt in der Spannung zwischen der anfänglichen Bestimmung der Quantität als Kontinuität und ihrer begrifflichen Abhängigkeit von der Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, sofern Quantität nicht als fertige Einheit, sondern als noch unentwickeltes Resultat der Dialektik des Fürsichseyns verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115519786162Z_2afc9fa9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Pure Quantity.","source_sha256":"17ef10c21528b59c580797bac0645b5b8d353f04de78499a1f31b25b5712ffa8","sha256":"fba48a56deb2d427b1d168606895d815827306d277803c0c83dd0721a3022b81","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:55:19.804156+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS1","text":"Isolated being-for-self proves to be a self-sublating negative relation to the excluded Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS2","text":"The sublation of exclusive repulsion produces attraction as a relation of identical Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS3","text":"Attraction initially determines quantity as continuity: as a self-identical relation without an interrupting limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS4","text":"Within this continuity, the excluded plurality remains preserved as indifferent externality-to-one-another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS5","text":"Continuity and discreteness form a unity, although quantity initially posits this unity only in the form of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AS6","text":"As the flowing-on of itself, repulsion produces a continuity that is at the same time uninterrupted plurality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A1","text":"Being-for-self is a One that relates itself to itself while at the same time repelling itself from another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","text":"Exclusive repulsion initially relates only negatively to the excluded One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A3","text":"The negative relation of the Ones passes over into an identical relation to the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A4","text":"The transition of repulsion into attraction produces continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","text":"Continuity is a simple, self-identical relation to itself without limit and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","text":"Continuity is not immediate unity, but the unity of the Ones that are for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","text":"In continuity, plurality remains preserved as the externality-to-one-another of the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A8","text":"The many are equal to one another, such that plurality is determined as indifferent equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","text":"Discreteness is a necessary moment of magnitude within continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A10","text":"The discreteness of quantity is confluent discreteness, whose Ones do not relate to one another through the void or the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","text":"Quantity is the unity of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","text":"Quantity initially posits this unity only in the form of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A13","text":"The initially posited quantity contains its moments without yet having developed them and explicitly posited them in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","text":"According to its concept, being-for-self is a self-sublating relation to itself and a continual coming-out-of-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","text":"What is repelled remains identical with what repels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","text":"Repulsion is therefore the productive flowing-on of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX1","text":"Quantity is not the absolute brittleness of an isolated One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX2","text":"Continuity is not immediate, presuppositionless unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX3","text":"Continuity is not interrupted by limit or exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX4","text":"Plurality is not determined as plurality isolated from or excluding one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX5","text":"The discrete Ones do not relate to the void or the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX6","text":"Quantity is not yet the fully developed unity of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:NX7","text":"In quantity, repulsion is no longer an exclusive principle, but only a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D1","text":"Being-for-self becomes quantity as soon as its exclusive self-relation passes over into an identical relation of the Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A1","CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","CH_GB18_DRQT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D2","text":"Attraction is the quantitative form of sublated repulsion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A2","CH_GB18_DRQT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D3","text":"Continuity preserves plurality by allowing the many Ones to persist as indifferent externality-to-one-another.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D4","text":"Continuity contains discreteness because its self-identity does not sublate the many, but allows them to flow together.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D5","text":"The discreteness of quantity is not an interruption of continuity, but its inner determination as plurality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D6","text":"The initial determination of quantity as continuity is a result of the dialectic of being-for-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A4","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D7","text":"Quantity initially contains its conceptual moments implicitly because it is posited as simple immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","CH_GB18_DRQT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:D8","text":"The identity of what is repelled with itself transforms repulsion into uninterrupted flowing-on.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD1","text":"Quantitative unity is neither simple unity nor mere plurality, but a unity that bears its plurality within itself as continuous self-identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A5","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD2","text":"Quantitative continuity is a dynamically produced being-outside-itself, not a static homogeneous subsistence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A14","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","CH_GB18_DRQT:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD3","text":"Repulsion produces connection precisely by virtue of the fact that what is repelled does not fall out of identity with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A15","CH_GB18_DRQT:A16","CH_GB18_DRQT:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD4","text":"Quantity is structurally tension-filled because it posits its unity as continuity, but this continuity is determined only through the unexcluded moment of discreteness.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A9","CH_GB18_DRQT:A11","CH_GB18_DRQT:A12","CH_GB18_DRQT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SD5","text":"The quantitative many is not a sum of externally conjoined unities, but the self-identical continuation of the Ones.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRQT:A6","CH_GB18_DRQT:A7","CH_GB18_DRQT:A8","CH_GB18_DRQT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX1","text":"The system depends upon the untruth of an absolutely independent and impermeable One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX2","text":"It excludes a plurality whose units would be determined only through external separation or empty interval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies a model in which continuity could subsist without inner plurality or discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX4","text":"It excludes an immediate unity that does not arise from the mediation of the Ones that are for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX5","text":"It rejects a repulsion whose result would be mere dispersion and not the production of a flowing-on.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:DNX6","text":"It presupposes that coming-out-of-itself signifies not the loss of identity but its quantitative realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a pure separation in which the Ones subsist without common continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX2","text":"Likewise impossible is a pure continuity in which plurality as a discrete moment would have disappeared.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the alternative between isolated unity and externally aggregated plurality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a concept of quantity that permits either only empty uniformity or only discrete countability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:SNX5","text":"The fundamental absence is a One standing outside relation, from which quantitative unity could take its point of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS1","text":"Self-relation of the One → negative repulsion of the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS2","text":"Negative repulsion → transition to the identical relation of the Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS3","text":"Identical relation → attraction as sublated repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS4","text":"Attraction → continuity as self-identical relation without limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS5","text":"Continuity → preservation of the externality-to-one-another of the many in indifferent equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS6","text":"Preserved plurality → discreteness as an inner, non-exclusive moment of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS7","text":"Continuity plus discreteness → quantity as their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS8","text":"Unity not yet developed → initial positing of quantity in the form of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS9","text":"Identity of what is repelled with itself → repulsion as the productive flowing-on of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:FGS10","text":"Flowing-on repulsion → continuity that remains plurality without interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRQT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:AF1","text":"Isolated being-for-self → negative repulsion → sublated exclusion → attraction → continuity → indifferent plurality preserved within it → confluent discreteness → quantity as the initially undeveloped unity of both moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME1","text":"The One is remapped from an isolated unity into a relational moment of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME2","text":"Continuity becomes visible no longer as the opposite of plurality, but as its self-identical form of organization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME3","text":"Discreteness is reclassified from an external interruption into an inner moment of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME4","text":"Repulsion and attraction appear not as alternative forces, but as mutually related moments of quantitative production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME5","text":"The opposition of unity and plurality collapses in favor of a unity that contains plurality within itself as being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ME6","text":"Quantity is mapped as the result of a movement and not as a presupposed homogeneous given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Quantity is determined as continuity and as the unity of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Unities remain distinguished, but are held together through identical relation, attraction, and self-identical continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The opposition between exclusive repulsion and connective unity is reframed into a generative sequence of repulsion, attraction, and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is determined as self-sublating being-for-self and continual coming-out-of-itself; continuity denotes the timeless-structural continuation of this movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from being-for-self to continuity and to quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT2","text":"The unity of continuity and discreteness is grasped, although discreteness remains subordinate to the initial positing of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the moments initially only contained are later explicitly developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT4","text":"Internal coherence rests on the identity of what is repelled with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the structure is the derivation of continuity from a repulsion that does not disintegrate into mere separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT6","text":"The central fault line lies in the tension between the initial determination of quantity as continuity and its conceptual dependence on discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRQT:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement insofar as quantity is understood not as a finished unity, but as the still undeveloped result of the dialectic of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DRQT@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DRQT:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 55","title":"A. Pure Quantity.","context":"Chapter 55","original_title":"A. Die reine Quantität."},"original_title":"A. Die reine Quantität.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":56,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_12"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_12@R001","sha256":"6c06723771b6d621ccc980aa52cde129869858173d3e0353f5dc7b1def62c84f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS1","text":"Das Argument löst das Problem, reine Quantität von Quantum, Grenze und atomistischer Zusammensetzung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS2","text":"Reine Quantität wird als unbeschränkte Kontinuität bestimmt, in der Diskretion nur als aufgehobenes Moment besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS3","text":"Die Grundlage dieser Neubestimmung ist, dass das Eins selbst in Attraktion und Idealität übergeht und Kontinuität daher seinem Wesen angehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS4","text":"Die atomistische Vorstellung wird als Veräußerlichung der Kontinuität diagnostiziert und durch die mathematische Zurückweisung diskreter Grundbestandteile widerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS5","text":"Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich werden als verschiedene Existenzweisen derselben selbstproduzierenden quantitativen Kontinuität entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung der Vielheit als einfacher Einheit, ohne dass dafür eine äußerliche Vorstellung ihrer Einheit erforderlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A1","text":"Reine Quantität ist zunächst weder begrenzt noch Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A2","text":"Wenn Quantität zum Quantum wird, beschränkt die Grenze nicht ihr eigentliches Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A3","text":"Die Grenze ist in der Quantität als aufgehobenes Fürsichseyn enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A4","text":"Diskretion ist ein Moment der reinen Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A5","text":"Die Quantität ist allenthalben die reale Möglichkeit des Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A6","text":"Das Eins ist nur als kontinuierliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A7","text":"Das Eins geht an und für sich in Attraktion und Idealität über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A8","text":"Kontinuität ist dem Eins nicht äußerlich, sondern in seinem Wesen gegründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A9","text":"Atomistik beruht auf der Äußerlichkeit der Kontinuität gegenüber den Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A10","text":"Mathematik verwirft unkontinuierliche Eins als konstituierende Bestandteile von Zeit, Raum und Linie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A11","text":"Diskrete mathematische Vorstellungen gelten nur momentan und werden in der unendlichen Vielheit eines begrenzten Kontinuums aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A12","text":"Die im Text angeführte Spinoza-Unterscheidung bestimmt vorgestellte Quantität als endlich, teilbar und zusammengesetzt, intellektuell begriffene Quantität dagegen als unendlich und unteilbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A13","text":"Raum und Zeit sind Vielheiten des Außersichgehens, die ihre Einheit fortwährend selbst hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A14","text":"Materie ist die reine quantitative Bestimmung in äußerlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A15","text":"Das Ich ist als absolutes Anderswerden und allseitige Repulsion negative Freiheit bei fortbestehender einfacher Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A16","text":"Die Vielheit ist als solche einfache Einheit, weil jedes Viele dasselbe ist wie jedes andere Viele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX1","text":"Reine Quantität ist nicht mit einem ursprünglich begrenzten Quantum identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX2","text":"Die Grenze ist keine unaufgehobene Beschränkung der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX3","text":"Kontinuität ist keine äußerliche Beziehung bereits fertiger Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX4","text":"Das Eins ist kein absolut sprödes und ausschließendes Atom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX5","text":"Raum, Zeit und Linie bestehen nicht aus letztgültigen Punkten oder unkontinuierlichen Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX6","text":"Die unendliche Vielheit diskreter Bestandteile bildet kein Kontinuum durch bloße äußere Addition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX7","text":"Reine Quantität ist nicht die bloß vorgestellte endliche, teilbare und aus Teilen zusammengesetzte Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX8","text":"Raum und Zeit gehen nicht in Qualität oder in ein isoliertes Eins über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX9","text":"Materie ist von der Quantität nicht durch eine weitere begriffliche Bestimmung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX10","text":"Die mannigfaltigen Grenzen von Empfindung und Anschauung unterbrechen die Kontinuität des Ichs nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX11","text":"Die Einheit der Vielheit verlangt keine äußerliche oder bildhafte Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D1","text":"Die Quantität kann Quantum werden, ohne in eine durch ihre Grenze erschöpfte Bestimmung überzugehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A1","CH_GB18_A_12:A2","CH_GB18_A_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D2","text":"Diskretion und Kontinuität bilden keine voneinander unabhängigen Bestimmungen, sondern zwei ineinander aufgehobene Momente der Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D3","text":"Die Kontinuität des Eins muss nicht vermittelt von außen hinzutreten, weil das Eins selbst in seine Idealität übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A7","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D4","text":"Der atomistische Fehler besteht nicht in der Anerkennung von Diskretion, sondern in ihrer Verselbständigung gegenüber der Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A8","CH_GB18_A_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D5","text":"Die mathematische Darstellung diskreter Bestandteile bleibt zulässig, sofern sie als momentane Vorstellung und nicht als ontologischer Grund verstanden wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D6","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Vorstellung und Begriff erklärt, warum Quantität imaginativ endlich und teilbar, intellektuell jedoch unendlich und unteilbar erscheinen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A11","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D7","text":"Raum und Zeit sind keine Aggregate, sondern Prozesse einer fortwährenden Hervorbringung ihrer eigenen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D8","text":"Materie besitzt gegenüber der Quantität nur den Unterschied äußerlicher Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A12","CH_GB18_A_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D9","text":"Das Ich verbindet absolute Andersheit mit ununterbrochener Allgemeinheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D10","text":"Die Einheit der Vielen ist keine zusätzliche Bestimmung neben ihrer Gleichheit als Viele.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD1","text":"Kontinuität und Diskretion werden als gegenseitig vorausgesetzte Momente einer einzigen quantitativen Struktur totalisiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD2","text":"Die Kritik des Atomismus ist zugleich eine Kritik der Vorstellung, weil dieselbe Äußerlichkeit sowohl die diskreten Einheiten als auch ihre Zusammensetzung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A9","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD3","text":"Mathematik und Begriff fallen darin zusammen, dass diskrete Bestimmungen nur als aufgehobene Momente eines Kontinuums gelten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD4","text":"Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich werden auf eine gemeinsame Logik selbstproduzierender Kontinuität zurückgeführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD5","text":"Die quantitative Einheit ist weder bloß objektive Ausdehnung noch bloß subjektive Allgemeinheit, sondern verbindet äußerliches Anderssein mit innerem Beisichseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD6","text":"Die Bestimmung der Vielheit als Einheit beseitigt den Gegensatz zwischen Vielheit und Einheit, indem sie die Gleichheit der Vielen als ihre einfache Kontinuität liest.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie unabhängiger, in sich abgeschlossener Atome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, die erst nachträglich zwischen diskreten Einheiten und Kontinuität hergestellt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Endlichkeit und Teilbarkeit als letzte begriffliche Wahrheit der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Kontinuum, dessen Einheit nur durch Addition äußerlicher Bestandteile entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Vorstellung eines stabilen Eins, das nicht bereits in Idealität und Attraktion übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Außeninstanz, in die das quantitative Außersichgehen von Raum und Zeit notwendig übergehen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Ich, dessen Mannigfaltigkeit die Kontinuität der Allgemeinheit zerreißt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX8","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine zusätzliche Repräsentation, die die Einheit der Vielen unabhängig von ihrem Begriff sichern soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX1","text":"Das System lässt keinen letzten Außenpunkt zu, von dem aus Kontinuität und Diskretion äußerlich verbunden werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX2","text":"Es lässt keine ursprüngliche Grenze zu, die Quantität endgültig auf ein begrenztes Quantum festlegen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX3","text":"Es lässt kein isoliertes Eins zu, das vor oder außerhalb der Kontinuität bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX4","text":"Es lässt keine eigenständige qualitative Welt hinter den quantitativen Formen von Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX5","text":"Es lässt keine endgültige Identität zu, die von der Bewegung des Anderswerdens, der Aufhebung und der Wiedererzeugung unberührt bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX6","text":"Es lässt keine bloße Vorstellung zu, die als ausreichender Träger der Einheit der Vielheit fungieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS1","text":"Unbegrenzte Quantität → Auftreten von Grenze und Quantum → Grenze als aufgehobenes Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A1","CH_GB18_A_12:A2","CH_GB18_A_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS2","text":"Quantität → reale Möglichkeit des Eins → Eins als kontinuierliche Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS3","text":"Eins → Attraktion und Idealität → Kontinuität als innere Wesensbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A7","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS4","text":"Veräußerlichte Kontinuität → atomistische Zusammensetzung → Ausschluss durch mathematische und begriffliche Aufhebung der diskreten Grundteile.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A9","CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS5","text":"Begriffliche Quantität → selbstproduzierendes Außersichgehen → Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich als differenzierte Erscheinungsweisen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A12","CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS6","text":"Gleichheit der Vielen → einfache Kontinuität → Einheit ohne äußerliche Repräsentation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF1","text":"Reine Quantität und Quantum → Problem der Grenze → Grenze als aufgehobene Beschränkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF2","text":"Diskretion und Eins → Übergang in Attraktion und Idealität → Kontinuität als innere Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF3","text":"Atomistische Außenbeziehung → mathematische Zurückweisung diskreter Grundbestandteile → Aufhebung der Diskretion im Kontinuum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF4","text":"Begriff der Quantität → Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich → gemeinsame Struktur des selbstproduzierenden Außersichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF5","text":"Vielheit als Viele → Gleichheit jedes Vielen mit jedem anderen → einfache Einheit ohne zusätzliche Vorstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME1","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer äußeren Schranke zu einem aufgehobenen Moment der Quantität umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Kontinuität und Diskretion wird in eine Binnenrelation zweier Momente derselben Struktur umgewandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME3","text":"Das Kontinuum wird nicht mehr als Summe, sondern als selbstproduzierende Einheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME4","text":"Atomistische Einheiten werden von Grundbestandteilen zu vorläufigen oder momentanen Vorstellungen herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME5","text":"Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich werden nicht als getrennte Gegenstandsbereiche, sondern als Varianten quantitativer Kontinuität klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME6","text":"Die Vielheit wird nicht länger als Gegenbegriff zur Einheit kartiert, sondern als deren quantitative Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME7","text":"Vorstellung und Begriff werden als verschiedene Zugangsweisen mit gegensätzlichen ontologischen Ergebnissen unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die Bestimmung reiner Quantität gegenüber Quantum, Grenze, Eins und Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die innere Vermittlung von Diskretion und Kontinuität durch Attraktion, Idealität und Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument verschiebt die Erklärung von äußerer Zusammensetzung zu immanenter Selbstproduktion und entzieht dadurch dem Atomismus seine begriffliche Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität erscheint als kontinuierliches Außersichkommen, dessen Einheit sich in der Erzeugung und Aufhebung von Eins, Jetzt und Vielheit erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von reiner Quantität über die Kritik des Atomismus bis zur Einheit der Vielheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue begriffliche Vermittlung zwischen reiner Quantität und dem Quantum, dessen Grenze zugleich gesetzt und aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der Annahme, dass Diskretion nur als Moment der Kontinuität auftreten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT4","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Zurückweisung des Eins als isolierter Einheit und der fortwährenden Erzeugung von Eins beziehungsweise Jetzt in Raum und Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Ich als absolute Repulsion bestimmt wird, ohne seine einfache Kontinuität preiszugeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT6","text":"Die Ableitung von Raum, Zeit, Materie und Ich aus der reinen Quantität bleibt stärker behauptet als formal entfaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Aufhebung als zentrale Vermittlungsoperation und nicht als bloße Negation verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111538800847Z_3bc611de","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 1.","source_sha256":"6c06723771b6d621ccc980aa52cde129869858173d3e0353f5dc7b1def62c84f","sha256":"ec2dce205c5edcf9856f8cb94f1ebfa511705cc9301c079fbf4ef0d8b73d5922","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:15:38.802727+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS1","text":"The argument resolves the problem of determining pure quantity in distinction from quantum, limit, and atomistic composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS2","text":"Pure quantity is determined as unbounded continuity, in which discreteness exists only as a sublated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS3","text":"The basis of this redetermination is that the One itself passes over into attraction and ideality, and continuity therefore belongs to its essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS4","text":"The atomistic conception is diagnosed as the externalization of continuity and refuted by the mathematical rejection of discrete basic constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS5","text":"Space, time, matter, and I are developed as different modes of existence of the same self-producing quantitative continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AS6","text":"The movement culminates in the determination of multiplicity as simple unity, without requiring an external representation of its unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A1","text":"Pure quantity is at first neither limited nor quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A2","text":"When quantity becomes quantum, the limit does not restrict its proper essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A3","text":"The limit is contained in quantity as sublated being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A4","text":"Discreteness is a moment of pure quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A5","text":"Quantity is everywhere the real possibility of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A6","text":"The One is only as continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A7","text":"The One passes over in and for itself into attraction and ideality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A8","text":"Continuity is not external to the One, but grounded in its essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A9","text":"Atomism rests on the externality of continuity in relation to the Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A10","text":"Mathematics rejects discontinuous Ones as constitutive components of time, space, and line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A11","text":"Discrete mathematical representations are valid only momentarily and are sublated in the infinite multiplicity of a bounded continuum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A12","text":"The Spinoza distinction cited in the text determines represented quantity as finite, divisible, and composite, whereas quantity comprehended intellectually is infinite and indivisible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A13","text":"Space and time are multiplicities of going-outside-themselves that continually produce their own unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A14","text":"Matter is the pure quantitative determination in external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A15","text":"As absolute becoming-other and all-sided repulsion, the I is negative freedom amid persisting simple continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:A16","text":"Multiplicity, as such, is simple unity, because every many is the same as every other many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX1","text":"Pure quantity is not identical with an originally limited quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX2","text":"The limit is not an unsubated restriction of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX3","text":"Continuity is not an external relation of already finished Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX4","text":"The One is not an absolutely brittle and exclusive atom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX5","text":"Space, time, and line do not consist of ultimate points or discontinuous Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX6","text":"The infinite multiplicity of discrete components does not form a continuum through mere external addition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX7","text":"Pure quantity is not merely represented finite, divisible, and part-composed magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX8","text":"Space and time do not pass over into quality or into an isolated One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX9","text":"Matter is not separated from quantity by a further conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX10","text":"The manifold limits of sensation and intuition do not interrupt the continuity of the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:NX11","text":"The unity of multiplicity requires no external or pictorial representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D1","text":"Quantity can become quantum without passing into a determination exhausted by its limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A1","CH_GB18_A_12:A2","CH_GB18_A_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D2","text":"Discreteness and continuity do not constitute determinations independent of one another, but two moments of quantity sublated into one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D3","text":"The continuity of the One need not be mediatedly added from outside, because the One itself passes over into its ideality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A7","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D4","text":"The atomistic error consists not in the recognition of discreteness, but in its autonomization in relation to continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A8","CH_GB18_A_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D5","text":"The mathematical representation of discrete components remains permissible insofar as it is understood as a momentary representation and not as an ontological ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D6","text":"The distinction between representation and Concept explains why quantity can appear imaginatively finite and divisible, but intellectually infinite and indivisible.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A11","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D7","text":"Space and time are not aggregates, but processes of a continual production of their own unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D8","text":"Matter possesses, in relation to quantity, only the difference of external existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A12","CH_GB18_A_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D9","text":"The I unites absolute otherness with uninterrupted universality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:D10","text":"The unity of the many is not an additional determination alongside their equality as many.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD1","text":"Continuity and discreteness are totalized as mutually presupposing moments of a single quantitative structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD2","text":"The critique of atomism is at the same time a critique of representation, because the same externality produces both the discrete units and their composition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A9","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD3","text":"Mathematics and Concept coincide in holding that discrete determinations count only as sublated moments of a continuum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11","CH_GB18_A_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD4","text":"Space, time, matter, and I are reduced to a common logic of self-producing continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD5","text":"Quantitative unity is neither merely objective extension nor merely subjective universality, but unites external being-other with inner being-with-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SD6","text":"The determination of multiplicity as unity abolishes the opposition between multiplicity and unity by reading the equality of the many as their simple continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of independent atoms self-enclosed within themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a mediation established only subsequently between discrete units and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX3","text":"Excluded are finitude and divisibility as the final conceptual truth of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a continuum whose unity arises only through the addition of external components.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the representation of a stable One that does not already pass over into ideality and attraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a qualitative external instance into which the quantitative going-outside-itself of space and time would necessarily have to pass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX7","text":"Excluded is an I whose manifoldness tears apart the continuity of universality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:DNX8","text":"Excluded is an additional representation intended to secure the unity of the many independently of their Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX1","text":"The system permits no final external point from which continuity and discreteness could be externally combined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX2","text":"It permits no original limit that could definitively fix quantity as a limited quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX3","text":"It permits no isolated One that could exist prior to or outside continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX4","text":"It permits no independent qualitative world behind the quantitative forms of space, time, matter, and I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX5","text":"It permits no final identity that would remain untouched by the movement of becoming-other, sublation, and reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:SNX6","text":"It permits no mere representation that could function as a sufficient bearer of the unity of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS1","text":"Unbounded quantity → emergence of limit and quantum → limit as sublated moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A1","CH_GB18_A_12:A2","CH_GB18_A_12:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS2","text":"Quantity → real possibility of the One → One as continuous determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A4","CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS3","text":"One → attraction and ideality → continuity as inner essential determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A7","CH_GB18_A_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS4","text":"Externalized continuity → atomistic composition → exclusion through the mathematical and conceptual sublation of discrete basic parts.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A9","CH_GB18_A_12:A10","CH_GB18_A_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS5","text":"Conceptual quantity → self-producing going-outside-itself → space, time, matter, and I as differentiated modes of appearance.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A12","CH_GB18_A_12:A13","CH_GB18_A_12:A14","CH_GB18_A_12:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:FGS6","text":"Equality of the many → simple continuity → unity without external representation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_12:A5","CH_GB18_A_12:A6","CH_GB18_A_12:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF1","text":"Pure quantity and quantum → problem of the limit → limit as sublated restriction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF2","text":"Discreteness and One → transition into attraction and ideality → continuity as inner determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF3","text":"Atomistic external relation → mathematical rejection of discrete basic constituents → sublation of discreteness in the continuum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF4","text":"Concept of quantity → space, time, matter, and I → common structure of self-producing being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:AF5","text":"Multiplicity as many → equality of every many with every other → simple unity without additional representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME1","text":"The limit is remapped from an external barrier into a sublated moment of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME2","text":"The opposition of continuity and discreteness is transformed into an internal relation of two moments of the same structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME3","text":"The continuum is no longer visible as a sum, but as self-producing unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME4","text":"Atomistic units are demoted from basic constituents to provisional or momentary representations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME5","text":"Space, time, matter, and I are classified not as separate domains of objects, but as variants of quantitative continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME6","text":"Multiplicity is no longer mapped as the counter-concept to unity, but as its quantitative form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ME7","text":"Representation and Concept are distinguished as different modes of access with opposed ontological results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the determination of pure quantity in relation to quantum, limit, One, and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is the inner mediation of discreteness and continuity through attraction, ideality, and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument shifts explanation from external composition to immanent self-production and thereby deprives atomism of its conceptual foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears as continuous coming-outside-itself, whose unity maintains itself in the production and sublation of One, Now, and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from pure quantity through the critique of atomism to the unity of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise conceptual mediation between pure quantity and quantum, whose limit is at once posited and sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on the assumption that discreteness can occur only as a moment of continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT4","text":"A tension remains between the rejection of the One as an isolated unit and the continual production of One, respectively Now, in space and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT5","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the I is determined as absolute repulsion without relinquishing its simple continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT6","text":"The derivation of space, time, matter, and I from pure quantity remains more asserted than formally unfolded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_12:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, insofar as sublation is understood as the central operation of mediation and not as mere negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_12:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 56","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 56","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":57,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_13"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_13@R001","sha256":"7d9fedb6c18a97738bcb4acb0fdcdb110e4c5e5c076dc0b816bbb5cb75edd15b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS1","text":"Der zu lösende Widerstreit der unendlichen Theilbarkeit entsteht aus den notwendigen, aber einseitig getrennten Momenten der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS2","text":"Die wahrhafte Auflösung besteht nicht in der Entscheidung für Atomismus oder unendliche Theilbarkeit, sondern in der Aufhebung beider isolierten Bestimmungen in der Einheit ihres Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS3","text":"Die Argumentation arbeitet als immanente Kritik: Sie reduziert die kantischen Beweise auf ihre verborgenen Voraussetzungen und prüft diese gegen die Begriffe von Kontinuität, Diskretion und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der kosmologischen Antinomie über die Reinigung der abstrakten Denkbestimmungen zur Entlarvung beider Beweisgänge und zur dialektischen Einheit der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS5","text":"Aristoteles fungiert als Gegenmodell, weil er unendliche Theilbarkeit als Möglichkeit und Moment des Konkreten bestimmt, während die kantische Auflösung den Begriff der Antinomie unerreicht läßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A1","text":"Quantität ist die einfache Einheit von Diskretion und Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A2","text":"Die Antinomie entsteht notwendig, weil Diskretion und Kontinuität beide behauptet werden müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A3","text":"Entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen haben isoliert keine Wahrheit, sondern nur aufgehoben in der Einheit ihres Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A4","text":"Kontinuität enthält die Möglichkeit des Theilens und damit das Moment des Atoms; Diskretion enthält durch die Gleichheit der Eins die Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A5","text":"Die Antinomie gründet in reinen Denkbestimmungen und nicht in den kosmologischen Materialien von Welt, Raum, Zeit oder Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A6","text":"Jeder Begriff ist als Einheit entgegengesetzter Momente antinomisch oder dialektisch bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A7","text":"Der kantische Beweis der Thesis setzt die Zufälligkeit und Äußerlichkeit der Zusammensetzung voraus, obwohl diese Voraussetzung erst das zu Beweisende ermöglichen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A8","text":"Der kantische Beweis der Antithesis setzt die Kontinuität des Raumes voraus und verwechselt diese mit Zusammensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A9","text":"Die transscendentale Idealität löst den Widerstreit nicht, weil sie ihn lediglich zu einem subjektiven Schein macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A10","text":"Unendliche Theilbarkeit und unendliche Vielheit existieren in der Kontinuität nur als Möglichkeit und aufgehobenes Moment, nicht als aktual vorhandene Menge von Theilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX1","text":"Die Antinomie ist keine sophistische Künstelei und kein bloß künstlich erzeugter Streit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX2","text":"Die Antinomie ist nicht auf die vier kantischen kosmologischen Fälle beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX3","text":"Welt, Raum, Zeit und Materie sind nicht die eigentlichen Träger der Antinomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX4","text":"Weder das absolute Atom noch die reine unendliche Theilbarkeit besitzt isolierte Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX5","text":"Die subjektive Verlegung des Widerspruchs in Erscheinung und Wahrnehmung ist keine begriffliche Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX6","text":"Die Kontinuität des Raumes ist nicht als Zusammensetzung aus vorgegebenen Bestandtheilen zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX7","text":"Unendliche Theilbarkeit bedeutet nicht das wirkliche Dasein unendlich vieler Theile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D1","text":"Die einseitige Diskretion erzeugt absolutes Getheiltseyn und das Atom als Princip, während die einseitige Kontinuität unendliche Theilbarkeit erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D2","text":"Die Gegensätze widerlegen sich nicht äußerlich, sondern gehen aus ihrer eigenen Bestimmung ineinander über.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A3","CH_GB18_A_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D3","text":"Die kantische Vierzahl der Antinomien besitzt keine systematische Vollständigkeit, weil jede begriffliche Bestimmung antinomisch artikulierbar ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D4","text":"Die Thesis über einfache Theile ist, sofern Zusammensetzung bereits als äußerlich und zufällig vorausgesetzt wird, tautologisch statt bewiesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D5","text":"Die Antithesis gegen einfache Theile scheitert, weil sie aus räumlicher Ausgedehntheit unmittelbar Zusammensetzung folgert und damit Kontinuität in Zusammensetzung umdeutet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D6","text":"Eine Lösung, die den Widerstreit subjektiviert, bleibt unterhalb der begrifflichen Ebene, auf der die Antinomie erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D7","text":"Das Konkrete ist weder abstrakte Vielheit noch abstrakte Kontinuität, sondern deren reale Einheit in Raum, Zeit, Bewegung und Materie.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D8","text":"Die apagogischen Beweisformen verdecken, daß ihre Ergebnisse bereits als assertorische Voraussetzungen in den Beweisen enthalten sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7","CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD1","text":"Atomismus und unendliche Theilbarkeit werden von konkurrierenden ontologischen Lehren zu wechselseitig abhängigen Abstraktionen eines einzigen Quantitätsbegriffs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A3","CH_GB18_A_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD2","text":"Die Antinomie wird von einem kosmologischen Problem zu einer allgemeinen Form immanenter Begriffsbewegung umkartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD3","text":"Beweisgültigkeit hängt hier nicht von formaler Beweisgestalt ab, sondern davon, ob die Voraussetzungen aus dem Begriff hervorgehen, statt das Ergebnis vorauszusetzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7","CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD4","text":"Die Kritik bewahrt den antimetaphysischen Ertrag der kantischen Antinomien, verwirft jedoch deren subjektivistische Begrenzung der Vernunft auf endliche Kategorien.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A6","CH_GB18_A_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, daß kein letztes Einfaches als absolut selbstständiger Grund der Zusammensetzung bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt voraus, daß kein reines Kontinuum ohne das Moment diskreter Theilbarkeit gedacht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, daß ein empirischer oder kosmologischer Gegenstand die begriffliche Antinomie entscheiden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, daß Widerspruch bloß als subjektiver Mangel des Erkennens gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, daß endliche Kategorien die gesamte Reichweite des Denkens erschöpfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt aus, daß abstrakte Möglichkeit als aktuale Realität behandelt werden darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX1","text":"Es gibt keinen äußeren Standort, von dem aus die Antinomie durch Wahrnehmung, Anschauung oder Subjektivierung endgültig neutralisiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX2","text":"Es gibt keine aktual existierende unendliche Menge von Theilen, die der Begriff der Theilbarkeit bloß vorfindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX3","text":"Es gibt keine feste Bestimmung, deren Wahrheit ohne ihr Übergehen in ihr Gegenteil bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS1","text":"Quantität = Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS2","text":"Isolierung der Diskretion → absolutes Getheiltseyn → Atom als Princip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS3","text":"Isolierung der Kontinuität → unendliche Theilbarkeit → abstrakte Vielheit als Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS4","text":"Kosmologische Einkleidung entfernen → reine Denkbestimmungen freilegen → Antinomie als Quantitätsstruktur bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS5","text":"Kantische Beweisform analysieren → verdeckte Voraussetzungen von Äußerlichkeit oder Kontinuität freilegen → Schein der Deduktion auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS6","text":"Immanente Gegenwärtigkeit des Anderen in jeder Seite → Aufhebung der einseitigen Geltung → Wahrheit als Einheit der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AF1","text":"Kosmologische Antinomie → Reduktion auf Quantität → Trennung von Kontinuität und Diskretion → Entlarvung der kantischen Beweisvoraussetzungen → Nachweis des wechselseitigen Enthaltenseins → Aufhebung in der Einheit der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AF2","text":"Kantische Scheinauflösung → subjektive Verlegung des Widerstreits → Rückkehr zur Begriffsstruktur → aristotelische Bestimmung der Möglichkeit → Konkretion von Raum, Zeit, Bewegung und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME1","text":"Antinomien werden von vier kosmologischen Sonderfällen zu einer allgemeinen Struktur jedes Begriffs umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME2","text":"Atom und unendliche Theilbarkeit erscheinen nicht mehr als ausschließende Weltbilder, sondern als abstrahierte Momente derselben Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME3","text":"Raum, Zeit und Materie verlieren den Status letzter Antinomieträger und werden zu austauschbaren konkreten Trägern reiner Denkbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME4","text":"Die kantischen Beweise werden von rationalen Ableitungen zu rhetorisch verdeckten assertorischen Setzungen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME5","text":"Die Grenze zwischen objektiver Begriffsbewegung und subjektiver Erscheinungslehre wird zugunsten einer immanenten Dialektik verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die zweite kantische Antinomie über einfache Theile und unendliche Theilbarkeit der Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die Einheit und gegenseitige Immanenz von Kontinuität und Diskretion als Momente der Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik ersetzt apagogische Beweisrhetorik durch die Prüfung, ob das Ergebnis als Voraussetzung bereits eingeschmuggelt wurde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Raum und Zeit sind konkrete Einheiten abstrakter Momente; Bewegung und Materie bilden eine weitere Ebene des Wirklichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Reduktion der Antinomie auf Quantität, die Kritik der kantischen Beweise und die dialektische Auflösung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT2","text":"Die positive Bestimmung der Einheit der Quantität bleibt unterbestimmt, weil sie zugleich Ausgangsbestimmung und Resultat der Analyse ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT3","text":"Die Verallgemeinerung von der Quantität auf jeden Begriff wird gesetzt, aber innerhalb der Anmerkung nicht selbst systematisch abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT4","text":"Die Kritik der Thesis legt die Unbewiesenheit der Zufälligkeit der Zusammensetzung offen, bestimmt jedoch nicht unabhängig den positiven Status von Substanz und Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT5","text":"Die aristotelische Möglichkeitsthese wird als adäquate Lösung eingesetzt, ohne daß ihr Übergang aus der vorangehenden Kritik formal vollständig ausgeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT6","text":"Die größte argumentative Tragfähigkeit liegt im symmetrischen Nachweis, daß jede isolierte Seite ihr Gegenteil bereits enthält und darum keine unabhängige Wahrheit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn die Aufhebung als immanente Begriffsoperation und nicht als empirische, subjektive oder formallogische Entscheidung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111600610735Z_ebd33139","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 2.","source_sha256":"7d9fedb6c18a97738bcb4acb0fdcdb110e4c5e5c076dc0b816bbb5cb75edd15b","sha256":"867abf9cf39240b7d21f0ffbae0edfe5935bacfde7b9df7422b32cce63e32302","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:16:00.612659+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS1","text":"The conflict to be resolved concerning infinite divisibility arises from the necessary, yet one-sidedly separated moments of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS2","text":"The genuine resolution consists not in deciding in favor of atomism or infinite divisibility, but in the sublation of both isolated determinations in the unity of their concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds as immanent critique: it reduces the Kantian proofs to their hidden presuppositions and tests these against the concepts of continuity, discreteness, and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from the cosmological antinomy, through the purification of abstract determinations of thought, to the exposure of both lines of proof and to the dialectical unity of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AS5","text":"Aristotle serves as a countermodel because he determines infinite divisibility as possibility and as a moment of the concrete, whereas the Kantian resolution leaves the concept of antinomy unattained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A1","text":"Quantity is the simple unity of discreteness and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A2","text":"The antinomy necessarily arises because discreteness and continuity must both be asserted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A3","text":"Opposed determinations have no truth in isolation, but only as sublated in the unity of their concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A4","text":"Continuity contains the possibility of dividing and thereby the moment of the atom; discreteness contains continuity through the equality of the ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A5","text":"The antinomy is grounded in pure determinations of thought and not in the cosmological materials of world, space, time, or matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A6","text":"Every concept, as unity of opposed moments, is determinable as antinomic or dialectical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A7","text":"The Kantian proof of the thesis presupposes the contingency and externality of composition, although this presupposition is first supposed to make possible what is to be proved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A8","text":"The Kantian proof of the antithesis presupposes the continuity of space and confuses it with composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A9","text":"Transcendental ideality does not resolve the conflict, because it merely makes it into a subjective semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:A10","text":"Infinite divisibility and infinite multiplicity exist in continuity only as possibility and sublated moment, not as an actually present multitude of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX1","text":"The antinomy is no sophistical contrivance and no merely artificially produced dispute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX2","text":"The antinomy is not restricted to the four Kantian cosmological cases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX3","text":"World, space, time, and matter are not the proper bearers of the antinomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX4","text":"Neither the absolute atom nor pure infinite divisibility possesses isolated truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX5","text":"The subjective displacement of contradiction into appearance and perception is no conceptual resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX6","text":"The continuity of space is not to be understood as composition from pregiven constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:NX7","text":"Infinite divisibility does not mean the actual existence of infinitely many parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D1","text":"One-sided discreteness produces absolute dividedness and the atom as principle, whereas one-sided continuity produces infinite divisibility.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D2","text":"The opposites do not refute one another externally, but pass over into one another from their own determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A3","CH_GB18_A_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D3","text":"The Kantian fourfold division of antinomies possesses no systematic completeness, because every conceptual determination can be articulated antinomically.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D4","text":"The thesis concerning simple parts is, insofar as composition is already presupposed as external and contingent, tautological rather than proved.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D5","text":"The antithesis against simple parts fails because it infers composition immediately from spatial extension and thereby reinterprets continuity as composition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D6","text":"A solution that subjectivizes the conflict remains below the conceptual level at which the antinomy is generated.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D7","text":"The concrete is neither abstract multiplicity nor abstract continuity, but their real unity in space, time, motion, and matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:D8","text":"The apagogical forms of proof conceal that their results are already contained in the proofs as assertoric presuppositions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7","CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD1","text":"Atomism and infinite divisibility are transformed from competing ontological doctrines into mutually dependent abstractions of a single concept of quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A1","CH_GB18_A_13:A3","CH_GB18_A_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD2","text":"The antinomy is remapped from a cosmological problem into a general form of immanent conceptual movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A5","CH_GB18_A_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD3","text":"The validity of proof here depends not on formal demonstrative shape, but on whether the presuppositions proceed from the concept rather than presupposing the result.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A7","CH_GB18_A_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SD4","text":"The critique preserves the anti-metaphysical yield of the Kantian antinomies, yet rejects their subjectivistic limitation of reason to finite categories.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_13:A6","CH_GB18_A_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that no ultimate simple can subsist as the absolutely self-sufficient ground of composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes that no pure continuum can be thought without the moment of discrete divisibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that an empirical or cosmological object could decide the conceptual antinomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility that contradiction can count merely as a subjective deficiency of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that finite categories exhaust the entire scope of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:DNX6","text":"The system excludes the possibility that abstract possibility may be treated as actual reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX1","text":"There is no external standpoint from which the antinomy could be definitively neutralized through perception, intuition, or subjectivization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX2","text":"There is no actually existing infinite multitude of parts that the concept of divisibility merely finds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:SNX3","text":"There is no fixed determination whose truth remains without its passing over into its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS1","text":"Quantity = unity of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS2","text":"Isolation of discreteness → absolute dividedness → atom as principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS3","text":"Isolation of continuity → infinite divisibility → abstract multiplicity as possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS4","text":"Remove cosmological garb → lay bare pure determinations of thought → determine antinomy as a structure of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS5","text":"Analyze Kantian form of proof → lay bare concealed presuppositions of externality or continuity → dissolve the semblance of deduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:FGS6","text":"Immanent presence of the other in each side → sublation of one-sided validity → truth as unity of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AF1","text":"Cosmological antinomy → reduction to quantity → separation of continuity and discreteness → exposure of the Kantian presuppositions of proof → demonstration of mutual containment → sublation in the unity of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:AF2","text":"Kantian apparent resolution → subjective displacement of the conflict → return to the structure of the concept → Aristotelian determination of possibility → concretization of space, time, motion, and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME1","text":"Antinomies are reclassified from four cosmological special cases into a general structure of every concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME2","text":"Atom and infinite divisibility no longer appear as mutually exclusive worldviews, but as abstracted moments of the same quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME3","text":"Space, time, and matter lose the status of ultimate bearers of antinomy and become interchangeable concrete bearers of pure determinations of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME4","text":"The Kantian proofs are remapped from rational derivations into rhetorically concealed assertoric positings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ME5","text":"The boundary between objective conceptual movement and subjective doctrine of appearance is shifted in favor of an immanent dialectic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the second Kantian antinomy concerning simple parts and the infinite divisibility of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is the unity and mutual immanence of continuity and discreteness as moments of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique replaces apagogical proof-rhetoric with the examination of whether the result has already been smuggled in as a presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Space and time are concrete unities of abstract moments; motion and matter form a further level of the real.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reduction of the antinomy to quantity, the critique of the Kantian proofs, and the dialectical resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT2","text":"The positive determination of the unity of quantity remains underdetermined because it is at once the initial determination and the result of the analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT3","text":"The generalization from quantity to every concept is posited, but is not itself systematically derived within the remark.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT4","text":"The critique of the thesis lays bare the unproved character of the contingency of composition, but does not independently determine the positive status of substance and simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT5","text":"The Aristotelian thesis of possibility is deployed as an adequate solution without its transition from the preceding critique being formally carried out in full.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT6","text":"The greatest argumentative force lies in the symmetrical demonstration that each isolated side already contains its opposite and therefore possesses no independent truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_13:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text only if sublation is treated as an immanent operation of the concept and not as an empirical, subjective, or formally logical decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_13:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_13@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_13:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 57","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 57","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD","layer":"CH","title":"B. Continuous and Discrete Magnitude.","order":58,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BKUD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BKUD@R001","sha256":"347d9dbf5e49e1f56731290a266d0db4d53dff1971c125429ba7db72a378b1cd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS1","text":"Quantität ist als Einheit der unterschiedenen Momente von Kontinuität und Diskretion zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS2","text":"Die unmittelbare Setzung der Quantität erscheint zunächst als kontinuierliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS3","text":"Die Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit führt zur immanenten Bestimmung des Eins und damit zur diskreten Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS4","text":"Diskretion bleibt als Diskretion der Quantität kontinuierlich, weil ihre Eins dieselbe Einheit haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS5","text":"Kontinuität und Diskretion sind daher keine isolierten Gegensätze, sondern wechselseitig enthaltene Formen derselben Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS6","text":"Die Unterscheidung wird von äußerer Gattungseinteilung auf die interne Setzungsweise der Momente verschoben; beide Formen sind noch keine Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","text":"Die Quantität enthält Kontinuität und Diskretion als ihre beiden Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","text":"Die Quantität ist konkrete Einheit nur als Einheit unterschiedener Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","text":"Die unterschiedenen Momente bleiben jeweils in ihrer Einheit mit dem anderen Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A4","text":"Ein Moment der Quantität kann, insofern es Moment des Ganzen ist, selbst als ganze Quantität gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A5","text":"Die unmittelbare Quantität ist zunächst als kontinuierliche Größe gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist eine Bestimmtheit, deren Aufgehobensein zur Quantität selbst gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","text":"Die Quantität ist in ihrer immanenten Bestimmtheit des Eins zu setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","text":"Die Quantität ist an sich Außereinandersein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","text":"Die kontinuierliche Größe ist Außereinandersein als sich ohne Negation fortsetzender, in sich gleicher Zusammenhang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist Außereinandersein als unterbrochenes Außereinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A11","text":"Weil die diskrete Größe Quantität ist, ist ihre Diskretion selbst kontinuierlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","text":"Die Kontinuität der Diskretion besteht darin, dass die Eins einander gleich sind und dieselbe Einheit haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A13","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist das Außereinander vieler Eins als vieler einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","text":"Jede der beiden Größen enthält beide Momente; ihr Unterschied besteht darin, welches Moment gesetzt und welches nur an sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A15","text":"Die kontinuierliche Größe enthält das Prinzip des Eins als eigene Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe sind Formen der Quantität unter den Bestimmungen ihrer eigenen Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A17","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe sind noch keine Quanta, sondern die Quantität selbst in zwei Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX1","text":"Die Quantität ist nicht auf Kontinuität oder Diskretion als isoliertes Einzelmoment zu reduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX2","text":"Die unterschiedenen Momente sind nicht in Attraktion und Repulsion als getrennte Kräfte aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX3","text":"Die kontinuierliche Größe ist keine reine Kontinuität ohne Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX4","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist nicht die atomistische Menge von Atomen und Leere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX5","text":"Die vielen Eins sind nicht als voneinander unabhängige Eins zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX6","text":"Diskretion ist nicht die Aufhebung jeder Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX7","text":"Die kontinuierliche Größe ist nicht bloß ein äußerlich ununterbrochenes Nebeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX8","text":"Die Unterscheidung von kontinuierlicher und diskreter Größe ist keine äußerliche Gattungs- und Artenteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX9","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe sind noch nicht als bestimmte Quanta gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX10","text":"Die Quantität ist nicht als unvermittelte Unmittelbarkeit festzuhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D1","text":"Die erste unmittelbare Setzung der Quantität bestimmt sie als kontinuierliche Größe.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D2","text":"Die Kontinuität ist nicht nur ein Teilmoment, sondern als Moment der konkreten Einheit die ganze Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","CH_GB18_BKUD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D3","text":"Die Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit setzt die Quantität in der Bestimmung des Eins und erzeugt damit die diskrete Größe.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D4","text":"Die kontinuierliche Größe bestimmt das Außereinander als selbstgleichen Zusammenhang ohne Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D5","text":"Die diskrete Größe bestimmt das Außereinander als Unterbrechung, ohne die Einheit der Quantität zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","CH_GB18_BKUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D6","text":"Die Kontinuität der diskreten Größe liegt in der Gleichheit der Eins und nicht in einer atomlosen Leere zwischen ihnen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A11","CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","CH_GB18_BKUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D7","text":"In kontinuierlichen Größen kann das Eins überall gesetzt werden, weil es als immanentes Prinzip in ihnen enthalten ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D8","text":"Raum, Zeit und Materie erscheinen als kontinuierliche Größen, insofern ihr Außereinandersein als strömendes Außersichkommen ohne Übergang in ein qualitativ Anderes bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D9","text":"Die Differenz der beiden Größenformen wird durch die jeweils gesetzte Bestimmung und nicht durch eine äußerliche Einteilung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","CH_GB18_BKUD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D10","text":"Der gemeinsame Charakter als Größe besteht zunächst nur darin, eine Bestimmtheit der Quantität zu sein, nicht darin, bereits Quantum zu sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","CH_GB18_BKUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD1","text":"Die Quantität konstituiert sich als selbstunterscheidende Einheit, in der Kontinuität und Diskretion zugleich getrennt und untrennbar sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD2","text":"Die Negation erzeugt innerhalb der Quantität keine qualitative Andersheit, sondern eine andere Weise ihres Außereinanderseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","CH_GB18_BKUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD3","text":"Das Eins ist kein isoliertes Atom, sondern die einheitliche Bestimmung, durch die sowohl kontinuierliche Setzung als auch diskrete Vielheit möglich werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","CH_GB18_BKUD:A13","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD4","text":"Der Übergang von Kontinuität zu Diskretion ist eine immanente Selbstbestimmung der Quantität und keine äußerliche Klassifikation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A5","CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","CH_GB18_BKUD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD5","text":"Kontinuität und Diskretion sind nur als gegenseitig vermittelte Formen bestimmbar; jede reine Form wird durch das jeweils andere Moment begrenzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD6","text":"Die Bestimmung der Quantität bleibt vor der Ebene des messbaren oder bestimmten Quantum, weil ihre Formen noch keine äußerlich gesetzte Größe besitzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","CH_GB18_BKUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine ontologische Trennung der beiden Momente aus, in der Kontinuität und Diskretion unabhängig voneinander bestehen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein äußeres Prinzip aus, das der Quantität erst nachträglich Einheit, Teilung oder Individuation zuführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine reine Vielheit aus, deren Elemente keine gemeinsame Einheit besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine qualitative Heterogenität aus, durch die das kontinuierliche Außereinander in ein anderes Sein überginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die unmittelbare Gegebenheit als letzte Grundlage der Quantität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Vorstellung aus, dass das Quantum bereits vor der inneren Differenzierung von Kontinuität und Diskretion vorliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX7","text":"Es schließt eine Erklärung der kontinuierlichen Größe durch bloße Abwesenheit von Unterbrechung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines äußeren Grundes, der die Einheit der Quantität stiften könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX2","text":"Er behandelt reine Kontinuität und reine Diskretion als nicht verfügbare Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX3","text":"Er versperrt die Möglichkeit, das Eins und das Viele als voneinander unabhängige ontologische Prinzipien anzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX4","text":"Er lässt keinen Übergang der Quantität in ein qualitativ Anderes als konstitutiven Bewegungstyp zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX5","text":"Er hält die Bestimmung des Quantum als äußerlich fixierter Größe noch zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX6","text":"Die terminale Abwesenheit ist eine Quantität ohne außerhalb ihrer selbst liegende Einheit, Teilung oder Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS1","text":"Quantität → Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion → jedes Moment bleibt Moment des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS2","text":"Unmittelbare Setzung → Kontinuität als zuerst gesetzte Form → kontinuierliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit → immanente Bestimmung des Eins → Diskretion als diskrete Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS4","text":"Außereinandersein → Fortsetzung ohne Negation oder Unterbrechung → kontinuierliche beziehungsweise diskrete Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS5","text":"Diskretion der Eins → Gleichheit und gemeinsame Einheit → Kontinuität im Diskreten → Ausschluss des Atomismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS6","text":"Beide Formen enthalten beide Momente → Unterschied durch gesetzte und an-sich-seiende Bestimmung → interne statt äußerer Klassifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS7","text":"Interne Formenbestimmung → kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe als Quantität selbst → Zurückhaltung der Bestimmung zum Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF1","text":"Einheit der unterschiedenen Momente → unmittelbare Setzung der Kontinuität → kontinuierliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF2","text":"Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit → Eins als immanente Bestimmung → diskrete Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF3","text":"Unterbrechung des Außereinanderseins → Gleichheit der Eins → Kontinuität der Diskretion → nichtatomistische Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF4","text":"Gegenseitige Einhaltung beider Momente → interne Formenunterscheidung → kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe ohne äußere Gattungsteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF5","text":"Formen der Quantität → Bestimmtheit ohne Quantum → noch nicht äußerlich gemessene Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Kontinuität und Diskretion wird in eine Relation gegenseitig enthaltener Momente umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME2","text":"Die diskrete Vielheit wird von atomistischer Vereinzelung auf die gemeinsame Einheit gleicher Eins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME3","text":"Das Eins wird vom isolierten Element zum immanenten Organisationsprinzip der Quantität umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME4","text":"Kontinuität wird nicht mehr als bloße Abwesenheit von Unterbrechung, sondern als bestimmte Einheit des Außereinanderseins sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME5","text":"Die Unterscheidung von kontinuierlicher und diskreter Größe wird aus der äußeren Taxonomie in die innere Bewegungsform der Quantität verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME6","text":"Raum, Zeit und Materie werden als kontinuierliche Größen unter einer immanenten Möglichkeit des Eins sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME7","text":"Der Begriff der Größe wird von der bereits bestimmten Messgröße auf zwei vorquantitative Formen der Quantität zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Kontinuität und Diskretion werden als zwei Bestimmungen der Quantität entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmung einer Form entsteht daraus, welches Moment gesetzt und welches nur an sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Äußerliche Gegenüberstellungen, atomistische Modelle und Gattungseinteilungen werden durch eine immanente Rekonstruktion ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein der Quantität wird als Außereinandersein bestimmt, dessen Differenzierung ohne Übergang in qualitative Andersheit erfolgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der unmittelbaren Kontinuität über das Eins zur diskreten, in sich kontinuierlichen Vielheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die vermittelnde Herleitung, durch die das Aufgehobensein der Unmittelbarkeit notwendig in die Bestimmung des Eins übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist das System dort, wo jede Form beide Momente enthält und ihre Differenz über gesetzt und an sich erklärt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung der Kontinuität des Diskreten aus der gemeinsamen Einheit gleicher Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der Unterbrechung der diskreten Größe und ihrer gleichzeitigen Kontinuität bestehen; sie wird bestimmt, aber nicht weiter vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass jeder Moment als ganze Quantität gilt, obwohl die Unterscheidung der Momente erhalten bleiben muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von Aufhebung, immanenter Bestimmung und Übergang zum Eins ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT8","text":"Bei Erhaltung dieser Übergangsordnung bewahrt das System die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung: Einheit → Kontinuität → Eins → Diskretion → Kontinuität des Diskreten → vorquantitative Formen der Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113521711238Z_391e09fa","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Continuous and Discrete Magnitude.","source_sha256":"347d9dbf5e49e1f56731290a266d0db4d53dff1971c125429ba7db72a378b1cd","sha256":"a2f32075dabd3bdf06079f4da9f25b850ada4f5d864dad9b8b748ca1dd96651a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:35:21.712489+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS1","text":"Quantity is to be determined as the unity of the distinguished moments of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS2","text":"The immediate positing of quantity initially appears as continuous magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS3","text":"The sublation of immediacy leads to the immanent determination of the One and thereby to discrete magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS4","text":"Discreteness remains continuous as the discreteness of quantity because its Ones have the same unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS5","text":"Continuity and discreteness are therefore not isolated opposites, but mutually contained forms of the same quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AS6","text":"The distinction is shifted from external division into genera to the internal mode of positing of the moments; both forms are not yet quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","text":"Quantity contains continuity and discreteness as its two moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","text":"Quantity is concrete unity only as the unity of distinguished moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","text":"The distinguished moments each remain in their unity with the other moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A4","text":"A moment of quantity can, insofar as it is a moment of the whole, itself be posited as whole quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A5","text":"Immediate quantity is initially posited as continuous magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","text":"Immediacy is a determinacy whose being-sublated belongs to quantity itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","text":"Quantity is to be posited in its immanent determinacy of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","text":"Quantity is in itself being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","text":"Continuous magnitude is being-outside-itself as a self-identical connection continuing itself without negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","text":"Discrete magnitude is being-outside-itself as interrupted being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A11","text":"Because discrete magnitude is quantity, its discreteness itself is continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","text":"The continuity of discreteness consists in the Ones being equal to one another and having the same unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A13","text":"Discrete magnitude is the being-outside-itself of many Ones as many of one unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","text":"Each of the two magnitudes contains both moments; their difference consists in which moment is posited and which is only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A15","text":"Continuous magnitude contains the principle of the One as its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude are forms of quantity under the determinations of its own moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:A17","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude are not yet quanta, but quantity itself in two forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX1","text":"Quantity is not to be reduced to continuity or discreteness as an isolated individual moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX2","text":"The distinguished moments are not to be dissolved into attraction and repulsion as separate forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX3","text":"Continuous magnitude is not pure continuity without discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX4","text":"Discrete magnitude is not the atomistic aggregate of atoms and void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX5","text":"The many Ones are not to be determined as Ones independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX6","text":"Discreteness is not the sublation of all continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX7","text":"Continuous magnitude is not merely an externally uninterrupted juxtaposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX8","text":"The distinction between continuous and discrete magnitude is not an external division into genus and species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX9","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude are not yet given as determinate quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:NX10","text":"Quantity is not to be held fast as unmediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D1","text":"The first immediate positing of quantity determines it as continuous magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D2","text":"Continuity is not merely a partial moment, but, as a moment of concrete unity, the whole quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","CH_GB18_BKUD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D3","text":"The sublation of immediacy posits quantity in the determination of the One and thereby produces discrete magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D4","text":"Continuous magnitude determines being-outside-itself as a self-identical connection without negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D5","text":"Discrete magnitude determines being-outside-itself as interruption without losing the unity of quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","CH_GB18_BKUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D6","text":"The continuity of discrete magnitude lies in the equality of the Ones and not in an atomless void between them.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A11","CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","CH_GB18_BKUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D7","text":"In continuous magnitudes the One can be posited everywhere because it is contained in them as an immanent principle.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D8","text":"Space, time, and matter appear as continuous magnitudes insofar as their being-outside-itself is determined as a flowing coming-outside-itself without transition into a qualitatively other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A9","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D9","text":"The difference between the two forms of magnitude is produced by the determination respectively posited and not by an external division.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","CH_GB18_BKUD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:D10","text":"The common character as magnitude initially consists only in being a determinacy of quantity, not in already being quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","CH_GB18_BKUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD1","text":"Quantity constitutes itself as a self-distinguishing unity in which continuity and discreteness are at once separate and inseparable.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A2","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD2","text":"Negation produces within quantity no qualitative otherness, but another mode of its being-outside-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A8","CH_GB18_BKUD:A10","CH_GB18_BKUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD3","text":"The One is not an isolated atom, but the unified determination through which both continuous positing and discrete multiplicity become possible.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A7","CH_GB18_BKUD:A12","CH_GB18_BKUD:A13","CH_GB18_BKUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD4","text":"The transition from continuity to discreteness is an immanent self-determination of quantity and not an external classification.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A5","CH_GB18_BKUD:A6","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14","CH_GB18_BKUD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD5","text":"Continuity and discreteness are determinable only as mutually mediated forms; each pure form is limited by the respectively other moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A1","CH_GB18_BKUD:A3","CH_GB18_BKUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SD6","text":"The determination of quantity remains prior to the level of measurable or determinate quantum, because its forms do not yet possess an externally posited magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKUD:A16","CH_GB18_BKUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an ontological separation of the two moments in which continuity and discreteness could exist independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX2","text":"It excludes an external principle that only subsequently imparts unity, division, or individuation to quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX3","text":"It excludes a pure multiplicity whose elements possess no common unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX4","text":"It excludes a qualitative heterogeneity through which continuous being-outside-itself would pass over into another being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX5","text":"It excludes immediate givenness as the ultimate foundation of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX6","text":"It excludes the notion that quantum is already present before the inner differentiation of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:DNX7","text":"It excludes an explanation of continuous magnitude through the mere absence of interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of an external ground that could establish the unity of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX2","text":"It treats pure continuity and pure discreteness as unavailable determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX3","text":"It blocks the possibility of positing the One and the Many as ontological principles independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX4","text":"It permits no transition of quantity into a qualitatively other as a constitutive type of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX5","text":"It still holds back the determination of quantum as externally fixed magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:SNX6","text":"The terminal absence is a quantity without unity, division, or determination of measure lying outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS1","text":"Quantity → unity of continuity and discreteness → each moment remains a moment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS2","text":"Immediate positing → continuity as the form first posited → continuous magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS3","text":"Sublation of immediacy → immanent determination of the One → discreteness as discrete magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS4","text":"Being-outside-itself → continuation without negation or interruption → continuous or discrete form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS5","text":"Discreteness of the Ones → equality and common unity → continuity in the discrete → exclusion of atomism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS6","text":"Both forms contain both moments → difference through posited and in-itself determination → internal rather than external classification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:FGS7","text":"Internal determination of form → continuous and discrete magnitude as quantity itself → withholding of the determination as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF1","text":"Unity of the distinguished moments → immediate positing of continuity → continuous magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF2","text":"Sublation of immediacy → One as immanent determination → discrete magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF3","text":"Interruption of being-outside-itself → equality of the Ones → continuity of discreteness → non-atomistic multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF4","text":"Mutual containment of both moments → internal distinction of forms → continuous and discrete magnitude without external division into genera.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:AF5","text":"Forms of quantity → determinacy without quantum → magnitude not yet externally measured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME1","text":"The opposition of continuity and discreteness is remapped into a relation of mutually containing moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME2","text":"Discrete multiplicity is reclassified from atomistic isolation to the common unity of equal Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME3","text":"The One is redetermined from an isolated element into the immanent organizational principle of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME4","text":"Continuity is no longer visible as the mere absence of interruption, but as a determinate unity of being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME5","text":"The distinction between continuous and discrete magnitude is shifted from external taxonomy into the inner form of movement of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME6","text":"Space, time, and matter become visible as continuous magnitudes under an immanent possibility of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ME7","text":"The concept of magnitude is led back from already determinate measurable magnitude to two pre-quantitative forms of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Continuity and discreteness are developed as two determinations of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determination of a form arises from which moment is posited and which is only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — External oppositions, atomistic models, and divisions into genera are replaced by an immanent reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of quantity is determined as being-outside-itself, whose differentiation occurs without transition into qualitative otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from immediate continuity through the One to discrete multiplicity continuous within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the mediating derivation through which the being-sublated of immediacy necessarily passes into the determination of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent where each form contains both moments and its difference is explained through posited and in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT4","text":"The strongest point is the derivation of the continuity of the discrete from the common unity of equal Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between the interruption of discrete magnitude and its simultaneous continuity; it is determined, but not further mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that each moment counts as whole quantity, although the distinction of the moments must remain preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed equation of sublation, immanent determination, and transition to the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKUD:MRT8","text":"If this order of transition is preserved, the system retains the actual movement of the argument: unity → continuity → One → discreteness → continuity of the discrete → pre-quantitative forms of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BKUD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BKUD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 58","title":"B. Continuous and Discrete Magnitude.","context":"Chapter 58","original_title":"B. Kontinuirliche und diskrete Größe."},"original_title":"B. Kontinuirliche und diskrete Größe.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ","layer":"CH","title":"C. Limitation of Quantity.","order":59,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CBDQ"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CBDQ@R001","sha256":"cd25c9c15b6dec3017f26e8059ddcf685b5255046b45d7e7e9a343f6d316ad81","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die diskrete Größe aus dem Eins, der Vielheit und ihrer wesentlichen Kontinuität zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS2","text":"Die diskrete Vielheit wird als Einheit der aufgehobenen Einsen neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS3","text":"Ihre Bestimmtheit entsteht durch das Eins als ausschließende Grenze innerhalb eines Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS4","text":"Die Grenze wird als auf sich bezogener, umschließender Punkt gefasst, dessen begrenztes Sein zugleich Kontinuität und Überschreitung der Grenze ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung von kontinuierlicher und diskreter Größe wird in der Bestimmung beider als Quanta aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","text":"Die diskrete Größe hat das Eins zum Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A2","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist Vielheit der Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A3","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist wesentlich stetig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","text":"Die Vielheit der Eins ist eine Einheit aufgehobener Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist als ein Dasein und ein Etwas gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","text":"Das Eins bestimmt das Dasein der diskreten Größe als ausschließendes Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","text":"Das ausschließende Eins ist Grenze an der Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","text":"Die Grenze ist als Eins auf sich selbst bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9","text":"Die auf sich bezogene Grenze ist umschließend und befassend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","text":"Das durch die Grenze bestimmte Sein ist wesentlich Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11","text":"Die Kontinuität geht über die Grenze und das einzelne Eins hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12","text":"Die reale diskrete Quantität ist Quantität als Dasein und als Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A13","text":"Die Grenze an der Kontinuität macht den Unterschied zwischen kontinuierlicher und diskreter Größe gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe gehen beide in die Bestimmung als Quanta über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX1","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist nicht eine bloße Vielheit äußerlich nebeneinanderstehender Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX2","text":"Die diskrete Größe ist nicht unmittelbar begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX3","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht zuerst ein von ihrem Dasein unterschiedenes Äußerliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX4","text":"Das begrenzte Sein ist nicht auf den einzelnen Grenzpunkt reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX5","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe sind nicht als schlechthin getrennte Größenarten festzuhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX6","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht bloß Negation eines fremden Etwas, sondern das auf sich bezogene Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D1","text":"Die Vielheit der Einsen bildet eine Einheit, weil die Einsen in der sie umfassenden Grenze aufgehoben sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A2","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit der diskreten Größe ist zugleich Negation und Grenze, weil das Eins ihr Dasein ausschließend bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D3","text":"Die Grenze ist ein negativer Punkt, der nicht außerhalb des begrenzten Daseins steht, sondern unmittelbar dessen Bestimmung bildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D4","text":"Die Grenze wird zur umschließenden Grenze, weil sie das Eins zugleich auf die Einheit und auf sich selbst bezieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D5","text":"Das begrenzte Quantum überschreitet seine Grenze, weil sein Sein als Kontinuität über den einzelnen Grenzpunkt hinausgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D6","text":"Die reale diskrete Größe ist ein Quantum, weil sie als bestimmte Quantität in einem Dasein gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD1","text":"Diskretion und Kontinuität erzeugen keine äußerlich getrennten Quantitätsarten, sondern zwei ineinander übergehende Bestimmungen derselben quantitativen Struktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A3","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A13","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD2","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmtheit entsteht durch die Einheit von ausschließender Grenze und über die Grenze hinausgehender Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD3","text":"Das Eins fungiert zugleich als konstituierendes Prinzip der Vielheit, als Grenze ihrer Einheit und als aufgehobenes Moment der Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD4","text":"Das Quantum ist die Form, in der quantitative Bestimmtheit als Dasein erscheint, ohne die Kontinuität ihrer Vermittlung zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine isolierte, selbständige Einheit aus, die weder Vielheit noch Kontinuität in sich enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Grenze aus, die als äußerliche Trennlinie unabhängig vom begrenzten Dasein bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Kontinuität aus, die nicht durch diskrete Bestimmtheit begrenzt und als Quantum gesetzt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Auffassung aus, dass die diskrete Größe durch bloße Addition äußerer Einheiten vollständig erklärt sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine absolute Dichotomie von Diskretion und Kontinuität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Quantität ohne innere Vermittlung von Einheit, Grenze und Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Sein, dessen Bestimmtheit entweder nur punktuelle Negation oder nur grenzenlose Kontinuität wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, diskrete und kontinuierliche Größe als ontologisch unabhängige Bereiche zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Grenze, die das begrenzte Sein endgültig fixiert und dessen Überschreitung verhindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS1","text":"Eins → Vielheit der Eins → Einheit der aufgehobenen Einsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS2","text":"Einheit → gesetztes Dasein → ausschließendes Eins → Negation und Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS3","text":"Grenze als Eins → Selbstbezug → umschließende und befassende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS4","text":"Umschließende Grenze → begrenztes Sein als Kontinuität → Überschreitung der Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS5","text":"Grenze an der Kontinuität → Gleichgültigkeit der Größenunterscheidung → kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe als Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS6","text":"Quantität als Dasein und Etwas → reale diskrete Quantität als Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AF1","text":"Prinzip des Eins → Vielheit → aufgehobene Einheit → ausschließende Grenze → selbstbezogene Umschließung → kontinuierliche Überschreitung → Quantum → Aufhebung der Trennung von diskret und kontinuierlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME1","text":"Die diskrete Größe wird von einer bloßen Vielheitsstruktur in eine Einheit aus gesetztem Eins und aufgehobenen Einsen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME2","text":"Die Grenze wird vom äußeren Trennmoment zum inneren, selbstbezogenen Konstitutionsmoment des Quantums umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME3","text":"Kontinuität erscheint nicht mehr als Gegenbegriff der Diskretion, sondern als dasjenige, worin die diskrete Grenze überschritten und vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME4","text":"Diskrete und kontinuierliche Größe werden auf einer gemeinsamen Ebene als Formen des Quantums kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME5","text":"Das Quantum wird als Daseinsform der Quantität sichtbar, in der Ausschließung und Überschreitung zugleich wirksam sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die diskrete Größe wird durch Eins, Vielheit, Grenze und Quantum bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die quantitative Einheit entsteht durch die Vermittlung von ausschließender Grenze und kontinuierlichem Übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Opposition von diskret und kontinuierlich wird nicht entschieden, sondern durch ihre gemeinsame Überführung in das Quantum neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantitative Bestimmtheit ist ein Dasein, dessen Identität als Grenze gesetzt ist und dessen Sein zugleich über diese Setzung hinausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung vom Eins zur diskreten Quantität als Quantum zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete Bestimmung dessen, worin die kontinuierliche Überschreitung der Grenze sich vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Grenze und Kontinuität als zugleich entgegengesetzte und vermittelte Momente gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Gleichgültigkeit von Diskretion und Kontinuität aus der Grenze an der Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der nicht weiter begründeten Identifikation des Eins mit Negation, Grenze und aufgehobener Einheit ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, wenn das Quantum als Resultat der inneren Vermittlung von Ausschließung und Überschreitung rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113841734525Z_235598e4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Limitation of Quantity.","source_sha256":"cd25c9c15b6dec3017f26e8059ddcf685b5255046b45d7e7e9a343f6d316ad81","sha256":"5e8525032d76bf02582c88003f6c16b10ef1d3994a386969ed0b7bac26c01478","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:38:41.736604+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining discrete magnitude from the One, plurality, and their essential continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS2","text":"Discrete plurality is redetermined as the unity of sublated Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS3","text":"Its determinacy arises through the One as an excluding limit within a determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS4","text":"The limit is conceived as a self-related, encompassing point, whose limited being is at once continuity and transcendence of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AS5","text":"The distinction between continuous and discrete magnitude is sublated in the determination of both as quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","text":"Discrete magnitude has the One as its principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A2","text":"Discrete magnitude is a plurality of Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A3","text":"Discrete magnitude is essentially continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","text":"The plurality of Ones is a unity of sublated Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","text":"Discrete magnitude is posited as a determinate being and a something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","text":"The One determines the determinate being of discrete magnitude as an excluding One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","text":"The excluding One is limit at the unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","text":"The limit, as One, is related to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9","text":"The self-related limit is encompassing and comprehending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","text":"Being determined by the limit is essentially continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11","text":"Continuity goes beyond the limit and the individual One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12","text":"Real discrete quantity is quantity as determinate being and as something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A13","text":"The limit at continuity renders the difference between continuous and discrete magnitude indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude both pass over into the determination as quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX1","text":"Discrete magnitude is not a mere plurality of Ones standing externally alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX2","text":"Discrete magnitude is not immediately limited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX3","text":"The limit is not initially something external distinguished from its determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX4","text":"Limited being is not reducible to the individual limit-point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX5","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude are not to be maintained as absolutely separate kinds of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:NX6","text":"The limit is not merely the negation of an alien something, but the self-related One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D1","text":"The plurality of Ones forms a unity because the Ones are sublated in the limit encompassing them.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A2","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D2","text":"The determinacy of discrete magnitude is at once negation and limit, because the One determines its determinate being by exclusion.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D3","text":"The limit is a negative point that does not stand outside limited determinate being but immediately constitutes its determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D4","text":"The limit becomes an encompassing limit because it relates the One at once to unity and to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D5","text":"The limited quantum transcends its limit because its being, as continuity, goes beyond the individual limit-point.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A8","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:D6","text":"Real discrete magnitude is a quantum because it is posited as determinate quantity in a determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A5","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD1","text":"Discreteness and continuity do not generate externally separate kinds of quantity, but two mutually passing-over determinations of the same quantitative structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A3","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A13","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD2","text":"Quantitative determinacy arises through the unity of excluding limit and continuity that goes beyond the limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A6","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A9","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD3","text":"The One functions at once as the constitutive principle of plurality, as the limit of its unity, and as a sublated moment of continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A1","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A4","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A7","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SD4","text":"Quantum is the form in which quantitative determinacy appears as determinate being without losing the continuity of its mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDQ:A10","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A12","CH_GB18_CBDQ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an isolated, self-subsistent unity that would contain within itself neither plurality nor continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX2","text":"It excludes a limit that would exist as an external dividing line independently of limited determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX3","text":"It excludes a continuity that could not be limited by discrete determinacy and posited as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX4","text":"It excludes the view that discrete magnitude is fully explained by the mere addition of external unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:DNX5","text":"It excludes an absolute dichotomy of discreteness and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a quantity without the internal mediation of unity, limit, and continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a being whose determinacy would be either only punctual negation or only boundless continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating discrete and continuous magnitude as ontologically independent domains.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a limit that definitively fixes limited being and prevents its transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS1","text":"One → plurality of Ones → unity of sublated Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS2","text":"Unity → posited determinate being → excluding One → negation and limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS3","text":"Limit as One → self-relation → encompassing and comprehending limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS4","text":"Encompassing limit → limited being as continuity → transcendence of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS5","text":"Limit at continuity → indifference of the distinction of magnitudes → continuous and discrete magnitude as quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:FGS6","text":"Quantity as determinate being and something → real discrete quantity as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:AF1","text":"Principle of the One → plurality → sublated unity → excluding limit → self-related encompassing → continuous transcendence → quantum → sublation of the separation of discrete and continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME1","text":"Discrete magnitude is remapped from a mere structure of plurality into a unity of posited One and sublated Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME2","text":"The limit is reclassified from the external moment of separation into the inner, self-related constitutive moment of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME3","text":"Continuity no longer appears as the counter-concept of discreteness, but as that in which the discrete limit is transcended and mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME4","text":"Discrete and continuous magnitude are mapped on a common level as forms of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ME5","text":"Quantum becomes visible as the form of determinate being of quantity in which exclusion and transcendence are at once effective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Discrete magnitude is determined through One, plurality, limit, and quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT2","text":"Structural — Quantitative unity arises through the mediation of excluding limit and continuous passing-over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition of discrete and continuous is not decided, but reframed through their common transposition into quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantitative determinacy is a determinate being whose identity is posited as limit and whose being at once goes beyond this positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the One to discrete quantity as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete determination of that in which the continuous transcendence of the limit is accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as limit and continuity count as moments that are at once opposed and mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of the indifference of discreteness and continuity from the limit at continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the further ungrounded identification of the One with negation, limit, and sublated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDQ:MRT6","text":"The movement of the argument is preserved if quantum is reconstructed as the result of the inner mediation of exclusion and transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CBDQ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CBDQ@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CBDQ:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 59","title":"C. Limitation of Quantity.","context":"Chapter 59","original_title":"C. Begrenzung der Quantität."},"original_title":"C. Begrenzung der Quantität.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ","layer":"CH","title":"A. Number.","order":60,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DIEZ"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIEZ@R001","sha256":"ae192d048393311c7013a2fa46f3ec1f21116cea133f0b906227cadf96609d94","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS1","text":"Das Quantum bestimmt die Quantität durch eine Grenze, die zunächst abstrakt, in der Zahl jedoch vollständig bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS2","text":"Die Grenze wird vom äußeren Beschränkungscharakter in die immanente Struktur des Eins überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS3","text":"Das Eins erzeugt zugleich Einheit, Vielheit gleicher Eins und Ausschluss von Anderem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS4","text":"Aus dieser dreifachen Bestimmung entsteht die Zahl als Einheit von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS5","text":"Die Grenze erweist sich nicht als äußerer Abschluss einer Vielheit, sondern als die durch die Vielheit selbst gebildete Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS6","text":"Die Zahl bleibt gegen andere Quanta äußerlich gleichgültig und enthält diese Äußerlichkeit zugleich als inneres Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS7","text":"Der darin gesetzte Widerspruch wird zur Qualität des Quantums und treibt dessen weitere Bestimmungen hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A1","text":"Die Quantität ist als kontinuierliche oder diskrete Größe ein Quantum, sobald sie eine Grenze hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A2","text":"Das extensive Quantum bestimmt seine Grenze als Beschränkung einer bestehenden Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A3","text":"Das intensive Quantum bestimmt seine Grenze als Grad, dessen Bestimmtheit zugleich an anderem besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A4","text":"Das an sich selbst äußerlich Gesetzte geht als Quantum in die quantitative Unendlichkeit über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A5","text":"Die Quantität ist als aufgehobenes Fürsichseyn gegen ihre Grenze gleichgültig, enthält aber das Eins als ihr eigenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A6","text":"Das Eins ist das Prinzip des Quantums als Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","text":"Das Eins ist zugleich Einheit und kontinuierliche Form sowie Vielheit gleicher Eins und diskrete Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A8","text":"Das Eins ist als einfache Grenze die Negation vieler Eins und schließt anderes Daseyn aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","text":"Die Zahl ist das vollständig gesetzte Quantum, dessen Grenze als bestimmte Vielheit von der Einheit unterschieden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","text":"Die Zahl enthält Kontinuität in der Einheit und Diskretion in der Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","text":"Einheit und Anzahl bilden die beiden Momente der Zahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A12","text":"Die vielen Eins der Anzahl bleiben als einzelne Eins gesetzt und sind gegen die ausschließende Grenze gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","text":"Die Grenze durchdringt die ganze Vielheit, sodass kein einzelnes Eins gegenüber den anderen ein bevorzugtes Grenz-Eins ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14","text":"Die Anzahl bildet selbst die Grenze des bestimmten Quantums und steht ihr nicht als bloße Vielheit gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","text":"Die Unterscheidung einer Zahl von anderen Zahlen bleibt quantitativ und gehört der äußerlichen vergleichenden Reflexion an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","text":"Die Zahl ist als Eins in sich zurückgekehrt und gegen andere Zahlen gleichgültig, enthält die absolute Äußerlichkeit jedoch in der Einheit von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17","text":"Der Widerspruch von innerer Bestimmtheit und äußerlicher Bestimmung ist die Qualität des Quantums und entwickelt dessen weitere Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX1","text":"Die Zahl ist nicht bloß durch eine abstrakte, einfache Grenze bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX2","text":"Die Grenze liegt nicht als äußerer Rand außerhalb der begrenzten Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX3","text":"Die Anzahl ist nicht eine Vielheit gegenüber einem gesonderten begrenzenden Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX4","text":"Kein einzelnes Eins besitzt gegenüber den anderen eine ausgezeichnete Grenzfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX5","text":"Die Zahl ist weder reine Einheit ohne Vielheit noch reine Diskretion ohne Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX6","text":"Die numerische Unterscheidung ist keine qualitative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX7","text":"Das Verhältnis zu anderen Zahlen ist keine innere qualitative Beziehung, sondern äußerliche quantitative Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D1","text":"Die Grenze wird zur Zahl, sobald sie als bestimmte Vielheit der Eins und zugleich als Einheit gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A6","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D2","text":"Die vollständige Bestimmtheit der Zahl beruht auf der untrennbaren Verbindung von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D3","text":"Weil alle Eins gleich sind, kann kein letztes oder hundertstes Eins allein die Grenze der Zahl bilden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A12","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D4","text":"Die Anzahl ist nicht das von der Grenze Begrenzte, sondern die konkrete Gestalt der Grenze selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D5","text":"Die Zahl unterscheidet sich von anderen Zahlen nur durch quantitative Vergleichbarkeit und nicht durch qualitative Eigenart.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D6","text":"Die Zahl enthält die Äußerlichkeit ihres Verhältnisses zu anderem bereits in ihrer eigenen Struktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D7","text":"Der Widerspruch der Zahl wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als Qualität des Quantums zum Prinzip weiterer Entwicklung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D8","text":"Die quantitative Unendlichkeit erscheint als Bewegungsform des Quantums, sobald dessen äußerliche Gesetztheit als Widerspruch hervortritt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A4","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD1","text":"Die Zahl ist keine Summe von Einheiten mit nachträglich hinzugefügter Grenze, sondern eine Totalität, deren Einheiten gemeinsam die Grenze konstituieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD2","text":"Numerische Identität ist zugleich Selbstbeziehung und Gleichgültigkeit gegen anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD3","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist keine zufällige Beziehung zwischen bereits bestimmten Zahlen, sondern ein im Quantum selbst erzeugtes Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A5","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD4","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmtheit erzeugt ihre eigene Entwicklungsbewegung, weil sie Einheit und äußerliche Vielheit zugleich festhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Grenze der Zahl einer bereits vollständigen Vielheit lediglich äußerlich auferlegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine konstitutive Rangordnung der Eins, in der ein einzelnes Eins die Bestimmtheit des Ganzen trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Wesenheit, aus der numerische Differenzen hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine vollständige Trennung von innerer Identität und äußerlicher Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Bestimmung des Quantums, die sich vollständig auf Kontinuität oder vollständig auf Diskretion reduzieren lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Zahl, deren eigentliche Grenze außerhalb ihrer Anzahl liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein selbständiges Prinzip reiner Einheit oder reiner Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Umwandlung quantitativer Differenz in qualitative Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich ist ein vollständig geschlossenes Quantum, das seine Äußerlichkeit nicht aus sich selbst erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS1","text":"Quantität → gesetzte Grenze → Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS2","text":"Aufgehobenes Fürsichseyn + eigenes Eins → immanente Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS3","text":"Eins → Einheit/Kontinuität + Vielheit/Diskretion + Ausschluss → Zahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS4","text":"Gleichheit der Eins + Durchdringung der Vielheit durch die Grenze → Aufhebung des privilegierten Grenz-Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS5","text":"Einheit + Anzahl → Zahl als vollständig bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS6","text":"In-sich-Zurückgekehrtsein + äußerliche Beziehung → innere Äußerlichkeit der Zahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS7","text":"Widerspruch von Selbstbestimmung und äußerer Bestimmung → Qualität des Quantums → weitere quantitative Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AF1","text":"Begrenzte Quantität → immanentes Eins → Einheit und Vielheit → Zahl als Einheit von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AF2","text":"Zahl als selbstbildende Grenze → Aufhebung des äußeren Grenz-Eins → quantitative Gleichgültigkeit gegen anderes → immanente Äußerlichkeit → Widerspruch → quantitative Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME1","text":"Die Grenze wird von einem äußeren Rand zu einer immanenten Konstitution der Vielheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME2","text":"Kontinuität und Diskretion erscheinen nicht mehr als konkurrierende Größenarten, sondern als Momente derselben Zahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME3","text":"Die Vielheit wird von einer bloßen Menge zu einer selbst begrenzenden Anzahl reklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME4","text":"Numerische Identität und Differenz werden als Selbstbeziehung und äußerliche Vergleichbarkeit zugleich sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME5","text":"Der Widerspruch wird von einem Defekt der Bestimmung zu ihrem produktiven Entwicklungsmechanismus umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gegenstand ist die Zahl als vollständig bestimmtes Quantum aus Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die zugrunde liegende Struktur ist die immanente Erzeugung der Grenze durch die Vielheit gleicher Eins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die äußere Begrenzung eines gegebenen Gegenstands durch die Rekonstruktion seiner eigenen Bestimmungsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Bestimmtheit ist eine in sich widersprüchliche Form von Selbstbeziehung und Äußerlichkeit, die in weitere quantitative Formen übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der begrenzten Quantität zur Zahl und von der Zahl zum quantitativen Widerspruch zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete Vermittlung zwischen Zahl, extensivem und intensivem Quantum sowie quantitativer Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Einheit, Anzahl und Äußerlichkeit als zugleich getrennte und verbundene Momente behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist das System bei der Auflösung des äußeren Grenz-Eins in die selbstbegrenzende Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der komprimierten Identität von Grenze, Eins, Einheit und Anzahl; eine Auflösung dieser Übergänge würde die Maschine zerlegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung zwischen Gleichgültigkeit gegen die Grenze und notwendiger Begrenztheit wird als dialektischer Motor bestimmt, nicht vollständig beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT7","text":"Die Spannung zwischen innerer Selbstbestimmung der Zahl und äußerlicher Beziehung zu anderen Zahlen bleibt als Struktur erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT8","text":"Die rekonstruierte Sequenz bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, lässt jedoch die Ausarbeitung der angekündigten weiteren quantitativen Entwicklung offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115437658878Z_33ec41ac","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Number.","source_sha256":"ae192d048393311c7013a2fa46f3ec1f21116cea133f0b906227cadf96609d94","sha256":"142c0e0120f1f4b1f6a8407641cf1f925a07be9e6e1dcdf518b2fddaf6be7fbd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:54:37.660660+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS1","text":"The quantum determines quantity through a limit that is initially abstract but, in number, fully determinate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS2","text":"The limit is transferred from the character of external restriction into the immanent structure of the One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS3","text":"The One simultaneously generates unity, a multiplicity of equal Ones, and the exclusion of otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS4","text":"From this threefold determination emerges number as the unity of unit and amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS5","text":"The limit proves to be not an external termination of a multiplicity, but the determination formed by the multiplicity itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS6","text":"Number remains externally indifferent toward other quanta and at the same time contains this externality as an inner moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AS7","text":"The contradiction posited therein becomes the quality of the quantum and drives forth its further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A1","text":"Quantity, as continuous or discrete magnitude, is a quantum as soon as it has a limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A2","text":"The extensive quantum determines its limit as the restriction of an existing multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A3","text":"The intensive quantum determines its limit as degree, whose determinacy at the same time exists in another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A4","text":"What is posited as external to itself passes over, as quantum, into quantitative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A5","text":"As sublated being-for-self, quantity is indifferent toward its limit, but contains the One as its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A6","text":"The One is the principle of the quantum as quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","text":"The One is at once unit and continuous form, as well as a multiplicity of equal Ones and discrete form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A8","text":"As simple limit, the One is the negation of many Ones and excludes other being-there.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","text":"Number is the fully posited quantum, whose limit, as determinate multiplicity, is distinguished from the unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","text":"Number contains continuity in the unit and discreteness in the amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","text":"Unit and amount constitute the two moments of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A12","text":"The many Ones of the amount remain posited as individual Ones and are indifferent toward the excluding limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","text":"The limit pervades the entire multiplicity, so that no individual One is a privileged limiting One in relation to the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14","text":"The amount itself constitutes the limit of the determinate quantum and does not stand opposed to it as mere multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","text":"The distinction of one number from other numbers remains quantitative and belongs to external comparative reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","text":"As One, number has returned into itself and is indifferent toward other numbers, yet contains absolute externality in the unity of unit and amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17","text":"The contradiction of inner determinacy and external determination is the quality of the quantum and develops its further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX1","text":"Number is not determined merely by an abstract, simple limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX2","text":"The limit does not lie outside the limited multiplicity as an external boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX3","text":"The amount is not a multiplicity set over against a separate limiting One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX4","text":"No individual One possesses a privileged limiting function in relation to the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX5","text":"Number is neither pure unit without multiplicity nor pure discreteness without continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX6","text":"Numerical distinction is not qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:NX7","text":"The relation to other numbers is not an inner qualitative relation, but external quantitative reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D1","text":"The limit becomes number as soon as it is posited as a determinate multiplicity of Ones and at the same time as unit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A6","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D2","text":"The complete determinacy of number rests on the inseparable connection of unit and amount.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D3","text":"Because all Ones are equal, no last or hundredth One can by itself constitute the limit of number.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A12","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D4","text":"The amount is not that which is limited by the limit, but the concrete shape of the limit itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D5","text":"Number differs from other numbers only through quantitative comparability and not through qualitative peculiarity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D6","text":"Number already contains the externality of its relation to another in its own structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D7","text":"The contradiction of number is not eliminated, but becomes, as the quality of the quantum, the principle of further development.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:D8","text":"Quantitative infinity appears as the form of movement of the quantum as soon as its external positedness emerges as contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A4","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD1","text":"Number is not a sum of units with a subsequently added limit, but a totality whose units jointly constitute the limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A7","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A13","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD2","text":"Numerical identity is at once self-relation and indifference toward another.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A10","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A15","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD3","text":"Externality is not an accidental relation between already determined numbers, but a moment generated in the quantum itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A5","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A11","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SD4","text":"Quantitative determinacy generates its own movement of development because it simultaneously holds fast to unit and external multiplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIEZ:A9","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A16","CH_GB18_DIEZ:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which the limit of number is merely externally imposed upon an already complete multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a constitutive hierarchy of Ones in which an individual One bears the determinacy of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a qualitative essence from which numerical differences emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a complete separation of inner identity and external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a determination of the quantum that can be reduced entirely to continuity or entirely to discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a number whose proper limit lies outside its amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an independent principle of pure unit or pure multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX3","text":"Barred is the transformation of quantitative difference into qualitative diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:SNX4","text":"Impossible is a completely closed quantum that does not generate its externality from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS1","text":"Quantity → posited limit → quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS2","text":"Sublated being-for-self + own One → immanent limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS3","text":"One → unit/continuity + multiplicity/discreteness + exclusion → number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS4","text":"Equality of the Ones + pervasion of multiplicity by the limit → sublation of the privileged limiting One.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS5","text":"Unit + amount → number as fully determinate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS6","text":"Having-returned-into-itself + external relation → inner externality of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:FGS7","text":"Contradiction of self-determination and external determination → quality of the quantum → further quantitative development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AF1","text":"Limited quantity → immanent One → unit and multiplicity → number as unity of unit and amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:AF2","text":"Number as self-forming limit → sublation of the external limiting One → quantitative indifference toward another → immanent externality → contradiction → quantitative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME1","text":"The limit is remapped from an external boundary into an immanent constitution of multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME2","text":"Continuity and discreteness no longer appear as competing kinds of magnitude, but as moments of the same number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME3","text":"Multiplicity is reclassified from a mere aggregate into a self-limiting amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME4","text":"Numerical identity and difference become visible at once as self-relation and external comparability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ME5","text":"The contradiction is remapped from a defect of determinacy into its productive mechanism of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — The object is number as a fully determinate quantum composed of unit and amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — The underlying structure is the immanent generation of the limit through the multiplicity of equal Ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the external limitation of a given object with the reconstruction of its own movement of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinacy is a self-contradictory form of self-relation and externality that passes over into further quantitative forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from limited quantity to number and from number to quantitative contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete mediation between number, extensive and intensive quantum, and quantitative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as unit, amount, and externality are treated as moments that are at once separate and connected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT4","text":"The system is strongest in dissolving the external limiting One into the self-limiting amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed identity of limit, One, unit, and amount; a dissolution of these transitions would dismantle the machine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT6","text":"The central tension between indifference toward the limit and necessary limitedness is determined as a dialectical motor, not completely eliminated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT7","text":"The tension between the inner self-determination of number and its external relation to other numbers remains preserved as structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIEZ:MRT8","text":"The reconstructed sequence preserves the actual movement of the text, but leaves open the elaboration of the further quantitative development announced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIEZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIEZ@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DIEZ:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 60","title":"A. Number.","context":"Chapter 60","original_title":"A. Die Zahl."},"original_title":"A. Die Zahl.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":61,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_14"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_14@R001","sha256":"809edf6cb3f1c8f90cb31b5d775d15d5d869b20a0afe3727f33f26140aa1f592","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS1","text":"Der Text bestreitet die Gleichstufigkeit von Raumgröße und Zahlgröße, weil Kontinuität und Diskretion verschiedene Vollkommenheiten der Bestimmtheit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS2","text":"Raumgröße besitzt eigene geometrische Bestimmungen der Gleichheit, benötigt jedoch Zahl zur vollständig bestimmten quantitativen Begrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS3","text":"Zahl wird als äußerlich zusammengesetzte, analytische Bestimmtheit bestimmt, deren Beziehungen nur durch äußeres Operieren hervorgebracht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS4","text":"Die Rechnungsarten werden aus den äußeren Unterschieden von Ungleichheit, Gleichheit sowie Einheit und Anzahl systematisch geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS5","text":"Die kantischen Beispiele synthetischer Urteile a priori werden zurückgewiesen, weil Zählen und die Bestimmung der kürzesten geraden Linie keine innere Einheit des Unterschiedenen hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS6","text":"Der Text schließt mit einer Methodologie, nach der philosophische Begriffsformen nur in der dem Gegenstand angemessenen Sphäre und Erscheinungsweise angewendet werden dürfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A1","text":"Raumgröße ist kontinuierliche Größe und besitzt zunächst nur Begrenzung überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A2","text":"Raumgröße bedarf der Zahl, um als schlechthin bestimmtes Quantum bestimmt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A3","text":"Geometrische Bestimmungen von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit sind eigentümliche Raum-Bestimmungen, reichen aber nicht für alle Raumfiguren aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A4","text":"Zahl ist als Zusammenfassung von Eins äußerlich erzeugt, analytisch und innerlich zusammenhangslos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A5","text":"Rechnen ist äußerliches Hervorbringen von Zahlen durch Zählen und Zusammenzählen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A6","text":"Die begriffliche Bestimmtheit der Zahl reduziert sich auf Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A7","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit von Zahlen sind äußere Reflexionsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A8","text":"Zusammenfassen und Trennen entsprechen positiven und negativen Rechnungsarten, bestimmen aber nicht selbst deren spezifische Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A9","text":"Das Numerieren setzt viele Eins äußerlich zusammen und begrenzt sie zufällig oder beliebig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A10","text":"Addition und Subtraktion operieren mit Zahlen, die als bloß ungleiche unmittelbar gegeneinander gesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A11","text":"Multiplikation und Division entstehen aus der Gleichheit der Zahlen und artikulieren den Unterschied von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A12","text":"Potenzieren und Wurzelausziehen vollziehen die Gleichheit von Einheit und Anzahl; das Quadrat enthält diese Gleichheit vollständig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A13","text":"Wahre Synthese verlangt eine Identität, die an sich selbst unterschieden ist; äußerliches Zählen erfüllt diese Bedingung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A14","text":"Philosophische Begriffsbestimmungen müssen in der dem Stoff angemessenen Form erscheinen und dürfen dessen eigentümliche Äußerlichkeit nicht spekulativ aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX1","text":"Raumgröße ist nicht bereits durch ihre Kontinuität ebenso vollständig bestimmt wie Zahlgröße durch ihre Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX2","text":"Geometrie ist nicht identisch mit Meßkunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX3","text":"Zahl ist keine innerlich verbundene begriffliche Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX4","text":"Die Reihenfolge der Rechnungsarten ist keine immanente Selbstentwicklung eines Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","text":"Addition ist keine gehaltvolle Synthese, sofern sie nur äußeres Fortzählen darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX6","text":"Der Satz von der kürzesten geraden Linie ist kein synthetisches Urteil a priori.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX7","text":"Das Apriori ist keine scharf abgegrenzte Erkenntnisquelle, die eindeutig gegen empirische oder gefühlshafte Bestimmungen isoliert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX8","text":"Philosophie darf äußerlichem und zufälligem Stoff keine ihm heterogene spekulative Innerlichkeit zuschreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D1","text":"Die Differenz von Geometrie und Arithmetik betrifft nicht nur kontinuierliche und diskrete Gegenstände, sondern den Grad und die Weise ihrer Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A1","CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D2","text":"Geometrische Vergleichung kann qualitative Raumrelationen bestimmen, aber ohne Zahl keine allgemeine quantitative Messung leisten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D3","text":"Zahlensysteme beruhen auf einer äußerlichen Festsetzung, welche Anzahl erneut als Einheit fungieren soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D4","text":"Arithmetische Resultate besitzen keine innere Notwendigkeit im Rechenvorgang selbst, sondern werden durch äußeres Zählen erzeugt und durch Gedächtnis fixiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A5","CH_GB18_A_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D5","text":"Addition und Subtraktion bilden ein Operationspaar unter der Bestimmung äußerlicher Ungleichheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A8","CH_GB18_A_14:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D6","text":"Multiplikation und Division bilden ein Operationspaar unter der Bestimmung gleicher Zahlen, deren Rollen als Einheit und Anzahl vertauschbar bleiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A8","CH_GB18_A_14:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D7","text":"Das Quadrat bildet den Abschluss der im Zahlenbegriff möglichen Ausgleichung zwischen Einheit und Anzahl; höhere Potenzen setzen diese Form nur äußerlich fort.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D8","text":"Kants Begriff wahrer Synthese bleibt gültig, während seine arithmetischen und geometrischen Beispiele diesen Begriff verfehlen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A13","CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","CH_GB18_A_14:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D9","text":"Die Reihenfolge der Rechnungsarten kann systematisch sein, ohne deshalb eine spekulative Selbstbewegung des Begriffs darzustellen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD1","text":"Quantitative Bestimmtheit spaltet sich in eine eigentümliche räumliche Qualität der Begrenzung und eine äußerlich hinzutretende numerische Fixierung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A1","CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3","CH_GB18_A_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD2","text":"Arithmetik erscheint als systematisierbare Ordnung äußerlicher Operationen, nicht als Erkenntnis einer innerlich produktiven begrifflichen Totalität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A5","CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD3","text":"Die Klassifikation der Rechnungsarten transformiert arithmetische Verfahren in eine erschöpfende Staffelung von Ausgleichungen äußerer Unterschiede.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A10","CH_GB18_A_14:A11","CH_GB18_A_14:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD4","text":"Die Kritik an Kant trennt den Begriff einer nichtäußerlichen Synthese von den Erkenntnisformen, die lediglich Einheiten äußerlich aggregieren oder abstrakte Einfachheit ausdrücken.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A13","CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","CH_GB18_A_14:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD5","text":"Philosophische Angemessenheit besteht nicht darin, alle Gegenstände spekulativ zu vertiefen, sondern darin, die äußere Erscheinungsform eines äußerlichen Stoffes als dessen angemessene Form zu begreifen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keine einheitliche quantitative Wissenschaft, in der Raum und Zahl nur gleichrangige Varianten derselben Bestimmtheit wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX2","text":"Es gibt keine arithmetische Operation, deren innere Wahrheit unabhängig von äußerlichem Setzen, Wiederholen, Gedächtnis und Vergleichung bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX3","text":"Es gibt keine unmittelbare Übertragung spekulativer Begriffsbewegung auf jedes Material; die Sphäre des Gegenstands begrenzt die Form seiner begrifflichen Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX4","text":"Es gibt kein hinreichendes Kriterium des Synthetischen in der bloßen Hinzufügung, Anschauung oder zeitlichen Vollzugsform einer Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, daß äußerlich zusammengesetzte Einheiten durch bloße Wiederholung zu innerer begrifflicher Selbstbestimmung werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erkenntnisordnung, in der das Apriori eine eindeutig reine, von Empfindung, Trieb, Raum und Zeit getrennte Herkunft bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine finale Formalisierung, in der höhere Potenzen eine vollständigere Bestimmtheit liefern als die im Quadrat erreichte Gleichheit von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS1","text":"Kontinuierliche Raumgröße → bloße Begrenzung → Bedarf numerischer Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS2","text":"Eins → äußerliche Zusammenfassung vieler Eins → Zahl als analytische und begriffslos erzeugte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Zahlproduktion → Numerieren → zufällige Grenze und äußerlich gesetzte Zahlensysteme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS4","text":"Äußerliche Ungleichheit der Zahlen → Addition / Subtraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS5","text":"Gleichheit der Zahlen bei fortbestehendem Unterschied von Einheit und Anzahl → Multiplikation / Division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS6","text":"Gleichheit von Einheit und Anzahl → Potenzieren / Wurzelausziehen → Quadrat als vollständige Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS7","text":"Äußerliche Operationsordnung → Kritik falscher Synthesezuschreibungen → methodische Begrenzung spekulativer Überformung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AF1","text":"Raumgröße und Zahlgröße **→** ungleiche Weisen der Bestimmtheit **→** Zahl als notwendige äußerliche Fixierung des Raums **→** Zahl als analytische Aggregation **→** Ordnung der Rechnungsarten durch Gleichheit und Ungleichheit **→** Kritik kantischer Synthese **→** Sphärenangemessene philosophische Methode.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AF2","text":"Äußerliche Einheit **→** äußerliches Zählen **→** systematische Staffelung der Rechenoperationen **→** Grenze der arithmetischen Innerlichkeit **→** Ausschluss unangemessener spekulativer Totalisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME1","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Geometrie und Arithmetik wird von einer bloßen Differenz kontinuierlicher und diskreter Größen zu einer Differenz der Bestimmtheitsformen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME2","text":"Rechenarten werden nicht mehr als zufällige Schuloperationen, sondern als vollständige Folge äußerer Gleichheits- und Ungleichheitsverhältnisse kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME3","text":"Addition, Multiplikation und Potenzierung erscheinen als abgestufte Ausgleichungen der im Zahlenbegriff vorhandenen Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME4","text":"Das kantische Gegensatzpaar analytisch/synthetisch wird von der Frage der bloßen Hinzufügung auf die Frage innerlich unterschiedener Identität umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME5","text":"Die Differenz zwischen immanenter Begriffsbewegung und äußerlich systematisierbarem Stoff wird als methodische Grenzlinie der Philosophie sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das Verhältnis von Raumgröße, Zahlgröße, Geometrie, Arithmetik und Rechnungsarten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT2","text":"Structural — Zahl erscheint als äußerliche Einheit vieler Eins, deren Bestimmungen durch Reflexionsrelationen und äußere Operationen organisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik Kantischer Beispiele dient der Trennung zwischen wahrer begrifflicher Synthese und äußerlicher Verknüpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Text unterscheidet innere Selbstbestimmung von zeitlich vollzogener Wiederholung, äußerem Fortgang und gedächtnishafter Fixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT5","text":"Methodological — Die Angemessenheit philosophischer Erkenntnis hängt von der Zuordnung begrifflicher Form zur eigentümlichen Sphäre ihres Gegenstands ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Differenz von Raumgröße und Zahlgröße, die äußere Natur der Zahl und die systematische Folge der Rechnungsarten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich der genauen Notwendigkeit des Übergangs von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit zu einzelnen Rechnungsarten teilweise unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT3","text":"Die Behauptung, das Quadrat enthalte die absolute Vollendung numerischer Bestimmtheit, trägt die Reduktion höherer Potenzen, wird jedoch nicht unabhängig begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT4","text":"Die Kritik an Kant ist strukturell kohärent, sofern wahre Synthese als innerlich unterschiedene Identität vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Anerkennung der Gültigkeit von Kants Synthesebegriff und der Zurückweisung seiner exemplarischen Erkenntnisformen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß Zahl als begriffslos äußerlich bestimmt wird, ihre Operationsfolge aber dennoch als systematisch und begrifflich ordnungsfähig erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern die Kant-Kritik als methodischer Einschub innerhalb der Herleitung der Rechnungsarten behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111622711184Z_bfbe7cd6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1.","source_sha256":"809edf6cb3f1c8f90cb31b5d775d15d5d869b20a0afe3727f33f26140aa1f592","sha256":"83a5d4e5a0dff0208e655acd27c1c10939b3e2ccb39a2d7b2059ad986763a6b9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:16:22.712383+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS1","text":"The text denies that spatial magnitude and numerical magnitude are of equal rank, because continuity and discreteness produce different perfections of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS2","text":"Spatial magnitude possesses its own geometrical determinations of equality, yet requires number for completely determinate quantitative delimitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS3","text":"Number is determined as an externally composed, analytical determinacy whose relations are produced only through external operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS4","text":"The arithmetical operations are systematically ordered from the external differences of inequality, equality, and unity and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS5","text":"The Kantian examples of synthetic judgments a priori are rejected because counting and the determination of the shortest straight line do not produce an inner unity of what is different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AS6","text":"The text concludes with a methodology according to which philosophical conceptual forms may be applied only in the sphere and mode of appearance appropriate to the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A1","text":"Spatial magnitude is continuous magnitude and initially possesses only delimitation as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A2","text":"Spatial magnitude requires number in order to be determined as an absolutely determinate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A3","text":"Geometrical determinations of equality and inequality are peculiar determinations of space, but do not suffice for all spatial figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A4","text":"Number is externally produced as a collection of ones, analytical, and internally without connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A5","text":"Calculation is the external production of numbers through counting and adding together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A6","text":"The conceptual determinacy of number reduces itself to unity and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A7","text":"Equality and inequality of numbers are external determinations of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A8","text":"Combining and separating correspond to positive and negative arithmetical operations, but do not themselves determine their specific form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A9","text":"Numeration externally composes many ones and delimits them contingently or arbitrarily.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A10","text":"Addition and subtraction operate with numbers that are immediately posited against one another as merely unequal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A11","text":"Multiplication and division arise from the equality of numbers and articulate the difference between unity and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A12","text":"Exponentiation and extraction of roots enact the equality of unity and number; the square contains this equality completely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A13","text":"True synthesis requires an identity that is differentiated within itself; external counting does not fulfill this condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:A14","text":"Philosophical conceptual determinations must appear in the form appropriate to the material and may not speculatively sublate its peculiar externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX1","text":"Spatial magnitude is not already as completely determined by its continuity as numerical magnitude is by its discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX2","text":"Geometry is not identical with the art of measurement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX3","text":"Number is not an internally connected conceptual totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX4","text":"The sequence of arithmetical operations is not an immanent self-development of a concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","text":"Addition is not a contentful synthesis insofar as it represents merely external continuation of counting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX6","text":"The proposition concerning the shortest straight line is not a synthetic judgment a priori.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX7","text":"The a priori is not a sharply delimited source of cognition that can be unambiguously isolated from empirical or affective determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:NX8","text":"Philosophy may not ascribe to external and contingent material a speculative inwardness heterogeneous to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D1","text":"The difference between geometry and arithmetic concerns not merely continuous and discrete objects, but the degree and manner of their determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A1","CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D2","text":"Geometrical comparison can determine qualitative spatial relations, but without number cannot perform general quantitative measurement.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D3","text":"Systems of numbers rest upon an external stipulation whereby number is again to function as unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D4","text":"Arithmetical results possess no inner necessity in the process of calculation itself, but are produced through external counting and fixed by memory.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A5","CH_GB18_A_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D5","text":"Addition and subtraction form a pair of operations under the determination of external inequality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A8","CH_GB18_A_14:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D6","text":"Multiplication and division form a pair of operations under the determination of equal numbers, whose roles as unity and number remain interchangeable.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A8","CH_GB18_A_14:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D7","text":"The square forms the completion of the equalization between unity and number possible in the concept of number; higher powers merely continue this form externally.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D8","text":"Kant's concept of true synthesis remains valid, whereas his arithmetical and geometrical examples fail to meet this concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A13","CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","CH_GB18_A_14:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:D9","text":"The sequence of arithmetical operations can be systematic without thereby representing a speculative self-movement of the concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD1","text":"Quantitative determinacy divides into a peculiar spatial quality of delimitation and a numerical fixation externally added to it.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A1","CH_GB18_A_14:A2","CH_GB18_A_14:A3","CH_GB18_A_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD2","text":"Arithmetic appears as a systematizable order of external operations, not as cognition of an internally productive conceptual totality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A5","CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD3","text":"The classification of arithmetical operations transforms arithmetical procedures into an exhaustive gradation of equalizations of external differences.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A6","CH_GB18_A_14:A7","CH_GB18_A_14:A10","CH_GB18_A_14:A11","CH_GB18_A_14:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD4","text":"The critique of Kant separates the concept of a non-external synthesis from forms of cognition that merely aggregate unities externally or express abstract simplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A13","CH_GB18_A_14:NX5","CH_GB18_A_14:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SD5","text":"Philosophical appropriateness does not consist in speculatively deepening all objects, but in comprehending the external mode of appearance of external material as its appropriate form.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_14:A4","CH_GB18_A_14:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX1","text":"There is no unified quantitative science in which space and number would be merely coequal variants of the same determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX2","text":"There is no arithmetical operation whose inner truth would exist independently of external positing, repetition, memory, and comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX3","text":"There is no immediate transfer of speculative conceptual movement to every material; the sphere of the object limits the form of its conceptual presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:DNX4","text":"There is no sufficient criterion of the synthetic in the mere addition, intuition, or temporal mode of execution of an operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that externally composed unities become inner conceptual self-determination through mere repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an order of cognition in which the a priori denotes an unambiguously pure origin separated from sensation, drive, space, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a final formalization in which higher powers provide a more complete determinacy than the equality of unity and number attained in the square.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS1","text":"Continuous spatial magnitude → mere delimitation → need for numerical determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS2","text":"One → external collection of many ones → number as an analytical and conceptlessly produced unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS3","text":"External number-production → numeration → contingent limit and externally posited systems of numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS4","text":"External inequality of numbers → addition / subtraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS5","text":"Equality of numbers with the difference between unity and number persisting → multiplication / division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS6","text":"Equality of unity and number → exponentiation / extraction of roots → square as complete determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:FGS7","text":"External order of operations → critique of false attributions of synthesis → methodological limitation of speculative overformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AF1","text":"Spatial magnitude and numerical magnitude **→** unequal modes of determinacy **→** number as necessary external fixation of space **→** number as analytical aggregation **→** order of arithmetical operations through equality and inequality **→** critique of Kantian synthesis **→** philosophically appropriate method for the sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:AF2","text":"External unity **→** external counting **→** systematic gradation of arithmetical operations **→** limit of arithmetical inwardness **→** exclusion of inappropriate speculative totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME1","text":"The juxtaposition of geometry and arithmetic is shifted from a mere difference between continuous and discrete magnitudes to a difference between forms of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME2","text":"Arithmetical operations are no longer mapped as contingent school operations, but as a complete sequence of external relations of equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME3","text":"Addition, multiplication, and exponentiation appear as graduated equalizations of the differences present in the concept of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME4","text":"The Kantian opposition analytical/synthetic is reordered from the question of mere addition to the question of internally differentiated identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ME5","text":"The difference between immanent conceptual movement and externally systematizable material becomes visible as a methodological boundary line of philosophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the relation of spatial magnitude, numerical magnitude, geometry, arithmetic, and arithmetical operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT2","text":"Structural — Number appears as the external unity of many ones, whose determinations are organized through relations of reflection and external operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique of Kantian examples serves to distinguish true conceptual synthesis from external combination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The text distinguishes inner self-determination from temporally enacted repetition, external progression, and fixation by memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:ALT5","text":"Methodological — The appropriateness of philosophical cognition depends on the assignment of conceptual form to the peculiar sphere of its object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the difference between spatial magnitude and numerical magnitude, the external nature of number, and the systematic sequence of arithmetical operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains partially underdetermined with respect to the exact necessity of the transition from equality and inequality to individual arithmetical operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT3","text":"The assertion that the square contains the absolute completion of numerical determinacy supports the reduction of higher powers, but is not independently justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT4","text":"The critique of Kant is structurally coherent insofar as true synthesis is presupposed as internally differentiated identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the recognition of the validity of Kant's concept of synthesis and the rejection of his exemplary forms of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that number is determined as externally without concept, yet its sequence of operations nevertheless appears systematic and capable of conceptual ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_14:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text insofar as the critique of Kant is treated as a methodological insertion within the derivation of the arithmetical operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_14:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_14@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_14:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 61","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 61","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":62,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_15"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_15@R001","sha256":"79802e23ba6f2ef734970f454736030b7e729557f273c04a9230082a1b7deb47","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS1","text":"Der Text prüft diagnostisch, ob Zahl und Rechnen den philosophischen Ausdruck des Begriffs oder die geistige Bildung tragen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS2","text":"Die Zahl wird als äußerlich gewordene Bestimmtheit der Quantität bestimmt und dadurch dem Begriff als Bewegung immanenter Beziehungen entgegengesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS3","text":"Die historische Verwendung der Zahl für Philosopheme erscheint als notwendiger, aber unvollkommener Übergang zwischen Sinnlichkeit und reinem Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS4","text":"Mit wachsender Konkretion der Denkbestimmungen erzeugt ihre numerische oder geometrische Darstellung Verwirrung, Willkür und Bedeutungsverlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS5","text":"Der Text schließt von der Äußerlichkeit des Rechnens auf die Unzulässigkeit, mathematische Formen als philosophische Logik oder als Hauptmittel der Geistesbildung zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A1","text":"Die Zahl ist die absolute Bestimmtheit der Quantität, deren Unterschied gleichgültig und äußerlich gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A2","text":"Arithmetische Verknüpfungen liegen ihrem Gegenstand nicht immanent inne, sondern werden ihm äußerlich angetan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A3","text":"Begriffsbestimmungen sind nur als immanente Beziehung und Bewegung dessen, was bestimmt wird, wahrhaft begrifflich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A4","text":"Die Beziehungslosigkeit der Zahl schließt jene innere Notwendigkeit aus, die der Begriff verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A5","text":"Die Zahl vermittelt zwischen Sinnlichkeit und Denken, weil sie die abstrakte Äußerlichkeit des Sinnlichen in unsinnlicher Form bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A6","text":"Zahlenformen können einfachen abstrakten Gedanken angenähert sein, verlieren aber bei konkreten Verhältnissen begriffliche Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A7","text":"Die Bedeutung mathematischer Formeln als Gedankenbestimmungen muss durch Philosophie und Logik bestimmt und gerechtfertigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A8","text":"Symbolische Formen enthalten keine Wahrheit über den Gedanken hinaus, sondern können deren gedankliche Explikation nur verhüllen oder vorbereiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A9","text":"Rechnen ist eine unsinnliche Reflexionsübung, bleibt aber wegen seines äußerlichen Unterschieds mechanisch und begrifflos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A10","text":"Eine Tätigkeit, die Maschinen vollständig ausführen können, bildet als solche nicht die spezifisch geistige Fähigkeit des Begriffs aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX1","text":"Die Zahl ist nicht der Begriff, weil sie die Beziehungslosigkeit der äußeren Bestimmtheit bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX2","text":"Arithmetik ist nicht begriffliches Erkennen, weil ihr kein Gegenstand mit zu entdeckenden inneren Verhältnissen zukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX3","text":"Die numerische Benennung von Denkbewegungen ist nicht deren Begreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX4","text":"Ein Symbol ist nicht die von ihm gemeinte Wahrheit und besitzt keinen semantischen Mehrwert gegenüber dem explizierten Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX5","text":"Mathematik ist nicht die Quelle der philosophischen Logik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX6","text":"Rechenunterricht ist nicht das Hauptbildungsmittel des Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D1","text":"Die historische philosophische Verwendung der Zahl ist als Übergangsform erklärbar, aber nicht als endgültige Form des Gedanken legitimierbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A5","CH_GB18_A_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D2","text":"Die Darstellung konkreter Begriffsverhältnisse durch Zahlen muss mit zunehmender inhaltlicher Bestimmtheit unklarer und willkürlicher werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A1","CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D3","text":"Die numerische Fixierung spekulativer Einheit verwandelt das zu begreifende Verhältnis in eine Ansammlung beziehungsloser Einheiten und produziert dadurch den behaupteten Widersinn.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D4","text":"Mathematische Formeln erhalten philosophischen Sinn erst nach ihrer logischen Übersetzung und verlieren dabei ihre partikulare mathematische Autorität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A7","CH_GB18_A_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D5","text":"Die pädagogische Konzentration auf Rechnen verdrängt gehaltvolle geistige und sittliche Inhalte durch die Wiederholung leerer Einheit und äußerlicher Verbindung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D6","text":"Die technische Reproduzierbarkeit arithmetischer Operationen fungiert im Text als Nachweis ihres mechanischen Charakters.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A2","CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD1","text":"Die Kritik an der Zahl ist zugleich eine Kritik jeder Erkenntnisordnung, die äußere Form, begriffliche Bedeutung und geistige Bildung gleichsetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A1","CH_GB18_A_15:A7","CH_GB18_A_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD2","text":"Der Text etabliert eine Schwelle der Darstellbarkeit: Je stärker ein Inhalt von Beziehung, Bewegung und Konkretion abhängt, desto weniger kann er durch diskrete äußere Bestimmungen adäquat ausgedrückt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A4","CH_GB18_A_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD3","text":"Die Philosophie beansprucht eine metatheoretische Zuständigkeit für die Bedeutung mathematischer Kategorien, weil deren logischer Gehalt nicht aus ihrer mathematischen Verwendung selbst hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A2","CH_GB18_A_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD4","text":"Die pädagogische Kritik folgt nicht aus einer Ablehnung der Abstraktion überhaupt, sondern aus der Unterscheidung zwischen reflektierender Abstraktion und mechanischer Entleerung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A5","CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX1","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass formale Exaktheit bereits begriffliche Wahrheit garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass ein äußerliches Zeichenverhältnis die innere Notwendigkeit seines Gegenstandes unverändert bewahren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX3","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass die Wiederholung abstrakter Operationen den Geist schon deshalb bildet, weil sie Anstrengung und Konzentration fordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX4","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass die Autorität einer besonderen Wissenschaft die philosophische Rechtfertigung ihrer Kategorien ersetzen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass der Begriff durch ein ihm äußerliches Medium vollständig repräsentiert werden kann, ohne seine Selbstbeziehung und Bewegung zu verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass isolierte Einheiten dasjenige ausdrücken können, dessen Wahrheit nur in konstitutiver Beziehung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Bildungslogik, in der die Vervollkommnung des Menschen als Rechenmaschine mit der Bildung des Geistes zusammenfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS1","text":"Äußerlich-gleichgültiger Unterschied → Zahl als abstrakte Bestimmtheit → Arithmetik als äußerliche Verknüpfung ohne immanente Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS2","text":"Begriffliche Wahrheit → immanente Beziehung und Bewegung → Unangemessenheit diskreter und beziehungsloser Zahlformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS3","text":"Abstrakter Gedanke → vorläufige symbolische oder numerische Bezeichnung → steigende Konkretion → Verwirrung, Willkür und Bedeutungsverlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS4","text":"Mathematische Formel mit beanspruchtem Gedankeninhalt → Prüfung ihres logischen Sinns → Ablösung ihrer mathematischen Partikularform → philosophische Rechtfertigung oder Verwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS5","text":"Rechenübung → abstrakte Reflexion plus mechanische Begrifflosigkeit → Verdrängung gehaltvoller Bildung → Zurückweisung ihrer pädagogischen Vorrangstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AF1","text":"Philosophische und pädagogische Aufwertung der Zahl → Bestimmung der Zahl als äußerliche Quantitätsform → Trennung von Zahl und Begriff → historische Einordnung der Zahl als Übergangsmedium → Kritik numerischer und symbolischer Begriffsrepräsentation → logische Rechenschaftspflicht mathematischer Formen → Zurückweisung des Rechnens als Hauptbildungsmittel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME1","text":"Zahl wird von einem möglichen Träger philosophischer Tiefe zu einer Grenzform umklassifiziert, die Gedanken nur in niedriger Abstraktion annähern kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME2","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Sinnlichkeit und Denken wird durch eine Zwischenzone ersetzt, in der die Zahl unsinnlich, aber weiterhin äußerlich bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME3","text":"Symbolische und mathematische Darstellungen werden nicht als Quellen, sondern als Gegenstände logischer Entschlüsselung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME4","text":"Pädagogische Disziplin wird in gehaltvolle geistige Bildung und mechanische Trainierbarkeit auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist der Gebrauch von Zahl, Rechnen, geometrischen Figuren und mathematischen Formeln in Philosophie und Erziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die Gegenüberstellung äußerlicher Verknüpfung und immanenter begrifflicher Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der illustrativen Brauchbarkeit mathematischer Formen zu den Bedingungen ihrer philosophischen Legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Zahl erscheint als geschichtlich frühe und systematisch unvollkommene Vermittlungsform zwischen sinnlicher Äußerlichkeit und reinem Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Ableitung von der äußeren Bestimmtheit der Zahl bis zur Kritik ihrer philosophischen und pädagogischen Vorrangstellung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt das positive Kriterium, nach dem der reine Gedanke seinen eigentümlichen Ausdruck vollständig gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern immanente Beziehung und Bewegung als notwendige Bedingungen des Begriffs vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Kette verbindet die Äußerlichkeit der Zahl mit der mechanischen Form des Rechnens und daraus mit der Begrenzung seines Bildungswertes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt bestehen, weil die Zahl zugleich als dem Gedanken nahe stehende Abstraktion und als äußerste Entäußerung des Denkens bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, sofern die historischen Verweise als Exemplifikation der systematischen Hierarchie und nicht als selbständige historische Beweisführung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111641585487Z_64d4e24b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 2.","source_sha256":"79802e23ba6f2ef734970f454736030b7e729557f273c04a9230082a1b7deb47","sha256":"9686566905bd5c0d3445bb3faa07b5354bd8383613adfbde82426a4c515a8a6f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:16:41.586848+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS1","text":"The text examines diagnostically whether number and calculation can bear the philosophical expression of the concept or spiritual education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS2","text":"Number is determined as the externalized determinacy of quantity and thereby opposed to the concept as the movement of immanent relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS3","text":"The historical use of number for philosophemes appears as a necessary but imperfect transition between sensibility and pure thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS4","text":"With increasing concreteness of the determinations of thought, their numerical or geometrical representation produces confusion, arbitrariness, and loss of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AS5","text":"The text infers from the externality of calculation the inadmissibility of treating mathematical forms as philosophical logic or as the principal means of spiritual education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A1","text":"Number is the absolute determinacy of quantity, whose difference is posited as indifferent and external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A2","text":"Arithmetic connections do not inhere immanently in their object but are externally imposed upon it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A3","text":"Determinations of the concept are genuinely conceptual only as the immanent relation and movement of that which is determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A4","text":"The relationlessness of number excludes that inner necessity which the concept requires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A5","text":"Number mediates between sensibility and thought because it preserves the abstract externality of the sensible in non-sensible form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A6","text":"Numerical forms can approximate simple abstract thoughts, but in concrete relations they lose conceptual determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A7","text":"The significance of mathematical formulas as determinations of thought must be determined and justified by philosophy and logic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A8","text":"Symbolic forms contain no truth beyond thought, but can only conceal or prepare its conceptual explication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A9","text":"Calculation is a non-sensible exercise of reflection, but because of its external difference it remains mechanical and devoid of concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:A10","text":"An activity that machines can perform completely does not, as such, cultivate the specifically spiritual capacity of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX1","text":"Number is not the concept because it preserves the relationlessness of external determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX2","text":"Arithmetic is not conceptual cognition because it has no object possessing inner relations to be discovered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX3","text":"The numerical naming of movements of thought is not their comprehension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX4","text":"A symbol is not the truth it means and possesses no semantic surplus over the explicated thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX5","text":"Mathematics is not the source of philosophical logic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:NX6","text":"Instruction in calculation is not the principal means of educating the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D1","text":"The historical philosophical use of number is explicable as a transitional form, but cannot be legitimized as the final form of thought.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A5","CH_GB18_A_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D2","text":"The representation of concrete conceptual relations through numbers must become more obscure and arbitrary with increasing determinacy of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A1","CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D3","text":"The numerical fixation of speculative unity transforms the relation to be comprehended into an aggregate of relationless units and thereby produces the alleged absurdity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D4","text":"Mathematical formulas acquire philosophical meaning only after their logical translation and thereby lose their particular mathematical authority.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A7","CH_GB18_A_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D5","text":"The pedagogical concentration on calculation displaces substantial spiritual and ethical contents through the repetition of empty unity and external connection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:D6","text":"The technical reproducibility of arithmetical operations functions in the text as proof of their mechanical character.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A2","CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD1","text":"The critique of number is at the same time a critique of every order of cognition that equates external form, conceptual meaning, and spiritual education.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A1","CH_GB18_A_15:A7","CH_GB18_A_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD2","text":"The text establishes a threshold of representability: the more strongly a content depends on relation, movement, and concreteness, the less it can be adequately expressed through discrete external determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A3","CH_GB18_A_15:A4","CH_GB18_A_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD3","text":"Philosophy claims a metatheoretical competence regarding the meaning of mathematical categories, because their logical content does not emerge from their mathematical use itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A2","CH_GB18_A_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SD4","text":"The pedagogical critique does not follow from a rejection of abstraction as such, but from the distinction between reflective abstraction and mechanical emptying.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_15:A5","CH_GB18_A_15:A9","CH_GB18_A_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX1","text":"It must be false that formal exactness already guarantees conceptual truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX2","text":"It must be false that an external relation of signs can preserve the inner necessity of its object unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX3","text":"It must be false that the repetition of abstract operations educates the spirit simply because it demands exertion and concentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:DNX4","text":"It must be false that the authority of a particular science can replace the philosophical justification of its categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the concept can be completely represented through a medium external to it without losing its self-relation and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that isolated units can express that whose truth consists only in constitutive relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an educational logic in which the perfection of the human being as a calculating machine coincides with the education of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS1","text":"Externally indifferent difference → number as abstract determinacy → arithmetic as external connection without immanent necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS2","text":"Conceptual truth → immanent relation and movement → inadequacy of discrete and relationless numerical forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS3","text":"Abstract thought → provisional symbolic or numerical designation → increasing concreteness → confusion, arbitrariness, and loss of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS4","text":"Mathematical formula with claimed conceptual content → examination of its logical sense → detachment from its particular mathematical form → philosophical justification or rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:FGS5","text":"Exercise in calculation → abstract reflection plus mechanical absence of concept → displacement of substantial education → rejection of its pedagogical priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:AF1","text":"Philosophical and pedagogical elevation of number → determination of number as an external form of quantity → separation of number and concept → historical classification of number as a transitional medium → critique of numerical and symbolic representation of the concept → logical accountability of mathematical forms → rejection of calculation as the principal means of education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME1","text":"Number is reclassified from a possible bearer of philosophical depth into a limiting form that can approximate thoughts only at a low level of abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME2","text":"The opposition between sensibility and thought is replaced by an intermediate zone in which number is non-sensible but remains external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME3","text":"Symbolic and mathematical representations are mapped not as sources but as objects of logical decipherment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ME4","text":"Pedagogical discipline is divided into substantial spiritual education and mechanical trainability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit subject is the use of number, calculation, geometrical figures, and mathematical formulas in philosophy and education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is the opposition between external connection and immanent conceptual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the question from the illustrative usefulness of mathematical forms to the conditions of their philosophical legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Number appears as a historically early and systematically imperfect mediating form between sensible externality and pure thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the derivation from the external determinacy of number to the critique of its philosophical and pedagogical priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive criterion according to which pure thought fully attains its distinctive expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent provided that immanent relation and movement are presupposed as necessary conditions of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT4","text":"Its strongest chain connects the externality of number with the mechanical form of calculation and, from this, with the limitation of its educational value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains because number is determined both as an abstraction standing close to thought and as the most extreme externalization of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_15:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement insofar as the historical references are treated as exemplifications of the systematic hierarchy and not as independent historical demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_15@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_15:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 62","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 62","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD","layer":"CH","title":"a. Their Difference.","order":63,"parents":["RAW_GB18_UNTD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_UNTD@R001","sha256":"50cc8db9dceccf09eae0635897fbc2780291151e5bc4717b007f32ca846847de","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die Bestimmtheit des Quantums zu erklären, obwohl seine Zahl zugleich äußerliche Vielheit und selbstbezogene Grenze ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS2","text":"Der Text trennt Bestimmungen der quantitativen Grenze von Bestimmungen der Quantität unter Abstraktion von jeder Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS3","text":"Die numerische Vielheit des extensiven Quantums hebt sich wegen der Gleichheit ihrer Einheiten in einfache Einheit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS4","text":"Die zur einfachen Einheit gewordene Grenze ist als Grad intensive Größe, deren verdrängte Vielheit außerhalb ihrer selbst gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS5","text":"Der Grad erhält seine Bestimmtheit nur durch seine wesentliche Beziehung auf andere Grade innerhalb einer kontinuierlichen Skala.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der in der Zahl enthaltenen Anzahl über deren Aufhebung zur qualitativen Realität einer äußerlich vermittelten Intensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","text":"Das Quantum ist mit seiner Grenze identisch und erhält seine Bestimmtheit als Grenze in der Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A2","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe sind Bestimmungen der quantitativen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A3","text":"Kontinuierliche und diskrete Größe sind Bestimmungen der Quantität als solcher, sofern von der Grenze abstrahiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A4","text":"Kontinuierliche Größe ist ohne das Eins und ohne Zahl kein vollständig bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A5","text":"Diskrete Größe ist ohne Zusammenfassung ihres Vielen in Eins nur unbestimmt begrenzte Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","text":"Das extensive Quantum ist Zahl als Anzahl einer und derselben Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A7","text":"Die numerischen Eins sind als viele Einheiten nicht in sich ungleich, sondern kontinuierlich und gleichgültig gegeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","text":"Die äußere Vielheit der Anzahl hebt sich in der selbstbezogenen Einheit der Zahl auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A9","text":"Die einfache, mit dem Quantum identische Grenze ist intensive Größe oder Grad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","text":"Der Grad enthält die Zahl als aufgehobene Anzahl und nicht als in ihm vorhandene Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","text":"Der Grad bezieht sich als einfache Grenze auf eine ihm äußerliche Vielheit, welche seine Bestimmtheit ausmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A12","text":"Die Qualität des Quantums besteht in einer Bestimmtheit, die an sich als äußerliche Bestimmtheit gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A13","text":"Die Grade sind zugleich selbstbezogene Einheiten und wesentlich aufeinander bezogene Momente einer kontinuierlichen Skala.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX1","text":"Extensive Größe ist nicht der Gegenbegriff zur diskreten Größe; ihr unmittelbarer Gegensatz ist intensive Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX2","text":"Kontinuierliche Größe allein ist nicht bestimmtes Quantum, weil ihr Eins, ihre Zahl und ihr Für-sich-Bestimmtsein fehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX3","text":"Diskrete Vielheit allein ist nicht bestimmtes Quantum, weil sie ohne Einheit nur Menge bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX4","text":"Die Anzahl numerischer Eins konstituiert nicht als bloße Summe die Bestimmtheit der Zahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX5","text":"Der Grad ist nicht die Summe der in seiner Zahl enthaltenen Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX6","text":"Der Grad ist nicht eine in sich vollständig geschlossene, von anderen Graden unabhängige Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX7","text":"Die Veränderung der Intensität ist nicht teilbare Abfolge isolierter Zustände, sondern ununterbrochenes Fließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D1","text":"Das bestimmte Quantum verlangt die Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion, weil jede dieser Bestimmungen für sich die quantitative Grenze nicht vollständig setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","CH_GB18_UNTD:A4","CH_GB18_UNTD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D2","text":"Der Übergang vom extensiven zum intensiven Quantum vernichtet die Anzahl nicht, sondern verlegt sie aus der inneren Verfassung der Zahl in ihre äußere Bedingung.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D3","text":"Die numerische Benennung eines Grades bezeichnet dessen bestimmte Einfachheit und nicht eine in ihm vorhandene Vielheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A9","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D4","text":"Intensive Bestimmtheit ist nur als Vergleichs- und Differenzverhältnis zu einer äußeren Mehrheit von Intensitäten bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D5","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung des Grades ist zugleich Beziehung auf ein Äußerliches, weil seine ausgeschlossene Vielheit die Bedingung seiner bestimmten Einfachheit bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D6","text":"Quantitative Bestimmtheit schlägt in Qualität um, weil ihre Gleichgültigkeit nur als an sich äußere Bestimmtheit Realität besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD1","text":"Die Unterscheidung von extensiv und intensiv betrifft nicht zwei getrennte Gegenstandsarten, sondern zwei Stellungen derselben quantitativen Grenze zur Vielheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","CH_GB18_UNTD:A2","CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","CH_GB18_UNTD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD2","text":"Die Intensität gewinnt ihre scheinbare Innerlichkeit nur durch Ausschluss und Externalisierung der Anzahl, die sie weiterhin bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD3","text":"Die Skala der Grade ist kein äußerliches Ordnungssystem, sondern die konstitutive Realität jedes einzelnen Grades.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD4","text":"Quantität erscheint als qualitativ wirksam, sobald ihre Bestimmtheit nicht mehr als innere Anzahl, sondern als äußerlich vermittelte Differenz operiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX1","text":"Ein isoliertes Quantum ohne Verhältnis zu anderer Größe kann keine vollständige intensive Bestimmtheit besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX2","text":"Eine Vielheit, deren Einheiten absolut verschieden und nicht kontinuierlich ineinander überführbar wären, ist als Grundlage der Zahl ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX3","text":"Eine Grenze kann nicht zugleich vollständig innerlich und vollständig äußerlich sein; ihre Bestimmtheit verlangt die Vermittlung beider Stellungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX4","text":"Reine Quantität ohne qualitative Konsequenz ist ausgeschlossen, weil die äußerliche Bestimmtheit des Quantums dessen Qualität ausmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX1","text":"Unvermittelte Selbstidentität ist ausgeschlossen, weil die Selbstbeziehung des Grades durch eine ausgeschlossene, aber wirksame Äußerlichkeit konstituiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX2","text":"Eine endgültige Trennung von Einheit und Vielheit ist ausgeschlossen, weil jede einfache intensive Einheit die aufgehobene Vielheit ihrer Zahl bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX3","text":"Ein absolut diskontinuierlicher Raum der Grade ist ausgeschlossen, weil jede Bestimmtheit eines Grades nur im ununterbrochenen Übergang zu anderen Graden besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS1","text":"Quantität ohne Grenze → kontinuierliche oder diskrete Abstraktion ohne vollständiges bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS2","text":"Grenze als Anzahl gleicher Einheiten → extensives Quantum als numerische Vielheit einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS3","text":"Gleichheit der numerischen Einheiten → Aufhebung ihrer äußeren Vielheit in selbstbezogene einfache Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS4","text":"Einfache Grenze als aufgehobene Anzahl → Grad als intensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS5","text":"Ausschluss der Anzahl aus dem Grad → äußerliche Vielheit als Bestimmungsgrund des Grades.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS6","text":"Äußere Vielheit + wesentliche Wechselbeziehung der Grade → kontinuierliche Skala, qualitative Realität und unteilbare Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF1","text":"Unbestimmtheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion → Bestimmung des Quantums durch Grenze und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF2","text":"Anzahl einer Einheit → extensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF3","text":"Homogenität der numerischen Vielheit → Rückkehr der Zahl in einfache Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF4","text":"Einfache, mit dem Quantum identische Grenze → Grad als intensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF5","text":"Externalisierung der aufgehobenen Anzahl → Bestimmung des Grades durch andere Grade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF6","text":"Wesentliche Gradrelation → kontinuierliche Skala und Qualität des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME1","text":"Die Opposition kontinuierlich/diskret wird von der Opposition extensiv/intensiv getrennt und auf eine andere Abstraktionsebene verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME2","text":"Zahl wird nicht mehr als bloße Menge numerischer Eins sichtbar, sondern als Selbstbeziehung, welche ihre eigene Vielheit aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME3","text":"Der Grad wird nicht als atomare innere Größe, sondern als einfache Grenze sichtbar, deren Inhalt außerhalb ihrer liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME4","text":"Die Skala wird von einem bloßen Messinstrument zu einer konstitutiven Relationsstruktur der Intensitäten umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME5","text":"Qualität erscheint nicht als von Quantität getrennte Sphäre, sondern als Realität der äußerlich vermittelten quantitativen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das extensive Quantum ist Anzahl; das intensive Quantum ist Grad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmtheit des Quantums entsteht durch die Bewegung von innerer Vielheit zu einfacher Grenze und äußerer Vergleichsrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt begriffliche Gegenüberstellungen durch Übergänge, in denen die ausgeschlossene Bestimmung als Bedingung fortwirkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein des Grades ist ein fortlaufendes, unteilbares Werden innerhalb einer Skala, nicht das ruhende Sein einer isolierten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von extensiver Anzahl zu intensiver Gradbestimmtheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion benötigt die Trennung zwischen Quantität als solcher und quantitativer Grenze, weil sonst die Zentralunterscheidung zusammenfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT3","text":"Die stärkste Strukturstelle ist die Aufhebung der inneren numerischen Vielheit bei gleichzeitiger Bewahrung ihrer bestimmenden Funktion außerhalb des Grades.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die äußerliche Vielheit der Grade selbst als bestimmte Totalität begrenzt oder geordnet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist nur unter der Bedingung kohärent, dass Aufhebung weder Vernichtung noch bloße Verlagerung bedeutet, sondern bewahrende Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass der Grad als gleichgültig gegen andere Grade und zugleich nur durch diese anderen Grade bestimmt gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, wenn sie die Intensität nicht als Alternative zur Zahl, sondern als deren transformierte und externalisierte Form behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T120025245037Z_5a75682b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Difference of the same.","source_sha256":"50cc8db9dceccf09eae0635897fbc2780291151e5bc4717b007f32ca846847de","sha256":"d79dc71260c328fcfcbe428985759d714827275ed5f6110386ff483d6a88ab79","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T12:00:25.246443+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS1","text":"The problem consists in explaining the determinacy of quantum, although its number is at once external plurality and self-related limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS2","text":"The text separates determinations of the quantitative limit from determinations of quantity under abstraction from every limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS3","text":"The numerical plurality of extensive quantum sublates itself into simple unity on account of the equality of its units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS4","text":"The limit that has become simple unity is, as degree, intensive magnitude, whose displaced plurality is posited outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS5","text":"Degree receives its determinacy only through its essential relation to other degrees within a continuous scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AS6","text":"The movement leads from the amount contained in number, through its sublation, to the qualitative reality of an externally mediated intensity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","text":"Quantum is identical with its limit and receives its determinacy as limit in amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A2","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude are determinations of the quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A3","text":"Continuous and discrete magnitude are determinations of quantity as such, insofar as abstraction is made from the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A4","text":"Continuous magnitude is not a completely determinate quantum without the One and without number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A5","text":"Discrete magnitude, without the gathering of its many into One, is only indeterminately delimited aggregate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","text":"Extensive quantum is number as the amount of one and the same unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A7","text":"The numerical Ones, as many units, are not unequal in themselves, but continuous and indifferent toward one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","text":"The external plurality of amount sublates itself in the self-related unity of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A9","text":"The simple limit identical with quantum is intensive magnitude or degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","text":"Degree contains number as sublated amount and not as an aggregate present within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","text":"As simple limit, degree relates to a plurality external to it, which constitutes its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A12","text":"The quality of quantum consists in a determinacy that is posited in itself as external determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:A13","text":"Degrees are at once self-related unities and moments essentially related to one another within a continuous scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX1","text":"Extensive magnitude is not the opposing concept of discrete magnitude; its immediate opposite is intensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX2","text":"Continuous magnitude alone is not determinate quantum, because it lacks its One, its number, and its being-determined-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX3","text":"Discrete plurality alone is not determinate quantum, because without unity it remains merely aggregate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX4","text":"The amount of numerical Ones does not constitute the determinacy of number as a mere sum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX5","text":"Degree is not the sum of the units contained in its number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX6","text":"Degree is not a simplicity completely closed within itself and independent of other degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:NX7","text":"The alteration of intensity is not a divisible succession of isolated states, but uninterrupted flowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D1","text":"Determinate quantum requires the unity of continuity and discreteness, because each of these determinations by itself does not completely posit the quantitative limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","CH_GB18_UNTD:A4","CH_GB18_UNTD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D2","text":"The transition from extensive to intensive quantum does not annihilate amount, but relocates it from the inner constitution of number into its external condition.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D3","text":"The numerical designation of a degree denotes its determinate simplicity and not a plurality present within it.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A9","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D4","text":"Intensive determinacy is determined only as a relation of comparison and difference to an external multiplicity of intensities.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D5","text":"The self-relation of degree is at once relation to an externality, because its excluded plurality remains the condition of its determinate simplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:D6","text":"Quantitative determinacy passes over into quality, because its indifference possesses reality only as determinacy external in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD1","text":"The distinction between extensive and intensive concerns not two separate kinds of object, but two positions of the same quantitative limit in relation to plurality.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A1","CH_GB18_UNTD:A2","CH_GB18_UNTD:A6","CH_GB18_UNTD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD2","text":"Intensity gains its apparent inwardness only through the exclusion and externalization of the amount that continues to determine it.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A8","CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD3","text":"The scale of degrees is not an external system of ordering, but the constitutive reality of each individual degree.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SD4","text":"Quantity appears as qualitatively effective as soon as its determinacy no longer operates as inner amount, but as externally mediated difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_UNTD:A10","CH_GB18_UNTD:A11","CH_GB18_UNTD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX1","text":"An isolated quantum without relation to other magnitude cannot possess complete intensive determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX2","text":"A plurality whose units would be absolutely different and could not be continuously transformed into one another is excluded as the basis of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX3","text":"A limit cannot be at once completely internal and completely external; its determinacy requires the mediation of both positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:DNX4","text":"Pure quantity without qualitative consequence is excluded, because the external determinacy of quantum constitutes its quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX1","text":"Unmediated self-identity is excluded, because the self-relation of degree is constituted by an excluded but effective externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX2","text":"A final separation of unity and plurality is excluded, because every simple intensive unity preserves the sublated plurality of its number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:SNX3","text":"An absolutely discontinuous space of degrees is excluded, because every determinacy of a degree consists only in the uninterrupted transition to other degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS1","text":"Quantity without limit → continuous or discrete abstraction without complete determinate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS2","text":"Limit as amount of equal units → extensive quantum as numerical plurality of one unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS3","text":"Equality of numerical units → sublation of their external plurality into self-related simple unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS4","text":"Simple limit as sublated amount → degree as intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS5","text":"Exclusion of amount from degree → external plurality as determining ground of degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:FGS6","text":"External plurality + essential reciprocal relation of degrees → continuous scale, qualitative reality, and indivisible alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF1","text":"Indeterminacy of continuity and discreteness → determination of quantum through limit and amount.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF2","text":"Amount of one unit → extensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF3","text":"Homogeneity of numerical plurality → return of number into simple unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF4","text":"Simple limit identical with quantum → degree as intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF5","text":"Externalization of sublated amount → determination of degree through other degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:AF6","text":"Essential relation of degrees → continuous scale and quality of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME1","text":"The opposition continuous/discrete is separated from the opposition extensive/intensive and shifted to another level of abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME2","text":"Number is no longer visible as a mere aggregate of numerical Ones, but as self-relation that sublates its own plurality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME3","text":"Degree becomes visible not as atomic inner magnitude, but as a simple limit whose content lies outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME4","text":"The scale is reclassified from a mere instrument of measurement into a constitutive relational structure of intensities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ME5","text":"Quality appears not as a sphere separate from quantity, but as the reality of externally mediated quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Extensive quantum is amount; intensive quantum is degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinacy of quantum arises through the movement from inner plurality to simple limit and external relation of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces conceptual oppositions with transitions in which the excluded determination continues to operate as condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of degree is a continuing, indivisible becoming within a scale, not the resting being of an isolated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from extensive amount to intensive degree-determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction requires the separation between quantity as such and quantitative limit, because otherwise the central distinction collapses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT3","text":"The strongest structural point is the sublation of inner numerical plurality while at the same time preserving its determining function outside degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT4","text":"What remains underdetermined is whereby the external plurality of degrees is itself delimited or ordered as a determinate totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT5","text":"The structure is coherent only on the condition that sublation signifies neither annihilation nor mere displacement, but preserving negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT6","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that degree is posited as indifferent toward other degrees and at the same time as determined only through these other degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_UNTD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement if it treats intensity not as an alternative to number, but as its transformed and externalized form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_UNTD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_UNTD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_UNTD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 63","title":"a. Their Difference.","context":"Chapter 63","original_title":"a. Unterschied derselben."},"original_title":"a. Unterschied derselben.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD","layer":"CH","title":"b. Identity of Extensive and Intensive Magnitude.","order":64,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BITD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BITD@R001","sha256":"e2fb2fa9d431a7ba91ccbb58844d09d88fd04dcc6ced27b967a4a7598a783215","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS1","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Grades muss erklärt werden, ohne extensive und intensive Größe als selbständige Quantitäten zu trennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS2","text":"Die intensive Größe ist ein einfaches Eins der Mehreren, dessen Bestimmtheit weder aus isolierter Einheit noch aus bloßer Mehrheit, sondern aus ihrer Beziehung im Außersichsein entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS3","text":"In dieser Beziehung enthält der bestimmte Grad die Anzahl als Kontinuität, während die Anzahl als solche außerhalb des Grades vermittelt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS4","text":"Die intensive Größe ist zugleich durch den Ausschluss anderer Grade und durch ihre eigene Anzahl bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS5","text":"Ihre eigene Anzahl macht sie zu einem extensiven Quantum; extensive und intensive Größe sind daher dieselbe quantitative Bestimmtheit unter verschiedener Stellung der Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS6","text":"Die extensive Vielheit fällt in die intensive Einheit zusammen, während die intensive Einheit durch ihre eigene Anzahl wieder zur extensiven Größe übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS7","text":"Die negative Identität dieser quantitativen Unterschiede erzeugt das qualitative Etwas, das ein Quantum besitzt, ihm gegenüber jedoch gleichgültig gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A1","text":"Der Grad ist in sich kein Äußerliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A2","text":"Die intensive Größe ist ein einfaches Eins der Mehreren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A3","text":"Die Bestimmtheit der intensiven Größe besteht in ihrer Beziehung zu ihrem Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A4","text":"Der bestimmte Grad enthält die ihn bestimmende Anzahl als kontinuierliche, einfache Mehrheit, obwohl die Anzahl als solche außerhalb des Grades steht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A5","text":"Die intensive Größe ist sowohl durch den Ausschluss anderer Grade als auch durch ihre eigene Anzahl bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A6","text":"Die Anzahl, sofern sie die eigene Anzahl des Grades ist, bestimmt ihn als extensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A7","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe sind dieselbe Bestimmtheit des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A8","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe unterscheiden sich dadurch, dass die eine die Anzahl innerhalb, die andere dieselbe Anzahl außerhalb ihrer hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A9","text":"Die extensive Vielheit fällt an und für sich in die Einheit der intensiven Größe zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A10","text":"Die intensive Einheit hat ihre Bestimmtheit nur an der Anzahl und ist dadurch ebenso wesentlich extensive Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A11","text":"Die negative Identität der quantitativen Unterschiede ist ein qualitatives Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A12","text":"Das qualitative Etwas ist gegen seine quantitative Bestimmung gleichgültig und besitzt dennoch ein extensives und intensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A13","text":"Die eine quantitative Bestimmtheit ist in den Momenten von Einheit und Anzahl gesetzt und kehrt durch diese Differenzierung in eine negative Einheit zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX1","text":"Der Grad ist kein innerhalb seiner bestehendes Äußerliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX2","text":"Die intensive Größe ist weder das unbestimmte Eins noch das bloße Prinzip der Zahl überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX3","text":"Die intensive Größe ist weder als einfaches Eins noch als bloße Mehrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Grades besteht nicht ausschließlich in der Zahl anderer Grade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX5","text":"Der bestimmte Grad ist nicht nur durch seine Abgrenzung vom vorhergehenden oder folgenden Grad bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX6","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe sind keine verschiedenen Arten quantitativer Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX7","text":"Die Anzahl ist weder ausschließlich innerhalb noch ausschließlich außerhalb der quantitativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX8","text":"Das qualitative Etwas ist nicht mit seiner quantitativen Bestimmung identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D1","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Grades entsteht aus der Identität von Einheit und Mehrheit innerhalb ihrer Beziehung zum Außersichsein.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A2","CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D2","text":"Die Zahl ist im bestimmten Grad als Kontinuität enthalten und bleibt zugleich als Zahl außerhalb des Grades die vermittelnde Bedingung seiner Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D3","text":"Die doppelte Bestimmung der intensiven Größe verbindet den Ausschluss anderer Grade mit der inneren Bestimmung durch die eigene Anzahl.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D4","text":"Sobald die Anzahl als eigene Anzahl des Grades bestimmt ist, ist die intensive Größe zugleich extensives Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A5","CH_GB18_BITD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen extensiver und intensiver Größe bezeichnet nur die verschiedene Stellung derselben Anzahl innerhalb oder außerhalb der Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D6","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe gehen ineinander über, weil Vielheit als Einheit und Einheit als durch Anzahl bestimmte Vielheit gesetzt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A9","CH_GB18_BITD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D7","text":"Aus der quantitativen Identität entsteht durch die Negation ihrer Unterschiede ein qualitatives Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D8","text":"Das Etwas ist der Träger beider quantitativer Bestimmungen, ohne in ihnen aufzugehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A12","CH_GB18_BITD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD1","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmtheit ist eine reversible Vermittlung von innerer Einheit und äußerer Vielheit, nicht eine stabile Verteilung auf zwei getrennte Größenarten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A2","CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD2","text":"Das Verhältnis von Innen und Außen bezeichnet keine ontologische Trennung, sondern die wechselnde Setzungsweise derselben Anzahl.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A4","CH_GB18_BITD:A6","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD3","text":"Die Identität von extensiver und intensiver Größe ist kein statisches Gleichsein, sondern erzeugt durch die Negation ihrer Unterschiede eine qualitative Seinsbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A9","CH_GB18_BITD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD4","text":"Das qualitative Etwas hebt die quantitative Bestimmung nicht auf, sondern ordnet sie als eine von ihm unterschiedene und dennoch von ihm besessene Bestimmung unter.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A11","CH_GB18_BITD:A12","CH_GB18_BITD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine intensive Einheit, die sich ohne Beziehung zu einer Mehrheit oder zu anderem bestimmen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Äußerlichkeit der Zahl, da die äußerliche Anzahl die innere Bestimmtheit des Grades konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine eigenständige Ontologie extensiver und intensiver Größen als zweier voneinander unabhängiger Quantitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine quantitative Bestimmung, die ihre eigene qualitative Vermittlung nicht hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unvermittlelt vorausliegendes Substrat, da das Etwas erst durch die Negation quantitativer Unterschiede für sich gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Existenz, die entweder ohne Quantum oder vollständig im Quantum bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Quantum, das seine Bestimmtheit entweder ohne Einheit oder ohne Mehrheit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Grenze zwischen der Anzahl innerhalb und der Anzahl außerhalb des Grades.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter quantitativer Standpunkt, von dem aus extensive und intensive Größe unabhängig voneinander bestimmt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein qualitatives Substrat, das den quantitativen Bestimmungen äußerlich vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX5","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine quantitative Selbstidentität, die nicht in die negative Identität des Etwas übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS1","text":"Unbestimmtes Eins → einfaches Eins der Mehreren → Beziehung des Außersichseins → relationale Bestimmtheit des Grades.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS2","text":"Relation zum Anderssein → enthaltene Zahl als kontinuierliche Mehrheit + äußerliche Zahl als Vermittlung → bestimmter Grad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS3","text":"Beziehung zu anderen Graden → Ausschlussbestimmung; eigene Anzahl → innere Bestimmung → extensives Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS4","text":"Extensive Vielheit → Zusammenfallen in Einheit → intensive Größe; intensive Einheit → Bestimmung durch eigene Anzahl → extensive Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS5","text":"Identität beider Größen → Negation ihrer Unterschiede → negative Identität → qualitatives Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS6","text":"Etwas mit Quantum → Setzung der Einheit und Anzahl als verschiedene Momente → Rückkehr in negative Einheit bei gleichzeitiger Gleichgültigkeit gegen das Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AF1","text":"Unbestimmtes Eins → intensive Einheit der Mehreren → relationale Bestimmtheit → kontinuierlich enthaltene Anzahl bei äußerlich bleibender Zahl → doppelte Bestimmung durch Ausschluss und eigene Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AF2","text":"Eigene Anzahl → extensive Bestimmung → reziproker Übergang von Vielheit und Einheit → quantitative Identität → Negation der Unterschiede → qualitatives Etwas mit extensivem und intensivem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von extensiver und intensiver Größe wird als Positionsunterschied der Anzahl innerhalb derselben quantitativen Bestimmtheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME2","text":"Das Außersichsein der Zahl wird von einer bloßen Außenlage zu einer konstitutiven Vermittlungsrelation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME3","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Einheit und Mehrheit wird als Umschlagsstelle und nicht als stabile Trennlinie sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME4","text":"Das Quantum wird vom selbständigen Gegenstand zur Bestimmung eines qualitativen Etwas umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME5","text":"Das Etwas erscheint zugleich als Träger quantitativer Bestimmungen und als negative Gleichgültigkeit gegen diese Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT1","text":"Auf der Oberflächenebene wird die Bestimmtheit von Grad, extensiver Größe und intensiver Größe bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT2","text":"Auf der strukturellen Ebene wird quantitative Bestimmtheit durch das Verhältnis von Einheit, Mehrheit, Außersichsein, Ausschluss und eigener Anzahl erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT3","text":"Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird ein scheinbarer Gegensatz in eine reziproke Vermittlung und einen Umschlag der Bestimmungsweisen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT4","text":"Auf der ontologischen Ebene wird qualitative Existenz als negative Identität quantitativer Unterschiede gesetzt, die das Quantum besitzt, ohne mit ihm identisch zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome genügen, um die Bewegung von der relationalen Bestimmung des Grades über die Identität von extensiver und intensiver Größe bis zum qualitativen Etwas zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das Außersichsein der Zahl ausschließlich logisch-relational oder zugleich als reale Äußerlichkeit verstanden werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die äußere Zahl als konstitutive Relation und nicht als unabhängiges Gegenstück behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die wechselseitige Ableitung von extensiver und intensiver Größe aus der verschiedenen Stellung derselben Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Stelle ist der Übergang zum qualitativen Etwas, da dessen Hervorgehen aus negativer Identität zugleich eine Erzeugung und eine Setzung als Träger voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT6","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der Gleichgültigkeit des Etwas gegen das Quantum und seiner Vermittlung durch genau dieses Quantum bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn die vorgängige Abstraktion des Quantums ohne Etwas von der abschließenden Setzung des Etwas mit Quantum unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113457334753Z_1cab4a10","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Identity of extensive and intensive magnitude.","source_sha256":"e2fb2fa9d431a7ba91ccbb58844d09d88fd04dcc6ced27b967a4a7598a783215","sha256":"032ecacadc2219ae7f80fab0306ed212fa045f80a8f3fecb9d61a1794a59a371","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:34:57.336487+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS1","text":"The determinacy of degree must be explained without separating extensive and intensive magnitude as independent quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS2","text":"Intensive magnitude is a simple one of the many, whose determinacy arises neither from isolated unity nor from mere multiplicity, but from their relation in being-outside-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS3","text":"In this relation, the determinate degree contains number as continuity, while number as such remains mediated outside the degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS4","text":"Intensive magnitude is determined both by the exclusion of other degrees and by its own number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS5","text":"Its own number makes it an extensive quantum; extensive and intensive magnitude are therefore the same quantitative determinacy under a different positioning of number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS6","text":"The extensive multiplicity collapses into the intensive unity, while the intensive unity, through its own number, passes back into extensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AS7","text":"The negative identity of these quantitative differences produces the qualitative something, which possesses a quantum but is posited as indifferent to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A1","text":"The degree is not in itself an externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A2","text":"Intensive magnitude is a simple one of the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A3","text":"The determinacy of intensive magnitude consists in its relation to its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A4","text":"The determinate degree contains the number determining it as continuous, simple multiplicity, although number as such stands outside the degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A5","text":"Intensive magnitude is determined both by the exclusion of other degrees and by its own number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A6","text":"Number, insofar as it is the degree's own number, determines it as an extensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A7","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude are the same determinacy of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A8","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude differ in that the one has number within itself, the other the same number outside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A9","text":"The extensive multiplicity collapses in and for itself into the unity of intensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A10","text":"The intensive unity has its determinacy only in number and is thereby equally essentially extensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A11","text":"The negative identity of the quantitative differences is a qualitative something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A12","text":"The qualitative something is indifferent to its quantitative determination and nevertheless possesses an extensive and intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:A13","text":"The one quantitative determinacy is posited in the moments of unity and number and returns through this differentiation into a negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX1","text":"The degree is not an externality subsisting within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX2","text":"Intensive magnitude is neither the indeterminate one nor the mere principle of number in general.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX3","text":"Intensive magnitude is determined neither as a simple one nor as mere multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX4","text":"The determinacy of degree does not consist exclusively in the number of other degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX5","text":"The determinate degree is not determined only by its delimitation from the preceding or following degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX6","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude are not different kinds of quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX7","text":"Number is neither exclusively within nor exclusively outside the quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:NX8","text":"The qualitative something is not identical with its quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D1","text":"The determinacy of degree arises from the identity of unity and multiplicity within their relation to being-outside-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A2","CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D2","text":"Number is contained in the determinate degree as continuity and at the same time remains, as number outside the degree, the mediating condition of its determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D3","text":"The double determination of intensive magnitude combines the exclusion of other degrees with the inner determination through its own number.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D4","text":"As soon as number is determined as the degree's own number, intensive magnitude is at the same time an extensive quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A5","CH_GB18_BITD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D5","text":"The opposition between extensive and intensive magnitude designates only the different positioning of the same number within or outside unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D6","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude pass into one another because multiplicity is posited as unity and unity as multiplicity determined through number.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A9","CH_GB18_BITD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D7","text":"From quantitative identity there arises, through the negation of its differences, a qualitative something.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:D8","text":"The something is the bearer of both quantitative determinations, without being exhausted in them.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A12","CH_GB18_BITD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD1","text":"Quantitative determinacy is a reversible mediation of inner unity and outer multiplicity, not a stable distribution across two separate kinds of magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A2","CH_GB18_BITD:A3","CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD2","text":"The relation of inside and outside designates no ontological separation, but rather the alternating mode of positing the same number.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A4","CH_GB18_BITD:A6","CH_GB18_BITD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD3","text":"The identity of extensive and intensive magnitude is not a static equality, but through the negation of their differences produces a qualitative determination of being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A7","CH_GB18_BITD:A9","CH_GB18_BITD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SD4","text":"The qualitative something does not annul the quantitative determination, but subordinates it as a determination distinct from it and yet possessed by it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BITD:A11","CH_GB18_BITD:A12","CH_GB18_BITD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an intensive unity that could determine itself without relation to a multiplicity or to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an absolute externality of number, since external number constitutes the inner determinacy of degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an independent ontology of extensive and intensive magnitudes as two quantities independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a quantitative determination that does not bring forth its own qualitative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an unmediatedly presupposed substrate, since the something is first posited for itself through the negation of quantitative differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a qualitative existence that could subsist either without quantum or wholly in quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a quantum that possesses its determinacy either without unity or without multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a final boundary between number within and number outside the degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a final quantitative standpoint from which extensive and intensive magnitude could be determined independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a qualitative substrate that lies externally prior to the quantitative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:SNX5","text":"Impossible is a pure quantitative self-identity that does not pass over into the negative identity of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate one → simple one of the many → relation of being-outside-itself → relational determinacy of degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS2","text":"Relation to otherness → contained number as continuous multiplicity + external number as mediation → determinate degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS3","text":"Relation to other degrees → determination by exclusion; own number → inner determination → extensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS4","text":"Extensive multiplicity → collapse into unity → intensive magnitude; intensive unity → determination through own number → extensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS5","text":"Identity of both magnitudes → negation of their differences → negative identity → qualitative something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:FGS6","text":"Something with quantum → positing of unity and number as different moments → return into negative unity with simultaneous indifference toward the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AF1","text":"Indeterminate one → intensive unity of the many → relational determinacy → continuously contained number while number remains external → double determination through exclusion and own number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:AF2","text":"Own number → extensive determination → reciprocal transition of multiplicity and unity → quantitative identity → negation of differences → qualitative something with extensive and intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME1","text":"The opposition of extensive and intensive magnitude is mapped as a positional difference of number within the same quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME2","text":"The being-outside-itself of number is reclassified from a mere external position into a constitutive mediating relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME3","text":"The boundary between unity and multiplicity becomes visible as a point of transition and not as a stable dividing line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME4","text":"The quantum is remapped from an independent object to the determination of a qualitative something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ME5","text":"The something appears at once as the bearer of quantitative determinations and as negative indifference toward these determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the determinacy of degree, extensive magnitude, and intensive magnitude is determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, quantitative determinacy is produced through the relation of unity, multiplicity, being-outside-itself, exclusion, and own number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, an apparent opposition is transformed into a reciprocal mediation and a transition of modes of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:ALT4","text":"At the ontological level, qualitative existence is posited as the negative identity of quantitative differences, which possesses the quantum without being identical with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the relational determination of degree through the identity of extensive and intensive magnitude to the qualitative something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the being-outside-itself of number is to be understood exclusively as logical-relational or also as real externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as external number is treated as a constitutive relation and not as an independent counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the reciprocal derivation of extensive and intensive magnitude from the different positioning of the same number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT5","text":"The weakest point is the transition to the qualitative something, since its emergence from negative identity presupposes both a production and a positing as bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT6","text":"A structural tension remains between the indifference of the something toward the quantum and its mediation through precisely this quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BITD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the prior abstraction of quantum without something is distinguished from the concluding positing of something with quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BITD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BITD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BITD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 64","title":"b. Identity of Extensive and Intensive Magnitude.","context":"Chapter 64","original_title":"b. Identität der extensiven und intensiven Größe."},"original_title":"b. Identität der extensiven und intensiven Größe.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":65,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_16"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_16@R001","sha256":"73fcc3991a9f83e9980efcf415cf37077bab5c0f844d53eae05c5a002ea750c3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS1","text":"Die gewöhnliche Unterscheidung von extensivem und intensivem Quantum behandelt beide fälschlich als ausschließende Arten von Gegenständen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS2","text":"Die dynamische Betrachtung ersetzt die äußerliche Vielheit der Teile durch die Äußerung einer zugrunde liegenden Kraft, ohne dadurch die extensive Seite aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS3","text":"Die entscheidende Neubestimmung besteht darin, extensive und intensive Größe als zwei notwendige Formen desselben Inhalts zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS4","text":"Das Argument verfährt diagnostisch und rekonstruktiv, indem es eine einseitige Umwandlung in eine wechselseitige Bestimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS5","text":"Zahl, Grad, konkrete Größen und geistige Intensität fungieren als gestufte Nachweise dieser Doppelbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der These, dass jedes Dasein seine Größebestimmung zugleich extensiv und intensiv darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A1","text":"Extensives und intensives Quantum sind keine ausschließenden Gegenstandsarten, sondern unterschiedliche Formen einer Größebestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A2","text":"Die mechanische Betrachtung bestimmt ein Ganzes als äußerlich verbundene, selbstständige Teile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A3","text":"Die dynamische Betrachtung bestimmt die extensive Vielheit als Äußerung einer zugrunde liegenden einfachen Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A4","text":"Kraft und Äußerung sind untrennbar, obwohl sie als intensive und extensive Form unterschieden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A5","text":"Der intensive Grad enthält die extensive Bestimmung, die in ihm aufgehoben erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A6","text":"Extensive und intensive Form sind wechselseitig füreinander wesentlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A7","text":"Jede Zahl ist zugleich Anzahl und Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A8","text":"Jede intensive Einheit erhält ihre Bestimmtheit durch eine außerhalb ihrer liegende extensive Vielheit oder Skala.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A9","text":"Konkrete Größen erscheinen zugleich als äußerliche Menge und als innerliche Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A10","text":"Eine intensive Bestimmung äußert sich in einer extensiven Wirkung, und eine extensive Wirkung weist auf eine intensive Bestimmung zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX1","text":"Das System bestimmt Größen nicht als Gegenstände, die ausschließlich extensiv oder ausschließlich intensiv wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX2","text":"Die Umwandlung des Extensiven in das Intensive ist keine vollständige Beseitigung der extensiven Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX3","text":"Die dynamische Betrachtung ist keine hinreichende Auflösung des Verhältnisses von Ganzem und Teilen oder von Kraft und Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX4","text":"Kraft ist keine selbstgenügsame Bestimmung ohne Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX5","text":"Die Äußerung ist keine äußerliche Realität, die von der Kraft abtrennbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX6","text":"Das Extensive ist keine bloße Äußerlichkeit ohne intensive Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX7","text":"Die Zahl ist nicht ausschließlich extensive Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX8","text":"Der Grad ist nicht eine in sich verständliche Einheit unabhängig von einer Reihe oder Skala.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D1","text":"Die dynamische Betrachtung ist gegenüber der mechanischen zunächst wahrhafter, bleibt aber einseitig, weil sie die Äußerung nicht von der Kraft ablösen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A2","CH_GB18_A_16:A3","CH_GB18_A_16:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D2","text":"Die Aufhebung des extensiven Quantums in den Grad erzeugt keine reine Intensität, weil der Grad die extensive Bestimmung in sich bewahrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A5","CH_GB18_A_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D3","text":"Dieselbe Größebestimmung kann unter extensiver und intensiver Form erscheinen, ohne dass zwei verschiedene Inhalte entstehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A5","CH_GB18_A_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D4","text":"Die Zahl vermittelt den Übergang vom Extensiven zum Intensiven, indem die Vielheit als Einheit bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A7","CH_GB18_A_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D5","text":"Ein Grad besitzt Bedeutung nur durch seine Stellung in einer gegliederten Reihe von Graden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A7","CH_GB18_A_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D6","text":"Die konkrete Größe eines Gegenstandes ist zugleich seine äußerliche Ausdehnung und sein innerliches Wirksamkeitsmaß.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D7","text":"Druck, Temperatur, Ton und Farbe zeigen, dass intensive Unterschiede extensive Wirkungen und extensive Wirkungen intensive Unterschiede bestimmen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A8","CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D8","text":"Auch geistige Intensität bestimmt sich durch ausgedehnte Wirkung, Reichweite und Vielseitigkeit der Berührung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD1","text":"Die behauptete Überlegenheit des Intensiven gegenüber dem Extensiven wird in eine wechselseitige Gleichursprünglichkeit beider Formen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD2","text":"Die intensive Einheit ist keine unmittelbare Einfachheit, sondern eine durch extensive Vielheit bestimmte Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD3","text":"Größe ist innerhalb des Systems eine relationale Struktur, in der jede Form ihre Bestimmtheit durch die andere erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD4","text":"Die dynamische Erklärung reproduziert die extensive Seite auf höherer begrifflicher Ebene, statt sie zu beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD5","text":"Höhere Intensität wird als größere extensive Wirksamkeit, Reichweite oder Ausdehnung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD6","text":"Die Logik der Doppelbestimmung erstreckt sich vom physikalischen Quantum über konkrete Gegenstände bis zur geistigen Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD7","text":"Die vermeintliche Alternative zwischen mechanischer Vielheit und dynamischer Einheit wird als Verhältnis zweier Formen desselben Inhalts neu gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie, in der extensive und intensive Bestimmungen verschiedenen Gegenstandsklassen angehören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine einseitige Kausalordnung, in der das Intensive das Extensive vollständig erzeugt und selbst keiner extensiven Vermittlung bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Innerlichkeit, deren Bestimmtheit nicht durch Äußerlichkeit, Vielheit oder Maß vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Äußerlichkeit, die keinen innerlichen Grad oder keine Kraftbestimmung enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit, deren Sinn nicht durch eine Reihe, Anzahl oder Skala bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung von intensiver Bestimmung und extensiver Wirkung als zwei unabhängig bestehenden Inhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer ausschließlich intensiven Realität wird strukturell blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines ausschließlich extensiven Daseins wird strukturell blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX3","text":"Die Möglichkeit, die mechanische Äußerlichkeit durch dynamische Innerlichkeit endgültig zu ersetzen, bleibt unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer unmittelbaren, nicht durch Vielheit bestimmten Einheit wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit, Intensität ohne Reichweite und extensive Wirkung zu denken, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX6","text":"Die Abwesenheit einer reinen Form bildet die verborgene Bedingung der gesamten Argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS1","text":"Gegenüberstellung: extensives Quantum und intensives Quantum werden zunächst als getrennte Größenarten gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS2","text":"Kritik: Die Trennung wird als falsche Gegenstandsontologie identifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS3","text":"Neurahmung: Die mechanische Vielheit wird dynamisch als Äußerung einer Kraft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS4","text":"Begrenzung: Kraft und Äußerung werden zugleich als untrennbare Gegenformen festgehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS5","text":"Vermittlung: Die Aufhebung des Extensiven im intensiven Grad wird als Erhaltung der extensiven Bestimmung im Inneren des Grades rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS6","text":"Verallgemeinerung: Zahl, Grad und konkrete Größe zeigen die Identität desselben Inhalts in äußerlicher und innerlicher Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS7","text":"Totalisierung: Die Relation wird auf physische, sinnliche und geistige Größen ausgedehnt, bis Intensität als extensive Wirksamkeit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AF1","text":"Getrennte Gegenstandsarten → dynamische Privilegierung des Intensiven → Nachweis der Untrennbarkeit von Kraft und Äußerung → Aufhebung des Extensiven im Grad bei Erhaltung seiner Bestimmung → Doppelbestimmung von Zahl, Maß und konkretem Dasein → extensive Wirksamkeit der Intensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AF2","text":"Mechanische Äußerlichkeit → dynamische Innerlichkeit → wechselseitige Formbestimmung → universale Größelogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME1","text":"Die Karte der Gegenstände wird durch eine Karte der Doppelbestimmungen ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von extensiv und intensiv wird von einer Artunterscheidung in ein Formverhältnis desselben Inhalts transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME3","text":"Der Grad wird nicht mehr als isolierte Intensität, sondern als relationale Einheit innerhalb einer extensiven Skala sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME4","text":"Kraft wird nicht mehr als Alternative zur Äußerung, sondern als deren innerliche Seite kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME5","text":"Physikalische Größen, sinnliche Unterschiede und geistige Wirksamkeit werden unter derselben Struktur der wechselseitigen Maßbestimmung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME6","text":"Höhere Intensität wird begrifflich mit größerer Reichweite und Wirkung verknüpft, nicht mit bloßer innerer Steigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT1","text":"Surface: Unterschieden werden extensive Anzahl, intensive Einheit, Grad und äußerlich messbare Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Formen sind durch das Verhältnis von Vielheit und Einheit, Äußerung und Kraft sowie Äußerlichkeit und Innerlichkeit vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Eine scheinbare Umwandlung des Extensiven in das Intensive wird als einseitige Abstraktion zurückgewiesen und in eine reziproke Bestimmung umgearbeitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Jedes Dasein wird als zugleich extensiv und intensiv bestimmt; eine eigenständige zeitliche Struktur wird nicht entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale These der notwendigen Doppelbestimmung von extensivem und intensivem Quantum zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT2","text":"Die formale Sequenz bewahrt die Bewegung von der falschen Trennung über die dynamische Neurahmung zur wechselseitigen Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die weiterführende systematische Behandlung des Verhältnisses von Ganzem und Teilen sowie von Kraft und Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt außerdem, wie genau derselbe Inhalt zwischen intensiver und extensiver Form identisch bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT5","text":"Eine interne Spannung besteht darin, dass das Intensive zunächst als wahrhafter gilt, später aber nicht weniger einseitig als das Extensive bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT6","text":"Die Beispiele sichern die Übergänge durch analoge Instanziierung, ersetzen jedoch keinen eigenständigen Beweis der universalen Übertragbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist dort am stärksten, wo sie reine Intensität und reine Extensität als unmögliche Grenzformen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111702688296Z_f5ed32d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 1.","source_sha256":"73fcc3991a9f83e9980efcf415cf37077bab5c0f844d53eae05c5a002ea750c3","sha256":"2f4ac7e32ddafaa69a4ad5db1ce8d651955938ffb4ad066f0aea8913e238b26d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:17:02.694983+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS1","text":"The ordinary distinction between extensive and intensive quantum wrongly treats both as exclusive kinds of objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS2","text":"The dynamic consideration replaces the external multiplicity of parts with the manifestation of an underlying force, without thereby abolishing the extensive side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS3","text":"The decisive redetermination consists in determining extensive and intensive magnitude as two necessary forms of the same content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS4","text":"The argument proceeds diagnostically and reconstructively by converting a one-sided transformation into a reciprocal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS5","text":"Number, degree, concrete magnitudes, and spiritual intensity function as graduated demonstrations of this double determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AS6","text":"The movement culminates in the thesis that every existence presents its determination of magnitude as at once extensive and intensive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A1","text":"Extensive and intensive quantum are not exclusive kinds of objects, but different forms of a determination of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A2","text":"The mechanical consideration determines a whole as externally connected, self-subsistent parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A3","text":"The dynamic consideration determines extensive multiplicity as the manifestation of an underlying simple force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A4","text":"Force and manifestation are inseparable, although they are distinguished as intensive and extensive form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A5","text":"The intensive degree contains the extensive determination, which appears sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A6","text":"Extensive and intensive form are reciprocally essential to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A7","text":"Every number is at once number and unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A8","text":"Every intensive unit receives its determinacy through an extensive multiplicity or scale lying outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A9","text":"Concrete magnitudes appear at once as external quantity and as internal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:A10","text":"An intensive determination manifests itself in an extensive effect, and an extensive effect points back to an intensive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX1","text":"The system does not determine magnitudes as objects that would be exclusively extensive or exclusively intensive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX2","text":"The transformation of the extensive into the intensive is not a complete elimination of the extensive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX3","text":"The dynamic consideration is not a sufficient resolution of the relation of whole and parts or of force and manifestation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX4","text":"Force is not a self-sufficient determination without manifestation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX5","text":"Manifestation is not an external reality that could be separated from force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX6","text":"The extensive is not mere externality without intensive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX7","text":"Number is not exclusively extensive number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:NX8","text":"Degree is not a unit intelligible in itself independently of a series or scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D1","text":"The dynamic consideration is initially more true than the mechanical one, but remains one-sided because it cannot detach manifestation from force.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A2","CH_GB18_A_16:A3","CH_GB18_A_16:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D2","text":"The sublation of extensive quantum into degree produces no pure intensity, because degree preserves the extensive determination within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A5","CH_GB18_A_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D3","text":"The same determination of magnitude can appear under extensive and intensive form without two different contents arising.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A5","CH_GB18_A_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D4","text":"Number mediates the transition from the extensive to the intensive by determining multiplicity as unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A7","CH_GB18_A_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D5","text":"A degree possesses significance only through its position in an articulated series of degrees.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A7","CH_GB18_A_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D6","text":"The concrete magnitude of an object is at once its external extension and its internal measure of efficacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D7","text":"Pressure, temperature, tone, and colour show that intensive differences determine extensive effects and extensive effects intensive differences.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A8","CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:D8","text":"Spiritual intensity, too, determines itself through extended effect, range, and versatility of contact.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_16:A9","CH_GB18_A_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD1","text":"The asserted superiority of the intensive over the extensive is converted into a reciprocal co-originary status of both forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD2","text":"The intensive unit is not immediate simplicity, but a simplicity determined through extensive multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD3","text":"Within the system, magnitude is a relational structure in which each form receives its determinacy through the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD4","text":"The dynamic explanation reproduces the extensive side at a higher conceptual level instead of eliminating it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD5","text":"Higher intensity becomes legible as greater extensive efficacy, range, or extension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD6","text":"The logic of double determination extends from physical quantum through concrete objects to spiritual efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SD7","text":"The supposed alternative between mechanical multiplicity and dynamic unity is reconceived as a relation of two forms of the same content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology in which extensive and intensive determinations belong to different classes of objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a one-sided causal order in which the intensive completely produces the extensive and itself requires no extensive mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a pure inwardness whose determinacy would not be mediated through externality, multiplicity, or measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a pure externality that would contain no internal degree or determination of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a unity whose sense is not determined through a series, number, or scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a separation of intensive determination and extensive effect as two independently existing contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an exclusively intensive reality is structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX2","text":"The possibility of an exclusively extensive existence is structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX3","text":"The possibility of definitively replacing mechanical externality with dynamic inwardness remains impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX4","text":"The possibility of an immediate unity not determined through multiplicity is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX5","text":"The possibility of conceiving intensity without range and extensive effect is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:SNX6","text":"The absence of a pure form constitutes the hidden condition of the entire argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS1","text":"Opposition: extensive quantum and intensive quantum are initially posited as separate kinds of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS2","text":"Critique: the separation is identified as a false ontology of objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS3","text":"Reframing: mechanical multiplicity is dynamically determined as the manifestation of a force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS4","text":"Limitation: force and manifestation are at the same time retained as inseparable counter-forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS5","text":"Mediation: the sublation of the extensive in the intensive degree is reconstructed as preservation of the extensive determination within the degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS6","text":"Generalization: number, degree, and concrete magnitude show the identity of the same content in external and internal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:FGS7","text":"Totalization: the relation is extended to physical, sensible, and spiritual magnitudes, until intensity appears as extensive efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AF1","text":"Separate kinds of objects → dynamic privileging of the intensive → demonstration of the inseparability of force and manifestation → sublation of the extensive in degree while preserving its determination → double determination of number, measure, and concrete existence → extensive efficacy of intensity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:AF2","text":"Mechanical externality → dynamic inwardness → reciprocal determination of form → universal logic of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME1","text":"The map of objects is replaced by a map of double determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME2","text":"The opposition of extensive and intensive is transformed from a distinction of kinds into a formal relation of the same content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME3","text":"Degree becomes visible no longer as isolated intensity, but as a relational unity within an extensive scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME4","text":"Force is no longer mapped as an alternative to manifestation, but as its internal side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME5","text":"Physical magnitudes, sensible differences, and spiritual efficacy are classified under the same structure of reciprocal determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ME6","text":"Higher intensity is conceptually linked with greater range and effect, not with mere internal increase.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT1","text":"Surface: extensive number, intensive unit, degree, and externally measurable effect are distinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT2","text":"Structural: the forms are mediated through the relation of multiplicity and unity, manifestation and force, as well as externality and inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: an apparent transformation of the extensive into the intensive is rejected as one-sided abstraction and reworked into a reciprocal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: every existence is determined as at once extensive and intensive; an autonomous temporal structure is not developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central thesis of the necessary double determination of extensive and intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT2","text":"The formal sequence preserves the movement from false separation through dynamic reframing to reciprocal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the further systematic treatment of the relation of whole and parts, as well as of force and manifestation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT4","text":"Also underdetermined is precisely how the same content remains identical between intensive and extensive form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT5","text":"An internal tension consists in the fact that the intensive initially counts as more true, but is later determined as no less one-sided than the extensive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT6","text":"The examples secure the transitions through analogous instantiation, but do not replace an independent proof of universal transferability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_16:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction is strongest where it determines pure intensity and pure extensity as impossible limiting forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_16@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_16:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 65","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 65","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":66,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_17"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_17@R001","sha256":"6a2829d6d19e3f42291503797ee74e2629e462059e768ae96658e32e0abe746a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist, wie die Anwendung des intensiven Quantums auf die Seele deren mögliche Aufhebung in nichts begründen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS2","text":"Die Seele wird zunächst als einfaches, unmittelbar seiendes Seelending bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS3","text":"Unter dieser Bestimmung kann Kant ihr trotz fehlender extensiver Größe einen Grad der Realität und damit eine stufenweise verminderbare Intensität zuschreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS4","text":"Der Geist ist dagegen nicht als unmittelbar seiendes Ding, sondern als eine Seinsweise zu bestimmen, in der die Form des unmittelbaren Seins und die Kategorien desselben aufgehoben sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS5","text":"Daher ist nicht nur die extensive, sondern die Kategorie des Quantums überhaupt vom Geist zu entfernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS6","text":"Die Aufgabe verschiebt sich von der quantitativen Beharrlichkeit eines Seelendinges zur Bestimmung, wie Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit aus der ewigen Natur des Geistes hervorgehen, ohne ihn zum Ding zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A1","text":"Die rationale Psychologie betrachtet die Seele als ein unmittelbar Seiendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A2","text":"Was unmittelbar seiend und einfach bestimmt ist, kann unter Kategorien des Quantums betrachtet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A3","text":"Eine einfache Bestimmung schließt extensive Größe aus, weil sie kein Außereinander eines Mannigfaltigen enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A4","text":"Der Ausschluss extensiver Größe schließt intensive Größe nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A5","text":"Intensive Größe ist ein Grad der Realität hinsichtlich der Vermögen und dessen, was Dasein ausmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A6","text":"Jeder intensive Grad kann durch unendlich viele kleinere Grade vermindert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A7","text":"Die Verminderung der intensiven Kräfte kann ein unmittelbar seiendes Substrat in nichts übergehen lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A8","text":"Dem Geist kommt Sein zu, ohne dass er deshalb ein Ding ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A9","text":"Die Intensität des Geistes ist nicht die Intensität des intensiven Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A10","text":"Im Geist sind die Form des unmittelbaren Seins und die Kategorien dieses Seins aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A11","text":"Die Bestimmungen von Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit müssen aus der ewigen Natur des Geistes erklärt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX1","text":"Die Seele darf nicht aus ihrer Einfachheit unmittelbar als beharrliche Substanz bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX2","text":"Einfachheit beseitigt nicht jede Größenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX3","text":"Die Seele ist in der rationalen Psychologie nicht als Geist, sondern als Seelending gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX4","text":"Die Anwendung des intensiven Quantums setzt die Bestimmung als unmittelbar Seiendes voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX5","text":"Der Geist darf nicht unter die Kategorie des Quantums subsumiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX6","text":"Der Geist darf nicht als Ding aus seinen Bestimmungen von Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D1","text":"Aus der Bestimmung der Seele als einfachem unmittelbar Seiendem folgt, dass ihr trotz fehlender extensiver Größe ein intensiver Grad zugeschrieben werden kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A2","CH_GB18_A_17:A3","CH_GB18_A_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D2","text":"Aus der Zuschreibung eines intensiven Grades folgt die Möglichkeit einer kontinuierlichen Verminderung der Seelenvermögen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A5","CH_GB18_A_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D3","text":"Aus der kontinuierlichen Verminderung folgt die Möglichkeit, dass die als Substanz vorgestellte Seele in nichts übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A6","CH_GB18_A_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D4","text":"Die kantische Widerlegung der Beharrlichkeit betrifft die Seele nur unter der Voraussetzung, dass sie als unmittelbar seiendes Substrat behandelt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A5","CH_GB18_A_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D5","text":"Wenn der Geist kein Ding ist, kann seine Bestimmung nicht durch die quantitative Stabilität oder Auflösung eines Substrats erfolgen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D6","text":"Die Entfernung des extensiven Quantums reicht für die Bestimmung des Geistes nicht aus, weil dadurch das Quantum als Kategorie erhalten bliebe.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A3","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD1","text":"Die Kritik an der rationalen Psychologie erzeugt keine ausreichende Bestimmung des Geistes, solange sie lediglich die quantitative Behandlung eines Seelendinges korrigiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:D4","CH_GB18_A_17:D5","CH_GB18_A_17:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Seele und Geist wird als Gegensatz zweier ontologischer Bestimmungsweisen organisiert: unmittelbares Dingsein einerseits und aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit andererseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD3","text":"Die Frage nach der Beharrlichkeit wird in eine Frage nach der Hervorbringung von Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit aus der ewigen Natur des Geistes transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD4","text":"Die Aufhebung der Kategorien des unmittelbaren Seins verhindert zugleich die quantitative Reduktion des Geistes und erzwingt eine nicht-dingliche Erklärung seiner endlichen Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10","CH_GB18_A_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX1","text":"Die Beharrlichkeit des Geistes darf nicht als Fortdauer eines einfachen Substrats modelliert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX2","text":"Die ontologische Bestimmung des Geistes darf nicht aus der Übertragung allgemeiner Kategorien auf irgendein Existierendes gewonnen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX3","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Seele und Geist darf nicht auf den Unterschied zwischen extensiver und intensiver Größe reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX4","text":"Endlichkeit darf nicht als bloße quantitative Abschwächung einer ursprünglich dinghaften Realität verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX5","text":"Die Erklärung von Bewusstsein darf nicht bei einem vorhandenen Bewusstseinsgrad als weiter verminderbarer Eigenschaft stehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Geistigkeit vollständig durch die Kategorien des unmittelbaren Seins erklärbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die ewige Natur des Geistes durch eine bloße quantitative Kontinuität endlicher Vermögen zu ersetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Ontologie, in der Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit nur Eigenschaften eines vorausgesetzten Seelendinges sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine dinghafte Erklärung des Geistes, von der die gesamte Abgrenzung der geistigen Intensität ausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS1","text":"Einfaches unmittelbar Seiendes → Ausschluss extensiver Größe → Erhalt intensiver Größe → Verminderbarkeit der Grade → mögliche Auflösung in nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS2","text":"Bestimmung der Seele als Seelending → legitime Anwendung des Quantums → quantitative Kritik der Beharrlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS3","text":"Bestimmung des Geistes als nicht-dingliches Sein → Aufhebung des unmittelbaren Seins → Aufhebung sämtlicher Kategorien desselben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS4","text":"Entfernung des Quantums überhaupt → Abbruch der quantitativen Erklärung → Übergang zur Ableitung von Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit aus der ewigen Natur des Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS5","text":"Nicht-dingliche Geistnatur + endliche Erscheinungsbestimmungen → Erklärungsproblem der Hervorgehensweise ohne Verdinglichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF1","text":"Einfachheit der Seele → Ausschluss extensiver Größe → Zulassung intensiver Größe → graduelle Verminderung → mögliche Auflösung der Seelensubstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF2","text":"Seelending → kategoriale Quantifizierung → Kritik der Beharrlichkeit → Unzureichendheit für den Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF3","text":"Geistiges Sein → Aufhebung unmittelbarer Seinsformen → Entfernung des Quantums überhaupt → nicht-dingliche Erklärung von Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF4","text":"Quantitative Seelenkritik → ontologische Differenz von Seele und Geist → genetische Bestimmung der geistigen Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen extensiver und intensiver Größe wird durch die grundlegendere Unterscheidung zwischen quantifiziertem Seelending und nicht-dinglichem Geist übergeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME2","text":"Die Frage der Beharrlichkeit wird von der Ebene der Substanzdauer auf die Ebene der Hervorgehensweise endlicher Bestimmungen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME3","text":"Die Seele wird als Gegenstand einer kategorialen Psychologie und der Geist als deren überschreitende ontologische Bestimmung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME4","text":"Die Negation des extensiven Quantums wird als unzureichend markiert und zur Negation des Quantums überhaupt erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME5","text":"Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit erscheinen nicht mehr als quantitative Eigenschaften eines Dinges, sondern als zu erklärende Hervorgänge aus der geistigen Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Seele kann trotz ihrer Einfachheit einen intensiven Grad der Realität besitzen und durch dessen Verminderung in nichts übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Möglichkeit dieser Konsequenz beruht auf der Behandlung der Seele als unmittelbar seiendes Seelending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik wird von der Widerlegung einer metaphysischen Beharrlichkeitslehre auf die Neubestimmung des Gegenstandsbereichs selbst umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Geistiges Sein ist eine ewige, nicht-quantitative Seinsweise, aus der Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit hervorgehen, ohne in Dingsein überzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die quantitative Behandlung der Seele und ihre mögliche Auflösung in nichts zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT2","text":"Sie reichen ebenfalls aus, um den Übergang von der Seelenkritik zur nicht-dinglichen Bestimmung des Geistes nachzuvollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie Dasein, Bewusstsein und Endlichkeit konkret aus der ewigen Natur des Geistes hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur in der Unterscheidung von unmittelbarem Sein und aufgehobenem geistigem Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der kantischen Zulässigkeit quantitativer Bestimmung unter der Voraussetzung eines Existierenden und der radikalen Entfernung des Quantums vom Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung von der quantitativen Kritik der Seele zur offenen genetischen Aufgabe einer geistigen Ontologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111724030030Z_472fb9a9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 2.","source_sha256":"6a2829d6d19e3f42291503797ee74e2629e462059e768ae96658e32e0abe746a","sha256":"bd5249b4679ee366e7aa7eb5dd8835c9c54038411dc0aec31cfd20860a96a0bb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:17:24.031544+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS1","text":"The problem is how the application of intensive quantum to the soul can ground its possible dissolution into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS2","text":"The soul is initially determined as a simple, immediately existent soul-thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS3","text":"Under this determination, Kant can ascribe to it, despite its lack of extensive magnitude, a degree of reality and thus an intensity capable of being diminished in stages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS4","text":"Spirit, by contrast, is to be determined not as an immediately existent thing, but as a mode of being in which the form of immediate being and its categories are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS5","text":"Therefore, not only extensive quantum, but the category of quantum as such, is to be removed from spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AS6","text":"The task shifts from the quantitative persistence of a soul-thing to the determination of how existence, consciousness, and finitude proceed from the eternal nature of spirit without making it into a thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A1","text":"Rational psychology considers the soul to be something immediately existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A2","text":"What is determined as immediately existent and simple can be considered under categories of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A3","text":"A simple determination excludes extensive magnitude because it contains no externality of a manifold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A4","text":"The exclusion of extensive magnitude does not exclude intensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A5","text":"Intensive magnitude is a degree of reality with respect to the faculties and to that which constitutes existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A6","text":"Every intensive degree can be diminished through infinitely many smaller degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A7","text":"The diminution of intensive forces can cause an immediately existent substrate to pass over into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A8","text":"Being belongs to spirit without its thereby being a thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A9","text":"The intensity of spirit is not the intensity of intensive quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A10","text":"In spirit, the form of immediate being and the categories of this being are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:A11","text":"The determinations of existence, consciousness, and finitude must be explained from the eternal nature of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX1","text":"The soul must not be determined immediately from its simplicity as a persistent substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX2","text":"Simplicity does not eliminate every determination of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX3","text":"In rational psychology, the soul is grasped not as spirit, but as a soul-thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX4","text":"The application of intensive quantum presupposes the determination as something immediately existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX5","text":"Spirit must not be subsumed under the category of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:NX6","text":"Spirit must not emerge as a thing from its determinations of existence, consciousness, and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D1","text":"From the determination of the soul as simple immediately existent being follows that, despite its lack of extensive magnitude, an intensive degree can be ascribed to it.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A2","CH_GB18_A_17:A3","CH_GB18_A_17:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D2","text":"From the ascription of an intensive degree follows the possibility of a continuous diminution of the faculties of the soul.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A5","CH_GB18_A_17:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D3","text":"From continuous diminution follows the possibility that the soul conceived as substance passes over into nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A6","CH_GB18_A_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D4","text":"The Kantian refutation of persistence concerns the soul only on the presupposition that it is treated as an immediately existent substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A5","CH_GB18_A_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D5","text":"If spirit is not a thing, its determination cannot occur through the quantitative stability or dissolution of a substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:D6","text":"The removal of extensive quantum is insufficient for the determination of spirit, because quantum as a category would thereby remain preserved.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A3","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD1","text":"The critique of rational psychology produces no sufficient determination of spirit so long as it merely corrects the quantitative treatment of a soul-thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:D4","CH_GB18_A_17:D5","CH_GB18_A_17:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD2","text":"The opposition between soul and spirit is organized as an opposition between two ontological modes of determination: immediate thing-being on the one hand and sublated immediacy on the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A1","CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD3","text":"The question of persistence is transformed into a question of the production of existence, consciousness, and finitude from the eternal nature of spirit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A8","CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SD4","text":"The sublation of the categories of immediate being simultaneously prevents the quantitative reduction of spirit and compels a non-thingly explanation of its finite determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_17:A9","CH_GB18_A_17:A10","CH_GB18_A_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX1","text":"The persistence of spirit must not be modeled as the continuance of a simple substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX2","text":"The ontological determination of spirit must not be obtained by transferring general categories onto any existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX3","text":"The difference between soul and spirit must not be reduced to the difference between extensive and intensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX4","text":"Finitude must not be understood as a mere quantitative attenuation of an originally thing-like reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:DNX5","text":"The explanation of consciousness must not remain at a given degree of consciousness as a property capable of further diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which spirituality would be fully explicable through the categories of immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of replacing the eternal nature of spirit with a merely quantitative continuity of finite faculties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains an ontology in which existence, consciousness, and finitude are only properties of a presupposed soul-thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility is a thing-like explanation of spirit, from which the entire delimitation of spiritual intensity proceeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS1","text":"Simple immediately existent being → exclusion of extensive magnitude → retention of intensive magnitude → diminishability of degrees → possible dissolution into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS2","text":"Determination of the soul as soul-thing → legitimate application of quantum → quantitative critique of persistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS3","text":"Determination of spirit as non-thingly being → sublation of immediate being → sublation of all its categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS4","text":"Removal of quantum as such → termination of quantitative explanation → transition to the derivation of existence, consciousness, and finitude from the eternal nature of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:FGS5","text":"Non-thingly nature of spirit + finite determinations of appearance → explanatory problem of proceeding without reification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF1","text":"Simplicity of the soul → exclusion of extensive magnitude → admission of intensive magnitude → gradual diminution → possible dissolution of the soul-substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF2","text":"Soul-thing → categorical quantification → critique of persistence → insufficiency for spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF3","text":"Spiritual being → sublation of immediate forms of being → removal of quantum as such → non-thingly explanation of existence, consciousness, and finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:AF4","text":"Quantitative critique of the soul → ontological difference of soul and spirit → genetic determination of spiritual finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME1","text":"The distinction between extensive and intensive magnitude is subordinated to the more fundamental distinction between quantified soul-thing and non-thingly spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME2","text":"The question of persistence is shifted from the level of the duration of substance to the level of the manner of proceeding of finite determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME3","text":"The soul is classified as the object of a categorical psychology and spirit as its transcending ontological determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME4","text":"The negation of extensive quantum is marked as insufficient and expanded into the negation of quantum as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ME5","text":"Existence, consciousness, and finitude no longer appear as quantitative properties of a thing, but as emergences from spiritual eternity requiring explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT1","text":"Surface — Despite its simplicity, the soul can possess an intensive degree of reality and pass over into nothing through its diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT2","text":"Structural — The possibility of this consequence rests on the treatment of the soul as an immediately existent soul-thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique is shifted from the refutation of a metaphysical doctrine of persistence to the redetermination of the domain of objects itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Spiritual being is an eternal, non-quantitative mode of being from which existence, consciousness, and finitude proceed without passing over into thing-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the quantitative treatment of the soul and its possible dissolution into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT2","text":"They likewise suffice to trace the transition from the critique of the soul to the non-thingly determination of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how existence, consciousness, and finitude concretely proceed from the eternal nature of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent in the distinction between immediate being and sublated spiritual being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the Kantian admissibility of quantitative determination under the presupposition of an existent and the radical removal of quantum from spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_17:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement from the quantitative critique of the soul to the open genetic task of a spiritual ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_17@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_17:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 66","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 66","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Alteration of Quantum.","order":67,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDVN"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDVN@R001","sha256":"b61f70848c087547df1b2438673d98619f75b71dcc9dfab4597c6601ed7b67ba","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS1","text":"Das Quantum wird als aufgehobene, gleichgültige Grenze bestimmt, deren Bestimmtheit zugleich die Negation ihrer selbst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS2","text":"Die intensive Größe macht die im Quantum enthaltene Äußerlichkeit als inneren Widerspruch geltend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS3","text":"Die Größebestimmung hat ihr Sein nur in der Kontinuität mit einem anderen Quantum und ist daher werdende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS4","text":"Als sich auf sich beziehende Negativität treibt das Quantum seine eigene Bestimmtheit über sich hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS5","text":"Jedes hervorgebrachte andere Quantum ist wiederum eine sich aufhebende Grenze, wodurch die Bewegung ins Unendliche erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A1","text":"Das Quantum ist eine aufgehobene Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A2","text":"Die Grenze des Quantums ist gleichgültig gegen die Bestimmtheit, die sie begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Quantums ist zugleich die Negation ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums ist in seiner intensiven Form als innerer Widerspruch gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","text":"Die Größebestimmung hat ihr Sein nur in der Kontinuität mit einem anderen Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A6","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht eine seiende, sondern eine werdende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","text":"Das Quantum ist als sich auf sich beziehende Negativität unendlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","text":"Die Negativität des Quantums ist die Repulsion seiner eigenen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A9","text":"Die Repulsion des Quantums erzeugt nicht das sich selbst Gleiche, sondern sein Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A10","text":"Das Quantum ist an ihm selbst gesetzt, über sich hinauszugehen und ein anderes zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","text":"Das hervorgebrachte Andere ist zunächst selbst ein Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A12","text":"Jedes neue Quantum ist wiederum eine sich über sich selbst hinaustreibende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX1","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht durch den Unterschied von extensiver und intensiver Größe als solcher bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX2","text":"Die Größebestimmung ist nicht eine in sich ruhende seiende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX3","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Quantums hat ihre Grundlage nicht ausschließlich an ihm selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX4","text":"Die Repulsion des Quantums ist nicht die Erzeugung des sich selbst Gleichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX5","text":"Das Andere des Quantums ist keine abschließende neue Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX6","text":"Die Grenze kann nicht als endgültige Grenze bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D1","text":"Weil das Quantum aufgehobene Bestimmtheit und zugleich Negation seiner selbst ist, muss seine Größebestimmung veränderbar sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A1","CH_GB18_CDVN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D2","text":"Weil die Bestimmung nur in der Kontinuität mit ihrem Anderssein besteht, muss das Quantum über jede einzelne Größebestimmung hinausgehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","CH_GB18_CDVN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D3","text":"Die intensive Größe setzt die dem Quantum äußerliche Beziehung als im Quantum selbst enthaltene Bewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","CH_GB18_CDVN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D4","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung der Negativität verwandelt die Bestimmtheit des Quantums in eine Bewegung der Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D5","text":"Das Anderssein des Quantums erscheint als ein neues Quantum und nicht als bloße Aufhebung jeder Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A9","CH_GB18_CDVN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D6","text":"Die erneute Bestimmung hebt sich wiederum auf und fordert eine weitere Bestimmung hervor.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","CH_GB18_CDVN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD1","text":"Das Quantum ist keine isolierte Größe, sondern eine relationale Prozessform, deren Identität nur durch fortgesetzte Überschreitung besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","CH_GB18_CDVN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD2","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums wird nicht als äußerer Zusatz, sondern als immanente Produktivität seiner eigenen Bestimmtheit konstituiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD3","text":"Die Veränderung des Quantums ist keine zufällige Möglichkeit, sondern die gesetzte Konsequenz seiner inneren Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD4","text":"Das Unendliche entsteht als formale Folge einer Grenze, die nur besteht, indem sie sich fortwährend aufhebt und erneut setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A6","CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","CH_GB18_CDVN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Auffassung aus, Quantität sei eine ruhende, selbstidentische Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Trennung von innerer Bestimmung und äußerer Beziehung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Veränderung aus, die dem Quantum lediglich von außen widerfährt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX4","text":"Es schließt ein Unendliches aus, das außerhalb der quantitativen Bestimmung läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Grenze aus, die nicht in eine weitere Grenze überginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Identität des Quantums, die ohne Bezug auf sein Anderssein bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine abgeschlossene quantitative Ordnung, weil jede gesetzte Grenze ihre eigene Überschreitung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter Grund der Veränderung außerhalb der Selbstbewegung des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, das Andere als bloß fremde, nicht aus dem Quantum erzeugte Bestimmung zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS1","text":"aufgehobene Bestimmtheit + gleichgültige Grenze → Bestimmtheit als Negation ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS2","text":"Negation der eigenen Bestimmtheit + enthaltene Äußerlichkeit → innerer Widerspruch des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS3","text":"innerer Widerspruch + Kontinuität mit dem Anderssein → Grenze als Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS4","text":"werdende Grenze + sich auf sich beziehende Negativität → Repulsion der eigenen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS5","text":"Repulsion der Bestimmtheit → Erzeugung des Andersseins als anderes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS6","text":"anderes Quantum + erneute Selbstaufhebung → weitere werdende Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS7","text":"rekurrente Selbstaufhebung der Grenze → unendliche Fortsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AF1","text":"Gleichgültige Quantitätsbestimmung → innere Negation → Kontinuität mit dem Anderssein → werdende Grenze → Selbstüberschreitung → anderes Quantum → erneute Selbstaufhebung → Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME1","text":"Quantität wird von einer statischen Größenordnung in eine sich selbst verändernde Grenzbewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME2","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit wird als immanente Einheit eines Widerspruchs neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME3","text":"Das Andere wird nicht mehr als äußerer Gegenpol, sondern als vom Quantum selbst erzeugte quantitative Fortsetzung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME4","text":"Das Unendliche wird als Prozessform der fortgesetzten Grenzaufhebung und nicht als fertige jenseitige Größe bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Veränderung einer quantitativen Bestimmung wird als notwendiges Übergehen in ein anderes Quantum gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die quantitative Grenze besteht nur durch ihre Kontinuität mit dem Anderssein und reproduziert dadurch ihre eigene Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz von extensiver und intensiver Größe wird der tieferen Bewegungsstruktur des Quantums untergeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein wird als Werden einer Grenze bestimmt, deren Identität in einer unendlichen Folge von Selbstüberschreitungen liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der aufgehobenen Bestimmtheit zur unendlichen Veränderung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die extensive und die intensive Größe systematisch auseinander hervorgehen, obwohl ihre Differenz für die Grundbewegung als gleichgültig gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Negation der Bestimmtheit als immanente Bewegungsquelle akzeptiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der Veränderung aus der Bestimmung des Quantums selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Gleichgültigkeit des Quantums gegen seine Größenbestimmung und der Notwendigkeit, gerade diese Bestimmung fortwährend zu verändern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass jedes neue Quantum als Resultat erscheint, zugleich aber dieselbe unaufgelöste Struktur der Selbstüberschreitung wiederholt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern das Unendliche als rekursive Form und nicht als äußerer Endpunkt verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114312279813Z_e7579a29","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Alteration of Quantum.","source_sha256":"b61f70848c087547df1b2438673d98619f75b71dcc9dfab4597c6601ed7b67ba","sha256":"9be4c31b7f14a942c11690920c245563627a4bdb08d2c0263ef54902714fda88","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:43:12.282402+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS1","text":"Quantum is determined as a sublated, indifferent limit, whose determinacy is at the same time the negation of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS2","text":"Intensive magnitude brings the externality contained in quantum to bear as an inner contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS3","text":"The magnitude-determination has its being only in continuity with another quantum and is therefore a becoming limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS4","text":"As self-relating negativity, quantum drives its own determinacy beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AS5","text":"Each produced other quantum is in turn a self-sublating limit, whereby the movement into infinity is generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A1","text":"Quantum is a sublated determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A2","text":"The limit of quantum is indifferent to the determinacy that it limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","text":"The determinacy of quantum is at the same time the negation of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","text":"The externality of quantum is posited in its intensive form as an inner contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","text":"The magnitude-determination has its being only in continuity with another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A6","text":"Quantum is not a being, but a becoming limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","text":"As self-relating negativity, quantum is infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","text":"The negativity of quantum is the repulsion of its own determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A9","text":"The repulsion of quantum produces not what is self-same, but its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A10","text":"Quantum is posited in itself to go beyond itself and become another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","text":"The produced other is initially itself a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:A12","text":"Each new quantum is in turn a limit driving itself beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX1","text":"Quantum is not determined by the distinction between extensive and intensive magnitude as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX2","text":"The magnitude-determination is not a being limit resting within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX3","text":"The determinacy of quantum does not have its ground exclusively in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX4","text":"The repulsion of quantum is not the production of what is self-same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX5","text":"The other of quantum is not a conclusive new determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:NX6","text":"The limit cannot remain as a final limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D1","text":"Because quantum is sublated determinacy and at the same time the negation of itself, its magnitude-determination must be alterable.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A1","CH_GB18_CDVN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D2","text":"Because the determination exists only in continuity with its otherness, quantum must go beyond every individual magnitude-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","CH_GB18_CDVN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D3","text":"Intensive magnitude posits the relation external to quantum as movement contained in quantum itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","CH_GB18_CDVN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D4","text":"The self-relation of negativity transforms the determinacy of quantum into a movement of self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D5","text":"The otherness of quantum appears as a new quantum and not as the mere sublation of every determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A9","CH_GB18_CDVN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:D6","text":"The renewed determination in turn sublates itself and calls forth a further determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","CH_GB18_CDVN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD1","text":"Quantum is not an isolated magnitude, but a relational process-form whose identity exists only through continual transcendence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","CH_GB18_CDVN:A5","CH_GB18_CDVN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD2","text":"The externality of quantum is constituted not as an external addition, but as the immanent productivity of its own determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A4","CH_GB18_CDVN:A8","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD3","text":"The alteration of quantum is not a contingent possibility, but the posited consequence of its inner negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A3","CH_GB18_CDVN:A7","CH_GB18_CDVN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SD4","text":"The infinite arises as the formal consequence of a limit that exists only by continually sublating and re-positing itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDVN:A6","CH_GB18_CDVN:A11","CH_GB18_CDVN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the conception that quantity is a resting, self-identical determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX2","text":"It excludes the separation of inner determination and external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX3","text":"It excludes an alteration that merely befalls quantum from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX4","text":"It excludes an infinite that would lie outside quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:DNX5","text":"It excludes a final limit that would not pass over into a further limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX1","text":"Inadmissible is an identity of quantum that could exist without relation to its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a closed quantitative order, because every posited limit contains its own transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is an ultimate ground of alteration outside the self-movement of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:SNX4","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of treating the other as a merely alien determinacy not generated from quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS1","text":"sublated determinacy + indifferent limit → determinacy as the negation of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS2","text":"negation of its own determinacy + contained externality → inner contradiction of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS3","text":"inner contradiction + continuity with otherness → limit as becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS4","text":"becoming limit + self-relating negativity → repulsion of its own determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS5","text":"repulsion of determinacy → production of otherness as another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS6","text":"another quantum + renewed self-sublation → further becoming limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:FGS7","text":"recurrent self-sublation of the limit → infinite continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDVN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:AF1","text":"Indifferent quantitative determination → inner negation → continuity with otherness → becoming limit → self-transcendence → another quantum → renewed self-sublation → infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME1","text":"Quantity is remapped from a static magnitude-order into a self-altering movement of limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME2","text":"The distinction between inwardness and externality is reclassified as the immanent unity of a contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME3","text":"The other becomes visible no longer as an external counterpole, but as a quantitative continuation generated by quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ME4","text":"The infinite is determined as the process-form of continual sublation of limits and not as a completed transcendent magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT1","text":"Surface — The alteration of a quantitative determination is conceived as a necessary transition into another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT2","text":"Structural — The quantitative limit exists only through its continuity with otherness and thereby reproduces its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition between extensive and intensive magnitude is subordinated to the deeper movement-structure of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is determined as the becoming of a limit whose identity lies in an infinite sequence of self-transcendences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from sublated determinacy to infinite alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how extensive and intensive magnitude systematically emerge from one another, although their difference counts as indifferent for the basic movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that the negation of determinacy is accepted as an immanent source of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the derivation of alteration from the determination of quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the indifference of quantum toward its magnitude-determination and the necessity of continually altering precisely this determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that each new quantum appears as a result, while at the same time repeating the same unresolved structure of self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDVN:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, provided that the infinite is understood as a recursive form and not as an external endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDVN@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDVN:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 67","title":"c. The Alteration of Quantum.","context":"Chapter 67","original_title":"c. Die Veränderung des Quantums."},"original_title":"c. Die Veränderung des Quantums.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD","layer":"CH","title":"a. Concept of the Same.","order":68,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BEGD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BEGD@R001","sha256":"49b30cbc89b42c50d7e17532fe0317fc16728845378d10db37ab240fdb5eafe6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS1","text":"Das Quantum wird als eine an sich widersprüchliche Bestimmtheit bestimmt, deren Veränderung in ein anderes Quantum fortgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS2","text":"Weil das Andere selbst wieder Quantum ist, wird die Veränderung zur Kontinuität des Quantums in sein eigenes Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS3","text":"Die Negation des begrenzten Quantums bestimmt dessen Unbegrenztheit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS4","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit erhalten jeweils eine doppelte, entgegengesetzte Bestimmung, in der das Moment der jeweils anderen enthalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS5","text":"Das quantitative Unendliche unterscheidet sich vom qualitativen dadurch, dass das Quantum seine Negation und sein Anderssein an ihm selbst gesetzt hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS6","text":"Die an ihm selbst gesetzte Beziehung des quantitativen Endlichen auf sein Unendliches stellt sich zunächst als quantitativ-unendlicher Progress dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","text":"Das Quantum verändert sich und wird ein anderes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","text":"Die Fortsetzung der Veränderung ins Unendliche gründet in der inneren Widersprüchlichkeit des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","text":"Das Quantum kontinu­iert sich in sein Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A4","text":"Das Andere des Quantums ist selbst ein Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","text":"Das Quantum ist als Begrenztes sein eigenes Negatives und dadurch unbegrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A6","text":"Das Quantum ist ein Sollen, dessen Für-sich-Bestimmtsein zunächst Bestimmtsein in einem Anderen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A7","text":"Das aufgehobene Bestimmtsein in einem Anderen ist gleichgültiges Bestehen-für-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","text":"Endlichkeit bedeutet sowohl Begrenztheit als auch Hinausschicken über sich in ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","text":"Unendlichkeit bedeutet sowohl Nichtbegrenztsein als auch Zurückgekehrtsein-in-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","text":"Das Hinausschicken des Endlichen über sich ist zugleich eine Bestimmung des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A11","text":"Das Quantum ist gegen seine Grenze, gegen andere Quanta und gegen sein Hinaus gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","text":"Das quantitative Endliche bezieht sich an ihm selbst auf sein Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A13","text":"Qualitative Bestimmtheit ist unmittelbare Bestimmtheit und hat ihre Negation nicht an ihr selbst gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A14","text":"Größe ist aufgehobene Bestimmtheit, die mit sich ungleich und gegen sich selbst gleichgültig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A15","text":"Das qualitative Endliche und das qualitative Unendliche stehen sich abstrakt gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A16","text":"Das qualitative Endliche kontinu­iert sich nur an sich, nicht an ihm selbst, in sein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A17","text":"Die quantitative Beziehung des Endlichen auf das Unendliche ist im quantitativ-unendlichen Progress zunächst gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX1","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht eine in sich unveränderliche Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX2","text":"Das Andere des Quantums ist nicht ein qualitativ fremdes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX3","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des Quantums ist nicht bloß von seiner Endlichkeit getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX4","text":"Das Für-sich-Sein des Quantums ist nicht unabhängig von seinem Verhältnis zu Grenze, Anderem und Hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX5","text":"Qualitative Unendlichkeit ist nicht durch dieselbe gesetzte Selbstbeziehung wie quantitative Unendlichkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX6","text":"Die quantitative Veränderung ist nicht ein Übergang in ein nichtquantitatives Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX7","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht bloß ein äußerlich begrenztes Quantum ohne innere Beziehung zum Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D1","text":"Die Veränderung des Quantums erzeugt keine Aufhebung seiner Quantität, sondern die Fortsetzung der Quantität in einem anderen Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","CH_GB18_BEGD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D2","text":"Die Grenze des Quantums wird zur Grenze, die sich selbst überschreitet.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D3","text":"Die Unendlichkeit ist nicht äußerliche Abwesenheit jeder Grenze, sondern die im Quantum gesetzte Negation seiner Begrenztheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D4","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit sind beim Quantum keine isolierten Gegensätze, weil jede Bestimmung das Moment der anderen enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D5","text":"Das Quantum ist zugleich in einem Anderen bestimmt und als aufgehobene Bestimmung gegen dieses Andere gleichgültig.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A6","CH_GB18_BEGD:A7","CH_GB18_BEGD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D6","text":"Die quantitative Größe ist als aufgehobene Bestimmtheit prinzipiell veränderlich.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D7","text":"Der quantitative Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem ist eine gesetzte Selbstbeziehung, während der qualitative Gegensatz nur begrifflich vermittelt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","CH_GB18_BEGD:A13","CH_GB18_BEGD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D8","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung des quantitativen Endlichen auf sein Unendliches erscheint als Progress über jede gesetzte Grenze hinaus.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","CH_GB18_BEGD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD1","text":"Das quantitative Unendliche entsteht nicht jenseits des Quantums, sondern aus der inneren Instabilität des Quantums als begrenzter Größe.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD2","text":"Die Identität des Quantums wird als durchgängige Selbstüberschreitung organisiert: Es bleibt Quantum, indem es ein anderes Quantum wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","CH_GB18_BEGD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit wird von einer äußeren Gegenüberstellung in eine im Quantum selbst gesetzte Doppelstruktur überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD4","text":"Der quantitativ-unendliche Progress ist die erste Erscheinungsform einer Unendlichkeit, deren Inhalt in der fortgesetzten Negation jeder erreichten Grenze liegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX1","text":"Das Unendliche darf nicht als von der Bestimmtheit vollständig abgetrenntes Jenseits gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX2","text":"Das Quantum darf nicht als bloß äußerlich begrenzte, von ihrer Negation unberührte Einheit gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX3","text":"Das Andere darf nicht als vollständiger Bruch mit der ursprünglichen Quantität verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX4","text":"Für-sich-Sein darf nicht als reine Beziehungslosigkeit bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX5","text":"Der quantitative Progress darf nicht auf eine bloße äußerliche Aneinanderreihung von Quanta reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX6","text":"Die qualitative Opposition darf nicht als bereits gesetzte Selbstnegation der qualitativen Bestimmung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Unendliches, das seine Bestimmung unabhängig von der endlichen Grenze besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Endlichkeit, die ihr Hinaus über sich nicht als eigene Bestimmung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nur durch Stillstand und nicht durch Kontinuität im Anderssein besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, in der das Andere seine ursprüngliche Bestimmtheit vollständig verliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS1","text":"Begrenztes Quantum → innere Widersprüchlichkeit → Veränderung in ein anderes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS2","text":"Anderes Quantum → Kontinuität der Quantität → Selbstbeziehung des Quantums im Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS3","text":"Selbstbeziehung → Negation der Grenze → Unbegrenztheit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS4","text":"Endlichkeit = Grenze + Hinaus; Unendlichkeit = Nichtbegrenztsein + Rückkehr-in-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS5","text":"Gegenseitige Enthaltenheit → Aufhebung der abstrakten Trennung von Endlichem und Unendlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS6","text":"Gesetzte Ungleichheit-und-Gleichgültigkeit der Größe → quantitative Veränderlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS7","text":"Quantitative Selbstbeziehung des Endlichen auf das Unendliche → quantitativ-unendlicher Progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AF1","text":"Widersprüchliches Quantum → anderes Quantum → Kontinuität der Quantität → Negation der Grenze → doppelte Bestimmung von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit → Abgrenzung vom qualitativen Unendlichen → quantitativ-unendlicher Progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME1","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer abschließenden Bestimmung in ein Moment der Selbstüberschreitung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME2","text":"Das Andere wird vom qualitativen Gegenüber zum quantitativen Fortbestand derselben Bestimmungsart umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME3","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit erscheinen nicht länger als getrennte Regionen, sondern als ineinander enthaltene Bestimmungen des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME4","text":"Veränderung wird als Erhaltung der Quantität im Anderssein und nicht als Verlust der ursprünglichen Bestimmung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME5","text":"Der unendliche Progress wird als Form der gesetzten quantitativen Selbstbeziehung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Quantum verändert sich, wird ein anderes Quantum und geht in einen unendlichen Fortgang über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die quantitative Struktur verbindet Begrenztheit, Hinausschicken, Rückkehr-in-sich und Gleichgültigkeit gegen die Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz von Endlichem und Unendlichem wird von einer abstrakten Gegenüberstellung in eine immanente Vermittlungsstruktur überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein des Quantums besteht als Kontinuität im Anderssein; seine zeitliche Unendlichkeit folgt aus der wiederholbaren Selbstüberschreitung der Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Quantum zum quantitativ-unendlichen Progress zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die zentrale Doppelbestimmung von Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie der quantitativ-unendliche Progress über seine erste Bestimmung hinaus systematisch weiterentwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der Gleichzeitigkeit von Kontinuität im Anderen und Gleichgültigkeit gegen das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Bestimmung des Unendlichen als im Quantum gesetzte Negation seiner Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT6","text":"Die schwächste Stelle liegt in der Spannung zwischen dem unendlichen Hinaus und dem gleichgültigen Für-sich-Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern der Progress als erzeugte Form und nicht als bloße Aufzählung von Quanta verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113351286053Z_13b4184b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Concept of the same.","source_sha256":"49b30cbc89b42c50d7e17532fe0317fc16728845378d10db37ab240fdb5eafe6","sha256":"cdce85164e66906a0fc4863aaae4c2d339d26d1b3b2a64cbd70a8832b6ab1391","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:33:51.288234+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS1","text":"The Quantum is determined as a determinacy contradictory in itself, whose alteration proceeds into another Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS2","text":"Because the other is itself again a Quantum, alteration becomes the continuity of the Quantum into its own otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS3","text":"The negation of the limited Quantum determines its unboundedness and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS4","text":"Finitude and infinity each receive a double, opposing determination, in which the moment of the respective other is contained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS5","text":"The quantitative infinite differs from the qualitative in that the Quantum has posited its negation and its otherness in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AS6","text":"The relation, posited in itself, of the quantitative finite to its infinite initially presents itself as quantitatively infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","text":"The Quantum alters and becomes another Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","text":"The continuation of alteration into infinity is grounded in the inner contradictoriness of the Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","text":"The Quantum continues itself into its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A4","text":"The other of the Quantum is itself a Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","text":"As limited, the Quantum is its own negative and thereby unbounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A6","text":"The Quantum is an ought, whose being-determined-for-self is initially determinacy in an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A7","text":"The sublated determinacy in an other is indifferent subsistence-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","text":"Finitude means both limitation and sending-beyond itself into an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","text":"Infinity means both non-limitedness and having-returned-into-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","text":"The sending-beyond itself of the finite is at the same time a determination of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A11","text":"The Quantum is indifferent toward its limit, toward other Quanta, and toward its beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","text":"The quantitative finite relates in itself to its infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A13","text":"Qualitative determinacy is immediate determinacy and has not posited its negation in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A14","text":"Magnitude is sublated determinacy, which is unequal to itself and indifferent toward itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A15","text":"The qualitative finite and the qualitative infinite stand abstractly opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A16","text":"The qualitative finite continues itself only in itself, not in itself, into its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:A17","text":"The quantitative relation of the finite to the infinite is initially posited in quantitatively infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX1","text":"The Quantum is not a limit immutable in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX2","text":"The other of the Quantum is not a qualitatively alien being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX3","text":"The infinity of the Quantum is not merely separated from its finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX4","text":"The being-for-self of the Quantum is not independent of its relation to limit, other, and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX5","text":"Qualitative infinity is not determined by the same posited self-relation as quantitative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX6","text":"Quantitative alteration is not a transition into a non-quantitative other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:NX7","text":"The finite is not merely an externally limited Quantum without an inner relation to the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D1","text":"The alteration of the Quantum produces no sublation of its quantity, but rather the continuation of quantity in another Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","CH_GB18_BEGD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D2","text":"The limit of the Quantum becomes a limit that surpasses itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D3","text":"Infinity is not the external absence of every limit, but the negation of its limitedness posited in the Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D4","text":"For the Quantum, finitude and infinity are not isolated opposites, because each determination contains the moment of the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D5","text":"The Quantum is at once determined in an other and, as sublated determinacy, indifferent toward this other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A6","CH_GB18_BEGD:A7","CH_GB18_BEGD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D6","text":"Quantitative magnitude, as sublated determinacy, is in principle alterable.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D7","text":"The quantitative opposition of finite and infinite is a posited self-relation, whereas the qualitative opposition is only conceptually mediated.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","CH_GB18_BEGD:A13","CH_GB18_BEGD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:D8","text":"The self-relation of the quantitative finite to its infinite appears as progress beyond every posited limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A12","CH_GB18_BEGD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD1","text":"The quantitative infinite does not arise beyond the Quantum, but from the inner instability of the Quantum as limited magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A2","CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD2","text":"The identity of the Quantum is organized as pervasive self-surpassing: it remains Quantum by becoming another Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A1","CH_GB18_BEGD:A3","CH_GB18_BEGD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD3","text":"The distinction between finitude and infinity is transferred from an external juxtaposition into a double structure posited in the Quantum itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A8","CH_GB18_BEGD:A9","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SD4","text":"Quantitatively infinite progress is the first form of appearance of an infinity whose content lies in the continued negation of every attained limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BEGD:A5","CH_GB18_BEGD:A10","CH_GB18_BEGD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX1","text":"The infinite must not count as a beyond completely detached from determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX2","text":"The Quantum must not count as a unity merely externally limited and untouched by its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX3","text":"The other must not be understood as a complete rupture with the original quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX4","text":"Being-for-self must not be determined as pure relationlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX5","text":"Quantitative progress must not be reduced to a merely external juxtaposition of Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:DNX6","text":"Qualitative opposition must not be treated as already posited self-negation of qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an infinite that possesses its determination independently of the finite limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a finitude that does not contain its beyond itself as its own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity that consists only through stasis and not through continuity in otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a mediation in which the other completely loses its original determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS1","text":"Limited Quantum → inner contradictoriness → alteration into another Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS2","text":"Other Quantum → continuity of quantity → self-relation of the Quantum in otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS3","text":"Self-relation → negation of the limit → unboundedness and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS4","text":"Finitude = limit + beyond; infinity = non-limitedness + return-into-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS5","text":"Mutual containment → sublation of the abstract separation of finite and infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS6","text":"Posited inequality-and-indifference of magnitude → quantitative alterability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:FGS7","text":"Quantitative self-relation of the finite to the infinite → quantitatively infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BEGD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:AF1","text":"Contradictory Quantum → other Quantum → continuity of quantity → negation of the limit → double determination of finitude and infinity → differentiation from the qualitative infinite → quantitatively infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME1","text":"The limit is remapped from a conclusive determination into a moment of self-surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME2","text":"The other is reclassified from a qualitative counterpart into the quantitative persistence of the same kind of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME3","text":"Finitude and infinity no longer appear as separate regions, but as mutually contained determinations of the Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME4","text":"Alteration becomes visible as preservation of quantity in otherness and not as loss of the original determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ME5","text":"Infinite progress is mapped as a form of posited quantitative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT1","text":"Surface — The Quantum alters, becomes another Quantum, and passes over into an infinite progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The quantitative structure connects limitedness, sending-beyond, return-into-itself, and indifference toward the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition of finite and infinite is transferred from an abstract juxtaposition into an immanent structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of the Quantum consists as continuity in otherness; its temporal infinity follows from the repeatable self-surpassing of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the Quantum to quantitatively infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central double determination of finitude and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how quantitatively infinite progress is systematically further developed beyond its first determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests on the simultaneity of continuity in the other and indifference toward the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the determination of the infinite as the negation of its limit posited in the Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT6","text":"The weakest point lies in the tension between infinite beyond and indifferent being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_BEGD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that progress is understood as a generated form and not as a mere enumeration of Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BEGD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BEGD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 68","title":"a. Concept of the Same.","context":"Chapter 68","original_title":"a. Begriff derselben."},"original_title":"a. Begriff derselben.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU","layer":"CH","title":"b. The Quantitative Infinite Progress.","order":69,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDQU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDQU@R001","sha256":"45f5837e8454e521c4f36f736761070ec478c4a14f44327f009c04a9905c6ef6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS1","text":"Der quantitative unendliche Progreß bestimmt den im Quantum enthaltenen Widerspruch von Grenze und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS2","text":"Das Argument behauptet, dass der Progreß diesen Widerspruch ausdrückt, aber nicht auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS3","text":"Die quantitative Kontinuität vermittelt das Endliche mit seinem Jenseits, indem sie das Jenseits zugleich als Nichtsein und als Quantum setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS4","text":"Jede erreichte Unendlichkeit wird dadurch erneut zu einer quantitativen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS5","text":"Die Wiederholung dieser Rückkehr erzeugt das Unendlich-Große und Unendlich-Kleine, ohne eine qualitative Bestimmtheit zu erreichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS6","text":"Der scheinbare Fortschritt wird als schlechte quantitative Unendlichkeit bestimmt: als wiederholte Setzung und Aufhebung desselben Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","text":"Das Quantum ist quantitativ-endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A2","text":"Das quantitativ-Endliche enthält ein Jenseits seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A3","text":"Die quantitative Grenze setzt sich in ihr Jenseits fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums gehört zu seiner eigenen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A5","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist Ausdruck des Widerspruchs zwischen Quantum und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist keine Auflösung dieses Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","text":"Die Kontinuität des Quantums mit seinem Jenseits erzeugt eine scheinbare Vereinigung beider.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","text":"Das Jenseits des Quantums ist zunächst das abstrakte Nichtsein des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","text":"Das Jenseits bleibt mit dem Quantum kontinuierlich verbunden und ist deshalb selbst wieder ein Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","text":"Die Rückkehr des Jenseits in das Quantum setzt eine neue quantitative Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","text":"Jede neue quantitative Grenze stößt sich erneut in ihr Jenseits ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","text":"Das Unendlich-Große und das Unendlich-Kleine behalten die Bestimmung des Quantums an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Quantum und Unendlichkeit ist wesentlich qualitativ und nicht bloß quantitativ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A14","text":"Eine absolute Bestimmtheit wäre ein Für-sichsein, das durch die quantitative Kontinuität nicht erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX1","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist nicht die Auflösung des Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX2","text":"Das Unendliche wird nicht als positives und gegenwärtiges Sein erreicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX3","text":"Der Progreß gelangt nicht über das Quantum selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX4","text":"Das Unendlich-Große ist keine Näherung an das Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX5","text":"Das Unendlich-Kleine ist keine qualitative Überschreitung des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX6","text":"Die quantitative Vergrößerung hebt den qualitativen Unterschied zwischen Quantum und Unendlichkeit nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX7","text":"Der Progreß ist kein wirkliches Fortgehen und Weiterkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX8","text":"Die beiden Glieder des Widerspruchs sind nicht voneinander trennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D1","text":"Das Jenseits ist zugleich das Nichtsein des Quantums und ein mit ihm kontinuierliches Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D2","text":"Die scheinbare Erreichung des Unendlichen besteht in der Verwandlung des Jenseits in eine neue Grenze.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D3","text":"Jede erreichte Grenze erzeugt notwendig ein neues Jenseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D4","text":"Das Unendlich-Große und das Unendlich-Kleine bewahren den Widerspruch, den sie scheinbar beenden sollen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D5","text":"Eine quantitative Erweiterung kann die qualitative Differenz zur Unendlichkeit nicht vermindern.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D6","text":"Der unendliche Progreß wiederholt die Folge von Setzung, Aufhebung, Wiedersetzung und Wiederaufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D7","text":"Das Negative bleibt ohnmächtig, weil das Aufgehobene durch den Akt seiner Aufhebung kontinuierlich wiederkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D8","text":"Die gegenseitige Flucht von Grenze und Jenseits bindet beide gerade durch ihre Flucht aneinander.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD1","text":"Die quantitative Unendlichkeit ist keine selbständige positive Bestimmung, sondern die rekursive Form, in der der Widerspruch des Quantums fortbesteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A5","CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD2","text":"Die Kontinuität vermittelt die Gegensätze nur dadurch, dass sie die Negation erneut in eine quantitative Bestimmung überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD3","text":"Der quantitative Progreß erzeugt eine Endlosigkeit der Wiederholung statt einen Übergang zu einer qualitativen Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD4","text":"Die Zeitform des Unendlichen ist hier die perennierende Wiederkehr einer Bestimmung, nicht ihre vollendete Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD5","text":"Unendlich-Großes und Unendlich-Kleines sind keine Lösungen des Widerspruchs, sondern seine entgegengesetzten quantitativen Erscheinungsformen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass bloße quantitative Akkumulation einen qualitativen Übergang zur Unendlichkeit hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt ein positives Unendliches aus, das als Resultat innerhalb des Quantums bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine äußere Andersheit aus, die nicht in die Bestimmung des Quantums zurückfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt einen endgültigen Abbruch der Vermittlung zwischen Quantum und Jenseits aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine quantitative Bestimmung aus, die sich zu einem Für-sichsein vollendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Negation durch ihre eigene Bewegung eine stabile neue Bestimmung freisetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein Jenseits, das die quantitative Form verlässt, ohne wieder als Quantum zu erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein Endpunkt, an dem das Unendliche zugleich positiv, gegenwärtig und nichtquantitativ wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Trennung von Grenze und Nichtsein, durch die die gegenseitige Flucht beendet werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX4","text":"Die Argumentation organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer qualitativen Unendlichkeit innerhalb der quantitativen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS1","text":"Quantum als Grenze → im Quantum enthaltenes Jenseits → quantitative Grenze setzt sich in ihr Jenseits fort.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","CH_GB18_BDQU:A2","CH_GB18_BDQU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS2","text":"Jenseits als Nichtsein → Kontinuität mit dem Quantum → Jenseits ist selbst Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS3","text":"Jenseits wird Quantum → neues Quantum bildet neue Grenze → neue Grenze stößt sich in neues Jenseits ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS4","text":"Rekursive Grenzbewegung → Unendlich-Großes und Unendlich-Kleines → Fortbestehen der quantitativen Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","CH_GB18_BDQU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS5","text":"Fortbestehen der quantitativen Bestimmung → qualitative Differenz bleibt erhalten → Progreß wird als schlechte quantitative Unendlichkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF1","text":"Im Quantum enthaltener Widerspruch → Grenze verweist auf Jenseits → Jenseits erscheint als Nichtsein des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF2","text":"Kontinuität mit dem Jenseits → Jenseits wird selbst Quantum → neue Grenze entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF3","text":"Neue Grenze → erneute Selbstentäußerung → perennierende Wiederholung von Quantum und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF4","text":"Wiederholung → Unendlich-Großes und Unendlich-Kleines → keine qualitative Annäherung an die Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF5","text":"Keine qualitative Annäherung → Progreß als schlechte quantitative Unendlichkeit → gegenseitige Flucht bei unaufhebbarer Verknüpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME1","text":"Unendlichkeit wird von einem erreichbaren Ziel zu einer Bewegungsform des im Quantum fortbestehenden Widerspruchs umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME2","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer festen Endmarke zu einer sich selbst überschreitenden quantitativen Bestimmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME3","text":"Das Jenseits wird zugleich als Negation des Quantums und als dessen kontinuierliche Wiederholung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME4","text":"Fortschritt wird von linearer Weiterbewegung zu rekursiver Wiederholung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME5","text":"Unendlich-Großes und Unendlich-Kleines werden von Grenzwerten zu Trägern des ungelösten Widerspruchs umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME6","text":"Kontinuität erscheint nicht als Überwindung der Gegensätze, sondern als Mechanismus ihrer dauernden Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der quantitative unendliche Progreß, das Unendlich-Große und das Unendlich-Kleine erscheinen als unmittelbare Formen des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Grenze, Jenseits, Äußerlichkeit und Kontinuität bilden eine rekursive Vermittlungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Begriff des Fortschritts wird gegen die Vorstellung eines tatsächlichen Weiterkommens gewendet und als Wiederholung diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Unendliche besitzt keine positive Gegenwart, sondern besteht als perennierende Wiederkehr der quantitativen Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Entstehung des Jenseits aus dem Quantum und seine Rückkehr als Quantum zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT2","text":"Die Rekursion von Grenze, Jenseits und neuer Grenze bewahrt die tatsächliche generative Bewegung des Arguments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT3","text":"Die apophatische Struktur erfasst, warum der Progreß weder Auflösung noch positive Gegenwart des Unendlichen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie eine qualitative Unendlichkeit außerhalb dieser quantitativen Rekursion positiv bestimmt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung zwischen Kontinuität und qualitativer Differenz wird bestimmt, aber nicht aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT6","text":"Die Spannung zwischen erreichter Unendlichkeit und nicht erreichter positiver Gegenwart wird durch die Neubildung einer Grenze vermittelt, nicht beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT7","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent als Diagnose der schlechten Unendlichkeit; sie bleibt dort offen, wo eine nichtquantitative Alternative konstruiert werden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113030887051Z_15d51b36","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The quantitative infinite progress.","source_sha256":"45f5837e8454e521c4f36f736761070ec478c4a14f44327f009c04a9905c6ef6","sha256":"728172bb31f491cde1450135a2baaa227f8fcc81ce6bb25ffa3cb57d3837eb16","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:30:30.888413+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS1","text":"The quantitative infinite progress determines the contradiction of limit and beyond contained in the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS2","text":"The argument asserts that progress expresses this contradiction but does not resolve it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS3","text":"Quantitative continuity mediates the finite with its beyond by positing the beyond simultaneously as non-being and as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS4","text":"Every infinity attained thereby becomes once again a quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS5","text":"The repetition of this return produces the infinitely large and the infinitely small without attaining a qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AS6","text":"The apparent advance is determined as bad quantitative infinity: as the repeated positing and sublation of the same contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","text":"The quantum is quantitatively finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A2","text":"The quantitatively finite contains a beyond of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A3","text":"The quantitative limit continues into its beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A4","text":"The externality of the quantum belongs to its own determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A5","text":"Infinite progress is the expression of the contradiction between quantum and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","text":"Infinite progress is not a resolution of this contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","text":"The continuity of the quantum with its beyond produces an apparent union of both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","text":"The beyond of the quantum is initially the abstract non-being of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","text":"The beyond remains continuously connected with the quantum and is therefore itself once again a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","text":"The return of the beyond into the quantum posits a new quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","text":"Every new quantitative limit again repels itself into its beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","text":"The infinitely large and the infinitely small retain the determination of quantum in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","text":"The difference between quantum and infinity is essentially qualitative and not merely quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:A14","text":"An absolute determinacy would be a being-for-self that is not attained through quantitative continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX1","text":"Infinite progress is not the resolution of the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX2","text":"The infinite is not attained as positive and present being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX3","text":"Progress does not get beyond quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX4","text":"The infinitely large is not an approximation to the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX5","text":"The infinitely small is not a qualitative transcendence of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX6","text":"Quantitative enlargement does not sublate the qualitative difference between quantum and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX7","text":"Progress is no real going forth and advancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:NX8","text":"The two members of the contradiction are not separable from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D1","text":"The beyond is at once the non-being of the quantum and a quantum continuous with it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D2","text":"The apparent attainment of the infinite consists in the transformation of the beyond into a new limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D3","text":"Every attained limit necessarily generates a new beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D4","text":"The infinitely large and the infinitely small preserve the contradiction that they are apparently supposed to end.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D5","text":"A quantitative extension cannot diminish the qualitative difference from infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D6","text":"Infinite progress repeats the sequence of positing, sublation, re-positing, and re-sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D7","text":"The negative remains impotent because what has been sublated continuously returns through the act of its sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:D8","text":"The mutual flight of limit and beyond binds both to one another precisely through their flight.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD1","text":"Quantitative infinity is not an independent positive determination, but the recursive form in which the contradiction of the quantum persists.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A5","CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD2","text":"Continuity mediates the opposites only by once again converting negation into a quantitative determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD3","text":"Quantitative progress produces an endlessness of repetition rather than a transition to a qualitative infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD4","text":"The temporal form of the infinite here is the perennial return of a determination, not its completed presence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A9","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SD5","text":"The infinitely large and the infinitely small are not solutions to the contradiction, but its opposed quantitative forms of appearance.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A12","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX1","text":"The system excludes that mere quantitative accumulation brings about a qualitative transition to infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a positive infinite that could subsist as a result within the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX3","text":"The system excludes an external otherness that does not fall back into the determination of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a final cessation of the mediation between quantum and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a quantitative determination that completes itself into a being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:DNX6","text":"The system excludes that negation, through its own movement, releases a stable new determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains a beyond that leaves the quantitative form without again appearing as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX2","text":"Excluded remains an endpoint at which the infinite would be simultaneously positive, present, and non-quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains a separation of limit and non-being through which the mutual flight could be ended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:SNX4","text":"The argument organizes itself around the absence of a qualitative infinity within quantitative movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS1","text":"Quantum as limit → beyond contained in the quantum → quantitative limit continues into its beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A1","CH_GB18_BDQU:A2","CH_GB18_BDQU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS2","text":"Beyond as non-being → continuity with the quantum → beyond is itself quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A7","CH_GB18_BDQU:A8","CH_GB18_BDQU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS3","text":"Beyond becomes quantum → new quantum forms new limit → new limit repels itself into new beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A10","CH_GB18_BDQU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS4","text":"Recursive movement of limits → infinitely large and infinitely small → persistence of the quantitative determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A11","CH_GB18_BDQU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:FGS5","text":"Persistence of the quantitative determination → qualitative difference remains preserved → progress is determined as bad quantitative infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDQU:A6","CH_GB18_BDQU:A13","CH_GB18_BDQU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF1","text":"Contradiction contained in the quantum → limit refers to beyond → beyond appears as non-being of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF2","text":"Continuity with the beyond → beyond itself becomes quantum → new limit arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF3","text":"New limit → renewed self-externalization → perennial repetition of quantum and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF4","text":"Repetition → infinitely large and infinitely small → no qualitative approximation to infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:AF5","text":"No qualitative approximation → progress as bad quantitative infinity → mutual flight amid an insublatable connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME1","text":"Infinity is remapped from an attainable goal to a form of movement of the contradiction persisting in the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME2","text":"The limit is reclassified from a fixed terminal mark to a quantitative determination that transcends itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME3","text":"The beyond becomes visible simultaneously as the negation of the quantum and as its continuous repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME4","text":"Progress is remapped from linear onward movement to recursive repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME5","text":"The infinitely large and the infinitely small are reclassified from limit values to bearers of the unresolved contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ME6","text":"Continuity appears not as the overcoming of the opposites, but as the mechanism of their lasting binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Quantitative infinite progress, the infinitely large, and the infinitely small appear as immediate forms of the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Limit, beyond, externality, and continuity form a recursive structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The concept of progress is turned against the notion of actual advancement and diagnosed as repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The infinite possesses no positive presence, but subsists as the perennial return of quantitative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the emergence of the beyond from the quantum and its return as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT2","text":"The recursion of limit, beyond, and new limit preserves the actual generative movement of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT3","text":"The apophatic structure captures why progress produces neither resolution nor positive presence of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined how a qualitative infinity outside this quantitative recursion could be positively determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT5","text":"The central tension between continuity and qualitative difference is determined, but not sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT6","text":"The tension between attained infinity and unattained positive presence is mediated, not eliminated, through the formation of a new limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDQU:MRT7","text":"The structure is internally coherent as a diagnosis of bad infinity; it remains open where a non-quantitative alternative would have to be constructed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDQU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDQU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDQU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 69","title":"b. The Quantitative Infinite Progress.","context":"Chapter 69","original_title":"b. Der quantitative unendliche Progreß."},"original_title":"b. Der quantitative unendliche Progreß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":70,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_18"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_18@R001","sha256":"55754590061dbdc70e05ea37fb487f9e0612bac63dd20f68b12d9e33246fc1e5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS1","text":"Der quantitative Progress ins Unendliche beansprucht Erhabenheit und Letztgültigkeit, reproduziert aber nur die nicht aufgehobene Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS2","text":"Die subjektive Erhebung durch Anhäufung von Größen vergrößert nicht ihren Gegenstand, sondern fixiert das Subjekt in einer leeren Bewegung des Übersteigens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS3","text":"Der unendliche Progress endet notwendig in Wiederholung, Ohnmacht, Schwindel und Sehnsucht, weil das Jenseits nur fortgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS4","text":"Die moralische und idealistische Form des Progresses setzt den Widerspruch von Ich und Nicht-Ich voraus und konserviert ihn als unauflösbaren Kampf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS5","text":"Die Reduktion qualitativer Gegensätze auf quantitative Unterschiede verhindert die begriffene Einheit, weil Quantität nur die erste, nicht die sich selbst negierende Negation ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS6","text":"Das wahrhafte Unendliche verlangt die im qualitativen Gegensatz hervortretende Negation der Negation, nicht die endlose Fortsetzung äußerlicher Größenverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A1","text":"Ein Progress ins Unendliche bleibt schlecht, sofern jede aufgehobene Grenze als neue Grenze wiederkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A2","text":"Quantitative Vermehrung hebt die qualitative Bestimmtheit ihres Gegenstands nicht notwendig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A3","text":"Das über eine Grenze hinausgehende Subjekt bleibt von dieser Grenze abhängig, wenn sein Überschreiten nur deren Wiederkehr erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A4","text":"Das als bloßes Jenseits gesetzte Unendliche ist dem Endlichen entgegengesetzt und darum selbst endlich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A5","text":"Das reine Ich bleibt abstrakt, wenn es seine Inhaltslosigkeit gegen die Fülle von Natur und Geist als äußeres Jenseits fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A6","text":"Moralischer Kampf setzt die Nichtangemessenheit von Wille und Gesetz voraus, wenn seine Vollendung als unerreichbares Ziel bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A7","text":"Wille und Natur sind als Momente eines einfachen Wesens zugleich unterschieden und aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A8","text":"Ein Widerspruch wird nicht aufgelöst, wenn seine Gegensätze als selbstständige Seiten erhalten und nur graduell verändert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A9","text":"Die Quantifizierung qualitativer Gegensätze setzt deren Gleichgültigkeit gegeneinander voraus oder erzeugt sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A10","text":"Quantität ist aufgehobene unmittelbare Bestimmtheit, aber nur als erste Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A11","text":"Die wahre Einheit des Absoluten ist nur als Negation der Negation begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A12","text":"Das Fürsichsein des Unendlichen tritt nur im qualitativen Gegensatz hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX1","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht die bloße Addition von Zahlen, Räumen, Zeiten, Welten oder Graden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX2","text":"Erhabenheit ist nicht die subjektive Fähigkeit, unermessliche Quantitäten vorzustellen oder zu verschlingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX3","text":"Das Jenseits ist nicht das Letzte, sofern es als unerreichbares Gegenüber des Endlichen bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX4","text":"Freiheit ist nicht die abstrakte Selbstgleichheit eines von allem Inhalt isolierten Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX5","text":"Moralität ist nicht als ewiger Kampf von Wille und Sinnlichkeit begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX6","text":"Einheit ist nicht die äußerlich reflektierte Abstraktion von vorausgesetzten Differenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX7","text":"Der Gegensatz ist nicht durch seine Herabsetzung auf ein quantitatives Verhältnis aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX8","text":"Das Absolute ist nicht als unmittelbares Sein bestimmt, das unter wechselnden Quantitäten unverändert bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D1","text":"Die Bewunderung des quantitativen Unendlichen verwechselt die Wiederholung einer Schranke mit deren Überwindung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D2","text":"Der Schwindel des unendlichen Fortschreitens ist keine zufällige psychologische Wirkung, sondern die Erfahrung seiner strukturellen Erfolglosigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A3","CH_GB18_A_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D3","text":"Die moralische Unendlichkeit stabilisiert gerade die Unangemessenheit, deren Überwindung sie verspricht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A6","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D4","text":"Die fortgesetzte Begrenzung des Willens durch Sinnlichkeit und der Sinnlichkeit durch Willen bildet einen einzigen widersprüchlichen Akt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D5","text":"Das Fichtesche Verhältnis von Ich und Nicht-Ich reproduziert seinen Ausgangswiderspruch, wenn das Nicht-Ich als unaufhebbarer Anstoß erhalten bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D6","text":"Die quantitative Auffassung entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen verwandelt ihre behauptete Einheit in eine äußerliche Vergleichsoperation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A9","CH_GB18_A_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D7","text":"Eine substantielle Freiheit ist nur denkbar, wenn die Einheit von Wille und Natur nicht als bloßes Nebeneinander selbstständiger Systeme verbleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD1","text":"Jede Philosophie, die ihre höchste Einheit als endlosen Progress darstellt, macht die eigene Unfähigkeit zur Vermittlung zur Form ihres Absoluten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD2","text":"Die quantitative Unendlichkeit fungiert als Ersatzform für begriffliche Versöhnung: Sie dehnt aus, was sie nicht vermitteln kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A9","CH_GB18_A_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD3","text":"Die Fixierung eines reinen Ich und eines selbstständigen Nicht-Ich erzeugt eine Sehnsuchtsstruktur, in der Einheit nur als abwesendes Ziel vorkommt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A5","CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD4","text":"Das wahre Unendliche ist keine größere Sphäre jenseits des Endlichen, sondern die Selbstaufhebung der Form, welche Endliches und Unendliches äußerlich entzweit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A11","CH_GB18_A_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass eine bloße Steigerung innerhalb derselben Bestimmungsform deren kategoriale Grenze überschreiten könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass das Unendliche durch räumliche, zeitliche oder numerische Unermesslichkeit positiv gegeben sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass Freiheit als Abstraktion von allem Anderen Bestand haben könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass der moralische Gegensatz eine letzte ontologische Struktur sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass Einheit vor oder außerhalb der Selbstvermittlung ihrer Unterschiede fertig vorhanden sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass eine äußerliche Reflexion die Wahrheit von Sein und Denken durch nachträgliche Gleichsetzung erfassen könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX1","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit eines endgültigen Jenseits, das als dauerhaftes Außen der endlichen Wirklichkeit bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX2","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit einer Wahrheit, die den Widerspruch bewahrt, indem sie ihn als ewiges Streben ästhetisiert oder moralisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX3","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit, dass das Absolute durch Indifferenz gegen seine Unterschiede absolut sein könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX4","text":"Verwehrt ist die Identifikation von Unendlichkeit mit Unabschließbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS1","text":"Grenze als äußerliche Bestimmtheit → Überschreitung als quantitatives Mehr → Wiederkehr der Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS2","text":"Wiederkehr der Grenze → unendliche Wiederholung → subjektive Ohnmacht, Langeweile, Schwindel und Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS3","text":"Abstraktes Ich gegen äußere Fülle → Jenseitsrelation → Reproduktion des unendlichen Progresses in der Innerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS4","text":"Wille gegen Sinnlichkeit → quantitative Gradualisierung des Gegensatzes → Konservierung des moralischen Kampfes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS5","text":"Qualitativer Gegensatz als Quantität → äußerliche Einheit → unbegriffenes Absolutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS6","text":"Negation der bloßen Quantifizierung → qualitative Selbstvermittlung → Negation der Negation → wahrhafte Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF1","text":"Quantitativer Progress als Erhabenheit **→** Diagnose seiner Wiederholungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF2","text":"Wiederholungsstruktur **→** Entlarvung subjektiver Erhebung als Ohnmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF3","text":"Äußere Unendlichkeit **→** abstrakte innere Unendlichkeit des reinen Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF4","text":"Abstraktes Ich **→** moralischer Gegensatz von Wille und Sinnlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF5","text":"Moralischer Gegensatz **→** Kritik seiner quantitativen Progressform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF6","text":"Quantifizierung aller Gegensätze **→** Kritik der äußerlichen Einheit des Absoluten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF7","text":"Unbegriffene Einheit **→** Forderung der qualitativen Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME1","text":"Quantitative Größe wird von einem Index des Unendlichen zu einer Form seiner Verfehlung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME2","text":"Erhabenheit wird in zwei defizitäre Formen gespalten: äußere Maßlosigkeit und innere Inhaltsleere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME3","text":"Moralischer Fortschritt wird nicht als Annäherung an Vollendung, sondern als Mechanismus der Konservierung von Unangemessenheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME4","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Ich und Nicht-Ich erscheint nicht als ursprüngliche Grundstruktur, sondern als reproduzierter Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME5","text":"Einheit wird von Gleichgültigkeit, Gradualität und äußerer Vergleichbarkeit auf Selbstnegation und Vermittlung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME6","text":"Das Verhältnis von Qualität und Quantität wird asymmetrisch bestimmt: Quantität kann Qualität voraussetzen, aber nicht ihre Wahrheit ersetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text demontiert die Erhebung durch unendliche Zahlen, Räume, Zeiten und kosmische Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der unendliche Progress ist die Form, in der eine Grenze zugleich negiert und fortwährend reproduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Philosophische Systeme werden danach unterschieden, ob sie Widersprüche vermitteln oder ihre Unvermitteltheit als Streben, Kampf oder Erhabenheit ausgeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirkliche Unendlichkeit ist nicht endlose Zeitlichkeit und nicht räumliche Unbegrenztheit, sondern die reflexive Selbstaufhebung endlicher Gegenüberstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT5","text":"Logical — Die Differenz von erster Negation und Negation der Negation entscheidet darüber, ob Einheit äußerlich bleibt oder begriffen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kritik des quantitativen Progresses, der abstrakten Innerlichkeit, der moralischen Unendlichkeit und der quantitativen Absolutheitslehre zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Ausarbeitung der behaupteten Negation der Negation; sie wird als notwendige Form markiert, aber nicht vollständig durchgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern jede schlechte Unendlichkeit als Wiederkehr einer nicht vermittelten Grenze bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Überführung psychischer Symptome wie Schwindel, Langeweile und Sehnsucht in Indikatoren eines logischen Strukturfehlers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt bestehen, weil die Kritik an Kant und Fichte deren Begriffe zugleich als notwendige Durchgangsformen zur eigenen positiven Bestimmung verwendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht, weil der qualitative Gegensatz als Bedingung wahrhafter Unendlichkeit gilt, während die endgültige Wahrheit gerade seine vermittelte Aufhebung verlangen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn sie quantitative Wiederholung, abstrakte Gegenüberstellung und äußerliche Einheit als Varianten derselben unaufgehobenen Negativität behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111747272005Z_038a0e06","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1.","source_sha256":"55754590061dbdc70e05ea37fb487f9e0612bac63dd20f68b12d9e33246fc1e5","sha256":"4cde280d4f07f60d3e82af75d2cc5461cbe5f0758fad0c2b1cd2d4422fc96325","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:17:47.274698+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS1","text":"Quantitative progress into infinity lays claim to sublimity and ultimate validity, but reproduces only the un-sublated limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS2","text":"Subjective elevation through the accumulation of magnitudes does not enlarge its object, but fixes the subject in an empty movement of surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS3","text":"Infinite progress necessarily ends in repetition, impotence, dizziness, and longing, because the beyond is only continued.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS4","text":"The moral and idealist form of progress presupposes the contradiction between I and not-I and preserves it as an irresolvable struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS5","text":"The reduction of qualitative opposites to quantitative differences prevents comprehended unity, because quantity is only the first, not the self-negating, negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AS6","text":"True infinity requires the negation of negation that emerges in qualitative opposition, not the endless continuation of external relations of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A1","text":"A progress into infinity remains bad insofar as every sublated limit returns as a new limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A2","text":"Quantitative increase does not necessarily sublate the qualitative determinacy of its object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A3","text":"The subject that goes beyond a limit remains dependent on that limit if its surpassing produces only its recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A4","text":"The infinite posited as a mere beyond is opposed to the finite and is therefore itself finitely determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A5","text":"The pure I remains abstract when it fixes its lack of content against the fullness of nature and spirit as an external beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A6","text":"Moral struggle presupposes the inadequacy of will and law when its completion is determined as an unattainable goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A7","text":"Will and nature, as moments of a simple essence, are at once distinguished and related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A8","text":"A contradiction is not resolved if its opposites are retained as independent sides and only altered gradually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A9","text":"The quantification of qualitative opposites presupposes or produces their indifference toward one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A10","text":"Quantity is sublated immediate determinacy, but only as first negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A11","text":"The true unity of the Absolute is comprehended only as negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:A12","text":"The being-for-self of the infinite emerges only in qualitative opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX1","text":"The infinite is not the mere addition of numbers, spaces, times, worlds, or degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX2","text":"Sublimity is not the subjective capacity to represent or devour immeasurable quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX3","text":"The beyond is not the ultimate insofar as it remains as the unattainable counterpart of the finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX4","text":"Freedom is not the abstract self-identity of an I isolated from all content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX5","text":"Morality is not comprehended as the eternal struggle of will and sensuousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX6","text":"Unity is not the externally reflected abstraction from presupposed differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX7","text":"The opposition is not sublated by its reduction to a quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:NX8","text":"The Absolute is not determined as immediate being that remains unchanged beneath changing quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D1","text":"Admiration for the quantitative infinite confuses the repetition of a barrier with its overcoming.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D2","text":"The dizziness of infinite progression is not an accidental psychological effect, but the experience of its structural failure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A3","CH_GB18_A_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D3","text":"Moral infinity stabilizes precisely the inadequacy whose overcoming it promises.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A6","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D4","text":"The continued limitation of will by sensuousness and of sensuousness by will constitutes a single contradictory act.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D5","text":"The Fichtean relation of I and not-I reproduces its initial contradiction when the not-I is retained as an un-sublatable impulse.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D6","text":"The quantitative conception of opposed determinations transforms their asserted unity into an external operation of comparison.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A9","CH_GB18_A_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:D7","text":"A substantial freedom is conceivable only if the unity of will and nature does not remain a mere juxtaposition of independent systems.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD1","text":"Every philosophy that presents its highest unity as endless progress makes its own incapacity for mediation the form of its Absolute.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A1","CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD2","text":"Quantitative infinity functions as a substitute form for conceptual reconciliation: it extends what it cannot mediate.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A2","CH_GB18_A_18:A8","CH_GB18_A_18:A9","CH_GB18_A_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD3","text":"The fixation of a pure I and an independent not-I produces a structure of longing in which unity occurs only as an absent goal.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A5","CH_GB18_A_18:A7","CH_GB18_A_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SD4","text":"True infinity is not a larger sphere beyond the finite, but the self-sublation of the form that externally sunders finite and infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_18:A4","CH_GB18_A_18:A11","CH_GB18_A_18:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that a mere increase within the same form of determinacy could transcend its categorial limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the infinite is positively given through spatial, temporal, or numerical immeasurability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility that freedom could subsist as abstraction from everything else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the moral opposition is an ultimate ontological structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the possibility that unity is already fully present prior to or outside the self-mediation of its differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the possibility that external reflection could grasp the truth of being and thought through subsequent equation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX1","text":"Denied is the possibility of a final beyond that could subsist as a lasting outside of finite actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX2","text":"Denied is the possibility of a truth that preserves contradiction by aestheticizing or moralizing it as eternal striving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX3","text":"Denied is the possibility that the Absolute could be absolute through indifference toward its differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:SNX4","text":"Denied is the identification of infinity with interminability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS1","text":"Limit as external determinacy → surpassing as quantitative more → recurrence of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS2","text":"Recurrence of the limit → infinite repetition → subjective impotence, boredom, dizziness, and longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS3","text":"Abstract I against external fullness → relation to the beyond → reproduction of infinite progress in inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS4","text":"Will against sensuousness → quantitative gradualization of the opposition → preservation of moral struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS5","text":"Qualitative opposition as quantity → external unity → unconceived Absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:FGS6","text":"Negation of mere quantification → qualitative self-mediation → negation of negation → true infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF1","text":"Quantitative progress as sublimity **→** diagnosis of its structure of repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF2","text":"Structure of repetition **→** exposure of subjective elevation as impotence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF3","text":"External infinity **→** abstract inner infinity of the pure I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF4","text":"Abstract I **→** moral opposition of will and sensuousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF5","text":"Moral opposition **→** critique of its quantitative form of progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF6","text":"Quantification of all opposites **→** critique of the external unity of the Absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:AF7","text":"Uncomprehended unity **→** demand for the qualitative negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME1","text":"Quantitative magnitude is reclassified from an index of the infinite into a form of its failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME2","text":"Sublimity is split into two deficient forms: external excess and inner emptiness of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME3","text":"Moral progress becomes visible not as an approach to completion, but as a mechanism for preserving inadequacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME4","text":"The opposition of I and not-I appears not as an original basic structure, but as a reproduced contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME5","text":"Unity is shifted from indifference, graduality, and external comparability to self-negation and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ME6","text":"The relation of quality and quantity is determined asymmetrically: quantity can presuppose quality, but cannot replace its truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text dismantles elevation through infinite numbers, spaces, times, and cosmic magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT2","text":"Structural — Infinite progress is the form in which a limit is at once negated and continually reproduced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Philosophical systems are distinguished according to whether they mediate contradictions or present their unmediatedness as striving, struggle, or sublimity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Actual infinity is neither endless temporality nor spatial boundlessness, but the reflexive self-sublation of finite opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:ALT5","text":"Logical — The difference between first negation and negation of negation determines whether unity remains external or is comprehended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the critique of quantitative progress, abstract inwardness, moral infinity, and the quantitative doctrine of absoluteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT2","text":"The positive elaboration of the asserted negation of negation remains underdetermined; it is marked as a necessary form, but not carried out completely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as every bad infinity is determined as the recurrence of a limit that has not been mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in transforming psychological symptoms such as dizziness, boredom, and longing into indicators of a logical structural defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT5","text":"A tension remains because the critique of Kant and Fichte at the same time employs their concepts as necessary transitional forms toward its own positive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises because qualitative opposition counts as the condition of true infinity, while final truth must require precisely its mediated sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_18:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if it treats quantitative repetition, abstract opposition, and external unity as variants of the same un-sublated negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_18:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_18@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_18:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 70","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 70","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":71,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_19"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_19@R001","sha256":"cf202a8efe1512d665d53583d52f60089925c99ee2f6f95bf0806ac386a903b6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS1","text":"Die kosmologische Antinomie wird auf den elementaren Gegensatz zwischen gesetzter Grenze und notwendigem Überschreiten der Grenze zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS2","text":"Die Beweise von Thesis und Antithesis gelten als zirkulär, weil jeder bereits die Bestimmung voraussetzt, deren Notwendigkeit er beweisen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS3","text":"Die Differenz von Zeit und Raum verändert nicht die logische Struktur der Antinomie, sondern nur deren quantitative Erscheinungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS4","text":"Die transzendentale Auflösung beseitigt den Widerspruch nicht, sondern verlegt ihn von der Welt in das anschauende und denkende Bewußtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS5","text":"Der Widerspruch wird als immanente Bestimmung der Welt und als auflösbare Bestimmung des Geistes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A1","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit erscheinen in Zeit und Raum als Gegensatz von Grenze und Jenseits der Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A2","text":"Eine gesetzte Grenze enthält notwendig die Beziehung auf ein Jenseits, durch welche sie sich als bloß gesetzte Grenze aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A3","text":"Die Thesis setzt einen bestimmten Zeitpunkt als vollendete qualitative Grenze der vergangenen Zeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A4","text":"Die Voraussetzung eines vollendeten Zeitpunkts enthält bereits die absolute Zeitgrenze, deren Existenz die Thesis erst beweisen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A5","text":"Zeit ist reine Quantität; das Jetzt ist kein festes Ende, sondern sich selbst aufhebendes Fürsichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A6","text":"Die Antithesis setzt ein vorweltliches zeitliches oder räumliches Jenseits voraus und kontinuiert zugleich das weltliche Dasein in dieses Jenseits hinein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A7","text":"Leere Zeit oder leerer Raum werden widersprüchlich bestimmt, sobald die Welt zu ihnen in ein Verhältnis gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A8","text":"Die Beweise der Antithesis setzen voraus, daß jedes weltliche Dasein durch ein anderes zeitliches Dasein bedingt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A9","text":"Die transzendentale Idealität von Raum und Zeit verschiebt den Widerspruch in das Bewußtsein, ohne seine Auflösung zu leisten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A10","text":"Die Welt ist dem Widerspruch ausgesetzt, kann ihn jedoch nicht als Widerspruch tragen und verfällt deshalb dem Entstehen und Vergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A11","text":"Der Geist kann den Widerspruch nicht nur ertragen, sondern auch auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX1","text":"Die Antinomie beruht nicht auf einer entscheidbaren Alternative zwischen objektiven Raum-Zeit-Verhältnissen und bloßen Anschauungsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX2","text":"Ein apagogischer Beweis ist nicht gültig, wenn seine Negationsannahme die zu beweisende Bestimmung bereits enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX3","text":"Das Jetzt ist nicht als starre qualitative Unterbrechung eines an sich kontinuierlichen Zeitverlaufs haltbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX4","text":"Eine leere Zeit ist nicht als äußerliche Bedingung eines zeitlichen Entstehens bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX5","text":"Ein leerer Raum bleibt nicht leer, sobald eine begrenzte Welt in ein Verhältnis zu ihm gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX6","text":"Die Verlegung des Widerspruchs in Subjektivität oder Vernunft ist keine Auflösung des Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D1","text":"Der Beweis der zeitlichen Thesis verwandelt den vorausgesetzten Endpunkt einer vergangenen Reihe in den zu beweisenden Anfang der Welt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D2","text":"Die Annahme einer unendlichen Vergangenheit wird nur dann unmöglich, wenn Zeit zuvor als bereits abgeschlossene Reihe und nicht als quantitative Kontinuität bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D3","text":"Der Beweis der räumlichen Thesis hängt von derselben Annahme einer vollendeten unendlichen Zeit ab wie der zeitliche Beweis.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D4","text":"Der Beweis der zeitlichen Antithesis setzt die unendliche Bedingtheit des weltlichen Daseins voraus, die er als Ergebnis ausgibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D5","text":"Der Beweis der räumlichen Antithesis erzeugt seine Unendlichkeit aus dem Verhältnis einer begrenzten Welt zu einem zugleich leeren und erfüllten Raum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D6","text":"Thesis und Antithesis sind keine einander äußerlichen Lehren, sondern gegensätzliche Explikationen derselben Selbstaufhebung der Grenze.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A1","CH_GB18_A_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D7","text":"Die transzendentale Lösung bewahrt den Widerspruch als subjektive Bestimmung, obwohl sie ihn aus der Welt entfernen soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD1","text":"Die Antinomie ist nicht primär ein Streit über die Größe der Welt, sondern die Selbstbewegung jeder bestimmten Grenze in ihr eigenes Jenseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A1","CH_GB18_A_19:A2","CH_GB18_A_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD2","text":"Die kantischen Beweise fungieren nicht als Rechtfertigungen ihrer Resultate, sondern als symptomatische Wiederholungen der unaufgelösten Grenzstruktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A4","CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD3","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von endlicher Welt und unendlichem Jenseits zerfällt, weil das Jenseits nur durch seine Beziehung zur Welt bestimmt und dadurch weltlich erfüllt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A2","CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD4","text":"Werden und Vergehen erscheinen als die endliche Gestalt eines Widerspruchs, den die Welt nicht zur begrifflichen Auflösung bringen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A10","CH_GB18_A_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD5","text":"Die eigentliche Alternative lautet nicht endliche oder unendliche Welt, sondern bloßes Erleiden des Widerspruchs oder dessen geistige Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A9","CH_GB18_A_19:A10","CH_GB18_A_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, die als widerspruchsfreie Gegebenheit vor dem Denken bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Beweisverfahren, das seine Voraussetzung außerhalb seines Resultats halten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Grenze, die Grenze bleiben könnte, ohne ein Jenseits und ein Verhältnis zu diesem Jenseits zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein reines leeres Außen von Zeit oder Raum, das von der Welt unberührt bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine subjektive Verlagerung des Widerspruchs, die zugleich seine objektive Geltung aufheben würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültig vollendete Totalität, deren Grenze nicht zugleich ihre Überschreitung erzwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Unendlichkeit, die als bloßes Außen der Endlichkeit gedacht werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Denken, das den Widerspruch entweder der Welt vollständig abspricht oder ihn im Geist dauerhaft unaufgelöst beläßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Annahme, daß Entstehen und Vergehen bloß empirische Vorgänge und nicht Ausdruck einer widersprüchlichen Endlichkeitsstruktur seien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS1","text":"Quantitative Begrenztheit oder Unbegrenztheit → Reduktion auf Grenze und Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS2","text":"Gesetzte Grenze → Beziehung auf ein Jenseits → Aufhebung der gesetzten Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS3","text":"Thesisbeweis → Voraussetzung eines abgeschlossenen Zeitpunkts → Einschmuggelung des zu beweisenden absoluten Anfangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS4","text":"Antithesisbeweis → Voraussetzung eines leeren Vorher oder Außen → Kontinuierung des Daseins in dieses Außen → Einschmuggelung der zu beweisenden Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS5","text":"Grenze und Überschreitung → rekursive Wiedererzeugung von Grenze und Jenseits → Antinomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS6","text":"Transzendentale Verlagerung des Widerspruchs → Kritik der bloßen Verlagerung → immanenter Weltwiderspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS7","text":"Weltlicher Widerspruch ohne Selbstauflösung → Entstehen und Vergehen; geistiger Widerspruch mit Selbstauflösung → begriffliche Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF1","text":"Kosmologische Endlichkeit oder Unendlichkeit → Reduktion auf Grenze und Grenzüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF2","text":"These einer begrenzten Welt → Analyse des vorausgesetzten Jetzt → Entdeckung der zirkulären Annahme eines absoluten Zeitendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF3","text":"Antithese einer unbegrenzten Welt → Analyse des leeren Vorher und Außen → Entdeckung der vorausgesetzten Kontinuität des Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF4","text":"Gegensätzliche Beweise → gemeinsamer Widerspruch von Grenze und aufgehobener Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF5","text":"Transzendentale Idealisierung → Verlagerung des Widerspruchs in das Bewußtsein → Zurückweisung dieser Verlagerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF6","text":"Immanenter Widerspruch der Welt → Unfähigkeit der Welt, ihn zu tragen → Entstehen und Vergehen; Fähigkeit des Geistes → Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME1","text":"Zeitliche und räumliche Antinomien werden als Varianten einer einzigen Logik der Grenze kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME2","text":"Die Beweisformen werden von Instrumenten der Demonstration zu Orten, an denen ihre verborgenen Voraussetzungen sichtbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME3","text":"Endlichkeit und Unendlichkeit werden nicht mehr als getrennte Prädikate, sondern als ineinander übergehende Bestimmungen lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME4","text":"Leere Zeit und leerer Raum werden nicht als neutrale Behälter, sondern als widersprüchliche Produkte eines zugleich trennenden und verbindenden Verhältnisses klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME5","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Welt und Geist wird als Differenz ihrer jeweiligen Fähigkeit bestimmt, Widerspruch zu tragen und aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT1","text":"Surface — Untersucht werden Anfang oder Anfangslosigkeit der Welt sowie ihre räumliche Begrenztheit oder Unbegrenztheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT2","text":"Structural — Jede bestimmte Grenze erzeugt ein Jenseits, das ihre Selbständigkeit negiert und die Gegenbestimmung reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik richtet sich gegen Beweise, deren argumentative Form ihre Resultate voraussetzt und dadurch den Widerspruch verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zeit und Raum fungieren als Felder, in denen Endlichkeit nur durch Selbstüberschreitung und Unendlichkeit nur durch neue Begrenzung bestimmbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Welt wird als widersprüchlich und vergänglich, der Geist als widerspruchsfähig und zur Auflösung befähigt bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Reduktion der Antinomie auf Grenze, Jenseits und Selbstaufhebung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT2","text":"Die Analyse der beiden Beweise bleibt rekonstruierbar, weil ihre jeweiligen Zirkularitäten aus der Voraussetzung eines Abschlusses oder eines äußeren Vorher hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der positive begriffliche Vollzug, durch den der Geist den Widerspruch tatsächlich auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT4","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der Bestimmung der Zeit als reiner Quantität und ihrer argumentativen Verwendung als durch qualitative Grenzen gegliederte Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß die Welt den Widerspruch besitzen soll, während ihre Unfähigkeit, ihn zu tragen, nur durch die Folge von Entstehen und Vergehen ausgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Rekonstruktionsleistung liegt in der Umwandlung der kosmologischen Alternative in eine immanente Kritik der Voraussetzungen beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT7","text":"Die Bewegung des Textes bleibt erhalten, sofern die Zurückweisung der transzendentalen Verlagerung als notwendiger Übergang zur Differenz von Welt und Geist mitrekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111810214401Z_e9a13af9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 2.","source_sha256":"cf202a8efe1512d665d53583d52f60089925c99ee2f6f95bf0806ac386a903b6","sha256":"1c443d63823f54425fe73046aa1bcc818d886e8155b958cd75522b578a677020","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:18:10.216846+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS1","text":"The cosmological antinomy is traced back to the elementary opposition between a posited limit and the necessary transgression of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS2","text":"The proofs of thesis and antithesis are considered circular because each already presupposes the determination whose necessity it is supposed to prove.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS3","text":"The difference between time and space alters not the logical structure of the antinomy, but only its quantitative form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS4","text":"The transcendental resolution does not eliminate the contradiction, but relocates it from the world into the intuiting and thinking consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AS5","text":"The contradiction is determined as an immanent determination of the world and as a resolvable determination of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A1","text":"Finitude and infinity appear in time and space as the opposition between limit and beyond the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A2","text":"A posited limit necessarily contains the relation to a beyond, through which it sublates itself as a merely posited limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A3","text":"The thesis presupposes a determinate point in time as the completed qualitative limit of past time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A4","text":"The presupposition of a completed point in time already contains the absolute temporal limit whose existence the thesis first seeks to prove.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A5","text":"Time is pure quantity; the now is not a fixed end, but being-for-self that sublates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A6","text":"The antithesis presupposes a pre-worldly temporal or spatial beyond and at the same time continues worldly existence into this beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A7","text":"Empty time or empty space is determined contradictorily as soon as the world is placed in a relation to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A8","text":"The proofs of the antithesis presuppose that every worldly existence is conditioned by another temporal existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A9","text":"The transcendental ideality of space and time shifts the contradiction into consciousness without effecting its resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A10","text":"The world is exposed to contradiction, but cannot bear it as contradiction and therefore falls prey to coming-to-be and passing-away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:A11","text":"Spirit can not only endure the contradiction, but also resolve it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX1","text":"The antinomy does not rest on a decidable alternative between objective space-time relations and mere forms of intuition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX2","text":"An apagogical proof is not valid if its assumption of negation already contains the determination to be proved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX3","text":"The now cannot be sustained as a rigid qualitative interruption of a temporal course continuous in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX4","text":"An empty time cannot be determined as an external condition of temporal coming-to-be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX5","text":"An empty space does not remain empty as soon as a limited world is placed in a relation to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:NX6","text":"The relocation of contradiction into subjectivity or reason is not a resolution of contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D1","text":"The proof of the temporal thesis transforms the presupposed endpoint of a past series into the beginning of the world that is to be proved.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D2","text":"The assumption of an infinite past becomes impossible only if time is first determined as an already completed series and not as quantitative continuity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D3","text":"The proof of the spatial thesis depends on the same assumption of a completed infinite time as the temporal proof.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A3","CH_GB18_A_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D4","text":"The proof of the temporal antithesis presupposes the infinite conditionedness of worldly existence, which it presents as its result.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D5","text":"The proof of the spatial antithesis generates its infinity from the relation of a limited world to a space that is at once empty and filled.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D6","text":"Thesis and antithesis are not doctrines external to one another, but opposed explications of the same self-sublation of the limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A1","CH_GB18_A_19:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:D7","text":"The transcendental solution preserves the contradiction as a subjective determination, although it is supposed to remove it from the world.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD1","text":"The antinomy is not primarily a dispute over the magnitude of the world, but the self-movement of every determinate limit into its own beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A1","CH_GB18_A_19:A2","CH_GB18_A_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD2","text":"The Kantian proofs function not as justifications of their results, but as symptomatic repetitions of the unresolved structure of the limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A4","CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD3","text":"The opposition of finite world and infinite beyond disintegrates because the beyond is determined only through its relation to the world and is thereby worldly filled.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A2","CH_GB18_A_19:A6","CH_GB18_A_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD4","text":"Coming-to-be and passing-away appear as the finite form of a contradiction that the world cannot bring to conceptual resolution.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A10","CH_GB18_A_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SD5","text":"The proper alternative is not finite or infinite world, but merely suffering contradiction or its spiritual sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_19:A9","CH_GB18_A_19:A10","CH_GB18_A_19:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a world that could subsist before thought as a contradiction-free given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a procedure of proof that could keep its presupposition outside its result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an absolute limit that could remain a limit without generating a beyond and a relation to this beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a pure empty outside of time or space that would remain untouched by the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a subjective displacement of contradiction that would at the same time sublate its objective validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an definitively completed totality whose limit does not at the same time compel its transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an infinity that could be thought as a mere outside of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a thinking that either wholly denies contradiction to the world or leaves it permanently unresolved in spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:SNX4","text":"Blocked is the assumption that coming-to-be and passing-away are merely empirical processes and not the expression of a contradictory structure of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS1","text":"Quantitative limitedness or unlimitedness → reduction to limit and beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS2","text":"Posited limit → relation to a beyond → sublation of the posited limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS3","text":"Proof of thesis → presupposition of a completed point in time → smuggling in of the absolute beginning to be proved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS4","text":"Proof of antithesis → presupposition of an empty before or outside → continuation of existence into this outside → smuggling in of the infinity to be proved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS5","text":"Limit and transgression → recursive regeneration of limit and beyond → antinomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS6","text":"Transcendental relocation of contradiction → critique of mere relocation → immanent contradiction of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:FGS7","text":"Worldly contradiction without self-resolution → coming-to-be and passing-away; spiritual contradiction with self-resolution → conceptual sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF1","text":"Cosmological finitude or infinity → reduction to limit and transgression of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF2","text":"Thesis of a limited world → analysis of the presupposed now → discovery of the circular assumption of an absolute end of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF3","text":"Antithesis of an unlimited world → analysis of the empty before and outside → discovery of the presupposed continuity of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF4","text":"Opposed proofs → common contradiction of limit and sublated limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF5","text":"Transcendental idealization → relocation of contradiction into consciousness → rejection of this relocation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:AF6","text":"Immanent contradiction of the world → inability of the world to bear it → coming-to-be and passing-away; capacity of spirit → resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME1","text":"Temporal and spatial antinomies are mapped as variants of a single logic of the limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME2","text":"The forms of proof are transformed from instruments of demonstration into sites at which their hidden presuppositions become visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME3","text":"Finitude and infinity are no longer legible as separate predicates, but as determinations passing into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME4","text":"Empty time and empty space are classified not as neutral containers, but as contradictory products of a relation that simultaneously separates and connects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ME5","text":"The difference between world and spirit is determined as the difference in their respective capacities to bear and sublate contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT1","text":"Surface — What is investigated is the beginning or beginninglessness of the world, as well as its spatial limitedness or unlimitedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT2","text":"Structural — Every determinate limit generates a beyond that negates its independence and reproduces the counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique is directed against proofs whose argumentative form presupposes their results and thereby conceals the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Time and space function as fields in which finitude can be determined only through self-transgression and infinity only through a new limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The world is determined as contradictory and perishable, spirit as capable of contradiction and capable of resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reduction of the antinomy to limit, beyond, and self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT2","text":"The analysis of the two proofs remains reconstructible because their respective circularities arise from the presupposition of a completion or of an external before.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive conceptual execution through which spirit actually resolves the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT4","text":"A structural tension remains between the determination of time as pure quantity and its argumentative use as time articulated by qualitative limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT5","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the world is supposed to possess contradiction, while its inability to bear it is demonstrated only through the consequence of coming-to-be and passing-away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT6","text":"The strongest reconstructive achievement lies in the transformation of the cosmological alternative into an immanent critique of the presuppositions of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_19:MRT7","text":"The movement of the text is preserved insofar as the rejection of the transcendental relocation is co-reconstructed as the necessary transition to the difference between world and spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_19:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_19@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_19:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 71","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 71","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Infinity of Quantum.","order":72,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDUD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDUD@R001","sha256":"bc27814d954bdda79610d97f2f8ae558dcd2b71808045ebcfe59b924f2c66be1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS1","text":"Das unendliche Quantum wird als unendlicher Progreß bestimmt, in dem das Quantum zugleich erhalten und negiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Quantums liegt zunächst außerhalb seiner selbst und erscheint dadurch als schlechtes Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS3","text":"Weil diese Äußerlichkeit selbst Quantum ist, wird das Jenseits begrenzt und als Moment der Quantitätsbestimmung zurückgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS4","text":"Der unendliche Progreß enthält daher nicht nur die Negation des Quantums, sondern die Negation dieser Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS5","text":"Die dadurch entstehende Einheit stellt das Quantum als qualitativ beziehungsweise fürsichbestimmt wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS6","text":"Diese Wiederherstellung vollzieht sich als Beziehung mehrerer Quanta, deren Äußerlichkeit ihre gemeinsame Bestimmung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A1","text":"Das Quantum als Grad ist einfach, auf sich bezogen und an ihm selbst bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A2","text":"Durch diese Einfachheit sind Andersseyn und Bestimmtheit am Quantum aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","text":"Die aufgehobene Bestimmtheit tritt zunächst als Äußerlichkeit des Quantums auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums ist zunächst sein abstraktes Nichtseyn und damit die schlechte Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A5","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist selbst Quantum und kann daher als Quantum begrenzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","text":"Im unendlichen Progreß sind die Negation des Quantums und die Negation dieser Negation enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","text":"Die Wahrheit dieser beiden Negationen ist ihre Einheit, in der sie als Momente bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","text":"Das Quantum ist aufgehobene qualitative Grenze und damit bereits aufgehobene Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A9","text":"Im unmittelbaren Quantum ist diese Aufhebung noch als selbständiges Daseyn und als Jenseits fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","text":"Die Negation der Negation macht die Äußerlichkeit zu einem eigenen Moment des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A11","text":"Das Quantum sucht im Hinausgehen über sich seine fürsichbestimmte, qualitative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","text":"Das Quantum wird von sich repellirt und erscheint dadurch als zwei Quanta innerhalb einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A13","text":"Jedes der beiden Quanta gilt nur in seiner Beziehung auf das andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A14","text":"Die Beziehung der Quanta bildet die Bestimmtheit des Quantums als qualitativer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX1","text":"Das Unendlichgroße und das Unendlichkleine sind keine selbständigen unendlichen Größen, sondern Bilder der Vorstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX2","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht als ein von der Quantität getrenntes Jenseits aufrechtzuerhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX3","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist nicht bloß die Möglichkeit, jedes Quantum weiter zu überschreiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums ist kein von der Quantität verschiedenes Nichtquantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX5","text":"Das Unendliche ist nicht nur die erste Negation des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX6","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit des Quantums ist nicht endgültig ausgelöscht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX7","text":"Die Quanta der Beziehung sind keine unabhängig geltenden Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX8","text":"Die Grenze des Quantums ist nicht bloß gleichgültig und äußerlich, sobald die Vermittlung vollzogen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D1","text":"Die zunächst äußerliche Bestimmtheit des Quantums erzeugt die Form des schlechten Unendlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A1","CH_GB18_CDUD:A2","CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D2","text":"Das Jenseits des Quantums wird selbst begrenzt, weil seine Äußerlichkeit als Quantum bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","CH_GB18_CDUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D3","text":"Der unendliche Progreß enthält die Negation der Negation und ist deshalb mehr als ein unaufgelöstes Überschreiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D4","text":"Die Wahrheit des unendlichen Quantums besteht in der Wiederherstellung des Quantums als durch sein Nichtseyn vermittelter Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D5","text":"Das Quantum wird qualitativ bestimmt, weil es seine Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Moment auf sich bezieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D6","text":"Die fürsichbestimmte Qualität des Quantums entsteht aus der Vermittlung durch die Negation der Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D7","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung des Quantums nimmt die Form einer Einheit mehrerer, voneinander verschiedener Quanta an.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D8","text":"Das quantitative Verhältnis ist die qualitative Bestimmung des Quantums in seiner Äußerlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13","CH_GB18_CDUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD1","text":"Der unendliche Progreß ist die Vermittlungsform, in der das Quantum seine äußerliche Grenze in eine eigene Bestimmung umschlägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A5","CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD2","text":"Die Unendlichkeit fungiert nicht als Gegenstand jenseits des Quantums, sondern als Prozess seiner Rückkehr zu sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD3","text":"Qualität wird nicht außerhalb der Quantität wiederhergestellt, sondern als deren vermittelte Selbstbestimmung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD4","text":"Die Identität des Quantums ist keine unmittelbare Selbstidentität, sondern eine durch Selbstverschiedenheit vermittelte Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A11","CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD5","text":"Das Quantum ist nur insofern bei sich, als seine Äußerlichkeit zugleich die Beziehung ist, durch die es bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Quantum, dessen Bestimmtheit vollständig in einer unmittelbaren Innerlichkeit läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Unendlichkeit, die als dauerhaft unerreichbares Jenseits unabhängig vom Quantum besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine bloße Gegenüberstellung von Quantum und Nichtquantum ohne Rückwirkung des Nichtquantums auf das Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung zwischen erster Negation und Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Qualität, die als frühere Bestimmung vollständig hinter der Quantität zurückbliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Beziehung, die den bereits bestimmten Quanta äußerlich und zufällig hinzugefügt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Selbstbestimmung, die nicht durch Äußerlichkeit und Vermittlung hindurchgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird ein nichtrelationales Fürsichseyn des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar wird ein endgültiger Standpunkt außerhalb jeder quantitativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird die Deutung des unendlichen Progresses als bloßes Scheitern an einer vollendeten Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit einer unmittelbaren Identität, die nicht aus der Negation ihrer eigenen Äußerlichkeit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines äußersten Jenseits strukturiert die gesamte Bewegung der Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX6","text":"Die Abwesenheit selbständiger Quanta macht die Beziehung zur ursprünglichen Form ihrer Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Quantum als Grad → einfache Selbstbeziehung → Bestimmtheit außerhalb des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS2","text":"Äußerliche Bestimmtheit → abstraktes Nichtseyn → schlechtes Unendliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS3","text":"Äußerlichkeit als Quantum → Begrenzung des Jenseits → Rücknahme des Nichtseyns in die Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS4","text":"Negation des Quantums + Negation dieser Negation → Einheit beider Negationen als Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS5","text":"Vermitteltes Nichtseyn → Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Moment → qualitativ und fürsich bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS6","text":"Fürsichbestimmung → Repulsion des Quantums von sich → zwei aufgehobene Quanta in einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS7","text":"Zwei Quanta → wechselseitige Beziehung → Bestimmtheit jedes Quantums durch sein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS8","text":"Beziehung als Rückkehr in die eigene Äußerlichkeit → quantitative Relation als qualitative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AF1","text":"Bildhafte Unendlichkeit → äußerliche Bestimmtheit des Quantums → schlechtes Jenseits → Selbstquantifizierung des Jenseits → Negation der Negation → qualitative Fürsichbestimmung → Repulsion in mehrere Quanta → quantitatives Verhältnis als relationale Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME1","text":"Das Unendlichgroße und das Unendlichkleine werden von scheinbaren Gegenständen zu Darstellungen eines widersprüchlichen Progresses umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME2","text":"Das Unendliche wird von einem transzendenten Jenseits zu einem im Quantum wirksamen Vermittlungsmoment umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Qualität und Quantität wird so reorganisiert, dass Qualität als vermittelte Selbstbestimmung der Quantität erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME4","text":"Die gleichgültige Grenze wird von einer äußeren Schranke zu einer Bestimmung transformiert, die durch Äußerlichkeit bei sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME5","text":"Die Quanta werden nicht mehr als isolierte Größen, sondern als relationale Momente einer Einheit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME6","text":"Der Gegensatz von Quantum und Nichtseyn wird in eine Struktur von Negation und Negation der Negation überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das unendliche Quantum als Einheit von Quantum und Nichtseyn im unendlichen Progreß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmtheit des Quantums wird durch die Bewegung von Äußerlichkeit, Begrenzung und Rückkehr zu sich erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die übliche Betrachtung des Progresses als endloses Überschreiten wird durch die Reflexion auf das Verschwinden des Jenseits neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unendlichkeit bezeichnet keine entfernte Endposition, sondern die vermittelte Weise, in der das Quantum seine Bestimmtheit erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom unmittelbaren Quantum über das schlechte Unendliche zur quantitativen Relation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue systematische Stellung des wiederhergestellten Begriffs des Quantums gegenüber dem später gesetzten quantitativen Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aufhebung zugleich Negation, Erhaltung und Umformung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung der inneren Bestimmung aus der zunächst äußerlichen Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von Unendlichkeit, Qualität und Fürsichseyn ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung bleibt darin, dass das Quantum seine Bestimmtheit zunächst außerhalb seiner selbst hat und sie anschließend gerade durch diese Äußerlichkeit bei sich selbst besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die relationale Einheit zwar aus der Repulsion erzeugt, ihrerseits aber als quantitative Relation abschließend gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom Widerspruch über die Negation der Negation zur relationalen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114255146333Z_a60e67d1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Infinity of Quantum.","source_sha256":"bc27814d954bdda79610d97f2f8ae558dcd2b71808045ebcfe59b924f2c66be1","sha256":"99e3611405b4640b588deb082544be13b01de43d270c05586c0768671ba83f09","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:42:55.147880+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS1","text":"The infinite quantum is determined as infinite progress, in which the quantum is at once preserved and negated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS2","text":"The determinacy of quantum initially lies outside itself and thereby appears as bad infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS3","text":"Because this externality is itself quantum, the beyond is limited and taken back as a moment of quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS4","text":"The infinite progress therefore contains not only the negation of quantum, but the negation of this negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS5","text":"The unity thereby arising restores quantum as qualitatively, or being-for-self determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AS6","text":"This restoration takes place as a relation of several quanta, whose externality constitutes their common determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A1","text":"Quantum as degree is simple, self-related, and determined in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A2","text":"Through this simplicity, otherness and determinacy are sublated in quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","text":"The sublated determinacy initially appears as the externality of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","text":"The externality of quantum is initially its abstract non-being and thus bad infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A5","text":"Externality is itself quantum and can therefore be limited as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","text":"The infinite progress contains the negation of quantum and the negation of this negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","text":"The truth of these two negations is their unity, in which they subsist as moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","text":"Quantum is sublated qualitative limit and is therefore already sublated negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A9","text":"In immediate quantum, this sublation is still fixed as self-subsistent existence and as a beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","text":"The negation of negation makes externality into a moment proper to quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A11","text":"In going beyond itself, quantum seeks its being-for-self determined, qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","text":"Quantum is repelled from itself and thereby appears as two quanta within a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A13","text":"Each of the two quanta is valid only in its relation to the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:A14","text":"The relation of the quanta constitutes the determinacy of quantum as a qualitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX1","text":"The infinitely great and the infinitely small are not self-subsistent infinite magnitudes, but images of representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX2","text":"The infinite cannot be maintained as a beyond separate from quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX3","text":"Infinite progress is not merely the possibility of further exceeding every quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX4","text":"The externality of quantum is not a non-quantum distinct from quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX5","text":"The infinite is not merely the first negation of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX6","text":"The qualitative determinacy of quantum is not definitively extinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX7","text":"The quanta of the relation are not independently valid unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:NX8","text":"The limit of quantum is not merely indifferent and external once mediation has been accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D1","text":"The initially external determinacy of quantum produces the form of bad infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A1","CH_GB18_CDUD:A2","CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D2","text":"The beyond of quantum is itself limited because its externality is determined as quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","CH_GB18_CDUD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D3","text":"Infinite progress contains the negation of negation and is therefore more than an unresolved exceeding.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D4","text":"The truth of infinite quantum consists in the restoration of quantum as a unity mediated through its non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D5","text":"Quantum becomes qualitatively determined because it relates its externality to itself as its own moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D6","text":"The being-for-self determined quality of quantum arises from mediation through the negation of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D7","text":"The self-relation of quantum takes the form of a unity of several quanta distinct from one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:D8","text":"The quantitative relation is the qualitative determination of quantum in its externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13","CH_GB18_CDUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD1","text":"Infinite progress is the form of mediation in which quantum transforms its external limit into a determination of its own.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A5","CH_GB18_CDUD:A6","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD2","text":"Infinity functions not as an object beyond quantum, but as the process of its return to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A4","CH_GB18_CDUD:A7","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD3","text":"Quality is not restored outside quantity, but produced as its mediated self-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A8","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD4","text":"The identity of quantum is not immediate self-identity, but a unity mediated through self-difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A11","CH_GB18_CDUD:A12","CH_GB18_CDUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SD5","text":"Quantum is with itself only insofar as its externality is at the same time the relation through which it is determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDUD:A3","CH_GB18_CDUD:A10","CH_GB18_CDUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a quantum whose determinacy would lie wholly in an immediate inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an infinity that subsists independently of quantum as a permanently unattainable beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a mere opposition of quantum and non-quantum without a retroactive effect of non-quantum upon quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a separation between the first negation and the negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a quality that would remain wholly behind quantity as an earlier determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a relation that would be externally and contingently added to the already determined quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:DNX7","text":"Excluded is a self-determination that does not pass through externality and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX1","text":"A non-relational being-for-self of quantum becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX2","text":"A final standpoint outside every quantitative determination becomes unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX3","text":"The interpretation of infinite progress as mere failure in the face of a completed infinity becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX4","text":"The possibility of an immediate identity that does not arise from the negation of its own externality is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX5","text":"The absence of an ultimate beyond structures the entire movement of infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:SNX6","text":"The absence of self-subsistent quanta makes relation the original form of their determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS1","text":"Immediate quantum as degree → simple self-relation → determinacy outside quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS2","text":"External determinacy → abstract non-being → bad infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS3","text":"Externality as quantum → limitation of the beyond → withdrawal of non-being into quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS4","text":"Negation of quantum + negation of this negation → unity of both negations as moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS5","text":"Mediated non-being → externality as a moment of its own → qualitatively and being-for-self determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS6","text":"Being-for-self determination → repulsion of quantum from itself → two sublated quanta in a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS7","text":"Two quanta → reciprocal relation → determinacy of each quantum through its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:FGS8","text":"Relation as return into its own externality → quantitative relation as qualitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:AF1","text":"Figurative infinity → external determinacy of quantum → bad beyond → self-quantification of the beyond → negation of negation → qualitative being-for-self determination → repulsion into several quanta → quantitative relation as relational unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME1","text":"The infinitely great and the infinitely small are reclassified from apparent objects into representations of a contradictory progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME2","text":"The infinite is remapped from a transcendent beyond into a moment of mediation operative in quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME3","text":"The distinction between quality and quantity is reorganized such that quality appears as the mediated self-determination of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME4","text":"The indifferent limit is transformed from an external barrier into a determination that is with itself through externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME5","text":"The quanta are no longer classified as isolated magnitudes, but as relational moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ME6","text":"The opposition of quantum and non-being is transferred into a structure of negation and negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines infinite quantum as the unity of quantum and non-being in infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinacy of quantum is produced through the movement of externality, limitation, and return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The usual consideration of progress as endless exceeding is reframed through reflection on the disappearance of the beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Infinity designates not a distant final position, but the mediated manner in which quantum receives its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from immediate quantum through bad infinity to quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the exact systematic position of the restored concept of quantum in relation to the subsequently posited quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sublation signifies negation, preservation, and transformation at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of inner determination from the initially external negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on the compressed equation of infinity, quality, and being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension remains in the fact that quantum initially has its determinacy outside itself and subsequently possesses it precisely through this externality in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that relational unity is indeed produced from repulsion, but is in turn conclusively posited as quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDUD:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from contradiction through the negation of negation to relational determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDUD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDUD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 72","title":"c. The Infinity of Quantum.","context":"Chapter 72","original_title":"c. Die Unendlichkeit des Quantums."},"original_title":"c. Die Unendlichkeit des Quantums.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1. The Conceptual Determinacy of the Mathematical Infinite.","order":73,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A1DB"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A1DB@R001","sha256":"b7db3e726dcce755188a4134fe85198517bbd4f8416016d1bd68e12a05c3b9bc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","text":"Die exakten Resultate der Infinitesimalrechnung beseitigen nicht den Widerspruch, dass ihre Operationen begrifflich ungeklärt und teilweise als unrichtig zugestanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS2","text":"Das diagnostisch-rekonstruktive Argument führt den methodischen Widerspruch auf die Verwechslung des wahrhaften Unendlichen mit unendlichem Progress, unbestimmter Kleinheit und äußerer Annäherung zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS3","text":"Die übliche Definition des unendlichen Quantums wird gegen sich gewendet: Was nicht mehr vermehrt oder vermindert werden kann, ist kein Quantum als solches mehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS4","text":"Das aufgehobene Quantum bleibt nicht als verschwindende Größe, sondern als qualitative Bestimmtheit eines Verhältnisses erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","text":"Bruch, Reihe, Potenzenverhältnis und Differentialkoeffizient bilden Stufen, auf denen die quantitative Selbständigkeit verschwindet und die relationale Bestimmtheit hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS6","text":"Die historischen Begründungen erfassen den relationalen Gedanken partiell, fallen in der Operation aber auf endliche Inkremente, Vernachlässigung, Annäherung oder formale Reihen zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0077","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion endet in einer doppelten Grenzziehung: Differentialoperationen sind qualitativ zu begründen, und analytische Zerlegungen dürfen nicht ohne zusätzlichen Grund als physische Existenzen gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","text":"Wissenschaftliche Rechtfertigung betrifft die Notwendigkeit des Verfahrens und kann nicht durch die Richtigkeit seiner Resultate ersetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","text":"Das endliche Quantum ist eine gegen Vermehrung und Verminderung gleichgültige Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","text":"Ein Quantum, das nicht mehr vermehrt oder vermindert werden kann, ist als Quantum aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","text":"Das wahrhafte unendliche Quantum setzt sowohl das endliche Quantum als auch dessen äußerliches Jenseits außer Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","text":"Die aufgehobene quantitative Bestimmtheit bleibt als qualitative Bestimmtheit bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","text":"Ein qualitatives Quantitätsmoment besitzt Bedeutung ausschließlich durch sein Verhältnis zu seinem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","text":"Außerhalb seines konstitutiven Verhältnisses ist das qualitative Quantitätsmoment Null.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","text":"Die Darstellung eines qualitativen Verhältnisses als Aggregat erzeugt notwendig einen unabschließbaren Progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","text":"Der vollständige relationale Ausdruck enthält gegenwärtig den Wert, den die unendliche Reihe nur als unerreichtes Jenseits sucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","text":"Der spezifische Grund der höheren Analysis ist das Potenzenverhältnis, nicht die bloße Veränderlichkeit ihrer Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","text":"Differentiale sind weder endliche Quanta noch bestimmungslose Nullen, sondern ausschließlich Momente des Differentialverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","text":"Der Übergang zum Differential ist die Rückführung einer endlichen Funktion auf das qualitative Verhältnis ihrer Quantitätsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","text":"Die Nichtberücksichtigung analytischer Glieder ist nur durch ihre qualitative Funktionslosigkeit, nicht durch ihre relative Kleinheit gerechtfertigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","text":"Jede nichtbegriffliche Begründung des Infinitesimalkalküls lässt in der Operation die endliche Quantitätsbestimmtheit wiederkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","text":"Mathematische Analyse kann qualitative physische Gesetze nicht aus sich selbst beweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0139","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX1","text":"Die Richtigkeit eines Resultats ist keine Rechtfertigung der erzeugenden Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX2","text":"Das wahrhafte Unendliche ist weder ein größtes noch ein kleinstes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX3","text":"Kants transzendentale Unendlichkeit überwindet den Größenwiderspruch nicht, sondern verteilt ihn auf begrenztes Objekt und überschreitendes Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX4","text":"Eine unendliche Reihe ist nicht wegen der Menge ihrer gesetzten Glieder wahrhaft unendlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX5","text":"Unendliche Differenzen sind weder unteilbare letzte Größen noch verschwindend kleine endliche Teilchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX6","text":"Bloße Veränderlichkeit bestimmt den Gegenstand der Differentialrechnung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX7","text":"Das Differential entsteht nicht durch äußerliche Addition oder Subtraktion eines kleinen Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX8","text":"Höhere Potenzen dürfen nicht wegen empirischer oder relativer Unbedeutsamkeit weggelassen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX9","text":"Unendliche Annäherung erklärt den Differentialkoeffizienten nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX10","text":"Ein Glied analytischer Entwicklung ist nicht schon deshalb eine physische Existenz oder ein physisches Gesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D1","text":"Die begriffliche Unkenntnis des mathematischen Unendlichen verhindert eine immanente Bestimmung seines legitimen Anwendungsumfangs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D2","text":"Das wahrhafte mathematische Unendliche ist die Einheit von aufgehobener quantitativer Selbständigkeit und erhaltener relationaler Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D3","text":"Der Bruch bildet eine vorläufige Gestalt des Unendlichen, weil seine Seiten austauschbare Verhältnisglieder sind, aber außerhalb des Verhältnisses noch als selbständige Quanta bestehen können.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","text":"Die unendliche Reihe ist der endliche, mangelhafte Ausdruck; der sogenannte endliche Summenausdruck ist der wahrhaft unendliche Ausdruck.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D5","text":"Das schlechte Unendliche besitzt seine Negation außerhalb seiner gesetzten Glieder; das wahrhafte Unendliche enthält die Negation im Verhältnis selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D6","text":"Funktionen ersten Grades sind nur formell Funktionen der höheren Analysis, weil ihr Verhältnis ein fixer Quotient und kein Potenzenverhältnis ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D7","text":"Differentiale sind vergleichbar, weil sie keine selbständigen Größen, sondern ausschließlich Momente einer Vergleichungsrelation sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D8","text":"Ein vollkommen genaues Resultat kann nicht durch eine bloß ungefähr genaue Operation wissenschaftlich begründet werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0081","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D9","text":"Newtons Grenzen, Eulers Nullen und Lagranges Reihen erfassen jeweils die Negation des Quantums, ohne deren positive Bestimmung als qualitative Relation vollständig festzuhalten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","text":"Der traditionelle Kalkül erzeugt seinen Grundwiderspruch, indem er Differentiale zunächst endlicher Arithmetik unterwirft und sie anschließend als Quanta vernachlässigt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D11","text":"Die Behandlung eines Bogenelements als Tangentenelement ist nur dort legitim, wo die endliche Quantitätsdifferenz verschwindet und das konstitutive Winkelverhältnis erhalten bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0131","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","text":"Die physische Bedeutung analytischer Glieder bedarf eines empirischen oder begrifflichen Grundes, der nicht aus ihrer formalen Ableitung folgt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1","text":"Die Exaktheit des Differentialkalküls beruht nicht auf verschwindenden Größen, sondern auf der Invarianz eines qualitativen Verhältnisses beim Verschwinden der selbständigen Quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD2","text":"Die Ontologie des Kalküls verschiebt sich von selbständigen Größen zu relationalen Momenten, deren Sein vollständig in ihrer wechselseitigen Bestimmung liegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD3","text":"Das mathematische Unendliche steht über dem gewöhnlichen metaphysischen Unendlichen, sofern es Grenze und Jenseits vereinigt, statt ihren äußeren Gegensatz endlos zu reproduzieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD4","text":"Eine Verallgemeinerung, die das spezifische Potenzenverhältnis beseitigt, zerstört den Grund, aus dem die Differentialmethode notwendig wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD5","text":"Sobald analytischen Gliedern ohne zusätzlichen Grund reale Existenz zugesprochen wird, verwandelt sich formale Ableitung in ontologische Fiktion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6","text":"Die höhere Analysis überschreitet die Kategorien endlicher Mathematik, kann diesen Überschritt aber ohne eine begriffliche Theorie ihres Gegenstands nicht selbst legitimieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX1","text":"Die relationale Bestimmtheit kann nicht aus selbständigen infinitesimalen Entitäten zusammengesetzt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX2","text":"Unabschließbarkeit kann keine positive Gegenwart des Unendlichen begründen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX3","text":"Eine quantitative Annäherung kann nicht durch bloße Steigerung in qualitative Exaktheit umschlagen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX4","text":"Kontinuität, Fließen und Werden sind keine hinreichenden Bestimmungen des spezifischen Differentialverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0121","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0123","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX5","text":"Methodische Allgemeinheit entsteht nicht durch Tilgung derjenigen qualitativen Bestimmtheit, welche die Methode erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX6","text":"Formale Ableitbarkeit kann weder physische Existenz noch kausale Wirksamkeit verbürgen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX1","text":"Eine vollständig autarke mathematische Selbstbegründung des Unendlichen ist innerhalb der Kategorien endlicher Quantität nicht verfügbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX2","text":"Der Infinitesimalbegriff bezeichnet keinen verfügbaren Mittelzustand zwischen Sein und Nichts; ausgeschlossen ist jede Ontologie des „fast Seienden“.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX3","text":"Das wahrhafte Unendliche ist um die Abwesenheit eines äußeren Jenseits organisiert; jede verbleibende Transzendenz der Grenze reproduziert Endlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4","text":"Zwischen analytischer Notwendigkeit und realer Existenz besteht kein automatisch verfügbarer Übergang.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS1","text":"Exakte Resultate plus begrifflich widersprüchliche Operationen erzeugen ein Rechtfertigungsdefizit, das durch Erfolg nicht geschlossen wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS2","text":"Endliches Quantum → unbegrenzbare Vermehrung oder Verminderung → Aufhebung des Quantums als Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung des Quantums plus Aufhebung seines Jenseits → qualitative quantitative Bestimmtheit → immanentes Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS4","text":"Verhältnis als Aggregat dargestellt → unvollständige Reihe → fortbestehendes Jenseits → schlechte Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS5","text":"Verhältnis als vollständige Einheit dargestellt → Einschluss des fehlenden Werts → gegenwärtige Vollständigkeit → wahrhafte Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","CH_GB18_A1DB:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS6","text":"Bruchrelation → Potenzenrelation → Verschwinden selbständiger Quanta → Differentialkoeffizient als reine qualitative Relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS7","text":"Rückfall in Inkrement, Kleinheit, Reihe oder Annäherung → Wiederkehr endlicher Quantität → operative Inkonsistenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0077","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS8","text":"Qualitative Rekonstruktion des Differentials → legitime Auswahl analytischer Momente → Trennung mathematischer Ableitung von physischer Existenzbehauptung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AF1","text":"Begriffliche Unrechtfertigkeit des Kalküls → Kritik der Erfolgslegitimation → Aufhebung des Quantums → Neubestimmung als Verhältnis → Umkehrung von Reihe und endlichem Ausdruck → Potenzenverhältnis → Differentialkoeffizient → qualitative Operationsregel → Begrenzung mathematischer Beweiskompetenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS3","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS4","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AF2","text":"Latenter Begriff bei Newton, Euler, Carnot und Lagrange → unvollständige Explikation → Rückkehr endlicher Größenkategorien → Vernachlässigungs- oder Annäherungsbegründung → erneutes Rechtfertigungsdefizit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D9","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0067","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0082","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von endlichem und unendlichem Quantum wird durch den Gegensatz von selbständigem Quantum und qualitativem Verhältnismoment ersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME2","text":"„Absolut“ und „relativ“ werden neu verteilt: Der schlechte metaphysische Progress erweist sich als abhängig von einer äußeren Grenze, das mathematische Verhältnis als immanent unendlich.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME3","text":"Die unendliche Reihe wird vom privilegierten Träger des Unendlichen zum mangelhaften Aggregat herabgestuft; der endliche relationale Ausdruck wird zum Träger wirklicher Unendlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","CH_GB18_A1DB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME4","text":"Die begriffliche Karte der höheren Analysis wird von „veränderlichen Größen“ auf Potenzenverhältnisse umgestellt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME5","text":"Das Infinitesimal wird von einem extrem kleinen Gegenstand zu einem unselbständigen Moment des Differentialkoeffizienten umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME6","text":"Das Weglassen höherer Glieder wird von einer Größenentscheidung zu einer Entscheidung über qualitative Relevanz transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME7","text":"Grenze und Annäherung verlieren den Status letzter Erklärungsprinzipien; sichtbar wird stattdessen die Erhaltung eines Verhältnisses beim Verschwinden seiner quantitativen Träger.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX3","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME8","text":"Analytische Formelglieder und physische Wirklichkeiten werden in getrennte Begründungsordnungen überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT1","text":"Altitude 1 — Surface — Untersucht werden Definitionen des mathematischen Unendlichen sowie die Begründungen von Reihen, Differentialen, Grenzen und Vernachlässigungsoperationen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0114","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT2","text":"Altitude 2 — Structural — Der tragende Mechanismus ist die Umwandlung selbständiger Quanta in qualitative Momente eines immanenten Verhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT3","text":"Altitude 3 — Metastrategic — Mathematische Verfahren werden nicht nach Erfolg oder formaler Allgemeinheit, sondern nach der Übereinstimmung ihrer Operationen mit der spezifischen Begriffsstruktur ihres Gegenstands beurteilt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT4","text":"Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal — Wirkliche Unendlichkeit ist vollendete Gegenwart und immanente Negation; schlechte Unendlichkeit ist unvollendetes Sollen mit einem zeitlich oder logisch hinausgeschobenen Jenseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Kritik der Erfolgsrechtfertigung bis zur qualitativen Deutung des Differentialkoeffizienten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete mathematische Verwendung des abgeleiteten Koeffizienten; ihre systematische Ausführung wird ausdrücklich einer folgenden Anmerkung überlassen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7","CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0122","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern zwischen dem aufgehobenen Quantum, der erhaltenen Quantitätsbestimmtheit und dem selbständigen Wert des Gesamtverhältnisses strikt unterschieden wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Generativität liegt in der Umkehrung von unendlicher Reihe und endlichem Ausdruck sowie in der Deutung der Differentiale als unselbständige Relationsmomente.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","CH_GB18_A1DB:D7","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT5","text":"Die Ableitung vom nicht mehr vermehrbaren Quantum zum Nicht-Quantum wird als unmittelbar notwendig gesetzt; die vermittelnden Bedingungen dieser Notwendigkeit bleiben komprimiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie bleibt bestehen: Differentiale sollen nur im Verhältnis Bedeutung haben, während der operative Kalkül ihre getrennte Behandlung weiterhin voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0115","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT7","text":"Die Legitimation der Gleichsetzung heterogener Elemente und die Grenze zwischen analytischem Glied und physischer Existenz erhalten Kriterien, aber keine vollständig ausgearbeitete allgemeine Entscheidungsregel.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D11","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0131","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: methodischer Widerspruch → begriffliche Neubestimmung → historische Prüfung → operative Korrektur → Begrenzung mathematischer Geltungsansprüche.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AF1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110652450005Z_a92f467f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1. The Conceptual Determinacy of the Mathematical Infinite.","source_sha256":"b7db3e726dcce755188a4134fe85198517bbd4f8416016d1bd68e12a05c3b9bc","sha256":"b722939a7ff7c2ead1a78a21cecad56ce6b35908aae9e1f2a32126f21c1552aa","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:06:52.450962+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","text":"The exact results of infinitesimal calculus do not eliminate the contradiction that its operations are conceptually unclarified and partly conceded to be incorrect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS2","text":"The diagnostic-reconstructive argument traces the methodological contradiction back to the confusion of the true infinite with infinite progress, indeterminate smallness, and external approximation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0078","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS3","text":"The usual definition of infinite quantum is turned against itself: that which can no longer be increased or diminished is no longer a quantum as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS4","text":"The sublated quantum remains not as a vanishing magnitude, but as the qualitative determinacy of a relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","text":"Fraction, series, power relation, and differential coefficient form stages at which quantitative independence vanishes and relational determinacy emerges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS6","text":"The historical foundations partially grasp the relational thought, but in operation fall back upon finite increments, neglect, approximation, or formal series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0077","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7","text":"The reconstruction ends in a double delimitation: differential operations are to be grounded qualitatively, and analytical decompositions may not, without additional reason, count as physical existences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","text":"Scientific justification concerns the necessity of the procedure and cannot be replaced by the correctness of its results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","text":"Finite quantum is a boundary indifferent to increase and diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","text":"A quantum that can no longer be increased or diminished is sublated as quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","text":"The true infinite quantum nullifies both finite quantum and its external beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","text":"The sublated quantitative determinacy persists as qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","text":"A qualitative moment of quantity possesses significance exclusively through its relation to its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","text":"Outside its constitutive relation, the qualitative moment of quantity is zero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","text":"The representation of a qualitative relation as an aggregate necessarily generates an interminable progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","text":"The complete relational expression contains presently the value that the infinite series seeks only as an unattained beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","text":"The specific ground of higher analysis is the power relation, not the mere variability of its magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","text":"Differentials are neither finite quanta nor indeterminate zeros, but exclusively moments of the differential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","text":"The transition to the differential is the reduction of a finite function to the qualitative relation of its determinations of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","text":"The disregard of analytical terms is justified only by their qualitative functional ineffectuality, not by their relative smallness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","text":"Every non-conceptual grounding of infinitesimal calculus causes finite quantitative determinacy to recur in the operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","text":"Mathematical analysis cannot prove qualitative physical laws from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0139","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX1","text":"The correctness of a result is no justification of the operation that produces it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX2","text":"The true infinite is neither a greatest nor a smallest quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX3","text":"Kant's transcendental infinity does not overcome the contradiction of magnitude, but distributes it between limited object and transgressing subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX4","text":"An infinite series is not truly infinite on account of the quantity of its posited terms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX5","text":"Infinite differences are neither indivisible ultimate magnitudes nor vanishingly small finite particles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX6","text":"Mere variability does not determine the object of differential calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX7","text":"The differential does not arise through the external addition or subtraction of a small quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX8","text":"Higher powers may not be omitted on account of empirical or relative insignificance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX9","text":"Infinite approximation does not explain the differential coefficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:NX10","text":"A term of analytical development is not thereby a physical existence or a physical law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D1","text":"Conceptual ignorance of the mathematical infinite prevents an immanent determination of the scope of its legitimate application.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D2","text":"The true mathematical infinite is the unity of sublated quantitative independence and preserved relational determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D3","text":"The fraction forms a provisional shape of the infinite because its sides are interchangeable terms of relation, but outside the relation can still subsist as independent quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","text":"The infinite series is the finite, deficient expression; the so-called finite sum expression is the truly infinite expression.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D5","text":"The bad infinite has its negation outside its posited terms; the true infinite contains negation in the relation itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D6","text":"Functions of the first degree are only formally functions of higher analysis, because their relation is a fixed quotient and not a power relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D7","text":"Differentials are comparable because they are not independent magnitudes, but exclusively moments of a relation of comparison.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D8","text":"A perfectly exact result cannot be scientifically grounded by an operation that is merely approximately exact.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0081","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D9","text":"Newton's limits, Euler's zeros, and Lagrange's series each grasp the negation of quantum without fully retaining its positive determination as qualitative relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","text":"Traditional calculus generates its fundamental contradiction by first subjecting differentials to finite arithmetic and subsequently neglecting them as quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D11","text":"The treatment of an arc element as a tangent element is legitimate only where the finite quantitative difference vanishes and the constitutive angular relation is preserved.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0131","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","text":"The physical significance of analytical terms requires an empirical or conceptual ground that does not follow from their formal derivation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1","text":"The exactness of differential calculus rests not on vanishing magnitudes, but on the invariance of a qualitative relation in the vanishing of independent quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD2","text":"The ontology of calculus shifts from independent magnitudes to relational moments whose being lies wholly in their reciprocal determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD3","text":"The mathematical infinite stands above the ordinary metaphysical infinite insofar as it unites boundary and beyond, rather than endlessly reproducing their external opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD4","text":"A generalization that eliminates the specific power relation destroys the ground from which the differential method becomes necessary.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD5","text":"As soon as real existence is ascribed to analytical terms without additional ground, formal derivation turns into ontological fiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6","text":"Higher analysis exceeds the categories of finite mathematics, but cannot itself legitimize this exceeding without a conceptual theory of its object.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX1","text":"Relational determinacy cannot be composed out of independent infinitesimal entities.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX2","text":"Unfinishability cannot ground any positive presence of the infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX3","text":"A quantitative approximation cannot, through mere intensification, pass over into qualitative exactness.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX4","text":"Continuity, flux, and becoming are not sufficient determinations of the specific differential relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0121","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0123","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX5","text":"Methodological universality does not arise through the effacement of that qualitative determinacy which produces the method.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX6","text":"Formal derivability can guarantee neither physical existence nor causal efficacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX1","text":"A fully autarkic mathematical self-grounding of the infinite is not available within the categories of finite quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX2","text":"The infinitesimal concept designates no available intermediate state between being and nothing; excluded is every ontology of “almost being.”","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A7","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX3","text":"The true infinite is organized around the absence of an external beyond; every remaining transcendence of the boundary reproduces finitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4","text":"There is no automatically available transition between analytical necessity and real existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0135","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS1","text":"Exact results plus conceptually contradictory operations generate a deficit of justification that success does not close.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS2","text":"Finite quantum → unbounded increase or diminution → sublation of quantum as quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS3","text":"Sublation of quantum plus sublation of its beyond → qualitative quantitative determinacy → immanent relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS4","text":"Relation represented as aggregate → incomplete series → persisting beyond → bad infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS5","text":"Relation represented as complete unity → inclusion of the missing value → present completeness → true infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","CH_GB18_A1DB:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS6","text":"Fraction relation → power relation → vanishing of independent quanta → differential coefficient as pure qualitative relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS7","text":"Relapse into increment, smallness, series, or approximation → recurrence of finite quantity → operative inconsistency.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0077","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS8","text":"Qualitative reconstruction of the differential → legitimate selection of analytical moments → separation of mathematical derivation from assertion of physical existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A12","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AF1","text":"Conceptual unjustifiability of calculus → critique of legitimation through success → sublation of quantum → redetermination as relation → reversal of series and finite expression → power relation → differential coefficient → qualitative rule of operation → limitation of mathematical competence to prove.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS3","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS4","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:AF2","text":"Latent concept in Newton, Euler, Carnot, and Lagrange → incomplete explication → return of finite categories of magnitude → grounding through neglect or approximation → renewed deficit of justification.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D9","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0067","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0082","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME1","text":"The opposition of finite and infinite quantum is replaced by the opposition of independent quantum and qualitative relational moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME2","text":"“Absolute” and “relative” are redistributed: bad metaphysical progress proves dependent on an external boundary, while the mathematical relation proves immanently infinite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME3","text":"The infinite series is demoted from the privileged bearer of the infinite to a deficient aggregate; the finite relational expression becomes the bearer of actual infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","CH_GB18_A1DB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME4","text":"The conceptual map of higher analysis is shifted from “variable magnitudes” to power relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME5","text":"The infinitesimal is reclassified from an extremely small object to a non-independent moment of the differential coefficient.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME6","text":"The omission of higher terms is transformed from a decision of magnitude into a decision concerning qualitative relevance.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME7","text":"Limit and approximation lose the status of ultimate explanatory principles; what becomes visible instead is the preservation of a relation in the vanishing of its quantitative bearers.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX3","CH_GB18_A1DB:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ME8","text":"Analytical formula terms and physical realities are transferred into separate orders of justification.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A15","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT1","text":"Altitude 1 — Surface — Investigated are definitions of the mathematical infinite as well as the foundations of series, differentials, limits, and operations of neglect.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS5","CH_GB18_A1DB:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0113","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0114","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT2","text":"Altitude 2 — Structural — The supporting mechanism is the transformation of independent quanta into qualitative moments of an immanent relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT3","text":"Altitude 3 — Metastrategic — Mathematical procedures are assessed not according to success or formal universality, but according to the conformity of their operations with the specific conceptual structure of their object.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A10","CH_GB18_A1DB:A13","CH_GB18_A1DB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:ALT4","text":"Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal — Actual infinity is completed presence and immanent negation; bad infinity is uncompleted oughtness with a beyond deferred temporally or logically.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A4","CH_GB18_A1DB:A8","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the critique of justification through success to the qualitative interpretation of the differential coefficient.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A1","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete mathematical use of the derived coefficient; its systematic exposition is expressly left to a following note.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AS7","CH_GB18_A1DB:FGS8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0122","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent provided that a strict distinction is maintained between the sublated quantum, the preserved determination of quantity, and the independent value of the total relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A3","CH_GB18_A1DB:A5","CH_GB18_A1DB:A6","CH_GB18_A1DB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT4","text":"The greatest generativity lies in the reversal of infinite series and finite expression, as well as in the interpretation of differentials as non-independent relational moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D4","CH_GB18_A1DB:D7","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT5","text":"The derivation from quantum no longer capable of increase to non-quantum is posited as immediately necessary; the mediating conditions of this necessity remain compressed.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A2","CH_GB18_A1DB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT6","text":"The central fracture remains: differentials are to have significance only in relation, while operative calculus continues to presuppose their separate treatment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:A11","CH_GB18_A1DB:D10","CH_GB18_A1DB:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0059","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0087","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0115","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT7","text":"The legitimation of equating heterogeneous elements and the boundary between analytical term and physical existence receive criteria, but no fully elaborated general rule of decision.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:D11","CH_GB18_A1DB:D12","CH_GB18_A1DB:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0131","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A1DB:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement: methodological contradiction → conceptual redetermination → historical examination → operative correction → limitation of claims to mathematical validity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A1DB:AF1","CH_GB18_A1DB:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0107","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A1DB:P0140","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A1DB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A1DB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 73","title":"Remark 1. The Conceptual Determinacy of the Mathematical Infinite.","context":"Chapter 73","original_title":"Anmerkung 1. Die Begriffsbestimmtheit des mathematischen Unendlichen."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1. Die Begriffsbestimmtheit des mathematischen Unendlichen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.The Purpose of Differential Calculus Derived from Its Application.","order":74,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A2DZ"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A2DZ@R001","sha256":"4432b8f4c27e1dc1b507940be062c6e6c5c8f628948c8aad8037f21aac7dfeec","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS1","text":"Der Text bearbeitet den Widerspruch zwischen der mechanischen Sicherheit der Koeffizientenableitung und der fehlenden Berechtigung, die übrigen Entwicklungsglieder wegzulassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS2","text":"Die sogenannte Anwendung ist nicht nachgeordnet, sondern der Ort, aus dem Zweck, Gegenstand und Recht des Kalküls abstrahiert werden müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS3","text":"Der spezifische Gegenstand des Kalküls ist das Verhältnis einer Potenzenfunktion zu ihrer nächsten Entwicklungs- oder Potenzierungsfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS4","text":"Die Differentiation erzeugt zunächst nur ein Verhältnis herabgesetzter Potenzenfunktionen, dessen konkrete Bedeutung erst durch eine unabhängig bewiesene Proportionalität entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS5","text":"Die Integration kehrt die formale Ableitungsrichtung um, erhält ihren realen Gehalt aber erst durch die Zuordnung ursprünglicher und abgeleiteter Funktionen zu verschiedenen Momenten eines Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS6","text":"Das Argument verfährt rekonstruktiv, genealogisch und polemisch, indem es die abstrakte Theorie auf historisch und sachlich vorausgehende Problemlösungen zurückführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von der unberechtigten formalen Operation über die Analyse ihrer Anwendungen zur qualitativen Potenzrelation und von dort zur getrennten Bestimmung von Differential- und Integralrechnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","text":"Jede besondere Rechnungsweise wird durch ein besonderes Größenverhältnis konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A2","text":"Das formale Verfahren der Differentialrechnung besteht mechanisch in der Gewinnung einer Entwicklungsfunktion aus einer Potenzenfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","text":"Das formale Verfahren rechtfertigt das Weglassen der übrigen Entwicklungsglieder nicht aus sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4","text":"Die konkreten Anwendungen bilden den sachlichen Grund und den Zweck der nachträglich abstrahierten Theorie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit des Quantitativen besitzt ihre mathematische Form im Potenzenverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","text":"Der spezifische Gegenstand des Differential- und Integralkalküls ist das Verhältnis einer Potenzenfunktion zu ihrer Entwicklungsfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","text":"Die Kategorien der Veränderlichkeit, Funktion, Kontinuität und unendlichen Größe enthalten diese spezifische Bestimmung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8","text":"Die relevanten Ausgangsgleichungen verbinden veränderliche Größen durch mindestens eine höhere Potenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","text":"Zuwachs, Binomialentwicklung und Reihenform sind Hilfsmittel zur Ermittlung der Entwicklungsfunktionen, nicht der eigentliche Gegenstand des Kalküls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","text":"Die Herabsetzung der Potenzen verändert die Werte der Gleichungsglieder und erzeugt daher zunächst ein Verhältnis, nicht notwendig eine neue Gleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","text":"Das abgeleitete Verhältnis erhält bestimmten Wert und konkrete Bedeutung erst durch den Beweis seiner Gleichheit mit einem Verhältnis von Gegenstandsmomenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","text":"Die formale Ableitung eines Verhältnisses und der objektbezogene Nachweis seiner Bedeutung sind getrennte Beweisoperationen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","text":"Die Integration kehrt formal den Übergang von der ursprünglichen Potenzenfunktion zur Entwicklungsfunktion um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14","text":"Die reale Aufgabe der Integration besteht in der Bestimmung des konkreten Verhältnisses zwischen ursprünglicher und abgeleiteter Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15","text":"Das Unendlichkleine bezeichnet nur die Negation eines bestimmten Quantums und kann deshalb keine positive Grundlage des Kalküls bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX1","text":"Der Differentialkalkül ist keine für sich selbst begründete alternative Form analytischen Rechnens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX2","text":"Die höheren Entwicklungsglieder werden nicht deshalb entbehrlich, weil sie schlechthin null oder bloß quantitativ unbedeutend wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX3","text":"Das Unendlichkleine ist kein positiv bestimmtes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX4","text":"Veränderlichkeit, Funktion und Kontinuität definieren den Differentialkalkül nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX5","text":"Die Reihe und ihre Summation sind nicht der eigentliche Gegenstand des Differential- und Integralkalküls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX6","text":"Eine Gleichung erster Potenz besitzt für sich keinen spezifischen Differentialgehalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX7","text":"Ein Differentialquotient ist nicht aus sich selbst eine inhaltlich bestimmte Gleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX8","text":"Das charakteristische Dreieck beweist die gesuchte Proportionalität nicht, wenn diese bereits in seine Konstruktion eingelegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0055","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX9","text":"Integration ist keine Summation unendlich vieler unendlich kleiner Elemente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX10","text":"Eine abgeleitete Funktion bezeichnet nicht allein kraft ihrer formalen Erzeugung einen realen Bewegungsanteil oder eine physikalische Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX11","text":"Unbegrenzte Annäherung ersetzt keine affirmative Bestimmung des zugrunde liegenden Größenverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX12","text":"Die äußerliche Vermehrung von Gliedern erzeugt keine wahrhafte Allgemeinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX13","text":"Eine Konstante ist nicht notwendig eine funktionslose oder sachlich gleichgültige Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D1","text":"Die abstrakte Theorie ist eine nachträgliche Systematisierung von Verfahren, die zunächst als empirische Regeln und geometrische Kunstgriffe existierten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D2","text":"Die übrigen Entwicklungsglieder dürfen nur deshalb unberücksichtigt bleiben, weil ausschließlich das Verhältnis zur nächsten Entwicklungsfunktion gesucht wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D3","text":"Kontinuität erhält ihren bestimmten Sinn als Erhaltung eines Potenzenverhältnisses durch die quantitative Veränderung hindurch.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Konstante und Funktion ist rollenabhängig, weil Konstanten selbst Funktionen anderer Bestimmungen sein können.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D5","text":"Die Differentiation einer ausschließlich linearen Gleichung wiederholt nur ein bereits vorhandenes Verhältnis und erzeugt keinen qualitativen Übergang.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D6","text":"Die Formel eines Differentialquotienten bezeichnet zunächst lediglich das Verhältnis zweier Entwicklungsfunktionen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D7","text":"Eine Tangentenbestimmung verlangt zuerst die Gewinnung eines linearen Verhältnisses aus der Kurvengleichung und danach den unabhängigen Nachweis, welche Linien dieses Verhältnis realisieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D8","text":"Ein Zuwachs ist legitim, wenn er als endliche arithmetische Größe einen qualitativ bestimmten Potenzenunterschied im geometrischen Beweis sichtbar macht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D9","text":"Die Differentiation vermindert Bestimmungen und hebt Differenzen auf, während die Integration aufgehobene Bestimmungen wiederherstellt; die üblichen Namen verdecken diese Operationsrichtung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D10","text":"Die Reihenform kann Integrationsoperationen technisch vermitteln, gehört aber nicht zum spezifischen Prinzip der Integration.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0085","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D11","text":"Die Zuordnung von Ordinate und Fläche oder Tangentenbestimmung und Bogen muss durch gegenstandsbezogene Relationen oder obere und untere Grenzen bewiesen werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D12","text":"Die formale Ableitung einer Bewegungsgleichung erzeugt ohne zusätzliche physikalische Begründung keinen selbständigen Bewegungsbestandteil.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D13","text":"Logarithmen, Reihen und Kreisverhältnisse sind im Kalkül Hilfsoperationen zur Traktabilität, nicht dessen konstitutives Größenverhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0110","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD1","text":"Der Kalkül ist formal erzeugungsfähig, aber semantisch unvollständig, solange kein gegenstandsspezifisches Verhältnis seine Resultate interpretiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A2","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD2","text":"Die Theorie konstituiert ihre Anwendungen nicht; sie rekonstruiert rückwirkend die gemeinsame Form bereits erfolgreicher gegenständlicher Übergänge.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD3","text":"Differential- und Integralrechnung sind formal invers, aber hinsichtlich ihrer konkreten Beweisaufgaben asymmetrisch.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD4","text":"Der affirmative Gehalt des mathematisch Unendlichen liegt nicht in verschwindender Quantität, sondern in der qualitativen Invarianz des Potenzenverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD5","text":"Die Allgemeinheit des Kalküls beruht auf einem wiederkehrenden Gesetz der Potenzrelation und nicht auf der äußerlichen Allgemeinheit beliebiger Funktionen oder beliebig vieler Summenglieder.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD6","text":"Der Gegenstand des Kalküls ist relational: Er besteht weder in isolierten Größen noch in infinitesimalen Entitäten, sondern im Übergang zwischen qualitativ verschiedenen Bestimmungsstufen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX1","text":"Eine formale Operation kann die konkrete Semantik ihres Resultats nicht aus ihrer eigenen Syntax erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX2","text":"Quantitative Kleinheit kann keinen qualitativen Übergang zwischen Potenzenbestimmungen begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX3","text":"Qualitativ verschiedene Dimensionen und Gegenstandsmomente sind nicht unmittelbar homogen und deshalb nicht ohne Vermittlung gleichsetzbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX4","text":"Historischer Erfolg und empirische Brauchbarkeit einer Regel ersetzen keinen Beweis ihres Gegenstandsverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX5","text":"Aus allgemeinen Kategorien lässt sich die spezifische Bestimmung des Kalküls nicht durch bloße Analyse herausziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX6","text":"Es existiert keine gegenstandsunabhängige Standardzuordnung, die jedes abgeleitete Verhältnis automatisch interpretiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0096","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines sich selbst interpretierenden Kalküls, dessen formale Operation zugleich ihre konkrete Bedeutung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX2","text":"Dem System fehlt eine positive infinitesimale Entität; seine Grundlegung muss ohne ein real vorhandenes Unendlichkleines auskommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine unmittelbare Identität zwischen ursprünglicher Funktion, abgeleitetem Verhältnis und konkretem Gegenstandsmoment; jede Verbindung verlangt eine eigene Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX4","text":"Eine vollständige Schließung des Systems bleibt aus, weil die behauptete Einheit des Prinzips nicht durch die Rückführung sämtlicher Anwendungen demonstriert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS1","text":"Mechanische Koeffizientenableitung plus unbegründetes Weglassen weiterer Glieder → formale Nichtselbständigkeit der Methode → Rückgang auf ihre Anwendungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS2","text":"Analyse der Anwendungen → Gleichungen mit höheren Potenzen → Identifikation des qualitativen Potenzenverhältnisses → Bestimmung des spezifischen Kalkülgegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS3","text":"Potenzengleichung mehrerer veränderlicher Größen → Ersetzung der Potenzen durch ihre nächsten Entwicklungsfunktionen → Wertveränderung der Glieder → bloßes Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS4","text":"Abgeleitetes Verhältnis → Konstruktion eines konkreten Gegenstandsverhältnisses → unabhängiger Proportionalitätsbeweis → Bestimmung des gesuchten Gegenstandsmoments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS5","text":"Endlicher Zuwachs → Entwicklung nach Potenzen → Vergleich qualitativ verschiedener Potenzordnungen → geometrischer Grenz- oder Tangentialbeweis ohne infinitesimale Entität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS6","text":"Gegebene Entwicklungsfunktion → formale Rückführung auf eine ursprüngliche Potenzenfunktion → Identifikation des entsprechenden Gegenstandsganzen → objektbezogener Nachweis durch Relationen oder Schranken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS7","text":"Differentiation erzeugt das Verhältnis, Integration rekonstruiert seine ursprüngliche Funktion, und die Anwendung selektiert sowie validiert die konkrete Bedeutung beider Operationen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF1","text":"Mechanische Regel → unberechtigtes Weglassen → fehlende Selbstbegründung → Verlagerung des Grundes in die Anwendungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF2","text":"Anwendungen → Potenzengleichungen → Depotenzierung → abgeleitetes Verhältnis → objektseitiger Proportionalitätsbeweis → Differentialbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF3","text":"Gegebenes abgeleitetes Verhältnis → Rückgang zur ursprünglichen Potenzenfunktion → Identifikation des entsprechenden Gegenstandsganzen → Integralbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF4","text":"Zurückweisung infinitesimaler Ontologie → Freilegung der qualitativen Potenzrelation → einheitliche Bestimmung von Differential- und Integralkalkül.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME1","text":"Die Anwendung wird von einer nachgeordneten Verwendung zur konstitutiven Quelle des Kalkülbegriffs umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME2","text":"Differentiation wird von einer Rechnung mit kleinen Differenzen zur Depotenzierung einer Gleichung in ein Verhältnis umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME3","text":"Integration wird von einer Summation infinitesimaler Elemente zur Wiedergewinnung einer ursprünglichen Funktion mit konkreter Gegenstandsbedeutung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME4","text":"Das Unendlichkleine wird von einer mathematischen Entität zu einem negativen oder bloß instrumentellen Ausdruck herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME5","text":"Die Reihe wird von der Grundlage des Kalküls zu einem äußeren Entwicklungs- und Darstellungsmittel umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME6","text":"Kontinuität wird nicht mehr als abstrakte Gleichförmigkeit, sondern als Erhaltung einer qualitativen Potenzbestimmung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME7","text":"Variable und Konstante werden als relationale Rollen statt als unveränderliche Arten mathematischer Größen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME8","text":"Der Differentialquotient wird von einer selbstgenügsamen Gleichung zu einem noch interpretationsbedürftigen Verhältnis umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME9","text":"Physikalische Benennungen abgeleiteter Funktionen werden als zusätzliche Gegenstandszuschreibungen und nicht als Resultate der Rechnung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME10","text":"Wahrhafte Allgemeinheit wird vom Umfang äußerlicher Wiederholung auf das erzeugende Gesetz einer Relation verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die Bestimmung des Zwecks und der legitimen Anwendung von Differential- und Integralrechnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0086","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Kalkül operiert durch die Trennung von formaler Erzeugung, gegenständlicher Zuordnung und unabhängigem Proportionalitätsbeweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Grundlegungsrichtung wird von abstrakter Theorie zu Anwendung in die Richtung von konkreter Problemlösung zu nachträglicher Prinzipienbildung umgekehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Größen gelten als qualitativ bestimmte Relationen von Potenzstufen; weder das Unendlichkleine noch ein zeitloser Bewegungsmoment besitzt eigenständige positive Realität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT1","text":"Die fünfzehn Axiome reichen aus, um Problem, Gegenstand, Differentialoperation, Integraloperation und negative Grundlegung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die behauptete Geltung des Prinzips für den vollständigen Umfang aller Anwendungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern formale Erzeugung und konkrete Bedeutungszuweisung strikt getrennt bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung des bloßen Verhältnisses aus der Wertveränderung, die durch die Herabsetzung der Potenzen entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT5","text":"Die Rückführung der Theorie auf Anwendungen erzeugt eine Spannung zwischen beanspruchter begrifflicher Notwendigkeit und tatsächlich exemplarischer Induktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT6","text":"Die Zurückweisung des Zuwachses als Grundbegriff und seine Wiederaufnahme als notwendiges Beweismittel bleiben nur durch eine zweckabhängige Funktionsunterscheidung vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT7","text":"Lineare Beziehungen werden als selbständige Differentialgegenstände ausgeschlossen, bleiben aber als Resultate und konkrete Interpretanten der Depotenzierung unverzichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT8","text":"Die Reduktion sämtlicher relevanter Funktionen auf Potenzenverhältnisse wird behauptet, aber für exponentielle, logarithmische und komplexere Funktionsformen nicht vollständig durchgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT9","text":"Historische Beispiele und polemische Demontagen übernehmen Beweislast, wo eine vollständige systematische Induktion ausdrücklich ausbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn die Anwendungen als logischer Grund und nicht als bloße Illustrationen der Theorie behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110721266086Z_59dccba9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 2. The purpose of differential calculus derived from its application.","source_sha256":"4432b8f4c27e1dc1b507940be062c6e6c5c8f628948c8aad8037f21aac7dfeec","sha256":"7809a5fba41887e533ee130f2b520541d2982a095d51fad5d9c5f15e80fef677","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:07:21.267099+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS1","text":"The text addresses the contradiction between the mechanical certainty of coefficient derivation and the lack of justification for omitting the remaining terms of the expansion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS2","text":"The so-called application is not subordinate, but rather the locus from which the purpose, object, and justification of the calculus must be abstracted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS3","text":"The specific object of the calculus is the relation of a power function to its next function of expansion or elevation to a power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS4","text":"Differentiation initially produces only a relation of reduced power functions, whose concrete meaning arises only through an independently proven proportionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS5","text":"Integration reverses the formal direction of derivation, but receives its real content only through the assignment of original and derived functions to different moments of an object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS6","text":"The argument proceeds reconstructively, genealogically, and polemically by tracing abstract theory back to historically and materially prior problem-solutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AS7","text":"The movement proceeds from the unjustified formal operation through the analysis of its applications to the qualitative power relation, and thence to the separate determination of differential and integral calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","text":"Every particular mode of calculation is constituted by a particular relation of magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A2","text":"The formal procedure of differential calculus consists mechanically in obtaining a function of expansion from a power function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","text":"The formal procedure does not justify the omission of the remaining terms of the expansion from within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4","text":"The concrete applications constitute the material ground and purpose of the subsequently abstracted theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","text":"The qualitative determinacy of the quantitative has its mathematical form in the power relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","text":"The specific object of differential and integral calculus is the relation of a power function to its function of expansion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","text":"The categories of variability, function, continuity, and infinite magnitude do not contain this specific determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8","text":"The relevant initial equations connect variable magnitudes through at least one higher power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","text":"Increment, binomial expansion, and series form are auxiliary means for determining the functions of expansion, not the actual object of the calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","text":"The reduction of the powers changes the values of the terms of the equation and therefore initially produces a relation, not necessarily a new equation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","text":"The derived relation receives determinate value and concrete meaning only through proof of its equality with a relation of moments of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","text":"The formal derivation of a relation and the object-related demonstration of its meaning are separate operations of proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","text":"Integration formally reverses the transition from the original power function to the function of expansion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14","text":"The real task of integration consists in determining the concrete relation between original and derived function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15","text":"The infinitely small designates only the negation of a determinate quantum and can therefore form no positive foundation of the calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX1","text":"Differential calculus is not an alternative form of analytical calculation justified for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX2","text":"The higher terms of the expansion do not become dispensable because they are simply zero or merely quantitatively insignificant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX3","text":"The infinitely small is not a positively determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX4","text":"Variability, function, and continuity do not define differential calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX5","text":"The series and its summation are not the actual object of differential and integral calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX6","text":"An equation of the first power has, in itself, no specific differential content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX7","text":"A differential quotient is not, in itself, an equation determined in content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX8","text":"The characteristic triangle does not prove the sought proportionality if the latter has already been built into its construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0055","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX9","text":"Integration is not the summation of infinitely many infinitely small elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX10","text":"A derived function does not, solely by virtue of its formal generation, designate a real component of motion or a physical force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX11","text":"Unlimited approximation does not replace an affirmative determination of the underlying relation of magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX12","text":"The external multiplication of terms produces no true universality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:NX13","text":"A constant is not necessarily a functionless or materially indifferent magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D1","text":"Abstract theory is a subsequent systematization of procedures that initially existed as empirical rules and geometrical devices.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D2","text":"The remaining terms of the expansion may be disregarded only because exclusively the relation to the next function of expansion is sought.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D3","text":"Continuity receives its determinate meaning as the preservation of a power relation through quantitative change.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D4","text":"The distinction between constant and function is role-dependent, because constants may themselves be functions of other determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D5","text":"The differentiation of an exclusively linear equation merely repeats an already existing relation and produces no qualitative transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A8","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D6","text":"The formula of a differential quotient initially designates only the relation of two functions of expansion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D7","text":"A determination of the tangent first requires the derivation of a linear relation from the equation of the curve and then the independent demonstration of which lines realize this relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D8","text":"An increment is legitimate when, as a finite arithmetical magnitude, it makes a qualitatively determinate difference of powers visible in geometrical proof.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D9","text":"Differentiation diminishes determinations and cancels differences, whereas integration restores cancelled determinations; the customary names obscure this direction of operation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D10","text":"Series form can technically mediate operations of integration, but does not belong to the specific principle of integration.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0085","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D11","text":"The assignment of ordinate and area, or of tangent determination and arc, must be proven through object-related relations or upper and lower bounds.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D12","text":"The formal derivation of an equation of motion produces no independent component of motion without additional physical justification.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:D13","text":"Logarithms, series, and circle relations are auxiliary operations for tractability in the calculus, not its constitutive relation of magnitudes.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0110","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD1","text":"The calculus is formally generative, but semantically incomplete so long as no object-specific relation interprets its results.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A2","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD2","text":"Theory does not constitute its applications; it retrospectively reconstructs the common form of already successful objective transitions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A3","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A4","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD3","text":"Differential and integral calculus are formally inverse, but asymmetrical with respect to their concrete tasks of proof.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A11","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A12","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A13","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD4","text":"The affirmative content of the mathematical infinite lies not in vanishing quantity, but in the qualitative invariance of the power relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD5","text":"The universality of the calculus rests on a recurrent law of the power relation and not on the external universality of arbitrary functions or arbitrarily many terms of a sum.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A1","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SD6","text":"The object of the calculus is relational: it consists neither in isolated magnitudes nor in infinitesimal entities, but in the transition between qualitatively different levels of determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A2DZ:A5","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A6","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A10","CH_GB18_A2DZ:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX1","text":"A formal operation cannot generate the concrete semantics of its result from its own syntax.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX2","text":"Quantitative smallness cannot ground a qualitative transition between determinations of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX3","text":"Qualitatively different dimensions and moments of the object are not immediately homogeneous and therefore cannot be equated without mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX4","text":"The historical success and empirical usefulness of a rule do not replace proof of its object-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX5","text":"The specific determination of the calculus cannot be extracted from general categories by mere analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:DNX6","text":"There exists no object-independent standard assignment that automatically interprets every derived relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0096","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a self-interpreting calculus whose formal operation simultaneously generates its concrete meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX2","text":"The system lacks a positive infinitesimal entity; its foundation must manage without a really existing infinitely small.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX3","text":"An immediate identity between original function, derived relation, and concrete moment of the object is precluded; every connection requires its own mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:SNX4","text":"A complete closure of the system remains absent, because the asserted unity of the principle is not demonstrated by reducing all applications to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS1","text":"Mechanical coefficient derivation plus unjustified omission of further terms → formal non-self-sufficiency of the method → return to its applications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS2","text":"Analysis of the applications → equations with higher powers → identification of the qualitative power relation → determination of the specific object of the calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS3","text":"Power equation of several variable magnitudes → replacement of the powers by their next functions of expansion → change in the value of the terms → mere relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS4","text":"Derived relation → construction of a concrete object-relation → independent proof of proportionality → determination of the sought moment of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS5","text":"Finite increment → expansion according to powers → comparison of qualitatively different orders of powers → geometrical limit or tangential proof without infinitesimal entity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS6","text":"Given function of expansion → formal reduction to an original power function → identification of the corresponding objective whole → object-related demonstration through relations or bounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0101","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:FGS7","text":"Differentiation produces the relation, integration reconstructs its original function, and application selects and validates the concrete meaning of both operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF1","text":"Mechanical rule → unjustified omission → lack of self-justification → displacement of the ground into the applications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF2","text":"Applications → power equations → de-potentiation → derived relation → object-side proof of proportionality → differential determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF3","text":"Given derived relation → return to the original power function → identification of the corresponding objective whole → integral determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:AF4","text":"Rejection of infinitesimal ontology → disclosure of the qualitative power relation → unified determination of differential and integral calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME1","text":"Application is reclassified from a subordinate use into the constitutive source of the concept of calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME2","text":"Differentiation is remapped from a calculation with small differences into the de-potentiation of an equation into a relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME3","text":"Integration is remapped from a summation of infinitesimal elements into the recovery of an original function with concrete objective meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME4","text":"The infinitely small is demoted from a mathematical entity to a negative or merely instrumental expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME5","text":"The series is reclassified from the foundation of the calculus into an external means of expansion and representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME6","text":"Continuity becomes legible no longer as abstract uniformity, but as the preservation of a qualitative determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME7","text":"Variable and constant become visible as relational roles rather than as unchanging kinds of mathematical magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME8","text":"The differential quotient is reclassified from a self-sufficient equation into a relation still requiring interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0069","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME9","text":"Physical designations of derived functions become visible as additional object-attributions and not as results of calculation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0078","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ME10","text":"True universality is shifted from the extent of external repetition to the generative law of a relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the determination of the purpose and legitimate application of differential and integral calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0086","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — The calculus operates through the separation of formal generation, objective assignment, and independent proof of proportionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The foundational direction is reversed from abstract theory to application into the direction from concrete problem-solving to subsequent formation of principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Magnitudes count as qualitatively determined relations of power levels; neither the infinitely small nor a timeless moment of motion possesses independent positive reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT1","text":"The fifteen axioms suffice to reconstruct the problem, object, differential operation, integral operation, and negative foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the asserted validity of the principle for the complete range of all applications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that formal generation and concrete assignment of meaning remain strictly separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0070","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the derivation of the mere relation from the change in value arising through the reduction of the powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT5","text":"The reduction of theory to applications produces a tension between claimed conceptual necessity and actually exemplary induction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0109","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT6","text":"The rejection of the increment as a basic concept and its reintroduction as a necessary means of proof remain compatible only through a purpose-dependent functional distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT7","text":"Linear relations are excluded as independent differential objects, but remain indispensable as results and concrete interpreters of de-potentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT8","text":"The reduction of all relevant functions to power relations is asserted, but not fully carried out for exponential, logarithmic, and more complex functional forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT9","text":"Historical examples and polemical dismantlings bear the burden of proof where a complete systematic induction is explicitly absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A2DZ:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text only if the applications are treated as logical ground and not as mere illustrations of the theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A2DZ:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A2DZ@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A2DZ:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 74","title":"Remark 2.The Purpose of Differential Calculus Derived from Its Application.","context":"Chapter 74","original_title":"Anmerkung 2.Der Zweck des Differentialkalkuls aus seiner Anwendung abgeleitet."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.Der Zweck des Differentialkalkuls aus seiner Anwendung abgeleitet.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 3. Other Forms Connected with Qualitative Determinacy of Magnitude.","order":75,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A3NA"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A3NA@R001","sha256":"cc3e8ea7e82e0135925fe7ee946ecc74774fea720634301a8606d07702d58c41","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS1","text":"Der mathematische Gebrauch des Unendlichkleinen verdeckt die affirmative qualitative Größenbestimmtheit, die seine Operationen ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS2","text":"Formal homogene Zahl- und Potenzenverhältnisse treten in geometrischer Anwendung als qualitative Unterschiede der Dimension und Figuration hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS3","text":"Die arithmetische Auflösung des Kontinuierlichen in diskrete Elemente erzeugt den Schein, eine Summe niedererdimensionaler Elemente müsse eine höherdimensionale Größe hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS4","text":"Das Unendlichkleine kompensiert diesen Dimensionsbruch, indem es dem Element die Qualität des Produkts zuschreibt und sie ihm als bestimmtem Quantum zugleich abspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS5","text":"Die angeblich bloße Summation enthält bereits eine geometrisch interpretierte Multiplikation, die den qualitativen Dimensionsübergang vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS6","text":"Die Gültigkeit diskreter Verfahren beruht nicht auf einer Zusammensetzung des Kontinuierlichen, sondern auf der vollständigen Erfassung seiner maßgebenden Größenbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS7","text":"Das diagnostisch-rekonstruktive Argument bewegt sich von analytischer Homogenisierung über infinitesimale Nothilfe und Multiplikationsneurahmung zur Unterscheidung affirmativer Bestimmungen von bloß negativer Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","text":"Analytische Potenzenbestimmungen sind als Zahlengrößen formal homogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","text":"Die geometrische Anwendung formal homogener Größen macht qualitative Unterschiede der Dimension und Figuration wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","text":"Die arithmetische Bestimmung eines Kontinuierlichen setzt dessen diskrete Fassung in bestimmende Elemente voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","text":"Eine äußerliche Summe niedererdimensionaler diskreter Einheiten erzeugt als solche kein höherdimensionales Kontinuierliches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","text":"Das Unendlichkleine ist eine negative Nothilfe, die ein Element höherdimensional qualifiziert und zugleich als vollständiges Quantum negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","text":"Eine als Summation erscheinende Bestimmung des Kontinuierlichen kann ihrem operativen Gehalt nach Multiplikation sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","text":"Arithmetische Multiplikation verändert unter rein numerischer Betrachtung nur die Größe homogener Zahlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","text":"Geometrisch typisierte Multiplikation verändert mit der Größe zugleich die räumliche Dimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmtheit eines geometrischen Produkts liegt in Faktoren oder Elementen von niedrigerer Dimension beziehungsweise Potenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","text":"Die sogenannte unendliche Anzahl der Elemente wird operativ durch die begrenzte kontinuierliche Größe ihrer Erstreckung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A11","text":"Bei einer Proportion bleibt ein gemeinsamer geometrischer Faktor für das Verhältnis unbestimmend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","text":"Untheilbare bestimmen die Größe eines Kontinuierlichen, ohne dessen kontinuierliche Existenz als Bestandteile zusammenzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","text":"Die Vergleichbarkeit von Untheilbaren verlangt eine identische maßgebende Abstands-, Lage- oder Erzeugungsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A14","text":"Die maßgebende Größenbestimmtheit einer Figur kann von ihrer anschaulichen äußeren Grenze verschieden sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A15","text":"In einer unendlichen Reihe kann das Gesetz der Fortbestimmung bekannt sein, obwohl wegen qualitativer Inkommensurabilität kein endlicher arithmetischer Ausdruck verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A16","text":"Quantitative Relationen zwischen qualitativ verschiedenen Größen bleiben ohne ausdrückliche qualitative Typisierung unbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX1","text":"Die qualitative Bedeutung geometrischer Größen ist nicht in ihrer bloßen numerischen Form enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX2","text":"Das Kontinuierliche ist nicht ontologisch aus Punkten, Linien oder Ebenen zusammengesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX3","text":"Eine Summe von Punkten ist keine Linie, und eine Summe von Linien ist keine Fläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX4","text":"Ein unendlich dünnes Element ist kein widerspruchsfrei bestimmtes Mittelding zwischen zwei Dimensionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX5","text":"Die unendliche Anzahl der Elemente ist keine bekannte oder operativ benötigte Kardinalzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX6","text":"Die zeitliche Bewegung eines Punktes ist nicht der begriffliche Grund des Übergangs vom Punkt zur Linie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX7","text":"Die Bestimmung eines Flächenverhältnisses erfordert keine Umdeutung der verglichenen Linien in infinitesimale Trapeze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX8","text":"Cavalieris Verfahren verpflichtet nicht auf die Zusammensetzung des Kontinuierlichen aus Untheilbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX9","text":"Die sichtbar längere oder schiefere Seite einer Figur ist nicht notwendig deren bestimmendes Größenmoment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX10","text":"Das Decken von Figuren ist nicht die begrifflich erschöpfende Grundlage ihrer Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX11","text":"Formal richtige Quotienten sind ohne qualitative Unterscheidung ihrer Glieder nicht hinreichend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX12","text":"Unendlichkeit ist kein einheitliches positives Prinzip für Reihe, Kontinuum, Diskretion und Infinitesimales.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D1","text":"Die diskrete Zerlegung ist ein Verfahren der Größenbestimmung und keine Aussage über die Seinsweise des Kontinuierlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D2","text":"Das Unendlichkleine entsteht dort, wo eine äußerliche Summation den von ihr selbst nicht leistbaren Dimensionsübergang tragen soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D3","text":"Der Nachweis der in der Summation enthaltenen Multiplikation beseitigt die Funktion des Infinitesimalen als Dimensionsbrücke.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D4","text":"Was als Anzahl unendlich vieler Elemente bezeichnet wird, ist tatsächlich die kontinuierliche Maßgröße eines niedrigerdimensionalen Faktors.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D5","text":"Die Flächenbestimmung des Trapezes ist nicht die Aggregation unendlich vieler Linien, sondern das Produkt aus linear bestimmter Progressionsgröße und Höhe.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D6","text":"Bei proportionalen Flächen kann der gemeinsame zweite Dimensionsfaktor entfallen, sodass das Verhältnis allein durch das variierende lineare Moment bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A11","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D7","text":"Cavalieris Methode ist gültig, sofern korrespondierende Schnitte dieselbe maßgebende Bestimmung besitzen; ihre Gültigkeit hängt nicht von einer unendlichen Elementanzahl ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D8","text":"Das Decken von Figuren stellt die bereits vollständige Bestimmtheit sinnlich dar, lässt aber den Unterschied zwischen bestimmenden Momenten und kontinuierlicher Gesamtexistenz unreflektiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D9","text":"Fehler diskreter Flächenbestimmung entstehen durch die Wahl einer anschaulichen Grenze anstelle des tatsächlich erzeugenden oder messenden Moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D10","text":"Rein quantitative Quotienten können zu inhaltsleeren Verhältnissen zusammenschrumpfen, wenn ihre Glieder nicht als Größen verschiedener qualitativer Funktion auseinandergehalten werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D11","text":"In der unendlichen Reihe bezeichnet Unendlichkeit die fehlende endliche Darstellung eines gesetzlich bestimmten inkommensurablen Verhältnisses, nicht eine positive unendliche Größe.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D12","text":"Bei der diskreten Fassung des Kontinuierlichen bezeichnet Unendlichkeit den Verlust eines Quantums gemäß kontinuierlicher Bestimmtheit, nicht die wirkliche Totalität diskreter Bestandteile.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D13","text":"Die Schwierigkeit des Dimensionsübergangs wird nicht durch Unendlichkeit, sondern durch die affirmative Bestimmung der geometrischen Operation gelöst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD1","text":"Das Infinitesimale ist kein positiver mathematischer Gegenstand, sondern der Index einer noch nicht explizierten qualitativen Operationsbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD2","text":"Diskretion und Kontinuität widersprechen einander nicht, sofern die diskrete Größenbestimmung von der kontinuierlichen Existenz des Gegenstands getrennt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD3","text":"Dieselbe arithmetische Operation kann formal homogen oder qualitativ dimensionsbildend sein, weil ihr geometrischer Gehalt von der Typisierung ihrer Operanden abhängt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD4","text":"Die Beweiskraft eines diskreten geometrischen Verfahrens liegt in der Invarianz des bestimmenden Moments, nicht in der anschaulichen Plausibilität einer Zerlegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD5","text":"Unendlichkeit fungiert entweder als legitimer Index fehlender endlicher Darstellung oder als illegitimer Ersatz für einen nicht explizierten qualitativen Übergang.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD6","text":"Mathematische Bestimmtheit verlangt weder die vollständige Aufzählung der Elemente noch notwendig einen abgeschlossenen arithmetischen Ausdruck.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX1","text":"Ein positiv bestimmtes infinitesimales Objekt, das zugleich niederer und höherer Dimension angehört, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX2","text":"Kontinuität kann nicht durch kardinale Akkumulation diskreter Einheiten erzeugt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX3","text":"Eine semantisch untypisierte Arithmetik kann geometrische Qualitätsunterschiede nicht aus eigener Kraft bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX4","text":"Keine Zerlegungs- oder Schnittmethode ist unabhängig von der Wahl des maßgebenden Bestimmungsmoments gültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX5","text":"Die anschauliche Gesamtheit einer Figur ist nicht mit ihrer mathematisch wirksamen Größenbestimmtheit identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX6","text":"Zeitliche Bewegung ist keine notwendige ontologische Grundlage räumlicher Dimensionsbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX7","text":"Exakte Gesetzeserkenntnis setzt keine endliche geschlossene Darstellung ihres Gegenstands voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX1","text":"Die Genese des Kontinuierlichen aus seinen analytischen Elementen bleibt prinzipiell versperrt; erzeugt wird nur seine Größenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX2","text":"Die Totalität einer unendlichen Elementmenge ist weder verfügbar noch für das Verfahren zulässig erforderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX3","text":"Ein dimensionsneutraler Übergang zwischen qualitativ verschiedenen Größen ist ausgeschlossen; jede Vermittlung verlangt funktionale oder geometrische Typisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX4","text":"Für inkommensurable Größen ist die endliche arithmetische Schließung nicht verfügbar, obwohl ihre Fortbestimmung gesetzlich festliegen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX5","text":"Die zentrale unmögliche Figur ist ein Element, das als bestimmtes Quantum seine niedrigere Dimension behält und dennoch unmittelbar die Qualität des höherdimensionalen Produkts besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS1","text":"Qualitativ bestimmte Potenz oder Dimension → formale Zahlgröße → analytische Homogenität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS2","text":"Analytische Homogenität + geometrische Anwendung → Wiederkehr der qualitativen Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS3","text":"Kontinuierlicher Gegenstand → diskrete Elemente → arithmetische Fortbestimmbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS4","text":"Äußerliche Summe niedererdimensionaler Elemente ≠ höherdimensionale kontinuierliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS5","text":"Dimensionsdefizit der Summe + gefordertes kontinuierliches Resultat → infinitesimale Doppelsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS6","text":"Kritik der infinitesimalen Doppelsetzung → Suche nach einer bereits im analytischen Verfahren enthaltenen qualitativen Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS7","text":"Scheinbare Summation → geometrisch typisierte Multiplikation → Dimensionsübergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS8","text":"Zahl × Zahl → homogene Zahl; Linie × Linie → Fläche; räumliches Außersichkommen der Fläche → dreidimensionaler Raum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS9","text":"Unendliche Elementanzahl → begrenzte Erstreckungsgröße → operativer Faktor des Produkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS10","text":"Gemeinsamer Dimensionsfaktor → Neutralisierung im Verhältnis → Bestimmung durch das verbleibende variable Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS11","text":"Familie von Untheilbaren + identische Transitusbestimmung → Größenvergleich des Kontinuierlichen ohne Zusammensetzungsthese.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS12","text":"Äußere Grenze ≠ notwendige Größenbestimmtheit → Auswahl von Höhe, Abstand oder erzeugender Linie als maßgebendem Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS13","text":"Fehlender endlicher Ausdruck → legitime Reihenunendlichkeit; verdeckter Dimensionsübergang → illegitime infinitesimale Nothilfe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS14","text":"Explikation der affirmativen qualitativen Bestimmung → Entbehrlichkeit der negativen Kategorie des Unendlichkleinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AF1","text":"Schwächere qualitative Form des Unendlichkleinen → analytische Homogenität und geometrische Differenz → diskrete Auflösung des Kontinuierlichen → Dimensionsdefizit der Summation → infinitesimale Nothilfe → Multiplikation als verborgener Qualitätsübergang → Prüfung an Produkt und Proportion → Rechtfertigung Cavalieris → Trennung von Bestimmtheit und äußerer Existenz → Differenzierung der Unendlichkeitsformen → affirmative Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME1","text":"Das Unendlichkleine wird vom positiven Grenzobjekt zum negativen Platzhalter einer verdeckten qualitativen Operation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME2","text":"Summation wird von äußerlicher Aggregation zu einer analytischen Erscheinungsform geometrischer Multiplikation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME3","text":"Das Untheilbare wird vom ontologischen Bestandteil zum Träger der quantitativen Bestimmtheit des Kontinuierlichen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Diskretion und Kontinuität wird in die Ebenendifferenz zwischen arithmetischer Bestimmung und kontinuierlicher Existenz überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME5","text":"Die unendliche Anzahl von Elementen wird durch die begrenzte Maßgröße ihrer Erstreckung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME6","text":"Die geometrische Grenze wird in äußere Begrenzung und operativ maßgebendes Bestimmungsmoment aufgespalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME7","text":"Unendlichkeit wird in fehlende endliche Darstellung, qualitative Inkommensurabilität und verdeckende infinitesimale Nothilfe differenziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME8","text":"Arithmetische Ausdrücke werden als typisierungsabhängige Träger geometrischer oder funktionaler Qualität lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Unendlichkleine erscheint als Faktor gegenüber dem Produkt beziehungsweise als Punkt gegenüber Linie und Linie gegenüber Fläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Größenbestimmung des Kontinuierlichen wird durch diskrete Elemente, geometrisch typisierte Multiplikation und die Wahl eines invarianten Bestimmungsmoments erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Frage nach der Zusammensetzung des Kontinuierlichen wird durch die Frage ersetzt, welche Elemente seine quantitative Bestimmtheit vollständig erfassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Kontinuierliche wird vorausgesetzt und nicht aus Untheilbaren erzeugt; der Dimensionsübergang ist begriffliches Außersichkommen und keine zeitliche Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Ein Fortbestimmungsgesetz kann exakt bekannt sein, obwohl weder eine unendliche Elementzahl noch ein endlicher arithmetischer Abschluss verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Diagnose des Infinitesimalen, die Multiplikationsneurahmung und die Rechtfertigung diskreter Vergleichsverfahren zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von analytischer Homogenisierung über Dimensionsbruch und Nothilfe zur affirmativen qualitativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie jede beliebige krummlinige oder variable Summation formal in die behauptete geometrische Multiplikationsstruktur überführt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz ist am stärksten in der Trennung von Größenbestimmtheit und äußerer Existenz sowie von begrenztem Maß und unendlicher Elementanzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT5","text":"Eine Bruchlinie besteht zwischen der Aussage, das Kontinuierliche werde im Produkt diskret an ihm selbst gesetzt, und der Zurückweisung seiner Zusammensetzung aus diskreten Elementen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Homogenität arithmetischer Multiplikation und ihrer qualitativen geometrischen Produktivität; die Verbindung tritt als zusätzliche Anwendungsannahme ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT7","text":"Die Umdeutung der Anzahl von Elementen in eine kontinuierliche Höhe oder Erstreckung ist operativ wirksam, aber nicht als eigenständige Maßtheorie formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT8","text":"Die Begrenzung geometrischer Produktion auf drei Dimensionen setzt eine Raumontologie voraus, die aus der arithmetischen Multiplikationsstruktur nicht folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT9","text":"Die abschließende Auflösung hängt von der Bündelung verschiedener Verwendungen der Unendlichkeit als negative Kategorie ab, obwohl Reihe, Inkommensurabilität und Infinitesimales unterschiedliche Funktionen behalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110751916811Z_410f9f9b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 3. Still other forms connected with qualitative quantitative determinacy.","source_sha256":"cc3e8ea7e82e0135925fe7ee946ecc74774fea720634301a8606d07702d58c41","sha256":"587e34346b4ffad97982a7e9562e35972e055c0895b52381f176299ae3a852ba","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:07:51.917942+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS1","text":"The mathematical use of the infinitesimal conceals the affirmative qualitative quantitative determinacy that makes its operations possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS2","text":"Formally homogeneous relations of numbers and powers emerge in geometrical application as qualitative differences of dimension and figuration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS3","text":"The arithmetical resolution of the continuous into discrete elements produces the appearance that a sum of lower-dimensional elements must bring forth a higher-dimensional magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS4","text":"The infinitesimal compensates for this break in dimension by ascribing to the element the quality of the product and at the same time denying it this quality as a determinate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS5","text":"The allegedly mere summation already contains a geometrically interpreted multiplication that accomplishes the qualitative transition of dimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS6","text":"The validity of discrete procedures rests not on a composition of the continuous, but on the complete apprehension of its decisive quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AS7","text":"The diagnostic-reconstructive argument moves from analytical homogenization through infinitesimal makeshift aid and reframing of multiplication to the distinction between affirmative determinations and merely negative infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","text":"Analytical determinations of powers are formally homogeneous as numerical magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","text":"The geometrical application of formally homogeneous magnitudes renders effective qualitative differences of dimension and figuration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","text":"The arithmetical determination of a continuous presupposes its discrete apprehension in determining elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","text":"An external sum of lower-dimensional discrete units does not, as such, produce a higher-dimensional continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","text":"The infinitesimal is a negative makeshift aid that qualifies an element in a higher-dimensional manner while at the same time negating it as a complete quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","text":"A determination of the continuous appearing as summation can, in terms of its operative content, be multiplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","text":"Under purely numerical consideration, arithmetical multiplication alters only the magnitude of homogeneous numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","text":"Geometrically typed multiplication alters spatial dimension along with magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","text":"The quantitative determinacy of a geometrical product lies in factors or elements of lower dimension or power, respectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","text":"The so-called infinite number of elements is operatively replaced by the limited continuous magnitude of their extension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A11","text":"In a proportion, a common geometrical factor remains indeterminate for the ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","text":"Indivisibles determine the magnitude of a continuous without composing its continuous existence as constituents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","text":"The comparability of indivisibles requires an identical decisive determination of distance, position, or generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A14","text":"The decisive quantitative determinacy of a figure can differ from its intuitively apprehended outer boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A15","text":"In an infinite series, the law of continuation can be known, although no finite arithmetical expression is available owing to qualitative incommensurability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:A16","text":"Quantitative relations between qualitatively different magnitudes remain indeterminate without explicit qualitative typing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX1","text":"The qualitative significance of geometrical magnitudes is not contained in their mere numerical form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX2","text":"The continuous is not ontologically composed of points, lines, or planes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX3","text":"A sum of points is not a line, and a sum of lines is not a surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX4","text":"An infinitely thin element is not a non-contradictorily determined intermediate entity between two dimensions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX5","text":"The infinite number of elements is not a known or operationally required cardinal number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX6","text":"The temporal motion of a point is not the conceptual ground of the transition from point to line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX7","text":"The determination of a ratio of surfaces requires no reinterpretation of the compared lines as infinitesimal trapezoids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX8","text":"Cavalieri's procedure does not commit one to the composition of the continuous from indivisibles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX9","text":"The visibly longer or more oblique side of a figure is not necessarily its determining moment of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX10","text":"The superposition of figures is not the conceptually exhaustive basis of their equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX11","text":"Formally correct quotients are not sufficiently determined without qualitative differentiation of their terms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:NX12","text":"Infinity is not a unitary positive principle for series, continuum, discreteness, and infinitesimal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D1","text":"Discrete division is a procedure of magnitude determination and not a statement about the mode of being of the continuous.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D2","text":"The infinitesimal arises where an external summation is supposed to bear a transition of dimension that it itself cannot accomplish.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D3","text":"Demonstrating the multiplication contained in summation eliminates the function of the infinitesimal as a bridge of dimensions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D4","text":"What is called the number of infinitely many elements is in fact the continuous measure-magnitude of a lower-dimensional factor.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D5","text":"The determination of the surface of the trapezoid is not the aggregation of infinitely many lines, but the product of a linearly determined magnitude of progression and height.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D6","text":"In proportional surfaces, the common second dimensional factor can drop out, so that the ratio is determined solely by the varying linear moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A11","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D7","text":"Cavalieri's method is valid insofar as corresponding sections possess the same decisive determination; its validity does not depend on an infinite number of elements.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D8","text":"The superposition of figures sensibly presents the already complete determinacy, but leaves unreflected the distinction between determining moments and continuous total existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D9","text":"Errors in discrete determination of surfaces arise from selecting an intuitively apprehended boundary in place of the actually generating or measuring moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D10","text":"Purely quantitative quotients can shrink into contentless ratios if their terms are not distinguished as magnitudes of different qualitative function.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D11","text":"In the infinite series, infinity designates the absence of a finite representation of a lawfully determined incommensurable ratio, not a positive infinite magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D12","text":"In the discrete apprehension of the continuous, infinity designates the loss of a quantum in accordance with continuous determinacy, not the actual totality of discrete constituents.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:D13","text":"The difficulty of the transition of dimension is resolved not by infinity, but by the affirmative determination of the geometrical operation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD1","text":"The infinitesimal is not a positive mathematical object, but the index of a qualitative operational determination not yet made explicit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A6","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD2","text":"Discreteness and continuity do not contradict one another insofar as discrete magnitude determination is separated from the continuous existence of the object.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A3","CH_GB18_A3NA:A4","CH_GB18_A3NA:A9","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD3","text":"The same arithmetical operation can be formally homogeneous or qualitatively dimension-forming, because its geometrical content depends on the typing of its operands.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A1","CH_GB18_A3NA:A2","CH_GB18_A3NA:A7","CH_GB18_A3NA:A8","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD4","text":"The probative force of a discrete geometrical procedure lies in the invariance of the determining moment, not in the intuitive plausibility of a division.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A13","CH_GB18_A3NA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD5","text":"Infinity functions either as a legitimate index of lacking finite representation or as an illegitimate substitute for a qualitative transition not made explicit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A5","CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15","CH_GB18_A3NA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SD6","text":"Mathematical determinacy requires neither the complete enumeration of elements nor necessarily a completed arithmetical expression.","refs":["CH_GB18_A3NA:A10","CH_GB18_A3NA:A12","CH_GB18_A3NA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX1","text":"A positively determined infinitesimal object that belongs simultaneously to lower and higher dimension is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX2","text":"Continuity cannot be produced through the cardinal accumulation of discrete units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX3","text":"A semantically untyped arithmetic cannot preserve geometrical qualitative differences by its own power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX4","text":"No method of division or sectioning is valid independently of the choice of the decisive determining moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX5","text":"The intuitive totality of a figure is not identical with its mathematically effective quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX6","text":"Temporal motion is not a necessary ontological basis of spatial dimension-formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:DNX7","text":"Exact cognition of a law does not presuppose a finite closed representation of its object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX1","text":"The genesis of the continuous from its analytical elements remains in principle barred; only its magnitude determination is produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX2","text":"The totality of an infinite set of elements is neither available nor permissibly required for the procedure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX3","text":"A dimension-neutral transition between qualitatively different magnitudes is excluded; every mediation requires functional or geometrical typing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX4","text":"For incommensurable magnitudes, finite arithmetical closure is not available, although their continuation may be lawfully fixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:SNX5","text":"The central impossible figure is an element that, as a determinate quantum, retains its lower dimension and yet immediately possesses the quality of the higher-dimensional product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS1","text":"Qualitatively determined power or dimension → formal numerical magnitude → analytical homogeneity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS2","text":"Analytical homogeneity + geometrical application → return of qualitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS3","text":"Continuous object → discrete elements → arithmetical determinability of continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS4","text":"External sum of lower-dimensional elements ≠ higher-dimensional continuous magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS5","text":"Dimensional deficit of the sum + required continuous result → infinitesimal double positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS6","text":"Critique of infinitesimal double positing → search for a qualitative operation already contained in the analytical procedure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS7","text":"Apparent summation → geometrically typed multiplication → transition of dimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS8","text":"Number × number → homogeneous number; line × line → surface; spatial coming-outside-itself of the surface → three-dimensional space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS9","text":"Infinite number of elements → limited magnitude of extension → operative factor of the product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS10","text":"Common dimensional factor → neutralization in the ratio → determination by the remaining variable moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS11","text":"Family of indivisibles + identical determination of transition → comparison of magnitudes of the continuous without a composition thesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS12","text":"Outer boundary ≠ necessary quantitative determinacy → selection of height, distance, or generating line as decisive moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS13","text":"Lacking finite expression → legitimate series-infinity; concealed transition of dimension → illegitimate infinitesimal makeshift aid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:FGS14","text":"Explication of affirmative qualitative determination → dispensability of the negative category of the infinitesimal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:AF1","text":"Weaker qualitative form of the infinitesimal → analytical homogeneity and geometrical difference → discrete resolution of the continuous → dimensional deficit of summation → infinitesimal makeshift aid → multiplication as concealed transition of quality → examination in product and proportion → justification of Cavalieri → separation of determinacy and external existence → differentiation of forms of infinity → affirmative resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME1","text":"The infinitesimal is reclassified from a positive limiting object into a negative placeholder for a concealed qualitative operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME2","text":"Summation is remapped from external aggregation into an analytical form of appearance of geometrical multiplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME3","text":"The indivisible is reclassified from ontological constituent into bearer of the quantitative determinacy of the continuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME4","text":"The opposition between discreteness and continuity is transferred into the difference of levels between arithmetical determination and continuous existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME5","text":"The infinite number of elements is replaced by the limited measure-magnitude of their extension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME6","text":"The geometrical boundary is split into external limitation and the operatively decisive determining moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME7","text":"Infinity is differentiated into lacking finite representation, qualitative incommensurability, and concealing infinitesimal makeshift aid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ME8","text":"Arithmetical expressions become legible as type-dependent bearers of geometrical or functional quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT1","text":"Surface — The infinitesimal appears as a factor vis-à-vis the product, or as point vis-à-vis line and line vis-à-vis surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT2","text":"Structural — The magnitude determination of the continuous is produced through discrete elements, geometrically typed multiplication, and the selection of an invariant determining moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The question of the composition of the continuous is replaced by the question of which elements completely apprehend its quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The continuous is presupposed and not produced from indivisibles; the transition of dimension is conceptual coming-outside-itself and not temporal motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — A law of continuation can be exactly known although neither an infinite number of elements nor a finite arithmetical completion is available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the diagnosis of the infinitesimal, the reframing of multiplication, and the justification of discrete comparative procedures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from analytical homogenization through break in dimension and makeshift aid to affirmative qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how every arbitrary curvilinear or variable summation can formally be transferred into the asserted geometrical structure of multiplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT4","text":"Internal coherence is strongest in the separation of quantitative determinacy and external existence, as well as of limited measure and infinite number of elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT5","text":"A fault line exists between the assertion that the continuous is discretely posited in the product in itself and the rejection of its composition from discrete elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT6","text":"A second fault line lies between the homogeneity of arithmetical multiplication and its qualitative geometrical productivity; the connection enters as an additional assumption of application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT7","text":"The reinterpretation of the number of elements as a continuous height or extension is operationally effective, but not formalized as an independent theory of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT8","text":"The limitation of geometrical production to three dimensions presupposes an ontology of space that does not follow from the structure of arithmetical multiplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A3NA:MRT9","text":"The concluding resolution depends on the bundling of different uses of infinity as a negative category, although series, incommensurability, and infinitesimal retain different functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A3NA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A3NA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 75","title":"Remark 3. Other Forms Connected with Qualitative Determinacy of Magnitude.","context":"Chapter 75","original_title":"Anmerkung 3. Noch andere mit der qualitativen Größenbestimmtheit zusammenhängende Formen."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 3. Noch andere mit der qualitativen Größenbestimmtheit zusammenhängende Formen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Direct Relation.","order":76,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DDVL"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DDVL@R001","sha256":"9dfd02aa2671f6993460cb33b320d8461fe843761268875298f8751fb1b84c3d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare quantitative Verhältniß soll die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums als dessen eigene qualitative Bestimmtheit setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS2","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß bestimmt beide Quanta durch eine einzige gemeinsame Grenze, den Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS3","text":"Der Exponent artikuliert sich als Einheit und Anzahl, wodurch jede Seite nur eines der beiden Momente des Quantums darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS4","text":"Die qualitative Bindung der Seiten negiert ihre Selbstständigkeit, obwohl sie weiterhin als selbständige Quanta erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS5","text":"Die Umkehrbarkeit von Einheit und Anzahl entzieht dem Exponenten als Quotienten die Stellung einer bestimmten qualitativen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS6","text":"Die Unzulänglichkeit des direkten Verhältnisses erzwingt die Setzung der Seiten in ihrer Negation und den Übergang zum umgekehrten Verhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","text":"Das Quantum erhält im Verhältniß seine Bestimmtheit nur durch die Beziehung auf ein anderes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß besitzt nur eine gemeinsame Bestimmtheit oder Grenze beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A3","text":"Die gemeinsame Bestimmtheit des direkten Verhältnisses ist der Exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","text":"Der Exponent enthält an sich den Unterschied von Einheit und Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","text":"Einheit und Anzahl erscheinen im Verhältniß als eigene Quanta und als Begrenzungen des Daseyns der Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","text":"Jede Seite des direkten Verhältnisses gilt begrifflich nur als Einheit oder nur als Anzahl und ist daher kein vollständiges Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","text":"Die qualitative Beziehung der Seiten negiert die Selbstständigkeit, die dem Quantum wesentlich zukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","text":"Der Quotient kann je nach Setzung der Seiten den Werth der Anzahl oder den Werth der Einheit haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","text":"Ein Exponent ist nur als qualitative Einheit bestimmt, wenn er die Einheit von Einheit und Anzahl selbst darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A10","text":"Die Setzung der unvollständigen Seiten in ihrer Negation erzeugt ein Verhältniß, dessen Exponent die Bedeutung ihres Produkts hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX1","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß ist keine bloß äußerliche Verbindung zweier bereits bestimmter Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX2","text":"Die Seiten des Verhältnisses sind keine vollständig selbstständigen Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX3","text":"Einheit und Anzahl sind keine fest und intrinsisch einer bestimmten Seite zugeordneten Rollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX4","text":"Der Quotient ist nicht schon dadurch qualitative Einheit, daß er die numerische Beziehung zweier Seiten ausdrückt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX5","text":"Das Qualitative tritt im direkten Verhältniß noch nicht als selbständige Bestimmung hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX6","text":"Die bloße Konstanz des Exponenten begründet keine vollständige qualitative Bestimmtheit des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D1","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß verwandelt die äußere Größenbestimmtheit der Seiten in eine gemeinsame relationale Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","CH_GB18_DDVL:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D2","text":"Die Veränderung einer Seite verändert innerhalb des direkten Verhältnisses nur die als Einheit geltende Größe, während die Anzahl derselben Einheiten konstant bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D3","text":"Die Seiten sind zugleich als Quanta vorhanden und als bloße Funktionsmomente des einen Verhältnisses entwirklicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D4","text":"Weil jede Seite als Einheit oder Anzahl gesetzt werden kann, besitzt der Exponent als Quotient keine bestimmte qualitative Orientierung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D5","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß enthält seinen Übergang, weil sein bestimmendes Prinzip zugleich seine qualitative Unbestimmtheit offenlegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD1","text":"Das quantitative Verhältniß internalisiert die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums, kann diese Internalisierung im direkten Verhältniß jedoch nur als formale Exponentenidentität vollziehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","CH_GB18_DDVL:A3","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD2","text":"Die qualitative Einheit des Verhältnisses ist nicht durch die numerische Konstanz seines Quotienten gesichert, sondern verlangt eine Bestimmung, welche die Rollen der Seiten selbst vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD3","text":"Das umgekehrte Verhältniß erscheint nicht als äußerlich hinzugefügte Rechenform, sondern als immanente Konsequenz der negierten Selbstständigkeit der Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD4","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß ist eine Übergangsform, in der Quantität ihre eigene qualitative Struktur hervorbringt, diese aber noch nicht angemessen bestimmen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Verhältnis, in dem relationale Bestimmtheit und volle Selbstständigkeit der Relata unmittelbar zusammenbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Einheit, die in einem bloßen Quotienten ohne Bestimmung seiner eigenen Momente bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Grenzziehung zwischen Einheit und Anzahl innerhalb der Form des direkten Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Auffassung, daß quantitative Veränderlichkeit die begriffliche Identität eines Verhältnisses unmittelbar zerstört oder unmittelbar erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine unmittelbare Versöhnung von äußerlicher Größenvariation und immanenter qualitativer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein selbstbegründender Exponent, solange seine Bedeutung zwischen Einheit und Anzahl wechseln kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Quantum, das zugleich vollständig für sich und ausschließlich durch sein Anderes bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS1","text":"Quantum mit negativem Jenseits → Äußerlichkeit wird qualitative Beziehung auf ein anderes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS2","text":"Gegenseitige Bestimmung zweier Quanta → eine gemeinsame Grenze → Exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS3","text":"Exponent → Differenz von Einheit und Anzahl → Seiten als funktionale Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS4","text":"Seiten als bloße Einheit beziehungsweise Anzahl → Unvollständigkeit der Quanta → Negation ihrer Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS5","text":"Vertauschbarkeit von Einheit und Anzahl → Quotient verliert bestimmte qualitative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS6","text":"Setzung der Negation der unvollständigen Seiten → Exponent als Produkt → umgekehrtes Verhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AF1","text":"Äußerlichkeit des Quantums → Beziehung auf ein anderes Quantum → gemeinsame Bestimmtheit → Exponent → Einheit und Anzahl → Unvollständigkeit der Seiten → Negation ihrer Selbstständigkeit → Indifferenz der Rollenverteilung → Unzulänglichkeit des Quotienten → umgekehrtes Verhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AF2","text":"Quantitative Konstanz des Exponenten → Anspruch qualitativer Einheit → Umkehrbarkeit der Seiten → Entzug dieser Einheit → produktive Neusetzen des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME1","text":"Das Verhältnis wird von einer äußerlichen Vergleichsoperation zu einer Form umklassifiziert, in der die Relata ihre Bestimmtheit erst durch ihre Beziehung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME2","text":"Einheit und Anzahl werden von bloßen Rechenelementen zu qualitativen Rollen innerhalb der Existenzweise des Quantums umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME3","text":"Der Exponent wird von einem neutralen Quotienten zu einer problematischen Instanz verschoben, deren Anspruch auf qualitative Einheit geprüft werden muß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME4","text":"Der Übergang vom direkten zum umgekehrten Verhältniß wird als immanente Folge einer Funktionsumkehr und nicht als äußerlicher Wechsel des Gegenstands sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das direkte Verhältniß bestimmt zwei Quanta durch einen Exponenten, der als Einheit und Anzahl ausgelegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Relata verlieren im Verhältnis ihre volle quantitative Selbstständigkeit, weil jedes nur noch ein Moment der gemeinsamen Bestimmung verkörpert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die unmittelbare Akzeptanz einer Rechenrelation durch eine immanente Prüfung, ob ihre bestimmende Form ihren eigenen Begriff erfüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Quantum findet seine Bestimmtheit in seinem Jenseits; seine Identität ist daher nicht vor der Beziehung vorhanden, sondern wird durch die Beziehung vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Konstruktion des direkten Verhältnisses als gemeinsamer Exponentenbestimmung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Unvollständigkeit der Seiten und die Negation ihrer Selbstständigkeit als interne Konsequenz zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT3","text":"Der entscheidende Übergang bleibt davon abhängig, daß die Umkehrbarkeit von Einheit und Anzahl als Mangel qualitativer Bestimmtheit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit als notwendige Eigenschaft des Quantums und ihre Negation als Übergangsmotor festgehalten wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt zwischen dem Anspruch des Exponenten auf qualitative Einheit und seiner tatsächlichen Gestalt als wechselnder Quotient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT6","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die vollständige Vermittlung, durch welche der Exponent im umgekehrten Verhältniß die Bedeutung des Produkts annimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung nur, wenn das direkte Verhältniß als notwendige, aber unzureichende Gestalt der quantitativen Qualität behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115153263944Z_8ca800ef","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The direct ratio.","source_sha256":"9dfd02aa2671f6993460cb33b320d8461fe843761268875298f8751fb1b84c3d","sha256":"01589f78ad76e891a58d07797ac00cf2709ee43dd3e1a63ab2ea56ed2850cf67","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:51:53.265777+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS1","text":"The immediate quantitative ratio is to posit the externality of quantum as its own qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS2","text":"The direct ratio determines both quanta through a single common limit, the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS3","text":"The exponent articulates itself as unit and number, whereby each side represents only one of the two moments of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS4","text":"The qualitative binding of the sides negates their self-subsistence, although they continue to appear as self-subsistent quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS5","text":"The reversibility of unit and number deprives the exponent as quotient of the status of a determinate qualitative unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AS6","text":"The inadequacy of the direct ratio compels the positing of the sides in their negation and the transition to the inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","text":"In ratio, quantum receives its determinacy only through relation to another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","text":"The direct ratio possesses only one common determinacy or limit of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A3","text":"The common determinacy of the direct ratio is the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","text":"The exponent contains within itself the difference of unit and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","text":"Unit and number appear in ratio as distinct quanta and as limitations of the existence of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","text":"Conceptually, each side of the direct ratio counts only as unit or only as number and is therefore not a complete quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","text":"The qualitative relation of the sides negates the self-subsistence that essentially belongs to quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","text":"Depending on the positing of the sides, the quotient can have the value of the number or the value of the unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","text":"An exponent is determined as a qualitative unit only when it itself represents the unity of unit and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:A10","text":"The positing of the incomplete sides in their negation produces a ratio whose exponent has the significance of their product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX1","text":"The direct ratio is not a merely external connection of two already determinate quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX2","text":"The sides of the ratio are not completely self-subsistent quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX3","text":"Unit and number are not roles fixedly and intrinsically assigned to a determinate side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX4","text":"The quotient is not thereby already a qualitative unit because it expresses the numerical relation of two sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX5","text":"In the direct ratio, the qualitative does not yet emerge as a self-subsistent determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:NX6","text":"The mere constancy of the exponent does not ground a complete qualitative determinacy of the ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D1","text":"The direct ratio transforms the external magnitude-determinacy of the sides into a common relational determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","CH_GB18_DDVL:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D2","text":"Within the direct ratio, the alteration of one side alters only the magnitude that counts as unit, while the number of those same units remains constant.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D3","text":"The sides are present at once as quanta and de-actualized as mere functional moments of the one ratio.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A5","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D4","text":"Because each side can be posited as unit or number, the exponent as quotient possesses no determinate qualitative orientation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:D5","text":"The direct ratio contains its transition because its determining principle simultaneously discloses its qualitative indeterminacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD1","text":"The quantitative ratio internalizes the externality of quantum, but in the direct ratio can accomplish this internalization only as a formal identity of the exponent.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A2","CH_GB18_DDVL:A3","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD2","text":"The qualitative unity of the ratio is not secured by the numerical constancy of its quotient, but requires a determinacy that mediates the roles of the sides themselves.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A4","CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A8","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD3","text":"The inverse ratio appears not as an externally added computational form, but as an immanent consequence of the negated self-subsistence of the sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A6","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SD4","text":"The direct ratio is a transitional form in which quantity brings forth its own qualitative structure, but cannot yet determine it adequately.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDVL:A1","CH_GB18_DDVL:A7","CH_GB18_DDVL:A9","CH_GB18_DDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a ratio in which relational determinacy and the full self-subsistence of the relata coexist immediately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a qualitative unity that could consist in a mere quotient without determination of its own moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a final demarcation between unit and number within the form of the direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the view that quantitative variability immediately destroys or immediately explains the conceptual identity of a ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an immediate reconciliation of external variation of magnitude and immanent qualitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a self-grounding exponent so long as its significance can alternate between unit and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a quantum that would be at once completely for itself and determined exclusively through its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS1","text":"Quantum with negative beyond → externality becomes qualitative relation to another quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS2","text":"Reciprocal determination of two quanta → one common limit → exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS3","text":"Exponent → difference of unit and number → sides as functional moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS4","text":"Sides as mere unit or number respectively → incompleteness of the quanta → negation of their self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS5","text":"Interchangeability of unit and number → quotient loses determinate qualitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:FGS6","text":"Positing the negation of the incomplete sides → exponent as product → inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AF1","text":"Externality of quantum → relation to another quantum → common determinacy → exponent → unit and number → incompleteness of the sides → negation of their self-subsistence → indifference of the distribution of roles → inadequacy of the quotient → inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:AF2","text":"Quantitative constancy of the exponent → claim to qualitative unity → reversibility of the sides → withdrawal of this unity → productive re-positing of the ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME1","text":"The ratio is reclassified from an external operation of comparison into a form in which the relata possess their determinacy only through their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME2","text":"Unit and number are reclassified from mere computational elements into qualitative roles within the mode of existence of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME3","text":"The exponent is shifted from a neutral quotient into a problematic instance whose claim to qualitative unity must be examined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ME4","text":"The transition from the direct to the inverse ratio becomes visible as an immanent consequence of a reversal of function and not as an external change of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT1","text":"Surface — The direct ratio determines two quanta through an exponent that is construed as unit and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT2","text":"Structural — In ratio, the relata lose their full quantitative self-subsistence because each embodies only a moment of the common determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the immediate acceptance of a computational relation with an immanent examination of whether its determining form fulfills its own concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantum finds its determinacy in its beyond; its identity is therefore not present prior to relation, but is mediated through relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the construction of the direct ratio as a common exponent-determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to generate the incompleteness of the sides and the negation of their self-subsistence as an internal consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT3","text":"The decisive transition remains dependent on the reversibility of unit and number counting as a deficiency of qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent provided that self-subsistence is maintained as a necessary property of quantum and its negation as the motor of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT5","text":"The strongest line of rupture lies between the exponent's claim to qualitative unity and its actual shape as an alternating quotient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT6","text":"What remains underdetermined is the complete mediation through which the exponent in the inverse ratio assumes the significance of the product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDVL:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement only if the direct ratio is treated as a necessary but inadequate shape of quantitative quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDVL:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DDVL@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DDVL:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 76","title":"A. The Direct Relation.","context":"Chapter 76","original_title":"A. Das direkte Verhältniß."},"original_title":"A. Das direkte Verhältniß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV","layer":"CH","title":"B. The Inverse Ratio.","order":77,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDUV"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDUV@R001","sha256":"7862229cf410f9aa31f7602d8e25da99840b5997cf5535d26730748196eea73c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt das Problem als Übergang vom unmittelbaren direkten Verhältnis zu einem Verhältnis, dessen Bestimmtheit nicht mehr in einer fixen Anzahl, sondern in der negativen Funktion des Exponenten liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS2","text":"Das umgekehrte Verhältnis entsteht, sobald die Veränderung einer Seite notwendig die Gegenveränderung der anderen erzeugt und die Veränderung damit im Verhältnis selbst liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS3","text":"Der Exponent wird vom gleichgültigen Quantum zur qualitativen Grenze, welche die beiden Quanta bestimmt, begrenzt und vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS4","text":"Die Seiten erhalten ihren Wert nicht aus einer selbständigen Größe, sondern aus dem Mangel, der Grenze und dem Wert der jeweils anderen Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS5","text":"Die Annäherung der Seiten an den Exponenten erzeugt zunächst den Schein eines unendlichen Jenseits, der als schlechte Unendlichkeit aufgehoben wird, weil dieses Jenseits im Exponenten gegenwärtig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS6","text":"Die negative Vermittlung der veränderlichen Quanta mit dem sich erhaltenden Exponenten bestimmt das umgekehrte Verhältnis als Übergang zum Potenzenverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","text":"Ein Verhältnis ist bestimmt, wenn sein Exponent als Produkt die Einheit von Einheit und Anzahl bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","text":"Im umgekehrten Verhältnis bleibt keine Seite eine fixe Anzahl von Einheiten der anderen Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","text":"Der Exponent ist als Quantum zunächst unmittelbar und beliebig als fest gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","text":"Der Exponent wird im umgekehrten Verhältnis als negatives, qualitatives Bestimmen und als Grenze der Seiten gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","text":"Jede Seite ist nur das Quantum, das die andere Seite nicht ist, und erhält ihren Wert daher durch deren Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","text":"Die gegenseitige Negation der Seiten ist zugleich ihre Kontinuität und ihre Einheit im Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","text":"Der Exponent ist das Ansichsein jeder Seite, die Grenze ihres gegenseitigen Begrenzens und die negative Einheit ihrer Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","text":"Eine Seite verliert ihre Bestimmung als Verhältnisglied, wenn sie sich ihrem Ansichsein gleichmacht, weil dann die andere Seite und schließlich sie selbst verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","text":"Die Annäherung der Seiten an den Exponenten ist als unendlicher Progress endlich und deshalb nur schlechte Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A10","text":"Das Jenseits des Exponenten ist zugleich als gegenwärtiges affirmatives Quantum vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","text":"Die Seiten besitzen keine andere immanente feste Grenze als den Exponenten, der sich in der Negation ihres gleichgültigen Bestehens erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A12","text":"Die im Außersichsein der Quanta realisierte Selbstvermittlung des Exponenten bestimmt das Verhältnis zum Potenzenverhältnis fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX1","text":"Das umgekehrte Verhältnis ist nicht das direkte Verhältnis zweier Seiten, die sich in gleichem Maß und äußerlich verändern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX2","text":"Der Exponent ist nicht bloß eine gleichgültige Anzahl oder ein festes Quantum ohne qualitative Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX3","text":"Keine Seite ist ein selbständig bestimmtes Quantum mit eigenem, vom anderen Glied unabhängigen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX4","text":"Der Exponent ist nicht als unerreichbares Jenseits von den endlichen Seiten getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX5","text":"Der unendliche Progress ist nicht die Wahrheit des Verhältnisses, sondern dessen endliche Erscheinungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX6","text":"Die Gleichsetzung einer Seite mit dem Ganzen ist nicht die Vollendung des Verhältnisses, sondern seine Selbstaufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D1","text":"Die quantitative Veränderung wird im umgekehrten Verhältnis zu einer immanenten Veränderung der Verhältnisbestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D2","text":"Die Vergrößerung einer Seite ist notwendig die Verkleinerung der anderen, weil jede nur durch die Grenze der anderen bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D3","text":"Die Seiten sind quantitativ unterschieden, aber nicht ontologisch selbständig, weil ihre Bestimmtheit im selben Exponenten zusammengehalten wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D4","text":"Die Grenze ist nicht äußerliche Schranke der Seiten, sondern die negative Form, in der ihr gemeinsames Ansichsein wirksam ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D5","text":"Die schlechte Unendlichkeit entsteht, weil die Seiten den Exponenten als Grenze voraussetzen, ihm aber als bloße Verhältnisglieder nicht gleich werden können.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","CH_GB18_BDUV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D6","text":"Die schlechte Unendlichkeit wird aufgehoben, weil das scheinbar äußere Jenseits bereits als affirmative Einheit und gegenwärtiger Exponent existiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D7","text":"Die Negation jedes besonderen Werts setzt den Exponenten als das sich durch die Veränderung hindurch Erhaltende frei.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD1","text":"Das Verhältnis transformiert Quantität in Qualität, indem quantitative Veränderlichkeit nur als Darstellung einer qualitativen Grenze gilt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD2","text":"Das Ganze ist nicht die Addition seiner Seiten, sondern die negative Einheit, durch welche jede Seite nur als Mangel an der anderen existiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD3","text":"Die Wahrheit der unendlichen Bewegung liegt nicht in einer endlosen Annäherung, sondern in der Gegenwart des als Jenseits erscheinenden Ganzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD4","text":"Die Selbstvermittlung des Exponenten verlangt eine Verhältnisform, in der das sich erhaltende Ganze nicht neben seinen Momenten steht, sondern in ihrer Selbstnegation realisiert ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, ein Quantum könne seine Bestimmtheit unabhängig von einem Verhältnis zu einem anderen Quantum besitzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, qualitative Bestimmtheit sei einer quantitativen Bewegung äußerlich hinzugefügt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, Unendlichkeit bestehe in einem von der endlichen Wirklichkeit abgetrennten Jenseits.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, die vollständige Realisierung einer Seite könne das Verhältnis vollenden, ohne dessen Bedingungen zu zerstören.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absolut selbstidentisches Verhältnisglied, das zugleich ohne Verlust seiner Selbständigkeit Verhältnisglied bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine endgültige quantitative Grenze, die nicht selbst als Ausdruck der negativen Einheit des Exponenten vermittelt wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Unendlichkeit, die weder endliche Erscheinung noch gegenwärtige affirmative Einheit wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS1","text":"Direkte Gleichgültigkeit des Exponenten gegenüber Einheit und Anzahl → Aufhebung der fixen Anzahl durch wechselseitige Veränderung der Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS2","text":"Wechselseitige Veränderung → Exponent als negative qualitative Grenze statt als bloßes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS3","text":"Negative Grenze → Jede Seite erhält ihren Wert als Negation, Mangel und Maß der anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS4","text":"Gegenseitige Negation → Kontinuität der Seiten im Exponenten als ihrem gemeinsamen Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS5","text":"Annäherung an den Exponenten → schlechte Unendlichkeit → Enthüllung des Jenseits als gegenwärtiger affirmativer Exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS6","text":"Gegenwärtiger Exponent in der Negation äußerlicher Quanta → Selbstvermittlung des Ganzen → Potenzenverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AF1","text":"Direkte Proportion als äußere quantitative Gleichgültigkeit → variable Gegensätzlichkeit der Seiten → Exponent als qualitative Grenze → wechselseitige Negation und gemeinsame Einheit → schlechte Unendlichkeit der Annäherung → affirmative Gegenwart des Jenseits → Selbstvermittlung des Exponenten → Potenzenverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AF2","text":"Fixe Anzahl → Verlust fixer Seitenwerte → relationaler Wert → Negation der Selbständigkeit → Erhaltung des Ganzen in der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME1","text":"Quantitative Veränderung wird von einem äußerlichen Geschehen zu einer Form der immanenten Selbstbestimmung des Verhältnisses umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME2","text":"Der Exponent wird von einem rechnerischen Verhältniswert zu einer Grenze, Einheit, Negation und affirmativen Unendlichkeit umkartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME3","text":"Die beiden Seiten erscheinen nicht mehr als vorgegebene Größen, sondern als wechselseitig erzeugte und wechselseitig begrenzte Verhältnisfunktionen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME4","text":"Das Gegensatzpaar von endlichem Diesseits und unendlichem Jenseits bricht zusammen, weil das Jenseits als immanente affirmative Einheit des Diesseits bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME5","text":"Der Übergang zum Potenzenverhältnis wird als Konsequenz einer im Außersichsein realisierten Selbstbeziehung des Exponenten sichtbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das explizite Objekt ist das umgekehrte Verhältnis zweier Quanta, deren Größen entgegengesetzt variieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Seiten werden durch den Exponenten als gemeinsame Grenze, negative Einheit und Maß ihres gegenseitigen Begrenzens organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Erklärung von festen Größen auf die Rekonstruktion der Vermittlung, durch die Größen überhaupt nur Verhältnisgeltung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Endlichkeit ist die selbstaufhebende Erscheinung eines Ganzen, das als affirmative Unendlichkeit gegenwärtig bleibt und sich in seiner eigenen Äußerlichkeit vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom direkten Verhältnis über die negative Bestimmung des Exponenten bis zum Potenzenverhältnis zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Bestimmung des Potenzenverhältnisses, weil es als Resultat gesetzt, aber innerhalb dieser Einheit nicht weiter entfaltet wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT3","text":"Die stärkste interne Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung der wechselseitigen Größenveränderung aus der negativen Einheit der Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT4","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung besteht darin, dass der Exponent zunächst als beliebig festgesetztes unmittelbares Quantum erscheint, später jedoch als immanente notwendige Grenze fungiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass der Exponent zugleich endliches Quantum und affirmative Unendlichkeit sein soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT6","text":"Der Text löst die Spannung zwischen Verhältnisglied und Ganzem negativ, weil die Gleichsetzung einer Seite mit ihrem Ansichsein nicht Synthese, sondern Verschwinden des Verhältnisses erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern die Aufhebung der schlechten Unendlichkeit als notwendige Vermittlung und nicht als bloße Umbenennung eines Jenseits verstanden wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113220977071Z_b5d107fc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. The inverse relation.","source_sha256":"7862229cf410f9aa31f7602d8e25da99840b5997cf5535d26730748196eea73c","sha256":"2f1a78ee5b03fd8531b53afb278f672a0fb7422047e0dbefac3fd34b7321e513","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:32:20.978734+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS1","text":"The text determines the problem as the transition from the immediate direct relation to a relation whose determinacy no longer lies in a fixed number, but in the negative function of the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS2","text":"The inverse relation arises as soon as the alteration of one side necessarily produces the counter-alteration of the other, and alteration thereby lies within the relation itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS3","text":"The exponent is transformed from an indifferent quantum into the qualitative limit that determines, limits, and mediates the two quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS4","text":"The sides receive their value not from an independent magnitude, but from the deficiency, the limit, and the value of the respective other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS5","text":"The approach of the sides toward the exponent initially produces the semblance of an infinite beyond, which is sublated as bad infinity because this beyond is present in the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AS6","text":"The negative mediation of the variable quanta with the self-preserving exponent determines the inverse relation as transition to the relation of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","text":"A relation is determinate when its exponent, as a product, constitutes the unity of unit and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","text":"In the inverse relation, neither side remains a fixed number of units of the other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","text":"The exponent, as quantum, is initially immediate and arbitrarily posited as fixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","text":"In the inverse relation, the exponent is posited as negative, qualitative determining and as the limit of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","text":"Each side is only the quantum that the other side is not, and therefore receives its value through the magnitude of the latter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","text":"The reciprocal negation of the sides is at the same time their continuity and their unity in the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","text":"The exponent is the being-in-itself of each side, the limit of their reciprocal limiting, and the negative unity of their distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","text":"A side loses its determination as a member of the relation when it makes itself equal to its being-in-itself, because then the other side, and finally it itself, disappears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","text":"The approach of the sides toward the exponent, as infinite progress, is finite and therefore only bad infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A10","text":"The beyond of the exponent is at the same time present as a present affirmative quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","text":"The sides possess no other immanent fixed limit than the exponent, which preserves itself in the negation of their indifferent existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:A12","text":"The self-mediation of the exponent realized in the being-outside-itself of the quanta carries the relation forward into the relation of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX1","text":"The inverse relation is not the direct relation of two sides that alter externally and to the same degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX2","text":"The exponent is not merely an indifferent number or a fixed quantum without qualitative function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX3","text":"Neither side is an independently determined quantum with a value of its own independent of the other member.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX4","text":"The exponent is not separated from the finite sides as an unattainable beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX5","text":"Infinite progress is not the truth of the relation, but its finite form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:NX6","text":"The equation of one side with the whole is not the completion of the relation, but its self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D1","text":"In the inverse relation, quantitative alteration becomes an immanent alteration of relational determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D2","text":"The enlargement of one side is necessarily the diminution of the other, because each is determined only through the limit of the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D3","text":"The sides are quantitatively distinct, but not ontologically independent, because their determinacy is held together in the same exponent.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D4","text":"The limit is not an external barrier of the sides, but the negative form in which their common being-in-itself is effective.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D5","text":"Bad infinity arises because the sides presuppose the exponent as limit, yet, as mere members of the relation, cannot become equal to it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","CH_GB18_BDUV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D6","text":"Bad infinity is sublated because the apparently external beyond already exists as affirmative unity and present exponent.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:D7","text":"The negation of every particular value liberates the exponent as that which preserves itself through alteration.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD1","text":"The relation transforms quantity into quality by taking quantitative variability to be only the presentation of a qualitative limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD2","text":"The whole is not the addition of its sides, but the negative unity through which each side exists only as deficiency in the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD3","text":"The truth of infinite movement lies not in an endless approach, but in the presence of the whole appearing as beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SD4","text":"The self-mediation of the exponent requires a form of relation in which the self-preserving whole does not stand beside its moments, but is realized in their self-negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that a quantum can possess its determinacy independently of a relation to another quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the assumption that qualitative determinacy is externally added to a quantitative movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the assumption that infinity consists in a beyond separated from finite actuality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the assumption that the complete realization of one side could complete the relation without destroying its conditions.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely self-identical member of a relation that nevertheless remains a member of the relation without loss of its independence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a final quantitative limit that would not itself be mediated as an expression of the negative unity of the exponent.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:SNX3","text":"Impossible is an infinity that would be neither finite appearance nor present affirmative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS1","text":"Direct indifference of the exponent toward unit and number → sublation of the fixed number through reciprocal alteration of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS2","text":"Reciprocal alteration → exponent as negative qualitative limit instead of as a mere quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS3","text":"Negative limit → each side receives its value as negation, deficiency, and measure of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS4","text":"Reciprocal negation → continuity of the sides in the exponent as their common being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS5","text":"Approach toward the exponent → bad infinity → disclosure of the beyond as present affirmative exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:FGS6","text":"Present exponent in the negation of external quanta → self-mediation of the whole → relation of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AF1","text":"Direct proportion as external quantitative indifference → variable opposition of the sides → exponent as qualitative limit → reciprocal negation and common unity → bad infinity of approach → affirmative presence of the beyond → self-mediation of the exponent → relation of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:AF2","text":"Fixed number → loss of fixed side-values → relational value → negation of independence → preservation of the whole in negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME1","text":"Quantitative alteration is reclassified from an external occurrence into a form of the immanent self-determination of the relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME2","text":"The exponent is remapped from a computational relational value into a limit, unity, negation, and affirmative infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME3","text":"The two sides no longer appear as given magnitudes, but as relational functions reciprocally generated and reciprocally limited.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME4","text":"The opposition between finite this-side and infinite beyond collapses because the beyond is determined as the immanent affirmative unity of the this-side.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ME5","text":"The transition to the relation of powers becomes visible as the consequence of a self-relation of the exponent realized in being-outside-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A11","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit object is the inverse relation of two quanta whose magnitudes vary in opposite directions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — The sides are organized by the exponent as common limit, negative unity, and measure of their reciprocal limiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts explanation from fixed magnitudes to the reconstruction of the mediation through which magnitudes receive relational validity at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Finitude is the self-sublating appearance of a whole that remains present as affirmative infinity and mediates itself in its own externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the direct relation, through the negative determination of the exponent, to the relation of powers.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A1","CH_GB18_BDUV:A2","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4","CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT2","text":"The positive determination of the relation of powers remains underdetermined, because it is posited as result but is not further developed within this unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT3","text":"The strongest internal connection lies in the derivation of reciprocal alteration of magnitude from the negative unity of the sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A5","CH_GB18_BDUV:A6","CH_GB18_BDUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT4","text":"A structural tension consists in the fact that the exponent initially appears as an immediate quantum arbitrarily posited as fixed, but later functions as an immanent necessary limit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","CH_GB18_BDUV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT5","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the exponent is supposed to be both finite quantum and affirmative infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A3","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT6","text":"The text resolves the tension between member of the relation and whole negatively, because the equation of one side with its being-in-itself produces not synthesis, but the disappearance of the relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A7","CH_GB18_BDUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDUV:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the sublation of bad infinity is understood as necessary mediation and not as a mere renaming of a beyond.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDUV:A9","CH_GB18_BDUV:A10","CH_GB18_BDUV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDUV:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDUV@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDUV:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 77","title":"B. The Inverse Ratio.","context":"Chapter 77","original_title":"B. Das umgekehrte Verhältniß."},"original_title":"B. Das umgekehrte Verhältniß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0","layer":"CH","title":"C. The Relation of Powers.","order":78,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CPL0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CPL0@R001","sha256":"7f965b8bab00cc0255f0114e8eb2dd50ecb91689213ded2f2151f2a2f0c17f57","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist, die äußere Veränderlichkeit des Quantums als eine ihm selbst gemäße Bestimmung zu begreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS2","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß bestimmt das Hinausgehen des Quantums über sich selbst als durch das Quantum selbst begrenzte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS3","text":"Einheit und Anzahl werden so bestimmt, daß die Anzahl der Einheiten selbst wieder Einheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS4","text":"Der Exponent wird dadurch aus einer unmittelbaren quantitativen Bestimmung in eine qualitative Bestimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS5","text":"Die Qualität des Quantums besteht darin, daß seine Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Bestimmen und als Beziehung auf sich selbst gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS6","text":"Die Totalität entsteht erst durch den doppelten Übergang von Qualität in Quantität und von Quantität zurück in Qualität; deren Wahrheit ist das Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","text":"Das Quantum kann sich in seinem Andersseyn mit sich identisch setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","text":"Das Hinausgehen des Quantums über sich selbst kann durch das Quantum selbst bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A3","text":"Die entwickelte qualitative Totalität des Quantums hat Einheit und Anzahl zu Momenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","text":"Im Potenzenverhältniß ist die Einheit Anzahl an ihr selbst und zugleich Anzahl gegen sich als Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A5","text":"Im Potenzenverhältniß ist die Anzahl der Einheiten selbst die Einheit; jede Einheit ist die ganze Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","text":"Die Veränderung des Quantums in der Potenz ist durch das Quantum selbst begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A7","text":"Die Grenze oder Negation des Quantums ist im Potenzenverhältniß nicht unmittelbar seiend, sondern in sein Andersseyn kontinuirt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","text":"Die Wahrheit der Qualität ist die Quantität als aufgehobene unmittelbare Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß stellt dar, was das Quantum an sich ist, und realisiert seine Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit der Bestimmtheit ist dem Begriffe des Quantums gemäß als dessen eigenes Bestimmen gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","text":"Die Quantität ist eine sich auf sich beziehende Bestimmtheit und damit selbst eine Qualität, unterschieden von der Qualität als solcher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A12","text":"Die Totalität erfordert sowohl den Übergang der Qualität in die Quantität als auch die Rückkehr der Quantität in die Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX1","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß ist keine bloß äußere Veränderung eines unabhängig gegebenen Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX2","text":"Der Exponent des Potenzenverhältnisses ist kein unmittelbares Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX3","text":"Die Anzahl ist nicht durch ein außerhalb der Einheit liegendes Drittes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX4","text":"Die Grenze oder Negation ist nicht als unmittelbares, feststehendes Seiendes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX5","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht bloß gleichgültige und äußerlich veränderbare Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX6","text":"Quantität und Qualität sind keine vollständig selbständigen und unvermittelten Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX7","text":"Die erste Bewegung der Qualität in die Quantität stellt noch keine Totalität her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX8","text":"Das direkte und das umgekehrte Verhältniß erschöpfen die begriffliche Bestimmung des Quantums nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D1","text":"Im Potenzenverhältniß fällt die Anzahl der Einheiten mit der Einheit zusammen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A3","CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","CH_GB18_CPL0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D2","text":"Das Andersseyn des Quantums ist in der Potenz eine durch das Quantum selbst bestimmte und begrenzte Veränderung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D3","text":"Der Exponent des Potenzenverhältnisses ist qualitativ, weil er die Identität des Quantums mit sich selbst in seinem Andersseyn ausdrückt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","CH_GB18_CPL0:A5","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D4","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß ist die Darstellung der Qualität des Quantums, weil es dessen Ansichseyn vollständig realisiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D5","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums wird im Potenzenverhältniß als seine eigene Beziehung auf sich selbst bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D6","text":"Das Quantum geht in die Qualität über, sobald seine Äußerlichkeit nicht mehr unmittelbar, sondern durch es selbst vermittelt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D7","text":"Die Quantität ist nicht nur eine Qualität, sondern die in sich zurückgekehrte Wahrheit der Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D8","text":"Der erste Übergang erzeugt nur die an sich vorhandene Identität von Qualität und Quantität; erst der Rückgang in die Qualität setzt sie als aufgehobene Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D9","text":"Das Quantum als aufgehobene gleichgültige Äußerlichkeit ist Maß.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD1","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß verwandelt das Andersseyn des Quantums von einer äußeren Abweichung in eine intern erzeugte Selbstbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD2","text":"Die Identität von Qualität und Quantität ist keine unmittelbare Gleichsetzung, sondern das Resultat wechselseitiger Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD3","text":"Die äußere Größe wird als Träger einer qualitativen Selbstunterscheidung neu bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD4","text":"Wissenschaftliche Totalität wird als reziproke Übergangsstruktur und nicht als lineare Ableitung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD5","text":"Die Grenze ist keine starre Schranke, sondern die vermittelte Kontinuität des Quantums in sein eigenes Andersseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX1","text":"Eine von der Einheit unabhängige Quelle der Anzahl ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX2","text":"Ein Hinausgehen über sich selbst, dessen Grenze nicht aus dem Quantum hervorgeht, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX3","text":"Ein Quantum als bloß vorliegendes und äußerlich veränderbares Substrat ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX4","text":"Eine unabhängig von quantitativer Vermittlung bestehende unmittelbare Qualität ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX5","text":"Eine Totalität, die durch nur einen Übergang hergestellt wäre, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX6","text":"Eine Bestimmtheit, die in ihrem Andersseyn nicht bei sich bleibt, gilt nicht als Wahrheit des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX1","text":"Unvermittelte Äußerlichkeit kann nicht letzter Grund der Bestimmung sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX2","text":"Ein eigenständiger Seinsbereich der Quantität neben der Qualität ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX3","text":"Ein Andersseyn ohne Rückkehr in die Selbstbeziehung kann keine abschließende Bestimmung bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX4","text":"Eine einseitige Ableitung von Qualität und Quantität kann nicht als wissenschaftliche Totalität gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX5","text":"Eine absolute Unmittelbarkeit der Bestimmtheit, die nicht aufgehoben wird, ist als letzte Wahrheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS1","text":"Selbstsetzung: Quantum → Identität mit sich im Andersseyn → selbstbestimmtes Hinausgehen über sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS2","text":"Artikulation: qualitative Totalität → Einheit und Anzahl → Potenz, in der die Einheit Anzahl an ihr selbst und gegen sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS3","text":"Internalisierung: Anzahl der Einheiten = Einheit → jede Einheit = ganze Menge → Andersseyn = durch sich selbst begrenzte Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS4","text":"Qualifizierung: unmittelbarer Exponent → qualitativer Exponent; unmittelbare Negation → kontinuierliches Andersseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS5","text":"Realisierung: äußere Veränderung → Darstellung des Quantums an sich → eigenes Bestimmen der Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS6","text":"Differenzierung: direktes Verhältniß = unmittelbarer Unterschied → umgekehrtes Verhältniß = negative Selbstbeziehung → Potenzenverhältniß = Unterschied des Quantums von sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS7","text":"Doppelte Vermittlung: Qualität → Quantität als einseitige Identität → Quantität → Qualität als Rückkehr und Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS8","text":"Abschluß: Quantität als aufgehobene gleichgültige Äußerlichkeit → Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF1","text":"Äußerlich veränderbares Quantum → selbstbestimmtes Andersseyn in der Potenz → qualitativer Exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF2","text":"Unmittelbares direktes und negatives umgekehrtes Verhältniß → Unterschied des Quantums von sich selbst → Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF3","text":"Gegenüberstellung von Quantität und Qualität → erster Übergang → einseitige Identität → Rückgang in die erste Bestimmung → Totalität → Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME1","text":"Das Potenzenverhältniß wird von einer Rechenform zu einer qualitativen Selbstbeziehung des Quantums umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Quantität und Qualität wird als einseitige Abstraktion innerhalb einer reziproken Übergangsstruktur sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME3","text":"Die Grenze wird von einer fixierten Negation zu einer Kontinuität in das Andersseyn umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME4","text":"Direkte, umgekehrte und potenzielle Verhältnisse werden als Stufen zunehmender Selbstbestimmung geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME5","text":"Maß erscheint als die kategoriale Form, in der äußerliche Quantität und qualitative Bestimmtheit zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das Quantum setzt sich in seinem Andersseyn mit sich identisch; die Potenz bestimmt die Anzahl als Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die äußere Bestimmtheit wird als durch das Quantum selbst vermittelte Selbstbeziehung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Wissenschaftliche Bestimmung muß den doppelten Übergang vollziehen und darf nicht bei einer einseitigen Identität stehenbleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Unmittelbares Daseyn wird als vermittelte Bestimmtheit gefaßt, die in ihr Andersseyn übergeht und in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der selbstbegrenzten Potenz über die qualitative Bestimmung bis zum Maß zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die mathematische Operation der Potenz; ihr Exponent wird kategorial, nicht formal-algebraisch bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz hängt davon ab, Qualität als unmittelbare Kategorie von der qualitativen Bestimmtheit der Quantität zu unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Struktur ist die Ableitung der Totalität aus dem doppelten Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von begrifflichen Verschiebungen zwischen Einheit, Anzahl, Quantum und Qualität ab; bei ihrer Einebnung bricht die Erzeugungslogik zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, daß das Potenzenverhältniß zunächst als äußere Veränderung erscheint, zugleich aber als vollständige Realisierung des Begriffs gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß die Quantität als Wahrheit der Qualität bestimmt wird, ohne daß dadurch die Unterscheidung beider Bestimmungen verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt nur erhalten, wenn die erste Identität als einseitig und das Maß als Resultat der Rückkehr rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114644084881Z_b961a9fb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Ratio of Powers.","source_sha256":"7f965b8bab00cc0255f0114e8eb2dd50ecb91689213ded2f2151f2a2f0c17f57","sha256":"2d0b7842faa35f11910db5d7708672d3f986fe4e71f6d8522274a80ab2c58175","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:46:44.087511+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS1","text":"The problem is to comprehend the external mutability of quantum as a determination commensurate with quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS2","text":"The ratio of powers determines quantum's going-beyond-itself as a self-relation limited by quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS3","text":"Unit and number are determined in such a way that the number of units is itself once again unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS4","text":"Thereby the exponent is transformed from an immediate quantitative determination into a qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS5","text":"The quality of quantum consists in its externality being posited as its own determining and as relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AS6","text":"Totality arises only through the twofold transition from quality into quantity and from quantity back into quality; their truth is measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","text":"Quantum can posit itself as identical with itself in its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","text":"Quantum's going-beyond-itself can be determined by quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A3","text":"The developed qualitative totality of quantum has unit and number as moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","text":"In the ratio of powers, the unit is number in itself and at the same time number over against itself as unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A5","text":"In the ratio of powers, the number of units is itself the unit; each unit is the whole sum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","text":"The alteration of quantum in the power is limited by quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A7","text":"In the ratio of powers, the limit or negation of quantum is not immediately existent, but is continued into its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","text":"The truth of quality is quantity as sublated immediate determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","text":"The ratio of powers represents what quantum is in itself and realizes its determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","text":"The externality of determinateness is posited in accordance with the Concept of quantum as its own determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","text":"Quantity is a self-relating determinateness and thus itself a quality, distinct from quality as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:A12","text":"Totality requires both the transition of quality into quantity and the return of quantity into quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX1","text":"The ratio of powers is not a merely external alteration of an independently given quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX2","text":"The exponent of the ratio of powers is not an immediate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX3","text":"Number is not determined by a third lying outside the unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX4","text":"The limit or negation is not determined as an immediate, fixed existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX5","text":"Quantum is not merely indifferent and externally alterable determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX6","text":"Quantity and quality are not completely self-subsistent and unmediated opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX7","text":"The first movement of quality into quantity does not yet produce any totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:NX8","text":"The direct and the inverse ratio do not exhaust the conceptual determination of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D1","text":"In the ratio of powers, the number of units coincides with the unit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A3","CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","CH_GB18_CPL0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D2","text":"In the power, the otherness of quantum is an alteration determined and limited by quantum itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D3","text":"The exponent of the ratio of powers is qualitative because it expresses quantum's identity with itself in its otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A4","CH_GB18_CPL0:A5","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D4","text":"The ratio of powers is the presentation of the quality of quantum because it completely realizes its being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D5","text":"In the ratio of powers, the externality of quantum is determined as its own relation to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D6","text":"Quantum passes over into quality as soon as its externality is no longer immediate but mediated through itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D7","text":"Quantity is not only a quality, but the truth of quality returned into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D8","text":"The first transition produces only the identity of quality and quantity present in itself; only the return into quality posits it as sublated unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:D9","text":"Quantum as sublated indifferent externality is measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD1","text":"The ratio of powers transforms the otherness of quantum from an external deviation into an internally generated self-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A1","CH_GB18_CPL0:A2","CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD2","text":"The identity of quality and quantity is not an immediate equation, but the result of reciprocal sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD3","text":"External magnitude is newly determined as the bearer of a qualitative self-differentiation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A9","CH_GB18_CPL0:A10","CH_GB18_CPL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD4","text":"Scientific totality is generated as a reciprocal structure of transition and not as a linear derivation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A8","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SD5","text":"The limit is not a rigid barrier, but the mediated continuity of quantum into its own otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_CPL0:A6","CH_GB18_CPL0:A7","CH_GB18_CPL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX1","text":"A source of number independent of the unit is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX2","text":"A going-beyond-itself whose limit does not proceed from quantum is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX3","text":"A quantum as a merely given and externally alterable substrate is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX4","text":"An immediate quality existing independently of quantitative mediation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX5","text":"A totality that would be produced through only one transition is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:DNX6","text":"A determinateness that does not remain with itself in its otherness does not count as the truth of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX1","text":"Unmediated externality cannot be the ultimate ground of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX2","text":"An autonomous sphere of being of quantity alongside quality is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX3","text":"An otherness without return into self-relation cannot constitute a conclusive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX4","text":"A one-sided derivation of quality and quantity cannot count as scientific totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:SNX5","text":"An absolute immediacy of determinateness that is not sublated is excluded as ultimate truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS1","text":"Self-positing: quantum → identity with itself in otherness → self-determined going-beyond-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS2","text":"Articulation: qualitative totality → unit and number → power, in which the unit is number in itself and over against itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS3","text":"Internalization: number of units = unit → each unit = whole sum → otherness = alteration limited by itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS4","text":"Qualification: immediate exponent → qualitative exponent; immediate negation → continuous otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS5","text":"Realization: external alteration → presentation of quantum in itself → own determining of externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS6","text":"Differentiation: direct ratio = immediate difference → inverse ratio = negative self-relation → ratio of powers = difference of quantum from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS7","text":"Twofold mediation: quality → quantity as one-sided identity → quantity → quality as return and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:FGS8","text":"Conclusion: quantity as sublated indifferent externality → measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF1","text":"Externally alterable quantum → self-determined otherness in the power → qualitative exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF2","text":"Immediate direct and negative inverse ratio → difference of quantum from itself → externality as its own determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:AF3","text":"Opposition of quantity and quality → first transition → one-sided identity → return into the first determination → totality → measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME1","text":"The ratio of powers is remapped from a computational form into a qualitative self-relation of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME2","text":"The opposition of quantity and quality becomes visible as a one-sided abstraction within a reciprocal structure of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME3","text":"The limit is reclassified from a fixed negation into a continuity into otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME4","text":"Direct, inverse, and power ratios are ordered as stages of increasing self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ME5","text":"Measure appears as the categorical form in which external quantity and qualitative determinateness coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Quantum posits itself as identical with itself in its otherness; the power determines number as unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT2","text":"Structural: External determinateness is organized as self-relation mediated through quantum itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Scientific determination must complete the twofold transition and may not remain at a one-sided identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Immediate determinate being is comprehended as mediated determinateness, which passes over into its otherness and returns into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the self-limiting power through qualitative determination to measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT2","text":"The mathematical operation of the power remains underdetermined; its exponent is determined categorically, not formally-algebraically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence depends on distinguishing quality as an immediate category from the qualitative determinateness of quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the structure is the derivation of totality from the twofold transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on conceptual shifts among unit, number, quantum, and quality; if they are flattened, the generative logic collapses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the ratio of powers initially appears as external alteration, yet at the same time counts as the complete realization of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that quantity is determined as the truth of quality without thereby causing the distinction between the two determinations to disappear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CPL0:MRT8","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved only if the first identity is reconstructed as one-sided and measure as the result of the return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CPL0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CPL0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CPL0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 78","title":"C. The Relation of Powers.","context":"Chapter 78","original_title":"C. Potenzverhältniß."},"original_title":"C. Potenzverhältniß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":79,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_20"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_20@R001","sha256":"131203558012ab2e926e9b9766113ba320c9e7a02e549b3913b63837d4c48ed6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS1","text":"Die Schwierigkeit des quantitativ Unendlichen wird auf das qualitative Moment zurückgeführt, das innerhalb des Quantitativen hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS2","text":"Die bloße Negation des Quantums bestimmt das Unendliche unzureichend; erforderlich ist seine affirmative Bestimmung als Qualitatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS3","text":"Die Übertragung des Potenzenverhältnisses auf den Begriff verfehlt die Differenz zwischen quantitativer Bestimmtheit und begrifflicher Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS4","text":"Das Argument ist diagnostisch und rekonstruktiv: Es weist die Kategorieverwechslung nach und bestimmt die Selbstbegründung des Begriffs als alternatives Kriterium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS5","text":"Zahlen, Potenzen und andere Formen können allenfalls symbolisch dienen, nicht aber ohne ausgewiesene Begriffsbestimmtheit philosophische Formen abgeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS6","text":"Sobald die Begriffsbestimmtheit ausgewiesen ist, wird die symbolische Form überflüssig und ihr Gebrauch als Ersparnis begrifflicher Arbeit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A1","text":"Die Schwierigkeiten des quantitativ Unendlichen haben ihren Ursprung in einem qualitativen Moment des Quantitativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A2","text":"Die negative Bestimmung des Unendlichen als Negation des Quantums ist unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A3","text":"Die affirmative Bestimmung des Unendlichen besteht darin, es als qualitativ zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A4","text":"Das Potenzenverhältnis ist in seiner philosophischen Verwendung eine Kategorie des Quantums und nicht die Aristotelische potentia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A5","text":"Die Potenzenfolge bestimmt quantitative Unterschiede, nicht den Unterschied, wie er am Begriff als solchem ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A6","text":"Das Quantum setzt die dem Begriff eigene Negativität noch nicht in dessen eigentümlicher Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A7","text":"Unterschiede des Quantums sind für den Begriff selbst oberflächliche Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A8","text":"Die Verwendung von Zahlen und Potenzen zur Bezeichnung allgemeiner wesentlicher Unterschiede gehört einer Vorstufe des reinen Denkens an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A9","text":"Die philosophische Entwicklung führt von numerischen Bezeichnungen zu selbstständigen Gedankenbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A10","text":"Die Philosophie bedarf für reine Begriffsbestimmungen keiner Hilfen aus der sinnlichen Welt, der Einbildungskraft oder untergeordneten Bestimmungssphären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A11","text":"Kategorien endlicher oder untergeordneter Sphären sind für das Unendliche und für höhere begriffliche Zusammenhänge nicht ohne Weiteres geeignet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A12","text":"Eine quantitative oder symbolische Form kann nur dann als philosophische Form gelten, wenn ihre Begriffsbestimmtheit zuerst ausgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A13","text":"Ist die Begriffsbestimmtheit ausgewiesen, bezeichnet sie sich selbst und macht die symbolische Bezeichnung überflüssig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A14","text":"Der nicht ausgewiesene Gebrauch symbolischer Formen erspart die Fassung, Angabe und Rechtfertigung der Begriffsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX1","text":"Das Potenzenverhältnis ist nicht die Aristotelische potentia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX2","text":"Quantitative Potenzstufen sind nicht die eigentümliche Bestimmung der begrifflichen Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX3","text":"Quantitative Unterschiede sind nicht begriffliche Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX4","text":"Die negative Bestimmung des Unendlichen ist nicht seine hinreichende philosophische Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX5","text":"Endliche Kategorien sind keine angemessenen Formen für das Unendliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX6","text":"Untergeordnete Bestimmungssphären können nicht unverändert für höhere Kreise und das Ganze gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX7","text":"Zahlen, Potenzen und das mathematisch Unendliche sind nicht als solche philosophische Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX8","text":"Symbolische Darstellung ist nicht identisch mit begrifflicher Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX9","text":"Die Rückkehr von Gedankenbestimmungen zu Zahlen ist kein Fortschritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX10","text":"Der Anspruch auf Neuheit oder Vornehmheit macht die numerische Rückkehr nicht zu einer höheren Denkform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX11","text":"Kraft, Substantialität, Ursache und Wirkung sind für lebendige oder geistige Verhältnisse keine unmittelbar wahren Bestimmungen, sofern sie nur als übertragene Symbole dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D1","text":"Die Kritik des quantitativ Unendlichen muss von der bloßen Negation des Quantums zur positiven Bestimmung des qualitativen Moments fortschreiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A1","CH_GB18_A_20:A2","CH_GB18_A_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D2","text":"Die Zuordnung von Unmittelbarkeit, Differenz und Totalität zu erster, zweiter und dritter Potenz überträgt eine quantitative Ordnung auf begriffliche Entwicklungsbestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A6","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D3","text":"Die Potenzenfolge kann die begriffliche Bewegung nicht ausdrücken, weil sie nur die quantitative Form eines Unterschieds bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D4","text":"Die Verwendung von Zahlen zur Bezeichnung wesentlicher Unterschiede bedeutet eine Rückkehr hinter die erreichte Ebene der Gedankenbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A8","CH_GB18_A_20:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D5","text":"Die Übertragung endlicher oder untergeordneter Kategorien auf das Unendliche erzeugt für dieses unwahre Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D6","text":"Der bloß symbolische Gebrauch von Potenzen ist nicht an sich untersagt, besitzt aber keine selbstständige philosophische Geltung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D7","text":"Der philosophische Anspruch einer symbolischen Form hängt vollständig vom vorgängigen Nachweis ihrer Begriffsbestimmtheit ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D8","text":"Nach dem Nachweis der Begriffsbestimmtheit fungiert das Symbol nicht mehr als notwendige Erkenntnisform, sondern nur noch als entbehrliche Bezeichnung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D9","text":"Wo dieser Nachweis ausbleibt, dient die symbolische Form dazu, begriffliche Fassung, Angabe und Rechtfertigung zu umgehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A13","CH_GB18_A_20:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD1","text":"Quantitative Formen können den Begriff nicht dadurch adäquat bestimmen, dass ihre eigene Entwicklungsordnung auf den Begriff übertragen wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A6","CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD2","text":"Das Qualitative ist im Quantitativen der Ursprung einer begrifflichen Schwierigkeit, ohne dass das Quantitative deshalb zur angemessenen Form des Begriffs wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A1","CH_GB18_A_20:A3","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD3","text":"Philosophischer Fortschritt wird als Übergang von äußerer numerischer Bezeichnung zu selbstständiger Gedankenbestimmung bestimmt; die Rückkehr zur Zahl erscheint dadurch als Regression unter dem Anspruch von Neuheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A8","CH_GB18_A_20:A9","CH_GB18_A_20:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD4","text":"Der Kategorienfehler der Potenzenverwendung verallgemeinert sich auf jede Übertragung untergeordneter Bestimmungen wie Kraft, Substantialität oder Kausalität auf höhere oder geistige Verhältnisse.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD5","text":"Das entscheidende Kriterium philosophischer Form ist nicht ihre Anschaulichkeit oder formale Ähnlichkeit, sondern die selbstständige Ausweisung ihrer Begriffsbestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A12","CH_GB18_A_20:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX1","text":"Der Begriff kann nicht durch die bloße Steigerung oder Staffelung quantitativer Formen begrifflich bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX2","text":"Zwischen quantitativer Differenz und begrifflicher Negativität besteht keine unmittelbare Übersetzbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX3","text":"Eine formale Analogie zwischen Zahlenfolge und Begriffsbewegung ersetzt keine begriffliche Rechtfertigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX4","text":"Die äußere Herkunft einer Bestimmung aus Sinnlichkeit, Einbildungskraft oder einer niedrigeren Sphäre darf nicht als philosophische Begründung fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX5","text":"Die Negation des Endlichen erschöpft nicht die positive Bestimmung des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX6","text":"Die Bequemlichkeit einer Bezeichnung darf nicht an die Stelle der Selbstbestimmung des Gegenstands treten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX7","text":"Eine philosophische Form darf nicht von einem fremden Bestimmungsbereich geliehen werden, ohne dessen begriffliche Transformation auszuweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass der Begriff seine Wahrheit durch ein äußeres quantitatives Schema erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Philosophie, in der symbolische Verfügbarkeit die fehlende begriffliche Selbstbestimmung kompensiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine unmittelbare Kontinuität zwischen der Form des Quantums und der Form des Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Fortschrittsmodell, in dem die Rückkehr zu vorgedanklichen Zeichen als höhere philosophische Erfindung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein externer Maßstab, durch den die Begriffsbestimmung ersetzt oder nachträglich legitimiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS1","text":"Quantitatives Problem → Hervortreten des qualitativen Moments → Zurückweisung der bloß negativen Bestimmung des Unendlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS2","text":"Zuordnung von Potenzstufen zum Begriff → Identifikation der Potenz als Quantums-Kategorie → Trennung quantitativer und begrifflicher Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS3","text":"Übertragung einer niederen Kategorie auf eine höhere Sphäre → Nachweis der kategorialen Unangemessenheit → Klassifikation als oberflächliche oder unwahre Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS4","text":"Symbolischer Gebrauch → begrenzte Duldung als Bezeichnung; Anspruch auf philosophische Form → Forderung nach ausgewiesener Begriffsbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS5","text":"Ausgewiesene Begriffsbestimmtheit → Selbstbezeichnung des Begriffs → Überflüssigkeit des Symbols → Diagnose der begrifflichen Arbeitersparnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS6","text":"Historische Gedankenbestimmung → numerische Rückkehr → Umkehrung des Fortschritts in eine als Neuheit maskierte Regression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AF1","text":"Quantitative Schwierigkeit → qualitative Herkunft → Unzulänglichkeit der negativen Unendlichkeitsbestimmung → Übertragung des Potenzenverhältnisses → Kategorienverwechslung → Vorrang der selbstständigen Begriffsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AF2","text":"Symbolische Bezeichnung → möglicher bloßer Gebrauchswert → philosophischer Geltungsanspruch → Nachweis der Begriffsbestimmtheit → Überflüssigkeit des Symbols → Aufdeckung der begrifflichen Ersparnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME1","text":"Die Frage wird von der Anschaulichkeit oder Neuheit eines Ausdrucks auf seine kategoriale Angemessenheit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME2","text":"Symbolischer Gebrauch und philosophische Form werden als zwei getrennte Geltungsweisen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME3","text":"Potenzen, Zahlen und mathematische Unendlichkeit werden bei philosophischem Formanspruch der Sphäre untergeordneter quantitativer Bestimmungen zugeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME4","text":"Das Unendliche wird von einer bloßen Negation des Quantums zu einer positiven qualitativen Bestimmung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME5","text":"Die Rückkehr zu Zahlen wird nicht mehr als Innovation, sondern als Rückfall hinter selbstständige Gedankenbestimmungen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME6","text":"Übertragene Kategorien wie Kraft, Substantialität und Kausalität werden als strukturell verwandte Fälle derselben Fremdbestimmung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Begriff wird in unmittelbarer, differenzieller und totaler Bestimmung als erste, zweite und dritte Potenz bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine quantitative Kategorie wird auf eine qualitative Begriffsbewegung übertragen und erzeugt dadurch eine kategoriale Verschiebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verlegt die Entscheidung über philosophische Geltung vom Ausdrucksmittel auf den Nachweis begrifflicher Selbstbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Unendliche wird als qualitative affirmative Bestimmung und die Gedankenentwicklung als Übergang von numerischer Vorstufe zu selbstständigem Begriff gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kritik der Potenzenübertragung, die Begrenzung des Symbolgebrauchs und den Vorrang der Begriffsbestimmung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie das qualitative Moment aus dem Quantitativen hervorgeht und wie die affirmative Bestimmung des Unendlichen im Einzelnen konstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern zwischen symbolischer Darstellung und philosophischer Form unterschieden wird; das genaue Kriterium ihres Übergangs bleibt jedoch nicht formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT4","text":"Ihre größte Stärke liegt in der Asymmetrie zwischen quantitativer Differenz und begrifflicher Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT5","text":"Die historische Ordnung von Zahlengebrauch, Gedankenbestimmung und Rückkehr zur Zahl bleibt komprimiert und trägt teilweise durch wertende rhetorische Klassifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von qualitativer Diagnose über Kategorienkritik und Symbolbegrenzung zur Forderung nach selbstständiger Begriffsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111833961880Z_b1a0f2cb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"131203558012ab2e926e9b9766113ba320c9e7a02e549b3913b63837d4c48ed6","sha256":"98ee1a8ec11241abc9e95deabe669c87f86dae4534e59f2689754f17027be623","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:18:33.964177+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS1","text":"The difficulty of the quantitatively infinite is traced back to the qualitative moment that emerges within the quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS2","text":"The mere negation of quantum determines the infinite inadequately; its affirmative determination as qualitative is required.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS3","text":"The transfer of the relation of powers to the concept misses the difference between quantitative determinacy and conceptual determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS4","text":"The argument is diagnostic and reconstructive: it demonstrates the confusion of categories and determines the self-grounding of the concept as the alternative criterion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS5","text":"Numbers, powers, and other forms can at most serve symbolically, but cannot constitute philosophical forms without demonstrated conceptual determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AS6","text":"As soon as conceptual determinacy has been demonstrated, the symbolic form becomes superfluous and its use becomes visible as a saving of conceptual labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A1","text":"The difficulties of the quantitatively infinite have their origin in a qualitative moment of the quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A2","text":"The negative determination of the infinite as the negation of quantum is inadequate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A3","text":"The affirmative determination of the infinite consists in determining it as qualitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A4","text":"In its philosophical use, the relation of powers is a category of quantum and not Aristotelian potentia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A5","text":"The succession of powers determines quantitative differences, not the difference as it is in the concept as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A6","text":"Quantum does not yet posit the negativity proper to the concept in its distinctive determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A7","text":"Differences of quantum are superficial determinations for the concept itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A8","text":"The use of numbers and powers to designate universal essential differences belongs to a preliminary stage of pure thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A9","text":"Philosophical development leads from numerical designations to self-subsistent thought-determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A10","text":"For pure conceptual determinations, philosophy requires no aids from the sensible world, the imagination, or subordinate spheres of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A11","text":"Categories of finite or subordinate spheres are not directly suitable for the infinite and for higher conceptual connections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A12","text":"A quantitative or symbolic form can count as a philosophical form only if its conceptual determinacy is first demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A13","text":"If conceptual determinacy has been demonstrated, it designates itself and renders symbolic designation superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:A14","text":"The undemonstrated use of symbolic forms saves the grasp, specification, and justification of conceptual determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX1","text":"The relation of powers is not Aristotelian potentia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX2","text":"Quantitative stages of powers are not the distinctive determination of conceptual negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX3","text":"Quantitative differences are not conceptual differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX4","text":"The negative determination of the infinite is not its sufficient philosophical determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX5","text":"Finite categories are not adequate forms for the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX6","text":"Subordinate spheres of determination cannot apply unchanged to higher circles and to the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX7","text":"Numbers, powers, and the mathematical infinite are not, as such, philosophical forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX8","text":"Symbolic representation is not identical with conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX9","text":"The return from thought-determinations to numbers is not progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX10","text":"The claim to novelty or distinction does not make the numerical return a higher form of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:NX11","text":"Force, substantiality, cause, and effect are not immediately true determinations for living or spiritual relations, insofar as they serve merely as transferred symbols.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D1","text":"The critique of the quantitatively infinite must advance from the mere negation of quantum to the positive determination of the qualitative moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A1","CH_GB18_A_20:A2","CH_GB18_A_20:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D2","text":"The assignment of immediacy, difference, and totality to first, second, and third power transfers a quantitative order to conceptual developmental determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A6","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D3","text":"The succession of powers cannot express conceptual movement because it determines only the quantitative form of a difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D4","text":"The use of numbers to designate essential differences signifies a return behind the attained level of thought-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A8","CH_GB18_A_20:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D5","text":"The transfer of finite or subordinate categories to the infinite produces untrue determinations for it.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D6","text":"The merely symbolic use of powers is not prohibited in itself, but possesses no independent philosophical validity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D7","text":"The philosophical claim of a symbolic form depends entirely on the prior demonstration of its conceptual determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D8","text":"After the demonstration of conceptual determinacy, the symbol no longer functions as a necessary form of cognition, but only as a dispensable designation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:D9","text":"Where this demonstration is absent, the symbolic form serves to evade conceptual grasp, specification, and justification.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A13","CH_GB18_A_20:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD1","text":"Quantitative forms cannot adequately determine the concept by having their own order of development transferred to the concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A4","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A6","CH_GB18_A_20:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD2","text":"The qualitative in the quantitative is the origin of a conceptual difficulty, without the quantitative thereby becoming the adequate form of the concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A1","CH_GB18_A_20:A3","CH_GB18_A_20:A5","CH_GB18_A_20:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD3","text":"Philosophical progress is determined as the transition from external numerical designation to self-subsistent thought-determination; the return to number thereby appears as regression under the claim of novelty.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A8","CH_GB18_A_20:A9","CH_GB18_A_20:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD4","text":"The category error in the use of powers generalizes to every transfer of subordinate determinations such as force, substantiality, or causality to higher or spiritual relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SD5","text":"The decisive criterion of philosophical form is not its intuitiveness or formal similarity, but the independent demonstration of its conceptual determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_20:A10","CH_GB18_A_20:A12","CH_GB18_A_20:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX1","text":"The concept cannot be conceptually determined by the mere intensification or staging of quantitative forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX2","text":"There is no immediate translatability between quantitative difference and conceptual negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX3","text":"A formal analogy between a sequence of numbers and conceptual movement does not replace conceptual justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX4","text":"The external origin of a determination in sensibility, imagination, or a lower sphere must not function as philosophical grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX5","text":"The negation of the finite does not exhaust the positive determination of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX6","text":"The convenience of a designation must not take the place of the self-determination of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:DNX7","text":"A philosophical form must not be borrowed from an alien domain of determination without demonstrating its conceptual transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the concept receives its truth through an external quantitative schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a philosophy in which symbolic availability compensates for absent conceptual self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an immediate continuity between the form of quantum and the form of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a model of progress in which the return to pre-conceptual signs counts as a higher philosophical invention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:SNX5","text":"Excluded is an external standard through which conceptual determination could be replaced or subsequently legitimized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS1","text":"Quantitative problem → emergence of the qualitative moment → rejection of the merely negative determination of the infinite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS2","text":"Assignment of stages of powers to the concept → identification of power as a category of quantum → separation of quantitative and conceptual difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS3","text":"Transfer of a lower category to a higher sphere → demonstration of categorical inadequacy → classification as a superficial or untrue determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS4","text":"Symbolic use → limited toleration as designation; claim to philosophical form → demand for demonstrated conceptual determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS5","text":"Demonstrated conceptual determinacy → self-designation of the concept → superfluity of the symbol → diagnosis of the saving of conceptual labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:FGS6","text":"Historical thought-determination → numerical return → reversal of progress into a regression masked as novelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AF1","text":"Quantitative difficulty → qualitative origin → inadequacy of the negative determination of infinity → transfer of the relation of powers → confusion of categories → primacy of independent conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:AF2","text":"Symbolic designation → possible merely practical value → claim to philosophical validity → demonstration of conceptual determinacy → superfluity of the symbol → disclosure of the conceptual saving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME1","text":"The question is shifted from the intuitiveness or novelty of an expression to its categorical adequacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME2","text":"Symbolic use and philosophical form are mapped as two separate modes of validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME3","text":"Powers, numbers, and mathematical infinity are assigned, where they claim philosophical form, to the sphere of subordinate quantitative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME4","text":"The infinite is remapped from a mere negation of quantum to a positive qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME5","text":"The return to numbers no longer appears as innovation, but as a relapse behind self-subsistent thought-determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ME6","text":"Transferred categories such as force, substantiality, and causality are classified as structurally related cases of the same external determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT1","text":"Surface — The concept is designated in immediate, differential, and total determination as first, second, and third power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT2","text":"Structural — A quantitative category is transferred to a qualitative conceptual movement and thereby produces a categorical displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text relocates the decision concerning philosophical validity from the means of expression to the demonstration of conceptual self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The infinite is conceived as a qualitative affirmative determination, and the development of thought as a transition from numerical preliminary stage to self-subsistent concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the critique of the transfer of powers, the limitation of symbolic use, and the primacy of conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the qualitative moment emerges from the quantitative and how the affirmative determination of the infinite is constructed in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as symbolic representation and philosophical form are distinguished; however, the exact criterion of their transition remains unformalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT4","text":"Its greatest strength lies in the asymmetry between quantitative difference and conceptual negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT5","text":"The historical order of the use of numbers, thought-determination, and return to number remains compressed and is sustained in part through evaluative rhetorical classification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_20:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from qualitative diagnosis through critique of categories and limitation of symbols to the demand for independent conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_20:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_20@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_20:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 79","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 79","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM","layer":"CH","title":"Third Section. Measure.","order":80,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DADM"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DADM@R001","sha256":"c82d7fa8b10f5c98ade5f31615a0a7b4a2874b9a61cf4d0ca9ca2b93ecf19fe8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt das Problem als die Vermittlung von qualitativer Bestimmtheit und quantitativer Gleichgültigkeit, ohne den Unterschied beider in bloße Äußerlichkeit aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS2","text":"Der Text verfährt rekonstruktiv-dialektisch, indem er das Maaß als das Dritte bestimmt, in welchem Äußerlichkeit auf sich selbst bezogen und dadurch aufgehoben ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS3","text":"Die Gegenmodelle der Modalität, des spinozistischen Modus und des Pantheismus werden daran geprüft, ob sie Differenz in einer konkreten Einheit erhalten oder in abstrakte Substanz beziehungsweise Maßlosigkeit zurückfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS4","text":"Die Entwicklung des Maaßes erzeugt aus unmittelbarer Einheit zunächst qualitative Quanta, sodann Verhältnisse spezifischer Quanta, schließlich Indifferenz und den Übergang in das Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS5","text":"Das Maaß wird als Vermittlungsform bestimmt, deren abstrakteste Gesetzlichkeit im Mechanismus vollständig realisierbar ist, während physische und organische Verhältnisse sie höheren Bestimmungen unterordnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet nicht in einer allgemeinen Natur- oder Geistesmathematik, weil das Geistige keine eigentümliche freie Entwicklung des Maaßes besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A1","text":"Das Maaß ist die unmittelbare Einheit von Qualität und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A2","text":"Quantität ist gegen Bestimmtheit gleichgültige Selbstgleichheit, deren Bestimmtheit nur in einem Anderen liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A3","text":"Die auf sich bezogene Äußerlichkeit hebt ihre bloße Äußerlichkeit auf und enthält den Unterschied als quantitatives und qualitatives Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A4","text":"Ein Modus, der nur in einem Anderen ist und durch ein Anderes begriffen wird, besitzt keine Rückkehr in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A5","text":"Das Maaß ist zugleich äußerliches Mehr oder Weniger und an sich seiende Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A6","text":"Im Maaß wird qualitative Bestimmtheit quantitativ, und die aufgehobene Gleichgültigkeit kehrt als qualitatives An-und-für-sich-Sein zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A7","text":"Das Maaß enthält das Wesen zunächst nur an sich oder im Begriffe, nicht als gesetzte reflektierte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A8","text":"Die Entwicklung des Maaßes setzt die Unterscheidung seiner Momente und ihre Beziehung, indem sie ihre unmittelbare Identität als vermittelte Beziehung hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A9","text":"Das erste Maaß ist ein Quantum mit qualitativer Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A10","text":"Selbständige spezifische Maße beruhen auf quantitativen Verhältnissen und gehen deshalb wesentlich ineinander über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A11","text":"Das Maßlose ist die dem Maaß immanente Negativität und nicht dessen äußerliches Gegenteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A12","text":"Die vollständige abstrakte Indifferenz des entwickelten Maaßes kann sich nur im Mechanismus vollständig realisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A13","text":"Im Organischen wird das Maaß höheren Verhältnissen untergeordnet und auf die Form unmittelbarer Größenverhältnisse zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A14","text":"Im Geistigen entstehen keine eigentümlichen Gesetze oder freien Formen des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX1","text":"Die Modalität ist nicht objektive Bestimmung des Gegenstands, sofern sie nur das Verhältnis des Gegenstands zum Erkenntnisvermögen ausdrückt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX2","text":"Der spinozistische Modus ist nicht die konkrete Vermittlung von Substanz und Bestimmtheit, sondern abstrakte Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX3","text":"Pantheistische Einheit ist nicht konkrete Einheit, sofern sie Bestimmtheit im Absoluten verschwinden lässt, statt sie aufzuheben und zu bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX4","text":"Das Maßlose ist nicht freie Unendlichkeit, sondern das Auseinanderfahren substantieller Einheit in ihre abstrakte Gegenform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX5","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht bloß eine gleichgültige äußere Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX6","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht unmittelbar im Maaß gegeben, sondern nur durch die Aufhebung seiner Unmittelbarkeit erreichbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX7","text":"Quantitative Regelmäßigkeit ist nicht ohne Weiteres ein allgemeines Gesetz konkreter Natur oder des Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D1","text":"Das Maaß fungiert als vermittelte dritte Bestimmung, weil es Qualität und Quantität weder addiert noch gegeneinander isoliert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D2","text":"Die Nothwendigkeit ist die reflektiertere Gestalt des Maaßes, weil sie Bestimmtheit nicht als bloße Grenze, sondern als innere Verbindlichkeit fasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D3","text":"Der Übergang in das Wesen ist keine Flucht aus dem Maaß, sondern dessen Selbstvermittlung durch die Aufhebung seiner Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D4","text":"Das Maßlose entsteht aus der Selbständigkeit spezifischer Maße, weil ihre quantitative Verschiedenheit ihre scheinbare Unabhängigkeit in Übergang verwandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D5","text":"Die pantheistische Rückführung aller Bestimmtheit auf Substanz erzeugt nicht Versöhnung, sondern die Auslöschung der vermittelnden Differenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D6","text":"Die wissenschaftliche Bestimmung des Maaßes verlangt die Unterscheidung zwischen abstrakter Gesetzesform und konkreter Gegenstandsform.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD1","text":"Das Wesen wird als Resultat einer immanenten Negation konstruiert: Die Einheit von Qualität und Quantität erzeugt ihre Differenz, vermittelt sie und bestimmt sich dadurch als reflektierte Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD2","text":"Konkrete Wahrheit verlangt weder substanzielle Identität ohne Differenz noch isolierte Differenz ohne Rückkehr in Einheit, sondern die Erhaltung des Unterschieds im Vermittlungsprozess.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD3","text":"Die Reichweite quantitativer Erklärung nimmt mit dem Übergang von Mechanismus zu physischer, organischer und geistiger Konkretion ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD4","text":"Das Maaß bildet eine Schwelle zwischen der Logik des Seyns und der Logik des Wesens, weil es Unmittelbarkeit zugleich noch bewahrt und bereits als vermittelte setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine erste Substanz, die ihre Bestimmtheiten nur als vergängliche Akzidenzen trägt und deshalb keine immanente Selbstvermittlung besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Unterschied, der nur äußerlich bleibt und deshalb weder qualitative Wahrheit noch reflektierte Einheit erzeugen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit, die Differenz nur vernichtet, anstatt sie als Moment ihrer eigenen Konkretion zu bewahren.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass eine formale mathematische Bestimmung unmittelbar die konkrete Realität des Organischen oder Geistigen erkläre.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine endgültige Unmittelbarkeit, weil jede unmittelbare Einheit im Maaß bereits die Differenz enthält, die ihre Vermittlung erzwingt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist die Alternative zwischen unterschiedsloser Einheit und maßloser Zerstreuung, weil beide die Selbstbeziehung des Unterschieds verfehlen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine geistige Gesetzlichkeit des Maaßes, die sich analog zu mechanischen Verhältnissen formal bestimmen ließe.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbare Bestimmtheit → quantitative Gleichgültigkeit → Bestimmtheit-in-Anderem.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS2","text":"Äußerlichkeit-in-Anderem → Selbstbeziehung der Äußerlichkeit → Einheit von quantitativem und qualitativem Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS3","text":"Unmittelbares Maaß → qualitatives Quantum → Verhältnis spezifischer Quanta → Übergang der Maße → Maßlosigkeit als immanente Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A9","CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS4","text":"Maßlosigkeit → reale Indifferenz → umgekehrtes Verhältnis selbständiger Maße → Reflexion-in-sich → Wesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS5","text":"Abstrakte Maaßgesetzlichkeit → Mechanismus; Unterordnung des Maaßes unter höhere Verhältnisse → Physik und Organik; Ausfall eigentümlicher Maaßgesetze → Geist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF1","text":"Gleichgültigkeit von Quantität gegenüber Qualität → Selbstbezügliche Äußerlichkeit → Maaß als vermittelte Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF2","text":"Kritik des bloß äußerlichen Modus → Ausschluss abstrakter Substanz- und Pantheismuseinheit → Forderung der Bewahrung des Unterschieds.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF3","text":"Qualitatives Quantum → spezifische Maaßverhältnisse → Maßlosigkeit → Indifferenz → Wesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A9","CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11","CH_GB18_DADM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF4","text":"Logische Realisation des Maaßes → Differenzierung seiner Naturformen → Begrenzung seiner Geltung im Geistigen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME1","text":"Qualität und Quantität erscheinen nicht mehr als getrennte Kategorien, sondern als Momente einer Einheit, deren Wahrheit erst in ihrer Vermittlung besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME2","text":"Das Maßlose wird von einem bloßen Jenseits des Maaßes in dessen eigene negative Bewegungsform umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME3","text":"Pantheistische Substanz, spinozistischer Modus und wahre Einheit werden nicht nach ihrem Einheitsanspruch, sondern nach ihrem Umgang mit erhaltener Differenz unterschieden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME4","text":"Die Möglichkeit quantitativer Gesetzlichkeit wird nach Realitätsbereichen abgestuft und vom Mechanischen über das Organische bis zum Geistigen begrenzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Maaß wird als Einheit qualitativer und quantitativer Bestimmtheit expliziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Entwicklung des Maaßes verwandelt unmittelbare Momente in gesetzte Beziehungen und erzeugt dadurch den Übergang zum Wesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Historische Kategorien und Systeme dienen als negative Prüfmodelle für die Frage, ob Einheit Differenz vermittelt oder annulliert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit entsteht nicht als ursprüngliche ruhende Substanz, sondern als Prozess, in dem Unmittelbarkeit ihre eigene Negativität durchläuft und reflektierte Einheit wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT5","text":"Scientific-Regional — Die logische Form des Maaßes realisiert sich nicht einheitlich, sondern erhält je nach Mechanismus, Natur und Geist verschiedene Reichweite.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Qualität und Quantität über das Maaß zum Wesen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT2","text":"Die kritische Funktion der Abschnitte zu Kant, Spinoza und Pantheismus bleibt rekonstruierbar, weil sie durch den Ausschluss bloßer Äußerlichkeit und differenzloser Einheit bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie konkrete qualitative Gegenstände aus ihrer eigenen Begriffsform bestimmte quantitative Verhältnisse hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern der Unterschied zwischen an sich und gesetzt die Bewegung von unmittelbarer Einheit zu reflektierter Einheit trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Bestimmung des Maßlosen als immanenter Negativität des Maaßes statt als äußerlichem Gegenbegriff.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT6","text":"Eine Bruchlinie entsteht, weil die universale logische Entwicklung zum Wesen behauptet wird, während ihre konkrete Realisation außerhalb des Mechanismus zunehmend eingeschränkt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A11","CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung bleibt darin bestehen, dass die Forderung nach bewahrter Differenz gegen pantheistische Auflösung geltend gemacht wird, ohne dass ihr konkreter Vollzug hier über die logische Form des Maaßes hinaus ausgeführt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, wenn sie die historischen Vergleiche als negative Grenzbestimmungen und die Natur- und Geistpassagen als Reichweitenbestimmungen des Maaßes behandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114922583638Z_33569198","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Third Section. Measure.","source_sha256":"c82d7fa8b10f5c98ade5f31615a0a7b4a2874b9a61cf4d0ca9ca2b93ecf19fe8","sha256":"e166a555ad333f208043d507670f18d1c86780b1d1e86e9694c1c5a57c64f77b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:49:22.585680+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS1","text":"The text determines the problem as the mediation of qualitative determinacy and quantitative indifference, without dissolving the difference between the two into mere externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS2","text":"The text proceeds reconstructively-dialectically by determining Measure as the third, in which externality is related to itself and thereby sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS3","text":"The countermodels of modality, the Spinozistic mode, and pantheism are tested as to whether they preserve difference in a concrete unity or fall back into abstract substance or, respectively, measurelessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS4","text":"The development of Measure generates from immediate unity first qualitative quanta, then relations of specific quanta, finally indifference and the transition into Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS5","text":"Measure is determined as a form of mediation whose most abstract lawfulness can be fully realized in mechanism, whereas physical and organic relations subordinate it to higher determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AS6","text":"The movement does not end in a general mathematics of nature or spirit, because the spiritual possesses no peculiar free development of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A1","text":"Measure is the immediate unity of quality and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A2","text":"Quantity is self-equality indifferent to determinacy, whose determinacy lies only in an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A3","text":"Externality related to itself sublates its mere externality and contains difference as a quantitative and qualitative moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A4","text":"A mode that is only in an other and is comprehended through an other possesses no return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A5","text":"Measure is at once external more or less and determinacy that is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A6","text":"In Measure, qualitative determinacy becomes quantitative, and sublated indifference returns as qualitative being-in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A7","text":"Measure initially contains Essence only in itself or in the Concept, not as a posited reflected determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A8","text":"The development of Measure posits the distinction of its moments and their relation, by bringing forth their immediate identity as a mediated relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A9","text":"The first Measure is a quantum with qualitative significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A10","text":"Independent specific measures rest on quantitative relations and therefore essentially pass over into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A11","text":"The measureless is the negativity immanent to Measure and not its external opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A12","text":"The complete abstract indifference of developed Measure can be fully realized only in mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A13","text":"In the organic, Measure is subordinated to higher relations and reduced to the form of immediate relations of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:A14","text":"In the spiritual, no peculiar laws or free forms of Measure arise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX1","text":"Modality is not an objective determination of the object insofar as it expresses only the relation of the object to the faculty of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX2","text":"The Spinozistic mode is not the concrete mediation of substance and determinacy, but abstract externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX3","text":"Pantheistic unity is not concrete unity insofar as it lets determinacy vanish in the Absolute instead of sublating and preserving it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX4","text":"The measureless is not free infinity, but the divergence of substantial unity into its abstract counterform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX5","text":"Measure is not merely an indifferent external magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX6","text":"Essence is not immediately given in Measure, but is attainable only through the sublation of its immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:NX7","text":"Quantitative regularity is not without further qualification a universal law of concrete nature or spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D1","text":"Measure functions as a mediated third determination because it neither adds quality and quantity nor isolates them from one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D2","text":"Necessity is the more reflected shape of Measure, because it grasps determinacy not as a mere limit, but as inner bindingness.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D3","text":"The transition into Essence is not a flight from Measure, but its self-mediation through the sublation of its immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D4","text":"The measureless arises from the independence of specific measures, because their quantitative diversity transforms their apparent independence into transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D5","text":"The pantheistic reduction of all determinacy to substance produces not reconciliation, but the extinguishing of mediating difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:D6","text":"The scientific determination of Measure requires the distinction between abstract form of law and concrete form of object.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD1","text":"Essence is constructed as the result of an immanent negation: the unity of quality and quantity generates its difference, mediates it, and thereby determines itself as reflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD2","text":"Concrete truth requires neither substantial identity without difference nor isolated difference without return into unity, but the preservation of difference in the process of mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD3","text":"The scope of quantitative explanation decreases with the transition from mechanism to physical, organic, and spiritual concretion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SD4","text":"Measure forms a threshold between the logic of Being and the logic of Essence, because it at once still preserves immediacy and already posits it as mediated.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a first substance that bears its determinacies only as transitory accidents and therefore possesses no immanent self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a difference that remains merely external and therefore can produce neither qualitative truth nor reflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a unity that merely annihilates difference instead of preserving it as a moment of its own concretion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that a formal mathematical determination immediately explains the concrete reality of the organic or spiritual.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final immediacy, because every immediate unity in Measure already contains the difference that compels its mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is the alternative between undifferentiated unity and measureless dispersion, because both miss the self-relation of difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a spiritual lawfulness of Measure that could be formally determined analogously to mechanical relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS1","text":"Immediate determinacy → quantitative indifference → determinacy-in-an-other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS2","text":"Externality-in-an-other → self-relation of externality → unity of quantitative and qualitative moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS3","text":"Immediate Measure → qualitative quantum → relation of specific quanta → transition of measures → measurelessness as immanent negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A9","CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS4","text":"Measurelessness → real indifference → inverse relation of independent measures → reflection-into-self → Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:FGS5","text":"Abstract lawfulness of Measure → mechanism; subordination of Measure to higher relations → physics and organic nature; failure of peculiar laws of Measure → spirit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF1","text":"Indifference of quantity toward quality → self-related externality → Measure as mediated unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A2","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF2","text":"Critique of the merely external mode → exclusion of abstract substance-unity and pantheistic unity → demand for the preservation of difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF3","text":"Qualitative quantum → specific relations of Measure → measurelessness → indifference → Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A9","CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11","CH_GB18_DADM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:AF4","text":"Logical realization of Measure → differentiation of its forms in nature → limitation of its validity in the spiritual.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME1","text":"Quality and quantity no longer appear as separate categories, but as moments of a unity whose truth consists only in their mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME2","text":"The measureless is reclassified from a mere beyond of Measure into its own negative form of movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME3","text":"Pantheistic substance, the Spinozistic mode, and true unity are distinguished not according to their claim to unity, but according to their treatment of preserved difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ME4","text":"The possibility of quantitative lawfulness is graded according to domains of reality and limited from the mechanical through the organic to the spiritual.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Measure is explicated as the unity of qualitative and quantitative determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT2","text":"Structural — The development of Measure transforms immediate moments into posited relations and thereby generates the transition to Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Historical categories and systems serve as negative test models for the question whether unity mediates or annuls difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth arises not as an original resting substance, but as a process in which immediacy traverses its own negativity and becomes reflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:ALT5","text":"Scientific-Regional — The logical form of Measure is not realized uniformly, but receives different scope according to mechanism, nature, and spirit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from quality and quantity through Measure to Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A1","CH_GB18_DADM:A6","CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT2","text":"The critical function of the sections on Kant, Spinoza, and pantheism remains reconstructible because it is determined by the exclusion of mere externality and undifferentiated unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A3","CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how concrete qualitative objects bring forth determinate quantitative relations from their own conceptual form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the distinction between in itself and posited bears the movement from immediate unity to reflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A7","CH_GB18_DADM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the determination of the measureless as immanent negativity of Measure rather than as an external counterconcept.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A10","CH_GB18_DADM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT6","text":"A line of rupture arises because the universal logical development toward Essence is asserted, while its concrete realization outside mechanism is increasingly restricted.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A11","CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT7","text":"A further tension remains in the fact that the demand for preserved difference is asserted against pantheistic dissolution, without its concrete execution here being elaborated beyond the logical form of Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A5","CH_GB18_DADM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DADM:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text if it treats the historical comparisons as negative boundary determinations and the passages on nature and spirit as determinations of the scope of Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DADM:A4","CH_GB18_DADM:A12","CH_GB18_DADM:A13","CH_GB18_DADM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DADM:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DADM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DADM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 80","title":"Third Section. Measure.","context":"Chapter 80","original_title":"Dritter Abschnitt. Das Maaß."},"original_title":"Dritter Abschnitt. Das Maaß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0","layer":"CH","title":"A. Specific Quantum.","order":81,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DSQ0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DSQ0@R001","sha256":"b07fd6129b78858e21f33b8128109fb1a36eec9fe4d599e91e302226593cca4e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die scheinbare Gleichgültigkeit quantitativer Veränderung mit dem qualitativen Untergang eines Daseins zu vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS2","text":"Das Maß bestimmt Quantum als immanente Bestimmtheit eines Daseins und damit als Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS3","text":"Die Größe eines Seienden zerfällt in eine spezifische, seine Natur tragende Größe und eine äußerliche, innerhalb einer Grenze veränderliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS4","text":"Der Text verfährt diagnostisch-rekonstruktiv, indem er die quantitative Betrachtung als abstrakte Teilwahrheit ausweist, deren einseitige Festhaltung den qualitativen Umschlag verfehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt vom unmittelbaren Maß über die Doppelheit von spezifischem und äußerlichem Quantum zur Aufhebung quantitativer Gleichgültigkeit im qualitativen Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","text":"Jedes Dasein besitzt eine Größe, die zu seiner bestimmten Natur und seinem Insichsein gehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","text":"Quantum ist als Maß keine gleichgültige Grenze, sondern die auf sich bezogene Äußerlichkeit eines bestimmten Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","text":"Das unmittelbare Maß enthält zugleich eine an sich bestimmte Größe und ein äußerliches, veränderliches Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","text":"Veränderungen des äußerlichen Quantums können erfolgen, ohne die Qualität unmittelbar zu verändern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","text":"Wird die dem Dasein immanente Größenbestimmung überschritten oder unterschritten, verändert sich seine Qualität oder es geht zugrunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6","text":"Wiederholte, einzeln unbedeutende quantitative Veränderungen summieren sich zu einer Größe, die das qualitative Ganze bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7","text":"Der qualitative Übergang ist nicht durch bloße Allmählichkeit erklärt, weil er einen Übergang von Dasein zu Nichtdasein oder von einer Qualität zu einer anderen einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8","text":"Ein allgemeiner Maßstab ist für besondere Dinge nur ein äußerliches Vergleichungsmittel und begründet nicht ihre ursprünglichen Maße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX1","text":"Maß ist nicht ein beliebig gesetzter Maßstab für äußere Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX2","text":"Quantum ist nicht schlechthin eine gleichgültige und folgenlose Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX3","text":"Qualitative Veränderung ist nicht auf eine bloße Vermehrung oder Verminderung reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX4","text":"Der Widerspruch der Sorites-Figuren ist keine sophistische Täuschung, sondern die Widerlegung einer abstrakten Quantumsauffassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX5","text":"Ein natürlicher universeller Maßstab ist nicht der Grund, aus dem die Maße besonderer Dinge als bloße Spezifikationen ableitbar wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D1","text":"Das Maß erzeugt eine begrenzte Zone quantitativer Variabilität: Innerhalb dieser Zone bleibt das Dasein dasselbe, an ihrer Grenze wird die Variation qualitativ wirksam.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D2","text":"Die Sorites-Verlegenheit entsteht, weil jede Einzeländerung isoliert als gleichgültig behandelt wird, obwohl ihre Wiederholung die Qualität des Ganzen betrifft.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D3","text":"Die quantitative Betrachtung ist nur als Moment des Maßes wahr; als selbständige Erklärung des Übergangs wird sie falsch.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D4","text":"Der Untergang eines Seienden erscheint zugleich unerwartet und verständlich: unerwartet wegen der vorausgesetzten Gleichgültigkeit einzelner Änderungen, verständlich wegen ihrer kumulativen Grenzwirkung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D5","text":"Ein äußerlicher Maßstab ermöglicht Vergleichung, kann aber die spezifische Größenbestimmung eines besonderen Daseins weder erzeugen noch aus ihr abgeleitet werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD1","text":"Das Maß bildet die Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskontinuität: Quantität kann sich kontinuierlich ändern, aber ihre Fortsetzung erzeugt einen qualitativen Bruch.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD2","text":"Dasjenige, was ein Dasein zunächst unverdächtig verändert, ist zugleich die Seite, an der seine Zerstörung vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD3","text":"Quantitative Abstraktion ist nicht einfach falsch, sondern wird erst durch ihre Loslösung von der qualitativen Bestimmtheit falsch.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD4","text":"Die Einheit des Allgemeinen liegt bei äußerem Messen nur in Übereinkunft; die Einheit eines besonderen Daseins liegt dagegen in seinem eigenen Maß.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, eine Qualität könne unabhängig von jeder bestimmten Größenordnung als unverändert bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die Wiederholung eines gleichartigen quantitativen Schritts bleibe ontologisch mit dem einzelnen Schritt identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die Natur besonderer Dinge lasse sich aus einem gemeinsamen äußeren Grundmaß deduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine unbegrenzte quantitative Steigerung oder Verminderung, innerhalb deren das Selbe notwendig dasselbe bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine rein äußerliche Beobachterposition, von der Quantität vollständig von qualitativer Wirklichkeit getrennt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX3","text":"Nicht zulässig ist die Erklärung qualitativen Werdens durch Addition allein; Addition muss als Wirksamkeit eines immanenten Maßes begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS1","text":"Dasein + zugehöriges Quantum → unmittelbares Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS2","text":"Unmittelbares Maß → Differenz von spezifischem Quantum und äußerlich variablem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Variation innerhalb der Maßgrenze → scheinbare quantitative Gleichgültigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS4","text":"Wiederholung äußerlicher Variation + Summation → Erreichen oder Überschreiten der spezifischen Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS5","text":"Überschreitung der spezifischen Grenze → qualitative Veränderung oder Untergang des bisherigen Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS6","text":"Äußerlicher Vergleichsmaßstab → konventionelle Allgemeinheit, nicht immanente Bestimmung besonderer Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF1","text":"Gleichgültiges Quantum → immanentes Maß → Doppelheit von spezifischer und äußerlicher Größe → begrenzte Variabilität → qualitativer Umschlag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF2","text":"Erfahrung gradueller Änderung → isolierte Betrachtung des Einzelschritts → Wiederholung und Summation → Widerlegung der Gleichgültigkeitsannahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF3","text":"Allgemeiner Maßstab → äußerliche Vergleichung → Trennung von ursprünglichem Maß und Konvention → Unmöglichkeit einer Ableitung besonderer Naturmaße aus einem Grundmaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME1","text":"Größe wird von einem bloß vergleichbaren Prädikat zu einer konstitutiven Bestimmtheit des Daseins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen gradueller und sprunghafter Veränderung wird als Einheit von quantitativer Akkumulation und qualitativem Übergang neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen natürlichem Maß und konventionellem Maßstab wird in immanente Bestimmung einerseits und äußere Vergleichung andererseits zerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME4","text":"Zerstörung wird nicht mehr als ausschließlich äußerer Angriff sichtbar, sondern als immanent vermittelte Folge einer zunächst indifferent erscheinenden Veränderungsseite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist das spezifische Quantum als unmittelbare Gestalt des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Maß strukturiert ein Dasein durch die Differenz von tragender Größenbestimmung und äußerlich beweglicher Größenbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text entzieht der isolierten Quantifizierung ihren Erklärungsanspruch, indem er sie als abstraktes Moment einer Maßrelation bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Werden eines Anderen erfolgt als zeitliche Wiederholung quantitativer Veränderung, deren Resultat die bisherige Qualität aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundbewegung vom Quantum als Gleichgültigkeit zum Quantum als Maß zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch für ein einzelnes Dasein die konkrete Grenze seines spezifischen Quantums bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur bleibt darauf angewiesen, dass Summation einen qualitativen Umschlag bewirkt, ohne den Vermittlungsmechanismus dieser Wirksamkeit weiter auszuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste interne Operation liegt in der Trennung zwischen der legitimen Beschreibung quantitativer Variation und ihrer unzulässigen Verabsolutierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung verbleibt zwischen der Zulassung kontinuierlicher Veränderung und dem qualitativen Bruch, dessen notwendige Grenze behauptet, aber noch nicht konkret bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern Maß als Einheit von Quantität und Qualität und nicht als äußerer Standard verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115600965274Z_7f5f6b35","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The specific Quantum.","source_sha256":"b07fd6129b78858e21f33b8128109fb1a36eec9fe4d599e91e302226593cca4e","sha256":"60f0532bf769f1a553bd450b6b80d4fb82873593462f6010057c30ee01693d6a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:56:00.966966+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in mediating the apparent indifference of quantitative alteration with the qualitative destruction of a determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS2","text":"Measure determines Quantum as the immanent determinacy of a determinate being and thereby as quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS3","text":"The magnitude of a being divides into a specific magnitude that sustains its nature and an external magnitude variable within a limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS4","text":"The text proceeds diagnostically and reconstructively by identifying quantitative consideration as an abstract partial truth, whose one-sided retention misses the qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AS5","text":"The movement leads from immediate measure through the duality of specific and external Quantum to the sublation of quantitative indifference in qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","text":"Every determinate being possesses a magnitude belonging to its determinate nature and its being-within-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","text":"As measure, Quantum is not an indifferent limit, but the self-related externality of a determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","text":"Immediate measure contains at once a magnitude determined in itself and an external, alterable Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","text":"Alterations of the external Quantum can occur without immediately altering quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","text":"If the magnitude-determinacy immanent to determinate being is exceeded or falls short of, its quality changes or it perishes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6","text":"Repeated, individually insignificant quantitative alterations accumulate into a magnitude that determines the qualitative whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7","text":"Qualitative transition is not explained by mere gradualness, because it includes a transition from determinate being to non-being or from one quality to another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8","text":"A universal standard of measure is, for particular things, only an external means of comparison and does not ground their original measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX1","text":"Measure is not an arbitrarily posited standard for external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX2","text":"Quantum is not simply an indifferent and consequence-free limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX3","text":"Qualitative alteration is not reducible to a mere increase or decrease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX4","text":"The contradiction of the Sorites figures is not a sophistical deception, but the refutation of an abstract conception of Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:NX5","text":"A natural universal standard of measure is not the ground from which the measures of particular things could be derived as mere specifications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D1","text":"Measure produces a limited zone of quantitative variability: within this zone, determinate being remains the same; at its limit, variation becomes qualitatively effective.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D2","text":"The Sorites difficulty arises because every individual alteration is treated in isolation as indifferent, although its repetition concerns the quality of the whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D3","text":"Quantitative consideration is true only as a moment of measure; as an independent explanation of transition, it becomes false.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D4","text":"The destruction of a being appears at once unexpected and intelligible: unexpected because of the presupposed indifference of individual alterations, intelligible because of their cumulative limiting effect.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:D5","text":"An external standard of measure enables comparison, but can neither produce the specific magnitude-determinacy of a particular determinate being nor be derived from it.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD1","text":"Measure forms the unity of continuity and discontinuity: quantity can alter continuously, but its continuation produces a qualitative break.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD2","text":"That which initially alters a determinate being unobtrusively is at the same time the side through which its destruction is mediated.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A4","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A5","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD3","text":"Quantitative abstraction is not simply false, but becomes false only through its detachment from qualitative determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A3","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SD4","text":"In external measuring, the unity of the universal lies only in agreement; the unity of a particular determinate being, by contrast, lies in its own measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSQ0:A1","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A2","CH_GB18_DSQ0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that a quality could subsist unchanged independently of every determinate order of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the repetition of a homogeneous quantitative step remains ontologically identical with the individual step.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the nature of particular things can be deduced from a common external basic measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an unlimited quantitative increase or decrease within which the same would necessarily remain the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a purely external observer position from which quantity could be completely separated from qualitative actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:SNX3","text":"Not permissible is the explanation of qualitative becoming by addition alone; addition must be comprehended as the efficacy of an immanent measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS1","text":"Determinate being + associated Quantum → immediate measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS2","text":"Immediate measure → difference between specific Quantum and externally variable Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS3","text":"External variation within the limit of measure → apparent quantitative indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS4","text":"Repetition of external variation + summation → attainment or transgression of the specific limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS5","text":"Transgression of the specific limit → qualitative alteration or destruction of the previous determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:FGS6","text":"External comparative standard → conventional universality, not immanent determinacy of particular things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF1","text":"Indifferent Quantum → immanent measure → duality of specific and external magnitude → limited variability → qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF2","text":"Experience of gradual alteration → isolated consideration of the individual step → repetition and summation → refutation of the assumption of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:AF3","text":"Universal standard of measure → external comparison → separation of original measure and convention → impossibility of deriving particular natural measures from a basic measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME1","text":"Magnitude is reclassified from a merely comparable predicate into a constitutive determinacy of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME2","text":"The opposition between gradual and abrupt alteration is reordered as the unity of quantitative accumulation and qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME3","text":"The opposition between natural measure and conventional standard is divided into immanent determinacy on the one hand and external comparison on the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ME4","text":"Destruction is no longer visible as an exclusively external attack, but as an immanently mediated consequence of a side of alteration that initially appears indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit object is the specific Quantum as the immediate shape of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Measure structures a determinate being through the difference between sustaining magnitude-determinacy and externally movable magnitude-determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text deprives isolated quantification of its explanatory claim by determining it as an abstract moment of a relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The becoming of an other occurs as the temporal repetition of quantitative alteration, whose result sublates the previous quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from Quantum as indifference to Quantum as measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what determines, for an individual determinate being, the concrete limit of its specific Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT3","text":"The structure remains dependent on summation effecting a qualitative transition, without further elaborating the mediating mechanism of this efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT4","text":"The strongest internal operation lies in the separation between the legitimate description of quantitative variation and its inadmissible absolutization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the admission of continuous alteration and the qualitative break, whose necessary limit is asserted but not yet concretely determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSQ0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as measure is understood as the unity of quantity and quality and not as an external standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSQ0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DSQ0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DSQ0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 81","title":"A. Specific Quantum.","context":"Chapter 81","original_title":"A. Das specifische Quantum."},"original_title":"A. Das specifische Quantum.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0","layer":"CH","title":"B. Specifying Measure.","order":82,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BSM0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BSM0@R001","sha256":"b03033ccf9951abb0f010e75d257dde6ba4516818e3d17f4cfe2dc4f79ba96ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Maaß gegen das bloße Quantum zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS2","text":"Das Maaß wird zunächst als äußerliche Regel gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS3","text":"Diese Regel geht in eine specifische Quantität über, welche das äußerliche Quantum bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS4","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Maaßes treten anschließend als qualitative Seiten derselben specifischen Quantitätsbestimmtheit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS5","text":"Die Beziehung dieser Seiten erzeugt die Einheit eines Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung verläuft von äußerer Maßregel über quantitative Bestimmung zur qualitativen Einheit beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A1","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht mit dem bloßen Quantum identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A2","text":"Das Maaß enthält eine äußerliche Regel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","text":"Das Maaß enthält eine specifische Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A4","text":"Die specifische Quantität bestimmt das äußerliche Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Maaßes stehen einander als Qualitäten gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A6","text":"Diese Qualitäten sind Bestimmungen einer specifischen Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A7","text":"Die beiden Seiten verhalten sich als ein Maaß zueinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A8","text":"Die drei Bestimmungen gehören derselben Einheit an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX1","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht bloßes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX2","text":"Die äußerliche Regel ist nicht die vollständige Bestimmung des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX3","text":"Die specifische Quantität ist nicht ein vom äußerlichen Quantum unabhängiges Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX4","text":"Die beiden Seiten sind nicht bloß quantitative Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX5","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht die bloße Addition getrennter Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D1","text":"Das äußerliche Quantum erhält seinen Maßcharakter erst durch die Bestimmung einer specifischen Quantität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A1","CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","CH_GB18_BSM0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D2","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmung wird in eine qualitative Bestimmung überführt, sobald sie die Seiten des Maaßes bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A4","CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","CH_GB18_BSM0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D3","text":"Die äußere Regel und die specifische Quantität werden als Momente einer gemeinsamen Maßbestimmung lesbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A2","CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","CH_GB18_BSM0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D4","text":"Das Maaß entsteht als relationale Einheit der beiden qualitativ bestimmten Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","CH_GB18_BSM0:A6","CH_GB18_BSM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD1","text":"Das Maaß ist eine Einheit, in der äußerliche Quantität und innere specifische Bestimmung wechselseitig aufeinander bezogen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD2","text":"Quantität fungiert im Maaß nicht als selbständige Größe, sondern als Träger qualitativer Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD3","text":"Die Identität des Maaßes besteht in der Vermittlung von Regel, bestimmender Quantität und qualitativer Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD4","text":"Die Maßbestimmung verschiebt den Gegensatz von äußerlicher Größe und innerer Bestimmung in eine gegliederte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX1","text":"Die Existenz des Maaßes hängt davon ab, dass Quantität nicht als vollständig selbständige Bestimmung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem eine äußere Regel ohne specifische Quantität Maßcharakter besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung zwischen der bestimmenden Quantität und dem bestimmten äußeren Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Maßrelation, deren Seiten ohne qualitative Bestimmtheit gegeneinanderstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX1","text":"Eine maßlose reine Quantität ist als abschließende Bestimmung nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX2","text":"Eine äußerliche Norm ohne innere quantitative Spezifikation kann nicht als vollständiges Maaß gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX3","text":"Die Möglichkeit, die Maßseiten als voneinander unabhängige Größen zu behandeln, wird strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX4","text":"Das Maaß setzt die Unmöglichkeit einer bloß äußerlichen Identität von Regel und Quantum voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS1","text":"Äußerliches Quantum → äußerliche Regel → Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS2","text":"Maßbestimmung → specifische Quantität → Bestimmung des äußerlichen Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS3","text":"Specifische Quantitätsbestimmung → qualitative Differenz beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS4","text":"Qualitative Seiten → relationale Einheit → ein Maaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS5","text":"Regel + bestimmende Quantität + qualitative Relation → Einheit des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AF1","text":"Bloßes Quantum → äußerliche Regel → specifische Quantität → Bestimmung des äußerlichen Quantums → qualitative Seiten → relationale Einheit als ein Maaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME1","text":"Das Quantum wird vom selbständigen Ausgangspunkt zur äußerlich bestimmten Seite eines Maaßes umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME2","text":"Die specifische Quantität wird als vermittelnde Bestimmung zwischen Regel und Quantum sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Quantität und Qualität wird als Verhältnis zweier Seiten derselben Maßbestimmung neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME4","text":"Die Einheit des Maaßes erscheint nicht als vorausgesetzte Gleichheit, sondern als Resultat der Beziehung seiner Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Maaß wird gegen das bloße Quantum als Regel und specifische Quantität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Maaß organisiert ein Bestimmungsverhältnis zwischen äußerlichem Quantum und specifischer Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Maßbestimmung ersetzt die isolierte Betrachtung einzelner Größen durch die Analyse ihrer qualitativen Relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identität erscheint als gegliederte Einheit verschiedener Bestimmungen, nicht als unmittelbare Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome A1 bis A8 reichen aus, um die dreifache Bestimmung des Maaßes zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die äußerliche Regel konkret beschaffen ist und wodurch die specifische Quantität näher bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die drei Bestimmungen als Momente einer Einheit gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der gerichteten Überführung von Quantum in qualitative Maßrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass das Maaß äußerlich beginnt, seine Einheit jedoch erst durch die relationale qualitative Bestimmung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Regel über specifische Quantität zur Einheit eines Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113719542796Z_ce4775de","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Specifying Measure.","source_sha256":"b03033ccf9951abb0f010e75d257dde6ba4516818e3d17f4cfe2dc4f79ba96ff","sha256":"0603e4cb0c96740b191f2ed266f44f4240f53db39aa377bf52aa706a834a6185","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:37:19.544232+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining Measure as against mere Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS2","text":"Measure is initially conceived as an external rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS3","text":"This rule passes over into a specific Quantity, which determines the external Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS4","text":"The determinations of Measure subsequently emerge as qualitative sides of the same specific quantitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS5","text":"The relation of these sides produces the unity of a Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument proceeds from external measure-rule through quantitative determination to the qualitative unity of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A1","text":"Measure is not identical with mere Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A2","text":"Measure contains an external rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","text":"Measure contains a specific Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A4","text":"The specific Quantity determines the external Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","text":"The determinations of Measure confront one another as qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A6","text":"These qualities are determinations of a specific Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A7","text":"The two sides are related to one another as one Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:A8","text":"The three determinations belong to the same unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX1","text":"Measure is not mere Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX2","text":"The external rule is not the complete determination of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX3","text":"The specific Quantity is not a Quantity independent of the external Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX4","text":"The two sides are not merely quantitative magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:NX5","text":"Measure is not the mere addition of separate determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D1","text":"The external Quantity acquires its character as Measure only through the determination of a specific Quantity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A1","CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","CH_GB18_BSM0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D2","text":"Quantitative determination is transformed into qualitative determination as soon as it determines the sides of Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A4","CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","CH_GB18_BSM0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D3","text":"The external rule and the specific Quantity become legible as moments of a common measure-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A2","CH_GB18_BSM0:A3","CH_GB18_BSM0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:D4","text":"Measure arises as the relational unity of the two qualitatively determined sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_BSM0:A5","CH_GB18_BSM0:A6","CH_GB18_BSM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD1","text":"Measure is a unity in which external Quantity and inner specific determination are reciprocally related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD2","text":"In Measure, Quantity functions not as an independent magnitude, but as the bearer of qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD3","text":"The identity of Measure consists in the mediation of rule, determining Quantity, and qualitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SD4","text":"Measure-determination shifts the opposition of external magnitude and inner determination into an articulated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX1","text":"The existence of Measure depends on Quantity not being regarded as a completely independent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which an external rule possesses the character of Measure without specific Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a separation between the determining Quantity and the determined external Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a measure-relation whose sides confront one another without qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX1","text":"A measureless pure Quantity is not available as a final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX2","text":"An external norm without inner quantitative specification cannot count as a complete Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX3","text":"The possibility of treating the sides of Measure as magnitudes independent of one another is structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:SNX4","text":"Measure presupposes the impossibility of a merely external identity of rule and Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS1","text":"External Quantity → external rule → measure-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS2","text":"Measure-determination → specific Quantity → determination of the external Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS3","text":"Specific quantitative determination → qualitative difference of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS4","text":"Qualitative sides → relational unity → one Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:FGS5","text":"Rule + determining Quantity + qualitative relation → unity of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:AF1","text":"Mere Quantity → external rule → specific Quantity → determination of the external Quantity → qualitative sides → relational unity as one Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME1","text":"Quantity is reclassified from the independent point of departure to the externally determined side of a Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME2","text":"Specific Quantity becomes visible as the mediating determination between rule and Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME3","text":"The opposition of Quantity and Quality is reordered as the relation of two sides of the same measure-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ME4","text":"The unity of Measure appears not as presupposed equality, but as the result of the relation of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Measure is determined, as against mere Quantity, as rule and specific Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Measure organizes a relation of determination between external Quantity and specific Quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Measure-determination replaces the isolated consideration of individual magnitudes with the analysis of their qualitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identity appears as an articulated unity of different determinations, not as immediate simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT1","text":"Axioms A1 through A8 suffice to reconstruct the threefold determination of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the external rule is concretely constituted and by what the specific Quantity is more closely determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that the three determinations are read as moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the directed transformation of Quantity into qualitative measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that Measure begins externally, yet receives its unity only through relational qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BSM0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from rule through specific Quantity to the unity of a Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BSM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BSM0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BSM0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 82","title":"B. Specifying Measure.","context":"Chapter 82","original_title":"B. Specificirendes Maaß."},"original_title":"B. Specificirendes Maaß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER","layer":"CH","title":"a. The Rule.","order":83,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DIER"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIER@R001","sha256":"ed110803c072a71d85b34da46bbf5862e5fa0732e2dee3b3556af0e3d5a29b75","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Verhältnis von Regel, Einheit und gemessenem Quantum zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS2","text":"Die Regel wird zunächst als bestimmte Einheit gefasst, gegen die ein eigenständig existierendes Quantum gemessen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS3","text":"Diese erste Bestimmung erscheint als äußerlicher Vergleich und macht die Einheit selbst willkürlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS4","text":"Die Möglichkeit, die Einheit wiederum als Anzahl kleinerer Einheiten zu bestimmen, relativiert ihre scheinbare Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS5","text":"Die Regel wird zur spezifischen Größe, sobald sie sich an sich selbst auf ihr Anderes, das Quantum, bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A1","text":"Eine Regel ist zunächst eine an sich bestimmte Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A2","text":"Die Regel besteht als Einheit gegenüber einem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A3","text":"Das Quantum besitzt eine besondere Existenz an einem von der Regel verschiedenen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A4","text":"Messen bestimmt das Quantum als Anzahl der Einheiten der Regel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A5","text":"Die anfängliche Vergleichung von Regel und Quantum ist ein äußerliches Tun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A6","text":"Die als Einheit gesetzte Größe ist willkürlich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A7","text":"Jede Einheit kann selbst wieder als Anzahl anderer Einheiten bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A8","text":"Das Maß ist nicht auf die Funktion einer äußerlichen Regel beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A9","text":"Das spezifische Maß verhält sich an sich selbst zu seinem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A10","text":"Das Andere des spezifischen Maßes ist ein Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX1","text":"Das Maß ist nicht ausschließlich eine äußerliche Vergleichsregel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX2","text":"Die Einheit ist keine absolut selbstständige Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX3","text":"Die Einheit ist nicht von jeder weiteren Quantifizierung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX4","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht bloß unabhängig von der Regel gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX5","text":"Die Bestimmung des Maßes erschöpft sich nicht in einer äußerlich vollzogenen Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D1","text":"Weil das Quantum als Anzahl der Einheiten bestimmt wird, entsteht seine Messbestimmung durch die Beziehung auf die Regel.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D2","text":"Weil die Einheit selbst als Anzahl gesetzt werden kann, ist ihre Bestimmtheit relativ und weiter zerlegbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A6","CH_GB18_DIER:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D3","text":"Die äußerliche Messung setzt Regel und Quantum zunächst als getrennte Größen voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A3","CH_GB18_DIER:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D4","text":"Die spezifische Bestimmung des Maßes entsteht durch die Überführung der äußerlichen Vergleichung in ein Verhältnis der Regel zu ihrem eigenen Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A8","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D5","text":"Das Quantum ist im spezifischen Maß nicht bloß ein äußerer Gegenstand, sondern die bestimmte Form seines Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A9","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD1","text":"Die anfängliche Willkür der Einheit wird durch ihre interne Beziehung zum Quantum in eine strukturierte Bestimmtheit überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A6","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD2","text":"Das Maß verbindet qualitative Einheit und quantitative Vielheit, indem die Einheit als Anzahl und das Quantum als ihr Anderes bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A4","CH_GB18_DIER:A7","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD3","text":"Die äußerliche Messoperation erweist sich als unzureichende Anfangsform eines Verhältnisses, das erst im spezifischen Maß an sich selbst bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A8","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD4","text":"Die Regel gewinnt ihre Spezifizität nicht durch eine isolierte Einheit, sondern durch die organisierte Beziehung zu dem Quantum, das ihr gegenübersteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A1","CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A9","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Vorstellung aus, eine Maßeinheit besitze ihre Bestimmtheit unabhängig von jeder Relation zu einem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Vorstellung aus, Messung sei nur die neutrale Anwendung einer bereits vollständig bestimmten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, qualitative Einheit und quantitative Vielheit seien getrennte und äußerlich verbundene Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt die Möglichkeit aus, die Willkür der Einheit als letzte Bestimmung des Maßes anzuerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Wirklichkeit des Maßes, in der Regel und Quantum ohne innere Vermittlung nebeneinanderstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Quantität ohne qualitative Einheit sowie eine reine Einheit ohne quantitative Entäußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Trennung zwischen der Setzung einer Einheit und ihrer Bestimmung durch das, worauf sie angewandt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS1","text":"Bestimmte Einheit → gegenüberstehendes Quantum → äußerliche Vergleichung → numerische Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS2","text":"Willkürliche Einheit → erneute Zerlegbarkeit in Einheiten → Relativierung der unmittelbaren Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Regel → Bezug auf ihr eigenes Anderes → spezifisches Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS4","text":"Einheit als qualitative Setzung + Quantum als quantitative Andersheit → Maß als in sich vermitteltes Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AF1","text":"An sich bestimmte Einheit → äußerlich gegebenes Quantum → Messung als Anzahl → Relativierung der Einheit → Selbstbezug der Regel auf ihr Anderes → spezifisches Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME1","text":"Die Karte verschiebt das Maß von einer äußeren Vergleichsoperation zu einem inneren Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME2","text":"Die Einheit wird von einer isolierten Größe zu einer selbst wieder quantifizierbaren Bestimmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Regel und Quantum wird als Verhältnis von Einheit und ihrem eigenen Anderen neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME4","text":"Die scheinbare Willkür der Maßeinheit wird als Moment einer weiter bestimmbaren Maßstruktur sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Eine Einheit wird zur Bestimmung eines Quantums verwendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Messung vermittelt Regel und Quantum zunächst äußerlich und führt sie anschließend in ein internes Verhältnis über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die anfängliche Bestimmung wird nicht verworfen, sondern als unzureichende Form in eine spezifischere Bestimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Einheit und Quantum sind nicht starre Seiendes, sondern Momente eines sich bestimmenden Maßverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von äußerlicher Messung zu spezifischem Maß zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie genau das „an sich selbst“ vermittelte Verhältnis formal weiterentwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die anfängliche Äußerlichkeit als notwendige Ausgangsform und nicht als Endbestimmung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Relativierung der Einheit durch ihre eigene erneute Quantifizierbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung bleibt zwischen der willkürlichen Setzung der Einheit und ihrer behaupteten inneren Spezifikation bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung von äußerlicher Vergleichung zu innerer Maßbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115414868221Z_3a74b89a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The Rule.","source_sha256":"ed110803c072a71d85b34da46bbf5862e5fa0732e2dee3b3556af0e3d5a29b75","sha256":"2e4b8f1c72945eb4d6751140ee66305150036df054dbb113dc6bdc97c86c4b50","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:54:14.870241+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the relation of rule, unit, and measured quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS2","text":"The rule is initially conceived as a determinate unit against which an independently existing quantum is measured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS3","text":"This first determination appears as an external comparison and renders the unit itself arbitrary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS4","text":"The possibility of in turn determining the unit as a number of smaller units relativizes its apparent independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AS5","text":"The rule becomes specific magnitude as soon as it relates itself in itself to its other, the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A1","text":"A rule is initially a magnitude determinate in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A2","text":"The rule subsists as a unit vis-à-vis a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A3","text":"The quantum possesses a particular existence in a something distinct from the rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A4","text":"Measuring determines the quantum as the number of units of the rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A5","text":"The initial comparison of rule and quantum is an external act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A6","text":"The magnitude posited as unit is arbitrarily determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A7","text":"Every unit can itself again be determined as a number of other units.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A8","text":"Measure is not restricted to the function of an external rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A9","text":"Specific measure relates itself in itself to its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:A10","text":"The other of specific measure is a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX1","text":"Measure is not exclusively an external rule of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX2","text":"The unit is not an absolutely independent magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX3","text":"The unit is not excluded from every further quantification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX4","text":"The quantum is not merely given independently of the rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:NX5","text":"The determination of measure is not exhausted in an externally performed comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D1","text":"Because the quantum is determined as a number of units, its determination by measurement arises through its relation to the rule.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D2","text":"Because the unit itself can be posited as a number, its determinacy is relative and further divisible.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A6","CH_GB18_DIER:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D3","text":"External measurement initially presupposes rule and quantum as separate magnitudes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A3","CH_GB18_DIER:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D4","text":"The specific determination of measure arises through the transformation of external comparison into a relation of the rule to its own other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A8","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:D5","text":"In specific measure, the quantum is not merely an external object, but the determinate form of its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A9","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD1","text":"The initial arbitrariness of the unit is transformed through its internal relation to the quantum into a structured determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A6","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD2","text":"Measure connects qualitative unity and quantitative multiplicity by determining the unit as number and the quantum as its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A4","CH_GB18_DIER:A7","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD3","text":"The external operation of measurement proves to be an inadequate initial form of a relation that is determined in itself only in specific measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A5","CH_GB18_DIER:A8","CH_GB18_DIER:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SD4","text":"The rule gains its specificity not through an isolated unit, but through the organized relation to the quantum that stands over against it.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIER:A1","CH_GB18_DIER:A2","CH_GB18_DIER:A9","CH_GB18_DIER:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the notion that a unit of measure possesses its determinacy independently of every relation to a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the notion that measuring is only the neutral application of an already completely determinate unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the assumption that qualitative unity and quantitative multiplicity are separate determinations connected externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility of recognizing the arbitrariness of the unit as the final determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a reality of measure in which rule and quantum stand alongside one another without inner mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX2","text":"Excluded are a pure quantity without qualitative unity and a pure unity without quantitative externalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the separation between the positing of a unit and its determination by that to which it is applied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS1","text":"Determinate unit → quantum standing over against it → external comparison → numerical determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS2","text":"Arbitrary unit → renewed divisibility into units → relativization of immediate independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS3","text":"External rule → relation to its own other → specific measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:FGS4","text":"Unit as qualitative positing + quantum as quantitative otherness → measure as a relation mediated within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:AF1","text":"Unit determinate in itself → externally given quantum → measurement as number → relativization of the unit → self-relation of the rule to its other → specific measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME1","text":"The map shifts measure from an external operation of comparison to an internal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME2","text":"The unit is reclassified from an isolated magnitude to a determination itself again quantifiable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME3","text":"The opposition of rule and quantum is reordered as the relation of unity and its own other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ME4","text":"The apparent arbitrariness of the unit of measure becomes visible as a moment of a measure-structure capable of further determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — A unit is used to determine a quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Measurement initially mediates rule and quantum externally and subsequently transfers them into an internal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The initial determination is not discarded, but transformed as an inadequate form into a more specific determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Unity and quantum are not rigid beings, but moments of a self-determining relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from external measurement to specific measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined exactly how the relation mediated “in itself” is formally developed further.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that the initial externality counts as a necessary initial form and not as the final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the relativization of the unit through its own renewed quantifiability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT5","text":"The central tension remains between the arbitrary positing of the unit and its asserted inner specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIER:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement from external comparison to an inner relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIER:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIER@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DIER:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 83","title":"a. The Rule.","context":"Chapter 83","original_title":"a. Die Regel."},"original_title":"a. Die Regel.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM","layer":"CH","title":"b. Specifying Measure.","order":84,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDSM"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDSM@R001","sha256":"bfdbe7d7f4bd6e9a41a1ddf9decda4ecb0788c040c605a5e0b8484869090cc19","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Maß nicht als bloße äußerliche Quantitätsbestimmung, sondern als qualitative Bestimmung äußerlicher Größe zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS2","text":"Die Neubestimmung setzt das Maß als immanente Qualität, die ein äußerlich gesetztes Quantum aufnimmt und spezifisch verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS3","text":"Die Grundlage dieser Bestimmung ist das Verhältnis zwischen äußerlichem Quantum und qualitativ bestimmtem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS4","text":"Der Beweisgang unterscheidet das Maß von Intensität und Extensität, weil dort dasselbe Quantum nur äußerlich anders erscheint, während es hier durch einen Verhältnisexponenten anders genommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt vom scheinbar fixen Quotienten zur Potenzbestimmung als immanentem qualitativen Prinzip des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS6","text":"Die Konsequenz ist eine qualitative Reaktion, durch die eine arithmetische Reihe des äußeren Quantums eine inkommensurable Potenzenreihe hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A1","text":"Das Maß ist die qualitative Bestimmung einer äußerlichen Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A2","text":"Das Maß setzt ein Quantum voraus, das als äußerliches und gleichgültiges Quantum verändert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","text":"Das Maß besitzt eine immanente Qualität, die dem äußerlich veränderten Quantum gegenübertritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A4","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmung des Maßes nimmt äußerliche Quantität nicht arithmetisch unverändert auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","text":"Die spezifisch aufgenommene Menge bleibt ein Quantum, ist aber nur als spezifisch bestimmtes Quantum verständlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A6","text":"Das Maß existiert als Verhältnis zwischen äußerlichem Quantum und qualitativ bestimmtem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A7","text":"Der Exponent des Verhältnisses bezeichnet nicht bloß ein fixes Quantum, sondern das qualitative Moment, das das Quantum spezifisch bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A8","text":"Die immanente qualitative Bestimmung des Quantums ist eine Potenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A9","text":"Das äußerliche Quantum verändert sich durch das numerische Eins in arithmetischer Progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A10","text":"Die qualitative Natur des Maßes erzeugt aus der arithmetischen Veränderung eine davon abhängige, aber nicht notwendig kommensurable Potenzenreihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A11","text":"Intensität und Extensität unterscheiden dasselbe zugrunde liegende Quantum nur durch eine äußerliche Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A12","text":"Im specificirenden Maß wird das Quantum durch den Verhältnisexponenten in einer anderen Anzahl genommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX1","text":"Das Maß ist nicht die bloße äußerliche Größe eines Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX2","text":"Die spezifisch aufgenommene Menge ist nicht ein Quantum als solches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX3","text":"Der Verhältnisexponent ist nicht lediglich ein fixes äußerliches Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX4","text":"Das Maß ist nicht auf die arithmetische Menge der äußerlich gesetzten Veränderung reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX5","text":"Die Differenz von Intensität und Extensität ist nicht bereits eine qualitative Veränderung des zugrunde liegenden Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX6","text":"Die Veränderung des äußerlichen Quantums besteht nicht nur im Hinzutreten numerischer Einheiten auf der Seite des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX7","text":"Das qualitative Prinzip des Maßes ist nicht durch einen gewöhnlichen Zahlexponenten erschöpfend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D1","text":"Das Maß verhält sich als Intensives gegenüber der äußerlich gesetzten extensiven Menge.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A2","CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","CH_GB18_BDSM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D2","text":"Die Reaktion des Maßes macht aus dem äußerlich gesetzten Quantum ein anderes Quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","CH_GB18_BDSM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D3","text":"Die spezifisch aufgenommene Menge ist veränderlich, weil sie von der äußerlichen Menge abhängt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","CH_GB18_BDSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D4","text":"Die spezifische Bestimmung des Maßes ist der Exponent seines Verhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A6","CH_GB18_BDSM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D5","text":"Die Maßbestimmung führt eine qualitative Differenz zwischen äußerlicher Beschaffenheit und an sich seiender Bestimmung ein.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A7","CH_GB18_BDSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D6","text":"Die arithmetische Progression des äußerlichen Quantums bildet nur die Ausgangsreihe für eine zweite, qualitativ bestimmte Reihe.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A9","CH_GB18_BDSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D7","text":"Die qualitative Reihe nimmt mit der äußerlichen Reihe zu und ab, folgt ihr aber nicht in einem durch einen Zahlquotienten festgelegten Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A8","CH_GB18_BDSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D8","text":"Die Unterscheidung des specificirenden Maßes liegt in der Weise der quantitativen Aufnahme, nicht in der bloßen Existenz eines weiteren Quantums.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","CH_GB18_BDSM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD1","text":"Das Maß vermittelt Quantität und Qualität, indem es äußerliche Veränderung in eine qualitative Selbstbestimmung des Quantums überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD2","text":"Die äußerliche Quantitätsreihe erhält ihre spezifische Form erst durch eine immanente Bestimmung, die nicht selbst als äußerliche Zahl erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD3","text":"Der Verhältnisbegriff des Maßes ersetzt die Identität von Intensität und Extensität durch eine Struktur, in der dasselbe Quantum qualitativ anders genommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD4","text":"Die quantitative Veränderung wird zur Erzeugungsbedingung einer qualitativ eigenständigen Reihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD5","text":"Die Maßbestimmung verschiebt die Erklärung von einer additiven Zahlenoperation zu einer Potenzstruktur, deren Verhältnis zur Ausgangsreihe inkommensurabel werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD6","text":"Das Maß erhält dadurch eine Form von Fürsichsein in der Äußerlichkeit: Es bleibt auf äußerliche Quantität bezogen, bestimmt diese aber nicht mehr passiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Qualität und Quantität in der Maßbestimmung voneinander unabhängig nebeneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass jede qualitative Bestimmung des Quantums als bloße numerische Relation angegeben werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Veränderung des Maßes durch dieselbe additive Gesetzmäßigkeit erklärt wird wie die Veränderung des äußerlichen Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass der Exponent eines Verhältnisses vollständig durch seinen numerischen Quotienten bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Differenz von Intensität und Extensität bereits die eigentliche qualitative Spezifikation des Quantums bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass äußerliche Abhängigkeit die qualitative Eigenständigkeit des Maßes aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines vollständig indifferenten, selbständigen Quantums ist ausgeschlossen, weil jedes Quantum im Maß durch eine qualitative Bestimmung vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit, qualitative Gesetzlichkeit auf eine kommensurable Zahlenordnung zu reduzieren, wird als unzureichend behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX3","text":"Eine äußerliche Welt bloßer Mengen, in der Veränderung nur Addition oder Subtraktion bedeutet, bleibt als Erklärungsmodell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX4","text":"Die Trennung von immanenter Bestimmung und äußerlicher Erscheinung wird nicht als endgültige Zweiheit zugelassen, sondern als Verhältnisstruktur aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS1","text":"Äußerliches Quantum → Veränderbarkeit des Quantums → Auftreten einer immanenten Maßqualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS2","text":"Immanente Maßqualität + äußerliches Quantum → spezifische Aufnahme der äußerlichen Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS3","text":"Spezifische Aufnahme → Verhältnis von äußerlichem Quantum und qualitativ bestimmtem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS4","text":"Verhältnis → scheinbarer fixer Quotient → Rücknahme des Quotienten in die qualitative Potenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS5","text":"Numerisches Eins → arithmetische Progression des äußerlichen Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS6","text":"Potenzbestimmung → qualitative Reaktion auf die arithmetische Progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS7","text":"Qualitative Reaktion + arithmetische Reihe → abhängige, nicht notwendig kommensurable Potenzenreihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS8","text":"Zwei Reihen mit ungleicher Gesetzlichkeit → Bestimmung des Maßes als Fürsichsein in der Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF1","text":"Äußerliche, gleichgültige Größe → qualitative Bestimmung der Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF2","text":"Qualitative Bestimmung → spezifische Reaktion auf äußerliche Vermehrung und Verminderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF3","text":"Spezifische Reaktion → Maß als Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF4","text":"Verhältnis → Unterscheidung von bloßem Quotienten und qualitativem Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF5","text":"Qualitativer Exponent → Potenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF6","text":"Potenzbestimmung → Abweichung der Maßreihe von der arithmetischen Reihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF7","text":"Nichtkommensurable Reihenbeziehung → Maß als qualitative Gesetzlichkeit äußerlicher Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME1","text":"Quantität wird von einer selbständigen Größe zu einer durch Qualität spezifisch genommenen Bestimmung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME2","text":"Intensität und Extensität werden als bloß äußerliche Formen desselben Quantums von der eigentlichen Maßdifferenz getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME3","text":"Der Exponent wird von einem Zahlenquotienten zu einem qualitativen Prinzip des Verhältnisses umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME4","text":"Die arithmetische Reihe wird von der vollständigen Gesetzlichkeit der Veränderung zu einer abhängigen Ausgangsreihe herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME5","text":"Inkommensurabilität erscheint nicht als Störung des Verhältnisses, sondern als Folge seiner qualitativen Potenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME6","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird als Ort des Fürsichseins neu bestimmt, nicht als dessen bloßes Gegenteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Maß bestimmt äußerliche Größe durch eine qualitative Spezifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Maß organisiert ein Verhältnis zwischen äußerlichem Quantum und qualitativ bestimmtem Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung wird von additiver Quantitätsveränderung auf die qualitative Erzeugung einer zweiten Reihe umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Quantum besitzt eine an sich seiende Potenzbestimmung, durch die seine zeitlich oder sukzessiv gedachte Veränderung nicht mit seiner äußerlichen Zahlenfolge identisch bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um das Maß als qualitative Spezifikation äußerlicher Quantität und als Verhältnisstruktur zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT2","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Intensität und Extensität sowie ihre Unterordnung unter die Maßbestimmung bleiben durch die Axiome erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT3","text":"Die Ableitung der Potenzreihe aus der arithmetischen Reihe ist strukturell angegeben, aber nicht mathematisch ausformuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der konsequenten Trennung von äußerlichem Quantum, qualitativem Exponenten und spezifisch aufgenommener Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Rückführung des scheinbar numerischen Exponenten auf eine qualitative Potenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT6","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche konkrete Potenzenfolge und welches genaue Verhältnis zwischen den beiden Reihen vorliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung von äußerlicher Quantität über Verhältnis und Exponent zur qualitativ differenten Reihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT8","text":"Die verbleibende Spannung liegt darin, dass das Maß zugleich von äußerlicher Quantität abhängt und deren Gesetzlichkeit durch eine nichtkommensurable qualitative Bestimmung überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113158383224Z_faec1b2e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The specifying Measure.","source_sha256":"bfdbe7d7f4bd6e9a41a1ddf9decda4ecb0788c040c605a5e0b8484869090cc19","sha256":"075900e5eb7ec2c188436e96fb512428c87bc967fe88487a2d64dc088141e445","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:31:58.384827+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining measure not as a merely external determination of quantity, but as a qualitative determination of external magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS2","text":"The re-determination posits measure as an immanent quality that receives an externally posited quantum and specifically alters it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS3","text":"The basis of this determination is the relation between external quantum and qualitatively determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS4","text":"The course of proof distinguishes measure from intensity and extensiveness, because there the same quantum merely appears otherwise externally, whereas here it is taken otherwise through an exponent of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS5","text":"The movement leads from the seemingly fixed quotient to the determination of power as the immanent qualitative principle of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AS6","text":"The consequence is a qualitative reaction through which an arithmetic series of external quantum produces an incommensurable series of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A1","text":"Measure is the qualitative determination of an external magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A2","text":"Measure presupposes a quantum that can be altered as an external and indifferent quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","text":"Measure possesses an immanent quality that confronts the externally altered quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A4","text":"The qualitative determination of measure does not receive external quantity as arithmetically unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","text":"The specifically received magnitude remains a quantum, but is intelligible only as a specifically determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A6","text":"Measure exists as a relation between external quantum and qualitatively determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A7","text":"The exponent of the relation designates not merely a fixed quantum, but the qualitative moment that specifically determines the quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A8","text":"The immanent qualitative determination of quantum is a determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A9","text":"The external quantum alters itself by the numerical one in arithmetic progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A10","text":"The qualitative nature of measure generates from the arithmetic alteration a series of powers dependent upon it, but not necessarily commensurable with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A11","text":"Intensity and extensiveness distinguish the same underlying quantum only through an external form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:A12","text":"In specifying measure, the quantum is taken in another number through the exponent of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX1","text":"Measure is not the merely external magnitude of a something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX2","text":"The specifically received magnitude is not a quantum as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX3","text":"The exponent of the relation is not merely a fixed external quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX4","text":"Measure is not reducible to the arithmetic magnitude of the externally posited alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX5","text":"The difference between intensity and extensiveness is not already a qualitative alteration of the underlying quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX6","text":"The alteration of the external quantum does not consist merely in the addition of numerical units on the side of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:NX7","text":"The qualitative principle of measure is not exhaustively determined by an ordinary numerical exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D1","text":"Measure behaves as an intensive in relation to the externally posited extensive magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A2","CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","CH_GB18_BDSM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D2","text":"The reaction of measure makes the externally posited quantum into another quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A3","CH_GB18_BDSM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D3","text":"The specifically received magnitude is variable because it depends on the external magnitude.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","CH_GB18_BDSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D4","text":"The specific determination of measure is the exponent of its relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A6","CH_GB18_BDSM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D5","text":"The determination of measure introduces a qualitative difference between external constitution and determination existing in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A7","CH_GB18_BDSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D6","text":"The arithmetic progression of external quantum forms only the initial series for a second, qualitatively determined series.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A9","CH_GB18_BDSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D7","text":"The qualitative series increases and decreases with the external series, but does not follow it in a relation fixed by a numerical quotient.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A8","CH_GB18_BDSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:D8","text":"The distinction of specifying measure lies in the manner of quantitative reception, not in the mere existence of a further quantum.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSM:A5","CH_GB18_BDSM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD1","text":"Measure mediates quantity and quality by transforming external alteration into a qualitative self-determination of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD2","text":"The external series of quantities receives its specific form only through an immanent determination that does not itself appear as an external number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD3","text":"The relational concept of measure replaces the identity of intensity and extensiveness with a structure in which the same quantum is taken qualitatively otherwise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD4","text":"Quantitative alteration becomes the condition of generation of a qualitatively autonomous series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD5","text":"The determination of measure shifts the explanation from an additive numerical operation to a power structure whose relation to the initial series can become incommensurable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SD6","text":"Measure thereby acquires a form of being-for-self in externality: it remains related to external quantity, but no longer determines it passively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX1","text":"The system excludes quality and quantity from existing independently alongside one another in the determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX2","text":"It excludes every qualitative determination of quantum from being specifiable as a merely numerical relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX3","text":"It excludes the alteration of measure from being explained by the same additive lawfulness as the alteration of external quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX4","text":"It excludes the exponent of a relation from being completely determined by its numerical quotient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX5","text":"It excludes the difference between intensity and extensiveness from already constituting the proper qualitative specification of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:DNX6","text":"It excludes external dependence from abolishing the qualitative autonomy of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a wholly indifferent, autonomous quantum is excluded, because every quantum in measure is mediated through a qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX2","text":"The possibility of reducing qualitative lawfulness to a commensurable numerical order is treated as inadequate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX3","text":"An external world of mere magnitudes, in which alteration means only addition or subtraction, remains barred as an explanatory model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:SNX4","text":"The separation of immanent determination and external appearance is not admitted as a final duality, but is sublated as a relational structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS1","text":"External quantum → alterability of quantum → emergence of an immanent quality of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS2","text":"Immanent quality of measure + external quantum → specific reception of external alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS3","text":"Specific reception → relation between external quantum and qualitatively determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS4","text":"Relation → seemingly fixed quotient → withdrawal of the quotient into the qualitative determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS5","text":"Numerical one → arithmetic progression of external quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS6","text":"Determination of power → qualitative reaction to arithmetic progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS7","text":"Qualitative reaction + arithmetic series → dependent series of powers not necessarily commensurable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:FGS8","text":"Two series with unequal lawfulness → determination of measure as being-for-self in externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF1","text":"External, indifferent magnitude → qualitative determination of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF2","text":"Qualitative determination → specific reaction to external increase and diminution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF3","text":"Specific reaction → measure as relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF4","text":"Relation → distinction between mere quotient and qualitative exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF5","text":"Qualitative exponent → determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF6","text":"Determination of power → deviation of the series of measure from the arithmetic series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:AF7","text":"Incommensurable relation of series → measure as qualitative lawfulness of external quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME1","text":"Quantity is remapped from an autonomous magnitude to a determination specifically taken through quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME2","text":"Intensity and extensiveness are separated, as merely external forms of the same quantum, from the proper difference of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME3","text":"The exponent is reclassified from a numerical quotient into a qualitative principle of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME4","text":"The arithmetic series is demoted from the complete lawfulness of alteration to a dependent initial series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME5","text":"Incommensurability appears not as a disturbance of the relation, but as a consequence of its qualitative determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ME6","text":"Externality is newly determined as the locus of being-for-self, not as its mere opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Measure determines external magnitude through a qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Measure organizes a relation between external quantum and qualitatively determined quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation is shifted from additive quantitative alteration to the qualitative generation of a second series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantum possesses a determination of power existing in itself, through which its temporally or successively conceived alteration does not remain identical with its external numerical sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct measure as the qualitative specification of external quantity and as a relational structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT2","text":"The distinction between intensity and extensiveness, as well as their subordination under the determination of measure, is preserved by the axioms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT3","text":"The derivation of the series of powers from the arithmetic series is structurally indicated, but not mathematically elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests on the consistent separation of external quantum, qualitative exponent, and specifically received magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the reduction of the seemingly numerical exponent to a qualitative determination of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT6","text":"What remains underdetermined is which concrete sequence of powers and which exact relation between the two series is involved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement from external quantity through relation and exponent to the qualitatively different series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSM:MRT8","text":"The remaining tension lies in measure's depending at once on external quantity and exceeding its lawfulness through an incommensurable qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDSM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDSM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 84","title":"b. Specifying Measure.","context":"Chapter 84","original_title":"b. Das specificirende Maaß."},"original_title":"b. Das specificirende Maaß.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":85,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_21"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_21@R001","sha256":"8e6ed541fd8205e839d1c48397cd85faf30a6c89768a69c1f9c4b206ed5fc697","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS1","text":"Das Problem entsteht aus der Bestimmung der Temperatur als zugleich äußerliches Quantum und spezifisch bestimmtes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS2","text":"Die äußerliche Temperatur wird zunächst als gleichförmig quantitativ veränderliches Medium angesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS3","text":"Die besonderen Körper nehmen diese Temperatur gemäß ihrem immanenten Maß verschieden auf, sodass ihre Veränderung nicht direkt der Veränderung des Mediums entspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS4","text":"Die Veränderlichkeit der Wärmekapazitäten zeigt, dass die quantitative Temperaturveränderung eine qualitative Spezifikation hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS5","text":"Die zunächst angenommene Relation zwischen äußerlichem Quantum und qualifizierendem Quantum wird als unzureichend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS6","text":"Das Verhältnis wird zur Relation zweier spezifischer Quanta umbestimmt, deren Seiten selbst Maßbestimmungen tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A1","text":"Temperatur besitzt eine äußerliche quantitative und eine spezifisch bestimmte Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A2","text":"Die äußerliche Temperatur kann als Temperatur eines allgemeinen Mediums aufgefasst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A3","text":"Die Veränderung des äußerlichen Mediums wird zunächst als gleichförmige quantitative Zu- oder Abnahme bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A4","text":"Besondere Körper bestimmen die aufgenommene Temperatur durch ein ihnen immanentes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A5","text":"Die Temperaturveränderung eines Körpers entspricht nicht notwendig direkt der Veränderung des äußeren Mediums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A6","text":"Verschiedene Körper bei gleicher äußerlicher Temperatur weisen unterschiedliche spezifische Wärmen und Wärmekapazitäten auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A7","text":"Die Wärmekapazität eines Körpers verändert sich mit der Temperatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A8","text":"Die Veränderung der Wärmekapazität ist mit einer Veränderung der spezifischen Gestalt verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A9","text":"Die Relation äußerlicher Temperatur zu Körpertyperatur besitzt keinen festen Verhältnisexponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A10","text":"Die äußerlich gesetzte Temperatur ist selbst eine spezifische Temperatur, etwa die der Luft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A11","text":"Das bestimmende Verhältnis besteht daher nicht zwischen einem bloß quantitativen und einem qualifizierenden Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A12","text":"Das bestimmende Verhältnis besteht zwischen zwei spezifischen Quanta, die an sich selbst Maßbestimmungen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX1","text":"Die Temperaturveränderung eines Körpers ist nicht als bloße Kopie der Veränderung des äußeren Mediums bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX2","text":"Die spezifische Wärme eines Körpers ist keine konstante, temperaturunabhängige Kapazität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX3","text":"Das Verhältnis zwischen äußerlicher und körperlicher Temperatur ist kein festes lineares Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX4","text":"Die äußerliche Temperatur ist nicht schlechthin unspezifisches Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX5","text":"Das Maßverhältnis ist nicht erschöpft durch die Gegenüberstellung eines Quantums mit einer bloß qualifizierenden Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D1","text":"Die quantitative Gleichförmigkeit des Mediums erzeugt keine gleichförmige quantitative Wirkung in den besonderen Körpern.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A3","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D2","text":"Die Vergleichbarkeit verschiedener Körper bei gleicher Temperatur wird durch Verhältniszahlen ihrer spezifischen Wärmen und Wärmekapazitäten vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D3","text":"Die Wärmekapazität fungiert nicht nur als quantitative Größe, sondern als Indikator einer spezifischen Bestimmtheit des Körpers.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A6","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D4","text":"In der Zu- oder Abnahme der Temperatur tritt eine besondere Spezifikation des Quantums hervor.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A1","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D5","text":"Die Abhängigkeit der Körpertemperatur von der äußerlichen Temperatur hebt die Eigenständigkeit des körperlichen Maßes nicht auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5","CH_GB18_A_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D6","text":"Die anfängliche Darstellung des Verhältnisses als äußerliches Quantum gegenüber qualifizierendem Quantum muss in eine Relation spezifischer Quanta überführt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A9","CH_GB18_A_21:A10","CH_GB18_A_21:A11","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD1","text":"Das Maß erscheint als Einheit von quantitativer Veränderung und qualitativer Spezifikation, nicht als äußerlich angelegtes Zahlenverhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A1","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD2","text":"Ein allgemeines Medium gewinnt seine konkrete Bestimmtheit erst durch die differentielle Aufnahme und Verarbeitung in besonderen Körpern.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A2","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD3","text":"Die Veränderung des Maßes ist nicht lediglich Größenveränderung, sondern eine Transformation der spezifischen Gestalt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8","CH_GB18_A_21:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD4","text":"Die Maßrelation wird von einer linearen Abbildung äußerer Einwirkung in eine wechselseitige Bestimmung zweier qualitativ strukturierter Größen umgebildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A9","CH_GB18_A_21:A10","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass quantitative Steigerung und quantitative Wirkung durch eine universelle Proportionalität verbunden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass ein Körper lediglich passiver Träger einer äußerlich empfangenen Temperatur ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die spezifische Qualität eines Körpers unabhängig von seiner quantitativen Veränderung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass das allgemeine Medium eine wirklich abstrakte, von jeder spezifischen Temperatur gereinigte Allgemeinheit bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Maß als äußerliche Vergleichsregel zwischen bereits fertigen Größen funktioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Maßbegriff, der die innere Bestimmtheit der gemessenen Gegenstände aus der Messrelation entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine reine Äußerlichkeit des Mediums, die ohne eigene Spezifikation als Grundlage der Relation dienen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Trennung von Quantität und Qualität, sobald die quantitative Veränderung selbst die spezifische Gestalt verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist ein linearer Kausalismus, in dem das Äußere die Form der Wirkung vollständig bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS1","text":"Äußerliches Medium + angenommene gleichförmige quantitative Veränderung → äußerlich bestimmtes Temperaturquantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS2","text":"Äußerliches Temperaturquantum + immanentes Maß des Körpers → unterschiedliche Aufnahme derselben Temperatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS3","text":"Unterschiedliche Aufnahme + fehlende direkte Proportionalität → Auflösung der linearen Maßrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS4","text":"Veränderliche Wärmekapazität + Temperaturveränderung → spezifische Gestaltveränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS5","text":"Spezifische Gestaltveränderung → quantitative Veränderung als qualitative Spezifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS6","text":"Spezifität des Mediums + Spezifität des Körpers → Relation zweier spezifischer Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS7","text":"Zwei spezifische Quanta, die selbst Maß sind → Maß als Verhältnis qualitativ strukturierter Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AF1","text":"Gleichförmige äußere Temperaturveränderung → differentielle Aufnahme durch Körper → variable Wärmekapazität → qualitative Gestaltveränderung → Scheitern des festen Verhältnisexponenten → Neubestimmung als Verhältnis zweier spezifischer Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME1","text":"Die Temperatur wird von einer einheitlich übertragbaren Größe zu einer Relation von Medium und immanenter Körperbestimmung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Quantität und Qualität wird durch die Bestimmung der quantitativen Veränderung als Spezifikation aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME3","text":"Das allgemeine Medium wird als selbst spezifische Größe klassifiziert und verliert den Status eines rein äußerlichen Bezugspols.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME4","text":"Die Messrelation wird von der direkten Proportionalität auf die gegenseitige Bestimmung zweier Maßgrößen umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT1","text":"Surface — Temperatur wird als äußerliches Quantum und als spezifische Temperatur eines Körpers bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ein immanentes Maß vermittelt die unterschiedliche Aufnahme eines gemeinsamen äußeren Mediums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die anfängliche quantitative Darstellung wird durch ihre eigene empirische Unangemessenheit in eine komplexere Maßrelation überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantitative Veränderung ist eine zeitlich verlaufende qualitative Selbstspezifikation; weder Medium noch Körper bleiben dabei abstrakt unverändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der äußerlichen Temperatur zur Relation zweier spezifischer Quanta zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie das immanente Maß der Körper selbst näher konstituiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die anfängliche Gleichförmigkeit ausdrücklich als vorläufige Annahme behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung qualitativer Spezifikation aus der Veränderlichkeit der Wärmekapazität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT5","text":"Die Argumentation hängt an der Spannung zwischen angenommener äußerlicher Quantität und tatsächlich spezifischer Bestimmtheit des Mediums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Korrektur vom eindimensionalen Verhältnis zur Relation zweier selbst maßhaltiger Qualitäten nicht ausgelassen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111851184093Z_d4502852","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"8e6ed541fd8205e839d1c48397cd85faf30a6c89768a69c1f9c4b206ed5fc697","sha256":"0ca8d3678642d13f2958b75fd5afb405ac17cf738185788df086e331bdf504ee","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:18:51.186186+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS1","text":"The problem arises from the determination of temperature as at once external quantum and specifically determined measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS2","text":"External temperature is initially posited as a uniformly quantitatively variable medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS3","text":"Particular bodies absorb this temperature differently according to their immanent measure, so that their alteration does not directly correspond to the alteration of the medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS4","text":"The variability of heat capacities shows that quantitative temperature alteration brings forth a qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS5","text":"The relation initially assumed between external quantum and qualifying quantum is determined as inadequate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AS6","text":"The relation is re-determined as the relation of two specific quanta, whose sides themselves bear measure determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A1","text":"Temperature has an external quantitative side and a specifically determined side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A2","text":"External temperature can be conceived as the temperature of a general medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A3","text":"The alteration of the external medium is initially determined as a uniform quantitative increase or decrease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A4","text":"Particular bodies determine the temperature absorbed through a measure immanent to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A5","text":"The temperature alteration of a body does not necessarily correspond directly to the alteration of the external medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A6","text":"Different bodies at the same external temperature exhibit different specific heats and heat capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A7","text":"The heat capacity of a body changes with temperature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A8","text":"The alteration of heat capacity is connected with an alteration of specific shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A9","text":"The relation of external temperature to bodily temperature has no fixed ratio exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A10","text":"The externally posited temperature is itself a specific temperature, for example that of air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A11","text":"The determining relation therefore does not consist between a merely quantitative and a qualifying moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:A12","text":"The determining relation consists between two specific quanta that are in themselves measure determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX1","text":"The temperature alteration of a body cannot be determined as a mere copy of the alteration of the external medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX2","text":"The specific heat of a body is not a constant, temperature-independent capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX3","text":"The relation between external and bodily temperature is not a fixed linear relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX4","text":"External temperature is not simply an unspecific quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:NX5","text":"The measure relation is not exhausted by the juxtaposition of a quantum with a merely qualifying quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D1","text":"The quantitative uniformity of the medium produces no uniform quantitative effect in particular bodies.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A3","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D2","text":"The comparability of different bodies at the same temperature is mediated by ratios of their specific heats and heat capacities.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D3","text":"Heat capacity functions not only as a quantitative magnitude but as an indicator of a specific determinacy of the body.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A6","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D4","text":"In the increase or decrease of temperature, a particular specification of the quantum emerges.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A1","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D5","text":"The dependence of bodily temperature on external temperature does not annul the independence of bodily measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5","CH_GB18_A_21:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:D6","text":"The initial presentation of the relation as external quantum opposed to qualifying quantum must be transformed into a relation of specific quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A9","CH_GB18_A_21:A10","CH_GB18_A_21:A11","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD1","text":"Measure appears as the unity of quantitative alteration and qualitative specification, not as an externally imposed numerical ratio.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A1","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD2","text":"A general medium acquires its concrete determinacy only through differential absorption and processing in particular bodies.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A2","CH_GB18_A_21:A4","CH_GB18_A_21:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD3","text":"The alteration of measure is not merely alteration of magnitude, but a transformation of specific shape.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A7","CH_GB18_A_21:A8","CH_GB18_A_21:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SD4","text":"The measure relation is transformed from a linear mapping of external influence into a reciprocal determination of two qualitatively structured magnitudes.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_21:A9","CH_GB18_A_21:A10","CH_GB18_A_21:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that quantitative increase and quantitative effect are connected through a universal proportionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that a body is merely a passive bearer of an externally received temperature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the specific quality of a body exists independently of its quantitative alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the general medium constitutes a genuinely abstract universality purified of every specific temperature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that measure functions as an external rule of comparison between already completed magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a concept of measure that removes the inner determinacy of the measured objects from the measuring relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a pure externality of the medium that could serve as the basis of the relation without its own specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the separation of quantity and quality once quantitative alteration itself changes specific shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:SNX4","text":"Barred is a linear causalism in which the external fully determines the form of the effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS1","text":"External medium + assumed uniform quantitative alteration → externally determined temperature quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS2","text":"External temperature quantum + immanent measure of the body → differing absorption of the same temperature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS3","text":"Differing absorption + absence of direct proportionality → dissolution of the linear measure relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS4","text":"Variable heat capacity + temperature alteration → specific alteration of shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS5","text":"Specific alteration of shape → quantitative alteration as qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS6","text":"Specificity of the medium + specificity of the body → relation of two specific quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:FGS7","text":"Two specific quanta that are themselves measure → measure as the relation of qualitatively structured magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:AF1","text":"Uniform external temperature alteration → differential absorption by bodies → variable heat capacity → qualitative alteration of shape → failure of the fixed ratio exponent → re-determination as the relation of two specific quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME1","text":"Temperature is remapped from a uniformly transferable magnitude into a relation of medium and immanent bodily determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME2","text":"The opposition between quantity and quality is dissolved through the determination of quantitative alteration as specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME3","text":"The general medium is classified as itself a specific magnitude and loses the status of a purely external pole of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ME4","text":"The measuring relation is shifted from direct proportionality to the reciprocal determination of two measure-magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT1","text":"Surface — Temperature is determined as external quantum and as the specific temperature of a body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT2","text":"Structural — An immanent measure mediates the differing absorption of a common external medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The initial quantitative presentation is transformed by its own empirical inadequacy into a more complex measure relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Quantitative alteration is a temporally unfolding qualitative self-specification; neither medium nor body remains abstractly unaltered in this process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from external temperature to the relation of two specific quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the immanent measure of bodies is itself more closely constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that the initial uniformity is expressly treated as a provisional assumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of qualitative specification from the variability of heat capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT5","text":"The argumentation depends on the tension between assumed external quantity and the actually specific determinacy of the medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_21:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement provided that the correction from the one-dimensional relation to the relation of two qualities that themselves contain measure is not omitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_21:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_21@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_21:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 85","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 85","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Relation of Both Sides as Qualities.","order":86,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CVLB"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVLB@R001","sha256":"c382369b49dd5b73386119cde722050bb3b33102eeab227ca575e696938f776a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS1","text":"Das Maß bestimmt die qualitative Seite nur in Beziehung auf ein äußerliches Quantum und hebt dessen bloße Äußerlichkeit durch Spezifikation auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS2","text":"Die beiden Seiten bleiben qualitativ verschieden, sind aber als äußerliches und spezifisches Quantum untrennbar aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS3","text":"Aus der Spezifikation desselben äußerlichen Quantums entsteht eine Mehrheit von Maßen und schließlich ein realisiertes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS4","text":"Die wahrhafte Veränderlichkeit besteht nicht im bloßen Ersetzen eines Quantums durch ein anderes, sondern in der qualitativen Bestimmung des Quantums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS5","text":"Die qualitative Differenz der Seiten wird als Verhältnis von extensiver Äußerlichkeit und intensiver Einheit formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS6","text":"Das direkte Verhältnis bleibt eine formelle Abstraktion; Wurzel-Quadrat-Verhältnisse bilden eine Zwischenstufe, höhere Potenzen eine begriffsgemäßere Realisation des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","text":"Die an sich bestimmte qualitative Seite ist nur als Beziehung auf das äußerlich Quantitative bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A2","text":"Die qualitative Spezifikation hebt die Äußerlichkeit des Quantums auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A3","text":"Das äußerliche Quantum ist Voraussetzung und Ausgangspunkt der Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A4","text":"Das äußerliche Quantum und die qualitative Seite sind in der Unmittelbarkeit des Seins qualitativ voneinander unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A5","text":"Jede Seite besitzt zugleich eine äußerliche und eine spezifische quantitative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A6","text":"Die beiden Seiten sind nur durch ihre untrennbare Verschränkung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","text":"Das Maß ist die qualitative Einheit des quantitativen Verhältnisses zweier Qualitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","text":"Im Maß ist das Quantum aufgehoben und gilt zugleich als Quantum und als qualitative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","text":"Die Spezifikation des Maßes setzt die Unterschiedenheit quantitativer Bestimmungen und damit eine Mehrheit von Maßen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A10","text":"Dasselbe äußerliche Quantum kann in verschiedenen Qualitäten als verschiedenes quantitatives Dasein hervortreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","text":"Die wahrhafte Veränderung betrifft das Quantum als solches und nicht bloß ein einzelnes Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","text":"Das Andere des Quantums ist in der wahrhaften Veränderung das Qualitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A13","text":"Die reelle veränderliche Größe ist durch ein qualitatives Potenzenverhältnis bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","text":"Die extensive Qualität ist Äußerlichkeit an ihr selbst, die intensive Qualität ist Insichsein und Negativität gegen diese Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","text":"Der extensiven Qualität entspricht die Anzahl, der intensiven Qualität die Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A16","text":"Im spezifizierenden Verhältnis erscheinen die extensive Seite als Potenz oder Anderswerden und die intensive Seite als Wurzel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","text":"Ein direktes Verhältnis bleibt gegenüber der begriffsgemäßen Maßbestimmung eine formelle und nicht existierende Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A18","text":"Höhere Potenzen realisieren die Qualifikation des Quantitativen begriffsgemäßer als das direkte oder bloß quadratische Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX1","text":"Das Maß ist nicht ein äußerliches quantitatives Verhältnis ohne qualitative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX2","text":"Die qualitative Seite ist nicht unabhängig von einem vorausgesetzten Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX3","text":"Das Quantum ist nicht als reine, unvermittelte Äußerlichkeit maßgebend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX4","text":"Die beiden Seiten sind nicht bloß äußerlich nebeneinanderstehende Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX5","text":"Die Veränderlichkeit besteht nicht lediglich im Austausch eines besonderen Quantums gegen ein anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX6","text":"Die Qualitäten sind nicht unbestimmt verschieden voneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX7","text":"Das direkte Verhältnis ist nicht die realisierte Form des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX8","text":"Das Wurzel-Quadrat-Verhältnis ist nicht die höchste begriffliche Realisation der Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D1","text":"Quantitative und qualitative Bestimmung bilden eine Einheit, weil das Quantum aufgehoben bleibt, während es zugleich als qualitativ anderes gilt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","CH_GB18_CVLB:A2","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D2","text":"Die Maßbestimmung erzeugt qualitative Verschiedenheit nicht durch Aufhebung des Quantums überhaupt, sondern durch dessen Spezifikation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A3","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D3","text":"Ein gemeinsames äußerliches Quantum kann als Vielzahl verschiedener Maße erscheinen, sobald es durch verschiedene Qualitäten bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","CH_GB18_CVLB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D4","text":"Das realisierte Maß besteht darin, dass beide Seiten als qualitativ bestimmte Quanta aufeinander bezogen sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A5","CH_GB18_CVLB:A6","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D5","text":"Die reelle veränderliche Größe ist keine bloße quantitative Variable, sondern eine Größe, deren Veränderung durch ein qualitatives Potenzenverhältnis bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D6","text":"Die extensive und die intensive Seite übernehmen im Maßverhältnis die Funktionen von Anzahl und Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","CH_GB18_CVLB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D7","text":"Im spezifizierenden Verhältnis wird die extensive Seite als Potenz oder Anderswerden und die intensive Seite als Wurzel bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","CH_GB18_CVLB:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D8","text":"Die mathematische Form des Verhältnisses wird nach dem Grad beurteilt, in dem sie qualitative Bestimmung im Quantitativen ausdrückt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A16","CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD1","text":"Das Maß reorganisiert das Verhältnis von Quantität und Qualität so, dass quantitative Veränderung nur als Träger qualitativer Bestimmung vollständig verständlich wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD2","text":"Die mathematische veränderliche Größe wird aus der formalen Variabilität in eine ontologisch bestimmte Maßrelation überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A10","CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD3","text":"Das Maß bildet eine Hierarchie, in der unmittelbare Maßbestimmung, realisiertes Maß und höhere Potenzen verschiedene Grade der qualitativen Vermittlung darstellen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD4","text":"Die Asymmetrie zwischen den Seiten ist nicht äußerlich gewählt, sondern aus der Differenz von extensiver Äußerlichkeit und intensiver Einheit erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","CH_GB18_CVLB:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD5","text":"Mathematische Verhältnisse werden nicht als formal gleichwertige Darstellungen behandelt, sondern nach ihrer Fähigkeit geordnet, die qualitative Einheit des Quantitativen zu realisieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein selbständig bestehendes reines Quantum, dessen Äußerlichkeit von jeder qualitativen Bestimmung unberührt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen sind zwei Qualitäten, deren Bestimmungen unabhängig voneinander vorliegen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine symmetrische Beziehung, in der keine Seite die Funktion von Äußerlichkeit oder Einheit übernimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Theorie der Veränderung, die nur empirische Sukzession oder quantitative Ersetzung kennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine mathematische Form, deren quantitative Struktur ohne qualitative Ontologie hinreichend wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Trennung von Quantität und Qualität; ihre Grenze wird durch das Maß selbst vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Quantität, die ohne qualitative Spezifikation als vollständige Bestimmung gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Veränderung, die gegenüber der Qualität indifferent bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein vollständig äußerliches Verhältnis, das zugleich als reales Maß gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit einer maßgebenden Relation ohne erzeugte Asymmetrie zwischen extensiver und intensiver Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS1","text":"Ein äußerliches Quantum wird als Voraussetzung gesetzt und auf eine qualitative Seite bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS2","text":"Die Beziehung unterscheidet beide Seiten qualitativ und erhält sie zugleich als Momente einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS3","text":"Die qualitative Seite spezifiziert das Quantum; dadurch wird dessen bloße Äußerlichkeit aufgehoben und eine Mehrheit von Maßbestimmungen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS4","text":"Die Mehrheit wird als verschiedene quantitative Erscheinung desselben äußerlichen Quantums in verschiedenen Qualitäten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS5","text":"Die qualitative Differenz wird in extensive Äußerlichkeit und intensive Einheit übersetzt und dadurch auf Anzahl, Einheit, Potenz und Wurzel bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS6","text":"Das direkte Verhältnis wird als bloße formelle Abstraktion reduziert, während Wurzel-Quadrat- und höhere Potenzen als gestufte Formen qualitativer Spezifikation erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS7","text":"Die reelle veränderliche Größe wird als Quantum bestimmt, dessen Veränderung nur innerhalb eines qualitativen Potenzenverhältnisses gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF1","text":"Äußerliches Quantum → qualitative Beziehung → Aufhebung der bloßen Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF2","text":"Qualitative Verschiedenheit → doppelte quantitative Bestimmung → untrennbare Verschränkung der Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF3","text":"Gemeinsames äußerliches Quantum → qualitative Spezifikation → Mehrheit von Maßen → realisiertes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF4","text":"Bloße quantitative Veränderlichkeit → Veränderung des Quantums als solchen → qualitativ bestimmte reelle veränderliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF5","text":"Extensive und intensive Qualität → Anzahl und Einheit → Dividend und Divisor → Potenz und Wurzel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF6","text":"Direktes Verhältnis → formelle Abstraktion → Wurzel-Quadrat-Verhältnis → höhere Potenzen als begriffsgemäßere Realisation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME1","text":"Das Quantum wird von einer einfachen äußeren Größe in eine doppelt bestimmte Größe umkartiert: äußerlich und spezifisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME2","text":"Verschiedene quantitative Erscheinungen desselben äußerlichen Quantums werden als Effekte qualitativer Differenz klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME3","text":"Veränderlichkeit wird von bloßer Ersetzbarkeit auf qualitative Bestimmung des Quantums umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME4","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Quantität und Qualität wird durch die Kategorie des Maßes in eine qualitative Einheit des Quantitativen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME5","text":"Mathematische Verhältnisse werden nach Graden der begrifflichen Realisation geordnet, statt als bloß gleichartige Rechenformen zu erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME6","text":"Die Rollen der beiden Seiten werden als extensive Äußerlichkeit und intensive Einheit neu klassifiziert; ihre Austauschbarkeit wird aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das Maß ist das Verhältnis zweier qualitativ bestimmter quantitativer Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Spezifikation des äußerlichen Quantums erzeugt qualitative Verschiedenheit, Maßpluralität und realisiertes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ordnet mathematische Formen nach ihrer Fähigkeit, quantitative Veränderung als qualitative Bestimmung darzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität und Veränderung gelten nicht als bloß quantitative Vorgänge, sondern als durch qualitative Potenzverhältnisse bestimmte Prozesse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom äußerlichen Quantum zur qualitativen Maßrelation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT2","text":"Die Verbindung von Aufhebung, Spezifikation und Maßpluralität bleibt intern geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, weshalb gerade höhere Potenzen und nicht eine anders geformte mathematische Struktur die begriffsgemäßere Realisation liefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Vermittlung von Maß, qualitativer Veränderung und reeller veränderlicher Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Voraussetzung des äußerlichen Quantums und seiner gleichzeitigen Aufhebung als bloßer Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass das direkte Verhältnis als nicht realisiert gilt, aber weiterhin als notwendige Abstraktionsstufe fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Arguments, sofern die mathematischen Beispiele als Stufen der qualitativen Spezifikation und nicht als bloße Anwendungen gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114731163505Z_049bd2eb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Relation of Both Sides as Qualities.","source_sha256":"c382369b49dd5b73386119cde722050bb3b33102eeab227ca575e696938f776a","sha256":"ccedeccff61a1b77d1b6efe4093f5652f31e235532cf3b7045e54a5cd32f8178","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:47:31.164583+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS1","text":"Measure determines the qualitative side only in relation to an external quantum and sublates its mere externality through specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS2","text":"The two sides remain qualitatively distinct, but as external and specific quantum they are inseparably related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS3","text":"From the specification of the same external quantum there arises a plurality of measures and, finally, a realized measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS4","text":"True changeability does not consist in the mere replacement of one quantum by another, but in the qualitative determination of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS5","text":"The qualitative difference of the sides is formalized as a relation of extensive externality and intensive unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AS6","text":"The direct relation remains a formal abstraction; root-square relations form an intermediate stage, higher powers a realization of measure more adequate to the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","text":"The qualitative side determined in itself is determined only as a relation to the externally quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A2","text":"Qualitative specification sublates the externality of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A3","text":"External quantum is the presupposition and point of departure of the determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A4","text":"External quantum and the qualitative side are qualitatively distinguished from one another in the immediacy of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A5","text":"Each side at once possesses an external and a specific quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A6","text":"The two sides are determined only through their inseparable interweaving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","text":"Measure is the qualitative unity of the quantitative relation of two qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","text":"In measure, quantum is sublated and at the same time holds as quantum and as qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","text":"The specification of measure posits the distinctness of quantitative determinations and thus a plurality of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A10","text":"The same external quantum can emerge in different qualities as different quantitative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","text":"True change concerns quantum as such and not merely an individual quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","text":"The other of quantum in true change is the qualitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A13","text":"The real variable magnitude is determined by a qualitative power relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","text":"Extensive quality is externality in itself; intensive quality is being-within-itself and negativity toward this externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","text":"Number corresponds to extensive quality, unity to intensive quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A16","text":"In the specifying relation, the extensive side appears as power or becoming-other, and the intensive side as root.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","text":"In comparison with the determination of measure adequate to the concept, a direct relation remains a formal and non-existing abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:A18","text":"Higher powers realize the qualification of the quantitative more adequately to the concept than the direct or merely quadratic relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX1","text":"Measure is not an external quantitative relation without qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX2","text":"The qualitative side is not independent of a presupposed quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX3","text":"Quantum is not determinative as pure, unmediated externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX4","text":"The two sides are not merely externally juxtaposed magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX5","text":"Changeability does not consist merely in the exchange of one particular quantum for another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX6","text":"The qualities are not indeterminately different from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX7","text":"The direct relation is not the realized form of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:NX8","text":"The root-square relation is not the highest conceptual realization of the determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D1","text":"Quantitative and qualitative determination form a unity because quantum remains sublated while at the same time it holds as qualitatively other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","CH_GB18_CVLB:A2","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D2","text":"The determination of measure generates qualitative difference not by sublating quantum altogether, but through its specification.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A3","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D3","text":"A common external quantum can appear as a multiplicity of different measures as soon as it is determined by different qualities.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","CH_GB18_CVLB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D4","text":"The realized measure consists in both sides being related to one another as qualitatively determined quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A5","CH_GB18_CVLB:A6","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D5","text":"The real variable magnitude is not a merely quantitative variable, but a magnitude whose change is determined by a qualitative power relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D6","text":"In the measure relation, the extensive and intensive sides assume the functions of number and unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","CH_GB18_CVLB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D7","text":"In the specifying relation, the extensive side is determined as power or becoming-other and the intensive side as root.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","CH_GB18_CVLB:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:D8","text":"The mathematical form of the relation is judged according to the degree to which it expresses qualitative determination in the quantitative.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A16","CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD1","text":"Measure reorganizes the relation of quantity and quality such that quantitative change becomes fully intelligible only as the bearer of qualitative determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A1","CH_GB18_CVLB:A7","CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD2","text":"The mathematical variable magnitude is transferred from formal variability into an ontologically determined measure relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A10","CH_GB18_CVLB:A11","CH_GB18_CVLB:A12","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD3","text":"Measure forms a hierarchy in which immediate determination of measure, realized measure, and higher powers represent different degrees of qualitative mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A8","CH_GB18_CVLB:A9","CH_GB18_CVLB:A13","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD4","text":"The asymmetry between the sides is not externally chosen, but generated from the difference between extensive externality and intensive unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A14","CH_GB18_CVLB:A15","CH_GB18_CVLB:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SD5","text":"Mathematical relations are not treated as formally equivalent representations, but ordered according to their capacity to realize the qualitative unity of the quantitative.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLB:A17","CH_GB18_CVLB:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a purely quantum existing independently, whose externality remains untouched by every qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX2","text":"Excluded are two qualities whose determinations could be present independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a symmetrical relation in which neither side assumes the function of externality or unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a theory of change that knows only empirical succession or quantitative replacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a mathematical form whose quantitative structure would be sufficient without qualitative ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a final separation of quantity and quality; their boundary is mediated by measure itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX1","text":"Impossible becomes a quantity that could count as a complete determination without qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible becomes a change that would remain indifferent to quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a wholly external relation that could at the same time count as real measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:SNX4","text":"Blocked is the possibility of a determinative relation without a generated asymmetry between extensive and intensive side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS1","text":"An external quantum is posited as presupposition and related to a qualitative side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS2","text":"The relation qualitatively distinguishes both sides and at the same time preserves them as moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS3","text":"The qualitative side specifies quantum; thereby its mere externality is sublated and a plurality of determinations of measure is generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS4","text":"The plurality is determined as the different quantitative appearance of the same external quantum in different qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS5","text":"The qualitative difference is translated into extensive externality and intensive unity and thereby related to number, unity, power, and root.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS6","text":"The direct relation is reduced to a mere formal abstraction, while root-square and higher powers appear as graduated forms of qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:FGS7","text":"The real variable magnitude is determined as a quantum whose change holds only within a qualitative power relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF1","text":"External quantum → qualitative relation → sublation of mere externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF2","text":"Qualitative difference → double quantitative determination → inseparable interweaving of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF3","text":"Common external quantum → qualitative specification → plurality of measures → realized measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF4","text":"Mere quantitative changeability → change of quantum as such → qualitatively determined real variable magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF5","text":"Extensive and intensive quality → number and unity → dividend and divisor → power and root.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:AF6","text":"Direct relation → formal abstraction → root-square relation → higher powers as realization more adequate to the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME1","text":"Quantum is remapped from a simple external magnitude into a doubly determined magnitude: external and specific.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME2","text":"Different quantitative appearances of the same external quantum are classified as effects of qualitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME3","text":"Changeability is shifted from mere replaceability to the qualitative determination of quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME4","text":"The opposition of quantity and quality is transferred, through the category of measure, into a qualitative unity of the quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME5","text":"Mathematical relations are ordered according to degrees of conceptual realization, rather than appearing as merely homogeneous computational forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ME6","text":"The roles of the two sides are reclassified as extensive externality and intensive unity; their interchangeability is sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT1","text":"Surface: Measure is the relation of two qualitatively determined quantitative sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT2","text":"Structural: The specification of external quantum generates qualitative difference, a plurality of measures, and realized measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text orders mathematical forms according to their capacity to represent quantitative change as qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality and change do not count as merely quantitative processes, but as processes determined by qualitative power relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from external quantum to qualitative measure relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT2","text":"The connection of sublation, specification, and plurality of measures remains internally closed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined why precisely higher powers, rather than a differently formed mathematical structure, furnish the realization more adequate to the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the mediation of measure, qualitative change, and real variable magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the presupposition of external quantum and its simultaneous sublation as mere externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT6","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the direct relation counts as unrealized but continues to function as a necessary stage of abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLB:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the mathematical examples are read as stages of qualitative specification and not as mere applications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVLB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CVLB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 86","title":"c. The Relation of Both Sides as Qualities.","context":"Chapter 86","original_title":"c. Verhältniß beider Seiten als Qualitäten."},"original_title":"c. Verhältniß beider Seiten als Qualitäten.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":87,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_22"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_22@R001","sha256":"dd42c52e8d17935ca44cd1560b096d3e2d290400be4bc8ffb86117c861050dd0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS1","text":"Das Argument rekonstruiert, wie qualitative Bestimmungen von Raum und Zeit quantitative Maßverhältnisse erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS2","text":"Die Geschwindigkeit wird vom bloßen Verhältnis zur begrifflich asymmetrischen Maßbestimmung von Raum und Zeit neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS3","text":"Die verschiedenen Bewegungsarten erzeugen verschiedene Potenzverhältnisse, weil ihre Momente in verschiedenen begrifflichen Beziehungen stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS4","text":"Empirische Gesetze bestätigen die Übereinstimmung mit Erscheinungen, leisten aber noch keinen höheren Beweis ihrer quantitativen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS5","text":"Mathematische Formeln und infinitesimale Beweise liefern keinen begrifflichen Beweis, wenn sie die Naturgesetze bereits aus der Erfahrung voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS6","text":"Die behauptete Überlegenheit Newtons gegenüber Kepler wird auf Umformung des Ausdrucks und beginnende analytische Behandlung zurückgeführt, sobald das Scheingerüst des Beweises entfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A1","text":"Das Maß ist die quantitative Bestimmung einer qualitativen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A2","text":"Raum und Zeit sind als qualitative Momente an sich und im Begriff untrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A3","text":"Der Raum ist ein äußerliches, reales Ganzes und fungiert daher als Anzahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A4","text":"Die Zeit ist das Ideelle und Negative und fungiert daher als Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A5","text":"Das quantitative Verhältnis von Raum und Zeit wird durch die qualitative Natur der bezogenen Momente bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A6","text":"Die mechanische Bewegung ist eine unfreie Beziehung, der Fall eine bedingtfreie Beziehung und die himmlische Bewegung eine absolutfreie Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A7","text":"In der Geschwindigkeit steht der durchlaufene Raum im direkten Verhältnis zur verflossenen Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A8","text":"Im Fall steht die Raumgröße als Quadrat zur Zeitgröße als Wurzel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A9","text":"In der absolutfreien himmlischen Bewegung steht die Umlaufszeit als Quadrat zur Entfernung als Kubus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A10","text":"Die Bewegungsarten und ihre Gesetze beruhen auf der Entwicklung des Begriffs ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A11","text":"Das quantitative Verhältnis der Momente ist das Fürsichsein des Maßes und eine einzige Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A12","text":"Eine wissenschaftliche Mathematik der Natur muss wesentlich Wissenschaft der Maße sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A13","text":"Empirische Quanta müssen in allgemeine Formen von Quantitätsbestimmungen erhoben werden, damit sie Momente eines Gesetzes oder Maßes werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A14","text":"Die Übereinstimmung eines Gesetzes mit dem Umfang der Wahrnehmung ist ein empirischer, aber nicht der höhere begriffliche Beweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A15","text":"Der höhere Beweis muss die quantitativen Bestimmungen aus den bezogenen Qualitäten oder bestimmten Begriffen erkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A16","text":"Eine mathematische Behandlung, die ihre Naturgesetze aus der Erfahrung voraussetzt, kann deren begriffliche Notwendigkeit nicht erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Raum und Zeit ist nicht als beliebige Vertauschung von Zähler und Nenner bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX2","text":"Raum und Zeit sind nicht bloß gleichartige, gegeneinander austauschbare Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX3","text":"Die Gesetze der Bewegung sind nicht unabhängig von der qualitativen Art ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX4","text":"Empirische Zahlen sind nicht bereits als solche die wissenschaftliche Form des Naturgesetzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX5","text":"Die Übereinstimmung eines Gesetzes mit beobachteten Einzelfällen ist nicht der höchste Beweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX6","text":"Eine abstrakte Formel ist nicht mit der begrifflichen Herleitung des Gesetzes identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX7","text":"Ein infinitesimalmathematischer Beweis ist kein wirklicher Beweis, wenn er weder aus der Empirie noch aus dem Begriff führt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX8","text":"Newtons Vorrang vor Kepler kann nicht aus dem bloßen Vorhandensein eines mathematischen Beweisapparats folgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D1","text":"Die Stellung des Raums als Zähler und der Zeit als Nenner in der Geschwindigkeit ist eine qualitative Maßbestimmung und keine bloße Darstellungswahl.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A1","CH_GB18_A_22:A3","CH_GB18_A_22:A4","CH_GB18_A_22:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D2","text":"Die Potenzverhältnisse von Raum und Zeit unterscheiden die Bewegungsarten nach dem Grad ihrer Freiheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A6","CH_GB18_A_22:A8","CH_GB18_A_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D3","text":"Die Gesetze des Falls und der himmlischen Bewegung sind nicht äußerlich hinzugefügte Zahlenverhältnisse, sondern Ausdrücke der begrifflichen Beziehung ihrer Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A2","CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D4","text":"Die von Galilei und Kepler gefundenen Gesetze besitzen empirische Geltung, weil ihr Umfang den Einzelheiten der Wahrnehmung entspricht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A13","CH_GB18_A_22:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D5","text":"Die Erhebung empirischer Zahlen in Gesetzesformen verwandelt sie in Momente einer allgemeinen Maßbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D6","text":"Mathematische Naturprinzipien leisten dort vor allem Umformung in abstrakte Ausdrücke und bequeme Formeln, wo sie die Gesetze bereits empirisch voraussetzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D7","text":"Der Missbrauch des Unendlichkleinen erzeugt den Schein eines Beweises, ohne die quantitative Bestimmung aus der qualitativen Natur der Momente abzuleiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A15","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D8","text":"Wird das Scheingerüst mathematischer Beweise entfernt, bleibt Newtons Unterschied zu Kepler hauptsächlich als Umformung des Ausdrucks und analytische Behandlung bestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD1","text":"Wissenschaftliche Naturerkenntnis wird als Hierarchie von empirischer Feststellung, mathematischer Formulierung und begrifflicher Begründung organisiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13","CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD2","text":"Die Geltung eines Naturgesetzes hängt nicht nur von seiner empirischen Reichweite, sondern von der Ableitbarkeit seiner Quantität aus der Qualität ab.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD3","text":"Mathematik wird innerhalb der Naturphilosophie zugleich als notwendige Wissenschaft der Maße gefordert und als unzureichend bestimmt, sobald sie ihre Gesetze nur formal umarbeitet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD4","text":"Der Fortschritt von mechanischer Bewegung über Fall zur himmlischen Bewegung wird als Entwicklung der Beziehung von Raum und Zeit und nicht als bloße Anhäufung empirischer Gesetze gefasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A6","CH_GB18_A_22:A9","CH_GB18_A_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD5","text":"Die wissenschaftliche Rangordnung verschiebt sich von der formalen Komplexität eines Beweises auf die begriffliche Herkunft seiner quantitativen Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Natur, deren Gesetzlichkeit in der bloßen Aufzählung äußerlich gegebener Quanta erschöpft wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine mathematische Allgemeinheit, die mit begrifflicher Notwendigkeit gleichgesetzt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein autonomes quantitatives Verhältnis, das unabhängig von der qualitativen Bestimmung seiner Momente bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein dritter Beweisweg, der weder empirisch noch begrifflich verfährt und dennoch wissenschaftliche Notwendigkeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass größere formale oder analytische Komplexität einen höheren Erkenntnisstatus garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Trennung von Raum und Zeit in voneinander unabhängige Variablen, deren Verhältnis erst nachträglich hergestellt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX1","text":"Der Text schließt die Möglichkeit einer neutralen, sich selbst begründenden Mathematik der Natur aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX2","text":"Der Text schließt eine Naturordnung aus, in der empirische Daten, mathematische Formeln und Begriffe gleichwertige Formen desselben Beweises wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX3","text":"Der Text umkreist die Abwesenheit einer vollständig ausgeführten Ableitung, durch die gerade die Potenzexponenten aus den Begriffen von Raum und Zeit hervorgehen würden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX4","text":"Der Text schließt eine Wissenschaftsgeschichte aus, in der Newtons spätere mathematische Form allein als Aufhebung von Keplers empirischer Gesetzesfindung gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX5","text":"Der Text behandelt die bloße Existenz empirischer Zahlen als unzureichend und macht ihre begriffliche Aufhebung in einer Maßform zur versperrten, aber notwendigen Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS1","text":"Qualitative Momente setzen → Raum und Zeit als begrifflich untrennbare Bestimmungen fassen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A1","CH_GB18_A_22:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS2","text":"Qualitative Differenz bestimmen → Raum als Anzahl und Zeit als Einheit funktional asymmetrisch anordnen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A3","CH_GB18_A_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS3","text":"Beziehungsart klassifizieren → mechanische, bedingtfreie und absolutfreie Bewegung unterscheiden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS4","text":"Beziehungsart quantifizieren → direkte, quadratische und kubische Maßverhältnisse erzeugen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A7","CH_GB18_A_22:A8","CH_GB18_A_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS5","text":"Einzelquanta verallgemeinern → empirische Zahlen als Momente einer Maß- und Gesetzesform rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS6","text":"Beweisstufen trennen → empirische Bestätigung von begrifflicher Begründung unterscheiden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS7","text":"Formale Beweise prüfen → jede mathematische Ableitung zurückweisen, die ihr Gesetz empirisch voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS8","text":"Wissenschaftlichen Mehrwert neu klassifizieren → Newtons Vorrang auf Ausdrucksumformung und analytische Behandlung begrenzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AF1","text":"Beliebigkeit des quantitativen Verhältnisses → qualitative Asymmetrie von Raum und Zeit → Differenzierung der Bewegungsarten → Potenzgesetze als Maßbestimmungen → empirische Bestätigung → Forderung des begrifflichen Beweises → Entlarvung mathematischer Scheinbeweise → Reduktion von Newtons Vorrang auf formale und analytische Umformung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Raum und Zeit wird von einer austauschbaren Quotientenstruktur in eine asymmetrische Maßstruktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME2","text":"Bewegungen werden nicht mehr nur nach beobachtbaren Abläufen, sondern nach der begrifflichen Freiheit ihrer Raum-Zeit-Beziehung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME3","text":"Empirische Zahlen werden von selbständigen Daten zu Momenten allgemeiner Maß- und Gesetzesformen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME4","text":"Der Begriff des Beweises wird in empirische Reichweite, mathematische Formulierung und begriffliche Herleitung aufgespalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Keplers empirischer Entdeckung und Newtons mathematischer Theorie wird von einem Rangunterschied zu einem Unterschied der Ausdrucks- und Behandlungsform umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT1","text":"Surface: Geschwindigkeit, Fall und himmlische Bewegung werden durch konkrete Verhältnisse von Raum, Zeit, Umlaufszeit und Entfernung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die quantitative Gesetzesform wird aus der qualitativen Beziehung der Momente und aus der Art der Bewegung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ordnet wissenschaftliche Verfahren hierarchisch und verschiebt den Maßstab von empirischer Bestätigung und formaler Eleganz auf begriffliche Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Raum erscheint als äußerliches reales Ganzes, Zeit als ideelle negative Einheit; ihre Untrennbarkeit bildet die ontologische Grundlage ihrer Maßverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Raum-Zeit-Qualität über Maßverhältnis und Bewegungstyp bis zur Kritik mathematischer Beweise zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete begriffliche Herleitung der Exponenten zwei und drei aus den Qualitäten von Raum und Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Grade von Unfreiheit, bedingter Freiheit und absoluter Freiheit formal ineinandergreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange empirische Geltung, mathematische Umformung und begriffliche Notwendigkeit als verschiedene Beweisstufen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Trennung von empirischer Bestätigung und begrifflicher Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT6","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle ist die behauptete, aber nicht ausgeführte Erzeugung der konkreten Maßgesetze aus dem Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Newtons Vorrang als Schlussfolgerung aus der Kritik des Scheins und nicht als eigenständige historische These behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111913525093Z_d8634db2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"dd42c52e8d17935ca44cd1560b096d3e2d290400be4bc8ffb86117c861050dd0","sha256":"b64712a530bf7356e568af2aef44aacb79269c3b7b677b2b5325cc346c6cc2dd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:19:13.526673+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS1","text":"The argument reconstructs how qualitative determinations of space and time generate quantitative relations of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS2","text":"Velocity is redetermined from a mere relation into the conceptually asymmetrical determination of measure of space and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS3","text":"The different kinds of motion generate different power relations because their moments stand in different conceptual relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS4","text":"Empirical laws confirm agreement with appearances, but do not yet provide a higher proof of their quantitative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS5","text":"Mathematical formulas and infinitesimal proofs provide no conceptual proof if they already presuppose the laws of nature from experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AS6","text":"Newton's asserted superiority over Kepler is attributed to transformation of expression and incipient analytical treatment, once the apparent scaffolding of proof falls away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A1","text":"Measure is the quantitative determination of a qualitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A2","text":"Space and time are inseparable as qualitative moments in themselves and in the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A3","text":"Space is an external, real whole and therefore functions as number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A4","text":"Time is the ideal and negative, and therefore functions as unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A5","text":"The quantitative relation of space and time is determined by the qualitative nature of the related moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A6","text":"Mechanical motion is an unfree relation, falling a conditionally free relation, and celestial motion an absolutely free relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A7","text":"In velocity, the space traversed stands in direct relation to the elapsed time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A8","text":"In falling, the magnitude of space stands as a square to the magnitude of time as a root.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A9","text":"In absolutely free celestial motion, the period of revolution stands as a square to distance as a cube.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A10","text":"The kinds of motion and their laws rest on the development of the Concept of their moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A11","text":"The quantitative relation of the moments is the being-for-self of measure and a single determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A12","text":"A scientific mathematics of nature must essentially be a science of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A13","text":"Empirical quanta must be elevated into universal forms of quantitative determinations in order to become moments of a law or measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A14","text":"The agreement of a law with the scope of perception is an empirical proof, but not the higher conceptual proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A15","text":"The higher proof must cognize the quantitative determinations from the related qualities or determinate Concepts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:A16","text":"A mathematical treatment that presupposes its laws of nature from experience cannot generate their conceptual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX1","text":"The relation of space and time is not determined as an arbitrary interchange of numerator and denominator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX2","text":"Space and time are not merely homogeneous magnitudes interchangeable with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX3","text":"The laws of motion are not independent of the qualitative kind of their moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX4","text":"Empirical numbers are not, as such, already the scientific form of natural law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX5","text":"The agreement of a law with observed individual cases is not the highest proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX6","text":"An abstract formula is not identical with the conceptual derivation of the law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX7","text":"An infinitesimal-calculus proof is no actual proof if it proceeds neither from empiricism nor from the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:NX8","text":"Newton's precedence over Kepler cannot follow from the mere presence of a mathematical apparatus of proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D1","text":"The position of space as numerator and of time as denominator in velocity is a qualitative determination of measure and not a mere choice of presentation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A1","CH_GB18_A_22:A3","CH_GB18_A_22:A4","CH_GB18_A_22:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D2","text":"The power relations of space and time distinguish the kinds of motion according to the degree of their freedom.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A6","CH_GB18_A_22:A8","CH_GB18_A_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D3","text":"The laws of falling and celestial motion are not externally added numerical relations, but expressions of the conceptual relation of their moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A2","CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D4","text":"The laws discovered by Galileo and Kepler possess empirical validity because their scope corresponds to the particulars of perception.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A13","CH_GB18_A_22:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D5","text":"The elevation of empirical numbers into law-forms transforms them into moments of a universal determination of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D6","text":"Mathematical principles of nature primarily provide transformation into abstract expressions and convenient formulas where they already presuppose the laws empirically.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D7","text":"The misuse of the infinitesimal generates the appearance of a proof without deriving the quantitative determination from the qualitative nature of the moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A15","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:D8","text":"If the apparent scaffolding of mathematical proofs is removed, Newton's difference from Kepler remains principally as transformation of expression and analytical treatment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD1","text":"Scientific cognition of nature is organized as a hierarchy of empirical ascertainment, mathematical formulation, and conceptual grounding.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13","CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD2","text":"The validity of a natural law depends not only on its empirical scope, but on the derivability of its quantity from quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD3","text":"Within the philosophy of nature, mathematics is simultaneously required as the necessary science of measures and determined as insufficient as soon as it merely reworks its laws formally.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD4","text":"The progression from mechanical motion through falling to celestial motion is conceived as development of the relation of space and time, and not as a mere accumulation of empirical laws.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A6","CH_GB18_A_22:A9","CH_GB18_A_22:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SD5","text":"The scientific hierarchy shifts from the formal complexity of a proof to the conceptual origin of its quantitative determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15","CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a nature whose lawfulness would be exhausted in the mere enumeration of externally given quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a mathematical universality that could be equated with conceptual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an autonomous quantitative relation that would exist independently of the qualitative determination of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a third path of proof that proceeds neither empirically nor conceptually and nevertheless generates scientific necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the assumption that greater formal or analytical complexity guarantees a higher cognitive status.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the separation of space and time into mutually independent variables whose relation is established only subsequently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX1","text":"The text excludes the possibility of a neutral, self-grounding mathematics of nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX2","text":"The text excludes an order of nature in which empirical data, mathematical formulas, and Concepts would be equivalent forms of the same proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX3","text":"The text circles around the absence of a fully executed derivation through which precisely the power exponents would proceed from the Concepts of space and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX4","text":"The text excludes a history of science in which Newton's later mathematical form could count solely as the supersession of Kepler's empirical discovery of laws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:SNX5","text":"The text treats the mere existence of empirical numbers as insufficient and makes their conceptual supersession in a form of measure the blocked, yet necessary possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS1","text":"Posit qualitative moments → conceive space and time as conceptually inseparable determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A1","CH_GB18_A_22:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS2","text":"Determine qualitative difference → arrange space as number and time as unity in functionally asymmetrical fashion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A3","CH_GB18_A_22:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS3","text":"Classify the type of relation → distinguish mechanical, conditionally free, and absolutely free motion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A5","CH_GB18_A_22:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS4","text":"Quantify the type of relation → generate direct, quadratic, and cubic relations of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A7","CH_GB18_A_22:A8","CH_GB18_A_22:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS5","text":"Generalize individual quanta → reconstruct empirical numbers as moments of a form of measure and law.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A12","CH_GB18_A_22:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS6","text":"Separate levels of proof → distinguish empirical confirmation from conceptual grounding.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A14","CH_GB18_A_22:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS7","text":"Examine formal proofs → reject every mathematical derivation that presupposes its law empirically.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:FGS8","text":"Reclassify scientific added value → restrict Newton's precedence to transformation of expression and analytical treatment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_22:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:AF1","text":"Arbitrariness of the quantitative relation → qualitative asymmetry of space and time → differentiation of the kinds of motion → power laws as determinations of measure → empirical confirmation → demand for conceptual proof → unmasking of mathematical apparent proofs → reduction of Newton's precedence to formal and analytical transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME1","text":"The relation of space and time is remapped from an interchangeable quotient structure into an asymmetrical structure of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME2","text":"Motions are no longer classified only according to observable processes, but according to the conceptual freedom of their space-time relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME3","text":"Empirical numbers are reclassified from independent data into moments of universal forms of measure and law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME4","text":"The concept of proof is split into empirical scope, mathematical formulation, and conceptual derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ME5","text":"The opposition between Kepler's empirical discovery and Newton's mathematical theory is redrawn from a difference in rank into a difference in form of expression and treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT1","text":"Surface: Velocity, falling, and celestial motion are determined through concrete relations of space, time, period of revolution, and distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT2","text":"Structural: The quantitative law-form is generated from the qualitative relation of the moments and from the kind of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text hierarchically orders scientific procedures and shifts the criterion from empirical confirmation and formal elegance to conceptual grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Space appears as an external real whole, time as ideal negative unity; their inseparability forms the ontological basis of their relations of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from space-time quality through relation of measure and type of motion to the critique of mathematical proofs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete conceptual derivation of the exponents two and three from the qualities of space and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is how the degrees of unfreedom, conditional freedom, and absolute freedom formally interlock.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as empirical validity, mathematical transformation, and conceptual necessity are treated as different levels of proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT5","text":"Its strongest point is the separation of empirical confirmation and conceptual grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT6","text":"Its weakest point is the asserted but unexecuted generation of the concrete laws of measure from the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_22:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as Newton's precedence is treated as a conclusion from the critique of appearance and not as an independent historical thesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_22:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_22@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_22:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 87","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 87","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR","layer":"CH","title":"C. Being-for-Self in Measure.","order":88,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDFR"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDFR@R001","sha256":"2e4a90ee74ec1e4b5c59ffea1fd5f38075a0620a2705d2a1f611ca0f6f5fbcee","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, daß das specifische Maaß zugleich ein qualitativ bestimmtes Potenzenverhältniß und ein äußerlich-unmittelbares Quantum enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS2","text":"Die unmittelbare Qualität und ihr unmittelbares Quantum erscheinen zunächst unabhängig von der specifischen Maaßbestimmung, bleiben aber deren Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS3","text":"Das unmittelbare Quantum wird als Exponent eines direkten Verhältnisses bestimmt, der die Negation der qualitativ unterschiedenen Seiten in sich faßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS4","text":"Das Maaß realisiert sich erst als Einheit des unmittelbaren direkten Maaßes und des immanenten specifischen Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS5","text":"Diese Einheit ist negative Einheit: Die Selbstbestimmung der einen Seite setzt sich in ihrem Anderen und gewinnt dadurch reales Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS6","text":"Das reale Fürsichseyn eines Maaßganzen schlägt in die Repulsion selbstständiger Etwas um, deren Materialität in ihrer Maaßbestimmtheit liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","text":"Das specifische Maaß ist ein qualitativ bestimmtes Größenverhältniß in Potenzenform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A2","text":"Die Seiten eines specifischen Maaßes sind Momente einer einzigen qualitativen Maaßbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","text":"Die Qualitäten der Maaßseiten bleiben zunächst unmittelbare und voneinander verschiedene Qualitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit der Qualität impliziert ein unmittelbares und gegen das specifische Verhältniß gleichgültiges Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","text":"Das unmittelbare Quantum gehört als äußeres und empirisch erscheinendes Moment dennoch dem Maaße an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A6","text":"Jedes Verhältniß unterschiedener Seiten enthält eine Einheit, die im Quantitativen als von der Verhältnißbestimmung unterschiedenes Quantum erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","text":"Dieses Quantum ist als Exponent die Negation der unterschiedenen Seiten und damit Fürsichseyn nur an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A8","text":"Der Exponent ist als Daseyn ein einfaches unmittelbares Quantum und ein unveränderlicher Exponent eines direkten Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","text":"Das Maaß ist realisiert, wenn es die Einheit eines unmittelbaren äußeren Maaßes und eines in sich specifirten Maaßes ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","text":"Die Einheit beider Maaßformen ist negative Einheit, weil jede ihre Selbstbestimmung in der Bestimmtheit ihres Anderen hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A11","text":"Die negative Einheit des Maaßes ist reales Fürsichseyn, die Kategorie eines selbstständigen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A12","text":"Das selbstständige Maaßganze repulsirt sich in unterschiedene Selbstständige, deren Bestehen in ihrer Maaßbestimmtheit liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX1","text":"Die specifische Maaßbestimmung ist nicht ein bloß äußerliches arithmetisches Fortschreiten von Quantitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX2","text":"Die unmittelbare Qualität ist nicht außerhalb ihrer Beziehung auf andere Qualität und Größe absolut selbstgenügsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX3","text":"Der empirische Koefficient ist nicht selbst die entwickelte qualitative Specifikation des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX4","text":"Die formelle Geschwindigkeit eines atomaren ersten Zeitmoments besitzt in der Fallbewegung kein Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX5","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß ist nicht mit dem Potenzenverhältniß des specifischen Maaßes identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX6","text":"Die Naturkraft ist nicht auf das mechanische Verhalten eines äußerlich hervorgebrachten direkten Verhältnisses reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX7","text":"Das Maaßganze ist nicht die unvermittelte Identität zweier fertiger Maaßformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D1","text":"Die unmittelbaren Qualitäten stehen neben ihrem specifischen Potenzenverhältniß in einem direkten und unmittelbaren Maaßverhältniß.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D2","text":"Der Exponent fungiert zugleich als empirische Einheit des Quantitativen und als Bestimmtheitsmoment des direkten Verhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A6","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D3","text":"Der empirische Koefficient stellt das Fürsichseyn des Maaßes nur in seiner unmittelbaren, noch an sich seienden Form dar.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D4","text":"Die entwickelte Bestimmtheit des Fürsichseyns liegt nicht im unmittelbaren Exponenten, sondern im specifischen Potenzenverhältniß der Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D5","text":"Im Beispiel der Fallbewegung ist das direkte Verhältniß nur antizipiert, während das wirkliche Maaßverhältniß als Potenzenverhältniß bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D6","text":"Eine Naturkraft gehört dem specifischen Maaß an, sofern die Natur ihrer qualitativen Seiten deren Potenzenverhältniß bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A2","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D7","text":"Das unmittelbare Maaß erhält seine qualitative Wahrheit erst durch seine Einheit mit dem specifischen Maaß.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD1","text":"Das Maaß integriert die Äußerlichkeit des empirischen Quantums, ohne diese Äußerlichkeit in die immanente Specifikation aufzulösen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD2","text":"Reales Fürsichseyn entsteht nicht vor dem Verhältniß, sondern als negative Einheit der gegensätzlichen Formen von Unmittelbarkeit und Specifikation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","CH_GB18_CDFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD3","text":"Selbstständigkeit ist im Maaßsystem zugleich Einheit und innere Teilbarkeit, weil das selbstständige Etwas sich notwendig in maaßbestimmte Selbstständige repulsirt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","CH_GB18_CDFR:A11","CH_GB18_CDFR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD4","text":"Das empirisch Gegebene wird vom Grund einer Naturbestimmung zum begrenzten Erscheinungsmoment ihrer unmittelbaren Seite herabgestuft.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Qualität, Quantum und Verhältnis unabhängig voneinander fertige Bestimmungen wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem ein empirischer Zahlenkoefficient die innere Notwendigkeit einer qualitativen Naturbestimmung erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die wirkliche Bewegung aus einem punktförmigen Anfangszustand und einer an diesem vorhandenen formellen Geschwindigkeit ableitbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Selbstständigkeit, die keiner Negation, keiner Vermittlung und keiner inneren Repulsion bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Naturkraft, deren Bestimmtheit vollständig im äußerlichen Mechanismus eines direkten Verhältnisses aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine schlechthin erste Unmittelbarkeit, die nicht schon als Moment eines Maaßverhältnisses bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist ein finales Fürsichseyn, das nicht zugleich die Möglichkeit seiner Selbstentzweiung in sich trüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX3","text":"Nicht zulässig ist eine vollständige begriffliche Ableitung des empirischen Koefficienten aus der qualitativen Maaßbestimmung allein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX4","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine unmittelbare Identität von Naturgesetz und empirischer Quantität, weil deren Einheit nur als negative Vermittlung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS1","text":"Specifisches Potenzenverhältniß → qualitative Maaßeinheit der Seiten → Fortbestehen unmittelbarer Qualitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS2","text":"Qualitative Unmittelbarkeit → quantitativ-unmittelbares und empirisch erscheinendes Moment → Exponent eines direkten Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS3","text":"Exponent als Negation der Seiten → Fürsichseyn an sich → unmittelbares Daseyn als unveränderlicher Quotient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS4","text":"Äußeres direktes Maaß + immanentes specifisches Maaß → negative Einheit → reales Fürsichseyn des Maaßganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS5","text":"Reales Fürsichseyn → Selbstrepulsion → unterschiedene maaßbestimmte Selbstständige und Materialitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF1","text":"Qualitativ bestimmtes Potenzenverhältniß → Unmittelbarkeit von Qualität und Quantum → empirischer Exponent des direkten Verhältnisses → Einheit beider Maaßformen → negative Einheit → reales Fürsichseyn → Repulsion selbstständiger Maaßganzer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF2","text":"Empirische Zahlbestimmung → Abtrennung von der immanenten Specifikation → Bestimmung als unmittelbares Fürsichseynsmoment → Unterordnung unter das realisierte Maaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF3","text":"Formelle Bewegungsvorstellung → Ausschluß atomarer Anfangsgeschwindigkeit → Vorrang des Potenzenverhältnisses → Einordnung der Schwere als specifische Naturkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME1","text":"Qualität und Quantum werden nicht als getrennte Sphären kartiert, sondern als gegensätzliche Momente eines Maaßprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME2","text":"Der empirische Koefficient erscheint nicht mehr als erklärender Grund des Naturgesetzes, sondern als unmittelbarer Exponent innerhalb seiner Maaßstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME3","text":"Das direkte Verhältniß wird vom Modell des wirklichen Gesetzes zum äußeren und nur mitgesetzten Maaßmoment umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME4","text":"Das Etwas erscheint nicht als vorausgesetzte Substanz, sondern als Resultat negativer Einheit im Maaßverhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME5","text":"Materialität wird als Bestehen maaßbestimmter Selbstständigkeit und nicht als von Maaßverhältnissen unabhängiger Träger sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Fallbewegung unterscheidet ein Potenzenverhältniß von Raum und Zeit von einem lediglich formellen direkten Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Maaß vermittelt specifische qualitative Bestimmtheit mit äußerlicher quantitativer Unmittelbarkeit durch den Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Empirische Größen werden als begrifflich begrenzte Momente behandelt, deren Erklärungskompetenz nicht über ihre Stellung im Maaß hinausreicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reales Fürsichseyn ist negative Einheit, deren Selbständigkeit nur als Repulsion in weitere maaßbestimmte Selbstständige besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom specifischen Potenzenverhältniß über den unmittelbaren Exponenten zur negativen Einheit des Maaßes zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Herkunft und konkrete Bestimmung des empirischen Koefficienten, da sie ausdrücklich den konkreten Wissenschaften überlassen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, daß äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit weder eliminiert noch als selbstständiger Grund zugelassen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Strukturstelle ist die Umwandlung des Exponenten aus einem empirisch-unmittelbaren Quantum in ein Moment realen Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung, das direkte Verhältniß existiere in der Fallbewegung nicht, und seiner Bestimmung als realisierter Seite des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung bleibt zwischen der begrifflichen Einordnung des Koefficienten als Fürsichseynsmoment und der ausgesetzten Erklärung seiner konkreten Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, sofern die Repulsion nicht als äußerer Folgeschritt, sondern als im realen Fürsichseyn enthaltene Selbstentzweiung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114108285677Z_c1308a28","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Being-for-self in Measure.","source_sha256":"2e4a90ee74ec1e4b5c59ffea1fd5f38075a0620a2705d2a1f611ca0f6f5fbcee","sha256":"1945b314640a6350fdc362524e21f8e7ad19aa72f1df532f3532b9c72f220992","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:41:08.287389+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS1","text":"The problem consists in the fact that specific Measure contains at once a qualitatively determinate ratio of powers and an externally immediate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS2","text":"Immediate quality and its immediate quantum initially appear independent of the specific determination of Measure, but remain its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS3","text":"The immediate quantum is determined as the exponent of a direct ratio, which encompasses within itself the negation of the qualitatively differentiated sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS4","text":"Measure realizes itself only as the unity of immediate direct Measure and immanent specific Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS5","text":"This unity is negative unity: the self-determination of the one side posits itself in its other and thereby attains real being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AS6","text":"The real being-for-self of a whole of Measure passes over into the repulsion of self-subsistent somethings, whose materiality lies in their determination by Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","text":"Specific Measure is a qualitatively determinate magnitude-ratio in the form of powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A2","text":"The sides of a specific Measure are moments of a single qualitative determination of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","text":"The qualities of the sides of Measure initially remain immediate qualities distinct from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","text":"The immediacy of quality implies an immediate quantum indifferent to the specific ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","text":"As an external and empirically appearing moment, the immediate quantum nevertheless belongs to Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A6","text":"Every ratio of differentiated sides contains a unity which, in the quantitative, appears as a quantum distinct from the determination of the ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","text":"As exponent, this quantum is the negation of the differentiated sides and hence being-for-self only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A8","text":"As determinate being, the exponent is a simple immediate quantum and an invariable exponent of a direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","text":"Measure is realized when it is the unity of an immediate external Measure and a Measure specified within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","text":"The unity of both forms of Measure is negative unity because each has its self-determination in the determinacy of its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A11","text":"The negative unity of Measure is real being-for-self, the category of a self-subsistent something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:A12","text":"The self-subsistent whole of Measure repels itself into differentiated self-subsistents, whose subsistence lies in their determination by Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX1","text":"The specific determination of Measure is not a merely external arithmetical progression of quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX2","text":"Immediate quality is not absolutely self-sufficient outside its relation to other quality and magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX3","text":"The empirical coefficient is not itself the developed qualitative specification of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX4","text":"The formal velocity of an atomic first moment of time has no determinate being in falling motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX5","text":"The direct ratio is not identical with the ratio of powers of specific Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX6","text":"Natural force is not reducible to the mechanical behavior of an externally produced direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:NX7","text":"The whole of Measure is not the unmediated identity of two ready-made forms of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D1","text":"The immediate qualities stand alongside their specific ratio of powers in a direct and immediate ratio of Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D2","text":"The exponent functions at once as the empirical unity of the quantitative and as a moment of determinacy of the direct ratio.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A6","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D3","text":"The empirical coefficient represents the being-for-self of Measure only in its immediate form, still being in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D4","text":"The developed determinacy of being-for-self lies not in the immediate exponent, but in the specific ratio of powers of the sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D5","text":"In the example of falling motion, the direct ratio is only anticipated, whereas the actual ratio of Measure is determined as a ratio of powers.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A8","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D6","text":"A natural force belongs to specific Measure insofar as the nature of its qualitative sides determines their ratio of powers.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A1","CH_GB18_CDFR:A2","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:D7","text":"Immediate Measure attains its qualitative truth only through its unity with specific Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD1","text":"Measure integrates the externality of the empirical quantum without dissolving this externality into immanent specification.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A4","CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD2","text":"Real being-for-self arises not prior to the ratio, but as the negative unity of the opposed forms of immediacy and specification.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A3","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9","CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","CH_GB18_CDFR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD3","text":"In the system of Measure, self-subsistence is at once unity and inner divisibility, because the self-subsistent something necessarily repels itself into self-subsistents determined by Measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A10","CH_GB18_CDFR:A11","CH_GB18_CDFR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SD4","text":"The empirically given is demoted from the ground of a natural determination to the limited moment of appearance of its immediate side.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDFR:A5","CH_GB18_CDFR:A7","CH_GB18_CDFR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which quality, quantum, and ratio would be ready-made determinations independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which an empirical numerical coefficient explains the inner necessity of a qualitative natural determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which actual motion would be derivable from a point-like initial state and a formal velocity present in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a self-subsistence that requires no negation, no mediation, and no inner repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a natural force whose determinacy is wholly exhausted in the external mechanism of a direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely first immediacy that would not already be determined as a moment of a ratio of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a final being-for-self that did not at the same time bear within itself the possibility of its self-division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX3","text":"Not admissible is a complete conceptual derivation of the empirical coefficient from the qualitative determination of Measure alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:SNX4","text":"An immediate identity of natural law and empirical quantity remains barred, because their unity appears only as negative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS1","text":"Specific ratio of powers → qualitative unity of Measure of the sides → persistence of immediate qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS2","text":"Qualitative immediacy → quantitatively immediate and empirically appearing moment → exponent of a direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS3","text":"Exponent as negation of the sides → being-for-self in itself → immediate determinate being as an invariable quotient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS4","text":"External direct Measure + immanent specific Measure → negative unity → real being-for-self of the whole of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:FGS5","text":"Real being-for-self → self-repulsion → differentiated self-subsistents and materialities determined by Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF1","text":"Qualitatively determinate ratio of powers → immediacy of quality and quantum → empirical exponent of the direct ratio → unity of both forms of Measure → negative unity → real being-for-self → repulsion of self-subsistent wholes of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF2","text":"Empirical numerical determination → separation from immanent specification → determination as immediate moment of being-for-self → subordination under realized Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:AF3","text":"Formal conception of motion → exclusion of atomic initial velocity → primacy of the ratio of powers → classification of gravity as a specific natural force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME1","text":"Quality and quantum are not mapped as separate spheres, but as opposed moments of a process of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME2","text":"The empirical coefficient no longer appears as the explanatory ground of natural law, but as an immediate exponent within its structure of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME3","text":"The direct ratio is reclassified from the model of the actual law into an external and merely co-posited moment of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME4","text":"The something appears not as a presupposed substance, but as the result of negative unity in the ratio of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ME5","text":"Materiality becomes visible as the subsistence of self-subsistence determined by Measure, and not as a bearer independent of ratios of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Falling motion distinguishes a ratio of powers of space and time from a merely formal direct ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Measure mediates specific qualitative determinacy with external quantitative immediacy through the exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Empirical magnitudes are treated as conceptually limited moments whose explanatory competence does not extend beyond their position in Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Real being-for-self is negative unity, whose self-subsistence exists only as repulsion into further self-subsistents determined by Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the specific ratio of powers, through the immediate exponent, to the negative unity of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT2","text":"The positive origin and concrete determination of the empirical coefficient remain underdetermined, since they are expressly left to the concrete sciences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on the fact that external immediacy is neither eliminated nor admitted as a self-subsistent ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural point is the transformation of the exponent from an empirically immediate quantum into a moment of real being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the assertion that the direct ratio does not exist in falling motion and its determination as a realized side of Measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT6","text":"A further tension remains between the conceptual classification of the coefficient as a moment of being-for-self and the suspended explanation of its concrete magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDFR:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement insofar as repulsion is treated not as an external consequential step, but as self-division contained in real being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDFR:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDFR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDFR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 88","title":"C. Being-for-Self in Measure.","context":"Chapter 88","original_title":"C. Das Fürsichseyn im Maaße."},"original_title":"C. Das Fürsichseyn im Maaße.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Relation of Self-Subsistent Measures.","order":89,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DVLS"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DVLS@R001","sha256":"19884217f0136f7347b3bed040286b38e39fdd509fb410f7b7a40d417673357b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Bestimmung des Maaßes als Verhältniß von Maaßen, deren Seiten zugleich selbstständige reale Dinge sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS2","text":"Die Kernthese lautet, daß materielle Qualität durch quantitative Relationen von Maaßen bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS3","text":"Das Argument ist eine rekonstruktiv-dialektische Fortbestimmung des Maaßes vom unmittelbaren Verhältniß zur relationalen Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von abstrakten Maaßverhältnissen zu materiellen Maaßen und von der äußeren Verbindung zur qualitativen Spezifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS5","text":"Die Spezifikation erzeugt eine Reihe direkter Verhältnisse, deren quantitative Kontinuität durch qualitative Knoten unterbrochen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS6","text":"Die Reihe geht in Maaßlosigkeit und Unendlichkeit des Maaßes über, worin die ausschließenden Selbstständigkeiten Eins werden und das Selbstständige in negative Beziehung zu sich selbst tritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","text":"Das Maaß ist als Verhältniß von Maaßen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","text":"Maaßverhältnisse machen die Qualität unterschiedener selbstständiger Etwas aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A3","text":"Abstrakte Maaße können zu Momenten materieller Existenzen untergeordnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A4","text":"Unter dieser Unterordnung verhalten sich die quantitativen Momente in äußerlich direkten Verhältnissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","text":"Die Seiten des realen Maaßes sind selbst Maaße und zugleich reale, selbstständige Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","text":"Das Verhältniß solcher Seiten ist zunächst unmittelbar und verbindet äußerlich getrennte Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","text":"Ein selbstständiges Maaß bestimmt durch sein Verhältniß zu anderen Dingen deren Spezifikation und die selbstständige Materialität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","text":"Das äußerliche Beziehen auf viele Andere erzeugt andere Verhältnisse und andere Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A9","text":"Die spezifische Selbstständigkeit geht aus dem direkten Verhältniß in eine Reihe spezifischer Bestimmungen über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","text":"Die entstehenden direkten Verhältnisse sind an sich bestimmte und ausschließende Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","text":"Der Unterschied dieser Maaße ist zunächst quantitativ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","text":"Qualitative Verhältnisse unterbrechen den quantitativen Fortgang und bilden eine Knotenlinie spezifischer Selbstständiger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","text":"Der Fortgang der Maaße tritt in die Maaßlosigkeit und die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","text":"In der Unendlichkeit des Maaßes sind die sich ausschließenden Selbstständigkeiten Eins miteinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A15","text":"In der Unendlichkeit des Maaßes tritt das Selbstständige in negative Beziehung zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX1","text":"Das reale Maaß ist nicht bloß unmittelbares Maaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX2","text":"Die abstrakten Momente des Maaßes verhalten sich nicht mehr lediglich nach ihrer eigenen Begriffsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX3","text":"Die äußerliche numerische Einfachheit direkter Verhältnisse ist keine geistige begriffliche Erfüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX4","text":"Die spezifische Selbstständigkeit bleibt nicht in einem direkten Verhältniß bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX5","text":"Der Fortgang der Maaße ist kein bloß ununterbrochener quantitativer Fortgang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX6","text":"Das mannigfaltige Verhalten bleibt nicht gleichgültig und äußerlich zerstreut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX7","text":"Die sich ausschließenden Selbstständigkeiten bleiben am Ende nicht einfach äußerlich voneinander getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX8","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes ist nicht die bloße Fortsetzung vieler voneinander isolierter Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D1","text":"Das reale Maaß entsteht, indem abstrakte quantitative Verhältnisse zu Bestimmungen materieller Existenzen werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D2","text":"Das anfängliche Ganze des realen Maaßes ist die äußerliche Verbindung zweier getrennt bestehender, selbstständiger Maaße.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D3","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit materieller Dinge wird durch ihre quantitative Beziehung auf andere Dinge erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D4","text":"Das Beziehen auf viele Andere verwandelt die unmittelbare Selbstständigkeit in eine Reihe spezifischer Maaßbestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D5","text":"Die direkten Verhältnisse bilden als bestimmte und ausschließende Maaße eine Struktur der Wahlverwandschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","CH_GB18_DVLS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D6","text":"Die quantitative Reihe enthält qualitative Sprünge und erscheint dadurch als Knotenlinie spezifischer Selbstständiger.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D7","text":"Die Knotenlinie führt den Fortgang aus der quantitativen Bestimmtheit in die Maaßlosigkeit und die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D8","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes vereinigt die ausschließenden Selbstständigkeiten und bestimmt das Selbstständige als negative Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD1","text":"Materielle Qualität erscheint nicht als unabhängiger Grund hinter dem Maaß, sondern als Resultat relationaler Maaßbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","CH_GB18_DVLS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD2","text":"Selbstständigkeit besitzt einen relationalen Ursprung und vollendet sich als ausschließende Schließung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9","CH_GB18_DVLS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD3","text":"Quantitative Kontinuität und qualitative Diskontinuität bilden keine Gegensätze, sondern eine gemeinsame Knotenstruktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD4","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes ist kein äußerliches Jenseits der Reihe, sondern deren immanente negative Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD5","text":"Das selbstständige Maaß ist zugleich als getrenntes Ding vorausgesetzt und erst durch sein Verhältniß zu anderen qualitativ bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","CH_GB18_DVLS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Qualität, die vor jeder quantitativen Beziehung zu anderen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein materielles Ding als fester Träger von Bestimmungen, der von seinen Verhältnissen unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein äußerliches Verhältniß, das die qualitative Bestimmtheit seiner Seiten unverändert ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein homogener quantitativer Fortgang ohne qualitative Unterbrechungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine positive Selbstständigkeit, die von Ausschließung und negativer Selbstbeziehung unberührt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX1","text":"Das System setzt die Abwesenheit eines nichtrelationalen Grundes voraus, auf den die materiellen Dinge zurückgeführt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX2","text":"Es behandelt die Möglichkeit einer zugleich vollständig äußeren und qualitativ unabhängigen Beziehung als unhaltbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX3","text":"Es gibt keinen positiven Endpunkt, an dem die Reihe der Maaße als fertige Selbstständigkeit abgeschlossen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit stabiler, nicht in sich zurückschlagender Selbstidentität verleiht der Unendlichkeit des Maaßes ihre negative Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte Maaßrelation → Unterordnung der quantitativen Momente unter materielle Bestimmungen → reales Maaß.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS2","text":"Reales Maaß → zwei selbstständige Seiten → unmittelbare äußerliche Verbindung getrennter Dinge.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Beziehung auf viele Andere → Erzeugung weiterer Verhältnisse → Reihe spezifischer Maaße.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS4","text":"Reihe direkter Verhältnisse → quantitative Unterschiede → ausschließende Maaße der Wahlverwandschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","CH_GB18_DVLS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS5","text":"Quantitativer Fortgang → qualitative Unterbrechungen → Knotenlinie spezifischer Selbstständiger.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS6","text":"Knotenlinie → Maaßlosigkeit → Unendlichkeit des Maaßes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS7","text":"Unendlichkeit des Maaßes → Einheit der Ausschließenden → negative Beziehung des Selbstständigen auf sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF1","text":"Abstrakte Maaßverhältnisse → reale Maaße materieller Dinge → unmittelbare äußere Verbindung → relationale Spezifikation → Reihe von Maaßen → qualitative Knotenlinie → Maaßlosigkeit und Unendlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF2","text":"Selbstständige Materialität → quantitative Beziehung auf Andere → direkte ausschließende Maaße → Wahlverwandschaft → Einheit der Ausschließenden → negative Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF3","text":"Äußerliche Getrenntheit → erzeugte relationale Bestimmtheit → Aufhebung der bloßen Direktheit → Selbstständigkeit als negative Relation zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME1","text":"Das Maaß wird von einer abstrakten Größenrelation zu einer Bestimmung materieller Existenz umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME2","text":"Das Ding wird nicht mehr als isolierter Träger von Qualität, sondern als Knoten in einer Reihe von Maaßverhältnissen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Quantität und Qualität wird durch die Knotenlinie als Zusammenhang von Kontinuität und qualitativer Schwelle reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME4","text":"Wahlverwandschaft wird von einer bloßen Verbindung zu einer ausschließenden Form relationaler Selbstständigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME5","text":"Unendlichkeit wird nicht als äußerliche Endlosigkeit, sondern als negative Selbstbeziehung des Maaßes kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gegenstand der unmittelbaren Bestimmung sind selbstständige Maaße, physikalische Dinge und materielle Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die materielle Qualität wird durch quantitative Beziehungen, Serienbildung, Ausschließung und qualitative Knoten erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Untersuchung verschiebt den Ausgangspunkt von unmittelbaren Dingen auf die Fortbestimmung ihrer Verhältnisse und der Verhältnisse dieser Verhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Seiende ist selbstständig nur innerhalb relationaler Bestimmung; die zeitliche Fortbewegung der Maaßreihe endet in einer negativen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom abstrakten Maaß zum realen Maaß, zur Reihe und zur Unendlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem genauen Kriterium ein quantitatives Verhältniß in ein qualitatives Verhältniß und eine Knotenlinie übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit als relationale und nicht als isoliert positive Bestimmung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung materieller Qualität aus der Beziehung von Maaßen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung bleibt, daß die selbstständigen Dinge zunächst als äußerlich getrennt vorausgesetzt, qualitativ aber erst durch ihre Beziehungen bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß der Fortgang zugleich quantitative Reihe und qualitative Unterbrechung sein muß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern Maaßlosigkeit nicht als Abbruch, sondern als immanente negative Konsequenz der Maaßreihe gefaßt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115737347846Z_13f3cd72","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The Relation of Independent Measures.","source_sha256":"19884217f0136f7347b3bed040286b38e39fdd509fb410f7b7a40d417673357b","sha256":"fa197c1fbf0420acb057b29af13c6679e76e8a2835a58a49a502b4be97c038ab","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:57:37.354372+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS1","text":"The central problem is the determination of measure as a relation of measures, whose sides are at the same time independent real things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS2","text":"The core thesis is that material quality is determined through quantitative relations of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS3","text":"The argument is a reconstructive-dialectical further determination of measure from immediate relation to relational independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS4","text":"The movement leads from abstract relations of measure to material measures and from external connection to qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS5","text":"Specification produces a series of direct relations whose quantitative continuity is interrupted by qualitative nodes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AS6","text":"The series passes over into measurelessness and the infinity of measure, wherein the excluding independences become one and the independent enters into negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","text":"Measure is determined as a relation of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","text":"Relations of measure constitute the quality of distinct independent somethings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A3","text":"Abstract measures can be subordinated to moments of material existences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A4","text":"Under this subordination, the quantitative moments relate in externally direct relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","text":"The sides of real measure are themselves measures and at the same time real, independent somethings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","text":"The relation of such sides is initially immediate and externally connects separate things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","text":"An independent measure determines, through its relation to other things, their specification and independent materiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","text":"External relating to many others produces other relations and other measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A9","text":"Specific independence passes from the direct relation into a series of specific determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","text":"The emerging direct relations are in themselves determinate and excluding measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","text":"The difference of these measures is initially quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","text":"Qualitative relations interrupt the quantitative progression and form a nodal line of specific independents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","text":"The progression of measures enters into measurelessness and the infinity of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","text":"In the infinity of measure, the mutually excluding independences are one with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:A15","text":"In the infinity of measure, the independent enters into negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX1","text":"Real measure is not merely immediate measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX2","text":"The abstract moments of measure no longer relate merely according to their own conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX3","text":"The external numerical simplicity of direct relations is no spiritual conceptual fulfillment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX4","text":"Specific independence does not remain in a direct relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX5","text":"The progression of measures is not a merely uninterrupted quantitative progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX6","text":"The manifold relating does not remain indifferent and externally dispersed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX7","text":"The mutually excluding independences do not ultimately remain simply externally separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:NX8","text":"The infinity of measure is not the mere continuation of many measures isolated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D1","text":"Real measure arises insofar as abstract quantitative relations become determinations of material existences.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D2","text":"The initial whole of real measure is the external connection of two separately existing, independent measures.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D3","text":"The qualitative determinacy of material things is produced through their quantitative relation to other things.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D4","text":"Relating to many others transforms immediate independence into a series of specific determinations of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D5","text":"As determinate and excluding measures, the direct relations form a structure of elective affinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","CH_GB18_DVLS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D6","text":"The quantitative series contains qualitative leaps and thereby appears as a nodal line of specific independents.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D7","text":"The nodal line leads the progression out of quantitative determinacy into measurelessness and the infinity of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:D8","text":"The infinity of measure unites the excluding independences and determines the independent as negative relation to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD1","text":"Material quality appears not as an independent ground behind measure, but as the result of relational determination of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","CH_GB18_DVLS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD2","text":"Independence possesses a relational origin and completes itself as excluding closure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9","CH_GB18_DVLS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD3","text":"Quantitative continuity and qualitative discontinuity form not opposites, but a common nodal structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD4","text":"The infinity of measure is not an external beyond of the series, but its immanent negative self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SD5","text":"The independent measure is at once presupposed as a separate thing and only qualitatively determined through its relation to others.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6","CH_GB18_DVLS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a quality that exists prior to every quantitative relation to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a material thing as a fixed bearer of determinations that would be independent of its relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an external relation that would leave the qualitative determinacy of its sides unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a homogeneous quantitative progression without qualitative interruptions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a positive independence that remains untouched by exclusion and negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX1","text":"The system presupposes the absence of a non-relational ground to which material things could be reduced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX2","text":"It treats the possibility of a relation that is at once wholly external and qualitatively independent as untenable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX3","text":"There is no positive endpoint at which the series of measures would be concluded as completed independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility of stable self-identity not rebounding into itself confers upon the infinity of measure its negative form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS1","text":"Abstract measure relation → subordination of quantitative moments to material determinations → real measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A1","CH_GB18_DVLS:A2","CH_GB18_DVLS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS2","text":"Real measure → two independent sides → immediate external connection of separate things.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A5","CH_GB18_DVLS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS3","text":"External relation to many others → production of further relations → series of specific measures.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A7","CH_GB18_DVLS:A8","CH_GB18_DVLS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS4","text":"Series of direct relations → quantitative differences → excluding measures of elective affinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A10","CH_GB18_DVLS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS5","text":"Quantitative progression → qualitative interruptions → nodal line of specific independents.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A11","CH_GB18_DVLS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS6","text":"Nodal line → measurelessness → infinity of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A12","CH_GB18_DVLS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:FGS7","text":"Infinity of measure → unity of the excluding → negative relation of the independent to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLS:A14","CH_GB18_DVLS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF1","text":"Abstract relations of measure → real measures of material things → immediate external connection → relational specification → series of measures → qualitative nodal line → measurelessness and infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF2","text":"Independent materiality → quantitative relation to others → direct excluding measures → elective affinity → unity of the excluding → negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:AF3","text":"External separateness → generated relational determinacy → sublation of mere immediacy → independence as negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME1","text":"Measure is remapped from an abstract relation of magnitude to a determination of material existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME2","text":"The thing is no longer visible as an isolated bearer of quality, but as a node in a series of relations of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME3","text":"The opposition of quantity and quality is reorganized by the nodal line as a connection of continuity and qualitative threshold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME4","text":"Elective affinity is reclassified from a mere connection into an excluding form of relational independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ME5","text":"Infinity is mapped not as external endlessness, but as the negative self-relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT1","text":"Surface — The object of immediate determination is independent measures, physical things, and material properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Material quality is produced through quantitative relations, series formation, exclusion, and qualitative nodes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The investigation shifts the point of departure from immediate things to the further determination of their relations and of the relations of these relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is independent only within relational determination; the temporal movement of the series of measures ends in a negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from abstract measure to real measure, to the series, and to infinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is according to which exact criterion a quantitative relation passes over into a qualitative relation and a nodal line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as independence is understood as a relational and not as an isolated positive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the derivation of material quality from the relation of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT5","text":"The central tension remains that the independent things are initially presupposed as externally separate, but qualitatively determined only through their relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the progression must be at once quantitative series and qualitative interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLS:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as measurelessness is grasped not as a break-off, but as the immanent negative consequence of the series of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DVLS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DVLS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 89","title":"A. The Relation of Self-Subsistent Measures.","context":"Chapter 89","original_title":"A. Das Verhältniß selbstständiger Maaße."},"original_title":"A. Das Verhältniß selbstständiger Maaße.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0","layer":"CH","title":"a. Combination of Two Measures.","order":90,"parents":["RAW_GB18_VZM0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_VZM0@R001","sha256":"1dccc8200dd73efdff7d7c60688abd7e705ea3e9a232e25b3ebb4a2fcc27196e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die Verbindung zweier Dinge von verschiedenem innerem Maaße gegenüber der bloßen Summation zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS2","text":"Das Etwas wird als Maaßverhältniß von Quantis und als Beziehung der daraus bestimmten Qualitäten gefaßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS3","text":"Die qualitative Natur entsteht aus dem Verhältnis einer materiellen Fürsichseinsseite zu einer ideellen äußerlichen Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS4","text":"Da jedes Quantum zugleich Exponent eines Maaßverhältnisses ist, wird seine äußerliche Veränderung zur gegenseitigen Spezifikation der Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS5","text":"In der Verbindung bleibt nur die materielle Menge als unmittelbares Quantum summierbar, während das Volumen als ideelle Seite veränderlich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS6","text":"Die Veränderung der Exponenten verändert dadurch das Maaß selbst und die auf ihm beruhende qualitative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS7","text":"Die immanent-diagnostische Bewegung führt von der quantitativen Verbindung zur Bestimmung des Maaßes als relational und nicht in sich fest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A1","text":"Ein Etwas ist als Maaßverhältniß von Quantis bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A2","text":"Das Etwas ist die Beziehung der ihm zukommenden Qualitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A3","text":"Eine Qualität ist das materielle Fürsichseyn, das sich intensiv als Gewicht und extensiv als Menge materieller Theile bestimmen läßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A4","text":"Die andere Qualität ist die Äußerlichkeit dieses Fürsichseyns und hat als Raum oder Volumen ideellen Charakter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","text":"Das Verhältnis der quantitativen Bestimmungen konstituiert die qualitative Natur des materiellen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A6","text":"Das Volumen fungiert als Einheit, während das intensive Quantum als Anzahl materieller Fürsichseins-Eins erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A7","text":"Der Exponent des Verhältnisses ist ein unmittelbares specifisches Quantum, dessen specifische Natur nur im Vergleich mit anderen Exponenten bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","text":"Weil das Maaß auf einem Quantum beruht, bleibt seine innere Bestimmtheit zugleich äußerlich und veränderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A9","text":"Das auf das Maaß bezogene Andere ist kein beliebiges Quantum, sondern selbst Exponent eines Maaßverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A10","text":"Jedes Maaß erhält sich gegen die äußerliche Quantumsveränderung, indem es sich negativ zu ihr verhält und sie specifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A11","text":"Bei der Verbindung zweier Maaße summiert sich als unmittelbares Quantum nur die materielle Menge beziehungsweise das Gewicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A12","text":"Die Exponenten verändern sich, weil das als äußerlicher Zusatz summierte Quantum vom Maaß negiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A13","text":"Die immanente Bestimmung des Quantitativen erscheint an der ideellen Seite als Veränderung des Volumens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A14","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit eines Etwas ist nicht in seinem eigenen Maaße fixiert, sondern in anderen Maaßverhältnissen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX1","text":"Die Verbindung ist keine bloße Summation von Gewicht und Volumen zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX2","text":"Das zur Verbindung gehörige Andere ist kein beliebiges Quantum außerhalb eines Maaßverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX3","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmung beruht hier nicht auf einem selbständigen reinen Potenzenverhältniß, sondern auf einem unmittelbaren direkten Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX4","text":"Das Volumen ist kein unveränderliches unmittelbares Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX5","text":"Die specifische Natur eines Etwas ist keine in sich isolierte und unveränderliche Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX6","text":"Die Gleichartigkeit der verbundenen materiellen Dinge wird aus der gegenwärtigen Bestimmung des Maaßverhältnisses ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX7","text":"Der Raum ist kein an sich bestehender substantieller Träger der Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D1","text":"Die specifische Natur eines Etwas erscheint als Exponent eines Maaßverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A1","CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","CH_GB18_VZM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D2","text":"Zwei Dinge können in Verbindung treten, sofern ihre jeweiligen Quanta zugleich Exponenten eigener Maaßverhältnisse sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","CH_GB18_VZM0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D3","text":"Die Selbsterhaltung eines Maaßes gegenüber äußerlicher Veränderung ist zugleich Veränderung dieses Maaßes.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A10","CH_GB18_VZM0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","text":"Die quantitative Verbindung besitzt eine asymmetrische Struktur: Das Gewicht bleibt als Summe erhalten, das Volumen nicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A11","CH_GB18_VZM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D5","text":"Die Veränderung des Volumens ist keine bloß äußerliche Abweichung, sondern die Erscheinung der immanenten Bestimmung des Quantitativen.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A12","CH_GB18_VZM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D6","text":"Mit der Veränderung der Exponenten verändert sich die qualitative Natur des verbundenen Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","CH_GB18_VZM0:A7","CH_GB18_VZM0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D7","text":"Das Maaß erhält seine Bestimmtheit nur durch die Beziehung zu anderen Maaßverhältnissen.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","CH_GB18_VZM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD1","text":"Die Verbindung überführt äußerliche quantitative Addition in eine gegenseitige Spezifikation der verbundenen Maaße.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D2","CH_GB18_VZM0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD2","text":"Die materielle Fürsichseinsseite besitzt nur eine partielle Stabilität: Ihre Menge bleibt unmittelbar erhalten, während ihre qualitative Bestimmtheit sich verändert.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","CH_GB18_VZM0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD3","text":"Die qualitative Identität eines Etwas wird von einer inneren Eigenschaft in eine relationale Bestimmung verschoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D1","CH_GB18_VZM0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD4","text":"Die scheinbare Anomalie einer Volumenverminderung fungiert als Erscheinungsform der Idealisierung des Raumes.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","CH_GB18_VZM0:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD5","text":"Das Maaß besteht nur durch eine Identität, die sich im Vollzug ihrer Erhaltung verändert.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D3","CH_GB18_VZM0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Maaß, das seine Bestimmung ausschließlich aus seinem eigenen Quantum gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Identität, die unabhängig von anderen Maaßverhältnissen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußerliche Veränderung, die gegenüber der inneren Bestimmung vollständig äußerlich bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Gleichsetzung von Selbsterhaltung mit unveränderter qualitativer Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Raum, der als selbständiger materieller Behälter die Bestimmungen der Dinge unverändert bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine symmetrische Additivität aller quantitativen Seiten eines verbundenen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar wird ein absolut selbstidentisches Etwas, dessen Maaß in sich selbst abgeschlossen und unveränderlich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich wird ein Verbindungsmodell, in dem unabhängig stabile Größen lediglich äußerlich zusammengestellt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine reine Trennung von innerem Wesen und äußerer Veränderung, weil die Äußerlichkeit selbst zur Spezifikation des Maaßes wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine endgültige qualitative Bestimmung außerhalb der Relationen zwischen Maaßverhältnissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS1","text":"Etwas → Maaßverhältniß von Quantis → Beziehung qualitativer Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS2","text":"Qualitative Seiten → materielles Fürsichseyn / ideelle Äußerlichkeit → Gewicht und Volumen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS3","text":"Gewicht : Volumen → unmittelbarer Exponent → specifische qualitative Natur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS4","text":"Äußerlicher Quantumzusatz → negative Selbsterhaltung des Maaßes → gegenseitige Spezifikation der Exponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS5","text":"Verbindung → Summation des materiellen Quantums / Veränderung der ideellen Seite → Gewicht bleibt, Volumen verändert sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS6","text":"Veränderung des Exponenten → Veränderung des Maaßes → Veränderung der qualitativen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS7","text":"Veränderliches Maaß → Bestimmung durch andere Maaßverhältnisse → Aufhebung der inneren Fixiertheit des Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AF1","text":"Problem der bloßen Summation → Bestimmung des Etwas als Maaßverhältniß → Unterscheidung von materieller Fürsichseinsseite und ideeller Äußerlichkeit → Exponent als qualitative Bestimmung → negative Selbsterhaltung gegen äußerliches Quantum → additive Erhaltung des Gewichts bei Veränderung des Volumens → relationale Nicht-Festigkeit des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME1","text":"Die quantitative Landschaft wird asymmetrisch kartiert: Gewicht erscheint als unmittelbare additive Größe, Volumen als ideell veränderliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME2","text":"Äußerliche Veränderung wird als operative Bestimmung des Maaßes und nicht als bloßer Zusatz neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME3","text":"Die qualitative Natur wird vom isolierten Ding auf die Relation zwischen Maaßverhältnissen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME4","text":"Die Volumenverminderung wird von einer sinnlichen Abweichung zu einem Index der ideellen Struktur des Raumes umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von innerer Bestimmung und äußerlicher Veränderung wird als wechselseitiger Bestimmungszusammenhang reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Die Verbindung zweier materieller Dinge zeigt eine Summation der Gewichte, aber eine Veränderung der Volumen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Differenz beruht auf der asymmetrischen Funktion von materieller Fürsichseinsseite und ideeller Äußerlichkeit innerhalb des Maaßverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Verbindung wird nicht als Addition fertiger Größen, sondern als gegenseitige Spezifikation von Maaßen lesbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Das Etwas erhält sich als dasselbe nur durch eine Veränderung seiner Maaßbestimmung und besitzt daher keine in sich abgeschlossene qualitative Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT1","text":"Das Axiomenset reicht aus, um die Bewegung von der Definition des Maaßes über die asymmetrische Verbindung bis zur relationalen Veränderlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete stoffliche Bedingung der Verbindung, da die Gleichartigkeit der beteiligten Dinge ausdrücklich nicht untersucht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die additive Erhaltung des Gewichts von der Veränderlichkeit des Volumens unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle liegt in der Ableitung der qualitativen Veränderung aus der Funktion des Quantums als Exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT5","text":"Eine zentrale Spannung bleibt zwischen dem inneren Maaß und seiner Bestimmung als äußerlich-relationales Quantum bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass sich das Maaß erhält, indem es sich verändert; diese Einheit von Erhaltung und Veränderung wird nicht weiter aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, hängt jedoch bei der Verbindung von begrifflicher Negativität und beobachteter Volumenverminderung von der immanenten Deutung des Textes ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T120110478027Z_aa167407","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Combination of two measures.","source_sha256":"1dccc8200dd73efdff7d7c60688abd7e705ea3e9a232e25b3ebb4a2fcc27196e","sha256":"ef0bb88d9a5dc41c216c1713faf502fa24f1582c439cf92ee4711867d184073b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T12:01:10.480671+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the combination of two things of different inner measure as against mere summation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS2","text":"The something is conceived as a measure-relation of quanta and as the relation of the qualities thereby determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS3","text":"The qualitative nature arises from the relation of a material side of being-for-self to an ideal external side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS4","text":"Since every quantum is at the same time an exponent of a measure-relation, its external alteration becomes the reciprocal specification of the measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS5","text":"In the combination, only the material quantity remains summable as immediate quantum, while volume, as the ideal side, becomes variable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS6","text":"The alteration of the exponents thereby alters measure itself and the qualitative determinacy based upon it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AS7","text":"The immanent-diagnostic movement leads from quantitative combination to the determination of measure as relational and not fixed within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A1","text":"A something is determined as a measure-relation of quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A2","text":"The something is the relation of the qualities belonging to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A3","text":"A quality is material being-for-self, which can be determined intensively as weight and extensively as a quantity of material parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A4","text":"The other quality is the externality of this being-for-self and, as space or volume, has an ideal character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","text":"The relation of the quantitative determinations constitutes the qualitative nature of the material something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A6","text":"Volume functions as unity, while the intensive quantum appears as the number of material ones of being-for-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A7","text":"The exponent of the relation is an immediate specific quantum, whose specific nature is determined only in comparison with other exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","text":"Because measure rests upon a quantum, its inner determinacy remains at the same time external and alterable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A9","text":"The other related to measure is not an arbitrary quantum, but is itself an exponent of a measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A10","text":"Each measure preserves itself against external quantitative alteration by relating itself negatively to it and specifying it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A11","text":"In the combination of two measures, only the material quantity, or respectively weight, is summed as immediate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A12","text":"The exponents alter because the quantum summed as an external addition is negated by measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A13","text":"The immanent determination of the quantitative appears on the ideal side as alteration of volume.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:A14","text":"The qualitative determinacy of a something is not fixed in its own measure, but determined in other measure-relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX1","text":"The combination is not a mere summation of weight and volume simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX2","text":"The other belonging to the combination is not an arbitrary quantum outside a measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX3","text":"The qualitative determination here rests not upon an independent pure power-relation, but upon an immediate direct exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX4","text":"Volume is not an unalterable immediate quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX5","text":"The specific nature of a something is not an isolated and unalterable property within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX6","text":"The homogeneity of the combined material things is excluded from the present determination of the measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:NX7","text":"Space is not a substantial bearer of matter existing in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D1","text":"The specific nature of a something appears as the exponent of a measure-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A1","CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","CH_GB18_VZM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D2","text":"Two things can enter into combination insofar as their respective quanta are at the same time exponents of their own measure-relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","CH_GB18_VZM0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D3","text":"The self-preservation of a measure against external alteration is at the same time alteration of this measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A10","CH_GB18_VZM0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","text":"Quantitative combination possesses an asymmetrical structure: weight remains preserved as a sum, volume does not.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A11","CH_GB18_VZM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D5","text":"The alteration of volume is not a merely external deviation, but the appearance of the immanent determination of the quantitative.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A12","CH_GB18_VZM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D6","text":"With the alteration of the exponents, the qualitative nature of the combined something alters.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A5","CH_GB18_VZM0:A7","CH_GB18_VZM0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:D7","text":"Measure receives its determinacy only through relation to other measure-relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:A8","CH_GB18_VZM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD1","text":"The combination transforms external quantitative addition into a reciprocal specification of the combined measures.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D2","CH_GB18_VZM0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD2","text":"The material side of being-for-self possesses only partial stability: its quantity remains immediately preserved, while its qualitative determinacy alters.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","CH_GB18_VZM0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD3","text":"The qualitative identity of a something is shifted from an inner property into a relational determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D1","CH_GB18_VZM0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD4","text":"The apparent anomaly of a diminution of volume functions as a form of appearance of the idealization of space.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D4","CH_GB18_VZM0:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SD5","text":"Measure subsists only through an identity that alters itself in the enactment of its preservation.","refs":["CH_GB18_VZM0:D3","CH_GB18_VZM0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a measure that derives its determination exclusively from its own quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a qualitative identity that subsists independently of other measure-relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an external alteration that remains wholly external to inner determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the equation of self-preservation with unaltered qualitative identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a space that, as an independent material container, preserves the determinations of things unaltered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a symmetrical additivity of all quantitative sides of a combined something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable becomes an absolutely self-identical something whose measure would be self-enclosed and unalterable within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX2","text":"Impossible becomes a model of combination in which independently stable magnitudes are merely externally assembled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX3","text":"Barred is a pure separation of inner essence and external alteration, because externality itself becomes the specification of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a final qualitative determination outside the relations among measure-relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS1","text":"Something → measure-relation of quanta → relation of qualitative sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS2","text":"Qualitative sides → material being-for-self / ideal externality → weight and volume.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS3","text":"Weight : volume → immediate exponent → specific qualitative nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS4","text":"External quantum-addition → negative self-preservation of measure → reciprocal specification of the exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS5","text":"Combination → summation of the material quantum / alteration of the ideal side → weight remains, volume alters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS6","text":"Alteration of the exponent → alteration of measure → alteration of qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:FGS7","text":"Alterable measure → determination through other measure-relations → sublation of the inner fixedness of the something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:AF1","text":"Problem of mere summation → determination of the something as measure-relation → distinction between material side of being-for-self and ideal externality → exponent as qualitative determination → negative self-preservation against external quantum → additive preservation of weight with alteration of volume → relational non-fixedness of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME1","text":"The quantitative landscape is mapped asymmetrically: weight appears as an immediate additive magnitude, volume as an ideally alterable magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME2","text":"External alteration is reclassified as an operative determination of measure and not as a mere addition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME3","text":"Qualitative nature is shifted from the isolated thing to the relation between measure-relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME4","text":"The diminution of volume is remapped from a sensible deviation into an index of the ideal structure of space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ME5","text":"The opposition between inner determination and external alteration is reorganized as a reciprocal nexus of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT1","text":"Surface: The combination of two material things shows a summation of weights, but an alteration of volumes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT2","text":"Structural: The difference rests upon the asymmetrical function of the material side of being-for-self and ideal externality within the measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The combination is rendered legible not as the addition of finished magnitudes, but as reciprocal specification of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The something preserves itself as the same only through an alteration of its measure-determination and therefore possesses no self-enclosed qualitative identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT1","text":"The set of axioms suffices to reconstruct the movement from the definition of measure through asymmetrical combination to relational alterability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT2","text":"The concrete material condition of the combination remains underdetermined, since the homogeneity of the participating things is expressly not investigated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the additive preservation of weight is distinguished from the alterability of volume.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point lies in the derivation of qualitative alteration from the function of quantum as exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT5","text":"A central tension remains between inner measure and its determination as externally relational quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that measure preserves itself by altering itself; this unity of preservation and alteration is not further resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_VZM0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but, in connecting conceptual negativity and observed diminution of volume, depends upon the immanent interpretation of the text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_VZM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_VZM0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_VZM0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 90","title":"a. Combination of Two Measures.","context":"Chapter 90","original_title":"a. Verbindung zweier Maaße."},"original_title":"a. Verbindung zweier Maaße.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA","layer":"CH","title":"b. Measure as a Series of Measure Relations.","order":91,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDMA"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDMA@R001","sha256":"7d3717d76194187faf89c31bd14c35b7ad2250e3541a658aebb819f9311bb17e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die qualitative Bestimmtheit eines selbstständigen Maaßes zu bestimmen, obwohl seine unmittelbaren Verbindungen mit anderen Maaßen quantitativ-gleichgültige Neutralisierungen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS2","text":"Die einzelne Verhältnißzahl wird von der adäquaten Bestimmung des Maaßes zur unzureichenden Einzelrelation herabgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS3","text":"Das Maaß wird als Reihe unterschiedlicher Exponenten rekonstruiert, in welcher es selbst Einheit gegenüber einer Mehrheit anderer selbstständiger Maaße ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS4","text":"Die Vergleichbarkeit selbstständiger Maaße wird auf das konstante Verhältnis ihrer jeweiligen Exponentenreihen zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS5","text":"Die quantitative Äußerlichkeit der Reihen wird als Ort der qualitativen Selbstbestimmung und nicht als deren bloßes Gegenteil bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS6","text":"Die zunächst neutrale Verhältnisreihe schlägt durch doppelte Negation in ausschließende Einheit um und erzeugt Wahlverwandtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","text":"Ein selbstständiges Maaß erhält sich in der Verbindung mit einem anderen Maaß durch sein gleichgültiges quantitatives Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A2","text":"Jedes selbstständige Maaß wird in einer Verbindung zugleich zum specifirenden Moment eines neuen Maaßverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A3","text":"Die Qualität des Maaßes ist im Quantitativen eingehüllt und erscheint daher zunächst als Gleichgültigkeit gegen andere Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","text":"Eine einzelne Verhältnißzahl drückt nur eine einzelne Relation aus und nicht die volle qualitative Eigentümlichkeit eines Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","text":"Die qualitative Bestimmtheit eines selbstständigen Maaßes besteht in der Reihe der Exponenten seiner Verhältnisse zu anderen selbstständigen Maaßen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","text":"Zwei selbstständige Maaße sind nur vergleichbar, wenn ihre Exponentenreihen in einem konstanten Verhältnis stehen, das beiden als gemeinsame Einheit dient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A7","text":"Jedes Glied einer Maaßreihe ist zugleich Einheit gegenüber einer anderen Reihe, Exponent für deren Glieder und Vergleichungszahl innerhalb seiner eigenen Reihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","text":"Das Fürsichbestimmtseyn des Maaßes liegt nicht in einem äußeren Quantum, sondern im Ganzen einer Reihe von Verhältnißzahlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A9","text":"Die quantitative Art des Verhaltens zu anderem Maaß konstituiert die specifische Bestimmung des selbstständigen Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","text":"Die Beziehung zweier Specifica auf einen Exponenten setzt beide negativ, ohne daß eines in das andere übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","text":"Die Negation der in der neutralen Beziehung enthaltenen Negation erzeugt eine für sich seyende ausschließende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A12","text":"Der qualitative Unterschied der Exponenten entsteht als ausschließender Unterschied, bleibt aber im Quantitativen gegründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX1","text":"Die specifische Eigentümlichkeit eines Maaßes ist nicht durch seine Neutralisierung mit nur einem anderen Maaß ausdrückbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX2","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht durch eine einfache Qualität bestimmt, die in der Verbindung mit anderem nur sich selbst aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX3","text":"Der qualitative Exponent ist nicht mit einem unmittelbaren einzelnen Quantum identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX4","text":"Zwei Maaße sind nicht schon vergleichbar, weil jedes eine eigene Exponentenreihe bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX5","text":"Die gemeinschaftliche Einheit vergleichbarer Maaße ist nicht ein äußerlich angesetzter Maßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX6","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Maaßes ist nicht bloß ein Kreis isolierter Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX7","text":"Die neutrale Beziehung zweier Specifica ist nicht bloße Veränderung und nicht bloße Negation überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX8","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft ist nicht identisch mit indifferenter Verwandtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D1","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit eines Maaßes ist relational vermittelt, weil es sich nur im quantitativen Fortbestehen innerhalb anderer Maaßverhältnisse erhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","CH_GB18_BDMA:A2","CH_GB18_BDMA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D2","text":"Die qualitative Identität eines Maaßes ist eine geordnete Vielheit von Relationen und nicht eine isolierte Eigenschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D3","text":"Die Reihe ist zugleich Ausdruck der Selbstbestimmung eines Maaßes und Bedingung seiner Vergleichbarkeit mit anderen Maaßen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D4","text":"Vergleichung verlangt eine relationale Einheit zweiter Ordnung, nämlich ein Verhältnis zwischen Verhältniszahlen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D5","text":"Jede Zahl im System ist funktionsplural, weil sie zugleich Bezugseinheit, Relationsausdruck und Vergleichungsgröße ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D6","text":"Das Qualitative wird nicht trotz, sondern durch die quantitative Form des Verhaltens bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A3","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","CH_GB18_BDMA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D7","text":"Ausschließende Qualität entsteht aus einer Beziehung, in der die verbundenen Specifica ihre Selbstständigkeit bewahren.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD1","text":"Das Maaß ist eine rekursive Relationsstruktur: Seine Einheit wird durch Reihen bestimmt, deren Glieder ihrerseits selbstständige Einheiten und Reihenbildner sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD2","text":"Qualität besitzt im Maaß keine unmittelbare Substanzform, sondern die Form einer invarianten Ordnung von quantitativen Beziehungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","CH_GB18_BDMA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD3","text":"Selbstständigkeit ist nicht Beziehungsfreiheit, sondern die Fähigkeit, in einer Vielzahl von Beziehungen eine bestimmte Reihenform zu behaupten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD4","text":"Die qualitative Besonderheit eines Maaßes wird erst dort manifest, wo quantitative Vergleichbarkeit in ausschließende Differenz übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD5","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft ist die qualitative Gestalt einer zuvor quantitativ vermittelten und neutral erscheinenden Reihenbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A9","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX1","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, daß Qualität unabhängig von ihrer quantitativen Artikulation vollständig bestimmt sein könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, daß ein Selbstständiges seine Identität außerhalb eines Systems anderer Selbstständiger besitzen könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, daß Vergleichung durch bloße Gegenüberstellung zweier isolierter Größen möglich sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, daß Neutralität eine letzte oder nicht weiter bestimmbare Form der Beziehung sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, daß Ausschluß dem Quantitativen äußerlich oder nachträglich hinzugefügt werde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine schlechthin unmittelbare Qualität, die vor aller Reihe, Vergleichung und quantitativen Vermittlung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absoluter Vergleichungsmaßstab, der nicht selbst aus dem Verhältnis der verglichenen Reihen hervorginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Trennung von äußerer Quantität und innerer Qualität als zweier unabhängig bestehender Bestimmungsordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Selbstständigkeit, die nicht zugleich Exponent, Vergleichungszahl und Einheit für anderes Selbstständiges wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS1","text":"Selbstständiges Maaß → quantitative Gleichgültigkeit in der Verbindung → Erhaltung in der Neutralisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS2","text":"Einzelne Neutralisierung → unzureichender Einzelexponent → Vervielfältigung der Verhältnisse zur Exponentenreihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS3","text":"Exponentenreihe → Verhältnis der Exponenten untereinander → konstante gemeinsame Einheit → Vergleichbarkeit der Maaße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS4","text":"Gegenseitige Reihenbildung → Austausch von Einheit, Exponent und Vergleichungszahl → rekursive Maaßordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS5","text":"Quantitative Reihenäußerlichkeit → Specificirung durch Drittes → negative Setzung ohne Übergang → Negation der Negation → ausschließende Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS6","text":"Ausschließende Qualität → nicht-indifferente Verwandtschaft → Wahlverwandtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF1","text":"Die bloße Neutralisierung verdeckt die specifische Eigentümlichkeit des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF2","text":"Die verdeckte Eigentümlichkeit wird als Reihe verschiedener Verhältnißexponenten neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF3","text":"Die Reihe wird durch das Verhältnis ihrer Exponenten als qualitative Einheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF4","text":"Die qualitative Einheit ermöglicht Vergleichbarkeit nur als gemeinsame konstante Reihenordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF5","text":"Die Reihenordnung verlegt das Fürsichbestimmtseyn des Maaßes in seine quantitative Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF6","text":"Die quantitative Äußerlichkeit wird als negative Einheit bestimmt und schließt in Wahlverwandtschaft ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME1","text":"Das Maaß wird von einer Zweierrelation zu einer Mehrheits- und Reihenstruktur umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von qualitativer Innerlichkeit und quantitativer Äußerlichkeit wird aufgehoben, weil die Qualität in der quantitativen Verhaltensweise lokalisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME3","text":"Vergleichung wird von der Messung isolierter Größen zur Ermittlung einer gemeinsamen Invarianz zwischen Reihen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME4","text":"Zahlen erscheinen nicht mehr als bloße Größen, sondern als wechselnde Funktionen von Einheit, Exponent und Vergleichungszahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME5","text":"Indifferente Verwandtschaft wird als Vorstufe einer ausschließenden, qualitativen Wahlverwandtschaft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Maaß wird als Reihe von Verhältnißzahlen bestimmt, durch die ein Selbstständiges zu anderen Selbstständigen in Beziehung tritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Identität eines Maaßes entsteht aus der konstanten Ordnung wechselseitig bestimmter Reihen und nicht aus einer isolierten Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Jede gültige Vergleichung verlangt die Rekonstruktion der gemeinsamen Einheit, welche die Vergleichungsgrößen selbst erst erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Selbstständigkeit existiert als Selbsterhaltung im Anderssein und als Ausschluß, der aus quantitativ vermittelter Negativität hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Verschiebung vom einzelnen Maaßverhältniß zur Exponentenreihe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Notwendigkeit einer gemeinsamen konstanten Einheit für Vergleichbarkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT3","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich der Bedingungen unterbestimmt, unter denen ein Verhältnis von Exponenten tatsächlich konstant ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT4","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich des Umfangs und der Abgrenzung der jeweiligen Reihen unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste interne Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung qualitativer Bestimmtheit aus der Funktion einer ganzen Verhältnisreihe statt aus einem Einzelexponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste strukturelle Spannung liegt darin, daß das Maaß selbstständig heißen soll, seine specifische Bestimmtheit jedoch nur in äußerlich gegliederten Reihen besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß Gleichgültigkeit als Bedingung der Beziehung fungiert, aber zugleich in ausschließende qualitative Negativität umschlagen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, sofern die Reihe zugleich als quantitative Äußerlichkeit, qualitative Identität und Bedingung ausschließender Verwandtschaft geführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113009516348Z_f053a0bd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Measure as a series of measure-relations.","source_sha256":"7d3717d76194187faf89c31bd14c35b7ad2250e3541a658aebb819f9311bb17e","sha256":"d92b3e7a876d5370453f1f46e5752c11e929d39f574b47c5a330648484fff814","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:30:09.517315+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the qualitative determinacy of an independent measure, although its immediate connections with other measures are quantitatively indifferent neutralizations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS2","text":"The individual ratio-number is demoted from the adequate determination of measure to an insufficient individual relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS3","text":"Measure is reconstructed as a series of different exponents, in which it itself is unity in relation to a plurality of other independent measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS4","text":"The comparability of independent measures is traced back to the constant relation of their respective series of exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS5","text":"The quantitative externality of the series is determined as the locus of qualitative self-determination and not as its mere opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AS6","text":"The initially neutral series of ratios turns, through double negation, into exclusive unity and produces elective affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","text":"An independent measure preserves itself in connection with another measure through its indifferent quantitative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A2","text":"In a connection, every independent measure at the same time becomes the specifying moment of a new measure-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A3","text":"The quality of measure is enveloped in the quantitative and therefore initially appears as indifference toward other measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","text":"An individual ratio-number expresses only an individual relation and not the full qualitative peculiarity of a measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","text":"The qualitative determinacy of an independent measure consists in the series of the exponents of its relations to other independent measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","text":"Two independent measures are comparable only if their series of exponents stand in a constant relation that serves both as a common unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A7","text":"Every member of a series of measures is at once unity in relation to another series, exponent for its members, and comparison-number within its own series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","text":"The being-for-self-determinedness of measure lies not in an external quantum, but in the whole of a series of ratio-numbers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A9","text":"The quantitative mode of relating to another measure constitutes the specific determination of the independent measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","text":"The relation of two Specifica to an exponent posits both negatively, without either passing over into the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","text":"The negation of the negation contained in the neutral relation produces an exclusive unity existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:A12","text":"The qualitative difference of the exponents arises as exclusive difference, but remains grounded in the quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX1","text":"The specific peculiarity of a measure cannot be expressed through its neutralization with only one other measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX2","text":"Measure is not determined by a simple quality that, in connection with another, merely sublates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX3","text":"The qualitative exponent is not identical with an immediate individual quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX4","text":"Two measures are not already comparable because each forms a series of exponents of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX5","text":"The common unity of comparable measures is not an externally posited standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX6","text":"The externality of measure is not merely a circle of isolated quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX7","text":"The neutral relation of two Specifica is neither mere alteration nor mere negation in general.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:NX8","text":"Elective affinity is not identical with indifferent affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D1","text":"The independence of a measure is relationally mediated, because it preserves itself only in quantitative persistence within other measure-relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","CH_GB18_BDMA:A2","CH_GB18_BDMA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D2","text":"The qualitative identity of a measure is an ordered multiplicity of relations and not an isolated property.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D3","text":"The series is at once the expression of the self-determination of a measure and the condition of its comparability with other measures.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D4","text":"Comparison requires a second-order relational unity, namely a relation between ratio-numbers.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D5","text":"Every number in the system is functionally plural, because it is at once unit of reference, expression of relation, and magnitude of comparison.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D6","text":"The qualitative is determined not despite, but through the quantitative form of relating.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A3","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","CH_GB18_BDMA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:D7","text":"Exclusive quality arises from a relation in which the connected Specifica preserve their independence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD1","text":"Measure is a recursive relational structure: its unity is determined by series whose members are in turn independent unities and formers of series.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD2","text":"In measure, quality possesses no immediate substantial form, but rather the form of an invariant order of quantitative relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A4","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8","CH_GB18_BDMA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD3","text":"Independence is not freedom from relation, but the capacity to maintain a determinate serial form in a multiplicity of relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A1","CH_GB18_BDMA:A5","CH_GB18_BDMA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD4","text":"The qualitative particularity of a measure becomes manifest only where quantitative comparability passes over into exclusive difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A6","CH_GB18_BDMA:A10","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SD5","text":"Elective affinity is the qualitative shape of a serial relation previously mediated quantitatively and appearing neutral.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDMA:A9","CH_GB18_BDMA:A11","CH_GB18_BDMA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that quality could be completely determined independently of its quantitative articulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that an independent entity could possess its identity outside a system of other independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that comparison could be possible through the mere juxtaposition of two isolated magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that neutrality could be a final or no further determinable form of relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that exclusion should be external to the quantitative or subsequently added to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely immediate quality that could subsist prior to every series, comparison, and quantitative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an absolute standard of comparison that would not itself arise from the relation of the compared series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the separation of external quantity and internal quality as two independently subsisting orders of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:SNX4","text":"Impossible is an independence that would not at the same time be exponent, comparison-number, and unity for another independent entity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS1","text":"Independent measure → quantitative indifference in connection → preservation in neutralization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS2","text":"Individual neutralization → insufficient individual exponent → multiplication of relations into a series of exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS3","text":"Series of exponents → relation of the exponents to one another → constant common unity → comparability of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS4","text":"Mutual series-formation → exchange of unity, exponent, and comparison-number → recursive order of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS5","text":"Quantitative serial externality → specification through a third → negative positing without transition → negation of negation → exclusive quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:FGS6","text":"Exclusive quality → non-indifferent affinity → elective affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF1","text":"Mere neutralization conceals the specific peculiarity of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF2","text":"The concealed peculiarity is newly determined as a series of different ratio-exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF3","text":"The series is determined as qualitative unity through the relation of its exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF4","text":"The qualitative unity makes comparability possible only as a common constant serial order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF5","text":"The serial order relocates the being-for-self-determinedness of measure into its quantitative externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:AF6","text":"The quantitative externality is determined as negative unity and concludes in elective affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME1","text":"Measure is reclassified from a binary relation into a plurality and serial structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME2","text":"The opposition of qualitative inwardness and quantitative externality is sublated, because quality is located in the quantitative mode of relating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME3","text":"Comparison is shifted from the measurement of isolated magnitudes to the determination of a common invariance between series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME4","text":"Numbers no longer appear as mere magnitudes, but as changing functions of unity, exponent, and comparison-number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ME5","text":"Indifferent affinity becomes visible as the preliminary stage of an exclusive, qualitative elective affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Measure is determined as a series of ratio-numbers through which an independent entity enters into relation with other independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT2","text":"Structural — The identity of a measure arises from the constant order of mutually determined series and not from an isolated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Every valid comparison requires the reconstruction of the common unity that first produces the magnitudes of comparison themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Independence exists as self-preservation in otherness and as exclusion arising from quantitatively mediated negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the shift from the individual measure-relation to the series of exponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the necessity of a common constant unity for comparability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the conditions under which a relation of exponents is actually constant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the scope and delimitation of the respective series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT5","text":"The strongest internal connection lies in the derivation of qualitative determinacy from the function of an entire series of ratios rather than from an individual exponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT6","text":"The strongest structural tension lies in the fact that measure is supposed to be called independent, while it possesses its specific determinacy only in externally articulated series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that indifference functions as a condition of relation, but is at the same time supposed to turn into exclusive qualitative negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDMA:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement insofar as the series is treated at once as quantitative externality, qualitative identity, and the condition of exclusive affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDMA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDMA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDMA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 91","title":"b. Measure as a Series of Measure Relations.","context":"Chapter 91","original_title":"b. Das Maaß als Reihe von Maaßverhältnissen."},"original_title":"b. Das Maaß als Reihe von Maaßverhältnissen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH","layer":"CH","title":"c. Elective Affinity.","order":92,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CWAH"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CWAH@R001","sha256":"abd49442276333f08d87935e314971467dcc3adb35e8e360e169eedff6cafde9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS1","text":"Die zu bestimmende Struktur ist die Wahlverwandtschaft als qualitative und zugleich quantitativ vermittelte Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS2","text":"Spezifische Bestimmtheit entsteht nur in der Differenz zu einem Anderen und erweitert sich zur Beziehung auf eine Reihe von Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS3","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmung der Neutralisation scheint die ausschließende Affinität zunächst als Intensitätsunterschied erklären zu können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS4","text":"Diese Erklärung hebt den Ausschluss auf, weil dasselbe Quantum auch durch beliebige Kombinationen von Gliedern erfüllt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS5","text":"Die Neutralisation erweist sich jedoch als Maßbestimmung, deren Exponent Quantität diskontinuierlich und ausschließend macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS6","text":"Die quantitative Gleichgültigkeit mehrerer möglicher Gegenmomente unterläuft diesen Ausschluss erneut und erzeugt eine alternierende Reihe von Quantität, Qualität und Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","text":"Die spezifische Bestimmtheit des Materiellen entsteht nur in der Beziehung auf ein Anderes und existiert als Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","text":"Die spezifische Beziehung ist an Quantität gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","text":"Die spezifische Beziehung richtet sich nicht nur auf ein einzelnes Anderes, sondern auf eine Reihe differenter Anderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A4","text":"Die Affinität zu jedem Glied der Reihe ist zugleich gleichgültig gegen andere Glieder und ausschließend gegen sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","text":"Qualitative Einheit in relationalen Systemen bildet sich im Verhalten eines Glieds zu einem Ganzen von Verbindungen und beruht zugleich auf quantitativen Verhältnissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A6","text":"Die qualitative Einheit eines Reihen-Glieds bestimmt sich durch sein Verhalten zu einer gegenüberstehenden Reihe, deren Glieder hinsichtlich der Neutralisation nur durch ihr Quantum unterschieden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","text":"Die Wahlverwandtschaft eines Glieds zu den Gliedern der Gegenreihe richtet sich nach der quantitativen Differenz der für die Neutralisation erforderlichen Mengen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","text":"Extensive und intensive Größe sind verschiedene Formen derselben quantitativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","text":"Neutralisation ist nicht nur die Form der Intensität, sondern wesentlich Maßbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","text":"Der Exponent der Maßbestimmung ist ausschließend, sodass die Zahlen ihre Kontinuität verlieren und das Mehr oder Weniger einen negativen Charakter erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A11","text":"Das neutralisierende Quantum kann einem Glied gegenüber mehreren anderen Gliedern gleichgültig entnommen und auf diese nach ihrer jeweiligen spezifischen Bestimmtheit verteilt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX1","text":"Spezifische Bestimmtheit ist keine isolierte, selbständige Eigenschaft eines Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX2","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft ist keine einfache Beziehung zwischen jeweils nur zwei Gliedern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX3","text":"Qualitative Affinität ist nicht auf bloße extensive Mengenunterschiede reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX4","text":"Ausschließlichkeit ist nicht schon durch die Umwandlung extensiver Größe in intensive Größe gesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX5","text":"Neutralisation ist nicht bloß Intensitätssteigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX6","text":"Maßbestimmung ist keine kontinuierlich ineinanderfließende Zahlenbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX7","text":"Die Wahlverwandtschaft ist keine absolute Ausschließlichkeit gegenüber allen anderen Verbindungsmöglichkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX8","text":"Qualitative Spezifik und quantitatives Außenverhältnis sind keine voneinander getrennten Sphären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D1","text":"Spezifische Qualität ist eine relationale Differenz, deren Bestimmtheit durch quantitative Vermittlung erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","CH_GB18_CWAH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D2","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft bildet eine serielle Struktur, in der jedes Glied zugleich in Beziehung zu mehreren Anderen steht und sich gegen sie ausschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","CH_GB18_CWAH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D3","text":"Qualitative Einheit kann nur als Verhältnis zu einer Gegenreihe bestimmt werden, deren qualitative Unterschiede zunächst auf verschiedene Neutralisationsquanten zurückgeführt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","CH_GB18_CWAH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D4","text":"Wird Ausschließlichkeit allein aus dem Quantum erklärt, schlägt sie über die Identität von extensiver und intensiver Größe in Intensität um und verliert ihren ausschließenden Charakter.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D5","text":"Die Maßbestimmung des Exponenten stellt Ausschließlichkeit als diskontinuierliche und negative Differenz wieder her.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D6","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass mehrere Gegenmomente dasselbe Neutralisationsquantum liefern, setzt die quantitative Gleichgültigkeit innerhalb der wiederhergestellten Ausschließlichkeit fort.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D7","text":"Die Bestimmungen bewegen sich zwischen bloß quantitativer Beziehung, spezifischer Ausschließlichkeit und Maßbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD1","text":"Ausschließlichkeit und Gleichgültigkeit sind keine äußerlich getrennten Eigenschaften der Wahlverwandtschaft, sondern gegensätzliche Wirkungen derselben quantitativen Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A4","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD2","text":"Das Qualitative besitzt keine unabhängige Stabilität, sondern wird durch quantitative Beziehungen erzeugt, in Maßbestimmung überführt und durch quantitative Verteilung wieder relativiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD3","text":"Das Quantum allein liefert kein hinreichendes Prinzip der Wahl; die Bestimmung der Wahlverwandtschaft verlangt die Verbindung von Quantität mit Maß und spezifischer Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD4","text":"Jedes Glied ist zugleich konstituierendes Zentrum eines Systems und abhängiges Glied in den Systemen anderer Glieder.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","CH_GB18_CWAH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD5","text":"Die Bestimmung der Wahlverwandtschaft erzeugt keine abschließende Synthese, sondern eine strukturierte Folge von Umschlägen zwischen quantitativer Indifferenz, qualitativer Spezifik und Maß.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass qualitative Identität unabhängig von relationaler Differenz besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass ein kontinuierliches quantitatives Medium qualitative Ausschließlichkeit vollständig erklären kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass intensive Größe eine von der quantitativen Bestimmung unabhängige neue Grundlage bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass Neutralisation durch eine bloße Addition oder Verteilung von Mengen erschöpfend bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass Ausschließlichkeit gegenüber allen möglichen Kombinationen absolut und unvermittelt besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt die Trennung einer rein qualitativen Sphäre von einem äußerlichen quantitativen Verhältnis aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX7","text":"Das System gewinnt das Prinzip des Maßes nicht aus bloßer Quantität, sondern verweist dessen konkrete Bestimmung auf die qualitative Naturwissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine qualitative Ordnung, die ohne quantitative Vermittlung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine quantitative Kontinuität, die ohne Diskontinuität und Ausschluss qualitative Differenz hervorbringen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein abschließendes Auswahlprinzip, das allein aus dem Neutralisationsquantum ablesbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Versöhnung von Ausschließlichkeit und quantitativer Gleichgültigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX5","text":"Die vollständige Bestimmung dessen, warum eine Affinität gegenüber anderen Affinitäten den Vorrang erhält, bleibt als nicht innerhalb der abstrakten Struktur verfügbare Möglichkeit zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS1","text":"Beziehung auf ein Anderes + Differenz → spezifische Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS2","text":"Reihe von Anderen + Neutralisationsquantum → vielfache Affinität → qualitative Ausschließlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS3","text":"quantitatives Verhältnis → extensive Größe = intensive Größe → Ausschließlichkeit als Intensität → Auflösung in kombinierbare Portionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS4","text":"Neutralisation als Maß + ausschließender Exponent → Diskontinuität der Zahlen + negativer Charakter des Mehr oder Weniger → Wiederherstellung des Ausschlusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS5","text":"mehrere Gegenmomente + gleichgültige Verteilung des Neutralisationsquantums → erneute Unterminierung des Ausschlusses durch Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS6","text":"quantitative Indifferenz ↔ qualitative Spezifik ↔ Maßrelation → Reihe wechselnder Bestimmungen → Verweisung des konkreten Maßprinzips auf die Naturwissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AF1","text":"Relationale Differenz → serielle quantitative Affinität → ausschließende Wahlverwandtschaft → Umschlag in Intensität → Verlust des Ausschlusses → Maßbestimmung → diskontinuierliche Wiederkehr des Ausschlusses → quantitative Gleichgültigkeit mehrerer Gegenmomente → alternierende Reihe von Quantität, Qualität und Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AF2","text":"Problem des Maßes → Bindung des Maßes an das eigentliche Qualitative → Auslagerung der konkreten Bestimmung in die besondere Naturwissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME1","text":"Spezifische Identität wird von einer intrinsischen Eigenschaft in eine relationale Position innerhalb einer Reihe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME2","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Qualität und Quantität zerfällt in eine Folge von Übergängen, in denen jede Bestimmung die andere hervorbringt und begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME3","text":"Ausschluss wird nicht mehr als einfache Negation anderer Verbindungen, sondern als Maßrelation mit diskontinuierlicher Priorität sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME4","text":"Die Wahl zwischen Verbindungen wird von einem binären Gegensatz zu einer strukturierten Verteilung möglicher Neutralisationsquanten umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME5","text":"Chemische und musikalische Verhältnisse werden unter einer gemeinsamen Karte serieller, quantitativ fundierter qualitativer Systeme erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME6","text":"Die strategische Frage verschiebt sich von der Existenz einer Affinität zur Bestimmung des Maßes, durch das eine Affinität gegen andere den Vorrang erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT1","text":"Surface: Chemische Wahlverwandtschaft und Neutralisation erscheinen als qualitative Verbindungen, die durch Mengenverhältnisse bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die operative Struktur besteht aus Gegenreihen, Neutralisationsquanten, ausschließenden Exponenten und der Gleichgültigkeit möglicher Kombinationen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text prüft nacheinander ein quantitatives, ein intensiviertes und ein maßtheoretisches Modell und weist jedes einseitige Modell durch seinen Gegenumschlag zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Sein und Bestimmtheit werden als relationale Differenz gefasst, deren Formen sich fortlaufend ineinander umschlagen, statt statisch getrennt zu bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von relationaler Spezifik über quantitative Affinität und Ausschluss bis zur Maßbestimmung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der konkrete Maßstab, der entscheidet, warum eine bestimmte Affinität gegenüber anderen den Vorrang erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Ausschließlichkeit und Gleichgültigkeit als gegensätzliche Momente derselben Vermittlung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung des Ausschlussproblems aus der Identität von extensiver und intensiver Größe sowie seine Korrektur durch den Begriff des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung bleibt bestehen, weil das Maß den Ausschluss wiederherstellt, während die quantitative Gleichgültigkeit mehrerer Gegenmomente ihn unmittelbar erneut relativiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT6","text":"Die Verallgemeinerung auf musikalische und andere Systeme erweitert die Struktur, ersetzt aber nicht die fehlende konkrete Bestimmung des Maßprinzips.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, wenn sie nicht bei der qualitativen Ausschließlichkeit endet, sondern deren Auflösung und erneute Unterminierung als notwendige Folgeschritte erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114817407016Z_efe39d56","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Elective Affinity.","source_sha256":"abd49442276333f08d87935e314971467dcc3adb35e8e360e169eedff6cafde9","sha256":"6e2ccea8e7f8e186424f019389aaf849b1dec5470b691c1b5323b656275af39d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:48:17.409398+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS1","text":"The structure to be determined is elective affinity as a qualitative and at the same time quantitatively mediated relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS2","text":"Specific determinacy arises only in the difference from an Other and expands into a relation to a series of Others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS3","text":"The quantitative determination of neutralization initially seems capable of explaining exclusive affinity as a difference of intensity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS4","text":"This explanation abolishes exclusion, because the same quantum can also be fulfilled by arbitrary combinations of members.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS5","text":"Neutralization, however, proves to be a measure-determination whose exponent makes quantity discontinuous and exclusive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AS6","text":"The quantitative indifference of several possible opposing moments undermines this exclusion anew and produces an alternating series of quantity, quality, and measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","text":"The specific determinacy of the material arises only in relation to an Other and exists as difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","text":"The specific relation is bound to quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","text":"The specific relation is directed not merely toward a single Other, but toward a series of different Others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A4","text":"Affinity to each member of the series is at once indifferent to other members and exclusive against them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","text":"Qualitative unity in relational systems is formed in the comportment of a member toward a whole of connections and rests at the same time on quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A6","text":"The qualitative unity of a member of a series is determined through its comportment toward an opposing series, whose members are distinguished, with respect to neutralization, only by their quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","text":"The elective affinity of a member toward the members of the opposing series is governed by the quantitative difference of the quantities required for neutralization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","text":"Extensive and intensive magnitude are different forms of the same quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","text":"Neutralization is not merely the form of intensity, but essentially measure-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","text":"The exponent of measure-determination is exclusive, so that the numbers lose their continuity and the more or less acquires a negative character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:A11","text":"The neutralizing quantum can, in relation to one member, be taken indifferently from several other members and distributed among them according to their respective specific determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX1","text":"Specific determinacy is not an isolated, self-subsistent property of an object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX2","text":"Elective affinity is not a simple relation between only two members at a time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX3","text":"Qualitative affinity cannot be reduced to mere differences in extensive quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX4","text":"Exclusivity is not already secured by the transformation of extensive magnitude into intensive magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX5","text":"Neutralization is not mere intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX6","text":"Measure-determination is not a numerical relation continuously flowing into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX7","text":"Elective affinity is not absolute exclusivity against all other possible combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:NX8","text":"Qualitative specificity and quantitative external relation are not spheres separate from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D1","text":"Specific quality is a relational difference whose determinacy is produced through quantitative mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","CH_GB18_CWAH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D2","text":"Elective affinity forms a serial structure in which each member stands at once in relation to several Others and excludes itself against them.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","CH_GB18_CWAH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D3","text":"Qualitative unity can be determined only as a relation to an opposing series, whose qualitative differences are initially traced back to different neutralization quanta.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","CH_GB18_CWAH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D4","text":"If exclusivity is explained solely from the quantum, it passes over, through the identity of extensive and intensive magnitude, into intensity and loses its exclusive character.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D5","text":"The measure-determination of the exponent restores exclusivity as discontinuous and negative difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D6","text":"The possibility that several opposing moments yield the same neutralization quantum continues quantitative indifference within restored exclusivity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:D7","text":"The determinations move between merely quantitative relation, specific exclusivity, and measure-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD1","text":"Exclusivity and indifference are not externally separate properties of elective affinity, but opposing effects of the same quantitative mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A4","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD2","text":"The qualitative possesses no independent stability, but is produced through quantitative relations, transformed into measure-determination, and relativized anew through quantitative distribution.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A1","CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD3","text":"The quantum alone provides no sufficient principle of choice; the determination of elective affinity requires the connection of quantity with measure and specific quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A2","CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD4","text":"Each member is at once the constituting center of a system and a dependent member in the systems of other members.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A3","CH_GB18_CWAH:A5","CH_GB18_CWAH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SD5","text":"The determination of elective affinity produces no conclusive synthesis, but a structured sequence of transitions between quantitative indifference, qualitative specificity, and measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CWAH:A7","CH_GB18_CWAH:A8","CH_GB18_CWAH:A9","CH_GB18_CWAH:A10","CH_GB18_CWAH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that qualitative identity exists independently of relational difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the assumption that a continuous quantitative medium can completely explain qualitative exclusivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the assumption that intensive magnitude forms a new foundation independent of quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the assumption that neutralization is exhaustively determined by a mere addition or distribution of quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the assumption that exclusivity exists absolutely and immediately in relation to all possible combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX6","text":"The system excludes the separation of a purely qualitative sphere from an external quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:DNX7","text":"The system does not derive the principle of measure from mere quantity, but refers its concrete determination to qualitative natural science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a pure qualitative order that could exist without quantitative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a pure quantitative continuity that could produce qualitative difference without discontinuity and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a conclusive principle of selection that could be read off from the neutralization quantum alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final reconciliation of exclusivity and quantitative indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:SNX5","text":"The complete determination of why one affinity receives priority over other affinities remains as a possibility not available within the abstract structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS1","text":"Relation to an Other + difference → specific determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS2","text":"Series of Others + neutralization quantum → multiple affinity → qualitative exclusivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS3","text":"quantitative relation → extensive magnitude = intensive magnitude → exclusivity as intensity → dissolution into combinable portions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS4","text":"Neutralization as measure + exclusive exponent → discontinuity of numbers + negative character of the more or less → restoration of exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS5","text":"several opposing moments + indifferent distribution of the neutralization quantum → renewed undermining of exclusion through quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:FGS6","text":"quantitative indifference ↔ qualitative specificity ↔ relation of measure → series of alternating determinations → referral of the concrete principle of measure to natural science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AF1","text":"Relational difference → serial quantitative affinity → exclusive elective affinity → transition into intensity → loss of exclusion → measure-determination → discontinuous return of exclusion → quantitative indifference of several opposing moments → alternating series of quantity, quality, and measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:AF2","text":"Problem of measure → binding of measure to the properly qualitative → outsourcing of concrete determination to particular natural science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME1","text":"Specific identity is remapped from an intrinsic property into a relational position within a series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME2","text":"The opposition of quality and quantity disintegrates into a sequence of transitions in which each determination brings forth and limits the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME3","text":"Exclusion no longer appears as the simple negation of other connections, but as a relation of measure with discontinuous priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME4","text":"The choice among connections is reclassified from a binary opposition into a structured distribution of possible neutralization quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME5","text":"Chemical and musical relations are grasped under a common map of serial, quantitatively grounded qualitative systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ME6","text":"The strategic question shifts from the existence of an affinity to the determination of the measure through which one affinity receives priority over others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT1","text":"Surface: Chemical elective affinity and neutralization appear as qualitative connections determined by quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT2","text":"Structural: The operative structure consists of opposing series, neutralization quanta, exclusive exponents, and the indifference of possible combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text successively examines a quantitative, an intensified, and a theory-of-measure model, and rejects every one-sided model through its counter-transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being and determinacy are conceived as relational difference, whose forms continually pass over into one another rather than existing as statically separate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from relational specificity through quantitative affinity and exclusion to measure-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT2","text":"The concrete standard that decides why a specific affinity receives priority over others remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as exclusivity and indifference are treated as opposing moments of the same mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of the problem of exclusion from the identity of extensive and intensive magnitude, together with its correction through the concept of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT5","text":"The tension persists because measure restores exclusion, while the quantitative indifference of several opposing moments immediately relativizes it anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT6","text":"The generalization to musical and other systems expands the structure, but does not replace the missing concrete determination of the principle of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CWAH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument if it does not end with qualitative exclusivity, but retains its dissolution and renewed undermining as necessary subsequent steps.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CWAH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CWAH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CWAH:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 92","title":"c. Elective Affinity.","context":"Chapter 92","original_title":"c. Wahlverwandtschaft."},"original_title":"c. Wahlverwandtschaft.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":93,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_23"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_23@R001","sha256":"1eb45cb14843f6a8e2bd92ba5d626a61e3f1d174b0f12b88513c2283127cfdbe","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt bei dem Problem an, wie chemische Stoffe nur in Beziehungen bestimmt sein und dennoch eine bestimmte Qualität besitzen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt die Sättigung als quantitative Relation, in der die Qualität eines chemischen Stoffs als Maß erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS3","text":"Die Gesetze neutraler Mischungen ordnen Sättigungsrelationen zu korrespondierenden Proportionsreihen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS4","text":"Berthollets Begriff der chemischen Masse erhält diese Reihen, löst aber den ausschließenden Charakter der Wahlverwandtschaft in Mengen- und Umstandsverhältnisse auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS5","text":"Die atomistische und elektrochemische Theorie werden kritisiert, weil sie die Proportionsgesetze nicht begründen, Unterschiede auslöschen oder ungesicherte Kategorien nachtragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS6","text":"Die Reduktion der Wahlverwandtschaft auf quantitative oder äußere Bedingungen wird durch die Behauptung begrenzt, dass mit dem Qualitativen eine neue Ordnung beginnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS7","text":"Der Übergang zu spezifischen Gewichten verschiebt die Analyse von zwischen getrennten Stoffen bestehenden Maßen zu untrennbaren Maßmomenten innerhalb eines Körpers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS8","text":"Die Bewegung ist rekonstruktiv-kritisch: relationale Quantität wird als Qualität bestimmt, reduktive Erklärungen werden entzogen, und die Forderung eines immanenten Maßsystems bleibt offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A1","text":"Chemische Stoffe sind Maßmomente, deren Bestimmtheit nur im Verhalten zu anderen Stoffen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A2","text":"Säuren und Basen besitzen isolierte Existenz nur als aufzuhebende Unselbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A3","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmung der Sättigung macht die qualitative Natur eines chemischen Stoffs aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A4","text":"Die Sättigungszahl ist wesentlich ein Exponent im Verhältnis zu einer gesetzten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A5","text":"Die quantitative Natur chemischer Beziehung ermöglicht, dass ein Stoff mit mehreren anderen Stoffen neutralisierend verbunden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A6","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft bezeichnet den ausschließenden Vorrang einer möglichen Verbindung vor anderen möglichen Verbindungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A7","text":"Die Neutralisation verschiedener Säuren und Basen bildet korrespondierende Reihen konstanter Proportionsverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A8","text":"Berthollets Begriff der chemischen Masse verändert die Sättigungsproportionen nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A9","text":"Nach Berthollet wird die Wirksamkeit eines chemischen Stoffs durch vorhandene Menge und Sättigungsfähigkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A10","text":"Nach Berthollet entsteht der Ausschluss eines Stoffes durch Umstände wie Kohäsion, Unauflöslichkeit oder Temperatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A11","text":"Die atomistische Raumvorstellung der Auflösung ist weder erfahrungsmäßig ausgewiesen noch widerspruchsfrei bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A12","text":"Die Gesetze bestimmter Proportionen betreffen Mengen quantitativer Einheiten und nicht atomare Entitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A13","text":"Die Rede von Affinitätsgraden setzt intensive Größe voraus und ist mit bloßer korpuskularer Juxtaposition nicht vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A14","text":"Elektrische Neutralisation bleibt der Körperqualität äußerlich und flüchtig, während chemische Neutralisation die ganze qualitative Natur der Stoffe verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A15","text":"Mit dem Qualitativen beginnt eine Ordnung, deren Spezifikation nicht bloß quantitativer Unterschied ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A16","text":"Spezifische Schwere ist ein unmittelbares Maß aus den untrennbaren Momenten von Gewicht und Volumen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A17","text":"In Mischungen werden spezifische Gewichte zu veränderlichen Verhältnisbestimmungen mit eigener Gesetzlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A18","text":"Ein immanentes Regelprinzip für die Reihen chemischer Verhältnisse und spezifischer Gewichte ist noch nicht erkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX1","text":"Chemische Qualität ist nicht die unmittelbare, in sich abgeschlossene Eigenschaft eines isolierten Körpers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX2","text":"Die isolierte Selbstständigkeit von Säure oder Basis ist nicht ihr endgültiger Seinsmodus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX3","text":"Sättigungsproportionen sind nicht durch Atomzahlen oder atomare Lagerungsverhältnisse bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX4","text":"Chemische Verwandtschaft ist nicht auf den binären Gegensatz eines einzigen Gegenstoffs beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX5","text":"Die Wahlverwandtschaft ist nicht unmittelbar aus der bloßen Proportionsreihe ableitbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX6","text":"Die Massenwirksamkeit hebt die Gesetze der bestimmten Sättigungsproportionen nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX7","text":"Der beobachtete Ausschluss eines Stoffs ist nach Berthollet nicht unbedingt Ausdruck seiner ursprünglichen qualitativen Natur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX8","text":"Die atomistische Theorie der Auflösung ist keine durch Erfahrung bestätigte Erklärung der chemischen Verbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX9","text":"Reine Korpuskularität kann keinen sinnvollen Begriff abgestufter Affinität liefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX10","text":"Chemismus und Elektrizität sind nicht erklärend identisch, wenn ihre spezifischen Unterschiede ausgelassen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX11","text":"Eine Reihe elektropositiver und elektronegativer Körper ist keine gesicherte Grundlage chemischer Affinität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX12","text":"Spezifische Gewichte sind in Mischungen nicht bloß fixe Vergleichungszahlen und Volumina nicht bloß addierbare Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D1","text":"Die chemische Qualität erscheint als relationales Koordinatensystem von Exponenten, nicht als absolute Stoffeigenschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A4","CH_GB18_A_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D2","text":"Die Möglichkeit mehrerer Neutralisationspartner trennt die Sättigungsordnung von der ausschließenden Präferenzordnung der Wahlverwandtschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A5","CH_GB18_A_23:A6","CH_GB18_A_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D3","text":"Berthollets Modell erzeugt eine zweischichtige Erklärung aus unveränderten stöchiometrischen Gesetzen und situationsabhängiger Wirksamkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A8","CH_GB18_A_23:A9","CH_GB18_A_23:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D4","text":"Die experimentelle Geltung der Proportionsreihen ist von atomistischen Bildern der Stoffstruktur unabhängig.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D5","text":"Die Rede von Affinitätsgraden führt Intensität gerade dort ein, wo die korpuskulare Theorie nur äußerliche Mengen nebeneinander zulässt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D6","text":"Die elektrochemische Reduktion ersetzt eine stabile chemische Differenz durch einen flüchtigen und äußerlich bedingten Gegensatz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D7","text":"Die Zurückführung des Ausschlusses auf äußere Umstände beseitigt das Qualitative nicht, sondern verlegt es in ein ungelöstes Verhältnis von Bedingung und Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A10","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D8","text":"Die Mischung verwandelt spezifische Schwere von einer äußerlichen Vergleichungsgröße in eine veränderliche Maßrelation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A16","CH_GB18_A_23:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D9","text":"Kontinuierliche Mischungsreihen enthalten eine spezifische Gesetzlichkeit, die aus bloßer Addition oder arithmetischer Proportion nicht folgt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D10","text":"Die bloße Sammlung exakter Verhältniszahlen erzeugt noch kein begrifflich geschlossenes Maßsystem.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD1","text":"Maß ist die Form, in der Quantität nicht in Qualität übergeht, sondern als deren relationale Bestimmtheit fungiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A1","CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A4","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD2","text":"Die Proportionsgesetze besitzen methodische Autonomie gegenüber atomistischen und elektrochemischen Ontologien.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A12","CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD3","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft zerfällt in drei nicht ineinander auflösbare Momente: Sättigungsmaß, Massen- und Umstandsbedingungen sowie qualitativer Vorrang.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A6","CH_GB18_A_23:A9","CH_GB18_A_23:A10","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD4","text":"Der Text unterscheidet zwei Maßtypen: zwischen selbständig erscheinenden Stoffen vermittelte Sättigungsmaße und in einem Körper untrennbar enthaltene unmittelbare Maße.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A1","CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD5","text":"Mischungen zeigen ein Verhältnis, in dem kontinuierliche quantitative Veränderung durch ein nichtarithmetisches Spezifikationsgesetz bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD6","text":"Eine Theorie erklärt chemische Verhältnisse nicht, wenn sie die Unterschiede, die sie erklären soll, durch Identifikation tilgt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A13","CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass kein chemischer Stoff vor seinen Beziehungen vollständig qualitativ bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass numerische Regelmäßigkeit keine ontologische Darstellung der Träger dieser Regelmäßigkeit erzwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX3","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass die Ausschließung einer Verbindung weder aus bloßer Sättigungszahl noch aus bloßer Massenwirkung vollständig erklärt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Intensität keine Erklärung gewinnt, indem sie lediglich von Affinität auf elektrische Polarität übertragen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX5","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass additive Rechnung nicht die gesamte Gesetzlichkeit von Maßverhältnissen erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist der vollständig selbständige chemische Einzelkörper, dessen Qualität unabhängig von Verbindung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein universelles Substratmodell, das Chemismus erklärt, ohne seine Differenz zu Elektrizität, räumlicher Lagerung oder bloßer Menge zu bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein abgeschlossenes Gesetz, das chemische Reihen und Reihen spezifischer Gewichte aus einer einzigen rechnerischen Regel erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS1","text":"Isolierter Stoff → aufzuhebende Unselbstständigkeit → Bestimmtheit nur durch Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS2","text":"Beziehung zu mehreren Stoffen → Sättigungsquantitäten → Qualität als relativer Maßexponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS3","text":"Wiederholte Neutralisation → korrespondierende Proportionsreihen → chemisches Maßsystem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS4","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft → Berthollets Massen- und Umstandsmodell → Ausschluss als bedingte Erscheinung bei fortbestehender Proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS5","text":"Atomismus, Intensitätsmetaphysik und Elektrochemismus → Verlust oder Widerspruch der spezifischen Differenz → Entzug des erklärenden Anspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS6","text":"Rückkehr des Qualitativen → neue, nicht bloß quantitative Ordnung → ungelöster Rest der Wahlverwandtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS7","text":"Untrennbare Maßmomente → spezifische Schwere → Mischung → veränderliche Exponenten mit inkommensurabler Gesetzlichkeit → offene Forderung eines Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AF1","text":"Relationale chemische Stoffbestimmung → Sättigungsmaß als qualitative Quantität → konstante Proportionsreihen → Konflikt zwischen Mehrfachbeziehung und Wahlverwandtschaft → Massen- und Umstandsmodell → Kritik atomistischer und elektrochemischer Reduktionen → Restitution einer qualitativen Ordnung → spezifische Gewichte und Mischungsmaße → Forderung eines noch unerreichten Maßsystems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME1","text":"Chemische Qualität wird von einer stoffimmanenten Eigenschaft zu einer durch proportionierte Beziehung bestimmten Maßqualität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME2","text":"Experimentelle Proportionsgesetze werden von den metaphysischen Bildern ihrer Erklärung abgetrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME3","text":"Wahlverwandtschaft wird weder als unmittelbare Stoffessenz noch als bloßer Mengenmechanismus lesbar, sondern als Konfliktfeld von Maß, Bedingungen und Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von quantitativer und qualitativer Erklärung wird in einen Übergang umgezeichnet, in dem Quantität qualitative Bestimmtheit trägt, aber nicht erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME5","text":"Spezifische Gewichte erscheinen nicht mehr bloß als tabellarische Konstanten, sondern als in Mischungen verschiebbare Verhältnisexponenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME6","text":"Die wissenschaftliche Landschaft wird in empirisch tragfähige Reihen, hypothetische Trägerbilder und noch fehlende systematische Gesetze gegliedert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text behandelt Sättigung, Wahlverwandtschaft, chemische Masse, Atomtheorie, Elektrochemismus und spezifische Gewichte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT2","text":"Structural — Chemische Bestimmtheit wird durch Maßrelationen erzeugt, deren Zahlen nur als Exponenten eines Systems Bedeutung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Theorie wird daran geprüft, ob sie die experimentelle Regel bewahrt, ohne die zu erklärende Differenz durch hypothetische Identifikation zu annullieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Chemische Stoffe sind nur in ihrer auf Verbindung gerichteten Relationalität bestimmt, während elektrische Gegensätze als flüchtig und äußerlich erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Eine Menge empirischer Zahlenreihen gilt nicht als Wissen eines Maßsystems, solange ihre spezifische Erzeugungsregel unbekannt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von relationaler Stoffbestimmtheit über Sättigungsreihen und Theoriekritik zu den Mischungsmaßen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran positiv entschieden werden kann, ob ein Ausschluss qualitativ wesentlich oder nur durch äußere Bedingungen erzeugt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT3","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der bertholletschen Externalisierung der Wahlverwandtschaft und der Behauptung einer irreduziblen qualitativen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist dort kohärent, wo sie Proportionsgesetze von atomistischen und elektrochemischen Überbauten trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT5","text":"Die Kritik an Atomismus und Elektrochemismus hängt von der Gegenüberstellung erfahrungsmäßiger Bestimmtheit und kategorialer Widerspruchsfreiheit ab, ohne selbst eine positive chemische Grundtheorie auszuarbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT6","text":"Die Schlussbewegung bleibt programmatisch, weil das verlangte Regelprinzip für harmonische Reihen nur gefordert und nicht erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn die Kritik reduktiver Modelle nicht mit einer vollständigen Aufhebung der quantitativen Maßbestimmung verwechselt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111939023313Z_e4e4446c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"1eb45cb14843f6a8e2bd92ba5d626a61e3f1d174b0f12b88513c2283127cfdbe","sha256":"4a3d0a2285d5df2b54c26fb8fceee24bdc93f64a41f855645df786609390a819","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:19:39.024653+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS1","text":"The text begins with the problem of how chemical substances can be determined only in relations and yet possess a determinate quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS2","text":"It determines saturation as a quantitative relation in which the quality of a chemical substance appears as measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS3","text":"The laws of neutral mixtures arrange saturation relations into corresponding series of proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS4","text":"Berthollet's concept of chemical mass preserves these series, but dissolves the exclusive character of elective affinity into relations of quantity and circumstances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS5","text":"Atomistic and electrochemical theory are criticized because they do not ground the laws of proportion, efface differences, or append unsecured categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS6","text":"The reduction of elective affinity to quantitative or external conditions is limited by the assertion that a new order begins with the qualitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS7","text":"The transition to specific gravities shifts the analysis from measures existing between separate substances to inseparable moments of measure within a body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AS8","text":"The movement is reconstructive-critical: relational quantity is determined as quality, reductive explanations are withdrawn, and the demand for an immanent system of measure remains open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A1","text":"Chemical substances are moments of measure whose determinacy consists only in their behavior toward other substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A2","text":"Acids and bases possess isolated existence only as self-subsistence that is to be sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A3","text":"The quantitative determination of saturation constitutes the qualitative nature of a chemical substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A4","text":"The saturation number is essentially an exponent in relation to a posited unit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A5","text":"The quantitative nature of chemical relation makes it possible for one substance to be connected neutralizingly with several other substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A6","text":"Elective affinity denotes the exclusive priority of one possible combination over other possible combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A7","text":"The neutralization of different acids and bases forms corresponding series of constant proportional relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A8","text":"Berthollet's concept of chemical mass does not alter the saturation proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A9","text":"According to Berthollet, the efficacy of a chemical substance is determined by its present quantity and capacity for saturation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A10","text":"According to Berthollet, the exclusion of a substance arises through circumstances such as cohesion, insolubility, or temperature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A11","text":"The atomistic spatial conception of dissolution is neither warranted by experience nor determined without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A12","text":"The laws of definite proportions concern quantities of quantitative units and not atomic entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A13","text":"Talk of degrees of affinity presupposes intensive magnitude and is incompatible with mere corpuscular juxtaposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A14","text":"Electrical neutralization remains external and transient to bodily quality, whereas chemical neutralization transforms the entire qualitative nature of substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A15","text":"With the qualitative begins an order whose specification is not merely quantitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A16","text":"Specific gravity is an immediate measure constituted from the inseparable moments of weight and volume.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A17","text":"In mixtures, specific gravities become variable determinations of relation with their own lawfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:A18","text":"An immanent regulative principle for the series of chemical relations and specific gravities has not yet been recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX1","text":"Chemical quality is not the immediate, self-enclosed property of an isolated body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX2","text":"The isolated self-subsistence of acid or base is not its final mode of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX3","text":"Saturation proportions are not determined by numbers of atoms or atomic arrangements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX4","text":"Chemical affinity is not restricted to the binary opposition of a single counter-substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX5","text":"Elective affinity cannot be immediately derived from the mere series of proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX6","text":"The efficacy of mass does not sublate the laws of definite saturation proportions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX7","text":"According to Berthollet, the observed exclusion of a substance is not necessarily an expression of its original qualitative nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX8","text":"The atomistic theory of dissolution is not an explanation of chemical combination confirmed by experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX9","text":"Pure corporeality cannot yield a meaningful concept of graduated affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX10","text":"Chemism and electricity are not explanatorily identical when their specific differences are omitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX11","text":"A series of electropositive and electronegative bodies is not a secure foundation of chemical affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:NX12","text":"In mixtures, specific gravities are not merely fixed comparative numbers, and volumes are not merely additive magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D1","text":"Chemical quality appears as a relational coordinate system of exponents, not as an absolute property of substance.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A4","CH_GB18_A_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D2","text":"The possibility of several neutralization partners separates the order of saturation from the order of exclusive preference of elective affinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A5","CH_GB18_A_23:A6","CH_GB18_A_23:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D3","text":"Berthollet's model produces a two-layered explanation of unchanged stoichiometric laws and situation-dependent efficacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A8","CH_GB18_A_23:A9","CH_GB18_A_23:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D4","text":"The experimental validity of the series of proportions is independent of atomistic images of the structure of matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D5","text":"Talk of degrees of affinity introduces intensity precisely where corpuscular theory permits only external quantities alongside one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D6","text":"The electrochemical reduction replaces a stable chemical difference with a transient and externally conditioned opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D7","text":"The reduction of exclusion to external circumstances does not eliminate the qualitative, but displaces it into an unresolved relation of condition and determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A10","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D8","text":"Mixture transforms specific gravity from an external comparative magnitude into a variable relation of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A16","CH_GB18_A_23:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D9","text":"Continuous series of mixtures contain a specific lawfulness that does not follow from mere addition or arithmetic proportion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:D10","text":"The mere collection of exact proportional numbers does not yet produce a conceptually closed system of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD1","text":"Measure is the form in which quantity does not pass over into quality, but functions as its relational determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A1","CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A4","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD2","text":"The laws of proportion possess methodological autonomy in relation to atomistic and electrochemical ontologies.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A7","CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A12","CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD3","text":"Elective affinity breaks down into three moments irreducible to one another: measure of saturation, conditions of mass and circumstances, and qualitative priority.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A6","CH_GB18_A_23:A9","CH_GB18_A_23:A10","CH_GB18_A_23:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD4","text":"The text distinguishes two types of measure: measures of saturation mediated between substances appearing as self-subsistent, and immediate measures inseparably contained in one body.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A1","CH_GB18_A_23:A3","CH_GB18_A_23:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD5","text":"Mixtures exhibit a relation in which continuous quantitative alteration is determined by a non-arithmetical law of specification.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A17","CH_GB18_A_23:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SD6","text":"A theory does not explain chemical relations if it effaces through identification the differences it is supposed to explain.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_23:A11","CH_GB18_A_23:A13","CH_GB18_A_23:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that no chemical substance is fully qualitatively determined prior to its relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes that numerical regularity does not compel an ontological representation of the bearers of this regularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX3","text":"The system presupposes that the exclusion of a combination is not fully explained either by mere saturation number or by mere mass action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that intensity gains no explanation by being merely transferred from affinity to electrical polarity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:DNX5","text":"The system presupposes that additive calculation does not grasp the entire lawfulness of relations of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the fully self-subsistent individual chemical body whose quality could subsist independently of combination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a universal substrate model that explains chemism without preserving its difference from electricity, spatial arrangement, or mere quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a completed law that generates chemical series and series of specific gravities from a single computational rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS1","text":"Isolated substance → self-subsistence to be sublated → determinacy only through relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS2","text":"Relation to several substances → quantities of saturation → quality as relative exponent of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS3","text":"Repeated neutralization → corresponding series of proportions → chemical system of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS4","text":"Elective affinity → Berthollet's model of mass and circumstances → exclusion as conditioned appearance with proportion persisting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS5","text":"Atomism, metaphysics of intensity, and electrochemism → loss or contradiction of specific difference → withdrawal of the explanatory claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS6","text":"Return of the qualitative → new, not merely quantitative order → unresolved remainder of elective affinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:FGS7","text":"Inseparable moments of measure → specific gravity → mixture → variable exponents with incommensurable lawfulness → open demand for a system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:AF1","text":"Relational determination of chemical substances → measure of saturation as qualitative quantity → constant series of proportions → conflict between multiple relation and elective affinity → model of mass and circumstances → critique of atomistic and electrochemical reductions → restitution of a qualitative order → specific gravities and measures of mixture → demand for a system of measure not yet attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME1","text":"Chemical quality is reclassified from a property immanent in substance into a quality of measure determined through proportioned relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME2","text":"Experimental laws of proportion are separated from the metaphysical images of their explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME3","text":"Elective affinity becomes readable neither as immediate essence of substance nor as a mere mechanism of quantity, but as a field of conflict among measure, conditions, and quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME4","text":"The opposition between quantitative and qualitative explanation is redrawn as a transition in which quantity bears qualitative determinacy but does not exhaust it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME5","text":"Specific gravities no longer appear merely as tabular constants, but as relational exponents displaceable in mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ME6","text":"The scientific landscape is divided into empirically viable series, hypothetical images of bearers, and systematic laws still lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text treats saturation, elective affinity, chemical mass, atomic theory, electrochemism, and specific gravities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT2","text":"Structural — Chemical determinacy is produced through relations of measure, whose numbers possess significance only as exponents of a system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Theory is tested by whether it preserves the experimental rule without annulling the difference to be explained through hypothetical identification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Chemical substances are determined only in their relationality directed toward combination, whereas electrical oppositions appear as transient and external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — A quantity of empirical numerical series does not count as knowledge of a system of measure so long as its specific generative rule remains unknown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from relational determination of substance through series of saturation and critique of theory to measures of mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what positive criterion it can be decided whether an exclusion is qualitatively essential or produced only by external conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT3","text":"The strongest line of rupture lies between the Bertholletian externalization of elective affinity and the assertion of an irreducible qualitative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent where it separates laws of proportion from atomistic and electrochemical superstructures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT5","text":"The critique of atomism and electrochemism depends on the opposition between experiential determinacy and categorical freedom from contradiction, without itself elaborating a positive fundamental chemical theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT6","text":"The concluding movement remains programmatic because the required regulative principle for harmonious series is only demanded and not generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_23:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the critique of reductive models is not confused with a complete sublation of quantitative determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_23:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_23@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_23:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 93","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 93","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM","layer":"CH","title":"B. Nodal Line of Measure Relations.","order":94,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BKVM"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BKVM@R001","sha256":"2489147a8224be14dbee6870cc1f5d604c0c99d25e4b0de7602853440746ff2b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, wie ein ausschließendes Maaßverhältnis aus quantitativer Veränderlichkeit qualitative Bestimmungen erzeugen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS2","text":"Das Maaß wird als qualitative, in sich bezogene Grundlage bestimmt, deren quantitative Äußerlichkeit aus ihrer eigenen Kontinuität hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS3","text":"Durch Selbstabstoßung erzeugt diese Einheit mehrere Maaßverhältnisse auf demselben Substrat und bildet eine Knotenlinie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS4","text":"Innerhalb jedes Maaßverhältnisses bleibt die Qualität gegen quantitative Veränderung indifferent, bis ein bestimmter Punkt erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS5","text":"Am spezifischen Punkt schlägt das quantitative Verhältnis in eine neue Qualität um, die nicht allmählich aus der vorhergehenden Qualität hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS6","text":"Der Text rekonstruiert qualitative Veränderung als kontinuierliche quantitative Bewegung mit diskontinuierlichen qualitativen Sprüngen und weist die Allmählichkeit als Erklärung des qualitativen Übergangs zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A1","text":"Das Maaßverhältnis ist als specifisch ausschließend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A2","text":"Das Ausschließen gehört der Neutralität als negativer Einheit ihrer unterschiedenen Momente an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A3","text":"Für die fürsichseiende Einheit der Wahlverwandtschaft ergibt sich gegenüber anderen Neutralitäten kein weiteres qualitatives Princip der Specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A4","text":"Die Wahlverwandtschaft bestimmt sich zunächst nur quantitativ dadurch, daß bestimmte Mengen sich neutralisiren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A5","text":"Die quantitative Grundbestimmung setzt die ausschließende Wahlverwandtschaft in andere Neutralitäten fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A6","text":"Diese Kontinuität ist eine innere Trennbarkeit der Neutralität, durch welche ihre Momente als selbstständige und gleichgültige Etwas in verschiedene Verbindungen treten können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A7","text":"Das Maaßverhältnis ist dadurch mit eigener Gleichgültigkeit, innerer Äußerlichkeit und Veränderlichkeit behaftet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","text":"Die Beziehung des Maaßes auf sich ist gegenüber seiner quantitativen Äußerlichkeit eine qualitative Grundlage und ein materielles Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","text":"Das Substrat muß in seiner Kontinuität mit sich selbst das Princip der Specification seiner Äußerlichkeit enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","text":"Das ausschließende Maaß stößt sich in seinem Fürsichseyn von sich selbst ab und setzt andere quantitative Maaßverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A11","text":"Die daraus entstehenden Verhältnisse finden innerhalb desselben Substrats und derselben Neutralitätsmomente statt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","text":"Diese Verhältnisse bilden eine Knotenlinie von Maaßen auf einer Skale des Mehr und Weniger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","text":"Ein Maaßverhältnis besitzt innerhalb quantitativer Veränderung eine Weite, in der seine Qualität gleichgültig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","text":"An einem bestimmten Punkt erweist sich das Quantum als specificirend und schlägt in ein neues Maaß und eine neue Qualität um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","text":"Die neue Qualität ist durch qualitative Dieselbigkeit der Momente und quantitative Kontinuität bestimmt, bleibt aber gegen die vorhergehende Qualität äußerlich und gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A16","text":"Die neue Qualität tritt nicht aus der vorhergehenden, sondern aus der innerlichen, noch nicht ins Daseyn getretenen specificirenden Einheit hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A17","text":"Jede neue Qualität ist demselben Fortgang der quantitativen Veränderung und damit einer unendlichen Wiederholung des Umschlags unterworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A18","text":"Die quantitative Allmähligkeit ist nur äußerlich, während der qualitative Übergang ein Sprung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX1","text":"Das System gründet die Spezifikation der Wahlverwandtschaft nicht auf ein weiteres qualitatives Princip gegenüber anderen Neutralitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX2","text":"Die Kontinuität der verschiedenen Neutralitätsverhältnisse ist nicht bloß äußerliche Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX3","text":"Die erzeugten Maaßverhältnisse sind keine Affinitäten zwischen selbstständigen Dingen verschiedener Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX4","text":"Das Maaß ist nicht bloß ein äußerliches quantitatives Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX5","text":"Die qualitative Veränderung ist nicht durch quantitative Veränderung allein erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX6","text":"Ein dem folgenden Verhältnis unendlich nahes quantitatives Verhältnis ist nicht schon dasselbe qualitative Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX7","text":"Die neue Qualität ist nicht aus dem vorhergehenden Maaßverhältnis als dessen bloße Fortsetzung hervorgegangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX8","text":"Die Allmähligkeit ist keine Grenze der qualitativen Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX9","text":"Die Allmähligkeit vermittelt den qualitativen Zusammenhang nicht, wenn sie die beiden Realitäten als schlechthin äußerlich gegeneinander setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D1","text":"Die quantitative Kontinuität der Neutralität erzeugt eine innere Selbstäußerlichkeit des Maaßes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A5","CH_GB18_BKVM:A6","CH_GB18_BKVM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D2","text":"Die qualitative Grundlage erzeugt durch Selbstabstoßung eine Reihe anderer Maaßverhältnisse.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D3","text":"Die Maaßverhältnisse der Reihe unterscheiden sich auf demselben Substrat zunächst nur quantitativ.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A11","CH_GB18_BKVM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D4","text":"Qualitative Identität bleibt innerhalb eines quantitativen Bereichs erhalten, obwohl das Verhältnis äußerlich veränderlich ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A7","CH_GB18_BKVM:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D5","text":"Der spezifische Punkt verwandelt die quantitative Differenz in eine qualitative Neubestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D6","text":"Die qualitative Neubestimmung verbindet quantitative Kontinuität mit äußerer qualitativer Verschiedenheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D7","text":"Der qualitative Umschlag entspringt einer inneren Bestimmung, die im vorhergehenden Verhältnis noch nicht als Daseyn gesetzt war.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","CH_GB18_BKVM:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D8","text":"Die Maaßverhältnisse erzeugen eine unbegrenzte Folge weiterer qualitativer Umschläge.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D9","text":"Die Allmähligkeit beschreibt die Nähe quantitativer Zustände, nicht die Identität ihrer Qualitäten.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D10","text":"Eine Erklärung des qualitativen Übergangs durch bloße Allmähligkeit beseitigt gerade die qualitative Grenze, die erklärt werden müßte.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD1","text":"Das Maaß ist eine selbstproduzierende Differenzierungsstruktur, in der quantitative Kontinuität eine Folge qualitativer Diskontinuitäten hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD2","text":"Kontinuität und Sprung bilden keine konkurrierenden Erklärungen, sondern gehören verschiedenen Seiten desselben Umschlags an.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD3","text":"Qualitative Verschiedenheit wird nicht als äußere Reihe fertiger Dinge, sondern als innere Produktion verschiedener Maaße auf einem gemeinsamen Substrat bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD4","text":"Das neue Etwas ist zugleich durch die Kontinuität seines Substrats vermittelt und gegenüber der vorhergehenden Qualität unmittelbar gesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","CH_GB18_BKVM:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD5","text":"Die qualitative Wirklichkeit ist als unendliche Knotenlinie organisiert, nicht als einmaliger Übergang zu einer abschließenden Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Erklärung aus, in der qualitative Bestimmung von außen an ein neutrales quantitatives Verhältnis herangetragen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Ontologie aus, in der alle qualitativen Unterschiede bloße Grade derselben kontinuierlichen Veränderung sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, daß die neue Qualität als bloße Wirkung der vorhergehenden Qualität oder ihres veränderten Quantums verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX4","text":"Es schließt ein Substrat aus, das als unveränderliches Trägersubstrat außerhalb seiner eigenen Spezifikation bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Identität unendlich benachbarter quantitativer Verhältnisse mit Rücksicht auf ihre qualitative Bestimmung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Vermittlung aus, die den qualitativen Sprung durch die Verlängerung quantitativer Zwischenstufen ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX7","text":"Es schließt eine endliche Letztbestimmung der durch das Maaß erzeugten qualitativen Reihe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Begriff der Veränderung, in dem qualitative Differenz vollständig in graduelle Quantitätsverschiebung aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Erklärungsmodell, das die innere Grenze des Maaßes durch äußerliche Nachbarschaft ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine abschließende Einheit, welche die unendliche Folge der Maaßumschläge stillstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Kontinuität als selbstgenügsame Erklärung des qualitativen Daseyns zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines äußeren Spezifikationsprincips zwingt die qualitative Differenz in die immanente Selbstbestimmung des Maaßes zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS1","text":"Ausschließende Neutralität → quantitative Affinität → innere Trennbarkeit der Momente → selbstäußerliche Veränderlichkeit des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS2","text":"Qualitative Grundlage → Selbstabstoßung → Produktion anderer Maaßverhältnisse auf demselben Substrat → Knotenlinie auf der Skale des Mehr und Weniger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS3","text":"Quantitative Variation innerhalb eines Maaßes → Bereich der qualitativen Gleichgültigkeit → spezifischer Punkt → Umschlag in neues Maaß und neue Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS4","text":"Quantitative Kontinuität → qualitative Äußerlichkeit des neuen Verhältnisses → Hervortreten aus der inneren specificirenden Einheit → erneuter Fortgang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS5","text":"Äußerliche Allmähligkeit ≠ qualitative Vermittlung → Abbruch der bloß quantitativen Grenze → Sprung zwischen qualitativ verschiedenen Daseynen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AF1","text":"Fehlendes qualitatives Spezifikationsprincip der Wahlverwandtschaft → Rückführung der Spezifikation in die innere Kontinuität des Maaßes → Selbstabstoßung und Erzeugung einer Maaßreihe → quantitative Indifferenz innerhalb von Bereichen → spezifischer Punkt → qualitativer Sprung → unendliche Knotenlinie → Zurückweisung der Allmähligkeit als Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME1","text":"Die Begriffslandschaft verschiebt sich von der äußeren Vergleichung verschiedener Neutralitäten zur immanenten Selbstbeziehung eines Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME2","text":"Qualitäten werden nicht mehr als isolierte Bestimmungen, sondern als Umschlagspunkte einer quantitativen Maaßreihe kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Kontinuität und Diskontinuität wird in äußere quantitative Allmähligkeit und qualitative Sprunghaftigkeit aufgeteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME4","text":"Das neue Etwas wird weder als bloße Fortsetzung noch als äußerlich hinzugefügte Bestimmung, sondern als Hervortreten einer inneren specificirenden Einheit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME5","text":"Die Reihe qualitativer Bestimmungen wird als offene Knotenlinie statt als lineare Steigerung ohne Umschlagspunkte sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein quantitativ verändertes Maaß schlägt an einem bestimmten Punkt in eine neue Qualität um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ein gemeinsames materielles Substrat erzeugt durch innere Selbstabstoßung verschiedene Maaßverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die Erklärung qualitativer Veränderung wird gegen das Modell der bloßen Allmähligkeit neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Realität besteht als kontinuierliche quantitative Veränderung mit diskontinuierlichen qualitativen Daseynen und unendlicher Wiederholung des Umschlags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Erzeugung der Maaßreihe, den spezifischen Punkt und den qualitativen Sprung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die quantitative Grundbestimmung der einzelnen Maaße im Detail festgelegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern quantitative Kontinuität und qualitative Diskontinuität als verschiedene Seiten desselben Verhältnisses behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Ableitung der qualitativen Differenz aus einer immanenten Maaßstruktur statt aus äußerlicher Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen dem bleibenden materiellen Substrat und seiner produktiven Selbstabstoßung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, daß die neue Qualität durch quantitative Kontinuität vermittelt, zugleich aber nicht aus dem vorhergehenden Verhältnis hervorgegangen sein soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT7","text":"Die Zurückweisung der Allmähligkeit hängt davon ab, daß qualitative Grenze und quantitative Nähe streng getrennt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern sie die Knotenlinie als unendliche Folge von Vermittlung und Sprung modelliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113544879912Z_90ce9231","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Nodal Line of Measure-Relations.","source_sha256":"2489147a8224be14dbee6870cc1f5d604c0c99d25e4b0de7602853440746ff2b","sha256":"732bfc558c4418798442486a0ce06bc83509fac3a087c4927196f10fe5ff29e6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:35:44.881493+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS1","text":"The problem consists in how an exclusive measure-relation can generate qualitative determinations out of quantitative variability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS2","text":"Measure is determined as a qualitative, self-related ground, whose quantitative externality proceeds from its own continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS3","text":"Through self-repulsion, this unity produces several measure-relations on the same substrate and forms a nodal line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS4","text":"Within each measure-relation, quality remains indifferent to quantitative alteration until a determinate point is reached.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS5","text":"At the specific point, the quantitative relation passes over into a new quality that does not proceed gradually from the preceding quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AS6","text":"The text reconstructs qualitative alteration as continuous quantitative movement with discontinuous qualitative leaps and rejects gradualness as an explanation of qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A1","text":"The measure-relation is determined as specifically exclusive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A2","text":"Exclusion belongs to neutrality as the negative unity of its differentiated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A3","text":"For the being-for-self unity of elective affinity, no further qualitative principle of specification results in relation to other neutralities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A4","text":"Elective affinity initially determines itself only quantitatively through the fact that determinate quantities neutralize one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A5","text":"The quantitative fundamental determination continues exclusive elective affinity into other neutralities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A6","text":"This continuity is an inner separability of neutrality, through which its moments, as self-subsistent and indifferent somethings, can enter into different combinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A7","text":"The measure-relation is thereby affected with its own indifference, inner externality, and mutability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","text":"The relation of measure to itself is, in contrast to its quantitative externality, a qualitative ground and a material substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","text":"In its continuity with itself, the substrate must contain the principle of the specification of its externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","text":"The exclusive measure repels itself from itself in its being-for-self and posits other quantitative measure-relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A11","text":"The relations arising therefrom take place within the same substrate and the same moments of neutrality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","text":"These relations form a nodal line of measures on a scale of more and less.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","text":"Within quantitative alteration, a measure-relation possesses a range in which its quality remains indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","text":"At a determinate point, the quantum proves to be specifying and passes over into a new measure and a new quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","text":"The new quality is determined through qualitative sameness of the moments and quantitative continuity, but remains external and indifferent to the preceding quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A16","text":"The new quality does not emerge from the preceding one, but from the inward, not-yet-actualized specifying unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A17","text":"Every new quality is subject to the same progression of quantitative alteration and thereby to an infinite repetition of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:A18","text":"Quantitative gradualness is only external, whereas qualitative transition is a leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX1","text":"The system does not ground the specification of elective affinity on a further qualitative principle in relation to other neutralities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX2","text":"The continuity of the different relations of neutrality is not mere external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX3","text":"The produced measure-relations are not affinities between self-subsistent things of different quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX4","text":"Measure is not merely an external quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX5","text":"Qualitative alteration is not explained by quantitative alteration alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX6","text":"A quantitative relation infinitely close to the following relation is not already the same qualitative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX7","text":"The new quality has not emerged from the preceding measure-relation as its mere continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX8","text":"Gradualness is not a boundary of qualitative alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:NX9","text":"Gradualness does not mediate the qualitative connection when it posits the two realities as absolutely external to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D1","text":"The quantitative continuity of neutrality produces an inner self-externality of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A5","CH_GB18_BKVM:A6","CH_GB18_BKVM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D2","text":"Through self-repulsion, the qualitative ground produces a series of other measure-relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D3","text":"The measure-relations of the series initially differ only quantitatively on the same substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A11","CH_GB18_BKVM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D4","text":"Qualitative identity is preserved within a quantitative range, although the relation is externally mutable.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A7","CH_GB18_BKVM:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D5","text":"The specific point transforms quantitative difference into a qualitative redetermination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D6","text":"The qualitative redetermination joins quantitative continuity with external qualitative difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D7","text":"The qualitative transition springs from an inner determination that had not yet been posited as existence in the preceding relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","CH_GB18_BKVM:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D8","text":"The measure-relations produce an unbounded sequence of further qualitative transitions.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D9","text":"Gradualness describes the proximity of quantitative states, not the identity of their qualities.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:D10","text":"An explanation of qualitative transition through mere gradualness eliminates precisely the qualitative boundary that would have to be explained.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD1","text":"Measure is a self-producing structure of differentiation in which quantitative continuity brings forth a sequence of qualitative discontinuities.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A8","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD2","text":"Continuity and leap do not constitute competing explanations, but belong to different sides of the same transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A13","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD3","text":"Qualitative difference is determined not as an external series of finished things, but as the inner production of different measures on a common substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A9","CH_GB18_BKVM:A10","CH_GB18_BKVM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD4","text":"The new something is at once mediated through the continuity of its substrate and immediately posited in contrast to the preceding quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A15","CH_GB18_BKVM:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SD5","text":"Qualitative actuality is organized as an infinite nodal line, not as a one-time transition to a conclusive determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BKVM:A12","CH_GB18_BKVM:A14","CH_GB18_BKVM:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an explanation in which qualitative determination is brought externally to a neutral quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX2","text":"It excludes an ontology in which all qualitative differences are mere degrees of the same continuous alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX3","text":"It excludes understanding the new quality as the mere effect of the preceding quality or of its altered quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX4","text":"It excludes a substrate that could subsist as an unalterable supporting substrate outside its own specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX5","text":"It excludes the identity of infinitely adjacent quantitative relations with respect to their qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX6","text":"It excludes a mediation that replaces the qualitative leap with the extension of quantitative intermediate stages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:DNX7","text":"It excludes a finite ultimate determination of the qualitative series produced by measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a concept of alteration in which qualitative difference is completely dissolved into gradual quantitative displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is an explanatory model that replaces the inner boundary of measure with external adjacency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a conclusive unity that brings the infinite sequence of measure-transitions to a standstill.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX4","text":"Blocked is the possibility of treating continuity as a self-sufficient explanation of qualitative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:SNX5","text":"The absence of an external principle of specification forces qualitative difference back into the immanent self-determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS1","text":"Exclusive neutrality → quantitative affinity → inner separability of the moments → self-external mutability of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS2","text":"Qualitative ground → self-repulsion → production of other measure-relations on the same substrate → nodal line on the scale of more and less.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS3","text":"Quantitative variation within a measure → range of qualitative indifference → specific point → transition into new measure and new quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS4","text":"Quantitative continuity → qualitative externality of the new relation → emergence from the inner specifying unity → renewed progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:FGS5","text":"External gradualness ≠ qualitative mediation → interruption of the merely quantitative boundary → leap between qualitatively different existences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:AF1","text":"Absent qualitative principle of specification of elective affinity → reduction of specification to the inner continuity of measure → self-repulsion and production of a series of measures → quantitative indifference within ranges → specific point → qualitative leap → infinite nodal line → rejection of gradualness as explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME1","text":"The conceptual landscape shifts from the external comparison of different neutralities to the immanent self-relation of a measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME2","text":"Qualities are no longer mapped as isolated determinations, but as points of transition in a quantitative series of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME3","text":"The opposition of continuity and discontinuity is divided into external quantitative gradualness and qualitative abruptness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME4","text":"The new something is classified neither as a mere continuation nor as an externally added determination, but as the emergence of an inner specifying unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ME5","text":"The series of qualitative determinations becomes visible as an open nodal line rather than as a linear increase without points of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A quantitatively altered measure passes over at a determinate point into a new quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** A common material substrate produces different measure-relations through inner self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The explanation of qualitative alteration is reframed against the model of mere gradualness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality consists as continuous quantitative alteration with discontinuous qualitative existences and infinite repetition of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the production of the series of measures, the specific point, and the qualitative leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the quantitative fundamental determination of the individual measures is fixed in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as quantitative continuity and qualitative discontinuity are treated as different sides of the same relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest point is the derivation of qualitative difference from an immanent structure of measure rather than from external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the enduring material substrate and its productive self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT6","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the new quality is mediated through quantitative continuity, yet is not supposed to have emerged from the preceding relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT7","text":"The rejection of gradualness depends on qualitative boundary and quantitative proximity being strictly separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BKVM:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as it models the nodal line as an infinite sequence of mediation and leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BKVM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BKVM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BKVM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 94","title":"B. Nodal Line of Measure Relations.","context":"Chapter 94","original_title":"B. Knotenlinie von Maaßverhältnissen."},"original_title":"B. Knotenlinie von Maaßverhältnissen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":95,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_24"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_24@R001","sha256":"341b746151a6a31dc44e7e0098332c18c60b764349eaaa04516d4eef9b1b65a6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS1","text":"Quantitative Fortgänge können trotz gleichförmiger unmittelbarer Verhältnisse spezifische Verhältnisse zu entfernten Bestimmungen hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS2","text":"An bestimmten quantitativen Maßverhältnissen tritt eine qualitative Bestimmung hervor, die nicht als bloße Steigerung der vorhergehenden Größe vorliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS3","text":"Der qualitative Eintritt unterbricht den quantitativen Fortgang und erfolgt als Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS4","text":"Das Modell der bloßen Allmählichkeit setzt das Entstehende bereits als nur unbemerkbar vorhandenes Dasein voraus und erklärt dadurch das Entstehen weg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS5","text":"Dieselbe Maßstruktur erscheint in natürlichen, moralischen und staatlichen Übergängen als Überschreitung einer Grenze mit qualitativer Folge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS6","text":"Die Argumentation bewegt sich diagnostisch von der scheinbaren Kontinuität zur Maßstruktur, zur Kritik des Gradualismus und zur allgemeinen Bestimmung qualitativen Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A1","text":"Eine quantitative Reihe kann ein gleichförmiges unmittelbares Verhältnis bewahren und zugleich spezifische Verhältnisse zwischen nicht unmittelbar benachbarten Bestimmungen enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A2","text":"Spezifische qualitative Verhältnisse treten an bestimmten quantitativen Maßverhältnissen hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A3","text":"Eine qualitative Bestimmung kann an ihrem Maßpunkt eintreten, ohne durch die unmittelbar vorausgehende Bestimmung qualitativ vorbereitet zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A4","text":"Qualitative Bestimmungen sind nicht notwendig als schwächere Grade in den zwischenliegenden quantitativen Verhältnissen vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A5","text":"Entstehen und Vergehen umfassen den Übergang zwischen quantitativen und qualitativen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A6","text":"Die Erklärung des Entstehens durch bloße Allmählichkeit setzt das Entstehende bereits als wirklich, aber unbemerkbar vorhanden voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A7","text":"Diese Voraussetzung verwandelt den inneren oder begrifflichen Unterschied in einen äußerlichen Größenunterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A8","text":"Ein Maßpunkt kann den quantitativen Fortgang unterbrechen und durch einen Sprung eine neue Qualität hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A9","text":"Im Moralischen kann die quantitative Überschreitung eines Maßes eine qualitative Umkehr hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A10","text":"Die quantitative Größe eines Staates kann unter sonst gleichen Bedingungen seinen qualitativen Charakter verändern und die bestehende Verfassung über ihre Tragfähigkeit hinausführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX1","text":"Die Behauptung, in der Natur gebe es keinen Sprung, wird als Erklärung des Entstehens und Vergehens zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX2","text":"Ein qualitativer Übergang ist kein bloßes Mehr oder Weniger derselben Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX3","text":"Neue qualitative Produkte sind nicht notwendig in den benachbarten Mischungsverhältnissen als schwächere Grade vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX4","text":"Zwischen zwei qualitativen Zuständen liegt nicht notwendig ein neutrales oder spezifisch bestimmtes Zwischenstadium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX5","text":"Das Entstehen wird nicht durch die bloße Verkleinerung oder Vergrößerung eines bereits fertigen Daseins erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX6","text":"Der wesentliche Unterschied wird nicht auf einen äußerlichen Größenunterschied reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX7","text":"Moralische und staatliche Qualitätsveränderungen sind nicht bloß quantitative Vermehrungen innerhalb derselben Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D1","text":"Quantitative Kontinuität schließt spezifische qualitative Relationen nicht aus, sondern kann deren Maßbedingungen hervorbringen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A1","CH_GB18_A_24:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D2","text":"Eine qualitative Neubestimmung kann auftreten, obwohl die quantitative Veränderung unmittelbar zuvor keine entsprechende qualitative Differenz erkennen ließ.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D3","text":"Der Sprung bezeichnet keine Unterbrechung der quantitativen Reihe als solcher, sondern den Eintritt einer neuen Qualität innerhalb ihres Fortgangs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A3","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D4","text":"Die allmähliche Erklärung des Werdens ist tautologisch, weil sie das Resultat bereits als unbemerkbare Gegenwart voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D5","text":"Das qualitative Anderswerden zeigt sich als allgemeine Struktur in Naturprozessen, moralischen Übergängen und staatlichen Veränderungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9","CH_GB18_A_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D6","text":"Eine quantitative Überschreitung kann eine Bestimmung in ihr qualitatives Gegenteil überführen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD1","text":"Kontinuität und Diskontinuität bilden keinen äußeren Gegensatz, weil die quantitative Kontinuität die Skala liefert, an deren Maßpunkten die qualitative Diskontinuität hervortritt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A1","CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD2","text":"Die qualitative Neuheit ist eine reale Neubestimmung und kein bloß epistemischer Effekt mangelnder Wahrnehmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A4","CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD3","text":"Das Maß fungiert zugleich als Vermittlung, Grenze und Produktionsbedingung qualitativer Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD4","text":"Die Kritik der Allmählichkeit richtet sich nicht gegen quantitative Veränderung, sondern gegen ihre Verabsolutierung als vollständige Erklärung des Werdens.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD5","text":"Natur, Moral und Staat werden durch eine gemeinsame Logik maßbedingter qualitativer Umschläge aufeinander bezogen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9","CH_GB18_A_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie, in der jede qualitative Differenz nur ein noch nicht wahrgenommener quantitativer Grad wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine lückenlose Übergangsordnung, in der jede neue Qualität notwendig durch qualitativ identifizierbare Zwischenstufen hindurchgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Gleichsetzung von Unbemerkbarkeit mit vorgängiger Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kausalität, die ausschließlich aus unmittelbarer Nachbarschaft innerhalb der quantitativen Reihe besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die unbegrenzte Fortsetzbarkeit einer moralischen oder staatlichen Form unter bloßer Veränderung ihrer Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX1","text":"Verneint wird die Möglichkeit, dass qualitative Neuheit vollständig als Wahrnehmungsdefizit oder Größenunterschied verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX2","text":"Verneint wird ein homogenes Sein, in dem die quantitative Reihe keine innere Schwelle und keinen qualitativen Umschlag enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX3","text":"Verneint wird die Möglichkeit, jeden Übergang aus einer Qualität in eine andere durch nachträglich konstruierbare Zwischenqualitäten einzuholen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX4","text":"Verneint wird die Möglichkeit, Entstehen und Vergehen ohne reale Unterbrechung und ohne qualitative Gegenbestimmung zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX5","text":"Verneint wird die Möglichkeit, dass dieselbe Verfassung unabhängig von der Überschreitung ihres Maßes dauerhaft dieselbe staatliche Qualität bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS1","text":"Quantitative Reihe mit gleichförmigen unmittelbaren Verhältnissen → Relationen zu entfernten Bestimmungen → spezifisches Maßverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS2","text":"Spezifisches Maßverhältnis → qualitative Bestimmung, die nicht als bloßer Grad der benachbarten Quantitäten vorliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS3","text":"Fortgesetzte quantitative Veränderung am Maßpunkt → Unterbrechung der Allmählichkeit → qualitativer Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS4","text":"Behauptete bloße Allmählichkeit → Voraussetzung unsichtbarer vorgängiger Existenz → Reduktion des Werdens auf Größenveränderung → Zurückweisung als Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS5","text":"Maßbedingter qualitativer Umschlag → Übertragung auf moralische und staatliche Bestimmungen → qualitative Umkehr oder Zerfall der bisherigen Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF1","text":"Gleichförmiger quantitativer Fortgang → spezifisches Verhältnis zu Entfernten → Maßverhältnis → qualitative Knotenlinie → Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF2","text":"Allmählichkeitsmodell → bereits vorhandene, nur unbemerkbare Qualität → Aufhebung des wirklichen Werdens → Rekonstruktion des Übergangs als Maßüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF3","text":"Naturale qualitative Umschläge → allgemeine Bestimmung von Entstehen und Vergehen → moralische Umkehr → staatliche qualitative Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME1","text":"Die quantitative Skala wird nicht mehr als homogenes Kontinuum, sondern als gegliederte Folge von Maßpunkten kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen kontinuierlicher Quantität und diskontinuierlicher Qualität wird durch die Kategorie des Maßes neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME3","text":"Entstehen und Vergehen werden von verborgener gradueller Präsenz auf reale qualitative Neubestimmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME4","text":"Zwischenqualitäten verlieren ihren Status als notwendige Vermittlungsinstanzen zwischen determinierten Zuständen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME5","text":"Naturale, moralische und politische Veränderungen werden als Varianten derselben maßbedingten Übergangslogik sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME6","text":"Staatliche Größe erscheint nicht mehr als neutrales Mehr, sondern als Bedingung eines möglichen Verfassungswechsels und Zerfalls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT1","text":"Surface: Quantitative Reihen zeigen an bestimmten Punkten neue qualitative Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT2","text":"Structural: Das Maß vermittelt zwischen quantitativer Veränderung, Schwelle und qualitativer Neubestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die gewöhnliche Erklärung durch Allmählichkeit wird als Modellfehler entlarvt und durch eine Logik des Umschlags ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirkliches Werden enthält Unterbrechung, Gegensatz und qualitative Neuheit; Zeitliche Kontinuität garantiert keine kontinuierliche Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Kernweg von quantitativer Veränderung über Maß und Schwelle zum qualitativen Sprung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem exakten Kriterium ein Maßpunkt in jedem einzelnen Bereich bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, dass quantitative Kontinuität und qualitative Diskontinuität durch das Maß vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Aufdeckung der verborgenen Voraussetzung, dass das Entstehende bei gradueller Erklärung bereits vorhanden sein muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT5","text":"Die Notwendigkeit des Sprungs wird stärker behauptet als aus einem einheitlichen formalen Maßbegriff deduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT6","text":"Die Beziehung zwischen unmittelbarer quantitativer Nachbarschaft und qualitativer Wirkung aus entfernten Verhältnissen bleibt als strukturelle Spannung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT7","text":"Die Übertragung auf Moral und Staat erweitert die Logik des Maßes, spezifiziert aber die Bedingungen ihrer Geltung nur teilweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von der quantitativen Reihe über die qualitative Knotenlinie zur Kritik der Allmählichkeit und zur allgemeinen Maßstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T111958706600Z_c0e95bff","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"341b746151a6a31dc44e7e0098332c18c60b764349eaaa04516d4eef9b1b65a6","sha256":"272b19e963b38f23296c730230eddf1eee37ae560f66920b0de233deb0984e15","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:19:58.707986+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS1","text":"Quantitative progressions can, despite uniform immediate relations, give rise to specific relations to remote determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS2","text":"At determinate quantitative relations of measure, a qualitative determination emerges that is not present as a mere increase of the preceding magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS3","text":"The qualitative emergence interrupts quantitative progression and occurs as a leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS4","text":"The model of mere gradualness presupposes the emergent as an existence already present, merely unnoticed, and thereby explains emergence away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS5","text":"The same structure of measure appears in natural, moral, and political transitions as the crossing of a boundary with a qualitative consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AS6","text":"The argument proceeds diagnostically from apparent continuity to the structure of measure, to the critique of gradualism, and to the general determination of qualitative becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A1","text":"A quantitative series can preserve a uniform immediate relation while at the same time containing specific relations between determinations that are not immediately adjacent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A2","text":"Specific qualitative relations emerge at determinate quantitative relations of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A3","text":"A qualitative determination can emerge at its point of measure without being qualitatively prepared by the immediately preceding determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A4","text":"Qualitative determinations are not necessarily present as weaker degrees in the intervening quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A5","text":"Coming-to-be and passing-away encompass the transition between quantitative and qualitative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A6","text":"The explanation of emergence through mere gradualness presupposes the emergent as actual, but present unnoticed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A7","text":"This presupposition transforms the inner or conceptual difference into an external difference of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A8","text":"A point of measure can interrupt quantitative progression and bring forth a new quality through a leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A9","text":"In the moral sphere, the quantitative exceeding of a measure can bring about a qualitative reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:A10","text":"The quantitative magnitude of a state can, other conditions being equal, alter its qualitative character and carry the existing constitution beyond its capacity to bear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX1","text":"The assertion that there is no leap in nature is rejected as an explanation of coming-to-be and passing-away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX2","text":"A qualitative transition is not a mere more or less of the same quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX3","text":"New qualitative products are not necessarily present in adjacent ratios of mixture as weaker degrees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX4","text":"Between two qualitative states there is not necessarily a neutral or specifically determined intermediate stage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX5","text":"Coming-to-be is not explained by the mere diminution or enlargement of an already finished existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX6","text":"The essential difference is not reduced to an external difference of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:NX7","text":"Moral and political changes of quality are not merely quantitative increases within the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D1","text":"Quantitative continuity does not exclude specific qualitative relations, but can bring forth their conditions of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A1","CH_GB18_A_24:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D2","text":"A qualitative redetermination can occur although the quantitative change immediately preceding it revealed no corresponding qualitative difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D3","text":"The leap does not designate an interruption of the quantitative series as such, but the emergence of a new quality within its progression.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A3","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D4","text":"The gradual explanation of becoming is tautological because it presupposes the result already as an unnoticed presence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D5","text":"Qualitative becoming-other manifests itself as a general structure in natural processes, moral transitions, and political changes.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9","CH_GB18_A_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:D6","text":"A quantitative exceeding can transform a determination into its qualitative opposite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD1","text":"Continuity and discontinuity do not form an external opposition, because quantitative continuity supplies the scale at whose points of measure qualitative discontinuity emerges.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A1","CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD2","text":"Qualitative novelty is a real redetermination and not a merely epistemic effect of deficient perception.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A4","CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD3","text":"Measure functions at once as mediation, boundary, and condition of production of qualitative determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A2","CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD4","text":"The critique of gradualness is directed not against quantitative change, but against its absolutization as a complete explanation of becoming.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A5","CH_GB18_A_24:A6","CH_GB18_A_24:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SD5","text":"Nature, morality, and the state are related to one another through a common logic of measure-conditioned qualitative reversals.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_24:A8","CH_GB18_A_24:A9","CH_GB18_A_24:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology in which every qualitative difference would be merely a quantitative degree not yet perceived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a gapless order of transition in which every new quality necessarily passes through qualitatively identifiable intermediate stages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the equation of unnoticeability with prior actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a causality consisting exclusively in immediate adjacency within the quantitative series.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the unlimited continuability of a moral or political form under the mere alteration of its magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX1","text":"Denied is the possibility that qualitative novelty is fully available as a deficit of perception or a difference of magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX2","text":"Denied is a homogeneous being in which the quantitative series contains no inner threshold and no qualitative reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX3","text":"Denied is the possibility of recovering every transition from one quality into another through retrospectively constructible intermediate qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX4","text":"Denied is the possibility of thinking coming-to-be and passing-away without real interruption and without qualitative counterdetermination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:SNX5","text":"Denied is the possibility that the same constitution, independently of the exceeding of its measure, permanently preserves the same political quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS1","text":"Quantitative series with uniform immediate relations → relations to remote determinations → specific relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS2","text":"Specific relation of measure → qualitative determination that is not present as a mere degree of adjacent quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS3","text":"Continued quantitative change at the point of measure → interruption of gradualness → qualitative leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS4","text":"Claimed mere gradualness → presupposition of invisible prior existence → reduction of becoming to change of magnitude → rejection as tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:FGS5","text":"Measure-conditioned qualitative reversal → transposition to moral and political determinations → qualitative reversal or dissolution of the previous form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF1","text":"Uniform quantitative progression → specific relation to remote determinations → relation of measure → qualitative nodal line → leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF2","text":"Model of gradualness → quality already present, merely unnoticed → cancellation of actual becoming → reconstruction of transition as exceeding of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:AF3","text":"Natural qualitative reversals → general determination of coming-to-be and passing-away → moral reversal → political qualitative change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME1","text":"The quantitative scale is no longer mapped as a homogeneous continuum, but as an articulated sequence of points of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME2","text":"The opposition between continuous quantity and discontinuous quality is reordered through the category of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME3","text":"Coming-to-be and passing-away are reclassified from hidden gradual presence to real qualitative redetermination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME4","text":"Intermediate qualities lose their status as necessary instances of mediation between determinate states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME5","text":"Natural, moral, and political changes become visible as variants of the same measure-conditioned logic of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ME6","text":"Political magnitude no longer appears as a neutral more, but as the condition of a possible constitutional change and dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT1","text":"Surface: Quantitative series exhibit new qualitative states at determinate points.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT2","text":"Structural: Measure mediates between quantitative change, threshold, and qualitative redetermination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The customary explanation through gradualness is exposed as a model error and replaced by a logic of reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Actual becoming contains interruption, opposition, and qualitative novelty; temporal continuity guarantees no continuous quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the core path from quantitative change through measure and threshold to the qualitative leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what exact criterion a point of measure is determined in each individual domain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on the mediation of quantitative continuity and qualitative discontinuity through measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in exposing the hidden presupposition that, under a gradual explanation, the emergent must already be present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT5","text":"The necessity of the leap is asserted more strongly than it is deduced from a unified formal concept of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT6","text":"The relation between immediate quantitative adjacency and qualitative effect from remote relations remains as a structural tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT7","text":"The transposition to morality and the state expands the logic of measure, but specifies the conditions of its validity only partially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_24:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the quantitative series through the qualitative nodal line to the critique of gradualness and to the general structure of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_24:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_24@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_24:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 95","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 95","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0","layer":"CH","title":"C. The Measureless.","order":96,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDM0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDM0@R001","sha256":"526dd618f81da0f21537357ae8a9909c49fa41924ebd53e9ed977fe1d932a396","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS1","text":"Das Argument rekonstruiert, wie eine quantitative Veränderung eine qualitative Bestimmung innerhalb eines Maaßverhältnisses hervorbringt, verändert und zerstört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS2","text":"Das Maaßlose wird nicht als bloße Abwesenheit von Bestimmung, sondern als Übergangsform des Quantums in eine neue qualitative Maaßbestimmung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS3","text":"Die Grundlage des Übergangs ist die im Maaß gesetzte Einheit von Qualität und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS4","text":"Die Knotenreihe erzeugt einen unendlichen Wechsel, in dem quantitative Fortsetzung in qualitative Spezifikation und qualitative Spezifikation in quantitative Relation übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS5","text":"Dieser Wechsel setzt nicht die Auflösung des Gegenstands, sondern die Kontinuität eines sich durch wechselnde Maaße erhaltenden Substrats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS6","text":"Die immanente Rekonstruktion des Maaßes endet darin, dass seine Fortbestimmung zugleich seine Herabsetzung zu einem bloßen Moment ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A1","text":"Das Maaß ist die unmittelbare Einheit von Qualität und Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A2","text":"Das Maaß besitzt ein quantitatives Dasein, dessen Verhältnisse sich auf einer Skala verändern können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","text":"Eine Qualität kann auf einem quantitativen Maaßverhältnis beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A4","text":"Die Veränderung der Größe eines Maaßverhältnisses kann die darauf beruhende Qualität zerstören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A5","text":"Das abstrakte Maaßlose ist ein in sich bestimmungsloses und für das Maaß gleichgültiges Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A6","text":"In der Knotenlinie der Maaße wird das quantitative Maaßlose als spezifische qualitative Bestimmung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A7","text":"Jede neue qualitative Maaßbestimmung kann selbst als ein neues, gegenüber der vorherigen Bestimmung maaßloses Verhältnis auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","text":"Die Folge der spezifischen und bloß quantitativen Maaßbestimmungen setzt sich ohne abschließenden äußeren Endpunkt fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","text":"Der unendliche Übergang negiert sowohl die spezifischen Verhältnisse als auch den bloß quantitativen Fortschritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","text":"Qualität und Quantität heben sich in ihrem Übergang ineinander gegenseitig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","text":"Die Einheit von Qualität und Quantität kehrt durch ihren Wechsel in sich selbst zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","text":"Eine sich durch wechselnde Maaße erhaltende Einheit ist als selbstständiges, perennierendes Substrat gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A13","text":"Die qualitativen Selbstständigkeiten der Maaßreihe bestehen innerhalb desselben Substrats nur in quantitativen Unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A14","text":"Die Reihen der Maaßverhältnisse besitzen eine für ihre Glieder konstante Ordnung, die zunächst nur äußerlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX1","text":"Das Maaßlose ist kein schlechthin bestimmungsloses Nichts, sondern zunächst ein Quantum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX2","text":"Eine qualitative Bestimmung ist nicht gegen quantitative Veränderung immun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX3","text":"Der quantitative Fortgang bleibt nicht in einer rein quantitativen Sphäre eingeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX4","text":"Die qualitative Unendlichkeit ist nicht die einzige Form des Über-sich-Hinausweisens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX5","text":"Eine neue Qualität ist nicht schlechthin von der quantitativen Relation getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX6","text":"Die qualitativen Maaßverhältnisse sind keine absolut voneinander unabhängigen Totalitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX7","text":"Der Übergang zwischen Maaßen ist nicht die vollständige Vernichtung des zugrunde liegenden Substrats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX8","text":"Die konstante Ordnung der Maaßreihen ist noch kein freier Begriff, der seine Unterschiede aus sich selbst bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX9","text":"Die Unendlichkeit der Maaßbestimmung ist weder bloße quantitative Verlängerung noch ein bloßer qualitativer Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D1","text":"Eine scheinbar gleichgültige Größenveränderung kann die qualitative Identität einer Sache in ihr Gegenteil verkehren oder sie aufheben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A2","CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","CH_GB18_CDM0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D2","text":"Das abstrakte Maaßlose erzeugt in der Knotenreihe eine neue spezifische Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A5","CH_GB18_CDM0:A6","CH_GB18_CDM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D3","text":"Die unendliche Maaßreihe ist eine doppelte Negation: Sie negiert sowohl die einzelne qualitative Spezifikation als auch das quantitative Weiterlaufen als solches.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D4","text":"Die qualitative und quantitative Unendlichkeit erweisen sich als Rückkehr der ursprünglichen Maaßeinheit in sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D5","text":"Die wechselnden spezifischen Existenzen lassen sich als quantitative Veränderungen eines sich erhaltenden Substrats bestimmen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D6","text":"Die selbstständigen Maaßverhältnisse werden zu Zuständen desselben Substrats herabgesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D7","text":"Die Veränderung eines Maaßverhältnisses ist daher Zustandsveränderung, während das Übergehende als dasselbe bestehen bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D8","text":"Die bloß äußerliche Ordnung der Maaßreihen bestimmt die Qualität zunächst als quantitativen, äußerlichen Zustand.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A13","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D9","text":"Die Fortbestimmung des Maaßes realisiert seine Struktur und setzt es zugleich zu einem untergeordneten Moment herab.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD1","text":"Die qualitative Mannigfaltigkeit der Maaßverhältnisse ist keine Vielheit unabhängiger Wesen, sondern die gegliederte Erscheinungsweise eines sich erhaltenden Substrats.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A7","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD2","text":"Die Unendlichkeit des Maaßes ist kein offener äußerer Progress, sondern ein Prozess, in dem die Überschreitung in die Einheit des Maaßes zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD3","text":"Die zerstörerische Macht der Quantität entsteht nicht außerhalb des Qualitativen, sondern aus der inneren Einheit beider im Maaß.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A1","CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","CH_GB18_CDM0:A4","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD4","text":"Die vollständige Realisierung des Maaßes hebt dessen Anspruch auf Selbstständigkeit auf und macht es zu einer Bestimmung des Substrats.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine absolute Trennung von Qualität und Quantität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Qualität aus, deren Bestimmung unabhängig von quantitativen Verhältnissen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine unendliche Reihe selbstständig bestehender Qualitäten aus, die nicht auf eine gemeinsame Einheit bezogen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt einen rein quantitativen Progress aus, der niemals in qualitative Bestimmung umschlagen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt einen Übergang aus, der zwar die Bestimmung, nicht aber die Kontinuität des Substrats aufheben würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX6","text":"Es schließt ein freies, den Unterschieden immanentes Bestimmungsprinzip aus, solange nur das Substrat als Grund gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie mehrerer letztlich voneinander unabhängiger Qualitäten oder Substanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein schlechthin offenes Jenseits, in dem jede Maaßbestimmung nur äußerlich durch eine weitere ersetzt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines endgültig selbstständigen Maaßes; jedes Maaß wird als Zustand oder Moment einer umfassenderen Einheit entmächtigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nur als unveränderte qualitative Bestimmung fortbestünde und keine quantitative Differenzierung in sich enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS1","text":"Quantitatives Dasein innerhalb eines Maaßverhältnisses → Veränderung der Größenbestimmung → Verschiebung der qualitativen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS2","text":"Verschiebung der Größenbestimmung → Überschreitung des bisherigen Maaßes → Maaßlosigkeit gegenüber der vorausgehenden Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS3","text":"Maaßlosigkeit → spezifische qualitative Neubestimmung → neues Maaßverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS4","text":"Neues Maaßverhältnis → Wiederholung des Übergangs → unendliche Knotenreihe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS5","text":"Unendliche Knotenreihe → gegenseitige Aufhebung von Qualität und Quantität → Rückkehr ihrer Einheit in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS6","text":"Rückkehr der Einheit → Kontinuität eines perennierenden Substrats → qualitative Unterschiede als quantitative Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS7","text":"Zuständlichkeit der Maaßverhältnisse → äußerliche quantitative Ordnung → Herabsetzung des Maaßes zu einem Moment des Substrats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AF1","text":"Qualitative Gefährdung durch Größenänderung → Maaßlosigkeit als Übergangsbestimmung → Knotenreihe qualitativer und quantitativer Maaße → gegenseitige Aufhebung ihrer Gegensätze → Rückkehr in ein perennierendes Substrat → Herabsetzung selbstständiger Maaße zu Zuständen → Realisierung und zugleich Entselbstständigung des Maaßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME1","text":"Qualitative Veränderung wird von einer isolierten Wesensveränderung in eine Veränderung quantitativer Verhältnisse umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME2","text":"Das Maaßlose wird von einem äußeren Jenseits zu einer produktiven Übergangsposition innerhalb der Maaßreihe umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME3","text":"Die unendliche Reihe wird von einer bloßen Verlängerung zu einer selbstbezüglichen Struktur der Negation und Rückkehr umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME4","text":"Qualitativ selbstständige Maaßverhältnisse werden von unabhängigen Totalitäten zu Zuständen eines gemeinsamen Substrats umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME5","text":"Die Identität der Sache wird nicht mehr an unveränderter Qualität, sondern an der Kontinuität des Substrats durch qualitative Wechsel bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME6","text":"Das Maaß erscheint zugleich als erzeugende Einheit der Unterschiede und als ein von dieser Einheit herabgesetztes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Größenveränderung kann ein auf einem Maaßverhältnis beruhendes qualitatives Dasein zerstören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Knotenreihe, Maaßverhältnis und Substrat vermitteln den Übergang zwischen quantitativer Veränderung und qualitativer Spezifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die begriffliche Behandlung des Wechsels von der Alternative „quantitativ oder qualitativ“ zu einer gegenseitigen Vermittlung beider Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Realität des Gegenstands liegt in einem sich durch unendliche Zustandswechsel erhaltenden Substrat; die Unendlichkeit ist zugleich Progression und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von quantitativer Größenveränderung über qualitative Neubestimmung zur Rückkehr in ein Substrat zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem konkreten Kriterium eine quantitative Veränderung in einem einzelnen Fall die Schwelle zur qualitativen Neubestimmung überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, dass das Maaß zugleich Einheit, Verhältnis, Zustandsform und herabgesetztes Moment sein kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Konstruktion liegt in der Bestimmung von qualitativer Differenz als quantitativer Differenz innerhalb einer erhaltenen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt darin bestehen, dass die qualitative Veränderung zugleich als äußerlich-gleichgültig und als wirklicher qualitativer Übergang bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen dem unendlichen Fortschreiten der Knotenreihe und ihrer Bestimmung als Rückkehr in die Maaßeinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT7","text":"Die Herabsetzung des Maaßes zu einem Moment hängt von der Annahme ab, dass das Substrat trotz aller qualitativen Übergänge als dasselbe bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Begriffe des Aufhebens, der Kontinuität und des Substrats nicht als bloße metaphorische Wiederholungen, sondern als Erzeugungsoperationen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114131604561Z_61926e33","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. The Measureless.","source_sha256":"526dd618f81da0f21537357ae8a9909c49fa41924ebd53e9ed977fe1d932a396","sha256":"edf11945fe15097dfd00a70eaedc8b2881e28a69a7915b3bde127064ce7bc29e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:41:31.607748+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS1","text":"The argument reconstructs how a quantitative alteration brings forth, alters, and destroys a qualitative determination within a relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS2","text":"The measureless is determined not as the mere absence of determination, but as a transitional form of quantity into a new qualitative determination of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS3","text":"The basis of the transition is the unity of quality and quantity posited in measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS4","text":"The nodal line produces an infinite alternation in which quantitative continuation passes over into qualitative specification, and qualitative specification into quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS5","text":"This alternation does not posit the dissolution of the object, but the continuity of a substrate maintaining itself through changing measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AS6","text":"The immanent reconstruction of measure ends in the fact that its further determination is at the same time its reduction to a mere moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A1","text":"Measure is the immediate unity of quality and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A2","text":"Measure possesses a quantitative existence whose relations can change on a scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","text":"A quality can rest upon a quantitative relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A4","text":"The alteration of the magnitude of a relation of measure can destroy the quality resting upon it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A5","text":"The abstract measureless is a quantity indeterminate in itself and indifferent to measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A6","text":"In the nodal line of measures, the quantitative measureless is posited as a specific qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A7","text":"Every new qualitative determination of measure can itself appear as a new relation measureless in comparison with the preceding determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","text":"The sequence of specific and merely quantitative determinations of measure continues without a concluding external endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","text":"The infinite transition negates both the specific relations and merely quantitative progression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","text":"Quality and quantity mutually sublate one another in their transition into each other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","text":"Through its alternation, the unity of quality and quantity returns into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","text":"A unity maintaining itself through changing measures is posited as an independent, perennial substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A13","text":"The qualitative independences of the series of measures exist within the same substrate only as quantitative differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:A14","text":"The series of relations of measure possess an order constant for their members, which is at first only external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX1","text":"The measureless is not an absolutely indeterminate nothing, but initially a quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX2","text":"A qualitative determination is not immune to quantitative alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX3","text":"Quantitative progression does not remain enclosed within a purely quantitative sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX4","text":"Qualitative infinity is not the only form of pointing-beyond-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX5","text":"A new quality is not absolutely separated from quantitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX6","text":"Qualitative relations of measure are not totalities absolutely independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX7","text":"The transition between measures is not the complete annihilation of the underlying substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX8","text":"The constant order of the series of measures is not yet a free concept that determines its differences out of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:NX9","text":"The infinity of determination of measure is neither mere quantitative extension nor a mere qualitative leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D1","text":"A seemingly indifferent alteration of magnitude can reverse the qualitative identity of a thing into its opposite or sublate it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A2","CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","CH_GB18_CDM0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D2","text":"The abstract measureless produces a new specific quality in the nodal line.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A5","CH_GB18_CDM0:A6","CH_GB18_CDM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D3","text":"The infinite series of measures is a double negation: it negates both the individual qualitative specification and quantitative continuation as such.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D4","text":"Qualitative and quantitative infinity prove to be the return of the original unity of measure into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D5","text":"The changing specific existences can be determined as quantitative alterations of a substrate maintaining itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D6","text":"The independent relations of measure are reduced to states of the same substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D7","text":"The alteration of a relation of measure is therefore alteration of state, while that which passes over remains as the same.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D8","text":"The merely external order of the series of measures initially determines quality as a quantitative, external state.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A13","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:D9","text":"The further determination of measure realizes its structure and at the same time reduces it to a subordinate moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD1","text":"The qualitative multiplicity of relations of measure is not a plurality of independent beings, but the articulated mode of appearance of a substrate maintaining itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A7","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD2","text":"The infinity of measure is not an open external progress, but a process in which transcendence returns into the unity of measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A8","CH_GB18_CDM0:A9","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10","CH_GB18_CDM0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD3","text":"The destructive power of quantity arises not outside the qualitative, but from the inner unity of both in measure.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A1","CH_GB18_CDM0:A3","CH_GB18_CDM0:A4","CH_GB18_CDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SD4","text":"The complete realization of measure sublates its claim to independence and makes it a determination of the substrate.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDM0:A11","CH_GB18_CDM0:A12","CH_GB18_CDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an absolute separation of quality and quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a quality whose determination would be independent of quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX3","text":"It excludes an infinite series of independently existing qualities that would not be related to a common unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX4","text":"It excludes a purely quantitative progress that could never pass over into qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX5","text":"It excludes a transition that would indeed sublate determination, but not the continuity of the substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:DNX6","text":"It excludes a free principle of determination immanent to the differences, so long as only the substrate is posited as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of several qualities or substances ultimately independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an absolutely open beyond in which every determination of measure would be replaced only externally by a further one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an ultimately independent measure; every measure is divested of power as a state or moment of a more comprehensive unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an identity that would persist only as an unaltered qualitative determination and contain no quantitative differentiation within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS1","text":"Quantitative existence within a relation of measure → alteration of the determination of magnitude → displacement of qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS2","text":"Displacement of the determination of magnitude → exceeding the previous measure → measurelessness in relation to the preceding quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS3","text":"Measurelessness → specific qualitative redetermination → new relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS4","text":"New relation of measure → repetition of the transition → infinite nodal line.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS5","text":"Infinite nodal line → mutual sublation of quality and quantity → return of their unity into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS6","text":"Return of unity → continuity of a perennial substrate → qualitative differences as quantitative states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:FGS7","text":"State-character of relations of measure → external quantitative order → reduction of measure to a moment of the substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:AF1","text":"Qualitative endangerment through alteration of magnitude → measurelessness as transitional determination → nodal line of qualitative and quantitative measures → mutual sublation of their opposites → return into a perennial substrate → reduction of independent measures to states → realization and at the same time divestment of the independence of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME1","text":"Qualitative alteration is remapped from an isolated alteration of essence into an alteration of quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME2","text":"The measureless is reclassified from an external beyond into a productive transitional position within the series of measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME3","text":"The infinite series is redescribed from a mere extension into a self-referential structure of negation and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME4","text":"Qualitatively independent relations of measure are reclassified from independent totalities into states of a common substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME5","text":"The identity of the thing is no longer determined by unaltered quality, but by the continuity of the substrate through qualitative alternations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ME6","text":"Measure appears at once as the generating unity of differences and as a moment reduced by this unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — An alteration of magnitude can destroy a qualitative existence resting upon a relation of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Nodal line, relation of measure, and substrate mediate the transition between quantitative alteration and qualitative specification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the conceptual treatment of alternation from the alternative “quantitative or qualitative” to a mutual mediation of both determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The reality of the object lies in a substrate maintaining itself through infinite changes of state; infinity is at once progression and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from quantitative alteration of magnitude through qualitative redetermination to return into a substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is by which concrete criterion a quantitative alteration in an individual case crosses the threshold to qualitative redetermination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on the fact that measure can at once be unity, relation, form of state, and reduced moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the construction lies in the determination of qualitative difference as quantitative difference within a preserved unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains in the fact that qualitative alteration is determined at once as externally indifferent and as an actual qualitative transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the infinite progression of the nodal line and its determination as return into the unity of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT7","text":"The reduction of measure to a moment depends on the assumption that the substrate remains as the same despite all qualitative transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDM0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the concepts of sublation, continuity, and substrate are treated not as mere metaphorical repetitions, but as generative operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDM0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDM0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 96","title":"C. The Measureless.","context":"Chapter 96","original_title":"C. Das Maaßlose."},"original_title":"C. Das Maaßlose.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0","layer":"CH","title":"A. Absolute Indifference.","order":97,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DAI0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DAI0@R001","sha256":"bc9326fe855f9b8525445a582282544b3c20d9e8d45c6cf3846cfa2c6aa4d08d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS1","text":"Das Sein wird als abstrakte Gleichgültigkeit bestimmt, sofern es ohne eigene Bestimmtheit für sich gedacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS2","text":"Die reine Quantität erweitert diese Gleichgültigkeit zur Fähigkeit, alle Bestimmungen äußerlich aufzunehmen, ohne ihren Zusammenhang aus sich zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS3","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz entsteht durch die Negation von Sein, Qualität, Quantität und Maß als unmittelbaren Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS4","text":"Die verbleibende Bestimmtheit erscheint nur noch als äußerlicher Zustand eines Substrats und besitzt keine selbständige Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS5","text":"Das äußerliche Qualitative hebt sich als Gegensatz des Seins selbst auf und wird zu einem leeren Unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS6","text":"Dieses leere Unterscheiden erweist sich als die absolute Indifferenz selbst, die dadurch vom abstrakten Substrat zur konkreten, in sich vermittelten Einheit wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A1","text":"Das Sein ist als für sich gedachte Gleichgültigkeit ohne eigene Bestimmtheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A2","text":"Die reine Quantität ist der Indifferenz gegenüber allen Bestimmungen fähig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","text":"Die Bestimmungen der reinen Quantität bleiben der Indifferenz äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A4","text":"Die reine Quantität erzeugt aus sich keinen Zusammenhang zwischen den äußerlichen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz vermittelt sich durch die Negation von Sein, Qualität, Quantität und Maß mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","text":"In der absoluten Indifferenz ist Bestimmtheit nur als qualitativer äußerlicher Zustand vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","text":"Die äußerliche Bestimmtheit hat die Indifferenz als ihr Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","text":"Das äußerliche Qualitative ist als Gegensatz des Seins ein sich aufhebendes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","text":"Die aufgehobene Bestimmtheit bleibt als leeres Unterscheiden erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","text":"Das leere Unterscheiden ist die absolute Indifferenz als Resultat ihrer eigenen Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A11","text":"Die Vermittlung der Indifferenz enthält Negation und Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A12","text":"Der Zustand ist als immanentes, auf sich bezogenes Unterscheiden in der Indifferenz enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A13","text":"Das Verschwinden der äußerlichen Bestimmtheit macht die Einheit des Seins zur Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A14","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist deshalb nicht bloß Substrat und nicht bloß abstrakte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX1","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist nicht eine bestimmte Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX2","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist nicht die bloße äußerliche Aufnahmefähigkeit der reinen Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX3","text":"Die Bestimmungen sind nicht in einem aus sich bestimmten inneren Zusammenhang der reinen Quantität verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX4","text":"Der Zustand ist keine selbständige oder dauerhafte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX5","text":"Das äußerliche Qualitative ist nicht ein bleibendes Gegenüber des Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX6","text":"Die Indifferenz ist nicht nur ein passives Substrat, an dem Bestimmungen äußerlich auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX7","text":"Das leere Unterscheiden ist keine von der Indifferenz getrennte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX8","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist nicht die Abwesenheit jeder Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D1","text":"Die bloße Fähigkeit, Bestimmungen aufzunehmen, reicht nicht zur absoluten Indifferenz aus.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A2","CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","CH_GB18_DAI0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D2","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist nur durch die Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Bestimmungen des Seins als einfache Einheit bestimmbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A1","CH_GB18_DAI0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D3","text":"Die Bestimmtheit verliert ihre Selbständigkeit, sobald sie nur als äußerlicher Zustand der Indifferenz gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D4","text":"Das Verschwinden der Bestimmtheit vernichtet die Differenz nicht vollständig, sondern verwandelt sie in ein leeres Unterscheiden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D5","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz enthält ihre eigene Bestimmtheit als aufgehobene und auf sich bezogene Differenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D6","text":"Negation ist in der absoluten Indifferenz nicht bloße Entfernung, sondern ein Verhältnis, durch das sie sich mit sich selbst vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D7","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz wird konkret, indem die äußerliche Bestimmtheit in ihre immanente Struktur zurückgenommen wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD1","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz erzeugt Bestimmtheit nicht als fremde Setzung, sondern als äußerlich erscheinende und sich selbst aufhebende Form ihrer eigenen Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","CH_GB18_DAI0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD2","text":"Das System verschiebt den Begriff der Einheit von der Abwesenheit von Differenz zu einer Einheit, die Differenz als aufgehobenes Verhältnis enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD3","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist zugleich Ursprung, Träger und Resultat der Bestimmtheit, jedoch jeweils unter einer veränderten Form ihrer Äußerlichkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD4","text":"Die Bewegung des Begriffs führt von einer äußerlichen Vielheit von Bestimmungen zu einer konkreten Einheit, in der die Differenz als immanente Selbstbeziehung fortbesteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Einheit durch vollständige Bestimmungslosigkeit ohne jede Differenz entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Bestimmungen unabhängig vom Substrat der Indifferenz bestehen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Negation lediglich Vernichtung und nicht zugleich Hervorbringung eines Verhältnisses ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem die absolute Indifferenz als unveränderliches, passives Beharrendes unter den Bestimmungen verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem äußerliche Differenz und innere Einheit dauerhaft getrennte Ebenen bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Identität, die Differenz nur beseitigt und nicht in sich vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine selbständige Bestimmtheit, die keinen Übergang in ihre eigene Aufhebung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Sein, dessen Einheit vor jeder Negation und jedem Verhältnis bereits vollständig gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die absolute Indifferenz als endgültige Leere zu fixieren; ihre Leere muss als Resultat eine innere Struktur besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte Gleichgültigkeit des Seins → äußerliche Aufnahmefähigkeit der reinen Quantität → Unzulänglichkeit bloßer Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS2","text":"Negation von Sein, Qualität, Quantität und Maß → einfache Einheit → absolute Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS3","text":"Absolute Indifferenz als Substrat → äußerlicher qualitativer Zustand → Selbstaufhebung der Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS4","text":"Selbstaufhebung der Bestimmtheit → leeres Unterscheiden → Rückkehr der Differenz in die Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS5","text":"Negation + Verhältnis + auf sich bezogenes Unterscheiden → konkrete, in sich vermittelte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS6","text":"Äußerlichkeit verschwindet → Substratfunktion wird immanent → Indifferenz ist nicht mehr abstraktes Substrat, sondern selbstvermitteltes Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF1","text":"Abstraktes Sein → Gleichgültigkeit → reine Quantität als äußerliche Bestimmbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF2","text":"Äußerliche Bestimmbarkeit → fehlender innerer Zusammenhang → absolute Indifferenz durch Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF3","text":"Absolute Indifferenz als Substrat → qualitativer Zustand → Selbstaufhebung des Qualitativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF4","text":"Selbstaufhebung → leeres Unterscheiden → immanente Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF5","text":"Immanente Selbstbeziehung → konkrete Einheit → Überwindung der bloß substrathaften Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME1","text":"Bestimmtheit wird von einer eigenständigen Qualität zu einem vorübergehenden Zustand der Indifferenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME2","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird nicht mehr als Gegenprinzip der Einheit, sondern als deren vorübergehende Erscheinungsform kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME3","text":"Negation wird von einem Ausschlussvorgang zu einer produktiven Vermittlungsform umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME4","text":"Das leere Unterscheiden wird als immanente Struktur der Einheit sichtbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Substrat und Bestimmung wird in eine Selbstbewegung der Indifferenz überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME6","text":"Einheit und Differenz erscheinen nicht länger als äußerliche Gegensätze, sondern als Momente einer vermittelten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Unbestimmtes Sein, reine Quantität, qualitative Bestimmtheit und Zustand werden begrifflich aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Bestimmtheit wird als äußerliches Moment eines Substrats gesetzt und durch ihre Selbstaufhebung in dessen immanente Struktur zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text ersetzt die Erklärung durch äußerliche Träger durch eine Rekonstruktion der Einheit aus Negation, Verhältnis und Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Sein ist nicht als statische Identität, sondern als durch Negation vermittelter Übergang von äußerlicher Bestimmtheit zu immanenter Einheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von abstrakter Gleichgültigkeit zu absoluter Indifferenz zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die entscheidende Differenz zwischen reiner Quantität als äußerlicher Fähigkeit und absoluter Indifferenz als selbstvermittelter Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue systematische Stellung des Übergangs vom Sein zum Wesen außerhalb dieses Abschnitts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo die Aufhebung der Bestimmtheit als Erzeugung des leeren Unterscheidens gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Umkehrung von äußerlicher Bestimmung in immanente Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass die Indifferenz zunächst als Substrat erscheint, später aber als Resultat ihrer eigenen Vermittlung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt davon ab, dass „leer“ nicht als vollständige Abwesenheit, sondern als aufgehobene und relationale Differenz gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: abstrakte Gleichgültigkeit → äußerliche Bestimmung → Selbstaufhebung → konkrete Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115005410983Z_7da63f2e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Absolute Indifference.","source_sha256":"bc9326fe855f9b8525445a582282544b3c20d9e8d45c6cf3846cfa2c6aa4d08d","sha256":"ff84565da1f65a867e32da1331e14cc84c874959cee973d5f9924ab6790d9e07","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:50:05.414294+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS1","text":"Being is determined as abstract indifference insofar as it is thought for itself without determinate character of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS2","text":"Pure quantity extends this indifference into the capacity to receive all determinations externally, without generating their connection from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS3","text":"Absolute indifference arises through the negation of being, quality, quantity, and measure as immediate determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS4","text":"The remaining determinacy appears only as an external state of a substrate and possesses no independent duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS5","text":"The external qualitative sublates itself as the opposition of being itself and becomes an empty distinguishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AS6","text":"This empty distinguishing proves to be absolute indifference itself, which thereby becomes, from an abstract substrate, a concrete unity mediated within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A1","text":"Being is determined as indifference thought for itself, without determinate character of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A2","text":"Pure quantity is capable of indifference toward all determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","text":"The determinations of pure quantity remain external to indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A4","text":"Pure quantity does not generate from itself any connection between the external determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","text":"Absolute indifference mediates itself with itself through the negation of being, quality, quantity, and measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","text":"In absolute indifference, determinacy is present only as a qualitative external state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","text":"External determinacy has indifference as its substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","text":"The external qualitative is, as the opposition of being, a self-sublating moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","text":"The sublated determinacy remains preserved as empty distinguishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","text":"Empty distinguishing is absolute indifference as the result of its own mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A11","text":"The mediation of indifference contains negation and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A12","text":"The state is contained in indifference as immanent, self-related distinguishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A13","text":"The disappearance of external determinacy makes the unity of being into indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:A14","text":"Absolute indifference is therefore not merely substrate and not merely abstract unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX1","text":"Absolute indifference is not a determinate quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX2","text":"Absolute indifference is not the mere external receptivity of pure quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX3","text":"The determinations are not connected in an inner connection of pure quantity determined from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX4","text":"The state is not an independent or enduring determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX5","text":"The external qualitative is not an enduring counterpart to being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX6","text":"Indifference is not merely a passive substrate upon which determinations occur externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX7","text":"Empty distinguishing is not a determination separate from indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:NX8","text":"Absolute indifference is not the absence of all mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D1","text":"The mere capacity to receive determinations does not suffice for absolute indifference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A2","CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","CH_GB18_DAI0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D2","text":"Absolute indifference is determinable as simple unity only through the sublation of the immediate determinations of being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A1","CH_GB18_DAI0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D3","text":"Determinacy loses its independence as soon as it is posited only as an external state of indifference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D4","text":"The disappearance of determinacy does not completely annihilate difference, but transforms it into empty distinguishing.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D5","text":"Absolute indifference contains its own determinacy as sublated and self-related difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D6","text":"Negation in absolute indifference is not mere removal, but a relation through which it mediates itself with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:D7","text":"Absolute indifference becomes concrete by withdrawing external determinacy into its immanent structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD1","text":"Absolute indifference generates determinacy not as an alien positing, but as an externally appearing and self-sublating form of its own mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A8","CH_GB18_DAI0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD2","text":"The system shifts the concept of unity from the absence of difference to a unity that contains difference as a sublated relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD3","text":"Absolute indifference is at once origin, bearer, and result of determinacy, though in each case under a changed form of its externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A6","CH_GB18_DAI0:A7","CH_GB18_DAI0:A10","CH_GB18_DAI0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SD4","text":"The movement of the concept leads from an external multiplicity of determinations to a concrete unity in which difference persists as immanent self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DAI0:A3","CH_GB18_DAI0:A5","CH_GB18_DAI0:A9","CH_GB18_DAI0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a model in which unity arises through complete indeterminacy without any difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a model in which determinations can exist independently of the substrate of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX3","text":"It excludes a model in which negation is merely annihilation and not at the same time the production of a relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX4","text":"It excludes a model in which absolute indifference remains as an unchanging, passive persistence beneath the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:DNX5","text":"It excludes a model in which external difference and inner unity form permanently separate levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a pure identity that merely eliminates difference and does not mediate it within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an independent determinacy that contains no transition into its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a being whose unity would already be completely given prior to every negation and every relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of fixing absolute indifference as final emptiness; as a result, its emptiness must possess an inner structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS1","text":"Abstract indifference of being → external receptivity of pure quantity → inadequacy of mere externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS2","text":"Negation of being, quality, quantity, and measure → simple unity → absolute indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS3","text":"Absolute indifference as substrate → external qualitative state → self-sublation of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS4","text":"Self-sublation of determinacy → empty distinguishing → return of difference into indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS5","text":"Negation + relation + self-related distinguishing → concrete unity mediated within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:FGS6","text":"Externality disappears → substrate-function becomes immanent → indifference is no longer abstract substrate, but self-mediated result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF1","text":"Abstract being → indifference → pure quantity as external determinability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF2","text":"External determinability → lacking inner connection → absolute indifference through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF3","text":"Absolute indifference as substrate → qualitative state → self-sublation of the qualitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF4","text":"Self-sublation → empty distinguishing → immanent self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:AF5","text":"Immanent self-relation → concrete unity → overcoming of merely substrate-like indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME1","text":"Determinacy is reclassified from an independent quality into a transitory state of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME2","text":"Externality is no longer mapped as the counter-principle of unity, but as its transitory form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME3","text":"Negation is redefined from a process of exclusion into a productive form of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME4","text":"Empty distinguishing is made visible as an immanent structure of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME5","text":"The relation between substrate and determination is transformed into a self-movement of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ME6","text":"Unity and difference no longer appear as external opposites, but as moments of a mediated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Indeterminate being, pure quantity, qualitative determinacy, and state are conceptually related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Determinacy is posited as an external moment of a substrate and, through its self-sublation, led back into the latter's immanent structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text replaces explanation through external bearers with a reconstruction of unity from negation, relation, and self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being is determined not as static identity, but as a transition mediated through negation from external determinacy to immanent unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from abstract indifference to absolute indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the decisive difference between pure quantity as an external capacity and absolute indifference as self-mediated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT3","text":"The exact systematic position of the transition from being to essence outside this section remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where the sublation of determinacy is conceived as the production of empty distinguishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the reversal of external determination into immanent self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that indifference initially appears as substrate, but is later determined as the result of its own mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on reading “empty” not as complete absence, but as sublated and relational difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DAI0:MRT8","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved: abstract indifference → external determination → self-sublation → concrete indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DAI0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DAI0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DAI0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 97","title":"A. Absolute Indifference.","context":"Chapter 97","original_title":"A. Die absolute Indifferenz."},"original_title":"A. Die absolute Indifferenz.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA","layer":"CH","title":"B. Indifference as the Inverse Ratio of Its Factors.","order":98,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDIA"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDIA@R001","sha256":"944b433f1ad61ad29ad95eaec689b097e5edb16199ce364618f2e8a6d21ca25d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS1","text":"Die Reduktion selbstständiger Maaßverhältnisse erzeugt ein untrennbares Substrat, das in allen seinen Unterschieden ganz gegenwärtig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS2","text":"Dieses Substrat erscheint zunächst als Indifferenz, weil seine Vermittlung nur an sich, nicht als eigene Selbstvermittlung gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS3","text":"Die quantitative Verschiedenheit der Momente wird durch die feste Grenze des Ganzen zu einem negativen umgekehrten Verhältniß transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS4","text":"Die Faktoren sind zugleich untrennbare Qualitäten und totale Seiten der Indifferenz; ihr quantitatives Mehr oder Weniger kann daher nicht unabhängig bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS5","text":"Sowohl Ungleichheit als auch Gleichgewicht heben die Bestimmtheit der Faktoren auf: jene zerstört die qualitative Gegenseitigkeit, dieses beseitigt den quantitativen Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS6","text":"Die Indifferenz wird dadurch als allseitiger Widerspruch bestimmt, dessen Selbstaufhebung in immanente negative absolute Einheit übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A1","text":"Die Reduktion zunächst selbstständiger Maaßverhältnisse begründet ein gemeinsames Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","text":"Das Substrat ist die Kontinuation seiner Unterschiede ineinander und in jedem Unterschied als Ganzes vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","text":"Das Substrat ist zunächst Indifferenz, weil seine Vermittlung nicht als gesetzte Selbstvermittlung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A4","text":"Die Indifferenz ist feste absolute Grenze, ohne selbst Quantum, Summe oder Exponent ihrer Momente zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","text":"Die Momente der Indifferenz sind als veränderliche Quanta durch die feste Grenze ihrer Summe negativ aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A6","text":"Das negative Verhältnis der Momente ist ein umgekehrtes Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","text":"Die Momente sind untrennbare Qualitäten, deren Realität nur in ihrer wechselseitigen Beziehung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","text":"Jede Seite enthält beide Qualitäten und unterscheidet sich von der anderen nur durch das Überwiegen der einen und das Weniger der anderen Qualität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A9","text":"Jede Seite ist zugleich Totalität der Indifferenz und als solche gegen die andere Seite selbstständig gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A10","text":"Die Indifferenz bestimmt die Bewegung ihrer Momente nicht selbst, solange ihre Einheit nur gleichgültig und an sich festgehalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","text":"Ein quantitatives Mehr einer Qualität über die andere würde ein von der anderen unabhängiges Daseyn voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A12","text":"Ein solches unabhängiges Mehr widerspricht der qualitativen Untrennbarkeit der Faktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A13","text":"Gleichheit der Faktoren löscht ihren quantitativen Unterschied, während ein Überwiegen eines Faktors die andere Qualität aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A14","text":"Die als indifferente Totalität gesetzte Einheit ist ein Widerspruch, der sich nur durch Selbstaufhebung zur immanent negativen Einheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX1","text":"Die Indifferenz ist nicht selbst Quantum, Summe oder Exponent ihrer Faktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX2","text":"Das umgekehrte Verhältnis ist nicht bloß ein formelles Rechenverhältnis, weil seine Seiten ein reales gemeinsames Substrat voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX3","text":"Die Unterschiede der Indifferenz sind nicht ursprünglich selbstbestimmende Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX4","text":"Die quantitative Bewegung ist nicht durch die Indifferenz selbst bestimmt, solange diese Gleichgültigkeit gegen sie bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX5","text":"Die Qualitäten sind nicht voneinander unabhängige sinnliche Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX6","text":"Kein Faktor kann ein haltbares Mehr besitzen, ohne die Realität des anderen Faktors und damit das Verhältnis selbst aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX7","text":"Gleichgewicht ist nicht die stabile Wahrheit des Verhältnisses, weil es die erforderliche quantitative Ungleichheit der Faktoren tilgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D1","text":"Die feste Begrenzung des Ganzen verwandelt die äußerliche Quantität der Momente in eine qualitative Negativbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A4","CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","CH_GB18_BDIA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D2","text":"Die quantitative Differenz ist nur die Erscheinungsweise einer qualitativen Einheit, weil jede Seite beide Qualitäten enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D3","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit der Seiten ist keine isolierte Selbstständigkeit, weil jede Seite die ganze Indifferenz und damit die andere Qualität in sich trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","CH_GB18_BDIA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D4","text":"Die Indifferenz besitzt ihre Bestimmtheiten zunächst nur als unmittelbar hervortretende und äußerlich bestimmte.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","CH_GB18_BDIA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D5","text":"Ein Mehr der einen Qualität verlangt zugleich ein entsprechendes Mehr der anderen, sofern ihre quantitative Ausdehnung ausschließlich aus ihrer qualitativen Beziehung folgt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","CH_GB18_BDIA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D6","text":"Der Versuch, die Faktoren quantitativ zu unterscheiden, produziert entweder ihre Gleichsetzung oder die Auflösung eines Faktors in das Ganze.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","CH_GB18_BDIA:A12","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD1","text":"Die Indifferenz ist keine ruhende Mitte zwischen Unterschieden, sondern die Form, in der ein gemeinsames Ganzes seine Differenzen zugleich trägt und deren Selbstständigkeit verunmöglicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A1","CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","CH_GB18_BDIA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD2","text":"Die quantitative Form fungiert zunächst als Schutz des Qualitativen gegen Übergehen, wird aber selbst zum Medium, in dem dessen Widerspruch sichtbar wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","CH_GB18_BDIA:A6","CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD3","text":"Das Absolute als Indifferenz scheitert nicht an einem äußeren Gegensatz, sondern an der Unvereinbarkeit von gleichgültiger Einheit und immanenter qualitativer Gegenseitigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A10","CH_GB18_BDIA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD4","text":"Die Wahrheit der Totalität liegt nicht im Enthaltensein aller Bestimmungen, sondern in der negativen Selbstbeziehung, durch welche die Totalität ihre indifferent gesetzte Form aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A9","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13","CH_GB18_BDIA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem quantitative Veränderung ontologisch neutral bleibt und die qualitative Realität der Faktoren unberührt läßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem ein gemeinsames Substrat die unabhängige Existenz seiner Momente lediglich ermöglicht, statt sie zugleich zu begrenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einheit, die ihre Unterschiede nur enthält, ohne durch deren Verhältnis selbst bestimmt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine stabile Differenz, deren Faktoren zugleich vollständig gegenseitig konstituiert und quantitativ ungleich wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Absolutes, dessen Bestimmtheit von einem außerhalb seiner liegenden Bestimmen abhängig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine endgültige indifferente Einheit: Sobald sie als Totalität der Faktoren bestimmt wird, erzeugt sie die Negativität, die ihre Indifferenz aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine letzte Realität bloßer äußerlicher Vermittlung, weil äußerliche Bestimmung die Einheit nur als unbegründete Voraussetzung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Widerspruch durch Gleichgewicht zu neutralisieren, weil Neutralisierung die Differenz vernichtet, deren Verhältnis erklärt werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS1","text":"Selbstständige Maaßverhältnisse → Reduktion → gemeinsames Substrat → Indifferenz als ungesetzte Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS2","text":"Feste Grenze des Substrats + veränderliche Quanta → negative Gegenseitigkeit → umgekehrtes Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS3","text":"Umgekehrtes Verhältnis + untrennbare Qualitäten → jede Seite als Totalität beider Qualitäten → scheinbare Selbstständigkeit der Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS4","text":"Gleichgültige Einheit + äußerliche quantitative Bewegung → Mangel der Selbstbestimmung → Abhängigkeit von äußerem Bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS5","text":"Qualitative Untrennbarkeit + quantitative Ungleichheit → Unmöglichkeit eines unabhängigen Mehrs → Gleichgewicht oder Überwältigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS6","text":"Gleichgewicht oder Überwältigung → Aufhebung der Faktorenbestimmtheit → allseitiger Widerspruch → immanente negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF1","text":"Reduktion der Maaßverhältnisse → Substrat als Kontinuation der Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF2","text":"Substrat → Indifferenz als nur an sich seiende Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF3","text":"Indifferenz → feste Grenze veränderlicher Quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF4","text":"Feste Grenze → umgekehrtes Verhältnis der Faktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF5","text":"Umgekehrtes Verhältnis → qualitative Untrennbarkeit und totale Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF6","text":"Totale Seiten → Widerspruch von Selbstständigkeit und gegenseitiger Konstitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF7","text":"Widerspruch → Selbstaufhebung der Indifferenz → Wesen als immanent negative absolute Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME1","text":"Quantität wird von einer äußerlichen Vergleichsform zur Erscheinungsform qualitativer Negativität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME2","text":"Selbstständigkeit wird in zwei Formen getrennt: die scheinbare Selbstständigkeit der Seiten und die untrennbare Selbstständigkeit des Substrats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME3","text":"Gleichgewicht und Ungleichgewicht werden nicht als gegensätzliche stabile Zustände, sondern als zwei Weisen der Aufhebung des Faktorenverhältnisses sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME4","text":"Das Absolute wird von einer indifferenten Trägersubstanz zu einem sich selbst aufhebenden Widerspruch verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME5","text":"Äußerliche Bestimmung erscheint nicht als zufälliger Zusatz, sondern als konstitutiver Mangel einer nur indifferenten Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zwei quantitative Faktoren stehen unter einer festen Grenze in umgekehrtem Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Jede Seite enthält beide Qualitäten und ist deshalb zugleich vom anderen Faktor unterschieden und durch ihn konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse verschiebt die Erklärung von der Verteilung quantitativer Größen auf die Bedingungen, unter denen quantitative Bestimmtheit überhaupt bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein der Indifferenz ist eine unvollständig gesetzte Vermittlung, deren Wahrheit erst als negative Selbstbeziehung und Wesen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Substrat, Indifferenz, umgekehrtem Verhältnis, Widerspruch und Wesen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die anfängliche Reduktion der selbstständigen Maaßverhältnisse vollzogen wird; sie fungiert als übernommene Ausgangsoperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern quantitative Differenz als abhängig von qualitativer Gegenseitigkeit gesetzt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der doppelten Widerlegung von Ungleichgewicht und Gleichgewicht als möglichen stabilen Formen der Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur hängt von der nicht weiter begründeten These ab, daß qualitative Untrennbarkeit jede quantitative Überschreitung ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn Indifferenz nicht als Endzustand, sondern als instabile Übergangsform zur negativen Einheit behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112929681706Z_365822ba","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Indifference as the Inverse Ratio of Its Factors.","source_sha256":"944b433f1ad61ad29ad95eaec689b097e5edb16199ce364618f2e8a6d21ca25d","sha256":"0a17e5adf2166114265919ea7ae84fbd04115565126cf0a235656921856566ae","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:29:29.683862+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS1","text":"The reduction of self-subsistent measure-relations produces an inseparable substrate that is wholly present in all its differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS2","text":"This substrate initially appears as indifference because its mediation is only in itself, not posited as its own self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS3","text":"The quantitative difference of the moments is transformed by the fixed limit of the whole into a negative inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS4","text":"The factors are at once inseparable qualities and total sides of indifference; their quantitative more or less therefore cannot subsist independently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS5","text":"Both inequality and equilibrium sublate the determinacy of the factors: the former destroys qualitative reciprocity, the latter abolishes quantitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AS6","text":"Indifference is thereby determined as all-sided contradiction, whose self-sublation passes over into immanent negative absolute unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A1","text":"The reduction of initially self-subsistent measure-relations grounds a common substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","text":"The substrate is the continuation of its differences into one another and is present in every difference as a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","text":"The substrate is initially indifference because its mediation does not appear as posited self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A4","text":"Indifference is a fixed absolute limit, without itself being quantum, sum, or exponent of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","text":"The moments of indifference, as variable quanta, are negatively related to one another through the fixed limit of their sum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A6","text":"The negative relation of the moments is an inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","text":"The moments are inseparable qualities whose reality consists only in their reciprocal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","text":"Each side contains both qualities and differs from the other only through the predominance of the one and the lesser degree of the other quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A9","text":"Each side is at once the totality of indifference and, as such, posited as self-subsistent over against the other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A10","text":"Indifference does not itself determine the movement of its moments so long as its unity is held fast only as indifferent and in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","text":"A quantitative more of one quality over the other would presuppose an existence independent of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A12","text":"Such an independent more contradicts the qualitative inseparability of the factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A13","text":"Equality of the factors extinguishes their quantitative difference, whereas a predominance of one factor sublates the other quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:A14","text":"The unity posited as indifferent totality is a contradiction that determines itself as immanently negative unity only through self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX1","text":"Indifference is not itself quantum, sum, or exponent of its factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX2","text":"The inverse ratio is not merely a formal computational relation, because its sides presuppose a real common substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX3","text":"The differences of indifference are not originally self-determining differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX4","text":"The quantitative movement is not determined by indifference itself so long as the latter remains indifferent toward it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX5","text":"The qualities are not sensuous matters independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX6","text":"No factor can possess an enduring more without sublating the reality of the other factor and thereby the ratio itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:NX7","text":"Equilibrium is not the stable truth of the ratio, because it effaces the requisite quantitative inequality of the factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D1","text":"The fixed delimitation of the whole transforms the external quantity of the moments into a qualitative relation of negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A4","CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","CH_GB18_BDIA:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D2","text":"The quantitative difference is only the mode of appearance of a qualitative unity, because each side contains both qualities.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D3","text":"The self-subsistence of the sides is not isolated self-subsistence, because each side bears within itself the whole indifference and thereby the other quality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","CH_GB18_BDIA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D4","text":"Indifference initially possesses its determinacies only as immediately emerging and externally determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","CH_GB18_BDIA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D5","text":"A more of the one quality simultaneously requires a corresponding more of the other, insofar as their quantitative extension follows exclusively from their qualitative relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","CH_GB18_BDIA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:D6","text":"The attempt to distinguish the factors quantitatively produces either their equalization or the dissolution of one factor into the whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A11","CH_GB18_BDIA:A12","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD1","text":"Indifference is not a resting middle between differences, but the form in which a common whole simultaneously bears its differences and renders their self-subsistence impossible.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A1","CH_GB18_BDIA:A2","CH_GB18_BDIA:A8","CH_GB18_BDIA:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD2","text":"The quantitative form initially functions as a protection of the qualitative against transition, but itself becomes the medium in which its contradiction becomes visible.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A5","CH_GB18_BDIA:A6","CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD3","text":"The Absolute as indifference fails not through an external opposition, but through the incompatibility of indifferent unity and immanent qualitative reciprocity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A3","CH_GB18_BDIA:A7","CH_GB18_BDIA:A10","CH_GB18_BDIA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SD4","text":"The truth of totality lies not in the containment of all determinacies, but in the negative self-relation through which totality sublates its indifferently posited form.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDIA:A9","CH_GB18_BDIA:A13","CH_GB18_BDIA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which quantitative alteration remains ontologically neutral and leaves the qualitative reality of the factors untouched.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which a common substrate merely enables the independent existence of its moments, instead of at the same time limiting them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a unity that merely contains its differences without itself being determined through their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a stable difference whose factors would at once be completely mutually constituted and quantitatively unequal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an Absolute whose determinacy remains dependent on a determining lying outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final indifferent unity: as soon as it is determined as totality of the factors, it generates the negativity that sublates its indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an ultimate reality of mere external mediation, because external determination preserves unity only as an ungrounded presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of neutralizing contradiction through equilibrium, because neutralization destroys the difference whose relation is to be explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS1","text":"Self-subsistent measure-relations → reduction → common substrate → indifference as unposited mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS2","text":"Fixed limit of the substrate + variable quanta → negative reciprocity → inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS3","text":"Inverse ratio + inseparable qualities → each side as totality of both qualities → apparent self-subsistence of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS4","text":"Indifferent unity + external quantitative movement → lack of self-determination → dependence on external determining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS5","text":"Qualitative inseparability + quantitative inequality → impossibility of an independent more → equilibrium or overpowering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:FGS6","text":"Equilibrium or overpowering → sublation of the determinacy of the factors → all-sided contradiction → immanent negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF1","text":"Reduction of measure-relations → substrate as continuation of the differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF2","text":"Substrate → indifference as mediation existing only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF3","text":"Indifference → fixed limit of variable quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF4","text":"Fixed limit → inverse ratio of the factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF5","text":"Inverse ratio → qualitative inseparability and total sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF6","text":"Total sides → contradiction of self-subsistence and mutual constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:AF7","text":"Contradiction → self-sublation of indifference → essence as immanent negative absolute unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME1","text":"Quantity is reclassified from an external form of comparison into the form of appearance of qualitative negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME2","text":"Self-subsistence is separated into two forms: the apparent self-subsistence of the sides and the inseparable self-subsistence of the substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME3","text":"Equilibrium and inequality become visible not as opposed stable states, but as two modes of the sublation of the relation of factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME4","text":"The Absolute is shifted from an indifferent supporting substance to a self-sublating contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ME5","text":"External determination appears not as an accidental addition, but as a constitutive defect of a merely indifferent unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Two quantitative factors stand under a fixed limit in inverse ratio.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Each side contains both qualities and is therefore at once distinguished from the other factor and constituted by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis shifts the explanation from the distribution of quantitative magnitudes to the conditions under which quantitative determinacy can exist at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of indifference is an incompletely posited mediation, whose truth emerges only as negative self-relation and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement of substrate, indifference, inverse ratio, contradiction, and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is through what the initial reduction of the self-subsistent measure-relations is effected; it functions as an inherited initial operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as quantitative difference remains posited as dependent on qualitative reciprocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the twofold refutation of imbalance and equilibrium as possible stable forms of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT5","text":"The structure depends on the not further grounded thesis that qualitative inseparability excludes every quantitative exceeding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDIA:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if indifference is treated not as a final state, but as an unstable transitional form toward negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDIA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDIA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDIA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 98","title":"B. Indifference as the Inverse Ratio of Its Factors.","context":"Chapter 98","original_title":"B. Die Indifferenz als umgekehrtes Verhältniß ihrer Faktoren."},"original_title":"B. Die Indifferenz als umgekehrtes Verhältniß ihrer Faktoren.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":99,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_25"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_25@R001","sha256":"7505cc9ca6c0fc4ad3d626b4c05d97d20e7dd28b1d6c0673535f64b747987fff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS1","text":"Die Theorie soll die fortdauernde elliptische Bewegung durch ein umgekehrtes Verhältnis entgegengesetzter Kräfte erklären, erzeugt jedoch Bedingungen, unter denen diese Bewegung verschwinden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS2","text":"Die qualitative Bezogenheit von Centripetal- und Centrifugalkraft schließt ihre Behandlung als voneinander ablösbare, quantitativ überwiegende Größen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS3","text":"Der angenommene Umschlag des Übergewichts kann aus den Kräften selbst nicht folgen und setzt deshalb eine fremde, unerklärte Vermittlung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS4","text":"Die Theorie wird als Formalismus bestimmt, weil sie dem festgehaltenen Faktum widerspricht und diese Konsequenz durch die bloße Nebeneinanderstellung von Faktum und Theorie verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS5","text":"Die Übertragung desselben Schemas auf Dichte, Organismus und Gattungsdifferenz reproduziert die formale Leere in weiteren Gegenstandsbereichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS6","text":"Die Bestimmung der Substanz als Indifferenz setzt Unterschied nur als äußerliches Quantum und löst damit die unmittelbare Einheit qualitativer und quantitativer Bestimmung, das Maß, auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A1","text":"Qualitativ entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen haben Bedeutung nur in ihrer wechselseitigen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A2","text":"Eine Bestimmung, die gegen ihr qualitatives Gegenmoment quantitativ selbständig überwiegt, verliert mit dessen Verschwinden ihre eigene Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A3","text":"Ein bloß quantitatives Zu- und Abnehmen hebt die qualitative Abhängigkeit entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A4","text":"Der Übergang eines Übergewichts in sein Gegenteil ist aus zwei bloß entgegengesetzten und quantitativ bestimmten Faktoren nicht immanent ableitbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A5","text":"Eine Erklärung verliert ihren Erklärungsanspruch, wenn sie die Fortdauer des zu erklärenden Faktums nur gegen ihre eigene Konsequenz festhalten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A6","text":"Die Einheit eines Ganzen wird zerstört, wenn seine Momente entweder als selbständige Kräfte äußerlich zusammengesetzt oder als bloße Quanta behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A7","text":"Die Form der Intensität bleibt dem Quantum unterworfen und begründet keine von quantitativer Bestimmung unabhängige Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A8","text":"Eine als abstrakte Indifferenz bestimmte Substanz enthält Unterschiede nicht als immanente qualitative Selbstunterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A9","text":"Wird der Unterschied zur Indifferenz äußerlich hinzugefügt, erscheint er als quantitativer Unterschied und als Außersichsein ihrer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A10","text":"Die Trennung qualitativer und quantitativer Bestimmung ist die Auflösung des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX1","text":"Eine wirkliche Erklärung ist nicht die nachträgliche Hinzufügung qualitativer Kräfte zu einem bereits empirisch bestimmten Gesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX2","text":"Entgegengesetzte Kräfte sind nicht als unabhängig bestehende Größen mit wechselndem Überschuss bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX3","text":"Die Intensität einer Kraft ist keine Rettung vor der quantitativen Abhängigkeit des Kraftbegriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX4","text":"Der Wechsel zwischen Beschleunigung und Verzögerung ist nicht durch ein bloß äußerliches Nacheinander gegenläufiger Übergewichte erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX5","text":"Die Einheit des Gegenstandes ist nicht das äußerliche Zusammentreffen selbständiger Faktoren nach dem Modell eines Kräfteparallelogramms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX6","text":"Indifferenz ist nicht das sich selbst unterscheidende Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX7","text":"Der bei Spinoza empirisch hinzutretende Unterschied ist keine immanente Bestimmung der Substanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D1","text":"Ein quantitatives Übergewicht der Centripetalkraft müsste die Centrifugalkraft nicht bloß vermindern, sondern ihre Gegenwirkung und damit die Rückkehr vom Zentralkörper aufheben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D2","text":"Ein quantitatives Übergewicht der Centrifugalkraft müsste umgekehrt die erneute Überwältigung durch die schwächere Centripetalkraft unmöglich machen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D3","text":"Die Theorie der wechselnden Übergewichte erklärt weder den Umschlag noch die Fortdauer der elliptischen Bewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A4","CH_GB18_A_25:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D4","text":"Das angenommene Umschlagen der Kräfte führt entweder zur äußerlichen Zusammensetzung selbständiger Faktoren oder zur Einsicht, dass keine Kraft gegen die andere selbständig bestehen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D5","text":"Die Übertragung des umgekehrten Verhältnisses auf Organismus und Naturgattungen reproduziert einen Formalismus, weil sie Unterschiede des Ganzen aus äußerlich ungleich gesetzten Faktoren ableitet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A3","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D6","text":"Die als Indifferenz bestimmte Substanz bleibt abstrakt, weil ihr Unterschied nur als äußerlicher quantitativer Zusatz auftreten kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A8","CH_GB18_A_25:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D7","text":"Mit der äußerlichen Quantifizierung des Unterschieds zerfällt die Einheit von Qualität und Quantität, die im Maß unmittelbar gesetzt war.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A9","CH_GB18_A_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD1","text":"Das Schema des umgekehrten Verhältnisses verwandelt eine immanente Gegenstandsbewegung in eine Reihe äußerlicher Wechsel und verliert gerade dadurch den Zusammenhang, den es erklären soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A4","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD2","text":"Die empirische Genauigkeit eines Gesetzes garantiert keine begriffliche Erklärung, wenn die erklärenden Kategorien dem Gesetz widersprechen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A5","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD3","text":"Die quantitative Modellierung qualitativer Gegensätze erzeugt eine Alternative zwischen gegenseitiger Vernichtung und äußerlicher Koordination, ohne eine immanente Einheit zu gewinnen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD4","text":"Die Indifferenz fungiert als Endform einer Abstraktion, in der Unterschiede nicht erzeugt, sondern nur nachträglich und äußerlich registriert werden können.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A8","CH_GB18_A_25:A9","CH_GB18_A_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass qualitative Relationen zugleich als voneinander unabhängige, graduell variierbare Größen bestehen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass ein zeitlicher Wechsel entgegengesetzter Zustände schon durch die bloße Aufeinanderfolge ihrer quantitativen Verteilungen begriffen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass ein empirisch bestätigtes Faktum und eine ihm widersprechende Theorie ohne Verlust des Wahrheitsanspruchs koexistieren können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass abstrakte Einheit und äußerlich angefügter Unterschied zusammen eine konkrete Substanz ergeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX5","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass die Reduktion qualitativer Unterschiede auf Quantität das Maß bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein stabiles Ganzes, dessen qualitativ abhängige Momente zugleich als selbständige, ungleich große Ursachen auftreten sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Erklärung der Bewegung, die deren Wechsel als Resultat ausgibt, ohne die innere Erzeugung des Wechsels zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Substanz, die alle Unterschiede absorbiert und dennoch ihre konkrete Differenzierung aus sich selbst hervorbringen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Einheit von Qualität und Quantität, solange beide nur als äußerlich auseinanderfallende Momente bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS1","text":"Empirisch bestimmtes Bewegungsgesetz → Hinzufügung entgegengesetzter Kräfte als Erklärung → Quantifizierung ihres Verhältnisses → Verlust ihrer qualitativen Relationalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS2","text":"Quantitatives Übergewicht einer Kraft → Verschwinden des Gegenmoments → Aufhebung der Kraftrelation → Aufhebung der erklärten elliptischen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS3","text":"Beobachtete Fortdauer und Umschlag der Bewegung → Widerspruch zur Krafttheorie → Unterstellung einer fremden Vermittlung → Erklärungsausfall der angenommenen Faktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS4","text":"Formalisierung des Verhältnisses → Übertragung auf Naturbereiche → äußerliche Faktorenlogik → begriffliche Verwirrung und Aufgabe des Schemas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS5","text":"Abstrakte Indifferenz → äußerlich gesetzter Unterschied → Quantifizierung des Unterschieds → Außersichsein der Einheit → Auflösung des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF1","text":"Fortdauernde elliptische Bewegung → Krafttheorie des umgekehrten Verhältnisses → quantitatives Übergewicht → Verschwinden einer Gegenkraft → Verlust der erklärten Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF2","text":"Widerspruch zwischen Faktum und Theorie → Ignorieren der Konsequenz → künstliche Koexistenz von Gesetz und Erklärung → Diagnose des Formalismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF3","text":"Wiederholung des Formalismus in Naturlehre und Physiologie → Ausweitung der begrifflichen Verwirrung → partielle Aufgabe des Schemas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF4","text":"Indifferenz als abstrakte Einheit → äußerlicher quantitativer Unterschied → fehlende Selbstunterscheidung der Substanz → Auflösung des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME1","text":"Die exakte quantitative Bestimmung eines Phänomens wird von seiner begrifflichen Erklärung getrennt; Gesetzesform und Erklärungsform sind nicht länger identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME2","text":"Das Kräftepaar erscheint nicht als Ursache der Bewegung, sondern als Prüfstein dafür, ob qualitative Relationalität unzulässig in quantitative Selbständigkeit übersetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von immanenter Einheit und äußerlicher Zusammensetzung ersetzt die bloße Gegenüberstellung von Centripetal- und Centrifugalkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME4","text":"Intensität wird als Variante des Quantums klassifiziert und verliert den Status einer eigenständigen dynamischen Erklärungsebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME5","text":"Spinozistische Indifferenz wird als abstrakte Einheit kartiert, deren Unterschied äußerlich bleibt und daher keine Subjektivität begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME6","text":"Das Maß erscheint als die verlorene unmittelbare Einheit von Qualität und Quantität, deren Zerfall die Indifferenz strukturell bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text prüft die Erklärung der Beschleunigung und Verzögerung in der elliptischen Bewegung durch Centripetal- und Centrifugalkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text bestimmt den Fehler als Verwandlung qualitativ korrelierter Momente in äußerlich ungleiche quantitative Faktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt den Maßstab der Erklärung von empirischer Anpassung und formaler Benennung auf die immanente Erzeugung des zu erklärenden Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zeitliche Abfolge ist kein Grund des Umschlags; ein wahrer Übergang müsste als immanente Selbstbewegung der Bestimmungen begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Indifferenz bezeichnet eine Einheit, deren abstrakte Zeitlosigkeit keine immanente Hervorbringung von Differenz zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kritik am umgekehrten Verhältnis als Kritik einer quantifizierten qualitativen Relation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von der Kraftkritik zur Diagnose eines allgemeinen Formalismus nachzuvollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Begriffsform, durch welche die Bewegung und ihr Umschlag immanent erklärt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Folgerung, dass quantitatives Übergewicht die relationale Bestimmtheit der Kräfte selbst aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der nicht weiter begründeten Gleichsetzung von qualitativer Abhängigkeit und Unmöglichkeit eines quantitativen Überschusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT6","text":"Die Verbindung zur Indifferenz bleibt komprimiert, weil der Text den Übergang von der physikalischen Kräfteanalyse zur Kategorie des Maßes nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT7","text":"Die rekonstruierte Maschine bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: Erklärungskritik → Formalismusdiagnose → Kritik äußerlicher Differenz → Auflösung des Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112020248222Z_3da80459","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"7505cc9ca6c0fc4ad3d626b4c05d97d20e7dd28b1d6c0673535f64b747987fff","sha256":"932e761cf40e49e0026cabc4163e23b22e5d03c401826fcdcf63fa2b941afa63","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:20:20.249919+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS1","text":"The theory is supposed to explain the enduring elliptical motion through an inverse relation of opposing forces, yet it produces conditions under which this motion would have to disappear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS2","text":"The qualitative relatedness of centripetal and centrifugal force excludes their treatment as quantitatively predominant magnitudes detachable from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS3","text":"The assumed reversal of predominance cannot follow from the forces themselves and therefore presupposes an alien, unexplained mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS4","text":"The theory is determined as formalism because it contradicts the fact that is maintained and conceals this consequence through the mere juxtaposition of fact and theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS5","text":"The transfer of the same schema to density, organism, and species difference reproduces the formal emptiness in further domains of objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AS6","text":"The determination of substance as indifference posits difference only as an external quantum and thereby dissolves the immediate unity of qualitative and quantitative determination, measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A1","text":"Qualitatively opposed determinations have significance only in their reciprocal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A2","text":"A determination that quantitatively predominates independently over its qualitative counter-moment loses its own determinacy with the disappearance of the latter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A3","text":"A merely quantitative increase and decrease does not cancel the qualitative dependence of opposed determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A4","text":"The transition of a predominance into its opposite cannot be derived immanently from two merely opposed and quantitatively determined factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A5","text":"An explanation loses its claim to explanation when it can maintain the persistence of the fact to be explained only against its own consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A6","text":"The unity of a whole is destroyed when its moments are treated either as independent forces externally composed or as mere quanta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A7","text":"The form of intensity remains subordinate to quantum and does not ground a force independent of quantitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A8","text":"A substance determined as abstract indifference does not contain differences as immanent qualitative self-differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A9","text":"If difference is externally added to indifference, it appears as quantitative difference and as the being-outside-itself of its unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:A10","text":"The separation of qualitative and quantitative determination is the dissolution of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX1","text":"A genuine explanation is not the subsequent addition of qualitative forces to a law already determined empirically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX2","text":"Opposed forces are not determinable as independently existing magnitudes with alternating excess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX3","text":"The intensity of a force is no rescue from the quantitative dependence of the concept of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX4","text":"The alternation between acceleration and deceleration is not explained by a merely external succession of countervailing predominances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX5","text":"The unity of the object is not the external concurrence of independent factors according to the model of a parallelogram of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX6","text":"Indifference is not the self-differentiating subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:NX7","text":"The difference empirically added in Spinoza is not an immanent determination of substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D1","text":"A quantitative predominance of centripetal force would have to not merely diminish centrifugal force, but cancel its counteraction and hence the return from the central body.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D2","text":"Conversely, a quantitative predominance of centrifugal force would have to make renewed overpowering by the weaker centripetal force impossible.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D3","text":"The theory of alternating predominances explains neither the reversal nor the persistence of elliptical motion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A4","CH_GB18_A_25:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D4","text":"The assumed reversal of the forces leads either to the external composition of independent factors or to the insight that no force can subsist independently against the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D5","text":"The transfer of the inverse relation to organism and natural species reproduces a formalism because it derives differences of the whole from externally posited unequal factors.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A3","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D6","text":"The substance determined as indifference remains abstract because its difference can appear only as an external quantitative addition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A8","CH_GB18_A_25:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:D7","text":"With the external quantification of difference, the unity of quality and quantity, which was immediately posited in measure, disintegrates.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A9","CH_GB18_A_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD1","text":"The schema of the inverse relation transforms an immanent movement of the object into a series of external alternations and thereby loses precisely the connection it is supposed to explain.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A1","CH_GB18_A_25:A4","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD2","text":"The empirical precision of a law guarantees no conceptual explanation when the explanatory categories contradict the law.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A5","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD3","text":"The quantitative modelling of qualitative opposites produces an alternative between mutual annihilation and external coordination, without attaining an immanent unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A2","CH_GB18_A_25:A3","CH_GB18_A_25:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SD4","text":"Indifference functions as the final form of an abstraction in which differences cannot be generated, but can only be subsequently and externally registered.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_25:A8","CH_GB18_A_25:A9","CH_GB18_A_25:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX1","text":"It must be false that qualitative relations can at the same time exist as mutually independent, gradually variable magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX2","text":"It must be false that a temporal alternation of opposed states is already comprehended through the mere succession of their quantitative distributions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX3","text":"It must be false that an empirically confirmed fact and a theory contradicting it can coexist without loss of the claim to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX4","text":"It must be false that abstract unity and externally appended difference together yield a concrete substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:DNX5","text":"It must be false that the reduction of qualitative differences to quantity preserves measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a stable whole whose qualitatively dependent moments are at the same time supposed to appear as independent causes of unequal magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an explanation of motion that presents its alternation as a result without determining the internal generation of the alternation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a substance that absorbs all differences and yet is supposed to bring forth its concrete differentiation from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a unity of quality and quantity so long as both are determined only as moments externally falling apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS1","text":"Empirically determined law of motion → addition of opposed forces as explanation → quantification of their relation → loss of their qualitative relationality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS2","text":"Quantitative predominance of one force → disappearance of the counter-moment → cancellation of the force relation → cancellation of the explained elliptical motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS3","text":"Observed persistence and reversal of motion → contradiction with force theory → presupposition of an alien mediation → explanatory failure of the assumed factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS4","text":"Formalization of the relation → transfer to domains of nature → external factor logic → conceptual confusion and abandonment of the schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:FGS5","text":"Abstract indifference → externally posited difference → quantification of difference → being-outside-itself of unity → dissolution of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF1","text":"Persistent elliptical motion → force theory of the inverse relation → quantitative predominance → disappearance of a counterforce → loss of the explained motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF2","text":"Contradiction between fact and theory → ignoring the consequence → artificial coexistence of law and explanation → diagnosis of formalism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF3","text":"Repetition of formalism in natural science and physiology → expansion of conceptual confusion → partial abandonment of the schema.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:AF4","text":"Indifference as abstract unity → external quantitative difference → absence of self-differentiation of substance → dissolution of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME1","text":"The exact quantitative determination of a phenomenon is separated from its conceptual explanation; the form of law and the form of explanation are no longer identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME2","text":"The pair of forces appears not as the cause of motion, but as a touchstone for whether qualitative relationality is impermissibly translated into quantitative independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME3","text":"The opposition between immanent unity and external composition replaces the mere juxtaposition of centripetal and centrifugal force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME4","text":"Intensity is classified as a variant of quantum and loses the status of an independent dynamic level of explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME5","text":"Spinozist indifference is mapped as an abstract unity whose difference remains external and therefore grounds no subjectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ME6","text":"Measure appears as the lost immediate unity of quality and quantity, whose disintegration structurally determines indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines the explanation of acceleration and deceleration in elliptical motion through centripetal and centrifugal force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text determines the error as the transformation of qualitatively correlated moments into externally unequal quantitative factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the standard of explanation from empirical fit and formal designation to the immanent generation of the transition to be explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Temporal succession is no ground of reversal; a true transition would have to be comprehended as immanent self-motion of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Indifference denotes a unity whose abstract timelessness permits no immanent production of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the critique of the inverse relation as a critique of a quantified qualitative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to trace the transition from the critique of force to the diagnosis of a general formalism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive conceptual form through which motion and its reversal could be explained immanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the inference that quantitative predominance cancels the relational determinacy of the forces themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the not further justified identification of qualitative dependence with the impossibility of a quantitative excess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT6","text":"The connection to indifference remains compressed because the text does not fully mediate the transition from physical force analysis to the category of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_25:MRT7","text":"The reconstructed machine preserves the actual movement: critique of explanation → diagnosis of formalism → critique of external difference → dissolution of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_25:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_25@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_25:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 99","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 99","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW","layer":"CH","title":"C. Transition into Essence.","order":100,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CBDW"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CBDW@R001","sha256":"15d6c44544444fc5dc027be0b69afc4fb9a789dd4c4bb41a0295e6cc210cf2d0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS1","text":"Die zu lösende Schwierigkeit besteht darin, dass die absolute Indifferenz als letzte Bestimmung des Seyns die Schwelle zum Wesen markiert, sie aber wegen ihrer äußerlichen Differenzbestimmung nicht überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS2","text":"Die fehlende Bestimmung besteht in der immanenten Aufhebung der Indifferenz durch ihre eigene Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS3","text":"Die Entwicklung der gesetzten Bestimmungen erweist die Indifferenz als Widerspruch zwischen an sich seyender Einheit und gesetzter Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS4","text":"Dieser Widerspruch erzeugt die negative Totalität als einfache, unendliche Negativität und Selbstabstoßung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS5","text":"Die abgestoßenen Bestimmungen verlieren ihre Selbstständigkeit und werden zu Momenten einer auf Einheit, einander und Negation bezogenen Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS6","text":"Mit der Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Bestimmungen verschwinden Seyn, Unmittelbarkeit und Ansichseyn als selbstständige Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS7","text":"Die Einheit erhält ihre Identität nur als resultierendes unendliches Zusammengehen mit sich, wodurch das Seyn zum Wesen bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS8","text":"Die Argumentbewegung ist eine immanente rekonstruktive Dialektik: äußerliche Indifferenz → Widerspruch → negative Totalität → Selbstabstoßung → relative Momente → Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist die letzte Bestimmung des Seyns vor dessen Übergang zum Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz erreicht das Wesen zunächst nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A3","text":"Die Indifferenz gehört noch der Sphäre des Seyns an, weil sie den Unterschied als äußerlichen und quantitativen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A4","text":"Die Indifferenz ist zunächst nur ansichseyend und nicht als fürsichseyendes Absolutes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A5","text":"Die äußere Reflexion fasst die spezifischen Bestimmungen als im Absoluten identisch und ihren Unterschied als gleichgültig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","text":"Die erforderliche Reflexion muss die eigene Aufhebung der Unterschiede jener Einheit sein und darf nicht bloß subjektive äußere Reflexion bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","text":"Die Indifferenz ist an sich eine Totalität, in der alle Bestimmungen des Seyns aufgehoben und enthalten sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","text":"Als Grundlage ist die Indifferenz zunächst nur einseitig als Ansichseyn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A9","text":"Die quantitative Differenz und das umgekehrte Verhältnis der Faktoren erscheinen zunächst äußerlich an der Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","text":"Die Indifferenz enthält den Widerspruch zwischen ihrer ansichseyenden Bestimmung und ihrer gesetzten Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","text":"Die Indifferenz ist als negative Totalität eine einfache und unendliche negative Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","text":"Die negative Beziehung auf sich selbst besteht als Unverträglichkeit der Indifferenz mit sich selbst und als Abstoßen ihrer von sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A13","text":"Das Bestimmen und Bestimmtwerden der Indifferenz ist weder Übergehen noch äußerliche Veränderung noch äußerliches Hervortreten von Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","text":"Die abgestoßenen Bestimmungen gehören nicht sich selbst an, sondern sind Momente einer ansichseyenden und einer fürsichseyenden Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","text":"Die Bestimmungen sind als Gesetzte auf ihre Einheit, aufeinander und auf ihre Negation bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A16","text":"Die Bestimmungen besitzen ihre Bedeutung nur in ihrer Relativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX1","text":"Die absolute Indifferenz ist noch nicht das Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX2","text":"Der Unterschied der Indifferenz ist nicht ursprünglich ein Unterschied an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX3","text":"Die Indifferenz ist nicht bereits fürsichseyendes Absolutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX4","text":"Die Einheit wird nicht durch die äußere Reflexion eines denkenden subjektiven Bewusstseyns hergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX5","text":"Die quantitative Differenz ist keine hinreichende innere Bestimmung der Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX6","text":"Die Selbstbestimmung der Indifferenz ist kein Übergehen und keine äußerliche Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX7","text":"Die Bestimmungen treten nicht als selbstständige oder äußerliche Wesen hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX8","text":"Die Bestimmungen sind nicht unabhängig von ihrem Substrat und ihrer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX9","text":"Die Bestimmungen sind nicht länger als selbstständige Seyende bestimmt, sondern als Gesetzte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX10","text":"Seyn, Unmittelbarkeit und Ansichseyn bleiben nicht als unabhängige Bestimmungen erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D1","text":"Die Unzulänglichkeit der Indifferenz ist kein äußerer Mangel, sondern ihr eigener entwickelter Widerspruch.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","CH_GB18_CBDW:A3","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D2","text":"Die zunächst einseitige Grundlage der Indifferenz wird durch den Widerspruch ihrer ansichseyenden Einheit und gesetzten Bestimmtheit aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D3","text":"Die negative Totalität entsteht, indem die Bestimmungen ihre eigene Grundeinseitigkeit und ihr Ansichseyn aufheben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D4","text":"Die Bestimmungen werden durch die Selbstbeziehung der Indifferenz erzeugt und nicht durch einen äußeren Einfluss auf sie gesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D5","text":"Die Selbstbeziehung der Indifferenz ist als Selbstabstoßung zugleich die Negativität ihres eigenen Ansichseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D6","text":"Die abgestoßenen Bestimmungen bestehen nur als Momente, weil sie weder aus der Einheit entlassen noch von ihr unabhängig sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D7","text":"Die Bestimmungen erhalten ihre Bestimmtheit ausschließlich durch ihre Beziehung auf Einheit, andere Bestimmungen und Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D8","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit der unterschiedlichen Bestimmungen und ihr Ansichseyn werden als selbstständige Formen aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D9","text":"Die Einheit ist nur durch die Aufhebung der vorausgesetzten Unmittelbarkeit eine einfache Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D10","text":"Das Wesen entsteht nicht als zusätzliche Bestimmung neben dem Seyn, sondern als Resultat der Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Seynsbestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD1","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Seyn und Wesen wird durch die immanente Selbstnegation der Indifferenz erzeugt und nicht durch einen äußeren Übergang überschritten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD2","text":"Die Identität der Einheit ist kein ursprünglicher Besitz, sondern das Resultat ihres unendlichen Zusammengehens mit sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD3","text":"Die äußerliche quantitative Differenz wird in eine immanente Relativität von Momenten derselben negativen Totalität umgebildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A9","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD4","text":"Die Einheit ist zugleich vorausgesetzte Totalität und nur als Aufhebung dieser Voraussetzung vermittelte Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD5","text":"Die Bestimmungen werden ontologisch von selbstständigen Seienden zu abhängigen Momenten einer selbstnegativen Einheit umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD6","text":"Der Übergang zum Wesen ist eine Transformation der Form von Unmittelbarkeit in vermittelte Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Wesen aus, das als äußerer Grund hinter oder jenseits des Seyns hinzutritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX2","text":"Es wird ein Modell ausgeschlossen, in dem eine statische Identität Unterschiede lediglich äußerlich neben sich bestehen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass subjektive Reflexion die Einheit der Bestimmungen konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Bestimmungen einen eigenständigen ontologischen Ursprung außerhalb der Einheit besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Bewegung vom Seyn zum Wesen als lineare Folge äußerer Zustände verstanden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX6","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Identität als bloße unmittelbare Selbstgleichheit bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX7","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Totalität durch die bloße Summe ihrer äußerlich bestimmten Unterschiede konstituiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX8","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Indifferenz als dauerhaftes Gleichgewicht ohne innere Negativität bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX1","text":"Ein äußerer Ort der Vermittlung ist nicht verfügbar; die Einheit muss ihre Negativität selbst hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX2","text":"Unvermittelte Unmittelbarkeit ist als dauerhafte ontologische Grundlage unmöglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX3","text":"Eine neutrale Indifferenz ohne Selbstwiderspruch und Selbstabstoßung ist unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX4","text":"Eine unabhängige Vielheit von Bestimmungen außerhalb der negativen Totalität ist nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX5","text":"Ein ursprünglicher Besitz der Identität ist nicht verfügbar; Identität existiert nur als resultierende Rückkehr zu sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX6","text":"Die Trennung von Seyn und Wesen als zwei äußerlich verbundene Sphären wird strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS1","text":"Absolute Indifferenz als letzte Seynsbestimmung + äußerlicher quantitativer Unterschied → Unfähigkeit, das Wesen zu erreichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS2","text":"In-sich-seiende Totalität + äußerlich gesetzte Bestimmtheit → Widerspruch der Indifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS3","text":"Widerspruch der Indifferenz → negative Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS4","text":"Negative Totalität → einfache unendliche Selbstbeziehung → Selbstunverträglichkeit und Selbstabstoßung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS5","text":"Selbstabstoßung → Bestimmungen als nichtselbstständige Momente der ansichseyenden und fürsichseyenden Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS6","text":"Momentstruktur → Relativität jeder Bestimmung auf Einheit, andere Bestimmungen und Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS7","text":"Aufhebung der selbstständigen Bestimmungen → Aufhebung von Seyn, Unmittelbarkeit und Ansichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS8","text":"Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Voraussetzung → vermittelte einfache Selbstbeziehung → resultierende Identität → Bestimmung des Seyns zum Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AF1","text":"Absolute Indifferenz als unzureichende letzte Seynsbestimmung → äußerliche Differenz und einseitiges Ansichseyn → immanenter Widerspruch → negative Totalität → Selbstabstoßung → Bestimmungen als relative Momente → Aufhebung von Unmittelbarkeit und Ansichseyn → resultierende Selbstidentität → Seyn als Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME1","text":"Der Unterschied wird von einer äußerlichen quantitativen Differenz zu einer immanenten relationalen Bestimmung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME2","text":"Die Indifferenz wird von einem passiven Gleichgewicht zu einer selbstnegativen Totalität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME3","text":"Die Bestimmungen werden von selbstständigen Seienden zu gesetzten Momenten einer Einheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME4","text":"Der Übergang vom Seyn zum Wesen wird von einem äußeren Wechsel zu einer immanenten Selbstaufhebung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME5","text":"Identität wird von unmittelbarer Gleichheit zu einer resultierenden Bewegung des Zusammengehens mit sich umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME6","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Einheit und Unterschied wird durch die gemeinsame Struktur der negativen Selbstbeziehung reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Die absolute Indifferenz erscheint als letzte Seynsbestimmung, deren äußerliche Differenz sie am Erreichen des Wesens hindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Struktur besteht aus dem Widerspruch zwischen ansichseyender Einheit, gesetzter Bestimmtheit und äußerlich bestimmtem Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die Erklärung wird von äußerer Reflexion auf immanente Selbstaufhebung und Selbstbeziehung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Seyn und Wesen werden nicht als zeitlich getrennte Zustände, sondern als logisch vermittelte Formen von Unmittelbarkeit und resultierender Selbstidentität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT1","text":"Die tragenden Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der absoluten Indifferenz zur Bestimmung des Seyns als Wesen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Bestimmung des Wesens selbst; expliziert wird vor allem die Negation der vorherigen Seynsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, die Aufhebung des Seyns als Aufhebung seiner unmittelbaren und selbstständigen Bestimmungen zu lesen, nicht als Vernichtung jeder Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Struktur ist die Erzeugung der negativen Totalität aus dem Widerspruch der Indifferenz selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der Einheit als unmittelbarer vorausgesetzter Totalität und derselben Einheit als nur vermitteltem Resultat bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Seyn verschwindet, während die Einheit weiterhin als Seyn bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern „Übergang“ als immanente logische Selbstaufhebung und nicht als zeitlicher oder äußerer Prozess verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113907430364Z_a19e1f82","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Transition into Essence.","source_sha256":"15d6c44544444fc5dc027be0b69afc4fb9a789dd4c4bb41a0295e6cc210cf2d0","sha256":"b42441f1cb94148844f13736b3f2c18d0b9cb1100ee730e70472d1d108dee761","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:39:07.432080+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS1","text":"The difficulty to be resolved consists in the fact that absolute indifference, as the final determination of Being, marks the threshold to Essence, but does not cross it on account of its external determination of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS2","text":"The missing determination consists in the immanent sublation of indifference through its own relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS3","text":"The development of the posited determinations proves indifference to be the contradiction between unity existing in itself and posited determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS4","text":"This contradiction produces negative totality as simple, infinite negativity and self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS5","text":"The repelled determinations lose their independence and become moments of a totality related to unity, to one another, and to negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS6","text":"With the sublation of the immediate determinations, Being, immediacy, and being-in-itself disappear as independent forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS7","text":"Unity receives its identity only as a resulting infinite convergence with itself, whereby Being is determined as Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AS8","text":"The movement of the argument is an immanent reconstructive dialectic: external indifference → contradiction → negative totality → self-repulsion → relative moments → Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","text":"Absolute indifference is the final determination of Being before its transition to Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","text":"Absolute indifference does not initially attain Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A3","text":"Indifference still belongs to the sphere of Being because it determines difference as external and quantitative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A4","text":"Indifference is initially only existent in itself and not determined as an Absolute existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A5","text":"External reflection apprehends the specific determinations as identical in the Absolute and their difference as indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","text":"The required reflection must be the self-sublation of the differences of that unity and must not remain merely subjective external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","text":"Indifference is in itself a totality in which all determinations of Being are sublated and contained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","text":"As foundation, indifference is initially determined only one-sidedly as being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A9","text":"The quantitative difference and the inverse ratio of the factors initially appear externally in indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","text":"Indifference contains the contradiction between its determination existing in itself and its posited determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","text":"As negative totality, indifference is a simple and infinite negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","text":"The negative relation to itself consists in the incompatibility of indifference with itself and in its repulsion of itself from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A13","text":"The determining and being-determined of indifference is neither transition, nor external alteration, nor the external emergence of determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","text":"The repelled determinations do not belong to themselves, but are moments of a unity existing in itself and existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","text":"As posited, the determinations are related to their unity, to one another, and to their negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:A16","text":"The determinations possess their significance only in their relativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX1","text":"Absolute indifference is not yet Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX2","text":"The difference of indifference is not originally a difference in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX3","text":"Indifference is not already an Absolute existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX4","text":"Unity is not produced by the external reflection of a thinking subjective consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX5","text":"Quantitative difference is not a sufficient inner determination of unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX6","text":"The self-determination of indifference is neither transition nor external alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX7","text":"The determinations do not emerge as independent or external essences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX8","text":"The determinations are not independent of their substrate and their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX9","text":"The determinations are no longer determined as independent beings, but as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:NX10","text":"Being, immediacy, and being-in-itself do not remain preserved as independent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D1","text":"The inadequacy of indifference is not an external defect, but its own developed contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","CH_GB18_CBDW:A3","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D2","text":"The initially one-sided foundation of indifference is sublated through the contradiction of its unity existing in itself and its posited determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D3","text":"Negative totality arises as the determinations sublate their own one-sidedness of foundation and their being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D4","text":"The determinations are produced through the self-relation of indifference and are not posited through an external influence upon it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D5","text":"The self-relation of indifference, as self-repulsion, is at the same time the negativity of its own being-in-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D6","text":"The repelled determinations exist only as moments because they are neither released from unity nor independent of it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D7","text":"The determinations receive their determinacy exclusively through their relation to unity, other determinations, and negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D8","text":"The immediacy of the differing determinations and their being-in-itself are sublated as independent forms.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D9","text":"Unity is a simple relation to itself only through the sublation of presupposed immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:D10","text":"Essence does not arise as an additional determination alongside Being, but as the result of the sublation of the immediate determinations of Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A2","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD1","text":"The boundary between Being and Essence is produced through the immanent self-negation of indifference and is not crossed through an external transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A10","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD2","text":"The identity of unity is not an original possession, but the result of its infinite convergence with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD3","text":"External quantitative difference is transformed into an immanent relativity of moments of the same negative totality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A9","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD4","text":"Unity is at once presupposed totality and self-relation mediated only as the sublation of this presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A7","CH_GB18_CBDW:A8","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD5","text":"The determinations are ontologically reclassified from independent beings into dependent moments of a self-negative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A12","CH_GB18_CBDW:A14","CH_GB18_CBDW:A15","CH_GB18_CBDW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SD6","text":"The transition to Essence is a transformation of the form of immediacy into mediated identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CBDW:A1","CH_GB18_CBDW:A6","CH_GB18_CBDW:A11","CH_GB18_CBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an Essence that enters as an external ground behind or beyond Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX2","text":"A model is excluded in which a static identity merely allows differences to subsist externally alongside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that subjective reflection constitutes the unity of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the determinations possess an independent ontological origin outside unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that the movement from Being to Essence can be understood as a linear sequence of external states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX6","text":"It is excluded that identity remains as mere immediate self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX7","text":"It is excluded that totality is constituted by the mere sum of its externally determined differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:DNX8","text":"It is excluded that indifference can persist as a lasting equilibrium without inner negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX1","text":"An external locus of mediation is unavailable; unity must itself bring forth its negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX2","text":"Unmediated immediacy is impossible as a lasting ontological foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX3","text":"A neutral indifference without self-contradiction and self-repulsion is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX4","text":"An independent multiplicity of determinations outside negative totality is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX5","text":"An original possession of identity is unavailable; identity exists only as a resulting return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:SNX6","text":"The separation of Being and Essence as two externally connected spheres is structurally barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS1","text":"Absolute indifference as the final determination of Being + external quantitative difference → inability to attain Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS2","text":"Totality existing within itself + externally posited determinacy → contradiction of indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS3","text":"Contradiction of indifference → negative totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS4","text":"Negative totality → simple infinite self-relation → self-incompatibility and self-repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS5","text":"Self-repulsion → determinations as non-independent moments of unity existing in itself and existing for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS6","text":"Moment-structure → relativity of every determination to unity, other determinations, and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS7","text":"Sublation of the independent determinations → sublation of Being, immediacy, and being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:FGS8","text":"Sublation of the immediate presupposition → mediated simple self-relation → resulting identity → determination of Being as Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:AF1","text":"Absolute indifference as an inadequate final determination of Being → external difference and one-sided being-in-itself → immanent contradiction → negative totality → self-repulsion → determinations as relative moments → sublation of immediacy and being-in-itself → resulting self-identity → Being as Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME1","text":"Difference is remapped from an external quantitative difference into an immanent relational determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME2","text":"Indifference is reclassified from a passive equilibrium into a self-negative totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME3","text":"The determinations are remapped from independent beings into posited moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME4","text":"The transition from Being to Essence is redetermined from an external change into an immanent self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME5","text":"Identity is redrawn from immediate equality into a resulting movement of convergence with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ME6","text":"The distinction between unity and difference is reorganized through the shared structure of negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Absolute indifference appears as the final determination of Being, whose external difference prevents it from attaining Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The structure consists in the contradiction between unity existing in itself, posited determinacy, and externally determined difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The explanation is shifted from external reflection to immanent self-sublation and self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being and Essence are determined not as temporally separate states, but as logically mediated forms of immediacy and resulting self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT1","text":"The load-bearing axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from absolute indifference to the determination of Being as Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT2","text":"The positive determination of Essence itself remains underdetermined; what is chiefly explicated is the negation of the preceding form of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on reading the sublation of Being as the sublation of its immediate and independent determinations, not as the annihilation of every unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the structure is the production of negative totality from the contradiction of indifference itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between unity as immediately presupposed totality and that same unity as a merely mediated result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that Being disappears while unity continues to be determined as Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CBDW:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as “transition” is understood as immanent logical self-sublation and not as a temporal or external process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CBDW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CBDW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 100","title":"C. Transition into Essence.","context":"Chapter 100","original_title":"C. Übergang in das Wesen."},"original_title":"C. Übergang in das Wesen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW","layer":"CH","title":"Second Book. The Doctrine of Essence.","order":101,"parents":["RAW_GB18_ZBDW"],"revision":"CH_GB18_ZBDW@R001","sha256":"3825c8b9708a9f7fc0be6675b4a9a9bfddecb0eb68e8ad52230e28cd4f625a4a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare Seyn kann seine Wahrheit nicht als Unmittelbarkeit ausweisen und erzwingt daher den Übergang zum Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS2","text":"Die Erkenntnis des Wesens erscheint zunächst als äußerliche Vermittlung vom Seyn zu einem hinter ihm liegenden Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS3","text":"Diese Vermittlung wird als Eigenbewegung des Seyns reklassifiziert: Seyn erinnert sich und wird durch Insichgehen Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS4","text":"Das Wesen ist nur dann wahr, wenn seine Negativität nicht äußerliche Abstraktion, sondern eigene unendliche Selbstbewegung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS5","text":"Das Wesen setzt die in ihm aufgehobenen Bestimmungen reflektiv, ohne in das äußerliche Werden der Sphäre des Seyns zurückzufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS6","text":"Die Selbstsetzung des Wesens erzeugt Existenz, Erscheinung und Wirklichkeit als Stufen seiner Rückkehr zu sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS7","text":"Das Wesen vermittelt Seyn und Begriff, weil es sein dem Ansich gleiches Daseyn setzt und dadurch zum Begriff übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","text":"Die Wahrheit des Seyns ist das Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A2","text":"Seyn ist Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3","text":"Das Wesen ist vergangenes, aber zeitlos vergangenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4","text":"Der Übergang vom Seyn zum Wesen ist die immanente Bewegung des Seyns selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","text":"Wesen ist nur wahr als durch eigene Negativität hervorgebrachtes An-und-Fürsichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6","text":"Äußerliche Abstraktion erzeugt lediglich ein leeres, von seinem Anderen abhängiges Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","text":"Die Negativität des Wesens ist Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","text":"Wesensbestimmungen sind vom Wesen selbst gesetzt und bleiben in ihm als aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","text":"Das Bestimmen des Wesens bleibt innerhalb der absoluten Einheit des An-und-Fürsichseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10","text":"Das Wesen muß sich Daseyn geben, weil es die in ihm enthaltenen Bestimmungen von sich unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","text":"Das Wesen ist die Mitte zwischen Seyn und Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12","text":"Das Wesen wird Begriff, indem es ein seinem Ansichseyn gleiches Daseyn setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A13","text":"Das Wesen artikuliert sich als ansichseyendes Wesen, Existenz und Erscheinung sowie mit der Erscheinung geeinte Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX1","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht ein hinter dem Seyn befindlicher Bestand, den ein äußerliches Erkennen aufsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX2","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht die bloße Negation aller endlichen Bestimmungen durch abstrahierende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX3","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht ein Produkt, Gemachtes oder Resultat einer ihm fremden Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX4","text":"Wesen ist nicht bloßes Ansichseyn, weil dieses selbst nur die Abstraktion des reinen Wesens wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX5","text":"Wesensbestimmungen sind nicht äußerliche Grenzen, andere Bestimmungen oder Beziehungen auf Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX6","text":"Die Bewegung des Wesens ist nicht Werden oder Übergehen im Modus des Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX7","text":"Die Existenz des Wesens ist noch nicht das an-und-für-sich-seyende Daseyn des Begriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D1","text":"Das Wissen erreicht das Wesen nur, indem es die Unmittelbarkeit des Seyns nicht festhält und sich aus ihr erinnert.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A2","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D2","text":"Die zunächst epistemisch erscheinende Vermittlung muß ontologisch als Selbstvermittlung des Seyns verstanden werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D3","text":"Ein Wesen, das durch Wegnahme bestimmter Inhalte entsteht, behält diese Inhalte als äußerlich gegenüberstehende Seiende bei.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D4","text":"Die Wahrheit des Wesens verlangt, daß Negation zugleich Selbstbeziehung und Aufhebung des Andersseyns ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D5","text":"Die im Wesen enthaltenen Bestimmungen gewinnen Realität nur als von ihm gesetzte und in seiner Einheit aufgehobene Unterschiede.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D6","text":"Existenz ist nicht der Verlust der wesentlichen Einheit, sondern deren reflexive Selbstentgegensetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D7","text":"Der Begriff vollendet eine im Wesen begonnene Gleichsetzung von Ansichseyn und gesetztem Daseyn.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD1","text":"Wahrheit ist keine Eigenschaft einer unmittelbaren Gegebenheit, sondern die immanente Rückkehr des Unmittelbaren in seine eigene Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD2","text":"Das Wesen transformiert Negativität von einem Verfahren des Entfernens in ein produktives Prinzip reflexiver Bestimmungssetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD3","text":"Die Differenz des Wesens ist nur als immanente Differenz gültig; Selbstständigkeit der Bestimmungen besteht ausschließlich innerhalb ihrer Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD4","text":"Die Ontologie des Wesens ist eine Übergangsontologie: Sie stabilisiert Selbstbeziehung nur, indem sie ihre Fortbewegung zum Begriff vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD5","text":"Wirklichkeit entsteht dort, wo Wesen und Erscheinung nicht mehr als getrennte Sphären gelten, sondern als Einheit der Selbstoffenbarung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Wahrheit in einer unmittelbar vorfindlichen Bestimmtheit erschöpft ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Vermittlung notwendig ein äußerliches Verhältnis zwischen einem erkennenden Subjekt und einem gegebenen Objekt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Negation nur Verlust, Leere oder Entfernung von Inhalt bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Bestimmtheit nur als Grenze durch ein Anderes möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX5","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Einheit vor der Differenz besteht oder Differenz außerhalb der Einheit bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX6","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß der Begriff dem Wesen äußerlich hinzugefügt wird; er muß dessen eigene Vollzugsform sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit eines letzten, ruhenden Grundes, der unabhängig von seiner Selbstnegation und Selbstsetzung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine endgültige Opposition von Sein und Wissen, weil der Erkenntnisweg als Bewegung des Seyns selbst gelten muß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Wirklichkeit jenseits der Erscheinung, weil Wirklichkeit als Einheit von Wesen und Erscheinung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine zeitlich vergangene Vergangenheit des Wesens; sein Vergangenseyn muß zeitlos und logisch sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Seyn → Unzulänglichkeit der Unmittelbarkeit → notwendige Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS2","text":"Scheinbar äußerliche Erkenntnisbewegung → immanente Erinnerung des Seyns → Wesen als Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Negation → leeres und abhängiges Wesen → Ausschluß der Abstraktion als Wahrheitsmodell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS4","text":"Eigene Negativität → Reflexion → Setzung aufgehobener Bestimmungen innerhalb der Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS5","text":"Reflexive Selbstunterscheidung → Daseyn des Wesens → Existenz und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS6","text":"Einheit von Wesen und Erscheinung → Wirklichkeit → Übergang zum Begriff als an-und-für-sich-seyendem Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF1","text":"Unmittelbares Seyn → Wahrheit jenseits der Unmittelbarkeit → Wesen als vermitteltes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF2","text":"Äußerlich scheinende Erkenntnis → immanente Selbstbewegung des Seyns → Wesen als Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF3","text":"Abstraktes reines Wesen → Kritik äußerlicher Negation → Wesen als eigene unendliche Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF4","text":"Eigene Negativität → Reflexion und Selbstsetzung → immanente Wesensbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF5","text":"Selbstsetzung → Existenz und Erscheinung → Wirklichkeit als Einheit von Wesen und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF6","text":"Wesen als erste Negation des Seyns → seinem Ansich gleiches Daseyn → Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung von epistemischem Weg und ontologischer Bewegung wird aufgehoben, indem Erkenntnis als Erscheinungsform der Selbstbewegung des Seyns erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME2","text":"Negation wird in zwei inkompatible Modi geteilt: äußerliche Abstraktion erzeugt leere Restbestände, immanente Negativität erzeugt Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME3","text":"Bestimmtheit wird von äußerlicher Begrenzung zu reflektierter, vom Wesen selbst gesetzter Differenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME4","text":"Erscheinung wird nicht als Abfall vom Wesen, sondern als notwendige Stufe seiner Existenz und seiner Offenbarung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME5","text":"Der Übergang von Seyn zu Begriff wird nicht als äußerer Kategorienwechsel, sondern als Selbstentfaltung einer einzigen Bewegung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Wesen wird als Wahrheit des Seyns und als dessen vergangene, zeitlose Gestalt bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der tragende Mechanismus ist Reflexion: Das Wesen negiert, unterscheidet und setzt seine Bestimmungen aus sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text entzieht der äußerlichen Abstraktion die Kompetenz zur Wahrheitsbestimmung und ersetzt sie durch immanente Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein ist nicht primär stabile Gegenwart, sondern eine Bewegung, deren Wahrheit als zeitlos vergangene Rückkehr in sich besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT5","text":"Logical — Wesen ist eine Übergangsform, deren innere Selbstsetzung die Notwendigkeit des Begriffs erzeugt, ohne bereits dessen vollendetes Daseyn zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Unmittelbarkeit über Selbstnegation und Reflexion zur Setzung des Daseyns zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die immanente Bewegung des Seyns gegenüber ihrer bloßen Behauptung zwingend ausgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern eigene Negativität zugleich Aufhebung des Andersseyns und Erzeugung immanenter Differenz leisten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Schließung liegt in der Umwendung äußerlicher Erkenntnisvermittlung in die Selbstbewegung ihres Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT5","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt darin, daß das Wesen absolut gegen Andersseyn gleichgültig sein soll, aber nur durch Selbstunterscheidung Daseyn gewinnen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung bleibt zwischen dem aufgehobenen Charakter der Wesensbestimmungen und ihrer erforderlichen Selbstständigkeit innerhalb der Einheit bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn Wesen weder als statischer Grund noch als bloßes Abstraktionsprodukt, sondern als sich selbst vermittelnde Negativität bestimmt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T120252850698Z_1f2a3dec","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Second Book: Essence.","source_sha256":"3825c8b9708a9f7fc0be6675b4a9a9bfddecb0eb68e8ad52230e28cd4f625a4a","sha256":"102509a8362b958297d117a1ca7e68b99e63baed5de2bbb1a84172127e70c3ed","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T12:02:52.857354+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS1","text":"Immediate Being cannot demonstrate its truth as immediacy and therefore compels the transition to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS2","text":"Knowledge of essence initially appears as an external mediation from Being to a ground lying behind it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS3","text":"This mediation is reclassified as the self-movement of Being: Being recollects itself and, by going into itself, becomes essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS4","text":"Essence is true only if its negativity is not external abstraction, but its own infinite self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS5","text":"Essence reflectively posits the determinations sublated within it, without falling back into the external becoming of the sphere of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS6","text":"The self-positing of essence produces existence, appearance, and actuality as stages of its return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AS7","text":"Essence mediates Being and Concept because it posits a determinate being equal to its being-in-itself and thereby passes over into the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","text":"The truth of Being is essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A2","text":"Being is immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3","text":"Essence is past, yet timelessly past Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4","text":"The transition from Being to essence is the immanent movement of Being itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","text":"Essence is true only as being-in-and-for-itself produced through its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6","text":"External abstraction produces only an empty essence dependent upon its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","text":"The negativity of essence is reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","text":"Determinations of essence are posited by essence itself and remain sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","text":"The determining of essence remains within the absolute unity of being-in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10","text":"Essence must give itself determinate being because it distinguishes from itself the determinations contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","text":"Essence is the middle between Being and Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12","text":"Essence becomes Concept by positing a determinate being equal to its being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:A13","text":"Essence articulates itself as essence that is in itself, existence and appearance, and actuality united with appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX1","text":"Essence is not a subsistence situated behind Being, which an external cognition seeks out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX2","text":"Essence is not the mere negation of all finite determinations by abstracting reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX3","text":"Essence is not a product, something made, or the result of an activity alien to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX4","text":"Essence is not mere being-in-itself, since this itself would be only the abstraction of pure essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX5","text":"Determinations of essence are not external limits, other determinations, or relations to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX6","text":"The movement of essence is not becoming or transition in the mode of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:NX7","text":"The existence of essence is not yet the determinate being that is in-and-for-itself of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D1","text":"Knowledge reaches essence only by not holding fast to the immediacy of Being and by recollecting itself out of it.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A2","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D2","text":"The mediation that initially appears epistemic must be understood ontologically as the self-mediation of Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D3","text":"An essence that arises through the removal of determinate contents retains these contents as beings externally opposed to it.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D4","text":"The truth of essence requires that negation be at once self-relation and sublation of otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D5","text":"The determinations contained in essence acquire reality only as differences posited by it and sublated in its unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D6","text":"Existence is not the loss of essential unity, but its reflective self-opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:D7","text":"The Concept completes an equation of being-in-itself and posited determinate being that has begun in essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD1","text":"Truth is not a property of an immediate givenness, but the immanent return of the immediate into its own mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A1","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A3","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A4","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD2","text":"Essence transforms negativity from a procedure of removal into a productive principle of reflective positing of determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A5","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A6","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A7","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD3","text":"The difference of essence is valid only as immanent difference; the self-subsistence of determinations exists exclusively within their unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A8","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD4","text":"The ontology of essence is a transitional ontology: it stabilizes self-relation only by effecting its movement onward to the Concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A10","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A11","CH_GB18_ZBDW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SD5","text":"Actuality arises where essence and appearance no longer count as separate spheres, but as the unity of self-revelation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZBDW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX1","text":"It must be false that truth is exhausted in an immediately encountered determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX2","text":"It must be false that mediation necessarily remains an external relation between a cognizing subject and a given object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX3","text":"It must be false that negation means only loss, emptiness, or removal of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX4","text":"It must be false that determinacy is possible only as a limit through an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX5","text":"It must be false that unity exists before difference, or that difference can exist outside unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:DNX6","text":"It must be false that the Concept is externally added to essence; it must be its own mode of enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an ultimate, quiescent ground that could subsist independently of its self-negation and self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a final opposition of Being and knowledge, because the path of cognition must count as the movement of Being itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an actuality beyond appearance, because actuality is determined as the unity of essence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a temporally past pastness of essence; its having-been must be timeless and logical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS1","text":"Immediate Being → inadequacy of immediacy → necessary mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS2","text":"Seemingly external movement of cognition → immanent recollection of Being → essence as return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS3","text":"External negation → empty and dependent essence → exclusion of abstraction as a model of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS4","text":"Own negativity → reflection → positing of sublated determinations within unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS5","text":"Reflective self-distinction → determinate being of essence → existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:FGS6","text":"Unity of essence and appearance → actuality → transition to the Concept as determinate being that is in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF1","text":"Immediate Being → truth beyond immediacy → essence as mediated Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF2","text":"Externally appearing cognition → immanent self-movement of Being → essence as self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF3","text":"Abstract pure essence → critique of external negation → essence as its own infinite negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF4","text":"Own negativity → reflection and self-positing → immanent determinations of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF5","text":"Self-positing → existence and appearance → actuality as unity of essence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:AF6","text":"Essence as first negation of Being → determinate being equal to its being-in-itself → Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME1","text":"The distinction between the epistemic path and ontological movement is sublated in that cognition appears as a form of appearance of the self-movement of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME2","text":"Negation is divided into two incompatible modes: external abstraction produces empty residues, immanent negativity produces essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME3","text":"Determinacy is reclassified from external limitation into reflected difference posited by essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME4","text":"Appearance is mapped not as a falling away from essence, but as a necessary stage of its existence and its revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ME5","text":"The transition from Being to Concept becomes legible not as an external change of categories, but as the self-unfolding of a single movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Essence is determined as the truth of Being and as its past, timeless form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting mechanism is reflection: essence negates, distinguishes, and posits its determinations out of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text withdraws from external abstraction the competence to determine truth and replaces it with immanent self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is not primarily stable presence, but a movement whose truth consists in a timelessly past return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:ALT5","text":"Logical — Essence is a transitional form whose inner self-positing generates the necessity of the Concept, without yet being its completed determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from immediacy, through self-negation and reflection, to the positing of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the immanent movement of Being is compellingly demonstrated as against its mere assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as own negativity can effect at once the sublation of otherness and the production of immanent difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT4","text":"The strongest closure lies in the reversal of external cognitive mediation into the self-movement of its object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension lies in the fact that essence is supposed to be absolutely indifferent to otherness, yet can acquire determinate being only through self-distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT6","text":"A second tension remains between the sublated character of the determinations of essence and their required self-subsistence within unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZBDW:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if essence remains determined neither as a static ground nor as a mere product of abstraction, but as negativity mediating itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZBDW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_ZBDW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_ZBDW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 101","title":"Second Book. The Doctrine of Essence.","context":"Chapter 101","original_title":"Zweites Buch Das Wesen."},"original_title":"Zweites Buch Das Wesen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW","layer":"CH","title":"First Section. Essence as Reflection into Itself.","order":102,"parents":["RAW_GB18_EADW"],"revision":"CH_GB18_EADW@R001","sha256":"73c94b7f10cc063a95c0d526c01e8d0360e68225d41e465d89009d0b2de7c48f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS1","text":"Das Wesen wird als Resultat der Bewegung aus dem Seyn bestimmt und dadurch der Unmittelbarkeit entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS2","text":"Die scheinbare Gegenüberstellung von wesentlichem und unwesentlichem Daseyn wird als aufgehobene Seinsopposition neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS3","text":"Das dem Wesen Gegenüberstehende ist Schein, dessen Setzung zugleich aus der eigenen Tätigkeit des Wesens hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS4","text":"Das Wesen entfaltet sich als Reflexion, deren Bestimmungen zugleich Gesetztseyn und Reflexion-in-sich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS5","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen konstituieren die Wesenheiten, aus denen das Wesen sich als Grund bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS6","text":"Als Grund geht das Wesen in Existenz und Erscheinung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A1","text":"Das Wesen kommt aus dem Seyn her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A2","text":"Das Wesen ist als Resultat seiner Bewegung nicht unmittelbar an und für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A3","text":"Das Wesen ist das an und für sich aufgehobene Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A4","text":"Das dem Wesen Gegenüberstehende ist nur Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A5","text":"Der Schein ist das eigene Setzen des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A6","text":"Das Wesen ist zunächst Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A7","text":"Die Bestimmungen der Reflexion sind zugleich Gesetztseyn und Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A8","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind die Wesenheiten des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A9","text":"Das Wesen bestimmt sich als Reflexion des Bestimmens in sich selbst zum Grunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A10","text":"Der Grund geht in Existenz und Erscheinung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX1","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht unmittelbares An-und-für-sich-Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX2","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht selbständig als bloß bestimmtes Daseyn gegen ein anderes Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX3","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von wesentlichem und unwesentlichem Daseyn besitzt keine letzte Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX4","text":"Das dem Wesen Gegenüberstehende ist kein eigenständiges Sein, sondern Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX5","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind keine äußerlich vorgefundenen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX6","text":"Der Grund bleibt nicht von Existenz und Erscheinung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit ist eine abgeleitete und aufzuhebende Bestimmung des Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A1","CH_GB18_EADW:A2","CH_GB18_EADW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D2","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Wesen und seinem Gegenüber ist eine innerhalb der Wesensbewegung erzeugte Scheindifferenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A4","CH_GB18_EADW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D3","text":"Reflexion ist nicht bloße Rückkehr in sich, sondern die Erzeugung bestimmter gesetzter Formen.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D4","text":"Die Wesenheiten besitzen ihre Bestimmtheit nur als Einheit von Gesetztseyn und Reflexion-in-sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A7","CH_GB18_EADW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D5","text":"Der Grund ist die Selbstvermittlung des Wesens durch die Reflexion des Bestimmens.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A8","CH_GB18_EADW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D6","text":"Existenz und Erscheinung sind Resultate der Grundstruktur des Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD1","text":"Die scheinbare Äußerlichkeit des Wesens wird als interne Selbstsetzung rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A3","CH_GB18_EADW:A4","CH_GB18_EADW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD2","text":"Bestimmtheit ist weder bloß äußerlich gesetzt noch rein unmittelbar in sich, sondern eine reflexiv erzeugte Einheit beider Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A7","CH_GB18_EADW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD3","text":"Das Wesen bildet eine Übergangslogik, in der aufgehobenes Seyn über Reflexion und Grund in bestimmte Wirklichkeit übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A1","CH_GB18_EADW:A3","CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD4","text":"Erscheinung ist nicht der Gegensatz des Wesens, sondern die gesetzte Äußerlichkeit seines Grundes.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A5","CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX1","text":"Das Wesen kann nicht als ursprüngliche, unbewegte Grundlage angesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX2","text":"Das Seyn kann nicht als unvermittelter Bestand neben dem Wesen fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX3","text":"Äußerlichkeit kann nicht als von der Setzung des Wesens unabhängige Realität fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX4","text":"Bestimmung kann nicht entweder bloßes Fremdgesetztseyn oder reine Selbstidentität sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX5","text":"Der Grund kann nicht als ein hinter Existenz und Erscheinung verborgenes, von ihnen getrenntes Substrat gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem das Wesen vor seiner Vermittlung durch Seyn, Reflexion und Grund bereits vollständig gegeben ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Trennung von innerem Wesen und äußerer Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Ontologie unabhängiger Gegenstände, deren Beziehung zum Wesen nur äußerlich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter Gegensatz von Wesen und Schein, weil der Schein aus dem Wesen selbst gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS1","text":"Seyn → Bewegung → aufgehobenes Seyn → Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS2","text":"Unmittelbare Setzung des Wesens → bestimmtes Daseyn gegen anderes Daseyn → Aufhebung der bloßen Opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS3","text":"Aufgehobenes Seyn → Schein als Gegenüber → Schein als eigenes Setzen des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS4","text":"Wesen → Reflexion → Bestimmung der Reflexion → Gesetztseyn plus Reflexion-in-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS5","text":"Reflexionsbestimmungen → Wesenheiten → Reflexion des Bestimmens in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS6","text":"Reflexion des Bestimmens → Grund → Existenz und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF1","text":"Seyn als Ausgang → Bewegung aus dem Seyn → Wesen als Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF2","text":"Wesen als scheinbare Unmittelbarkeit → Daseynsopposition → Aufhebung der Opposition im Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF3","text":"Schein als Gegenüber → Schein als Selbstsetzung → Wesen als Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF4","text":"Reflexion → gesetzte Reflexionsbestimmungen → Wesenheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF5","text":"Wesenheiten → Reflexion des Bestimmens → Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF6","text":"Grund → Existenz → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME1","text":"Die Karte verschiebt das Wesen vom Status eines unmittelbaren Anfangs zum Resultat einer Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Wesen und Gegenüber wird von einer ontologischen Trennung in eine interne Scheinrelation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME3","text":"Bestimmungen werden als reflexive Selbstsetzungen statt als äußerlich gegebene Merkmale sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME4","text":"Der Grund wird als Vermittlungsform zwischen innerer Reflexion und äußerer Existenz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME5","text":"Erscheinung wird von einer bloßen Oberfläche zu einer notwendigen Hervorbringung des Wesens umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Wesen erscheint als aus dem Seyn hervorgegangenes Resultat und geht in Existenz und Erscheinung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Struktur erzeugt Bestimmungen durch die Einheit von Gesetztseyn und Reflexion-in-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Gegenüberstellung von innerem Wesen und äußerem Gegenüber durch eine Analyse ihrer Vermittlung und Selbstsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird als Übergang vom Seyn über aufgehobenes Seyn, Reflexion und Grund in Existenz und Erscheinung gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung vom Seyn zum Wesen und vom Wesen zur Erscheinung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die einzelnen Reflexionsbestimmungen und die konkrete Form der späteren Existenz- und Erscheinungslogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Schein nicht als unabhängige Realität, sondern als Selbstsetzung des Wesens verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Aufhebung, Reflexion, Grund und Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT5","text":"Die Hauptspannung besteht darin, dass das Wesen zugleich als nicht unmittelbar und hypothetisch als unmittelbar genommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass der Schein dem Wesen gegenübersteht und dennoch aus dessen eigener Setzung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegungsrichtung, lässt aber die konkreten Formen der Wesenheiten offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115903851938Z_ca97368a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"First Section. Essence as Reflection into Itself.","source_sha256":"73c94b7f10cc063a95c0d526c01e8d0360e68225d41e465d89009d0b2de7c48f","sha256":"92d7e3fc70abda45c7f846f73c2981fb54027cbd7125e71cc487a350782f190d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:59:03.875712+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS1","text":"Essence is determined as the result of the movement out of Being and is thereby removed from immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS2","text":"The apparent opposition of essential and unessential existence is redetermined as a sublated opposition of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS3","text":"That which stands opposed to Essence is semblance, whose positing at the same time proceeds from Essence's own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS4","text":"Essence unfolds as reflection, whose determinations are at once positedness and reflection-into-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS5","text":"The determinations of reflection constitute the essentialities, from which Essence determines itself as Ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AS6","text":"As Ground, Essence passes over into existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A1","text":"Essence comes from Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A2","text":"As the result of its movement, Essence is not immediate in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A3","text":"Essence is Being sublated in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A4","text":"That which stands opposed to Essence is only semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A5","text":"Semblance is Essence's own positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A6","text":"Essence is initially reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A7","text":"The determinations of reflection are at once positedness and reflection into themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A8","text":"The determinations of reflection are the essentialities of Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A9","text":"Essence determines itself as the reflection of determining into itself as Ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:A10","text":"Ground passes over into existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX1","text":"Essence is not immediate being-in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX2","text":"Essence is not self-subsistent as merely determinate existence over against another existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX3","text":"The opposition of essential and unessential existence possesses no final validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX4","text":"That which stands opposed to Essence is not an autonomous being, but semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX5","text":"The determinations of reflection are not externally encountered determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:NX6","text":"Ground does not remain separated from existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D1","text":"Immediacy is a derivative and sublatable determination of Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A1","CH_GB18_EADW:A2","CH_GB18_EADW:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D2","text":"The difference between Essence and that which stands opposed to it is a difference of semblance produced within the movement of Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A4","CH_GB18_EADW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D3","text":"Reflection is not a mere return into itself, but the production of determinate posited forms.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D4","text":"The essentialities possess their determinacy only as the unity of positedness and reflection-into-self.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A7","CH_GB18_EADW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D5","text":"Ground is the self-mediation of Essence through the reflection of determining.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A8","CH_GB18_EADW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:D6","text":"Existence and appearance are results of the ground-structure of Essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD1","text":"The apparent externality of Essence is reconstructed as internal self-positing.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A3","CH_GB18_EADW:A4","CH_GB18_EADW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD2","text":"Determinacy is neither merely externally posited nor purely immediate in itself, but a reflectively produced unity of both moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A7","CH_GB18_EADW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD3","text":"Essence forms a logic of transition in which sublated Being passes over, through reflection and Ground, into determinate actuality.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A1","CH_GB18_EADW:A3","CH_GB18_EADW:A6","CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SD4","text":"Appearance is not the opposite of Essence, but the posited externality of its Ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_EADW:A5","CH_GB18_EADW:A9","CH_GB18_EADW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX1","text":"Essence cannot be posited as an original, unmoved foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX2","text":"Being cannot persist as an unmediated subsistence alongside Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX3","text":"Externality cannot function as a reality independent of the positing of Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX4","text":"Determination cannot be either mere being-posited-by-another or pure self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:DNX5","text":"Ground cannot count as a substrate concealed behind existence and appearance and separated from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX1","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which Essence is already fully given prior to its mediation through Being, reflection, and Ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a definitive separation of inner Essence and outer appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX3","text":"Precluded is an ontology of independent objects whose relation to Essence would be merely external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a final opposition between Essence and semblance, because semblance is posited out of Essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS1","text":"Being → movement → sublated Being → Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS2","text":"Immediate positing of Essence → determinate existence over against another existence → sublation of mere opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS3","text":"Sublated Being → semblance as that which stands opposed → semblance as Essence's own positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS4","text":"Essence → reflection → determination of reflection → positedness plus reflection-into-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS5","text":"Determinations of reflection → essentialities → reflection of determining into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:FGS6","text":"Reflection of determining → Ground → existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF1","text":"Being as point of departure → movement out of Being → Essence as result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF2","text":"Essence as apparent immediacy → opposition of existences → sublation of the opposition in semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF3","text":"Semblance as that which stands opposed → semblance as self-positing → Essence as reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF4","text":"Reflection → posited determinations of reflection → essentialities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF5","text":"Essentialities → reflection of determining → Ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:AF6","text":"Ground → existence → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_EADW:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME1","text":"The map shifts Essence from the status of an immediate beginning to the result of a movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME2","text":"The opposition of Essence and that which stands opposed to it is reclassified from an ontological separation into an internal relation of semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME3","text":"Determinations become visible as reflexive self-positings rather than as externally given characteristics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME4","text":"Ground is determined as the form of mediation between inner reflection and outer existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ME5","text":"Appearance is remapped from a mere surface into a necessary production of Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Essence appears as a result that has emerged from Being and passes over into existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT2","text":"Structural — The structure produces determinations through the unity of positedness and reflection-into-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the opposition of inner Essence and outer counterpart with an analysis of their mediation and self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is conceived as a transition from Being through sublated Being, reflection, and Ground into existence and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from Being to Essence and from Essence to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT2","text":"The individual determinations of reflection and the concrete form of the later logic of existence and appearance remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, insofar as semblance is understood not as independent reality, but as the self-positing of Essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of sublation, reflection, Ground, and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT5","text":"The principal tension consists in Essence being taken at once as not immediate and hypothetically as immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in semblance standing opposed to Essence and nevertheless proceeding from its own positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_EADW:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of movement, but leaves the concrete forms of the essentialities open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_EADW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_EADW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 102","title":"First Section. Essence as Reflection into Itself.","context":"Chapter 102","original_title":"Erster Abschnitt. Das Wesen als Reflexion in ihm selbst."},"original_title":"Erster Abschnitt. Das Wesen als Reflexion in ihm selbst.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Essential and the Unessential.","order":103,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DWUD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DWUD@R001","sha256":"acec07cd8f9c80d835931baebd328cf838227e6e3b1bacef83ebe7c67f4c1147","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS1","text":"Die anfängliche Gegenüberstellung von Wesen und Seyn soll als unzureichende Bestimmung des Wesens rekonstruiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS2","text":"Das Wesen wird als aufgehobenes Seyn bestimmt, das seine Unmittelbarkeit in negierter Form bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS3","text":"Die Unterscheidung des Wesentlichen und Unwesentlichen wird als äußerliche Setzung im Daseyn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS4","text":"Das rekonstruktive dialektische Argument verschärft diese erste Negation zur absoluten Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS5","text":"Aus der Nicht-Erhaltung des Seyns als Anderes wird das unmittelbare Daseyn zum Unwesen und Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS6","text":"Der Schein wird als eigener Schein des Wesens und damit als Reflexion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","text":"Das Wesen ist aufgehobenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A2","text":"Das Wesen ist einfache Gleichheit mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A3","text":"Das Wesen ist die Negation der Sphäre des Seyns überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit, aus der das Wesen geworden ist, bleibt im Aufheben erhalten und steht dem Wesen gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","text":"Das Wesen ist in seiner anfänglichen Bestimmung seyendes, unmittelbares Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","text":"Das Seyn ist in Beziehung auf das Wesen nur Negatives und nicht an und für sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A7","text":"Seyn und Wesen verhalten sich zunächst als Andere mit gleichgültigen Unmittelbarkeiten gleichen Wertes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","text":"Das dem Wesen entgegengesetzte Seyn ist als Aufgehobenes das Unwesentliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","text":"Wenn das Wesen sich nur als Anderes zum Seyn verhält, ist es nicht eigentlich Wesen, sondern nur anders bestimmtes Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem wird am Daseyn äußerlich gesetzt und berührt dessen Inhalt nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","text":"Die Zuordnung zum Wesentlichen oder Unwesentlichen bleibt innerhalb dieser äußeren Setzung unbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A12","text":"Derselbe Inhalt kann unter äußerer Rücksicht bald als wesentlich, bald als unwesentlich gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","text":"Das Wesen ist die absolute Negativität des Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","text":"Das Seyn hebt sich sowohl als unmittelbares Seyn wie als unmittelbare, mit Andersseyn behaftete Negation auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","text":"Das Seyn oder Daseyn erhält sich nicht als ein vom Wesen verschiedenes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","text":"Das vom Wesen unterschiedene Unmittelbare ist an und für sich nichtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","text":"Das nichtige Unmittelbare ist Unwesen und Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A18","text":"Der Schein ist der eigene Schein des Wesens und damit Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX1","text":"Das Wesen ist keine vom Seyn unabhängige unmittelbare Sphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX2","text":"Das Seyn ist kein an und für sich bestehendes Gegenüber des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem ist keine im Daseyn selbst begründete Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX4","text":"Kein Inhalt trägt aus sich selbst eine unveränderliche Bestimmung als wesentlich oder unwesentlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX5","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht eigentlich Wesen, solange es nur als ein Anderes gegen das Seyn bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX6","text":"Das dem Wesen gegenüberstehende Unmittelbare ist nicht bloß unwesentliches Daseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX7","text":"Der Schein ist kein dem Wesen äußerliches Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX8","text":"Die Trennung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem ist keine selbständige Zweiheit innerhalb des Daseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D1","text":"Die anfängliche Gegenüberstellung erzeugt zwei gleichwertig erscheinende Unmittelbarkeiten, ohne ihnen selbständige An-und-Fürsichseinsweise zu verleihen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","CH_GB18_DWUD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D2","text":"Wird das Wesen nur als aufgehobenes Seyn genommen, entsteht die Bestimmung des Wesentlichen erst in Gegenüberstellung zu einem Unwesentlichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem lässt das Wesen in die Sphäre des Daseyns zurückfallen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","CH_GB18_DWUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D4","text":"Die äußerliche Setzung macht die wesentliche Bestimmung inhaltlich umkehrbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","CH_GB18_DWUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D5","text":"Die absolute Negativität des Seyns hebt dessen Bestimmung als selbständiges Anderes auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D6","text":"Das nicht als Anderes erhaltene Unmittelbare wird nicht zum bloß Unwesentlichen, sondern zum nichtigen Unwesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D7","text":"Der Schein bezeichnet die erhaltene, aber nicht selbständige Unmittelbarkeit des Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","CH_GB18_DWUD:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D8","text":"Die Erscheinung des Wesens ist keine Bewegung auf ein äußeres Gegenüber, sondern Reflexion des Wesens in sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","CH_GB18_DWUD:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD1","text":"Die anfängliche äußere Dualität von Wesen und Seyn wird durch ihre eigene Negativität in eine selbstbezogene Bestimmung des Wesens überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD2","text":"Die Kategorie des Wesentlichen ist keine abschließende ontologische Teilung, sondern die Übergangsform einer noch unvollständig bestimmten Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD3","text":"Der Schein ist zugleich Rest der aufgehobenen Unmittelbarkeit und Ausschluss ihrer selbständigen Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A2","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD4","text":"Das Wesen muss zunächst als unmittelbares Seyn auftreten, obwohl seine begriffliche Wahrheit in der absoluten Negativität des Seyns liegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A3","CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD5","text":"Die anfängliche Gleichwertigkeit von Seyn und Wesen hinsichtlich der Unmittelbarkeit besteht zugleich mit der Bestimmung des Seyns als bloß Negativem; diese Spannung wird erst durch die absolute Negativität bearbeitet.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","CH_GB18_DWUD:A7","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX1","text":"Eine selbständige positive Substanz hinter der Relation von Wesen und Seyn ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX2","text":"Eine stabile Zweiheit von innerem Wesen und äußerer Erscheinung ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX3","text":"Eine Unmittelbarkeit, die sich als unabhängiges Anderes erhält, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX4","text":"Ein im Inhalt selbst liegendes Kriterium für Wesentlichkeit ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX5","text":"Ein neutrales Daseyn, das die Trennung von Wesen und Unwesen aus sich selbst begründet, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX6","text":"Die erste Negation des Seyns genügt nicht als letzte Bestimmung des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX7","text":"Ein vom Wesen unabhängiger Träger der aufgehobenen Unmittelbarkeit ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines selbständigen unmittelbaren Grundes außerhalb der Wesensrelation ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines hinter dem Schein verborgenen, äußerlichen Wesens ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX3","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer stabilen ontologischen Hierarchie von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass die aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit als selbständiges Anderes fortbesteht, ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer Bestimmung des Wesens ohne Durchgang durch Negation, Aufhebung und Reflexion ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Seyn → Aufhebung des Seyns → Wesen als einfache Gleichheit mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS2","text":"Erhaltene Unmittelbarkeit → Gegenüberstellung von Wesen und Seyn → anfängliche Gleichrangigkeit zweier Anderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS3","text":"Bloße Andersheit → Wesentliches und Unwesentliches → Rückfall des Wesens in die Sphäre des Daseyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS4","text":"Äußerliche Setzung → unbestimmte Zuordnung → Austauschbarkeit der Bestimmungen bei gleichem Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS5","text":"Absolute Negativität → Aufhebung des unmittelbaren Seyns und seines Andersseins → Nicht-Erhaltung eines selbständigen Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS6","text":"Nichtige Unmittelbarkeit → Unwesen → Schein → eigener Schein des Wesens → Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AF1","text":"Unmittelbares Seyn → Unwesentliches → wesenloses Seyn → äußerliche Unterscheidung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem → absolute Negativität → nichtiges Unmittelbares → Schein → Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME1","text":"Das Unmittelbare wird vom bloß Unwesentlichen zum nichtigen Schein umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME2","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem wird von einer inneren Teilung des Daseyns zu einer äußerlichen Setzungsform verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME3","text":"Das Wesen wird nicht als verborgene Gegenständlichkeit, sondern als negative Selbstbeziehung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME4","text":"Der Schein wird vom äußeren Gegenbild des Wesens zur eigenen Erscheinungsweise des Wesens umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME5","text":"Die Frage nach dem wesentlichen Inhalt wird durch die Frage nach der Weise seiner Setzung und Aufhebung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME6","text":"Die Opposition von Wesen und Erscheinung verliert ihren Charakter als Zwei-Welten-Modell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Das Seyn erscheint zunächst als Unwesentliches, sodann als wesenloses Seyn und Schein; das Wesen erscheint in diesem Schein als Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Bestimmungen von Wesen, Daseyn und Schein werden durch Aufhebung, äußerliche Setzung und absolute Negativität vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die begriffliche Operation verschiebt die Analyse von der Klassifikation eines Inhalts zur Rekonstruktion der Relation, durch die er als wesentlich oder unwesentlich gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Das Nacheinander von zunächst, zweitens und drittens artikuliert eine logische Genesis: Unmittelbarkeit wird negiert, erhalten, als Anderes entkräftet und als Schein in die Reflexion überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom aufgehobenen Seyn über die äußerliche Unterscheidung zum Schein zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue begriffliche Funktion des Dritten, in das die Trennung von Wesentlichem und Unwesentlichem fällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aufhebung zugleich Negation und Bewahrung der Unmittelbarkeit bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT4","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung bleibt zwischen der Gleichwertigkeit von Seyn und Wesen als Unmittelbarkeiten und der Bestimmung des Seyns als bloß Negativem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste operative Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung des Scheins aus der Nicht-Erhaltung des Seyns als Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der komprimierten Einheit von Aufhebung, absoluter Negativität und Reflexion; deren Vermittlung wird nicht weiter formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, wenn der Schein nicht als Endrest, sondern als eigene Erscheinung des Wesens rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115823835581Z_4d0bc08e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The Essential and the Unessential.","source_sha256":"acec07cd8f9c80d835931baebd328cf838227e6e3b1bacef83ebe7c67f4c1147","sha256":"4330089abb39f7bc6940d2a0e094d15425e2df824d2fec94a7bb553876430f9f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:58:23.836743+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS1","text":"The initial opposition of essence and Being is to be reconstructed as an inadequate determination of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS2","text":"Essence is determined as sublated Being, which preserves its immediacy in negated form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS3","text":"The distinction between the essential and the unessential is determined as an external positing in determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS4","text":"The reconstructive dialectical argument intensifies this first negation into absolute negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS5","text":"From the non-preservation of Being as an Other, immediate determinate being becomes unessentiality and semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AS6","text":"Semblance is determined as essence's own semblance and thereby as reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","text":"Essence is sublated Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A2","text":"Essence is simple equality with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A3","text":"Essence is the negation of the sphere of Being as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","text":"The immediacy from which essence has become is preserved in sublation and stands opposed to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","text":"In its initial determination, essence is being, immediate essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","text":"In relation to essence, Being is only negative and not in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A7","text":"At first, Being and essence relate as Others with indifferent immediacies of equal value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","text":"Being opposed to essence is, as sublated, the unessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","text":"If essence relates to Being only as an Other, it is not properly essence, but only determinate being determined otherwise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","text":"The distinction between the essential and the unessential is externally posited on determinate being and does not affect its content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","text":"The assignment to the essential or unessential remains indeterminate within this external positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A12","text":"The same content can, under an external respect, count now as essential, now as unessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","text":"Essence is the absolute negativity of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","text":"Being sublates itself both as immediate Being and as immediate negation burdened with otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","text":"Being or determinate being does not preserve itself as an Other distinct from essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","text":"The immediate distinct from essence is null in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","text":"The null immediate is unessentiality and semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:A18","text":"Semblance is essence's own semblance and thereby reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX1","text":"Essence is not an immediate sphere independent of Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX2","text":"Being is not an opposite of essence that subsists in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX3","text":"The distinction between the essential and the unessential is not a separation grounded in determinate being itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX4","text":"No content bears within itself an unchangeable determination as essential or unessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX5","text":"Essence is not properly essence so long as it is determined only as an Other over against Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX6","text":"The immediate standing opposed to essence is not merely unessential determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX7","text":"Semblance is not an Other external to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:NX8","text":"The separation of the essential and the unessential is not an independent duality within determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D1","text":"The initial opposition produces two apparently equivalent immediacies without conferring upon them an independent mode of being-in-and-for-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","CH_GB18_DWUD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D2","text":"If essence is taken only as sublated Being, the determination of the essential first arises in opposition to an unessential.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D3","text":"The distinction between the essential and the unessential causes essence to fall back into the sphere of determinate being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","CH_GB18_DWUD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D4","text":"External positing makes the essential determination reversible in content.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","CH_GB18_DWUD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D5","text":"The absolute negativity of Being sublates its determination as an independent Other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D6","text":"The immediate not preserved as an Other does not become merely the unessential, but rather null unessentiality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D7","text":"Semblance designates the preserved but not independent immediacy of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A16","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","CH_GB18_DWUD:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:D8","text":"The appearance of essence is not a movement toward an external opposite, but reflection of essence into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A17","CH_GB18_DWUD:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD1","text":"The initial external duality of essence and Being is transformed through its own negativity into a self-related determination of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A1","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A11","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD2","text":"The category of the essential is not a conclusive ontological division, but the transitional form of a negation still incompletely determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A8","CH_GB18_DWUD:A9","CH_GB18_DWUD:A10","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD3","text":"Semblance is at once the remnant of sublated immediacy and the exclusion of its independent existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A2","CH_GB18_DWUD:A4","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14","CH_GB18_DWUD:A15","CH_GB18_DWUD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD4","text":"Essence must initially appear as immediate Being, although its conceptual truth lies in the absolute negativity of Being.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A3","CH_GB18_DWUD:A5","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SD5","text":"The initial equivalence of Being and essence with respect to immediacy coexists with the determination of Being as merely negative; this tension is first worked through by absolute negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DWUD:A6","CH_GB18_DWUD:A7","CH_GB18_DWUD:A13","CH_GB18_DWUD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX1","text":"An independent positive substance behind the relation of essence and Being is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX2","text":"A stable duality of inner essence and outer appearance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX3","text":"An immediacy that preserves itself as an independent Other is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX4","text":"A criterion for essentiality lying in the content itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX5","text":"A neutral determinate being that grounds the separation of essence and unessentiality from within itself is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX6","text":"The first negation of Being does not suffice as the final determination of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:DNX7","text":"A bearer of sublated immediacy independent of essence is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an independent immediate ground outside the relation of essence is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX2","text":"The possibility of an external essence concealed behind semblance is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX3","text":"The possibility of a stable ontological hierarchy of the essential and the unessential is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX4","text":"The possibility that sublated immediacy persists as an independent Other is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:SNX5","text":"The possibility of a determination of essence without passage through negation, sublation, and reflection is barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS1","text":"Immediate Being → sublation of Being → essence as simple equality with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS2","text":"Preserved immediacy → opposition of essence and Being → initial equal rank of two Others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS3","text":"Mere otherness → essential and unessential → essence's falling back into the sphere of determinate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS4","text":"External positing → indeterminate assignment → interchangeability of the determinations with identical content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS5","text":"Absolute negativity → sublation of immediate Being and its otherness → non-preservation of an independent Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:FGS6","text":"Null immediacy → unessentiality → semblance → essence's own semblance → reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:AF1","text":"Immediate Being → unessential → essenceless Being → external distinction between essential and unessential → absolute negativity → null immediate → semblance → reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME1","text":"The immediate is reclassified from the merely unessential into null semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME2","text":"The difference between the essential and the unessential is shifted from an internal division of determinate being to a form of external positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME3","text":"Essence is mapped not as concealed objectivity, but as negative self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME4","text":"Semblance is reassigned from the external counter-image of essence to essence's own mode of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME5","text":"The question of essential content is replaced by the question of the manner of its positing and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ME6","text":"The opposition of essence and appearance loses its character as a two-world model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Being appears first as the unessential, then as essenceless Being and semblance; essence appears in this semblance as reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The determinations of essence, determinate being, and semblance are mediated through sublation, external positing, and absolute negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The conceptual operation shifts the analysis from the classification of a content to the reconstruction of the relation through which it is posited as essential or unessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The succession of first, second, and third articulates a logical genesis: immediacy is negated, preserved, invalidated as an Other, and transformed as semblance into reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from sublated Being through the external distinction to semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT2","text":"The precise conceptual function of the third into which the separation of the essential and unessential falls remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sublation signifies at once negation and preservation of immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT4","text":"An unresolved tension remains between the equivalence of Being and essence as immediacies and the determination of Being as merely negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT5","text":"The strongest operative connection lies in the derivation of semblance from the non-preservation of Being as an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed unity of sublation, absolute negativity, and reflection; their mediation is not further formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DWUD:MRT7","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved if semblance is reconstructed not as an ultimate remnant, but as essence's own appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DWUD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DWUD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DWUD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 103","title":"A. The Essential and the Unessential.","context":"Chapter 103","original_title":"A. Das Wesentliche und das Unwesentliche."},"original_title":"A. Das Wesentliche und das Unwesentliche.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0","layer":"CH","title":"B. The Show.","order":104,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDS0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDS0@R001","sha256":"10b0a279392eb593ba4299efcbb471b4aa94b34704f244dc79118a0cbf52a463","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS1","text":"Der Schein erzeugt das Problem einer scheinbar unmittelbaren und vom Wesen unabhängigen Restexistenz des Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS2","text":"Die kritisierte skeptische und idealistische Position bewahrt diese Restexistenz, indem sie dem Schein einen unmittelbar gegebenen, mannigfaltigen Inhalt belässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS3","text":"Die Eigenständigkeit des Scheins wird aufgehoben, indem seine Nichtheit als die Negativität des Wesens selbst bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS4","text":"Die scheinbare Unmittelbarkeit des Scheins wird als reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit rekonstruiert, die nur durch Negation besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS5","text":"Das Wesen erscheint nicht an einem Anderen, sondern ist als Einheit von Negativität und Unmittelbarkeit das Scheinen seiner selbst in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung des Wesens als Reflexion, weil seine Differenzierung zugleich deren Selbstaufhebung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","text":"Das Seyn des Scheins besteht ausschließlich in seinem Aufgehobenseyn und seiner Nichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","text":"Der Schein hat Daseyn nur in seiner Beziehung auf ein Anderes und somit in seinem Nichtdaseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Scheins ist keine seyende, sondern reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A4","text":"Der Schein kann mannigfaltige Bestimmtheiten enthalten, setzt diese Bestimmtheiten jedoch nicht aus sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","text":"Das Nichtseyn des Scheins ist nichts anderes als die Negativität des Wesens an ihm selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","text":"Die Negativität des Wesens ist zugleich seine Gleichheit mit sich selbst und seine einfache Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","text":"Nichtigkeit als Bestehen und Seyn als Moment sind Momente des Wesens selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","text":"Jede Bestimmtheit des Wesens hebt sich als Bestimmung selbst auf und kehrt in die absolute Negativität zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A9","text":"Der Schein ist das Wesen selbst in der Bestimmtheit des Seyns, wobei diese Bestimmtheit nur Moment des Wesens ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A10","text":"Das Wesen ist in seiner Selbstbewegung Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX1","text":"Der Schein ist kein Etwas, kein Ding und kein gleichgültig bestehendes Seyn außerhalb seiner Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX2","text":"Der Schein ist keine selbstständige unmittelbare Seite gegenüber dem Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX3","text":"Der Schein ist nicht das Erscheinen eines Anderen am Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX4","text":"Das Wesen ist keine erste, starre und von seiner Vermittlung ablösbare Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines Ding-an-sich begründet nicht die Selbstsetzung des erscheinenden Inhalts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX6","text":"Die Differenz von Wesen und Schein ist keine äußerliche Differenz zweier selbstständiger Sphären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D1","text":"Die scheinbare Unmittelbarkeit des Scheins erweist sich als vermittelte Bestimmtheit, weil sie nur durch ihr eigenes Nichtseyn besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D2","text":"Die Rückführung des Scheins auf das Wesen verlangt keine Bewegung zwischen zwei getrennten Bereichen, weil der Schein bereits eine Bestimmtheit des Wesens ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D3","text":"Skeptizismus und Idealismus verbleiben im Umkreis des Seyns, sofern sie den Inhalt des Scheins als unmittelbar gegeben oder äußerlich begrenzt behandeln.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D4","text":"Die Unselbstständigkeit des Scheins ist nicht bloßer Mangel, sondern die Form seiner Selbstbeziehung und damit seiner reflektierten Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D5","text":"Das Wesen kann nur als sich unterscheidende Einheit bestimmt werden, weil seine Negativität zugleich die Aufhebung der von ihm gesetzten Bestimmtheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD1","text":"Das Problem des Scheins wird von einer Frage nach dem ontologischen Status eines äußeren Erscheinungsbereichs in eine Frage nach der immanenten Selbstgliederung des Wesens transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD2","text":"Die Einheit des Wesens ist keine differenzlose Identität, sondern besteht nur als Bewegung, in der Negativität und Unmittelbarkeit einander tragen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD3","text":"Jede Berufung auf unmittelbar gegebenen Erscheinungsinhalt reproduziert diejenige Äußerlichkeit, deren Überwindung die Wesenslogik verlangt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Seyn und Nichtseyn könnten innerhalb der Sphäre des Wesens als unmittelbar gegeneinanderstehende Wirklichkeiten fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die epistemische Ausklammerung des Ding-an-sich beseitige die ontologische Abhängigkeit des Erscheinungsinhalts.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität des Wesens, die nur durch Ausschluss von Differenz, Negativität und Selbstaufhebung bestehen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letztes Substrat hinter dem Schein, das vom Vollzug der Reflexion unabhängig wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX2","text":"Nicht zulässig ist eine absolute Exteriorität, in der ein Bestimmtes endgültig außerhalb seiner eigenen Negation bestehen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine ruhende Grundlage, die der Erscheinung vorausläge, ohne selbst das Scheinen ihrer Bestimmtheit zu vollziehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A9","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS1","text":"Aufgehobenes Seyn → nichtiges Seyn → Schein als unmittelbares Nichtdaseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS2","text":"Scheinbare Unmittelbarkeit → Kritik des gegebenen Inhalts → Bestimmung als reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS3","text":"Nichtseyn des Scheins → Negativität des Wesens → Identität von Negativität und Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS4","text":"Identität von Negativität und Unmittelbarkeit → Selbstaufhebung der Bestimmtheit → Wesen als Scheinen seiner selbst → Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF1","text":"Die Bewegung beginnt bei der Restform des Seyns, die als Schein noch den Anschein unabhängiger Unmittelbarkeit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF2","text":"Die Bewegung führt über die Diagnose, dass skeptische und idealistische Erscheinungsformen diese Unmittelbarkeit durch gegebenen Inhalt konservieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF3","text":"Die Bewegung bestimmt die Differenz von Wesen und Schein als innere Differenz des Wesens und entzieht ihr den Status äußerer Andersheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF4","text":"Die Bewegung schließt mit Wesen → Selbstnegation → reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit → Scheinen-in-sich → Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME1","text":"Die Opposition von Wesen und Erscheinung wird von einer Zwei-Bereiche-Struktur in eine immanente Differenzierungsstruktur überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Unmittelbarkeit und Vermittlung wird umgeordnet, weil Unmittelbarkeit nur als durch Negation vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME3","text":"Skeptizismus und Idealismus werden nicht als Überwindungen des Seyns, sondern als Formen seiner fortbestehenden Unmittelbarkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME4","text":"Negativität wird von bloßer Auflösung zu der produktiven Form umklassifiziert, in welcher das Wesen seine Bestimmtheit, Einheit und Erscheinung vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt den Schein als nichtiges und unselbstständiges Fortbestehen des aufgehobenen Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text lokalisiert die Bestimmungen des Scheins als Momente der Selbstvermittlung des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text neutralisiert kritische Modelle des Erscheinens, indem er ihre Negation eines Ding-an-sich als unzureichend gegenüber der fortgesetzten Unmittelbarkeit ihres Inhalts bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Text ersetzt die zeitlich oder äußerlich gedachte Abfolge von Seyn, Nichtseyn und Werden durch die reflexive Gleichzeitigkeit von Negativität und Unmittelbarkeit im Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Umwandlung des Scheins von scheinbarer Eigenständigkeit in ein Moment des Wesens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die notwendige Bewegung vom Rest des Seyns über reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit zur Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Erzeugung des mannigfaltigen Inhalts des Scheins, weil dessen Gegebenheit kritisiert wird, ohne an dieser Stelle vollständig aus der Reflexion abgeleitet zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Gelenkstelle liegt in der Identifikation des Nichtseyns des Scheins mit der Negativität des Wesens, weil dadurch die äußerliche Differenz beider aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste strukturelle Spannung besteht darin, dass der Schein zugleich als nichtig und als bestimmt erscheint und diese Bestimmtheit nur durch ihre sofortige Rücknahme im Wesen tragen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung absoluter Selbstvermittlung und der zunächst eingeräumten Unmittelbarkeit eines gegebenen Inhalts bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt intern kohärent, sofern Unmittelbarkeit durchgehend als Moment der Negativität und nicht als unabhängiger Ausgangspunkt gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113113223602Z_5b5020f3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. Semblance.","source_sha256":"10b0a279392eb593ba4299efcbb471b4aa94b34704f244dc79118a0cbf52a463","sha256":"96c5eb9f8ea77ea69800805aa9d5753d3026ae131d50d3e4715b722d06b408ca","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:31:13.226225+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS1","text":"Semblance generates the problem of an apparently immediate residual existence of Being independent of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS2","text":"The criticized skeptical and idealist position preserves this residual existence by leaving semblance with an immediately given, manifold content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS3","text":"The self-subsistence of semblance is sublated by determining its non-being as the negativity of essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS4","text":"The apparent immediacy of semblance is reconstructed as reflected immediacy, which exists only through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS5","text":"Essence does not appear in an other, but, as the unity of negativity and immediacy, is the shining of itself within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the determination of essence as reflection, because its differentiation is at the same time its self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","text":"The Being of semblance consists exclusively in its sublated-being and its nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","text":"Semblance has existence only in its relation to an other and thus in its non-existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","text":"The immediacy of semblance is not a being immediacy, but reflected immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A4","text":"Semblance can contain manifold determinacies, but it does not posit these determinacies out of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","text":"The non-being of semblance is nothing other than the negativity of essence in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","text":"The negativity of essence is at the same time its equality with itself and its simple immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","text":"Nullity as subsistence and Being as moment are moments of essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","text":"Every determinacy of essence sublates itself as determination and returns into absolute negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A9","text":"Semblance is essence itself in the determinacy of Being, whereby this determinacy is only a moment of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:A10","text":"Essence is reflection in its self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX1","text":"Semblance is not a something, not a thing, and not an indifferently subsisting Being outside its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX2","text":"Semblance is not a self-subsistent immediate side over against essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX3","text":"Semblance is not the appearance of an other in essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX4","text":"Essence is not a first, rigid immediacy detachable from its mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX5","text":"The absence of a thing-in-itself does not ground the self-positing of appearing content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:NX6","text":"The difference between essence and semblance is not an external difference between two self-subsistent spheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D1","text":"The apparent immediacy of semblance proves to be mediated determinacy, because it subsists only through its own non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D2","text":"The reduction of semblance to essence requires no movement between two separate domains, because semblance is already a determinacy of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D3","text":"Skepticism and idealism remain within the orbit of Being insofar as they treat the content of semblance as immediately given or externally delimited.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D4","text":"The non-self-subsistence of semblance is not a mere deficiency, but the form of its self-relation and thus of its reflected immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:D5","text":"Essence can be determined only as a unity differentiating itself, because its negativity is at the same time the sublation of the determinacy posited by it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD1","text":"The problem of semblance is transformed from a question concerning the ontological status of an external sphere of appearance into a question concerning the immanent self-articulation of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD2","text":"The unity of essence is not a differentiationless identity, but exists only as movement in which negativity and immediacy sustain one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SD3","text":"Every appeal to immediately given appearance-content reproduces precisely that externality whose overcoming the logic of essence demands.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that Being and non-being could persist within the sphere of essence as immediately opposed actualities.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the epistemic bracketing of the thing-in-itself eliminates the ontological dependence of appearance-content.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A3","CH_GB18_BDS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity of essence that could subsist only through the exclusion of difference, negativity, and self-sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final substrate behind semblance that would be independent of the enactment of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A1","CH_GB18_BDS0:A5","CH_GB18_BDS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX2","text":"Not permissible is an absolute exteriority in which a determinate could subsist definitively outside its own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A2","CH_GB18_BDS0:A6","CH_GB18_BDS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a resting ground that would precede appearance without itself enacting the shining of its determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDS0:A9","CH_GB18_BDS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS1","text":"Sublated Being → null Being → semblance as immediate non-existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS2","text":"Apparent immediacy → critique of given content → determination as reflected immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS3","text":"Non-being of semblance → negativity of essence → identity of negativity and immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:FGS4","text":"Identity of negativity and immediacy → self-sublation of determinacy → essence as the shining of itself → reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF1","text":"The movement begins with the residual form of Being, which as semblance still possesses the appearance of independent immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF2","text":"The movement proceeds through the diagnosis that skeptical and idealist forms of appearance conserve this immediacy through given content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF3","text":"The movement determines the difference of essence and semblance as an inner difference of essence and deprives it of the status of external otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:AF4","text":"The movement concludes with essence → self-negation → reflected immediacy → shining-within-itself → reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME1","text":"The opposition of essence and appearance is transferred from a two-domain structure into an immanent structure of differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME2","text":"The opposition of immediacy and mediation is reordered, because immediacy counts only as immediacy mediated through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME3","text":"Skepticism and idealism are classified not as overcomings of Being, but as forms of its persisting immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ME4","text":"Negativity is reclassified from mere dissolution into the productive form in which essence enacts its determinacy, unity, and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines semblance as the null and non-self-subsistent persistence of sublated Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text locates the determinations of semblance as moments of the self-mediation of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text neutralizes critical models of appearing by determining their negation of a thing-in-itself to be insufficient in the face of the continuing immediacy of their content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The text replaces the temporally or externally conceived sequence of Being, non-being, and becoming with the reflexive simultaneity of negativity and immediacy in essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transformation of semblance from apparent self-subsistence into a moment of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the necessary movement from the remainder of Being through reflected immediacy to reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive generation of the manifold content of semblance, because its givenness is criticized without being fully derived from reflection at this point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT4","text":"The strongest juncture lies in the identification of the non-being of semblance with the negativity of essence, because thereby their external difference is sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT5","text":"The strongest structural tension consists in the fact that semblance appears at once as null and as determinate, and that it can sustain this determinacy only through its immediate withdrawal into essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT6","text":"A further tension remains between the assertion of absolute self-mediation and the initially conceded immediacy of a given content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDS0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction remains internally coherent insofar as immediacy is consistently read as a moment of negativity and not as an independent point of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDS0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDS0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDS0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 104","title":"B. The Show.","context":"Chapter 104","original_title":"B. Der Schein."},"original_title":"B. Der Schein.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0","layer":"CH","title":"C. Reflection.","order":105,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDR0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDR0@R001","sha256":"08d7d0330bb58464db51a623558bb0763798dcd4ba1d5656566762ede0be86a2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist zu bestimmen, wie Reflexion aus der Unmittelbarkeit hervorgeht, ohne auf ein vorausliegendes Substrat gegründet zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit wird als bereits vollzogene Bewegung der Negation und nicht als ursprünglicher Ausgangspunkt neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS3","text":"Das Wesen wird als Reflexion gefasst, deren Andersheit nicht äußere Bestimmtheit, sondern Negation der Negation ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung des Werdens wird dadurch als Bewegung von Nichts zu Nichts bestimmt, die in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS5","text":"Die reine absolute Reflexion differenziert sich in setzende, äußerliche und bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von der Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Grundlage zur Selbstbestimmung der Reflexion durch Setzung, Voraussetzung und Aufhebung der Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A1","text":"Der Schein ist die unmittelbare Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A2","text":"Das Wesen ist Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A3","text":"Die Reflexion ist eine Bewegung des Übergehens, die in sich selbst bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A4","text":"Das Unterschiedene ist im Wesen nur als an sich Negatives und damit als Schein bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","text":"Die reflektierende Bewegung bestimmt das Andere als Negation an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A6","text":"Die auf sich bezogene Negation ist Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A7","text":"Das Sein der Negation liegt in ihrem Negiertsein; darin ist sie Schein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A8","text":"Das Andere der Reflexion ist nicht ein durch Negation begrenztes Sein, sondern Negation mit Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A9","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist die Gleichheit der Negation mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A10","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist kein ursprüngliches Erstes und kein sich durch Reflexion bewegendes Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","text":"Das Werden im Wesen ist Bewegung von Nichts zu Nichts und dadurch Rückkehr zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A12","text":"Das Sein ist nur als Bewegung von Nichts zu Nichts bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A13","text":"Das Wesen ist diese Bewegung als absoluter Schein und reine Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A14","text":"Die reine Negativität negiert kein äußerliches Anderes, sondern nur ihr eigenes Negatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A15","text":"Die absolute Reflexion bestimmt sich in einer setzenden, einer äußerlichen und einer bestimmenden Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX1","text":"Die Reflexion ist nicht bloß unmittelbare Gegebenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX2","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht ein ruhendes Sein neben oder hinter der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX3","text":"Das Unterschiedene ist nicht selbständige positive Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX4","text":"Das Andere der Reflexion ist nicht ein äußerliches Sein mit einer Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX5","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist nicht der erste Anfang des Arguments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX6","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist kein seiendes Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX7","text":"Das Werden ist nicht Übergang eines Seins in sein Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX8","text":"Das Sein der Reflexion ist nicht von einem äußerlich negierten Gegenstand abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX9","text":"Die Voraussetzung der äußerlichen Reflexion bleibt nicht unangetastet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D1","text":"Die reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit ist nur als Resultat der Negation der Negation bestimmbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","CH_GB18_CDR0:A6","CH_GB18_CDR0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D2","text":"Die Gleichheit der Negation mit sich selbst ist keine statische Identität, sondern die Bewegung, durch die Unmittelbarkeit entsteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A9","CH_GB18_CDR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D3","text":"Das Andere erhält seine Bestimmtheit nicht durch ein vorausgesetztes Sein, sondern durch die Reflexionsbewegung der Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A4","CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","CH_GB18_CDR0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D4","text":"Das Übergehen hebt sich in seinem eigenen Vollzug auf, weil das werdende Andere die Negation eines Nichts ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","CH_GB18_CDR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D5","text":"Das Sein der Reflexion ist die Negation eines Nichts und dadurch die Rückkehr der Bewegung in sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","CH_GB18_CDR0:A12","CH_GB18_CDR0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D6","text":"Die reine Reflexion ist selbstgenügsam, weil sie nur ihr eigenes Negatives negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A13","CH_GB18_CDR0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D7","text":"Die Setzung der Reflexion ist die erste Form ihrer Selbstbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D8","text":"Die äußerliche Reflexion entsteht, indem die Reflexion von einem vorausgesetzten Unmittelbaren ausgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A10","CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D9","text":"Die bestimmende Reflexion entsteht, indem die Reflexion ihre eigene Voraussetzung aufhebt und zugleich als voraussetzende Bewegung fortbesteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD1","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit ist kein ontologischer Grund der Reflexion, sondern der vorläufige Effekt einer sich selbst negierenden Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD2","text":"Die Andersheit des Wesens wird vollständig in eine immanente Negativität überführt; äußerliche Kausalität verliert damit ihre Grundfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD3","text":"Sein, Schein und Wesen bilden keine getrennten Schichten, sondern verschiedene Bestimmungen einer einzigen reflexiven Negationsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD4","text":"Die Reflexion erzeugt ihre scheinbare Voraussetzung selbst und kann sie anschließend als Voraussetzung aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD5","text":"Die Selbstbestimmung der Reflexion ist zugleich Selbstbegründung und Selbstentzug eines ersten Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD6","text":"Die Dreiteilung der Reflexion ist keine bloße Klassifikation, sondern die zeitlich-logische Entfaltung einer Bewegung, die ihre eigenen Voraussetzungen erzeugt und beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit eines von der Reflexion unabhängigen Ursprungs ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein ruhendes Sein aus, das den reflexiven Übergängen als Träger zugrunde liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Andersheit, die außerhalb der Negation selbst Bestand hätte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX4","text":"Es kann Werden nicht als lineare Veränderung eines positiven Seienden modellieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Negation aus, deren Wirksamkeit von einem fremden Gegenstand abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX6","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass jede scheinbare Voraussetzung als Moment der Reflexion rekonstruierbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Realität, deren Bestimmtheit vor jeder Reflexion verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein Anfang, der nicht selbst aus einer Negationsbewegung hervorgegangen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Sein, Andersheit und Grund als voneinander unabhängige Größen zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX4","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines positiven Außen, gegen das die Reflexion sich richten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX5","text":"Unstatthaft wird eine Erklärung, die den Ursprung der Reflexion in eine nichtreflexive Unmittelbarkeit verlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbarer Schein → Reflexion des Scheins → Entfremdung von der Unmittelbarkeit → Bestimmung des Wesens als Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS2","text":"Äußere Andersheit → Negation an sich → Negation der Negation → Schein als Sein der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS3","text":"Vorausgesetztes Sein → Aufhebung des vorausgesetzten Seins → Negation eines Nichts → Sein als Bewegung von Nichts zu Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS4","text":"Bewegung der Negativität → Rückkehr in sich → absolute Reflexion → Selbstbestimmung ohne äußeres Negat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS5","text":"Absolute Reflexion → Setzung → Voraussetzung eines Unmittelbaren → äußerliche Reflexion → Aufhebung der Voraussetzung → bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS6","text":"Setzung und Voraussetzung erzeugen eine scheinbare Grundlage; deren Aufhebung macht die Reflexion zur expliziten Quelle ihrer eigenen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS7","text":"Die generative Form lautet: Negation → Negation der Negation → reflexive Unmittelbarkeit → selbstgesetzte Voraussetzung → aufgehobene Voraussetzung → bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AF1","text":"Unmittelbarer Schein → Reflexion als entfremdete Unmittelbarkeit → Wesen als selbstbezügliche Negativität → Werden von Nichts zu Nichts → absolute Reflexion → Setzung → äußerliche Voraussetzung → Aufhebung der Voraussetzung → bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen unmittelbarem Sein und reflektierter Bestimmung wird in eine interne Bewegung der Negation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Sein und Nichts bricht zusammen, weil Sein als Negation eines Nichts bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME3","text":"Das Andere wird von einer äußeren Gegenposition zu einem immanenten Moment der Negation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von ursprünglicher Grundlage und abgeleiteter Reflexion wird durch die Selbstproduktion der Voraussetzung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME5","text":"Die drei Reflexionsformen erscheinen als Funktionsweisen eines einzigen Generierungsprozesses und nicht als nebeneinanderstehende Typen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME6","text":"Der argumentative Raum verschiebt sich von einer Ontologie gegebener Dinge zu einer Logik selbstaufhebender Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Schein wird als unmittelbare Reflexion und das Wesen als Reflexion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Sein, Andersheit und Unmittelbarkeit werden durch Negation, Negation der Negation und Rückkehrbewegung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Jede vorausgesetzte Grundlage wird als Moment der Reflexion übernommen, funktionalisiert und anschließend aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität besitzt keinen ersten ruhenden Grund; sie besteht als selbstbezügliche Bewegung von Nichts zu Nichts und als deren Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der unmittelbaren Reflexion zur bestimmenden Reflexion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT2","text":"Die Ableitung hängt entscheidend an der Gleichsetzung von Wesen und Reflexion sowie an der Bestimmung der Negation als Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die drei Reflexionsformen über die angegebene Bewegungsfolge hinaus voneinander inhaltlich differenziert sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Unmittelbarkeit ausschließlich als Resultat und Moment der Bewegung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Aufhebung des ursprünglichen Substrats durch die immanente Selbstbewegung der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Selbstgenügsamkeit der absoluten Reflexion und dem ausdrücklich eingeführten vorausgesetzten Unmittelbaren der äußerlichen Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Reflexion ihre Voraussetzung aufheben soll, zugleich aber als voraussetzende Bewegung fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die scheinbare Grundlage nicht als externe Ursache, sondern als erzeugtes und aufgehobenes Reflexionsmoment gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114215258562Z_22d999fe","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Reflection.","source_sha256":"08d7d0330bb58464db51a623558bb0763798dcd4ba1d5656566762ede0be86a2","sha256":"763bf1ec70a7f2c70e19181fc04ae02a4f801232bff3d9f8311a94d68a88c206","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:42:15.260546+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS1","text":"The central problem is to determine how reflection proceeds from immediacy without being grounded in a prior substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS2","text":"Immediacy is redefined as an already accomplished movement of negation and not as an original starting point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS3","text":"Essence is conceived as reflection, whose otherness is not external determinacy but negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS4","text":"The movement of becoming is thereby determined as a movement from nothing to nothing that returns into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS5","text":"Pure absolute reflection differentiates itself into positing, external, and determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AS6","text":"The argument moves from the sublation of the immediate foundation to the self-determination of reflection through positing, presupposition, and sublation of the presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A1","text":"Appearance is immediate reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A2","text":"Essence is reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A3","text":"Reflection is a movement of passing-over that remains within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A4","text":"In essence, the differentiated is determined only as negative in itself and thus as appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","text":"The reflecting movement determines the other as negation in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A6","text":"Negation relating to itself is negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A7","text":"The being of negation lies in its being negated; therein it is appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A8","text":"The other of reflection is not a being delimited by negation, but negation with negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A9","text":"Immediacy is the equality of negation with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A10","text":"Immediacy is neither an original first nor a substrate moving through reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","text":"Becoming in essence is movement from nothing to nothing and thereby return to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A12","text":"Being is determined only as movement from nothing to nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A13","text":"Essence is this movement as absolute appearance and pure negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A14","text":"Pure negativity negates no external other, but only its own negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:A15","text":"Absolute reflection determines itself in a positing, an external, and a determining form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX1","text":"Reflection is not merely immediate givenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX2","text":"Essence is not a resting being alongside or behind reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX3","text":"The differentiated is not self-subsistent positive determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX4","text":"The other of reflection is not an external being with a limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX5","text":"Immediacy is not the first beginning of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX6","text":"Immediacy is not a being substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX7","text":"Becoming is not the transition of a being into its non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX8","text":"The being of reflection is not dependent on an externally negated object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:NX9","text":"The presupposition of external reflection does not remain untouched.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D1","text":"Reflected immediacy can be determined only as the result of the negation of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","CH_GB18_CDR0:A6","CH_GB18_CDR0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D2","text":"The equality of negation with itself is not a static identity, but the movement through which immediacy arises.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A9","CH_GB18_CDR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D3","text":"The other receives its determinacy not through a presupposed being, but through the reflective movement of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A4","CH_GB18_CDR0:A5","CH_GB18_CDR0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D4","text":"Passing-over sublates itself in its own enactment, because the becoming other is the negation of a nothing.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","CH_GB18_CDR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D5","text":"The being of reflection is the negation of a nothing and thereby the return of movement into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A11","CH_GB18_CDR0:A12","CH_GB18_CDR0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D6","text":"Pure reflection is self-sufficient because it negates only its own negative.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A13","CH_GB18_CDR0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D7","text":"The positing of reflection is the first form of its self-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D8","text":"External reflection arises in that reflection proceeds from a presupposed immediate.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A10","CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:D9","text":"Determining reflection arises in that reflection sublates its own presupposition and at the same time persists as presupposing movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDR0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD1","text":"Immediacy is not an ontological ground of reflection, but the provisional effect of a self-negating movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD2","text":"The otherness of essence is wholly transformed into an immanent negativity; external causality thereby loses its foundational function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD3","text":"Being, appearance, and essence do not form separate layers, but different determinations of a single reflexive movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD4","text":"Reflection itself produces its apparent presupposition and can subsequently sublate it as presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD5","text":"The self-determination of reflection is at once self-grounding and self-withdrawal of a first ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SD6","text":"The tripartition of reflection is not a mere classification, but the temporal-logical unfolding of a movement that produces and eliminates its own presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth of an origin independent of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a resting being that underlies reflexive transitions as their bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies an otherness that would subsist outside negation itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX4","text":"It cannot model becoming as a linear alteration of a positive being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX5","text":"It excludes a negation whose efficacy depends on an alien object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:DNX6","text":"It presupposes that every apparent presupposition can be reconstructed as a moment of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a reality whose determinacy would be available prior to every reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a beginning that would not itself have arisen from a movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of treating being, otherness, and ground as magnitudes independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX4","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a positive outside against which reflection could direct itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:SNX5","text":"Impermissible becomes an explanation that locates the origin of reflection in a non-reflexive immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS1","text":"Immediate appearance → reflection of appearance → alienation from immediacy → determination of essence as reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS2","text":"External otherness → negation in itself → negation of negation → appearance as being of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS3","text":"Presupposed being → sublation of presupposed being → negation of a nothing → being as movement from nothing to nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS4","text":"Movement of negativity → return into itself → absolute reflection → self-determination without external negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS5","text":"Absolute reflection → positing → presupposition of an immediate → external reflection → sublation of the presupposition → determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS6","text":"Positing and presupposition produce an apparent foundation; its sublation makes reflection the explicit source of its own determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:FGS7","text":"The generative form is: negation → negation of negation → reflexive immediacy → self-posited presupposition → sublated presupposition → determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:AF1","text":"Immediate appearance → reflection as alienated immediacy → essence as self-relating negativity → becoming from nothing to nothing → absolute reflection → positing → external presupposition → sublation of the presupposition → determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME1","text":"The distinction between immediate being and reflected determination is remapped into an internal movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME2","text":"The opposition of being and nothing collapses because being is determined as the negation of a nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME3","text":"The other is reclassified from an external counterposition into an immanent moment of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME4","text":"The opposition of original foundation and derived reflection is replaced by the self-production of the presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME5","text":"The three forms of reflection appear as modes of operation of a single process of generation and not as juxtaposed types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ME6","text":"The argumentative space shifts from an ontology of given things to a logic of self-sublating determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Appearance is determined as immediate reflection and essence as reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Being, otherness, and immediacy are organized through negation, negation of negation, and movement of return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Every presupposed foundation is taken up as a moment of reflection, functionalized, and subsequently sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality has no first resting ground; it exists as self-relating movement from nothing to nothing and as that movement's return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from immediate reflection to determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT2","text":"The derivation depends decisively on the identification of essence and reflection, as well as on the determination of negation as negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the three forms of reflection are substantively differentiated from one another beyond the stated sequence of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as immediacy is understood exclusively as result and moment of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT5","text":"The strongest point is the sublation of the original substrate through the immanent self-movement of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the asserted self-sufficiency of absolute reflection and the explicitly introduced presupposed immediate of external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that reflection is supposed to sublate its presupposition while at the same time persisting as presupposing movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDR0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the apparent foundation is read not as an external cause but as a produced and sublated moment of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDR0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDR0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDR0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 105","title":"C. Reflection.","context":"Chapter 105","original_title":"C. Die Reflexion."},"original_title":"C. Die Reflexion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR","layer":"CH","title":"1. Positing Reflection.","order":106,"parents":["RAW_GB18_1DSR"],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DSR@R001","sha256":"5a5f089cc7cf2db8d99731d52fe49cd4671fca26780b1f4a4740078f60c63e32","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt das Problem der scheinbaren Unmittelbarkeit, deren Sein nicht vorausliegt, sondern aus der Rückkehr der Negativität hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS2","text":"Die zentrale These lautet, dass Reflexion die sich selbst negierende Negativität als Einheit von Negativität, Gleichheit mit sich und Unmittelbarkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS3","text":"Die Reflexion wird nicht als Übergang zwischen gegebenen Bestimmungen, sondern als Aufheben des Übergangs rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS4","text":"Aus der Rückkehr der Negativität erzeugt die Reflexion die Unmittelbarkeit als Gesetztsein und setzt dadurch voraus, was sie selbst hervorgebracht hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS5","text":"Diese Umkehrung von Setzen und Voraussetzen konstituiert die reflektierende Bewegung als absoluten Gegenstoß und Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung der Reflexion als äußerer Reflexion, weil die erzeugte Unmittelbarkeit zugleich als Anderes bestimmt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A1","text":"Der Schein hat sein Sein nicht in einem Anderen, sondern in seiner eigenen Gleichheit mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A2","text":"Die auf sich bezogene Negativität negiert sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A3","text":"Die sich selbst negierende Negativität ist zugleich aufgehobene Negativität und einfache Gleichheit mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A4","text":"Reflexion ist die Bewegung des Nichts zu Nichts und damit die mit sich selbst zusammengehende Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A5","text":"Die Bewegung der Reflexion ist kein Übergang der Negation in eine ihr äußerliche Gleichheit, sondern das Aufheben des Übergangs selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A6","text":"Unmittelbarkeit ist die Gleichheit des Negativen mit sich und daher sich selbst negierende Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","text":"Die Beziehung des Negativen auf sich selbst ist Rückkehr in sich; Unmittelbarkeit besteht nur als diese Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","text":"Unmittelbarkeit ist als reine Bestimmtheit oder als sich reflektierende Unmittelbarkeit Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","text":"Die Reflexion kehrt nicht aus einem unabhängig vorhandenen Anderen zurück, sondern ist nur Rückkehr und Negativität ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","text":"Die Reflexion hebt als Negation des Negativen die Unmittelbarkeit als ihr Anderes auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","text":"Das Aufheben des Setzens innerhalb des Setzens ist Voraussetzen, und das Aufheben der Voraussetzung ist wiederum die Voraussetzung selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A12","text":"Im Voraussetzen bestimmt die Reflexion ihre Rückkehr als das Negative ihrer selbst, dessen Aufheben das Wesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit tritt nur als Rückkehr hervor, während der Schein eines Anfangs durch diese Rückkehr negiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A14","text":"Das Vorgefundene wird erst dadurch, dass es verlassen wird; seine Unmittelbarkeit ist aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","text":"Das Überschreiten des Unmittelbaren und das Ankommen bei ihm sind dieselbe Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A16","text":"Die Reflexion ist sie selbst und ihr Nichtsein und ist nur sie selbst, indem sie das Negative ihrer selbst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX1","text":"Das Sein des Scheins gründet nicht in einem äußeren Träger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX2","text":"Reflexion ist kein Übergang in eine von der Negation getrennte Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX3","text":"Die Rückkehr setzt kein selbständig vorhandenes Ausgangs- oder Zielobjekt voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX4","text":"Unmittelbarkeit ist kein ursprünglicher, reflexionsloser Anfang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX5","text":"Das Vorgefundene besitzt keine von seinem Verlassen unabhängige Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX6","text":"Das Überschreiten des Unmittelbaren ist kein lineares Entfernen von ihm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX7","text":"Reflexion ist keine reine Identität ohne Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX8","text":"Wesen ist kein hinter dem Schein ruhendes, unvermitteltes Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX9","text":"Setzen und Voraussetzen sind keine voneinander isolierten oder zeitlich nacheinander erfolgenden Akte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D1","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit kann nicht als vorausliegende Grundlage der Reflexion fungieren, weil sie erst durch die Rückkehr des Negativen entsteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D2","text":"Der Anfang der Reflexion ist ein Effekt ihrer Rückkehr und keine unabhängige Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D3","text":"Die Reflexion erzeugt ihre Voraussetzung, indem sie das von ihr gesetzte Unmittelbare als Voraussetzung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D4","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht ein vorausliegendes Sein, sondern die Rückkehr, in der die aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit zu sich kommt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A12","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D5","text":"Das Ankommen bei sich ist zugleich Aufheben seiner selbst und damit selbstabstoßende, voraussetzende Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D6","text":"Die reflektierende Bewegung ist Selbstbewegung, weil ihr Fortgehen unmittelbar in die Rückkehr und ihr Hinausgehen in das Ankommen umschlägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D7","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit wird als das Andere der Reflexion bestimmt, obwohl sie nur als deren gesetzte und aufgehobene Rückkehr besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D8","text":"Die Reflexion bestimmt sich deshalb als äußere Reflexion, weil sie von einer Unmittelbarkeit als ihrem Anderen anfängt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD1","text":"Die Bedingung der Reflexion ist ein nachträgliches Produkt der Reflexion selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD2","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Setzen und Voraussetzen bezeichnet keine zwei Vorgänge, sondern die doppelte Funktion derselben Rückkehrbewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD3","text":"Unmittelbarkeit und Vermittlung, Identität und Negativität sind im System nicht getrennt, sondern werden gegenseitig durch dieselbe reflektierende Bewegung konstituiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A3","CH_GB18_1DSR:A6","CH_GB18_1DSR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD4","text":"Die lineare Ordnung von Ausgang, Übergang und Ankunft wird durch eine rekursive Ordnung des absoluten Gegenstoßes ersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A5","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD5","text":"Äußere Reflexion erscheint als intern erzeugte Form der Selbstbeziehung, nicht als schlichter Austritt aus ihr.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD6","text":"Das System hält die Unmittelbarkeit zugleich als eigene Rückkehr und als Anderes der Reflexion fest.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unabhängiger Grund, der vor der Reflexion besteht und ihre Bewegung trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine ursprüngliche Unmittelbarkeit, die nicht erst durch Aufhebung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine lineare Kausalordnung, in der die Reflexion von einem gegebenen Anfang zu einem getrennten Resultat fortschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nicht durch Selbstnegation vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Anderes, das außerhalb der reflektierenden Beziehung selbständig Bestand hätte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Trennung von Setzen und Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wesen, dessen Selbstgleichheit ohne Selbstaufhebung gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird ein nicht gesetzter Anfang, der der Reflexion als unverfügbare Grundlage vorausginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich wird eine vollständige Absonderung des Wesens von der Bewegung seines Erscheinens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich wird eine nichtzirkuläre Fundierung, in der Voraussetzung und Resultat endgültig auseinanderfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich wird eine reine Immanenz, die das Moment des Anderen restlos tilgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX5","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Bestimmung, in der die Reflexion ausschließlich innere Reflexion und zugleich ohne vorausgesetzte Unmittelbarkeit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX6","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine abschließende Auflösung der Spannung zwischen der erzeugten Unmittelbarkeit und ihrer Bestimmung als Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS1","text":"Selbstbezug der Negativität → Selbstnegation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS2","text":"Selbstnegation → aufgehobene Negativität = Gleichheit mit sich = Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS3","text":"Unmittelbarkeit als Rückkehr → Gesetztsein als reflektierte Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS4","text":"Gesetztsein → Aufhebung des Negativen und seiner Unmittelbarkeit → Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS5","text":"Voraussetzen → Bestimmung der Rückkehr als Negatives ihrer selbst → Wesen als Aufhebung dieses Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS6","text":"Vorgefundene Unmittelbarkeit → Verlassen derselben → aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit → Ankommen des Wesens bei sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS7","text":"Ankommen bei sich → Aufheben seiner selbst → selbstabstoßende Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS8","text":"Setzen und Voraussetzen als wechselseitige Umkehrung → absoluter Gegenstoß → Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS9","text":"Gesetzte Rückkehr als Negatives gegen ein Anderes → Reflexion als äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF1","text":"Schein als scheinbarer Anfang → auf sich bezogene Negativität → Selbstnegation → Unmittelbarkeit als Rückkehr → Gesetztsein → Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF2","text":"Voraussetzen → Rückkehr in das aufgehobene Vorgefundene → Ankommen des Wesens bei sich → Aufheben dieses Ankommens → absoluter Gegenstoß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF3","text":"Selbstbewegung der Reflexion → erzeugte Unmittelbarkeit als Anderes → Beginn von diesem Anderen → äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME1","text":"Der Anfang wird von einer ursprünglichen Gegebenheit zu einem Effekt der Rückkehr umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME2","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird von einer vorausliegenden Grundlage zu reflektiertem Gesetztsein umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME3","text":"Setzen und Voraussetzen werden als reziproke Funktionen derselben Bewegung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME4","text":"Das Vorgefundene wird als nur durch sein Verlassen bestimmbar kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME5","text":"Bewegung wird nicht mehr als lineares Fortschreiten, sondern als Gegenstoß und Selbstbewegung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME6","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird als eine aus der inneren Reflexionsstruktur hervorgehende Bestimmung neu eingeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME7","text":"Wesen wird von einem verborgenen Träger zu einer operativen Rückkehrbewegung umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Schein, Unmittelbarkeit, Negativität, Setzen und Voraussetzen bilden die expliziten Bestimmungen der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Begriffe werden durch die rekursive Relation von Aufhebung, Rückkehr, Gesetztsein und Voraussetzung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text verschiebt die Analyse vom scheinbaren Ausgangspunkt auf die Operation, durch die dieser Ausgangspunkt erst hervorgebracht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Sein und Wesen werden als selbstbezügliche Negativität bestimmt; Priorität erscheint als logische Rückläufigkeit und nicht als zeitliche Abfolge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Selbstnegation über Gesetztsein und Voraussetzen zum absoluten Gegenstoß zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie der Schein über diese Bewegungsstruktur hinaus zum Wesen bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner der genaue Status des Anderen, das zunächst nicht unabhängig bestehen darf, am Ende aber als Gegenüber der Reflexion erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent als reziproke Bewegung von Setzen und Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT5","text":"Ihre zentrale Bruchlinie liegt in der Doppelbestimmung der Unmittelbarkeit als erzeugte Rückkehr und als vorausgesetztes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Rekonstruktion ist die Ableitung der Selbstbewegung aus der Umkehrung von Setzen und Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der Mehrfachfunktion des Aufhebens als Negation, Erhaltung und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die abschließende Bestimmung als äußere Reflexion nicht in reine Selbstimmanenz aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110251162085Z_45d7f98a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1. Positing Reflection.","source_sha256":"5a5f089cc7cf2db8d99731d52fe49cd4671fca26780b1f4a4740078f60c63e32","sha256":"72c775f57be6501da528f2f5cd3808709164fa211a03608ccce4c23854a0dcfa","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:02:51.163050+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS1","text":"The text determines the problem of apparent immediacy, whose being does not precede, but proceeds from the return of negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS2","text":"The central thesis is that reflection is the self-negating negativity as the unity of negativity, self-equality, and immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS3","text":"Reflection is reconstructed not as a transition between given determinations, but as the sublation of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS4","text":"From the return of negativity, reflection produces immediacy as positedness and thereby presupposes what it has itself brought forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS5","text":"This reversal of positing and presupposing constitutes the reflective movement as absolute recoil and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the determination of reflection as external reflection, because the produced immediacy at the same time remains determined as an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A1","text":"Semblance has its being not in an Other, but in its own self-equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A2","text":"Self-related negativity negates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A3","text":"Self-negating negativity is at the same time sublated negativity and simple self-equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A4","text":"Reflection is the movement from nothing to nothing and thus negation coinciding with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A5","text":"The movement of reflection is not a transition of negation into an equality external to it, but the sublation of transition itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A6","text":"Immediacy is the equality of the negative with itself and therefore self-negating equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","text":"The relation of the negative to itself is return into itself; immediacy exists only as this return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","text":"Immediacy, as pure determinacy or as self-reflecting immediacy, is positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","text":"Reflection does not return from an independently existing Other, but is only return and negativity of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","text":"As negation of the negative, reflection sublates immediacy as its Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","text":"The sublation of positing within positing is presupposing, and the sublation of presupposition is in turn presupposition itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A12","text":"In presupposing, reflection determines its return as the negative of itself, whose sublation is essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","text":"Immediacy emerges only as return, while the semblance of a beginning is negated through this return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A14","text":"What is found is only thereby that it is left; its immediacy is sublated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","text":"The going beyond immediacy and the arriving at it are the same movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:A16","text":"Reflection is itself and its non-being and is itself only insofar as it is the negative of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX1","text":"The being of semblance is not grounded in an external substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX2","text":"Reflection is not a transition into an equality separate from negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX3","text":"Return presupposes no independently existing object of departure or destination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX4","text":"Immediacy is not an original, reflectionless beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX5","text":"What is found possesses no immediacy independent of its being left.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX6","text":"Going beyond immediacy is not a linear removal from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX7","text":"Reflection is not pure identity without negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX8","text":"Essence is not an unmediated substrate resting behind semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:NX9","text":"Positing and presupposing are not acts isolated from one another or occurring successively in time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D1","text":"Immediacy cannot function as a preceding foundation of reflection, because it arises only through the return of the negative.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D2","text":"The beginning of reflection is an effect of its return and not an independent presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D3","text":"Reflection produces its presupposition by determining the immediacy posited by it as presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D4","text":"Essence is not a preceding being, but the return in which sublated immediacy comes to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A12","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D5","text":"Arriving at itself is at the same time the sublation of itself and thus self-repelling, presupposing reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D6","text":"Reflective movement is self-movement because its going forth immediately reverses into return and its going out into arriving.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D7","text":"Immediacy is determined as the Other of reflection, although it exists only as its posited and sublated return.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:D8","text":"Reflection therefore determines itself as external reflection because it begins from an immediacy as its Other.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A8","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD1","text":"The condition of reflection is a retrospective product of reflection itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD2","text":"The difference between positing and presupposing designates not two processes, but the double function of the same movement of return.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A11","CH_GB18_1DSR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD3","text":"Immediacy and mediation, identity and negativity are not separate in the system, but are mutually constituted through the same reflective movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A3","CH_GB18_1DSR:A6","CH_GB18_1DSR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD4","text":"The linear order of departure, transition, and arrival is replaced by a recursive order of absolute recoil.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A5","CH_GB18_1DSR:A13","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD5","text":"External reflection appears as an internally produced form of self-relation, not as a mere exit from it.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A15","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SD6","text":"The system holds immediacy fast both as its own return and as the Other of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DSR:A7","CH_GB18_1DSR:A9","CH_GB18_1DSR:A10","CH_GB18_1DSR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an independent ground that exists before reflection and sustains its movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an original immediacy that is not determined only through sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a linear causal order in which reflection proceeds from a given beginning to a separate result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an identity not mediated through self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an Other that would subsist independently outside the reflective relation itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a final separation of positing and presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:DNX7","text":"Excluded is an essence whose self-equality would be given without self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an unposited beginning that would precede reflection as an unavailable foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a complete separation of essence from the movement of its appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a non-circular grounding in which presupposition and result finally fall apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX4","text":"Impossible is a pure immanence that entirely effaces the moment of the Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX5","text":"Unavailable remains a determination in which reflection would be exclusively internal reflection and at the same time without presupposed immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:SNX6","text":"Blocked remains a conclusive resolution of the tension between produced immediacy and its determination as Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS1","text":"Self-relation of negativity → self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS2","text":"Self-negation → sublated negativity = self-equality = immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS3","text":"Immediacy as return → positedness as reflected determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS4","text":"Positedness → sublation of the negative and its immediacy → presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS5","text":"Presupposing → determination of return as the negative of itself → essence as sublation of this negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS6","text":"Found immediacy → leaving it → sublated immediacy → essence's arriving at itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS7","text":"Arriving at itself → sublation of itself → self-repelling presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS8","text":"Positing and presupposing as reciprocal reversal → absolute recoil → self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:FGS9","text":"Posited return as negative against an Other → reflection as external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF1","text":"Semblance as apparent beginning → self-related negativity → self-negation → immediacy as return → positedness → presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF2","text":"Presupposing → return into the sublated found → essence's arriving at itself → sublation of this arriving → absolute recoil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:AF3","text":"Self-movement of reflection → produced immediacy as Other → beginning from this Other → external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME1","text":"The beginning is remapped from an original givenness to an effect of return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME2","text":"Immediacy is reclassified from a preceding foundation to reflected positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME3","text":"Positing and presupposing become visible as reciprocal functions of the same movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME4","text":"What is found is mapped as determinable only through its being left.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME5","text":"Movement is no longer organized as linear progression, but as recoil and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME6","text":"Externality is reclassified as a determination arising from the inner structure of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ME7","text":"Essence is redefined from a hidden substrate into an operative movement of return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Semblance, immediacy, negativity, positing, and presupposing form the explicit determinations of the movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The concepts are organized through the recursive relation of sublation, return, positedness, and presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text shifts the analysis from the apparent point of departure to the operation through which this point of departure is first produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being and essence are determined as self-related negativity; priority appears as logical retroactivity and not as temporal succession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from self-negation through positedness and presupposing to absolute recoil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how semblance is determined as essence beyond this movemental structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT3","text":"Also underdetermined remains the precise status of the Other, which at first may not exist independently, but at the end appears as the opposite of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent as the reciprocal movement of positing and presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT5","text":"Its central fault line lies in the double determination of immediacy as produced return and as presupposed Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT6","text":"The strongest point of the reconstruction is the derivation of self-movement from the reversal of positing and presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on the multiple function of sublation as negation, preservation, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DSR:MRT8","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved provided that the concluding determination as external reflection is not dissolved into pure self-immanence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DSR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DSR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_1DSR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 106","title":"1. Positing Reflection.","context":"Chapter 106","original_title":"1. Die setzende Reflexion."},"original_title":"1. Die setzende Reflexion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR","layer":"CH","title":"2. External Reflection.","order":107,"parents":["RAW_GB18_2DUR"],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DUR@R001","sha256":"3248332961e2be4e0d859af9a6d745f7d9606c0cbf6ea504759fc164920aaa43","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS1","text":"Die äußere Reflexion erscheint als von einem unmittelbar gegebenen Sein ausgehende Bewegung, deren Verhältnis zu diesem Sein zunächst äußerlich bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS2","text":"Das vorausgesetzte Unmittelbare ist nur dadurch vorausgesetzt, daß die Reflexion ihr eigenes Setzen unmittelbar aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS3","text":"Indem die äußere Reflexion das Unmittelbare als ihr Negatives bestimmt, negiert sie zugleich diese Bestimmung und setzt damit das Unmittelbare als mit ihr identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS4","text":"Die anfängliche Äußerlichkeit der Reflexion erweist sich als Selbstverhältnis des Unmittelbaren, weil das vorausgesetzte Andere erst im reflektierenden Anfang gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS5","text":"Die Aufhebung der Trennung von Reflexion und Unmittelbarkeit erzeugt wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit und überführt äußere Reflexion in immanente, bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS6","text":"Die Kantische reflektierende Urteilskraft bildet eine besondere Gestalt äußerer Reflexion, enthält aber implizit den Übergang zur absoluten Reflexion, sofern ihr Allgemeines als Wesen des Gegebenen gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","text":"Reflexion ist wesentlich Setzen und zugleich Aufheben ihres Setzens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","text":"Die Voraussetzung der äußeren Reflexion ist das durch aufgehobenes Setzen hervorgebrachte Unmittelbare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","text":"Das vorausgesetzte Unmittelbare gilt zunächst als selbstbezügliches Reales und nicht bloß als Moment des Gesetztseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","text":"Die äußere Reflexion verhält sich zu ihrer Voraussetzung als zu ihrem Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","text":"Das Negative der Reflexion ist nur als aufgehobenes Negatives wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","text":"Die Bestimmungen, welche äußere Reflexion am Unmittelbaren setzt, erscheinen zunächst als dem Unmittelbaren äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","text":"Das Negieren des Unmittelbaren ist zugleich Negieren der eigenen negierenden Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","text":"Das Unmittelbare wird durch Reflexion als ihr Anderes bestimmt, aber diese Bestimmung wird von derselben Reflexion negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","text":"Das aufgehobene Gegenüber von Reflexion und Unmittelbarkeit ist wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","text":"Was die setzende Reflexion hervorbringt, ist das an und für sich seiende Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","text":"Die reflektierende Urteilskraft sucht zu einem gegebenen Besonderen ein Allgemeines und bleibt daher zunächst äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A12","text":"Das Allgemeine, zu dem Reflexion fortgeht, gilt als Wesen des Unmittelbaren, von dem sie ausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A13","text":"Reflektierte Bestimmungen beanspruchen An-und-Fürsichsein und erhalten sich deshalb gegen ihre gegenseitige Bewegung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX1","text":"Reflexion ist nicht lediglich subjektive Tätigkeit des Bewußtseins oder der Urteilskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX2","text":"Das vorausgesetzte Unmittelbare ist nicht schlechthin unabhängig von Reflexion gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX3","text":"Die Bestimmung des Unmittelbaren bleibt nicht endgültig eine ihm äußerliche Zutat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX4","text":"Äußere Reflexion ist nicht dauerhaft bloß formelles, vom fremden Inhalt abhängiges Tun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX5","text":"Das Unmittelbare ist nicht bloß ein erstes, festes Fundament, das dem Rückgang der Reflexion unverändert vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX6","text":"Das Allgemeine ist nicht nur eine abstrakte Regel über einem äußerlich vorliegenden Besonderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX7","text":"Die Entgegensetzung von äußerer Reflexion und absoluter Betrachtung ist nicht schlechthin gültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX8","text":"Wesentliche reflektierte Bestimmungen sind nicht bloß flüchtige Bestimmungen des unmittelbaren Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D1","text":"Die Voraussetzung ist kein vorreflexiver Ausgangspunkt, sondern das Resultat der Selbstaufhebung des Setzens.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D2","text":"Die äußere Reflexion erzeugt ihr eigenes Gegenüber, indem sie das Unmittelbare als Negatives bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D3","text":"Die Negation des Unmittelbaren zerstört dieses nicht, sondern hebt seine Fremdheit gegenüber der Reflexion auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D4","text":"Das Unmittelbare wird als dasjenige gesetzt, was es zunächst nur an sich oder für die äußere Reflexion war: Reflexion selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D5","text":"Die Bewegung von gegebenem Besonderen zu Allgemeinem enthält eine Umdeutung des Besonderen als Erscheinung seines Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D6","text":"Bestimmende Reflexion ist nicht die Anwendung äußerer Kategorien auf ein fertiges Objekt, sondern die Setzung des wesentlichen Seins des Objekts.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D7","text":"Reflektierte Bestimmungen erzeugen eine eigentümliche Starrheit, weil ihr Anspruch auf Wesenheit ihre Beweglichkeit in Gegensätze verdeckt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Alternative von gegebenem Sein und reflektierender Form durch eine rekursive Struktur, in der das Gegebene nur als Resultat seines reflektierenden Bezugs erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD2","text":"Die immanente Wahrheit äußerer Reflexion besteht nicht in der Abschaffung des Unmittelbaren, sondern in seiner Requalifikation als wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD3","text":"Die Kantische Reflexion wird zugleich begrenzt und integriert: Sie bleibt als Suche nach einem gegebenen Allgemeinen äußerlich, enthält aber die absolute Struktur, sofern das Allgemeine als Wesen gilt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD4","text":"Der Anspruch reflektierter Bestimmungen auf Selbständigkeit ist zugleich die Bedingung ihrer notwendigen Vermittlung, weil ihre getrennte Identität gegenseitige Voraussetzung einschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme eines absolut voraussetzungslosen Anfangs mit einem von Reflexion unberührten Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, Erkenntnis füge einem in sich voll bestimmten Gegenstand nur nachträgliche Prädikate hinzu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, Negation sei ein einseitiger Vernichtungsakt statt eine Bewegung, die ihre eigene Bestimmung zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, Wesen und Erscheinung seien zwei selbständige Seinsbereiche, die nur äußerlich verbunden werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX5","text":"Falsch sein muß die Annahme, reflektierte Bestimmungen könnten als endgültig isolierte Wesenseinheiten gelten, obwohl sie sich gegenseitig voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine unbedingte Exteriorität, in der Reflexion und ihr Gegenstand dauerhaft als voneinander unabhängige Seiten bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unmittelbares Sein, das als Ursprung fungiert, ohne selbst durch die Bewegung seiner Voraussetzung vermittelt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wesen, das hinter dem Unmittelbaren als separates Jenseits liegt; Wesen ist nur als dessen reflektierte Wahrheit wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine finale Ruhe reflektierter Bestimmungen, weil ihr behauptetes An-und-Fürsichsein durch wechselseitige Voraussetzung strukturell unterlaufen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS1","text":"Selbstaufhebendes Setzen erzeugt Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS2","text":"Voraussetzung erscheint als selbstbezügliches Unmittelbares und negatives Gegenüber der Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS3","text":"Die Reflexion bestimmt das Unmittelbare als Anderes und negiert die Fremdheit dieser Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS4","text":"Das negierte Gegenüber geht als wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit mit der Reflexion zusammen.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS5","text":"Die aufgehobene Äußerlichkeit qualifiziert Reflexion als immanente Bestimmung des Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS6","text":"Die reflektierte Wesensbestimmung stabilisiert sich als An-und-Fürsichsein und produziert dadurch die Spannung von Selbständigkeit und wechselseitiger Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF1","text":"Die scheinbare Gegebenheit eines Unmittelbaren wird als Voraussetzung äußerer Reflexion angesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF2","text":"Die Voraussetzung wird als negatives Gegenüber der Reflexion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF3","text":"Die Reflexion negiert ihr eigenes Bestimmen des Unmittelbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF4","text":"Die Negation der Negation hebt die Äußerlichkeit zwischen Reflexion und Unmittelbarkeit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF5","text":"Das Unmittelbare wird als wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit und als durch Reflexion gesetztes Wesen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF6","text":"Die bestimmende Reflexion tritt als Form hervor, in der wesentliche Bestimmungen zugleich selbständig erscheinen und ihre Vermittlung verdecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen vorausgesetztem Gegenstand und reflektierender Tätigkeit wird als interne Differenz einer einzigen Selbstvermittlungsbewegung kartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME2","text":"Das Unmittelbare wird von einem bloß ersten Realen zu einer wesentlichen Unmittelbarkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME3","text":"Die Opposition von formaler Reflexion und absolutem Wesen wird in einen Übergang überführt, in dem die äußere Form ihre immanente Wahrheit freilegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME4","text":"Die Kantische Differenz von reflektierender und bestimmender Urteilskraft wird als lokale Gestalt eines allgemeineren Reflexionsmechanismus eingeordnet.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME5","text":"Wesenhafte Bestimmtheit wird nicht als reine Stabilität, sondern als spannungsvolle Einheit von Selbständigkeit, Gegensatz und wechselseitiger Voraussetzung sichtbar.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Reflexion beginnt bei einem als gegeben erscheinenden Unmittelbaren und sucht oder setzt dessen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Voraussetzung, Setzen und Aufheben bilden keine getrennten Operationen, sondern die rekursive Struktur, durch welche das Unmittelbare als Gegenüber entsteht und aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik der äußeren Reflexion wird nicht durch ihre Verwerfung vollzogen, sondern durch den Nachweis, daß ihre eigene Operation in immanente Bestimmung übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Erste ist nicht zeitlich oder ontologisch ursprünglich, sondern wird retrospektiv als durch seine eigene Aufhebung gesetzte Voraussetzung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wesen ist nicht ein hinter dem Seienden liegender Bestand, sondern das Sein des Unmittelbaren, sofern dieses als reflektiert gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von äußerer Voraussetzung über selbstnegierende Bestimmung zu immanenter Reflexion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt unterbestimmt hinsichtlich der systematischen Ableitung, durch welche die äußere Reflexion aus der absoluten Reflexion hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, daß Voraussetzung nicht außerhalb des Setzens verbleibt, sondern als dessen aufgehobenes Resultat begriffen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umkehrung des gegebenen Unmittelbaren in ein von Reflexion selbst gesetztes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Bruchlinie bleibt bestehen, weil das Unmittelbare zunächst als selbstbezügliches Reales gelten muß, obwohl es nachträglich als Produkt reflexiver Vermittlung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, daß reflektierte Bestimmungen zugleich als wesentliche Selbständigkeiten und als wechselseitig vorausgesetzte Momente bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT7","text":"Die Kant-Lektüre bleibt komprimiert, weil die reflektierende Urteilskraft zugleich als bloß äußerlich und als Trägerin des Begriffs absoluter Reflexion erscheint, ohne daß der Übergang vollständig vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung nur dann, wenn sie die Selbstaufhebung des Setzens als produktive und nicht als bloß eliminative Negation behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110420970601Z_75d2eedd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2. External Reflection.","source_sha256":"3248332961e2be4e0d859af9a6d745f7d9606c0cbf6ea504759fc164920aaa43","sha256":"a16f7e8995e7bddc6f31d8c8745c45d5963d0051336b4c84bf039f9459482dd6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:04:20.971885+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS1","text":"External reflection appears as a movement proceeding from an immediately given being, whose relation to this being initially remains external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS2","text":"The presupposed immediate is presupposed only because reflection immediately sublates its own positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS3","text":"In determining the immediate as its negative, external reflection simultaneously negates this determination and thereby posits the immediate as identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS4","text":"The initial externality of reflection proves to be the self-relation of the immediate, because the presupposed other is first posited in the reflective beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS5","text":"The sublation of the separation between reflection and immediacy produces essential immediacy and transforms external reflection into immanent, determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AS6","text":"Kantian reflective judgment constitutes a particular form of external reflection, but implicitly contains the transition to absolute reflection insofar as its universal counts as the essence of the given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","text":"Reflection is essentially positing and at the same time the sublation of its positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","text":"The presupposition of external reflection is the immediate produced through sublated positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","text":"The presupposed immediate initially counts as self-related reality and not merely as a moment of being-posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","text":"External reflection relates to its presupposition as to its negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","text":"The negative of reflection is effective only as a sublated negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","text":"The determinations that external reflection posits in the immediate initially appear as external to the immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","text":"The negation of the immediate is at the same time the negation of its own negating determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","text":"The immediate is determined by reflection as its other, but this determination is negated by that same reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","text":"The sublated opposition of reflection and immediacy is essential immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","text":"What positing reflection produces is essence that is in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","text":"Reflective judgment seeks a universal for a given particular and therefore initially remains external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A12","text":"The universal to which reflection proceeds counts as the essence of the immediate from which it proceeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:A13","text":"Reflected determinations lay claim to being-in-and-for-itself and therefore preserve themselves as separate against their reciprocal movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX1","text":"Reflection is not merely the subjective activity of consciousness or judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX2","text":"The presupposed immediate is not given as wholly independent of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX3","text":"The determination of the immediate does not ultimately remain an addition external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX4","text":"External reflection is not enduringly a merely formal activity dependent on alien content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX5","text":"The immediate is not merely a first, fixed foundation that precedes the regress of reflection unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX6","text":"The universal is not merely an abstract rule above an externally given particular.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX7","text":"The opposition of external reflection and absolute consideration is not unconditionally valid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:NX8","text":"Essential reflected determinations are not merely fleeting determinations of immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D1","text":"The presupposition is not a pre-reflective starting point, but the result of the self-sublation of positing.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D2","text":"External reflection produces its own counterpart by determining the immediate as negative.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D3","text":"The negation of the immediate does not destroy it, but sublates its alienness in relation to reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D4","text":"The immediate is posited as that which it initially was only in itself or for external reflection: reflection itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D5","text":"The movement from the given particular to the universal contains a reinterpretation of the particular as the appearance of its essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D6","text":"Determining reflection is not the application of external categories to a finished object, but the positing of the object's essential being.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:D7","text":"Reflected determinations produce a peculiar rigidity because their claim to essentiality conceals their mobility into opposites.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD1","text":"The system replaces the alternative of given being and reflective form with a recursive structure in which the given appears only as the result of its reflective relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD2","text":"The immanent truth of external reflection consists not in the abolition of the immediate, but in its requalification as essential immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD3","text":"Kantian reflection is at once limited and integrated: it remains external as a search for a given universal, but contains the absolute structure insofar as the universal counts as essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SD4","text":"The claim of reflected determinations to independence is at the same time the condition of their necessary mediation, because their separate identity includes reciprocal presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A4","CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX1","text":"The assumption of an absolutely presuppositionless beginning with a being untouched by reflection must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX2","text":"The assumption that cognition merely adds subsequent predicates to an object fully determined in itself must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX3","text":"The assumption that negation is a one-sided act of annihilation rather than a movement that retracts its own determination must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX4","text":"The assumption that essence and appearance are two independent spheres of being that could be connected only externally must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:DNX5","text":"The assumption that reflected determinations could count as definitively isolated units of essence, although they presuppose one another, must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an unconditional externality in which reflection and its object permanently subsist as mutually independent sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an immediate being that functions as origin without itself being mediated through the movement of its presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an essence lying behind the immediate as a separate beyond; essence is effective only as its reflected truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final repose of reflected determinations, because their asserted being-in-and-for-itself is structurally undermined by reciprocal presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS1","text":"Self-sublating positing produces presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A1","CH_GB18_2DUR:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS2","text":"Presupposition appears as self-related immediacy and as the negative counterpart of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS3","text":"Reflection determines the immediate as other and negates the alienness of this determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A7","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS4","text":"The negated counterpart unites with reflection as essential immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A5","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS5","text":"The sublated externality qualifies reflection as the immanent determination of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A9","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:FGS6","text":"The reflected determination of essence stabilizes itself as being-in-and-for-itself and thereby produces the tension between independence and reciprocal presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF1","text":"The apparent givenness of an immediate is posited as the presupposition of external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF2","text":"The presupposition is determined as the negative counterpart of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF3","text":"Reflection negates its own determination of the immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF4","text":"The negation of negation sublates the externality between reflection and immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF5","text":"The immediate is determined as essential immediacy and as essence posited through reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:AF6","text":"Determining reflection emerges as the form in which essential determinations at once appear independent and conceal their mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME1","text":"The distinction between presupposed object and reflective activity is mapped as the internal difference of a single movement of self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A2","CH_GB18_2DUR:A8","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME2","text":"The immediate is reclassified from a merely first reality into an essential immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A3","CH_GB18_2DUR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME3","text":"The opposition of formal reflection and absolute essence is transformed into a transition in which external form discloses its immanent truth.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A6","CH_GB18_2DUR:A10","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME4","text":"The Kantian distinction between reflective and determining judgment is situated as a local form of a more general mechanism of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A11","CH_GB18_2DUR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ME5","text":"Essential determinacy becomes visible not as pure stability, but as a tension-filled unity of independence, opposition, and reciprocal presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DUR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Reflection begins with an immediate that appears to be given and seeks or posits its determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Presupposition, positing, and sublation do not constitute separate operations, but the recursive structure through which the immediate arises and is sublated as a counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique of external reflection is not accomplished through its rejection, but through demonstrating that its own operation passes over into immanent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The first is not temporally or ontologically original, but is retrospectively determined as a presupposition posited through its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Essence is not a subsistence lying behind being, but the being of the immediate insofar as it is posited as reflected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from external presupposition through self-negating determination to immanent reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the systematic derivation through which external reflection proceeds from absolute reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on presupposition not remaining outside positing, but being comprehended as its sublated result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the reversal of the given immediate into an other posited by reflection itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT5","text":"A structural fault line remains, because the immediate must initially count as self-related reality, although it subsequently appears as the product of reflective mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT6","text":"A further tension consists in reflected determinations being determined at once as essential independences and as mutually presupposed moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT7","text":"The reading of Kant remains compressed, because reflective judgment appears at once as merely external and as the bearer of the concept of absolute reflection, without the transition being fully mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DUR:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement only if it treats the self-sublation of positing as productive and not as merely eliminative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DUR:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DUR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_2DUR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 107","title":"2. External Reflection.","context":"Chapter 107","original_title":"2. Die äußere Reflexion."},"original_title":"2. Die äußere Reflexion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0","layer":"CH","title":"3. Determining Reflection.","order":108,"parents":["RAW_GB18_3BR0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_3BR0@R001","sha256":"0392d34dea128b7d0e229feb2eb3158442e0005d322b772c09ece9171f4f2bd4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS1","text":"Die bestimmende Reflexion muss die Unmittelbarkeit des äußeren Anfangs und die voraussetzungslose Negativität des Setzens in einer Einheit vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS2","text":"Das bloß setzende Bestimmen bleibt unvollständig, weil seine Bestimmung zunächst nur Gesetztes und nicht ihre eigene vollzogene Reflexion ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS3","text":"Gesetztsein überführt Dasein aus der Sphäre des unmittelbaren Seins in eine Negativität, deren Boden das Wesen als reine Negativität ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS4","text":"Die Einheit von Setzen und äußerer Reflexion macht das Voraussetzen zur Operation, durch welche Gesetztsein als in sich reflektierte Negation zur Reflexionsbestimmung wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS5","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung gewinnt Bestand, weil ihre Negation nicht im Anderen vergeht, sondern in die Gleichheit der Reflexion mit sich zurückgenommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS6","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmung ist zugleich gesetzte Negation und in sich reflektiertes Bestehen; ihre Bestimmtheit besteht daher als Beziehung ihres Andersseins auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","text":"Bestimmende Reflexion ist die Einheit von setzender und äußerer Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A2","text":"Äußere Reflexion beginnt vom unmittelbaren Sein, während setzende Reflexion vom Nichts beginnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A3","text":"Setzende Reflexion hat keine Voraussetzung, setzt ihre Bestimmung aber deshalb zunächst nur als Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A4","text":"Das Gesetzte ist nur als aufgehobenes Anderes und damit als Beziehung auf die Rückkehr in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","text":"Dasein ist in der Sphäre des Wesens nur Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A6","text":"Gesetztsein vermittelt Dasein und Wesen, indem es Dasein als negative Beziehung auf das Wesen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A7","text":"Die Einheit von Setzen und äußerer Reflexion ist absolutes Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","text":"Vorausgesetztes Gesetztsein ist Negation als in sich reflektierte Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung gründet nicht im Sein, sondern im Reflektiertsein in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","text":"Die Gleichheit der Reflexion mit sich gibt der Negation als Gesetztem ihr Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung ist zugleich Gesetztsein und Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A12","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmung enthält ihr Anderssein als ihre eigene Negation und bezieht dieses Anderssein auf sich selbst zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX1","text":"Bestimmende Reflexion ist nicht bloß äußere Reflexion, weil sie nicht bei einem vorausgesetzten unmittelbaren Sein verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX2","text":"Bestimmende Reflexion ist nicht bloßes Setzen, weil voraussetzungsloses Setzen zunächst nur eine gesetzte, noch nicht vollendete Bestimmung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX3","text":"Gesetztsein ist nicht unmittelbares Dasein, weil seine Negation nicht als seiende, sondern unmittelbar als aufgehobene bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX4","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung ist nicht Qualität, weil Qualität ihre Negation auf dem Boden des Seins trägt und in ihr Anderes übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX5","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung ist nicht eine ruhende Bestimmtheit, die äußerlich auf ein Anderes bezogen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX6","text":"Das Anderssein der Reflexionsbestimmung ist nicht ein von ihr ausgeschlossener Gegenstand, sondern ihre eigene aufgehobene Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D1","text":"Das Setzen erzeugt Bestimmtheit nur als rückkehrbedürftige Unmittelbarkeit; seine Vollendung verlangt die Vermittlung durch äußere Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A2","CH_GB18_3BR0:A3","CH_GB18_3BR0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D2","text":"Gesetztsein ist höher als unmittelbares Dasein, weil es Dasein ausdrücklich als negative Beziehung auf seine Rückkehr in das Wesen fasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D3","text":"Voraussetzen ist keine bloße Vorfindlichkeit, sondern das Selbstabstoßen der Reflexion, durch das sie ihre Bestimmtheit als ihre eigene setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","CH_GB18_3BR0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D4","text":"Die Bestimmung wird wesentlich, sofern ihre Negation durch Selbstgleichheit getragen ist und daher nicht in äußerem Anderssein verschwindet.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D5","text":"Der bestimmte Schein des Wesens besteht aus fixierten Bestimmungen, deren Gesetztsein und Übergehen der Reflexion in sich unterworfen sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D6","text":"Das Bestehen der Reflexionsbestimmung ist nicht von ihrem Gesetztsein, sondern von dessen Aufgehobensein in der Reflexion in sich abhängig.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A4","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD1","text":"Das Wesen erscheint nicht hinter oder jenseits der Bestimmungen, sondern nur in deren Status als aufgehobene, auf sich zurückkehrende Negationen.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A6","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD2","text":"Bestimmtheit wird im Übergang vom Sein zum Wesen von einer vergänglichen Differenz zu einer selbsttragenden Differenz transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD3","text":"Die Freiheit der Reflexionsbestimmungen ist keine Unabhängigkeit vom Negativen, sondern ihre vollständige Internalisierung des Negativen als Bedingung ihres Bestehens.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD4","text":"Bestimmende Reflexion produziert eine Ordnung, in der jede bestimmte Seite nur durch ihre immanente Beziehung auf ihre eigene Negation wesentlich ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Bestimmungen durch einen positiven, ihnen äußerlichen Seinsgrund dauerhaft getragen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Negation bloßer Mangel, bloßes Nichtsein oder bloßer Übergang in ein fremdes Anderes bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung, in der Wesen und Erscheinung, Bestimmtheit und Reflexion oder Gesetztsein und Bestehen selbständige Sphären bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Reflexion, die ihr Vorausgesetztes als unabhängig gegebene Grenze anerkennen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein schlechthin erstes Positives, das der Reflexion vorausläge und von ihrer Negativität unberührt bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Anderssein, das als irreduzibel äußerlich bestehen könnte, ohne in die Selbstbeziehung der Reflexion zurückgenommen zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX3","text":"Nicht zulässig ist eine Bestimmung, deren Identität ohne die Aufhebung ihres eigenen Gesetztseins begriffen werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Sein und Nichts erzeugen die getrennten Anfangsformen äußerer Reflexion und setzender Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS2","text":"Setzen ohne Voraussetzung → bloßes Gesetztsein → Rückkehrbedürftigkeit der gesetzten Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS3","text":"Äußere Reflexion + Setzen → absolutes Voraussetzen → Gesetztsein als in sich reflektierte Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS4","text":"In sich reflektierte Negation → Selbstgleichheit im Negiertsein → Bestand der Bestimmung unabhängig vom Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS5","text":"Gesetztsein + Reflexion in sich → Anderssein als eigene Negation → Reflexionsbestimmung als wesentliche Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS6","text":"Wesentliche Selbstbeziehung → bestimmter Schein → Erscheinung des Wesens als fixierte Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF1","text":"Die Unvollständigkeit bloßen Setzens → die Differenz von Sein und Nichts als Reflexionsanfänge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF2","text":"Die Differenz der Anfänge → Gesetztsein als Vermittlung von Dasein und Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF3","text":"Gesetztsein als bloße Negation → Einheit von Setzen und äußerer Reflexion im Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF4","text":"Vorausgesetzte Negation → Reflexionsbestimmung als in sich reflektierte Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF5","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung → Abgrenzung von Qualität und Übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF6","text":"Internalisierung des Andersseins → Bestimmung als unendliche Beziehung auf sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME1","text":"Dasein wird nicht als primäre positive Gegebenheit, sondern als im Wesen reduziertes Gesetztsein kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von äußerer und innerer Reflexion wird in eine Einheit überführt, deren äußerer Pol selbst als Operation des Voraussetzens erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME3","text":"Negation wird von einem Moment des Verschwindens zu einem Träger wesentlicher Beständigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME4","text":"Anderssein wird nicht mehr als äußerer Gegenpol, sondern als immanente Struktur jeder Reflexionsbestimmung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME5","text":"Freiheit der Bestimmungen wird als Fixierung durch Selbstbeziehung, nicht als Ablösung von Vermittlung, bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist die Bestimmung der Reflexionsbestimmung aus der Einheit von setzender und äußerer Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Argument ersetzt den Seinsgrund der Bestimmung durch eine Struktur aufgehobener Negativität und rückkehrender Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse disqualifiziert alle Erklärungen, die Bestimmtheit entweder aus unmittelbarer Gegebenheit oder aus einem isolierten subjektiven Setzen ableiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein der Bestimmung wird als Vollzug ihrer Aufhebung bestimmt; ihre Identität besteht nur als fortgesetzte Rückkehr aus Anderssein in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Überführung von äußerer und setzender Reflexion in bestimmende Reflexion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt zentral an der Gleichsetzung des Gesetztseins mit aufgehobener Negation und an dessen Umwandlung in Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Einheit von Setzen und äußerer Reflexion ihre eigene Einheit begründet, ohne diese bereits vorauszusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste operative Verbindung liegt in der Differenzierung von Qualität und Reflexionsbestimmung durch ihre jeweiligen Gründe: Sein beziehungsweise Selbstreflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Freiheit der Reflexionsbestimmungen und ihrer vollständigen Abhängigkeit von der sie tragenden absoluten Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur, wenn Gesetztsein zugleich als notwendige Unmittelbarkeit und als aufzuhebendes Moment behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110605395635Z_c7798cdd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3. Determining Reflection.","source_sha256":"0392d34dea128b7d0e229feb2eb3158442e0005d322b772c09ece9171f4f2bd4","sha256":"c7e97b2f698048ea0ba3c7bff6fd670849c23019c39d32bc2285a8dd95616835","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:06:05.397411+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS1","text":"Determining reflection must mediate, in a unity, the immediacy of the external beginning and the presuppositionless negativity of positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS2","text":"Merely positing determination remains incomplete, because its determination is initially only posited and not its own accomplished reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS3","text":"Positedness transfers determinate being from the sphere of immediate being into a negativity whose ground is essence as pure negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS4","text":"The unity of positing and external reflection makes presupposing into the operation through which positedness, as negation reflected into itself, becomes reflection-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS5","text":"Reflection-determination acquires subsistence because its negation does not perish in the other, but is taken back into the equality of reflection with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AS6","text":"Reflection-determination is at once posited negation and existence reflected into itself; its determinacy therefore exists as the relation of its otherness to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","text":"Determining reflection is the unity of positing and external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A2","text":"External reflection begins from immediate being, whereas positing reflection begins from nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A3","text":"Positing reflection has no presupposition, but for that reason initially posits its determination only as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A4","text":"The posited is only as a sublated other and thus as a relation to the return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","text":"In the sphere of essence, determinate being is only positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A6","text":"Positedness mediates determinate being and essence by determining determinate being as a negative relation to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A7","text":"The unity of positing and external reflection is absolute presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","text":"Presupposed positedness is negation as negation reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","text":"Reflection-determination is grounded not in being, but in being reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","text":"The equality of reflection with itself gives negation, as posited, its subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","text":"Reflection-determination is at once positedness and reflection into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:A12","text":"Reflection-determination contains its otherness as its own negation and relates this otherness back to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX1","text":"Determining reflection is not merely external reflection, because it does not remain with a presupposed immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX2","text":"Determining reflection is not mere positing, because presuppositionless positing initially produces only a posited, not yet completed determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX3","text":"Positedness is not immediate determinate being, because its negation is determined not as being, but immediately as sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX4","text":"Reflection-determination is not quality, because quality bears its negation on the ground of being and passes over into its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX5","text":"Reflection-determination is not a resting determinacy externally related to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:NX6","text":"The otherness of reflection-determination is not an object excluded from it, but its own sublated negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D1","text":"Positing produces determinacy only as an immediacy requiring return; its completion demands mediation through external reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A2","CH_GB18_3BR0:A3","CH_GB18_3BR0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D2","text":"Positedness is higher than immediate determinate being, because it explicitly apprehends determinate being as a negative relation to its return into essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D3","text":"Presupposing is not mere givenness, but the self-repulsion of reflection through which it posits its determinacy as its own.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","CH_GB18_3BR0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D4","text":"Determination becomes essential insofar as its negation is borne by self-equality and therefore does not vanish into external otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D5","text":"The determinate semblance of essence consists of fixed determinations whose positedness and transition are subject to reflection into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:D6","text":"The subsistence of reflection-determination depends not on its positedness, but on the sublatedness of the latter in reflection into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A4","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD1","text":"Essence does not appear behind or beyond determinations, but only in their status as sublated negations returning into themselves.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A6","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD2","text":"In the transition from being to essence, determinacy is transformed from a transient difference into a self-sustaining difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A5","CH_GB18_3BR0:A9","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD3","text":"The freedom of reflection-determinations is not an independence from the negative, but their complete internalization of the negative as the condition of their subsistence.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A8","CH_GB18_3BR0:A10","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SD4","text":"Determining reflection produces an order in which every determinate side is essential only through its immanent relation to its own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3BR0:A1","CH_GB18_3BR0:A11","CH_GB18_3BR0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which determinations are durably borne by a positive ground of being external to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which negation remains mere lack, mere non-being, or mere transition into an alien other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a separation in which essence and appearance, determinacy and reflection, or positedness and subsistence constitute independent spheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a reflection that could acknowledge its presupposed as an independently given limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely first positive that would precede reflection and remain untouched by its negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an otherness that could subsist as irreducibly external without being taken back into the self-relation of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:SNX3","text":"Not admissible is a determination whose identity could be comprehended without the sublation of its own positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS1","text":"Immediate being and nothing generate the separate initial forms of external reflection and positing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS2","text":"Positing without presupposition → mere positedness → the need for return of the posited determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS3","text":"External reflection + positing → absolute presupposing → positedness as negation reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS4","text":"Negation reflected into itself → self-equality in being negated → subsistence of determination independent of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS5","text":"Positedness + reflection into itself → otherness as its own negation → reflection-determination as essential self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:FGS6","text":"Essential self-relation → determinate semblance → appearance of essence as fixed negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF1","text":"The incompleteness of mere positing → the difference of being and nothing as the beginnings of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF2","text":"The difference of the beginnings → positedness as mediation of determinate being and essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF3","text":"Positedness as mere negation → unity of positing and external reflection in presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF4","text":"Presupposed negation → reflection-determination as determinacy reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF5","text":"Reflection-determination → demarcation from quality and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:AF6","text":"Internalization of otherness → determination as infinite relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME1","text":"Determinate being is mapped not as primary positive givenness, but as positedness reduced within essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME2","text":"The opposition of external and internal reflection is transferred into a unity whose external pole itself appears as an operation of presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME3","text":"Negation is reclassified from a moment of vanishing into a bearer of essential persistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME4","text":"Otherness becomes visible no longer as an external counterpole, but as the immanent structure of every reflection-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ME5","text":"The freedom of determinations is determined as fixation through self-relation, not as detachment from mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit object is the determination of reflection-determination from the unity of positing and external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The argument replaces the ground of being of determination with a structure of sublated negativity and returning self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis disqualifies all explanations that derive determinacy either from immediate givenness or from an isolated subjective positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of determination is determined as the enactment of its sublation; its identity exists only as a continued return from otherness into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transformation of external and positing reflection into determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction centrally depends on the equation of positedness with sublated negation and on its transformation into reflection into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the unity of positing and external reflection grounds its own unity without already presupposing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT4","text":"The strongest operative connection lies in differentiating quality and reflection-determination through their respective grounds: being and self-reflection, respectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between the asserted freedom of reflection-determinations and their complete dependence on the absolute reflection that bears them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3BR0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if positedness is treated at once as necessary immediacy and as a moment to be sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3BR0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_3BR0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_3BR0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 108","title":"3. Determining Reflection.","context":"Chapter 108","original_title":"3. Bestimmende Reflexion."},"original_title":"3. Bestimmende Reflexion.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":109,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_26"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_26@R001","sha256":"7e6c802ac62b9156f4e3fbe48013bd10746afde59ff06a72da8ee30df70b3b81","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS1","text":"Der Text prüft, ob Reflexionsbestimmungen als unmittelbare, allgemeine und unwidersprechliche Denkgesetze gelten können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt das Wesen als bestimmte Reflexion, negative Einfachheit und absolute Vermittlung mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS3","text":"Die Reflexion erzeugt aus der Identität die Verschiedenheit, aus dieser den Gegensatz und aus dem Gegensatz den Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS4","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen werden von den qualitativen Bestimmungen des Seins durch ihre innere Beziehungsstruktur unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS5","text":"Ihre Formulierung als Sätze des Denkens erzwingt jedoch ein äußerliches Subjekt, wodurch das Sein wieder eingeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS6","text":"Die isolierten Denkgesetze erweisen sich deshalb als gegenseitig entgegengesetzt und aufhebend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS7","text":"Die Argumentation bewegt sich rekonstruktiv-dialektisch von der Bestimmung des Wesens über die Form des Gesetzes zur Aufdeckung ihres verborgenen Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A1","text":"Die Reflexion ist bestimmte Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A2","text":"Das Wesen ist das Scheinen des Wesens in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A3","text":"Das Wesen ist als unendliche Rückkehr in sich negative Einfachheit und absolute Vermittlung mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A4","text":"Die Momente der Vermittlung sind selbst in sich reflektierte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A5","text":"Das Wesen ist zunächst einfache Beziehung auf sich selbst und damit reine Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A6","text":"Die Identität ist als Bestimmung zugleich Bestimmungslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A7","text":"Die eigentliche Bestimmung der Reflexion ist der Unterschied, zunächst als Verschiedenheit und sodann als Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A8","text":"Der Gegensatz reflektiert sich im Widerspruch in sich selbst und geht in seinen Grund zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A9","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Seins gehen wesentlich in ihr Entgegengesetztes über, und ihre Negation ist ebenso notwendig wie sie selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A10","text":"Reflexionsbestimmungen sind sich auf sich beziehende Beziehungen und keine qualitativen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A11","text":"Eine Reflexionsbestimmung enthält als bestimmte Beziehung ihre Satzform bereits in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A12","text":"Ein Satz unterscheidet sich vom Urteil dadurch, dass sein Inhalt die Beziehung selbst bildet, während das Urteil den Inhalt in ein vom Verhältnis getrenntes Prädikat verlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A13","text":"Die Form allgemeiner Denkgesetze benötigt ein Subjekt der Beziehung, nämlich „Alles“ oder „A“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A14","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind trotz ihrer Selbstbeziehung gegeneinander bestimmt und daher dem Übergang und dem Widerspruch nicht entnommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX1","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind nicht unmittelbare, qualitative Eigenschaften eines Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX2","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Seins können nicht ohne ihre entgegengesetzten Bestimmungen als unmittelbare Denkgesetze gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX3","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen benötigen keine äußerliche Satzform, um bestimmte Beziehungen zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX4","text":"Die Einführung von „Alles“ oder „A“ als Subjekt ist keine neutrale Formgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX5","text":"Identität, Verschiedenheit, Gegensatz und Grund sind nicht voneinander isolierte Denkgesetze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX6","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind nicht gegen Übergang, Negation und Widerspruch abgesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX7","text":"Die Aufzählung mehrerer absoluter Denkgesetze garantiert weder ihre Vereinbarkeit noch ihre gemeinsame Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX8","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen dürfen nicht als Qualitäten aufgefasst werden, in denen ein Seiendes unverändert bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D1","text":"Das Wesen ist keine unmittelbare Einfachheit, sondern eine durch unterschiedene Momente vermittelte Rückkehr in sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A1","CH_GB18_A_26:A2","CH_GB18_A_26:A3","CH_GB18_A_26:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D2","text":"Die innere Entwicklung der Reflexion verläuft von Identität über Verschiedenheit und Gegensatz zum Widerspruch und von dort zum Grund.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A6","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D3","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Seins können als unmittelbare Sätze keine ausschließliche Geltung beanspruchen, weil ihre Negationen mit gleicher Notwendigkeit hervortreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D4","text":"Reflexionsbestimmungen besitzen ihre propositionale Form nicht erst durch Prädikation, sondern durch die in ihnen enthaltene Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D5","text":"Die Überführung der Reflexionsbestimmungen in allgemeine Gesetzessätze verlagert ihre Beziehung auf ein äußerliches Subjekt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12","CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D6","text":"Die Subjektform „Alles“ oder „A“ verwandelt die Reflexionsbestimmung in eine scheinbar am Seienden haftende Qualität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D7","text":"Wird Identität als absolutes Gesetz gesetzt, werden Verschiedenheit, Gegensatz und Grund ausgeschlossen; wird Verschiedenheit absolut gesetzt, wird die Identität von A mit sich selbst negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D8","text":"Die isolierte Gesetzesform bringt die gegenseitige Aufhebung ihrer eigenen Bestimmungen hervor.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D9","text":"Die gedankenlose Aufzählung der Denkgesetze verdeckt den Übergang, weil sie das Reflektiertsein in sich vom Gesetztsein als bestimmter Beziehung abtrennt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD1","text":"Die Wahrheit einer Reflexionsbestimmung liegt nicht in ihrer isolierten Selbstgleichheit, sondern in ihrer notwendigen Beziehung, Negation und Bewegung zu anderen Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A3","CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD2","text":"Die traditionellen Denkgesetze werden von selbständigen Wahrheiten zu gegenseitig bestimmenden Momenten eines dialektischen Zusammenhangs umgebildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A13","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD3","text":"Der Widerspruch fungiert nicht als äußerer Fehler der Bestimmungen, sondern als das Verfahren, durch das ihre Rückkehr in den Grund erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD4","text":"Eine spekulative Darstellung muss Inhalt und Beziehung zusammenhalten, weil ihre Trennung die Reflexionsbestimmung wieder in ein äußerliches Sein zurückfallen lässt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12","CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine positive, unmittelbare Einfachheit des Wesens, die keiner Vermittlung bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Seiendes, das als unverändertes Substrat seinen Reflexionsqualitäten vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die unabhängig von Verschiedenheit, Gegensatz und Widerspruch bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung von Inhalt und Beziehung innerhalb der Reflexionsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein System von Denkgesetzen, deren Geltung durch bloße Aufzählung gesichert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Reflexion, die ihre eigene Bestimmtheit gegen Übergang und Negation abschirmen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter unmittelbarer Anfangssatz, der als isolierte Wahrheit allen weiteren Bestimmungen vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein neutrales Subjekt „Alles“, das die Reflexionsbestimmungen aufnehmen könnte, ohne selbst die Sphäre des Seins zu reaktivieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine Identität, deren Wahrheit nicht durch ihre eigene Differenzierung hindurchginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Darstellung, in der die Bestimmungen nebeneinander bestehen, ohne sich gegenseitig zu negieren und zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Widerspruch lediglich als Ausschlussregel statt als innere Bewegungsform der Bestimmung zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS1","text":"Bestimmte Reflexion → Wesenheit → Scheinen des Wesens in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS2","text":"Unendliche Rückkehr in sich → negative Einfachheit → Vermittlung durch unterschiedene Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS3","text":"Reine Identität → Bestimmungslosigkeit → Verschiedenheit → Gegensatz → Widerspruch → Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS4","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung als Selbstbeziehung → innere Satzform; Seinsbestimmung als unmittelbare Qualität → notwendiger Übergang ins Entgegengesetzte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS5","text":"Innere Beziehung → äußerliche Gesetzesform → erforderliches Subjekt „Alles“ oder „A“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS6","text":"Gesetzessubjekt → Reaktivierung des Seins → Reflexionsbestimmung als scheinbare Qualität eines Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS7","text":"Identität, Verschiedenheit und Gegensatz als isolierte Gesetze → gegenseitige Ausschließung → Widerspruch der Gesetzessätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS8","text":"Abstrakte Aufzählung → Abtrennung des Gesetztseins → Verdeckung des Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS9","text":"Wiederaufnahme des Gesetztseins → Einheit von Selbstbeziehung, Bestimmtheit, Negation und Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF1","text":"Bestimmte Reflexion → Wesenheit → negative Einfachheit → Identität → Verschiedenheit → Gegensatz → Widerspruch → Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF2","text":"Reflexionsbestimmung als innere Beziehung → propositionale Form → Formulierung als allgemeines Denkgesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF3","text":"Allgemeines Denkgesetz → Subjekt „Alles“ oder „A“ → Wiederkehr des Seins → nicht-spekulative Qualitätsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF4","text":"Isolierte Identität und isolierte Verschiedenheit → gegenseitige Negation → Aufhebung der absoluten Gesetzesform → Sichtbarkeit des dialektischen Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME1","text":"Identität wird von einem selbständigen Grundsatz zu einem Moment einer durch Differenz vermittelten Bewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME2","text":"Das Wesen wird vom unmittelbaren Sein zur negativen, in sich vermittelten Einfachheit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME3","text":"Reflexionsbestimmungen werden als Beziehungen und nicht als am Seienden haftende Qualitäten sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Satz und Urteil wird zu einer Unterscheidung zwischen innerem Beziehungsinhalt und äußerlicher Prädikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME5","text":"Die Denkgesetze werden von einer linearen Liste isolierter Regeln zu einem Netz gegenseitiger Bestimmung und Aufhebung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME6","text":"Der Widerspruch wird von einer bloßen Unvereinbarkeit zu einer Übergangsfunktion innerhalb der Wesensbestimmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME7","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Identität und Verschiedenheit wird als systeminterne Beziehung statt als äußerer Gegensatz sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Geltung der Sätze „Alles ist sich selbst gleich“ und „A kann nicht zugleich A und nicht A sein“ wird als Problem isolierter Denkgesetze behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Reflexionsbestimmungen werden durch Selbstbeziehung, gegenseitige Bestimmtheit, Übergang und Widerspruch strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Betrachtungsweise wird von der Aufzählung unmittelbarer Gesetze auf die Rekonstruktion ihrer Beziehungen und ihrer gegenseitigen Aufhebung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität des Wesens erscheint als negative Rückkehr und Vermittlungsbewegung, nicht als ruhendes Sein mit angehefteten Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von bestimmter Reflexion über Identität, Unterschied und Widerspruch zur Kritik der absoluten Denkgesetze zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die zentrale Unterscheidung zwischen innerer Reflexionsbeziehung und äußerlicher Prädikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie der Grund aus dem Widerspruch im Einzelnen bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT4","text":"Eine innere Spannung besteht zwischen der Identität als Bestimmungslosigkeit und ihrer Funktion als erstes bestimmtes Reflexionsmoment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht zwischen der bereits enthaltenen Satzform der Reflexionsbestimmung und dem zur allgemeinen Gesetzesform benötigten Subjekt „Alles“ oder „A“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT6","text":"Die interne Kohärenz hängt davon ab, dass formale Unmittelbarkeit und spekulative Bestimmtheit auf verschiedene Abstraktionsebenen verteilt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT7","text":"Die stärkste operative Einheit liegt in der Ableitung der gegenseitigen Aufhebung aus der isolierten Setzung von Identität, Verschiedenheit und Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die scheinbare Aufzählung der Denkgesetze als Abstraktion vom Gesetztsein behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112042780481Z_a4297329","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"7e6c802ac62b9156f4e3fbe48013bd10746afde59ff06a72da8ee30df70b3b81","sha256":"de4a1e90347f0fe1599c0d3f56a9517fa231621cb539fb5ad785b070ff8c96ca","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:20:42.781598+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS1","text":"The text examines whether determinations of reflection can count as immediate, universal, and non-contradictory laws of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS2","text":"It determines essence as determinate reflection, negative simplicity, and absolute mediation with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS3","text":"Reflection generates difference from identity, opposition from difference, and contradiction from opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS4","text":"The determinations of reflection are distinguished from the qualitative determinations of being by their inner relational structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS5","text":"Their formulation as propositions of thought, however, compels an external subject, whereby being is reintroduced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS6","text":"The isolated laws of thought therefore prove to be mutually opposed and sublating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AS7","text":"The argument proceeds reconstructively and dialectically from the determination of essence through the form of the law to the disclosure of its hidden transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A1","text":"Reflection is determinate reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A2","text":"Essence is the shining of essence within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A3","text":"As infinite return into itself, essence is negative simplicity and absolute mediation with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A4","text":"The moments of mediation are themselves determinations reflected into themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A5","text":"Essence is initially simple relation to itself and hence pure identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A6","text":"As a determination, identity is at the same time determinacy-less-ness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A7","text":"The proper determination of reflection is difference, initially as diversity and then as opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A8","text":"In contradiction, opposition reflects itself into itself and returns into its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A9","text":"The determinations of being essentially pass over into their opposite, and their negation is just as necessary as they themselves are.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A10","text":"Determinations of reflection are self-relating relations and not qualitative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A11","text":"As a determinate relation, a determination of reflection already contains its propositional form within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A12","text":"A proposition differs from a judgment in that its content constitutes the relation itself, whereas the judgment places the content in a predicate separate from the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A13","text":"The form of universal laws of thought requires a subject of the relation, namely “Everything” or “A”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:A14","text":"Despite their self-relation, the determinations of reflection are determined in opposition to one another and are therefore not exempt from transition and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX1","text":"The determinations of reflection are not immediate, qualitative properties of a being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX2","text":"The determinations of being cannot be posited as immediate laws of thought without their opposite determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX3","text":"The determinations of reflection require no external propositional form in order to be determinate relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX4","text":"The introduction of “Everything” or “A” as subject is not a neutral formalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX5","text":"Identity, diversity, opposition, and ground are not laws of thought isolated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX6","text":"The determinations of reflection are not secured against transition, negation, and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX7","text":"The enumeration of several absolute laws of thought guarantees neither their compatibility nor their common truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:NX8","text":"The determinations of reflection must not be conceived as qualities in which a being remains unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D1","text":"Essence is not immediate simplicity, but a return into itself mediated through differentiated moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A1","CH_GB18_A_26:A2","CH_GB18_A_26:A3","CH_GB18_A_26:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D2","text":"The inner development of reflection proceeds from identity through diversity and opposition to contradiction, and thence to ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A6","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D3","text":"As immediate propositions, the determinations of being cannot claim exclusive validity, because their negations emerge with equal necessity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D4","text":"Determinations of reflection possess their propositional form not only through predication, but through the relation contained within them.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D5","text":"The transformation of determinations of reflection into universal propositions of law shifts their relation onto an external subject.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12","CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D6","text":"The subject-form “Everything” or “A” transforms the determination of reflection into a quality apparently adhering to a being.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D7","text":"If identity is posited as an absolute law, diversity, opposition, and ground are excluded; if diversity is posited absolutely, the identity of A with itself is negated.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D8","text":"The isolated form of law produces the mutual sublation of its own determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:D9","text":"The unthinking enumeration of the laws of thought conceals transition because it separates reflection-into-itself from positedness as a determinate relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD1","text":"The truth of a determination of reflection lies not in its isolated self-sameness, but in its necessary relation, negation, and movement toward other determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A3","CH_GB18_A_26:A5","CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD2","text":"The traditional laws of thought are transformed from independent truths into mutually determining moments of a dialectical connection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A13","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD3","text":"Contradiction functions not as an external error of the determinations, but as the process through which their return into ground is generated.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A7","CH_GB18_A_26:A8","CH_GB18_A_26:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SD4","text":"A speculative presentation must hold content and relation together, because their separation makes the determination of reflection relapse into an external being.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_26:A10","CH_GB18_A_26:A11","CH_GB18_A_26:A12","CH_GB18_A_26:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a positive, immediate simplicity of essence requiring no mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a being that precedes its reflective qualities as an unchanged substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity that could subsist independently of diversity, opposition, and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a separation of content and relation within the determination of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a system of laws of thought whose validity would be secured by mere enumeration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a reflection that could shield its own determinacy against transition and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final immediate initial proposition that, as an isolated truth, precedes all further determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a neutral subject “Everything” that could receive the determinations of reflection without itself reactivating the sphere of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a pure identity whose truth would not pass through its own differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible is a presentation in which the determinations subsist alongside one another without mutually negating and determining one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:SNX5","text":"Blocked is the possibility of treating contradiction merely as a rule of exclusion rather than as the inner form of movement of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS1","text":"Determinate reflection → essentiality → shining of essence within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS2","text":"Infinite return into itself → negative simplicity → mediation through differentiated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS3","text":"Pure identity → determinacy-less-ness → diversity → opposition → contradiction → ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS4","text":"Determination of reflection as self-relation → inner propositional form; determination of being as immediate quality → necessary transition into the opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS5","text":"Inner relation → external form of law → required subject “Everything” or “A”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS6","text":"Subject of law → reactivation of being → determination of reflection as apparent quality of a being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS7","text":"Identity, diversity, and opposition as isolated laws → mutual exclusion → contradiction of the propositions of law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS8","text":"Abstract enumeration → separation of positedness → concealment of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:FGS9","text":"Resumption of positedness → unity of self-relation, determinacy, negation, and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF1","text":"Determinate reflection → essentiality → negative simplicity → identity → diversity → opposition → contradiction → ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF2","text":"Determination of reflection as inner relation → propositional form → formulation as universal law of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF3","text":"Universal law of thought → subject “Everything” or “A” → return of being → non-speculative qualitative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:AF4","text":"Isolated identity and isolated diversity → mutual negation → sublation of the absolute form of law → visibility of dialectical transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME1","text":"Identity is remapped from an independent principle into a moment of a movement mediated through difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME2","text":"Essence is reclassified from immediate being into negative simplicity mediated within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME3","text":"Determinations of reflection become visible as relations and not as qualities adhering to a being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME4","text":"The distinction between proposition and judgment becomes a distinction between inner relational content and external predication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME5","text":"The laws of thought are reordered from a linear list of isolated rules into a network of mutual determination and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME6","text":"Contradiction is reclassified from a mere incompatibility into a function of transition within the determination of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ME7","text":"The opposition between identity and diversity becomes visible as a relation internal to the system rather than as an external opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT1","text":"Surface — The validity of the propositions “Everything is equal to itself” and “A cannot be both A and not A at the same time” is treated as a problem of isolated laws of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinations of reflection are structured through self-relation, mutual determinacy, transition, and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The mode of consideration is shifted from the enumeration of immediate laws to the reconstruction of their relations and their mutual sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The reality of essence appears as negative return and movement of mediation, not as resting being with properties attached to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from determinate reflection through identity, difference, and contradiction to the critique of absolute laws of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central distinction between inner relation of reflection and external predication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how ground is determined from contradiction in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT4","text":"An inner tension exists between identity as determinacy-less-ness and its function as the first determinate moment of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT5","text":"A second tension exists between the already contained propositional form of the determination of reflection and the subject “Everything” or “A” required for the universal form of law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT6","text":"The internal coherence depends on formal immediacy and speculative determinacy being distributed across different levels of abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT7","text":"The strongest operative unity lies in deriving mutual sublation from the isolated positing of identity, diversity, and opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_26:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument insofar as the apparent enumeration of the laws of thought is treated as an abstraction from positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_26:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_26@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_26:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 109","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 109","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0","layer":"CH","title":"A. Identity.","order":110,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DIT0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIT0@R001","sha256":"2589096d808c0ec66203e80012e5e4e6baed16d6913c4c07c0d59673cdc78140","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS1","text":"Das Wesen wird als aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS2","text":"Seine Negativität bildet nicht eine äußerliche Bestimmung, sondern sein eigenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS3","text":"Absolute Negativität hebt Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes in reine Sichselbstgleichheit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS4","text":"Daraus entsteht eine Identität mit sich, die als Unmittelbarkeit der Reflexion bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS5","text":"Diese Identität ist keine abstrakte Gleichheit, sondern ein reines Herstellen aus und in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS6","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Seyns ist an sich selbst aufgehoben und dadurch als wesentliche Identität konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS7","text":"Die Argumentation bewegt sich von aufgehobener Unmittelbarkeit über absolute Negativität zur sich selbst erzeugenden Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","text":"Das Wesen ist einfache Unmittelbarkeit als aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","text":"Die Negativität des Wesens ist sein eigenes Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","text":"Absolute Negativität lässt Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes in reine Sichselbstgleichheit verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","text":"Das Wesen ist einfache Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","text":"Die Identität des Wesens ist Unmittelbarkeit der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","text":"Wesentliche Identität entsteht nicht durch ein außerhalb ihrer vollzogenes relatives Negieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A7","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht abstrakte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","text":"Seyn und alle Bestimmtheit des Seyns sind nicht relativ, sondern an sich selbst aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A9","text":"Die einfache Negativität des Seyns an sich ist die Identität selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A10","text":"Die wesentliche Identität ist ein reines Herstellen aus und in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX1","text":"Die Identität des Wesens ist nicht die Gleichheit mit sich von Seyn oder Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX2","text":"Die Identität des Wesens ist keine abstrakte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX3","text":"Sie entsteht nicht durch ein relatives Negieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX4","text":"Das Negieren geschieht nicht außerhalb der Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX5","text":"Das Unterschiedene bleibt nicht als selbständig Seiendes außerhalb der Identität bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX6","text":"Die Aufhebung des Seyns erfolgt nicht relativ, sondern an sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX7","text":"Die Identität ist keine Wiederherstellung aus einem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX8","text":"Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes gelten nicht als selbständige Grundlagen des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D1","text":"Weil das Wesen aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit ist und seine Negativität sein Seyn bildet, ist sein Seyn nicht von seiner Identität zu trennen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","CH_GB18_DIT0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D2","text":"Weil absolute Negativität Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes aufhebt, ist die Identität des Wesens reine Sichselbstgleichheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D3","text":"Weil die Identität aus und in sich selbst hergestellt wird, ist sie eine Unmittelbarkeit der Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D4","text":"Weil kein äußerliches relatives Negieren vorausgeht, ist die wesentliche Identität nicht die Abtrennung eines Unterschiedenen bei fortbestehendem äußerem Bestand.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D5","text":"Weil Seyn und seine Bestimmtheiten an sich selbst aufgehoben sind, wird die einfache Negativität selbst zur Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D6","text":"Die Identität des Wesens ist ein Selbstverhältnis, dessen Einheit nicht aus der Vermittlung mit einem unabhängigen Anderen hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD1","text":"Das Wesen entsteht als selbstbegründete Einheit, indem es die gesamte vorausgesetzte Äußerlichkeit in die eigene Negativität zurücknimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD2","text":"Identität bezeichnet hier keinen vorgegebenen Zustand, sondern die Resultatform eines Prozesses innerer Aufhebung und Selbstherstellung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD3","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen wesentlicher und abstrakter Identität wird durch die Herkunft der Einheit bestimmt: Selbstherstellung statt äußerlicher Abstraktion.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD4","text":"Die Aufhebung des Anderen erzeugt keine bloße Leere, sondern die positive Bestimmung einer sich selbst gleichen Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Identität aus, die als unmittelbare, vorreflexive Gegebenheit unabhängig von ihrer eigenen Aufhebung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Negation lediglich äußerlich trennt, ohne das Negierte selbst aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt die selbständige Existenz eines Unterschiedenen außerhalb der Identität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Begründungsstruktur aus, in der das Wesen seine Einheit aus einem vorausgesetzten Anderen empfängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Gleichsetzung von Identität mit bloßer Abwesenheit von Unterschied aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist eine ontologische Ordnung, in der Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes letzte Bedingungen der Identität bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine äußere Grundlage, aus der die Einheit des Wesens rekonstruiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die entweder als leere Tautologie oder als Resultat fremder Vermittlung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX4","text":"Die Argumentation kann nur bestehen, wenn jede unabhängige Positivität des Seyns in der Bewegung seiner eigenen Aufhebung aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird als bereits aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit angesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS2","text":"Die Aufhebung wird als eigene Negativität des Wesens bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","CH_GB18_DIT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS3","text":"Die eigene Negativität tilgt Andersseyn und äußere Beziehung als selbständige Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS4","text":"Das Resultat der Tilgung wird als Sichselbstgleichheit und einfache Identität gefasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS5","text":"Diese Identität wird gegen die Gleichheit von Seyn, Nichts und abstrakter Identität abgegrenzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS6","text":"Die abgegrenzte Identität wird als Selbstherstellung aus und in sich selbst bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS7","text":"Die an sich vollzogene Aufhebung des Seyns wird mit der Identität selbst gleichgesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit → Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit → eigene Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF2","text":"Eigene Negativität → Verschwinden von Andersseyn und äußerer Beziehung → Sichselbstgleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF3","text":"Sichselbstgleichheit → Unmittelbarkeit der Reflexion → wesentliche Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF4","text":"Wesentliche Identität → Ausschluss äußerlicher Negation und fremder Grundlage → Selbstherstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF5","text":"Selbstherstellung → an sich vollzogene Aufhebung des Seyns → einfache Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME1","text":"Identität wird von einer statischen Gleichheit in eine durch Selbstaufhebung erzeugte Struktur transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME2","text":"Negation wird von einem äußerlichen Trennungsverfahren in den inneren Grund der Identität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME3","text":"Andersseyn und Beziehung auf Anderes erscheinen nicht mehr als konstitutive Außenbedingungen, sondern als aufgehobene Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen abstrakter und wesentlicher Identität wird auf die Differenz zwischen äußerlicher Abstraktion und innerer Selbstherstellung gegründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME5","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird als Resultat von Reflexion und nicht als vorausliegender Anfang kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Wesen wird als einfache Identität mit sich und als aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Einheit entsteht durch die im Wesen selbst vollzogene Aufhebung von Seyn, Bestimmtheit, Andersseyn und äußerer Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Begriff der Identität wird gegen abstrakte, äußerliche und fremdvermittelte Modelle abgeschirmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Sein des Wesens ist die zeitlos gefasste Bewegung einer Selbstaufhebung, deren Resultat als einfache Sichselbstgleichheit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von aufgehobener Unmittelbarkeit zu wesentlicher Identität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT2","text":"Die entscheidende Generationsregel lautet: eigene Negativität hebt äußere Bestimmtheit an sich auf und erzeugt dadurch Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie aus der reinen Identität die spätere Bestimmung von Unterschied und Beziehung erneut hervorgehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern absolute Negativität zugleich als Aufhebung und als Selbstkonstitution verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Unterscheidung zwischen wesentlicher und abstrakter Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass die Identität durch Negativität erzeugt wird, während Andersseyn und Beziehung vollständig verschwinden sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern Identität als Resultat innerer Selbstaufhebung und nicht als vorausgesetzte Tautologie angesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115457791254Z_e42d63e7","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. Identity.","source_sha256":"2589096d808c0ec66203e80012e5e4e6baed16d6913c4c07c0d59673cdc78140","sha256":"fcf4d271747d3527e4e66b79d6d847f2f5febdfe0b39b3c71b9cd408598cf7d9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:54:57.792676+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS1","text":"Essence is determined as sublated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS2","text":"Its negativity does not constitute an external determination, but rather its own Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS3","text":"Absolute negativity sublates otherness and relation to another into pure self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS4","text":"From this there arises an identity with itself that is determined as the immediacy of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS5","text":"This identity is not abstract equality, but a pure self-production out of and within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS6","text":"The determinacy of Being is sublated in itself and thereby constituted as essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AS7","text":"The argument moves from sublated immediacy through absolute negativity to self-generating identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","text":"Essence is simple immediacy as sublated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","text":"The negativity of essence is its own Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","text":"Absolute negativity causes otherness and relation to another to vanish into pure self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","text":"Essence is simple identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","text":"The identity of essence is the immediacy of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","text":"Essential identity does not arise through a relative negating carried out outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A7","text":"Essence is not abstract identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","text":"Being and all determinacy of Being are not relative, but sublated in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A9","text":"The simple negativity of Being in itself is identity itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:A10","text":"Essential identity is a pure self-production out of and within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX1","text":"The identity of essence is not the equality with itself of Being or Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX2","text":"The identity of essence is not abstract identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX3","text":"It does not arise through a relative negating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX4","text":"The negating does not occur outside identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX5","text":"What is differentiated does not persist as independently existing outside identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX6","text":"The sublation of Being occurs not relatively, but in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX7","text":"Identity is not a restoration from an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:NX8","text":"Otherness and relation to another do not count as independent foundations of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D1","text":"Because essence is sublated immediacy and its negativity constitutes its Being, its Being cannot be separated from its identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","CH_GB18_DIT0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D2","text":"Because absolute negativity sublates otherness and relation to another, the identity of essence is pure self-sameness.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D3","text":"Because identity is produced out of and within itself, it is an immediacy of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D4","text":"Because no external relative negating precedes it, essential identity is not the separation of something differentiated while its external subsistence continues.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D5","text":"Because Being and its determinacies are sublated in themselves, simple negativity itself becomes identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:D6","text":"The identity of essence is a self-relation whose unity does not proceed from mediation with an independent other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD1","text":"Essence arises as a self-grounding unity by taking back the entirety of presupposed externality into its own negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1","CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD2","text":"Here identity designates not a given state, but the resultant form of a process of inner sublation and self-production.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD3","text":"The distinction between essential and abstract identity is determined by the origin of unity: self-production rather than external abstraction.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SD4","text":"The sublation of the other produces not mere emptiness, but the positive determination of an identity equal to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3","CH_GB18_DIT0:A4","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an identity that exists as immediate, pre-reflective givenness independently of its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX2","text":"It excludes a model in which negation merely separates externally without sublating what is negated itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX3","text":"It excludes the independent existence of something differentiated outside identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX4","text":"It excludes a grounding structure in which essence receives its unity from a presupposed other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:DNX5","text":"It excludes the equation of identity with the mere absence of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX1","text":"Impermissible is an ontological order in which otherness and relation to another remain ultimate conditions of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an external ground from which the unity of essence could be reconstructed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity understood either as an empty tautology or as the result of alien mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:SNX4","text":"The argument can subsist only if every independent positivity of Being is absorbed into the movement of its own sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS1","text":"Immediacy is posited as already sublated immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS2","text":"Sublation is determined as the essence's own negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A2","CH_GB18_DIT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS3","text":"Its own negativity effaces otherness and external relation as independent moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS4","text":"The result of the effacement is grasped as self-sameness and simple identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS5","text":"This identity is distinguished from the equality of Being, Nothing, and abstract identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A5","CH_GB18_DIT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS6","text":"The distinguished identity is determined as self-production out of and within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A6","CH_GB18_DIT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:FGS7","text":"The sublation of Being carried out in itself is equated with identity itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DIT0:A8","CH_GB18_DIT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DIT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF1","text":"Immediacy → sublation of immediacy → own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF2","text":"Own negativity → disappearance of otherness and external relation → self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF3","text":"Self-sameness → immediacy of reflection → essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF4","text":"Essential identity → exclusion of external negation and alien ground → self-production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:AF5","text":"Self-production → sublation of Being carried out in itself → simple identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME1","text":"Identity is transformed from a static equality into a structure generated through self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME2","text":"Negation is reclassified from an external procedure of separation into the inner ground of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME3","text":"Otherness and relation to another no longer appear as constitutive external conditions, but as sublated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME4","text":"The distinction between abstract and essential identity is grounded in the difference between external abstraction and inner self-production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ME5","text":"Immediacy is mapped as the result of reflection and not as a preceding beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Essence is determined as simple identity with itself and as sublated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Unity arises through the sublation, carried out within essence itself, of Being, determinacy, otherness, and external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The concept of identity is shielded against abstract, external, and alien-mediated models.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being of essence is the timelessly grasped movement of a self-sublation, whose result appears as simple self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from sublated immediacy to essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT2","text":"The decisive generative rule is: own negativity sublates external determinacy in itself and thereby generates identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the later determination of difference and relation can emerge anew from pure identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that absolute negativity is understood simultaneously as sublation and as self-constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT5","text":"Its strongest point is the distinction between essential and abstract identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that identity is generated through negativity, while otherness and relation are supposed to disappear completely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_DIT0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text, provided identity is posited as the result of inner self-sublation and not as a presupposed tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DIT0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DIT0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 110","title":"A. Identity.","context":"Chapter 110","original_title":"A. Die Identität."},"original_title":"A. Die Identität.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":111,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_27"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_27@R001","sha256":"2c00e012d2d13f8444146db30cba190c50fb8053b28e996491f3c45ab864de25","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS1","text":"Das Argument setzt bei der Unfähigkeit der äußeren Reflexion an, Identität und Unterschied anders als abstrakt und äußerlich getrennt zu erfassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS2","text":"Es bestimmt Identität und Unterschied nicht als nebeneinanderstehende Bestimmungen, sondern als immanente Übergangsbewegung des Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS3","text":"Seine Grundlage ist die Bestimmung der Identität als sich auf sich beziehende Negativität, die sich am Sein selbst und nicht an äußerer Reflexion ergibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS4","text":"Die immanente Betrachtung zeigt, dass jede Bestimmung an ihr selbst ihr Gegenteil ist und dadurch in die andere übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von absoluter Negation und reinem Unterschied zur Rückkehr in sich und schließlich zur bestimmten Identität als einfacher Gleichheit gegen den absoluten Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A1","text":"Die äußere Reflexion kennt nur abstrakte Identität und einen von ihr getrennten Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A2","text":"Die äußerlich getrennte Identität und der äußerlich getrennte Unterschied sind Produkte der Abstraktion, die bei gleichgültiger Verschiedenheit stehenbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A3","text":"Alles, was ist, ist in seiner Gleichheit mit sich selbst ungleich und widersprechend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A4","text":"Jede Bestimmung ist an ihr selbst das Gegenteil ihrer selbst und geht deshalb in die andere Bestimmung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A5","text":"Identität ist einfache, sich auf sich beziehende Negativität und kein Produkt äußerer Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A6","text":"Identität ist zunächst das Wesen selbst und die ganze Reflexion, nicht ein von ihm unterschiedenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A7","text":"Absolute Negation ist eine Negation, die unmittelbar sich selbst negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A8","text":"Unterscheiden setzt das Nichtsein des Anderen, und das Aufheben des Anderen hebt dadurch auch das Unterscheiden selbst auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A9","text":"Der Unterschied ist als sich auf sich beziehende Negativität reiner, absoluter Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A10","text":"Identität ist Reflexion in sich als innerliches Abstoßen, das sich unmittelbar in sich zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A11","text":"Der Unterschied ist nur insofern mit sich identisch, als er absolute Nichtidentität ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A12","text":"Absolute Nichtidentität ist nur sie selbst und dadurch absolute Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A13","text":"Identität setzt sich als Reflexion in sich selbst als ihr eigenes Nichtsein und als ihr eigenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A14","text":"Identität als bestimmtes Moment ist einfache Gleichheit mit sich selbst gegen den absoluten Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX1","text":"Vernunft ist kein äußerer Webstuhl, der Identität und Unterschied von außen verbindet oder trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX2","text":"Identität und Unterschied bestehen nicht unabhängig voneinander als äußerlich nebeneinanderliegende Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX3","text":"Die begriffliche Identität ist kein Erzeugnis äußerer Reflexion oder willkürlicher Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX4","text":"Äußerliche Versicherungen darüber, was Vernunft tut, sind keine immanente Bestimmung der Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX5","text":"Unterscheiden erzeugt keinen dauerhaft außerhalb der Bestimmung verbleibenden Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX6","text":"Absolute Identität ist nicht auf abstrakte Gleichheit ohne Unterschied beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX7","text":"Absoluter Unterschied ist nicht auf ein von ihm äußerlich verschiedenes Anderes bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX8","text":"Identität ist weder ausschließlich das Ganze der Reflexion noch ausschließlich dessen isoliertes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D1","text":"Die äußere Reflexion kann das Wesen nicht erkennen, weil sie Identität und Unterschied nur als getrennte Abstraktionen behandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A2","CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D2","text":"Identität und Unterschied sind keine fixierten Gegensätze, sondern Bestimmungen einer immanenten Bewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D3","text":"Absolute Negation macht das Unterscheiden zu einem Vorgang, der in seinem eigenen Vollzug verschwindet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A7","CH_GB18_A_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D4","text":"Reiner Unterschied ist nicht fremdbezogene Verschiedenheit, sondern ein Unterschied, dessen Negativität sich auf sich selbst bezieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A8","CH_GB18_A_27:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D5","text":"Identität und Unterschied fallen auf der Ebene ihrer absoluten Bestimmungen ineinander, ohne dadurch zu äußerlich gleichen Bestimmungen zu werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D6","text":"Die Identität gewinnt ihre bestimmte Gestalt dadurch, dass sie ihr eigenes Nichtsein und ihre eigene Gesetztseinsform setzt und aus ihnen in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A12","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D7","text":"Das System unterscheidet zwischen Identität als ganzer Reflexion und Identität als gesetztem Moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A6","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD1","text":"Die ontologische Priorität verschiebt sich von äußerer Beziehung auf immanente Selbstnegation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A2","CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD2","text":"Widerspruch fungiert nicht als Fehler einer Bestimmung, sondern als erzeugende Operation ihres Übergangs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4","CH_GB18_A_27:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD3","text":"Identität und Unterschied bilden einen selbstbezüglichen Erzeugungskreislauf: Identität setzt Nichtidentität, Nichtidentität erweist sich als Selbstidentität, und daraus entsteht bestimmte Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12","CH_GB18_A_27:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD4","text":"Bestimmte Identität bleibt nur als intern erzeugtes Moment des absoluten Unterschieds möglich, nicht als selbständige Gegenposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A9","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD5","text":"Erkenntnis muss von den äußeren Versicherungen über Vernunft zu einer immanenten Betrachtung der Bestimmungen selbst übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keine Bestimmung, deren Identität gegenüber ihrem eigenen Unterschied äußerlich stabil bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX2","text":"Es gibt keinen Unterschied, der durch ein dauerhaft außerhalb liegendes Anderes begründet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX3","text":"Keine der beiden Bestimmungen besitzt ontologische Priorität als reine, von der anderen unabhängige Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX4","text":"Es gibt keine Negation, deren Resultat außerhalb des negierenden Vorgangs bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX5","text":"Identität kann nicht auf einer einzigen Ebene zugleich als ganzes Wesen und als isolierte Bestimmung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX1","text":"Das System schließt einen indifferenten Grund jenseits von Identität und Unterschied aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX2","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Auflösung des Widerspruchs durch äußerliche Gleichsetzung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX3","text":"Es schließt ein unabhängiges Anderes als letzten Grund des Unterschieds aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX4","text":"Es schließt eine reine Identität oder einen reinen Unterschied aus, die keine eigene Negativität enthielten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX5","text":"Es schließt einen Abschluss aus, in dem die Bewegung der Bestimmungen in einem widerspruchslosen Endzustand stillgestellt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS1","text":"Äußere Reflexion isoliert Identität und Unterschied → sie behandelt beide als äußerlich verbundene oder getrennte Abstraktionen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS2","text":"Immanente Betrachtung des Seienden → jede Bestimmung enthält ihre eigene Ungleichheit und ihr Gegenteil → Identität und Unterschied gehen ineinander über.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS3","text":"Identität als Selbstnegation → absolutes Negieren seiner selbst → Unterscheiden als Setzen des Nichtseins des Anderen → Aufhebung des Anderen und des Unterscheidens.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A7","CH_GB18_A_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS4","text":"Aufhebung des äußeren Anderen → selbstbezogener reiner Unterschied → Identität des Unterschieds mit sich als absolute Nichtidentität → absolute Nichtidentität als absolute Selbstidentität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A9","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS5","text":"Identität als Reflexion in sich → Setzen des eigenen Nichtseins und des eigenen Moments → Rückkehr in sich → bestimmte Identität als einfache Gleichheit gegen den absoluten Unterschied.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AF1","text":"Äußere Abstraktion → Unvermögen zur Erkenntnis des Wesens → immanente Betrachtung des Seienden → Selbstwiderspruch jeder Bestimmung → absolute Selbstnegation → reiner Unterschied → Selbstidentität der Nichtidentität → Rückkehr der Identität als bestimmtes Moment gegen den absoluten Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME1","text":"Identität und Unterschied werden von äußerlich getrennten Gegenständen zu wechselseitig erzeugten Momenten derselben Bewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME2","text":"Widerspruch wird von einem Defekt der Bestimmung zu ihrem immanenten Übergangsmechanismus umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Identität und Unterschied zerfällt auf der absoluten Ebene, bleibt aber als Verhältnis von Ganzem und Moment erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME4","text":"Der Ursprung des Begriffs wird von äußerer Reflexion in die immanente Struktur des Seins verlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME5","text":"Das Andere wird nicht mehr als äußerer Träger des Unterschieds, sondern als gesetztes und aufgehobenes Moment der Negativität kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT1","text":"Auf der Oberflächenebene wird die äußerliche Auffassung von Identität und Unterschied zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT2","text":"Auf der strukturellen Ebene erzeugen Selbstbeziehung, Negation und Aufhebung die Übergänge zwischen den Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT3","text":"Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird die Methode von äußerer Beschreibung und historischer Versicherung auf immanente Bestimmung der Sache umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT4","text":"Auf der ontologischen und zeitlichen Ebene ist Sein als widersprüchliche Übergangsbewegung bestimmt, in der Negation unmittelbar in Selbstbeziehung und Rückkehr übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von äußerer Reflexion zur immanenten Selbstnegation und zur bestimmten Identität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, durch welchen konkreten Vollzug die immanente Betrachtung des Seienden ihre behaupteten Übergänge ausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern zwischen Identität als absolutem Ganzen und Identität als bestimmtem Moment unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung des Unterschieds aus der Selbstnegation statt aus einem äußerlichen Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung liegt darin, dass Identität zugleich als absolute Nichtidentität und als einfache Gleichheit mit sich bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Unterscheiden aufgehoben wird, während der reine absolute Unterschied als Resultat bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung nur dann, wenn absolute Bestimmung, Übergangsbewegung und bestimmte Momentstruktur nicht auf eine einzige Bedeutung von Identität reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112103276576Z_83998745","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1.","source_sha256":"2c00e012d2d13f8444146db30cba190c50fb8053b28e996491f3c45ab864de25","sha256":"7243d330a5cf5e5b0f0fede6c06ba85f02e385cc66b93c4c90c754ac267f56d0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:21:03.279132+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS1","text":"The argument begins from the incapacity of external reflection to grasp identity and difference other than as abstractly and externally separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS2","text":"It determines identity and difference not as determinations standing alongside one another, but as the immanent movement of transition of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS3","text":"Its basis is the determination of identity as self-relating negativity, which emerges in being itself and not in external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS4","text":"The immanent consideration shows that every determination is in itself its opposite and thereby passes over into the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AS5","text":"The movement leads from absolute negation and pure difference to return into itself and finally to determinate identity as simple equality against absolute difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A1","text":"External reflection knows only abstract identity and a difference separated from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A2","text":"Externally separated identity and externally separated difference are products of abstraction, which remains at indifferent diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A3","text":"Everything that is is unequal and contradictory in its equality with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A4","text":"Every determination is in itself the opposite of itself and therefore passes over into the other determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A5","text":"Identity is simple, self-relating negativity and not a product of external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A6","text":"Identity is initially essence itself and the whole of reflection, not a moment distinct from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A7","text":"Absolute negation is a negation that immediately negates itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A8","text":"Distinguishing posits the non-being of the other, and the sublation of the other thereby also sublates distinguishing itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A9","text":"Difference, as self-relating negativity, is pure, absolute difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A10","text":"Identity is reflection into itself as inward repulsion, which immediately takes itself back into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A11","text":"Difference is identical with itself only insofar as it is absolute non-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A12","text":"Absolute non-identity is only itself and thereby absolute identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A13","text":"Identity posits itself, as reflection into itself, as its own non-being and as its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:A14","text":"Identity as determinate moment is simple equality with itself against absolute difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX1","text":"Reason is not an external loom that externally connects or separates identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX2","text":"Identity and difference do not subsist independently of one another as determinations externally lying alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX3","text":"Conceptual identity is not a product of external reflection or arbitrary abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX4","text":"External assurances concerning what reason does are not an immanent determination of the matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX5","text":"Distinguishing does not produce an other that permanently remains outside the determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX6","text":"Absolute identity is not restricted to abstract equality without difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX7","text":"Absolute difference is not related to an other externally distinct from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:NX8","text":"Identity is neither exclusively the whole of reflection nor exclusively its isolated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D1","text":"External reflection cannot cognize essence because it treats identity and difference only as separate abstractions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A2","CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D2","text":"Identity and difference are not fixed opposites, but determinations of an immanent movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D3","text":"Absolute negation makes distinguishing into a process that disappears in its own enactment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A7","CH_GB18_A_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D4","text":"Pure difference is not other-related diversity, but a difference whose negativity relates to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A8","CH_GB18_A_27:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D5","text":"Identity and difference coincide at the level of their absolute determinations without thereby becoming externally equal determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D6","text":"Identity acquires its determinate shape by positing its own non-being and its own form of positedness and returning from them into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A12","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:D7","text":"The system distinguishes between identity as whole reflection and identity as posited moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A6","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD1","text":"Ontological priority shifts from external relation to immanent self-negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A2","CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD2","text":"Contradiction functions not as the defect of a determination, but as the generative operation of its transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4","CH_GB18_A_27:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD3","text":"Identity and difference form a self-relating generative cycle: identity posits non-identity, non-identity proves to be self-identity, and determinate identity arises from this.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12","CH_GB18_A_27:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD4","text":"Determinate identity remains possible only as an internally generated moment of absolute difference, not as an independent counterposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A9","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SD5","text":"Cognition must pass from external assurances concerning reason to an immanent consideration of the determinations themselves.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX1","text":"There is no determination whose identity remains externally stable in relation to its own difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX2","text":"There is no difference grounded by an other that permanently lies outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX3","text":"Neither of the two determinations possesses ontological priority as a pure determination independent of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX4","text":"There is no negation whose result remains outside the negating process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:DNX5","text":"Identity cannot be treated on a single level both as whole essence and as isolated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX1","text":"The system excludes an indifferent ground beyond identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX2","text":"It excludes a final resolution of contradiction through external equalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX3","text":"It excludes an independent other as the ultimate ground of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX4","text":"It excludes a pure identity or a pure difference containing no negativity of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:SNX5","text":"It excludes a closure in which the movement of determinations would be brought to a standstill in a contradiction-free final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS1","text":"External reflection isolates identity and difference → it treats both as externally connected or separated abstractions.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A1","CH_GB18_A_27:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS2","text":"Immanent consideration of being → every determination contains its own inequality and its opposite → identity and difference pass over into one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A3","CH_GB18_A_27:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS3","text":"Identity as self-negation → absolute negation of itself → distinguishing as positing the non-being of the other → sublation of the other and of distinguishing.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A5","CH_GB18_A_27:A7","CH_GB18_A_27:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS4","text":"Sublation of the external other → self-relating pure difference → identity of difference with itself as absolute non-identity → absolute non-identity as absolute self-identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A9","CH_GB18_A_27:A11","CH_GB18_A_27:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:FGS5","text":"Identity as reflection into itself → positing of its own non-being and its own moment → return into itself → determinate identity as simple equality against absolute difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_27:A10","CH_GB18_A_27:A13","CH_GB18_A_27:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:AF1","text":"External abstraction → incapacity for cognition of essence → immanent consideration of being → self-contradiction of every determination → absolute self-negation → pure difference → self-identity of non-identity → return of identity as determinate moment against absolute difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME1","text":"Identity and difference are remapped from externally separated objects into mutually generated moments of the same movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME2","text":"Contradiction is reclassified from a defect of determination into its immanent mechanism of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME3","text":"The opposition between identity and difference disintegrates at the absolute level, but is preserved as the relation of whole and moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME4","text":"The origin of the concept is relocated from external reflection into the immanent structure of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ME5","text":"The other is no longer mapped as the external bearer of difference, but as a posited and sublated moment of negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the external conception of identity and difference is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, self-relation, negation, and sublation generate the transitions between determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the method is shifted from external description and historical assurance to immanent determination of the matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, being is determined as a contradictory movement of transition in which negation immediately passes over into self-relation and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from external reflection to immanent self-negation and determinate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is by what concrete enactment the immanent consideration of being establishes its asserted transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as a distinction is made between identity as absolute whole and identity as determinate moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of difference from self-negation rather than from an external other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension lies in the fact that identity is determined simultaneously as absolute non-identity and as simple equality with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that distinguishing is sublated while pure absolute difference remains as the result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_27:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument only if absolute determination, movement of transition, and determinate moment-structure are not reduced to a single meaning of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_27:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_27@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_27:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 111","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 111","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":112,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_28"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_28@R001","sha256":"44594ef31dc6b2babdb599ba9fac399907d0b20ec3b7554f89731032a0c82236","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS1","text":"Der als erstes Denkgesetz beanspruchte Satz der Identität soll auf seine Wahrheitsfähigkeit geprüft werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS2","text":"Die abstrakte Selbstgleichheit erweist sich als leere und einseitige Bestimmung, weil ihre Abgrenzung von der Verschiedenheit bereits Verschiedenheit in sie einführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS3","text":"Die Unvollständigkeit der abstrakten Identität setzt eine Totalität voraus, in der Identität nur mit Verschiedenheit wahr ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS4","text":"Erfahrung und Satzform widerlegen die Behauptung, abstrakte Identität sei unmittelbar, allgemein und für sich wahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS5","text":"Der Identitätssatz und der Satz des Widerspruchs enthalten, gegen ihre beabsichtigte Lesart, die reflexive Negativität und den absoluten Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A1","text":"Der positive Satz A=A drückt zunächst nur leere Tautologie aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A2","text":"Abstrakte Identität ist als von Verschiedenheit getrennte Bestimmung einseitig und unvollständig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A3","text":"Die Bestimmung der Identität als verschieden von der Verschiedenheit setzt Verschiedenheit in die Natur der Identität selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A4","text":"Wahrheit besteht für die Identität nur in ihrer Einheit mit Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A5","text":"Konkrete Erfahrung enthält Identität stets nur in Beziehung auf ein verschiedenes Mannigfaltiges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A6","text":"Die Form des Identitätssatzes vollzieht eine Reflexionsbewegung: Sie eröffnet Verschiedenheit und läßt sie im Rückgang auf die Selbstgleichheit verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A7","text":"Das Substrat des Satzes, etwa A oder „Pflanze“, ist die erscheinende, aber für die reine Identitätsbehauptung zufällige Instanz der Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A8","text":"Identität ist reine Negativität oder Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A9","text":"Der Satz des Widerspruchs bezieht A und Nicht-A als Unterschiedene auf dasselbe A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A10","text":"Die Sätze der Identität und des Widerspruchs sind nicht bloß analytisch, weil sie Verschiedenheit, Negation und Widerspruch enthalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX1","text":"Identität ist nicht die unbewegte Selbstgleichheit, die jedem Unterschied äußerlich gegenübersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX2","text":"Die Wahrheit der Identität ist nicht ihre abstrakte Absonderung von Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX3","text":"Erfahrung ist nicht der Beleg einer isolierten abstrakten Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX4","text":"Der Konsens über A=A ist nicht der Nachweis einer wirklich vollzogenen universellen Erfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX5","text":"Der Satz A=A ist nicht inhaltlich wahr, weil seine gesellschaftlich erfahrbare Wiederholung keine Bestimmung liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX6","text":"Der Satz des Widerspruchs ist nicht eine äußerlich zur Identität hinzugefügte Negationsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D1","text":"Die Behauptung einer von Verschiedenheit abgesonderten wesentlichen Identität verwandelt diese Identität selbst in ein Moment der Trennung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A2","CH_GB18_A_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D2","text":"Die Anerkennung der Unvollständigkeit abstrakter Identität verpflichtet auf eine vorausgesetzte Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit als Maßstab ihrer Wahrheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A2","CH_GB18_A_28:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D3","text":"Jede Berufung auf konkrete Erfahrung gegen die Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit zerstört ihren eigenen Erfahrungsbegriff.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A4","CH_GB18_A_28:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D4","text":"Die Wiederholung einer Identitätsaussage produziert durch die enttäuschte Erwartung einer Bestimmung ihre eigene praktische Widerlegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A1","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D5","text":"Die negative Form des Widerspruchssatzes expliziert, was in der positiven Form von A=A bereits implizit wirksam ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A8","CH_GB18_A_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D6","text":"Der Anspruch, Identität gegen Unterschied als absolutes Wahres zu formulieren, erzeugt gerade den absoluten Unterschied, den er ausschließen soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A3","CH_GB18_A_28:A8","CH_GB18_A_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD1","text":"Das erste Denkgesetz verliert den Status eines ruhenden Fundaments und wird zum Symptom einer Selbstbewegung des Denkens.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A1","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD2","text":"Die Differenz ist nicht ein nachträglicher Zusatz zu bereits fertiger Identität, sondern deren konstitutive Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A3","CH_GB18_A_28:A4","CH_GB18_A_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD3","text":"Der Gegensatz von analytischem und synthetischem Urteil wird für die Grundgesetze des Denkens instabil, weil ihre scheinbare Selbstgleichheit bereits Beziehung auf Anderes enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A9","CH_GB18_A_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD4","text":"Die konkrete Aussageform fungiert als immanente Widerlegung der Abstraktion, sofern sie deren ausgeschlossene Verschiedenheit performativ wieder einführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A5","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß ein Denken durch ein Gesetz begründet werden kann, dessen Wahrheit von jedem Verhältnis zu Anderem gereinigt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Identität und Verschiedenheit zwei äußerlich trennbare, gleichursprüngliche Bestimmungen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß Unmittelbarkeit ohne vermittelte Negation als epistemische Beglaubigung gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muß, daß eine formale Aussage von ihrem Vollzug, ihrer Erwartungsstruktur und ihrer konkreten Anwendung ablösbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer Wahrheit, die als reine Selbstgegenwart ohne inneren Selbstunterschied bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit eines letzten Denkgesetzes, das seine Geltung nicht durch eine Bewegung von Negation und Rückkehr erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt ein absoluter Anfang des Denkens, der nicht bereits die Differenz enthält, die er als nachgeordnet ausgeben möchte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte Selbstgleichheit → Absonderung von Verschiedenheit → Einseitigkeit und Unvollständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS2","text":"Urteil über Unvollständigkeit → vorausgesetzte Vollständigkeit → Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS3","text":"Berufung auf Erfahrung → konkrete Beziehung von Identischem und Mannigfaltigem → Widerlegung isolierter Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS4","text":"Satzform A ist A → Antizipation eines Anderen → Ausbleiben der Bestimmung → Rückkehr und Verschwinden der Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS5","text":"Reflexive Rückkehr → Negativität der Identität → Explikation als A und Nicht-A → Widerspruch als immanenter Gehalt des Identitätssatzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS6","text":"Anspruch auf analytisches Denkgesetz → Enthaltensein von Negation und absolutem Unterschied → Umschlag des Gesetzes in sein behauptetes Gegenteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF1","text":"Anspruch eines ersten Denkgesetzes → Diagnose der leeren Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF2","text":"Leere Tautologie → Nachweis ihrer einseitigen Abgrenzung gegen Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF3","text":"Einseitigkeit → Forderung der Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF4","text":"Erfahrungsberufung → konkrete Erfahrung als Einheit von Identischem und Verschiedenem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF5","text":"Satzförmige Wiederholung → Reflexionsbewegung, Negativität und Verschwinden des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF6","text":"Negativität der Identität → Widerspruchssatz als explizite Selbstunterscheidung → Aufhebung des Anspruchs auf abstrakte Denkgesetzlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME1","text":"Identität wird von einer fixen Relation der Gleichheit zu einer reflexiven Bewegung der Selbstunterscheidung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME2","text":"Verschiedenheit wird von einem äußeren Gegenpol zu einem inneren Moment der Identität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME3","text":"Erfahrung wird nicht als Bestätigung formaler Unmittelbarkeit, sondern als Feld der untrennbaren Einheit von Identität und Unterschied sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Identitätssatz und Widerspruchssatz wird als Verhältnis von impliziter und expliziter Negativität neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME5","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen analytischer Form und synthetischem Gehalt wird an den Grundgesetzen selbst destabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text untersucht die Wahrheitsgeltung des Satzes A=A und seiner negativen Fassung A kann nicht zugleich A und Nicht-A sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Satz der Identität enthält durch Abgrenzung, Substrat und Prädikationsform die Differenz, die er formal ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Rekurs auf unmittelbare Evidenz und allgemeine Anerkennung wird gegen sich selbst gewendet, indem seine konkrete Vollzugsform analysiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identität ist keine ruhende Gegebenheit, sondern negative Reflexionsbewegung von Setzung, Andersheit, Verschwinden und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Umkehrung des Identitätsgesetzes in einen Begriff immanenter Differenz zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die Satzform notwendigerweise die behauptete ontologische Struktur der Reflexion ausdrücken muß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Verschiedenheit als internes Moment und nicht als äußerer Gegensatz der Identität bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Operation besteht in der Verbindung von logischer Formanalyse, Erfahrungsanalyse und performativer Widerlegung leerer Wiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung bleibt zwischen der Zurückweisung empirischer Beglaubigung abstrakter Identität und der Nutzung sozial erfahrbarer Wirkung als negativer Evidenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß abstrakte Identität zugleich als unwahr für sich und als notwendiges Moment der vollständigen Wahrheit behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur dann, wenn der Widerspruch nicht als äußerer Fehler, sondern als expliziter Gehalt der Identität gefaßt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112122138088Z_ab68f93d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 2.","source_sha256":"44594ef31dc6b2babdb599ba9fac399907d0b20ec3b7554f89731032a0c82236","sha256":"97af33d77133c2fc219b0b07334b2e4305228feb509de89c965b53b350463d39","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:21:22.140628+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS1","text":"The proposition claimed as the first law of thought is to be examined for its capacity for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS2","text":"Abstract self-sameness proves to be an empty and one-sided determination, because its delimitation from difference already introduces difference into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS3","text":"The incompleteness of abstract identity presupposes a totality in which identity is true only with difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS4","text":"Experience and propositional form refute the assertion that abstract identity is immediately, universally, and in itself true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AS5","text":"The proposition of identity and the proposition of contradiction contain, contrary to their intended reading, reflexive negativity and absolute difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A1","text":"The positive proposition A=A initially expresses only empty tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A2","text":"Abstract identity, as a determination separated from difference, is one-sided and incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A3","text":"The determination of identity as different from difference posits difference in the nature of identity itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A4","text":"For identity, truth consists only in its unity with difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A5","text":"Concrete experience always contains identity only in relation to a diverse manifold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A6","text":"The form of the proposition of identity enacts a movement of reflection: it opens up difference and lets it vanish in the return to self-sameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A7","text":"The substrate of the proposition, such as A or “plant,” is the appearing, yet contingent for the pure assertion of identity, instance of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A8","text":"Identity is pure negativity or negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A9","text":"The proposition of contradiction relates A and non-A, as differentiated, to the same A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:A10","text":"The propositions of identity and contradiction are not merely analytic, because they contain difference, negation, and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX1","text":"Identity is not the motionless self-sameness that stands externally opposed to every difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX2","text":"The truth of identity is not its abstract isolation from difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX3","text":"Experience is not evidence of an isolated abstract identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX4","text":"Consensus regarding A=A is not proof of a genuinely enacted universal experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX5","text":"The proposition A=A is not true in content, because its socially experienceable repetition supplies no determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:NX6","text":"The proposition of contradiction is not a form of negation externally added to identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D1","text":"The assertion of an essential identity separated from difference transforms this identity itself into a moment of separation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A2","CH_GB18_A_28:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D2","text":"The recognition of the incompleteness of abstract identity commits one to a presupposed unity of identity and difference as the measure of its truth.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A2","CH_GB18_A_28:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D3","text":"Every appeal to concrete experience against the unity of identity and difference destroys its own concept of experience.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A4","CH_GB18_A_28:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D4","text":"The repetition of a proposition of identity produces, through the disappointed expectation of a determination, its own practical refutation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A1","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D5","text":"The negative form of the proposition of contradiction explicates what is already implicitly operative in the positive form of A=A.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A8","CH_GB18_A_28:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:D6","text":"The claim to formulate identity against difference as the absolute true produces precisely the absolute difference that it is supposed to exclude.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A3","CH_GB18_A_28:A8","CH_GB18_A_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD1","text":"The first law of thought loses the status of a resting foundation and becomes the symptom of a self-movement of thought.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A1","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD2","text":"Difference is not an additional supplement to identity already complete, but its constitutive negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A3","CH_GB18_A_28:A4","CH_GB18_A_28:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD3","text":"The opposition of analytic and synthetic judgment becomes unstable for the fundamental laws of thought, because their apparent self-sameness already contains relation to an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A9","CH_GB18_A_28:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SD4","text":"The concrete form of assertion functions as an immanent refutation of abstraction insofar as it performatively reintroduces the difference excluded by the latter.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_28:A5","CH_GB18_A_28:A6","CH_GB18_A_28:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX1","text":"It must be false that a thinking can be grounded by a law whose truth is purified of every relation to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX2","text":"It must be false that identity and difference are two externally separable, equally originary determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX3","text":"It must be false that immediacy without mediated negation can count as epistemic authentication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:DNX4","text":"It must be false that a formal statement can be detached from its enactment, its structure of expectation, and its concrete application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a truth that could subsist as pure self-presence without inner self-difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an ultimate law of thought that does not produce its validity through a movement of negation and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:SNX3","text":"Unavailable remains an absolute beginning of thought that does not already contain the difference it wishes to present as subordinate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS1","text":"Abstract self-sameness → separation from difference → one-sidedness and incompleteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS2","text":"Judgment of incompleteness → presupposed completeness → unity of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS3","text":"Appeal to experience → concrete relation of the identical and the manifold → refutation of isolated identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS4","text":"Propositional form A is A → anticipation of an other → absence of determination → return and vanishing of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS5","text":"Reflexive return → negativity of identity → explication as A and non-A → contradiction as immanent content of the proposition of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:FGS6","text":"Claim to an analytic law of thought → inclusion of negation and absolute difference → reversal of the law into its asserted opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF1","text":"Claim of a first law of thought → diagnosis of empty tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF2","text":"Empty tautology → demonstration of its one-sided delimitation against difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF3","text":"One-sidedness → demand for the unity of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF4","text":"Appeal to experience → concrete experience as unity of the identical and the different.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF5","text":"Propositional repetition → movement of reflection, negativity, and vanishing of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:AF6","text":"Negativity of identity → proposition of contradiction as explicit self-differentiation → sublation of the claim to abstract lawfulness of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME1","text":"Identity is remapped from a fixed relation of equality into a reflexive movement of self-differentiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME2","text":"Difference is reclassified from an external counterpole into an inner moment of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME3","text":"Experience becomes visible not as confirmation of formal immediacy, but as the field of the inseparable unity of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME4","text":"The opposition between the proposition of identity and the proposition of contradiction is newly determined as a relation of implicit and explicit negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ME5","text":"The distinction between analytic form and synthetic content is destabilized in the fundamental laws themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines the validity in truth of the proposition A=A and its negative formulation A cannot simultaneously be A and non-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT2","text":"Structural — Through delimitation, substrate, and predicative form, the proposition of identity contains the difference that it formally excludes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The recourse to immediate evidence and general recognition is turned against itself by analyzing its concrete form of enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identity is not a resting given, but a negative movement of reflection of positing, otherness, vanishing, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reversal of the law of identity into a concept of immanent difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why the propositional form must necessarily express the asserted ontological structure of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as difference is determined as an internal moment and not as an external opposition to identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation consists in the conjunction of logical formal analysis, analysis of experience, and performative refutation of empty repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension remains between the rejection of empirical authentication of abstract identity and the use of socially experienceable effect as negative evidence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that abstract identity is treated both as untrue in itself and as a necessary moment of complete truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_28:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if contradiction is grasped not as an external error, but as the explicit content of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_28:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_28@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_28:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 112","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 112","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU","layer":"CH","title":"1. The Absolute Difference.","order":113,"parents":["RAW_GB18_1DAU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DAU@R001","sha256":"6c6d90f8a0bcd409dd49eb7c2fd7754f39c6733ee654e43f79cb69039d6e6a98","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS1","text":"Der Unterschied wird als immanente Bestimmung der Reflexion gegen die äußere Beziehung bereits bestehender Daseiender bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS2","text":"Die Reflexion erzeugt den Unterschied aus ihrer eigenen Negativität, die zugleich als Nichts im identischen Sprechen erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS3","text":"Der absolute Unterschied wird als einfacher, sich auf sich beziehender Unterschied von A und Nicht-A unter derselben Bestimmungsrücksicht gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS4","text":"Der sich auf sich beziehende Unterschied bestimmt sich als Negativität seiner selbst und erhält dadurch die Identität als sein immanentes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS5","text":"Unterschied und Identität bilden eine Einheit, in der jedes zugleich Ganzes und Moment der Reflexion ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS6","text":"Die gegenseitige Selbstbeziehung beider Momente erzeugt den bestimmten Unterschied und führt, sofern beide selbst Reflexionen in sich sind, zur Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS7","text":"Die Argumentbewegung ist rekonstruktiv-metaphysisch: immanente Negativität → absolute Differenz → innere Einheit mit der Identität → bestimmter Unterschied → Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A1","text":"Die Reflexion enthält Negativität in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A2","text":"Die Identität bestimmt sich als Negativität ihrer selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A3","text":"Der Unterschied ist ein wesentliches Moment der Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A4","text":"Der absolute Unterschied ist Unterschied an und für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A5","text":"Der absolute Unterschied ist einfach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A6","text":"Das einfache Nicht konstituiert den Unterschied von A und Nicht-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A7","text":"Der Unterschied der Reflexion bezieht sich auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A8","text":"Der Unterschied an sich ist die Negativität seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A9","text":"Die Identität ist das Andere des Unterschieds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","text":"Unterschied und Identität sind jeweils zugleich Ganzes und Moment der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A11","text":"Unterschied und Identität setzen sich als Momente beziehungsweise als Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A12","text":"Der bestimmte Unterschied ist die Einheit von Unterschied und Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A13","text":"In dieser Einheit erhält sich jedes Moment im jeweils anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A14","text":"Die Momente des Unterschieds sind jeweils Beziehungen auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A15","text":"Ein Unterschied aus Momenten, die selbst Reflexionen in sich sind, ist Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX1","text":"Der absolute Unterschied ist kein durch ein Äußerliches gesetzter Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX2","text":"Der Unterschied der Reflexion ist nicht das Anderssein äußerlich auseinanderfallender Daseiender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX3","text":"Der Unterschied der Reflexion ist kein Übergehen einer Bestimmtheit in eine andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX4","text":"Das Andere des Wesens ist kein außerhalb des Wesens befindliches Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX5","text":"Der Unterschied ist keine bloße Beziehung auf ein von ihm getrenntes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX6","text":"Die Identität verliert sich nicht im Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX7","text":"Der Unterschied ist keine reine, von der Identität isolierte Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX8","text":"Die Einfachheit des Unterschieds bedeutet nicht eine unterschiedslose Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D1","text":"Der Unterschied von A und Nicht-A ist einfach, weil beide durch dasselbe Nicht und unter derselben Bestimmungsrücksicht unterschieden sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A5","CH_GB18_1DAU:A6","CH_GB18_1DAU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D2","text":"Der Unterschied ist zugleich er selbst und die Identität, weil seine Selbstnegation die Identität als sein Anderes hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A8","CH_GB18_1DAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D3","text":"Die Beziehung von Unterschied und Identität ist keine nachträgliche Verbindung, sondern die konstitutive Form des Unterschieds selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A9","CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D4","text":"Der Unterschied bildet als Einheit mit der Identität einen bestimmten Unterschied.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D5","text":"Im bestimmten Unterschied erhält sich die Identität im Unterschied, ohne in ihn als ihr Anderes überzugehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A12","CH_GB18_1DAU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D6","text":"Unterschied und Identität sind als Momente zugleich Gesetztsein und Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A11","CH_GB18_1DAU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D7","text":"Wenn beide Momente selbst Reflexionen in sich sind, bestimmt sich der Unterschied als Verschiedenheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A14","CH_GB18_1DAU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD1","text":"Die Unterscheidung entsteht nicht aus der Beziehung zwischen vorgegebenen Einheiten, sondern aus der Selbstbeziehung der Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD2","text":"Identität und Unterschied sind keine gegeneinander verselbständigten Pole, sondern wechselseitig konstituierende Momente einer Reflexionseinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD3","text":"Die Reflexion wird zum Grund von Tätigkeit und Selbstbewegung, weil ihre Negativität sich auf sich selbst bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD4","text":"Die ontologische Form des Unterschieds wird von äußerer Trennung und Übergang auf immanente Bestimmung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD5","text":"Verschiedenheit bezeichnet keine bloße Vielheit äußerlich getrennter Dinge, sondern eine gegliederte Einheit selbstbezüglicher Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem identische Dinge zuerst bestehen und erst anschließend durch eine äußere Relation unterschieden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Identität, die vor oder außerhalb ihrer Differenz existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein reiner Unterschied, der ohne Identität als sein immanentes Anderes bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein äußerer Grund, der die Einheit von Unterschied und Identität vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist der Übergang zwischen fixierten Bestimmungen als letzte Form von Tätigkeit und Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Reduktion des Wesensunterschieds auf das äußerliche Anderssein des Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX1","text":"Eine letzte Erklärung durch Äußerlichkeit oder externe Vermittlung steht dem System nicht zur Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX2","text":"Keine absolute Identität und kein absoluter Unterschied können isoliert voneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX3","text":"Es gibt keinen einfachen Grund jenseits der inneren Beziehung von Identität und Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit, Selbstbewegung als bloßes Übergehen zwischen äußerlich fixierten Bestimmungen zu erklären, wird gesperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX5","text":"Eine Differenz außerhalb der Reflexion, des Wesens und ihrer immanenten Negativität ist als systemischer Ausgangspunkt nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS1","text":"Reflexion → Negativität in sich → Unterschied als immanentes Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS2","text":"Negativität der Identität → Selbstbestimmung → Unterschied an und für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS3","text":"A und Nicht-A unter derselben Rücksicht → einfaches Nicht → absoluter einfacher Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS4","text":"Sich auf sich beziehender Unterschied → Unterschied von sich selbst → Identität als internes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS5","text":"Unterschied und Identität → gegenseitige Erhaltung → Einheit von Ganzem und Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS6","text":"Einheit beider Momente → bestimmter Unterschied ohne Übergang in ein Äußeres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS7","text":"Beide Momente als Reflexionen in sich → Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AF1","text":"Negativität der Reflexion → einfaches Nicht → absoluter Unterschied → Selbstunterschied → Identität als immanentes Anderes → Einheit von Unterschied und Identität → bestimmter Unterschied → Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME1","text":"Unterschied wird von einer Relation zwischen Daseienden zu einer inneren Operation der Reflexion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME2","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von A und Nicht-A wird als gemeinsamer Bestimmungsgrund und nicht als äußerliche Trennung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Identität und Unterschied wird in eine gegenseitige Momentstruktur überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen statischer Bestimmung und Bewegung wird durch die Kategorie der sich auf sich beziehenden Negativität reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME5","text":"Verschiedenheit wird als Resultat innerer Reflexionsgliederung und nicht als bloße Vielheit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Unterschied erscheint als Negativität der Reflexion und als wesentliches Moment der Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die tragende Struktur ist die wechselseitige Konstitution von Identität und Unterschied als selbstbezügliche Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Argumentation ersetzt die äußerliche Vergleichung von Bestimmungen durch ihre Rekonstruktion aus einem gemeinsamen immanenten Bestimmungsgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Unterschied des Wesens wird vom Anderssein des Daseins und vom Übergang zwischen Bestimmungen auf reflektierte Selbstbewegung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierte Axiomenmenge reicht aus, um die Bewegung von der Reflexionsnegativität bis zur Verschiedenheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie das einfache Nicht formal aus dem identischen Sprechen beziehungsweise aus der Identität hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur, sofern die Identität als immanentes Anderes des Unterschieds akzeptiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist das System bei der Aufhebung des Gegensatzes zwischen äußerer Differenz und innerer Reflexionsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Bestimmung des einfachen Unterschieds als beinahe unterschiedslos und seiner Bestimmung als konstitutives Moment des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass der Unterschied zugleich nicht er selbst und gerade er selbst sein soll; ihre Auflösung durch die Identität als internes Anderes wird behauptet, aber nicht weiter vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, komprimiert jedoch die Herleitung vom bestimmten Unterschied zur Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110225791423Z_68992557","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1. Absolute Difference.","source_sha256":"6c6d90f8a0bcd409dd49eb7c2fd7754f39c6733ee654e43f79cb69039d6e6a98","sha256":"a86be6247fdf3ac4d3ab6dae26be5ba000c5530b05381a0b140a160a555bfa1c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:02:25.792425+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS1","text":"Difference is determined as an immanent determination of reflection, as against the external relation of already existing existents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS2","text":"Reflection produces difference out of its own negativity, which at the same time appears as nothing in identical speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS3","text":"Absolute difference is conceived as the simple, self-relating difference of A and non-A under the same respect of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS4","text":"The self-relating difference determines itself as the negativity of itself and thereby receives identity as its immanent other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS5","text":"Difference and identity form a unity in which each is at once whole and moment of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS6","text":"The reciprocal self-relation of both moments produces determinate difference and leads, insofar as both are themselves reflections within themselves, to diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AS7","text":"The movement of argument is reconstructive-metaphysical: immanent negativity → absolute difference → inner unity with identity → determinate difference → diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A1","text":"Reflection contains negativity within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A2","text":"Identity determines itself as the negativity of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A3","text":"Difference is an essential moment of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A4","text":"Absolute difference is difference in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A5","text":"Absolute difference is simple.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A6","text":"The simple not constitutes the difference of A and non-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A7","text":"The difference of reflection relates to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A8","text":"Difference in itself is the negativity of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A9","text":"Identity is the other of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","text":"Difference and identity are each at once whole and moment of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A11","text":"Difference and identity posit themselves as moments, or respectively as positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A12","text":"Determinate difference is the unity of difference and identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A13","text":"In this unity, each moment preserves itself in the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A14","text":"The moments of difference are each relations to themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:A15","text":"A difference composed of moments that are themselves reflections within themselves is diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX1","text":"Absolute difference is not a difference posited by something external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX2","text":"The difference of reflection is not the being-other of externally falling-apart existents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX3","text":"The difference of reflection is not the transition of one determinacy into another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX4","text":"The other of essence is not an other situated outside essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX5","text":"Difference is not a mere relation to an other separate from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX6","text":"Identity does not lose itself in difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX7","text":"Difference is not a pure negation isolated from identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:NX8","text":"The simplicity of difference does not mean an undifferentiated identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D1","text":"The difference of A and non-A is simple because both are distinguished through the same not and under the same respect of determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A5","CH_GB18_1DAU:A6","CH_GB18_1DAU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D2","text":"Difference is at once itself and identity because its self-negation brings forth identity as its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A8","CH_GB18_1DAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D3","text":"The relation of difference and identity is not a subsequent connection, but the constitutive form of difference itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A9","CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D4","text":"As unity with identity, difference constitutes a determinate difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D5","text":"In determinate difference, identity preserves itself in difference without passing over into it as its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A12","CH_GB18_1DAU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D6","text":"As moments, difference and identity are at once positedness and self-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A10","CH_GB18_1DAU:A11","CH_GB18_1DAU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:D7","text":"If both moments are themselves reflections within themselves, difference determines itself as diversity.","refs":["CH_GB18_1DAU:A14","CH_GB18_1DAU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD1","text":"Distinction arises not from the relation between pre-given unities, but from the self-relation of negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD2","text":"Identity and difference are not poles rendered independent in opposition to one another, but reciprocally constituting moments of a unity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD3","text":"Reflection becomes the ground of activity and self-movement because its negativity relates to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD4","text":"The ontological form of difference is shifted from external separation and transition to immanent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SD5","text":"Diversity denotes not a mere multiplicity of externally separated things, but an articulated unity of self-relating moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which identical things first exist and are only subsequently distinguished by an external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a pure identity that exists prior to or outside its difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a pure difference that could exist without identity as its immanent other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an external ground that mediates the unity of difference and identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX5","text":"Excluded is transition between fixed determinacies as the ultimate form of activity and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the reduction of the difference of essence to the external being-other of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX1","text":"No ultimate explanation through externality or external mediation is available to the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX2","text":"No absolute identity and no absolute difference can exist in isolation from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX3","text":"There is no simple ground beyond the inner relation of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX4","text":"The possibility of explaining self-movement as a mere transition between externally fixed determinacies is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:SNX5","text":"A difference outside reflection, essence, and their immanent negativity is unavailable as a systematic point of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS1","text":"Reflection → negativity within itself → difference as immanent nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS2","text":"Negativity of identity → self-determination → difference in and for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS3","text":"A and non-A under the same respect → simple not → absolute simple difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS4","text":"Self-relating difference → difference from itself → identity as internal other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS5","text":"Difference and identity → reciprocal preservation → unity of whole and moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS6","text":"Unity of both moments → determinate difference without transition into an externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:FGS7","text":"Both moments as reflections within themselves → diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:AF1","text":"Negativity of reflection → simple not → absolute difference → self-difference → identity as immanent other → unity of difference and identity → determinate difference → diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME1","text":"Difference is remapped from a relation between existents to an inner operation of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME2","text":"The juxtaposition of A and non-A becomes legible as a common ground of determination and not as external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME3","text":"The opposition of identity and difference is transformed into a reciprocal moment-structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME4","text":"The opposition between static determination and movement is reorganized through the category of self-relating negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ME5","text":"Diversity is classified as the result of an inner articulation of reflection and not as mere multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Difference appears as negativity of reflection and as an essential moment of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — The supporting structure is the reciprocal constitution of identity and difference as self-relating moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argumentation replaces the external comparison of determinacies with their reconstruction from a common immanent ground of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The difference of essence is shifted from the being-other of existence and from transition between determinacies to reflected self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT1","text":"The extracted set of axioms suffices to reconstruct the movement from reflection-negativity to diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the simple not formally proceeds from identical speaking, or respectively from identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as identity is accepted as the immanent other of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT4","text":"The system is strongest in the sublation of the opposition between external difference and inner determination of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the determination of simple difference as almost undifferentiated and its determination as a constitutive moment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that difference is supposed to be at once not itself and precisely itself; its resolution through identity as internal other is asserted but not further mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_1DAU:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_1DAU:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument, but compresses the derivation from determinate difference to diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_1DAU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_1DAU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 113","title":"1. The Absolute Difference.","context":"Chapter 113","original_title":"1. Der absolute Unterschied."},"original_title":"1. Der absolute Unterschied.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0","layer":"CH","title":"2. Diversity.","order":114,"parents":["RAW_GB18_2DV0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DV0@R001","sha256":"481e941dc1676f48410dcff86c994c4d1223746b07a1ca5802361e7f495e7637","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS1","text":"Die Identität muss als sich negierende Reflexion begriffen werden, damit Verschiedenheit nicht als äußerlich hinzutretende Bestimmung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS2","text":"Verschiedenheit setzt die Identität als ihren Boden voraus und erscheint deshalb zunächst als Gleichgültigkeit selbstbezüglicher Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS3","text":"Die äußerliche Behandlung der Verschiedenheit erzeugt Gleichheit und Ungleichheit als gesetzte Vergleichsbestimmungen eines Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS4","text":"Das Vergleichen versucht Gleichheit und Ungleichheit durch Seiten, Rücksichten und Insofern-Bestimmungen auseinanderzuhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS5","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit der getrennten Vergleichsbestimmungen zerstört ihre wechselseitige Bestimmtheit und hebt den äußerlichen Unterschied auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS6","text":"Die Selbstaufhebung der Verschiedenheit setzt die negative Einheit frei, in der Gleichheit und Ungleichheit Momente eines Gegensatzes sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A1","text":"Identität ist nur als Reflexion in sich, die ihr eigenes Negieren aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","text":"Verschiedenheit besteht nur auf dem Boden der Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A3","text":"Das Verschiedene ist als mit sich identisch gegen anderes gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A4","text":"Identität und Unterschied sind als Momente der Verschiedenheit zunächst nur selbstbezügliche Reflexionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","text":"Was nur selbstbezüglich ist, ist nicht durch das andere bestimmt; sein Unterschied wird äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","text":"Gesetztsein ist äußerliche Reflexion und Negation als Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","text":"Gleichheit ist äußerlich gesetzte Identität, und Ungleichheit ist äußerlich gesetzter Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit beziehen sich nicht ursprünglich auf die verglichenen Dinge, sondern auf die äußerliche Reflexion eines Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A9","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit haben Bedeutung nur als wechselseitige Bestimmungen des Unterschieds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit der Gleichheit und Ungleichheit gegeneinander hebt ihren Unterschied auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A11","text":"Die negative Einheit des Vergleichens ist nicht bloß subjektive Tätigkeit, sondern die immanente Natur von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A12","text":"Der bloß gesetzte Unterschied ist ein Unterschied, der keiner ist, und daher Negation seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A13","text":"Verschiedenheit ist die Einheit gleichgültiger Seiten, die nur Momente einer negativen Einheit sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX1","text":"Verschiedenheit ist nicht unmittelbares Anderssein des Daseins, dessen Negativität im unmittelbaren Sein gründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX2","text":"Identität und Unterschied sind nicht ursprünglich getrennte, gegeneinander bestimmte Qualitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX3","text":"Gleichheit ist keine Identität, die den verglichenen Dingen an und für sich zukommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX4","text":"Ungleichheit ist kein dem Ungleichen selbst immanenter Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX5","text":"Das Vergleichen ist keine stabile Vermittlung, die Gleichheit und Ungleichheit dauerhaft voneinander isolieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX6","text":"Die Insofern-Unterscheidung ist keine Lösung des Widerspruchs zwischen Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX7","text":"Äußerlicher Unterschied ist nicht selbständig; seine Form ist Selbstaufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D1","text":"Verschiedenheit ist die reflektierte Form von Anderssein, weil das Negative nur durch Identität mit sich bestehen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A1","CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","CH_GB18_2DV0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D2","text":"Die Selbstbezüglichkeit von Identität und Unterschied verwandelt ihren behaupteten Gegensatz in äußere Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A4","CH_GB18_2DV0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D3","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit sind keine Grundbestimmungen des Seienden, sondern Produkte gesetzter äußerlicher Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","CH_GB18_2DV0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D4","text":"Die Vergleichsrelation setzt einen dritten Standpunkt voraus, der zugleich außerhalb des Verglichenen und dessen immanente negative Einheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D5","text":"Das Auseinanderhalten von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit entzieht beiden die relationale Differenz, durch die sie allein bestimmt sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A9","CH_GB18_2DV0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D6","text":"Die abstrakte Identität der bloß an sich seienden Reflexion fällt mit Gesetztsein zusammen.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D7","text":"Die negative Einheit ist die Wahrheit der äußerlichen Vergleichsformen, weil deren Selbständigkeit deren eigene Negation hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD1","text":"Jede Bestimmung, die sich als bloß gleichgültig gegen ihr Anderes setzt, reproduziert dieses Andere als Bedingung ihrer eigenen Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","CH_GB18_2DV0:A3","CH_GB18_2DV0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD2","text":"Die Opposition zwischen immanenter Bestimmung und äußerlicher Zuschreibung ist instabil, weil die äußerliche Reflexion als negative Einheit in die Bestimmungen selbst zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD3","text":"Vergleich erzeugt nicht bloß Erkenntnis über Verschiedenes, sondern enthüllt die Selbstnegation der Kategorien, mittels deren es verglichen wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD4","text":"Die Bewegung von Verschiedenheit zu Gegensatz ist notwendig, weil bloß gesetzter und gleichgültiger Unterschied seine eigene Differenz nicht erhalten kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12","CH_GB18_2DV0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Bestimmungen könnten unabhängig von ihrer Negation einen festen positiven Inhalt besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, ein äußerer Beobachter könne Vergleichsverhältnisse setzen, ohne in deren immanente Negativität einzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die Abstraktion von Negation sichere eine reine, nicht gesetzte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, relationale Kategorien könnten durch die Trennung ihrer Relata vor Widerspruch geschützt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine letzte positive Differenz, die weder von Identität getragen noch durch negative Reflexion vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein äußerlicher Standpunkt, der die Kategorien des Vergleichs begründet, ohne selbst als Moment ihrer Bewegung bestimmt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine endgültige Koexistenz von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit als getrennten und zugleich bedeutungsvollen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS1","text":"Identität als Selbstnegation → reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit des Negativen → Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS2","text":"Selbstbezüglichkeit von Identität und Unterschied → fehlende wechselseitige Bestimmung → äußerlicher Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS3","text":"Äußerliche Reflexion → Gesetztsein → Gleichheit und Ungleichheit als Vergleichsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS4","text":"Vergleich durch einen Dritten → Trennung nach Rücksichten → Gleichgültigkeit der getrennten Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS5","text":"Gleichgültigkeit → Verlust relationaler Bestimmtheit → Selbstaufhebung von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS6","text":"Selbstaufhebung des gesetzten Unterschieds → negative Einheit → Verschiedenheit als Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF1","text":"Identität als negative Reflexion → Verschiedenheit als reflektiertes Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF2","text":"Verschiedenheit als Gleichgültigkeit → äußerliche Setzung von Identität und Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF3","text":"Äußerliche Setzung → Gleichheit und Ungleichheit → Vergleich durch einen Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF4","text":"Vergleichende Trennung → Verlust der wechselseitigen Differenz → negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF5","text":"Negative Einheit → Selbstnegation der Verschiedenheit → Gegensatz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME1","text":"Identität und Unterschied werden von festen Gegenbestimmungen zu reflexiven Momenten einer einzigen negativen Bewegung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME2","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit werden von Eigenschaften verglichener Dinge zu äußerlichen Formen des Gesetztseins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen subjektivem Vergleichen und objektiver Bestimmtheit wird aufgehoben, indem das Vergleichende als immanente negative Einheit bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen äußerem Unterschied und immanentem Gegensatz wird als notwendige Übergangsarchitektur sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt Verschiedenheit über Gleichheit, Ungleichheit und Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Vergleichsbestimmungen werden als gesetzte Formen äußerlicher Reflexion bestimmt, deren Trennung ihre Bedeutung zerstört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse verlegt die Entscheidung über Unterschiede von der bloßen Zuordnung von Eigenschaften auf die Reflexionsform, die Zuordnung überhaupt ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Bestimmtheit besteht nur als Selbstbeziehung durch Negation; jede fixierte Verschiedenheit trägt ihren Übergang in negative Einheit in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Identität über Verschiedenheit und Vergleichung zur negativen Einheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die Begründung, weshalb die negative Einheit nicht bloß als Leistung eines äußerlichen Vergleichenden verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT3","text":"Die Konstruktion ist kohärent, sofern Selbstbezüglichkeit notwendig als negative und nicht als bloß abstrakte Identität verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umkehrung, durch die die äußerliche Vergleichsrelation als immanente Selbstaufhebung ihrer eigenen Kategorien erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass das Vergleichende zunächst als äußerlich-subjektiv bestimmt wird und erst nachträglich als Natur der verglichenen Bestimmungen gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass Gleichgültigkeit zugleich als Stabilisierung selbstbezüglicher Bestimmungen und als Mechanismus ihrer Auflösung fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn Gleichheit und Ungleichheit nicht als Endpunkte, sondern als instabile Durchgangsformen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110441596432Z_a727f762","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2. Diversity.","source_sha256":"481e941dc1676f48410dcff86c994c4d1223746b07a1ca5802361e7f495e7637","sha256":"5e6f974d5e4bffaaf013c4c12711c28ce71597ce3a5f4f717f236568abc0947c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:04:41.597408+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS1","text":"Identity must be grasped as self-negating reflection, so that diversity does not appear as a determination added externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS2","text":"Diversity presupposes identity as its ground and therefore initially appears as the indifference of self-relating moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS3","text":"The external treatment of diversity produces equality and inequality as posited comparative determinations of a third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS4","text":"Comparison attempts to keep equality and inequality apart by means of sides, respects, and insofar-determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS5","text":"The indifference of the separated comparative determinations destroys their reciprocal determinateness and sublates the external difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AS6","text":"The self-sublation of diversity releases the negative unity in which equality and inequality are moments of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A1","text":"Identity is only reflection into itself that sublates its own negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","text":"Diversity exists only on the ground of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A3","text":"What is diverse is, as identical with itself, indifferent toward another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A4","text":"Identity and difference, as moments of diversity, are initially only self-relating reflections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","text":"What is only self-relating is not determined by the other; its difference becomes external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","text":"Positedness is external reflection and negation as negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","text":"Equality is externally posited identity, and inequality is externally posited difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","text":"Equality and inequality do not originally relate to the things compared, but to the external reflection of a third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A9","text":"Equality and inequality have significance only as reciprocal determinations of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","text":"The indifference of equality and inequality toward one another sublates their difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A11","text":"The negative unity of comparison is not merely subjective activity, but the immanent nature of equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A12","text":"Merely posited difference is a difference that is none, and hence the negation of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:A13","text":"Diversity is the unity of indifferent sides that are only moments of a negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX1","text":"Diversity is not the immediate otherness of determinate being, whose negativity is grounded in immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX2","text":"Identity and difference are not originally separate qualities determined against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX3","text":"Equality is not an identity that pertains to the things compared in and for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX4","text":"Inequality is not a difference immanent in the unequal itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX5","text":"Comparison is not a stable mediation that could permanently isolate equality and inequality from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX6","text":"The insofar-distinction is not a solution to the contradiction between equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:NX7","text":"External difference is not self-subsistent; its form is self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D1","text":"Diversity is the reflected form of otherness, because the negative can subsist only through identity with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A1","CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","CH_GB18_2DV0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D2","text":"The self-relatedness of identity and difference transforms their asserted opposition into external determinateness.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A4","CH_GB18_2DV0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D3","text":"Equality and inequality are not fundamental determinations of what is, but products of posited external reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","CH_GB18_2DV0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D4","text":"The relation of comparison presupposes a third standpoint that is at once outside what is compared and its immanent negative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D5","text":"Keeping equality and inequality apart deprives both of the relational difference through which alone they are determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A9","CH_GB18_2DV0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D6","text":"The abstract identity of reflection that is merely in itself coincides with positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:D7","text":"Negative unity is the truth of the external forms of comparison, because their self-subsistence brings forth their own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD1","text":"Every determination that posits itself as merely indifferent toward its other reproduces this other as the condition of its own determinateness.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A2","CH_GB18_2DV0:A3","CH_GB18_2DV0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD2","text":"The opposition between immanent determination and external attribution is unstable, because external reflection returns into the determinations themselves as negative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A6","CH_GB18_2DV0:A8","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD3","text":"Comparison does not merely produce knowledge about diverse things, but reveals the self-negation of the categories by means of which they are compared.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A7","CH_GB18_2DV0:A10","CH_GB18_2DV0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SD4","text":"The movement from diversity to opposition is necessary, because merely posited and indifferent difference cannot preserve its own difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_2DV0:A5","CH_GB18_2DV0:A12","CH_GB18_2DV0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that determinations could possess a fixed positive content independently of their negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that an external observer could posit comparative relations without entering into their immanent negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that abstraction from negation secures a pure, unposited identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that relational categories could be protected from contradiction through the separation of their relata.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an ultimate positive difference that would be neither sustained by identity nor mediated through negative reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an external standpoint that grounds the categories of comparison without itself being determined as a moment of their movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a definitive coexistence of equality and inequality as separate and yet meaningful determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS1","text":"Identity as self-negation → reflected immediacy of the negative → diversity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS2","text":"Self-relatedness of identity and difference → lack of reciprocal determination → external difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS3","text":"External reflection → positedness → equality and inequality as forms of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS4","text":"Comparison through a third → separation according to respects → indifference of the separated forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS5","text":"Indifference → loss of relational determinateness → self-sublation of equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:FGS6","text":"Self-sublation of posited difference → negative unity → diversity as opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF1","text":"Identity as negative reflection → diversity as reflected otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF2","text":"Diversity as indifference → external positing of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF3","text":"External positing → equality and inequality → comparison through a third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF4","text":"Comparative separation → loss of reciprocal difference → negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:AF5","text":"Negative unity → self-negation of diversity → opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME1","text":"Identity and difference are reclassified from fixed counter-determinations into reflexive moments of a single negative movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME2","text":"Equality and inequality are reclassified from properties of compared things into external forms of positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME3","text":"The opposition between subjective comparison and objective determinateness is sublated by determining the comparing as immanent negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ME4","text":"The distinction between external difference and immanent opposition becomes visible as a necessary transitional architecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines diversity through equality, inequality, and comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Comparative determinations are determined as posited forms of external reflection, whose separation destroys their significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis shifts the decision concerning differences from the mere attribution of properties to the form of reflection that makes attribution possible in the first place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinateness exists only as self-relation through negation; every fixed diversity bears within itself its transition into negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from identity through diversity and comparison to negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the grounding of why negative unity does not remain merely the achievement of an external comparer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT3","text":"The construction is coherent insofar as self-relatedness is necessarily understood as negative and not as merely abstract identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the reversal through which the external relation of comparison appears as the immanent self-sublation of its own categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that the comparing is initially determined as external-subjective and only subsequently counts as the nature of the compared determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT6","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that indifference functions at once as stabilization of self-relating determinations and as the mechanism of their dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_2DV0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text only if equality and inequality are treated not as endpoints, but as unstable transitional forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_2DV0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_2DV0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_2DV0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 114","title":"2. Diversity.","context":"Chapter 114","original_title":"2. Die Verschiedenheit."},"original_title":"2. Die Verschiedenheit.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":115,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_29"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_29@R001","sha256":"c54e2919d9e76ac0eff787915515aa25a78c742aa1930cc6ed8739c1d74404ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS1","text":"Das Argument problematisiert die anfängliche Gleichgültigkeit von Identität und Verschiedenheit als voneinander unabhängigen Sätzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS2","text":"Es bestimmt Verschiedenheit neu als bestimmte, durch Ungleichheit vermittelte Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS3","text":"Der Text verfährt diagnostisch und rekonstruktiv, indem er die Unzulänglichkeit unmittelbarer Sätze aus ihrer eigenen Bestimmungslogik entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS4","text":"Die gerichtete Bewegung verläuft von Identität über Verschiedenheit und Ungleichheit zur Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS5","text":"Der Anspruch auf allgemeine Ungleichheit verlangt Vermittlung, weil verschiedene Bestimmungen in einem synthetischen Satz nicht unmittelbar verbunden werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS6","text":"Die Trennung von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit durch das „Insofern“ beseitigt den Widerspruch nicht, sondern verlegt ihn in die äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A1","text":"Im Satz der Identität gilt A als mit sich identisches, unbestimmtes und vertauschbares Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A2","text":"Identität und Verschiedenheit werden zunächst als je für sich geltende und gleichgültig gegeneinander gehaltene Bestimmungen angesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A3","text":"Numerische Vielheit erzeugt nur unbestimmte Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A4","text":"Bestimmte Verschiedenheit besteht in Ungleichheit und nicht in bloßer numerischer Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A5","text":"Eine Bestimmung fügt der Identität eine Negation hinzu und macht aus dem unbestimmten A ein bestimmtes A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A6","text":"Die Verbindung verschiedener Bestimmungen in einem synthetischen Satz bedarf eines Beweises oder eines vermittelnden Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A7","text":"Der äußerliche Unterschied ist ein in sich reflektierter Unterschied und damit eine Beziehung seiner Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A8","text":"Zwei Dinge sind als Dinge oder als zwei überhaupt gleich und durch eine angenommene Bestimmung ungleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A9","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit gehören derselben bestimmten Verschiedenheit in einer Einheit an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A10","text":"Das „Insofern“ trennt Gleichheit und Ungleichheit nach Seiten oder Rücksichten und macht ihre Einheit zu einer äußerlichen Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A11","text":"Die äußere Reflexion unterscheidet Gleichheit und Ungleichheit in einer Tätigkeit und enthält beide zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A12","text":"Die Entfernung des Widerspruchs aus dem Ding löst ihn nicht auf, sondern verschiebt ihn in die subjektive oder äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX1","text":"Die bloße Behauptung, alle Dinge seien verschieden, wird als überflüssig zurückgewiesen, weil die Pluralität bereits unbestimmte Verschiedenheit enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX2","text":"Numerische Mehrheit wird nicht als hinreichende Bestimmung von Ungleichheit zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX3","text":"Identität allein darf nicht als bestimmte Verschiedenheit ausgegeben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX4","text":"Der Satz, dass es keine vollkommen gleichen Dinge gebe, darf nicht als unmittelbarer Satz gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX5","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit dürfen nicht als voneinander unabhängige Bestimmungen der Dinge festgehalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX6","text":"Das „Insofern“ wird nicht als wirkliche Auflösung des Widerspruchs anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX7","text":"Die äußerliche Verlagerung des Widerspruchs in die Reflexion gilt nicht als dessen Beseitigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D1","text":"Die Verschiedenheit der Dinge wird erst durch Ungleichheit zu einer bestimmten Verschiedenheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A3","CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D2","text":"Der Satz der bestimmten Verschiedenheit setzt eine Bewegung von Identität zu Verschiedenheit und von Verschiedenheit zu Ungleichheit voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A6","CH_GB18_A_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D3","text":"Zwei Dinge sind zugleich gleich und ungleich, weil ihre Gleichheit aus ihrer gemeinsamen Bestimmtheit als Dinge und ihre Ungleichheit aus einer weiteren Bestimmung hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A8","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D4","text":"Die Behauptung vollkommener Ungleichheit enthält bereits die Gleichheit der Dinge als gemeinsame Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A8","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D5","text":"Das „Insofern“ erzeugt die Einheit von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit nicht im Ding, sondern in der Tätigkeit der Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A10","CH_GB18_A_29:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D6","text":"Die subjektive oder äußere Reflexion enthält die beiden Momente als aufgehobene und aufeinander bezogene Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A11","CH_GB18_A_29:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD1","text":"Verschiedenheit ist keine äußerliche Eigenschaft bereits bestehender Dinge, sondern eine in sich reflektierte Beziehung von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD2","text":"Die anfängliche Trennung von Identität und Verschiedenheit schlägt in eine Einheit ihrer entgegengesetzten Momente um.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A2","CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD3","text":"Der Gegenstand und die Reflexion können nicht endgültig getrennt werden, weil die Reflexion die Einheit der objektiv auseinandergehaltenen Bestimmungen selbst vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A10","CH_GB18_A_29:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD4","text":"Der Widerspruch ist kein äußerlicher Fehler der Bestimmung, sondern das Resultat der Bestimmung selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A5","CH_GB18_A_29:A9","CH_GB18_A_29:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD5","text":"Die bestimmte Verschiedenheit geht notwendig in Entgegensetzung über, weil ihre Momente zugleich getrennt und in einer Beziehung vereinigt sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9","CH_GB18_A_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX1","text":"Eine reine, beziehungslose Verschiedenheit außerhalb von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX2","text":"Eine numerische Vielheit, die bereits als vollständige Bestimmtheit gelten könnte, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX3","text":"Eine unmittelbare Verbindung von Identität, Verschiedenheit und Ungleichheit ohne Vermittlung ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX4","text":"Ein selbstidentisches Substrat ohne innere Negation kann nicht als bestimmtes Ding bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX5","text":"Eine Gleichheit, die ohne korrelative Ungleichheit als vollständige Bestimmung ausreicht, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX6","text":"Eine widerspruchsfreie Gegenständlichkeit, die durch bloße Perspektivierung hergestellt wird, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines Unterschieds, der außerhalb einer Beziehung seiner Momente zu sich bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer Identität, die ohne Verschiedenheit und Negation als letzte Bestimmung bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, Gleichheit und Ungleichheit endgültig auf getrennte Seiten, Rücksichten oder Träger zu verteilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Reflexion, die dem Gegenstand äußerlich bleibt und den in ihm enthaltenen Widerspruch nicht selbst reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letztes Modell der Verschiedenheit, in dem die Einheit ihrer entgegengesetzten Momente nicht mehr wirksam wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS1","text":"Identität(A) → Unbestimmtheit(A) → Vertauschbarkeit des Substrats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS2","text":"Numerische Vielheit → unbestimmte Verschiedenheit; numerische Vielheit ⇏ Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS3","text":"Bestimmung(A) → Negation(A) → bestimmtes A → Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS4","text":"Synthetische Verbindung verschiedener Bestimmungen → Beweisforderung → vermittelndes Drittes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS5","text":"Identität → Verschiedenheit → in sich reflektierter Unterschied → Gleichheit ∧ Ungleichheit → Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS6","text":"Gleichheit ∧ Ungleichheit → „Insofern“-Trennung → äußere Reflexion → Einheit in einer Tätigkeit → verschobener Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS7","text":"Vermeidung des Widerspruchs → Verlagerung in die Reflexion → Sichtbarkeit der reflexiven Einheit beider Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF1","text":"Gleichgültige Koexistenz von Identität und Verschiedenheit → Unzulänglichkeit bloßer Vielheit → bestimmte Verschiedenheit als Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF2","text":"Unmittelbare Behauptung allgemeiner Ungleichheit → Forderung nach Vermittlung → Rekonstruktion des Übergangs von Identität zu Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF3","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit im selben Unterschied → Trennung durch das „Insofern“ → Einheit in der äußeren Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF4","text":"Vermeidung des Widerspruchs → Verschiebung in das Subjekt oder die Reflexion → Nachweis, dass der Widerspruch dadurch erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME1","text":"Verschiedenheit wird von einer bloßen Vielheitsrelation zu einer bestimmten Beziehung von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz „gleich oder ungleich“ bricht zusammen und wird als gleichzeitige Einheit beider Bestimmungen neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME3","text":"Die äußere Reflexion wird nicht mehr als neutraler Beobachtungsstandpunkt, sondern als Tätigkeit der Vermittlung und Einheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME4","text":"Der Widerspruch wird vom vermeintlich widerspruchsfreien Ding in die Struktur der Bestimmung und ihrer Reflexion verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME5","text":"Der Satz über die Verschiedenheit wird von einer unmittelbaren Feststellung zu einem Übergangsmoment der begrifflichen Entwicklung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der unmittelbare Gegenstand sind die Sätze von Identität, Verschiedenheit, Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die tragende Struktur ist die Vermittlung von Identität, Negation, bestimmter Verschiedenheit und Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die gewöhnliche Strategie, Widersprüche durch verschiedene Seiten oder Rücksichten auseinanderzuhalten, wird als Verlagerung statt als Lösung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Bestimmungen gelten nicht als statische Eigenschaften, sondern erzeugen sich durch Übergänge und reflektierte Beziehungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Argumentgang von der unbestimmten Identität zur bestimmten Verschiedenheit und weiter zur Entgegensetzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue Gestalt des geforderten vermittelnden Dritten und des Beweises für den Übergang zur Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Gleichheit und Ungleichheit aus derselben bestimmten Verschiedenheit entwickelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT4","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung besteht zwischen der anfänglichen Gleichgültigkeit der Sätze und der später behaupteten inneren Einheit ihrer Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass der Satz der Verschiedenheit zugleich als notwendiger Entwicklungsschritt verwendet und als unmittelbarer Satz für nichtig erklärt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT6","text":"Die Kritik der äußeren Reflexion bleibt spannungsvoll, weil eben diese Reflexion benötigt wird, um die Einheit von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit sichtbar zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern Übergang, Vermittlung, Einheit und Verlagerung des Widerspruchs nicht auf isolierte Aussagen reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112142540895Z_1a082606","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"c54e2919d9e76ac0eff787915515aa25a78c742aa1930cc6ed8739c1d74404ff","sha256":"acb9bfda4dc6313eb91790e28ae9559c5ccdb1da7d50730067feecf9edbe0c1c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:21:42.542751+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS1","text":"The argument problematizes the initial indifference of identity and difference as propositions independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS2","text":"It redefines difference as determinate negation mediated through inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS3","text":"The text proceeds diagnostically and reconstructively by developing the inadequacy of immediate propositions from their own logic of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS4","text":"The directed movement proceeds from identity through difference and inequality to opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS5","text":"The claim to universal inequality requires mediation, because different determinations cannot be immediately connected in a synthetic proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AS6","text":"The separation of equality and inequality through the “insofar” does not eliminate the contradiction, but displaces it into external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A1","text":"In the proposition of identity, A counts as a self-identical, indeterminate, and interchangeable substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A2","text":"Identity and difference are initially posited as determinations each valid for itself and held to be indifferent toward one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A3","text":"Numerical multiplicity produces only indeterminate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A4","text":"Determinate difference consists in inequality and not in mere numerical multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A5","text":"A determination adds a negation to identity and turns indeterminate A into determinate A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A6","text":"The connection of different determinations in a synthetic proposition requires a proof or a mediating third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A7","text":"External difference is a difference reflected into itself and thus a relation of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A8","text":"Two things are equal as things, or as two in general, and unequal through an assumed determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A9","text":"Equality and inequality belong together in a unity as the same determinate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A10","text":"The “insofar” separates equality and inequality according to sides or respects and makes their unity into an external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A11","text":"External reflection distinguishes equality and inequality in one activity and contains both at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:A12","text":"The removal of contradiction from the thing does not dissolve it, but shifts it into subjective or external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX1","text":"The mere assertion that all things are different is rejected as superfluous, because plurality already contains indeterminate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX2","text":"Numerical multiplicity is not admitted as a sufficient determination of inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX3","text":"Identity alone must not be presented as determinate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX4","text":"The proposition that there are no completely equal things must not count as an immediate proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX5","text":"Equality and inequality must not be maintained as determinations of things independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX6","text":"The “insofar” is not recognized as a real resolution of the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:NX7","text":"The external displacement of contradiction into reflection does not count as its elimination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D1","text":"The difference of things becomes a determinate difference only through inequality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A3","CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D2","text":"The proposition of determinate difference presupposes a movement from identity to difference and from difference to inequality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A6","CH_GB18_A_29:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D3","text":"Two things are at once equal and unequal, because their equality follows from their common determinacy as things and their inequality from a further determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A8","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D4","text":"The assertion of complete inequality already contains the equality of things as a common presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A8","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D5","text":"The “insofar” does not produce the unity of equality and inequality in the thing, but in the activity of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A10","CH_GB18_A_29:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:D6","text":"Subjective or external reflection contains the two moments as sublated and mutually related determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A11","CH_GB18_A_29:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD1","text":"Difference is not an external property of already existing things, but a relation of equality and inequality reflected into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A4","CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD2","text":"The initial separation of identity and difference turns into a unity of their opposed moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A2","CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD3","text":"The object and reflection cannot be definitively separated, because reflection itself effectuates the unity of the determinations objectively held apart.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A10","CH_GB18_A_29:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD4","text":"Contradiction is not an external defect of determination, but the result of determination itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A5","CH_GB18_A_29:A9","CH_GB18_A_29:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SD5","text":"Determinate difference necessarily passes over into opposition, because its moments are at once separated and united in a relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_29:A7","CH_GB18_A_29:A9","CH_GB18_A_29:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX1","text":"A pure, relationless difference outside equality and inequality is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX2","text":"A numerical multiplicity that could already count as complete determinacy is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX3","text":"An immediate connection of identity, difference, and inequality without mediation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX4","text":"A self-identical substrate without internal negation cannot exist as a determinate thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX5","text":"An equality that suffices as a complete determination without correlative inequality is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:DNX6","text":"A contradiction-free objectivity produced through mere perspectivization is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a difference that could subsist outside a relation of its moments to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an identity that remains as final determination without difference and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of definitively distributing equality and inequality among separate sides, respects, or bearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a reflection that remains external to the object and does not itself reproduce the contradiction contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a final model of difference in which the unity of its opposed moments would no longer be operative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS1","text":"Identity(A) → Indeterminacy(A) → Interchangeability of the substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS2","text":"Numerical multiplicity → indeterminate difference; numerical multiplicity ⇏ inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS3","text":"Determination(A) → Negation(A) → determinate A → inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS4","text":"Synthetic connection of different determinations → demand for proof → mediating third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS5","text":"Identity → difference → difference reflected into itself → equality ∧ inequality → opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS6","text":"Equality ∧ inequality → “insofar”-separation → external reflection → unity in one activity → displaced contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:FGS7","text":"Avoidance of contradiction → displacement into reflection → visibility of the reflective unity of both moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF1","text":"Indifferent coexistence of identity and difference → inadequacy of mere multiplicity → determinate difference as inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF2","text":"Immediate assertion of universal inequality → demand for mediation → reconstruction of the transition from identity to difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF3","text":"Equality and inequality in the same difference → separation through the “insofar” → unity in external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:AF4","text":"Avoidance of contradiction → displacement into the subject or reflection → demonstration that contradiction thereby remains preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME1","text":"Difference is remapped from a mere relation of multiplicity to a determinate relation of equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME2","text":"The opposition “equal or unequal” collapses and is reclassified as the simultaneous unity of both determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME3","text":"External reflection becomes visible no longer as a neutral standpoint of observation, but as an activity of mediation and unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME4","text":"Contradiction is shifted from the supposedly contradiction-free thing into the structure of determination and its reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ME5","text":"The proposition concerning difference is reordered from an immediate statement into a transitional moment of conceptual development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT1","text":"Surface: The immediate object is the propositions of identity, difference, equality, and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT2","text":"Structural: The supporting structure is the mediation of identity, negation, determinate difference, and opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The usual strategy of keeping contradictions apart through different sides or respects is redefined as displacement rather than solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Determinations do not count as static properties, but generate themselves through transitions and reflected relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the course of the argument from indeterminate identity to determinate difference and further to opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT2","text":"The exact form of the required mediating third and of the proof for the transition to inequality remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent where equality and inequality are developed from the same determinate difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT4","text":"A structural tension exists between the initial indifference of the propositions and the later asserted internal unity of their moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT5","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the proposition of difference is used at once as a necessary developmental step and declared invalid as an immediate proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT6","text":"The critique of external reflection remains tension-filled, because this very reflection is required to make the unity of equality and inequality visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_29:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as transition, mediation, unity, and displacement of contradiction are not reduced to isolated assertions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_29@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_29:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 115","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 115","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0","layer":"CH","title":"3. Opposition.","order":116,"parents":["RAW_GB18_3DG0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_3DG0@R001","sha256":"cd9d6e6ce4db9e677258f332a6a4494100307b58973db946653336004d03754e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS1","text":"Der vollendete Unterschied wird als Gegensatz bestimmt, weil Identität und Verschiedenheit in einer Einheit zugleich verschieden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS2","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit werden von inneren Reflexionsmomenten zu äußerlich gesetzten Bestimmungen unterschieden, deren Sein und Nichtsein durch Setzung vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS3","text":"Positives und Negatives entstehen, indem Gleichheit und Ungleichheit jeweils die Beziehung auf ihr eigenes Nichtsein in sich aufnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS4","text":"Der Gegensatz wird als eine Vermittlung bestimmt, in der jede Seite nur durch das Nichtsein der anderen und durch deren Aufhebung in sich besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS5","text":"Die zunächst austauschbaren Zuschreibungen positiv und negativ werden erst bestimmt, indem jede Seite ihre Beziehung auf die andere als ausschließende Selbstbeziehung in sich zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS6","text":"Das Ansichsein des Positiven und Negativen besteht nicht außerhalb ihrer Relation, sondern darin, daß die ausschließende Relation selbst ihre eigene Bestimmung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A1","text":"Der Gegensatz ist die Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit, deren Momente innerhalb einer Identität verschieden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A2","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit sind äußerliche Reflexionsbestimmungen, deren Gesetztsein Sein und deren Nichtgesetztsein Nichtsein ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","text":"Jede Bestimmung des Gegensatzes enthält ihr anderes Moment und bezieht sich dadurch wesentlich auf ihr eigenes Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A4","text":"Das Positive ist die in Gleichheit mit sich reflektierte Bestimmung, die Ungleichheit als ihr Nichtsein enthält; das Negative ist die in Ungleichheit reflektierte Bestimmung, die Gleichheit als ihr Nichtsein enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","text":"Positive und negative Seiten sind selbstständig, weil jede die Reflexion des ganzen Gegensatzes in sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","text":"Jede Seite ist nur, insofern ihr Nichtsein ist; ihr Bestehen ist identische Beziehung auf das Nichtsein der anderen Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A7","text":"Die erste Form des Positiven und Negativen ist eine untrennbare Vermittlung, in der jede Seite durch das Nichtsein der anderen bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A8","text":"Solange Positives und Negatives bloß gesetzte Bestimmungen sind, können ihre Zuschreibungen vertauscht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","text":"Positives und Negatives sind an und für sich nur, wenn die Beziehung auf das andere in jede Seite selbst zurückgenommen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A10","text":"Das Ansichsein des Positiven oder Negativen ist die eigene Bestimmung einer ausschließenden Beziehung auf das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX1","text":"Gleichheit und Ungleichheit sind nicht die inneren Momente der Identität und Verschiedenheit, sondern deren entäußerte Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX2","text":"Das Positive ist nicht reine Gleichheit, weil es die Ungleichheit als konstitutives Nichtsein enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX3","text":"Das Negative ist nicht bloß unmittelbare Negation, weil es aufgehobenes Gesetztsein und positive Reflexion auf sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX4","text":"Keine Seite des Gegensatzes ist unmittelbar für sich, weil jede durch das Nichtsein ihres Anderen vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX5","text":"Positiv und negativ sind nicht in ihrer ersten Gestalt unvertauschbare Eigenschaften von Gegenständen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX6","text":"Ansichsein ist nicht Abstraktion von der Beziehung auf das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX7","text":"Selbstständigkeit ist nicht Unabhängigkeit von der entgegengesetzten Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D1","text":"Jede Seite des Gegensatzes ist zugleich Ganzes und Moment, weil sie das andere Moment in sich enthält, aber nur als dessen Nichtsein besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D2","text":"Selbstbeziehung ist im Gegensatz nur als vermittelte Beziehung möglich, da jede Seite durch die Negation ihres Anderen zu sich gelangt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","CH_GB18_3DG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D3","text":"Die bloße Gegenüberstellung zweier Seiten erzeugt noch keine bestimmte Positivität und Negativität, sondern nur wechselseitige Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A7","CH_GB18_3DG0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit positiv oder negativ wird erst zwingend, wenn die Seite ihre Beziehung auf das Andere als eigene innere Bestimmung besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A8","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D5","text":"Die Ausschließung des Anderen ist kein äußerlicher Zusatz zur Selbstständigkeit, sondern deren Vollzug.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D6","text":"Das Positive und Negative sind nicht asymmetrisch verteilt: Beide sind zugleich Selbstbeziehung und Beziehung auf ihr ausgeschlossenes Anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A4","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD1","text":"Identität erweist sich als reflexive Einheit, die Verschiedenheit nicht aufhebt, sondern sie als ihr inneres Negationsmoment trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A1","CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz transformiert Abhängigkeit in Selbstständigkeit, indem jede Seite ihre Abhängigkeit vom Anderen als ihre eigene Bestimmung vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD3","text":"Ausschließung und innere Enthaltenheit sind nicht alternative Relationen, sondern die doppelte Form, in der ein Entgegengesetztes bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD4","text":"Das an und für sich Seiende ist keine relationslose Substanz, sondern eine Bestimmung, deren Selbstheit in der ausschließenden Relation besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer unmittelbaren Identität, die ohne innere Verschiedenheit und ohne Beziehung auf Nichtsein bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines reinen Negativen, das lediglich Mangel, Abwesenheit oder abhängiges Moment wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, positive und negative Bestimmungen als feste, vorreflexive Prädikate zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines Ansichseins, das durch Ablösung von jeder Gegensätzlichkeit gewonnen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußere Vergleichsinstanz, die Positives und Negatives endgültig und unabhängig von ihrer Selbstvermittlung zuweisen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein Ursprung des Positiven oder Negativen vor ihrer wechselseitigen Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Selbstständigkeit, die nicht zugleich ihr eigenes Nichtsein und das ausgeschlossene Andere in sich trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Scheidung von Relation und Wesen, weil die ausschließende Relation selbst das Wesen der entgegengesetzten Seiten bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS1","text":"Identität + Verschiedenheit → Unterschied als in sich gehaltene Einheit verschiedener Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS2","text":"Äußerliche Reflexion → Gleichheit/Ungleichheit als gesetzte Bestimmungen von Sein und Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS3","text":"Reflexion jeder Bestimmung in sich → Enthaltensein des Anderen als eigenes Nichtsein → Positives/Negatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS4","text":"Wechselseitiges Nichtsein → eine Vermittlung → jede Seite ist durch das Andere und durch dessen Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS5","text":"Bloßes Gesetztsein → Gleichgültigkeit der Seiten → Austauschbarkeit der positiven und negativen Zuschreibung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS6","text":"Rücknahme der Beziehung in jede Seite → ausschließende Selbstbeziehung → Positives und Negatives an und für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF1","text":"Vollendeter Unterschied → Einheit von Identität und Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF2","text":"Innere Reflexion → Abgrenzung gegen äußerliche Gleichheit und Ungleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF3","text":"Gleichheit/Ungleichheit → Positives/Negatives als reflektierte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF4","text":"Positives/Negatives → wechselseitige Vermittlung durch Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF5","text":"Wechselseitige Vermittlung → Phase austauschbarer Zuschreibungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF6","text":"Rückkehr der Relation in jede Seite → ausschließende Selbstständigkeit → Ansich- und Fürsichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME1","text":"Identität und Verschiedenheit werden nicht als entgegengesetzte Zustände, sondern als ko-konstitutive Momente des Unterschieds kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME2","text":"Positiv und negativ werden von festen Wert- oder Sachprädikaten zu Formen reflexiver Selbstbestimmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME3","text":"Selbstständigkeit und Abhängigkeit erscheinen nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als zwei Seiten derselben Vermittlungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME4","text":"Ansichsein wird von relationsloser Innerlichkeit zu einer durch Ausschließung bestimmten Relationsform verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME5","text":"Äußerliche Vergleichbarkeit wird als abstrakte und instabile Stufe ausgewiesen, auf der positive und negative Zuschreibungen vertauschbar bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt Positives und Negatives als die beiden Seiten des Gegensatzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Jede Seite enthält die andere als Nichtsein und gewinnt ihre Bestimmtheit ausschließlich durch diese vermittelte Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Argumentation verschiebt die Frage von der Zuordnung entgegengesetzter Eigenschaften zur Rekonstruktion der Operationen, die Gegensätzlichkeit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein, Nichtsein, Gesetztsein und Reflexion bilden keine getrennten ontologischen Regionen, sondern aufeinander rückbezogene Momente der Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Unterschied über gesetzte Bestimmung zu Positivität und Negativität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt unterbestimmt, sofern der Übergang von austauschbarer äußerer Zuschreibung zu notwendiger ausschließender Selbstbestimmung nicht weiter vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit als reflexiv vermittelte und nicht als relationslose Selbstständigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Operation besteht in der Bestimmung jeder Seite als Ganzes, das sein Anderes zugleich enthält und ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt darin, daß das Andere zugleich inneres Moment, aufgehobenes Gesetztsein und selbstständiges ausgeschlossenes Sein sein muß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, wenn die drei Stufen der wechselseitigen Negativität, der austauschbaren Bestimmung und der ausschließenden Selbstbeziehung unterschieden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T110625830786Z_ba74ce3a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3. Opposition.","source_sha256":"cd9d6e6ce4db9e677258f332a6a4494100307b58973db946653336004d03754e","sha256":"212c3fdd73ad5eed449ac9121f8f49950a80d8be7c2e0c5af4843d0fbd5be501","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:06:25.833128+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS1","text":"The consummated difference is determined as opposition, because identity and difference remain different simultaneously within a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS2","text":"Equality and inequality are distinguished from inner moments of reflection as externally posited determinations, whose being and non-being are mediated through positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS3","text":"Positive and negative arise insofar as equality and inequality each take up within themselves the relation to their own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS4","text":"Opposition is determined as a mediation in which each side subsists only through the non-being of the other and through the sublation of the latter within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS5","text":"The initially interchangeable attributions positive and negative become determinate only insofar as each side takes back into itself its relation to the other as an excluding self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AS6","text":"The in-itself-being of the positive and negative does not consist outside their relation, but in the fact that the excluding relation itself is their own determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A1","text":"Opposition is the unity of identity and difference, whose moments are different within an identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A2","text":"Equality and inequality are external determinations of reflection, whose positedness is being and whose non-positedness is non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","text":"Each determination of opposition contains its other moment and thereby relates essentially to its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A4","text":"The positive is the determination reflected into equality with itself, which contains inequality as its non-being; the negative is the determination reflected into inequality, which contains equality as its non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","text":"Positive and negative sides are self-subsistent because each is the reflection of the whole opposition within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","text":"Each side is only insofar as its non-being is; its subsistence is an identical relation to the non-being of the other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A7","text":"The first form of the positive and negative is an inseparable mediation in which each side is determined through the non-being of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A8","text":"So long as positive and negative are merely posited determinations, their attributions can be exchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","text":"Positive and negative are in and for themselves only when the relation to the other has been taken back into each side itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:A10","text":"The in-itself-being of the positive or negative is the proper determination of an excluding relation to the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX1","text":"Equality and inequality are not the inner moments of identity and difference, but their externalized reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX2","text":"The positive is not pure equality, because it contains inequality as constitutive non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX3","text":"The negative is not merely immediate negation, because it is sublated positedness and positive reflection into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX4","text":"No side of opposition is immediately for itself, because each is mediated through the non-being of its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX5","text":"Positive and negative are not, in their first shape, non-interchangeable properties of objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX6","text":"In-itself-being is not abstraction from the relation to the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:NX7","text":"Self-subsistence is not independence from the opposed side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D1","text":"Each side of opposition is at once whole and moment, because it contains the other moment within itself, yet subsists only as its non-being.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D2","text":"In opposition, self-relation is possible only as mediated relation, since each side arrives at itself through the negation of its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","CH_GB18_3DG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D3","text":"The mere juxtaposition of two sides does not yet produce determinate positivity and negativity, but only reciprocal negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A7","CH_GB18_3DG0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D4","text":"The determinacy positive or negative becomes necessary only when the side possesses its relation to the other as its own inner determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A8","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D5","text":"The exclusion of the other is not an external addition to self-subsistence, but its enactment.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:D6","text":"The positive and the negative are not asymmetrically distributed: both are at once self-relation and relation to their excluded other.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A4","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD1","text":"Identity proves to be a reflexive unity that does not sublate difference, but bears it as its inner moment of negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A1","CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD2","text":"Opposition transforms dependence into self-subsistence by enacting, in each side, its dependence on the other as its own determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A5","CH_GB18_3DG0:A6","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD3","text":"Exclusion and inner containment are not alternative relations, but the double form in which an opposite is determined.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A3","CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SD4","text":"That which is in and for itself is not a relationless substance, but a determination whose selfhood consists in the excluding relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_3DG0:A9","CH_GB18_3DG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an immediate identity that could subsist without inner difference and without relation to non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a pure negative that would be merely lack, absence, or dependent moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating positive and negative determinations as fixed, pre-reflective predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an in-itself-being that would be attained through detachment from all opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an external instance of comparison that could assign positive and negative definitively and independently of their self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an origin of the positive or negative prior to their reciprocal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a self-subsistence that does not simultaneously bear within itself its own non-being and the excluded other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the separation of relation and essence, because the excluding relation itself constitutes the essence of the opposed sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS1","text":"Identity + difference → difference as a unity of different moments held within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS2","text":"External reflection → equality/inequality as posited determinations of being and non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS3","text":"Reflection of each determination into itself → containment of the other as its own non-being → positive/negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS4","text":"Reciprocal non-being → one mediation → each side is through the other and through its non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS5","text":"Mere positedness → indifference of the sides → interchangeability of positive and negative attribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:FGS6","text":"Taking back the relation into each side → excluding self-relation → positive and negative in and for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF1","text":"Consummated difference → unity of identity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF2","text":"Inner reflection → delimitation against external equality and inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF3","text":"Equality/inequality → positive/negative as reflected determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF4","text":"Positive/negative → reciprocal mediation through non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF5","text":"Reciprocal mediation → phase of interchangeable attributions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:AF6","text":"Return of the relation into each side → excluding self-subsistence → being-in-itself and being-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME1","text":"Identity and difference are mapped not as opposed states, but as co-constitutive moments of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME2","text":"Positive and negative are reclassified from fixed value- or thing-predicates into forms of reflexive self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME3","text":"Self-subsistence and dependence no longer appear as opposites, but as two sides of the same structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME4","text":"In-itself-being is shifted from relationless inwardness to a form of relation determined through exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ME5","text":"External comparability is shown to be an abstract and unstable stage at which positive and negative attributions remain interchangeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines positive and negative as the two sides of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Each side contains the other as non-being and acquires its determinacy exclusively through this mediated relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument shifts the question from the assignment of opposed properties to the reconstruction of the operations that produce opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being, non-being, positedness, and reflection form not separate ontological regions, but moments of determination referred back to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from difference through posited determination to positivity and negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined insofar as the transition from interchangeable external attribution to necessary excluding self-determination is not further mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as self-subsistence is understood as reflexively mediated and not as relationless self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation consists in determining each side as a whole that simultaneously contains and excludes its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT5","text":"The central fault line lies in the fact that the other must simultaneously be an inner moment, sublated positedness, and self-subsistent excluded being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_3DG0:MRT6","text":"The movement of the argument is preserved when the three stages of reciprocal negativity, interchangeable determination, and excluding self-relation are distinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_3DG0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_3DG0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_3DG0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 116","title":"3. Opposition.","context":"Chapter 116","original_title":"3. Der Gegensatz."},"original_title":"3. Der Gegensatz.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":117,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_30"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_30@R001","sha256":"dd1b1e24169b72dbc09754deff97c8a2e686938275a08c1bcaae562ebba454e9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS1","text":"Der arithmetische Gebrauch von Plus und Minus wird problematisch, weil er äußere Entgegensetzung und an-sich-seiende qualitative Negativität vermischt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS2","text":"Die Zeichen können zunächst bloß austauschbare Bezeichnungen relativ entgegengesetzter Größen sein, ohne deren eigenes Sein zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS3","text":"Addition und Subtraktion entfalten die Entgegengesetzten zugleich als aufgehobene Differenz, als identische Einheit und als getrennt fortbestehende Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS4","text":"Multiplikation und Division erzwingen eine qualitative Asymmetrie, in der das Negative die immanente Entgegensetzung und das Positive die unbestimmte Gleichgültigkeit bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung, dass Negation nur durch das Negative wirksam wird und ihre Negation Positivität erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A1","text":"Entgegensetzung kann einem an sich gegen sie gleichgültigen unmittelbaren Dasein äußerlich zukommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A2","text":"Positivität und Negativität können an-sich-seiende Bestimmungen sein, für die das Verschiedene nicht gleichgültig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A3","text":"Bei bloß äußerlicher Entgegensetzung sind Plus und Minus wechselseitig austauschbare Benennungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A4","text":"Die positive oder negative Bestimmung einer äußeren Relation hängt von einer dritten, außerhalb der entgegengesetzten Größen liegenden Rücksicht ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A5","text":"Entgegengesetzte Größen können sich relational aufheben, ohne dass ihre identische Grundlage verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A6","text":"Entgegengesetzte Größen können als getrennt reflektierte Existenzen fortbestehen und dadurch eine wirkliche Vielheit bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A7","text":"Derselbe Ausdruck entgegengesetzter Größen kann je nach Abstraktion als Aufhebung, als Einheit oder als Summe getrennter Größen gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A8","text":"Multiplikation und Division setzen ein qualitatives Verhältnis von Einheit und Anzahl voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A9","text":"Im qualitativen Verhältnis bezeichnet das Negative die an ihm selbst seiende Entgegensetzung, das Positive dagegen das Unbestimmte und Gleichgültige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A10","text":"Negation wird nicht durch Positivität, sondern allein durch das Negative eingeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A11","text":"Die Negation der Negation bestimmt sich als Positivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX1","text":"Positiv und negativ sind nicht notwendig eigenständige Eigenschaften der durch sie bezeichneten Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX2","text":"Die Aufhebung entgegengesetzter Größen in Null ist nicht ihre einzige Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX3","text":"Plus und Minus sind bei Multiplikation und Division nicht bloß symmetrische Fälle allgemeiner Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX4","text":"Die Regeln der Vorzeichen bei Multiplikation und Division sind nicht aus Addition und Subtraktion ableitbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX5","text":"Das Negative ist nicht bloß das von außen gesetzte Gegenstück eines Positiven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX6","text":"Vermögen und Schuld sind nicht an sich positive beziehungsweise negative Wertgrößen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D1","text":"Bei äußerlicher Entgegensetzung kann dieselbe Größe je nach Bezugspunkt positiv oder negativ erscheinen, ohne sich selbst qualitativ zu verändern.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D2","text":"Die Gleichung entgegengesetzter Größen kann drei Ebenen ausdrücken: relationale Aufhebung, identische Einheit oder quantitative Verdopplung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D3","text":"Ein Nettowert von Null schließt weder die Einheit der zugrunde liegenden Größe noch die Fortexistenz zweier entgegengesetzter Ansprüche aus.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D4","text":"Ein Beweis der Vorzeichenregeln bleibt widersprüchlich, wenn er die qualitative Differenz der Faktoren durch bloße Gegenüberstellung ersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D5","text":"Die Regel, dass das Produkt zweier negativer Größen positiv ist, setzt die Negation des an sich Negativen voraus, nicht bloß die Kombination zweier entgegengesetzter Zeichen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD1","text":"Arithmetische Zeichen operieren in mehreren ontologischen Registern zugleich: äußerliche Relation, reflektierte Einheit, getrennte Existenz und immanente Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD2","text":"Die Bedeutung eines Vorzeichens ist nicht operationsunabhängig, sondern wird durch die Art des Verhältnisses erzeugt, in dem die Größen stehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD3","text":"Null ist keine absolute Vernichtung, sondern kann die abstrakte Form einer aufgehobenen Beziehung sein, deren Einheit und Vielheit erhalten bleiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD4","text":"Das Negative fungiert als privilegierter Träger bestimmender Kraft, weil nur durch es eine immanente Negation und deren Umschlag möglich wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Quantität vollständig durch bloßes Zählen und äußere Addition bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine vollständige Symmetrie von Positivem und Negativem, sobald die Entgegensetzung als qualitative Bestimmung auftritt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Relation die Eigenständigkeit der Relata vollständig absorbiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein rein formaler Kalkül, der seine Vorzeichenregeln ohne begriffliche Bestimmung von Einheit, Anzahl und Negation begründen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX1","text":"Unzugänglich ist eine Positivität, die aus sich selbst Negation oder Differenz hervorbringen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein universeller Standpunkt, der die Vorzeichen aller Größen unabhängig von Relation und Operation endgültig festlegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Nullbegriff, der jede fortbestehende Einheit, Vielheit oder Vermittlung restlos auslöscht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS1","text":"Unbestimmte Zeichenopposition → Unterscheidung von äußerlicher und an-sich-seiender Entgegensetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS2","text":"Äußerliche Entgegensetzung → Relativierung der Vorzeichen durch einen dritten Bezugspunkt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS3","text":"Relation der Entgegengesetzten → Aufhebung in Null zugleich mit Erhaltung identischer Grundlage und getrennter Existenzen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS4","text":"Mehrdeutigkeit der Rechnung → Trennung von Aufhebungs-, Einheits- und Vielheitsabstraktion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS5","text":"Übergang zu Multiplikation und Division → qualitative Asymmetrie von Einheit und Anzahl → immanente Bestimmung des Negativen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS6","text":"Immanente Negation → Negation der Negation → Positivität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF1","text":"Ungeklärter Vorzeichenbegriff → Trennung zweier Formen der Entgegensetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF2","text":"Austauschbare äußere Vorzeichen → Abhängigkeit von perspektivischer Relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF3","text":"Addition und Subtraktion → Null, Einheit und Vielheit als unterschiedliche Reflexionsresultate.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF4","text":"Multiplikation und Division → qualitative Differenz der Faktoren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF5","text":"Qualitative Differenz → Vorrang des Negativen als Träger bestimmender Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF6","text":"Bestimmende Negation → Negation der Negation → Positivität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME1","text":"Plus und Minus werden von festen Eigenschaften zu operations- und relationsabhängigen Bestimmungen umkartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Null und Nichtnull zerfällt in drei unterscheidbare Ebenen: aufgehobene Beziehung, bleibende Einheit und reale Vielheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME3","text":"Addition und Subtraktion werden als äußere Mehrungs- und Minderungsrelationen, Multiplikation und Division dagegen als qualitative Verhältnisse neu klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME4","text":"Die Vorzeichenregel wird von einer Konvention der Notation in eine Theorie immanenter Negation überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text untersucht die Bedeutung und die Rechenfolgen der Zeichen Plus und Minus in Addition, Subtraktion, Multiplikation und Division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text unterscheidet äußerlich gesetzte Opposition, reflektierte Identität und selbstbestimmte qualitative Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Prüfung arithmetischer Regeln von symbolischer Gleichbehandlung zu einer Analyse der begrifflichen Bedingungen der Operation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Wirkliche erscheint als Einheit, die Differenz hervorbringt, in der Negation bestimmt wird und durch Negation ihrer selbst in Positivität umschlägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Verschiebung von äußerlicher Zeichenopposition zu qualitativer Negation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue formale Übersetzung der drei Resultate von +y−y in einen einheitlichen modernen Kalkül.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern die jeweils wechselnde Abstraktionsebene ausdrücklich getrennt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Stelle ist die operationsspezifische Trennung zwischen äußerlicher Gegenüberstellung und qualitativer Faktorenrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT5","text":"Seine zentrale Bruchlinie besteht darin, dass identische symbolische Ausdrücke verschiedene Resultate erhalten, deren Vereinbarkeit nur durch Wechsel der Betrachtungsweise gesichert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, wenn sie die Vorzeichenregeln nicht als Ausgangspunkt, sondern als Folge einer Theorie der Negation behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112201589984Z_dc140a46","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"dd1b1e24169b72dbc09754deff97c8a2e686938275a08c1bcaae562ebba454e9","sha256":"dfc28011c9b6bb40f0e8b46415cc86b51c7f29ff5b127292c98fb6f6a4572f85","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:22:01.591808+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS1","text":"The arithmetical use of plus and minus becomes problematic because it conflates external opposition and qualitative negativity existing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS2","text":"Initially, the signs can be merely interchangeable designations of relatively opposed magnitudes, without determining their own being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS3","text":"Addition and subtraction unfold the opposites simultaneously as sublated difference, as identical unity, and as a plurality persisting separately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS4","text":"Multiplication and division compel a qualitative asymmetry in which the negative designates immanent opposition and the positive indeterminate indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AS5","text":"The movement ends in the determination that negation becomes effective only through the negative and that its negation produces positivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A1","text":"Opposition can accrue externally to an immediate determinate being that is in itself indifferent to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A2","text":"Positivity and negativity can be determinations existing in themselves, for which what is different is not indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A3","text":"In merely external opposition, plus and minus are reciprocally interchangeable names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A4","text":"The positive or negative determination of an external relation depends on a third respect lying outside the opposed magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A5","text":"Opposed magnitudes can sublate one another relationally without their identical basis disappearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A6","text":"Opposed magnitudes can persist as separately reflected existences and thereby constitute a real plurality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A7","text":"The same expression of opposed magnitudes can, depending on the abstraction, count as sublation, as unity, or as the sum of separate magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A8","text":"Multiplication and division presuppose a qualitative relation of unity and number.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A9","text":"In the qualitative relation, the negative designates opposition existing in itself, whereas the positive designates the indeterminate and indifferent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A10","text":"Negation is introduced not through positivity, but solely through the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:A11","text":"The negation of negation determines itself as positivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX1","text":"Positive and negative are not necessarily independent properties of the magnitudes designated by them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX2","text":"The sublation of opposed magnitudes into zero is not their sole determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX3","text":"In multiplication and division, plus and minus are not merely symmetrical cases of general opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX4","text":"The rules of signs in multiplication and division cannot be derived from addition and subtraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX5","text":"The negative is not merely the counterpart of a positive posited from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:NX6","text":"Assets and debts are not in themselves positive and negative value-magnitudes respectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D1","text":"In external opposition, the same magnitude can appear positive or negative depending on the point of reference, without qualitatively changing itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D2","text":"The equation of opposed magnitudes can express three levels: relational sublation, identical unity, or quantitative doubling.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D3","text":"A net value of zero excludes neither the unity of the underlying magnitude nor the continued existence of two opposed claims.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D4","text":"A proof of the rules of signs remains contradictory if it replaces the qualitative difference of the factors with mere juxtaposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:D5","text":"The rule that the product of two negative magnitudes is positive presupposes the negation of the negative existing in itself, not merely the combination of two opposed signs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD1","text":"Arithmetical signs operate simultaneously in several ontological registers: external relation, reflected unity, separate existence, and immanent determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD2","text":"The meaning of a sign is not operation-independent, but is generated by the kind of relation in which the magnitudes stand.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD3","text":"Zero is not absolute annihilation, but can be the abstract form of a sublated relation whose unity and plurality are preserved.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SD4","text":"The negative functions as the privileged bearer of determinative force, because only through it are immanent negation and its transition possible.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which quantity is determined entirely through mere counting and external addition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a complete symmetry of positive and negative as soon as opposition appears as a qualitative determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that relation completely absorbs the independence of the relata.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a purely formal calculus that could ground its rules of signs without a conceptual determination of unity, number, and negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX1","text":"Inaccessible is a positivity that could bring forth negation or difference from itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is a universal standpoint that definitively fixes the signs of all magnitudes independently of relation and operation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a concept of zero that utterly extinguishes every persisting unity, plurality, or mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate opposition of signs → distinction between external opposition and opposition existing in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS2","text":"External opposition → relativization of signs through a third point of reference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS3","text":"Relation of the opposites → sublation into zero together with preservation of identical basis and separate existences.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS4","text":"Ambiguity of calculation → separation of the abstractions of sublation, unity, and plurality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS5","text":"Transition to multiplication and division → qualitative asymmetry of unity and number → immanent determination of the negative.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:FGS6","text":"Immanent negation → negation of negation → positivity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF1","text":"Unclarified concept of sign → separation of two forms of opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF2","text":"Interchangeable external signs → dependence on perspectival relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF3","text":"Addition and subtraction → zero, unity, and plurality as distinct results of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF4","text":"Multiplication and division → qualitative difference of the factors.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF5","text":"Qualitative difference → primacy of the negative as bearer of determinative negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:AF6","text":"Determinative negation → negation of negation → positivity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME1","text":"Plus and minus are remapped from fixed properties into determinations dependent on operation and relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A4","CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME2","text":"The opposition of zero and nonzero disintegrates into three distinguishable levels: sublated relation, enduring unity, and real plurality.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A6","CH_GB18_A_30:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME3","text":"Addition and subtraction are reclassified as external relations of increase and decrease, whereas multiplication and division are reclassified as qualitative relations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ME4","text":"The rule of signs is transferred from a convention of notation into a theory of immanent negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A9","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines the meaning and computational consequences of the signs plus and minus in addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text distinguishes externally posited opposition, reflected identity, and self-determined qualitative negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A1","CH_GB18_A_30:A2","CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the examination of arithmetical rules from symbolic equal treatment to an analysis of the conceptual conditions of the operation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A3","CH_GB18_A_30:A8","CH_GB18_A_30:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The real appears as unity that brings forth difference, in which negation is determined and through negation of itself transitions into positivity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_30:A5","CH_GB18_A_30:A10","CH_GB18_A_30:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the shift from external opposition of signs to qualitative negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise formal translation of the three results of +y−y into a unified modern calculus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as the respectively shifting level of abstraction is explicitly separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the operation-specific separation between external juxtaposition and qualitative relation of factors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT5","text":"Its central fault line consists in the fact that identical symbolic expressions receive different results, whose compatibility is secured only by a change of standpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_30:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement if it treats the rules of signs not as its point of departure, but as the consequence of a theory of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_30:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_30@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_30:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 117","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 117","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0","layer":"CH","title":"C. Contradiction.","order":118,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDW0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDW0@R001","sha256":"92c438bcfd4388b377be6de4186c296bf313ccff1fe8c5efca1586d08b957606","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt den Gegensatz als Selbstständigkeit von Positivem und Negativem, die nur durch ihre wechselseitige Beziehung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS2","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit jeder Seite erzeugt Widerspruch, weil sie das Andere als Bedingung ihrer Bestimmtheit enthält und als Anderes ausschließen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS3","text":"Der Widerspruch erscheint als Selbstaufhebung der entgegengesetzten Bestimmungen und als ihr rastloses Übergehen ineinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS4","text":"Die Aufhebung des Gegensatzes ist nicht bloße Vernichtung, sondern die Erzeugung einer positiven Einheit durch aufgehobenes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS5","text":"Der Grund ist die Einheit, in der Gegensatz und Widerspruch zugleich als aufgehoben und als erhalten bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A1","text":"Unterschied enthält seine Seiten als Momente einer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A2","text":"Im Gegensatz sind die Seiten nur durch ihr Anderes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","text":"Positive und negative Bestimmung beanspruchen jeweils Selbstständigkeit gegen ihr Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A4","text":"Selbstständigkeit besteht darin, das Andere in sich zu enthalten und es zugleich aus sich auszuschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","text":"Jede ausschließende Bestimmung setzt durch den Ausschluss ihr eigenes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A6","text":"Jede entgegengesetzte Bestimmung schließt durch ihren Selbstvollzug ihre eigene Selbstständigkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A7","text":"Das Negative ist nicht unmittelbare Bestimmtheit, sondern auf die Negation seiner selbst bezogene Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A8","text":"Der Widerspruch ist die Selbstbeziehung einer Bestimmung, die sich nur durch ihre Selbstnegation bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","text":"Die Selbstaufhebung des gesetzten Gegensatzes hebt dessen Gesetztsein auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","text":"Die aufgehobene Negation ist positive Rückkehr der Selbstständigkeit in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","text":"Der Grund ist das Wesen als mit sich identische Einheit von Positivität und Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A12","text":"Der Grund setzt den Gegensatz als seine eigene Negation und erhält ihn darin als bloß Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX1","text":"Der Gegensatz ist nicht bloße gleichgültige Verschiedenheit zweier äußerlich getrennter Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX2","text":"Positive und negative Bestimmung sind nicht unabhängig vorhandene Selbstständigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX3","text":"Das Positive ist nicht reine Identität ohne Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX4","text":"Das Negative ist nicht unmittelbares Nichtsein oder bloße qualitative Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX5","text":"Ausschließen ist nicht ein einseitiger Akt, weil jedes Ausschließen zugleich das ausgeschlossene Andere setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX6","text":"Die Auflösung des Widerspruchs ist nicht bloße Nullität oder endgültiges Verschwinden aller Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX7","text":"Der Grund ist nicht ein dem Gegensatz äußerlich vorausliegendes Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D1","text":"Positive und negative Bestimmung sind jeweils ganze Gegensätze, weil jede ihr Anderes in sich vermittelt und aus sich ausschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A2","CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","CH_GB18_CDW0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D2","text":"Das Setzen einer selbstständigen Bestimmung ist unmittelbar das Setzen einer ihr entgegengesetzten selbstständigen Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D3","text":"Das Positive wird durch die Ausschließung des Negativen selbst zu einem Gesetzten und damit zum Negativen eines Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D4","text":"Das Negative ist der gesetzte Widerspruch, weil seine Identität mit sich die Ausschließung der Identität enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A7","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D5","text":"Der unmittelbare Ertrag des Widerspruchs ist Null, weil die entgegengesetzten Selbstständigkeiten ineinander verschwinden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A6","CH_GB18_CDW0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D6","text":"Die Null ist nicht das Endresultat, weil die Selbstaufhebung zugleich setzende Reflexion und Rückkehr in positive Einheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D7","text":"Der Grund ist gewordene Einheit, weil er aus der Aufhebung des zunächst selbstständigen Gegensatzes hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D8","text":"Der Gegensatz bleibt im Grund als dessen gesetzte Negativität erhalten, obwohl seine unabhängige Selbstständigkeit aufgehoben ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD1","text":"Jede beanspruchte reine Selbstidentität kippt in vermittelte Negativität um, weil ihr Ausschluss des Anderen dieses Andere konstitutiv reproduziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A4","CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD2","text":"Widerspruch ist keine Störung einer vorgängigen Einheit, sondern der Mechanismus, durch den eine nicht-äußerliche Einheit erst hervorgebracht wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A1","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD3","text":"Der Grund verwandelt die zeitlich oder logisch anfängliche Selbstständigkeit des Gegensatzes in eine abhängige Erscheinungsform des Wesens.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD4","text":"Aufhebung bewahrt Negativität als innere Bestimmungsform der positiven Einheit, statt sie aus dem Resultat zu eliminieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Bestimmungen zuerst vollständig selbstständig sind und erst nachträglich in Beziehung treten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Identität ohne konstitutive Negation gedacht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Negation lediglich Mangel, Abwesenheit oder äußerer Verlust bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Auflösung den Gegensatz restlos auslöscht und keine bestimmte Einheit zurücklässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX5","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Grund eine unbewegte, widerspruchsfreie Grundlage außerhalb seiner gesetzten Bestimmungen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Verfügbarkeit eines absolut ersten Positiven, das nicht schon durch sein Verhältnis zur Negation vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer endgültigen Selbstständigkeit, die sich nicht im Vollzug ihres Ausschlusses selbst aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Endzustand reiner Ruhe, weil der Grund seine Einheit nur als gesetzte und aufgehobene Negativität besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS1","text":"Unterschied als Einheitsform → Gegensatz als wechselseitige Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS2","text":"Wechselseitige Bestimmtheit → Anspruch selbstständiger Positivität und Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS3","text":"Selbstständigkeit durch Einschluss und Ausschluss des Anderen → Selbstwiderspruch jeder Seite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS4","text":"Selbstwiderspruch → wechselseitiges Übergehen, Aufhebung des Gesetztseins und unmittelbare Nullität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS5","text":"Aufgehobenes Gesetztsein → positive Rückkehr in sich → Wesen als Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS6","text":"Grund als identische Negativität → Erhaltung des Gegensatzes als innere, bloß gesetzte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF1","text":"Selbstständiger Gegensatz → Einschluss des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF2","text":"Einschluss des Anderen → notwendiger Ausschluss des Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF3","text":"Ausschluss des Anderen → Setzung des ausgeschlossenen Anderen und Selbstwiderspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF4","text":"Selbstwiderspruch → Selbstaufhebung der entgegengesetzten Selbstständigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF5","text":"Selbstaufhebung → Aufhebung des Gesetztseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF6","text":"Aufgehobenes Gesetztsein → Grund als positive Einheit von Positivem und Negativem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF7","text":"Grund → Rückklassifikation des anfänglichen Gegensatzes als gesetzte Negativität des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME1","text":"Positives und Negatives werden von festen Gegenbestimmungen zu rekursiven Vollzügen des Setzens, Ausschließens und Selbstaufhebens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz wird nicht als Relation zwischen bereits bestehenden Polen, sondern als Erzeugungsform der Pole selbst sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME3","text":"Nullität und positive Einheit werden nicht als Alternativen kartiert, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Momente derselben Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME4","text":"Der Grund wird nicht als vorausgesetztes Fundament, sondern als Resultat und innere Wahrheit des aufgehobenen Gegensatzes kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME5","text":"Erhaltung und Aufhebung werden als gleichzeitig notwendige Bestimmungen des Resultats verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text analysiert Positives und Negatives als selbstständige Seiten eines Gegensatzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmungen reproduzieren ihr Anderes durch die Operation, mit der sie dessen Ausschluss vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Widerspruch wird von einem Fehlerzeichen zu einer produktiven Bewegungsform der Begriffsbestimmung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wesen ist nicht ursprüngliche ruhende Präsenz, sondern die durch Selbstnegation in sich zurückkehrende Einheit des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Gegensatz über Widerspruch zu Grund zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die Selbstständigkeit zunächst als unmittelbarer Anfang erscheint, obwohl sie rückwirkend als gesetzte Bestimmung des Grundes gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Selbstbeziehung notwendig als negative Vermittlung und nicht als unmittelbare Identität verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation besteht in der Ableitung, dass Ausschluss zugleich Setzung des Ausgeschlossenen und damit Selbstnegation ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung besteht darin, dass der Grund zugleich Ergebnis der Aufhebung und die Wahrheit sein soll, von der der aufgehobene Gegensatz bereits abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegungsform nur, wenn Aufhebung als Erhaltung der Negativität innerhalb positiver Einheit bestimmt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114332865949Z_3c0260f2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. The Contradiction.","source_sha256":"92c438bcfd4388b377be6de4186c296bf313ccff1fe8c5efca1586d08b957606","sha256":"c775783476fd09c883da3ae3bdcfb43c83e39ffb28ebc679a1615cebbe74bdaa","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:43:32.869958+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS1","text":"The text determines opposition as the self-subsistence of the positive and the negative, which exists only through their reciprocal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS2","text":"The self-subsistence of each side generates contradiction because it contains the other as the condition of its determinacy and must exclude it as other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS3","text":"Contradiction appears as the self-sublation of the opposed determinations and as their restless passing over into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS4","text":"The sublation of opposition is not mere annihilation, but the production of a positive unity through sublated positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AS5","text":"Ground is the unity in which opposition and contradiction are determined simultaneously as sublated and as preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A1","text":"Difference contains its sides as moments of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A2","text":"In opposition, the sides are determined only through their other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","text":"Positive and negative determination each lay claim to self-subsistence against their other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A4","text":"Self-subsistence consists in containing the other within itself and simultaneously excluding it from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","text":"Every excluding determination posits its own other through exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A6","text":"Every opposed determination excludes its own self-subsistence through its self-actualization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A7","text":"The negative is not immediate determinacy, but negativity related to the negation of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A8","text":"Contradiction is the self-relation of a determination that determines itself only through its self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","text":"The self-sublation of posited opposition sublates its positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","text":"Sublated negation is the positive return of self-subsistence into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","text":"Ground is essence as the unity of positivity and negativity identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:A12","text":"Ground posits opposition as its own negation and preserves it therein as merely posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX1","text":"Opposition is not mere indifferent diversity of two externally separated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX2","text":"Positive and negative determination are not independently existing self-subsistences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX3","text":"The positive is not pure identity without negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX4","text":"The negative is not immediate non-being or mere qualitative determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX5","text":"Excluding is not a one-sided act, because every exclusion simultaneously posits the excluded other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX6","text":"The resolution of contradiction is not mere nullity or the final disappearance of all determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:NX7","text":"Ground is not a substrate externally antecedent to opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D1","text":"Positive and negative determination are each complete oppositions, because each mediates its other within itself and excludes it from itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A2","CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","CH_GB18_CDW0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D2","text":"The positing of a self-subsistent determination is immediately the positing of a self-subsistent determination opposed to it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D3","text":"Through the exclusion of the negative, the positive itself becomes something posited and thereby the negative of an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A3","CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D4","text":"The negative is posited contradiction, because its identity with itself contains the exclusion of identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A7","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D5","text":"The immediate yield of contradiction is zero, because the opposed self-subsistences vanish into one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A6","CH_GB18_CDW0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D6","text":"Zero is not the final result, because self-sublation is simultaneously positing reflection and return into positive unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D7","text":"Ground is unity that has come to be, because it proceeds from the sublation of the initially self-subsistent opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:D8","text":"Opposition remains preserved in ground as its posited negativity, although its independent self-subsistence is sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD1","text":"Every claimed pure self-identity turns into mediated negativity, because its exclusion of the other constitutively reproduces that other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A4","CH_GB18_CDW0:A5","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD2","text":"Contradiction is not a disturbance of a prior unity, but the mechanism through which a non-external unity is first produced.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A1","CH_GB18_CDW0:A8","CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD3","text":"Ground transforms the temporally or logically initial self-subsistence of opposition into a dependent form of appearance of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A9","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SD4","text":"Sublation preserves negativity as an inner form of determination of positive unity, instead of eliminating it from the result.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDW0:A10","CH_GB18_CDW0:A11","CH_GB18_CDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX1","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which determinations are first fully self-subsistent and only subsequently enter into relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which identity can be thought without constitutive negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which negation signifies merely deficiency, absence, or external loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX4","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which resolution wholly extinguishes opposition and leaves no determinate unity behind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:DNX5","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which ground would be an unmoved, contradiction-free foundation outside its posited determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the availability of an absolutely first positive that would not already be mediated through its relation to negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a final self-subsistence that does not sublate itself in the enactment of its exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a final state of pure rest, because ground possesses its unity only as posited and sublated negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS1","text":"Difference as a form of unity → opposition as reciprocal determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS2","text":"Reciprocal determinacy → claim to self-subsistent positivity and negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS3","text":"Self-subsistence through inclusion and exclusion of the other → self-contradiction of each side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS4","text":"Self-contradiction → reciprocal passing over, sublation of positedness, and immediate nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS5","text":"Sublated positedness → positive return into itself → essence as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:FGS6","text":"Ground as identical negativity → preservation of opposition as an inner, merely posited determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF1","text":"Self-subsistent opposition → inclusion of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF2","text":"Inclusion of the other → necessary exclusion of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF3","text":"Exclusion of the other → positing of the excluded other and self-contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF4","text":"Self-contradiction → self-sublation of the opposed self-subsistences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF5","text":"Self-sublation → sublation of positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF6","text":"Sublated positedness → ground as positive unity of the positive and the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:AF7","text":"Ground → reclassification of the initial opposition as posited negativity of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME1","text":"The positive and the negative are reclassified from fixed counter-determinations into recursive enactments of positing, excluding, and self-sublating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME2","text":"Opposition becomes visible not as a relation between already existing poles, but as the generative form of the poles themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME3","text":"Nullity and positive unity are mapped not as alternatives, but as successive moments of the same sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME4","text":"Ground is mapped not as a presupposed foundation, but as the result and inner truth of sublated opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ME5","text":"Preservation and sublation are conjoined as simultaneously necessary determinations of the result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text analyzes the positive and the negative as self-subsistent sides of an opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determinations reproduce their other through the operation by which they enact its exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Contradiction is transformed from a sign of error into a productive form of movement of conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Essence is not original resting presence, but the unity of ground returning into itself through self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from opposition through contradiction to ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is why self-subsistence initially appears as an immediate beginning, although retrospectively it counts as a posited determination of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as self-relation is necessarily understood as negative mediation and not as immediate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation consists in the derivation that exclusion is simultaneously the positing of the excluded and thus self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension consists in the fact that ground is supposed to be simultaneously the result of sublation and the truth upon which the sublated opposition already depends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDW0:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the form of movement only if sublation remains determined as preservation of negativity within positive unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDW0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDW0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 118","title":"C. Contradiction.","context":"Chapter 118","original_title":"C. Der Widerspruch."},"original_title":"C. Der Widerspruch.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 1.","order":119,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_31"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_31@R001","sha256":"724c5cfad704d5e06efa512a79a4d4afabb264ee79e8d855dc885661e9b72876","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Verhältnis von Positivem und Negativem jenseits einer äußerlichen Gegenüberstellung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS2","text":"Die Bestimmungen werden von der äußeren Vergleichung in ihre eigene Reflexion verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS3","text":"Diese Reflexion zeigt, dass jedes Bestimmte im Anderen erscheint und sich als das Andere setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS4","text":"Die beobachtete Umkehrung von Positivem und Negativem wird als notwendige Bewegung und nicht als subjektiver Denkfehler rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS5","text":"Die scheinbar festen Gegensätze werden dadurch als gegenseitig begrifflich enthaltene Bestimmungen neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS6","text":"Das diagnostisch-rekonstruktive Argument schließt, dass philosophische Erkenntnis an der Erhaltung dieser relationalen Einheit von Gegensatz und Übergang hängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A1","text":"Positives und Negatives sind an ihnen selbst und nicht durch äußere Vergleichung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A2","text":"In ihrer eigenen Reflexion erscheint jedes im Anderen und setzt sich als das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A3","text":"Das Positive hat nur als Entgegengesetztes gegen das Negative Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A4","text":"Das Positive enthält als auf sich bezogene Negation des bloßen Gesetztseins die absolute Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A5","text":"Das Negative hat nur in Beziehung auf das Positive Sinn und enthält dieses in seinem Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A6","text":"Das Negative besitzt auch ohne die Beziehung auf das Positive ein mit sich identisches Bestehen und nimmt dadurch die Bestimmung des Positiven an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A7","text":"Die Umwandlung des Positiven in das Negative und des Negativen in das Positive ist in ihrer begrifflichen Natur notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A8","text":"Wird das Negative als bloße subjektive oder äußerliche Abstraktion bestimmt, so ist auch die Bestimmung des Positiven als objektiv nur äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A9","text":"Die Wahrheit dieser Reflexionsbestimmungen besteht in ihrer Beziehung aufeinander und in der begrifflichen Enthaltung des jeweils Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Positivem und Negativem ist nicht abschließend durch äußere Vergleichung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX2","text":"Positives und Negatives sind keine unmittelbar festen und voneinander isolierten Pole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX3","text":"Die Verwirrung des reflektierenden Denkens ist nicht bloß einem subjektiven Fehler zuzuschreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX4","text":"Das Positive ist keine unmittelbare, relationslose Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX5","text":"Das Negative ist keine bloß subjektive Willkür oder leere Abstraktion äußerlicher Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX6","text":"Das objektiv Positive besteht nicht unabhängig von der Negativität, die in seinem Begriff liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX7","text":"Das Negative ist nicht mit bloßer Abwesenheit oder Nichtvorhandenheit gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX8","text":"Die Benennung oder äußerliche Zuordnung einer Bestimmung als positiv oder negativ entscheidet nicht über ihre eigene begriffliche Natur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D1","text":"Die Identität von Positivem und Negativem ist keine unmittelbare Gleichheit, sondern eine durch gegenseitige Reflexion vermittelte Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A1","CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D2","text":"Eine feste Gegenüberstellung von Positivem und Negativem erzeugt notwendig die Umkehrung, die sie ausschließen wollte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D3","text":"Das Positive ist nicht nur positiv, sondern trägt als absolute Negation eine negative Bestimmung in sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D4","text":"Das Negative ist nicht nur negativ, sondern besitzt durch seine Selbstidentität eine positive Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D5","text":"Die Umkehrung der Bestimmungen erscheint dem Bewusstsein als Verwirrung, solange ihre begriffliche Notwendigkeit nicht erkannt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D6","text":"Eine als positiv gesetzte Bestimmung kann durch ihre eigene innere Struktur absolute Negativität sein, während eine als negativ gesetzte Bestimmung positive Selbstidentität enthalten kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D7","text":"Wahrheit ist nur als Übereinstimmung mit dem Gegenstand bestimmt, insofern das Wissen sich negativ gegen das Andere verhält, es durchdringt und seine Negation aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D8","text":"Unwissenheit kann entweder als äußerlich zugeschriebener Mangel oder als eigene negative Bestimmung mit positiver Richtung auftreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A8","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD1","text":"Der Gegensatz wird von einer statischen Klassifikation in eine gegenseitige Erzeugungsstruktur überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD2","text":"Der notwendige Übergang zwischen den Bestimmungen wird zum Kriterium ihrer objektiven Begriffsstruktur.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A6","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD3","text":"Die herkömmliche Zuordnung von Licht, Tugend, Wahrheit oder Positivität zur reinen Bejahung und von Finsternis, Laster, Irrtum oder Negativität zur reinen Abwesenheit wird systematisch aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD4","text":"Die scheinbare Indifferenz bildet keinen endgültigen Außenbereich des Gegensatzes, sondern kann als bestimmte Natur in eine Beziehung auf ihr Anderes übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD5","text":"Philosophie kann nur fortschreiten, wenn sie die Bestimmungen nicht fixiert, sondern ihre gegenseitige begriffliche Enthaltung und Verwandlung festhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A1","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ontologie ursprünglicher, relationsloser positiver oder negativer Träger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein äußerer Standpunkt, von dem aus das Negative lediglich dem Bewusstsein und nicht dem Gegenstand selbst angehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Positivität Sein und Negativität bloßes Nichtsein ohne eigene Bestimmtheit bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass begriffliche Stabilität durch das Festhalten unveränderlicher Gegensätze hergestellt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erkenntnis, in der das Wissen den Gegenstand äußerlich betrachtet, ohne seine eigene negative Beziehung zu ihm zu vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird die Existenz einer reinen Positivität, die keine Negation in sich trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich wird die Existenz einer reinen Negativität, die weder positive Selbstidentität noch Beziehung auf das Positive enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird jeder philosophische Standpunkt, der sich außerhalb der von ihm bestimmten Gegensätze stellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Wahrheit durch unmittelbare Identität statt durch negative Vermittlung und Aufhebung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine endgültige Kategorie der bloßen Gleichgültigkeit, die von jeder bestimmten Beziehung auf ein Anderes frei wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS1","text":"Zwei Bestimmungen werden zunächst als Positives und Negatives gegenübergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS2","text":"Die äußere Gegenüberstellung wird suspendiert und durch die Frage nach der Eigenreflexion jeder Bestimmung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS3","text":"Die Eigenreflexion erzeugt die Form: Jede Bestimmung erscheint im Anderen und setzt sich als das Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS4","text":"Das Positive wird als Gegensatz und zugleich als absolute Negation des bloßen Gesetztseins bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS5","text":"Das Negative wird als relationale Bestimmung und zugleich als mit sich identisches Bestehen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS6","text":"Aus dieser Doppelbestimmung folgt die notwendige Umkehrung von Positivität und Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS7","text":"Die Umkehrung wird auf konkrete Bestimmungen wie Licht und Finsternis, Tugend und Laster sowie Wahrheit, Irrtum und Unwissenheit übertragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS8","text":"Die Übertragung bestätigt als abschließende Regel, dass jede Reflexionsbestimmung ihre Wahrheit nur durch die Beziehung und begriffliche Enthaltung ihres Anderen besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AF1","text":"Äußerlich fixierte Gegenüberstellung → beobachtete Verwirrung und Umkehrung → Verlagerung in die Eigenreflexion → gegenseitiges Scheinen und Setzen → begriffliche Enthaltung des Anderen → notwendige Verwandlung → allgemeine Bestimmung philosophischer Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME1","text":"Die begriffliche Karte verschiebt sich von einer binären Gegenüberstellung zu einer Struktur gegenseitiger Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME2","text":"Die Umkehrung von Positivem und Negativem wird von einem Denkfehler zu einem Indikator begrifflicher Notwendigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME3","text":"Licht, Finsternis, Tugend, Laster, Wahrheit, Irrtum und Unwissenheit werden nicht mehr nach äußerlicher Wert- oder Namenszuweisung, sondern nach ihrer inneren Reflexionsstruktur kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME4","text":"Die Kategorie der Indifferenz wird von einem bloßen Zwischen- oder Mangelszustand in eine potenziell bestimmte Ausgangsform der Beziehung auf ein Anderes überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME5","text":"Wahrheit wird als aktive negative Durchdringung und Aufhebung bestimmt, während Irrtum als positive Behauptung und Unwissenheit als ambivalente Bestimmung sichtbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT1","text":"Surface — Positives und Negatives erscheinen zunächst als einander entgegengesetzte Reflexionsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Gegenbestimmungen erzeugen sich gegenseitig durch Scheinen, Setzen, Enthalten und Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Denken muss seine Fixierung der Gegensätze aufgeben und die notwendige Verwandlung als Erkenntnisbewegung anerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Bestimmungen besitzen keine isolierte unmittelbare Realität; ihre Identität vollzieht sich als Selbstbeziehung im Übergang zum Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Bewegung von äußerer Gegenüberstellung zu innerer Reflexion und notwendiger Umkehrung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt auf die dialektische Bedeutung von „dasselbe“ angewiesen und schließt numerische Identität aus, ohne diese Abgrenzung vollständig zu formalisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt das Verhältnis zwischen der relationalen Sinnbestimmung des Negativen und seinem zugleich behaupteten selbstidentischen Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT4","text":"Die Behandlung der Unschuld und der Unwissenheit lässt eine Spannung zwischen Gleichgültigkeit und bereits bestimmter negativer Richtung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Identität als vermittelte Einheit von Gegensatz und Beziehung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT6","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle liegt in der Ableitung der notwendigen Umkehrung aus der gegenseitigen begrifflichen Enthaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt bei den konkreten Kategorien teilweise von der komprimierten Übertragung des allgemeinen Schemas auf Beispiele ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, wenn die Schlussposition nicht als Aufhebung des Gegensatzes in bloße Gleichheit, sondern als Einheit durch gegenseitige Negation rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112224134952Z_66243cbe","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note 1.","source_sha256":"724c5cfad704d5e06efa512a79a4d4afabb264ee79e8d855dc885661e9b72876","sha256":"d13c72afe632859baf159f7be6e5f560c791c7a4f3c2d9c702e43dc31a5c1936","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:22:24.136455+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the relation of the positive and the negative beyond an external juxtaposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS2","text":"The determinations are shifted from external comparison into their own reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS3","text":"This reflection shows that each appears in the other and posits itself as the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS4","text":"The observed reversal of the positive and the negative is reconstructed as a necessary movement and not as a subjective error of thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS5","text":"The seemingly fixed opposites are thereby redetermined as determinations mutually conceptually contained in one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AS6","text":"The diagnostic-reconstructive argument concludes that philosophical cognition depends on preserving this relational unity of opposition and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A1","text":"The positive and the negative are to be determined in and for themselves and not through external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A2","text":"In their own reflection, each appears in the other and posits itself as the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A3","text":"The positive has meaning only as that which is opposed to the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A4","text":"As a negation of mere positedness relating itself to itself, the positive contains absolute negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A5","text":"The negative has sense only in relation to the positive and contains the latter in its concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A6","text":"Even without the relation to the positive, the negative possesses a self-identical subsistence and thereby assumes the determination of the positive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A7","text":"The transformation of the positive into the negative and of the negative into the positive is necessary in their conceptual nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A8","text":"If the negative is determined as a merely subjective or external abstraction, then the determination of the positive as objective is likewise merely external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:A9","text":"The truth of these determinations of reflection consists in their relation to one another and in the conceptual containment of the other in each case.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX1","text":"The relation of the positive and the negative is not conclusively determined by external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX2","text":"The positive and the negative are not immediately fixed poles isolated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX3","text":"The confusion of reflective thinking is not to be ascribed merely to a subjective error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX4","text":"The positive is not an immediate, relationless identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX5","text":"The negative is not mere subjective arbitrariness or an empty abstraction of external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX6","text":"The objectively positive does not subsist independently of the negativity that lies in its concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX7","text":"The negative is not to be equated with mere absence or nonexistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:NX8","text":"The designation or external attribution of a determination as positive or negative does not decide its own conceptual nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D1","text":"The identity of the positive and the negative is not immediate equality, but a unity mediated through mutual reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A1","CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D2","text":"A fixed juxtaposition of the positive and the negative necessarily produces the reversal that it sought to exclude.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D3","text":"The positive is not merely positive, but bears a negative determination within itself as absolute negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D4","text":"The negative is not merely negative, but possesses a positive determination through its self-identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D5","text":"The reversal of the determinations appears to consciousness as confusion so long as its conceptual necessity is not recognized.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D6","text":"A determination posited as positive can, through its own inner structure, be absolute negativity, whereas a determination posited as negative can contain positive self-identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D7","text":"Truth is determined only as correspondence with the object insofar as knowing relates negatively to the other, penetrates it, and sublates its negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:D8","text":"Ignorance can occur either as an externally ascribed deficiency or as its own negative determination with a positive direction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A8","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD1","text":"Opposition is transferred from a static classification into a structure of mutual generation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD2","text":"The necessary transition between the determinations becomes the criterion of their objective conceptual structure.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A6","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD3","text":"The customary association of light, virtue, truth, or positivity with pure affirmation, and of darkness, vice, error, or negativity with pure absence, is systematically sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A3","CH_GB18_A_31:A4","CH_GB18_A_31:A5","CH_GB18_A_31:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD4","text":"Apparent indifference does not constitute a final exterior region of opposition, but can, as a determinate nature, pass over into a relation to its other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A2","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SD5","text":"Philosophy can progress only if it does not fix the determinations, but retains their mutual conceptual containment and transformation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_31:A1","CH_GB18_A_31:A7","CH_GB18_A_31:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an ontology of original, relationless positive or negative bearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an external standpoint from which the negative belongs merely to consciousness and not to the object itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which positivity means being and negativity mere nonbeing without determinate character of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that conceptual stability is established by holding fast to unchanging opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a cognition in which knowing externally contemplates the object without enacting its own negative relation to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX1","text":"The existence of a pure positivity that bears no negation within itself becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX2","text":"The existence of a pure negativity that contains neither positive self-identity nor relation to the positive becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX3","text":"Every philosophical standpoint that places itself outside the opposites it determines becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX4","text":"The possibility of determining truth through immediate identity instead of through negative mediation and sublation is foreclosed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:SNX5","text":"Unavailable is a final category of mere indifference that would be free from every determinate relation to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS1","text":"Two determinations are initially juxtaposed as the positive and the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS2","text":"The external juxtaposition is suspended and replaced by the question of the self-reflection of each determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS3","text":"Self-reflection generates the form: Each determination appears in the other and posits itself as the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS4","text":"The positive is determined as opposition and at the same time as absolute negation of mere positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS5","text":"The negative is determined as a relational determination and at the same time as self-identical subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS6","text":"From this double determination follows the necessary reversal of positivity and negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS7","text":"The reversal is applied to concrete determinations such as light and darkness, virtue and vice, as well as truth, error, and ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:FGS8","text":"The application confirms as a concluding rule that every determination of reflection possesses its truth only through the relation to and conceptual containment of its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:AF1","text":"Externally fixed juxtaposition → observed confusion and reversal → shift into self-reflection → mutual appearing and positing → conceptual containment of the other → necessary transformation → general determination of philosophical truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME1","text":"The conceptual map shifts from a binary juxtaposition to a structure of mutual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME2","text":"The reversal of the positive and the negative is reclassified from an error of thought into an indicator of conceptual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME3","text":"Light, darkness, virtue, vice, truth, error, and ignorance are no longer mapped according to external attribution of value or name, but according to their inner structure of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME4","text":"The category of indifference is transferred from a mere intermediate or deficient state into a potentially determinate initial form of relation to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ME5","text":"Truth is determined as active negative penetration and sublation, whereas error becomes visible as positive assertion and ignorance as an ambivalent determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT1","text":"Surface — The positive and the negative initially appear as determinations of reflection opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT2","text":"Structural — The counter-determinations mutually generate one another through appearing, positing, containing, and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Thought must abandon its fixation of opposites and recognize necessary transformation as a movement of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinations possess no isolated immediate reality; their identity enacts itself as self-relation in the transition to the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central movement from external juxtaposition to inner reflection and necessary reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains dependent on the dialectical meaning of „dasselbe“ and excludes numerical identity without fully formalizing this delimitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT3","text":"The relation between the relational determination of sense of the negative and its simultaneously asserted self-identical subsistence remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT4","text":"The treatment of innocence and ignorance leaves standing a tension between indifference and an already determinate negative direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as identity is understood as a mediated unity of opposition and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT6","text":"Its strongest point lies in the derivation of the necessary reversal from mutual conceptual containment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT7","text":"With respect to the concrete categories, the reconstruction depends in part on the compressed application of the general schema to examples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_31:MRT8","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved if the concluding position is reconstructed not as the sublation of opposition into mere equality, but as unity through mutual negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_31:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_31@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_31:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 119","title":"Remark 1.","context":"Chapter 119","original_title":"Anmerkung 1."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 1.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 2.","order":120,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_32"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_32@R001","sha256":"31c9213410577a621333dd460390a0fa5fe722c7443b6d4d3bf46eb3bdba80c1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS1","text":"Der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten soll die Entgegensetzung als logische Bestimmung ausdrücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS2","text":"Seine gewöhnliche Auslegung reduziert Entgegensetzung auf die bloße Abwesenheit eines Prädikats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS3","text":"Dadurch wird die Bestimmtheit nicht zur bestimmten Entgegensetzung weitergeführt, sondern in Unbestimmtheit zurückgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS4","text":"Gegenüber dem Satz des Widerspruchs soll der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten ein gleichgültiges Drittes ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS5","text":"In seiner eigenen Form setzt er jedoch ein solches Drittes voraus: das Etwas, auf das A und Nicht-A bezogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS6","text":"Die gesetzten und zugleich aufgehobenen Gegensätze gehen in die Einheit der Reflexion als ihren Grund zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A1","text":"Entgegensetzung ist eine positive oder negative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A2","text":"Identität geht in Verschiedenheit und Verschiedenheit in Entgegensetzung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A3","text":"Eine bloße Prädikatsbestimmung erzeugt noch keine bestimmte Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A4","text":"Die gewöhnliche Lesart des ausgeschlossenen Dritten behandelt das Entgegengesetzte als bloßes Nichtsein eines Prädikats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A5","text":"Der Satz des Widerspruchs schließt die gleichzeitige Bestimmung als A und Nicht-A aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A6","text":"Der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten schließt ein Etwas aus, das weder A noch Nicht-A ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A7","text":"Der Ausschluss eines Dritten setzt ein Etwas voraus, auf das die Gegensätze bezogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A8","text":"Das Etwas ist im Verhältnis zu A und Nicht-A weder als bloßes A noch als bloßes Nicht-A fixierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A9","text":"Entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen sind im Etwas gesetzt und in ihrem Gesetztsein zugleich aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A10","text":"Die aufgehobene Entgegensetzung geht in eine Einheit der Reflexion zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A11","text":"Die Einheit der Reflexion fungiert als Grund der Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX1","text":"Entgegensetzung ist nicht bloß die Abwesenheit oder Unbestimmtheit eines Prädikats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX2","text":"Der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten ist nicht als vollständige Aufzählung beliebiger Prädikate zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX3","text":"Die Aussage „A oder Nicht-A“ ist nicht schon dadurch begrifflich gehaltvoll, dass einem Gegenstand irgendein Prädikat oder dessen Nichtsein zugeschrieben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX4","text":"Das ausgeschlossene Dritte ist nicht einfach ein von A und Nicht-A äußerlich verschiedenes Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX5","text":"A kann nicht widerspruchsfrei als dasjenige behandelt werden, was ausschließlich außerhalb von +A und −A steht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX6","text":"Die Entgegensetzung lässt sich nicht auf eine zweiwertige Zuordnung äußerer Prädikate reduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D1","text":"Die gewöhnliche Prädikatslogik des Satzes führt von Bestimmtheit zurück zur Unbestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A3","CH_GB18_A_32:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D2","text":"Die bloße Negation eines Prädikats erzeugt keine Gegenbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A1","CH_GB18_A_32:A3","CH_GB18_A_32:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D3","text":"Der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten enthält eine Bezugseinheit, die von seiner expliziten Ausschlussform nicht erfasst wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A6","CH_GB18_A_32:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D4","text":"Das Etwas fungiert zugleich als Träger der Alternative und als das Dritte, das die Alternative ausschließen will.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A6","CH_GB18_A_32:A7","CH_GB18_A_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D5","text":"Die Bestimmungen +A und −A sind im Etwas zugleich gesetzt und aufgehoben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A8","CH_GB18_A_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D6","text":"Der scheinbar ausgeschlossene dritte Term erscheint als Reflexionsverhältnis der beiden Gegensätze.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A7","CH_GB18_A_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D7","text":"Die Entgegensetzung besitzt ihren Grund nicht in einem äußerlich indifferenten Dritten, sondern in einer Einheit der Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A9","CH_GB18_A_32:A10","CH_GB18_A_32:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD1","text":"Der Satz des ausgeschlossenen Dritten widerlegt in seiner gewöhnlichen Form gerade die begriffliche Entgegensetzung, die er ausdrücken soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD2","text":"Der Ausschlussmechanismus erzeugt sein eigenes ausgeschiedenes Moment, weil jede Alternative ein gemeinsames Bezugselement voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD3","text":"Die logische Opposition ist keine äußerliche Disjunktion, sondern eine Reflexionsstruktur, in der Bestimmungen zugleich gelten und aufgehoben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD4","text":"Der eigentliche logische Grund der Entgegensetzung liegt in einer Einheit, die durch die Form des Ausschlusses verdeckt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht voraussetzen, dass Negation lediglich die Abwesenheit einer positiven Prädikatsbestimmung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX2","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass die Terme einer Opposition unabhängig von einem gemeinsamen Bezug bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX3","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass ein Etwas außerhalb der Opposition steht und dennoch deren Träger bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX4","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass Ausschluss und Bezug aufeinander unabhängige Operationen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX5","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass die formale Alternative ihre eigene Reflexionsgrundlage vollständig ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer Opposition, deren Gegensätze ohne innere Einheit und ohne gemeinsamen Grund bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird ein rein äußerliches Zweiwertigkeitsmodell, in dem das Etwas weder an der Opposition teilnimmt noch durch sie strukturiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX3","text":"Verwehrt wird die Vorstellung, dass logische Bestimmtheit durch die Addition beliebiger Prädikate gewonnen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit eines wirklich indifferenten Dritten strukturiert den Übergang von der formalen Alternative zur Einheit der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS1","text":"Identität → Verschiedenheit → Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS2","text":"Entgegensetzung → formale Alternative A / Nicht-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS3","text":"Formale Alternative → Reduktion des Gegensatzes auf Prädikat / Nichtsein des Prädikats.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS4","text":"Reduktion → Rückfall von Bestimmtheit in Unbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS5","text":"Ausschluss des Dritten → notwendige Setzung eines gemeinsamen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS6","text":"Gemeinsames Etwas → gleichzeitige Beziehung auf A und Nicht-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS7","text":"Gleichzeitige Beziehung → Setzung und Aufhebung der Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS8","text":"Aufhebung der Gegensätze → Einheit der Reflexion als Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AF1","text":"Formale Entgegensetzung → gewöhnliche Prädikatsauslegung → Trivialisierung → immanentes Drittes → Reflexionseinheit → Grund der Opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz wird von einer äußeren Alternative in eine innere Reflexionsrelation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME2","text":"Das Etwas wird vom neutralen Träger der Prädikate zum strukturellen Ort der Opposition und ihrer Aufhebung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME3","text":"Das ausgeschlossene Dritte wird nicht als zusätzlicher Term, sondern als Einheit der aufeinander bezogenen Gegensätze sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME4","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen formaler Negation und bestimmter Entgegensetzung wird als zentraler logischer Bruch freigelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME5","text":"Der Grund der Opposition wird innerhalb der Opposition lokalisiert, nicht außerhalb ihrer Terme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Satz „Etwas ist entweder A oder Nicht-A“ beansprucht den Ausschluss eines dritten Falls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Opposition wird durch ein Etwas vermittelt, das auf beide Gegensätze bezogen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die geläufige Lesart wird als Trivialisierung zurückgewiesen und durch eine dialektische Lesart ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Bestimmungen bestehen nicht statisch, sondern gehen von Identität über Verschiedenheit in Entgegensetzung und von dort in reflektierte Einheit über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kritik der gewöhnlichen Auslegung und die Rückführung der Opposition auf Reflexion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue systematische Stellung der Einheit der Reflexion innerhalb der umfassenderen Logik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern „Drittes“ zwischen äußerem indifferentem Term und innerer Reflexionseinheit unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die immanente Umkehrung des Ausschlusses: Das Ausgeschlossene wird als notwendige Bezugseinheit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass A zugleich nicht als +A oder −A fixiert und dennoch als Einheit beider Bestimmungen gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von formaler Trivialität über den Selbstwiderspruch des Ausschlusses zur Einheit der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112242625689Z_b258c179","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 2.","source_sha256":"31c9213410577a621333dd460390a0fa5fe722c7443b6d4d3bf46eb3bdba80c1","sha256":"f42e7c10d64e2551d269147c36bf58e3936c01565fd5e0ac0469375558d19ba1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:22:42.626704+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS1","text":"The law of excluded middle is supposed to express opposition as a logical determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS2","text":"Its customary interpretation reduces opposition to the mere absence of a predicate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS3","text":"Thereby determinacy is not carried forward into determinate opposition, but taken back into indeterminacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS4","text":"In contrast to the law of contradiction, the law of excluded middle is supposed to exclude an indifferent third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS5","text":"Yet in its own form it presupposes such a third: the something to which A and not-A are related.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AS6","text":"The posited and at the same time sublated opposites return into the unity of reflection as their ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A1","text":"Opposition is a positive or negative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A2","text":"Identity passes over into difference, and difference into opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A3","text":"A mere predicate-determination does not yet produce determinate opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A4","text":"The customary reading of excluded middle treats the opposite as the mere non-being of a predicate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A5","text":"The law of contradiction excludes simultaneous determination as A and not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A6","text":"The law of excluded middle excludes a something that is neither A nor not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A7","text":"The exclusion of a third presupposes a something to which the opposites are related.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A8","text":"The something cannot be fixed, in relation to A and not-A, as either mere A or mere not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A9","text":"Opposed determinations are posited in the something and simultaneously sublated in their positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A10","text":"The sublated opposition returns into a unity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:A11","text":"The unity of reflection functions as the ground of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX1","text":"Opposition is not merely the absence or indeterminacy of a predicate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX2","text":"The law of excluded middle is not to be understood as a complete enumeration of arbitrary predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX3","text":"The statement “A or not-A” is not conceptually substantive merely because some predicate or its non-being is ascribed to an object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX4","text":"The excluded third is not simply a something externally distinct from A and not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX5","text":"A cannot consistently be treated as that which stands exclusively outside +A and −A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:NX6","text":"Opposition cannot be reduced to a bivalent assignment of external predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D1","text":"The customary predicate logic of the law leads from determinacy back to indeterminacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A3","CH_GB18_A_32:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D2","text":"The mere negation of a predicate produces no counter-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A1","CH_GB18_A_32:A3","CH_GB18_A_32:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D3","text":"The law of excluded middle contains a unity of reference that is not grasped by its explicit form of exclusion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A6","CH_GB18_A_32:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D4","text":"The something functions at once as bearer of the alternative and as the third that the alternative seeks to exclude.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A6","CH_GB18_A_32:A7","CH_GB18_A_32:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D5","text":"The determinations +A and −A are at once posited and sublated in the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A8","CH_GB18_A_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D6","text":"The apparently excluded third term appears as the relation of reflection of the two opposites.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A7","CH_GB18_A_32:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:D7","text":"Opposition has its ground not in an externally indifferent third, but in a unity of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_32:A9","CH_GB18_A_32:A10","CH_GB18_A_32:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD1","text":"In its customary form, the law of excluded middle refutes precisely the conceptual opposition that it is supposed to express.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD2","text":"The mechanism of exclusion generates its own excluded moment, because every alternative presupposes a common element of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD3","text":"Logical opposition is not an external disjunction, but a structure of reflection in which determinations simultaneously hold and are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SD4","text":"The proper logical ground of opposition lies in a unity concealed by the form of exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX1","text":"The system cannot presuppose that negation is merely the absence of a positive predicate-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX2","text":"It cannot presuppose that the terms of an opposition subsist independently of a common reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX3","text":"It cannot presuppose that a something stands outside opposition and nevertheless remains its bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX4","text":"It cannot presuppose that exclusion and reference are operations independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:DNX5","text":"It cannot presuppose that the formal alternative completely excludes its own ground of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of an opposition whose opposites exist without inner unity and without common ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX2","text":"A purely external model of bivalence, in which the something neither participates in the opposition nor is structured by it, becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX3","text":"Disallowed is the notion that logical determinacy can be gained through the addition of arbitrary predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:SNX4","text":"The hidden absence of a genuinely indifferent third structures the transition from the formal alternative to the unity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS1","text":"Identity → difference → opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS2","text":"Opposition → formal alternative A / not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS3","text":"Formal alternative → reduction of opposition to predicate / non-being of the predicate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS4","text":"Reduction → relapse from determinacy into indeterminacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS5","text":"Exclusion of the third → necessary positing of a common something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS6","text":"Common something → simultaneous relation to A and not-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS7","text":"Simultaneous relation → positing and sublation of the opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:FGS8","text":"Sublation of the opposites → unity of reflection as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:AF1","text":"Formal opposition → customary predicate interpretation → trivialization → immanent third → unity of reflection → ground of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME1","text":"Opposition is remapped from an external alternative into an internal relation of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME2","text":"The something is reclassified from the neutral bearer of predicates into the structural site of opposition and its sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME3","text":"The excluded third becomes visible not as an additional term, but as the unity of the opposites related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME4","text":"The difference between formal negation and determinate opposition is disclosed as the central logical rupture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ME5","text":"The ground of opposition is located within opposition, not outside its terms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT1","text":"Surface — The statement “Something is either A or not-A” claims the exclusion of a third case.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT2","text":"Structural — Opposition is mediated through a something that is related to both opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The familiar reading is rejected as trivialization and replaced by a dialectical reading.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Determinations do not subsist statically, but pass from identity through difference into opposition and from there into reflected unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the critique of the customary interpretation and the reduction of opposition to reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the exact systematic position of the unity of reflection within the more comprehensive logic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as “third” is distinguished between an external indifferent term and an inner unity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT4","text":"The strongest point is the immanent reversal of exclusion: what is excluded is generated as a necessary unity of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that A is at once not fixed as +A or −A and yet grasped as the unity of both determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_32:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from formal triviality through the self-contradiction of exclusion to the unity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_32:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_32@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_32:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 120","title":"Remark 2.","context":"Chapter 120","original_title":"Anmerkung 2."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 2.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33","layer":"CH","title":"Remark 3.","order":121,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_33"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_33@R001","sha256":"602cda3b13e40e45bf5c0386cd955bdc8043f1d25d4070caaeeab9d27e4dc13b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt den Widerspruch als die Wahrheit, in welche Identität, Verschiedenheit und Entgegensetzung notwendig übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS2","text":"Die gewöhnliche Entfernung des Widerspruchs aus den Dingen und seine Verlegung in subjektive Reflexion wird als Grundvorurteil zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS3","text":"Der Widerspruch wird als immanente Negativität bestimmt, aus der Bewegung, Trieb, Tätigkeit und Lebendigkeit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS4","text":"Die Argumentation verfährt dialektisch, indem sie abstrakte Identität als implizite Negation, Negation als Unterschied und Unterschied als Widerspruch rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS5","text":"Das spekulative Denken unterscheidet sich vom Vorstellen dadurch, dass es den Widerspruch als Übergang und negative Einheit festhält, statt seine Momente äußerlich zu trennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung kulminiert in der Umkehrung des Schlusses vom Endlichen auf das Absolute: Nicht das Sein des Endlichen, sondern sein widersprüchliches Nichtsein setzt das Absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A1","text":"Abstrakte Identität ist leere Unmittelbarkeit und enthält implizit Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A2","text":"Negativität bestimmt sich notwendig zu Verschiedenheit, Entgegensetzung und gesetztem Widerspruch fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A3","text":"Der Widerspruch ist eine immanente Bestimmung des Wirklichen und des Begriffs, nicht ein bloß subjektiver Reflexionseffekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A4","text":"Bewegung und Lebendigkeit bestehen nur, sofern ein Etwas Widerspruch in sich enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A5","text":"Entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen bestehen nur durch ihre negative Beziehung aufeinander und enthalten daher Einheit und Gegensätzlichkeit zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A6","text":"Das Vorstellen hält die Momente des Widerspruchs äußerlich auseinander, während denkende Vernunft ihre immanente Übergangsbewegung erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A7","text":"Das Konkrete ist negative Einheit seiner unterschiedenen Momente und trägt den aufgelösten Widerspruch als seinen Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A8","text":"Jede endliche Sphäre ist als bestimmte Sphäre widersprüchlich und verweist durch ihren Zerfall auf eine höhere negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A9","text":"Eine Totalität bestimmter Realitäten wird, sofern ihre Unterschiede ernst genommen werden, zum absoluten Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX1","text":"Der Widerspruch ist nicht aus dem Wirklichen auszuschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX2","text":"Der Widerspruch ist nicht bloß eine zufällige Abnormität oder ein vorübergehender Defekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX3","text":"Identität ist nicht die tiefste oder wesentlichste Reflexionsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX4","text":"Bewegung ist nicht mit bloßem Ortswechsel identisch, sondern schließt gleichzeitiges Sein und Nichtsein derselben Bestimmung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX5","text":"Widerspruch ist nicht bloße Auflösung in Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX6","text":"Das Endliche ist nicht ein bestehenbleibender Grund, aus dessen positivem Sein das Absolute erschlossen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D1","text":"Äußere sinnliche Bewegung ist die unmittelbare Existenz des Widerspruchs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D2","text":"Lebendigkeit verlangt die Kraft, den eigenen Widerspruch zu fassen und auszuhalten; fehlt diese Kraft, zerfällt das Existierende im Widerspruch.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A4","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D3","text":"Relationale Bestimmungen verlieren ihren bestimmten Sinn, sobald ihre konstitutive negative Beziehung als bloße Gleichgültigkeit behandelt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D4","text":"Die Totalität aller bestimmten Realitäten ist nicht widerspruchsfrei möglich, weil Bestimmtheit selbst in Gegensatz und Widerspruch übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D5","text":"Das Endliche setzt seinen Grund nur dadurch, dass es sich in seinem widersprüchlichen Sein aufhebt und als Gesetztes erweist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D6","text":"Spekulatives Denken ist kein widerspruchsfreies Ordnen fertiger Bestimmungen, sondern das Festhalten ihrer negativen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD1","text":"Das Sein des Konkreten ist dynamisch strukturiert: Es besteht nur als Einheit einer Bestimmung mit ihrer immanenten Selbstnegation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD2","text":"Die Endlichkeit bildet keine Ansammlung äußerlich verschiedener Dinge, sondern eine rekursive Ordnung von Widersprüchen, die jeweils in höhere Gründe zurückgehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD3","text":"Das Absolute wird nicht durch Hinzufügung eines höchsten Seienden gewonnen, sondern durch die Aufhebung des Anspruchs des Endlichen auf selbständiges Sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD4","text":"Der Widerspruch fungiert zugleich als Destruktionsprinzip endlicher Bestimmungen und als Produktionsprinzip von Bewegung, Grund und höherer Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Denken und Gegenstand äußerlich getrennt bleiben und der Widerspruch nur aus ihrem Vergleich entsteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell stabiler Bestimmtheit, in dem Identität ohne immanente Negativität bestehen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Begriff von Realität, nach dem positive Bestimmungen ohne konstitutive Grenze, Negation oder Gegenbestimmung vereinbar sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Schlussmodell, in dem das Absolute aus der positiven Fortdauer des Endlichen abgeleitet wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine letzte endliche Sphäre, die ihren Widerspruch endgültig in sich selbst auflösen könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist die Vorstellung eines positiven Absoluten, das dem Negativen äußerlich gegenübersteht und ohne die Selbstaufhebung des Endlichen bestimmt werden könnte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Erkenntnisform, die Wahrheit als widerspruchsfreie Repräsentation fixer Bestimmungen auffasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte Identität → implizites Nichts → bestimmte Negation → Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS2","text":"Verschiedenheit → Entgegensetzung → wechselseitige Negation → gesetzter Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS3","text":"Immanenter Widerspruch → Selbstbewegung oder Zerfall der untragfähigen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS4","text":"Zerfall der endlichen Bestimmung → negative Einheit → Grund → höhere widersprüchliche Sphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS5","text":"Widersprüchliches Nichtsein des Endlichen → Aufhebung seines Selbständigkeitsanspruchs → Setzung des absolut Notwendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF1","text":"Leere Identität → immanente Negation → Widerspruch als Wahrheit der Reflexionsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF2","text":"Verdrängung des Widerspruchs → Kritik des Vorstellens → Nachweis von Bewegung und Leben als widersprüchlicher Selbstbezug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF3","text":"Widerspruch des Konkreten → negative Einheit und Grund → Endlichkeit als Selbstaufhebung → absolutes Notwendiges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME1","text":"Identität und Widerspruch werden nicht als gleichrangige Alternativen kartiert; Identität erscheint als abstrakte Vorstufe des tieferen Widerspruchs.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME2","text":"Bewegung wird von einem äußerlichen Wechselzustand in die Existenzform immanenter Negativität umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME3","text":"Relationen werden nicht als sekundäre Verknüpfungen selbständiger Terme kartiert, sondern als konstitutive Bedingungen ihrer bestimmten Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME4","text":"Der Schluss vom Endlichen auf das Absolute wird von einer positiven Fundierung in eine Selbstaufhebungslogik des Endlichen transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist der ontologische und logische Status des Widerspruchs gegenüber Identität, Verschiedenheit und Entgegensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Wirkliche ist als Prozess negativer Selbstbeziehung organisiert, in dem endliche Bestimmungen ihre Selbständigkeit verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Spekulatives Denken wird als Praxis bestimmt, die den Widerspruch festhält, während Vorstellen ihn durch äußerliche Trennung neutralisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zeitliche Bewegung und ontologische Bestimmtheit setzen Gleichzeitigkeit von Sein und Nichtsein innerhalb derselben Bestimmung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Identität über Widerspruch zu negativer Einheit und absoluter Notwendigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der genaue Status der höheren Sphäre, auf die jede endliche Sphäre zurückgeht, weil ihr positiver Begriff nicht innerhalb der Anmerkung entwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist nur kohärent, wenn Widerspruch nicht als formale Unvereinbarkeit, sondern als immanente Selbstnegation bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verknüpfung liegt in der Verbindung von relationaler Gegensätzlichkeit, negativer Einheit und Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur komprimiert den Übergang von widersprüchlicher Endlichkeit zu absoluter Notwendigkeit, weil die Notwendigkeit dieses Übergangs eher behauptet als innerhalb der Anmerkung vollständig entfaltet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die gerichtete Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Widerspruch zugleich als Auflösung endlicher Bestimmtheit und als produktiver Grund höherer Einheit behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112300379911Z_26166aac","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark 3.","source_sha256":"602cda3b13e40e45bf5c0386cd955bdc8043f1d25d4070caaeeab9d27e4dc13b","sha256":"84fcd503e113eb95fdcdec0929a1a4523c34127695cf889936ddf8247510742f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:23:00.389105+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS1","text":"The text determines contradiction as the truth into which identity, difference, and opposition necessarily pass over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS2","text":"The customary removal of contradiction from things and its relocation into subjective reflection is rejected as a fundamental prejudice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS3","text":"Contradiction is determined as immanent negativity, from which movement, impulse, activity, and vitality arise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS4","text":"The argument proceeds dialectically by reconstructing abstract identity as implicit negation, negation as difference, and difference as contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS5","text":"Speculative thinking differs from representation in that it holds fast to contradiction as transition and negative unity, instead of externally separating its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AS6","text":"The movement culminates in the reversal of the inference from the finite to the Absolute: not the being of the finite, but its contradictory non-being posits the Absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A1","text":"Abstract identity is empty immediacy and implicitly contains negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A2","text":"Negativity necessarily develops itself into difference, opposition, and posited contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A3","text":"Contradiction is an immanent determination of actuality and of the Concept, not a merely subjective effect of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A4","text":"Movement and vitality exist only insofar as something contains contradiction within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A5","text":"Opposed determinations exist only through their negative relation to one another and therefore contain unity and opposition simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A6","text":"Representation holds the moments of contradiction externally apart, whereas thinking reason grasps their immanent movement of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A7","text":"The concrete is the negative unity of its differentiated moments and bears resolved contradiction as its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A8","text":"Every finite sphere, as a determinate sphere, is contradictory and refers through its disintegration to a higher negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:A9","text":"A totality of determinate realities becomes, insofar as its differences are taken seriously, absolute contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX1","text":"Contradiction cannot be excluded from actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX2","text":"Contradiction is not merely an accidental abnormality or a temporary defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX3","text":"Identity is not the deepest or most essential determination of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX4","text":"Movement is not identical with mere change of place, but includes the simultaneous being and non-being of the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX5","text":"Contradiction is not mere dissolution into nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:NX6","text":"The finite is not an enduring ground from whose positive being the Absolute is inferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D1","text":"External sensible movement is the immediate existence of contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D2","text":"Vitality requires the strength to grasp and endure its own contradiction; if this strength is lacking, the existent disintegrates in contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A4","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D3","text":"Relational determinations lose their determinate meaning as soon as their constitutive negative relation is treated as mere indifference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D4","text":"The totality of all determinate realities is not possible without contradiction, because determinateness itself passes over into opposition and contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D5","text":"The finite posits its ground only by sublating itself in its contradictory being and proving itself to be posited.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:D6","text":"Speculative thinking is not a contradiction-free ordering of finished determinations, but the holding fast of their negative unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD1","text":"The being of the concrete is dynamically structured: it exists only as the unity of a determination with its immanent self-negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD2","text":"Finitude constitutes not an aggregation of externally different things, but a recursive order of contradictions, each of which returns to higher grounds.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD3","text":"The Absolute is not gained through the addition of a highest being, but through the sublation of the finite's claim to independent being.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SD4","text":"Contradiction functions simultaneously as the principle of destruction of finite determinations and as the principle of production of movement, ground, and higher unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4","CH_GB18_A_33:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which thinking and object remain externally separated and contradiction arises only from their comparison.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of stable determinateness in which identity can exist without immanent negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a concept of reality according to which positive determinations are compatible without a constitutive limit, negation, or counter-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A5","CH_GB18_A_33:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model of inference in which the Absolute is derived from the positive continuance of the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final finite sphere that could conclusively resolve its contradiction within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is the representation of a positive Absolute that stands externally opposed to the negative and could be determined without the self-sublation of the finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:SNX3","text":"Barred is a form of cognition that conceives truth as contradiction-free representation of fixed determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS1","text":"Abstract identity → implicit nothing → determinate negation → difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS2","text":"Difference → opposition → reciprocal negation → posited contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS3","text":"Immanent contradiction → self-movement or disintegration of the untenable determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS4","text":"Disintegration of the finite determination → negative unity → ground → higher contradictory sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:FGS5","text":"Contradictory non-being of the finite → sublation of its claim to independence → positing of the absolutely necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF1","text":"Empty identity → immanent negation → contradiction as the truth of the determinations of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF2","text":"Repression of contradiction → critique of representation → demonstration of movement and life as contradictory self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:AF3","text":"Contradiction of the concrete → negative unity and ground → finitude as self-sublation → the absolutely necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME1","text":"Identity and contradiction are not mapped as coequal alternatives; identity appears as an abstract preliminary stage of deeper contradiction.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A1","CH_GB18_A_33:A2","CH_GB18_A_33:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME2","text":"Movement is reclassified from an external state of change into the mode of existence of immanent negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A3","CH_GB18_A_33:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME3","text":"Relations are not mapped as secondary connections of independent terms, but as constitutive conditions of their determinate existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ME4","text":"The inference from the finite to the Absolute is transformed from a positive grounding into a logic of the finite's self-sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_33:A7","CH_GB18_A_33:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit subject is the ontological and logical status of contradiction in relation to identity, difference, and opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT2","text":"Structural — Actuality is organized as a process of negative self-relation in which finite determinations lose their independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Speculative thinking is determined as a practice that holds fast to contradiction, whereas representation neutralizes it through external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Temporal movement and ontological determinateness presuppose the simultaneity of being and non-being within the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from identity through contradiction to negative unity and absolute necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT2","text":"The precise status of the higher sphere to which every finite sphere returns remains underdetermined, because its positive Concept is not developed within the remark.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent only if contradiction is determined not as formal incompatibility, but as immanent self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT4","text":"The strongest linkage lies in the connection of relational opposition, negative unity, and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT5","text":"The structure compresses the transition from contradictory finitude to absolute necessity, because the necessity of this transition is asserted rather than fully unfolded within the remark.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_33:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the directed movement of the text insofar as contradiction is treated simultaneously as the dissolution of finite determinateness and as the productive ground of higher unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_33:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_33@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_33:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 121","title":"Remark 3.","context":"Chapter 121","original_title":"Anmerkung 3."},"original_title":"Anmerkung 3.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":122,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_34"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_34@R001","sha256":"3643c57b45196bdb2cbdf6eeee74501360636916678440d4b18366c437f60d23","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare Sein wird als unzureichende Erscheinungsform bestimmt, deren Wahrheit erst in der rückkehrenden Reflexion des Wesens liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS2","text":"Das Wesen wird nur dadurch Grund, daß es seine eigene Bestimmtheit negiert, setzt und als aufgehobene Bestimmung bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS3","text":"Der Grund ersetzt reine Reflexion durch reale Vermittlung, indem die Negation als wiederhergestellte Unmittelbarkeit des Seins erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung des Grundes führt von absoluter Selbstvermittlung über bestimmte Inhalte und Bedingungen zur Einheit des Unbedingten und zur Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS5","text":"Der Satz vom zureichenden Grund wird gegen mechanische Kausalität verschoben: Erklärung verlangt die Einheit einer Existenz, nicht bloß die Ursachen einzelner Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS6","text":"Die teleologische Vollendung des Grundes wird als notwendige, aber noch nicht verfügbare Form der Vermittlung dem Begriff und der Vernunft vorbehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A1","text":"Sein in unmittelbarer Form ist wesentlich gesetztes Sein und nicht seine eigene Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A2","text":"Das Wesen ist reine Negativität als Rückkehr des Seins in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A3","text":"Grundsein verlangt, daß das Wesen seine Bestimmtheit selbst setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A4","text":"Die wesentlichen Reflexionsbestimmungen bestehen als Positives und Negatives, die sich gegenseitig aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A5","text":"Die aufgehobene Bestimmung ist die wahre Bestimmung des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A6","text":"Das Gesetztsein des Wesens ist nur als aufgehobenes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A7","text":"Das Bestimmen des Wesens besteht im Aufheben seines Bestimmtseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A8","text":"Reine Vermittlung ist beziehungsförmig, aber ohne selbständige Bezogene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A9","text":"Reale Vermittlung enthält die aufgehobene Reflexion und stellt dadurch Unmittelbarkeit als vermitteltes Sein her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A10","text":"Grund und Bedingung setzen sich wechselseitig voraus; ihre Einheit ist das Unbedingte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A11","text":"Mechanische Ursachen erklären Teilbestimmungen, nicht die wesentliche Einheit einer Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A12","text":"Die zureichende Erklärung einer Einheit verlangt Zweckbeziehung und gehört daher dem Begriff an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX1","text":"Der Grund ist nicht eine unmittelbar gegebene Grundlage vor seiner Selbstsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX2","text":"Die wahre Bestimmung ist nicht eine bleibende positive Qualität, sondern die untergegangene Reflexionsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX3","text":"Das Positive und das Negative sind nicht selbständige Substanzen oder feste Gegenglieder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX4","text":"Reine Vermittlung ist keine Beziehung zwischen bereits selbständigen Entitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX5","text":"Die zureichende Erklärung ist nicht die Addition mechanischer Einzelursachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX6","text":"Die Bedingung ist kein einseitig vorausliegender äußerer Grund der Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX7","text":"Der teleologische Grund ist nicht innerhalb der gegenwärtigen Wesenslogik vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D1","text":"Die Rückkehr vom Unmittelbaren in seinen Grund ist keine Flucht aus dem Sein, sondern die Freilegung seines Gesetztseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A1","CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D2","text":"Das Wesen gewinnt Selbstidentität nicht vor der Negation, sondern als Identität mit der aufgehobenen Negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D3","text":"Der Grund produziert die Unmittelbarkeit, die er vorauszusetzen scheint, als Resultat seiner aufgehobenen Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A6","CH_GB18_A_34:A8","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D4","text":"Eine bestimmte Grundlage ist nur gültig, sofern sie sich aus der Selbstaufhebung ihrer eigenen Bestimmung in die Identität des Wesens zurückübersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A3","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D5","text":"Der Satz vom zureichenden Grund fordert eine Erklärung der Einheit von Bestimmungen und nicht nur ihrer isolierten Verursachung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A11","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D6","text":"Die Existenz ist die Ausführung der wechselseitigen Vermittlung von Grund und Bedingung in einer unbedingten Sache.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A9","CH_GB18_A_34:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD1","text":"Erklärung wird von der Suche nach einem äußeren ersten Grund in die Rekonstruktion eines selbstnegierenden und selbstsetzenden Vermittlungsprozesses transformiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A3","CH_GB18_A_34:A7","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD2","text":"Das wahre Unmittelbare ist nicht der Ausgangspunkt der Erklärung, sondern ihr durch Negation hervorgebrachtes Resultat.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A1","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A6","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD3","text":"Zureichend ist ein Grund nur als immanente Einheit von Teilbestimmungen, nicht als quantitativ vollständiger Katalog von Ursachen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A11","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD4","text":"Die Entwicklung vom Grund zur Existenz enthält eine Grenzmarkierung: Die Logik des Wesens kann Einheit fordern, aber deren Zweckform erst im Begriff explizieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A9","CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unvermitteltes Sein, das als letztgültige ontologische Grundlage bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell der Erklärung, in dem ein Grund seiner Bestimmung vorausliegt und unabhängig von ihr fertig vorhanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine stabile Opposition von Positivem und Negativem, aus der Vermittlung erst nachträglich entstehen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine lineare Kausalordnung, deren lokale Ursachen die Ganzheit einer Existenz erschöpfend begründen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die unmittelbare Verfügbarkeit des Zwecks innerhalb der Kategorien des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Wahrheit, die ohne den Durchgang durch Gesetztsein, Negation und Aufhebung unmittelbar gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist ein absoluter Grund als ruhende positive Substanz; Absolutheit erscheint nur als selbstaufhebende Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX3","text":"Nicht zulässig ist eine endgültige Erklärung der Einheit durch Kausalität allein; die fehlende Zweckdimension bleibt als konstitutive Abwesenheit wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Sein → Bestimmung als Gesetztes → Rückgang in die Reflexion des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS2","text":"Reine Negativität → Selbstsetzung der Bestimmung → Aufhebung des Gesetztseins → Identität des Wesens mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS3","text":"Aufgehobene Reflexion → reale Vermittlung → wiederhergestelltes Sein als vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS4","text":"Absoluter Grund → Form und Materie → bestimmter Inhalt → bedingende Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS5","text":"Wechselseitige Voraussetzung von Grund und Bedingung → Einheit des Unbedingten → Sache an sich → Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS6","text":"Mechanische Teilursachen → unzureichende Erklärung der Einheit → Zweck als erforderliche Vermittlungsform → Übergang zum Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF1","text":"Unmittelbares Sein als Unwahres → Sein als Gesetztes → Rückkehr in den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF2","text":"Wesen als Negativität → Selbstsetzung → Aufhebung der Bestimmtheit → Grund als reale Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF3","text":"Reale Vermittlung → vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → Grund und Bedingung → Unbedingtes → Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF4","text":"Satz vom Grund → Kritik mechanischer Kausalität → Einheit des Ganzen → Zweckbeziehung → Vorverweisung auf Begriff und Vernunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME1","text":"Der Grund wird von einer statischen Basis zu einer Operation der Selbstnegation und Selbstsetzung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME2","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird von einem ersten Gegebenen zu einem Ergebnis aufgehobener Reflexion umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME3","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Ursache und Grund trennt lokale Hervorbringung von der Erklärung wesentlicher Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME4","text":"Die Bedingung erscheint nicht als äußerlicher Kontext des Grundes, sondern als dessen reziproke Vermittlungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME5","text":"Teleologie wird weder verworfen noch im Wesen vollzogen, sondern als nächsthöhere Erklärungsebene kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt den Satz vom zureichenden Grund als Forderung, alles Seiende als Gesetztes auf seinen Grund zurückzuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT2","text":"Structural — Grund ist die Struktur, in der das Wesen durch Aufhebung seiner gesetzten Bestimmtheit reale Vermittlung mit sich selbst erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Mechanische Erklärung wird als kategorial begrenzt ausgewiesen, weil sie die Einheit des Erklärten nicht aus ihren Teilursachen gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein besitzt keine ursprüngliche Selbstgenügsamkeit; es wird als Resultat einer Rückkehrbewegung des Wesens in seine eigene Negativität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Existenz folgt nicht aus einem isolierten Anfang, sondern aus der Einheit einer reziproken Vermittlung von Grund und Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundbewegung von unmittelbarem Sein über Negation und Selbstsetzung zu realer Vermittlung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT2","text":"Die Ableitung der besonderen Übergänge von absolutem Grund zu Form, Materie und Inhalt bleibt gegenüber der allgemeinen Negativitätslogik unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT3","text":"Die Architektur ist intern kohärent, sofern aufgehobenes Gesetztsein zugleich als Negation der Bestimmtheit und als Träger erneuerter Unmittelbarkeit fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umkehrung, daß die Erklärung nicht hinter die Vermittlung zu einem bloßen Sein zurückführt, sondern die vermittelte Hervorbringung von Sein ausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, daß der Grund als absoluter Anfang eingeführt wird, aber nur als Resultat seiner eigenen Selbstaufhebung bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT6","text":"Eine vollständige Rekonstruktion muß den Übergang zur teleologischen Einheit als ausgesetzte Fortsetzung behandeln, weil ihre begriffliche Vermittlung ausdrücklich außerhalb der erreichten Ebene liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112320121699Z_256618fb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"3643c57b45196bdb2cbdf6eeee74501360636916678440d4b18366c437f60d23","sha256":"34b09932d025c466cae5a57a648822c28074b9ed3cbc25c1892a8b069eafe860","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:23:20.123444+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS1","text":"Immediate being is determined as an inadequate form of appearance, whose truth lies only in the returning reflection of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS2","text":"Essence becomes ground only by negating its own determinacy, positing it, and preserving it as a sublated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS3","text":"Ground replaces pure reflection with real mediation, insofar as negation appears as restored immediacy of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS4","text":"The movement of ground leads from absolute self-mediation through determinate contents and conditions to the unity of the unconditioned and to existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS5","text":"The principle of sufficient ground is shifted against mechanical causality: explanation requires the unity of an existence, not merely the causes of individual determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AS6","text":"The teleological completion of ground is reserved for the Concept and Reason as a necessary, but not yet available, form of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A1","text":"Being in immediate form is essentially posited being and not its own truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A2","text":"Essence is pure negativity as the return of being into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A3","text":"Being-ground requires that essence itself posit its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A4","text":"The essential determinations of reflection subsist as positive and negative, which mutually sublate one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A5","text":"The sublated determination is the true determination of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A6","text":"The positedness of essence exists only as sublated positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A7","text":"The determining of essence consists in sublating its determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A8","text":"Pure mediation is relational in form, but without independent relata.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A9","text":"Real mediation contains sublated reflection and thereby restores immediacy as mediated being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A10","text":"Ground and condition mutually presuppose one another; their unity is the unconditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A11","text":"Mechanical causes explain partial determinations, not the essential unity of an existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:A12","text":"The sufficient explanation of a unity requires purposive relation and therefore belongs to the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX1","text":"Ground is not an immediately given foundation prior to its self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX2","text":"The true determination is not an enduring positive quality, but the vanished determination of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX3","text":"The positive and the negative are not independent substances or fixed opposing members.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX4","text":"Pure mediation is not a relation between already independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX5","text":"The sufficient explanation is not the addition of individual mechanical causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX6","text":"The condition is not a one-sided, externally antecedent ground of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:NX7","text":"The teleological ground is not consummated within the present logic of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D1","text":"The return from the immediate into its ground is not a flight from being, but the disclosure of its positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A1","CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D2","text":"Essence gains self-identity not prior to negation, but as identity with sublated negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D3","text":"Ground produces the immediacy that it appears to presuppose as the result of its sublated reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A6","CH_GB18_A_34:A8","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D4","text":"A determinate foundation is valid only insofar as it translates itself back, through the self-sublation of its own determination, into the identity of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A3","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D5","text":"The principle of sufficient ground demands an explanation of the unity of determinations and not merely of their isolated causation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A11","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:D6","text":"Existence is the realization of the reciprocal mediation of ground and condition in an unconditioned thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A9","CH_GB18_A_34:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD1","text":"Explanation is transformed from the search for an external first ground into the reconstruction of a self-negating and self-positing process of mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A2","CH_GB18_A_34:A3","CH_GB18_A_34:A7","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD2","text":"The true immediate is not the starting point of explanation, but its result produced through negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A1","CH_GB18_A_34:A5","CH_GB18_A_34:A6","CH_GB18_A_34:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD3","text":"A ground is sufficient only as the immanent unity of partial determinations, not as a quantitatively complete catalogue of causes.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A11","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SD4","text":"The development from ground to existence contains a demarcation: the logic of essence can demand unity, but can explicate its purposive form only in the Concept.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_34:A9","CH_GB18_A_34:A10","CH_GB18_A_34:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an unmediated being that could subsist as an ultimately valid ontological foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of explanation in which a ground precedes its determination and exists fully formed independently of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a stable opposition of positive and negative from which mediation would arise only subsequently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a linear causal order whose local causes could exhaustively ground the totality of an existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the immediate availability of purpose within the categories of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a truth that would be immediately given without passing through positedness, negation, and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an absolute ground as a resting positive substance; absoluteness appears only as self-sublating self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:SNX3","text":"Not permissible is a final explanation of unity through causality alone; the missing dimension of purpose remains operative as a constitutive absence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS1","text":"Immediate being → determination as posited → regression into the reflection of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS2","text":"Pure negativity → self-positing of determination → sublation of positedness → identity of essence with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS3","text":"Sublated reflection → real mediation → restored being as mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS4","text":"Absolute ground → form and matter → determinate content → conditioning mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS5","text":"Reciprocal presupposition of ground and condition → unity of the unconditioned → thing-in-itself → existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:FGS6","text":"Mechanical partial causes → inadequate explanation of unity → purpose as required form of mediation → transition to the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF1","text":"Immediate being as untrue → being as posited → return into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF2","text":"Essence as negativity → self-positing → sublation of determinateness → ground as real mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF3","text":"Real mediation → mediated immediacy → ground and condition → unconditioned → existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:AF4","text":"Principle of ground → critique of mechanical causality → unity of the whole → purposive relation → advance reference to Concept and Reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME1","text":"Ground is reclassified from a static basis into an operation of self-negation and self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME2","text":"Immediacy is reordered from a first given into a result of sublated reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME3","text":"The distinction between cause and ground separates local production from the explanation of essential unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME4","text":"The condition appears not as an external context of ground, but as its reciprocal form of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ME5","text":"Teleology is neither rejected nor consummated in essence, but mapped as the next higher level of explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the principle of sufficient ground as the demand to lead every being, as posited, back to its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ground is the structure in which essence, through the sublation of its posited determinateness, generates real mediation with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Mechanical explanation is shown to be categorically limited because it does not derive the unity of what is explained from its partial causes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being possesses no original self-sufficiency; it is determined as the result of a movement of return by essence into its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Existence follows not from an isolated beginning, but from the unity of a reciprocal mediation of ground and condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from immediate being, through negation and self-positing, to real mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT2","text":"The derivation of the particular transitions from absolute ground to form, matter, and content remains underdetermined in relation to the general logic of negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT3","text":"The architecture is internally coherent insofar as sublated positedness functions simultaneously as negation of determinateness and as bearer of renewed immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the reversal that explanation does not lead back behind mediation to a mere being, but demonstrates the mediated production of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that ground is introduced as an absolute beginning, yet can be determined only as the result of its own self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_34:MRT6","text":"A complete reconstruction must treat the transition to teleological unity as a suspended continuation, because its conceptual mediation explicitly lies outside the level attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_34:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_34@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_34:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 122","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 122","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0","layer":"CH","title":"a. Form and Essence.","order":123,"parents":["RAW_GB18_FUW0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_FUW0@R001","sha256":"d1b368eff0c07bc27b8dd2793fd49f758010c1a0dfef9072344a74619299d3ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, das Verhältnis von Grund, Begründetem, Wesen und Form zu bestimmen, ohne deren Unterschied als äußere Trennung zu fixieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS2","text":"Der Grund entsteht als Selbstaufhebung des gesetzten Unmittelbaren und ist daher nicht ein vorausliegendes Unbestimmtes, sondern negativ mit sich identisches Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS3","text":"Die Grundbeziehung erzeugt die Differenz von Grund und Begründetem, deren Identität zugleich über beide als einfache Wesenheit hinausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS4","text":"Die Vermittlung des Grundes verwandelt reflektive Bestimmungen in bestehende, aber nur gesetzte Bestimmungen; dieses Verhältnis konstituiert Form gegenüber Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Form und Wesen wird als notwendige, aber selbstaufhebende Unterscheidung rekonstruiert: Form ist die eigene Negativität und Reflexion des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung des Wesens als formlose Identität oder Materie, insofern die Form ihre Identität als ein Anderes voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","text":"Jedes unmittelbare Dasein innerhalb der Grundbeziehung hat nur die Bedeutung eines Gesetzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","text":"Das Gesetzte setzt wesentlich einen Grund voraus, während das Setzen des Grundes die Selbstaufhebung des Gesetzten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A3","text":"Der Grund ist aufgehobene Bestimmtheit und daher durch sich selbst bestimmtes, negativ mit sich identisches Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A4","text":"Grund und Begründetes sind entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen von Nichtgesetztsein und Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A5","text":"Die Identität des Grundes und die negative Identität des Begründeten sind dieselbe einfache Identität des Wesens überhaupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","text":"Die Vermittlung des Grundes vereinigt reine und bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","text":"Die Bestimmungen der Grundvermittlung bestehen nur, weil ihr Bestehen selbst ein Gesetztes ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","text":"Das Gesetzte als von seiner einfachen Identität unterschieden bildet Form gegenüber Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A9","text":"Form umfasst alle bestimmten Reflexionsbestimmungen, insofern sie als gesetzte Bestimmungen von ihrem Substrat unterschieden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","text":"Wesen und Form sind keine getrennten Entitäten, sondern Momente einer absoluten Wechselbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","text":"Form ist absolute, sich auf sich beziehende Negativität und damit die dem Wesen immanente Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A12","text":"Die Form bestimmt das Wesen nur, indem sie ihr eigenes Unterscheiden aufhebt und sich als Grund ihres Bestehens erweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A13","text":"Das Wesen erscheint für die voraussetzende Form als unbestimmte, formlose Identität und wird in dieser Bestimmung Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX1","text":"Der Grund ist nicht ein unmittelbar vorgegebenes Erstes, das der Reflexion äußerlich vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX2","text":"Das Unmittelbare ist nicht an und für sich, sondern nur als gesetztes Begründetes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX3","text":"Der Grund ist nicht unbestimmte Abwesenheit aller Bestimmtheit, sondern aufgehobene und selbstbestimmte Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX4","text":"Die Vermittlung des Grundes ist weder reine Reflexion ohne selbständige Bestimmungen noch bestimmende Reflexion mit endgültig selbständigen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX5","text":"Form ist nicht ein dem Wesen äußerlich hinzugefügtes Bestimmungsprinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX6","text":"Wesen ist nicht ein starres Substrat, das seiner Reflexion zeitlich oder ontologisch vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX7","text":"Die Selbständigkeit der Reflexionsbestimmungen ist nicht deren Bestand gegen den Grund, sondern ihre Auflösung in ihn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D1","text":"Das Begründete besitzt nur eine abgeleitete Unmittelbarkeit, weil seine Identität die Reflexion des Gesetzten in sich ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D2","text":"Die einfache Identität von Grund und Begründetem ist nicht selbst der Grund, weil der Grund nur im Gegensatz zum Gesetztsein Grund ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A4","CH_GB18_FUW0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D3","text":"Das Bestehen der Formbestimmungen ist zugleich abhängig und wirksam, weil es als Gesetztes ihre eigene Reflexion in sich trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D4","text":"Das Wesen gewinnt erst als Grund die Bestimmung eines Substrats, weil erst dann ein Bezogenes und ein bestehendes Gesetztes hervortreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D5","text":"Die Formbestimmungen können ihr Bestehen nicht aus isolierter Selbständigkeit beziehen, sondern nur aus ihrer Aufhebung in die wesentliche Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D6","text":"Die Bestimmung des Wesens durch Form ist eine immanente Selbstbestimmung des Wesens und keine Kausalwirkung eines äußeren Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D7","text":"Materie bezeichnet nicht ein selbständiges Ding außerhalb der Form, sondern das Wesen unter der Perspektive der von Form vorausgesetzten formlosen Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12","CH_GB18_FUW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt das Modell einer fundierenden Substanz durch eine Selbstfundierung: Grund ist nur, indem das Gesetzte sich aufhebt und darin seine tragende Identität erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A3","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD2","text":"Form wird zugleich zur Bedingung der Bestimmtheit und zum Modus ihrer Entkräftung, weil jede Formbestimmung nur als aufgehobenes Gesetztsein Bestand hat.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD3","text":"Das Wesen ist weder jenseits seiner Erscheinung noch mit einer einzelnen Formbestimmung identisch, sondern die Einheit, in der jede Bestimmung als gesetzte und aufgehobene besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A5","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD4","text":"Der Begriff der Materie entsteht als Grenzbestimmung der Formrelation: Er bezeichnet die Identität, die Form voraussetzen muss, aber nicht als äußerlich gegebenen Stoff behaupten kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein erster Grund, der unabhängig von der Bewegung des Begründeten bereits vollständig bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Bestimmtheit, die ohne Gesetztsein und ohne Verhältnis zu ihrer Aufhebung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wesen, das außerhalb der Negativität seiner Formen unvermittelt zugänglich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Form, die Bestimmungen hervorbringt, ohne selbst in deren Aufhebung und Grund zurückzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Materie als positiv vorhandenes, der Form äußerlich vorausgesetztes Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absoluter Anfang, der weder gesetzt noch durch die Rückkehr aus dem Gesetztsein vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist die endgültige Stabilisierung eines Gegensatzes von Wesen und Erscheinung, Grund und Folge oder Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine positive Bestimmung des Wesens, die seine Negativität nicht bereits als ihre innere Bedingung enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS1","text":"Gesetztsein des Unmittelbaren → Voraussetzen eines Grundes → Selbstaufhebung des Setzens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS2","text":"Aufgehobene Bestimmtheit → negativ identisches Wesen → Grund als Nichtgesetztes gegenüber dem Gesetzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS3","text":"Differenz von Grund und Begründetem → Identität beider Reflexionen → Wesen überhaupt als einfache Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS4","text":"Einheit von reiner und bestimmender Reflexion → bestehende, aber gesetzte Bestimmungen → Form-Wesen-Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS5","text":"Form als vollständige Negativität → Aufhebung ihrer Selbständigkeit → Form als immanente Reflexion des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS6","text":"Voraussetzen der Identität durch die Form → Wesen als formlose Identität → Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF1","text":"Scheinbare Unmittelbarkeit → Bestimmung als Gesetztsein → Erfordernis des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF2","text":"Grund als Nichtgesetztes → Gegenüberstellung von Grund und Begründetem → gemeinsame negative Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF3","text":"Gemeinsame Identität → Vermittlung gesetzter Bestimmungen → Herausbildung von Form gegen Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF4","text":"Äußere Form-Wesen-Trennung → immanente absolute Negativität der Form → Aufhebung der Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF5","text":"Rückkehr der Form in ihre Identität → Wesen als vorausgesetztes Unbestimmtes → Materie als Grenzbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME1","text":"Grund und Begründetes werden nicht als asymmetrische Ursache und Wirkung kartiert, sondern als wechselseitig bestimmte Momente einer Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME2","text":"Form erscheint nicht als sekundäre Gestalt eines bereits fertigen Wesens, sondern als die operative Negativität, durch die Wesen überhaupt Wesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME3","text":"Substrat wird von einem vorausliegenden Träger zu einer erst im Grundverhältnis hervortretenden Bestimmung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME4","text":"Materie wird von einem positiv äußeren Stoff zu der formfreien Identität umklassifiziert, die nur innerhalb der Selbstvoraussetzung der Form erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME5","text":"Selbständigkeit wird als Auflösungsform bestimmt: Was als selbständig erscheint, besteht nur durch seine Rückkehr in den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das Verhältnis von Grund, Begründetem, Wesen, Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Gesetztheit, Aufhebung, Reflexion und Bestehen bilden einen Mechanismus, in dem Bestimmungen nur durch ihre Abhängigkeit vom Grund bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument entzieht sowohl dem äußerlichen Fundationalismus als auch der äußerlichen Formtheorie ihre Geltung, indem es beide als unzureichende Fixierungen der Reflexion ausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Kein Moment besitzt einen zeitlich oder ontologisch unabhängigen Vorrang; Anfang, Grundlage und Bestimmtheit werden nur rückläufig durch ihre Selbstaufhebung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom gesetzten Unmittelbaren über Grund und Vermittlung zur Form-Wesen-Relation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Bestimmung der Materie einen bloßen perspektivischen Moment der Formrelation oder den Übergang zu einer weiteren eigenständigen Begriffsbestimmung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Grund, Form und Wesen als nichtselbständige Momente einer reflexiven Einheit gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umkehrung äußerer Abhängigkeit: Das Gesetzte setzt seinen Grund nur durch die Aufhebung seines eigenen Anspruchs auf Unmittelbarkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung verbleibt zwischen der notwendigen Unterscheidung von Form und Wesen und ihrer gleichzeitigen Aufhebung als bloß äußerlicher Unterschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass Wesen als unthätige Grundlage und Form als tätige Negativität erscheinen, obwohl beide als dieselbe immanente Reflexion gelten sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn Materie nicht als Rückfall in ein äußeres Substrat, sondern als durch die Form selbst erzeugte Grenzbestimmung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115948433982Z_e34f9600","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Form and Essence.","source_sha256":"d1b368eff0c07bc27b8dd2793fd49f758010c1a0dfef9072344a74619299d3ff","sha256":"a1151f22b967b7d5f067165fab6bea053ee4f674c0a1a5bae2b6c2f59bd84f1a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:59:48.436543+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the relation of ground, grounded, essence, and form without fixing their difference as an external separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS2","text":"The ground arises as the self-sublation of the posited immediate and is therefore not a preceding indeterminate, but essence negatively identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS3","text":"The ground relation generates the difference of ground and grounded, whose identity at the same time points beyond both toward simple essentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS4","text":"The mediation of ground transforms reflective determinations into subsisting, yet merely posited, determinations; this relation constitutes form as against essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS5","text":"The distinction of form and essence is reconstructed as a necessary but self-sublating distinction: form is the essence's own negativity and reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the determination of essence as formless identity or matter, insofar as form presupposes its identity as an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","text":"Every immediate existence within the ground relation has only the significance of something posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","text":"What is posited essentially presupposes a ground, whereas the positing of the ground is the self-sublation of what is posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A3","text":"The ground is sublated determinacy and is therefore essence determined through itself, negatively identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A4","text":"Ground and grounded are opposed determinations of non-positedness and positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A5","text":"The identity of the ground and the negative identity of the grounded are the same simple identity of essence as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","text":"The mediation of ground unites pure and determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","text":"The determinations of ground-mediation subsist only because their subsistence itself is something posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","text":"What is posited, as distinguished from its simple identity, constitutes form as against essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A9","text":"Form encompasses all determinate reflective determinations insofar as they are distinguished from their substrate as posited determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","text":"Essence and form are not separate entities, but moments of an absolute interrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","text":"Form is absolute, self-relating negativity and thus the reflection immanent to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A12","text":"Form determines essence only by sublating its own distinguishing and proving itself to be the ground of its subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:A13","text":"For presupposing form, essence appears as indeterminate, formless identity and in this determination becomes matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX1","text":"The ground is not an immediately given first that externally precedes reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX2","text":"The immediate is not in and for itself, but is determined only as posited grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX3","text":"The ground is not the indeterminate absence of all determinacy, but sublated and self-determined determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX4","text":"The mediation of ground is neither pure reflection without independent determinations nor determining reflection with finally independent determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX5","text":"Form is not a principle of determination externally added to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX6","text":"Essence is not a rigid substrate that temporally or ontologically precedes its reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:NX7","text":"The independence of the reflective determinations is not their persistence against the ground, but their dissolution into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D1","text":"The grounded possesses only a derived immediacy, because its identity is the reflection of what is posited into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D2","text":"The simple identity of ground and grounded is not itself the ground, because the ground is ground only in opposition to positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A4","CH_GB18_FUW0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D3","text":"The subsistence of the form-determinations is at once dependent and efficacious, because as something posited it bears their own reflection into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D4","text":"Essence first acquires the determination of a substrate as ground, because only then do a related term and a subsisting posited emerge.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A6","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D5","text":"The form-determinations cannot derive their subsistence from isolated independence, but only from their sublation into essential identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D6","text":"The determination of essence by form is an immanent self-determination of essence and not a causal effect of an external other.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:D7","text":"Matter designates not an independent thing outside form, but essence under the perspective of the formless identity presupposed by form.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12","CH_GB18_FUW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD1","text":"The system replaces the model of a grounding substance with a self-grounding: ground is only insofar as what is posited sublates itself and therein generates its sustaining identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A1","CH_GB18_FUW0:A2","CH_GB18_FUW0:A3","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD2","text":"Form becomes at once the condition of determinacy and the mode of its enervation, because every form-determination subsists only as sublated positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A7","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD3","text":"Essence is neither beyond its appearance nor identical with a single form-determination, but is the unity in which every determination subsists as posited and sublated.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A5","CH_GB18_FUW0:A8","CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SD4","text":"The concept of matter arises as the limit-determination of the form relation: it designates the identity that form must presuppose, but cannot assert as externally given material.","refs":["CH_GB18_FUW0:A10","CH_GB18_FUW0:A11","CH_GB18_FUW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a first ground that would already be completely determined independently of the movement of the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a determinacy that could subsist without positedness and without relation to its sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an essence that would be immediately accessible outside the negativity of its forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a form that produces determinations without itself returning into their sublation and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is matter as a positively existing substrate externally presupposed by form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolute beginning that would be neither posited nor mediated by return from positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is the final stabilization of an opposition between essence and appearance, ground and consequence, or form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a positive determination of essence that did not already contain its negativity as its inner condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS1","text":"Positedness of the immediate → presupposition of a ground → self-sublation of positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS2","text":"Sublated determinacy → negatively identical essence → ground as non-posited over against the posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS3","text":"Difference of ground and grounded → identity of both reflections → essence as such as simple foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS4","text":"Unity of pure and determining reflection → subsisting, yet posited, determinations → form-essence difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS5","text":"Form as complete negativity → sublation of its independence → form as immanent reflection of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:FGS6","text":"Presupposition of identity by form → essence as formless identity → matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF1","text":"Apparent immediacy → determination as positedness → requirement of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF2","text":"Ground as non-posited → juxtaposition of ground and grounded → common negative identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF3","text":"Common identity → mediation of posited determinations → emergence of form over against essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF4","text":"External form-essence separation → immanent absolute negativity of form → sublation of the separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:AF5","text":"Return of form into its identity → essence as presupposed indeterminate → matter as limit-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME1","text":"Ground and grounded are not mapped as asymmetric cause and effect, but as reciprocally determined moments of an identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME2","text":"Form appears not as a secondary shape of an already finished essence, but as the operative negativity through which essence is essence at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME3","text":"Substrate is reordered from a preceding bearer into a determination that first emerges in the ground relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME4","text":"Matter is reclassified from a positively external material into the form-free identity that appears only within the self-presupposition of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ME5","text":"Independence is determined as a form of dissolution: what appears independent subsists only through its return into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the relation of ground, grounded, essence, form, and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Positedness, sublation, reflection, and subsistence form a mechanism in which determinations subsist only through their dependence on ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument deprives both external foundationalism and external form theory of their validity by demonstrating both to be inadequate fixations of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — No moment possesses temporally or ontologically independent priority; beginning, foundation, and determinacy are determined only retroactively through their self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the posited immediate through ground and mediation to the form-essence relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the determination of matter constitutes a merely perspectival moment of the form relation or the transition to a further independent conceptual determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as ground, form, and essence are read as non-independent moments of a reflective unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the reversal of external dependence: what is posited presupposes its ground only through the sublation of its own claim to immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between the necessary distinction of form and essence and their simultaneous sublation as a merely external difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT6","text":"A further fault line lies in the fact that essence appears as an inactive foundation and form as active negativity, although both are supposed to count as the same immanent reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_FUW0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if matter is read not as a relapse into an external substrate, but as a limit-determination generated by form itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_FUW0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_FUW0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_FUW0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 123","title":"a. Form and Essence.","context":"Chapter 123","original_title":"a. Form und Wesen."},"original_title":"a. Form und Wesen.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM","layer":"CH","title":"b. Form and Matter.","order":124,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BFUM"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BFUM@R001","sha256":"d81c01bc866f39ed72dba8344a06916ba739e1a82383cb55671336715559aa34","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, Form und Materie zugleich als entgegengesetzte Bestimmungen und als nicht äußerlich voneinander trennbare Einheit zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS2","text":"Materie erscheint als abstrakt-unbestimmte Grundlage der Form, ist aber nur durch die in ihr aufgehobene Formnegativität Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS3","text":"Form erscheint als tätige Bestimmung der Materie, bestimmt jedoch im Vollzug nur ihre eigene entäußerte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS4","text":"Die wechselseitige Voraussetzung von Form und Materie erzeugt keine zwei selbständigen Gründe, sondern die Selbstvermittlung eines absoluten Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS5","text":"Das Bestimmen der Materie durch die Form und die Selbstbewegung der Materie sind zwei Erscheinungsweisen einer einzigen negativen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung hebt die isolierte Selbständigkeit von Form und Materie auf und stellt ihre Einheit als gesetzte Einheit wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS7","text":"Die gesetzte, gegen Form und Materie gleichgültige Einheit ihrer aufgehobenen Bestimmungen ist der Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A1","text":"Materie ist die einfache unterschiedslose Identität des Wesens unter der Bestimmung, das Andere der Form zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A2","text":"Materie ist nur durch Abstraktion von aller Form bestimmbar und kann deshalb nicht als sinnlich gegebene Materie erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","text":"Die Abstraktion der Materie ist keine äußerliche Entfernung von Form, sondern die Selbstreduktion der Form auf einfache Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","text":"Form setzt Materie voraus, weil sie sich nur als aufgehobene Bestimmung auf ihre Identität als ein Anderes beziehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","text":"Materie setzt Form voraus, weil sie nur als aufgehobene Negation und damit durch in ihr enthaltene Form bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","text":"Form und Materie sind nicht Grund voneinander, sondern je grundlos gegenüber der anderen Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit der Materie und die unterscheidende Tätigkeit der Form sind Momente einer gemeinsamen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","text":"Form ist negative Selbstbeziehung, Widerspruch, Selbstauflösung und bestimmende Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","text":"Materie ist zugleich unbestimmte Selbstidentität und absolute Negativität und daher in sich widersprechend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","text":"Das Bestimmen von Form und Materie ist eine einzige Vermittlungsbewegung, in der jede sich durch ihr eigenes Nichtsein mit sich vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","text":"Die Wahrheit der endlichen Form und der endlichen Materie liegt nicht in ihrer Einzelheit, sondern ausschließlich in ihrer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A12","text":"Die wiederhergestellte Einheit von Form und Materie ist negative, bestimmte und voraussetzende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A13","text":"Die bestimmte Grundlage, in der Form und Materie als unwesentliche Gleichgültige aufgehoben sind, ist Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX1","text":"Materie ist nicht die empirisch sicht-, fühl- oder berührbare Bestimmtheit; jede sinnlich gegebene Materie ist bereits Einheit von Materie und Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX2","text":"Die Materie ist nicht ein aus sich selbst bestehendes, ewiges Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX3","text":"Die Form ist nicht ein aus sich selbst bestehendes, ewiges Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX4","text":"Form und Materie stehen einander nicht äußerlich, zufällig oder unabhängig gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX5","text":"Materie ist nicht der Grund der Form als Materie, und Form ist nicht der Grund der Materie als Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX6","text":"Form ist nicht bloß ein äußerlich auf Materie einwirkendes Tätiges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX7","text":"Materie ist nicht bloß passives, formloses Substrat ohne eigene Negativität und Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX8","text":"Endliche Form und endliche Materie besitzen keine Wahrheit als isolierte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D1","text":"Die materielle Gleichgültigkeit ist keine formlose Leere, sondern eine verschlossene Gegenwart der Form in ihrer aufgehobenen Gestalt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A1","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D2","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Form auf die Materie hebt nur den Schein auf, dass beide äußerlich gleichgültig und voneinander getrennt seien.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D3","text":"Die Form materialisiert sich, indem sie ihre abstrakte Selbständigkeit aufhebt und in der Materie ihr Bestehen gewinnt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D4","text":"Die Materie formiert sich selbst, indem ihre absolute Negativität ihre unbestimmte Identität auflöst und ihre Bestimmung erreicht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D5","text":"Das äußere Bestimmtwerden der Materie ist die Erscheinungsform ihres immanenten Sollens zur Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D6","text":"Die ursprüngliche Einheit von Form und Materie ist nicht unmittelbare Identität, sondern wird erst durch ihre Selbstentzweiung und Rückkehr als Einheit gesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D7","text":"Formierte Materie und bestehende Form bezeichnen dieselbe Resultatbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Form und Materie ist keine Kausalrelation zweier Entitäten, sondern die Selbstexplikation einer Einheit, die sich nur durch Negation zu sich verhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD2","text":"Aktivität und Passivität sind keine letzten ontologischen Rollen, sondern asymmetrische Erscheinungsweisen derselben Selbstvermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD3","text":"Der absolute Grund ist nur als Bewegung bestimmbar, weil er sich als Form und Materie entzweit, beide Voraussetzungen erzeugt und ihre Selbständigkeit wieder aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD4","text":"Inhalt ist weder ein drittes neben Form und Materie noch eine bloße Zusammensetzung beider, sondern ihre negative Grundlage nach Aufhebung ihrer isolierten Geltung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12","CH_GB18_BFUM:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD5","text":"Jede endliche Bestimmung ist nur wahr, sofern sie ihre Abhängigkeit von einer Einheit anerkennt, die zugleich ihre Voraussetzung und ihr Resultat ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein dualistisches Modell, in dem Form und Materie unabhängig konstituierte Substanzen sind, die nachträglich in Beziehung treten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein empiristisches Modell, in dem Materie als unmittelbar gegebener Stoff vor aller begrifflichen oder formalen Vermittlung vorhanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein einseitiger Formalismus, in dem Form eine fremde Materie bestimmt, ohne selbst materielles Bestehen vorauszusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein einseitiger Materialismus, in dem Materie ein positives, formunabhängiges Substrat und alleiniger Grund ihrer Bestimmungen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Grundmodell, in dem Grund und Begründetes als feste, nicht reversible Positionen verteilt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine unmittelbare Einheit, die ohne Selbstentzweiung, Negation und gesetzte Wiederherstellung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absolut erster Anfang in Gestalt reiner Materie oder reiner Form, weil jede dieser Bestimmungen bereits ihr Anderes voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine letzte Selbständigkeit endlicher Bestimmungen, weil ihre behauptete Eigenständigkeit nur die abstrahierte Gestalt ihrer Aufhebung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist ein positiv ruhender Grund, der ohne negative Selbstbeziehung und ohne Selbstentäußerung Grund sein könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Inhalt, der vor der Vermittlung als fertige Substanz vorläge; Inhalt entsteht nur als gesetzte Gleichgültigkeit der aufgehobenen Form-Materie-Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS1","text":"Wesen → Selbstbestimmung der Reflexion → Materie als formlose Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS2","text":"Form als Negativität → Selbstaufhebung der Form → Voraussetzung der Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS3","text":"Materie als aufgehobene Negation → immanente Formhaltigkeit → Voraussetzung der Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS4","text":"Gegenseitige Voraussetzung → Schein äußerer Differenz → Enthüllung einer ursprünglichen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS5","text":"Formtätigkeit und Materiebewegung → wechselseitige Negation der Selbständigkeit → eine Vermittlung durch eigenes Nichtsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS6","text":"Aufhebung der isolierten Form und Materie → Wiederherstellung der Einheit → Einheit von Ansichsein und Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS7","text":"Gesetzte negative Einheit → bestimmte Grundlage gegen ihre Momente → Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF1","text":"Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit → Materie als formlos-unbestimmte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF2","text":"Materie als Grundlage der Form → Zurückweisung äußerlicher Gegenüberstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF3","text":"Wechselseitige Voraussetzung → Form und Materie als Momente eines absoluten Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF4","text":"Aktivität der Form und Passivität der Materie → Umkehr in eine gemeinsame negative Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF5","text":"Selbstaufhebung beider Selbständigkeiten → Wiederherstellung und Setzung ihrer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF6","text":"Endlichkeit von Form und Materie → Rückgang in die sie begründende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF7","text":"Negative Einheit als bestimmte Grundlage → Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME1","text":"Die Opposition Form/Materie wird von einer Entgegensetzung zweier Dinge in eine interne Differenz einer sich vermittelnden Einheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME2","text":"Die Differenz aktiv/passiv wird von einer Verteilung fester Rollen in zwei Darstellungsweisen derselben Negativität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME3","text":"Die Kategorie des Grundes wird von einem einseitigen Begründungsverhältnis in eine Selbstgründung durch negative Vermittlung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME4","text":"Materie wird von empirischem Stoff zu abstrakter Grundlage und zugleich zu immanenter Selbstnegativität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME5","text":"Form wird von äußerlicher Gestalt zu einer Bewegung bestimmt, die ihr Bestehen nur durch Entäußerung und Materialisierung gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME6","text":"Inhalt wird als Resultat der aufgehobenen Differenz sichtbar und nicht als vorausgesetztes Drittes neben Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Form bestimmt Materie, und Materie erhält durch Form Bestimmtheit und Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Form und Materie setzen sich gegenseitig voraus, weil jede nur durch die aufgehobene Bestimmung der anderen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die scheinbar äußere Einwirkung wird systematisch als Erscheinung einer immanenten Selbstvermittlung umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Ursprüngliche ist nicht zeitlich oder logisch unmittelbar, sondern eine Einheit, die sich nur als Entzweiung, Negation und gesetzte Rückkehr realisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Grund ist keine ruhende Substanz unter seinen Bestimmungen, sondern die negative Bewegung, welche Voraussetzungen setzt und in sich zurücknimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Umdeutung von Form und Materie von äußerlichen Gegensätzen zu Momenten einer negativen Einheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die absolute Einheit notwendig gerade in die Differenz von Form und Materie auseinandertritt und keine andere Bestimmungsweise annimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Voraussetzung, Aufhebung und Wiederherstellung nicht als zeitlich getrennte Ereignisse, sondern als Momente einer Bewegung gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Identifikation von Formtätigkeit und Materiebewegung als einer Vermittlung durch wechselseitige Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt darin, dass Form und Materie zunächst asymmetrisch als tätig und passiv bestimmt werden, diese Asymmetrie aber anschließend als bloßer Schein einer Einheit aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass Materie als Grundlage fungiert, ohne Grund der Form sein zu dürfen, während ihre Grundfunktion nur durch Rückgang auf eine höhere Einheit gesichert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur, wenn Inhalt nicht als zusätzliche Bestimmung eingeführt wird, sondern als Resultat der Aufhebung von Form und Materie verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113435863269Z_fb879587","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Form and Matter.","source_sha256":"d81c01bc866f39ed72dba8344a06916ba739e1a82383cb55671336715559aa34","sha256":"0029d75d195eba2e2b43a2e5d69fa5d2ed4e7ac2d195403f9645ff6fd6ff39f3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:34:35.865231+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining form and matter simultaneously as opposed determinations and as a unity not externally separable from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS2","text":"Matter appears as the abstractly indeterminate basis of form, but is matter only through the negativity of form sublated within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS3","text":"Form appears as the active determination of matter, yet in its enactment determines only its own externalized identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS4","text":"The reciprocal presupposition of form and matter produces not two independent grounds, but the self-mediation of an absolute ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS5","text":"The determination of matter by form and the self-movement of matter are two modes of appearance of a single negative movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS6","text":"The movement sublates the isolated independence of form and matter and restores their unity as posited unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AS7","text":"The posited unity of their sublated determinations, indifferent to form and matter, is content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A1","text":"Matter is the simple undifferentiated identity of essence under the determination of being the other of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A2","text":"Matter is determinable only through abstraction from all form and can therefore not appear as sensibly given matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","text":"The abstraction of matter is not an external removal of form, but the self-reduction of form to simple identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","text":"Form presupposes matter because, only as a sublated determination, can it relate to its identity as an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","text":"Matter presupposes form because it is determined only as sublated negation and thus through form contained within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","text":"Form and matter are not the ground of one another, but are each groundless vis-à-vis the other determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","text":"The indifference of matter and the differentiating activity of form are moments of a common relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","text":"Form is negative self-relation, contradiction, self-dissolution, and determining activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","text":"Matter is at once indeterminate self-identity and absolute negativity and is therefore contradictory within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","text":"The determining of form and matter is a single movement of mediation, in which each mediates itself with itself through its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","text":"The truth of finite form and finite matter lies not in their singularity, but exclusively in their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A12","text":"The restored unity of form and matter is negative, determinate, and presupposing unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:A13","text":"The determinate basis in which form and matter are sublated as inessential indifferent elements is content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX1","text":"Matter is not the empirically visible, palpable, or tangible determinacy; every sensibly given matter is already a unity of matter and form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX2","text":"Matter is not an eternal principle subsisting of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX3","text":"Form is not an eternal principle subsisting of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX4","text":"Form and matter do not stand opposed to one another externally, contingently, or independently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX5","text":"Matter is not the ground of form as matter, and form is not the ground of matter as form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX6","text":"Form is not merely an active element externally acting upon matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX7","text":"Matter is not merely a passive, formless substrate without its own negativity and self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:NX8","text":"Finite form and finite matter possess no truth as isolated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D1","text":"Material indifference is not formless emptiness, but an enclosed presence of form in its sublated shape.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A1","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D2","text":"The activity of form upon matter sublates only the semblance that both are externally indifferent and separated from one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D3","text":"Form materializes itself by sublating its abstract independence and attaining its subsistence in matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D4","text":"Matter forms itself by its absolute negativity dissolving its indeterminate identity and attaining its determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D5","text":"The external determination of matter is the mode of appearance of its immanent ought toward form.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D6","text":"The original unity of form and matter is not immediate identity, but is posited as unity only through its self-division and return.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:D7","text":"Formed matter and subsisting form designate the same resultant determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD1","text":"The relation of form and matter is not a causal relation of two entities, but the self-explication of a unity that relates to itself only through negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD2","text":"Activity and passivity are not ultimate ontological roles, but asymmetrical modes of appearance of the same self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A7","CH_GB18_BFUM:A8","CH_GB18_BFUM:A9","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD3","text":"The absolute ground is determinable only as movement, because it divides itself into form and matter, produces both presuppositions, and again sublates their independence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A3","CH_GB18_BFUM:A4","CH_GB18_BFUM:A5","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD4","text":"Content is neither a third alongside form and matter nor a mere composition of both, but their negative basis after the sublation of their isolated validity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12","CH_GB18_BFUM:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SD5","text":"Every finite determination is true only insofar as it acknowledges its dependence on a unity that is at once its presupposition and its result.","refs":["CH_GB18_BFUM:A6","CH_GB18_BFUM:A10","CH_GB18_BFUM:A11","CH_GB18_BFUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a dualistic model in which form and matter are independently constituted substances that subsequently enter into relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an empiricist model in which matter is present as immediately given stuff prior to all conceptual or formal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a one-sided formalism in which form determines an alien matter without itself presupposing material subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a one-sided materialism in which matter would be a positive substrate independent of form and the sole ground of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a model of ground in which ground and grounded can be distributed as fixed, non-reversible positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an immediate unity that could subsist without self-division, negation, and posited restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely first beginning in the shape of pure matter or pure form, because each of these determinations already presupposes its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is an ultimate independence of finite determinations, because their asserted self-subsistence is only the abstracted shape of their sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX3","text":"Barred is a positively resting ground that could be ground without negative self-relation and without self-externalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a content that would be present prior to mediation as a finished substance; content arises only as the posited indifference of the sublated form-matter difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS1","text":"Essence → self-determination of reflection → matter as formless identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS2","text":"Form as negativity → self-sublation of form → presupposition of matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS3","text":"Matter as sublated negation → immanent formal determinacy → presupposition of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS4","text":"Reciprocal presupposition → semblance of external difference → disclosure of an original unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS5","text":"Form-activity and matter-movement → reciprocal negation of independence → one mediation through its own non-being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS6","text":"Sublation of isolated form and matter → restoration of unity → unity of being-in-itself and positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:FGS7","text":"Posited negative unity → determinate basis against its moments → content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF1","text":"Abstraction from all determinacy → matter as formless-indeterminate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF2","text":"Matter as basis of form → rejection of external opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF3","text":"Reciprocal presupposition → form and matter as moments of an absolute ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF4","text":"Activity of form and passivity of matter → reversal into a common negative self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF5","text":"Self-sublation of both independences → restoration and positing of their unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF6","text":"Finitude of form and matter → regression into the unity grounding them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:AF7","text":"Negative unity as determinate basis → content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME1","text":"The opposition form/matter is remapped from an opposition of two things into an internal difference of a self-mediating unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME2","text":"The difference active/passive is transformed from a distribution of fixed roles into two modes of presentation of the same negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME3","text":"The category of ground is transformed from a one-sided grounding relation into self-grounding through negative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME4","text":"Matter is reclassified from empirical stuff into abstract basis and at once into immanent self-negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME5","text":"Form is determined from external shape into a movement that attains its subsistence only through externalization and materialization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ME6","text":"Content becomes visible as the result of the sublated difference and not as a presupposed third alongside form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Form determines matter, and matter receives determinacy and subsistence through form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Form and matter reciprocally presuppose one another because each is only through the sublated determination of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The apparently external influence is systematically reinterpreted as the appearance of an immanent self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The original is not temporally or logically immediate, but a unity that realizes itself only as division, negation, and posited return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Ground is not a resting substance beneath its determinations, but the negative movement that posits presuppositions and takes them back into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reinterpretation of form and matter from external opposites into moments of a negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why absolute unity necessarily breaks apart precisely into the difference of form and matter and assumes no other mode of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as presupposition, sublation, and restoration are read not as temporally separate events, but as moments of one movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the identification of form-activity and matter-movement as one mediation through reciprocal negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT5","text":"The strongest tension lies in the fact that form and matter are initially determined asymmetrically as active and passive, while this asymmetry is subsequently sublated as the mere semblance of a unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that matter functions as basis without being permitted to be ground of form, while its grounding function is secured only through regression to a higher unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BFUM:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if content is not introduced as an additional determination, but understood as the result of the sublation of form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BFUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BFUM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BFUM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 124","title":"b. Form and Matter.","context":"Chapter 124","original_title":"b. Form und Materie."},"original_title":"b. Form und Materie.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI","layer":"CH","title":"c. Form and Content.","order":125,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CFUI"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CFUI@R001","sha256":"633f838bde0e0b44e804c01df49fdcfd14318129461bd6d22102b22891583ca9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist die Bestimmung des Verhältnisses von Form, Wesen, Materie, Inhalt und Grund unter wechselnden Gegensätzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS2","text":"Die zentrale Behauptung lautet, dass jede zunächst selbständige Bestimmung unter die Form tritt und dadurch in eine umfassendere Grundbeziehung übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS3","text":"Das Argument verfährt rekonstruktiv-dialektisch: Es verfolgt die Umwandlung äußerer Gegenüberstellungen in innere Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von Form gegen Wesen über Form gegen Materie zu Form gegen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS5","text":"Der Inhalt wird als gesetzte Einheit von Form und Materie bestimmt, deren Gleichgültigkeit durch negative Reflexion in Grundidentität übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS6","text":"Das Resultat ist der bestimmte Grund, dessen Bestimmtheit sich in Form und Inhalt verdoppelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A1","text":"Die Form steht zunächst dem Wesen gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A2","text":"Die Form ist in dieser Gegenüberstellung die Grundbeziehung von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A3","text":"Die Form tritt nacheinander dem Wesen, der Materie und dem Inhalt gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A4","text":"In der Gegenüberstellung zur Materie ist die Form bestimmende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A5","text":"In der Gegenüberstellung zum Inhalt sind die Bestimmungen der Form wiederum Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A6","text":"Das zunächst mit sich Identische wird schrittweise unter die Form als deren Bestimmung aufgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A7","text":"Der Inhalt ist die Einheit einer ihm wesentlichen Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A8","text":"Als gesetzte Einheit steht der Inhalt der Form gegenüber, während die Form als Gesetztsein und als das Unwesentliche erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A9","text":"Der Inhalt ist gegen die Form gleichgültig und begreift Form und Materie als in ihm gegründetes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A10","text":"Die Identität von Form und Materie ist im Inhalt ein Gesetztsein, das in seine Einheit oder seinen Grund zurückgegangen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A11","text":"Die Identität des Inhalts ist sowohl gleichgültige Identität gegen die Form als auch Identität des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A12","text":"Der Inhalt ist die negative Reflexion der Formbestimmungen in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A13","text":"Die zunächst gleichgültige Einheit des Inhalts ist dadurch zugleich formelle Einheit und Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A14","text":"Der Inhalt ist die wesentliche Form des Grundes, und der Grund hat umgekehrt einen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A15","text":"Der Inhalt ist nicht bloß unbestimmte Materie, sondern formierte Materie mit materiell gleichgültigem Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A16","text":"Der Grund wird zum bestimmten Grund, indem seine Bestimmtheit sich in Form und Inhalt verdoppelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX1","text":"Die Form ist gegenüber dem Inhalt nicht das Wesentliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX2","text":"Der Inhalt ist keine bloß äußerliche Ansammlung von Form und Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX3","text":"Form und Materie bestehen nicht unabhängig von ihrer Rückkehr in die Einheit des Inhalts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX4","text":"Die Identität des Inhalts erschöpft sich nicht in Gleichgültigkeit gegenüber der Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX5","text":"Der Grund bleibt nicht einfach in seinem Inhalt verschwunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX6","text":"Der Inhalt ist nicht bloße unbestimmte Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX7","text":"Das unmittelbare Gesetztsein ist nicht die gesamte Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX8","text":"Der bestimmte Grund ist weder bloße Form noch bloßer Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D1","text":"Die Folge der Gegenüberstellungen verwandelt Wesen, Materie und Inhalt in Bestimmungen der Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A1","CH_GB18_CFUI:A3","CH_GB18_CFUI:A5","CH_GB18_CFUI:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D2","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit des Inhalts gegenüber der Form bezeichnet keine äußerliche Trennung, weil der Inhalt Form und Materie zugleich umfasst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A7","CH_GB18_CFUI:A8","CH_GB18_CFUI:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D3","text":"Das im Inhalt zurückgenommene Gesetztsein wird zur Identität des Grundes.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A10","CH_GB18_CFUI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D4","text":"Durch die negative Reflexion wird der Inhalt selbst zur formellen Einheit und damit zur Grundbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A12","CH_GB18_CFUI:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D5","text":"Weil der Inhalt die wesentliche Form des Grundes ist, kann der Grund nicht ohne Inhalt bestimmt werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A13","CH_GB18_CFUI:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D6","text":"Die Materie erhält innerhalb des Inhalts den Status einer formierten, aber materiell gleichgültig bestehenden Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A9","CH_GB18_CFUI:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D7","text":"Der bestimmte Grund enthält eine formale und eine inhaltliche Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A15","CH_GB18_CFUI:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt eine zunächst äußere Opposition in eine sich selbst zurückbeziehende Grundrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD2","text":"Identität erscheint nicht als einfache Gleichheit, sondern als Spannung zwischen gleichgültiger Identität und Grundidentität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD3","text":"Der Grund wird nicht als fertige Grundlage vorausgesetzt, sondern durch die Vermittlung des Inhalts zum bestimmten Grund erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD4","text":"Die Form gewinnt strukturellen Vorrang, weil jede zuvor selbständige Bestimmung als Formbestimmung wiederkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD5","text":"Inhalt und Form werden am Ende nicht als getrennte Pole, sondern als die beiden Weisen der Bestimmtheit desselben Grundes gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige, unbewegliche Opposition zwischen Form und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Inhalt ohne Formbestimmung und ein Grund ohne Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nicht in ihre Bestimmungen zurückkehrt und diese vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist Materie als schlechthin ursprüngliches, formunabhängiges Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist der Grund als äußerliche Ursache außerhalb der Beziehung von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Form, deren Bestimmungen nicht in ein materielles Bestehen übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein Standpunkt außerhalb der Form- und Grundbeziehung, von dem aus deren Momente unabhängig bestimmt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist reine Unmittelbarkeit, weil jede scheinbar selbständige Bestimmung unter die Form tritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist reine Form ohne Inhalt ebenso wie reiner Inhalt ohne Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines formfreien Grundes organisiert die gesamte Rückkehr der Bestimmungen in die Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS1","text":"Form gegenüber Wesen → Grundbeziehung von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS2","text":"Form gegenüber Materie → bestimmende Reflexion → Reflexionsbestimmungen mit eigenem Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS3","text":"Form gegenüber Inhalt → Form und Materie erscheinen als Bestimmungen der Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS4","text":"Inhalt = Einheit von Form und Materie; gesetzte Einheit → Form als Gesetztsein und als das Unwesentliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS5","text":"Negative Reflexion der Formbestimmungen in den Inhalt → gleichgültige Einheit wird formelle Einheit und Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS6","text":"Grundbeziehung im Inhalt → Grund kehrt in sich zurück; Materie wird formierte Materie; unmittelbares Gesetztsein wird vom freien Gesetztsein unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS7","text":"Formierte Identität plus doppelte Bestimmtheit → bestimmter Grund mit den Momenten Form und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AF1","text":"Form gegen Wesen → Grundbeziehung → Form gegen Materie → bestimmende Reflexion → Form gegen Inhalt → Inhalt als gesetzte Einheit → negative Reflexion → formelle Einheit → Grund mit Inhalt → formierte Materie → bestimmter Grund → doppelte Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME1","text":"Die Form wird von einer äußeren Bestimmung zur umfassenden Grundrelation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME2","text":"Der Inhalt wird vom bloßen Gegenpol der Form zur Einheit, die Form und Materie begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME3","text":"Die Opposition von Form und Inhalt wird als Differenz innerhalb einer gemeinsamen Grundidentität neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME4","text":"Die Materie wird von unbestimmter Gleichgültigkeit zu formierter Materie mit eigenem, aber gesetztem Bestehen umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME5","text":"Der Grund wird von einer abstrakten Identität zu einer doppelt bestimmten Struktur aus Form und Inhalt umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Der Text ordnet die wechselnden Gegenüberstellungen von Form, Wesen, Materie und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Gegenüberstellungen werden als Stufen der Reflexion, des Gesetztseins und der Rückkehr in den Grund organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Jede scheinbare Äußerlichkeit wird als vorläufige Form einer tieferen inneren Relation neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Die Bestimmungen werden in einer logischen Abfolge von ursprünglicher Identität, Entgegensetzung, Rückkehr und Verdopplung erzeugt; die Zeitfolge ist eine Ordnung der Begriffsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der ursprünglichen Form-Gegenüberstellung zum bestimmten Grund zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, weshalb die Abfolge Wesen, Materie und Inhalt notwendig genau in dieser Reihenfolge durchlaufen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Gleichgültigkeit als vorläufige und nicht als endgültige Trennung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt darin, dass der Inhalt zugleich gegen die Form gleichgültig und als ihre wesentliche Form bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT5","text":"Diese Spannung wird durch die Unterscheidung von gleichgültiger Identität und Grundidentität vermittelt, aber nicht außerhalb dieser Unterscheidung weiter begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht zwischen dem Verschwinden des Grundes im Inhalt und seiner Rückkehr als Inhalt des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern sie die Rückkehr nicht als Wiederholung, sondern als Hervorgehen des bestimmten Grundes aus der vermittelten Einheit versteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114602403454Z_cbbab5f7","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Form and Content.","source_sha256":"633f838bde0e0b44e804c01df49fdcfd14318129461bd6d22102b22891583ca9","sha256":"d0615a125eee7c6b751677f21d54f1afd38eb0adb7efa0c76c37d915873af638","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:46:02.404734+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS1","text":"The problem is the determination of the relation of form, essence, matter, content, and ground under changing oppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS2","text":"The central claim is that every determination initially independent enters under form and thereby passes into a more comprehensive relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds reconstructively-dialectically: it traces the transformation of external oppositions into internal determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from form against essence, through form against matter, to form against content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS5","text":"Content is determined as the posited unity of form and matter, whose indifference passes through negative reflection into identity of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AS6","text":"The result is determinate ground, whose determinacy doubles itself in form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A1","text":"Form initially stands opposed to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A2","text":"In this opposition, form is the relation of ground between ground and the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A3","text":"Form stands successively opposed to essence, matter, and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A4","text":"In opposition to matter, form is determining reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A5","text":"In opposition to content, the determinations of form are in turn form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A6","text":"What is initially identical with itself is progressively taken up under form as its determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A7","text":"Content is the unity of a form and matter essential to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A8","text":"As posited unity, content stands opposed to form, while form appears as positedness and as the inessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A9","text":"Content is indifferent toward form and comprehends form and matter as positedness grounded in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A10","text":"The identity of form and matter is, in content, a positedness that has returned into its unity or its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A11","text":"The identity of content is both indifferent identity toward form and identity of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A12","text":"Content is the negative reflection of the determinations of form into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A13","text":"The initially indifferent unity of content is thereby at the same time formal unity and a relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A14","text":"Content is the essential form of ground, and conversely ground has a content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A15","text":"Content is not merely indeterminate matter, but formed matter with materially indifferent subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:A16","text":"Ground becomes determinate ground by its determinacy doubling itself in form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX1","text":"With respect to content, form is not the essential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX2","text":"Content is not a merely external aggregation of form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX3","text":"Form and matter do not subsist independently of their return into the unity of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX4","text":"The identity of content is not exhausted in indifference toward form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX5","text":"Ground does not simply remain vanished in its content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX6","text":"Content is not merely indeterminate matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX7","text":"Immediate positedness is not the entire relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:NX8","text":"Determinate ground is neither mere form nor mere content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D1","text":"The sequence of oppositions transforms essence, matter, and content into determinations of form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A1","CH_GB18_CFUI:A3","CH_GB18_CFUI:A5","CH_GB18_CFUI:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D2","text":"The indifference of content toward form designates no external separation, because content simultaneously encompasses form and matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A7","CH_GB18_CFUI:A8","CH_GB18_CFUI:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D3","text":"The positedness withdrawn into content becomes the identity of ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A10","CH_GB18_CFUI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D4","text":"Through negative reflection, content itself becomes formal unity and thus a relation of ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A12","CH_GB18_CFUI:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D5","text":"Because content is the essential form of ground, ground cannot be determined without content.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A13","CH_GB18_CFUI:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D6","text":"Within content, matter acquires the status of a formed determination that nevertheless subsists in material indifference.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A9","CH_GB18_CFUI:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:D7","text":"Determinate ground contains a formal and a material determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CFUI:A15","CH_GB18_CFUI:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD1","text":"The system transforms an initially external opposition into a self-relating ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD2","text":"Identity appears not as simple equality, but as a tension between indifferent identity and identity of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD3","text":"Ground is not presupposed as a finished foundation, but is produced as determinate ground through the mediation of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD4","text":"Form gains structural priority because every previously independent determination returns as a determination of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SD5","text":"At the end, content and form are grasped not as separate poles, but as the two modes of determinacy of the same ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a final, immobile opposition between form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX2","text":"Excluded are content without determination by form and ground without content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity that does not return into its determinations and mediate them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX4","text":"Excluded is matter as an absolutely original, form-independent substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX5","text":"Excluded is ground as an external cause outside the relation of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a form whose determinations do not pass over into a material subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a standpoint outside the relation of form and ground from which its moments could be determined independently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX2","text":"Pure immediacy is impossible, because every seemingly independent determination enters under form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX3","text":"Pure form without content is inadmissible, as is pure content without positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:SNX4","text":"The absence of a ground free of form organizes the entire return of determinations into the relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS1","text":"Form opposed to essence → relation of ground between ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS2","text":"Form opposed to matter → determining reflection → determinations of reflection with their own subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS3","text":"Form opposed to content → form and matter appear as determinations of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS4","text":"Content = unity of form and matter; posited unity → form as positedness and as the inessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS5","text":"Negative reflection of the determinations of form into content → indifferent unity becomes formal unity and relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS6","text":"Relation of ground in content → ground returns into itself; matter becomes formed matter; immediate positedness is distinguished from free positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:FGS7","text":"Formed identity plus double determinacy → determinate ground with the moments form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:AF1","text":"Form against essence → relation of ground → form against matter → determining reflection → form against content → content as posited unity → negative reflection → formal unity → ground with content → formed matter → determinate ground → double determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME1","text":"Form is remapped from an external determination to a comprehensive ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME2","text":"Content is remapped from the mere counterpole of form to the unity that grounds form and matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME3","text":"The opposition of form and content is reclassified as a difference within a common identity of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME4","text":"Matter is redefined from indeterminate indifference to formed matter with its own, yet posited, subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ME5","text":"Ground is remapped from an abstract identity to a doubly determinate structure of form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The text orders the changing oppositions of form, essence, matter, and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The oppositions are organized as stages of reflection, positedness, and return into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Every apparent externality is redetermined as a provisional form of a deeper internal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The determinations are produced in a logical sequence of original identity, opposition, return, and doubling; the temporal sequence is an order of the movement of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the original opposition of form to determinate ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why the sequence essence, matter, and content must necessarily be traversed in precisely this order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as indifference is understood as provisional and not as final separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT4","text":"The strongest tension lies in the fact that content is determined both as indifferent toward form and as its essential form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT5","text":"This tension is mediated through the distinction between indifferent identity and identity of ground, but is not further grounded outside this distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises between the disappearance of ground in content and its return as the content of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CFUI:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as it understands the return not as repetition, but as the emergence of determinate ground from mediated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CFUI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CFUI@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CFUI:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 125","title":"c. Form and Content.","context":"Chapter 125","original_title":"c. Form und Inhalt."},"original_title":"c. Form und Inhalt.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0","layer":"CH","title":"a. Formal Ground.","order":126,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DFG0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DFG0@R001","sha256":"bbac49cee89c8a2b00c48b525c2bc6bcf36b2b78f673034441209f9b3991dc88","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, einen bestimmten Inhalt zugleich als Grund und als Begründetes zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS2","text":"Der Text bestimmt den Grund als negative Selbstbeziehung, die sich als Gesetztes konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS3","text":"Die rekonstruktive Bewegung führt von dieser negativen Selbstbeziehung zur wechselseitigen Vermittlung von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS4","text":"Beide Seiten erweisen sich als verschiedene Formbestimmungen eines identischen Inhalts und als jeweils vollständige Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS5","text":"Daraus folgt die auf dieses Verhältnis eingeschränkte Zureichendheit des Grundes: Keine Seite enthält mehr oder weniger als die andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS6","text":"Weil der Inhalt noch keine eigene Grundbeziehung enthält, bleibt die Form formal und der Inhalt ihr gegenüber gleichgültig und äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A1","text":"Der Grund besitzt einen bestimmten Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Inhalts begründet die Form des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A3","text":"Der Grund ist eine sich negativ auf sich beziehende Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","text":"Die negative Selbstbeziehung des Grundes macht ihn zum Gesetzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","text":"Das Gesetzte geht in den Grund zurück, während der Grund sich selbst zum Gesetzten macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","text":"Die beiden Seiten der Form gehen ineinander über und setzen dadurch eine gemeinsame aufgehobene Identität voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A7","text":"Der bestimmte Inhalt ist das positive Vermittelnde und das identische Bestehen beider Formseiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","text":"Grund und Begründetes sind derselbe bestimmte Inhalt unter verschiedenen Formbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","text":"Jede Seite ist zugleich Grund und Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A10","text":"Die Vermittlung kann von jeder Seite ausgehen und bildet von jeder Seite aus die ganze Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A11","text":"Die ganze Form ist als mit sich identische Form die Grundlage ihrer beiden Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","text":"Zureichend ist der Grund insofern, als im Grund nichts enthalten ist, was nicht im Begründeten enthalten wäre, und umgekehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","text":"Die einfache Bestimmtheit des Inhalts enthält die Form der Grundbeziehung nicht an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A14","text":"Der Inhalt bleibt gegenüber der Form gleichgültig und ist von ihr unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX1","text":"Der Grund ist kein einseitiger Anfang, dem das Begründete nachgeordnet wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX2","text":"Grund und Begründetes sind keine voneinander unabhängigen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX3","text":"Die Vermittlung ist kein äußerer Übergang zwischen bereits getrennten Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX4","text":"Der Grund enthält keinen Inhalt, der dem Begründeten fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX5","text":"Das Begründete enthält keinen Inhalt, der nicht zugleich im Grund läge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX6","text":"Die Formseiten unterscheiden sich nicht durch einen jeweils eigenen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX7","text":"Die einfache Inhaltsbestimmung ist nicht bereits selbst die vollständige Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D1","text":"Der bestimmte Inhalt fungiert zugleich als Grundlage der Form und als das durch sie Vermittelte.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A1","CH_GB18_DFG0:A2","CH_GB18_DFG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D2","text":"Die zunächst verschwundene Bestimmtheit von Grund und Begründetem kehrt als negative Vermittlung ihrer Formseiten wieder.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","CH_GB18_DFG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D3","text":"Das Begründete hebt sich in den Grund auf und setzt dadurch den Grund zugleich als Begründetes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D4","text":"Grund und Begründetes sind nicht bloß korrelative Seiten, sondern jeweils die ganze Form der Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10","CH_GB18_DFG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D5","text":"Die Vermittlung ist reversibel, weil von jeder Seite zur jeweils anderen übergegangen werden kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D6","text":"Die Frage nach dem Grund verlangt dieselbe Bestimmung zweimal: einmal als Gesetztes und einmal als in sich reflektiertes Dasein.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D7","text":"Der bestimmte Grund ist zureichend, weil die Verschiedenheit von Grund und Begründetem keine inhaltliche Überschreitung hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D8","text":"Der bestimmte Grund geht in den formellen Grund über, sobald der Inhalt nur als einfache, formindifferente Bestimmtheit vorliegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","CH_GB18_DFG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD1","text":"Das Grundverhältnis erzeugt keine lineare Ursprungsordnung, sondern eine in sich rückläufige Vermittlung, in der jede Seite die andere hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A3","CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","CH_GB18_DFG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD2","text":"Begründen bedeutet innerhalb dieses Systems nicht, einen neuen Inhalt zu erzeugen, sondern denselben Inhalt in zwei Formen sichtbar zu machen.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Grund und Begründetem ist eine funktionale Formunterscheidung innerhalb einer identischen Inhaltsbestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD4","text":"Die gewonnene Identität bleibt spannungsvoll, weil Grund und Begründetes der Form nach identisch, der Form gegenüber aber durch den gleichgültigen Inhalt unterschieden sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","CH_GB18_DFG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD5","text":"Die Zureichendheit des Grundes bezeichnet eine geschlossene Form der Vermittlung, nicht die reale inhaltliche Bestimmtheit ihrer Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A11","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Grund, der gegenüber dem Begründeten einen zusätzlichen oder höheren Inhalt besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Begründung, die eine von beiden Seiten unabhängige Grundlage voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, in der der Grund lediglich gesetzt wird, ohne selbst zum Gesetzten zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine inhaltliche Differenz, durch die Grund und Begründetes zu verschiedenen Bestimmungen würden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Inhalt, der die Grundbeziehung bereits aus eigener Bestimmtheit hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reale Bestimmtheit der Seiten, solange ihr Inhalt nur einfache Identität bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein äußerer Ursprung, der außerhalb der wechselseitigen Setzung von Grund und Begründetem verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine unaufhebbare erste Seite, von der die Vermittlung nur in eine Richtung ausgehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Grund, der zugleich vollständig mit dem Begründeten identisch ist und ihm einen eigenständigen Inhalt entgegensetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein erklärender Überschuss, durch den die Begründung über die Verdopplung derselben Bestimmung hinausginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Bestimmung, in der Inhalt und Grundform ohne Rest zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS1","text":"Bestimmter Inhalt → Begründung der Form → einfache Bestimmtheit als Grundlage der Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS2","text":"Negative Selbstbeziehung → Selbstsetzung des Grundes → Hervorgehen des Gesetzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS3","text":"Rückgang des Gesetzten in den Grund + Selbstsetzung des Grundes → wechselseitige negative Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS4","text":"Übergang der Formseiten ineinander → gemeinsame aufgehobene Identität → Inhalt als positives Vermittelndes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS5","text":"Derselbe Inhalt unter zwei Formbestimmungen → Reversibilität der Seiten → jede Seite als ganze Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS6","text":"Ganze Form als identische Grundlage → gegenseitige Inhaltsgleichheit → eingeschränkte Zureichendheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS7","text":"Fehlende inhaltliche Differenz der Seiten → Form bleibt reine Grundform → formeller Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS8","text":"Formelle Grundbeziehung + formindifferenter Inhalt → Identität innerhalb der Form bei äußerer Andersheit des Inhalts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF1","text":"Bestimmter Inhalt → negative Selbstbeziehung des Grundes → Selbstsetzung als Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF2","text":"Gesetztes → Rückgang in den Grund → Grund setzt sich selbst als Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF3","text":"Wechselseitige Setzung → gemeinsame aufgehobene Identität → Grund und Begründetes als dieselbe Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF4","text":"Dieselbe Bestimmung in zwei Formen → jede Seite als ganze Vermittlung → Zureichendheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF5","text":"Keine inhaltliche Differenz → reine Form der Grundbeziehung → formeller Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF6","text":"Formidentität bei Inhaltsäußerlichkeit → erreichte formale Geschlossenheit mit ungelöster Differenz von Form und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME1","text":"Grund und Begründetes werden von getrennten Gegenständen zu wechselnden Positionen desselben Inhalts umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME2","text":"Eine einseitige Ordnungsstruktur wird durch eine reversible Vermittlungsstruktur ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME3","text":"Der Inhalt erscheint nicht mehr nur als Grundstoff, sondern als identisches Bestehen beider Formseiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME4","text":"Zureichendheit wird als vollständige Inhaltsgleichheit und nicht als inhaltliche Mehrleistung des Grundes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME5","text":"Die Form wird als selbstvermittelnd sichtbar, während der Inhalt zugleich als ihre Grundlage und als ihr äußerliches Anderes klassifiziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME6","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Grund und Begründetem wird von einer Inhaltsdifferenz zu einer Differenz der Setzungsweise umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein bestimmter Inhalt wird als Grund und als Begründetes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Negative Vermittlung organisiert den Übergang jeder Seite in die andere und erzeugt eine gemeinsame Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Frage nach dem Grund wird als Verdopplung derselben Bestimmung in zwei Darstellungsformen neu gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Grund und Begründetes bestehen nicht als selbständige Entitäten, sondern als Formbestimmungen eines identischen Inhalts; die Form ist in sich vermittelt, der Inhalt ihr gegenüber jedoch äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von bestimmtem Inhalt über negative Selbstbeziehung und reziproke Vermittlung zum formellen Grund zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin eine reale Bestimmtheit des Grundes bestehen würde, die über die einfache Inhaltsidentität hinausginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Identität und Unterschied auf verschiedene Ebenen verteilt werden: Identität innerhalb der Form, Unterschied zwischen Form und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Herleitung der Reversibilität und der eingeschränkten Zureichendheit aus der gemeinsamen Inhaltsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von Grund und Begründetem und muss zugleich deren formale Differenz erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT6","text":"Wird die Äußerlichkeit des Inhalts gegenüber der Form entfernt, bricht der Übergang zum formellen Grund zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT7","text":"Wird dagegen die Identität von Grund und Begründetem entfernt, verliert die Vermittlung ihre Reversibilität und ihre Zureichendheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern sie die erreichte Formidentität nicht mit einer vollständigen Identität von Form und Inhalt verwechselt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115252559970Z_beb5af41","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The Formal Ground.","source_sha256":"bbac49cee89c8a2b00c48b525c2bc6bcf36b2b78f673034441209f9b3991dc88","sha256":"407657f41aefeb6e5e42edcb340368687de0b0267050f699f58b4d787b610c39","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:52:52.561200+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining a determinate content simultaneously as ground and as grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS2","text":"The text determines the ground as a negative self-relation that constitutes itself as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS3","text":"The reconstructive movement leads from this negative self-relation to the reciprocal mediation of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS4","text":"Both sides prove to be different determinations of form of an identical content and, in each case, complete mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS5","text":"From this follows the sufficiency of the ground restricted to this relation: neither side contains more or less than the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AS6","text":"Because the content does not yet contain a ground-relation of its own, the form remains formal and the content indifferent and external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A1","text":"The ground possesses a determinate content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A2","text":"The determinacy of the content grounds the form of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A3","text":"The ground is an identity negatively relating itself to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","text":"The negative self-relation of the ground makes it into the posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","text":"The posited returns into the ground, while the ground makes itself into the posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","text":"The two sides of the form pass over into one another and thereby presuppose a common sublated identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A7","text":"The determinate content is the positive mediating element and the identical subsistence of both sides of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","text":"Ground and grounded are the same determinate content under different determinations of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","text":"Each side is at once ground and posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A10","text":"Mediation can proceed from either side and, from either side, constitutes the whole form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A11","text":"The whole form, as form identical with itself, is the foundation of its two determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","text":"The ground is sufficient insofar as nothing is contained in the ground that would not be contained in the grounded, and conversely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","text":"The simple determinacy of the content does not contain the form of the ground-relation in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:A14","text":"The content remains indifferent to the form and is distinct from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX1","text":"The ground is not a one-sided beginning to which the grounded would be subordinate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX2","text":"Ground and grounded are not determinations independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX3","text":"Mediation is not an external transition between already separated sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX4","text":"The ground contains no content lacking in the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX5","text":"The grounded contains no content that would not at the same time be present in the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX6","text":"The sides of form do not differ through a content belonging separately to each.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:NX7","text":"The simple determination of content is not already itself the complete ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D1","text":"The determinate content functions at once as the foundation of form and as that mediated through it.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A1","CH_GB18_DFG0:A2","CH_GB18_DFG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D2","text":"The initially vanished determinacy of ground and grounded returns as the negative mediation of their sides of form.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","CH_GB18_DFG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D3","text":"The grounded sublates itself into the ground and thereby at the same time posits the ground as grounded.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D4","text":"Ground and grounded are not merely correlative sides, but each is the whole form of mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10","CH_GB18_DFG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D5","text":"Mediation is reversible because passage can be made from either side to the other respectively.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A9","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D6","text":"The question of the ground demands the same determination twice: once as posited and once as existence reflected into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D7","text":"The determinate ground is sufficient because the difference between ground and grounded produces no excess of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:D8","text":"The determinate ground passes over into the formal ground as soon as the content is present only as simple determinacy indifferent to form.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","CH_GB18_DFG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD1","text":"The ground-relation generates no linear order of origin, but rather a mediation retrogressive within itself, in which each side brings forth the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A3","CH_GB18_DFG0:A4","CH_GB18_DFG0:A5","CH_GB18_DFG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD2","text":"Within this system, grounding does not mean generating a new content, but making the same content visible in two forms.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD3","text":"The distinction between ground and grounded is a functional distinction of form within an identical determination of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD4","text":"The identity obtained remains tension-filled, because ground and grounded are identical according to form, yet distinguished with respect to form by the indifferent content.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A6","CH_GB18_DFG0:A8","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13","CH_GB18_DFG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SD5","text":"The sufficiency of the ground designates a closed form of mediation, not the real determinacy of content of its sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_DFG0:A11","CH_GB18_DFG0:A12","CH_GB18_DFG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a ground that possesses an additional or higher content in relation to the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a grounding that presupposes a foundation independent of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a mediation in which the ground is merely posited without itself becoming posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a difference of content through which ground and grounded would become different determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a content that already produces the ground-relation out of its own determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a real determinacy of the sides so long as their content remains merely simple identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an external origin that remains outside the reciprocal positing of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an unsublatable first side from which mediation could proceed only in one direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a ground that is at once completely identical with the grounded and opposes to it an independent content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is an explanatory excess through which grounding would go beyond the duplication of the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:SNX5","text":"Unavailable is a determination in which content and ground-form coincide without remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS1","text":"Determinate content → grounding of form → simple determinacy as the foundation of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS2","text":"Negative self-relation → self-positing of the ground → emergence of the posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS3","text":"Return of the posited into the ground + self-positing of the ground → reciprocal negative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS4","text":"Transition of the sides of form into one another → common sublated identity → content as positive mediating element.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS5","text":"The same content under two determinations of form → reversibility of the sides → each side as whole mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS6","text":"Whole form as identical foundation → reciprocal equality of content → restricted sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS7","text":"Absence of difference of content between the sides → form remains pure ground-form → formal ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:FGS8","text":"Formal ground-relation + content indifferent to form → identity within form amid external otherness of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF1","text":"Determinate content → negative self-relation of the ground → self-positing as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF2","text":"Posited → return into the ground → ground posits itself as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF3","text":"Reciprocal positing → common sublated identity → ground and grounded as the same determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF4","text":"The same determination in two forms → each side as whole mediation → sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF5","text":"No difference of content → pure form of the ground-relation → formal ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:AF6","text":"Identity of form amid externality of content → achieved formal closure with unresolved difference between form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME1","text":"Ground and grounded are remapped from separate objects into alternating positions of the same content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME2","text":"A one-sided ordering structure is replaced by a reversible structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME3","text":"The content no longer appears merely as basic material, but as the identical subsistence of both sides of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME4","text":"Sufficiency is determined as complete equality of content and not as a surplus achievement of content on the part of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME5","text":"The form becomes visible as self-mediating, while the content is at the same time classified as its foundation and as its external other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ME6","text":"The difference between ground and grounded is reordered from a difference of content into a difference in the mode of positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT1","text":"Surface — A determinate content is determined as ground and as grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Negative mediation organizes the transition of each side into the other and produces a common identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The question of the ground is reconceived as the duplication of the same determination in two forms of presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Ground and grounded do not subsist as independent entities, but as determinations of form of an identical content; the form is mediated within itself, but the content is external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from determinate content, through negative self-relation and reciprocal mediation, to the formal ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is wherein a real determinacy of the ground would consist that went beyond simple identity of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as identity and difference are distributed across different levels: identity within form, difference between form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of reversibility and restricted sufficiency from the common determination of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed equation of ground and grounded and must at the same time preserve their formal difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT6","text":"If the externality of content in relation to form is removed, the transition to the formal ground collapses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT7","text":"If, by contrast, the identity of ground and grounded is removed, mediation loses its reversibility and its sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DFG0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as it does not confuse the achieved identity of form with a complete identity of form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DFG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DFG0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DFG0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 126","title":"a. Formal Ground.","context":"Chapter 126","original_title":"a. Der formelle Grund."},"original_title":"a. Der formelle Grund.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":127,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_35"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_35@R001","sha256":"95d8f0eb0bee6da4dbdf3cf5748e8a5ec5f12bfd1f20efe8a4a8d2e04b0eda39","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert wissenschaftliche Begründungen, deren Grund den Inhalt des Phänomens nur in reflektierter Form wiederholt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS2","text":"Eine Erklärung verliert ihren Erklärungscharakter, wenn sie das zu Erklärende lediglich als Kraft, Gesetz oder Prinzip umbenennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS3","text":"Die formale Begründung verdeckt, dass ihre Gründe aus dem Phänomen abgeleitet werden, das sie nachträglich erklären sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS4","text":"Die Darstellung kehrt diese Abhängigkeit um, indem sie abgeleitete Reflexionsbestimmungen als erste, selbständige Prinzipien ausgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS5","text":"Die Umkehrung erzeugt einen Zirkel, in dem Phänomene, Hypothesen, Reflexionsbestimmungen und vermeintliche Wirklichkeiten denselben Rang erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS6","text":"Das Bekenntnis zur Unkenntnis des inneren Wesens zeigt, dass die formale Erklärung ihren eigenen Anspruch nicht erfüllt und auf einen anderen Zugang oder auf bloße Tatsachen zurückverwiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A1","text":"Eine formale Grundangabe kann denselben Inhalt wie das gegebene Dasein in die Form reflektierter Wesentlichkeit übersetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A2","text":"Eine Erklärung ist leer, wenn der angebliche Grund keinen anderen Inhalt als das zu erklärende Phänomen besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A3","text":"Die Identität des Inhalts von Grund und Begründetem macht die Grundangabe zu einer Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A4","text":"Die Grundbeziehung enthält zugleich die Bewegung vom Grund zum Dasein und die gegenläufige Bewegung vom Dasein zum Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A5","text":"In der kritisierten Reflexionsweise wird der Grund aus dem Phänomen gewonnen und ist daher gesetzt und abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A6","text":"Wissenschaftliche Darstellung kann das Abgeleitete als vorausgesetztes Prinzip behandeln und das Vorausgesetzte erst im Folgenden begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A7","text":"Prinzipien ohne immanente Notwendigkeit verlangen ihre Anerkennung als gegebene Grundregeln statt ihre rationale Einsicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A8","text":"Reflektierte und hypothetische Bestimmungen können mit unmittelbaren Bestimmungen des Phänomens vermischt und als Wahrnehmungsgegenstände ausgegeben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A9","text":"Das Eingeständnis, das innere Wesen der verwendeten Kräfte und Materien nicht zu kennen, bezeugt die Unzulänglichkeit der formalen Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX1","text":"Erklärung ist nicht die bloße Wiederholung eines Phänomens unter dem Namen einer Kraft, eines Gesetzes oder eines Prinzips.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX2","text":"Ein Grund ist nicht selbständig, wenn er erst durch Abstraktion aus dem zu begründenden Dasein erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX3","text":"Ein vorausgesetztes wissenschaftliches Prinzip ist nicht notwendig, sofern seine Geltung nur auf Einübung und Glauben beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX4","text":"Hypothetische Reflexionsbestimmungen sind nicht schon deshalb unmittelbare Wirklichkeiten, weil sie in der Sprache unmittelbaren Daseins auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX5","text":"Die Berufung auf unbekannte innere Wesen ist keine Kompensation für die inhaltsleere Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX6","text":"Wissenschaftlicher Status unterscheidet eine tautologische Ätiologie nicht strukturell von einer abgeschmackten Alltagsantwort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D1","text":"Die Rede von anziehender, vegetativer oder kristallbildender Kraft erklärt nichts, sofern sie nur die beobachtete Bewegung, das Wachstum oder die Gestalt in reflektierter Benennung verdoppelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A1","CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D2","text":"Die scheinbare Deutlichkeit der formalen Erklärung beruht auf der Inhaltsidentität von Grund und Phänomen, nicht auf erlangter Erkenntnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A1","CH_GB18_A_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D3","text":"Der Übergang vom Phänomen zum Grund wird verdeckt, wenn der gewonnene Grund als Ausgangspunkt der Darstellung erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D4","text":"Die Darstellung kann keinen rationalen Anfang erzeugen, weil sie Bestimmungen als Grundlage setzt, deren eigene Begründung erst aus dem Folgenden hervorgehen soll.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D5","text":"Der Leser kann weder den Grund noch das Phänomen angemessen beurteilen, wenn beide wechselseitig als Beleg des jeweils anderen fungieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D6","text":"Die Vermischung von Hypothese und unmittelbarem Dasein erzeugt den Anschein, theoretische Konstruktionen seien vorgefundene Gegenstände.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D7","text":"Die Selbstaussage der Unkenntnis des inneren Wesens hebt den Anspruch auf, durch bekannte Kräfte und Materien bereits erklärt zu haben.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD1","text":"Die kritisierte Wissenschaft reproduziert Erkenntnis als Zirkulation: Das Phänomen erzeugt den Grund, der Grund ordnet das Phänomen, und die Ordnung gilt als Erklärung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD2","text":"Die formale Erklärung verwandelt epistemische Abhängigkeit in ontologische Hierarchie, indem aus dem vom Phänomen abhängigen Begriff ein dessen angeblich vorausliegender Grund wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD3","text":"Die wissenschaftliche Autorität solcher Systeme beruht teilweise auf institutionalisierter Anerkennung vorausgesetzter Prinzipien und nicht auf ihrer immanenten Notwendigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD4","text":"Die Gleichrangigkeit von Phänomen und Phantom ist die systemische Folge einer Sprache, die abgeleitete Hypothesen als unmittelbare Daseinsbestimmungen behandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD5","text":"Die Alternative zwischen der Suche nach einem anderen Grund und dem Verbleib bei einfachen Tatsachen markiert eine Grenze, an der die kritisierte Erklärungsform nicht fortgesetzt werden kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX1","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen sein, dass eine bloße Verschiebung desselben Inhalts von unmittelbarem Dasein zu reflektierter Bestimmung Erkenntnisfortschritt erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX2","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen sein, dass ein aus dem Phänomen extrahierter Begriff diesem Phänomen als ontologisch unabhängiger Grund vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX3","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen sein, dass theoretische Verwendbarkeit die unmittelbare Wirklichkeit hypothetischer Bestimmungen beweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX4","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen sein, dass die Unkenntnis des Wesens mit einer erfolgreichen Erklärung vereinbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX5","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen sein, dass methodisch vorausgesetzte Prinzipien ihre eigene Geltung durch die aus ihnen entwickelte Darstellung begründen können, wenn diese Darstellung sie erst voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX1","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit eines selbstbegründenden wissenschaftlichen Anfangs, sofern jeder ausgesprochene Grund aus demjenigen Phänomen hervorgeht, das er begründen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX2","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit, durch die Benennung eines unbekannten inneren Wesens die Differenz zwischen Erscheinung und Erklärung zu überbrücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein positiv bestimmtes Kriterium dafür, welcher andere Grund die tautologische Reflexion tatsächlich ersetzen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX4","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine gesicherte Grenze zwischen legitimer theoretischer Konstruktion und bloßem Phantom, solange beide als Daseinsbestimmungen auftreten können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Phänomen → reflektierte Inhaltsbestimmung → Benennung als Grund oder Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS2","text":"Inhaltsidentität von Phänomen und Grund → formale Verdopplung → tautologische Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS3","text":"Phänomen → Abstraktion des Grundes → Umkehrung der Darstellungsrichtung → Grund als erstes Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS4","text":"Vorausgesetztes Prinzip ohne immanente Notwendigkeit → Einübung seiner Anerkennung → blockierter rationaler Anfang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS5","text":"Hypothetische Reflexionsbestimmung + Sprache unmittelbaren Daseins → Verwechslung von Konstruktion und Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS6","text":"Eingeständnis unbekannten Wesens → Selbstwiderlegung der formalen Erklärung → Verweisung auf anderen Grund oder einfache Tatsachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF1","text":"Phänomenale Bewegung oder Gestalt → Umbenennung als Kraft oder Grund → Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF2","text":"Tautologische Erklärung → Analyse der doppelten Richtung der Grundbeziehung → Nachweis der Abhängigkeit des Grundes vom Phänomen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF3","text":"Abhängigkeit des Grundes vom Phänomen → Darstellung des Grundes als vorausgesetztes Prinzip → methodische Verkehrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF4","text":"Verkehrte Prinzipienordnung → Einübungszwang und Beurteilungsunsicherheit → Zirkel von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF5","text":"Zirkelhafte Darstellung → Vermischung von unmittelbaren Phänomenen und hypothetischen Konstruktionen → Gleichrangigkeit von Wirklichkeit und Phantom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF6","text":"Bekenntnis unbekannten Wesens → Offenlegung der Unzulänglichkeit → Abbruch oder Überschreitung der formalen Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME1","text":"Wissenschaftliche Kräfte und Materien werden von selbständigen Ursachen zu reflektierten Umformulierungen des Phänomens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME2","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Grund und Folge wird als Darstellungsordnung sichtbar, die ihre tatsächliche epistemische Richtung verkehren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von wissenschaftlicher Erklärung und alltäglicher Tautologie verliert seine prinzipielle Schärfe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME4","text":"Theoretische Gegenstände werden nicht mehr automatisch als Wahrnehmungsgegenstände behandelt, sondern als möglicherweise aus Phänomenen abgeleitete Hypothesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME5","text":"Verständlichkeit wird von Erkenntnis getrennt: Maximale Deutlichkeit kann gerade aus der vollständigen Inhaltsidentität von Erklärung und Erklärtem entstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text untersucht Erklärungen durch Kräfte, Materien, Gesetze und Gründe in wissenschaftlichen Ätiologien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text analysiert die Umwandlung von Phänomenen in Reflexionsbestimmungen und ihre anschließende Auszeichnung als Grundlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der Wahrheit einzelner wissenschaftlicher Aussagen auf die Darstellungs- und Legitimationsweise wissenschaftlicher Prinzipien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Text bestreitet, dass die zeitlich und erkenntnismäßig nach dem Phänomen erzeugte Bestimmung diesem ohne weiteres als dessen ontologischer Grund vorausliegen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Der Text unterscheidet unmittelbares Dasein, reflektierte Bestimmung, hypothetische Konstruktion und unbekanntes Wesen als nicht gleichrangige Erkenntnisformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Kritik an tautologischer Erklärung, die Umkehrung der Grundrelation und die Vermischung von Hypothese und Dasein zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die gerichtete Bewegung vom leeren Grund über die methodische Verkehrung bis zur Selbstanzeige der Unzulänglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch ein nicht-tautologischer Grund positiv ausgezeichnet werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Struktur liegt im Nachweis, dass die formale Erklärung ihre Gründe aus demjenigen ableitet, dem sie diese Gründe anschließend zuschreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung verbleibt zwischen der Forderung nach einem Grund anderen Inhalts und der Möglichkeit, bei einfachen Tatsachen stehen zu bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung verbleibt darin, dass die Kritik theoretische Hypothesen als abgeleitet entlarvt, ohne ein Kriterium ihrer möglichen legitimen Vermittlung auszuarbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt intern kohärent, sofern die formale Identität von Grund und Phänomen als Negativkriterium von Erklärung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112342821583Z_60954c59","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"95d8f0eb0bee6da4dbdf3cf5748e8a5ec5f12bfd1f20efe8a4a8d2e04b0eda39","sha256":"5012f3bd5665cc10dbebf0af1b992c3c114e24d6588967f26fb8ca52402b66c1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:23:42.823538+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS1","text":"The text problematizes scientific justifications whose ground merely repeats the content of the phenomenon in reflected form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS2","text":"An explanation loses its explanatory character when it merely renames what is to be explained as force, law, or principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS3","text":"Formal grounding conceals that its grounds are derived from the phenomenon that they are subsequently supposed to explain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS4","text":"The presentation reverses this dependency by presenting derived determinations of reflection as primary, independent principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS5","text":"The reversal produces a circle in which phenomena, hypotheses, determinations of reflection, and supposed realities receive the same rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AS6","text":"The avowal of ignorance of the inner essence shows that formal explanation does not fulfill its own claim and is referred back either to another access or to mere facts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A1","text":"A formal specification of the ground can translate the same content as given existence into the form of reflected essentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A2","text":"An explanation is empty when the alleged ground possesses no content other than the phenomenon to be explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A3","text":"The identity of the content of ground and grounded makes the specification of the ground a tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A4","text":"The relation of ground contains at once the movement from ground to existence and the countervailing movement from existence to ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A5","text":"In the criticized mode of reflection, the ground is obtained from the phenomenon and is therefore posited and derived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A6","text":"Scientific presentation can treat what is derived as a presupposed principle and justify what is presupposed only subsequently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A7","text":"Principles without immanent necessity demand their recognition as given basic rules rather than rational insight into them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A8","text":"Reflected and hypothetical determinations can be mixed with immediate determinations of the phenomenon and presented as objects of perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:A9","text":"The admission that the inner essence of the forces and matters employed is unknown attests to the inadequacy of formal grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX1","text":"Explanation is not the mere repetition of a phenomenon under the name of a force, a law, or a principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX2","text":"A ground is not independent if it is first produced through abstraction from the existence to be grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX3","text":"A presupposed scientific principle is not necessary insofar as its validity rests only on habituation and belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX4","text":"Hypothetical determinations of reflection are not thereby immediate realities merely because they occur in the language of immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX5","text":"Appeal to unknown inner essences is no compensation for the explanation devoid of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:NX6","text":"Scientific status does not structurally distinguish a tautological etiology from an insipid everyday answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D1","text":"Talk of attractive, vegetative, or crystallizing force explains nothing insofar as it merely duplicates the observed movement, growth, or shape in reflected designation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A1","CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D2","text":"The apparent clarity of formal explanation rests on the identity of content between ground and phenomenon, not on knowledge attained.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A1","CH_GB18_A_35:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D3","text":"The transition from phenomenon to ground is concealed when the ground obtained appears as the starting point of the presentation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D4","text":"The presentation cannot produce a rational beginning because it posits as a foundation determinations whose own grounding is supposed to arise only from what follows.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D5","text":"The reader can adequately judge neither the ground nor the phenomenon when both mutually function as evidence for the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D6","text":"The mixing of hypothesis and immediate existence creates the appearance that theoretical constructions are found objects.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:D7","text":"The self-statement of ignorance of the inner essence cancels the claim already to have explained by means of known forces and matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD1","text":"The criticized science reproduces knowledge as circulation: the phenomenon produces the ground, the ground orders the phenomenon, and the order counts as explanation.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A4","CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD2","text":"Formal explanation transforms epistemic dependency into ontological hierarchy by making the concept dependent on the phenomenon into its allegedly antecedent ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD3","text":"The scientific authority of such systems rests partly on the institutionalized recognition of presupposed principles and not on their immanent necessity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A6","CH_GB18_A_35:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD4","text":"The equal rank of phenomenon and phantom is the systemic consequence of a language that treats derived hypotheses as immediate determinations of existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A5","CH_GB18_A_35:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SD5","text":"The alternative between seeking another ground and remaining with simple facts marks a limit at which the criticized form of explanation cannot be continued.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_35:A2","CH_GB18_A_35:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX1","text":"It must be excluded that a mere displacement of the same content from immediate existence to reflected determination produces progress in knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX2","text":"It must be excluded that a concept extracted from the phenomenon precedes this phenomenon as an ontologically independent ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX3","text":"It must be excluded that theoretical usability proves the immediate reality of hypothetical determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX4","text":"It must be excluded that ignorance of the essence is compatible with a successful explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:DNX5","text":"It must be excluded that methodologically presupposed principles can justify their own validity through the presentation developed from them when this presentation itself first presupposes them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a self-grounding scientific beginning is precluded insofar as every articulated ground proceeds from the phenomenon that it is supposed to ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX2","text":"The possibility of bridging the difference between appearance and explanation by naming an unknown inner essence is precluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a positively determined criterion for which other ground could actually replace tautological reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:SNX4","text":"Absent remains a secured boundary between legitimate theoretical construction and mere phantom, so long as both can appear as determinations of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS1","text":"Immediate phenomenon → reflected determination of content → designation as ground or force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS2","text":"Identity of content between phenomenon and ground → formal duplication → tautological explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS3","text":"Phenomenon → abstraction of the ground → reversal of the direction of presentation → ground as first principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS4","text":"Presupposed principle without immanent necessity → habituation to its recognition → blocked rational beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS5","text":"Hypothetical determination of reflection + language of immediate existence → confusion of construction and reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:FGS6","text":"Admission of unknown essence → self-refutation of formal explanation → referral to another ground or simple facts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF1","text":"Phenomenal movement or shape → renaming as force or ground → tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF2","text":"Tautological explanation → analysis of the double direction of the relation of ground → demonstration of the dependency of the ground on the phenomenon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF3","text":"Dependency of the ground on the phenomenon → presentation of the ground as a presupposed principle → methodological reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF4","text":"Reversed order of principles → compulsion to habituation and uncertainty of judgment → circle of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF5","text":"Circular presentation → mixing of immediate phenomena and hypothetical constructions → equal rank of reality and phantom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:AF6","text":"Admission of unknown essence → disclosure of inadequacy → termination or transcendence of formal explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME1","text":"Scientific forces and matters are reclassified from independent causes into reflected reformulations of the phenomenon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME2","text":"The opposition of ground and consequence becomes visible as an order of presentation that can reverse its actual epistemic direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME3","text":"The opposition between scientific explanation and everyday tautology loses its principled sharpness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME4","text":"Theoretical objects are no longer automatically treated as objects of perception, but as hypotheses possibly derived from phenomena.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ME5","text":"Intelligibility is separated from knowledge: maximum clarity can arise precisely from the complete identity of content between explanation and what is explained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines explanations through forces, matters, laws, and grounds in scientific etiologies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text analyzes the transformation of phenomena into determinations of reflection and their subsequent elevation as foundations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the question from the truth of individual scientific statements to the mode of presentation and legitimation of scientific principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The text denies that a determination produced temporally and epistemically after the phenomenon can straightforwardly precede it as its ontological ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — The text distinguishes immediate existence, reflected determination, hypothetical construction, and unknown essence as forms of knowledge not of equal rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the critique of tautological explanation, the reversal of the relation of ground, and the mixing of hypothesis and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the directed movement from the empty ground through methodological reversal to the self-indication of inadequacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined by what a non-tautological ground is to be positively distinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT4","text":"The strongest structure lies in demonstrating that formal explanation derives its grounds from that to which it subsequently attributes these grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the demand for a ground of different content and the possibility of remaining with simple facts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT6","text":"A further tension remains in that the critique exposes theoretical hypotheses as derived without elaborating a criterion for their possible legitimate mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_35:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction remains internally coherent insofar as the formal identity of ground and phenomenon is treated as a negative criterion of explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_35:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_35@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_35:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 127","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 127","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG","layer":"CH","title":"b. The Real Ground.","order":128,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDRG"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDRG@R001","sha256":"7d4e92537dae6cb472ac1e34f611f35f93cf5283be8e59790236b8482ce19d0e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS1","text":"Die Grundbeziehung muss erklären, wie Inhaltsbestimmung und Formunterschied zugleich ihre Bestimmtheit bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS2","text":"Grund und Begründetes werden zunächst als inhaltlich identische, formal unterschiedene Momente bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS3","text":"Die Verschiedenheit ihrer Inhalte hebt die formale Tautologie auf und realisiert den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS4","text":"Das Begründete wird als Einheit des immanenten Grundinhalts und eines eigenen unmittelbaren Inhalts rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS5","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit der Inhalte verhindert ihre Vermittlung und reduziert ihre Einheit auf ein äußerliches Band.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung führt von formaler Identität über reale Inhaltsdifferenz zur Selbstäußerlichkeit des Grundverhältnisses und zum äußerlichen Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A1","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Grundes ist eine Inhaltsbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Grundes ist zugleich ein Anderssein von Inhalt und Form in der Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A3","text":"Der Inhalt ist die Identität des Grundes mit sich im Begründeten und des Begründeten im Grunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A4","text":"Die Seite des Grundes ist selbst Gesetztes, und die Seite des Begründeten ist selbst Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A5","text":"Jede Seite ist in ihrer bestimmten Form die Identität des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","text":"Die Formunterscheidung bestimmt die beiden Seiten als Träger verschiedener Inhalte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","text":"Der Grundinhalt bleibt im Begründeten als dessen Gesetztheit mit sich identisch und verleiht ihm Identität und Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","text":"Das Begründete enthält neben dem Grundinhalt einen eigentümlichen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","text":"Die verschiedenen Inhalte sind unmittelbare und gegeneinander gleichgültige Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","text":"Im realen Grund ist der mit dem Grund identische Inhalt wesentlicher Inhalt, während der zusätzliche Inhalt unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","text":"Der wesentliche Inhalt ist weder Grund der unwesentlichen Mannigfaltigkeit noch Grund ihrer Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A12","text":"Die Bestimmung von Grund und Gesetztem liegt außerhalb ihrer Inhalte in der Beziehung zu einem nicht durch sie gesetzten Unmittelbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX1","text":"Die Inhalte von Grund und Begründetem sind nicht schlechthin äußerlich; äußerlich wird erst die Grundbeziehung als Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX2","text":"Die realisierte Grundbeziehung ist nicht mehr formal, und ihre Rückkehr in den Grund ist keine Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX3","text":"Die Einheit der verschiedenen Inhalte ist nicht ihre Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX4","text":"Der wesentliche Inhalt ist nicht Grund der unwesentlichen Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX5","text":"Die unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit ist nicht als solche durch den Grund gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX6","text":"Das äußerliche Band ist keine Formbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX7","text":"Die Inhalte selbst bestimmen nicht, was Grund und was Gesetztes ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D1","text":"Die Verschiedenheit der Inhalte hebt die formale Grundbeziehung auf und macht den Grund zu einem realen Grund.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A1","CH_GB18_BDRG:A2","CH_GB18_BDRG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D2","text":"Die Frage nach dem Grund verlangt eine andere Inhaltsbestimmung als diejenige, deren Grund gesucht wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D3","text":"Das Begründete ist die Einheit des immanenten Grundinhalts und eines eigenen Inhalts.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D4","text":"Die Einheit der beiden Inhalte ist wegen ihrer Gleichgültigkeit nur eine negative, leere und inhaltslose Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D5","text":"Der Grundinhalt bildet die einfache Identität von Grund und Begründetem, während der zusätzliche Inhalt als unmittelbare Mannigfaltigkeit vom Grund frei bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D6","text":"Die Beziehung des wesentlichen zum unwesentlichen Inhalt ist selbst kein Grundverhältnis, sondern ein äußerliches Band und eine Grundlage.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D7","text":"Der reale Grund zerfällt in die wesentliche Identität und die Beziehung des unterschiedenen Inhalts als zwei verschiedene Grundlagen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D8","text":"Der äußerliche Grund verbindet verschiedene Inhalte und bestimmt ihre Rollen durch die Beziehung zu einem unmittelbaren, nicht gesetzten Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD1","text":"Der reale Grund bewahrt Identität nur noch im wesentlichen Inhalt, während er die Beziehung zur unwesentlichen Mannigfaltigkeit externalisiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A3","CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD2","text":"Der Grund erklärt nicht mehr die gesamte Bestimmtheit des Begründeten, sondern nur dessen wesentlichen Identitätsanteil.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD3","text":"Grund und Gesetztes werden von immanenten Inhaltsbestimmungen zu äußerlich zugewiesenen relationalen Positionen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A4","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD4","text":"Die reale Grundbeziehung enthält eine doppelte Äußerlichkeit: die Verbindung eines Inhalts mit anderem Inhalt und die Verbindung der Form mit einem unmittelbaren Anderen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD5","text":"Die Grundlage bezeichnet die Restform von Einheit dort, wo Vermittlung zwischen den Inhalten ausbleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine immanente Vermittlung der verschiedenen, gleichgültigen Inhalte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass die vollständige Bestimmtheit des Begründeten aus dem Grundinhalt folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass der Grund die unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit als solche erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass die Rollen von Grund und Gesetztem aus den Inhalten selbst hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass die Grundbeziehung ihre eigene Verknüpfung immanent begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine einheitliche Grundform, in der dasselbe ohne Bruch zugleich wesentlich und gesetzt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Grund, der das Begründete als Ganzes aus einem einzigen Inhalt erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine immanente Vermittlung von wesentlichem Inhalt und unwesentlicher Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein inneres Kriterium für die Verteilung der Rollen von Grund und Gesetztem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX4","text":"Nicht aufrechterhalten wird eine ungeteilte Grundbeziehung; an ihre Stelle treten zwei Grundlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist eine Erklärung, in der die äußere Verbindung selbst noch aus dem Grund hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS1","text":"Inhaltsbestimmung und Formunterschied konstituieren die Bestimmtheit des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS2","text":"Inhaltliche Identität und Rollenumkehr machen jede Seite zu einem Moment des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS3","text":"Formunterschied → verschiedene Inhalte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS4","text":"Verschiedene Inhalte → Aufhebung der Tautologie → Realisierung des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS5","text":"Grundinhalt im Begründeten → Identität und Bestehen des Begründeten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS6","text":"Eigener Inhalt des Begründeten + Grundinhalt → zweifacher Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS7","text":"Gleichgültigkeit der Inhalte → negative Einheit → leere äußere Verknüpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS8","text":"Zweifacher Inhalt → wesentliche Identität + unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS9","text":"Fehlende Vermittlung → äußerliches Band → zwei Grundlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS10","text":"Zwei Grundlagen → Selbstäußerlichkeit der Grundbeziehung → äußerlicher Grund mit Beziehung auf ein unmittelbares Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF1","text":"Formale Identität → Formunterschied → verschiedene Inhalte → realisierter Grund → zweifacher Inhalt → fehlende Vermittlung → äußerliches Band → zwei Grundlagen → äußerlicher Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF2","text":"Grundinhalt als wesentliche Identität → eigener Inhalt als unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit → Gleichgültigkeit beider → externe Zuweisung von Grund und Gesetztem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF3","text":"Inhaltliche Identität bleibt erhalten, während die Grundbeziehung als Verhältnis ihrer Momente äußerlich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME1","text":"Der Grund wird von einer formalen Identitätsrelation zu einer Relation verschiedener Inhalte umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME2","text":"Das Begründete wird vom bloß Gesetzten zur zusammengesetzten Einheit aus wesentlichem und eigenem Inhalt umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME3","text":"Identität und Vermittlung werden getrennt: Ein Inhalt kann im Begründeten identisch fortbestehen, ohne dessen gesamte Bestimmtheit zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME4","text":"Die Einheit zweier Bestimmungen wird nicht mehr als Vermittlung, sondern als äußerliches Band sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME5","text":"Grund und Gesetztes erscheinen nicht länger als aus dem Inhalt ablesbare Bestimmungen, sondern als äußerlich bestimmte Positionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME6","text":"Die Landschaft der Erklärung verschiebt sich von immanenter Hervorbringung zu äußerer Verbindung und Zuordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Frage nach dem Grund verlangt eine andere Inhaltsbestimmung als diejenige, deren Grund gesucht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Grundbeziehung zerfällt in wesentliche Identität und unwesentliche Mannigfaltigkeit, die nur äußerlich verbunden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Erklären bedeutet nicht mehr, das Begründete aus dem Grund vollständig hervorgehen zu lassen, sondern die Verbindung und Rollenverteilung äußerlich zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Bestehen des Begründeten beruht zugleich auf einem immanenten wesentlichen Inhalt und auf einem unmittelbaren, nicht gesetzten Zusatzinhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von der formalen Grundbeziehung zum realen und äußerlichen Grund zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, weshalb die gleichgültigen Inhalte überhaupt in einem Etwas verbunden sind; das äußerliche Band wird als notwendiger Rest gesetzt, nicht immanent erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT3","text":"Eine interne Spannung besteht zwischen der anfänglichen Zurückweisung äußerlicher Inhaltsbeziehung und der späteren Selbstäußerlichkeit der Grundbeziehung; sie wird durch die Unterscheidung von Inhalt und Form vermittelt, aber nicht aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT4","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass das Begründete den Grund vollständig enthält und zugleich einen eigenen Inhalt besitzt; die Kohärenz hängt an der Trennung von wesentlichem und unwesentlichem Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT5","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion in der Ableitung der aufgehobenen Tautologie aus der Inhaltsdifferenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT6","text":"Am schwächsten ist sie dort, wo die äußere Verbindung selbst erklärt werden müsste, aber auf ein unmittelbares, nicht gesetztes Anderes verweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die äußere Bestimmung nicht als nachträgliche Vermittlung, sondern als Endform des realen Grundes verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113053216329Z_826af90f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The real ground.","source_sha256":"7d4e92537dae6cb472ac1e34f611f35f93cf5283be8e59790236b8482ce19d0e","sha256":"d78ef39fd639d9a1dde5a02d4096eede323840ed56878ea9e4d74eb6fea86f6f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:30:53.217398+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS1","text":"The ground-relation must explain how determination of content and difference of form together constitute their determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS2","text":"Ground and grounded are initially determined as moments identical in content and different in form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS3","text":"The difference of their contents sublates the formal tautology and realizes the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS4","text":"The grounded is reconstructed as the unity of the immanent ground-content and a content of its own that is immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS5","text":"The indifference of the contents prevents their mediation and reduces their unity to an external bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AS6","text":"The movement leads from formal identity, through real difference of content, to the self-externality of the ground-relation and to the external ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A1","text":"The determinacy of the ground is a determination of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A2","text":"The determinacy of the ground is at the same time an otherness of content and form in the ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A3","text":"Content is the identity of the ground with itself in the grounded and of the grounded in the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A4","text":"The side of the ground is itself posited, and the side of the grounded is itself ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A5","text":"Each side is, in its determinate form, the identity of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","text":"The distinction of form determines the two sides as bearers of different contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","text":"The ground-content remains identical with itself in the grounded as its positedness and confers upon it identity and subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","text":"Alongside the ground-content, the grounded contains a peculiar content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","text":"The different contents are immediate determinations indifferent to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","text":"In the real ground, the content identical with the ground is essential content, whereas the additional content is inessential manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","text":"The essential content is neither the ground of the inessential manifoldness nor the ground of its relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:A12","text":"The determination of ground and posited lies outside their contents, in the relation to an immediate that is not posited by them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX1","text":"The contents of ground and grounded are not absolutely external; rather, it is the ground-relation as form that first becomes external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX2","text":"The realized ground-relation is no longer formal, and its return into the ground is no tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX3","text":"The unity of the different contents is not their mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX4","text":"The essential content is not the ground of the inessential manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX5","text":"The inessential manifoldness is not, as such, posited by the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX6","text":"The external bond is not a relation of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:NX7","text":"The contents themselves do not determine what is ground and what is posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D1","text":"The difference of contents sublates the formal ground-relation and makes the ground into a real ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A1","CH_GB18_BDRG:A2","CH_GB18_BDRG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D2","text":"The question concerning the ground requires a determination of content other than that whose ground is sought.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D3","text":"The grounded is the unity of the immanent ground-content and a content of its own.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D4","text":"Because of their indifference, the unity of the two contents is only a negative, empty, and contentless relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D5","text":"The ground-content constitutes the simple identity of ground and grounded, whereas the additional content remains free from the ground as immediate manifoldness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D6","text":"The relation of essential to inessential content is itself not a ground-relation, but an external bond and a basis.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D7","text":"The real ground falls apart into essential identity and the relation of differentiated content as two different bases.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:D8","text":"The external ground connects different contents and determines their roles through the relation to an immediate, unposited other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD1","text":"The real ground preserves identity only in the essential content, while externalizing the relation to the inessential manifoldness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A3","CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD2","text":"The ground no longer explains the entire determinacy of the grounded, but only its essential share of identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A7","CH_GB18_BDRG:A8","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD3","text":"Ground and posited become, from immanent determinations of content, relational positions assigned externally.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A4","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD4","text":"The real ground-relation contains a double externality: the connection of one content with another content and the connection of form with an immediate other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A6","CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SD5","text":"The basis designates the residual form of unity where mediation between the contents fails to occur.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDRG:A9","CH_GB18_BDRG:A10","CH_GB18_BDRG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an immanent mediation of the different, indifferent contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX2","text":"Excluded is that the complete determinacy of the grounded follows from the ground-content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX3","text":"Excluded is that the ground produces the inessential manifoldness as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX4","text":"Excluded is that the roles of ground and posited arise from the contents themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX5","text":"Excluded is that the ground-relation immanently grounds its own connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a unified form of ground in which the same would, without rupture, be at once essential and posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a ground that produces the grounded as a whole from a single content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an immanent mediation of essential content and inessential manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is an internal criterion for the distribution of the roles of ground and posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX4","text":"An undivided ground-relation is not maintained; two bases take its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:SNX5","text":"Blocked is an explanation in which the external connection itself still arises from the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS1","text":"Determination of content and difference of form constitute the determinacy of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS2","text":"Identity of content and reversal of roles make each side a moment of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS3","text":"Difference of form → different contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS4","text":"Different contents → sublation of tautology → realization of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS5","text":"Ground-content in the grounded → identity and subsistence of the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS6","text":"Content of the grounded's own + ground-content → twofold content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS7","text":"Indifference of the contents → negative unity → empty external connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS8","text":"Twofold content → essential identity + inessential manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS9","text":"Absence of mediation → external bond → two bases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:FGS10","text":"Two bases → self-externality of the ground-relation → external ground with relation to an immediate other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF1","text":"Formal identity → difference of form → different contents → realized ground → twofold content → absence of mediation → external bond → two bases → external ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF2","text":"Ground-content as essential identity → content of its own as inessential manifoldness → indifference of both → external assignment of ground and posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:AF3","text":"Identity of content is preserved, while the ground-relation becomes external as the relation of its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME1","text":"The ground is remapped from a formal relation of identity to a relation of different contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME2","text":"The grounded is reclassified from the merely posited into the composite unity of essential and own content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME3","text":"Identity and mediation are separated: a content can persist identically in the grounded without producing its entire determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME4","text":"The unity of two determinations is no longer visible as mediation, but as an external bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME5","text":"Ground and posited no longer appear as determinations readable from content, but as externally determined positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ME6","text":"The landscape of explanation shifts from immanent production to external connection and assignment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT1","text":"Surface — The question concerning the ground requires a determination of content other than that whose ground is sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT2","text":"Structural — The ground-relation falls apart into essential identity and inessential manifoldness, which are connected only externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — To explain no longer means to let the grounded arise completely from the ground, but to determine externally the connection and distribution of roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subsistence of the grounded rests at once on an immanent essential content and on an immediate, unposited additional content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the formal ground-relation to the real and external ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is why the indifferent contents are connected at all in a something; the external bond is posited as a necessary remainder, not produced immanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT3","text":"An internal tension exists between the initial rejection of an external relation of content and the later self-externality of the ground-relation; it is mediated through the distinction of content and form, but not sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT4","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the grounded contains the ground completely and yet possesses a content of its own; coherence depends upon the separation of essential and inessential content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the derivation of the sublated tautology from the difference of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT6","text":"It is weakest where the external connection itself would have to be explained, but refers to an immediate, unposited other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDRG:MRT7","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved provided that the external determination is understood not as subsequent mediation, but as the final form of the real ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDRG@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDRG:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 128","title":"b. The Real Ground.","context":"Chapter 128","original_title":"b. Der reale Grund."},"original_title":"b. Der reale Grund.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":129,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_36"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_36@R001","sha256":"fc3ee5a5c23f79582cfa98e1568279d60ad0925991c04cdf9b04f5103748e72e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS1","text":"Die Grundbeziehung soll Notwendigkeit erklären, zerfällt aber entweder in tautologische Inhaltsidentität oder in äußerliche Inhaltsverschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS2","text":"Der reale Grund wird zur bloßen Grundlage, weil sein allgemeiner Inhalt die besonderen Bestimmungen des Begründeten und deren Verbindung nicht erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS3","text":"Weil ein Konkretes mehrere gleich wesentliche Inhaltsbestimmungen enthält, kann jede von ihnen äußerlich als Grund oder als Gesetztes gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS4","text":"Das Raisonnement aus Gründen produziert deshalb unendliche, gegensätzliche und folgenlose Rechtfertigungen statt einer letzten Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS5","text":"Nur der Begriff als die Sache in ihrer ganzen immanenten Verknüpfung könnte leisten, was einzelne Gründe strukturell nicht leisten können: zureichende Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A1","text":"Formelle Grundbeziehung setzt denselben Inhalt als Grund und Begründetes voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A2","text":"Inhaltsidentität begründet nur tautologische Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A3","text":"Reale Grundbeziehung setzt einen vom Begründeten verschiedenen Inhalt voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A4","text":"Ein allgemeiner oder wesentlicher Inhalt begründet weder die besondere Mannigfaltigkeit eines Konkreten noch deren bestimmte Verbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A5","text":"Die Grundform ist den verbundenen Inhaltsbestimmungen äußerlich und wird durch ein Drittes zugeteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A6","text":"Jedes Konkrete enthält mehrere bleibende und wesentliche Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A7","text":"Jede wesentliche Teilbestimmung eines Konkreten kann unter einer äußeren Rücksicht als Grund gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A8","text":"Ein einzelner Grund enthält nicht den ganzen Umfang des Konkreten, dessen Bestimmungen er nur partiell herausgreift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A9","text":"Zureichender Grund wäre nur eine Bestimmung, welche die ganze Sache und die Verknüpfung ihrer Bestimmungen enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX1","text":"Notwendigkeit ist nicht durch bloße Gleichheit von Grund und Begründetem gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX2","text":"Eine Grundlage ist nicht schon der Grund der konkreten Bestimmtheit dessen, worauf sie liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX3","text":"Das allgemeine Wesen ist nicht die Erklärung der besonderen Gestalt oder Mannigfaltigkeit seines Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX4","text":"Wesentlichkeit einer Bestimmung ist nicht identisch mit ihrer kausalen oder begründenden Priorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX5","text":"Das Vorliegen eines Grundes ist nicht hinreichend für das Eintreten einer bestimmten Folge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX6","text":"Die Häufung guter Gründe ist nicht zureichende Erkenntnis der Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX7","text":"Raisonnement ist nicht Begriffskenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D1","text":"Die reale Grundbeziehung kann ihre eigene Selektionsregel nicht liefern, weil mehrere wesentliche Inhalte gleichermaßen zu möglichen Gründen werden.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D2","text":"Die Zuordnung von Grund und Begründetem bleibt kontingent, weil ihre Form nicht aus dem Inhalt selbst folgt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D3","text":"Dieselbe Bestimmung kann Grund heterogener und sogar entgegengesetzter Erscheinungen sein, sofern ein weiteres Drittes die konkrete Bestimmung vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D4","text":"Der Wechsel der Perspektive erlaubt die Umkehrung der Grundrelation zwischen denselben Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D5","text":"Folgerungen aus moralischen Gründen bleiben äußerlich aufhebbar, weil der Folgeinhalt nicht im moralischen Grund selbst enthalten ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D6","text":"Einzelgründe sind notwendig einseitig, weil ihre Geltung auf isolierter Wesentlichkeit und nicht auf der Totalität des Gegenstands beruht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A7","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD1","text":"Die Grundbeziehung ist als Erkenntnisform instabil: Sie oszilliert zwischen leerer Identität und unendlicher äußerlicher Differenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A1","CH_GB18_A_36:A2","CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD2","text":"Jede Begründungspraxis, die isolierte wesentliche Merkmale privilegiert, kann konträre Positionen gleich gut legitimieren.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD3","text":"Die Suche nach Gründen erzeugt eine offene Regressionsstruktur, weil jeder gewählte Grund weitere äußere Vermittlungen voraussetzt und keinen Abschluss in sich trägt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD4","text":"Der Begriff fungiert als notwendige, aber in der Anmerkung nur negativ bestimmte Instanz: Er wird durch das Versagen jedes partikulären Grundes gefordert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A8","CH_GB18_A_36:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, daß die allgemeine Bestimmung eines Gegenstands seine konkrete Individualität deduktiv enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, daß Korrelation, beständige Koexistenz oder Wesentlichkeit bereits eine immanente Grundrelation ausmachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme eines kontextfreien privilegierten Grundes innerhalb eines konkreten Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, daß praktische oder moralische Motive Handlungen unmittelbar und vollständig determinieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Erklärung, die aus einem abstrakten Wesen ohne zusätzliche Vermittlung die bestimmte Welt, Handlung oder Institution hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist die endgültige Erkenntnis der Sache durch eine bloße Aufzählung oder Abwägung ihrer Gründe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt die Gleichsetzung von begründender Form und Wahrheit, solange die Form ihre konkrete Zuordnung nur von einem äußerlichen Dritten erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS1","text":"Inhaltsidentität von Grund und Begründetem → Notwendigkeit ohne Differenz → Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS2","text":"Inhaltsdifferenz zwischen Grund und Begründetem → besondere Bestimmungen fallen außerhalb des Grundes → Grund wird Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS3","text":"Konkrete Mannigfaltigkeit → mehrere wesentliche Teilinhalte → freie Auswahl eines privilegierten Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS4","text":"Äußerliche Zuteilung der Grundform → Umkehrbarkeit und Kontingenz der Grund-Folge-Zuordnung → unabschließbares Raisonnement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS5","text":"Scheitern einseitiger Gründe an der Totalität des Konkreten → Forderung nach dem Begriff als zureichender Einheit der Verknüpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF1","text":"Formelle Notwendigkeit → Tautologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF2","text":"Reale Inhaltsdifferenz → Äußerlichkeit der Verbindung → Abstieg des Grundes zur Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF3","text":"Konkrete Vielbestimmtheit → konkurrierende Grundzuschreibungen → freie und reversible Selektion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF4","text":"Kontingente Selektion → gegensätzliche und folgenlose Gründe → Sophistik des Raisonnements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF5","text":"Unzureichende Teilgründe → Begriff als Name der fehlenden zureichenden Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung Grund/Grundlage trennt tragenden allgemeinen Inhalt von der Erklärung konkreter Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME2","text":"Wesentlichkeit wird von Begründungskraft getrennt: Eine Bestimmung kann wesentlich sein, ohne die anderen Bestimmungen des Konkreten hervorzubringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME3","text":"Kausale, moralische, institutionelle und theologische Erklärungen erscheinen als strukturell gleichartige Fälle äußerlicher Grundzuschreibung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen einem Grund und seinem Gegenteil verliert argumentative Ausschließlichkeit, weil beide aus verschiedenen einseitigen Rücksichten begründbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME5","text":"Erkenntnis wird von der Akkumulation von Gründen auf die Rekonstruktion der Sache als immanenter Verknüpfung ihrer Bestimmungen umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Anmerkung analysiert den Unterschied von formellem und realem Grund sowie die Unzulänglichkeit einzelner Begründungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT2","text":"Structural — Grund und Begründetes werden nicht durch ihren Inhalt, sondern durch eine äußerliche dritte Instanz in eine asymmetrische Form gebracht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Raisonnement wird als Technik der frei selektierbaren Rechtfertigung bestimmt, deren Offenheit Sophistik ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Konkrete Wirklichkeit ist nicht aus einem abstrakten allgemeinen Wesen ableitbar, weil ihre besondere Mannigfaltigkeit und Verknüpfung zusätzliche Vermittlung verlangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Zureichende Erkenntnis verlangt eine Einheit, die nicht neben den Bestimmungen steht, sondern deren immanente Verknüpfung enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von formeller Tautologie über reale Äußerlichkeit zur Kritik des Raisonnements zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive innere Bestimmung des Begriffs, da er primär als Name des zureichenden Grundes gegen einseitige Gründe erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Grund als Erklärung konkreter Verknüpfung verlangt wird, nicht bloß als allgemeine Voraussetzung oder auswählbares Merkmal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Trennung von Wesentlichkeit, Grundlage und zureichender Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, daß die notwendige Vermittlung durch ein Drittes diagnostiziert wird, ohne daß deren eigene Begründungsform innerhalb der Anmerkung positiv entfaltet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur, wenn der Begriff nicht als zusätzlicher Einzelgrund, sondern als Aufhebung der äußerlichen Grundform verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112401691450Z_cace34f4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"fc3ee5a5c23f79582cfa98e1568279d60ad0925991c04cdf9b04f5103748e72e","sha256":"28f2b704411af45f57c4b6f41d43ffcac15c0641e6a7868f49e7e4d2946bb3b6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:24:01.692404+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS1","text":"The ground-relation is supposed to explain necessity, but disintegrates either into tautological identity of content or into external difference of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS2","text":"The real ground becomes a mere foundation, because its universal content does not produce the particular determinations of the grounded and their connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS3","text":"Because a concrete entity contains several equally essential determinations of content, each of them can externally be posited as ground or as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS4","text":"Ratiocination from grounds therefore produces infinite, opposed, and inconsequential justifications instead of a final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AS5","text":"Only the Concept as the thing in its entire immanent interconnection could accomplish what individual grounds structurally cannot accomplish: sufficient grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A1","text":"The formal ground-relation presupposes the same content as ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A2","text":"Identity of content grounds only tautological necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A3","text":"The real ground-relation presupposes content different from the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A4","text":"A universal or essential content grounds neither the particular manifoldness of a concrete entity nor their determinate connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A5","text":"The ground-form is external to the connected determinations of content and is assigned by a third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A6","text":"Every concrete entity contains several enduring and essential determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A7","text":"Every essential partial determination of a concrete entity can, under an external respect, be posited as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A8","text":"An individual ground does not contain the whole scope of the concrete entity, whose determinations it selects only partially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:A9","text":"A sufficient ground would be only a determination that contains the whole thing and the interconnection of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX1","text":"Necessity is not obtained through mere equality of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX2","text":"A foundation is not thereby already the ground of the concrete determinacy of that upon which it rests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX3","text":"The universal essence is not the explanation of the particular shape or manifoldness of its existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX4","text":"The essentiality of a determination is not identical with its causal or grounding priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX5","text":"The presence of a ground is not sufficient for the occurrence of a determinate consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX6","text":"The accumulation of good grounds is not sufficient cognition of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:NX7","text":"Ratiocination is not cognition of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D1","text":"The real ground-relation cannot supply its own rule of selection, because several essential contents equally become possible grounds.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D2","text":"The assignment of ground and grounded remains contingent, because its form does not follow from the content itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D3","text":"The same determination can be the ground of heterogeneous and even opposed appearances, insofar as a further third mediates the concrete determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D4","text":"The change of perspective permits the reversal of the ground-relation between the same determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D5","text":"Inferences from moral grounds remain externally defeasible, because the content of the consequence is not contained in the moral ground itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:D6","text":"Individual grounds are necessarily one-sided, because their validity rests on isolated essentiality and not on the totality of the object.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A7","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD1","text":"The ground-relation is unstable as a form of cognition: it oscillates between empty identity and infinite external difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A1","CH_GB18_A_36:A2","CH_GB18_A_36:A3","CH_GB18_A_36:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD2","text":"Every practice of grounding that privileges isolated essential characteristics can legitimate contrary positions equally well.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A6","CH_GB18_A_36:A7","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD3","text":"The search for grounds generates an open regressive structure, because every selected ground presupposes further external mediations and carries no closure within itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A4","CH_GB18_A_36:A5","CH_GB18_A_36:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SD4","text":"The Concept functions as a necessary, but in the Remark only negatively determined, instance: it is required through the failure of every particular ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_36:A8","CH_GB18_A_36:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the universal determination of an object deductively contains its concrete individuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that correlation, constant coexistence, or essentiality already constitute an immanent ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption of a context-free privileged ground within a concrete object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that practical or moral motives immediately and completely determine actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an explanation that produces the determinate world, action, or institution from an abstract essence without additional mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is definitive cognition of the thing through a mere enumeration or weighing of its grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:SNX3","text":"Blocked remains the equation of grounding form and truth, so long as the form receives its concrete assignment only from an external third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS1","text":"Identity of content of ground and grounded → necessity without difference → tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS2","text":"Difference of content between ground and grounded → particular determinations fall outside the ground → ground becomes foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS3","text":"Concrete manifoldness → several essential partial contents → free selection of a privileged ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS4","text":"External assignment of the ground-form → reversibility and contingency of the ground-consequence assignment → unclosable ratiocination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:FGS5","text":"Failure of one-sided grounds before the totality of the concrete → demand for the Concept as sufficient unity of interconnection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF1","text":"Formal necessity → tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF2","text":"Real difference of content → externality of the connection → degradation of ground into foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF3","text":"Concrete manifold determinacy → competing attributions of ground → free and reversible selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF4","text":"Contingent selection → opposed and inconsequential grounds → sophistry of ratiocination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:AF5","text":"Insufficient partial grounds → Concept as the name of the lacking sufficient unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME1","text":"The distinction ground/foundation separates supporting universal content from the explanation of concrete determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME2","text":"Essentiality is separated from grounding power: a determination can be essential without producing the other determinations of the concrete entity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME3","text":"Causal, moral, institutional, and theological explanations appear as structurally homogeneous cases of external attribution of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME4","text":"The opposition between a ground and its opposite loses argumentative exclusivity, because both become groundable from different one-sided respects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ME5","text":"Cognition is shifted from the accumulation of grounds to the reconstruction of the thing as the immanent interconnection of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT1","text":"Surface — The Remark analyzes the difference between formal and real ground, as well as the inadequacy of individual justifications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ground and grounded are brought into an asymmetric form not by their content, but by an external third instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Ratiocination is determined as a technique of freely selectable justification, whose openness enables sophistry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Concrete actuality cannot be derived from an abstract universal essence, because its particular manifoldness and interconnection demand additional mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Sufficient cognition demands a unity that does not stand alongside the determinations, but contains their immanent interconnection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from formal tautology through real externality to the critique of ratiocination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT2","text":"The positive inner determination of the Concept remains underdetermined, since it appears primarily as the name of sufficient ground against one-sided grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as ground is required as an explanation of concrete interconnection, not merely as a universal presupposition or selectable characteristic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the separation of essentiality, foundation, and sufficient grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that necessary mediation through a third is diagnosed without its own form of grounding being positively developed within the Remark.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_36:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if the Concept is understood not as an additional individual ground, but as the sublation of the external ground-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_36:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_36@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_36:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 129","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 129","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Complete Ground.","order":130,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CD_2"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CD_2@R001","sha256":"ac7169b03120f8f68c377bdd6d80b2fefaf60e3fb744a3872b0126255f9f4c66","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS1","text":"Der reale Grund erscheint als äußerliche Reflexion und kann deshalb die Beziehung von Grund und Begründetem nicht abschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS2","text":"Die Aufhebung der äußerlichen Grundbeziehung erzeugt einen neuen Grund, in dem Grund und Begründetes denselben Inhalt und eine reflektierte Beziehung ihrer Inhaltsbestimmungen besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS3","text":"Die vollständige Grundbeziehung vereinigt formellen und realen Grund, indem sie die zunächst unmittelbaren Inhaltsbestimmungen vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS4","text":"Die Vermittlung verteilt denselben Gesamtinhalt auf zwei Etwas, deren Unterschied allein in der unmittelbaren oder gesetzten Art ihrer Beziehung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS5","text":"Die vollständige Grundbeziehung wird zur bedingenden Vermittlung, weil Form und Inhalt einander wechselseitig voraussetzen und sich jeweils auf ein Anderes beziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","text":"Der reale Grund ist keine selbstgenügsame Grundbeziehung, sondern äußerliche und gesetzte Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A2","text":"Was als gesetzte Grundbeziehung erscheint, gehört zur Seite des Begründeten und verlangt selbst einen anderen Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","text":"Die Rückkehr des realen Grundes in seinen Grund stellt die Identität von Grund und Begründetem wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A4","text":"Die vollständige Grundbeziehung enthält zugleich formellen Grund, realen Grund und die Vermittlung ihrer Inhaltsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","text":"Der formelle Grund besitzt zunächst denselben Inhalt auf beiden Seiten, aber dieser Inhalt kann sich selbst als gedoppelter Inhalt von Grund und Begründetem bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A6","text":"Zwei Etwas können denselben vollständigen Inhalt besitzen und sich dennoch dadurch unterscheiden, dass ihre Inhaltsbestimmungen einmal unmittelbar und einmal gesetzt verknüpft sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","text":"Eine Inhaltsbestimmung ist nur insofern Grund einer anderen, als ihre ursprüngliche Verknüpfung in einem ersten Etwas die gesetzte Verknüpfung im zweiten Etwas vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A8","text":"Im zweiten Etwas ist nicht nur die gesetzte Bestimmung, sondern auch der Charakter der unmittelbaren Bestimmung als Grund vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","text":"Die vollständige Grundbeziehung ist wesentlich voraussetzende Reflexion, weil der formelle Grund den Inhalt und der reale Grund die Form voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A10","text":"Der Grund vermittelt sich mit sich nur dadurch, dass er seine eigene unmittelbare Gestalt negiert und sich auf ein Anderes bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX1","text":"Der reale Grund ist nicht die absolute Beziehung der Inhaltsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX2","text":"Die unmittelbare Verknüpfung verschiedener Inhaltsbestimmungen ist nicht deren reflektierte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX3","text":"Die Gleichheit des Inhalts macht Grund und Begründetes nicht bereits identisch als Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX4","text":"Der Grund ist nicht Grund an und für sich selbst als unmittelbare Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX5","text":"Der reale Inhalt ist nicht unabhängig von der Form Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX6","text":"Das Begründete ist nicht bloß eine äußerlich angefügte Folge eines isolierten Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX7","text":"Vollständigkeit des Grundes ist nicht unmittelbare Selbstidentität, sondern vermittelte Selbstbeziehung durch Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D1","text":"Der reale Grund verliert als äußerliche Beziehung seine letzte Begründungsfunktion und wird selbst zum Begründeten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D2","text":"Die Wiederherstellung der Identität von Grund und Begründetem verlangt einen Grund, der die Beziehung der Inhaltsbestimmungen selbst enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D3","text":"Der Unterschied von Grund und Begründetem kann bei identischem Gesamtinhalt ausschließlich als Unterschied der Beziehungsform auftreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D4","text":"Die Beziehung im zweiten Etwas hat ihren Grund nicht in dessen isoliertem Inhalt, sondern in der ursprünglichen Verknüpfung des ersten Etwas.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D5","text":"Der Grund des Grundes ist die ursprüngliche Beziehung, durch welche eine unmittelbare Inhaltsbestimmung erst als Grund bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D6","text":"Die vollständige Grundbeziehung kann weder auf Form noch auf Inhalt reduziert werden, weil beide nur durch ihre gegenseitige Voraussetzung Grundcharakter erhalten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A4","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D7","text":"Die Totalität des Grundes ist eine Selbstvermittlung, deren Einheit nur im Durchgang durch ihre eigene Negation besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD1","text":"Grundsein ist kein festes Prädikat eines einzelnen Inhalts, sondern eine relationale Funktion innerhalb einer vermittelten Totalität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD2","text":"Die vollständige Begründung verschiebt den Ursprung des Grundes von einer einfachen Grundlage auf eine Struktur wechselseitiger Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A2","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD3","text":"Das Verhältnis von Grund und Begründetem wird als asymmetrisch gesetzte, aber inhaltlich identische Differenz bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD4","text":"Die Einheit des Grundes ist nicht vor der Vermittlung vorhanden, sondern entsteht nur als Rückkehr aus der Äußerlichkeit in reflektierte Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD5","text":"Bedingung ist die Form, in der die Grundbeziehung ihre eigene Unmittelbarkeit als vorausgesetztes Anderes reproduziert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein erster Grund, der vor aller Beziehung als vollständig bestimmter und unabhängig geltender Inhalt bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell linearer Kausalität, in dem ein Grund ein Begründetes erzeugt, ohne selbst durch eine andere Beziehung bestimmt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Form, die ihren Inhalt bloß ordnet, ohne von ihm als ihrer eigenen Voraussetzung abhängig zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Inhalt, der seine Grundfunktion unabhängig von der Form seiner Setzung und Vermittlung besäße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Identität, die Differenz nicht als aufgehobene, aber erhaltene Äußerlichkeit enthalten müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein schlechthin unmittelbarer Anfang, der nicht bereits als vorausgesetzte und vermittelte Bestimmung zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine endgültige Fundierung, die nicht zugleich die Frage nach dem Grund ihres eigenen Grundcharakters erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Selbstidentität ohne Selbstentzweiung, weil Identität hier nur als Rückkehr aus dem Anderen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Außen der Grundbeziehung, von dem aus Form, Inhalt oder ihre Vermittlung unabhängig begründet werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS1","text":"Äußerliche reale Grundbeziehung → Aufhebung ihres Grundcharakters → Übergang des Grundes auf die Seite des Begründeten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS2","text":"Rückgang des realen Grundes in einen anderen Grund → Wiederherstellung der Identität von Grund und Begründetem → Entstehung vollständiger Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS3","text":"Gemeinsamer Gesamtinhalt → Differenz unmittelbarer und gesetzter Verknüpfung → formeller Unterschied von Grund und Begründetem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS4","text":"Ursprüngliche Verknüpfung im ersten Etwas → vermittelte Setzung im zweiten Etwas → Grund des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS5","text":"Wechselseitige Voraussetzung von Form und Inhalt → Selbstnegation der Unmittelbarkeit → bedingende Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF1","text":"Äußerlicher realer Grund → Selbstaufhebung des Grundcharakters → Rückgang in einen anderen Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF2","text":"Rückgang des realen Grundes → Identität von Grund und Begründetem → vollständige Einheit von formellem und realem Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF3","text":"Einheit des Gesamtinhalts → Zwei Etwas mit verschiedener Beziehungsform → Vermittlung der gesetzten Beziehung durch die ursprüngliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF4","text":"Vermittlung des Begründeten → Vermittlung seines Grundes → Grund des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF5","text":"Selbstbezügliche Totalität → gegenseitige Voraussetzung von Form und Inhalt → bedingende Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME1","text":"Grund und Begründetes werden nicht als getrennte Gegenstände, sondern als unterschiedliche Funktionsstellen desselben vermittelten Inhalts kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von formellem und realem Grund wird von einer Alternative zu zwei untrennbaren Momenten vollständiger Begründung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME3","text":"Unmittelbarkeit erscheint nicht als Anfang jenseits der Vermittlung, sondern als durch Reflexion vorausgesetztes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME4","text":"Das zweite Etwas wird nicht als bloße Wiederholung des ersten, sondern als Ort sichtbar, an dem die ursprüngliche Beziehung als gesetzte Beziehung reproduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME5","text":"Bedingung wird nicht als äußere Vorbedingung, sondern als Selbstverhältnis des Grundes in der Gestalt eines Anderen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das Verhältnis von formellem Grund, realem Grund, Grund, Begründetem und vollständiger Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Grundbeziehung wird als Vermittlungsstruktur gefasst, in der Inhalt, Form, Unmittelbarkeit, Setzung und Reflexion wechselseitig bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse ersetzt die Suche nach einem isolierten Grund durch die Rekonstruktion der Bedingungen, unter denen etwas überhaupt als Grund fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Unmittelbare besitzt keinen unabhängigen Vorrang; es ist als vorausgesetztes Resultat einer reflexiven Rückkehr bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identität ist keine ursprüngliche Einheit, sondern eine Einheit, die sich nur durch Entäußerung, Negation und Rückkehr erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom realen Grund zur vollständigen Grundbeziehung und zur bedingenden Vermittlung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem Kriterium die ursprüngliche Verknüpfung des ersten Etwas selbst gegenüber einem weiteren Grund abschließend ausgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Voraussetzung nicht als zeitlicher Anfang, sondern als reflexive Funktionsbestimmung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation besteht in der Ableitung, dass auch der Grundcharakter des Grundes vermittelt und daher begründungsbedürftig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Bruchlinie entsteht daraus, dass die vollständige Grundbeziehung als Totalität gelten soll, obwohl ihre Form wesentlich auf ein vorausgesetztes Anderes verweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Unmittelbarkeit zugleich aufgehoben, erhalten und als notwendige Voraussetzung der Vermittlung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung nur dann, wenn Selbstnegation nicht als äußerer Defekt, sondern als produktive Bedingung vollständiger Grundbeziehung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114414324235Z_045f786a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Complete Ground.","source_sha256":"ac7169b03120f8f68c377bdd6d80b2fefaf60e3fb744a3872b0126255f9f4c66","sha256":"543f49c8ae412154369547130842d8097fd5c1ab6c9826c22338d913c45322cf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:44:14.333026+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS1","text":"The real ground appears as external reflection and therefore cannot complete the relation of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS2","text":"The sublation of the external ground-relation produces a new ground in which ground and grounded possess the same content and a reflected relation of their determinations of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS3","text":"The complete ground-relation unites formal and real ground by mediating the determinations of content that are initially immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS4","text":"Mediation distributes the same total content across two somethings, whose difference lies solely in the immediate or posited manner of their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AS5","text":"The complete ground-relation becomes conditioning mediation because form and content mutually presuppose one another and each relates to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","text":"The real ground is not a self-sufficient ground-relation, but external and posited reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A2","text":"What appears as a posited ground-relation belongs to the side of the grounded and itself requires another ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","text":"The return of the real ground into its ground restores the identity of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A4","text":"The complete ground-relation contains at once formal ground, real ground, and the mediation of their determinations of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","text":"Formal ground initially possesses the same content on both sides, but this content can determine itself as the doubled content of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A6","text":"Two somethings can possess the same complete content and nevertheless differ in that their determinations of content are connected once immediately and once as posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","text":"A determination of content is the ground of another only insofar as its original connection in a first something mediates the posited connection in the second something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A8","text":"In the second something, not only the posited determination but also the character of the immediate determination as ground is mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","text":"The complete ground-relation is essentially presupposing reflection, because formal ground presupposes content and real ground presupposes form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:A10","text":"The ground mediates itself with itself only by negating its own immediate shape and relating itself to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX1","text":"The real ground is not the absolute relation of the determinations of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX2","text":"The immediate connection of different determinations of content is not their reflected unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX3","text":"The equality of content does not already make ground and grounded identical as relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX4","text":"Ground is not ground in and for itself as immediate form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX5","text":"Real content is not ground independently of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX6","text":"The grounded is not merely an externally appended consequence of an isolated ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:NX7","text":"The completeness of ground is not immediate self-identity, but mediated self-relation through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D1","text":"As an external relation, the real ground loses its ultimate grounding function and itself becomes grounded.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D2","text":"The restoration of the identity of ground and grounded requires a ground that itself contains the relation of the determinations of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D3","text":"Given identical total content, the difference of ground and grounded can appear solely as a difference in the form of relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D4","text":"The relation in the second something has its ground not in its isolated content, but in the original connection of the first something.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D5","text":"The ground of the ground is the original relation through which an immediate determination of content is first determined as ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D6","text":"The complete ground-relation can be reduced neither to form nor to content, because both receive the character of ground only through their mutual presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A4","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:D7","text":"The totality of ground is a self-mediation whose unity consists only in passage through its own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD1","text":"Being-ground is not a fixed predicate of an individual content, but a relational function within a mediated totality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A7","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD2","text":"Complete grounding shifts the origin of ground from a simple basis to a structure of mutual presupposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A2","CH_GB18_CD_2:A8","CH_GB18_CD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD3","text":"The relation of ground and grounded is determined as an asymmetrically posited, yet materially identical, difference.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A5","CH_GB18_CD_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD4","text":"The unity of ground is not present prior to mediation, but arises only as a return from externality into reflected identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A1","CH_GB18_CD_2:A3","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SD5","text":"Condition is the form in which the ground-relation reproduces its own immediacy as a presupposed other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_2:A9","CH_GB18_CD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a first ground that could subsist, prior to all relation, as a fully determined and independently valid content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of linear causality in which a ground produces a grounded without itself being determined through another relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a form that merely orders its content without depending on it as its own presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a content that would possess its grounding function independently of the form of its positing and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an absolute identity that would not have to contain difference as sublated yet preserved externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolutely immediate beginning that does not already return as a presupposed and mediated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is an ultimate foundation that does not at the same time generate the question of the ground of its own character as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX3","text":"Barred is a self-identity without self-division, because identity here exists only as a return from the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:SNX4","text":"Not available is an outside of the ground-relation from which form, content, or their mediation could be independently grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS1","text":"External real ground-relation → sublation of its character as ground → transition of ground to the side of the grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS2","text":"Regression of the real ground into another ground → restoration of the identity of ground and grounded → emergence of the complete ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS3","text":"Common total content → difference of immediate and posited connection → formal difference of ground and grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS4","text":"Original connection in the first something → mediated positing in the second something → ground of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:FGS5","text":"Mutual presupposition of form and content → self-negation of immediacy → conditioning mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF1","text":"External real ground → self-sublation of the character as ground → regression into another ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF2","text":"Regression of the real ground → identity of ground and grounded → complete unity of formal and real ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF3","text":"Unity of total content → two somethings with different forms of relation → mediation of the posited relation through the original one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF4","text":"Mediation of the grounded → mediation of its ground → ground of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:AF5","text":"Self-related totality → mutual presupposition of form and content → conditioning mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME1","text":"Ground and grounded are mapped not as separate objects, but as different functional positions of the same mediated content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME2","text":"The opposition of formal and real ground is reordered from an alternative into two inseparable moments of complete grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME3","text":"Immediacy appears not as a beginning beyond mediation, but as a moment presupposed through reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME4","text":"The second something becomes visible not as a mere repetition of the first, but as the locus in which the original relation is reproduced as a posited relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ME5","text":"Condition is determined not as an external precondition, but as the self-relation of ground in the shape of an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the relation of formal ground, real ground, ground, grounded, and complete ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The ground-relation is conceived as a structure of mediation in which content, form, immediacy, positing, and reflection are mutually determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis replaces the search for an isolated ground with the reconstruction of the conditions under which something functions as ground at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The immediate possesses no independent priority; it is determined as the presupposed result of a reflexive return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identity is not an original unity, but a unity that sustains itself only through externalization, negation, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from real ground to the complete ground-relation and to conditioning mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the criterion by which the original connection of the first something itself is conclusively established in relation to a further ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as presupposition is read not as a temporal beginning, but as a reflexive functional determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation consists in the derivation that even the character of ground of the ground is mediated and therefore requires grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT5","text":"A fault line arises from the fact that the complete ground-relation is supposed to count as totality, although its form essentially refers to a presupposed other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that immediacy is at once sublated, preserved, and treated as a necessary presupposition of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement only if self-negation is understood not as an external defect, but as the productive condition of the complete ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CD_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CD_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 130","title":"c. The Complete Ground.","context":"Chapter 130","original_title":"c. Der vollständige Grund."},"original_title":"c. Der vollständige Grund.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0","layer":"CH","title":"a. The Relatively Unconditioned.","order":131,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DRU0"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DRU0@R001","sha256":"e6a4d8f08133136a8eecc9ed9c18b614e590be5d2ad940f70f477e6626a16680","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, Grund und Bedingung so zu bestimmen, dass ihre Verschiedenheit und ihre notwendige Beziehung zugleich erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS2","text":"Der Text verfährt rekonstruktiv-dialektisch, indem er die Grundbeziehung aus der Reflexionsbewegung selbst entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS3","text":"Der Grund wird als setzende und voraussetzende Reflexion bestimmt, deren eigene Vermittlung ein unmittelbares Dasein voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS4","text":"Dieses unmittelbare Dasein wird als Bedingung bestimmt: als relativ Unbedingtes, das Material und Ansichsein des Grundes bildet, ohne selbst Grund zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Bedingung und Grund erzeugt zugleich eine wechselseitige Äußerlichkeit und eine wesentliche Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung beider Seiten als Widerspruch von selbstständigem Bestehen und bloßem Momentsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A1","text":"Der Grund ist das Unmittelbare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A2","text":"Das Begründete ist das Vermittelte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","text":"Der Grund ist setzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","text":"Der Grund ist voraussetzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","text":"Die Vermittlung vom Unmittelbaren zum Grund ist das eigene Tun des Grundes und keine äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A6","text":"Das unmittelbare Dasein, auf das der Grund sich als Voraussetzung bezieht, ist die Bedingung; der reale Grund ist daher wesentlich bedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A7","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des realen Grundes ist sein Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A8","text":"Die Bedingung ist ein unmittelbares, mannigfaltiges Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","text":"Als Bedingung ist das Dasein auf den Grund als ein Anderes bezogen, bleibt aber an sich unmittelbar und grundlos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","text":"Die Bedingung ist die Voraussetzung des Grundes und bildet als in sich zurückgegangene Formbeziehung dessen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","text":"Der Inhalt der Bedingung ist gegenüber der Form gleichgültig und bildet deshalb zunächst nur das Material des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","text":"Durch den Eintritt in die Grundbeziehung verliert das Dasein seine gleichgültige Unmittelbarkeit und wird Moment eines Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A13","text":"In seiner Unmittelbarkeit bleibt das Dasein für den Grund das Unbedingte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","text":"Die Bedingung ist nicht die negative Selbstbeziehung, Bewegung und Setzung des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A15","text":"Etwas ist nicht durch seine Bedingung allein bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","text":"Die Grundbeziehung ist selbstständige Beziehung auf sich und die ganze Form des Vermittelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A17","text":"Der Inhalt des Grundes ist wesentlich formiert, während der Inhalt der Bedingung unmittelbares Material bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A18","text":"Bedingung und Grund sind gegeneinander gleichgültig und unbedingt, zugleich aber beide vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX1","text":"Die Vermittlung des Grundes ist keine äußere Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX2","text":"Die Bedingung ist nicht der Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX3","text":"Die Bedingung ist nicht die Bewegung des negativen Sichauf-sich-Beziehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX4","text":"Etwas ist nicht durch seine Bedingung allein begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX5","text":"Der unmittelbare Inhalt der Bedingung ist nicht der wesentlich formierte Inhalt des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX6","text":"Das Für-andere-Sein der Bedingung ist keine ursprüngliche Bestimmung ihres unmittelbaren Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX7","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit der Bedingung ist nicht identisch mit ihrer Bestimmung, Bedingung zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX8","text":"Die Bedingung ist nicht reine Selbstständigkeit außerhalb jeder Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX9","text":"Der Grund ist nicht reine Form ohne vorausgesetztes Material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX10","text":"Bedingung und Grund fallen weder in einen einzigen Inhalt noch in eine einzige Form zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D1","text":"Weil der Grund sich selbst voraussetzt und seine Vermittlung selbst vollzieht, ist er nicht unbedingt schlechthin, sondern wesentlich bedingt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D2","text":"Die Bedingung besitzt eine doppelte Bestimmung: Sie ist unmittelbares Dasein für sich und zugleich Moment der Grundbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A8","CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D3","text":"Die Bedingung ist für den Grund relativ unbedingt, obwohl sie als Bedingung selbst eine Voraussetzung hat und dadurch bedingt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A6","CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D4","text":"Der Grund kann nicht auf die Bedingung reduziert werden, weil die Bedingung weder die Reflexionsbewegung noch das Setzen des Grundes vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","CH_GB18_DRU0:A15","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D5","text":"Die Grundbeziehung besitzt gegenüber dem Bedingungsmaterial einen eigenen, formierten Inhalt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D6","text":"Das Material der Bedingung wird erst durch seine Aufnahme in die Grundbeziehung zum Moment des Grundes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D7","text":"Die Verschiedenheit von Bedingung und Grund besteht nicht nur in zwei getrennten Inhalten, sondern in der Differenz von unmittelbarem Material und selbstständiger Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D8","text":"Beide Seiten sind zugleich unabhängig voneinander und wesentliche Momente derselben Grundbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD1","text":"Die Grundbeziehung erzeugt ihre eigene Bedingtheit, indem ihre selbstständige Vermittlung nur durch ein vorausgesetztes unmittelbares Dasein möglich ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD2","text":"Das relativ Unbedingte bezeichnet keinen absoluten Status, sondern die Funktion einer Unmittelbarkeit innerhalb einer bestimmten Grundbeziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","CH_GB18_DRU0:A13","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD3","text":"Die Erklärung kann weder bei der Bedingung als Material noch beim Grund als Form stehenbleiben, weil jede Seite ihre Bestimmung nur durch die andere erhält.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD4","text":"Die scheinbare Unabhängigkeit von Bedingung und Grund ist selbst ein Moment ihrer Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD5","text":"Die Gesamtstruktur macht aus der Differenz von Unmittelbarkeit und Vermittlung einen immanenten Widerspruch statt einer äußeren Gegenüberstellung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD6","text":"Das System ersetzt eine lineare Begründungsordnung durch eine reflexive Struktur, in der der Grund seine Voraussetzung sowohl voraussetzt als auch in sich aufnimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Bedingung als selbstständige Ursache den Grund vollständig liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Grund, der ohne vorausgesetzte Unmittelbarkeit reine Selbstvermittlung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, die außerhalb jeder Vermittlung bestehen und dennoch Bedingung sein könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Inhalt, der unabhängig von jeder Form bereits vollständiger Grundinhalt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Form, die ohne materielles Dasein einen vollständigen Grund bilden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die stabile Trennung von Bedingung und Grund als zweier vollständig unabhängiger Instanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Auflösung des Widerspruchs durch die einseitige Bevorzugung von Bedingung oder Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX8","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein absolutes Unbedingtsein, das keiner relationalen Bestimmung unterliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter Grund, der selbst keiner Voraussetzung und keiner Vermittlung bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine erste, außerhalb der Reflexionsbewegung liegende Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Erklärung, in der Material und Form ohne gegenseitige Differenz unmittelbar identisch wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Bedingung, die zugleich völlig beziehungslos und vollständig erklärend wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Grund, dessen Selbstständigkeit nicht durch eine äußere Voraussetzung gebrochen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX6","text":"Nicht formalisiert ist eine abschließende dritte Instanz, welche den Widerspruch von selbstständigem Bestehen und Momentsein endgültig auflösen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Dasein → setzende und voraussetzende Reflexion → Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS2","text":"Vorausgesetzte Unmittelbarkeit → Bedingung → relativ Unbedingtes für den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS3","text":"Bedingung tritt in die Grundbeziehung ein → Verlust der gleichgültigen Unmittelbarkeit → Material und Moment des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS4","text":"Grundbeziehung als selbstständige Reflexion → Form des Vermittelns → eigener, formierter Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS5","text":"Äußerliche Differenz von Bedingung und Grund + wesentliche Abhängigkeit beider Seiten → gegenseitige Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS6","text":"Gegenseitige Unmittelbarkeit und Unbedingtheit + beiderseitige Vermittlung → Widerspruch von Selbstständigkeit und Momentsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS7","text":"Widerspruch der beiden Seiten → Bestimmung des relativ Unbedingten als relationaler, nicht absoluter Unbedingtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AF1","text":"Unmittelbares und Begründetes → setzende und voraussetzende Reflexion → Bedingung als vorausgesetzte Unmittelbarkeit → relativ Unbedingtes → Unterscheidung von Bedingung und Grund → gegenseitige Äußerlichkeit und wesentliche Vermittlung → Widerspruch von Selbstständigkeit und Momentsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AF2","text":"Bedingung als unmittelbares Material → Aufnahme in die Grundbeziehung → Moment des Grundes; Grund als selbstständige Form → vorausgesetztes Material → zusammenfallende Gegenläufigkeit von Form und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME1","text":"Die Bedingung wird von einem möglichen selbstständigen Erklärungsgrund zu unmittelbarem Material und Ansichsein des Grundes umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME2","text":"Der Grund wird von einer äußerlich voraussetzungslosen Instanz zu einer selbstvermittelnden Reflexionsbeziehung mit notwendiger Voraussetzung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME3","text":"Das Unbedingte wird von einem absoluten Status zu einer relativen Funktion innerhalb einer Grundbeziehung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME4","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Form und Inhalt wird in die Differenz von selbstständiger Grundform und unmittelbarem Bedingungsmaterial überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von unabhängigem Bestehen und bloßem Momentsein wird als gleichzeitige Bestimmung jeder Seite sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME6","text":"Die lineare Ordnung Ursache oder Grund → Bedingung wird durch eine reflexive Ordnung von Voraussetzung, Aufnahme und Selbstvermittlung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist das Verhältnis von Bedingung und Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die zugrunde liegende Struktur ist eine Reflexionsbeziehung, die ihre eigene Voraussetzung als Material voraussetzt und vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse verschiebt die Frage vom isolierten Erklärungsgrund auf die interne Erzeugung und gegenseitige Bestimmung der Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unmittelbarkeit, Bedingtheit und Unbedingtheit sind keine absoluten Seinsweisen, sondern relationale Bestimmungen desselben Daseins innerhalb verschiedener Momente der Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Reflexionsbestimmung des Grundes über die Bedingung bis zum abschließenden Widerspruch zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie eine abschließende Vermittlung des Widerspruchs von Selbstständigkeit und Momentsein aussehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern „unbedingt“ stets relativ zur jeweiligen Grundbeziehung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die gleichzeitige Bestimmung von Bedingung und Grund als äußerlich gleichgültig und wesentlich vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der strikten Unterscheidung zwischen unmittelbarem Material, formiertem Inhalt und Reflexionsbewegung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT6","text":"Die latente Spannung zwischen der Bedingung als Unbedingtem und ihrer eigenen Bedingtheit bleibt bestehen und wird nicht in eine weitere Bestimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT7","text":"Die rekonstruierte Maschine bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: Selbstvermittlung des Grundes → Voraussetzung der Bedingung → relative Unbedingtheit → materielle Aufnahme → immanenter Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115544207164Z_e5ee1793","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The Relatively Unconditioned.","source_sha256":"e6a4d8f08133136a8eecc9ed9c18b614e590be5d2ad940f70f477e6626a16680","sha256":"49231be9aedac957491ba259ee5975045e64ab7a37ba9e0a0e63ad23dcf85c42","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:55:44.208665+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining ground and condition in such a way that their difference and their necessary relation are simultaneously preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS2","text":"The text proceeds reconstructively-dialectically by developing the ground-relation out of the movement of reflection itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS3","text":"Ground is determined as positing and presupposing reflection, whose own mediation presupposes an immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS4","text":"This immediate existence is determined as condition: as the relatively unconditioned, which forms the material and being-in-itself of the ground without itself being ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS5","text":"The distinction between condition and ground simultaneously produces a reciprocal externality and an essential mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the determination of both sides as the contradiction between independent subsistence and being a mere moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A1","text":"Ground is the immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A2","text":"The grounded is the mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","text":"Ground is positing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","text":"Ground is presupposing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","text":"The mediation from the immediate to the ground is the ground's own activity and not an external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A6","text":"The immediate existence to which the ground relates as presupposition is the condition; the real ground is therefore essentially conditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A7","text":"The determinacy of the real ground is its being-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A8","text":"The condition is an immediate, manifold existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","text":"As condition, existence is related to ground as to an other, yet remains immediate and groundless in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","text":"The condition is the presupposition of the ground and, as a form-relation that has returned into itself, constitutes its content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","text":"The content of the condition is indifferent to form and therefore initially constitutes only the material of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","text":"By entering into the ground-relation, existence loses its indifferent immediacy and becomes a moment of an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A13","text":"In its immediacy, existence remains for the ground the unconditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","text":"The condition is not the negative self-relation, movement, and positing of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A15","text":"Something is not determined by its condition alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","text":"The ground-relation is an independent relation to itself and the entire form of mediating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A17","text":"The content of the ground is essentially formed, whereas the content of the condition remains immediate material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:A18","text":"Condition and ground are indifferent and unconditioned with respect to one another, yet both are mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX1","text":"The mediation of the ground is not an external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX2","text":"The condition is not the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX3","text":"The condition is not the movement of negative relating-to-self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX4","text":"Something is not grounded by its condition alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX5","text":"The immediate content of the condition is not the essentially formed content of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX6","text":"The being-for-other of the condition is not an original determination of its immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX7","text":"The immediacy of the condition is not identical with its determination of being condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX8","text":"The condition is not pure independence outside every relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX9","text":"Ground is not pure form without presupposed material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:NX10","text":"Condition and ground do not coincide either in a single content or in a single form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D1","text":"Because ground presupposes itself and itself accomplishes its mediation, it is not unconditioned absolutely, but essentially conditioned.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D2","text":"The condition possesses a twofold determination: it is immediate existence for itself and at the same time a moment of the ground-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A8","CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D3","text":"The condition is relatively unconditioned for the ground, although as condition it itself has a presupposition and is thereby conditioned.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A6","CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D4","text":"Ground cannot be reduced to condition, because condition performs neither the movement of reflection nor the positing of the ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","CH_GB18_DRU0:A15","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D5","text":"The ground-relation possesses, in relation to the conditional material, a content of its own, one that is formed.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D6","text":"The material of the condition becomes a moment of the ground only through its incorporation into the ground-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D7","text":"The difference between condition and ground consists not only in two separate contents, but in the difference between immediate material and independent form.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:D8","text":"Both sides are at once independent of one another and essential moments of the same ground-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD1","text":"The ground-relation generates its own conditionedness insofar as its independent mediation is possible only through a presupposed immediate existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A3","CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD2","text":"The relatively unconditioned designates no absolute status, but the function of an immediacy within a determinate ground-relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A9","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","CH_GB18_DRU0:A13","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD3","text":"Explanation can remain neither with condition as material nor with ground as form, because each side receives its determination only through the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A11","CH_GB18_DRU0:A14","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD4","text":"The apparent independence of condition and ground is itself a moment of their mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD5","text":"The overall structure makes the difference between immediacy and mediation into an immanent contradiction rather than an external opposition.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A16","CH_GB18_DRU0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SD6","text":"The system replaces a linear order of grounding with a reflexive structure in which ground both presupposes its presupposition and takes it up into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DRU0:A4","CH_GB18_DRU0:A5","CH_GB18_DRU0:A10","CH_GB18_DRU0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which the condition, as an independent cause, completely supplies the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a ground that, without presupposed immediacy, would be pure self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a pure immediacy that could subsist outside every mediation and yet be condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a content that, independently of every form, would already be complete ground-content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a form that could constitute a complete ground without material existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the stable separation of condition and ground as two wholly independent instances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX7","text":"Excluded is the resolution of the contradiction through the one-sided privileging of condition or ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:DNX8","text":"Excluded is an absolute unconditionedness that is subject to no relational determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an ultimate ground that itself requires neither presupposition nor mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a first immediacy lying outside the movement of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is an explanation in which material and form would be immediately identical without reciprocal difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a condition that would be at once wholly unrelated and completely explanatory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX5","text":"Unavailable is a ground whose independence is not broken by an external presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:SNX6","text":"Not formalized is a conclusive third instance that would definitively resolve the contradiction between independent subsistence and being a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS1","text":"Immediate existence → positing and presupposing reflection → ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS2","text":"Presupposed immediacy → condition → relatively unconditioned for ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS3","text":"Condition enters into the ground-relation → loss of indifferent immediacy → material and moment of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS4","text":"Ground-relation as independent reflection → form of mediating → content of its own, one that is formed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS5","text":"External difference of condition and ground + essential dependence of both sides → reciprocal mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS6","text":"Reciprocal immediacy and unconditionedness + mutual mediation → contradiction between independence and being a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:FGS7","text":"Contradiction of the two sides → determination of the relatively unconditioned as relational, not absolute, unconditionedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AF1","text":"Immediate and grounded → positing and presupposing reflection → condition as presupposed immediacy → relatively unconditioned → distinction between condition and ground → reciprocal externality and essential mediation → contradiction between independence and being a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:AF2","text":"Condition as immediate material → incorporation into the ground-relation → moment of the ground; ground as independent form → presupposed material → coinciding counter-movement of form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME1","text":"The condition is reclassified from a possible independent explanatory ground into immediate material and being-in-itself of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME2","text":"Ground is remapped from an externally presuppositionless instance into a self-mediating relation of reflection with a necessary presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME3","text":"The unconditioned is transformed from an absolute status into a relative function within a ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME4","text":"The opposition of form and content is transferred into the difference between independent ground-form and immediate conditional material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME5","text":"The opposition of independent subsistence and mere being a moment becomes visible as the simultaneous determination of each side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ME6","text":"The linear order cause or ground → condition is replaced by a reflexive order of presupposition, incorporation, and self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the relation of condition and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The underlying structure is a relation of reflection that presupposes and mediates its own presupposition as material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis shifts the question from the isolated explanatory ground to the internal generation and reciprocal determination of the ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Immediacy, conditionedness, and unconditionedness are not absolute modes of being, but relational determinations of the same existence within different moments of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the determination of ground as reflection through condition to the concluding contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined what a conclusive mediation of the contradiction between independence and being a moment could look like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that “unconditioned” is always understood relative to the respective ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the simultaneous determination of condition and ground as externally indifferent and essentially mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the strict distinction between immediate material, formed content, and the movement of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT6","text":"The latent tension between condition as the unconditioned and its own conditionedness remains and is not carried over into a further determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DRU0:MRT7","text":"The reconstructed machine preserves the actual movement: self-mediation of the ground → presupposition of the condition → relative unconditionedness → material incorporation → immanent contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DRU0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DRU0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DRU0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 131","title":"a. The Relatively Unconditioned.","context":"Chapter 131","original_title":"a. Das relativ Unbedingte."},"original_title":"a. Das relativ Unbedingte.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU","layer":"CH","title":"b. The Absolute Unconditioned.","order":132,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDAU"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDAU@R001","sha256":"b760d99870ee962065ef6f89a07c8446cbcc7a2d57a42f7f1fe9533d75bea7e0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die scheinbare Äußerlichkeit und wechselseitige Abhängigkeit von Bedingung und Grund als unzureichende Form des Unbedingten zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS2","text":"Die Bedingung wird als unmittelbares Daseyn bestimmt, das seiner eigenen Natur nach vermittelte Reflexion, Gesetztseyn und Ansichseyn ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS3","text":"Der Grund wird als selbstbezügliche Reflexion bestimmt, die ihr eigenes Ansichseyn als Bedingung voraussetzt und sich dadurch in ein Anderes entzweit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS4","text":"Bedingung und Grund erweisen sich als identische Momente einer einzigen Form- und Inhaltsganzheit, nicht als selbständige Ursprünge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS5","text":"Das absolut Unbedingte ist die Sache selbst als negative Identität, deren Setzen und Voraussetzen den Schein eines Verhältnisses von Bedingung und Grund aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A1","text":"Unmittelbares Daseyn ist seinem Wesen nach Selbstaufhebung und Werden zum Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Daseyns ist wesentlich vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","text":"Die Bedingung ist gesetztes Ansichseyn und daher selbst Moment einer Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A4","text":"Das Ansichseyn der Bedingung besteht nur durch die Negation ihrer selbst im Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A5","text":"Die Bedingung enthält die ganze Form der Grundbeziehung als vorausgesetztes Ansichseyn und als Gesetztseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A6","text":"Der Grund ist selbstbezügliche Reflexion des Setzens und besitzt sein Ansichseyn und seinen Inhalt in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A7","text":"Der Grund ist zugleich voraussetzende Reflexion und setzt sein eigenes Ansichseyn als Bedingung gegen sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A8","text":"Das unmittelbare Daseyn ist nicht bloß Material, sondern formirte Materie und mit dem Inhalt des Grundes identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","text":"Bedingung und Grund sind als Form und als Inhalt eine wesentliche Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","text":"Die Gegenseitigkeit von Bedingung und Grund setzt ihre eine Identität als ihr Bestehen voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","text":"Das wahrhaft Unbedingte ist die eine Form- und Inhaltseinheit, in der Bedingung und Grund als Momente aufgehoben sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A12","text":"Das absolut Unbedingte ist negative Identität, die sich in Bedingung und Grund entzweit und deren Gegensatz als bloßen Schein aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX1","text":"Die Formbestimmungen von Gesetztseyn und Ansichseyn sind dem unmittelbaren Daseyn nicht äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX2","text":"Die Bedingung ist kein selbständiges, unvermitteltes Daseyn neben dem Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX3","text":"Der Grund ist kein von seiner Bedingung unabhängiger erster Ursprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX4","text":"Das Daseyn ist kein formloses und gleichgültig verfügbares Material der Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX5","text":"Der Fortgang von Bedingung zu weiterer Bedingung folgt nicht aus dem Begriff der Bedingung als solcher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX6","text":"Die Sache entspringt nicht aus einem real selbständigen Verhältnis von Bedingung und Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D1","text":"Die Bedingung ist zugleich dasjenige, was zu Grunde geht, und dasjenige, was sich als Grund zum Gesetztseyn macht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A1","CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","CH_GB18_BDAU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit der Bedingung besitzt nur als aufgehobene Vermittlung den Status eines Ansichseyns.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","CH_GB18_BDAU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D3","text":"Das Voraussetzen des Grundes ist keine äußere Bezugnahme, sondern die Selbstentzweiung seiner eigenen Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A6","CH_GB18_BDAU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D4","text":"Bedingung und Grund teilen notwendig denselben Inhalt, weil das Daseyn nur als mit sich identische Formbeziehung Inhalt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A8","CH_GB18_BDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D5","text":"Die wechselseitige Voraussetzung von Bedingung und Grund ist nur die Erscheinungsform einer einzigen vorausgesetzten Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D6","text":"Die Endlichkeit einer bestimmten Bedingung begründet keine unendliche Regresspflicht, weil die Bedingung als gesetztes Ansichseyn im Absoluten aufgehoben ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD1","text":"Die Unbedingtheit liegt weder vor noch außerhalb der Vermittlung, sondern besteht als deren sich selbst aufhebende immanente Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD2","text":"Die kategoriale Differenz von Bedingung und Grund bleibt nur als notwendiger Selbstunterschied des Absoluten bestehen, nicht als Differenz zweier selbständiger Seiender.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD3","text":"Die Sache selbst ist Ursache ihrer eigenen Bedingungen nur insofern, als ihr Setzen und Voraussetzen eine einheitliche Selbstbewegung bildet.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A7","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD4","text":"Das Verhältnis von Grund und Bedingung wird von einem Entstehungsmodell in ein Modell immanenter Selbstmanifestation überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A5","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein schlechthin unmittelbarer Anfang, der nicht bereits vermittelte und aufgehobene Grundbeziehung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine ontologische Zweiheit, in der Bedingung und Grund einander äußerlich gegenüberstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein kausales Ursprungsmodell, in dem die Sache als Resultat zuvor selbständiger Bedingungen und Gründe erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Unbedingtes, das als ruhender Grund jenseits seiner eigenen Bewegung des Setzens und Voraussetzens existierte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein absoluter Standpunkt außerhalb der Bewegung, durch die das Absolute Bedingung und Grund setzt und aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Trennung von Vermittlung und Unmittelbarkeit, weil jede Unmittelbarkeit als vermittelte bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Behandlung der Sache selbst als ein von ihren Erscheinungsformen ablösbares Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Daseyn → Selbstaufhebung → vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → Bedingung als gesetztes Ansichseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS2","text":"Selbstbezügliche Reflexion → negatives Sichselbstverhalten → Setzung des eigenen Ansichseyns als Anderes → Grund setzt Bedingung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS3","text":"Bedingung als Grundmoment + Grund als voraussetzende Reflexion → Identität von Form und Inhalt → Einheit beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS4","text":"Einheit von Bedingung und Grund → negative Identität → Entzweiung in Momente → Aufhebung des Verhältnisscheins → absolut Unbedingtes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AF1","text":"Äußerlicher Schein von Bedingung und Grund → Immanenz ihrer Formbestimmungen → wechselseitiges Setzen und Voraussetzen → Identität von Inhalt und Form → Aufhebung der Gegenseitigkeit → absolut Unbedingte Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AF2","text":"Relativ-Unbedingtes der Bedingung → Kritik des unendlichen Bedingungsregresses → Aufhebung der Bedingung im Absoluten → Selbstbedingung der Sache als Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird als Resultat von Vermittlung und nicht als deren voraussetzungsloser Gegenpol kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME2","text":"Bedingung und Grund werden von zwei relationalen Termen zu Selbstunterschieden einer einzigen Totalität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME3","text":"Der unendliche Regress verliert seinen Status als notwendige Folge der Bedingtheit und wird an die zusätzliche Bestimmung endlichen Daseyns gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME4","text":"Kausales Hervorgehen wird als Erscheinungsform durch ein Modell der immanenten Selbstbewegung der Sache ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt das Verhältnis von Bedingung, Grund und absolut Unbedingtem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Verhältnis wird als Reflexionsmechanismus rekonstruiert, in dem Setzen und Voraussetzen dieselbe Bewegung bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text neutralisiert den regressiven Zwang, indem er die Frage nach weiteren Bedingungen als falsche Verabsolutierung endlichen Daseyns begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein besitzt keine stabile ursprüngliche Unmittelbarkeit, sondern ist wesentlich Übergang, Negation und Rückkehr in Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Überführung von äußerlicher Bedingungsrelation in immanente Selbstbewegung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die spezifische Bestimmung des endlichen Daseyns zur regressauslösenden Frage nach einer weiteren Bedingung führt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT3","text":"Das System ist kohärent, sofern Setzen und Voraussetzen als zwei Momente einer einzigen Reflexion gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Strukturstelle ist die Identifikation von Unmittelbarkeit als aufgehobener Vermittlung; sie entzieht Bedingung und Grund ihre äußere Selbständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt darin, dass die Totalität zugleich als vorausgesetzt und als durch ihre Momente gesetzt bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Verhältnis von Bedingung und Grund verschwinden soll, aber als notwendige Bewegung des Absoluten weiterhin artikuliert werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn die Identität nicht als statische Einheit, sondern als negative, sich entzweiende und den Schein aufhebende Identität verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112726670939Z_8cfa2249","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The absolutely unconditioned.","source_sha256":"b760d99870ee962065ef6f89a07c8446cbcc7a2d57a42f7f1fe9533d75bea7e0","sha256":"8db017919ac21659bf92ef2bf5aec5fba9e3914e857543c7cd970707de49217b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:27:26.671878+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining the apparent externality and mutual dependence of condition and ground as an inadequate form of the unconditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS2","text":"The condition is determined as immediate Dasein, which by its own nature is mediated reflection, positedness, and being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS3","text":"The ground is determined as self-related reflection, which presupposes its own being-in-itself as condition and thereby divides itself into an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS4","text":"Condition and ground prove to be identical moments of a single totality of form and content, not self-subsistent origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AS5","text":"The absolutely unconditioned is the thing itself as negative identity, whose positing and presupposing sublates the semblance of a relation of condition and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A1","text":"Immediate Dasein is, by its essence, self-sublation and becoming essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","text":"The immediacy of Dasein is essentially mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","text":"The condition is posited being-in-itself and is therefore itself a moment of a ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A4","text":"The being-in-itself of the condition exists only through the negation of itself in the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A5","text":"The condition contains the entire form of the ground-relation as presupposed being-in-itself and as positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A6","text":"The ground is self-related reflection of positing and possesses its being-in-itself and its content within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A7","text":"The ground is at the same time presupposing reflection and posits its own being-in-itself as condition over against itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A8","text":"Immediate Dasein is not merely material, but formed matter and identical with the content of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","text":"Condition and ground are an essential unity as form and as content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","text":"The reciprocity of condition and ground presupposes their one identity as their subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","text":"The truly unconditioned is the one unity of form and content in which condition and ground are sublated as moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:A12","text":"The absolutely unconditioned is negative identity, which divides itself into condition and ground and sublates their opposition as mere semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX1","text":"The determinations of form of positedness and being-in-itself are not external to immediate Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX2","text":"The condition is not a self-subsistent, unmediated Dasein alongside the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX3","text":"The ground is not a first origin independent of its condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX4","text":"Dasein is not formless material, indifferently available to the ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX5","text":"The progression from condition to further condition does not follow from the concept of condition as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:NX6","text":"The thing does not arise from a really self-subsistent relation of condition and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D1","text":"The condition is at once that which goes to ground and that which makes itself, as ground, into positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A1","CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","CH_GB18_BDAU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D2","text":"The immediacy of the condition possesses the status of a being-in-itself only as sublated mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","CH_GB18_BDAU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D3","text":"The presupposing of the ground is not an external reference, but the self-division of its own reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A6","CH_GB18_BDAU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D4","text":"Condition and ground necessarily share the same content, because Dasein is content only as a form-relation identical with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A8","CH_GB18_BDAU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D5","text":"The mutual presupposition of condition and ground is only the form of appearance of a single presupposed identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:D6","text":"The finitude of a determinate condition does not ground an obligation of infinite regress, because the condition as posited being-in-itself is sublated in the absolute.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A3","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD1","text":"Unconditionedness lies neither before nor outside mediation, but consists as its self-sublating immanent unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A2","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD2","text":"The categorial difference of condition and ground persists only as a necessary self-difference of the absolute, not as the difference of two self-subsistent beings.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A9","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD3","text":"The thing itself is the cause of its own conditions only insofar as its positing and presupposing constitute a unified self-movement.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A7","CH_GB18_BDAU:A11","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SD4","text":"The relation of ground and condition is transferred from a model of origination into a model of immanent self-manifestation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDAU:A5","CH_GB18_BDAU:A10","CH_GB18_BDAU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an absolutely immediate beginning that would not already be a mediated and sublated ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an ontological duality in which condition and ground stand externally opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a causal model of origin in which the thing appears as the result of previously self-subsistent conditions and grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an unconditioned that would exist as a resting ground beyond its own movement of positing and presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an absolute standpoint outside the movement through which the absolute posits and sublates condition and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a final separation of mediation and immediacy, because every immediacy is determined as mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is the treatment of the thing itself as a substrate detachable from its forms of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS1","text":"Immediate Dasein → self-sublation → mediated immediacy → condition as posited being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS2","text":"Self-related reflection → negative self-relation → positing of its own being-in-itself as other → ground presupposes condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS3","text":"Condition as ground-moment + ground as presupposing reflection → identity of form and content → unity of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:FGS4","text":"Unity of condition and ground → negative identity → division into moments → sublation of the semblance of relation → absolutely unconditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AF1","text":"External semblance of condition and ground → immanence of their determinations of form → mutual positing and presupposing → identity of content and form → sublation of reciprocity → absolutely unconditioned thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:AF2","text":"Relatively unconditioned character of the condition → critique of infinite regress of conditions → sublation of the condition in the absolute → self-conditioning of the thing as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME1","text":"Immediacy is mapped as the result of mediation and not as its presuppositionless opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME2","text":"Condition and ground are reclassified from two relational terms into self-differences of a single totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME3","text":"Infinite regress loses its status as a necessary consequence of conditionedness and is tied to the additional determination of finite Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ME4","text":"Causal emergence is replaced, as a form of appearance, by a model of the immanent self-movement of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the relation of condition, ground, and the absolutely unconditioned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relation is reconstructed as a mechanism of reflection in which positing and presupposing constitute the same movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text neutralizes the regressive compulsion by delimiting the question of further conditions as a false absolutization of finite Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being possesses no stable original immediacy, but is essentially transition, negation, and return into identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transformation of an external relation of condition into immanent self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the specific determination of finite Dasein leads to the regress-inducing question of a further condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT3","text":"The system is coherent insofar as positing and presupposing count as two moments of a single reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural point is the identification of immediacy as sublated mediation; it deprives condition and ground of their external self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT5","text":"The strongest tension lies in the fact that the totality is determined at once as presupposed and as posited through its moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the relation of condition and ground is supposed to disappear, but must nevertheless continue to be articulated as a necessary movement of the absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDAU:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text only if identity is understood not as static unity, but as negative identity that divides itself and sublates semblance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDAU:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDAU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDAU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 132","title":"b. The Absolute Unconditioned.","context":"Chapter 132","original_title":"b. Das absolute Unbedingte."},"original_title":"b. Das absolute Unbedingte.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Emergence of the Thing into Existence.","order":133,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CHDS"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CHDS@R001","sha256":"8aa9c05df7718a9bfd9ecada3ba8a3fd8367dce72089cae3ef1bc8153de66f61","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die Existenz der Sache zu erklären, ohne sie aus einem ihr äußerlichen Grund, Material oder Anfang abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS2","text":"Die unbedingte Sache ist Grund nur, indem sie sich selbst als Bedingung und unmittelbares Gesetztsein voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS3","text":"Die Bedingungen erscheinen als zerstreute Äußerlichkeit, sind aber der vollständige Inhalt der Sache in der Form aufgehobener Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung von Bedingungen zu Grund und von Grund zu Bedingungen ist eine Selbstbewegung der Sache, nicht eine Fremdbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS5","text":"Mit der Vollständigkeit der Bedingungen verschwinden Bedingung und Grund als selbständige Vermittlungsinstanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS6","text":"Existenz ist die unmittelbare Selbsterscheinung der Sache, vermittelt allein durch das Verschwinden ihrer Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","text":"Das absolut Unbedingte ist der mit seiner Bedingung identische absolute Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","text":"Der Grund setzt sich negativ zu sich selbst und macht sich dadurch zum Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","text":"Das Gesetztsein des Grundes ist die Bedingung als reflexionslose Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","text":"Die Bedingungen enthalten den ganzen Inhalt der Sache in der Form formlosen und äußerlichen Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A5","text":"Das bedingende Dasein wird nicht von einem Anderen als Material gebraucht, sondern macht sich selbst zum Moment eines Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A6","text":"Das Werden der Bedingungen ist das Tun der Reflexion und ihr Zurückgehen in den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","text":"Grund und Bedingungen sind Momente einer einzigen Selbstvermittlung der absoluten Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","text":"Wenn die Totalität der Bedingungen vorhanden ist, hebt sie sich als unmittelbare Voraussetzung auf und setzt den Grund als aufgehobenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","text":"Der Grund begründet nur, indem er als vom Begründeten verschiedener Grund verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A10","text":"Existenz ist die durch die Aufhebung von Grund und Bedingung mit sich identische Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX1","text":"Die Bedingung ist nicht ein äußerlich vorhandenes Material, das von einem fremden Grund verwendet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Daseins ist nicht das wahrhaft Erste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX3","text":"Das Werden der Sache ist nicht ein zeitliches Anfangen aus einer selbständigen Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX4","text":"Der Grund bleibt nicht als tragendes Substrat unter oder außerhalb der hervorgegangenen Sache zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX5","text":"Die Vermittlung ist nicht ein bleibendes Drittes zwischen Grund, Bedingungen und Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX6","text":"Die Vielheit der Bedingungen ist nicht eine selbständige Vielheit außer der Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX7","text":"Existenz ist nicht grundlos im Sinn bloßer Zufälligkeit, sondern grundlos als aufgehobene Grundbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D1","text":"Die Wahrheit der Bedingung besteht darin, Moment der Selbstreflexion der Sache zu sein.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A5","CH_GB18_CHDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D2","text":"Die äußerliche Mannigfaltigkeit der Bedingungen ist der Schein einer auseinandergetretenen Einheit der Sache.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D3","text":"Die Vollständigkeit der Bedingungen bezeichnet keine bloße Addition von Umständen, sondern die Gegenwart der ganzen Sache in äußerlicher Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D4","text":"Das Hervortreten der Sache ist keine Wirkung eines fortbestehenden Grundes, sondern die Selbstaufhebung des Grundes in seine eigene Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D5","text":"Die Vermittlung der Existenz ist wirksam nur als ihre eigene Tilgung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D6","text":"Die Sache ist zugleich unbedingte Wesentlichkeit und grundlose Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD1","text":"Die Grundlosigkeit der Existenz ist keine Abwesenheit von Bestimmung, sondern die vollzogene Selbstnegation jeder äußerlichen Begründungsform.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD2","text":"Die Differenz von Grund und Bedingung besitzt nur einen transitorischen Status innerhalb der Selbstbewegung derselben Sache.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD3","text":"Die Existenz verwandelt die scheinbar äußere Sphäre des Seins in die immanente Erscheinungsform der absoluten Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A6","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD4","text":"Das Erklären der Existenz erreicht seinen Abschluss nur durch die Aufhebung der Unterscheidung zwischen erklärendem Grund und erklärter Sache.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Bedingungen der Sache ontologisch vorausliegen und ihre Existenz unabhängig erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem der Grund als unveränderte Ursache der Sache bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Vermittlung eine dauerhafte Relation zwischen bereits selbständigen Termen bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem das Unbedingte außerhalb seiner Bedingungen oder jenseits seiner Existenz lokalisierbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Unmittelbarkeit der Existenz ohne zuvor aufgehobene Reflexion gedacht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein letzter Anfang, der selbst nicht als gesetzte Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein letzter Grund, der die Sache begründet, ohne in ihrem Hervorgang selbst zu verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine bleibende Außenbeziehung zwischen Wesen und Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Existenz, deren Unmittelbarkeit von der Negativität ihrer eigenen Hervorbringung abtrennbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS1","text":"Unbedingte Sache = mit ihrer Bedingung identischer Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS2","text":"Selbstnegative Grundbeziehung → Setzen des Grundes als unmittelbare Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS3","text":"Gesetzte Bedingung → äußerliche Mannigfaltigkeit des vollständigen Inhalts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS4","text":"Äußerliche Mannigfaltigkeit → immanentes Werden → Rückgang in den Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS5","text":"Vollständigkeit der Bedingungen → Aufhebung ihrer unmittelbaren Selbständigkeit und Setzung des aufgehobenen Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS6","text":"Aufhebung von Bedingungen und Grund → Verschwinden der Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS7","text":"Verschwundene Vermittlung → mit sich identische Unmittelbarkeit = Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF1","text":"Die äußerliche Bedingtheit der Sache erscheint als Problem einer Abhängigkeit von Anderem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF2","text":"Die Bedingung wird als Selbstsetzung des mit ihr identischen Grundes neubestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF3","text":"Die zerstreute Vielheit der Bedingungen wird als vollständiger, aber äußerlich gewordener Inhalt der Sache bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF4","text":"Das Werden der Bedingungen wird als Rückkehr der Sache aus ihrer gesetzten Äußerlichkeit in den Grund bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF5","text":"Die Anwesenheit aller Bedingungen hebt Bedingung und Grund als gesonderte Vermittlungen auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF6","text":"Die aufgehobene Vermittlung schlägt in das unmittelbare Hervortreten der Sache zur Existenz um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME1","text":"Grund und Bedingung werden von getrennten Erklärungspolen zu entgegengesetzten Momenten derselben Selbstreflexion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME2","text":"Die Sphäre des Seins wird von einer vorausliegenden ontologischen Region zur gesetzten Erscheinungsform des Wesens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME3","text":"Die Vollständigkeit der Bedingungen wird von empirischer Umstandssumme zu reflexiver Totalität transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME4","text":"Grundlosigkeit wird von Begründungsmangel zu einer Bestimmung der vollendeten Selbstvermittlung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME5","text":"Existenz wird nicht als Beginn nach der Vermittlung, sondern als deren aufgehobenes Resultat sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Sache tritt in die Existenz, wenn ihre Bedingungen vollständig vorhanden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Bedingungen, Grund und gesetztes Sein sind Funktionen einer einzigen reflexiven Bewegung und keine selbständigen Entitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung einer Sache wird von äußerer Kausalzuweisung auf die Rekonstruktion ihrer immanenten Selbstaufhebung verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das wahrhaft Erste ist nicht unmittelbarer Anfang, sondern die sich selbst voraussetzende und ihre Voraussetzung aufhebende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Existenz besitzt die Form unmittelbarer Gegenwart nur, weil ihre genetische Vermittlung in ihr verschwunden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von unbedingter Sache über Bedingung und Grund zur Existenz zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem Kriterium die empirisch oder begrifflich gegebene Totalität der Bedingungen als vollständig gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, dass Gesetztsein, Bedingung, Grundlosigkeit und Existenz als verschiedene Stadien derselben Reflexion gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Strukturleistung liegt in der Aufhebung der Alternative zwischen äußerer Kausalität und grundloser Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT5","text":"Die Hauptspannung liegt darin, dass der Grund zugleich notwendige Erklärungsfunktion und zu verschwindender Schein sein muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Bedingungen als vollständiger Inhalt gelten, obwohl sie zunächst als gleichgültige und mit Außerwesentlichem vermischte Mannigfaltigkeit auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn das Verschwinden der Vermittlung nicht als Wegfall, sondern als ihre vollendete Wirksamkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114622385411Z_affafdec","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. Emergence of the Thing into Existence.","source_sha256":"8aa9c05df7718a9bfd9ecada3ba8a3fd8367dce72089cae3ef1bc8153de66f61","sha256":"b4e780fade078e6cbacf5f914a1edda4b0a50a62e16f3f42ae0d8e922bda1dac","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:46:22.387556+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS1","text":"The problem consists in explaining the existence of the thing without deriving it from a ground, material, or beginning external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS2","text":"The unconditioned thing is ground only insofar as it presupposes itself as condition and immediate positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS3","text":"The conditions appear as dispersed externality, but they are the complete content of the thing in the form of sublated reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS4","text":"The movement from conditions to ground and from ground to conditions is a self-movement of the thing, not an external determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS5","text":"With the completeness of the conditions, condition and ground disappear as independent mediating instances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AS6","text":"Existence is the immediate self-appearance of the thing, mediated solely through the disappearance of its mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","text":"The absolutely unconditioned is the absolute ground identical with its condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","text":"The ground relates itself negatively to itself and thereby makes itself into positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","text":"The positedness of the ground is condition as reflectionless immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","text":"The conditions contain the entire content of the thing in the form of formless and external being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A5","text":"Conditioning determinate being is not used by another as material, but makes itself into a moment of another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A6","text":"The becoming of the conditions is the doing of reflection and its return into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","text":"Ground and conditions are moments of a single self-mediation of the absolute thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","text":"When the totality of the conditions is present, it sublates itself as immediate presupposition and posits the ground as sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","text":"The ground grounds only insofar as it disappears as a ground distinct from that which is grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:A10","text":"Existence is immediacy identical with itself through the sublation of ground and condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX1","text":"The condition is not externally available material used by an alien ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX2","text":"The immediacy of determinate being is not the truly first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX3","text":"The becoming of the thing is not a temporal beginning from an independent immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX4","text":"The ground does not remain behind as a supporting substrate beneath or outside the emerged thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX5","text":"Mediation is not an abiding third between ground, conditions, and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX6","text":"The multiplicity of conditions is not an independent multiplicity outside the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:NX7","text":"Existence is not groundless in the sense of mere contingency, but groundless as a sublated relation of ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D1","text":"The truth of condition consists in being a moment of the self-reflection of the thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A5","CH_GB18_CHDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D2","text":"The external multiplicity of conditions is the semblance of a unity of the thing that has fallen apart.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D3","text":"The completeness of the conditions designates not a mere addition of circumstances, but the presence of the entire thing in external form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D4","text":"The emergence of the thing is not an effect of a persisting ground, but the self-sublation of the ground into its own immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D5","text":"The mediation of existence is efficacious only as its own effacement.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:D6","text":"The thing is at once unconditioned essentiality and groundless existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD1","text":"The groundlessness of existence is not an absence of determination, but the accomplished self-negation of every external form of grounding.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A2","CH_GB18_CHDS:A8","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD2","text":"The difference between ground and condition has only a transitory status within the self-movement of the same thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A1","CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD3","text":"Existence transforms the seemingly external sphere of being into the immanent form of appearance of absolute reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A3","CH_GB18_CHDS:A4","CH_GB18_CHDS:A6","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SD4","text":"The explanation of existence reaches its completion only through the sublation of the distinction between explaining ground and explained thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_CHDS:A7","CH_GB18_CHDS:A9","CH_GB18_CHDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which conditions ontologically precede the thing and independently produce its existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which the ground remains as the unaltered cause of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which mediation forms a lasting relation between terms that are already independent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model in which the unconditioned could be located outside its conditions or beyond its existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a model in which the immediacy of existence can be thought without previously sublated reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final beginning that would not itself be determined as posited immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a final ground that grounds the thing without itself disappearing in its emergence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is an abiding external relation between essence and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible is an existence whose immediacy would be separable from the negativity of its own production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS1","text":"Unconditioned thing = ground identical with its condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS2","text":"Self-negative relation of ground → positing of the ground as immediate condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS3","text":"Posited condition → external multiplicity of the complete content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS4","text":"External multiplicity → immanent becoming → return into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS5","text":"Completeness of the conditions → sublation of their immediate independence and positing of the sublated ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS6","text":"Sublation of conditions and ground → disappearance of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:FGS7","text":"Disappeared mediation → immediacy identical with itself = existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF1","text":"The external conditionedness of the thing appears as the problem of a dependence on another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF2","text":"The condition is redetermined as the self-positing of the ground identical with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF3","text":"The dispersed multiplicity of conditions is determined as the complete, but externally become, content of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF4","text":"The becoming of the conditions is determined as the return of the thing from its posited externality into ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF5","text":"The presence of all conditions sublates condition and ground as distinct mediations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:AF6","text":"Sublated mediation turns into the immediate emergence of the thing into existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME1","text":"Ground and condition are remapped from separate explanatory poles into opposed moments of the same self-reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME2","text":"The sphere of being is reclassified from a preceding ontological region into the posited form of appearance of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME3","text":"The completeness of the conditions is transformed from an empirical sum of circumstances into a reflexive totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME4","text":"Groundlessness is shifted from a lack of grounding to a determination of completed self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ME5","text":"Existence becomes visible not as a beginning after mediation, but as its sublated result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT1","text":"Surface — A thing enters into existence when its conditions are completely present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Conditions, ground, and posited being are functions of a single reflective movement and not independent entities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation of a thing is shifted from external causal attribution to the reconstruction of its immanent self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The truly first is not immediate beginning, but reflection that presupposes itself and sublates its presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Existence possesses the form of immediate presence only because its genetic mediation has disappeared within it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from unconditioned thing through condition and ground to existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what criterion the empirically or conceptually given totality of conditions counts as complete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT3","text":"The internal coherence rests on positedness, condition, groundlessness, and existence being regarded as different stages of the same reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural achievement lies in the sublation of the alternative between external causality and groundless immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT5","text":"The principal tension lies in the fact that the ground must be at once a necessary explanatory function and a semblance that must disappear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the conditions count as complete content, although they initially appear as an indifferent multiplicity mixed with what is inessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CHDS:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the disappearance of mediation is understood not as its omission, but as its completed efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CHDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CHDS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CHDS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 133","title":"c. The Emergence of the Thing into Existence.","context":"Chapter 133","original_title":"c. Hervorgang der Sache in die Existenz."},"original_title":"c. Hervorgang der Sache in die Existenz.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE","layer":"CH","title":"Second Section. Appearance.","order":134,"parents":["RAW_GB18_ZADE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_ZADE@R001","sha256":"5668fd5bb734dcae2323119c489beb2be245daf968a91a94c3a445689309054b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist die Bestimmung, wie das absolute, negative Seyn als Wesen in die Form des Erscheinens übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS2","text":"Das Seyn wird als seine eigene Aufhebung neubestimmt und dadurch zum Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS3","text":"Das Wesen setzt sich durch Reflexion als Existenz und Ding in die Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS4","text":"Die aufhebende Negativität der Unmittelbarkeit erzeugt die Erscheinung als Wahrheit des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS5","text":"Erscheinendes und wesentliches Seyn werden im wesentlichen Verhältnis vermittelt; dessen Vollendung ist Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung ist dialektisch-rekonstruktiv: absolute Abstraktion → Wesen → Existenz → Erscheinung → Verhältnis → Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A1","text":"Das Seyn ist die absolute Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","text":"Die Negativität des Seyns ist ihm immanent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","text":"Das Seyn ist als sich aufhebendes Seyn Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A4","text":"Das Wesen ist als einfache Gleichheit mit sich wiederum Seyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","text":"Die Reflexion ist das Scheinen des Wesens in ihm selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A6","text":"Die Bestimmungen der Reflexion bestehen nur als gesetzte und aufgehobene Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","text":"Der Grund bestimmt sich durch eine sich selbst aufhebende und in sich zurückkehrende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A8","text":"Die in der Grundreflexion aufgehobene Andersheit wird zur Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","text":"Die zur Unmittelbarkeit fortgegangene Wesenheit ist zunächst Existenz oder Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A10","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit des Dings hebt sich aufgrund seines reflexiven Grundes selbst auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A11","text":"Die Existenz wird dadurch zum gesetzten Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","text":"Die Erscheinung ist die in das Anderssein reflektierte Existenz und die Wahrheit des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A13","text":"Das Erscheinende und das wesentliche Seyn stehen notwendig in Beziehung zueinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","text":"Das wesentliche Verhältnis ist die unvollkommene Vereinigung der Reflexion ins Anderssein und der Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A15","text":"Wirklichkeit ist die vollständige Durchdringung beider Reflexionsrichtungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX1","text":"Das Seyn ist nicht durch eine ihm äußerliche Negativität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX2","text":"Das Wesen ist nicht ein vom Seyn getrenntes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX3","text":"Die Reflexionsbestimmungen sind nicht selbständige, unmittelbare Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX4","text":"Das Ding besitzt keine unaufhebbare Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX5","text":"Die Erscheinung ist nicht bloßer Schein ohne Wahrheitsgehalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX6","text":"Das wesentliche Seyn ist nicht von seiner Erscheinung isoliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX7","text":"Das Verhältnis ist noch nicht die vollständige Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D1","text":"Die absolute Abstraktion des Seyns erzeugt seine Selbstaufhebung als notwendige Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A1","CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","CH_GB18_ZADE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D2","text":"Die Selbstaufhebung des Seyns schlägt in die Gleichheit des Wesens mit sich selbst um.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","CH_GB18_ZADE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D3","text":"Reflexion erzeugt keine äußerliche Form, sondern das Scheinen des Wesens innerhalb seiner eigenen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","CH_GB18_ZADE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D4","text":"Der Grund gewinnt Realität, indem seine Reflexion ihre eigene gesetzte Bestimmung aufhebt und in sich zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A6","CH_GB18_ZADE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D5","text":"Die Aufhebung der Andersheit innerhalb des Grundes lässt die Formbestimmungen als Existenz hervortreten.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D6","text":"Das Ding ist zunächst die ununterschiedene Einheit von Wesen und Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D7","text":"Weil die Unmittelbarkeit des Dings durch Reflexion begründet ist, verwandelt sie sich in Gesetztsein.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A10","CH_GB18_ZADE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D8","text":"Die gesetzte Existenz wird als Erscheinung zur Wahrheit des Dings.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A11","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D9","text":"Die Erscheinung überschreitet ihre einzelne Setzung, indem sie sich in ihre Unendlichkeit fortbestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D10","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Erscheinungswelt und an-sich-seiender Welt bleibt durch ihre gegenseitige Beziehung vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D11","text":"Das Erscheinen des Wesentlichen und das Ins-Erscheinen-Treten des Wesens bilden ein wesentliches Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D12","text":"Wirklichkeit entsteht erst, wenn Reflexion-ins-Anderssein und Reflexion-in-sich vollständig ineinandergreifen.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","CH_GB18_ZADE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD1","text":"Das System konstituiert Unmittelbarkeit nicht als Anfangszustand, sondern als Resultat einer vorausliegenden Negativität und Reflexion.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD2","text":"Erscheinung wird zur notwendigen Vermittlungsform, in der Wesen und Anderssein zugleich getrennt und aufeinander bezogen sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13","CH_GB18_ZADE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD3","text":"Das Wahrheitskriterium des Dings liegt nicht hinter der Erscheinung, sondern in der strukturellen Einheit von Erscheinung und Wesen.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD4","text":"Die dialektische Bewegung erzeugt ihre Gegenstände stufenweise: Wesen setzt Existenz, Existenz setzt Erscheinung, Erscheinung setzt Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","CH_GB18_ZADE:A8","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD5","text":"Wirklichkeit ist keine zusätzliche Sphäre neben Erscheinung und Wesen, sondern die Vollendung ihrer wechselseitigen Durchdringung.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","CH_GB18_ZADE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine von ihrer eigenen Negativität unabhängige Identität des Seyns aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine statische, vorreflexive Unmittelbarkeit als zureichenden Seinsmodus aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen Grund aus, der seine Bestimmungen äußerlich hervorbringt, ohne sie selbst aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Erscheinung aus, die lediglich eine subjektive oder zufällige Oberfläche des Dings wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX5","text":"Es schließt ein an sich seiendes Wesen aus, das keinerlei konstitutive Beziehung zu seiner Erscheinung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Identifikation des wesentlichen Verhältnisses mit bereits vollendeter Wirklichkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Wirklichkeit, deren Wesen ohne Erscheinung und deren Erscheinung ohne Wesen bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein unmittelbarer Zugang zu einem vom Erscheinen abgetrennten An-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine letzte Ontologie isolierter Substanzen; Sein ist nur als vermittelte Selbstaufhebung und Beziehung bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit eines außervermittelten Absoluten strukturiert die gesamte Bewegung von Wesen zu Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS1","text":"Absolute Abstraktion + immanente Negativität → Selbstaufhebung des Seyns → Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS2","text":"Wesen als Gleichheit mit sich + Reflexion → gesetzte und aufgehobene Bestimmungen → Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS3","text":"Grundreflexion → Aufhebung der Andersheit → Existenz als aus Negativität hervorgegangene Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS4","text":"Reflexiver Grund + instabile Unmittelbarkeit → Ding als Gesetztsein → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS5","text":"Erscheinung als reflektierte Existenz → Überschreitung in die Unendlichkeit → Gegenüber von Erscheinungswelt und an-sich-seiender Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS6","text":"Erscheinendes ↔ wesentliches Seyn → unvollkommenes Verhältnis → vollständige Durchdringung → Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF1","text":"Absolute Abstraktion → immanente Negativität → sich aufhebendes Seyn → Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF2","text":"Wesen → Reflexion in sich → Grund → reale Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF3","text":"Grund → Aufhebung der Andersheit → Existenz → Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF4","text":"Dingliche Unmittelbarkeit → Selbstaufhebung → Gesetztsein → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF5","text":"Erscheinung → reflektierte Existenz → Unendlichkeit → Beziehung zur wesentlichen Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF6","text":"Erscheinendes und Wesentliches → wesentliches Verhältnis → Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit wird von einem ursprünglichen Gegebenen zu einem reflexiv erzeugten Resultat umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME2","text":"Erscheinung wird von einer bloßen Oberfläche zur Wahrheitsform des Dings umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME3","text":"Die Opposition von Erscheinungswelt und an-sich-seiender Welt wird als Verhältnis statt als absolute Trennung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME4","text":"Wesen und Existenz werden nicht als getrennte Sphären, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Bestimmungen derselben negativen Bewegung angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME5","text":"Wirklichkeit wird als Relationsvollendung und nicht als jenseitige Ergänzung der Erscheinung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Das Ding geht aus der Unmittelbarkeit in die Erscheinung über; die Erscheinung zeigt das Wesentliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Reflexion hebt Unmittelbarkeit auf, setzt sie als Existenz und organisiert sie als Verhältnis von Erscheinendem und Wesentlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Gegensatz zwischen Schein und Wahrheit wird so neu gerahmt, dass Wahrheit nur durch die Vermittlung des Erscheinens bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein ist eine genetische Folge von Negativität, Selbstaufhebung, Existenz, Erscheinung und Wirklichkeit; jede spätere Bestimmung bewahrt die aufgehobene frühere in veränderter Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung vom Seyn zur Wirklichkeit formal zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die vollständige Wirklichkeit über die bloße Bestimmung ihrer Durchdringung hinaus konkret gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Negativität, Reflexion und Aufhebung als kontinuierliche Generationsoperatoren behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung der Erscheinung aus der Selbstaufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Erscheinung als Wahrheit des Dings und der Gegenüberstellung von Erscheinungswelt und an-sich-seiender Welt bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das wesentliche Verhältnis bereits die Einheit von Anderssein und Reflexion bezeichnet, aber noch als unvollkommen gegenüber der Wirklichkeit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Differenz zwischen Verhältnis und Wirklichkeit als graduelle Vollendung und nicht als neuer ontologischer Bereich gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T120227969325Z_b9eee0bb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Second Section. Appearance.","source_sha256":"5668fd5bb734dcae2323119c489beb2be245daf968a91a94c3a445689309054b","sha256":"1846a2431d46aa49e9290fd3e44cb64f7208941d709317e3cfe5590f65c1f492","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T12:02:27.970538+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS1","text":"The problem is the determination of how absolute, negative Being (Seyn), as essence, passes into the form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS2","text":"Being (Seyn) is redetermined as its own sublation and thereby becomes essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS3","text":"Through reflection, essence posits itself into immediacy as existence and thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS4","text":"The sublating negativity of immediacy generates appearance as the truth of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS5","text":"The appearing and essential Being (Seyn) are mediated in the essential relation; its completion is actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AS6","text":"The argumentative movement is dialectical-reconstructive: absolute abstraction → essence → existence → appearance → relation → actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A1","text":"Being (Seyn) is absolute abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","text":"The negativity of Being (Seyn) is immanent to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","text":"Being (Seyn), as self-sublating Being, is essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A4","text":"Essence, as simple equality with itself, is in turn Being (Seyn).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","text":"Reflection is the shining of essence within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A6","text":"The determinations of reflection subsist only as posited and sublated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","text":"Ground determines itself through a reflection that sublates itself and returns into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A8","text":"The otherness sublated in ground-reflection becomes existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","text":"Essence that has proceeded to immediacy is initially existence or thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A10","text":"The immediacy of the thing sublates itself on account of its reflective ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A11","text":"Existence thereby becomes posited being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","text":"Appearance is existence reflected into other-being and the truth of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A13","text":"The appearing and essential Being (Seyn) necessarily stand in relation to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","text":"The essential relation is the incomplete union of reflection into other-being and reflection into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:A15","text":"Actuality is the complete interpenetration of both directions of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX1","text":"Being (Seyn) is not determined by a negativity external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX2","text":"Essence is not a being separate from Being (Seyn).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX3","text":"The determinations of reflection are not independent, immediate determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX4","text":"The thing possesses no unsublatable immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX5","text":"Appearance is not mere semblance without truth-content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX6","text":"Essential Being (Seyn) is not isolated from its appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:NX7","text":"The relation is not yet complete actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D1","text":"The absolute abstraction of Being (Seyn) generates its self-sublation as a necessary determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A1","CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","CH_GB18_ZADE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D2","text":"The self-sublation of Being (Seyn) reverses into the equality of essence with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","CH_GB18_ZADE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D3","text":"Reflection generates no external form, but rather the shining of essence within its own unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","CH_GB18_ZADE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D4","text":"Ground gains reality by having its reflection sublate its own posited determination and return into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A6","CH_GB18_ZADE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D5","text":"The sublation of otherness within ground allows the determinations of form to emerge as existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D6","text":"The thing is initially the undifferentiated unity of essence and immediacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D7","text":"Because the immediacy of the thing is grounded through reflection, it transforms into positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A10","CH_GB18_ZADE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D8","text":"Posited existence becomes, as appearance, the truth of the thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A11","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D9","text":"Appearance surpasses its singular positing by further determining itself into its infinity.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D10","text":"The difference between the world of appearance and the world that is in itself remains mediated through their reciprocal relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D11","text":"The appearance of the essential and the emergence of essence into appearance constitute an essential relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:D12","text":"Actuality arises only when reflection-into-other-being and reflection-into-itself completely interlock.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","CH_GB18_ZADE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD1","text":"The system constitutes immediacy not as an initial state, but as the result of a preceding negativity and reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A2","CH_GB18_ZADE:A7","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD2","text":"Appearance becomes the necessary form of mediation in which essence and other-being are at once separated and related to one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A5","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13","CH_GB18_ZADE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD3","text":"The criterion of truth of the thing lies not behind appearance, but in the structural unity of appearance and essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD4","text":"The dialectical movement generates its objects stepwise: essence posits existence, existence posits appearance, appearance posits relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A3","CH_GB18_ZADE:A8","CH_GB18_ZADE:A9","CH_GB18_ZADE:A12","CH_GB18_ZADE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SD5","text":"Actuality is not an additional sphere alongside appearance and essence, but the completion of their reciprocal interpenetration.","refs":["CH_GB18_ZADE:A14","CH_GB18_ZADE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an identity of Being (Seyn) independent of its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX2","text":"It excludes a static, pre-reflective immediacy as a sufficient mode of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX3","text":"It excludes a ground that externally produces its determinations without itself sublating them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX4","text":"It excludes an appearance that would merely be a subjective or contingent surface of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX5","text":"It excludes an essence that is in itself and possesses no constitutive relation whatsoever to its appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:DNX6","text":"It excludes the identification of the essential relation with already completed actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an actuality whose essence could subsist without appearance and whose appearance could subsist without essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is immediate access to an in-itself separated from appearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an ultimate ontology of isolated substances; being can be determined only as mediated self-sublation and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility of an absolute without mediation structures the entire movement from essence to actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS1","text":"Absolute abstraction + immanent negativity → self-sublation of Being (Seyn) → essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS2","text":"Essence as equality with itself + reflection → posited and sublated determinations → ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS3","text":"Ground-reflection → sublation of otherness → existence as immediacy that has emerged from negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS4","text":"Reflective ground + unstable immediacy → thing as positedness → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS5","text":"Appearance as reflected existence → surpassing into infinity → opposition of the world of appearance and the world that is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:FGS6","text":"Appearing ↔ essential Being (Seyn) → incomplete relation → complete interpenetration → actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF1","text":"Absolute abstraction → immanent negativity → self-sublating Being (Seyn) → essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF2","text":"Essence → reflection into itself → ground → real determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF3","text":"Ground → sublation of otherness → existence → thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF4","text":"Thingly immediacy → self-sublation → positedness → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF5","text":"Appearance → reflected existence → infinity → relation to the essential world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:AF6","text":"Appearing and essential → essential relation → actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME1","text":"Immediacy is reclassified from something originally given into a reflexively generated result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME2","text":"Appearance is remapped from a mere surface into the truth-form of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME3","text":"The opposition of the world of appearance and the world that is in itself becomes intelligible as relation rather than as absolute separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME4","text":"Essence and existence are arranged not as separate spheres, but as successive determinations of the same negative movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ME5","text":"Actuality is determined as the completion of relation and not as a transcendent supplement to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The thing passes from immediacy into appearance; appearance shows the essential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Reflection sublates immediacy, posits it as existence, and organizes it as a relation of the appearing and the essential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The opposition between semblance and truth is thus reframed so that truth can be determined only through the mediation of appearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is a genetic sequence of negativity, self-sublation, existence, appearance, and actuality; every later determination preserves the sublated earlier one in altered form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient formally to reconstruct the movement from Being (Seyn) to actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how complete actuality is concretely apprehended beyond the mere determination of its interpenetration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as negativity, reflection, and sublation are treated as continuous operators of generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of appearance from the self-sublation of immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between appearance as the truth of the thing and the opposition of the world of appearance and the world that is in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the essential relation already designates the unity of other-being and reflection, yet is still regarded as incomplete in comparison with actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_ZADE:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the difference between relation and actuality is read as gradual completion and not as a new ontological domain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_ZADE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_ZADE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_ZADE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 134","title":"Second Section. Appearance.","context":"Chapter 134","original_title":"Zweiter Abschnitt. Die Erscheinung."},"original_title":"Zweiter Abschnitt. Die Erscheinung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Thing and Its Properties.","order":135,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DDUS"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DDUS@R001","sha256":"d2950dd882b62498fa411cb0f6ed977f6735b4ae61499ee572e941321de78107","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS1","text":"Die Existenz soll als Wahrheit des Seyns bestimmt werden, ohne in bloße erste Unmittelbarkeit oder bloßes Gesetztsein zu zerfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS2","text":"Der Text verfährt rekonstruktiv von Grund, Bedingung und Vermittlung zu ihrer Selbstaufhebung als hervorgebrachter Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS3","text":"Die Gottesbeweise exponieren die Differenz zwischen einem bloßen Erkenntnisgrund und der im Wesen selbst wirksamen Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS4","text":"Das Ende der Vermittlung wird als negativer Grund bestimmt, der nicht Nichts erzeugt, sondern das unmittelbare Seyende freisetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS5","text":"Die Existenz wird als Übergang des Wesens in seine absolute Entäußerung bestimmt, nicht als dem Wesen äußerlich zukommendes Prädikat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS6","text":"Die selbstidentische Vermittlung der Existenz bestimmt sich als negative Einheit, Existirendes und Ding; die Differenz von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Existenz wird darin als immanente Analyse eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A1","text":"Die Wahrheit des Seyns ist das aus dem Wesen hervorgegangene Unmittelbare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","text":"Existenz ist Unmittelbarkeit, die aus der Aufhebung von Grund und Bedingung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","text":"Die Vermittlung durch Grund hebt sich im Hervorgehen der Existenz selbst auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","text":"Die aufgehobene Vermittlung ist zugleich negativer Grund und positive Bedingung der Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A5","text":"Die Negation des Grundes ist die positive Kontinuität des Wesens mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","text":"Ein Grund in Gottesbeweisen ist kein objektiver Grund Gottes, sondern Grund für die Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A7","text":"Vermittlung ist dem Wesen selbst immanent, auch wenn die beweisende Reflexion sie als subjektiv-äußerlich auffaßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","text":"Existenz ist keine dem Wesen beigelegte Bestimmung, sondern die Identität des Wesens mit seiner Entäußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","text":"Existenz ist mit sich identische Vermittlung und daher vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","text":"Die vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit der Existenz ist negative Einheit und bestimmt sich als Existirendes oder Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A11","text":"Die Differenz von Ding und äußerlicher Existenz ist in der Existenz selbst enthalten und analytisch, nicht bloß Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX1","text":"Existenz ist nicht die erste, voraussetzungslose Unmittelbarkeit des bloßen Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX2","text":"Existenz ist nicht lediglich ein Gesetztes, dessen Wesen in einem äußerlichen Grund zurückbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX3","text":"Der Grund ist nicht als bleibende, dem Hervorgegangenen äußerliche Ursache zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX4","text":"Das Aufheben der Vermittlung ist nicht Erzeugung eines bloßen Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX5","text":"Glaube ist nicht ein vom Untergang der Vermittlung abgelöstes, nur unmittelbar anfangendes Wissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX6","text":"Die Existenz Gottes ist nicht durch einen objektiven, Gott äußerlichen Grund beweisbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX7","text":"Existenz ist nicht Prädikat, Realitätselement oder Zusatzbestimmung eines bereits fertigen Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX8","text":"Das Ding ist nicht identisch mit dem nur seyenden Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D1","text":"Weil der Grund im Hervorgehen verschwindet, ist Existenz zugleich begründet und grundlos, bedingt und unbedingt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D2","text":"Die beweisende Reflexion verkennt ihre eigene Wahrheit, wenn sie ihre Vermittlung nur als subjektive Operation und nicht als Bewegung des Wesens auffaßt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","CH_GB18_DDUS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D3","text":"Das positive Wissen vom Wesen geht aus dem Untergang der vermittelnden Reflexion selbst hervor und besitzt keinen unabhängigen Ursprung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","CH_GB18_DDUS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D4","text":"Das Wesen bleibt nicht hinter seiner Existenz als verborgenes Substrat zurück, weil seine Existenz seine vollzogene Selbstgleichheit ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A5","CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D5","text":"Das Ding enthält seine Äußerlichkeit nicht als bloß äußerlich hinzugefügtes Verhältnis, sondern als immanentes Moment seiner existentiellen Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Alternative von unmittelbarem Sein und äußerlich vermitteltem Gesetztsein durch eine Unmittelbarkeit, deren Wahrheit gerade ihre aufgehobene Vermittlung ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A1","CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD2","text":"Die absolute Gegenständlichkeit Gottes kann weder aus äußerer Kausalität noch aus bloßer subjektiver Reflexion begriffen werden, sondern nur als Selbstaufhebung der vermittelnden Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","CH_GB18_DDUS:A7","CH_GB18_DDUS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD3","text":"Das Ding ist keine atomare Einheit vor allen Relationen, sondern die Form, in der aufgehobene Vermittlung als unmittelbares Insichseyn besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD4","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Existenz wird als innere Artikulation der Existenz und nicht als Trennung zweier selbständiger Gegenstände kartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX1","text":"Unwahr ist ein Modell, in dem das Wesen als jenseitiger Grund fortbesteht und die Existenz nur als abhängiges Resultat unter sich hält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX2","text":"Unwahr ist ein Modell, in dem Vermittlung und Unmittelbarkeit einander äußerlich entgegengesetzt bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX3","text":"Unwahr ist ein Modell, in dem das Scheitern der Reflexion lediglich Erkenntnisverlust und nicht die positive Genesis des unmittelbaren Wissens bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX4","text":"Unwahr ist ein Modell, in dem das Ding zuerst schlicht vorhanden ist und erst nachträglich in das Verhältnis von Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit eintritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, die weder durch Negation noch durch aufgehobene Vermittlung konstituiert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter Grund, der als positives Fundament unter dem Begründeten verbleibt, ohne selbst zu verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Transzendenz des Wesens über seine Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Zugang zum Absoluten, der entweder bloß subjektives Beweisen oder bloß grundlosen Glauben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS1","text":"Grund und Bedingung → vermittelte Abhängigkeit des Existirenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS2","text":"Vermittlung des Grundes → Selbstaufhebung des Grundverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS3","text":"Selbstaufhebung → negativer Grund beziehungsweise Abgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS4","text":"Negativer Grund → positive Selbstgleichheit und vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS5","text":"Vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit → Existenz als Identität von Wesen und Entäußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS6","text":"Existenz als negative Einheit → Existirendes beziehungsweise Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS7","text":"Immanente Vermittlung des Dinges → analytische Differenz von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF1","text":"Grundbedingte Existenz **→** Widerspruch von Bedingtheit und Unbedingtheit **→** Selbstaufhebung des Grundes **→** Abgrund als positiver Ursprung **→** Existenz als Wesen in absoluter Entäußerung **→** Ding als negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF2","text":"Gottesbeweis als Erkenntnisgrund **→** Verkennung der immanenten Vermittlung **→** Aufhebung der äußerlichen Reflexion **→** nichtbloßes unmittelbares Wissen vom Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF3","text":"Existenz als vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit **→** Existirendes **→** Ding **→** innere Differenz von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME1","text":"Grund und Existenz werden von einem asymmetrischen Fundierungsverhältnis in ein Selbstaufhebungsverhältnis überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Beweis und Glaube zerfällt, weil beide ohne die im Wesen selbst stattfindende Aufhebung der Vermittlung unzureichend bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME3","text":"Das Wesen wird nicht als verborgenes Inneres, sondern als in die Existenz übergegangene Selbstgleichheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME4","text":"Das Ding wird nicht als bloße Einheit von Eigenschaften, sondern als negative Einheit aufgehobener Vermittlung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME5","text":"Ding-an-sich und äußerliche Existenz erscheinen nicht als getrennte Regionen, sondern als interne Differenzstruktur der Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Existenz wird vom bloßen Seyn unterschieden und als Existirendes beziehungsweise Ding bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Grund, Bedingung und Vermittlung werden als Verhältnisse gefaßt, deren Wahrheit in ihrer Selbstaufhebung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gottesbeweis wird von einer objektiven Begründung des Gegenstandes in die Darstellung einer sich selbst aufhebenden Erkenntnisvermittlung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Wesen ist nur, indem es in Existenz übergeht; seine Identität ist kein vorgängiger Zustand, sondern Resultat vollzogener Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unmittelbarkeit ist nicht Ursprung vor Vermittlung, sondern deren immanentes und positives Ende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Grund und Bedingung zur Existenz als vermittelte Unmittelbarkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die notwendige Umkehrung, nach der das Verschwinden des Grundes nicht Grundlosigkeit im bloß negativen Sinn, sondern positiven Ursprung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die angekündigte Lehre vom Schluß und damit die genaue Form, in welcher Begriff und Objektivität vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste strukturelle Stelle ist die Identifikation von aufgehobener Vermittlung, negativem Grund und positiver Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung, das Wesen sei nicht von seiner Existenz unterschieden, und der anschließend eröffneten Differenz von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, daß die beweisende Reflexion zugleich als äußerlich-subjektiv und als im Wesen selbst wirksame Vermittlung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion erhält die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern die Selbstaufhebung des Grundes als generative Operation und nicht als bloße Negation verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115133163691Z_d50d8c19","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The Thing and Its Properties.","source_sha256":"d2950dd882b62498fa411cb0f6ed977f6735b4ae61499ee572e941321de78107","sha256":"c19177b30b31353b71106bf2477f17633f0a8494cdc5dceb99733cb51db4fc4a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:51:33.166581+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS1","text":"Existence is to be determined as the truth of Being, without collapsing into mere first immediacy or mere positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS2","text":"The text proceeds reconstructively from ground, condition, and mediation to their self-sublation as produced immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS3","text":"The proofs of God expound the difference between a mere ground of cognition and mediation operative in essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS4","text":"The end of mediation is determined as negative ground, which does not produce Nothing but releases immediate being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS5","text":"Existence is determined as the transition of essence into its absolute externalization, not as a predicate accruing externally to essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AS6","text":"The self-identical mediation of existence determines itself as negative unity, existent and thing; the difference between thing-in-itself and external existence is thereby opened up as immanent analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A1","text":"The truth of Being is the immediate that has issued from essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","text":"Existence is immediacy that issues from the sublation of ground and condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","text":"Mediation through ground sublates itself in the emergence of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","text":"Sublated mediation is at once negative ground and positive condition of immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A5","text":"The negation of ground is the positive continuity of essence with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","text":"A ground in proofs of God is not an objective ground of God, but a ground for cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A7","text":"Mediation is immanent to essence itself, even if proving reflection apprehends it as subjective-external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","text":"Existence is not a determination appended to essence, but the identity of essence with its externalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","text":"Existence is mediation identical with itself and therefore mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","text":"The mediated immediacy of existence is negative unity and determines itself as existent or thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:A11","text":"The difference between thing and external existence is contained in existence itself and is analytic, not mere transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX1","text":"Existence is not the first, presuppositionless immediacy of mere Being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX2","text":"Existence is not merely something posited whose essence remains behind in an external ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX3","text":"Ground is not to be determined as an enduring cause external to what has issued forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX4","text":"The sublation of mediation is not the production of a mere Nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX5","text":"Faith is not a knowing detached from the demise of mediation and merely beginning immediately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX6","text":"The existence of God cannot be proven through an objective ground external to God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX7","text":"Existence is not a predicate, an element of reality, or an additional determination of an already finished essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:NX8","text":"The thing is not identical with the merely being something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D1","text":"Because ground disappears in emergence, existence is at once grounded and groundless, conditioned and unconditioned.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D2","text":"Proving reflection misconceives its own truth when it apprehends its mediation only as a subjective operation and not as a movement of essence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","CH_GB18_DDUS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D3","text":"Positive knowledge of essence issues from the demise of mediating reflection itself and possesses no independent origin.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","CH_GB18_DDUS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D4","text":"Essence does not remain behind its existence as a concealed substrate, because its existence is its enacted self-equality.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A5","CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:D5","text":"The thing contains its externality not as a relation merely externally appended, but as an immanent moment of its existential mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD1","text":"The system replaces the alternative of immediate being and externally mediated positedness with an immediacy whose truth is precisely its sublated mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A1","CH_GB18_DDUS:A2","CH_GB18_DDUS:A3","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD2","text":"The absolute objectivity of God can be comprehended neither from external causality nor from mere subjective reflection, but only as the self-sublation of the mediating relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A4","CH_GB18_DDUS:A6","CH_GB18_DDUS:A7","CH_GB18_DDUS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD3","text":"The thing is not an atomic unity prior to all relations, but the form in which sublated mediation exists as immediate being-within-itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A10","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SD4","text":"The distinction between thing-in-itself and external existence is mapped as an inner articulation of existence and not as the separation of two independent objects.","refs":["CH_GB18_DDUS:A8","CH_GB18_DDUS:A9","CH_GB18_DDUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX1","text":"Untrue is a model in which essence persists as a transcendent ground and holds existence beneath itself merely as a dependent result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX2","text":"Untrue is a model in which mediation and immediacy remain externally opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX3","text":"Untrue is a model in which the failure of reflection signifies merely a loss of cognition and not the positive genesis of immediate knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:DNX4","text":"Untrue is a model in which the thing is first simply present and only subsequently enters into the relation of inwardness and externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a pure immediacy that would be constituted neither through negation nor through sublated mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a final ground that remains as a positive foundation beneath what is grounded without itself disappearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an absolute transcendence of essence over its existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an access to the Absolute that would be either merely subjective proving or merely groundless faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS1","text":"Ground and condition → mediated dependence of the existent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS2","text":"Mediation of ground → self-sublation of the ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS3","text":"Self-sublation → negative ground or abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS4","text":"Negative ground → positive self-equality and mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS5","text":"Mediated immediacy → existence as identity of essence and externalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS6","text":"Existence as negative unity → existent or thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:FGS7","text":"Immanent mediation of the thing → analytic difference between thing-in-itself and external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF1","text":"Ground-conditioned existence **→** contradiction of conditionedness and unconditionedness **→** self-sublation of ground **→** abyss as positive origin **→** existence as essence in absolute externalization **→** thing as negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF2","text":"Proof of God as ground of cognition **→** misconstrual of immanent mediation **→** sublation of external reflection **→** not merely immediate knowledge of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:AF3","text":"Existence as mediated immediacy **→** existent **→** thing **→** inner difference between thing-in-itself and external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME1","text":"Ground and existence are transferred from an asymmetrical relation of grounding into a relation of self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME2","text":"The opposition of proof and faith disintegrates, because both remain insufficient without the sublation of mediation occurring in essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME3","text":"Essence becomes visible not as concealed inwardness, but as self-equality that has passed over into existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME4","text":"The thing is classified not as a mere unity of properties, but as the negative unity of sublated mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ME5","text":"Thing-in-itself and external existence appear not as separate regions, but as the internal differential structure of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Existence is distinguished from mere Being and determined as existent or thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ground, condition, and mediation are conceived as relations whose truth lies in their self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The proof of God is shifted from an objective grounding of the object into the presentation of a self-sublating mediation of cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Essence is only insofar as it passes over into existence; its identity is not a prior state, but the result of enacted negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Immediacy is not an origin prior to mediation, but its immanent and positive end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from ground and condition to existence as mediated immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the necessary reversal according to which the disappearance of ground produces not groundlessness in the merely negative sense, but positive origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the announced doctrine of the syllogism, and thus the precise form in which concept and objectivity are mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural point is the identification of sublated mediation, negative ground, and positive immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the assertion that essence is not distinct from its existence and the subsequently opened difference between thing-in-itself and external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that proving reflection is determined at once as external-subjective and as mediation operative in essence itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DDUS:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the self-sublation of ground is understood as a generative operation and not as mere negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DDUS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DDUS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DDUS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 135","title":"A. The Thing and Its Properties.","context":"Chapter 135","original_title":"A. Das Ding und seine Eigenschaften."},"original_title":"A. Das Ding und seine Eigenschaften.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE","layer":"CH","title":"a. Thing-in-Itself and Existence.","order":136,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DSUE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DSUE@R001","sha256":"62ce9ae657d4f1a17adb08aad8bd154fc7dda3723d35ef2cff0c96e2e28c2624","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, wie ein zunächst unbestimmtes Ding an sich Bestimmtheit besitzen kann, ohne dass diese als bloß äußerlicher Zusatz verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS2","text":"Der Text vollzieht eine immanente dialektische Rekonstruktion, welche die aufgehobene Vermittlung als Bedingung der wesentlichen Unmittelbarkeit ausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS3","text":"Die Existenz wird in eine wesentliche Existenz des Dings an sich und ein unwesentliches, gesetztes Dasein auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS4","text":"Die zunächst äußerliche Reflexion wird als nicht selbständige Mannigfaltigkeit bestimmt, deren Differenzen nur in Beziehung auf das Ding an sich bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS5","text":"Das Scheitern einer stabilen äußeren Beziehung zwingt dazu, die Reflexion als Negativität und Selbstvermittlung des Dings an sich zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS6","text":"Die Beziehung des Dings an sich auf sich als auf ein Anderes erzeugt dessen immanente Bestimmtheit, die als Eigenschaft erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","text":"Das Ding an sich existiert als wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit, die nur durch aufgehobene Vermittlung vorhanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","text":"Die Existenz enthält sowohl das wesentliche Ding an sich als auch dessen unwesentliches, vermitteltes Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A3","text":"Das vermittelte Sein ist Dasein als Gesetztsein und daher unwesentliche Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A4","text":"Das Ding an sich besitzt in seiner ersten Unmittelbarkeit keine eigene bestimmte Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","text":"Die äußere Reflexion bringt Bestimmungen an das Ding an sich heran, ohne dass diese zunächst eigene Bestimmungen des Dings sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","text":"Die Mannigfaltigkeit der äußeren Reflexion besitzt kein selbständiges Bestehen neben oder jenseits des Dings an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","text":"Die unwesentliche Reflexion hebt sich als bloß äußere Beziehung auf und wird zur wesentlichen Identität des Dings an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","text":"Die Identität des Dings an sich besteht nur, insofern sie die Negativität der Reflexion in sich enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","text":"Mehrere Dinge an sich sind nur durch äußere Beziehung unterschieden und besitzen keine an sich bestehende Bestimmtheit gegeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A10","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Dings an sich ist seine wesentliche Vermittlung mit sich selbst als mit einem Anderen und erscheint als Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX1","text":"Das Ding an sich ist nicht der Grund des unwesentlichen Daseins, sondern dessen unbewegte Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX2","text":"Das Ding an sich ist nicht ein Träger ursprünglich eigener empirischer oder mannigfaltiger Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX3","text":"Äußere Reflexion ist nicht ein selbständiger Bereich neben dem Ding an sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX4","text":"Die Differenz der Dinge an sich ist nicht eine ihnen unabhängig von ihrer Beziehung zukommende Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX5","text":"Das Verhältnis zwischen Dingen an sich ist nicht dauerhaft bloße Oberflächenbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX6","text":"Eigenschaft ist nicht eine dem Ding äußerlich zugeschriebene Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D1","text":"Wesentliche und unwesentliche Existenz bilden keine getrennten Seinsbereiche, sondern zwei Momente derselben Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","CH_GB18_DSUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D2","text":"Die Mannigfaltigkeit äußerer Reflexion ist Schein, weil sie nur als Beziehung auf wesentliche Identität besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D3","text":"Die äußerliche Reflexion zerstört ihre eigene Äußerlichkeit, weil ihre Beziehung auf das Ding an sich ihre Selbstaufhebung ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D4","text":"Das zunächst äußere Dasein wird zum inneren Moment des Dings an sich, weil dessen Identität Negativität einschließt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D5","text":"Die Vielheit von Dingen an sich kann keine selbständige Vielheit bleiben, weil jedes nur durch das Andere bestimmt wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D6","text":"Bestimmtheit entsteht als Selbstbeziehung des Dings an sich unter der Form einer Beziehung auf ein Anderes.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD1","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als notwendiges, jedoch unselbständiges Moment der Selbstvermittlung immanent gemacht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD2","text":"Die Totalität der Existenz ist eine Struktur, in der jedes scheinbar äußere Verhältnis zur Selbstbeziehung der wesentlichen Identität zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD3","text":"Das Ding an sich ist nur als negativ vermittelte Selbstidentität bestimmbar und nicht als rein positives, beziehungsloses Substrat.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","CH_GB18_DSUE:A4","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD4","text":"Eigenschaft bezeichnet den Übergang, in dem die zunächst fremde Bestimmung als notwendige Eigenbestimmung des Dings erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Ding an sich, das völlig relationslos bleibt und dennoch bestimmte Eigenschaften besitzen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine äußere Reflexion, die das Ding bestimmen könnte, ohne selbst von dessen wesentlicher Identität abhängig zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vielheit selbständiger Dinge an sich, deren Unterschiede unabhängig von ihren Beziehungen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Eigenschaft, die entweder bloß subjektive Zuschreibung oder bloß unvermittelte Eigenheit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, die keine aufgehobene Vermittlung in sich bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine absolute Äußerlichkeit, die außerhalb der Selbstvermittlung der wesentlichen Identität bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die dauerhafte Trennung von Ding, Beziehung und Eigenschaft; die Beziehung muss in die Eigenbestimmtheit des Dings zurückkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS1","text":"Aufgehobene Vermittlung → wesentliche Unmittelbarkeit → Ding an sich als existierende Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS2","text":"Wesentliche Identität → Abspaltung des vermittelten Seins → unwesentliches Dasein als Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS3","text":"Unwesentliches Dasein → äußere Reflexion → Mannigfaltigkeit und Unterschied als bloße Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS4","text":"Bloß relationale Mannigfaltigkeit → fehlende Selbständigkeit → Selbstaufhebung der äußeren Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS5","text":"Selbstaufhebung der Äußerlichkeit → Immanenz der Negativität → Ding an sich als Selbstbeziehung auf ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS6","text":"Selbstbeziehung als Andersbeziehung → Zusammenfall der scheinbar mehreren Dinge → immanente Bestimmtheit → Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AF1","text":"Unbestimmtes Ding an sich → Trennung von wesentlicher und unwesentlicher Existenz → äußere Reflexion und scheinbare Mannigfaltigkeit → Selbstaufhebung der Äußerlichkeit → Negativität als Moment der Identität → Selbstbeziehung als Andersbeziehung → Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AF2","text":"Die Argumentbewegung kehrt von der zunächst ausgeschlossenen Bestimmtheit über die Entkräftung ihrer Äußerlichkeit zu einer immanenten Bestimmtheit des Dings zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Ding an sich und Existenz wird als innere Differenz einer einzigen Existenzordnung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von äußerer Zuschreibung und eigener Bestimmung wird durch die Vermittlung ersetzt, in der äußere Reflexion zum inneren Moment wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME3","text":"Die Vielheit von Dingen an sich wird von einer ontologisch selbständigen Pluralität zu einer Form der Selbstunterscheidung eines Dings umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME4","text":"Eigenschaft wird nicht als bloßes Prädikat, sondern als Form wesentlicher Selbstvermittlung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist das Verhältnis von Ding an sich, Existenz, äußerer Reflexion und Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die operative Struktur ist die Umwandlung äußerlicher, unwesentlicher Vermittlung in immanente, wesentliche Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Frage nach einer äußerlich legitimierten Zuschreibung durch die Frage, ob die Zuschreibung aus der Selbstbewegung des Begriffs hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein ist nicht als starre Unmittelbarkeit gefasst, sondern als Identität, die ihre Bestimmtheit nur durch Negativität und Rückkehr aus der Äußerlichkeit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von wesentlicher Unmittelbarkeit über äußere Reflexion zur Eigenschaft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, weshalb die äußere Reflexion notwendig in wesentliche Identität umschlagen muss und nicht bloß als äußerliche Zuschreibung fortbestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT3","text":"Das System ist nur dann kohärent, wenn die anfängliche Bestimmungslosigkeit des Dings an sich als vorläufige Bestimmung und nicht als bleibende Eigenschaftenlosigkeit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Ableitung der Eigenschaft aus der Selbstvermittlung des Dings und nicht aus einer äußerlichen Prädikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der komprimierten Identifikation von Selbstaufhebung, Reflexion-in-sich und wesentlicher Identität ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der anfänglichen Behauptung, dass dem Ding keine bestimmte Mannigfaltigkeit zukomme, und der Endbestimmung, dass seine Bestimmtheit eigene Eigenschaft sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT7","text":"Die Bewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die Vielheit der Dinge an sich als notwendige Durchgangsform der Selbstbeziehung und nicht als endgültige Ontologie behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115620627451Z_7243b7f1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. Thing in itself and existence.","source_sha256":"62ce9ae657d4f1a17adb08aad8bd154fc7dda3723d35ef2cff0c96e2e28c2624","sha256":"8907a349bedb5447c7b53d899033a7112d5e0a1c70c882adfee99b0939699fbe","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:56:20.629090+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS1","text":"The problem consists in how an initially indeterminate thing in itself can possess determinacy without this remaining a merely external addition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS2","text":"The text carries out an immanent dialectical reconstruction that demonstrates sublated mediation as the condition of essential immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS3","text":"Existence is divided into an essential existence of the thing in itself and an inessential, posited Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS4","text":"Initially external reflection is determined as a non-self-subsistent manifoldness whose differences exist only in relation to the thing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS5","text":"The failure of a stable external relation compels the determination of reflection as negativity and self-mediation of the thing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AS6","text":"The relation of the thing in itself to itself as to an other produces its immanent determinacy, which appears as property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","text":"The thing in itself exists as essential immediacy, which is present only through sublated mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","text":"Existence contains both the essential thing in itself and its inessential, mediated being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A3","text":"Mediated being is Dasein as positedness and is therefore inessential existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A4","text":"In its first immediacy, the thing in itself possesses no determinate manifoldness of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","text":"External reflection brings determinations to the thing in itself without these initially being determinations proper to the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","text":"The manifoldness of external reflection possesses no self-subsistent existence alongside or beyond the thing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","text":"Inessential reflection sublates itself as a merely external relation and becomes the essential identity of the thing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","text":"The identity of the thing in itself exists only insofar as it contains within itself the negativity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","text":"Several things in themselves are distinguished only through external relation and possess no determinacy existing in itself in relation to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:A10","text":"The determinacy of the thing in itself is its essential mediation with itself as with an other and appears as property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX1","text":"The thing in itself is not the ground of inessential Dasein, but its unmoved basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX2","text":"The thing in itself is not a bearer of originally its own empirical or manifold determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX3","text":"External reflection is not a self-subsistent domain alongside the thing in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX4","text":"The difference of things in themselves is not a difference that belongs to them independently of their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX5","text":"The relation between things in themselves is not enduringly a merely surface relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:NX6","text":"Property is not a determination externally ascribed to the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D1","text":"Essential and inessential existence do not constitute separate domains of being, but two moments of the same existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","CH_GB18_DSUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D2","text":"The manifoldness of external reflection is semblance, because it exists only as a relation to essential identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D3","text":"External reflection destroys its own externality, because its relation to the thing in itself is its self-sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D4","text":"Initially external Dasein becomes an inner moment of the thing in itself, because its identity includes negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D5","text":"The plurality of things in themselves cannot remain a self-subsistent plurality, because each would be determined only through the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:D6","text":"Determinacy arises as the self-relation of the thing in itself under the form of a relation to an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A8","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD1","text":"Externality is not eliminated, but made immanent as a necessary yet non-self-subsistent moment of self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A6","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD2","text":"The totality of existence is a structure in which every seemingly external relation returns to the self-relation of essential identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A2","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A9","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD3","text":"The thing in itself is determinable only as negatively mediated self-identity and not as a purely positive, relationless substratum.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A1","CH_GB18_DSUE:A4","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SD4","text":"Property designates the transition in which the initially alien determination appears as the necessary self-determination of the thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_DSUE:A5","CH_GB18_DSUE:A7","CH_GB18_DSUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a thing in itself that remains wholly relationless and yet could possess determinate properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an external reflection that could determine the thing without itself being dependent on its essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a plurality of self-subsistent things in themselves whose differences exist independently of their relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a property that would be either merely subjective ascription or merely unmediated peculiarity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a pure immediacy that preserves no sublated mediation within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an absolute externality that remains outside the self-mediation of essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is the enduring separation of thing, relation, and property; the relation must return into the self-determinacy of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS1","text":"Sublated mediation → essential immediacy → thing in itself as existing identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS2","text":"Essential identity → splitting off of mediated being → inessential Dasein as positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS3","text":"Inessential Dasein → external reflection → manifoldness and difference as mere relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS4","text":"Merely relational manifoldness → lack of self-subsistence → self-sublation of external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS5","text":"Self-sublation of externality → immanence of negativity → thing in itself as self-relation to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:FGS6","text":"Self-relation as relation-to-an-other → collapse of the seemingly several things → immanent determinacy → property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AF1","text":"Indeterminate thing in itself → separation of essential and inessential existence → external reflection and apparent manifoldness → self-sublation of externality → negativity as a moment of identity → self-relation as relation-to-an-other → property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:AF2","text":"The movement of the argument returns from the initially excluded determinacy, through the invalidation of its externality, to an immanent determinacy of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME1","text":"The opposition between thing in itself and existence is mapped as an inner difference of a single order of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME2","text":"The opposition between external ascription and determination proper is replaced by mediation in which external reflection becomes an inner moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME3","text":"The plurality of things in themselves is reclassified from an ontologically self-subsistent plurality into a form of the self-distinction of one thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ME4","text":"Property becomes visible not as a mere predicate, but as a form of essential self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit subject is the relation of thing in itself, existence, external reflection, and property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT2","text":"Structural — The operative structure is the transformation of external, inessential mediation into immanent, essential mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the question of an externally legitimized ascription with the question whether the ascription proceeds from the self-movement of the concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is not conceived as rigid immediacy, but as identity that possesses its determinacy only through negativity and return from externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from essential immediacy through external reflection to property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why external reflection must necessarily turn into essential identity and cannot merely persist as external ascription.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT3","text":"The system is coherent only if the initial indeterminacy of the thing in itself counts as a provisional determination and not as enduring lack of properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation is the derivation of property from the self-mediation of the thing and not from external predication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed identification of self-sublation, reflection-into-self, and essential identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT6","text":"The central fault line lies between the initial assertion that no determinate manifoldness belongs to the thing and the final determination that its determinacy is its own property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DSUE:MRT7","text":"The movement is preserved provided that the plurality of things in themselves is treated as a necessary transitional form of self-relation and not as a final ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DSUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DSUE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DSUE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 136","title":"a. Thing-in-Itself and Existence.","context":"Chapter 136","original_title":"a. Ding an sich und Existenz."},"original_title":"a. Ding an sich und Existenz.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2","layer":"CH","title":"b. Property.","order":137,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BD_2"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BD_2@R001","sha256":"e4bea575cb1d4367240565bae1336246dd57027c5af7d99e459d44bbccc383cf","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS1","text":"Das Argument muss erklären, wie unmittelbare Bestimmtheit zugleich Negativität, Beziehung und Identität mit sich sein kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS2","text":"Die Eigenschaft wird als reflektierte Qualität bestimmt, in der die Beziehung zu Anderem eine eigene, sich erhaltende Bestimmung des Dings ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS3","text":"Die Grundlage dieses Übergangs ist eine aufgehobene Vermittlung, die als Selbstbeziehung auf ein Anderes und zugleich als Identität mit sich fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS4","text":"Der Nachweis erfolgt dadurch, dass die Eigenschaft sich in äußerlicher Beziehung bewährt, ohne in Anderssein oder Verlust überzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS5","text":"Aus der Selbsterhaltung der Eigenschaft in der Äußerlichkeit entsteht die Bestimmung des Dings als Ursache, zunächst jedoch nur als ansichseyende und noch nicht setzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Aufhebung des Gegensatzes von Ding-an-sich und äußerer Existenz: Das Ding ist als Grund in seinen Eigenschaften und existiert wesentlich als äußerliche, zugleich ansichseyende Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A1","text":"Qualität ist die unmittelbare Bestimmtheit des Etwas und die Negativität, durch die das Sein Etwas ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A2","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist die Negativität der Reflexion, durch die Existenz als Existierendes und als einfache Identität mit sich bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A3","text":"Die aufgehobene Vermittlung bleibt selbst Vermittlung und Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A4","text":"Diese Vermittlung ist Beziehung auf sich als auf ein Anderes und zugleich Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist die aus Anderem in sich zurückkehrende Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A6","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Dinges ist Beschaffenheit, die als solche selbst Bestimmung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A7","text":"Die Beziehung des Dinges zu Anderem geht nicht notwendig in Anderssein oder Veränderung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A8","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist nur als bestimmte Beziehung oder Verhaltensweise zu Anderem vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist die äußerliche Reflexion und die Seite des Gesetztseins des Dinges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A10","text":"Das Ding ist in seinem Gesetztsein an sich und erhält sich in der Beziehung auf Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","text":"Die Eigenschaft bewährt sich nur unter der Bedingung einer entsprechenden Beschaffenheit des anderen Dinges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","text":"Die Eigenschaft bleibt trotz ihrer Äußerlichkeit dem Ding eigentümlich und bildet seine mit sich identische Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","text":"Das Ding wird durch seine Eigenschaften Ursache, indem es sich als Wirkung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A14","text":"Das Ding vieler Eigenschaften ist zunächst nur ansichseyende und noch nicht setzende Reflexion seiner Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist in seinen Eigenschaften als Grund vorhanden und keine jenseits der äußeren Existenz befindliche bestimmungslose Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","text":"Das Gesetztsein des Dinges ist zugleich äußerliche Reflexion, sodass der Grund nur insofern in sich reflektiert und an sich ist, insofern er äußerlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A17","text":"Die Existenz ist äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit, durch die das Ding der Veränderung unterworfen ist, und zugleich reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit des Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A18","text":"Die Eigenschaft selbst ist als solche der Grund, dessen Bestimmtheit die sich äußerliche Reflexion und dessen Form die Identität mit sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX1","text":"Qualität ist nicht eine bloß unreflektierte oder zufällige Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX2","text":"Vermittlung ist nicht bloß Beziehung auf ein äußerlich anderes Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist nicht ein jenseits seiner äußeren Existenz liegendes bestimmungsloses Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX4","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist nicht bloß äußerliche Reflexion oder bloßes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX5","text":"Die Eigenschaft geht in der Äußerlichkeit nicht verloren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX6","text":"Die Beziehung zu Anderem ist nicht notwendig Übergang in Anderssein oder Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX7","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist keine von jeder Beschaffenheit des anderen Dinges unabhängige Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX8","text":"Das Ding vieler Eigenschaften ist noch nicht die wirkliche Ursache als setzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX9","text":"Die Dingheit ist nicht ein von der Eigenschaft unterschiedener Grund, während die Eigenschaft bloßes Gesetztsein wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX10","text":"Existenz ist nicht reine Unmittelbarkeit des Seins ohne reflektiertes Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D1","text":"Die Qualität bestimmt das Sein nicht durch ein äußerliches Merkmal, sondern durch eine Negativität, die das Etwas konstituiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A1","CH_GB18_BD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D2","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist eine Vermittlungsform, in der äußerliche Beziehung und Selbstidentität zusammenfallen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A2","CH_GB18_BD_2:A3","CH_GB18_BD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich kann durch Beziehung zu Anderem bestimmt sein, ohne in ein anderes Sein überzugehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","CH_GB18_BD_2:A6","CH_GB18_BD_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D4","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist zugleich relationale Verhaltensweise und sich erhaltende Bestimmung des Dinges.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A8","CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","CH_GB18_BD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D5","text":"Die Bedingtheit durch das andere Ding hebt die Eigenheit der Eigenschaft nicht auf, sondern bezeichnet die Weise ihrer Bewährung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","CH_GB18_BD_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D6","text":"Die Selbsterhaltung der Eigenschaft in der Äußerlichkeit erzeugt die Bestimmung des Dinges als Ursache und der Wirkung als Selbsterhaltung der Ursache.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D7","text":"Die erste Kausalitätsbestimmung bleibt unvollständig, weil das Ding zunächst nur mehrere Eigenschaften besitzt und ihre setzende Reflexion noch nicht selbst ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","CH_GB18_BD_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D8","text":"Das Ding-an-sich wird als bedingter Grund bestimmt, weil seine Identität mit sich nur in seinem äußerlichen Gesetztsein besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D9","text":"Veränderung bezeichnet keine Auflösung des Ansichseins, sondern die äußerliche Erscheinungsweise der reflektierten Unmittelbarkeit des Grundes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D10","text":"Die Existenz des Ding-an-sich ist notwendig, weil das Ansichsein nur als reflektierte Äußerlichkeit wirklich bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17","CH_GB18_BD_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD1","text":"Der Gegensatz von innerem Ding-an-sich und äußerer Eigenschaft wird in eine Einheit überführt, in der das Ansichsein nur durch Äußerlichkeit besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD2","text":"Äußerliche Beziehung wird von einer bloßen Gefährdung der Identität zur notwendigen Form ihrer Selbsterhaltung umbestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A7","CH_GB18_BD_2:A10","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD3","text":"Kausalität entsteht nicht aus einer von der Wirkung getrennten Ursache, sondern aus der Selbsterhaltung einer Bestimmung in ihrer Wirkung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","CH_GB18_BD_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD4","text":"Eigenschaft, Dingheit und Grund bilden keine getrennten Schichten, sondern verschiedene Bestimmungen desselben sich in Äußerlichkeit auf sich beziehenden Grundes.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen eigener Grundlage und Abhängigkeit von der Beschaffenheit des anderen wird als bedingter Grund systemintern erhalten, nicht durch eine Seite aufgelöst.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zweiweltenstruktur, in der das wahre Ding-an-sich von seiner Existenz und seinen Eigenschaften getrennt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine statische Identität, die vor oder außerhalb jeder Vermittlung mit Anderem bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Eigenschaft, deren Wirklichkeit unabhängig von relationaler Bewährung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kausalität, in der die Ursache als selbständiges Inneres der Wirkung äußerlich gegenübersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Veränderung, die das Ansichsein als bloßen Verlust der Bestimmung erklären würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Grund, der als von seinen Eigenschaften getrennte Entität hinter ihnen verborgen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Äußerlichkeit, die nicht zugleich reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit des Grundes wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein vollständig isoliertes Ding-an-sich, das ohne äußere Beziehung bestimmt und identisch wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist ein indeterminierter Träger, der den Eigenschaften und der Existenz ontologisch vorausliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine reine Außenbeziehung ohne Selbstbeziehung und Selbsterhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Kausalordnung, in der die Ursache vor der Wirkung selbständig besteht und sich nicht in ihr erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist eine abschließende Trennung von Wesen und Erscheinung, weil das Wesen nur in seiner Erscheinung als Grund bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS1","text":"Qualität := unmittelbare Bestimmtheit = Negativität; Sein → Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS2","text":"Aufgehobene Vermittlung → Beziehung auf sich als auf ein Anderes ∧ Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS3","text":"Ding-an-sich := Rückkehr aus Anderem in sich; Beschaffenheit → Bestimmung; Beziehung zu Anderem ∧ kein Übergang in Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS4","text":"Eigenschaft := reflektierte Qualität = äußerliche Reflexion/Gesetztsein ∧ eigene selbstidentische Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS5","text":"Entsprechende Beschaffenheit des Anderen → Bewährung der Eigenschaft; Bewährung ∧ Selbsterhaltung in Äußerlichkeit → Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS6","text":"Sich-Erhalten als Wirkung → Ursache; viele Eigenschaften ∧ ruhiges Ding → noch keine setzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS7","text":"Eigenschaft → in die Äußerlichkeit übergegangener Grund; Gesetztsein → Identität mit sich im bedingten Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS8","text":"Existenz := äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit ∧ reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit des Grundes; daraus folgen Veränderlichkeit ∧ Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS9","text":"Ding-an-sich → wesentliche Existenz; Existenz → zugleich Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Qualität → Negativität der Reflexion → Selbstbeziehung als Beziehung auf ein Anderes → Eigenschaft als sich erhaltende Äußerlichkeit → vorläufige Kausalität → Eigenschaft als Grund → bedingter Grund in der Existenz → Einheit von äußerlicher Unmittelbarkeit und Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME1","text":"Die Eigenschaft wird von einem äußerlichen Merkmal zu einer eigenen Bestimmung des Dinges und zur Form seines Grundes umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME2","text":"Die Beziehung zu Anderem wird von äußerer Abhängigkeit zu einer Bedingung der Selbsterhaltung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME3","text":"Veränderung wird nicht mehr als Gegenbegriff zum Ansichsein, sondern als dessen äußerliche Realisationsform sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME4","text":"Kausalität wird als Übergang von der erhaltenen Eigenschaft zur sich als Wirkung erhaltenden Ursache kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von Ding-an-sich und Existenz bricht zusammen, weil Existenz selbst als reflektiertes Ansichsein bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME6","text":"Grund und Eigenschaft werden nicht hierarchisch, sondern als ineinander übergegangene Bestimmungen desselben Reflexionsganzen angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: Qualität, Eigenschaft, Beziehung zu Anderem, Wirkung und Ursache werden als aufeinanderfolgende Bestimmungen des Dinges behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: Das System organisiert diese Bestimmungen durch das Verhältnis von äußerlicher Reflexion, Gesetztsein, Grund und Selbstidentität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der scheinbare Gegensatz von Innerem und Äußerem wird nicht entschieden, sondern durch die Bestimmung ihrer gegenseitigen Erzeugung neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Sein ist als Prozess der Rückkehr in sich bestimmt, der sich in äußerlicher Beziehung, Veränderung und Selbsterhaltung realisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Qualität über Eigenschaft und Kausalität zum bedingten Grund zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue kategoriale Vermittlung zwischen Qualität, Beschaffenheit und reflektierter Qualität, sofern ihre dialektische Übergangslogik nicht vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil Äußerlichkeit und Ansichsein nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als gegenseitige Bedingungen gefasst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Bestimmung der Eigenschaft als zugleich relationaler Äußerlichkeit und eigener Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste ungelöste Spannung liegt darin, dass die Eigenschaft von der Beschaffenheit des anderen abhängt und dennoch als eigener Grund gelten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht zwischen der Bestimmung des Dinges als Ursache und seiner gleichzeitigen Einschränkung auf eine noch nicht setzende Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur dann, wenn „aufgehobene Vermittlung“ zugleich als negierte und fortbestehende Vermittlung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT8","text":"Wird diese Doppelstruktur auf bloße Identität oder bloße Äußerlichkeit reduziert, bricht die Erzeugung des bedingten Grundes und damit die Schlussbestimmung der Existenz zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113309341337Z_7eadbf47","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. Property.","source_sha256":"e4bea575cb1d4367240565bae1336246dd57027c5af7d99e459d44bbccc383cf","sha256":"cae4c18b12c7907d541dd6b22bd2b64afe5676c84e73666facc43cfa1f11c67c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:33:09.342636+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS1","text":"The argument must explain how immediate determinacy can at once be negativity, relation, and identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS2","text":"Property is determined as reflected quality, in which the relation to an Other is a proper, self-preserving determination of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS3","text":"The basis of this transition is a sublated mediation, which persists as self-relation to an Other and at the same time as identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS4","text":"The demonstration proceeds by showing that property proves itself in external relation without passing over into otherness or loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS5","text":"From the self-preservation of property in externality arises the determination of the thing as cause, though initially only as reflection that is being-in-itself and not yet positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the sublation of the opposition between thing-in-itself and external existence: the thing is present as ground in its properties and exists essentially as external, yet at the same time being-in-itself, immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A1","text":"Quality is the immediate determinacy of the something and the negativity through which being is something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A2","text":"Property is the negativity of reflection through which existence is determined as existent and as simple identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A3","text":"The sublated mediation itself remains mediation and relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A4","text":"This mediation is relation to itself as to an Other and at the same time identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","text":"The thing-in-itself is the relation returning into itself out of an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A6","text":"The determinacy of the thing is constitution, which as such is itself determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A7","text":"The relation of the thing to an Other does not necessarily pass over into otherness or alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A8","text":"Property is present only as determinate relation or mode of conduct toward an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","text":"Property is external reflection and the side of the thing's positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A10","text":"The thing is in itself in its positedness and preserves itself in relation to an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","text":"Property proves itself only under the condition of a corresponding constitution of the other thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","text":"Despite its externality, property remains peculiar to the thing and forms its foundation identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","text":"Through its properties, the thing becomes cause by preserving itself as effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A14","text":"The thing of many properties is initially only reflection that is being-in-itself and not yet positing of its determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","text":"The thing-in-itself is present in its properties as ground and is not a indeterminate foundation situated beyond external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","text":"The positedness of the thing is at the same time external reflection, so that the ground is reflected into itself and is in itself only insofar as it is external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A17","text":"Existence is external immediacy, through which the thing is subject to alteration, and at the same time reflected immediacy of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:A18","text":"Property itself, as such, is the ground, whose determinacy is reflection external to itself and whose form is identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX1","text":"Quality is not a merely unreflected or contingent determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX2","text":"Mediation is not merely relation to an externally other something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX3","text":"The thing-in-itself is not an indeterminate substrate lying beyond its external existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX4","text":"Property is not merely external reflection or mere positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX5","text":"Property is not lost in externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX6","text":"Relation to an Other is not necessarily transition into otherness or alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX7","text":"Property is not an efficacy independent of every constitution of the other thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX8","text":"The thing of many properties is not yet the actual cause as positing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX9","text":"Thinghood is not a ground distinct from property, while property would be mere positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:NX10","text":"Existence is not pure immediacy of being without reflected being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D1","text":"Quality determines being not through an external mark, but through a negativity that constitutes the something.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A1","CH_GB18_BD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D2","text":"Property is a form of mediation in which external relation and self-identity coincide.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A2","CH_GB18_BD_2:A3","CH_GB18_BD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D3","text":"The thing-in-itself can be determined through relation to an Other without passing over into another being.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","CH_GB18_BD_2:A6","CH_GB18_BD_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D4","text":"Property is at once relational mode of conduct and self-preserving determination of the thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A8","CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","CH_GB18_BD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D5","text":"The conditionality through the other thing does not sublate the peculiarity of property, but designates the manner of its proving itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","CH_GB18_BD_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D6","text":"The self-preservation of property in externality generates the determination of the thing as cause and of the effect as self-preservation of the cause.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D7","text":"The first determination of causality remains incomplete because the thing initially possesses only several properties and is not yet itself their positing reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","CH_GB18_BD_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D8","text":"The thing-in-itself is determined as conditioned ground because its identity with itself consists only in its external positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D9","text":"Alteration designates not a dissolution of being-in-itself, but the external mode of appearance of the reflected immediacy of the ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:D10","text":"The existence of the thing-in-itself is necessary because being-in-itself is actually determined only as reflected externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17","CH_GB18_BD_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD1","text":"The opposition between inner thing-in-itself and external property is brought into a unity in which being-in-itself exists only through externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A5","CH_GB18_BD_2:A9","CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD2","text":"External relation is redetermined from a mere endangerment of identity into the necessary form of its self-preservation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A7","CH_GB18_BD_2:A10","CH_GB18_BD_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD3","text":"Causality arises not from a cause separate from the effect, but from the self-preservation of a determination in its effect.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A13","CH_GB18_BD_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD4","text":"Property, thinghood, and ground form no separate layers, but rather different determinations of the same ground relating itself to itself in externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A15","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16","CH_GB18_BD_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SD5","text":"The tension between its own foundation and dependence on the constitution of the other is preserved internally to the system as conditioned ground, not resolved by either side.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_2:A11","CH_GB18_BD_2:A12","CH_GB18_BD_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a two-world structure in which the true thing-in-itself would be separated from its existence and its properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a static identity that would subsist prior to or outside every mediation with an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a property whose actuality would be independent of relational proving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a causality in which the cause, as an independent interior, stands externally opposed to the effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an alteration that would explain being-in-itself as mere loss of determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a ground that remains hidden behind its properties as an entity separated from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:DNX7","text":"Excluded is a pure externality that would not at the same time be reflected immediacy of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a completely isolated thing-in-itself that would be determinate and identical without external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is an indeterminate bearer that is ontologically prior to properties and existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is a pure external relation without self-relation and self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a causal order in which the cause exists independently before the effect and does not preserve itself in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:SNX5","text":"Foreclosed is a conclusive separation of essence and appearance, because essence is determined as ground only in its appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS1","text":"Quality := immediate determinacy = negativity; being → something.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS2","text":"Sublated mediation → relation to itself as to an Other ∧ identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS3","text":"Thing-in-itself := return out of an Other into itself; constitution → determination; relation to an Other ∧ no transition into otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS4","text":"Property := reflected quality = external reflection/positedness ∧ proper self-identical foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS5","text":"Corresponding constitution of the Other → proving of property; proving ∧ self-preservation in externality → effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS6","text":"Self-preserving as effect → cause; many properties ∧ quiescent thing → not yet positing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS7","text":"Property → ground passed over into externality; positedness → identity with itself in conditioned ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS8","text":"Existence := external immediacy ∧ reflected immediacy of the ground; from this follow alterability ∧ being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:FGS9","text":"Thing-in-itself → essential existence; existence → at the same time being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:AF1","text":"Immediate quality → negativity of reflection → self-relation as relation to an Other → property as self-preserving externality → provisional causality → property as ground → conditioned ground in existence → unity of external immediacy and being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME1","text":"Property is remapped from an external mark into a proper determination of the thing and the form of its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME2","text":"Relation to an Other is reclassified from external dependence into a condition of self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME3","text":"Alteration no longer appears as the counter-concept to being-in-itself, but as its external form of realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME4","text":"Causality is mapped as the transition from preserved property to cause preserving itself as effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME5","text":"The opposition between thing-in-itself and existence collapses because existence itself is determined as reflected being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ME6","text":"Ground and property are arranged not hierarchically, but as determinations that have passed over into one another within the same whole of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: quality, property, relation to an Other, effect, and cause are treated as successive determinations of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: the system organizes these determinations through the relation of external reflection, positedness, ground, and self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: the apparent opposition of inner and outer is not decided, but reframed through the determination of their mutual generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: being is determined as a process of return into itself, which realizes itself in external relation, alteration, and self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from quality through property and causality to conditioned ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise categorial mediation between quality, constitution, and reflected quality, insofar as their dialectical logic of transition is not presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because externality and being-in-itself are grasped not as opposites, but as mutual conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the determination of property as at once relational externality and its own foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT5","text":"The strongest unresolved tension lies in the fact that property depends on the constitution of the other and yet is supposed to count as its own ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises between the determination of the thing as cause and its simultaneous limitation to a reflection not yet positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if “sublated mediation” is read at once as negated and persisting mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_2:MRT8","text":"If this double structure is reduced to mere identity or mere externality, the generation of conditioned ground, and thus the concluding determination of existence, collapses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BD_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BD_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 137","title":"b. Property.","context":"Chapter 137","original_title":"b. Die Eigenschaft."},"original_title":"b. Die Eigenschaft.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":138,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_37"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_37@R001","sha256":"0dfd342210666162d94ce2246a104e2f43dcba221ad7552619786716d84ae8d4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS1","text":"Das Ding-an-sich wird als leere Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit gesetzt und dadurch als unerkennbar bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit fällt zunächst in eine dem Ding-an-sich äußerliche Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS3","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus bestimmt diese äußere Reflexion als Bewusstsein und verlegt sämtliche Bestimmungen in das Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS4","text":"Das Freiheitsbewusstsein kehrt diese Verteilung um, indem es das Ich als allgemeine, unbestimmte Identität und die Bestimmungen als äußerlich auffasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS5","text":"Die äußere Reflexion erweist sich jedoch selbst als Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich und damit als dessen eigene innere Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS6","text":"Die abstrakte Trennung von Ding-an-sich und Reflexion wird dadurch aufgehoben; das reine Ding-an-sich erweist sich als unwahre Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A1","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist als Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A2","text":"Eine Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit ist als solche nicht erkennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A3","text":"Wird das Ding-an-sich als unbestimmt gesetzt, so fällt jede Bestimmung außerhalb desselben in eine ihm fremde Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A4","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus bestimmt die äußerliche Reflexion als Bewusstsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A5","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus verlegt Form und Inhalt der Dinge in das Bewusstsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A6","text":"Das Freiheitsbewusstsein weiß das Ich als allgemeine und unbestimmte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A7","text":"Das Freiheitsbewusstsein trennt die mannigfaltigen und notwendigen Bestimmungen vom Ich und schreibt sie den Dingen als äußerliche Bestimmungen zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A8","text":"Das reflektierte Ich besitzt in seinem Freiheitsbewusstsein diejenige Identität, die dem Ding-an-sich zugeschrieben werden sollte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A9","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus überschreitet die Endlichkeit nicht, sondern verlegt die Schranke vom Objekt in das Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A10","text":"Die äußerliche Reflexion ist zunächst weder als Bewusstsein noch das Ding-an-sich als Ich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A11","text":"Die äußerliche Reflexion bestimmt sich selbst zum Ding-an-sich beziehungsweise zur eigenen Bestimmung des ersten Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A12","text":"Das Ding-an-sich hat die äußerliche Reflexion wesentlich an sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A13","text":"Ein Ding-an-sich mit eigener Bestimmtheit und Eigenschaften ist nicht mehr reine Abstraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A14","text":"Die Bestimmung des reinen Dinges-an-sich erweist sich dadurch als unwahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX1","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist nicht eine erkennbare inhaltliche Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX2","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist nicht von seinen Bestimmungen unabhängig, sobald diese als seine eigene Reflexion begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX3","text":"Die äußerliche Reflexion ist nicht schlechthin fremd zum Ding-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX4","text":"Das Bewusstsein ist nicht die endgültige Erklärung der Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX5","text":"Die Verlegung der Bestimmungen in das Subjekt überschreitet die endliche Schranke nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX6","text":"Das Ich ist im Freiheitsbewusstsein nicht die bloße Summe wechselnder subjektiver Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX7","text":"Die Mannigfaltigkeit der Eigenschaften ist nicht ausschließlich dem Subjekt zuzuschreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX8","text":"Das reine, bestimmungslose Ding-an-sich ist keine haltbare letzte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D1","text":"Die Bestimmungslosigkeit des Dinges-an-sich erzeugt die Unmöglichkeit, es als solches zu erkennen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D2","text":"Die Setzung eines unbestimmten Dinges-an-sich erzeugt eine Gegenüberstellung von abstraktem Ansichsein und äußerlicher Bestimmtheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D3","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus macht die subjektive Verfassung zur Trägerin sämtlicher gegenständlicher Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A4","CH_GB18_A_37:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D4","text":"Das Freiheitsbewusstsein stellt der subjektivistischen Bestimmung ein allgemeines Ich entgegen, das die Bestimmungen von sich abtrennt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D5","text":"Das freie Ich erhält dadurch die Funktion eines in sich reflektierten Ansichseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D6","text":"Die subjektive Verlegung der Schranke reproduziert die Endlichkeit in veränderter Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D7","text":"Die zunächst äußerliche Reflexion wird zur Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A10","CH_GB18_A_37:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D8","text":"Das Ding-an-sich wird durch die Aufnahme der Reflexion zu einem bestimmten Ding mit Eigenschaften.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12","CH_GB18_A_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D9","text":"Die abstrakte Reinheit des Dinges-an-sich wird durch seine eigene Bestimmtheit negiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A12","CH_GB18_A_37:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD1","text":"Die Opposition von Ding-an-sich und äußerlicher Reflexion ist keine ursprüngliche Zweiheit, sondern eine einseitige Abstraktion innerhalb der Bestimmung des Dinges selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A3","CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD2","text":"Der transzendentale Idealismus verändert nur den Ort der Schranke und erhält dadurch die endliche Struktur, die er zu überwinden beansprucht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A5","CH_GB18_A_37:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD3","text":"Das Freiheitsbewusstsein fungiert als Übergang vom abstrakten Ansichsein zur in sich reflektierten, bestimmten Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A8","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD4","text":"Die Bestimmtheit ist weder bloß subjektiv noch einem völlig bestimmungslosen Gegenstand äußerlich, sondern die eigene Reflexionsstruktur des Dinges-an-sich.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A3","CH_GB18_A_37:A5","CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD5","text":"Die Aufhebung des abstrakten Dinges-an-sich erfolgt nicht durch Rückkehr zum subjektiven Idealismus, sondern durch dessen Bestimmung als in sich reflektiertes, eigenschaftliches Ding.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A9","CH_GB18_A_37:A13","CH_GB18_A_37:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf der Annahme eines schlechthin bestimmungslosen, dennoch als letzte Realität fungierenden Gegenstandes beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit kann nicht dauerhaft entweder dem Subjekt oder einem vom Subjekt völlig getrennten Gegenstand zugerechnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX3","text":"Eine bloße Verschiebung der Grenze vom Objekt in das Subjekt ist keine Überwindung der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX4","text":"Die Freiheit kann nicht als empirische Mannigfaltigkeit subjektiver Zustände begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX5","text":"Die Reflexion kann nicht als äußerliche Instanz bestehen bleiben, wenn sie die Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX6","text":"Die Trennung von Ansichsein und Bestimmtheit kann nicht als endgültige ontologische Differenz gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein absolutes Ansichsein, dessen Reinheit gerade in der Abwesenheit jeder Bestimmung bestehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erkenntnisordnung, in der das Subjekt sämtliche Bestimmtheit erzeugt und der Gegenstand nur deren passiver Träger bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die Endlichkeit durch bloße Umkehrung der Subjekt-Objekt-Zuordnung zu beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine letzte Position jenseits der Reflexion, sofern das Ding-an-sich sich nur durch seine Reflexionsbestimmungen als Ding erweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS1","text":"Setzung: Ding-an-sich = Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS2","text":"Konsequenz: Abstraktion von aller Bestimmtheit → Unerkennbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS3","text":"Externalisierung: Unerkanntes Unbestimmtes → Bestimmung in äußerlicher Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS4","text":"Subjektivistische Fixierung: äußerliche Reflexion → Bewusstsein → Verlegung von Form und Inhalt ins Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS5","text":"Gegenbewegung: Freiheitsbewusstsein → Ich als allgemeine Unbestimmtheit → Abtrennung der Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS6","text":"Grenzdiagnose: Verlegung der Schranke ins Subjekt → Reproduktion der Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS7","text":"Immanente Umkehrung: äußerliche Reflexion → eigene Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS8","text":"Aufhebung: Ding-an-sich + eigene Reflexion → bestimmtes Ding mit Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS9","text":"Schlussnegation: bestimmtes Ding-an-sich → Unwahrheit des reinen, abstrakten Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF1","text":"Bestimmungsloses Ding-an-sich → Unerkennbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF2","text":"Unerkennbarkeit → äußerliche Reflexion als Trägerin der Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF3","text":"Äußerliche Reflexion → transzendentaler Idealismus und Subjektivierung der Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF4","text":"Subjektivismus → Freiheitsbewusstsein als Gegenposition des allgemeinen Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF5","text":"Gegenposition → Nachweis, dass die Schranke nur vom Objekt ins Subjekt verlegt wurde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF6","text":"Äußerlichkeit der Reflexion → ihre Bestimmung als eigene Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF7","text":"Eigene Reflexionsbestimmung → bestimmtes Ding mit Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF8","text":"Bestimmtes Ding → Aufhebung der Reinheit des abstrakten Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME1","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Ding-an-sich und Reflexion wird von einer Zweiheit zu einer inneren Selbstbestimmung des Dinges umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME2","text":"Die subjektive und objektive Form der Schranke werden als Varianten derselben Endlichkeitsstruktur klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich wird von einem unbestimmten Grenzbegriff zu einem durch eigene Eigenschaften bestimmten Reflexionszusammenhang umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME4","text":"Freiheit wird nicht mehr als bloße Abwesenheit von Bestimmung, sondern als in sich reflektierte Identität lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME5","text":"Die Alternative „Bestimmung im Subjekt oder Bestimmung im Gegenstand“ wird als falscher Gegensatz sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text behandelt das Verhältnis von Ding-an-sich, Bewusstsein, Ich und Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die entscheidende Struktur ist die Verschiebung und anschließende Rückbindung der Bestimmung zwischen äußerlicher Reflexion und Ding-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der transzendentale Idealismus wird nicht durch Gegenbehauptung, sondern durch die immanente Konsequenz seiner eigenen Schrankenbestimmung widerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird als in sich reflektierte Bestimmtheit gefasst; reine Unbestimmtheit besitzt keinen stabilen ontologischen Vorrang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der abstrakten Unbestimmtheit zur bestimmten Reflexionsidentität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die konkrete Dialektik der Eigenschaften im Einzelnen weiterentwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Selbstbestimmung der äußerlichen Reflexion als notwendiger Übergang anerkannt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Diagnose, dass die Verschiebung der Schranke ins Subjekt die Endlichkeit nicht beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT5","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle liegt in der vorausgesetzten Identifikation von äußerlicher Reflexion und eigener Bestimmung des Dinges-an-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von abstrakter Trennung über subjektive Vermittlung zu immanenter Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112423625927Z_c3bc958a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"0dfd342210666162d94ce2246a104e2f43dcba221ad7552619786716d84ae8d4","sha256":"21cc44b5374b4dc294717d5aa26b7a6901cd8eccc5d9f0a063a308fe7353fa87","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:24:23.627058+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS1","text":"The thing-in-itself is posited as an empty abstraction from all determinacy and thereby determined as unknowable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS2","text":"Determinacy initially falls into a reflection external to the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS3","text":"Transcendental idealism determines this external reflection as consciousness and relocates all determinations into the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS4","text":"Consciousness of freedom reverses this distribution by conceiving the I as universal, indeterminate identity and the determinations as external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS5","text":"External reflection, however, proves itself to be a determination of the thing-in-itself itself and thus its own inner determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AS6","text":"The abstract separation of thing-in-itself and reflection is thereby sublated; the pure thing-in-itself proves to be an untrue determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A1","text":"The thing-in-itself is posited as an abstraction from all determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A2","text":"An abstraction from all determinacy is, as such, not knowable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A3","text":"If the thing-in-itself is posited as indeterminate, then every determination falls outside it into a reflection alien to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A4","text":"Transcendental idealism determines external reflection as consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A5","text":"Transcendental idealism relocates the form and content of things into consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A6","text":"Consciousness of freedom knows the I as universal and indeterminate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A7","text":"Consciousness of freedom separates the manifold and necessary determinations from the I and ascribes them to things as external determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A8","text":"The reflected I possesses, in its consciousness of freedom, that identity which ought to be ascribed to the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A9","text":"Transcendental idealism does not transcend finitude, but relocates the limitation from the object into the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A10","text":"External reflection is initially determined neither as consciousness nor the thing-in-itself as I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A11","text":"External reflection determines itself as the thing-in-itself, or rather as the own determination of the first thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A12","text":"The thing-in-itself essentially has external reflection in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A13","text":"A thing-in-itself with its own determinacy and properties is no longer pure abstraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:A14","text":"The determination of the pure thing-in-itself thereby proves to be untrue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX1","text":"The thing-in-itself is not a knowable determinacy of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX2","text":"The thing-in-itself is not independent of its determinations once these are conceived as its own reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX3","text":"External reflection is not absolutely alien to the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX4","text":"Consciousness is not the final explanation of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX5","text":"The relocation of determinations into the subject does not transcend the finite limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX6","text":"In consciousness of freedom, the I is not the mere sum of changing subjective determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX7","text":"The manifoldness of properties is not to be ascribed exclusively to the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:NX8","text":"The pure, determinationless thing-in-itself is not a sustainable final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D1","text":"The indeterminacy of the thing-in-itself generates the impossibility of cognizing it as such.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D2","text":"The positing of an indeterminate thing-in-itself generates an opposition between abstract being-in-itself and external determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D3","text":"Transcendental idealism makes the subjective constitution the bearer of all objective determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A4","CH_GB18_A_37:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D4","text":"Consciousness of freedom opposes to the subjectivist determination a universal I that separates the determinations from itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D5","text":"The free I thereby assumes the function of a being-in-itself reflected into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D6","text":"The subjective relocation of the limitation reproduces finitude in altered form.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D7","text":"The initially external reflection becomes a determination of the thing-in-itself itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A10","CH_GB18_A_37:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D8","text":"Through the incorporation of reflection, the thing-in-itself becomes a determinate thing with properties.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12","CH_GB18_A_37:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:D9","text":"The abstract purity of the thing-in-itself is negated by its own determinacy.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A12","CH_GB18_A_37:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD1","text":"The opposition of thing-in-itself and external reflection is not an original duality, but a one-sided abstraction within the determination of the thing itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A1","CH_GB18_A_37:A3","CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD2","text":"Transcendental idealism merely changes the location of the limitation and thereby preserves the finite structure which it claims to overcome.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A5","CH_GB18_A_37:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD3","text":"Consciousness of freedom functions as the transition from abstract being-in-itself to determinate identity reflected into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A6","CH_GB18_A_37:A8","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD4","text":"Determinacy is neither merely subjective nor external to a wholly determinationless object, but is the thing-in-itself's own structure of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A3","CH_GB18_A_37:A5","CH_GB18_A_37:A11","CH_GB18_A_37:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SD5","text":"The sublation of the abstract thing-in-itself occurs not through a return to subjective idealism, but through its determination as a thing reflected into itself and possessing properties.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_37:A9","CH_GB18_A_37:A13","CH_GB18_A_37:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on the assumption of an object that is absolutely determinationless yet functions as ultimate reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX2","text":"Determinacy cannot permanently be attributed either to the subject or to an object wholly separate from the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX3","text":"A mere displacement of the boundary from the object into the subject is no overcoming of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX4","text":"Freedom cannot be conceived as an empirical manifoldness of subjective states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX5","text":"Reflection cannot remain an external instance if it brings forth the determination of the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:DNX6","text":"The separation of being-in-itself and determinacy cannot count as a final ontological difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an absolute being-in-itself whose purity is supposed to consist precisely in the absence of every determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an order of cognition in which the subject generates all determinacy and the object remains merely its passive bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of eliminating finitude by the mere reversal of the subject-object attribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final position beyond reflection, insofar as the thing-in-itself proves itself to be a thing only through its determinations of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS1","text":"Positing: thing-in-itself = abstraction from all determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS2","text":"Consequence: abstraction from all determinacy → unknowability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS3","text":"Externalization: unknown indeterminate → determination in external reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS4","text":"Subjectivist fixation: external reflection → consciousness → relocation of form and content into the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS5","text":"Countermovement: consciousness of freedom → I as universal indeterminacy → separation of determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS6","text":"Diagnosis of limitation: relocation of the limitation into the subject → reproduction of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS7","text":"Immanent reversal: external reflection → own determination of the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS8","text":"Sublation: thing-in-itself + own reflection → determinate thing with properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:FGS9","text":"Concluding negation: determinate thing-in-itself → untruth of the pure, abstract thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF1","text":"Determinationless thing-in-itself → unknowability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF2","text":"Unknowability → external reflection as bearer of determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF3","text":"External reflection → transcendental idealism and the subjectivization of determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF4","text":"Subjectivism → consciousness of freedom as counterposition of the universal I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF5","text":"Counterposition → demonstration that the limitation was merely relocated from the object into the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF6","text":"Externality of reflection → its determination as the own determination of the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF7","text":"Own determination of reflection → determinate thing with properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:AF8","text":"Determinate thing → sublation of the purity of the abstract thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME1","text":"The opposition of thing-in-itself and reflection is remapped from a duality into an inner self-determination of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME2","text":"The subjective and objective forms of limitation are classified as variants of the same structure of finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME3","text":"The thing-in-itself is reclassified from an indeterminate limiting concept into a nexus of reflection determined through its own properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME4","text":"Freedom becomes legible no longer as the mere absence of determination, but as identity reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ME5","text":"The alternative “determination in the subject or determination in the object” becomes visible as a false opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text treats the relation of thing-in-itself, consciousness, I, and properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT2","text":"Structural — The decisive structure is the displacement and subsequent reconnection of determination between external reflection and thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Transcendental idealism is refuted not by a counterassertion, but by the immanent consequence of its own determination of limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is conceived as determinacy reflected into itself; pure indeterminacy possesses no stable ontological priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from abstract indeterminacy to determinate identity of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the concrete dialectic of properties is further developed in detail.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that the self-determination of external reflection is recognized as a necessary transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the diagnosis that the relocation of the limitation into the subject does not eliminate finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT5","text":"Its weakest point lies in the presupposed identification of external reflection and the own determination of the thing-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_37:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from abstract separation through subjective mediation to immanent determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_37:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_37@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_37:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 138","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 138","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Reciprocal Action of Things.","order":139,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDWD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDWD@R001","sha256":"819b3d793be2125808c24d55ec61138acf595e32f4abdb93537e641f7b0ab551","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS1","text":"Das Argument rekonstruiert, wie ein als selbständiges Ding-an-sich gesetztes Seiendes durch seine Bestimmtheit in die Eigenschaft übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS2","text":"Es behauptet, dass das Ding seinen wesentlichen Unterschied nur in der Eigenschaft besitzt und außerhalb ihrer Beziehung zur äußerlichen Einheit herabsinkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS3","text":"Es verfährt als immanente metaphysische Übergangs- und Umkehrungsanalyse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS4","text":"Die zunächst als Vermittlung zwischen selbständigen Extremen gesetzte Eigenschaft erweist sich als die einheitliche Reflexion und Kontinuität dieser Extreme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS5","text":"Die Dinge verschwinden als selbständige Extreme, während die Eigenschaft zur selbstständigen Materie und das Ding zur unwesentlichen äußeren Form wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A1","text":"Das Ding-an-sich existiert wesentlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A2","text":"Äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit und Bestimmtheit gehören zum Ansichsein als Reflexion-in-sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich ist ein Ding, das Eigenschaften hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A4","text":"Mehrere Dinge unterscheiden sich durch sich selbst und nicht durch eine ihnen fremde Rücksicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","text":"Die verschiedenen Dinge stehen durch ihre Eigenschaften in wesentlicher Wechselwirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist die Wechselbeziehung der Dinge selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A7","text":"Das Ding ist nichts außerhalb seiner eigenschaftlichen Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","text":"Die gegenseitige Bestimmung der Dinge bildet eine mit sich identische Reflexion und Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist negative Reflexion und das Unterscheiden des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","text":"Das Ding besitzt seinen Unterschied von anderem nur in der Eigenschaft an ihm selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A11","text":"Das wahrhafte Ansichsein liegt im Gesetztsein und damit in der Eigenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","text":"Das Ding ohne bestimmte Eigenschaft ist nur abstraktes Ansichsein, unwesentlicher Umfang und äußerliches Zusammenfassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A13","text":"Ohne bestimmte Eigenschaften ist der Unterschied der Dinge nur gleichgültig quantitativ und ihre Trennung oder Vereinigung äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","text":"Die Dinge verschwinden als bestehende Extreme, sobald ihre Beziehung als Eigenschaft erkannt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist das Selbstständige, während die Dinge das Unwesentliche sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A16","text":"Die selbstständige Eigenschaft ist einfache Kontinuität mit sich, die sich als mannigfaltige Materie bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX1","text":"Das Ding ist kein von seinen Eigenschaften ablösbares selbstständiges Extrem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX2","text":"Die Beziehung der Dinge ist keine äußerliche Verbindung bereits unabhängiger Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX3","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist keine bloß fremde oder äußerliche Bestimmung des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX4","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist kein im Ding aufgehobenes bloßes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX5","text":"Das Ding ohne Eigenschaft ist kein wahrhaft wesentliches Ansichsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX6","text":"Dingheit ist keine substanzielle Identität, die unabhängig von bestimmter Eigenschaft fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX7","text":"Die Einheit des Dings ist kein hinreichender Grund seiner Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX8","text":"Die Unterscheidung der Dinge ist ohne Eigenschaften keine qualitative Selbstunterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D1","text":"Die Eigenschaft wird von einer vermeintlichen Vermittlung zwischen Dingen zur eigentlichen Bestimmung ihrer Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D2","text":"Die Wechselwirkung ist zugleich Unterscheidung und Beziehung, weil beide Momente eine einzige Reflexion bilden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","CH_GB18_CDWD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D3","text":"Das Ding-an-sich geht in die Eigenschaft über, weil sein Ansichsein nur im Gesetztsein wahrhaft bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A1","CH_GB18_CDWD:A2","CH_GB18_CDWD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D4","text":"Die Abstraktion vom Eigenschaftlichen erzeugt kein ursprüngliches Wesen, sondern einen unwesentlichen Umfang.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D5","text":"Die Grenzen eines Dings sind ohne seine Eigenschaften äußerlich setzbar und daher quantitativ variabel.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D6","text":"Die als Mitte gesetzte Eigenschaft wird selbst zum selbstständigen Träger der Beziehung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D7","text":"Das Ding bleibt als unmittelbare negative Einheit bestehen, besitzt aber keine selbstständige Wesentlichkeit außerhalb der Eigenschaft.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D8","text":"Die selbstständige Eigenschaft bestimmt sich als vielfältige Materie, aus der das Ding besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD1","text":"Die ontologische Priorität verschiebt sich vom Ding als Träger auf die Eigenschaft als relationale und zugleich selbstständige Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","CH_GB18_CDWD:A7","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD2","text":"Beziehung erzeugt hier nicht lediglich eine Verbindung zwischen Substanzen, sondern erweist sich als die Substanzialität selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD3","text":"Individuation wird in die Eigenschaft verlegt, während die Einheit des Dings auf äußerliche und quantitative Abgrenzbarkeit reduziert wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD4","text":"Dingheit wird zu einer maßstabsabhängigen Zusammenfassung, deren Einheit in immer weitere Dinge zerlegt werden kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD5","text":"Die ursprüngliche Opposition von Ding und Eigenschaft wird nicht zwischen zwei bleibenden Entitäten vermittelt, sondern in eine Kontinuität überführt, in der nur die Eigenschaft Selbstständigkeit behält.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD6","text":"Die Eigenschaft erhält eine doppelte Bestimmung als Wechselbeziehung und als selbstständige Materie, wodurch die ursprüngliche Trennung von Relation und Substanz instabil wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme eines eigenschaftslosen Substrats, das vor jeder Bestimmung als das eigentliche Wesen des Dings besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Relationsmodell, in dem selbstständige Extreme der Beziehung ontologisch vorausliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine feste Dinggrenze, die unabhängig von eigenschaftlicher Bestimmung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Vorstellung, Abstraktion vom Eigenschaftlichen sei eine neutrale Entfernung von etwas Äußerlichem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die ontologische Rangordnung, in der das Ding wesentlich und die Eigenschaft akzidentell wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine qualitative Identität des Dings, die nicht durch negative Reflexion vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine relationfreie Identität hinter den Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine letzte, selbständige Einheit vor der eigenschaftlichen Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX3","text":"Nicht aufrechterhaltbar ist die Trennung von Träger und Bestimmung als grundlegende ontologische Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich wird ein Ansichsein, das außerhalb seines Gesetztseins und seiner Beziehung bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS1","text":"Setze das Ding-an-sich als wesentliches, unmittelbares und bestimmtes Extrem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS2","text":"Bestimme das Ding durch Eigenschaften und vervielfache die Dinge durch eigenschaftliche Selbstunterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS3","text":"Identifiziere die Eigenschaft mit der Wechselbeziehung, in der Unterscheidung und Beziehung eine einzige Reflexion bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS4","text":"Löse die vermeintlichen Extreme in der Kontinuität dieser Beziehung auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS5","text":"Kehre die anfängliche Abstraktion um, indem das Ding zur äußeren Form und die Eigenschaft zum selbstständigen Bestehen bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS6","text":"Bestimme die selbstständige Eigenschaft als einfache Kontinuität mit sich und als mannigfaltige Materie, aus der die Dinge bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AF1","text":"Ding-an-sich als wesentliches Extrem → eigenschaftliche Bestimmtheit → Wechselwirkung als selbstidentische Reflexion → Auflösung der selbstständigen Dinge → Umkehrung der Abstraktion → Eigenschaft als selbstständige Materie → Ding als unwesentliche äußere Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME1","text":"Dingheit wird von einer ursprünglichen Wesensbestimmung zu einer äußerlichen Form der Eigenschaft umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME2","text":"Eigenschaft wird von einem Prädikat des Dings zu dessen konstitutiver Beziehung und selbstständigem Bestehen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME3","text":"Der Unterschied wird aus äußerlicher Vergleichung in negative, eigenschaftliche Reflexion verlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME4","text":"Die Grenze des Dings erscheint als äußerlich setzbare Zusammenfassung und nicht als letztgültige ontologische Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von unabhängigen Dingen und äußerer Beziehung bricht zugunsten einer Kontinuität der Wechselbeziehung zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME6","text":"Materie erscheint nicht als vorausgesetzter Träger der Eigenschaften, sondern als Resultat ihrer Verselbstständigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Das Ding besitzt Eigenschaften, durch die es sich von anderen Dingen unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Eigenschaft ist die relationale Reflexion, in der Dinge zugleich unterschieden und bezogen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die begriffliche Operation der Abstraktion wird als wertverändernder Übergang rekonstruiert und gegen ihre anfängliche Selbstdeutung gewendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Ansichsein wird nicht als relationfreie Unmittelbarkeit, sondern als in der Bestimmtheit gesetztes und dadurch eigenschaftliches Bestehen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom Ding-an-sich über die Eigenschaft zur selbstständigen Materie zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die selbstständige Materie jenseits ihrer bloßen Bestimmung als mannigfaltige Eigenschaft weiter bestimmt werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist als dialektischer Übergang kohärent, nicht jedoch als statische Ontologie gleichrangiger Begriffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle liegt in der Auflösung der vermeintlichen Selbstständigkeit des Dings durch die Analyse seiner eigenschaftlichen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die Eigenschaft zugleich als Beziehung und als selbstständige Materie fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen dem anfänglichen wesentlichen Ding-an-sich und dem später unwesentlichen Ding als äußerer Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Umkehrung der Abstraktion und die Verschiebung der Selbstständigkeit nicht als bloße Beschreibung, sondern als erzeugende Übergänge verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114354414555Z_391ce46a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Reciprocal Interaction of Things.","source_sha256":"819b3d793be2125808c24d55ec61138acf595e32f4abdb93537e641f7b0ab551","sha256":"e42d3986c24140107f979c809555164c1a00343d05a0b64dac87059af6962d4a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:43:54.425290+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS1","text":"The argument reconstructs how a being posited as a self-subsistent thing-in-itself passes over into property through its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS2","text":"It asserts that the thing possesses its essential difference only in property and, outside its relation to external unity, sinks into insignificance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS3","text":"It proceeds as an immanent metaphysical analysis of transition and reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS4","text":"Property, initially posited as mediation between self-subsistent extremes, proves to be the unified reflection and continuity of these extremes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AS5","text":"The things vanish as self-subsistent extremes, while property becomes self-subsistent matter and the thing becomes an inessential external form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A1","text":"The thing-in-itself exists essentially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A2","text":"External immediacy and determinacy belong to being-in-itself as reflection-into-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A3","text":"The thing-in-itself is a thing that has properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A4","text":"Several things differ through themselves and not through a respect alien to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","text":"The different things stand in essential reciprocal interaction through their properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","text":"Property is the interrelation of the things themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A7","text":"The thing is nothing outside its relation of properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","text":"The reciprocal determination of things constitutes a reflection and continuity identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","text":"Property is negative reflection and the distinguishing of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","text":"The thing possesses its difference from another only in property within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A11","text":"True being-in-itself lies in positedness and thereby in property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","text":"The thing without determinate property is only abstract being-in-itself, inessential extent, and external aggregation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A13","text":"Without determinate properties, the difference of things is only indifferently quantitative, and their separation or union is external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","text":"The things vanish as subsisting extremes as soon as their relation is recognized as property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","text":"Property is the self-subsistent, whereas the things are the inessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:A16","text":"The self-subsistent property is simple continuity with itself, which determines itself as manifold matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX1","text":"The thing is not a self-subsistent extreme detachable from its properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX2","text":"The relation of things is not an external connection of already independent unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX3","text":"Property is not a merely alien or external determination of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX4","text":"Property is not a mere moment sublated in the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX5","text":"The thing without property is not truly essential being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX6","text":"Thinghood is not a substantial identity that persists independently of determinate property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX7","text":"The unity of the thing is not a sufficient ground of its determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:NX8","text":"Without properties, the distinction of things is not a qualitative self-distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D1","text":"Property passes from a purported mediation between things to the proper determination of their existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D2","text":"Reciprocal interaction is at once distinction and relation, because both moments form a single reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","CH_GB18_CDWD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D3","text":"The thing-in-itself passes over into property because its being-in-itself is truly determined only in positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A1","CH_GB18_CDWD:A2","CH_GB18_CDWD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D4","text":"Abstraction from what is proprial does not produce an original essence, but an inessential extent.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D5","text":"The boundaries of a thing can be externally posited without its properties and are therefore quantitatively variable.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D6","text":"Property, posited as the middle, itself becomes the self-subsistent bearer of the relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D7","text":"The thing remains as immediate negative unity, but possesses no self-subsistent essentiality outside property.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:D8","text":"The self-subsistent property determines itself as manifold matter of which the thing consists.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD1","text":"Ontological priority shifts from the thing as bearer to property as relational and at the same time self-subsistent determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A5","CH_GB18_CDWD:A7","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD2","text":"Relation here does not merely produce a connection between substances, but proves to be substantiality itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD3","text":"Individuation is relocated into property, while the unity of the thing is reduced to external and quantitative delimitability.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A9","CH_GB18_CDWD:A10","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD4","text":"Thinghood becomes a scale-dependent aggregation whose unity can be decomposed into ever further things.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A12","CH_GB18_CDWD:A13","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD5","text":"The original opposition of thing and property is not mediated between two enduring entities, but is transformed into a continuity in which property alone retains self-subsistence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A8","CH_GB18_CDWD:A14","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SD6","text":"Property receives a double determination as interrelation and as self-subsistent matter, whereby the original separation of relation and substance becomes unstable.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDWD:A6","CH_GB18_CDWD:A15","CH_GB18_CDWD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX1","text":"False must be the assumption of a propertyless substrate that subsists before every determination as the proper essence of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of relation in which self-subsistent extremes ontologically precede the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a fixed boundary of the thing that holds independently of proprial determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the conception that abstraction from what is proprial is a neutral removal of something external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the ontological hierarchy in which the thing would be essential and property accidental.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a qualitative identity of the thing that would not be mediated by negative reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an identity free of relation behind the properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an ultimate, self-subsistent unity prior to proprial distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX3","text":"The separation of bearer and determination as a fundamental ontological order is not maintainable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:SNX4","text":"Being-in-itself that could subsist outside its positedness and its relation becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS1","text":"Posit the thing-in-itself as an essential, immediate, and determinate extreme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS2","text":"Determine the thing through properties and multiply the things through proprial self-distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS3","text":"Identify property with the interrelation in which distinction and relation form a single reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS4","text":"Dissolve the purported extremes in the continuity of this relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS5","text":"Reverse the initial abstraction by determining the thing as external form and property as self-subsistent subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:FGS6","text":"Determine the self-subsistent property as simple continuity with itself and as manifold matter of which things consist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:AF1","text":"Thing-in-itself as essential extreme → proprial determinacy → reciprocal interaction as self-identical reflection → dissolution of self-subsistent things → reversal of abstraction → property as self-subsistent matter → thing as inessential external unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME1","text":"Thinghood is remapped from an original essential determination to an external form of property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME2","text":"Property is reclassified from a predicate of the thing to its constitutive relation and self-subsistent subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME3","text":"Difference is relocated from external comparison into negative, proprial reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME4","text":"The boundary of the thing appears as an externally positible aggregation and not as an ultimately valid ontological unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME5","text":"The opposition between independent things and external relation collapses in favor of a continuity of interrelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ME6","text":"Matter appears not as a presupposed bearer of properties, but as the result of their becoming self-subsistent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The thing possesses properties through which it distinguishes itself from other things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Property is the relational reflection in which things are at once distinguished and related.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The conceptual operation of abstraction is reconstructed as a value-transforming transition and turned against its initial self-interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being-in-itself is determined not as relation-free immediacy, but as subsistence posited in determinacy and thereby proprial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the thing-in-itself through property to self-subsistent matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how self-subsistent matter is to be further determined beyond its mere determination as manifold property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent as a dialectical transition, but not as a static ontology of coequal concepts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point lies in the dissolution of the purported self-subsistence of the thing through the analysis of its proprial determinacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in property functioning at once as relation and as self-subsistent matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises between the initially essential thing-in-itself and the later inessential thing as external unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDWD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the reversal of abstraction and the displacement of self-subsistence are understood not as mere description but as generative transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDWD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDWD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDWD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 139","title":"c. The Reciprocal Action of Things.","context":"Chapter 139","original_title":"c. Die Wechselwirkung der Dinge."},"original_title":"c. Die Wechselwirkung der Dinge.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD","layer":"CH","title":"B. The Subsistence of the Thing in Matters.","order":140,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDBD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDBD@R001","sha256":"4de505bb69acb844bc49060eba785e0fa8efba47dd0694b63a28e4a69d4f2f1d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS1","text":"Die Eigenschaft wird als das Wesentliche und dadurch als wahrhaft selbstständige Existenz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS2","text":"Ihre Selbstständigkeit erzwingt den Übergang von der Eigenschaft zur Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS3","text":"Die Eigenschaft enthält zugleich Kontinuität mit sich und negative Unterscheidung gegen Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS4","text":"Die Kontinuität hebt den qualitativen Unterschied der Dinge auf und stellt die Dingheit nur als negative Selbstständigkeit wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS5","text":"Das Ding wird dadurch vollkommen bestimmt, aber seine Bestimmtheit fällt in das Element der Unwesentlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS6","text":"Die selbstständigen Materien überschreiten das einzelne Ding, bleiben gegeneinander äußerlich und konstituieren es nur als quantitative Sammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS7","text":"Die rekonstruktiv-dialektische Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung des Dings als Zusammenhang, dessen einziger Zusammenhang im Fehlen eines inneren Zusammenhangs besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist das Wesentliche des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","text":"Das Wesentliche muss als selbstständige Existenz bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","text":"Die Eigenschaft ist sowohl Reflexion-in-sich als auch Reflexion-in-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","text":"Die Reflexion-in-sich der Eigenschaft erzeugt ihre Kontinuität mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A5","text":"Die Kontinuität der Eigenschaft setzt die Aufhebung des Unterschieds der Dinge voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","text":"Die negative Beziehung der Eigenschaft auf Anderes bleibt in ihrer Selbstständigkeit erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A7","text":"Das Ding an sich ist zunächst abstrakte Identität und unbestimmte negative Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","text":"Die Eigenschaften bestimmen das Ding zunächst durch seinen Unterschied von anderen Dingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","text":"Die Kontinuität der Eigenschaft mit anderen hebt diesen Unterschied als unvollkommenen Unterschied auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A10","text":"Die Rückkehr des Dings in sich erzeugt seine Bestimmtheit als bestimmtes Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","text":"Die selbstständige Materie macht die Bestimmtheit des Dings zu einer äußerlichen und unwesentlichen Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","text":"Das Ding besteht aus mehreren selbstständigen Materien, deren Beziehung innerhalb des Dings unwesentlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A13","text":"Die Materien überschreiten das einzelne Ding und setzen sich in anderen Dingen fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","text":"Die Materien begrenzen einander nicht qualitativ und heben sich in ihrer Verbindung nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","text":"Die Beziehung der Materien ist nur quantitativ bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A16","text":"Das Ding ist die bloße Sammlung eines Quantums verschiedener Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX1","text":"Materien und Stoffe werden nicht ohne Weiteres als Dinge bestimmt; ihr Status bleibt zwischen Ding und Halbding unentschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX2","text":"Die Dingheit wird nicht beseitigt, sondern zu einem unwesentlichen Moment herabgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX3","text":"Der Unterschied der Dinge bleibt nicht als selbstständige qualitative Trennung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX4","text":"Die Verbindung der Materien im Ding ist keine wesentliche Verknüpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX5","text":"Das Zugehören einer Materie zu einem Ding bildet keine Schranke für diese Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX6","text":"Die Materien sind füreinander keine qualitativen Beschränkungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX7","text":"Die Materien heben sich durch ihre Verbindung im Ding nicht gegenseitig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX8","text":"Das Ding ist keine qualitative Einheit, sondern eine quantitative Beziehung und Sammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX9","text":"Der Zusammenhang des Dings ist kein innerer Zusammenhang der Bestandteile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D1","text":"Die Notwendigkeit der Materie entsteht aus der Forderung, das Wesentliche als selbstständige Existenz zu behandeln.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D2","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit der Eigenschaft ist zugleich positive Kontinuität und negative Einheit gegen die aufgehobene Dingheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","CH_GB18_BDBD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D3","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit der Materie setzt die Aufhebung des qualitativen Unterschieds der Dinge voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","CH_GB18_BDBD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D4","text":"Das Ding geht vom unbestimmten Ding an sich zu einer Bestimmtheit über, die als Bestimmtheit seiner selbst gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A7","CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D5","text":"Die vollständige Bestimmtheit des Dings ist zugleich unwesentlich, weil sie in der äußerlichen Kontinuität der Materien besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A10","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D6","text":"Die Einheit von Äußerlichkeit und Wesentlichkeit spaltet sich in selbstständige Materie und das Ding als negatives Eins.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D7","text":"Die Unterscheidung eines Dings von anderen beruht auf der Anzahl und dem Quantum der in ihm enthaltenen Materien.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D8","text":"Die Bestimmung des Dings wird von einer qualitativen Differenz in eine quantitative Zusammensetzung überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD1","text":"Die ontologische Priorität verschiebt sich vom Ding mit Eigenschaften auf selbstständige Materien, aus deren äußerlicher Zusammenstellung das Ding hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD2","text":"Individuation wird nicht mehr durch innere qualitative Bestimmung, sondern durch quantitative Verteilung selbstständiger Materien erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD3","text":"Die Identität des Dings beruht auf einer Beziehung, deren Bestandteile von dieser Beziehung unabhängig bleiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD4","text":"Die negative Einheit bleibt erhalten, verliert aber jede konstitutive Kraft gegenüber der positiven Kontinuität der Materien.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD5","text":"Das einzelne Ding besitzt keine exklusive materielle Grenze, weil seine Bestandteile über es hinaus in anderen Dingen fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD6","text":"Die Behauptung eines Zusammenhangs führt zur Bestimmung des Dings als Sammlung, deren Einheit durch das Fehlen innerer Vermittlung erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX1","text":"Die Eigenschaft darf nicht als bloß äußerliches Prädikat ohne selbstständige Existenz bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX2","text":"Das Ding an sich darf nicht als abstrakte, unbestimmte Identität fixiert bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX3","text":"Die qualitative Differenz darf nicht als zureichender Grund der Individualität gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX4","text":"Die Materie darf nicht der Grenze und Identität eines einzelnen Dings untergeordnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX5","text":"Die Einheit des Dings darf nicht durch eine innere Vermittlung der Materien erklärt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX6","text":"Eine positive, konstitutive Wechselwirkung der Materien darf nicht vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX7","text":"Die quantitative Zusammensetzung darf nicht auf eine qualitative Totalität zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX1","text":"Eine genuine innere Totalität des Dings ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX2","text":"Ein positiver Grund des Zusammenhangs zwischen den Materien bleibt ausgeschlossen; die Identität des Dings beruht auf dem Fehlen eines solchen Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX3","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Ding und Bestandteil kann ontologisch nicht geschlossen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass ein Ding seine Materien durch eigene qualitative Einheit bindet, ist versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS1","text":"Wesentlichkeit der Eigenschaft → Forderung nach selbstständiger Existenz → Übergang zur Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS2","text":"Reflexion-in-sich + Reflexion-in-Anderes → Kontinuität mit sich + negative Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS3","text":"Kontinuität der Eigenschaft → Aufhebung des Unterschieds der Dinge → Wiederherstellung der Dingheit als negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS4","text":"Unbestimmtes Ding an sich + eigenschaftliche Differenzierung → Rückkehr in sich → Ding als bestimmt bestimmtes Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS5","text":"Rückkehr in sich + selbstständige Materie → vollständige, aber unwesentliche äußerliche Bestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS6","text":"Selbstständigkeit der Materien → äußerliche Verbindung → Fortsetzung der Materien über das einzelne Ding hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS7","text":"Gleichgültigkeit der Materien + fehlende gegenseitige Begrenzung → rein quantitative Bestimmbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS8","text":"Quantitative Bestimmbarkeit + äußerliche Sammlung → Ding als Quantum von Materien → Zusammenhang durch Zusammenhangslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AF1","text":"Wesentlichkeit der Eigenschaft → Verselbstständigung als Materie → Aufhebung des qualitativen Dingunterschieds → negative Wiederherstellung der Dingheit → vollständige, aber unwesentliche Bestimmtheit → äußerliche Koexistenz selbstständiger Materien → quantitative Sammlung ohne inneren Zusammenhang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME1","text":"Die Eigenschaft wird von einer Bestimmung des Dings zu einer selbstständigen Materie umkartiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME2","text":"Die qualitative Grenze zwischen Dingen wird durch die quantitative Verteilung von Materien ersetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME3","text":"Bestandteile erscheinen nicht mehr als konstitutive Momente eines Ganzen, sondern als voneinander unabhängige Existenzen innerhalb einer äußerlichen Sammlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME4","text":"Die Überschreitung des Dings durch seine Materien löst die strikte Gegenüberstellung von Ding und Bestandteil auf.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME5","text":"Der Begriff des Zusammenhangs wird so transformiert, dass auch die Zusammenhangslosigkeit als Bestimmung des Dings fungiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME6","text":"Dingheit und Materie werden nicht mehr als zwei abgeschlossene ontologische Klassen kartiert, sondern als ineinander übergehende Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Ding besteht aus verschiedenen Materien und ist deren quantitative Sammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Eigenschaft wird durch doppelte Reflexion in selbstständige Materie und negative Dingheit auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die qualitative Erklärung der Dingunterschiede wird in eine Analyse äußerlicher Komposition und quantitativer Differenz umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Ding durchläuft die Bewegung vom unbestimmten Ansichsein über eigenschaftliche Bestimmung zur äußerlichen, quantitativ bestimmten Sammlung selbstständiger Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von der Eigenschaft zur Materie und von der Materie zur Sammlung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der genaue ontologische Status der Materien, da ihre Unterscheidung von Dingen ausdrücklich nicht geschlossen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern dialektisch kohärent, solange negative Einheit und positive Kontinuität als getrennte Momente behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT4","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die Materien das Ding konstituieren sollen, ohne durch ihre Zugehörigkeit wesentlich bestimmt oder begrenzt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass der Text Zusammenhang behauptet, ihn aber zugleich als Fehlen eines inneren Zusammenhangs bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist am stärksten bei der Umwandlung qualitativer Differenz in quantitative Komposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT7","text":"Sie hängt von der vorausgesetzten Wesentlichkeit der Eigenschaft und von der Annahme ab, dass Selbstständigkeit nur als Materie begrifflich stabilisiert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegungsrichtung des Textes bleibt erhalten: Eigenschaft → Materie → negative Dingheit → äußerliche Bestimmtheit → quantitative Sammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112748464877Z_9ac184d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. The Thing's Consisting of Matters.","source_sha256":"4de505bb69acb844bc49060eba785e0fa8efba47dd0694b63a28e4a69d4f2f1d","sha256":"b49d03fef017173de03dc83abab88c33d735405c9e859e494737f3432110770b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:27:48.465996+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS1","text":"The property is determined as the essential and thereby as truly self-subsistent existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS2","text":"Its self-subsistence compels the transition from property to matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS3","text":"The property contains at once continuity with itself and negative distinction from other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS4","text":"Continuity sublates the qualitative difference of things and restores thinghood only as negative self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS5","text":"The thing is thereby completely determined, but its determinateness falls into the element of unessentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS6","text":"The self-subsistent matters exceed the individual thing, remain external to one another, and constitute it only as a quantitative collection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AS7","text":"The reconstructive-dialectical movement ends in the determination of the thing as a connection whose sole connection consists in the absence of an inner connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","text":"The property is the essential of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","text":"The essential must be determined as self-subsistent existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","text":"The property is both reflection-into-itself and reflection-into-other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","text":"The reflection-into-itself of the property produces its continuity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A5","text":"The continuity of the property presupposes the sublation of the difference of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","text":"The negative relation of the property to other remains preserved in its self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A7","text":"The thing in itself is initially abstract identity and indeterminate negative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","text":"The properties initially determine the thing through its difference from other things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","text":"The continuity of the property with others sublates this difference as an incomplete difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A10","text":"The return of the thing into itself produces its determinateness as a determinate thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","text":"Self-subsistent matter makes the determinateness of the thing an external and unessential determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","text":"The thing consists of several self-subsistent matters, whose relation within the thing is unessential.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A13","text":"The matters exceed the individual thing and continue themselves in other things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","text":"The matters do not limit one another qualitatively and do not sublate one another in their combination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","text":"The relation of the matters can be determined only quantitatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:A16","text":"The thing is the mere collection of a quantum of different matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX1","text":"Matters and stuffs are not straightforwardly determined as things; their status remains undecided between thing and half-thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX2","text":"Thinghood is not eliminated, but demoted to an unessential moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX3","text":"The difference of things does not remain as a self-subsistent qualitative separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX4","text":"The combination of the matters in the thing is not an essential connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX5","text":"The belonging of a matter to a thing constitutes no limit for this matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX6","text":"The matters are not qualitative restrictions for one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX7","text":"The matters do not mutually sublate one another through their combination in the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX8","text":"The thing is not a qualitative unity, but a quantitative relation and collection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:NX9","text":"The connection of the thing is not an inner connection of its components.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D1","text":"The necessity of matter arises from the demand to treat the essential as self-subsistent existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D2","text":"The self-subsistence of the property is at once positive continuity and negative unity against the sublated thinghood.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","CH_GB18_BDBD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D3","text":"The self-subsistence of matter presupposes the sublation of the qualitative difference of things.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A4","CH_GB18_BDBD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D4","text":"The thing passes from the indeterminate thing in itself to a determinateness that is posited as its own determinateness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A7","CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D5","text":"The complete determinateness of the thing is at once unessential because it consists in the external continuity of the matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A10","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D6","text":"The unity of externality and essentiality splits into self-subsistent matter and the thing as negative one.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A3","CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D7","text":"The distinction of one thing from others rests on the number and quantum of the matters contained in it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:D8","text":"The determination of the thing is transferred from a qualitative difference into a quantitative composition.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD1","text":"Ontological priority shifts from the thing with properties to self-subsistent matters, from whose external assemblage the thing emerges.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD2","text":"Individuation is no longer produced through inner qualitative determination, but through the quantitative distribution of self-subsistent matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD3","text":"The identity of the thing rests on a relation whose components remain independent of this relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD4","text":"Negative unity remains preserved, but loses every constitutive force in relation to the positive continuity of the matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A6","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD5","text":"The individual thing possesses no exclusive material boundary, because its components persist beyond it in other things.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SD6","text":"The assertion of a connection leads to the determination of the thing as a collection whose unity is produced through the absence of inner mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX1","text":"The property must not remain as a merely external predicate without self-subsistent existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX2","text":"The thing in itself must not remain fixed as abstract, indeterminate identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX3","text":"Qualitative difference must not count as the sufficient ground of individuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX4","text":"Matter must not be subordinated to the boundary and identity of an individual thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX5","text":"The unity of the thing must not be explained through an inner mediation of the matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX6","text":"A positive, constitutive interaction of the matters must not be presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:DNX7","text":"The quantitative composition must not be reduced to a qualitative totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX1","text":"A genuine inner totality of the thing is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX2","text":"A positive ground of the connection between the matters remains excluded; the identity of the thing rests on the absence of such a ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX3","text":"The boundary between thing and component cannot be ontologically closed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:SNX4","text":"The possibility that a thing binds its matters through its own qualitative unity is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS1","text":"Essentiality of the property → demand for self-subsistent existence → transition to matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS2","text":"Reflection-into-itself + reflection-into-other → continuity with itself + negative distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS3","text":"Continuity of the property → sublation of the difference of things → restoration of thinghood as negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS4","text":"Indeterminate thing in itself + differentiation by properties → return into itself → thing as determinately determinate thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS5","text":"Return into itself + self-subsistent matter → complete, but unessential external determinateness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS6","text":"Self-subsistence of the matters → external combination → continuation of the matters beyond the individual thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS7","text":"Indifference of the matters + absence of mutual limitation → purely quantitative determinability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:FGS8","text":"Quantitative determinability + external collection → thing as quantum of matters → connection through lack of connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:AF1","text":"Essentiality of the property → self-subsistence as matter → sublation of the qualitative difference of things → negative restoration of thinghood → complete, but unessential determinateness → external coexistence of self-subsistent matters → quantitative collection without inner connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME1","text":"The property is remapped from a determination of the thing into self-subsistent matter.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A1","CH_GB18_BDBD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME2","text":"The qualitative boundary between things is replaced by the quantitative distribution of matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A8","CH_GB18_BDBD:A9","CH_GB18_BDBD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME3","text":"Components no longer appear as constitutive moments of a whole, but as existences independent of one another within an external collection.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME4","text":"The exceeding of the thing by its matters sublates the strict opposition of thing and component.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A12","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME5","text":"The concept of connection is so transformed that lack of connection too functions as a determination of the thing.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A14","CH_GB18_BDBD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ME6","text":"Thinghood and matter are no longer mapped as two closed ontological classes, but as determinations passing into one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDBD:A2","CH_GB18_BDBD:A11","CH_GB18_BDBD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT1","text":"Surface — The thing consists of different matters and is their quantitative collection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The property is disarticulated through double reflection into self-subsistent matter and negative thinghood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The qualitative explanation of the differences of things is reframed into an analysis of external composition and quantitative difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The thing passes through the movement from indeterminate being-in-itself, through determination by properties, to the external, quantitatively determined collection of self-subsistent matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from property to matter and from matter to collection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT2","text":"The exact ontological status of the matters remains underdetermined, since their distinction from things is explicitly not closed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally dialectically coherent so long as negative unity and positive continuity are treated as separate moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT4","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the matters are supposed to constitute the thing without being essentially determined or limited by their belonging to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT5","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that the text asserts connection while at the same time determining it as the absence of an inner connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the transformation of qualitative difference into quantitative composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT7","text":"It depends on the presupposed essentiality of the property and on the assumption that self-subsistence can be conceptually stabilized only as matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDBD:MRT8","text":"The text's actual direction of movement is preserved: property → matter → negative thinghood → external determinateness → quantitative collection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDBD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDBD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDBD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 140","title":"B. The Subsistence of the Thing in Matters.","context":"Chapter 140","original_title":"B. Das Bestehen des Dings aus Materien."},"original_title":"B. Das Bestehen des Dings aus Materien.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS","layer":"CH","title":"C. Dissolution of the Thing.","order":141,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CDAS"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDAS@R001","sha256":"3c92cb7431bbf38248f2ccfa8128fb4a5722ad1e834da9ee5a717f37eda3da8d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS1","text":"Das Ding ist zunächst nur der quantitative Zusammenhang freier Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS2","text":"Seine Identität verändert sich durch Zu- und Abgang von Stoffen sowie durch veränderte Mengenverhältnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS3","text":"Entstehung und Vergehen des Dings sind äußerliche Verbindung und äußerliche Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS4","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit seines Bestehens ist nicht akzidentell, sondern sein wesentliches Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS5","text":"Die Stoffe sind zugleich selbstständig, voneinander verschieden und negativ aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS6","text":"Ihr gleichzeitiges Bestehen bildet eine negative Einheit, in der jede Materie durch das Bestehen und Nichtbestehen der anderen vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS7","text":"Die widersprüchliche Vermittlung des selbstständigen Bestehens durch seine Negation führt von der Existenz zur Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","text":"Das Ding ist der bloß quantitative Zusammenhang freier Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A2","text":"Die Bestimmtheit des Dings hängt von seiner stofflichen Zusammensetzung und deren Mengenverhältnissen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","text":"Stoffe können in das Ding eintreten oder aus ihm ausscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","text":"Das Ding besitzt kein eigenes Maß und keine eigene Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A5","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit seines Seins und seine Auflösbarkeit sind wesentliche Bestimmungen des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","text":"Die Stoffe sind selbstständige Eigenschaften, aber keine Dinge mit negativer Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A7","text":"Der Inhalt jeder Materie ist eine bestimmte Bestimmtheit, die sich ihrem Inhalt nach auf Anderes bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","text":"Das Ding ist sowohl das gleichgültige Auch seiner Stoffe als auch ihre negative Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","text":"Die Bestimmtheit einer Materie setzt voraus, dass die andere in derselben Rücksicht nicht besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A10","text":"Das Ding erhält die Stoffe zugleich in ihrem Bestehen und in ihrer gegenseitigen Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A11","text":"Das gemeinsame Bestehen der Stoffe ist die Punktualität oder negative Einheit des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","text":"Die Stoffe durchdringen einander, ohne sich als gleichgültige Bestimmtheiten zu berühren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A13","text":"Jede Materie besteht in den Poren oder im Nichtbestehen der anderen Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A14","text":"Das Bestehen jeder Materie ist zugleich ihr Aufgehobensein und das Bestehen anderer Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A15","text":"Das Ding vermittelt selbstständiges Bestehen mit sich durch sein Gegenteil, die Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","text":"Die Existenz enthält als ihre Vollständigkeit selbstständiges Ansichsein und unwesentliche Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","text":"Die Wahrheit der Existenz ist ihr Ansichsein in der Unwesentlichkeit und ihre Grundlage in der Nichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A18","text":"Die Existenz ist in dieser Bestimmung Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX1","text":"Das Ding ist kein unveränderliches Ganzes mit feststehender Zusammensetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX2","text":"Das Ding besitzt keine von den Stoffen unabhängige Form oder ein eigenes Maß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX3","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit des Dings ist nicht von seinem eigentlichen Sein abtrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX4","text":"Die Stoffe sind keine selbstständigen Dinge mit negativer Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX5","text":"Das Ding ist nicht bloß eine additive Sammlung gleichgültig nebeneinander bestehender Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX6","text":"Die Stoffe stehen nicht in einer einfachen positiven Koexistenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX7","text":"Ihre Durchdringung ist kein unmittelbares Berühren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX8","text":"Kein Stoff besteht isoliert von der Negation und dem Nichtbestehen anderer Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX9","text":"Selbstständiges Bestehen ist nicht als unmittelbare, unbedingte Grundlage verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX10","text":"Existenz ist nicht die letzte Wahrheit des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D1","text":"Die Identität des Dings ist eine veränderliche Kompositionsidentität.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","CH_GB18_CDAS:A2","CH_GB18_CDAS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D2","text":"Entstehen und Vergehen des Dings sind keine inneren Selbstveränderungen, sondern Veränderungen äußerlicher Verbindung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D3","text":"Die absolute Porosität bezeichnet eine Existenzweise ohne abschließende eigene Grenze.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D4","text":"Die Stoffe sind formal auf sich bezogen, während ihr bestimmter Inhalt sie auf Anderes verweist.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","CH_GB18_CDAS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D5","text":"Die Einheit des Dings besteht in der Gleichzeitigkeit von Bestehen und gegenseitiger Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D6","text":"Das Bestehen eines Stoffes ist nur unter der Bedingung möglich, dass andere Stoffe in derselben Rücksicht nicht bestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D7","text":"Die Stoffe durchdringen einander gerade deshalb, weil ihre negative Vermittlung keinen unmittelbaren Kontakt erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A11","CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","CH_GB18_CDAS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D8","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit einer Materie ist durch das Bestehen und Nichtbestehen anderer Materien vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A13","CH_GB18_CDAS:A14","CH_GB18_CDAS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D9","text":"Die Existenz erweist sich als Erscheinung, weil ihr Ansichsein nur in unwesentlicher, durch Anderes vermittelter Existenz besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","CH_GB18_CDAS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD1","text":"Die Identität des Dings ist kein beharrendes Substrat, sondern der Prozess seiner fortgesetzten stofflichen Ersetzung und Auflösung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD2","text":"Die Einheit des Dings ist eine sich selbst auflösende Einheit, deren Bestand nur durch gegenseitige Negation erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10","CH_GB18_CDAS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD3","text":"Die behauptete Selbstständigkeit der Stoffe wird durch ihre relationale Vermittlung zugleich hergestellt und entzogen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","CH_GB18_CDAS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD4","text":"Die äußerliche Beziehung wird zur inneren Struktur des Dings, indem das Ding nur als diese Äußerlichkeit besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5","CH_GB18_CDAS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD5","text":"Die ontologische Wahrheit des Dings liegt nicht in unmittelbarem Bestehen, sondern in der Erscheinung eines durch Nichtigkeit gegründeten Bestehens.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A15","CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","CH_GB18_CDAS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein substantielles Modell, in dem die Stoffe unabhängig von ihren Beziehungen zu Anderen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unveränderlicher Träger, der hinter der Veränderung der Zusammensetzung erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine positive Einheit, die den Stoffen vorausliegt und ihre Verbindung von außen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Trennung von Sein und äußerlicher Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein selbstständiges Bestehen, das nicht durch sein Gegenteil vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Existenz, deren Grund ein positives Ansichsein statt Nichtigkeit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine reine Koexistenz, in der die Stoffe einander nicht zugleich begrenzen und aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Ding, das außerhalb der Zirkulation, Austauschbarkeit und äußerlichen Verbindung seiner Stoffe für sich bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein positiver ontologischer Grund, der vor der relationalen Negation liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Identität, die sich vollständig von dem unterscheidet, was sie ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine letzte Selbstständigkeit, die nicht zugleich Abhängigkeit von Anderem wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX5","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit des Systems ist ein Bestehen ohne Aufhebung, Vermittlung und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS1","text":"Quantitative Sammlung freier Stoffe → variable Zusammensetzung des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS2","text":"Zu- und Abgang sowie Mengenveränderung → äußerliche Veränderung, Entstehung und Vergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS3","text":"Wesentlich gesetzte Äußerlichkeit → absolute Porosität ohne eigenes Maß und eigene Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS4","text":"Selbstständige Stoffe ohne Dinghaftigkeit → Eigenschaften als reflektierte Bestimmtheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS5","text":"Bestimmter Inhalt → Beziehung auf Anderes und negative Beziehung der Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS6","text":"Gleichzeitiges Bestehen und gegenseitige Aufhebung → Punktualität oder negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS7","text":"Negative Einheit und Gleichgültigkeit → poröse Durchdringung ohne Berührung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS8","text":"Poröse Vermittlung → Bestehen jeder Materie im Bestehen und Nichtbestehen anderer Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS9","text":"Vermittlung des Selbstständigen durch seine Negation → widersprüchliche Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS10","text":"Widersprüchliche Existenz → Einheit von Ansichsein und unwesentlicher Existenz → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AF1","text":"Quantitative Stoffsammlung → äußerliche Veränderlichkeit → wesentliche Äußerlichkeit → negative Stoffbeziehung → negative Einheit → poröse Durchdringung → widersprüchliche Vermittlung → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AF2","text":"Selbstständiger Stoff → Beziehung auf Anderes → gegenseitiges Bestehen und Nichtbestehen → Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Selbstständigkeit → Existenz in der Unwesentlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME1","text":"Die Grenze des Dings wird von einer festen Kontur zu einer porösen Austauschstruktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME2","text":"Die Stoffe werden von scheinbar selbstständigen Substanzen zu selbstständigen Eigenschaften und bestimmten Relationen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME3","text":"Einheit wird nicht mehr als positive Gemeinsamkeit, sondern als negative Einheit gegenseitiger Aufhebung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME4","text":"Koexistenz und Ausschluss erscheinen nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als gleichzeitige Momente derselben Stoffbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME5","text":"Existenz wird von einer unmittelbaren Seinsform zu einer durch Anderes und Nichtigkeit gegründeten Erscheinung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Ding verändert sich durch Austausch, Ausscheidung, Hinzufügung und veränderte Mengenverhältnisse seiner Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Einheit des Dings wird durch äußerliche Verbindung, negative Stoffbeziehung und poröse Vermittlung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT3","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Bestehen ist zugleich Nichtbestehen und Aufgehobensein; die Wahrheit der Existenz liegt als Erscheinung in der Unwesentlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der quantitativen Stoffsammlung zur Erscheinung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die genaue kategoriale Vermittlung zwischen absoluter Porosität, negativer Einheit und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit nicht als Unabhängigkeit, sondern als durch Negation vermittelte Bestimmung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Herleitung der wesentlichen Äußerlichkeit aus der veränderlichen Zusammensetzung des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von Nichtbestehen, Aufgehobensein, Nichtigkeit und Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT6","text":"Die Spannung zwischen gleichgültiger Koexistenz und negativer Beziehung wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als konstitutiver Widerspruch des Dings erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, wenn das Ding nicht als Substrat, sondern als selbstauflösende Vermittlung von Bestehen und Negation rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113931450102Z_938cf41c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. The Dissolution of the Thing.","source_sha256":"3c92cb7431bbf38248f2ccfa8128fb4a5722ad1e834da9ee5a717f37eda3da8d","sha256":"1d1568c317e87f9c890951631406d23c77ee00b49f11a428f228cd7602525cf2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:39:31.451183+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS1","text":"The thing is initially only the quantitative connection of free materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS2","text":"Its identity changes through the ingress and egress of materials as well as through altered quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS3","text":"The coming-to-be and passing-away of the thing are external combination and external dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS4","text":"The externality of its subsistence is not accidental, but its essential subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS5","text":"The materials are at once self-subsistent, distinct from one another, and negatively related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS6","text":"Their simultaneous subsistence constitutes a negative unity in which each matter is mediated through the subsistence and non-subsistence of the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AS7","text":"The contradictory mediation of self-subsistent subsistence through its negation leads from existence to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","text":"The thing is the merely quantitative connection of free materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A2","text":"The determinacy of the thing depends on its material composition and its quantitative relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","text":"Materials can enter into the thing or depart from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","text":"The thing possesses no measure or form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A5","text":"The externality of its being and its dissolvability are essential determinations of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","text":"The materials are self-subsistent properties, but not things with negative self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A7","text":"The content of each matter is a determinate determinacy that, in accordance with its content, relates to an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","text":"The thing is both the indifferent also of its materials and their negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","text":"The determinacy of one matter presupposes that the other does not subsist in the same respect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A10","text":"The thing preserves the materials at once in their subsistence and in their reciprocal sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A11","text":"The common subsistence of the materials is the punctuality or negative unity of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","text":"The materials permeate one another without touching one another as indifferent determinacies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A13","text":"Each matter subsists in the pores or in the non-subsistence of the other matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A14","text":"The subsistence of each matter is at once its sublatedness and the subsistence of other matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A15","text":"The thing mediates self-subsistent subsistence with itself through its opposite, negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","text":"Existence contains, as its completeness, self-subsistent being-in-itself and unessential existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","text":"The truth of existence is its being-in-itself in unessentiality and its ground in nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:A18","text":"Existence is appearance in this determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX1","text":"The thing is not an unchanging whole with a fixed composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX2","text":"The thing possesses no form independent of the materials or measure of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX3","text":"The externality of the thing is not separable from its proper being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX4","text":"The materials are not self-subsistent things with negative self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX5","text":"The thing is not merely an additive collection of materials subsisting indifferently alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX6","text":"The materials do not stand in a simple positive coexistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX7","text":"Their permeation is not immediate touching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX8","text":"No material subsists in isolation from the negation and non-subsistence of other materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX9","text":"Self-subsistent subsistence is not available as an immediate, unconditional ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:NX10","text":"Existence is not the final truth of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D1","text":"The identity of the thing is a mutable compositional identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","CH_GB18_CDAS:A2","CH_GB18_CDAS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D2","text":"The coming-to-be and passing-away of the thing are not inner self-transformations, but transformations of external combination.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D3","text":"Absolute porosity designates a mode of existence without a conclusive boundary of its own.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D4","text":"The materials are formally related to themselves, while their determinate content refers them to an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","CH_GB18_CDAS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D5","text":"The unity of the thing consists in the simultaneity of subsistence and reciprocal sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D6","text":"The subsistence of one material is possible only on the condition that other materials do not subsist in the same respect.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D7","text":"The materials permeate one another precisely because their negative mediation produces no immediate contact.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A11","CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","CH_GB18_CDAS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D8","text":"The self-subsistence of one matter is mediated through the subsistence and non-subsistence of other matters.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A13","CH_GB18_CDAS:A14","CH_GB18_CDAS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:D9","text":"Existence proves to be appearance because its being-in-itself subsists only in unessential existence mediated through an other.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","CH_GB18_CDAS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD1","text":"The identity of the thing is not a persistent substrate, but the process of its continued material replacement and dissolution.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A1","CH_GB18_CDAS:A3","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD2","text":"The unity of the thing is a self-dissolving unity whose subsistence is produced only through reciprocal negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A8","CH_GB18_CDAS:A9","CH_GB18_CDAS:A10","CH_GB18_CDAS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD3","text":"The asserted self-subsistence of the materials is at once established and withdrawn through their relational mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A6","CH_GB18_CDAS:A12","CH_GB18_CDAS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD4","text":"The external relation becomes the inner structure of the thing, insofar as the thing subsists only as this externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A4","CH_GB18_CDAS:A5","CH_GB18_CDAS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SD5","text":"The ontological truth of the thing lies not in immediate subsistence, but in the appearance of a subsistence grounded in nullity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CDAS:A15","CH_GB18_CDAS:A16","CH_GB18_CDAS:A17","CH_GB18_CDAS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a substantial model in which the materials subsist independently of their relations to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an unchanging bearer that remains preserved behind the alteration of composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a positive unity that precedes the materials and determines their combination from without.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a separation of being and external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a self-subsistent subsistence that is not mediated through its opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an existence whose ground would be a positive being-in-itself rather than nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:DNX7","text":"Excluded is a pure coexistence in which the materials do not at once limit and sublate one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a thing that could subsist for itself outside the circulation, exchangeability, and external combination of its materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a positive ontological ground that lies prior to relational negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX3","text":"Inadmissible is an identity that distinguishes itself completely from that which it excludes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is an ultimate self-subsistence that would not at once be dependence on an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:SNX5","text":"The blocked possibility of the system is a subsistence without sublation, mediation, and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS1","text":"Quantitative collection of free materials → variable composition of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS2","text":"Ingress and egress, as well as quantitative alteration → external alteration, coming-to-be, and passing-away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS3","text":"Essentially posited externality → absolute porosity without measure and form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS4","text":"Self-subsistent materials without thinghood → properties as reflected determinacies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS5","text":"Determinate content → relation to an other and negative relation of the materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS6","text":"Simultaneous subsistence and reciprocal sublation → punctuality or negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS7","text":"Negative unity and indifference → porous permeation without touching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS8","text":"Porous mediation → subsistence of each matter in the subsistence and non-subsistence of other matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS9","text":"Mediation of the self-subsistent through its negation → contradictory existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:FGS10","text":"Contradictory existence → unity of being-in-itself and unessential existence → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AF1","text":"Quantitative collection of materials → external mutability → essential externality → negative material relation → negative unity → porous permeation → contradictory mediation → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:AF2","text":"Self-subsistent material → relation to an other → reciprocal subsistence and non-subsistence → sublation of immediate self-subsistence → existence in unessentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME1","text":"The boundary of the thing is remapped from a fixed contour to a porous structure of exchange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME2","text":"The materials are reclassified from apparently self-subsistent substances to self-subsistent properties and determinate relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME3","text":"Unity is no longer visible as positive commonality, but as the negative unity of reciprocal sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME4","text":"Coexistence and exclusion no longer appear as opposites, but as simultaneous moments of the same material relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ME5","text":"Existence is remapped from an immediate form of being to an appearance grounded through an other and nullity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT1","text":"Surface — The thing changes through exchange, expulsion, addition, and altered quantitative relations of its materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT2","text":"Structural — The unity of the thing is produced through external combination, negative material relation, and porous mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:ALT3","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Subsistence is at once non-subsistence and sublatedness; the truth of existence lies, as appearance, in unessentiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the quantitative collection of materials to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT2","text":"The precise categorical mediation between absolute porosity, negative unity, and appearance remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as self-subsistence is understood not as independence but as a determination mediated through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT4","text":"The strongest point is the derivation of essential externality from the mutable composition of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed equation of non-subsistence, sublatedness, nullity, and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT6","text":"The tension between indifferent coexistence and negative relation is not eliminated, but preserved as a constitutive contradiction of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CDAS:MRT7","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved if the thing is reconstructed not as substrate, but as self-dissolving mediation of subsistence and negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CDAS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CDAS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CDAS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 141","title":"C. Dissolution of the Thing.","context":"Chapter 141","original_title":"C. Die Auflösung des Dings."},"original_title":"C. Die Auflösung des Dings.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":142,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_38"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_38@R001","sha256":"b55146127285251b62117a900405823d4b06eab06e20d726002bb9ba3af725ee","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS1","text":"Das Vorstellen erklärt das Ding durch selbstständige Materien, obwohl es dieselben Inhaltsbestimmungen zuvor als Eigenschaften eines einheitlichen Dinges bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS2","text":"Die räumliche Ausdehnung des materiellen „Auch“ wird in die negative Einheit des punktuellen „Dieses“ zurückgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS3","text":"Die Koexistenz selbstständiger Materien im selben Punkt erzeugt notwendig gegenseitige Durchdringung, Negation und Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS4","text":"Das Vorstellen verdeckt diesen Widerspruch, indem es ihn als bloße Kleinheit, Allmählichkeit oder Unbemerkbarkeit quantifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS5","text":"Die physikalische Vorstellung durchdringender Stoffe bestätigt die Gleichgültigkeit der Materien, kann aber ihre Gleichzeitigkeit als gegenseitige Negation nicht widerspruchsfrei fassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS6","text":"Das Ding ist als Einheit selbstständiger und einander negierender Materien Widerspruch und deshalb Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS7","text":"Der Geist unterscheidet sich vom Ding, weil seine Unterschiede nicht als selbstständige Kräfte, sondern als Momente der absoluten Einheit des Begriffs bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A1","text":"Eigenschaften und Materien haben dieselben Inhaltsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A2","text":"Eigenschaften sind Momente, die in die negative Einheit der Dingheit reflektiert sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A3","text":"Materien werden als selbstständige Einheiten vorgestellt, aus deren äußerlicher Verbindung das Ding bestehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A4","text":"Das Ding ist zugleich punktuelles „Dieses“ und ausgedehntes „Auch“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A5","text":"Was im Ding ausgedehnt zusammen ist, ist zugleich in derselben negativen Einheit oder Punktualität gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A6","text":"Selbstständige Materien, die im selben Punkt sind, durchdringen einander und setzen einander wechselseitig als Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A7","text":"Die Vorstellung ersetzt begriffliche Negation durch äußere quantitative Unterschiede wie Kleinheit und Allmählichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A8","text":"Das unmittelbare Selbstständigsein einer Materie ist im Ding zugleich die Selbstständigkeit eines Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A9","text":"Der Geist ist negative Einheit, in der Unterschiede nur besondere Momente der einfachen Individualität sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A10","text":"Das Ding hält seine Unterschiede als selbstständige Existenzen fest; der Geist hat diese Selbstständigkeit in die Einheit des Begriffs zurückgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX1","text":"Das Ding ist nicht die äußerliche Summe räumlich getrennter Stoffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX2","text":"Porosität ist nicht eine widerspruchsfreie Erklärung für die Koexistenz selbstständiger Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX3","text":"Kleinheit ist nicht die Aufhebung des Widerspruchs, sondern dessen Herabsetzung zum Unbemerkbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX4","text":"Sinnliches Dasein ist nicht widerspruchsfrei auf das Nichtwahrnehmbare übertragbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX5","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit durchdringender Materien ist nicht mit ihrer gemeinsamen Punktualität vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX6","text":"Der Geist ist nicht ein Ding aus voneinander indifferenten Seelenvermögen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX7","text":"Seelenkräfte sind nicht isolierte Tätigkeiten, die unabhängig voneinander kultiviert oder stillgelegt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D1","text":"Die Umdeutung von Eigenschaften zu Materien verwandelt innere Momente derselben Inhaltsbestimmungen in äußerlich selbstständige Einheiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A1","CH_GB18_A_38:A2","CH_GB18_A_38:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D2","text":"Die Ausdehnung des Dinges kann nicht als bloßes Nebeneinander gelten, weil sie durch die negative Einheit des „Dieses“ bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A4","CH_GB18_A_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D3","text":"Die Porosität reproduziert die zu erklärende Durchdringung auf jeder Stufe, statt sie zu erklären.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A5","CH_GB18_A_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D4","text":"Die quantitative Verkleinerung der Materien verschiebt den Widerspruch aus der begrifflichen Bestimmung in die Unbestimmtheit der Anschauung.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D5","text":"Das physikalische Modell kontinuierlich ineinander verbreiteter Stoffe zeigt Durchdringung, hält aber die darin gesetzte wechselseitige Negation fern.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D6","text":"Das Ding ist keine stabile Grundlage seiner Bestimmungen, weil seine Einheit nur als Selbstnegation selbstständiger Unterschiede besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D7","text":"Die Vorstellung selbst erzeugt ihren objektiven Widerspruch, indem sie reflektierte Bestimmungen zugleich als sinnlich vorhandene Gegenstände behandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D8","text":"Die Einheit des Geistes ist nicht die dingliche Einheit widersprechender Selbstständigkeiten, sondern die begriffliche Einheit unselbstständiger Momente.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD1","text":"Die Dingheit wird als Übergangsform bestimmt: Sie kann Unterschiede nur bewahren, indem sie sie zugleich in einer Einheit setzt, welche ihre Selbstständigkeit aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A5","CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD2","text":"Das Vorstellen ist nicht bloß unzureichende Erkenntnis, sondern eine Operation, die begriffliche Widersprüche in quantitative Bilder übersetzt und dadurch ihre Wahrheit verdeckt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD3","text":"Erscheinung bezeichnet nicht einen bloßen subjektiven Schein, sondern die objektive Unhaltbarkeit des Dinges als selbstständige Einheit verschiedener Selbstständigkeiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD4","text":"Die Analogie von Materien und Seelenvermögen disqualifiziert jede Psychologie, die geistige Bestimmungen als nebeneinander bestehende Teilsubstanzen behandelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A1","CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD5","text":"Der Übergang vom Ding zum Geist verlangt nicht die Beseitigung des Widerspruchs von außen, sondern dessen Rückgang in eine Einheit, in der Unterschiede nur Momente sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A8","CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Selbstständigkeit könne ohne räumliche oder begriffliche Exklusivität bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, die quantitative Teilbarkeit eines Gegenstands erkläre seine qualitative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Wahrnehmbarkeit sei das angemessene Realitätsmaß reflektierter Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Widerspruch sei ein Defekt der Beschreibung statt eine Bestimmung des dinglichen Gegenstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, geistige Einheit sei als einfache Unterschiedenlosigkeit oder als Aggregat separater Vermögen zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein Modell des Dinges, in dem Einheit, Selbstständigkeit und Unterschied zugleich ohne Selbstaufhebung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Vermittlung, die den Widerspruch durch Verkleinerung, Verdünnung oder Verteilung neutralisiert, ohne seine negative Struktur zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Übertragung der Dinglogik auf den Geist, sofern geistige Unterschiede als fertige, äußerlich koexistierende Einheiten behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine positive Substanz hinter dem Ding, die dessen widersprüchliche Bestimmungen als bloß akzidentelle Eigenschaften tragen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS1","text":"Gleiche Inhaltsbestimmung → Reflexion als Eigenschaft in negative Einheit oder Verselbstständigung als Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS2","text":"Verselbstständigte Materien + gemeinsame Dingheit → Ausdehnung und Punktualität als zugleich geltende Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS3","text":"Gemeinsame Punktualität + behauptete Selbstständigkeit → Durchdringung → gegenseitige Negation → Negation der Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS4","text":"Durchdringungswiderspruch → quantitative Entschärfung durch Poren, Kleinheit und Allmählichkeit → Verdeckung statt Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS5","text":"Aufgedeckte Verdeckung → objektiver Widerspruch des Dinges → Ding als Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS6","text":"Dinglicher Widerspruch + Rückgang der Unterschiede in Begriffseinheit → Geist als Einheit besonderer Momente, nicht als Erscheinungsding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF1","text":"Die Vorstellung setzt Eigenschaften und Materien als alternative Deutungen derselben Inhaltsbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF2","text":"Die Materiendeutung verlegt selbstständige Unterschiede in ein einziges punktuelles Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF3","text":"Die gemeinsame Punktualität erzwingt Durchdringung und zerstört die behauptete Gleichgültigkeit der Materien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF4","text":"Das Vorstellen ersetzt die Widerspruchsbestimmung durch quantitative Unbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF5","text":"Die Wiedergewinnung des Widerspruchs bestimmt das Ding als Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF6","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung mit Seelenvermögen überführt die Dingkritik in die Bestimmung des Geistes als Begriffseinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung Eigenschaft/Materie wird von einer Inhaltsdifferenz zu einer Differenz der Reflexionsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME2","text":"Räumliche Ausdehnung wird nicht mehr als äußeres Nebeneinander, sondern als Manifestation einer negativen Einheit lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME3","text":"Porosität wird von einer physikalischen Lösungsfigur zu einer Rekursion des ungelösten Widerspruchs umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME4","text":"Quantitative Erklärungen werden als Abstieg des Vorstellens von begrifflicher Negation in äußere Unbestimmtheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME5","text":"Das Ding erscheint als objektiv widersprüchliche Einheit; der Geist erscheint als bereits begrifflich vermittelte Einheit seiner Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text untersucht die Vorstellung eines Dinges aus mehreren Materien sowie die analoge Vorstellung einer Seele aus mehreren Vermögen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Einheit eines Gegenstands wird als negative Einheit bestimmt, welche die Selbstständigkeit seiner Unterschiede zugleich setzt und negiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Vorstellen wird als systematische Vermeidungsoperation bestimmt, die Widerspruch in quantitative Bilder überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Ding ist Erscheinung, weil seine gegenwärtige Einheit nur als Selbstaufhebung selbstständiger Unterschiede besteht; der Geist ist der bereits vollzogene Rückgang dieser Unterschiede in den Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Eigenschaften zu Materien, von Materien zu Durchdringung und von Durchdringung zu Erscheinung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt hinsichtlich der genauen Vermittlung zwischen negativer Einheit, Punktualität und räumlicher Ausdehnung unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit als immanente Negation und nicht als äußerliche Unabhängigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Zurückweisung quantitativer Entschärfungen als Verdeckungen des objektiven Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT5","text":"Die schärfste Bruchlinie liegt im Übergang vom Ding zum Geist, weil die behauptete begriffliche Aufhebung dinglicher Selbstständigkeit gesetzt, aber innerhalb dieser Einheit nicht weiter hergeleitet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur dann, wenn die Kritik des Vorstellens nicht als bloß erkenntnistheoretischer Fehler, sondern als Freilegung des Widerspruchs des Gegenstands selbst verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112510943430Z_e67ea4bc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Remark.","source_sha256":"b55146127285251b62117a900405823d4b06eab06e20d726002bb9ba3af725ee","sha256":"101b2e8562b4fea53822a41a70de02b7735b2830331245a4da6cb5f4b4eae882","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:25:10.944599+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS1","text":"Representation explains the thing through self-subsistent matters, although it previously determines the same determinations of content as properties of a unified thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS2","text":"The spatial extension of the material „Auch“ is taken back into the negative unity of the punctual „Dieses“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS3","text":"The coexistence of self-subsistent matters at the same point necessarily produces mutual interpenetration, negation, and negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS4","text":"Representation conceals this contradiction by quantifying it as mere smallness, gradualness, or imperceptibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS5","text":"The physical representation of interpenetrating substances confirms the indifference of matters, but cannot grasp their simultaneity as mutual negation without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS6","text":"As the unity of self-subsistent and mutually negating matters, the thing is contradiction and therefore appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AS7","text":"Spirit differs from the thing because its differences exist not as self-subsistent forces, but as moments of the absolute unity of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A1","text":"Properties and matters have the same determinations of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A2","text":"Properties are moments reflected into the negative unity of thinghood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A3","text":"Matters are represented as self-subsistent unities, from whose external connection the thing is supposed to consist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A4","text":"The thing is at once punctual „Dieses“ and extended „Auch“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A5","text":"What is together in the thing in extension is at the same time posited in the same negative unity or punctuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A6","text":"Self-subsistent matters that are at the same point interpenetrate one another and mutually posit one another as negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A7","text":"Representation replaces conceptual negation with external quantitative differences such as smallness and gradualness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A8","text":"The immediate self-subsistence of one matter is, in the thing, at the same time the self-subsistence of an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A9","text":"Spirit is negative unity, in which differences are only particular moments of simple individuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:A10","text":"The thing holds its differences fast as self-subsistent existences; spirit has taken this self-subsistence back into the unity of the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX1","text":"The thing is not the external sum of spatially separated substances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX2","text":"Porosity is not a contradiction-free explanation for the coexistence of self-subsistent matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX3","text":"Smallness is not the sublation of contradiction, but its reduction to the imperceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX4","text":"Sensuous existence cannot be transferred without contradiction to the imperceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX5","text":"The indifference of interpenetrating matters is not compatible with their common punctuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX6","text":"Spirit is not a thing composed of mutually indifferent faculties of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:NX7","text":"Powers of the soul are not isolated activities that can be cultivated or suspended independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D1","text":"The reinterpretation of properties as matters transforms internal moments of the same determinations of content into externally self-subsistent unities.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A1","CH_GB18_A_38:A2","CH_GB18_A_38:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D2","text":"The extension of the thing cannot count as mere external juxtaposition, because it is determined by the negative unity of the „Dieses“.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A4","CH_GB18_A_38:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D3","text":"Porosity reproduces the interpenetration to be explained at every level, instead of explaining it.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A5","CH_GB18_A_38:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D4","text":"The quantitative diminution of matters shifts contradiction from conceptual determination into the indeterminacy of intuition.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D5","text":"The physical model of substances continuously diffused into one another displays interpenetration, but keeps at a distance the mutual negation posited therein.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D6","text":"The thing is no stable ground of its determinations, because its unity exists only as the self-negation of self-subsistent differences.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D7","text":"Representation itself produces its objective contradiction by treating reflected determinations at the same time as sensuously present objects.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:D8","text":"The unity of spirit is not the thing-like unity of contradictory self-subsistences, but the conceptual unity of non-self-subsistent moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD1","text":"Thinghood is determined as a transitional form: it can preserve differences only by at the same time positing them in a unity that sublates their self-subsistence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A5","CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD2","text":"Representation is not merely inadequate cognition, but an operation that translates conceptual contradictions into quantitative images and thereby conceals their truth.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD3","text":"Appearance does not designate a merely subjective semblance, but the objective untenability of the thing as the self-subsistent unity of diverse self-subsistences.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A6","CH_GB18_A_38:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD4","text":"The analogy between matters and faculties of the soul disqualifies every psychology that treats spiritual determinations as coexisting partial substances.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A1","CH_GB18_A_38:A3","CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SD5","text":"The transition from the thing to spirit requires not the removal of contradiction from without, but its return into a unity in which differences are only moments.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_38:A8","CH_GB18_A_38:A9","CH_GB18_A_38:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that self-subsistence can exist without spatial or conceptual exclusivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the quantitative divisibility of an object explains its qualitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that perceptibility is the adequate measure of reality for reflected determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that contradiction is a defect of description rather than a determination of the thing-like object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the assumption that spiritual unity is to be determined as simple undifferentiatedness or as an aggregate of separate faculties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a model of the thing in which unity, self-subsistence, and difference exist simultaneously without self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a mediation that neutralizes contradiction through diminution, dilution, or distribution without thinking its negative structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the transfer of the logic of the thing to spirit, insofar as spiritual differences are treated as finished, externally coexisting unities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:SNX4","text":"Not available is a positive substance behind the thing that could bear its contradictory determinations as merely accidental properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS1","text":"Same determination of content → reflection as property into negative unity or self-subsistence as matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS2","text":"Self-subsistent matters + common thinghood → extension and punctuality as determinations valid simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS3","text":"Common punctuality + asserted self-subsistence → interpenetration → mutual negation → negation of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS4","text":"Contradiction of interpenetration → quantitative attenuation through pores, smallness, and gradualness → concealment rather than sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS5","text":"Uncovered concealment → objective contradiction of the thing → thing as appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:FGS6","text":"Thing-like contradiction + return of differences into conceptual unity → spirit as unity of particular moments, not as a thing of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF1","text":"Representation posits properties and matters as alternative interpretations of the same determinations of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF2","text":"The interpretation in terms of matter places self-subsistent differences into a single punctual thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF3","text":"Common punctuality compels interpenetration and destroys the asserted indifference of matters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF4","text":"Representation replaces the determination of contradiction with quantitative indeterminacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF5","text":"The recovery of contradiction determines the thing as appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:AF6","text":"The comparison with faculties of the soul transforms the critique of the thing into the determination of spirit as conceptual unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME1","text":"The distinction property/matter is remapped from a difference of content to a difference in the form of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME2","text":"Spatial extension becomes legible no longer as external juxtaposition, but as the manifestation of a negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME3","text":"Porosity is reclassified from a physical figure of solution into a recursion of unresolved contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME4","text":"Quantitative explanations become visible as representation's descent from conceptual negation into external indeterminacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ME5","text":"The thing appears as an objectively contradictory unity; spirit appears as the already conceptually mediated unity of its differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text examines the representation of a thing composed of several matters, as well as the analogous representation of a soul composed of several faculties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT2","text":"Structural — The unity of an object is determined as a negative unity that at once posits and negates the self-subsistence of its differences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Representation is determined as a systematic operation of avoidance that translates contradiction into quantitative images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The thing is appearance because its present unity exists only as the self-sublation of self-subsistent differences; spirit is the already accomplished return of these differences into the Concept.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from properties to matters, from matters to interpenetration, and from interpenetration to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with respect to the exact mediation between negative unity, punctuality, and spatial extension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as self-subsistence is understood as immanent negation and not as external independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the rejection of quantitative attenuations as concealments of objective contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT5","text":"The sharpest line of fracture lies in the transition from the thing to spirit, because the asserted conceptual sublation of thing-like self-subsistence is posited but not further derived within this unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_38:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if the critique of representation is understood not as a merely epistemological error, but as the exposure of the contradiction of the object itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_38:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_38@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_38:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 142","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 142","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Law of Appearance.","order":143,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DGDE"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DGDE@R001","sha256":"867782a245af2a9761d6bbc3b98fdcdb9462656ea5fffa3fa847765b96daa277","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS1","text":"Die Erscheinung soll als Wahrheit der Existenz bestimmt werden, ohne sie zu einer bloß subjektiven oder äußerlich reflektierten Unwirklichkeit herabzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS2","text":"Die Existenz wird als durch ihre eigene Negativität vermittelte und daher wesentlich gesetzte Unmittelbarkeit rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS3","text":"Die wechselseitige Negation der erscheinenden Bestimmungen erzeugt eine positive Identität, die als wesentlicher Inhalt vom vergänglichen Wechsel unterschieden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS4","text":"Diese bleibende Identität wird als Gesetz der Erscheinung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS5","text":"Das Gesetz wird als immanenter Grund der Erscheinung bestimmt, der deren wesentlichen Inhalt enthält, aber deren negative Bewegungsform nicht vollständig umfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS6","text":"Die Unvollständigkeit des Gesetzes besteht darin, dass die Beziehung seiner Inhaltsseiten zunächst äußerlich, unmittelbar und nicht aus ihrem Inhalt selbst notwendig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der als wesentlich gesetzten Existenz über die immanente Gesetzlichkeit zu der Einsicht, dass das Gesetz noch nicht die reale, in ihren Inhalt reflektierte Form ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A1","text":"Existenz ist reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit des Wesens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A2","text":"Erscheinung ist Existenz, insofern deren Wesentlichkeit als eigene Negativität gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A3","text":"Erscheinung ist nicht durch eine äußerliche Reflexion bestimmt, sondern durch die ihr eigene Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","text":"Das Erscheinende besteht nur durch Vermittlung mit einem Anderen, das selbst nur gesetztes und aufgehobenes Bestehen hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","text":"Der Grund des Erscheinenden ist kein selbständiges Erstes, sondern ein vorausgesetztes und selbst reflektiertes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","text":"Die gegenseitige Negation des Erscheinenden enthält eine positive Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","text":"Der wesentliche Inhalt der Erscheinung ist die dem Wechsel entzogene Einheit ihrer bestimmten Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A8","text":"Die Seiten des wesentlichen Inhalts bestehen nur wechselseitig; das Gesetztsein der einen Seite ist das Gesetztsein der anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","text":"Das Gesetz ist die positive, bleibende Einheit der durch die Erscheinung vermittelten Unterschiede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","text":"Gesetz und Erscheinung haben denselben wesentlichen Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A11","text":"Die Erscheinung enthält außer dem Gesetz die negative Form ihrer Bewegung, ihres Übergangs und ihres Sichaufhebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","text":"Das Gesetz enthält die Einheit seiner Inhaltsseiten zunächst nur als unmittelbare und äußerliche Verbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A13","text":"Ein Gesetz ist noch nicht notwendig, sofern seine verbundenen Inhaltsbestimmungen nicht aus ihrer eigenen Negativität ineinander übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX1","text":"Erscheinung ist nicht bloß unwahre oder wesenlose Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX2","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit der Existenz ist nicht die höhere Wahrheit gegenüber der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX3","text":"Die Reflexion, durch welche Existenz Erscheinung ist, ist nicht fremd oder äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX4","text":"Der Grund ist nicht ein unabhängiges, dem Erscheinenden vorausliegendes Erstes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX5","text":"Das Gesetz ist nicht außerhalb oder jenseits der Erscheinung gelegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX6","text":"Das Reich der Gesetze ist nicht eine von der erscheinenden Welt getrennte Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX7","text":"Das Gesetz ist nicht die vollständige Wahrheit der Erscheinung, weil es deren negative Selbstbewegung nicht enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX8","text":"Die gesetzliche Verbindung verschiedener Inhalte ist nicht schon durch ihre bloße unmittelbare Gegebenheit notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D1","text":"Die Wahrheit der Existenz liegt nicht in isolierter Unmittelbarkeit, sondern im Übergang der Existenz in Erscheinung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A1","CH_GB18_DGDE:A2","CH_GB18_DGDE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D2","text":"Selbstständigkeit des Erscheinenden ist nur wesentlicher Schein, weil sie durch die Negation ihrer eigenen Voraussetzungen vermittelt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","CH_GB18_DGDE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D3","text":"Das Vergängliche besitzt einen wesentlichen Inhalt, sofern seine Vielfalt auf eine bleibende bestimmte Einheit zurückgeführt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","CH_GB18_DGDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D4","text":"Das Gesetz ist nicht Abstraktion von der Erscheinung, sondern deren in die Identität reflektierter Inhalt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","CH_GB18_DGDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D5","text":"Die Erscheinung ist gegenüber dem Gesetz die umfassendere Totalität, weil sie dessen ruhigen Inhalt und dessen sich auflösende Form enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","CH_GB18_DGDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D6","text":"Die Erkenntnis eines Gesetzes verlangt zusätzliche Vermittlung, weil seine behauptete Verbindung nicht aus dem bloß gegebenen Gesetzesinhalt hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","CH_GB18_DGDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD1","text":"Grund und Begründetes bilden keine hierarchische Ordnung unabhängiger Entitäten, sondern eine Struktur gegenseitigen Gesetztseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","CH_GB18_DGDE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD2","text":"Dauer ist nicht Abwesenheit von Veränderung, sondern die positive Identität, die nur innerhalb der sich aufhebenden Veränderung besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD3","text":"Gesetzlichkeit erscheint als immanente Stabilisierung des Erscheinens, nicht als transzendente Ordnung über dem Erscheinenden.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A3","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","CH_GB18_DGDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD4","text":"Die Differenz zwischen Erscheinung und Gesetz ist keine Differenz zweier Inhalte, sondern eine Differenz zwischen bewegter negativer Form und ruhiger positiver Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","CH_GB18_DGDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD5","text":"Das Gesetz verweist aus sich hinaus, weil es seine eigene Notwendigkeit noch nicht als immanente Selbstvermittlung seines Inhalts ausweisen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","CH_GB18_DGDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Existenz durch bloße unmittelbare Selbstidentität ohne Negativität bestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Ursache, Grund oder Gesetz als positiv selbständige Fundamente vor ihren Relationen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Veränderung bloß akzidentell zu einem bereits vollständigen bleibenden Inhalt hinzutritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem empirische Gesetzmäßigkeit durch ihre Wiederholbarkeit bereits objektive Notwendigkeit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Form des Gesetzes von seinem Inhalt und dessen Vermittlung endgültig ablösbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX1","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit eines letzten unbewegten Positiven, das nicht selbst durch Negativität vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX2","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit einer Erscheinung, die hinter ihrem Erscheinen ein vollständig selbständiges Ansich als äußeren Träger besäße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX3","text":"Verwehrt ist die Möglichkeit eines Gesetzes, das zugleich bloße Regelmäßigkeit und bereits vollendete begriffliche Notwendigkeit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX4","text":"Verwehrt ist die Trennung einer ruhigen Welt der Gesetze von einer bewegten Welt der Erscheinungen als zweier selbständiger Reiche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS1","text":"Reflektierte Unmittelbarkeit → eigenes Gesetztsein der Existenz → Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS2","text":"Gesetztsein → Vermittlung durch ein aufgehobenes Anderes → wechselseitige Negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS3","text":"Wechselseitige Negation → Rückkehr in positive Identität → wesentlicher Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS4","text":"Wesentlicher Inhalt als bleibende Einheit bestimmter Unterschiede → Gesetz der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS5","text":"Gesetz als immanenter Inhalt der Erscheinung → Differenz zwischen ruhigem Inhalt und bewegter negativer Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS6","text":"Äußerliche Einheit der Gesetzesseiten → fehlende immanente Negativität → Unvollständigkeit des Gesetzes als reale Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Existenz → reflektierte Existenz → Erscheinung als eigenes Gesetztsein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF2","text":"Erscheinung als wechselseitige Negation → positive Identität → bleibender wesentlicher Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF3","text":"Bleibender Inhalt → Gesetz als Einheit der Unterschiede → immanenter Grund der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF4","text":"Gesetz als ruhige Wesentlichkeit → Kontrast zur bewegten Form der Erscheinung → Erscheinung als umfassendere Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF5","text":"Unmittelbare gesetzliche Verbindung → fehlende Selbstvermittlung der Inhalte → Übergang zur Forderung realer Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME1","text":"Erscheinung wird von einer defizitären Scheinform zur höheren Wahrheit der bloß unmittelbaren Existenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME2","text":"Grund wird von einem externen Fundament zu einer reflexiven Funktion wechselseitigen Gesetztseins umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME3","text":"Gesetz wird von einer über der Welt stehenden Regel zu deren immanentem, positivem Wesensmoment umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME4","text":"Stabilität und Veränderung werden nicht als Gegensätze zweier Bereiche, sondern als positive und negative Seiten einer Erscheinungseinheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME5","text":"Empirische Regelmäßigkeit und begriffliche Notwendigkeit werden als unterschiedliche Bestimmungsstufen des Gesetzes sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Gesetz wird als bleibender Inhalt der Erscheinung gegen deren vergängliche und bewegte Gestalt bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT2","text":"Structural — Erscheinung besteht als Struktur wechselseitiger Negation, in der Grund, Bestehen und Gesetztsein ihre selbständige Festigkeit verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Untersuchung verschiebt die Frage von der Feststellung gegebener Gesetze zur Rekonstruktion der Vermittlung, die Gesetzlichkeit erst als notwendig ausweisen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Bleibende ist nur als Reflexionsidentität im Vergehen, und die Zeitlichkeit der Erscheinung ist keine äußere Störung einer ruhenden Substanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bestimmung der Erscheinung als reflektierte Existenz, die Entstehung des Gesetzes und dessen Begrenzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Form, in welcher die noch fehlende reale Notwendigkeit des Gesetzes erreicht werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT3","text":"Das System ist kohärent, sofern positive Identität nicht als negationsfreie Unmittelbarkeit, sondern als Resultat der Negativität gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Strukturstelle ist die Umkehrung, durch welche die wechselseitige Aufhebung nicht Vernichtung, sondern die Erzeugung eines bleibenden Inhalts bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Immanenz des Gesetzes in der Erscheinung und seiner gleichzeitigen Unzulänglichkeit gegenüber deren negativer Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass das Gesetz als wesentliche Einheit gilt, seine Notwendigkeit aber erst außerhalb seiner eigenen gegebenen Form begründet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn sie das Gesetz als notwendiges Zwischenresultat und nicht als abschließende Ontologie behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115401346166Z_52546396","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The Law of Appearance.","source_sha256":"867782a245af2a9761d6bbc3b98fdcdb9462656ea5fffa3fa847765b96daa277","sha256":"f0f08c6ecef31f8650ce43f5d8f15153e1a267def25c1b88f8b713014a8fab50","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:54:01.351900+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS1","text":"Appearance is to be determined as the truth of existence, without reducing it to a merely subjective or externally reflected unreality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS2","text":"Existence is reconstructed as immediacy mediated through its own negativity and therefore essentially posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS3","text":"The reciprocal negation of the appearing determinations produces a positive identity that is distinguished, as essential content, from transitory change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS4","text":"This enduring identity is determined as the law of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS5","text":"The law is determined as the immanent ground of appearance, which contains its essential content but does not fully encompass its negative form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS6","text":"The incompleteness of the law consists in the fact that the relation of its content-sides is at first external, immediate, and not necessary from their content itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AS7","text":"The movement leads from existence posited as essential, through immanent lawfulness, to the insight that the law is not yet the real form reflected into its content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A1","text":"Existence is reflected immediacy of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A2","text":"Appearance is existence insofar as its essentiality is posited as its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A3","text":"Appearance is determined not by an external reflection, but by the reflection proper to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","text":"What appears subsists only through mediation with an other, which itself has only posited and sublated subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","text":"The ground of what appears is not an independent first, but a presupposed and self-reflected positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","text":"The reciprocal negation of what appears contains a positive identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","text":"The essential content of appearance is the unity of its determinate differences withdrawn from change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A8","text":"The sides of essential content subsist only reciprocally; the positedness of one side is the positedness of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","text":"The law is the positive, enduring unity of the differences mediated by appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","text":"Law and appearance have the same essential content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A11","text":"In addition to the law, appearance contains the negative form of its movement, its transition, and its self-sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","text":"The law at first contains the unity of its content-sides only as an immediate and external connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:A13","text":"A law is not yet necessary insofar as its connected content-determinations do not pass over into one another from their own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX1","text":"Appearance is not merely untrue or essenceless existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX2","text":"The immediacy of existence is not the higher truth in comparison with appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX3","text":"The reflection through which existence is appearance is not alien or external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX4","text":"The ground is not an independent first antecedent to what appears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX5","text":"The law is not situated outside or beyond appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX6","text":"The realm of laws is not a totality separate from the appearing world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX7","text":"The law is not the complete truth of appearance because it does not contain its negative self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:NX8","text":"The lawful connection of different contents is not necessary merely through its bare immediate givenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D1","text":"The truth of existence lies not in isolated immediacy, but in the transition of existence into appearance.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A1","CH_GB18_DGDE:A2","CH_GB18_DGDE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D2","text":"The independence of what appears is only essential semblance, because it is mediated through the negation of its own presuppositions.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","CH_GB18_DGDE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D3","text":"The transitory possesses an essential content insofar as its multiplicity is referred back to an enduring determinate unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","CH_GB18_DGDE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D4","text":"The law is not abstraction from appearance, but its content reflected into identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","CH_GB18_DGDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D5","text":"In relation to the law, appearance is the more comprehensive totality, because it contains its tranquil content and its self-dissolving form.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","CH_GB18_DGDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:D6","text":"Cognition of a law requires additional mediation, because its asserted connection does not follow from the merely given content of the law.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","CH_GB18_DGDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD1","text":"Ground and grounded do not form a hierarchical order of independent entities, but a structure of reciprocal positedness.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A4","CH_GB18_DGDE:A5","CH_GB18_DGDE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD2","text":"Duration is not the absence of change, but the positive identity that subsists only within self-sublating change.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A6","CH_GB18_DGDE:A7","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD3","text":"Lawfulness appears as an immanent stabilization of appearing, not as a transcendent order above what appears.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A3","CH_GB18_DGDE:A9","CH_GB18_DGDE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD4","text":"The difference between appearance and law is not a difference of two contents, but a difference between moving negative form and tranquil positive identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A10","CH_GB18_DGDE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SD5","text":"The law points beyond itself because it cannot yet establish its own necessity as the immanent self-mediation of its content.","refs":["CH_GB18_DGDE:A12","CH_GB18_DGDE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which existence would be determined through mere immediate self-identity without negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model in which cause, ground, or law subsist as positively independent foundations prior to their relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which change merely accrues accidentally to an already complete enduring content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model in which empirical lawfulness already possesses objective necessity through its repeatability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a model in which the form of the law would be definitively detachable from its content and its mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX1","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of an ultimate unmoved positive that would not itself be mediated through negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of an appearance that would possess, behind its appearing, a completely independent in-itself as an external bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of a law that would be at once mere regularity and already completed conceptual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:SNX4","text":"Foreclosed is the separation of a tranquil world of laws from a moving world of appearances as two independent realms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS1","text":"Reflected immediacy → own positedness of existence → appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS2","text":"Positedness → mediation through a sublated other → reciprocal negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS3","text":"Reciprocal negation → return into positive identity → essential content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS4","text":"Essential content as enduring unity of determinate differences → law of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS5","text":"Law as immanent content of appearance → difference between tranquil content and moving negative form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:FGS6","text":"External unity of the sides of the law → lacking immanent negativity → incompleteness of the law as real form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF1","text":"Immediate existence → reflected existence → appearance as its own positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF2","text":"Appearance as reciprocal negation → positive identity → enduring essential content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF3","text":"Enduring content → law as unity of differences → immanent ground of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF4","text":"Law as tranquil essentiality → contrast with the moving form of appearance → appearance as more comprehensive totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:AF5","text":"Immediate lawful connection → lacking self-mediation of contents → transition to the demand for real necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME1","text":"Appearance is reclassified from a deficient form of semblance into the higher truth of merely immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME2","text":"Ground is reclassified from an external foundation into a reflexive function of reciprocal positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME3","text":"Law is reclassified from a rule standing above the world into its immanent, positive moment of essence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME4","text":"Stability and change are mapped not as opposites of two domains, but as positive and negative sides of a unity of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ME5","text":"Empirical regularity and conceptual necessity become visible as distinct stages of determination of the law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT1","text":"Surface — The law is determined as the enduring content of appearance in contrast to its transitory and moving shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT2","text":"Structural — Appearance subsists as a structure of reciprocal negation in which ground, subsistence, and positedness lose their independent fixity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The inquiry shifts the question from the ascertainment of given laws to the reconstruction of the mediation that alone could establish lawfulness as necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — What endures is only as identity of reflection in passing away, and the temporality of appearance is not an external disturbance of a resting substance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the determination of appearance as reflected existence, the emergence of the law, and its limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive form in which the still lacking real necessity of the law is to be attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT3","text":"The system is coherent insofar as positive identity is read not as immediacy free of negation, but as the result of negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT4","text":"The strongest structural point is the reversal through which reciprocal sublation signifies not annihilation, but the production of an enduring content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT5","text":"A structural tension remains between the asserted immanence of the law in appearance and its simultaneous inadequacy in relation to its negative form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the law counts as an essential unity, yet its necessity can first be grounded outside its own given form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DGDE:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if it treats the law as a necessary intermediate result and not as a conclusive ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DGDE:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DGDE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DGDE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 143","title":"A. The Law of Appearance.","context":"Chapter 143","original_title":"A. Das Gesetz der Erscheinung."},"original_title":"A. Das Gesetz der Erscheinung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3","layer":"CH","title":"B. The World of Appearance and the World-in-Itself.","order":144,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BD_3"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BD_3@R001","sha256":"966e2eb58f8b5924cfce7dec54f0a5aeb3965cb4dfdb6ed642473021c2c7a8bf","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS1","text":"Die Veränderlichkeit der existirenden Welt wird als Erscheinung bestimmt, deren Bestand in ihrem Anderen liegt und deren Auflösung deshalb zugleich ihre Vermittlung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS2","text":"Das Gesetz wird zunächst als einfache Selbstidentität der Erscheinung bestimmt, muss aber als deren negative Reflexion begriffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS3","text":"Die im Gesetz enthaltenen Seiten werden zu gegensätzlichen Bestimmungen, weil jede in der anderen gesetzt ist und ihr eigenes Nichtbestehen einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS4","text":"Das Gesetz wird durch die Aufnahme seiner eigenen Negativität zur wesentlichen Totalität der Erscheinung und öffnet sich als an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS5","text":"Die an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt ist als übersinnliche, reflektirte Existenz zugleich Wahrheit der sinnlichen Welt und deren immanenter Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS6","text":"Weil die wesentliche Welt absolute Negativität enthält, entzweit sie sich in sich selbst in wesentliche und erscheinende Welt; ihre Beziehung ist eine Umkehrung, nicht eine ruhende Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","text":"Die existirende Welt ist Erscheinung, deren bestimmter Inhalt nur im Anderen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A2","text":"Das Gesetz ist zunächst die einfache Selbstidentität der Erscheinung, nicht deren negative Einheit oder Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","text":"Das Existirende ist in sein Nichtseyn reflektirt und hat darin seinen Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A4","text":"Die Reflexion der Erscheinung in ihr Anderes ist, weil dieses Andere selbst reflektirte Existenz ist, zugleich Reflexion der Erscheinung in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","text":"Die Seiten des Gesetzes sind negativ aufeinander bezogen, weil das Gesetztseyn jeder Seite das Gesetztseyn der anderen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","text":"Die positive Identität des Gesetzes wird erst real, wenn ihre negative Einheit an ihren Seiten gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","text":"Das Gesetz wird durch seine wesentliche Negativität zur Totalität des Inhalts und der Form der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","text":"Die an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt ist reflektirte, wesentliche Existenz und unterscheidet sich dadurch von sinnlicher Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","text":"Die an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt ist die Totalität der Existenz und enthält kein äußeres Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","text":"Absolute Negativität bewirkt, dass die wesentliche Welt sich selbst als erscheinende Welt setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A11","text":"Die Identität der wesentlichen und der erscheinenden Welt ist als Entgegensetzung, Werden und Übergehen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX1","text":"Das Gesetz ist nicht bloß die abstrakte Grundlage der Erscheinung und nicht zunächst ihr Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX2","text":"Das Andere der Erscheinung ist kein schlechthin äußeres Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX3","text":"Die Seiten des Gesetzes sind nicht bloß gleichgültig verschiedene Inhalte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX4","text":"Die positive Identität des Gesetzes ist nicht unmittelbar gegeben, sondern vermittlungsbedürftig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX5","text":"Die übersinnliche Welt ist kein bloßes Jenseits ohne Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX6","text":"Die an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt ist keine zweite Welt außerhalb der Totalität der Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX7","text":"Die Beziehung beider Welten ist weder Identität desselben Inhalts noch bloße Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D1","text":"Die Abhängigkeit der Erscheinung von anderem Erscheinenden hebt die Äußerlichkeit dieser Abhängigkeit auf, weil jedes Andere selbst nur als reflektirte Existenz besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D2","text":"Das Gesetz kann nur als reale Identität gelten, wenn es die Negation und den Gegensatz seiner eigenen Seiten in sich enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D3","text":"Die Verwandlung des Gesetzes in Totalität überführt die Unwesentlichkeit der Erscheinung in wesentliche Negativität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D4","text":"Die übersinnliche Welt bezeichnet keine Abkehr von Existenz, sondern deren Status als reflektirte und wahre Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D5","text":"Die wesentliche Welt ist zugleich Grund der Erscheinung und nur durch die Selbstsetzung der Erscheinung als Grund bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D6","text":"Der bestimmte Grund der Erscheinung umfasst deren gesamte Mannigfaltigkeit, weil das Reich der Gesetze die Negativität des Erscheinens in sich aufgenommen hat.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D7","text":"Die Rückkehr der Erscheinung in ihren Grund beseitigt die Grundbeziehung als ruhende Form und setzt an ihre Stelle Werden und Übergehen entgegengesetzter Bestimmungen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD1","text":"Die ontologische Hierarchie von Erscheinung und Wesen ist nicht vorausgesetzt, sondern entsteht aus der Selbstnegation der Erscheinung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD2","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht die Beseitigung der Erscheinung, sondern ihre Selbstreflexion in einer Form, die ihre Negativität als eigenes Moment enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD3","text":"Grund ist keine einseitig vorausliegende Ursache, sondern die Selbstsetzung einer Totalität, die ihr Gesetztes zugleich als ihr entgegengesetztes Moment erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD4","text":"Die Umkehrung der Welten ist die Form, in der ihre Identität real wird, weil jede Welt nur im Gegenüber ihrer eigenen Negativität bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine letztgültige, unreflektirte Unmittelbarkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt ein absolut äußeres Anderes aus, das nicht selbst in die Bewegung der Reflexion einträte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine starre Zweiweltenlehre aus, in der Sinnliches und Übersinnliches unabhängig nebeneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt einen Grund aus, der von dem durch ihn Begründeten unberührt und unvermittelt bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Wahrheit, die ohne Negativität und ohne Selbstentgegensetzung Bestand hätte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Totalität, die ihre Erscheinung nicht aus sich selbst hervorbringen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine unmittelbare Erkenntnis des Wesentlichen durch bloße sinnliche Anschauung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS1","text":"Veränderliche Existenz → Bestehen im Anderen → Erscheinung als vermittelte Auflösung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","CH_GB18_BD_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS2","text":"Vermittelte Erscheinung → einfache Selbstidentität → Gesetz als abstrakte Grundlage.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A2","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS3","text":"Gesetzliche Identität → negative Einheit seiner Seiten → reale und gesetzte Identität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS4","text":"Reale gesetzliche Identität → wesentliche Negativität → Totalität des Inhalts und der Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS5","text":"Totale reflektirte Existenz → übersinnliche Welt → Selbstsetzung der erscheinenden Welt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS6","text":"Selbstgesetzte Erscheinung → negative Identität der Welten → Umkehrung, Werden und Übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF1","text":"Wandel der existirenden Welt → Reflexion ihres Bestandes in anderem Existirenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF2","text":"Reflexion in Anderes → Selbstreflexion der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF3","text":"Selbstreflexion → Gesetz als negative Einheit gegensätzlicher Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF4","text":"Negative Einheit → Gesetz als Totalität und wesentliche Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF5","text":"Totales Gesetz → an-und-für-sich-seyende oder übersinnliche Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF6","text":"Übersinnliche Totalität → Selbstentzweiung in wesentliche und erscheinende Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF7","text":"Selbstentzweiung → entgegengesetzte Identität → an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt als verkehrte erscheinende Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME1","text":"Das Gesetz wird von einer bloßen Regelmäßigkeit des Erscheinens zu dessen immanenter negativer Totalität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME2","text":"Das Andere wird von einer äußeren Bedingung zu einer Form der Selbstbeziehung der Erscheinung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME3","text":"Das Übersinnliche wird nicht als jenseitiger Gegenstandsbereich, sondern als reflektirte Existenz sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME4","text":"Der Grund wird von einer einseitigen Begründungsrelation zu einer sich selbst setzenden negativen Beziehung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von wesentlicher und erscheinender Welt wird als interne Umkehrungsstruktur einer einzigen Totalität lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die existirende Welt erscheint als veränderliche Mannigfaltigkeit, deren Regelmäßigkeit im Reich der Gesetze gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Gesetz erhält Realität erst durch die negative Einheit seiner Seiten und wird dadurch zur Totalität der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die sinnliche Vorstellung und die bewußtlose Reflexion werden durch eine Bestimmung reflektirter Existenz überschritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein, Grund, Erscheinung und Wesen werden als Selbstentzweiung, Rückkehr, Werden und Übergehen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Erscheinung über Gesetz und Negativität zur Umkehrung der Welten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem Kriterium die negative Einheit an den Seiten des Gesetzes als wirklich gesetzt gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT3","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist kohärent, sofern Identität nur als Resultat ihrer eigenen Negation verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung der wesentlichen Welt aus der im Gesetz selbst freigesetzten Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung entsteht daraus, dass die an-und-für-sich-seyende Welt zugleich die Totalität ohne äußeres Anderes und nur eine Seite gegenüber der Erscheinung sein soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Grundbeziehung zunächst wiederhergestellt und anschließend als unzureichende Form in Werden und Übergehen aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern die übersinnliche Welt nicht als statisches Jenseits, sondern als notwendige Selbstumkehrung der Erscheinung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113329789412Z_91886855","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. The World of Appearance and the World in-and-for-itself.","source_sha256":"966e2eb58f8b5924cfce7dec54f0a5aeb3965cb4dfdb6ed642473021c2c7a8bf","sha256":"1ea72f72d2a08c14afe8a05da905755282223ce7f5f32c6b6e69fcf35cf68c53","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:33:29.791026+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS1","text":"The mutability of the existing world is determined as appearance, whose subsistence lies in its other and whose dissolution is therefore at the same time its mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS2","text":"The law is initially determined as the simple self-identity of appearance, but must be comprehended as its negative reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS3","text":"The sides contained in the law become opposed determinations because each is posited in the other and includes its own non-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS4","text":"Through the incorporation of its own negativity, the law becomes the essential totality of appearance and opens itself as the world in-and-for-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS5","text":"As supersensible, reflected existence, the world in-and-for-itself is at once the truth of the sensuous world and its immanent ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AS6","text":"Because the essential world contains absolute negativity, it divides itself within itself into essential and appearing world; their relation is an inversion, not a resting identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","text":"The existing world is appearance, whose determinate content subsists only in the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A2","text":"The law is initially the simple self-identity of appearance, not its negative unity or ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","text":"The existent is reflected into its non-being and has its ground therein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A4","text":"The reflection of appearance into its other is, because this other is itself reflected existence, at the same time the reflection of appearance into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","text":"The sides of the law are negatively related to one another because the positedness of each side is the positedness of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","text":"The positive identity of the law becomes real only when its negative unity is posited in its sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","text":"Through its essential negativity, the law becomes the totality of the content and form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","text":"The world in-and-for-itself is reflected, essential existence and is thereby distinguished from sensuous immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","text":"The world in-and-for-itself is the totality of existence and contains no external other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","text":"Absolute negativity brings it about that the essential world posits itself as appearing world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:A11","text":"The identity of the essential and appearing worlds is determined as opposition, becoming, and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX1","text":"The law is not merely the abstract basis of appearance and is not initially its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX2","text":"The other of appearance is not an absolutely external other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX3","text":"The sides of the law are not merely indifferent different contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX4","text":"The positive identity of the law is not immediately given, but requires mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX5","text":"The supersensible world is not a mere beyond without existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX6","text":"The world in-and-for-itself is not a second world outside the totality of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:NX7","text":"The relation of the two worlds is neither identity of the same content nor mere difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D1","text":"The dependence of appearance on other appearing things sublates the externality of this dependence, because every other itself subsists only as reflected existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D2","text":"The law can count as real identity only if it contains within itself the negation and opposition of its own sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D3","text":"The transformation of the law into totality transfers the unessentiality of appearance into essential negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D4","text":"The supersensible world designates no turning away from existence, but rather its status as reflected and true existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D5","text":"The essential world is at once ground of appearance and determined as ground only through the self-positing of appearance.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D6","text":"The determinate ground of appearance encompasses its entire multiplicity, because the realm of laws has taken up into itself the negativity of appearing.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:D7","text":"The return of appearance into its ground removes the ground-relation as a resting form and replaces it with becoming and transition of opposed determinations.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD1","text":"The ontological hierarchy of appearance and essence is not presupposed, but arises from the self-negation of appearance.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A3","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD2","text":"Truth is not the removal of appearance, but its self-reflection in a form that contains its negativity as its own moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A7","CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD3","text":"Ground is not a one-sided antecedent cause, but the self-positing of a totality that simultaneously produces its posited as its opposed moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SD4","text":"The inversion of the worlds is the form in which their identity becomes real, because each world is determined only in opposition to its own negativity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an ultimately valid, unreflected immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX2","text":"The system excludes an absolutely external other that would not itself enter into the movement of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX3","text":"The system excludes a rigid doctrine of two worlds in which the sensuous and the supersensible subsist independently alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a ground that would remain unaffected and unmediated by that which is grounded through it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a truth that could subsist without negativity and without self-opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a final totality that would not have to produce its appearance out of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:SNX3","text":"Impossible is an immediate cognition of the essential through mere sensuous intuition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS1","text":"Mutable existence → subsistence in the other → appearance as mediated dissolution.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A1","CH_GB18_BD_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS2","text":"Mediated appearance → simple self-identity → law as abstract basis.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A2","CH_GB18_BD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS3","text":"Lawful identity → negative unity of its sides → real and posited identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A5","CH_GB18_BD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS4","text":"Real lawful identity → essential negativity → totality of content and form.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A6","CH_GB18_BD_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS5","text":"Total reflected existence → supersensible world → self-positing of the appearing world.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A8","CH_GB18_BD_3:A9","CH_GB18_BD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:FGS6","text":"Self-posited appearance → negative identity of the worlds → inversion, becoming, and transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_BD_3:A10","CH_GB18_BD_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF1","text":"Change of the existing world → reflection of its subsistence in other existing things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF2","text":"Reflection into other → self-reflection of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF3","text":"Self-reflection → law as negative unity of opposed sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF4","text":"Negative unity → law as totality and essential negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF5","text":"Total law → world in-and-for-itself or supersensible world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF6","text":"Supersensible totality → self-division into essential and appearing world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:AF7","text":"Self-division → opposed identity → world in-and-for-itself as inverted appearing world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME1","text":"The law is reclassified from a mere regularity of appearing into its immanent negative totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME2","text":"The other is reclassified from an external condition into a form of the self-relation of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME3","text":"The supersensible becomes visible not as a transcendent domain of objects, but as reflected existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME4","text":"Ground is transformed from a one-sided grounding relation into a self-positing negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ME5","text":"The juxtaposition of essential and appearing world becomes readable as the internal inversion-structure of a single totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — The existing world appears as mutable multiplicity, whose regularity is grasped in the realm of laws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — The law receives reality only through the negative unity of its sides and thereby becomes the totality of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Sensuous representation and unconscious reflection are surpassed through a determination of reflected existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being, ground, appearance, and essence are organized as self-division, return, becoming, and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from appearance through law and negativity to the inversion of the worlds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to what criterion the negative unity in the sides of the law counts as actually posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT3","text":"The reconstruction is coherent insofar as identity is understood only as the result of its own negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the derivation of the essential world from the negativity released within the law itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT5","text":"A structural tension arises from the fact that the world in-and-for-itself is supposed to be both the totality without an external other and only one side in relation to appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the ground-relation is initially restored and subsequently sublated as an inadequate form into becoming and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BD_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text insofar as the supersensible world is read not as a static beyond, but as the necessary self-inversion of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BD_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BD_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BD_3:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 144","title":"B. The World of Appearance and the World-in-Itself.","context":"Chapter 144","original_title":"B. Die erscheinende und die an-sich-seynede Welt."},"original_title":"B. Die erscheinende und die an-sich-seynede Welt.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD","layer":"CH","title":"C. Dissolution of Appearance.","order":145,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CASD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CASD@R001","sha256":"2a42fe76ba418843cd56e29a4c5b12e2368f22dd993c516e4b46691a46688229","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist der scheinbare Gegensatz einer erscheinenden Welt und einer an und für sich seienden Welt, deren Verhältnis zunächst als Grundverhältnis erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS2","text":"Die Kernbehauptung lautet, dass dieser Gegensatz sich aufhebt, weil jede Welt das negative beziehungsweise entgegengesetzte Moment der anderen in sich trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS3","text":"Das Argument verfährt immanent-dialektisch, indem es die gesetzte Trennung aus den inneren Bestimmungen ihrer beiden Seiten auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der reziproken Verkehrung der Bestimmungen über das Verschwinden des Weltunterschieds zur Identität beider Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS5","text":"Die erscheinende Welt wird als sich selbst gleiches Gesetz bestimmt, während die an und für sich seiende Welt als in sich entgegengesetzter Inhalt und als unmittelbare Existenz erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS6","text":"Die Endposition bestimmt beide Welten als Totalitäten, deren Selbstständigkeit nur in ihrer wesentlichen Beziehung und ihrer gemeinsamen Formeinheit besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A1","text":"Die an und für sich seiende Welt ist der bestimmte Grund der erscheinenden Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A2","text":"Dieser Grund ist nur als negatives Moment und als Totalität der Inhaltsbestimmungen und ihrer Veränderungen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A3","text":"Was in der erscheinenden Welt positiv ist, ist in der an und für sich seienden Welt negativ, und umgekehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A4","text":"Die erscheinende Welt ist Reflexion in das Anderssein, sodass ihre Bestimmungen und Existenzen in einem Anderen ihren Grund und ihr Bestehen haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A5","text":"Das Andere der erscheinenden Welt ist seinerseits in ein Anderes reflektiert und dadurch ein sich aufhebendes Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A6","text":"Die an und für sich seiende Welt ist zunächst ein mit sich identischer Inhalt, der dem Anderssein und dem Wechsel entnommen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A7","text":"Als vollständige Reflexion der erscheinenden Welt in sich enthält die an und für sich seiende Welt das negative Moment und die Beziehung auf sich als auf das Anderssein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A8","text":"Der Inhalt der an und für sich seienden Welt erhält durch seine innere Entgegensetzung die Form unmittelbarer Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A9","text":"Die erscheinende und die an und für sich seiende Welt sind jeweils Totalitäten der Identitätsreflexion und der Reflexion-in-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A10","text":"Jede Welt setzt sich in ihrer anderen fort und besitzt ihre Selbstständigkeit nur als Totalität, die das Moment der anderen enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A11","text":"Im Gesetz ist die Identität seiner verschiedenen Seiten zunächst nur eine innere Identität, während sein Inhalt als gleichgültig verschiedener Inhalt bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A12","text":"Im realisierten Gesetz wird die innere Identität zugleich daseiend, und der Inhalt wird in die Idealität erhoben, weil jede Seite ihre andere an ihr selbst hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A13","text":"Die Mannigfaltigkeit hört auf, bloß verschiedene Mannigfaltigkeit zu sein, und die beiden Totalitäten des Inhalts treten als wesentliches Verhältnis und als Formeinheit hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX1","text":"Die erscheinende und die an und für sich seiende Welt sind keine voneinander isolierten selbstständigen Sphären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX2","text":"Positivität und Negativität sind keine festen Eigenschaften, die jeweils nur einer Welt zukommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX3","text":"Die erscheinende Welt ist keine grundlose unmittelbare Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX4","text":"Die an und für sich seiende Welt ist kein unveränderlicher Inhalt außerhalb von Anderssein und Wechsel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX5","text":"Die Identität des Gesetzes ist keine bloß innere, noch nicht realisierte Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX6","text":"Der Inhalt des Gesetzes ist kein gleichgültig nebeneinanderstehender verschiedener Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX7","text":"Selbstständigkeit bedeutet keine Unabhängigkeit von der wesentlichen Beziehung auf die andere Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX8","text":"Die Welt ist keine formlose Totalität einer bloß äußerlichen Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D1","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen den beiden Welten verschwindet, weil jede Welt die Bestimmung der anderen an ihr selbst enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A3","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D2","text":"Die erscheinende Welt bezieht sich über das sich aufhebende Andere auf sich selbst und ist dadurch sich selbst gleiches Gesetz.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A4","CH_GB18_CASD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D3","text":"Die an und für sich seiende Welt wird durch die in ihr enthaltene Negativität zu sich selbst entgegengesetztem und sich verkehrendem Inhalt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A6","CH_GB18_CASD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D4","text":"Der Grund der erscheinenden Welt wird durch seine eigene Entgegensetzung zum aufgehobenen Grund und zur unmittelbaren Existenz.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A1","CH_GB18_CASD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D5","text":"Die beiden zunächst unterschiedenen Existenzen sind jeweils zugleich unmittelbare Existenz und Reflexion in ihr Anderssein.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A8","CH_GB18_CASD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D6","text":"Die anfänglich nur innere Gesetzesidentität wird zu einer daseienden Identität der Seiten.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A11","CH_GB18_CASD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D7","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit der beiden Totalitäten besteht nur als wesentliche Beziehung aufeinander.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D8","text":"Die bloße Mannigfaltigkeit wird in die Bestimmung eines wesentlichen Verhältnisses überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A12","CH_GB18_CASD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD1","text":"Die anfängliche Zweiweltenstruktur wird in eine innere Doppelbestimmung einer Totalität überführt, die sich in zwei relational bestimmte Totalitäten abstößt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A3","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD2","text":"Grund, Erscheinung und Wesen sind keine fixierten ontologischen Positionen, sondern Übergangsformen der Reflexion, in denen Grund zur unmittelbaren Existenz und Gesetz zum wesentlichen Verhältnis wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A1","CH_GB18_CASD:A8","CH_GB18_CASD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD3","text":"Identität und Selbstständigkeit entstehen nicht vor der Beziehung, sondern werden durch die in sich aufgenommene Entgegensetzung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A7","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD4","text":"Die Aufhebung der bloß verschiedenen Mannigfaltigkeit erzeugt keine einfache Einheit, sondern eine durch wesentliche Beziehung bestimmte Formeinheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A10","CH_GB18_CASD:A12","CH_GB18_CASD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt einen äußeren Grund aus, der außerhalb der relationalen Totalität bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein reines Wesen aus, das hinter oder neben der Erscheinung als selbstständige Sphäre fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Identität aus, die ohne Differenz, Negativität und Beziehung zu ihrem Anderen bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Entgegensetzung aus, deren Seiten durch die jeweils andere Seite unverändert blieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine unmittelbare Existenz aus, die nicht zugleich Reflexion in ihr Anderssein wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX6","text":"Es schließt ein Gesetz aus, dessen Identität nur äußerlich zwischen gleichgültigen Inhalten vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine letztgültige Zweiweltenontologie, in der Erscheinung und Wesen als unabhängige Totalitäten ohne gegenseitige Bestimmung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit ebenso wie eine reine Reflexion, weil jede Seite die Bestimmung der anderen enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Bewahrung des Gesetzes als bloß innerer Identität und des Inhalts als gleichgültiger Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, deren Totalität in bloßer Mannigfaltigkeit und nicht in wesentlicher Beziehung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist eine einfache Auflösung des Gegensatzes in unterschiedslose Einheit; der Gegensatz bleibt als relationale Formeinheit erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS1","text":"Grundsetzung: an und für sich seiende Welt → bestimmter Grund der erscheinenden Welt → negatives Moment und Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS2","text":"Reziproke Verkehrung: positive Bestimmung der Erscheinung ↔ negative Bestimmung des Ansichseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS3","text":"Reflexion der Erscheinung: Anderssein → Reflexion in ein weiteres Anderssein → sich aufhebendes Anderes → Selbstbeziehung → sich selbst gleiches Gesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS4","text":"Reflexion des Ansichseins: identischer Inhalt → absolute Differenz → Beziehung auf sich als Anderssein → Selbstentgegensetzung → sich verkehrender, wesenloser Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS5","text":"Umschlag des Grundes: Grund mit innerer Entgegensetzung → aufgehobener Grund → unmittelbare Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS6","text":"Totalisierung: Identitätsreflexion und Reflexion-in-Anderes → zwei Totalitäten → jede enthält das Moment der anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS7","text":"Realisierung des Gesetzes: innere Identität → daseiende Identität → idealisierter Inhalt → wesentliches Verhältnis → Formeinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF1","text":"Bestimmter Grund der Erscheinung → negatives Moment → reziproke Verkehrung der positiven und negativen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF2","text":"Reziproke Verkehrung → Verschwinden des Unterschieds beider Welten → Erscheinung als selbstgleiches Gesetz und Wesen als sich entgegensetzender Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF3","text":"Innere Entgegensetzung des Wesens → aufgehobener Grund und unmittelbare Existenz → beiderseitige Totalität von Identitätsreflexion und Reflexion-in-Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF4","text":"Beiderseitige Totalität → relationale Selbstständigkeit → Realisierung der Gesetzesidentität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF5","text":"Realisiertes Gesetz → wesentliches Verhältnis → Aufhebung der bloßen Verschiedenheit → Formeinheit der beiden Inhaltstotalitäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME1","text":"Die begriffliche Karte ordnet positive und negative Bestimmungen nicht mehr zwei getrennten Welten, sondern einer reziproken Verkehrung innerhalb derselben Totalität zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Erscheinung und Wesen wird von einer Weltentrennung in zwei innerhalb jeder Totalität wirksame Reflexionsweisen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME3","text":"Der Grund wird nicht länger als äußerer Ursprung, sondern als eine durch innere Entgegensetzung in unmittelbare Existenz umschlagende Bestimmung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME4","text":"Das Gesetz wird von einer bloß inneren Korrespondenz verschiedener Inhalte zu einer realisierten Identität der Seiten umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME5","text":"Selbstständigkeit wird von isolierter Unabhängigkeit in wesentliche Beziehung und Einheit mit dem Anderen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME6","text":"Die Welt der Mannigfaltigkeit wird nicht als bloßes Nebeneinander, sondern als Struktur eines wesentlichen Verhältnisses lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Auf der Oberfläche erscheinen zwei Welten, deren positive und negative Bestimmungen einander entgegengesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Auf der strukturellen Ebene erzeugen Reflexion-in-Anderes, Selbstbeziehung und innere Entgegensetzung das Gesetz und die wesentliche Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird der scheinbare Zweiweltengegensatz als immanente Operation der Umkehrung und Aufhebung neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Auf der ontologisch-logischen Ebene wird Existenz als Totalität bestimmt, deren zunächst unterschiedene Momente sich in einer gerichteten Folge von Grund, Aufhebung, unmittelbarer Existenz und wesentlichem Verhältnis bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT1","text":"Die tragenden Propositionen reichen aus, um den Übergang von der getrennt erscheinenden Zweiweltenstruktur zur relationalen Totalität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT2","text":"Unverzichtbar sind die reziproke Verkehrung, die Reflexion-in-Anderes, die innere Negativität, die beiderseitige Totalität und die Realisierung des Gesetzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der genaue begriffliche Status von „Inhalt“, „Idealität“ und „Formeinheit“ innerhalb dieses Ausschnitts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT4","text":"Die Aufhebung des Unterschieds führt nicht zu einfacher Einheit; die Unterscheidung bleibt als Zweiheit relational bestimmter Totalitäten erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT5","text":"Die Bestimmung der an und für sich seienden Welt als Grund, wesenloser Inhalt und unmittelbare Existenz enthält eine Spannung, deren Vermittlung nur durch die innere Entgegensetzung angegeben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT6","text":"Die interne Kohärenz hängt davon ab, dass Aufhebung zugleich Beseitigung der isolierten Selbstständigkeit und Erhaltung der unterschiedenen Momente bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT7","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen reziproker Reflexion, realisiertem Gesetz und wesentlichem Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern sie die logische Stufenfolge und nicht die bloße Reihenfolge der Beispiele zugrunde legt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113823217164Z_7bc7546c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Dissolution of Appearance.","source_sha256":"2a42fe76ba418843cd56e29a4c5b12e2368f22dd993c516e4b46691a46688229","sha256":"ac02c5aedffee7f3e3a4073d13f3cc0294ac0eb8d0938e0ed5ea4848b20a3d34","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:38:23.218725+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS1","text":"The problem is the apparent opposition between a world of appearance and a world existing in and for itself, whose relation initially appears as a ground-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS2","text":"The core claim is that this opposition sublates itself because each world bears within itself the negative, or opposed, moment of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds immanently-dialectically by dissolving the posited separation from the inner determinations of its two sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS4","text":"The movement leads from the reciprocal inversion of the determinations, through the disappearance of the distinction between the worlds, to the identity of both sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS5","text":"The world of appearance is determined as law equal to itself, whereas the world existing in and for itself appears as internally opposed content and as immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AS6","text":"The final position determines both worlds as totalities whose self-subsistence consists only in their essential relation and their common unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A1","text":"The world existing in and for itself is the determinate ground of the world of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A2","text":"This ground is determined only as negative moment and as totality of the determinations of content and their alterations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A3","text":"What is positive in the world of appearance is negative in the world existing in and for itself, and conversely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A4","text":"The world of appearance is reflection into otherness, such that its determinations and existences have their ground and subsistence in an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A5","text":"The other of the world of appearance is, for its part, reflected into an other and thereby is a self-sublating other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A6","text":"The world existing in and for itself is initially a content identical with itself, abstracted from otherness and alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A7","text":"As the complete reflection of the world of appearance into itself, the world existing in and for itself contains the negative moment and relation to itself as to otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A8","text":"Through its inner opposition, the content of the world existing in and for itself receives the form of immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A9","text":"The world of appearance and the world existing in and for itself are each totalities of identity-reflection and reflection-into-otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A10","text":"Each world continues itself in its other and possesses its self-subsistence only as a totality that contains the moment of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A11","text":"In law, the identity of its different sides is initially only an inner identity, while its content is determined as an indifferent, different content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A12","text":"In realized law, inner identity at the same time becomes existent, and the content is raised into ideality because each side has its other in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:A13","text":"Manifoldness ceases to be merely different manifoldness, and the two totalities of content emerge as essential relation and unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX1","text":"The world of appearance and the world existing in and for itself are not self-subsistent spheres isolated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX2","text":"Positivity and negativity are not fixed properties belonging in each case only to one world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX3","text":"The world of appearance is not groundless immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX4","text":"The world existing in and for itself is not an unalterable content outside otherness and alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX5","text":"The identity of law is not a merely inner identity not yet realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX6","text":"The content of law is not an indifferent different content standing alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX7","text":"Self-subsistence does not mean independence from the essential relation to the other totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:NX8","text":"The world is not a formless totality of merely external manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D1","text":"The distinction between the two worlds disappears because each world contains the determination of the other in itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A3","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D2","text":"Through the self-sublating other, the world of appearance relates to itself and thereby is law equal to itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A4","CH_GB18_CASD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D3","text":"Through the negativity contained within it, the world existing in and for itself becomes content opposed to itself and inverting itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A6","CH_GB18_CASD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D4","text":"Through its own opposition, the ground of the world of appearance becomes sublated ground and immediate existence.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A1","CH_GB18_CASD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D5","text":"The two initially distinct existences are each at the same time immediate existence and reflection into their otherness.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A8","CH_GB18_CASD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D6","text":"The initially merely inner identity of law becomes an existent identity of the sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A11","CH_GB18_CASD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D7","text":"The self-subsistence of the two totalities consists only as essential relation to one another.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:D8","text":"Mere manifoldness is transferred into the determination of an essential relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A12","CH_GB18_CASD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD1","text":"The initial two-world structure is transferred into an inner double determination of a totality that repels itself into two relationally determined totalities.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A3","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD2","text":"Ground, appearance, and essence are not fixed ontological positions, but transitional forms of reflection in which ground becomes immediate existence and law becomes essential relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A1","CH_GB18_CASD:A8","CH_GB18_CASD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD3","text":"Identity and self-subsistence do not arise prior to relation, but are generated through opposition taken up into itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A7","CH_GB18_CASD:A9","CH_GB18_CASD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SD4","text":"The sublation of merely different manifoldness generates not a simple unity, but a unity of form determined through essential relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CASD:A10","CH_GB18_CASD:A12","CH_GB18_CASD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an external ground that could subsist outside the relational totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX2","text":"It excludes a pure essence that persists behind or alongside appearance as a self-subsistent sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX3","text":"It excludes an identity that could subsist without difference, negativity, and relation to its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX4","text":"It excludes an opposition whose sides would remain unchanged by the respectively other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX5","text":"It excludes an immediate existence that would not at the same time be reflection into its otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:DNX6","text":"It excludes a law whose identity would be mediated only externally between indifferent contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an ultimately valid two-world ontology in which appearance and essence subsist as independent totalities without reciprocal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is pure immediacy no less than pure reflection, because each side contains the determination of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the preservation of law as merely inner identity and of content as indifferent difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a world whose totality consists in mere manifoldness and not in essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:SNX5","text":"Barred is a simple dissolution of the opposition into undifferentiated unity; the opposition remains preserved as relational unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS1","text":"Ground-positing: world existing in and for itself → determinate ground of the world of appearance → negative moment and totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS2","text":"Reciprocal inversion: positive determination of appearance ↔ negative determination of being-in-itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS3","text":"Reflection of appearance: otherness → reflection into a further otherness → self-sublating other → self-relation → law equal to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS4","text":"Reflection of being-in-itself: identical content → absolute difference → relation to itself as otherness → self-opposition → inverting, essenceless content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS5","text":"Transition of ground: ground with inner opposition → sublated ground → immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS6","text":"Totalization: identity-reflection and reflection-into-otherness → two totalities → each contains the moment of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:FGS7","text":"Realization of law: inner identity → existent identity → idealized content → essential relation → unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF1","text":"Determinate ground of appearance → negative moment → reciprocal inversion of the positive and negative determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF2","text":"Reciprocal inversion → disappearance of the distinction between both worlds → appearance as law equal to itself and essence as self-opposing content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF3","text":"Inner opposition of essence → sublated ground and immediate existence → reciprocal totality of identity-reflection and reflection-into-otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF4","text":"Reciprocal totality → relational self-subsistence → realization of the identity of law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:AF5","text":"Realized law → essential relation → sublation of mere difference → unity of form of the two content-totalities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME1","text":"The conceptual map assigns positive and negative determinations no longer to two separate worlds, but to a reciprocal inversion within the same totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME2","text":"The opposition of appearance and essence is remapped from a separation of worlds into two modes of reflection operative within each totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME3","text":"Ground no longer becomes visible as an external origin, but as a determination that, through inner opposition, passes over into immediate existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME4","text":"Law is reclassified from a merely inner correspondence of different contents into a realized identity of the sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME5","text":"Self-subsistence is transferred from isolated independence into essential relation and unity with the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ME6","text":"The world of manifoldness becomes legible not as mere juxtaposition, but as the structure of an essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT1","text":"Surface — At the surface, two worlds appear whose positive and negative determinations are opposed to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT2","text":"Structural — At the structural level, reflection-into-otherness, self-relation, and inner opposition generate law and essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — At the metastrategic level, the apparent two-world opposition is reframed as an immanent operation of inversion and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — At the ontological-logical level, existence is determined as a totality whose initially distinct moments determine themselves in a directed sequence of ground, sublation, immediate existence, and essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT1","text":"The supporting propositions suffice to reconstruct the transition from the seemingly separate two-world structure to relational totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT2","text":"Indispensable are reciprocal inversion, reflection-into-otherness, inner negativity, reciprocal totality, and the realization of law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT3","text":"The precise conceptual status of “content,” “ideality,” and “unity of form” within this excerpt remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT4","text":"The sublation of the distinction does not lead to simple unity; the distinction remains preserved as a duality of relationally determined totalities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT5","text":"The determination of the world existing in and for itself as ground, essenceless content, and immediate existence contains a tension whose mediation is indicated only through inner opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT6","text":"Internal coherence depends on sublation meaning at once the removal of isolated self-subsistence and the preservation of the distinct moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT7","text":"The strongest connection consists between reciprocal reflection, realized law, and essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CASD:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as it takes logical sequence, and not the mere order of the examples, as its basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CASD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CASD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 145","title":"C. Dissolution of Appearance.","context":"Chapter 145","original_title":"C. Auflösung der Erscheinung."},"original_title":"C. Auflösung der Erscheinung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD","layer":"CH","title":"A. The Relation of Whole and Parts.","order":146,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DVLD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DVLD@R001","sha256":"8bf723d3e972465222fceb7811c42ee1d1682c8e8374fbc4c5418ad4dda65e68","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS1","text":"Die Wahrheit der Erscheinung wird als wesentliches Verhältniß bestimmt, in dem Selbstständigkeit nur als Reflexion in ein Anderes besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS2","text":"Das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Theile setzt reflektirte Einheit und unmittelbare Mannigfaltigkeit zugleich als selbstständig und als wechselseitig abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS3","text":"Jede Seite beansprucht, Grundlage der anderen zu sein, und verliert gerade dadurch ihre behauptete Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS4","text":"Die Gleichheit von Ganzem und Theilen erweist sich als Tautologie, weil jede Seite nur unter Absehung ihrer entgegengesetzten Bestimmung mit der anderen gleichgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS5","text":"Der Widerspruch der wechselseitig selbstständigen und aufgehobenen Seiten zwingt das Verhältnis in vermittelte negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS6","text":"Mit der Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Selbstständigkeit von Ganzem und Theilen geht das Verhältnis in Kraft und Äußerung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A1","text":"Das wesentliche Verhältniß ist die Wahrheit der Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","text":"Selbstständigkeit besteht im wesentlichen Verhältniß nur als Reflexion in ein Anderes und dadurch als Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A3","text":"Die Seiten eines wesentlichen Verhältnisses sind selbstständige Totalitäten, deren Bestehen nur in negativer Einheit mit ihrem Anderen Bedeutung hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A4","text":"Das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Theile ist die unmittelbare Gestalt der Einheit reflektirter und seyender Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","text":"Das Ganze ist reflektirte Einheit und hat sein Bestehen nur durch die Theile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","text":"Die Theile sind unmittelbare Mannigfaltigkeit und haben ihre Selbstständigkeit nur durch das Ganze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","text":"Ganze und Theile setzen und bedingen einander gegenseitig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit jeder Seite ist zugleich ihre Negation, weil ihr Grund außer ihr in der anderen Seite liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A9","text":"Die Gleichheit von Ganzem und Theilen gilt nur als Gleichheit des Ganzen mit seiner Einheit beziehungsweise der Theile mit dem getheilten Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A10","text":"Die Wahrheit des Verhältnisses ist Vermittlung als negative Einheit, in der reflektirte und seyende Unmittelbarkeit aufgehoben sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A11","text":"Die Aufhebung der unmittelbaren Seitenbestimmungen transformiert das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Theile in das Verhältnis von Kraft und Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX1","text":"Das Ganze ist nicht eine von den Theilen ablösbare abstrakte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX2","text":"Die Theile sind nicht ohne das Ganze bestimmbare selbstständige Einheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX3","text":"Die Identität von Ganzem und Theilen ist nicht deren bereits vollzogene negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX4","text":"Die Gleichheit von Ganzem und Theilen ist nicht eine Gleichheit des Ganzen mit den Theilen als selbstständigen Verschiedenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX5","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit der Seiten ist nicht unvermittelte Selbstgenügsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX6","text":"Die unmittelbare Beziehung des Ganzen und der Theile ist nicht die letzte Form des wesentlichen Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D1","text":"Das Ganze ist nur Totalität, weil die Theile sein eigenes Bestehen ausmachen; es ist daher zugleich Totalität und Relatives.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D2","text":"Die Theile sind nur selbstständig, indem ihre Mannigfaltigkeit in der reflektirten Einheit des Ganzen besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D3","text":"Die wechselseitige Bedingung kehrt das Bedingen in sich zurück und erzeugt innerhalb des Verhältnisses den Anspruch des Unbedingten.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A4","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D4","text":"Die behauptete Gleichheit des Ganzen mit den Theilen hebt deren reale Bestimmungsdifferenz nicht auf, sondern verschiebt sie in formale Tautologie.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D5","text":"Die Gleichgültigkeit des Ganzen gegen die Theile zerstört die Bestimmtheit des Ganzen, während die Gleichgültigkeit der Theile gegen das Ganze ihre Mannigfaltigkeit zerstört.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D6","text":"Die Unmittelbarkeit jeder Seite ist nur gesetzt und vermittelt, weil ihr Anfang jeweils im Anderen liegt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD1","text":"Das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Theile ist keine stabile ontologische Ordnung, sondern eine Übergangsform, in der jede Grundlage durch ihre Abhängigkeit von dem Begründeten unterminiert wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD2","text":"Der Anspruch einer Seite, das Erste zu sein, ist nur möglich als vermittelte Setzung, da jedes vermeintlich Erste seinen Anfang im Anderen hat.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD3","text":"Die Form der Totalität wird als intern differenzierte, selbstnegierende Einheit bestimmt und nicht als Addition selbstständiger Bestandteile.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A3","CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD4","text":"Der Übergang zu Kraft und Äußerung folgt notwendig daraus, daß die Seiten nicht als unmittelbare Dinge bestehen können, sondern als gesetzte Momente eines Vermittlungsprozesses.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10","CH_GB18_DVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem Abhängigkeit und Selbstständigkeit verschiedenen Ebenen angehören und daher widerspruchslos nebeneinander bestehen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein ursprüngliches, schlechthin unmittelbares Erstes, das nicht bereits durch ein Anderes vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Totalität, deren Einheit der Mannigfaltigkeit äußerlich gegenüberstünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Differenz, die als gleichgültige Vielheit bestehen könnte, ohne sich selbst in Einheit zurückzutreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine letzte Ruheform, in der Ganze und Theile zugleich vollständig selbstständig und vollständig identisch wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Sein, dessen Unmittelbarkeit keiner Setzung, Vermittlung oder negativen Beziehung unterliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, den Widerspruch des Verhältnisses durch bloße begriffliche Gleichsetzung seiner Seiten aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS1","text":"Erscheinung → wesentliches Verhältniß → Selbstständigkeit als Reflexion in Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS2","text":"Reflektirte Einheit des Ganzen + unmittelbare Mannigfaltigkeit der Theile → wechselseitige Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS3","text":"Wechselseitige Voraussetzung + Anspruch eigenständiger Grundlage → jede Seite wird zugleich Grund und Gesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS4","text":"Selbstständigkeit jeder Seite + Bestehensgrund im Anderen → Selbstnegation der Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS5","text":"Formale Gleichheit von Ganzem und Theilen → Tautologie → Fortbestand der realen Differenz und des Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS6","text":"Widerspruch → Vermittlung → negative Einheit → Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit → Kraft und Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF1","text":"Erscheinung als bloßes Dasein → Wesen als Verhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF2","text":"Verhältnis → Einheit reflektirter und unmittelbarer Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF3","text":"Einheit der Selbstständigkeiten → Ganzes und Theile als unmittelbare Seiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF4","text":"Ganze und Theile als Grundlagen → gegenseitiges Bedingen und Voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF5","text":"Gegenseitige Selbstständigkeit → Selbstwiderspruch und Tautologie der Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF6","text":"Widerspruch → negative Vermittlung → Übergang zu Kraft und Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME1","text":"Das Ganze wird von einer übergeordneten Einheit in eine Einheit umklassifiziert, die nur in und durch ihre Theile besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME2","text":"Die Theile werden von selbstständigen Bestandteilen in Momente umklassifiziert, deren Selbstständigkeit ihre Abhängigkeit einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME3","text":"Bedingung und Bedingtes werden nicht als lineare Ordnung, sondern als reziproke Vermittlungsstruktur kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME4","text":"Gleichheit wird von einer Aufhebung der Differenz in eine formale Tautologie umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME5","text":"Widerspruch wird nicht als äußerer Defekt, sondern als immanenter Übergangsmechanismus des Verhältnisses kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das Kapitel bestimmt das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Theile als wechselseitige Beziehung von Einheit und Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ganze und Theile besitzen ihre jeweilige Selbstständigkeit nur durch die andere Seite und negieren dadurch ihre isolierte Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Frage nach der Vorrangigkeit des Ganzen oder der Theile durch die Analyse der Vermittlung, welche beide Vorrangsansprüche erzeugt und aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unmittelbarkeit erscheint als nachträglich gesetzte und vermittelte Form; jedes Erste ist nur Anfang aus einem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Transformation von Ganzem und Theilen aus unmittelbaren Selbstständigkeiten in vermittelte Momente zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, weshalb die negative Einheit notwendig gerade die Bestimmung von Kraft und Äußerung annimmt und keine andere Folgeform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Selbstständigkeit als relationale und nicht als isolierte Bestimmung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Ableitung, daß jede Seite ihren Grund gerade dort hat, wo sie ihr Anderes setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Bruchlinie liegt darin, daß die Gegenseitigkeit zunächst als Rückkehr zum Unbedingten erscheint, während die Seiten zugleich als gleichgültige selbstständige Existenzen fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt darin, daß die Gleichheit von Ganzem und Theilen behauptet werden muß, aber nur durch ihre Reduktion auf Tautologie haltbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn sie die Folge Selbstständigkeit, Gegenseitigkeit, Widerspruch, Vermittlung und Übergang nicht als äußere Abfolge, sondern als Selbstauflösung derselben Beziehung fasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115718368863Z_248f8217","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"A. The Relation of the Whole and the Parts.","source_sha256":"8bf723d3e972465222fceb7811c42ee1d1682c8e8374fbc4c5418ad4dda65e68","sha256":"a02de3b7f798318c6bda32c4941da81b145d07df35e84faeb044b0c56f8649d7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:57:18.369954+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS1","text":"The truth of appearance is determined as essential relation, in which self-subsistence exists only as reflection into an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS2","text":"The relation of the whole and the parts posits reflected unity and immediate multiplicity simultaneously as self-subsistent and as mutually dependent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS3","text":"Each side claims to be the ground of the other and thereby loses precisely its asserted self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS4","text":"The equality of whole and parts proves to be tautology, because each side is equated with the other only by abstracting from its opposed determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS5","text":"The contradiction of the mutually self-subsistent and sublated sides compels the relation into mediated negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AS6","text":"With the sublation of the immediate self-subsistence of whole and parts, the relation passes over into force and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A1","text":"Essential relation is the truth of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","text":"In essential relation, self-subsistence exists only as reflection into an other and thereby as reflection into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A3","text":"The sides of an essential relation are self-subsistent totalities whose subsistence has significance only in negative unity with their other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A4","text":"The relation of the whole and the parts is the immediate form of the unity of reflected and being self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","text":"The whole is reflected unity and has its subsistence only through the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","text":"The parts are immediate multiplicity and have their self-subsistence only through the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","text":"Whole and parts posit and condition one another reciprocally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","text":"The self-subsistence of each side is at the same time its negation, because its ground lies outside it in the other side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A9","text":"The equality of whole and parts holds only as the equality of the whole with its unity, respectively of the parts with the divided whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A10","text":"The truth of the relation is mediation as negative unity, in which reflected and being immediacy are sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:A11","text":"The sublation of the immediate determinations of the sides transforms the relation of the whole and the parts into the relation of force and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX1","text":"The whole is not an abstract unity detachable from the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX2","text":"The parts are not self-subsistent units determinable without the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX3","text":"The identity of whole and parts is not their already accomplished negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX4","text":"The equality of whole and parts is not an equality of the whole with the parts as self-subsistent distincts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX5","text":"The self-subsistence of the sides is not unmediated self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:NX6","text":"The immediate relation of the whole and the parts is not the final form of essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D1","text":"The whole is totality only because the parts constitute its own subsistence; it is therefore at once totality and relative.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D2","text":"The parts are self-subsistent only insofar as their multiplicity consists in the reflected unity of the whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D3","text":"The reciprocal condition turns conditioning back into itself and generates within the relation the claim of the unconditioned.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A4","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D4","text":"The asserted equality of the whole with the parts does not sublate their real difference of determination, but shifts it into formal tautology.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D5","text":"The indifference of the whole toward the parts destroys the determinacy of the whole, whereas the indifference of the parts toward the whole destroys their multiplicity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:D6","text":"The immediacy of each side is only posited and mediated, because its beginning lies in each case in the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD1","text":"The relation of the whole and the parts is not a stable ontological order, but a transitional form in which every ground is undermined by its dependence on that which is grounded.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A6","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD2","text":"The claim of one side to be the first is possible only as a mediated positing, since every supposedly first has its beginning in the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A2","CH_GB18_DVLD:A7","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD3","text":"The form of totality is determined as an internally differentiated, self-negating unity and not as an addition of self-subsistent components.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A3","CH_GB18_DVLD:A5","CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SD4","text":"The transition to force and expression follows necessarily from the fact that the sides cannot subsist as immediate things, but only as posited moments of a process of mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DVLD:A8","CH_GB18_DVLD:A10","CH_GB18_DVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which dependence and self-subsistence belong to different levels and could therefore coexist without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an original, absolutely immediate first that would not already be mediated by an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a totality whose unity would stand externally opposed to multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a difference that could subsist as indifferent plurality without driving itself back into unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a final form of rest in which whole and parts would be simultaneously completely self-subsistent and completely identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a being whose immediacy is subject to no positing, mediation, or negative relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of resolving the contradiction of the relation through mere conceptual equation of its sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS1","text":"Appearance → essential relation → self-subsistence as reflection into an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS2","text":"Reflected unity of the whole + immediate multiplicity of the parts → reciprocal presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS3","text":"Reciprocal presupposition + claim of an independent ground → each side becomes at once ground and posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS4","text":"Self-subsistence of each side + ground of subsistence in the other → self-negation of self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS5","text":"Formal equality of whole and parts → tautology → persistence of real difference and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:FGS6","text":"Contradiction → mediation → negative unity → sublation of immediacy → force and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF1","text":"Appearance as mere existence → essence as relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF2","text":"Relation → unity of reflected and immediate self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF3","text":"Unity of self-subsistences → whole and parts as immediate sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF4","text":"Whole and parts as grounds → mutual conditioning and presupposing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF5","text":"Mutual self-subsistence → self-contradiction and tautology of equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:AF6","text":"Contradiction → negative mediation → transition to force and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME1","text":"The whole is reclassified from a superordinate unity into a unity that subsists only in and through its parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME2","text":"The parts are reclassified from self-subsistent components into moments whose self-subsistence includes their dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME3","text":"Condition and conditioned are mapped not as a linear order, but as a reciprocal structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME4","text":"Equality is reclassified from a sublation of difference into a formal tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ME5","text":"Contradiction is mapped not as an external defect, but as an immanent mechanism of transition of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT1","text":"Surface — The chapter determines the relation of the whole and the parts as the reciprocal relation of unity and multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Whole and parts possess their respective self-subsistence only through the other side and thereby negate their isolated validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the question of the priority of the whole or the parts with the analysis of mediation, which produces and sublates both claims to priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Immediacy appears as a subsequently posited and mediated form; every first is only a beginning from an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transformation of whole and parts from immediate self-subsistences into mediated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why negative unity necessarily assumes precisely the determination of force and expression and no other consequent form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as self-subsistence is read as a relational and not as an isolated determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the derivation that each side has its ground precisely where it posits its other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT5","text":"A structural fault line lies in the fact that reciprocity initially appears as a return to the unconditioned, while the sides simultaneously persist as indifferent self-subsistent existences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT6","text":"A second fault line lies in the fact that the equality of whole and parts must be asserted, but is sustainable only through its reduction to tautology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DVLD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if it conceives the sequence of self-subsistence, reciprocity, contradiction, mediation, and transition not as an external succession, but as the self-dissolution of the same relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DVLD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DVLD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DVLD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 146","title":"A. The Relation of Whole and Parts.","context":"Chapter 146","original_title":"A. Das Verhältniß des Ganzen und der Theile."},"original_title":"A. Das Verhältniß des Ganzen und der Theile.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":147,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_39"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_39@R001","sha256":"5e1a5602053a8b53e3dbbdae9e0b2d325394ff15b05f22d511bbb0e69e74a252","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS1","text":"Die Antinomie der unendlichen Teilbarkeit wird als Widerspruch des Verhältnisses von Ganzem und Teilen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS2","text":"Quantität wird als Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS3","text":"Ganze und Teile sind zugleich wesentlich aufeinander bezogen und voneinander unabhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS4","text":"Die Bestimmung eines Existierenden als Ganzes setzt Teile, während die Bestimmung desselben als Teil das Ganze als äußerliche Beziehung abstreift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS5","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit des Teils schlägt dadurch in die Bestimmung des Ganzen und die Zusammensetzung aus Teilen um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS6","text":"Der unendliche Progress bezeichnet die fortgesetzte Erzeugung jeder Bestimmung aus der Aufhebung ihrer eigenen Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS7","text":"Die Antinomie beruht auf der Unfähigkeit, die wechselseitige Vermittlung von Selbstständigkeit und Unselbstständigkeit in einer Bestimmung zusammenzubringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A1","text":"Die Quantität ist die Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A2","text":"Das selbstständige Eins enthält sowohl seine Identität mit anderem als auch die Negation dieser Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A3","text":"Das Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen ist die wesentliche Form der quantitativen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A4","text":"Ganzes und Teile sind wesentlich aufeinander bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A5","text":"Ganzes und Teile besitzen zugleich ein voneinander unabhängiges Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A6","text":"Das Ganze besteht aus Teilen, deren Zusammensetzung seine Einheit bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A7","text":"Die Einheit des Ganzen ist gegenüber den selbstständig existierenden Teilen eine gesetzte äußere Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A8","text":"Ein Seiendes ist als Teil nur durch seine Beziehung auf ein Ganzes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A9","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit eines Moments gegenüber dem anderen erzeugt unmittelbar die entgegengesetzte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A10","text":"Die gesetzte Bestimmung jedes Moments ist zugleich das Verschwinden dieses Moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX1","text":"Das Ganze ist keine für sich selbstständige Einheit unabhängig von seinen Teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX2","text":"Der Teil ist nicht an sich Teil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX3","text":"Die Beziehung zum Ganzen gehört dem selbstständig Existierenden nicht als innere Bestimmung an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX4","text":"Der Teil ist, insofern er nicht durch das Ganze bestimmt ist, nicht Teil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX5","text":"Das selbstständige Moment ist nicht dauerhaft auf die Bestimmung des Teils festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX6","text":"Die Unendlichkeit ist kein abgeschlossenes Ganzes von Teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX7","text":"Die Selbstständigkeit eines Moments schließt seine isolierte Stabilität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D1","text":"Wird das Existierende als Ganzes bestimmt, so muss es aus Teilen bestehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A3","CH_GB18_A_39:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D2","text":"Wird ein Teil von seiner Beziehung zum Ganzen abgelöst, so verliert es die Bestimmung des Teils und erscheint als Einfaches.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D3","text":"Das als selbstständig gesetzte Einfache wird, weil es nur Ganzes oder Teil sein kann, wieder als Ganzes bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D4","text":"Die Bestimmung als Ganzes setzt erneut Zusammensetzung und damit Teile voraus.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A6","CH_GB18_A_39:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D5","text":"Die Trennung des Teils vom Ganzen reproduziert das Ganze in der Bestimmung des selbstständigen Teils.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D6","text":"Der unendliche Progress entsteht als Abwechslung zwischen Teilsein und Ganzsein.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:D2","CH_GB18_A_39:D3","CH_GB18_A_39:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D7","text":"Jede Bestimmung geht durch ihre Absonderung vom anderen in die Bestimmung des anderen über.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A4","CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen erzeugt seine eigene Instabilität, weil jede seiner Bestimmungen nur durch die Aufhebung ihrer Selbstständigkeit bestehen kann.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A4","CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD2","text":"Die unendliche Teilbarkeit ist keine Eigenschaft eines unabhängig vorgegebenen Materials, sondern die Form der sich selbst fortsetzenden Vermittlung von Ganzem und Teil.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A1","CH_GB18_A_39:A3","CH_GB18_A_39:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD3","text":"Die behauptete Selbstständigkeit des Teils produziert gerade die Totalität, von der sie sich lösen wollte.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD4","text":"Der unendliche Progress markiert die Nichtvereinigung zweier Bestimmungen, deren jede die andere notwendig hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10","CH_GB18_A_39:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Ganzes, dessen Einheit unabhängig von der Beziehung zu Teilen in sich gründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Teil, dessen Selbstständigkeit seine Teilbestimmung bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, in der Ganzes und Teil zugleich unterschieden und ohne Umschlag stabil erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine dritte Bestimmung jenseits der Alternative von Ganzem und Teil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Endlichkeit, in der die Teilung ohne erneute Setzung des Ganzen abgeschlossen werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX1","text":"Der Text setzt die Unmöglichkeit voraus, Selbstständigkeit und Teilbestimmung in einer bleibenden Identität zu vereinigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist ein Verhältnis, in dem die Beziehung nicht äußerlich und die Selbstständigkeit nicht selbstaufhebend wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX3","text":"Die Abwesenheit einer stabilen Vermittlungsform strukturiert den Übergang vom Teil zum Ganzen und zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine isolierte Einheit, die weder Ganzes noch Teil durch relationale Bestimmung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS1","text":"Quantität = Kontinuität ∧ Diskretion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS2","text":"Quantitative Einheit → Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS3","text":"Ganzes → Zusammensetzung aus Teilen; Teil → Bestimmung durch das Ganze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS4","text":"Äußerlichkeit der Ganzes-Teil-Beziehung → Ablösung des selbstständigen Teils vom Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS5","text":"Ablösung des Teils → Verlust der Teilbestimmung → Einfaches beziehungsweise Ganzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS6","text":"Ganzes → erneute Zusammensetzung aus Teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS7","text":"Wiederholung der Umschläge → unendlicher Progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS8","text":"Unendlicher Progress → Bestimmung jeder Seite durch die Aufhebung ihrer eigenen Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS9","text":"Nichtzusammenbringen der vermittelten Bestimmungen → Form der Antinomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AF1","text":"Antinomie der Teilbarkeit → quantitative Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion → Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen → äußerliche Selbstständigkeit des Teils → Umschlag des Teils in das Ganze → unendlicher Progress → Diagnose der nicht zusammengebrachten Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME1","text":"Die Teilbarkeit wird von einer bloßen Eigenschaft der Materie in eine relationale Dynamik von Ganzem und Teilen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME2","text":"Selbstständigkeit wird nicht länger als feste Gegenposition zur Relation, sondern als Übergang in die entgegengesetzte Bestimmung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Ganzem und Teil wird als Einheit von wesentlicher Bezogenheit und äußerlicher Gleichgültigkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME4","text":"Die unendliche Reihe wird als strukturelle Wiederholung eines Umschlags und nicht als bloße Fortsetzung von Teilungen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME5","text":"Die Antinomie wird von der Ebene isolierter Gegenstände auf die Ebene der Bestimmungen ihres Verhältnisses verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Materie erscheint als Ganzes, das aus Teilen besteht, deren Teilbarkeit fortgesetzt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Beziehung von Ganzem und Teilen verbindet wesentliche Bezogenheit mit selbstständigem Bestehen und erzeugt dadurch den Umschlag beider Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Antinomie wird nicht durch Auswahl einer Seite, sondern durch Rekonstruktion der Übergangsbewegung diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein erscheint als perennierende Bestimmungsbewegung, in der jede gesetzte Identität ihr eigenes Verschwinden hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Antinomie aus der Einheit von Kontinuität und Diskretion sowie dem Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt den entscheidenden Übergang vom selbstständigen Teil zum Ganzen und vom Ganzen zurück zu Teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, in welchem Sinn die erwähnte Auflösung der früheren Antinomie über den diagnostizierten Progress hinaus vollzogen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Argumentation als Darstellung eines sich selbst reproduzierenden Widerspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Ableitung des unendlichen Progresses aus der wechselseitigen Negation der Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur hängt an der Voraussetzung, dass nur die Alternativen Ganzes und Teil verfügbar sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern der unendliche Progress als Unfähigkeit der Vermittlung und nicht als bloße quantitative Fortsetzung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T112529812496Z_82c75896","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Note.","source_sha256":"5e1a5602053a8b53e3dbbdae9e0b2d325394ff15b05f22d511bbb0e69e74a252","sha256":"aaa43aaee90b32dd299976ef508157489a3e8b8301bd9ab001f65394f31787a8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:25:29.813745+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS1","text":"The antinomy of infinite divisibility is determined as a contradiction of the relation between whole and parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS2","text":"Quantity is conceived as the unity of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS3","text":"Whole and parts are at once essentially related to one another and independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS4","text":"The determination of an existent as a whole posits parts, whereas the determination of the same as a part strips off the whole as an external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS5","text":"The independence of the part thereby turns into the determination of the whole and into composition from parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS6","text":"The infinite progress designates the continued production of every determination from the sublation of its own independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AS7","text":"The antinomy rests on the inability to bring together, in one determination, the reciprocal mediation of independence and dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A1","text":"Quantity is the unity of continuity and discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A2","text":"The self-subsistent One contains both its identity with another and the negation of this identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A3","text":"The relation of whole and parts is the essential form of quantitative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A4","text":"Whole and parts are essentially related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A5","text":"Whole and parts simultaneously possess an existence independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A6","text":"The whole consists of parts whose composition constitutes its unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A7","text":"The unity of the whole is, in relation to the independently existing parts, a posited external relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A8","text":"A being is determined as a part only through its relation to a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A9","text":"The independence of one moment from the other immediately produces the opposite determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:A10","text":"The posited determination of each moment is at the same time the vanishing of this moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX1","text":"The whole is not a self-subsistent unity for itself, independent of its parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX2","text":"The part is not in itself a part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX3","text":"The relation to the whole does not belong to the independently existing entity as an inner determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX4","text":"The part, insofar as it is not determined by the whole, is not a part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX5","text":"The independent moment is not permanently fixed upon the determination of the part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX6","text":"Infinity is not a completed whole of parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:NX7","text":"The independence of a moment excludes its isolated stability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D1","text":"If the existent is determined as a whole, it must consist of parts.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A3","CH_GB18_A_39:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D2","text":"If a part is detached from its relation to the whole, it loses the determination of the part and appears as a simple entity.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D3","text":"The simple entity posited as independent, because it can only be whole or part, is again determined as a whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D4","text":"The determination as a whole once again presupposes composition and thus parts.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A6","CH_GB18_A_39:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D5","text":"The separation of the part from the whole reproduces the whole in the determination of the independent part.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D6","text":"The infinite progress arises as an alternation between being-part and being-whole.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:D2","CH_GB18_A_39:D3","CH_GB18_A_39:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:D7","text":"Every determination passes over, through its separation from the other, into the determination of the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A4","CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD1","text":"The relation of whole and parts generates its own instability, because each of its determinations can subsist only through the sublation of its independence.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A4","CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD2","text":"Infinite divisibility is not a property of an independently given material, but the form of the self-continuing mediation of whole and part.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A1","CH_GB18_A_39:A3","CH_GB18_A_39:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD3","text":"The asserted independence of the part produces precisely the totality from which it sought to detach itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A5","CH_GB18_A_39:A7","CH_GB18_A_39:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SD4","text":"The infinite progress marks the non-unification of two determinations, each of which necessarily produces the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_39:A9","CH_GB18_A_39:A10","CH_GB18_A_39:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a whole whose unity is grounded in itself independently of the relation to parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a part whose independence preserves its determination as a part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a mediation in which whole and part remain stably preserved as at once distinguished and without reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a third determination beyond the alternative of whole and part.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a finitude in which division could be completed without the renewed positing of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX1","text":"The text presupposes the impossibility of uniting independence and determination as a part in an enduring identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX2","text":"The blocked possibility is a relation in which the relation would not be external and independence would not be self-sublating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX3","text":"The absence of a stable form of mediation structures the transition from part to whole and back again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:SNX4","text":"Impermissible is an isolated unity that would be neither whole nor part through relational determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS1","text":"Quantity = continuity ∧ discreteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS2","text":"Quantitative unity → relation of whole and parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS3","text":"Whole → composition from parts; part → determination by the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS4","text":"Externality of the whole-part relation → detachment of the independent part from the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS5","text":"Detachment of the part → loss of the determination as part → simple entity or whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS6","text":"Whole → renewed composition from parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS7","text":"Repetition of the reversals → infinite progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS8","text":"Infinite progress → determination of each side through the sublation of its own independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:FGS9","text":"Failure to bring together the mediated determinations → form of the antinomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:AF1","text":"Antinomy of divisibility → quantitative unity of continuity and discreteness → relation of whole and parts → external independence of the part → reversal of the part into the whole → infinite progress → diagnosis of mediation not brought together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME1","text":"Divisibility is remapped from a mere property of matter into a relational dynamic of whole and parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME2","text":"Independence is no longer visible as a fixed counterposition to relation, but as a transition into the opposite determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME3","text":"The opposition of whole and part is classified as the unity of essential relatedness and external indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME4","text":"The infinite series is determined as the structural repetition of a reversal, and not as the mere continuation of divisions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ME5","text":"The antinomy is shifted from the level of isolated objects to the level of the determinations of their relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT1","text":"Surface — Matter appears as a whole consisting of parts whose divisibility can be continued.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relation of whole and parts unites essential relatedness with independent existence and thereby generates the reversal of both determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The antinomy is diagnosed not by selecting one side, but by reconstructing the movement of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as a perennial movement of determination in which every posited identity produces its own vanishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to generate the antinomy from the unity of continuity and discreteness as well as the relation of whole and parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the decisive transition from the independent part to the whole and from the whole back to parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is in what sense the mentioned resolution of the earlier antinomy has been carried out beyond the diagnosed progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT4","text":"The argumentation is internally coherent as a presentation of a self-reproducing contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT5","text":"The strongest point lies in the derivation of the infinite progress from the reciprocal negation of the determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT6","text":"The structure depends on the presupposition that only the alternatives whole and part are available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_39:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the infinite progress is understood as an inability of mediation and not as a mere quantitative continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_39:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_39@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_A_39:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 147","title":"Remark.","context":"Chapter 147","original_title":"Anmerkung."},"original_title":"Anmerkung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL","layer":"CH","title":"B. The Relation of Force and Its Expression.","order":148,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDVL"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDVL@R001","sha256":"7421a7a0b1b6cf4656578d3c2a8e20da1e1f3693ebc4bc876489a0819464ea00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS1","text":"Das unmittelbare Verhältniß des Ganzen und der Theile erweist sich als widersprüchliches, äußerlich zusammengehaltenes Aggregat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS2","text":"Die Kraft bestimmt sich als negative Einheit, in welcher der Widerspruch von Ganzem und Theilen aufgelöst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS3","text":"In der Kraft werden unmittelbare und reflektirte Selbstständigkeit nicht beseitigt, sondern als aufgehobene Momente gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS4","text":"Die Kraft geht in ihre Äußerung über, während die Äußerung als äußerliches Daseyn in die Kraft als ihren Grund zurückgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS5","text":"Dieses Übergehen ist zugleich negative Beziehung auf sich: Die Kraft verändert ihre Bestimmung und erhält sich in der gesetzten Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS6","text":"Die sich auf sich beziehende Kraft bleibt dennoch vermitteltes Moment, weil ihre Bewegung durch ein Anderes bedingt und sollicitirt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A1","text":"Das Verhältniß des Ganzen und der Theile ist die unmittelbare Form der gegenständlichen Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A2","text":"Im Verhältniß des Ganzen und der Theile stehen Ganzes und Theile als selbstständige Seiten gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A3","text":"Die Einheit des Ganzen ist der Mannigfaltigkeit der Theile zunächst äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A4","text":"Die äußerliche Einheit des Ganzen und der Theile enthält einen Widerspruch zwischen Einheit und selbstständiger Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A5","text":"Die Kraft ist die negative Einheit, in welche dieser Widerspruch aufgelöst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A6","text":"Die Kraft ist eine höhere Rückkehr der Einheit in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A7","text":"Die unmittelbare und die reflektirte Selbstständigkeit sind in der Kraft als aufgehobene Momente gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","text":"Die Kraft geht in ihre Äußerung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A9","text":"Die Äußerung ist ein äußerliches Daseyn, das in die Kraft als seinen Grund zurückgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A10","text":"Die Äußerung ist nur, insofern sie von der Kraft getragen und gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","text":"Das Übergehen der Kraft in ihre Äußerung ist negative Beziehung auf sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A12","text":"Die Kraft erhält sich in der durch sie selbst gesetzten Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","text":"Die sich auf sich beziehende Einheit der Kraft ist selbst ein aufgehobenes und vermitteltes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A14","text":"Die Bewegung der Kraft hat ein Anderes zur Bedingung und wird von einer Voraussetzung sollicitirt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX1","text":"Die Einheit des Ganzen und der Theile ist keine innere, selbstvermittelnde Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX2","text":"Das Ganze und die Theile sind kein Verhältnis, in dem die Seiten ihre Selbstständigkeit unmittelbar verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX3","text":"Die mechanische Einheit ist keine bloß gedankliche Form ohne gegenständliche Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX4","text":"Die Kraft ist kein bloßes unmittelbares Daseyn neben ihrer Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX5","text":"Die Äußerung ist kein selbstständiges Äußerliches, das von der Kraft unabhängig bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX6","text":"Die Bewegung der Kraft ist nicht bloßes Werden und Verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX7","text":"Die Veränderung der Kraft ist keine Auflösung ihrer Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX8","text":"Die reflektirte Einheit der Kraft ist kein voraussetzungsloser Anfang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D1","text":"Das mechanische Aggregat wird durch die Kraft in ein Verhältnis innerer Vermittlung überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A1","CH_GB18_BDVL:A3","CH_GB18_BDVL:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D2","text":"Die ehemals für sich bestehenden Extreme von Ganzem und Theilen werden innerhalb der Kraft zu Momenten einer Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A2","CH_GB18_BDVL:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D3","text":"Die Äußerung besitzt ihre Bestimmtheit nicht unabhängig, sondern durch die Kraft als ihren Grund.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","CH_GB18_BDVL:A9","CH_GB18_BDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D4","text":"Die Kraft ist in ihrer Äußerung zugleich außerhalb ihrer und bei sich selbst.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","CH_GB18_BDVL:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D5","text":"Die Veränderung der Kraft ist eine Selbstsetzung, durch welche die Kraft als dieselbe erhalten bleibt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","CH_GB18_BDVL:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D6","text":"Die Kraft kann ihre Selbstbeziehung nur als vermitteltes Verhältnis vollziehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","CH_GB18_BDVL:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D7","text":"Das Andere ist nicht bloß äußerer Anlaß, sondern Bedingung des Anfangs und der Bewegung der Kraft.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","CH_GB18_BDVL:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD1","text":"Die Kraft ersetzt die äußerliche Aggregation nicht durch einfache Einheit, sondern durch eine Einheit, die sich nur im Übergang zu ihrem Anderen erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD2","text":"Das Verhältnis von Grund und Äußerung ist eine rekursive Struktur: Die Kraft setzt die Äußerung, und die Äußerung weist als getragenes Daseyn auf die Kraft zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD3","text":"Identität wird als Beständigkeit in der selbstgesetzten Veränderung und nicht als unveränderte Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD4","text":"Die höhere Einheit bleibt von demjenigen abhängig, was sie als ihr Anderes vermittelt; Selbstbeziehung und Voraussetzung bilden daher eine unaufgelöste Doppelstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD5","text":"Die Kraft hebt die Selbstständigkeit ihrer Momente auf, ohne deren Differenz aus dem Verhältnis zu entfernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Einheit aus, die ihre Mannigfaltigkeit äußerlich und gleichgültig neben sich bestehen läßt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Ontologie aus, in der selbstständige Teile vor jeder Beziehung vollständig für sich bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen Grund aus, der von seiner Erscheinung oder Äußerung unabhängig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Veränderung aus, die keinen Bezug auf die Selbsterhaltung des Verändernden enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Selbstbeziehung aus, die ohne ein vorausgesetztes Anderes und ohne äußere Veranlassung beginnen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Identität eines Gegenstandes als bloße Beharrung eines unveränderlichen Substrats aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine reine Unmittelbarkeit, aus der weder Vermittlung noch Äußerung hervorgehen müßte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Modell, in dem Einheit und Differenz als äußerlich nebeneinander bestehende Größen abschließend getrennt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Selbstständigkeit, die ihre eigene Bedingtheit und ihr Anderes vollständig tilgen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit einer voraussetzungslosen Kraft strukturiert die gesamte Bewegung des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS1","text":"Selbstständige Theile + äußerliche Einheit → mechanisches Aggregat + Widerspruch von Einheit und Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS2","text":"Widerspruch des Ganzen und der Theile → negative Auflösung → Kraft als höhere Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS3","text":"Kraft als reflektirte Einheit + unmittelbares Daseyn → aufgehobene Momente innerhalb desselben Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS4","text":"Kraft → Äußerung; Äußerung → Rückgang in die Kraft als Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS5","text":"Übergang → negative Beziehung auf sich → Veränderung wird von der Kraft gesetzt und in ihr erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS6","text":"Selbstbeziehung der Kraft → Vermittlung durch das Andere → Bedingtheit und Sollicitation des Anfangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS7","text":"Bedingte Selbstbewegung → Einheit von Selbstsetzung, Äußerung, Rückkehr und vorausgesetztem Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF1","text":"Äußerliches Ganzes-und-Theile-Verhältniß → Widerspruch zwischen Einheit und selbstständiger Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF2","text":"Widerspruch → negative Einheit der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF3","text":"Kraft → Aufhebung der selbstständigen Extreme zu Momenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF4","text":"Kraft → Äußerung → Rückkehr der Äußerung in ihren Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF5","text":"Rückkehr → negative Selbstbeziehung → Erhaltung in der Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF6","text":"Selbstbeziehung → Vermittlung durch ein Anderes → bedingte Selbstbewegung der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME1","text":"Das Ganze-und-Theile-Verhältniß wird von einer Aggregatstruktur zu einer Stufe innerhalb der Vermittlung der Kraft umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME2","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird nicht mehr als selbstständige Gegenposition, sondern als gesetztes und rückläufiges Moment klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME3","text":"Übergang und Identität werden als zusammengehörige Operationen sichtbar: Die Kraft verändert sich, indem sie sich erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME4","text":"Das Andere wird von einer bloßen Gegeninstanz zur konstitutiven Bedingung der Selbstbewegung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von Einheit und Mannigfaltigkeit wird durch das Modell einer sich äußernden und in sich zurückkehrenden Einheit neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das unmittelbare Thema ist das Verhältniß der Kraft zu ihrer Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT2","text":"Structural: Das Verhältnis organisiert selbstständige Momente als aufgehobene, durch Grund, Äußerung und Bedingung vermittelte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Argumentation verschiebt die Erklärung von äußerlicher Zusammensetzung zu immanenter Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Sein wird als Übergang, Rückkehr und Selbsterhaltung in gesetzter Veränderung bestimmt; keine Bewegung beginnt voraussetzungslos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Ganzen-und-Theile-Verhältniß zur Kraft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome erfassen die operative Einheit von Kraft, Äußerung, Grund und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch das Andere die Kraft konkret sollicitirt und wie diese Sollicitation näher beschaffen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aufhebung zugleich Erhaltung als Moment bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Bestimmung der Identität als Selbsterhaltung in der Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, daß die Kraft als negative Selbstbeziehung bestimmt wird, ihr Anfang aber dennoch ein vorausgesetztes Anderes erfordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von äußerlicher Aggregation über negative Einheit und Äußerung zur bedingten Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113243644535Z_4477bd52","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"B. The Relation of Force and Its Expression.","source_sha256":"7421a7a0b1b6cf4656578d3c2a8e20da1e1f3693ebc4bc876489a0819464ea00","sha256":"e4a9222df99c42b163d08debece9ad11498ce731cef57b693e2a9e95ef874338","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:32:43.646988+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS1","text":"The immediate relation of the whole and the parts proves to be a contradictory aggregate held together externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS2","text":"Force determines itself as negative unity, in which the contradiction of whole and parts is resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS3","text":"In force, immediate and reflected self-subsistence are not eliminated, but posited as sublated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS4","text":"Force passes over into its expression, while expression, as external existence, returns into force as its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS5","text":"This passing-over is at the same time a negative relation to itself: force alters its determination and preserves itself in the posited alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AS6","text":"The force relating itself to itself nevertheless remains a mediated moment, because its movement is conditioned and solicited by an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A1","text":"The relation of the whole and the parts is the immediate form of objective unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A2","text":"In the relation of the whole and the parts, whole and parts confront one another as self-subsistent sides.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A3","text":"The unity of the whole is initially external to the manifoldness of the parts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A4","text":"The external unity of the whole and the parts contains a contradiction between unity and self-subsistent manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A5","text":"Force is the negative unity into which this contradiction is resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A6","text":"Force is a higher return of unity into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A7","text":"Immediate and reflected self-subsistence are posited in force as sublated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","text":"Force passes over into its expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A9","text":"Expression is an external existence that returns into force as its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A10","text":"Expression is only insofar as it is borne and posited by force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","text":"The passing-over of force into its expression is negative relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A12","text":"Force preserves itself in the alteration posited by itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","text":"The self-relating unity of force is itself a sublated and mediated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:A14","text":"The movement of force has an Other as its condition and is solicited by a presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX1","text":"The unity of the whole and the parts is not an inner, self-mediating unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX2","text":"The whole and the parts are not a relation in which the sides immediately lose their self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX3","text":"Mechanical unity is not a merely conceptual form without objective expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX4","text":"Force is not a merely immediate existence alongside its expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX5","text":"Expression is not a self-subsistent externality that would exist independently of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX6","text":"The movement of force is not mere becoming and vanishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX7","text":"The alteration of force is not a dissolution of its identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:NX8","text":"The reflected unity of force is not an unpresupposing beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D1","text":"The mechanical aggregate is transferred by force into a relation of inner mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A1","CH_GB18_BDVL:A3","CH_GB18_BDVL:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D2","text":"The extremes of whole and parts, formerly existing for themselves, become within force moments of a unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A2","CH_GB18_BDVL:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D3","text":"Expression possesses its determinacy not independently, but through force as its ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","CH_GB18_BDVL:A9","CH_GB18_BDVL:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D4","text":"In its expression, force is at once outside itself and with itself.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A8","CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","CH_GB18_BDVL:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D5","text":"The alteration of force is a self-positing through which force remains preserved as the same.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A11","CH_GB18_BDVL:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D6","text":"Force can enact its self-relation only as a mediated relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","CH_GB18_BDVL:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:D7","text":"The Other is not merely an external occasion, but the condition of the beginning and movement of force.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDVL:A13","CH_GB18_BDVL:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD1","text":"Force replaces external aggregation not with simple unity, but with a unity that preserves itself only in the transition to its Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD2","text":"The relation of ground and expression is a recursive structure: force posits expression, and expression, as borne existence, points back to force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD3","text":"Identity is determined as persistence in self-posited alteration and not as unaltered immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD4","text":"The higher unity remains dependent on that which mediates it as its Other; self-relation and presupposition therefore form an unresolved double structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SD5","text":"Force sublates the self-subsistence of its moments without removing their difference from the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a unity that lets its manifoldness subsist externally and indifferently alongside itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX2","text":"It excludes an ontology in which self-subsistent parts exist wholly for themselves prior to every relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX3","text":"It excludes a ground that remains independent of its appearance or expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX4","text":"It excludes an alteration that contains no reference to the self-preservation of that which is altered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX5","text":"It excludes a self-relation that could begin without a presupposed Other and without external occasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:DNX6","text":"It excludes the identity of an object as the mere persistence of an unchangeable substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a pure immediacy from which neither mediation nor expression would have to proceed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a model in which unity and difference can be conclusively separated as magnitudes externally subsisting alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a self-subsistence that could wholly efface its own conditionedness and its Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:SNX4","text":"The hidden absence of an unpresupposing force structures the entire movement of the relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS1","text":"Self-subsistent parts + external unity → mechanical aggregate + contradiction of unity and manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS2","text":"Contradiction of whole and parts → negative resolution → force as higher return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS3","text":"Force as reflected unity + immediate existence → sublated moments within the same relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS4","text":"Force → expression; expression → return into force as ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS5","text":"Transition → negative relation to itself → alteration is posited by force and preserved in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS6","text":"Self-relation of force → mediation through the Other → conditionedness and solicitation of the beginning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:FGS7","text":"Conditioned self-movement → unity of self-positing, expression, return, and presupposed Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF1","text":"External relation of whole and parts → contradiction between unity and self-subsistent manifoldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF2","text":"Contradiction → negative unity of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF3","text":"Force → sublation of the self-subsistent extremes into moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF4","text":"Force → expression → return of expression into its ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF5","text":"Return → negative self-relation → preservation in alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:AF6","text":"Self-relation → mediation through an Other → conditioned self-movement of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME1","text":"The relation of whole and parts is remapped from an aggregate structure into a stage within the mediation of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME2","text":"Externality is no longer classified as a self-subsistent counterposition, but as a posited and reverting moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME3","text":"Transition and identity become visible as operations belonging together: force alters itself by preserving itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME4","text":"The Other is reclassified from a mere counter-instance into the constitutive condition of self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ME5","text":"The opposition of unity and manifoldness is reordered through the model of a unity expressing itself and returning into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT1","text":"Surface: The immediate theme is the relation of force to its expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT2","text":"Structural: The relation organizes self-subsistent moments as sublated determinations mediated through ground, expression, and condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The argument shifts explanation from external composition to immanent self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being is determined as transition, return, and self-preservation in posited alteration; no movement begins without presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the relation of whole and parts to force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT2","text":"The axioms capture the operative unity of force, expression, ground, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whereby the Other concretely solicits force and how this solicitation is more precisely constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sublation at the same time signifies preservation as a moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT5","text":"The strongest point is the determination of identity as self-preservation in alteration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that force is determined as negative self-relation, while its beginning nevertheless requires a presupposed Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDVL:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from external aggregation through negative unity and expression to conditioned self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDVL:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDVL@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDVL:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 148","title":"B. The Relation of Force and Its Expression.","context":"Chapter 148","original_title":"B. Das Verhältniß der Kraft und ihrer Äußerung."},"original_title":"B. Das Verhältniß der Kraft und ihrer Äußerung.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK","layer":"CH","title":"a. The Conditionedness of Force.","order":149,"parents":["RAW_GB18_DBDK"],"revision":"CH_GB18_DBDK@R001","sha256":"e9bd3f6d034c64965b6587a5802a9e59b0607f3f4ec8ba657a4fa8dabab97ead","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS1","text":"Die zu erklärende Bestimmung ist, wie Kraft und unmittelbares Dingsein zusammengehören, obwohl das Ding keinen eigenen Grund für die Kraft enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS2","text":"Die anfängliche Auffassung setzt die Kraft als reflektiertes Gesetztseyn einem gleichgültigen Ding äußerlich zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS3","text":"Die immanente Neubestimmung hebt die Selbstständigkeit des Dings und der Materie auf und bestimmt die unmittelbare Existenz als Moment der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS4","text":"Die Einheit von reflektierter und unmittelbarer Bestimmung erzeugt einen sich selbst abstoßenden Widerspruch, der als Tätigkeit und äußerliche Mannigfaltigkeit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS5","text":"Die Tätigkeit setzt eine äußere Unmittelbarkeit voraus, die nicht mehr Ding, sondern eine andere Kraft ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in einem reziproken Kraftverhältnis, dessen Einheit erst ansichseiend bleibt und dessen Seiten zunächst verschieden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A1","text":"Die Kraft ist negative, in sich reflektierte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A2","text":"Die unmittelbare Existenz ist in der Kraft nur ein übergehendes und aufgehobenes Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A3","text":"Die Kraft erscheint zunächst als Gesetztseyn, das einem existierenden Ding oder einer Materie angehört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A4","text":"Das unmittelbare Ding ist gegenüber der Kraft gleichgültig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A5","text":"Im unmittelbaren Ding liegt kein eigener Grund dafür, Kraft zu haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A6","text":"Die Kraft ist die Einheit von reflektiertem und unmittelbarem Bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A7","text":"Diese Einheit enthält positive Identität und negierte Reflexion zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A8","text":"Die Kraft ist als Einheit ihrer selbst und ihrer Negation ein sich von sich selbst abstoßender Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A9","text":"Die Kraft ist Tätigkeit, durch welche die reflektierte Einheit zur äußerlichen Mannigfaltigkeit wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A10","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Kraft setzt eine ihr äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit als Voraussetzung und Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A11","text":"Die gleichgültige Selbstständigkeit des vorausgesetzten Dings ist in der Kraft aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A12","text":"Die aufgehobene selbstständige Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt sich selbst als sich auf sich beziehende negative Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A13","text":"Die Bedingung der Kraft ist daher selbst eine Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A14","text":"Die Tätigkeit einer Kraft ist durch eine andere Kraft bedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A15","text":"Kraft ist ein Verhältnis, in dem jede Seite dasselbe ist wie die andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A16","text":"Die im Kraftverhältnis enthaltene Einheit ist zunächst nur innere, ansichseiende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A17","text":"Die andere Kraft bleibt jenseits der setzenden Tätigkeit der ersten Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX1","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht bloß die Form eines Dings, durch welche das Ding bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX2","text":"Das Ding ist nicht der immanente Grund seiner Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX3","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht eine ruhige, unmittelbar vorhandene Bestimmtheit des Dings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX4","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht eine selbstständige bestimmte Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX5","text":"Die unmittelbare Existenz in der Kraft ist kein selbstständig existierendes Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX6","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht eine bloß feststehende Negation, sondern negative, sich in sich reflektierende Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX7","text":"Die Voraussetzung der Kraft ist kein ihr gegenüberstehendes, gleichgültig selbstständiges Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX8","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht isolierte Tätigkeit ohne wesentliche Beziehung auf eine andere Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX9","text":"Das Kraftverhältnis ist zunächst keine bereits gesetzte vollständige Einheit, sondern enthält nur ansichseiende Einheit bei fortbestehender Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D1","text":"Die anfängliche Zuordnung der Kraft zum Ding erzeugt das Bild einer äußerlich auferlegten Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A3","CH_GB18_DBDK:A4","CH_GB18_DBDK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D2","text":"Die Erklärung der Kraft durch einen materiellen Träger verfehlt ihre Bestimmung, weil die unmittelbare Existenz in die Funktion eines aufgehobenen Moments übergeht.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A1","CH_GB18_DBDK:A2","CH_GB18_DBDK:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D3","text":"Die Einheit der Kraft kann nur als Tätigkeit bestehen, weil sie ihre eigene Negation enthält.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A6","CH_GB18_DBDK:A7","CH_GB18_DBDK:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D4","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Kraft erzeugt die äußerliche Existenz nicht als fremden Zusatz, sondern als aus ihrer reflektierten Einheit hervorgehende Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A8","CH_GB18_DBDK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D5","text":"Weil die Tätigkeit auf eine äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit bezogen bleibt, ist die Kraft nur erst ansichseiend tätig.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A9","CH_GB18_DBDK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D6","text":"Die Bedingung der Kraft wird vom Status eines Dings in den Status einer anderen selbstständigen Kraft überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A10","CH_GB18_DBDK:A11","CH_GB18_DBDK:A12","CH_GB18_DBDK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D7","text":"Die Tätigkeit einer einzelnen Kraft ist wesentlich Tätigkeit unter der Bedingung einer anderen Kraft.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A13","CH_GB18_DBDK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D8","text":"Das Verhältnis der Kräfte bestimmt die Seiten zugleich als identisch in ihrer Form und als zunächst verschieden in ihrer Stellung.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A15","CH_GB18_DBDK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D9","text":"Die eigene Bedingtheit der Kraft gehört zu ihrem eigenen Tun, ohne dass die andere Kraft bereits in ihrer setzenden Tätigkeit aufgegangen wäre.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A14","CH_GB18_DBDK:A16","CH_GB18_DBDK:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD1","text":"Die Erklärung verschiebt sich von einer Ontologie des Dinges mit Eigenschaften zu einer Ontologie relationaler Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD2","text":"Die äußerliche Existenz erhält einen Doppelstatus: Sie wird von der Kraft gesetzt und zugleich als Bedingung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD3","text":"Keine einzelne Kraft kann als vollständiger Ursprung ihrer Tätigkeit bestimmt werden, weil ihre Tätigkeit die Form einer anderen Kraft voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD4","text":"Die Bedingung reproduziert dieselbe Bestimmungsform wie das Bedingte und erzeugt dadurch ein geschlossenes Feld von Kraftverhältnissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD5","text":"Die reziproke Identität der Kräfte ist strukturell hergestellt, bleibt aber als Einheit zunächst nur ansichseiend und daher nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Substanz-Eigenschaft-Ordnung aus, in der ein selbstständiges Ding Eigenschaften besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die unmittelbare Existenz als letzten Erklärungsgrund aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt einen von der Kraft unabhängigen Ursprung ihrer Bestimmung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine einfache Kausalität aus, in der ein Ding die Kraft hervorbringt oder eine Kraft dem Ding äußerlich hinzugefügt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt die isolierte Selbstgenügsamkeit einer einzelnen Kraft aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt eine vollendete Einheit des Kraftverhältnisses aus, solange die andere Kraft noch jenseits der setzenden Tätigkeit bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Erklärungsgrund außerhalb des Kraftverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kraft, die ihre Tätigkeit ohne vorausgesetzte Andersheit vollständig aus sich selbst vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine stabile Trennung zwischen innerer Kraft und äußerer Existenz, weil die Kraft die Äußerlichkeit zugleich erzeugt und voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine bereits vollzogene Versöhnung von Identität und Verschiedenheit der Kräfte; ihre Einheit bleibt zunächst nicht vollständig gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS1","text":"Negative Einheit + unmittelbare Existenz → unmittelbare Existenz erscheint als Ding, Kraft erscheint als dessen Gesetztseyn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS2","text":"Gleichgültiges Ding + fehlender eigener Grund der Kraft → Kraft erscheint als äußerlich auferlegte Bestimmung oder als Materie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung der Ding- und Materieselbstständigkeit → unmittelbare Existenz wird zum Moment der reflektierten Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS4","text":"Einheit von reflektierter und unmittelbarer Bestimmung + enthaltene Negation → sich abstoßender Widerspruch → Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS5","text":"Tätigkeit der Kraft + notwendige Beziehung auf äußerliche Unmittelbarkeit → äußerliche Existenz als gesetzte und vorausgesetzte Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS6","text":"Aufhebung des Dingstatus der Bedingung → Bedingung als andere Kraft → reziprokes Kraftverhältnis mit Identität der Form, Verschiedenheit der Seiten und nur ansichseiender Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AF1","text":"Unbegründete Dingzuordnung → äußerliche Fremdsetzung der Kraft → Aufhebung von Ding und Materie als selbstständigen Trägern → Kraft als widersprüchliche Tätigkeit → äußerliche Mannigfaltigkeit als gesetzte Existenz → Voraussetzung einer anderen Kraft → reziprokes Kraftverhältnis mit nur ansichseiender Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AF2","text":"Die aufgehobene Unmittelbarkeit verschwindet nicht, sondern kehrt als Bedingung der Tätigkeit in veränderter Form wieder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME1","text":"Kraft wird von einer Eigenschaft oder Materie in ein Verhältnis selbstständiger, aber wesentlich aufeinander bezogener Kräfte umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME2","text":"Das Ding verliert seine Funktion als erklärender Träger; unmittelbare Existenz wird als Moment und Bedingung der Kraft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von innerer Kraft und äußerer Existenz bricht zusammen, weil Äußerlichkeit als Wirkung der Kraft und als ihre Voraussetzung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME4","text":"Die andere Kraft wird nicht mehr als fremder äußerer Faktor, sondern als dieselbe Bestimmungsform in anderer selbstständiger Gestalt kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME5","text":"Identität und Verschiedenheit werden nicht getrennt, sondern als gleichzeitige Struktur des Kraftverhältnisses bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Kraft wird zunächst als einem unmittelbaren Ding oder einer Materie äußerlich angehörig bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Bestimmung organisiert sich durch das Verhältnis von unmittelbarem Bestehen, reflektierter Einheit, Bedingung und äußerlicher Mannigfaltigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Frage nach dem Ursprung einer Kraft im Ding wird in die Frage nach der relationalen Vermittlung von Kräften überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unmittelbarkeit wird als übergehendes und aufgehobenes Moment der Kraft bestimmt, kehrt jedoch als vorausgesetzte Bedingung der Tätigkeit wieder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Gang von der äußerlichen Dingzuordnung zur relationalen Bestimmung der Kräfte zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die nur ansichseiende Einheit der Kräfte in eine vollständig gesetzte Einheit übergehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Unmittelbarkeit zugleich als aufgehobenes Moment und als wiederkehrende Bedingung gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Konstruktion liegt in der Überführung der Bedingung vom Dingstatus in den Status einer anderen Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass die Kraft die Äußerlichkeit aus sich hervorbringt, sie aber dennoch als ihr äußerliche Voraussetzung benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur dann, wenn die reziproke Identität der Kräfte nicht mit einer bereits vollendeten Einheit verwechselt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T115111372026Z_1d4a19f9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"a. The Conditionedness of Force.","source_sha256":"e9bd3f6d034c64965b6587a5802a9e59b0607f3f4ec8ba657a4fa8dabab97ead","sha256":"c4a4ac588f6a84293eb3c810d0113bbd0c95645aaf7057e71460a3a30afd4e7a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:51:11.373070+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS1","text":"The determination to be explained is how force and immediate thinghood belong together, although the thing contains no ground of its own for force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS2","text":"The initial conception externally attributes force, as reflected positedness, to an indifferent thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS3","text":"The immanent redetermination sublates the self-subsistence of the thing and of matter and determines immediate existence as a moment of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS4","text":"The unity of reflected and immediate determination produces a self-repelling contradiction, which appears as activity and external multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS5","text":"Activity presupposes an external immediacy, which is no longer a thing but another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AS6","text":"The movement ends in a reciprocal relation of forces, whose unity initially remains only in itself and whose sides are initially distinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A1","text":"Force is negative unity reflected into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A2","text":"Immediate existence in force is only a transient and sublated moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A3","text":"Force initially appears as positedness belonging to an existing thing or a matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A4","text":"The immediate thing is indifferent to force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A5","text":"In the immediate thing there lies no ground of its own for having force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A6","text":"Force is the unity of reflected and immediate subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A7","text":"This unity contains positive identity and negated reflection at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A8","text":"As the unity of itself and its negation, force is a contradiction repelling itself from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A9","text":"Force is activity, through which reflected unity becomes external multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A10","text":"The activity of force presupposes, as presupposition and condition, an immediacy external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A11","text":"The indifferent self-subsistence of the presupposed thing is sublated in force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A12","text":"The sublated self-subsistent immediacy determines itself as a negative unity relating itself to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A13","text":"The condition of force is therefore itself a force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A14","text":"The activity of one force is conditioned by another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A15","text":"Force is a relation in which each side is the same as the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A16","text":"The unity contained in the relation of forces is initially only inner unity, unity in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:A17","text":"The other force remains beyond the positing activity of the first force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX1","text":"Force is not merely the form of a thing through which the thing is determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX2","text":"The thing is not the immanent ground of its force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX3","text":"Force is not a tranquil, immediately present determinacy of the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX4","text":"Force is not a self-subsistent determinate matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX5","text":"Immediate existence in force is not a self-subsistently existing thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX6","text":"Force is not a merely fixed negation, but negative unity reflecting itself into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX7","text":"The presupposition of force is not a thing standing over against it and indifferently self-subsistent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX8","text":"Force is not isolated activity without an essential relation to another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:NX9","text":"The relation of forces is initially not an already posited complete unity, but contains only unity in itself amid persisting difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D1","text":"The initial attribution of force to the thing produces the image of an externally imposed determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A3","CH_GB18_DBDK:A4","CH_GB18_DBDK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D2","text":"The explanation of force through a material bearer misses its determination, because immediate existence passes over into the function of a sublated moment.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A1","CH_GB18_DBDK:A2","CH_GB18_DBDK:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D3","text":"The unity of force can subsist only as activity, because it contains its own negation.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A6","CH_GB18_DBDK:A7","CH_GB18_DBDK:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D4","text":"The activity of force produces external existence not as an alien addition, but as multiplicity emerging from its reflected unity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A8","CH_GB18_DBDK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D5","text":"Because activity remains related to an external immediacy, force is only active in itself as yet.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A9","CH_GB18_DBDK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D6","text":"The condition of force is transferred from the status of a thing to the status of another self-subsistent force.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A10","CH_GB18_DBDK:A11","CH_GB18_DBDK:A12","CH_GB18_DBDK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D7","text":"The activity of an individual force is essentially activity under the condition of another force.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A13","CH_GB18_DBDK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D8","text":"The relation of forces determines the sides at once as identical in their form and as initially distinct in their position.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A15","CH_GB18_DBDK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:D9","text":"The force's own conditionedness belongs to its own doing, without the other force already having been absorbed into its positing activity.","refs":["CH_GB18_DBDK:A14","CH_GB18_DBDK:A16","CH_GB18_DBDK:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD1","text":"The explanation shifts from an ontology of the thing with properties to an ontology of relational forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD2","text":"External existence receives a double status: it is posited by force and at the same time presupposed as a condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD3","text":"No individual force can be determined as the complete origin of its activity, because its activity presupposes the form of another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD4","text":"The condition reproduces the same form of determination as the conditioned and thereby generates a closed field of relations of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SD5","text":"The reciprocal identity of forces is structurally established, but as unity initially remains only in itself and is therefore not completely mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a substance-property order in which a self-subsistent thing possesses properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX2","text":"The system excludes immediate existence as the ultimate ground of explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX3","text":"The system excludes an origin of its determination independent of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a simple causality in which a thing produces force or force is externally added to the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the isolated self-sufficiency of an individual force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:DNX6","text":"The system excludes a consummated unity of the relation of forces so long as the other force still remains beyond the positing activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a ground of explanation outside the relation of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a force that completely carries out its activity from itself without presupposed otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a stable separation between inner force and external existence, because force both produces and presupposes externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an already accomplished reconciliation of the identity and difference of forces; their unity initially remains not completely posited.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS1","text":"Negative unity + immediate existence → immediate existence appears as a thing, force appears as its positedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS2","text":"Indifferent thing + absence of a ground of its own for force → force appears as an externally imposed determination or as matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS3","text":"Sublation of the self-subsistence of thing and matter → immediate existence becomes a moment of reflected force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS4","text":"Unity of reflected and immediate determination + contained negation → self-repelling contradiction → activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS5","text":"Activity of force + necessary relation to external immediacy → external existence as posited and presupposed condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:FGS6","text":"Sublation of the thing-status of the condition → condition as another force → reciprocal relation of forces with identity of form, difference of sides, and unity only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AF1","text":"Ungrounded attribution to a thing → external alien positing of force → sublation of thing and matter as self-subsistent bearers → force as contradictory activity → external multiplicity as posited existence → presupposition of another force → reciprocal relation of forces with unity only in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:AF2","text":"Sublated immediacy does not disappear, but returns in altered form as the condition of activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME1","text":"Force is reclassified from a property or matter into a relation of self-subsistent forces that are nevertheless essentially related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME2","text":"The thing loses its function as explanatory bearer; immediate existence becomes visible as moment and condition of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME3","text":"The opposition of inner force and external existence collapses, because externality is determined as the effect of force and as its presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME4","text":"The other force is no longer mapped as an alien external factor, but as the same form of determination in another self-subsistent shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ME5","text":"Identity and difference are not separated, but determined as the simultaneous structure of the relation of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT1","text":"Surface — Force is initially determined as belonging externally to an immediate thing or a matter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT2","text":"Structural — The determination organizes itself through the relation of immediate subsistence, reflected unity, condition, and external multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The question of the origin of a force in the thing is transferred into the question of the relational mediation of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Immediacy is determined as a transient and sublated moment of force, yet returns as a presupposed condition of activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the course from the external attribution to a thing to the relational determination of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the unity of forces that is only in itself is to pass over into a completely posited unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as immediacy is grasped simultaneously as a sublated moment and as a recurring condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the construction lies in the transfer of the condition from the status of a thing into the status of another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that force brings externality forth from itself, yet nonetheless requires it as a presupposition external to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_DBDK:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the reciprocal identity of forces is not confused with an already consummated unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_DBDK:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_DBDK@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_DBDK:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 149","title":"a. The Conditionedness of Force.","context":"Chapter 149","original_title":"a. Das Bedingtseyn der Kraft."},"original_title":"a. Das Bedingtseyn der Kraft.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD","layer":"CH","title":"b. The Solicitation of Force.","order":150,"parents":["RAW_GB18_BDSD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDSD@R001","sha256":"984fae59975c8ed4df0c690ce3419c44ac54a5c2c2535aa049b1d7fa206ef7cc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, die Bedingtheit der Kraft mit ihrer Selbstbestimmung zu vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS2","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit der Kraft wird als ihre eigene voraussetzende Tätigkeit neubestimmt, die zunächst als andere Kraft erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS3","text":"Die voraussetzende Beziehung ist gegenseitig, weil jede Kraft zugleich voraussetzend und vorausgesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS4","text":"Der Anstoß bestimmt die Kraft nicht von außen, sondern sollicitirt ihre eigene Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS5","text":"Die Reaktion hebt die fremde Äußerlichkeit auf, indem sie sie als eigene Äußerung setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS6","text":"Sollicitirende und sollicitirte Kraft sind keine festen Identitäten, sondern durch einander vermittelte Formbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS7","text":"Die rekonstruktiv-dialektische Bewegung führt von bedingter Äußerlichkeit über vermittelte Reaktion zur in sich zurückkehrenden Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A1","text":"Die Kraft enthält ihre unmittelbare Existenz nur als Gesetztes und zugleich als Vorausgesetztes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A2","text":"Die Kraft negirt sich selbst in der vorausgesetzten Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","text":"Die der Kraft gegenüberstehende Äußerlichkeit ist ihre eigene voraussetzende Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","text":"Die eigene Äußerlichkeit der Kraft erscheint zunächst als eine andere Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","text":"Jede Kraft ist zugleich voraussetzend und vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist ein sich selbst aufhebendes Moment und steht der Kraft zugleich als Anderes und als mit ihr Identisches gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","text":"Die Kraft ist eine negative Einheit ihrer selbst und verhält sich nicht als bloß passiv bestimmbares Substrat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","text":"Der Anstoß sollicitirt die Kraft, ohne eine fremde Bestimmung in sie einzuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","text":"Die Äußerung der Kraft macht die Äußerlichkeit zu ihrem eigenen Moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","text":"Der Begriff der Kraft ist die Identität der setzenden und der voraussetzenden Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","text":"Die Bestimmungen des Sollicitirens und des Sollicitirtwerdens sind durch einander vermittelte Formbestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A12","text":"Jede Kraft bestimmt durch ihre eigene Tätigkeit die andere als die ihr gegenüberstehende sollicitirende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A13","text":"Der gegebene und der empfangene Anstoß sind keine unmittelbaren, sondern gegenseitig vermittelte Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX1","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht ein passives Sein, in das eine fremde Bestimmung eintritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX2","text":"Der Anstoß ist keine Übertragung eines fremden Inhalts in die Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX3","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist keine selbständige, von der Kraft unabhängige Ursache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX4","text":"Sollicitirend und sollicitirtwerdend sind keine festen Wesensbestimmungen je einer Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX5","text":"Die Einheit der Kräfte ist nicht bloß äußerliche Vergleichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX6","text":"Der gegebene und der empfangene Anstoß sind nicht unmittelbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX7","text":"Aktivität und Passivität sind keine voneinander isolierten Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D1","text":"Die Bedingtheit der Kraft ist eine Selbstbeziehung der Negation und keine äußerlich auferlegte Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A1","CH_GB18_BDSD:A2","CH_GB18_BDSD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D2","text":"Die Zweiheit der Kräfte wird durch die eigene voraussetzende Tätigkeit der Kraft erzeugt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D3","text":"Der Anstoß ist nur insofern äußerlich, als die Kraft diese Äußerlichkeit selbst voraussetzt und setzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D4","text":"Die Passivität der sollicitirten Kraft ist eine durch ihre eigene Reflexion vermittelte Aktivität.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D5","text":"Die sollicitirende Kraft ist nur insofern sollicitirend, als sie selbst in einer vorausgesetzten Äußerlichkeit sollicitirt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D6","text":"Jede Kraft ist diejenige Bestimmtheit, welche die andere gegen sie besitzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D7","text":"Die Äußerung der Kraft ist Reaktion, weil sie die Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Moment setzt und dadurch ihre Fremdheit aufhebt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D8","text":"Das Aufheben des Anstoßes und das Setzen der Äußerlichkeit sind wechselseitig dasselbe Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD1","text":"Die Beziehung zweier Kräfte ist eine auf zwei Kräfte verteilte Selbstbeziehung der negativen Einheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD2","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit fungiert nicht als Grenze der Identität, sondern als deren vermittelndes Vollzugsmedium.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD3","text":"Der Gegensatz der Kräfte erzeugt die Einheit, weil jede Kraft ihre eigene Tätigkeit nur in der Bestimmung der anderen vollzieht.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD4","text":"Die scheinbare Kausalfolge von Anstoß, Passivität und Reaktion wird in einen gegenseitigen Kreislauf der Selbstbestimmung überführt.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD5","text":"Die Realität der Kraft besteht nicht in einer isolierten Identität, sondern in der Einheit von Setzen, Voraussetzen, Äußerung und Rückkehr.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Kraft vor jeder Beziehung eine vollständig selbständige Identität besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell absoluter Äußerlichkeit, in dem das Andere nicht zugleich durch die Kraft gesetzt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine einseitige Kausalität, in der eine Kraft bestimmt und die andere lediglich empfängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Aktivität, die ihre eigene Passivität nicht in sich enthielte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die unabhängig von ihrer Vermittlung durch Andersheit bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein reiner Außenstandpunkt außerhalb der gegenseitigen Kraftbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Ursprung der Bewegung, der nicht aus der Selbstnegation der Kraft hervorginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Aufhebung der Äußerlichkeit, durch die kein gesetztes Äußeres zurückbliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine endgültige Festlegung dessen, welche Kraft an sich die aktive oder passive sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine nicht-zirkuläre Zeit- und Kausalordnung mit einem letzten unabhängigen Anstoß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS1","text":"Gesetzte Unmittelbarkeit in der Kraft → Vorausgesetztheit der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS2","text":"Negation der vorausgesetzten Unmittelbarkeit → Erzeugung eigener Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS3","text":"Eigene Äußerlichkeit → Erscheinung als andere Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS4","text":"Gegenseitige Vorausgesetztheit → Jede Kraft wird zugleich voraussetzend und vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS5","text":"Äußerlichkeit als sich aufhebendes Moment → Anstoß als Solicitation der eigenen Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS6","text":"Solicitation ohne fremde Einwirkung → Übergang von scheinbarer Passivität zu eigener Aktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS7","text":"Eigene Aktivität → Äußerung, die die Äußerlichkeit als eigenes Moment setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS8","text":"Setzen und Aufheben der Äußerlichkeit → Reaktion als unendliche Rückkehr der Kraft in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AF1","text":"Bedingte Kraft → vorausgesetzte Unmittelbarkeit → eigene Äußerlichkeit → andere Kraft → gegenseitige Solicitation → vermittelte Passivität → reaktive Äußerung → Rückkehr in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AF2","text":"Scheinbar äußerer Anstoß → Negativität der Kraft → Aufhebung der Fremdheit → Setzung des Anstoßes als eigener Äußerung → wesentliche Identität beider Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME1","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird von einer unabhängigen Gegeninstanz in ein eigenes Moment der Kraft umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Aktivität und Passivität wird in eine reversible Beziehung gegenseitiger Formbestimmungen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME3","text":"Der Anstoß wird nicht mehr als Bestimmungsübertragung, sondern als Auslösung eigener Negativität klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME4","text":"Die Reaktion wird nicht als nachträgliche Antwort, sondern als ursprüngliche Selbstäußerung der Kraft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME5","text":"Die lineare Kausalordnung wird durch eine zirkuläre Struktur von Voraussetzen, Anstoß, Aufhebung und Rückkehr ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME6","text":"Die Differenz der Kräfte wird als notwendige Form ihrer wesentlichen Einheit neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Kraft scheint durch eine andere sollicitirt zu werden und reagiert darauf mit einer Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Kraftbeziehung beruht auf gegenseitiger Vermittlung, in der jede Kraft die Bestimmung der anderen mitsetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz von äußerem Anstoß und eigener Tätigkeit wird nicht durch Auswahl einer Seite, sondern durch ihre dialektische Vermittlung neu gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein und Wirksamkeit der Kraft bestehen als unendliche Rückkehr in eine Äußerlichkeit, die zugleich gesetzt und aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von vorausgesetzter Unmittelbarkeit über gegenseitige Solicitation zur Reaktion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Kraft und die beiden Kräfte ontologische Entitäten oder ausschließlich begriffliche Momente sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT3","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der Äußerlichkeit als wirklichem Anderen und ihrer Bestimmung als eigenes, an sich nichtiges Moment bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT4","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der unmittelbaren Asymmetrie von sollicitirender und sollicitirter Kraft und ihrer wesentlichen Symmetrie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion ist intern kohärent, sofern Vermittlung als Aufhebung der Unmittelbarkeit und nicht als Beseitigung der Differenz verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT6","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Ableitung der Reaktion aus der eigenen Negativität der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT7","text":"Ihre Kompression hängt an der begrifflichen Gleichzeitigkeit von Setzen und Voraussetzen sowie von Äußerung und Aufhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die zirkuläre Vermittlung nicht in eine lineare Ursache-Wirkungs-Folge aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T113135021046Z_21f686a0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"b. The Solicitation of Force.","source_sha256":"984fae59975c8ed4df0c690ce3419c44ac54a5c2c2535aa049b1d7fa206ef7cc","sha256":"9f249e04ce52eb6555601201699aa134400f8b907d40ee1c01130439299780f1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:31:35.026465+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS1","text":"The problem consists in mediating the conditionedness of force with its self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS2","text":"The externality of force is redetermined as its own presupposing activity, which initially appears as another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS3","text":"The presupposing relation is reciprocal, because each force is at once presupposing and presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS4","text":"The impulse does not determine force from without, but solicits its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS5","text":"Reaction sublates the alien externality by positing it as its own manifestation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS6","text":"Soliciting and solicited force are not fixed identities, but form-determinations mediated through one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AS7","text":"The reconstructive-dialectical movement leads from conditioned externality, through mediated reaction, to force returning into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A1","text":"Force contains its immediate existence only as something posited and at the same time as something presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A2","text":"Force negates itself in presupposed immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","text":"The externality confronting force is its own presupposing activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","text":"Force's own externality initially appears as another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","text":"Each force is at once presupposing and presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","text":"Externality is a self-sublating moment and confronts force at once as other and as identical with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","text":"Force is a negative unity of itself and does not relate as a merely passively determinable substrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","text":"The impulse solicits force without introducing an alien determination into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","text":"The manifestation of force makes externality into its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","text":"The concept of force is the identity of positing and presupposing reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","text":"The determinations of soliciting and being solicited are form-determinations mediated through one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A12","text":"Through its own activity, each force determines the other as the soliciting force confronting it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:A13","text":"The given and the received impulse are not immediate, but reciprocally mediated determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX1","text":"Force is not a passive being into which an alien determination enters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX2","text":"The impulse is not a transfer of an alien content into force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX3","text":"Externality is not an independent cause independent of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX4","text":"Soliciting and being solicited are not fixed essential determinations of either force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX5","text":"The unity of forces is not merely external comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX6","text":"The given and the received impulse are not immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:NX7","text":"Activity and passivity are not states isolated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D1","text":"The conditionedness of force is a self-relation of negation and not an externally imposed determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A1","CH_GB18_BDSD:A2","CH_GB18_BDSD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D2","text":"The duality of forces is generated by force's own presupposing activity.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D3","text":"The impulse is external only insofar as force itself presupposes and posits this externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D4","text":"The passivity of solicited force is an activity mediated through its own reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D5","text":"Soliciting force is soliciting only insofar as it itself is solicited in a presupposed externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D6","text":"Each force is that determinacy which the other possesses over against it.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D7","text":"The manifestation of force is reaction because it posits externality as its own moment and thereby sublates its alienness.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:D8","text":"The sublation of the impulse and the positing of externality are reciprocally the same relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD1","text":"The relation of two forces is a self-relation of negative unity distributed over two forces.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A3","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD2","text":"Externality does not function as the limit of identity, but as its mediating medium of enactment.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A6","CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD3","text":"The opposition of forces generates unity because each force enacts its own activity only in the determination of the other.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A4","CH_GB18_BDSD:A5","CH_GB18_BDSD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD4","text":"The apparent causal sequence of impulse, passivity, and reaction is transformed into a reciprocal cycle of self-determination.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A7","CH_GB18_BDSD:A8","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SD5","text":"The reality of force consists not in an isolated identity, but in the unity of positing, presupposing, manifestation, and return.","refs":["CH_GB18_BDSD:A9","CH_GB18_BDSD:A10","CH_GB18_BDSD:A11","CH_GB18_BDSD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which force possesses a fully independent identity prior to every relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of absolute externality in which the other would not at the same time be posited through force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a one-sided causality in which one force determines and the other merely receives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an activity that did not contain its own passivity within itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an identity that could exist independently of its mediation through otherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a pure external standpoint outside the reciprocal relation of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX2","text":"Impossible is an origin of movement that would not proceed from the self-negation of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a final sublation of externality through which no posited externality would remain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX4","text":"Impermissible is a final determination of which force is active or passive in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:SNX5","text":"Unavailable is a non-circular temporal and causal order with a final independent impulse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS1","text":"Posited immediacy in force → presupposedness of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS2","text":"Negation of presupposed immediacy → generation of its own externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS3","text":"Its own externality → appearance as another force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS4","text":"Reciprocal presupposedness → Each force becomes at once presupposing and presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS5","text":"Externality as self-sublating moment → impulse as solicitation of its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS6","text":"Solicitation without alien influence → transition from apparent passivity to its own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS7","text":"Its own activity → manifestation that posits externality as its own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:FGS8","text":"Positing and sublating externality → reaction as the infinite return of force into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AF1","text":"Conditioned force → presupposed immediacy → its own externality → another force → reciprocal solicitation → mediated passivity → reactive manifestation → return into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:AF2","text":"Apparently external impulse → negativity of force → sublation of alienness → positing of the impulse as its own manifestation → essential identity of both forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME1","text":"Externality is remapped from an independent counter-instance into force's own moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME2","text":"The opposition of activity and passivity is transformed into a reversible relation of reciprocal form-determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME3","text":"The impulse is no longer classified as a transfer of determination, but as the triggering of its own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME4","text":"Reaction becomes visible not as a subsequent response, but as the original self-manifestation of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME5","text":"The linear causal order is replaced by a circular structure of presupposing, impulse, sublation, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ME6","text":"The difference of forces is remapped as the necessary form of their essential unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT1","text":"Surface — One force seems to be solicited by another and reacts to it with a manifestation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relation of forces rests on reciprocal mediation, in which each force co-posites the determination of the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition between external impulse and its own activity is reconceived not through selecting one side, but through their dialectical mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The being and efficacy of force consist as infinite return into an externality that is at once posited and sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from presupposed immediacy through reciprocal solicitation to reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether force and the two forces are ontological entities or exclusively conceptual moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT3","text":"A structural tension remains between externality as a real other and its determination as its own, in-itself null moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT4","text":"A further tension exists between the immediate asymmetry of soliciting and solicited force and their essential symmetry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT5","text":"The construction is internally coherent insofar as mediation is understood as the sublation of immediacy and not as the elimination of difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT6","text":"Its strongest point is the derivation of reaction from force's own negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT7","text":"Its compression depends on the conceptual simultaneity of positing and presupposing, as well as of manifestation and sublation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_BDSD:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument insofar as circular mediation is not resolved into a linear sequence of cause and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_BDSD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_BDSD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_BDSD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 150","title":"b. The Solicitation of Force.","context":"Chapter 150","original_title":"b. Die Sollicitation der Kraft."},"original_title":"b. Die Sollicitation der Kraft.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3","layer":"CH","title":"c. The Infinity of Force.","order":151,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CD_3"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CD_3@R001","sha256":"ce5ae2fb1efc906951e6af664141e3259b0a1679db1d229d105b728bc2ce5755","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS1","text":"Die Kraft erscheint als endlich, solange ihre Momente durch Unmittelbarkeit und die Trennung von voraussetzender und sich auf sich beziehender Reflexion bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS2","text":"Diese Trennung erzeugt eine äußerliche, für sich bestehende Kraft und eine ihr gegenüber passive Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS3","text":"Die formale Bedingtheit der Kraft begrenzt zugleich ihren Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS4","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Kraft besteht darin, die Äußerlichkeit aufzuheben und sie als mit sich identische Bestimmung zu setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS5","text":"Die Beziehung der Kraft auf Anderes erweist sich dadurch als Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS6","text":"Passivität und äußerer Anstoß werden in vermittelte Formen eigener Aktivität zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS7","text":"Die Kraft bestimmt die Äußerlichkeit als mit ihrer Innerlichkeit identisch und überschreitet damit die Endlichkeit der unmittelbaren Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit bestimmt die Momente der Kraft als endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","text":"Die voraussetzende Reflexion und die sich auf sich beziehende Reflexion sind zunächst unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","text":"Die voraussetzende Reflexion erscheint als äußerliche, für sich bestehende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A4","text":"Die auf sich bezogene Reflexion erscheint in Beziehung auf die äußerliche Kraft als passiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A5","text":"Die Kraft ist ihrer Form nach bedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A6","text":"Eine formale Bestimmtheit enthält zugleich eine inhaltliche Beschränkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Kraft besteht in der Aufhebung ihrer Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A8","text":"Die aufgehobene Äußerlichkeit wird als mit der Kraft identisch mit sich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","text":"Die Beziehung der Kraft auf Anderes ist in Wahrheit ihre Beziehung auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A10","text":"Die Passivität der Kraft besteht innerhalb ihrer Aktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","text":"Der Anstoß zur Tätigkeit der Kraft ist ein eigenes Sollicitieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","text":"Die an die Kraft kommende Äußerlichkeit ist durch die Kraft vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","text":"Die wesentliche Identität der Kraft mit sich ist durch ihre Negation vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A14","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit der Kraft ist mit ihrer Innerlichkeit identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX1","text":"Die Kraft ist nicht unendlich, solange ihre Momente unmittelbar bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX2","text":"Die Beziehung auf Anderes ist keine letztgültige Fremdbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX3","text":"Die Passivität ist keine selbständige Gegenbestimmung zur Aktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX4","text":"Der Anstoß ist kein Unmittelbares, das von außerhalb der Kraft in sie eintritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX5","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist keine von der Kraft unabhängige Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX6","text":"Die Innerlichkeit ist keine unmittelbar gegebene Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX7","text":"Die Formbedingtheit ist nicht auf die Form beschränkt, sondern begrenzt auch den Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D1","text":"Die Endlichkeit der Kraft beruht auf der Trennung ihrer Reflexionsmomente und nicht auf einer bloßen quantitativen Begrenzung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","CH_GB18_CD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D2","text":"Die formale Abhängigkeit der Kraft erzeugt notwendig eine inhaltliche Beschränktheit.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A5","CH_GB18_CD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D3","text":"Die Tätigkeit der Kraft hebt die Bestimmung auf, durch welche sie zunächst als endlich erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D4","text":"Das Andere besitzt für die Kraft keine selbständige Bestimmung außerhalb ihrer eigenen Reflexionsbewegung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D5","text":"Die scheinbare Passivität der Kraft ist eine durch ihre eigene Aktivität gesetzte Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A4","CH_GB18_CD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D6","text":"Der äußere Anstoß ist das Resultat einer Vermittlung, in der die Kraft sich selbst zur Tätigkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D7","text":"Die Identität der Kraft mit sich entsteht nicht vor der Negation, sondern durch sie.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A8","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D8","text":"Äußerlichkeit und Innerlichkeit werden als zwei Vermittlungsformen einer identischen Kraft bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD1","text":"Die Kraft überschreitet ihre Endlichkeit nicht durch Rückzug aus der Äußerlichkeit, sondern durch deren Vermittlung und Aufhebung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD2","text":"Die Unterscheidung von äußerer und innerer Kraft wird in eine relationale Identität überführt, ohne dass die Differenz ersatzlos verschwindet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD3","text":"Fremdbestimmung wird als Selbstvermittlung rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD4","text":"Die Unendlichkeit der Kraft bezeichnet eine Struktur, in der die Kraft ihre Begrenzung durch die Negation und Vermittlung ihrer eigenen Äußerlichkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD5","text":"Die Kraft ist zugleich dasjenige, was wirkt, und dasjenige, worin die Bedingung ihres Wirkens erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A10","CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einer ursprünglichen, unvermittelten Äußerlichkeit als unabhängigem Wirkgrund beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX2","text":"Es kann keine stabile Ontologie zweier äußerlich getrennter Kräfte voraussetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX3","text":"Es kann Passivität nicht als positives, der Aktivität entgegengesetztes Prinzip behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX4","text":"Es kann Identität nicht als unmittelbare Selbstgleichheit vor jeder Negation bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX5","text":"Es kann Inhalt und Form nicht als voneinander unabhängige Bestimmungen auffassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX6","text":"Es kann die Endlichkeit der Kraft nicht als bloß äußerlich auferlegte Grenze erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Außen, das der Kraft vorausliegt und ihre Tätigkeit unvermittelt verursacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kraft, deren Identität ohne Beziehung, Negation und Äußerung bereits vollständig verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die Kraft als endliches Ding mit einer von ihrer Tätigkeit unabhängigen Grenze zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine absolute Trennung von Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit; die Unterscheidung bleibt nur als vermittelte Differenz bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit → Endlichkeit der Kraft → Unterscheidung von voraussetzender und selbstbezogener Reflexion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS2","text":"Reflexionsunterscheidung → äußerliche Kraft / passive Gegenbestimmung → formale Bedingtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS3","text":"Formale Bestimmtheit → inhaltliche Beschränkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS4","text":"Tätigkeit der Kraft → Aufhebung der Äußerlichkeit → Setzung der Identität mit sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS5","text":"Beziehung auf Anderes → Selbstbeziehung; Passivität → Moment der Aktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS6","text":"Anstoß → eigenes Sollicitieren → vermittelte Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS7","text":"Negation der Unmittelbarkeit → vermittelte Identität → Identität von Äußerlichkeit und Innerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS8","text":"Vermittelte Identität → Überschreitung der endlichen Form → Unendlichkeit der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AF1","text":"Unmittelbarkeit → Endlichkeit → Reflexionsdualismus → formale und inhaltliche Beschränkung → Tätigkeit als Aufhebung der Äußerlichkeit → Selbstbeziehung im Anderen → Vermittlung von Anstoß und Identität → Unendlichkeit der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME1","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird von einer unabhängigen Gegeninstanz zu einer durch die Kraft vermittelten Bestimmung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME2","text":"Passivität wird von einem Gegenprinzip der Aktivität zu deren internem Moment umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME3","text":"Die Grenze der Kraft wird von einer äußerlich gesetzten Schranke zu einer durch unmittelbare Form erzeugten und durch Negation überwindbaren Bestimmung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME4","text":"Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit erscheinen nicht mehr als getrennte Sphären, sondern als identische Bestimmungen in vermittlungsabhängiger Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME5","text":"Kausalität wird als Selbstvermittlung der Kraft statt als linearer äußerer Anstoß kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Kraft wird zunächst als endlich, äußerlich bedingt und einer passiven Gegenbestimmung gegenüberstehend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Endlichkeit wird aus der Reflexionsform, der Trennung der Momente und der daraus folgenden Beschränkung von Form und Inhalt erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt das Modell äußerer Einwirkung durch ein Modell der Selbstvermittlung, in dem Gegenwirkung und Anstoß als eigene Tätigkeit lesbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identität ist kein unmittelbarer Ausgangspunkt, sondern ein durch Negation und Vermittlung erzeugtes Verhältnis; Unendlichkeit bezeichnet die Rückkehr der Kraft zu sich durch ihre Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der endlichen zur unendlichen Bestimmung der Kraft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT2","text":"Die entscheidende Bewegung wird durch die Kette Unmittelbarkeit → Äußerlichkeit → Aufhebung → Vermittlung → Identität erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT3","text":"Die interne Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Aufhebung nicht als Beseitigung, sondern als vermittelte Erhaltung der Äußerlichkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Unendlichkeit der Kraft bereits erreicht oder nur als Resultat der beschriebenen Tätigkeit angekündigt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Rückführung des äußeren Anstoßes auf eigenes Sollicitieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass die Äußerlichkeit zugleich aufgehoben und als notwendiges Moment der Identität bewahrt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Differenz von Innerlichkeit und Äußerlichkeit nicht vorschnell in bloße Identität aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114434587713Z_1a437360","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"c. The Infinity of Force.","source_sha256":"ce5ae2fb1efc906951e6af664141e3259b0a1679db1d229d105b728bc2ce5755","sha256":"2791fe833d251aee7ad187748d51eaef0f03f242c7801cf6e0292feceb044f2f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:44:34.589316+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS1","text":"Force appears as finite so long as its moments are determined by immediacy and by the separation of presupposing reflection and self-relating reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS2","text":"This separation produces an external force subsisting for itself and, in opposition to it, a passive reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS3","text":"The formal conditionedness of force at the same time limits its content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS4","text":"The activity of force consists in sublating externality and positing it as a determination identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS5","text":"The relation of force to an Other thereby proves to be a relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS6","text":"Passivity and external impulse are traced back to mediated forms of its own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AS7","text":"Force determines externality as identical with its inwardness and thereby surpasses the finitude of immediate form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","text":"Immediacy determines the moments of force as finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","text":"Presupposing reflection and self-relating reflection are at first distinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","text":"Presupposing reflection appears as an external force subsisting for itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A4","text":"Self-related reflection appears as passive in relation to external force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A5","text":"Force is conditioned according to its form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A6","text":"A formal determinacy at the same time contains a limitation of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","text":"The activity of force consists in the sublation of its externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A8","text":"The sublated externality is determined as identical with itself in force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","text":"The relation of force to an Other is in truth its relation to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A10","text":"The passivity of force subsists within its activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","text":"The impulse to the activity of force is a solicitation of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","text":"The externality that comes to force is mediated through force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","text":"The essential identity of force with itself is mediated through its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:A14","text":"The externality of force is identical with its inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX1","text":"Force is not infinite so long as its moments are immediately determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX2","text":"The relation to an Other is not an ultimately valid relation to something alien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX3","text":"Passivity is not an independent counter-determination to activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX4","text":"The impulse is not an immediate that enters force from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX5","text":"Externality is not a determination independent of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX6","text":"Inwardness is not an immediately given identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:NX7","text":"Formal conditionedness is not confined to form, but also limits content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D1","text":"The finitude of force rests on the separation of its moments of reflection and not on a merely quantitative limitation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","CH_GB18_CD_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D2","text":"The formal dependence of force necessarily produces a limitation of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A5","CH_GB18_CD_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D3","text":"The activity of force sublates the determination through which it at first appears as finite.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D4","text":"The Other possesses for force no independent determination outside its own movement of reflection.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D5","text":"The apparent passivity of force is a determination posited through its own activity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A4","CH_GB18_CD_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D6","text":"The external impulse is the result of a mediation in which force determines itself to activity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D7","text":"The identity of force with itself does not arise before negation, but through it.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A8","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:D8","text":"Externality and inwardness are determined as two forms of mediation of an identical force.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD1","text":"Force surpasses its finitude not by withdrawing from externality, but through its mediation and sublation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD2","text":"The distinction between external and internal force is transformed into a relational identity, without the difference disappearing without remainder.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A2","CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD3","text":"Determination by an Other is reconstructed as self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A3","CH_GB18_CD_3:A9","CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD4","text":"The infinity of force designates a structure in which force determines its limitation through the negation and mediation of its own externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A1","CH_GB18_CD_3:A7","CH_GB18_CD_3:A13","CH_GB18_CD_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SD5","text":"Force is at once that which acts and that in which the condition of its acting is produced.","refs":["CH_GB18_CD_3:A10","CH_GB18_CD_3:A11","CH_GB18_CD_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From"}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest upon an original, unmediated externality as an independent efficacious ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX2","text":"It cannot presuppose a stable ontology of two externally separated forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX3","text":"It cannot treat passivity as a positive principle opposed to activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX4","text":"It cannot determine identity as immediate self-sameness prior to every negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX5","text":"It cannot conceive content and form as determinations independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:DNX6","text":"It cannot explain the finitude of force as a limit imposed merely externally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an outside that precedes force and unmediatedly causes its activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a force whose identity would already be fully available without relation, negation, and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating force as a finite thing with a limit independent of its activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an absolute separation of inwardness and externality; the distinction remains only as a mediated difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS1","text":"Immediacy → finitude of force → distinction between presupposing and self-related reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS2","text":"Distinction of reflection → external force / passive counter-determination → formal conditionedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS3","text":"Formal determinacy → limitation of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS4","text":"Activity of force → sublation of externality → positing of identity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS5","text":"Relation to an Other → self-relation; passivity → moment of activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS6","text":"Impulse → solicitation of its own → mediated externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS7","text":"Negation of immediacy → mediated identity → identity of externality and inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CD_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:FGS8","text":"Mediated identity → surpassing of finite form → infinity of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:AF1","text":"Immediacy → finitude → dualism of reflection → formal and material limitation → activity as sublation of externality → self-relation in the Other → mediation of impulse and identity → infinity of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME1","text":"Externality is remapped from an independent counter-instance to a determination mediated through force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME2","text":"Passivity is reclassified from a counter-principle of activity into its internal moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME3","text":"The limit of force is redrawn from an externally posited barrier into a determination generated by immediate form and surmountable through negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME4","text":"Inwardness and externality no longer appear as separate spheres, but as identical determinations in a difference dependent on mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ME5","text":"Causality is mapped as the self-mediation of force rather than as a linear external impulse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Force is at first determined as finite, externally conditioned, and confronted by a passive counter-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Finitude is generated from the form of reflection, the separation of the moments, and the consequent limitation of form and content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the model of external influence with a model of self-mediation, in which counteraction and impulse become legible as its own activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identity is not an immediate point of departure, but a relation generated through negation and mediation; infinity designates the return of force to itself through its expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the finite to the infinite determination of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT2","text":"The decisive movement is preserved through the chain immediacy → externality → sublation → mediation → identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT3","text":"The internal structure is coherent provided that sublation is understood not as elimination, but as the mediated preservation of externality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the infinity of force has already been attained or is only announced as the result of the activity described.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system is the reduction of the external impulse to its own solicitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that externality is at once sublated and preserved as a necessary moment of identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""},{"id":"CH_GB18_CD_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument provided that the difference between inwardness and externality is not prematurely dissolved into mere identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":""}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CD_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CD_3:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 151","title":"c. The Infinity of Force.","context":"Chapter 151","original_title":"c. Die Unendlichkeit der Kraft."},"original_title":"c. Die Unendlichkeit der Kraft.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD","layer":"CH","title":"C. The Relation of Outer and Inner.","order":152,"parents":["RAW_GB18_CVLD"],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVLD@R001","sha256":"dbc1b40761b008f6aa50e861a624c2143d197837f82b9c422f82c6ae31732b66","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS1","text":"Das Verhältnis des Inneren und Äußeren wird als Problem ihrer gleichzeitigen Selbstständigkeit und negativen Einheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS2","text":"Die Äußerung der Kraft erweist das äußere Anderswerden als Rückkehr der reflektierten Einheit in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS3","text":"Die scheinbare Differenz der Seiten wird dadurch zur Vermittlung, in der ihr selbstständiges Bestehen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS4","text":"Innere und Äußere werden zunächst als Formen einer inhaltsvollen, identischen Grundlage bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS5","text":"Diese Grundlage wird von ihren Formbestimmungen unterschieden, worauf die Identität auf der Formebene als unmittelbares Übergehen erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS6","text":"Jede Seite ist unmittelbar die andere, bleibt dabei aber als Bestimmtheit erhalten und weist auf die Totalität hin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS7","text":"Der Argumentgang endet in einer negativen Einheit ohne inhaltsvolle Grundlage, im einfachen inhaltslosen Punkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A1","text":"Das Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Teile ist unmittelbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","text":"Die reflektierte und die seyende Unmittelbarkeit besitzen je eigene Selbstständigkeit, die im wesentlichen Verhältnis nur negative Einheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","text":"Die Äußerung der Kraft ist das Übersetzen der reflektierten Einheit in die Äußerlichkeit und ihre Rücknahme in sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A4","text":"Die Differenz der selbstständigen Kräfte hebt sich in der Äußerung der Kraft auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A5","text":"Die Äußerung der Kraft ist die Vermittlung der reflektierten Einheit mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A6","text":"Das Innere ist die Form der reflektierten Unmittelbarkeit oder des Wesens, das Äußere die Form des Seyns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","text":"Inneres und Äußeres bilden eine einzige Identität als inhaltsvolle Grundlage oder absolute Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","text":"Die absolute Sache ist von ihren Formbestimmungen verschieden, besteht aber in der Einheit des Inneren und Äußeren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A9","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind Formbestimmungen, deren identische Grundlage ihnen als ein Anderes zugrunde liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","text":"In der Äußerung der Kraft sind voraussetzendes und in sich zurückkehrendes Bestimmen ein und dasselbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","text":"Die Einheit der entgegengesetzten Formbestimmungen ist reine abstrakte Vermittlung, in der jede unmittelbar die andere ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","text":"Die Identität der Formbestimmungen ist ihr Übergehen und nicht ihre inhaltsvolle Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","text":"Jede Formbestimmung bleibt als solche erhalten, setzt die andere voraus, geht in deren Wahrheit über und weist auf die Totalität beider.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A14","text":"Das isolierte Innere ist nur in Beziehung auf das Äußere, und das isolierte Äußere nur in Beziehung auf das Innere bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A15","text":"Die unmittelbare Beziehung beider auf ihre Einheit besitzt auf dieser Stufe keine sie enthaltende identische Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX1","text":"Die Bewegung der Bestimmungen ist nicht bloß ein Übergehen von einer selbstständigen Seite in eine andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX2","text":"Die Ausgangsunmittelbarkeit ist keine voraussetzungslose Unmittelbarkeit, sondern selbst eine gesetzte Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX3","text":"Die Differenz von Innerem und Äußerem ist kein selbstständiger Unterschied zweier Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX4","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind dem Inhalte nach nicht zwei verschiedene Sachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX5","text":"Die absolute Sache ist nicht mit einer ihrer Formbestimmungen identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX6","text":"Die formale Einheit der Seiten ist keine reale Totalität des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX7","text":"Die Identität der Formbestimmungen ist keine inhaltsvolle Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX8","text":"Die Vermittlung von Innerem und Äußerem ist noch nicht durch eine identische Grundlage erfüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX9","text":"Die negative Einheit der Seiten ist kein inhaltsvoller gemeinsamer Grund, sondern ein einfacher inhaltsloser Punkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D1","text":"Die zunächst selbstständigen Seiten des Ganzen-und-Teile-Verhältnisses werden durch die Kraftäußerung zu Momenten einer Selbstvermittlung.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D2","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit ist nicht bloße Oberfläche, sondern die Vermittlungsform, in der die reflektierte Einheit besteht.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D3","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind dem Inhalte nach identisch, obwohl sie als Formbestimmungen unterschieden bleiben.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A6","CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D4","text":"Die absolute Sache ist zugleich Grundlage der Formbestimmungen und von ihnen als von ihrer Äußerlichkeit unterschieden.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D5","text":"Weil voraussetzendes und zurückkehrendes Bestimmen dasselbe sind, bestimmt jede Seite die andere als ihre eigene Form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D6","text":"Wird zunächst das Innere oder das Äußere gesetzt, so wird damit unmittelbar die jeweils andere Bestimmung mitgesetzt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D7","text":"Keine der beiden Seiten kann isoliert bestehen, ohne auf die Totalität ihrer Beziehung zu verweisen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","CH_GB18_CVLD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D8","text":"Die inhaltliche Einheit der Grundlage wird auf der unmittelbaren Formebene nur als negative, nicht als erfüllte Vermittlung wirksam.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt den Gegensatz von Innerem und Äußerem in eine Selbstvermittlung, ohne die Differenz der Seiten zu beseitigen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A4","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD2","text":"Die eine Identität zerfällt in zwei Geltungsweisen: als inhaltsvolle Grundlage ist sie substantiell, als Formeinheit ist sie bloßes Übergehen.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD3","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit wird als internes Moment der Sache bestimmt und nicht als ein außerhalb der Identität liegendes Gebiet.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A9","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD4","text":"Die Totalität ist durch die wechselseitige Bestimmung strukturell angezeigt, aber auf der unmittelbaren Formebene noch nicht inhaltlich vermittelt.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD5","text":"Die Vermittlung erzeugt eine Rückkehr in die Einheit, deren Grund gerade als fehlender identischer Grund erscheint.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Auffassung des Inneren und Äußeren als zweier selbstständig bestehender Inhalte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine statische Identität, die unabhängig von Übergang, Äußerung und Rückkehr bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Äußerlichkeit, die außerhalb der Sache und ihrer Einheit verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Formdifferenz, die bereits die reale Totalität des Ganzen darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vermittlung, deren Zusammenhang durch einen unmittelbar vorhandenen gemeinsamen Grund gesichert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein drittes Moment, das die Gegensätze auf dieser Stufe inhaltlich abschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Weltordnung zweier unabhängig realer Bereiche, deren Beziehung erst nachträglich hergestellt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird die Reduktion der Äußerlichkeit auf bloße Nichtigkeit, weil der Schein selbst die Vermittlung des Bestehens ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine abgeschlossene, inhaltsvolle Einheit innerhalb der unmittelbaren Formbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist ein Standpunkt außerhalb des Übergehens, von dem aus Inneres oder Äußeres als ursprüngliche, fixe Seite festgehalten werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX5","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine Form der Einheit, in der gegenseitige Bestimmung und inhaltsvolle Grundlage bereits zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbares Verhältnis des Ganzen und der Teile → Setzung zweier selbstständiger Seiten → negative Einheit ihrer Selbstständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS2","text":"Negative Einheit → Äußerung der Kraft → Übersetzung der reflektierten Einheit in die Äußerlichkeit → Rücknahme der Äußerlichkeit in die Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS3","text":"Äußere Setzung und Rückkehr → Aufhebung des selbstständigen Unterschieds → Vermittlung der Einheit mit sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS4","text":"Vermittlung → Bestimmung des Inneren als Wesen und des Äußeren als Seyn → Identität beider als eine inhaltsvolle Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS5","text":"Inhaltsvolle Grundlage → Unterscheidung von Sache und Formbestimmungen → Äußerlichkeit der Sache als Verhältnis von Innerem und Äußerem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS6","text":"Formbestimmungen → voraussetzendes und zurückkehrendes Bestimmen als dasselbe → unmittelbare Umkehrung jeder Seite in die andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS7","text":"Unmittelbare Umkehrung → Erhaltung der entgegengesetzten Bestimmungen → Verweis auf die Totalität ohne reale Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS8","text":"Verweis auf Totalität ohne identische Grundlage → negative Einheit → einfacher inhaltsloser Punkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AF1","text":"Selbstständigkeit der Seiten → negative Einheit → Äußerung der Kraft → äußere Setzung und Rückkehr → aufgehobene Differenz → inhaltsvolle Grundlage → Trennung von Grundlage und Form → unmittelbare Umkehrung von Innerem und Äußerem → Verweis auf Totalität → inhaltsloser negativer Punkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME1","text":"Selbstständigkeit wird von einer ontologischen Eigenschaft zu einer negativen Funktion innerhalb eines wesentlichen Verhältnisses umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME2","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird von einem Gegenbereich des Inneren zur Vermittlungsform seiner Selbstbeziehung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME3","text":"Identität wird in eine inhaltsvolle Grundlage und eine abstrakte Formeinheit auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Innerem und Äußerem wird als reziproke Bestimmung statt als stabile Zweiheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME5","text":"Totalität erscheint zugleich als vorausgesetzter Zusammenhang und als auf der Formebene noch nicht erfüllte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME6","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen Wesen und Seyn wird als operative Bewegung von Setzung, Äußerung und Rückkehr lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Das Innere und Äußere werden als gegensätzliche Bestimmungen einer Sache behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Kraftäußerung, Reflexion, Formbestimmung und negative Einheit organisieren das Verhältnis als Selbstvermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Gegensatz wird nicht durch Auswahl einer Seite gelöst, sondern durch die Verschiebung von selbstständigen Dingen zu wechselseitigen Formbestimmungen neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein und Wesen werden als Bestimmungen einer Bewegung gefasst, in der Äußerung, Anderswerden und Rückkehr eine einzige begriffliche Operation bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von selbstständigen Seiten zu negativer Einheit, Kraftäußerung und formaler Umkehrung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT2","text":"Unverzichtbar ist die Unterscheidung zwischen der inhaltsvollen Grundlage und der abstrakten Formeinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die gemeinschaftliche Einheit der Formbeziehungen genau mit der zuvor bestimmten absoluten Sache vermittelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT4","text":"Die Spannung zwischen eigener Selbstständigkeit und negativer Einheit ist intern funktional, aber nicht als statische Vereinbarkeit auflösbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Ableitung der reziproken Bestimmung aus der Äußerung und Rückkehr der Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT6","text":"Die schwächste Stelle liegt im Übergang von der inhaltsvollen Grundlage zum inhaltslosen Punkt, dessen Vermittlungsstatus nicht weiter bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern Inhaltsebene, Formebene und deren unvollständige Vermittlung getrennt rekonstruiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261019T114754606131Z_e31e7a84","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"C. Relation of the External and the Internal.","source_sha256":"dbc1b40761b008f6aa50e861a624c2143d197837f82b9c422f82c6ae31732b66","sha256":"2fb7adc784a80d80d757bfabaf4a03c5a065a63a9a25de81145862c8543126af","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-19T11:47:54.607118+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS1","text":"The relation of the internal and the external is determined as the problem of their simultaneous self-subsistence and negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS2","text":"The expression of force demonstrates external becoming-other as the return of reflected unity into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS3","text":"The apparent difference of the sides thereby becomes mediation, in which their self-subsistent existence consists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS4","text":"The internal and the external are initially determined as forms of a contentful, identical ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS5","text":"This ground is distinguished from its determinations of form, whereupon identity on the level of form appears as immediate transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS6","text":"Each side is immediately the other, but thereby remains preserved as determinacy and points to totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AS7","text":"The course of the argument ends in a negative unity without a contentful ground, in the simple contentless point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A1","text":"The relation of the whole and the parts is immediate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","text":"Reflected and being immediacy each possess their own self-subsistence, which in the essential relation is only negative unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","text":"The expression of force is the translation of reflected unity into externality and its withdrawal back into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A4","text":"The difference of the self-subsistent forces sublates itself in the expression of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A5","text":"The expression of force is the mediation of reflected unity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A6","text":"The internal is the form of reflected immediacy or of essence, the external the form of Being (Seyn).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","text":"Internal and external form a single identity as contentful ground or absolute thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","text":"The absolute thing is distinct from its determinations of form, but consists in the unity of the internal and the external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A9","text":"Internal and external are determinations of form, whose identical ground underlies them as an other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","text":"In the expression of force, presupposing determination and determination returning into itself are one and the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","text":"The unity of the opposed determinations of form is pure abstract mediation, in which each is immediately the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","text":"The identity of the determinations of form is their transition and not their contentful identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","text":"Each determination of form remains preserved as such, presupposes the other, passes over into its truth, and points to the totality of both.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A14","text":"The isolated internal is determined only in relation to the external, and the isolated external only in relation to the internal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:A15","text":"At this stage, the immediate relation of both to their unity possesses no identical ground containing them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX1","text":"The movement of the determinations is not merely a transition from one self-subsistent side to another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX2","text":"The initial immediacy is not a presuppositionless immediacy, but is itself a posited determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX3","text":"The difference of internal and external is not a self-subsistent difference of two forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX4","text":"Internal and external are not, in respect of content, two different things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX5","text":"The absolute thing is not identical with one of its determinations of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX6","text":"The formal unity of the sides is not a real totality of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX7","text":"The identity of the determinations of form is not a contentful identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX8","text":"The mediation of internal and external is not yet fulfilled through an identical ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:NX9","text":"The negative unity of the sides is not a contentful common ground, but a simple contentless point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D1","text":"The initially self-subsistent sides of the relation of whole and parts become, through the expression of force, moments of a self-mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D2","text":"Externality is not mere surface, but the form of mediation in which reflected unity subsists.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D3","text":"Internal and external are identical in respect of content, although they remain distinguished as determinations of form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A6","CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D4","text":"The absolute thing is at once the ground of the determinations of form and distinguished from them as from its externality.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D5","text":"Because presupposing and returning determination are the same, each side determines the other as its own form.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D6","text":"If initially the internal or the external is posited, then the respectively other determination is thereby immediately co-posited.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D7","text":"Neither of the two sides can subsist in isolation without referring to the totality of their relation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","CH_GB18_CVLD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:D8","text":"The contentual unity of the ground becomes effective on the immediate level of form only as negative, not as fulfilled mediation.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD1","text":"The system transforms the opposition of internal and external into a self-mediation without abolishing the difference of the sides.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A2","CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A4","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD2","text":"The one identity falls apart into two modes of validity: as contentful ground it is substantial, as unity of form it is mere transition.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A7","CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11","CH_GB18_CVLD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD3","text":"Externality is determined as an internal moment of the thing and not as a domain lying outside identity.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A8","CH_GB18_CVLD:A9","CH_GB18_CVLD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD4","text":"Totality is structurally indicated through reciprocal determination, but on the immediate level of form is not yet mediated in respect of content.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A12","CH_GB18_CVLD:A13","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SD5","text":"Mediation produces a return into unity, whose ground appears precisely as a missing identical ground.","refs":["CH_GB18_CVLD:A3","CH_GB18_CVLD:A10","CH_GB18_CVLD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the conception of the internal and the external as two independently subsisting contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a static identity that would subsist independently of transition, expression, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an externality that remains outside the thing and its unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a difference of form that already represents the real totality of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a mediation whose connection would be secured by an immediately present common ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a third moment that conclusively resolves the opposites at this stage in respect of content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX1","text":"Impossible becomes a world order of two independently real domains whose relation would only subsequently be established.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX2","text":"Impermissible becomes the reduction of externality to mere nullity, because semblance itself is the mediation of subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a completed, contentful unity within the immediate relation of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX4","text":"Blocked is a standpoint outside transition, from which the internal or the external could be held fast as an original, fixed side.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:SNX5","text":"Absent remains a form of unity in which reciprocal determination and contentful ground already coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS1","text":"Immediate relation of whole and parts → positing of two self-subsistent sides → negative unity of their self-subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS2","text":"Negative unity → expression of force → translation of reflected unity into externality → withdrawal of externality back into unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS3","text":"External positing and return → sublation of the self-subsistent difference → mediation of unity with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS4","text":"Mediation → determination of the internal as essence and of the external as Being (Seyn) → identity of both as one contentful ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS5","text":"Contentful ground → distinction of thing and determinations of form → externality of the thing as relation of internal and external.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS6","text":"Determinations of form → presupposing and returning determination as the same → immediate reversal of each side into the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS7","text":"Immediate reversal → preservation of the opposed determinations → reference to totality without real totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:FGS8","text":"Reference to totality without identical ground → negative unity → simple contentless point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:AF1","text":"Self-subsistence of the sides → negative unity → expression of force → external positing and return → sublated difference → contentful ground → separation of ground and form → immediate reversal of internal and external → reference to totality → contentless negative point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME1","text":"Self-subsistence is remapped from an ontological property to a negative function within an essential relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME2","text":"Externality is reclassified from a counter-domain of the internal into the mediating form of its self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME3","text":"Identity is divided into a contentful ground and an abstract unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME4","text":"The opposition of internal and external is mapped as reciprocal determination rather than as a stable duality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME5","text":"Totality appears at once as a presupposed connection and as a unity not yet fulfilled on the level of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ME6","text":"The distinction between essence and Being (Seyn) becomes legible as the operative movement of positing, expression, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The internal and the external are treated as opposed determinations of one thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Expression of force, reflection, determination of form, and negative unity organize the relation as self-mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The opposition is not resolved through the selection of one side, but reframed through the shift from self-subsistent things to reciprocal determinations of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being and essence are conceived as determinations of a movement in which expression, becoming-other, and return form a single conceptual operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from self-subsistent sides to negative unity, expression of force, and formal reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT2","text":"Indispensable is the distinction between the contentful ground and the abstract unity of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined precisely how the common unity of the relations of form is mediated with the previously determined absolute thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT4","text":"The tension between independent self-subsistence and negative unity is internally functional, but cannot be resolved as static compatibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT5","text":"The system's strongest point lies in the derivation of reciprocal determination from the expression and return of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT6","text":"The weakest point lies in the transition from the contentful ground to the contentless point, whose mediating status is not further determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_CVLD:MRT7","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved provided that the level of content, the level of form, and their incomplete mediation are reconstructed separately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_CVLD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_GB18_CVLD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_GB18_CVLD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 152","title":"C. The Relation of Outer and Inner.","context":"Chapter 152","original_title":"C. Verhältniß des Äußern und Innern."},"original_title":"C. Verhältniß des Äußern und Innern.","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40","layer":"CH","title":"Remark.","order":153,"parents":["RAW_GB18_A_40"],"revision":"CH_GB18_A_40@R001","sha256":"8a305f2c461b4a1611ec58b9451adaa32d55b27400d24aaa6e4e3e05f8e2d208","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, dass die anfängliche Identität von Innerem und Äußerem noch keine inhaltlich vermittelte Totalität bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS2","text":"Diese anfängliche Identität wird als unmittelbares, passives und daher äußerliches Dasein bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS3","text":"Entwicklung setzt voraus, dass die Momente entgegengesetzt, vermittelt und durch Tätigkeit nach außen gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS4","text":"Durch die Reflexion der Form werden Inneres und Äußeres zu je einer Totalität ihrer selbst und ihres Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS5","text":"Äußerlichkeit wird dadurch zur Äußerung des Wesens, während Erscheinung nicht bloß Reflexion in Anderes, sondern Reflexion in sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AS6","text":"Die Identität von Erscheinung und Wesen bestimmt das wesentliche Verhältnis zur Wirklichkeit; der Geist bleibt dabei die vermittelte Rückkehr aus der gesetzten Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A1","text":"Die Bewegung des Wesens ist ein Werden zum Begriffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A2","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind im wesentlichen Verhältnis in negativer Einheit gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A3","text":"In dieser negativen Einheit ist jede Bestimmung sowohl ihre andere als auch die Totalität des Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A4","text":"Die Totalität als Allgemeines gehört dem Begriffe an und ist in der anfänglichen bloßen Beziehung von Innerem und Äußerem noch nicht vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A5","text":"Die unmittelbare Identität der Form ist eine Identität ohne inhaltvolle Bewegung der Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A6","text":"Der Anfang eines Realen ist unmittelbare Identität, weil seine Momente noch nicht entgegengesetzt und entwickelt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A7","text":"Das nur Innere ist als solches unmittelbares, passives Dasein und damit Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A8","text":"Wirkliche Entwicklung setzt Entgegensetzung, Vermittlung und Hervorbringung durch Tätigkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A9","text":"Die unmittelbare Sphäre des Seins ist die Sphäre der seienden Unmittelbarkeit und der Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A10","text":"Das nur innere Wesen kann als äußerliche, systemlose Gemeinschaftlichkeit erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A11","text":"Die erste Identität von Innerem und Äußerem ist gleichgültige Grundlage und Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A12","text":"Die zweite Identität von Innerem und Äußerem ist ihre unmittelbare Umkehrung und reine Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A13","text":"Grundlage und Form sind nur verschiedene Seiten einer Totalität und gehen ineinander über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A14","text":"Der Inhalt ist die Form, insofern sie sich als Verschiedenheit bestimmt und Inneres und Äußeres setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A15","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind jeweils als Totalität ihrer selbst und ihres Anderen gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A16","text":"Jede Seite ist durch ihr Anderes das, was sie an sich ist, und dadurch mit ihm vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A17","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit eines Etwas ist seine Totalität und die Äußerung dessen, was es an sich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:A18","text":"Die Identität von Inhalt und Form bestimmt das wesentliche Verhältnis zur Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX1","text":"Das Unmittelbare ist noch kein entwickelter Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX2","text":"Das nur Innere ist keine selbständige, bereits verwirklichte Wesenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX3","text":"Das Äußere ist keine vom Inneren unabhängige Schicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX4","text":"Totalität ist keine äußerliche Zusammenstellung gleichgültiger Teile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Ganzem und Teilen ist in seiner unmittelbaren Form noch keine vermittelte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX6","text":"Erscheinung ist nicht bloß Reflexion in ein Anderes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX7","text":"Inhalt und Form sind keine voneinander unabhängigen Bestimmungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX8","text":"Unmittelbarer Gott ist noch nicht Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:NX9","text":"Das abstrakte Absolute des ersten Denkens ist nicht der absolute Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D1","text":"Das anfänglich nur Innere ist zugleich unmittelbares und passives Äußeres.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A5","CH_GB18_A_40:A6","CH_GB18_A_40:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D2","text":"Die anfängliche Beziehung von Ganzem und Teilen besitzt nur ein äußerliches Bestehen, weil ihre Identität noch nicht an ihnen selbst gesetzt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A6","CH_GB18_A_40:A8","CH_GB18_A_40:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D3","text":"Die Sphäre des Seins bezeichnet die unmittelbare Äußerlichkeit, während die Sphäre des Wesens zunächst nur das Innere bezeichnet.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A7","CH_GB18_A_40:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D4","text":"Die Identität von Grundlage und Form ist keine doppelte Grundlage, sondern die Umkehrung zweier Seiten einer Totalität.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A11","CH_GB18_A_40:A12","CH_GB18_A_40:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D5","text":"Das Innere ist als reflektierte Identität ebenso Sein und Äußerlichkeit, während das Äußere als bestimmtes Sein in seinen Grund zurückgegangen und damit Inneres ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A14","CH_GB18_A_40:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D6","text":"Die Totalität vermittelt sich durch die Form mit sich selbst, während die Bestimmtheit durch ihre einfache Identität mit sich vermittelt ist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A15","CH_GB18_A_40:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D7","text":"Die Äußerlichkeit eines Etwas ist nicht bloße Oberfläche, sondern die gesetzte Erscheinung seines Ansichseins.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D8","text":"Erscheinung reflektiert sich in sich, weil Inhalt und Form schlechthin identisch geworden sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A14","CH_GB18_A_40:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D9","text":"Die wesentliche Beziehung bestimmt sich zur Wirklichkeit, sobald Erscheinung und Wesen als identische Einheit gesetzt sind.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A17","CH_GB18_A_40:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:D10","text":"Gott ist im unmittelbaren Begriff Natur und im ersten Denken reines Sein beziehungsweise abstraktes Absolutes, nicht aber schon absoluter Geist.","refs":["CH_GB18_A_40:A7","CH_GB18_A_40:A9","CH_GB18_A_40:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD1","text":"Unmittelbare Identität ist als Anfang notwendig, bleibt aber als solche unzureichend; Wirklichkeit entsteht erst durch Differenz, Vermittlung und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD2","text":"Inneres und Äußeres sind keine selbständigen ontologischen Bereiche, sondern funktionale Bestimmungen innerhalb einer sich selbst vermittelnden Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD3","text":"Entwicklung ist keine äußerliche Ergänzung eines bereits fertigen Wesens, sondern die Erzeugung seiner Bestimmtheit durch Selbstäußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD4","text":"Wirklichkeit wird nicht als verborgener Grund hinter der Erscheinung, sondern als Identität von Wesen und dessen Selbstoffenbarung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD5","text":"Sein, Wesen, Begriff und Wirklichkeit bilden eine Ordnung zunehmender Vermittlung: unmittelbare Äußerlichkeit, innerliche Bestimmtheit, begriffliche Totalität und wirkliche Selbstoffenbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SD6","text":"Die Bestimmung des Geistes beruht auf einer Unmittelbarkeit, die sich selbst setzt, verlässt und in sich zurücknimmt; ein unmittelbarer Geist ist daher ein ausgeschlossener Begriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX1","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass unmittelbare Identität bereits die entwickelte Einheit ihrer entgegengesetzten Momente enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass das Wesen als verborgenes Inneres unabhängig von seiner Äußerung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX3","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass das Äußere lediglich ein nachträglicher Zusatz zu einem fertigen Inneren ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX4","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Totalität vor ihrer Vermittlung als fertiger Grund gegeben ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX5","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Inhalt und Form getrennte Bestandteile eines Gegenstandes sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX6","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Wirklichkeit ohne Entgegensetzung, Tätigkeit und Rückkehr aus der Äußerlichkeit erreicht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:DNX7","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass das Absolute als unmittelbares Sein bereits die Wahrheit des Geistes besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Wirklichkeit, die in unmittelbarer Identität verharrt und sich nicht selbst äußerlich setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wesen, dessen Wahrheit hinter seiner Erscheinung verborgen bleibt und nicht in ihr hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Anfang, der bereits die Totalität enthält, ohne Differenz, Vermittlung und Entwicklung zu durchlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Absolutes, das nicht durch Selbstvermittlung zu sich selbst zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS1","text":"Unmittelbare Identität von Innerem und Äußerem → noch nicht entwickelte Momente → passives und äußerliches Dasein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS2","text":"Setzung von Unterschied und Entgegensetzung → Tätigkeit und Vermittlung → Hervorbringung der inneren Bestimmung als Äußerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS3","text":"Reflexion der Form auf ihren Unterschied → Form als Inhalt und Inhalt als differenzierte Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS4","text":"Jede Seite enthält die Totalität ihrer selbst und ihres Anderen → wechselseitige Vermittlung von Innerem und Äußerem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS5","text":"Wechselseitige Vermittlung → Äußerlichkeit als Ausdruck des Ansichseins → Erscheinung als Reflexion in sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS6","text":"Identität von Erscheinung und Wesen → Bestimmung des wesentlichen Verhältnisses zur Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:FGS7","text":"Gesetzte Unmittelbarkeit → Rückkehr aus der Äußerlichkeit in sich → Geist als vermittelte, nicht unmittelbare Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GB18_A_40:AF1","text":"Unmittelbare Identität ohne Totalität → passives Inneres und äußerliches Dasein → Entgegensetzung und Vermittlung → Form-Inhalt-Reflexion → wechselseitige Totalität von Innerem und Äußerem → Äußerlichkeit als Selbstoffenbarung → Wirklichkeit als Identität von Erscheinung und Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GB18_A_40:P0011","trace_type":"Stru